        u"*sigh* Are we really doing this\u2026?": u"*suspiro* A gente vai mesmo fazer isso\u2026?",
        u"*sigh* As much as I would love a drink tonight to relax\u2026 Yuri has a point. ": u"*suspiro* Por mais que eu adorasse beber algo para relaxar esta noite\u2026 A Yuri tem raz\u00e3o. ",
        u"*sigh* Aww, man\u2026 I thought I would\u2019ve been able to pull it off this time! ": u"*suspiro* Ah, poxa\u2026 Pensei que conseguiria desta vez! ",
