        u"*sigh* Bet you guys didn\u2019t miss the speeches\u2026": u"*suspiro* Aposto que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o sentiram falta dos discursos\u2026",
        u"*sigh* Boy, didn\u2019t you cause enough ruckus at the waterfall the other day?": u"*suspiro* Rapaz, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 n\u00e3o causou confus\u00e3o suficiente na cachoeira outro dia?",
        u"*sigh* But it looks like he didn\u2019t even write anything down on his laptop.": u"*suspiro* Mas parece que ele nem escreveu nada no notebook.",
