        u"*sigh* Can\u2019t we get to work already? ": u"*suspiro* N\u00e3o podemos come\u00e7ar a trabalhar logo? ",
        u"*sigh* Chew your food well before talking, Taiga. You might choke.": u"*suspiro* Mastigue bem antes de falar, Taiga. Voc\u00ea pode engasgar.",
