        u"*sigh* Do I really have to choose?": u"*suspiro* Eu realmente tenho que escolher?",
        u"*sigh* Don't remind me\u2026 I don't know how Dad can stand to keep working  in his office like that all day long \u2013 it drives me crazy!": u"*suspiro* Nem me lembre\u2026 N\u00e3o sei como o papai aguenta ficar trabalhando daquele jeito no escrit\u00f3rio o dia inteiro \u2014 isso me deixa maluca!",
