        u"*sigh* I can\u2019t really blame you\u2026 Even this shirt is several sizes too small.": u"*suspiro* N\u00e3o posso culp\u00e1-lo\u2026 At\u00e9 esta camisa \u00e9 v\u00e1rios tamanhos menor do que deveria.",
        u"*sigh* I didn\u2019t receive any instructions from him\u2026 He usually takes care of this stuff.": u"*suspiro* N\u00e3o recebi nenhuma instru\u00e7\u00e3o dele\u2026 Normalmente \u00e9 ele quem cuida dessas coisas.",
