        u"*sigh* I hope it\u2019s not too unbecoming of your prestigious reputation, sir.": u"*suspiro* Espero que isso n\u00e3o seja impr\u00f3prio demais para sua prestigiosa reputa\u00e7\u00e3o, senhor.",
        u"*sigh* I hope you guys are right. But she still doesn\u2019t pass my vibe check. ": u"*suspira* Espero que estejam certos. Mas ela ainda n\u00e3o passa no meu teste de energia.",
        u"*sigh* I just really hope it\u2019s the food they\u2019re excited for.": u"*suspiro* Espero sinceramente que seja a comida que os deixa animados.",
        u"*sigh* I knew it was a bad idea to drink yesterday\u2026": u"*suspiro* Eu sabia que beber ontem era uma m\u00e1 ideia\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I knew this would happen\u2026 I got woken up last night as soon as it hit. ": u"*suspiro* Eu sabia que isso ia acontecer\u2026 Acordei ontem \u00e0 noite assim que a tempestade come\u00e7ou. ",
        u"*sigh* I knew you were gonna react to that.": u"*suspiro* Eu sabia que voc\u00ea ia reagir assim.",
        u"*sigh* I knew you weren\u2019t going to give up that easily\u2026": u"*suspiro* Eu sabia que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o desistiria t\u00e3o facilmente\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I knew you\u2019d say something like that\u2026": u"*suspira* Eu sabia que diria algo assim\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I know I mentioned this before, but\u2026 I\u2019m a bit disappointed we\u2019re headed home today.": u"*suspiro* Sei que j\u00e1 mencionei isso, mas\u2026 estou um pouco decepcionado por voltarmos para casa hoje.",
        u"*sigh* I know it\u2019s hard to believe but Yuri was quite the troublemaker back then.": u"*suspiro* Eu sei que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil de acreditar, mas a Yuri dava bastante trabalho naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"*sigh* I know that we\u2019ve done a good job and all, but I\u2019m really gonna miss working with you guys\u2026": u"*suspiro* Sei que fizemos um \u00f3timo trabalho e tudo mais, mas vou sentir muita falta de trabalhar com voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I look like a dork compared to you guys\u2026": u"*suspiro* Eu pare\u00e7o um bob\u00e3o comparado a voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I meant about the caf\u00e9, but sure, why not\u2026": u"*suspira* Eu quis dizer sobre o caf\u00e9, mas claro, por que n\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I probably should\u2019ve made Yoichi work on something else, huh\u2026?": u"*suspiro* Provavelmente deveria ter colocado o Yoichi para fazer outra coisa, hein\u2026?",
        u"*sigh* I really missed having the scouts around! They\u2019re always so excited for anything I cook.": u"*suspiro* Eu realmente senti falta de ter os escoteiros por perto! Eles sempre ficam t\u00e3o animados com qualquer coisa que eu cozinho.",
        u"*sigh* I remember that\u2026 One time it got really bad and they got caught by Sir Goro\u2026": u"*suspiro* Eu me lembro disso\u2026 Uma vez a coisa ficou bem feia e o Sr. Goro pegou as duas no flagra\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I remember when my bank account had a hundred thousand just as petty cash\u2026": u"*suspiro* Lembro de quando minha conta banc\u00e1ria tinha cem mil s\u00f3 como dinheiro para gastos\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I see you\u2019re already in your usual attire.": u"*suspiro* Vejo que j\u00e1 est\u00e1 com seu traje habitual.",
        u"*sigh* I should\u2019ve expected you\u2019d ask that\u2026": u"*suspira* Eu deveria ter imaginado que perguntaria isso\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I should\u2019ve guessed that\u2019d be her first question.": u"*suspiro* Eu devia imaginar que essa seria a primeira pergunta dela.",
        u"*sigh* I should\u2019ve thought twice before letting everyone share a bathroom with you, Aiden\u2026": u"*suspira* Eu deveria ter pensado duas vezes antes de deixar todos dividirem o banheiro com voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I think I have trust issues now\u2026": u"*suspiro* Acho que agora tenho problemas de confian\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I think I know exactly what he saw in there\u2026": u"*suspiro* Acho que sei exatamente o que ele viu l\u00e1 dentro\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I wonder what Emilia did to get on her nerves so early in the morning\u2026": u"*suspira* O que ser\u00e1 que Emilia fez para irrit\u00e1-la t\u00e3o cedo\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I'm not sure either, but Yuri was insistent that I wear it.": u"*suspiro* Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei bem, mas Yuri insistiu que eu usasse.",
        u"*sigh* If that\u2019s the case\u2026": u"*suspiro* Nesse caso\u2026",
        u"*sigh* It always caused a ruckus with the campers even back then.": u"*suspiro* Ele sempre causava uma confus\u00e3o entre os campistas, mesmo naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"*sigh* It feels so wrong to leave now, especially without Sir Goro around\u2026": u"*suspiro* Parece t\u00e3o errado ir embora agora, principalmente sem o Sr. Goro por perto\u2026",
        u"*sigh* It is difficult to relax for a drink when she\u2019s upset with us.": u"*suspiro* \u00c9 dif\u00edcil relaxar para tomar uma bebida quando ela est\u00e1 brava conosco.",
        u"*sigh* It\u2019s just another one of Yuri\u2019s episodes\u2026": u"*suspira* \u00c9 s\u00f3 mais um dos surtos de Yuri\u2026",
        u"*sigh* It\u2019s too late, everyone\u2019s already splashing about\u2026": u"*suspiro* \u00c9 tarde demais, todo mundo j\u00e1 est\u00e1 brincando na \u00e1gua\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I\u2019d love to, but the culinary school I\u2019m headed to is two flights away.": u"*suspiro* Eu adoraria, mas a escola de culin\u00e1ria para onde vou fica a dois voos de dist\u00e2ncia.",
        u"*sigh* I\u2019ll go tell him.": u"*suspiro* Vou avis\u00e1-lo.",
