        u"*sigh* I\u2019m gonna miss them when all of this is over, though.": u"*suspiro* Mas vou sentir falta deles quando tudo isso acabar.",
        u"*sigh* I\u2019m not getting paid enough for this\u2026": u"*suspiro* N\u00e3o me pagam o suficiente para isso\u2026",
