        u"*sigh* I\u2019m not making this awkward, am I?": u"*suspiro* N\u00e3o estou deixando isso constrangedor, estou?",
        u"*sigh* I\u2019m not sure this is a good idea, Aiden\u2026": u"*suspira* N\u00e3o sei se isso \u00e9 uma boa ideia, Aiden\u2026",
