        u"*sigh* I\u2019m really sorry\u2026 This is my department\u2026 I should\u2019ve taken more precautions\u2026": u"*suspiro* Sinto muito\u2026 Esta \u00e9 minha \u00e1rea\u2026 Eu deveria ter tomado mais precau\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026",
        u"*sigh* I\u2019m so sorry about Yoichi\u2019s behavior, Jin. He\u2019s rather hostile when it comes to meeting strangers\u2026": u"*suspiro* Sinto muito pelo comportamento do Yoichi, Jin. Ele \u00e9 bastante hostil quando conhece estranhos\u2026",
