        u"A-Aiden!! People can hear us\u2026!": u"A-Aiden!! As pessoas podem nos ouvir\u2026!",
        u"A-Aiden, I\u2019m not sure if Jin\u2014": u"A-Aiden, n\u00e3o sei se o Jin\u2014",
        u"A-Aiden, I\u2019m not sure if\u2014": u"A-Aiden, n\u00e3o sei se\u2014",
        u"A-Aiden, don\u2019t give them the wrong idea\u2026!": u"A-Aiden, n\u00e3o fa\u00e7a eles entenderem errado\u2026!",
        u"A-Aiden, get back here\u2026!!": u"A-Aiden, volte aqui\u2026!!",
        u"A-Aiden, get back there! ": u"A-Aiden, volte para l\u00e1! ",
        u"A-Aiden, he\u2019s probably just a little tired from the party.": u"A-Aiden, ele provavelmente s\u00f3 est\u00e1 um pouco cansado da festa.",
        u"A-Aiden, is it really fair to make him do that since he\u2019s only wearing one thing\u2026?": u"A-Aiden, \u00e9 mesmo justo faz\u00ea-lo tirar isso se ele s\u00f3 est\u00e1 usando uma pe\u00e7a\u2026?",
        u"A-Aiden, put something on this instant! ": u"A-Aiden, vista alguma coisa agora mesmo! ",
        u"A-Aiden, shh! If Yuri finds us out here, she\u2019ll kill us!": u"A-Aiden, shhh! Se Yuri nos encontrar aqui fora, ela vai nos matar!",
        u"A-Aiden, ssh\u2026!!": u"A-Aiden, shh\u2026!!",
        u"A-Aiden, stop teasing Sir Goro\u2026": u"A-Aiden, pare de provocar o Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"A-Aiden, th-that\u2019s not what I meant\u2026 I-I just thought the time we\u2019d be apart would be worth it for\u2014  ": u"A-Aiden, n-n\u00e3o foi isso que eu quis dizer\u2026 E-Eu s\u00f3 achei que o tempo que ficar\u00edamos separados valeria a pena para\u2014  ",
        u"A-Aiden, w-we\u2019re in public\u2026!!": u"A-Aiden, e-estamos em p\u00fablico\u2026!!",
        u"A-Aiden, wait\u2014": u"A-Aiden, espera\u2014",
        u"A-Aiden, wait\u2026!": u"A-Aiden, espera\u2026!",
        u"A-Aiden, you\u2019re seriously drunk!! And did you walk around camp with just your underwear on?!": u"A-Aiden, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 muito b\u00eabado!! E voc\u00ea andou pelo acampamento s\u00f3 de cueca?!",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026 I\u2019m gonna\u2014": u"A-Aiden\u2026 Eu vou\u2014",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026 That\u2019s\u2014": u"A-Aiden\u2026 Isso \u00e9\u2014",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026 Was that really the best idea? ": u"A-Aiden\u2026 Isso foi mesmo uma boa ideia? ",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026! I-I\u2019m close\u2026!": u"A-Aiden\u2026! E-Eu estou quase\u2026!",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026! I-I\u2019m sorry, please let me make this right!  I\u2019ll drop everything I\u2019m doing right now! Let me fight for us!": u"A-Aiden\u2026! E-Eu sinto muito, por favor, deixe-me consertar isso!  Vou largar tudo que estou fazendo agora! Deixe-me lutar por n\u00f3s!",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026! I\u2019m sorry! Please let me make this right! ": u"A-Aiden\u2026! Sinto muito! Por favor, deixe-me consertar isso! ",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026! What are you doing?!": u"A-Aiden\u2026! O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?!",
        u"A-Aiden\u2026!! I meant eating\u2026!!": u"A-Aiden\u2026!! Eu quis dizer comida\u2026!!",
        u"A-Alright, I\u2019ll handle it until Goro gets back.": u"C-Certo, vou cuidar disso at\u00e9 Goro voltar.",
        u"A-Alright, Yoshi!": u"E-Est\u00e1 bem, Yoshi!",
        u"A-Alright\u2026 I might need them for a different reason, though\u2026": u"C-Certo\u2026 Mas talvez eu precise deles por outro motivo\u2026",
        u"A-Alright\u2026 Rock, paper, scissors\u2026 shoot!": u"T-T\u00e1 bem\u2026 Pedra, papel, tesoura\u2026 j\u00e1!",
        u"A-Alright\u2026!": u"C-Certo\u2026!",
        u"A-Also, even if we wanted to, can we even do that\u2026? She was put in that position by Mr. Clermont himself\u2026": u"E-E tamb\u00e9m, mesmo que quis\u00e9ssemos, ser\u00e1 que podemos fazer isso\u2026? Foi o pr\u00f3prio Sr. Clermont quem a colocou nessa posi\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"A-Although, if I could make a request... Can you at least let me finish my role in the expansion project before I pursue this opportunity?": u"E-Embora, se eu puder fazer um pedido\u2026 O senhor poderia pelo menos me deixar terminar minha fun\u00e7\u00e3o no projeto de expans\u00e3o antes de seguir esta oportunidade?",
        u"A-And even if we wanted to, can we even do that\u2026? She was put in that position by Mr. Clermont himself\u2026": u"E-E mesmo que quis\u00e9ssemos, podemos fazer isso\u2026? Foi o pr\u00f3prio Sr. Clermont quem colocou ela nesse cargo\u2026",
        u"A-And in any case, I\u2019m just happy to be of service.": u"E-E, de qualquer forma, fico feliz por ter ajudado.",
        u"A-And no, I\u2019m not working either!": u"E-E n\u00e3o, tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o estou trabalhando!",
        u"A-And taking into account that she\u2019s had a change of heart, that would solve the one problem we had with her\u2026 ": u"E-E considerando que ela mudou de atitude, isso resolveria o principal problema que t\u00ednhamos com ela\u2026 ",
        u"A-And we weren\u2019t complaining either\u2026 We were just commenting on it\u2026": u"E-E tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o est\u00e1vamos reclamando\u2026 S\u00f3 est\u00e1vamos comentando\u2026",
        u"A-And you smell very nice too\u2026": u"E-E tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 com um cheiro muito bom\u2026",
        u"A-Anyway, I actually just noticed this one because I used to work out on something like it in college!": u"D-De todo modo, s\u00f3 reparei nesta porque treinava em algo parecido na faculdade!",
        u"A-Anyway, I actually used to work out on something like this back in college!": u"D-De todo modo, eu treinava em algo parecido na \u00e9poca da faculdade!",
        u"A-Anyway, I checked on Mr. Clermont a while ago and he\u2019s already packing up to leave. ": u"E-Enfim, fui ver o Sr. Clermont h\u00e1 pouco e ele j\u00e1 est\u00e1 arrumando as coisas para ir embora. ",
        u"A-Anyway, I just want to say that I\u2019m glad to get to know you better, Darius!": u"E-Enfim, s\u00f3 quero dizer que fico feliz por conhec\u00ea-lo melhor, Darius!",
        u"A-Anyway, I really appreciate you guys\u2019 company, and for helping me out with the blog project\u2026": u"E-Enfim, agrade\u00e7o muito a companhia de voc\u00eas e por me ajudarem com o projeto do blog\u2026",
        u"A-Anyway, I think Jin has enough information! Thanks for helping, you two!": u"E-Enfim, acho que Jin j\u00e1 tem informa\u00e7\u00f5es suficientes! Obrigado pela ajuda, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"A-Anyway, I\u2019ll get back to my other duties, and let you-": u"E-Enfim, vou voltar \u00e0s minhas outras tarefas e deixar o senhor\u2014",
        u"A-Anyway, I\u2019m sorry for changing subjects, why don\u2019t we go back to what we were talking about before?": u"D-De todo modo, desculpe por mudar de assunto. Por que n\u00e3o voltamos ao que est\u00e1vamos falando antes?",
        u"A-Anyway, Yoshi! We need to talk to you about something\u2026!": u"E-Enfim, Yoshi! Precisamos conversar com voc\u00ea sobre uma coisa\u2026!",
        u"A-Anyway, let me help out with the prep \u2013 I can\u2019t let you do everything!": u"E-Enfim, deixe eu ajudar com a prepara\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 n\u00e3o posso deixar voc\u00ea fazer tudo!",
        u"A-Anyway, let\u2019s check out the food bar. ": u"E-Enfim, vamos dar uma olhada na mesa de comida. ",
        u"A-Anyway, let\u2019s get started\u2026!": u"E-Enfim, vamos come\u00e7ar\u2026!",
        u"A-Anyway, should we all go now before it gets chilly out here?": u"E-Enfim, vamos embora antes que comece a esfriar aqui fora?",
        u"A-Anyway, why don\u2019t we just focus on the task at hand? We have to build these tents!": u"E-Enfim, por que n\u00e3o nos concentramos na tarefa? Temos que montar estas barracas!",
        u"A-Anyways, can you help us get one of those private booths?": u"D-De todo modo, pode nos ajudar a conseguir uma daquelas cabines privativas?",
        u"A-Anyway\u2026! I-I apologize if I\u2019m late! I was up all night preparing for this\u2026!": u"E-Enfim\u2026! P-Pe\u00e7o desculpas se estou atrasado! Passei a noite inteira me preparando para isto\u2026!",
        u"A-Are we really doing this right now, Aiden\u2026?": u"A-A gente vai mesmo fazer isso agora, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"A-Are you alright, Emilia?": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Emilia?",
        u"A-Are you alright\u2026? Come back to me.": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026? Volte para mim.",
        u"A-Are you feeling alright\u2026? If you need us to bring you to the hospital, just tell us right away\u2026!": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 se sentindo bem\u2026? Se precisar que a gente leve voc\u00ea ao hospital, diga imediatamente\u2026!",
        u"A-Are you guys serious about giving her the boot\u2026? Isn\u2019t that a little too much\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o falando s\u00e9rio sobre mandar ela embora\u2026? N\u00e3o \u00e9 um pouco demais\u2026?",
        u"A-Are you in there, Aiden\u2026?": u"A-Aiden, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 a\u00ed\u2026?",
        u"A-Are you okay, Dar? That didn\u2019t choke you, did it?": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Dar? N\u00e3o engasgou, n\u00e9?",
        u"A-Are you saying we would take over Sir Goro\u2019s position? We can\u2019t do that!": u"E-Est\u00e1 dizendo que assumir\u00edamos o cargo do Sr. Goro? N\u00e3o podemos fazer isso!",
        u"A-Are you sure I\u2019m not gonna get in trouble\u2026?": u"T-Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o vou me meter em encrenca\u2026?",
        u"A-Are you sure that\u2019s a good idea, Dad? She might\u2026": u"T-Tem certeza de que \u00e9 uma boa ideia, pai? Ela pode\u2026",
        u"A-Are you sure we should leave the group, though? Won\u2019t we get in trouble?": u"M-Mas tem certeza de que devemos deixar o grupo? N\u00e3o teremos problemas?",
        u"A-Are you sure you two don\u2019t need me to\u2014 ": u"T-Tem certeza de que voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o precisam que eu\u2014 ",
        u"A-Are you sure you wanna stay out here with me\u2026? It\u2019s pretty cold\u2026": u"T-Tem certeza de que quer ficar aqui fora comigo\u2026? Est\u00e1 bem frio\u2026",
        u"A-Are you sure you wanna stay up here with me\u2026? It\u2019s pretty cold\u2026": u"T-Tem certeza de que quer ficar aqui comigo\u2026? Est\u00e1 bem frio\u2026",
        u"A-Are you sure, Mr. Clermont? Your sponsorship has already done so much for us, I\u2019m not sure if we should accept\u2014": u"T-Tem certeza, Sr. Clermont? Seu patroc\u00ednio j\u00e1 fez tanto por n\u00f3s que n\u00e3o sei se dever\u00edamos aceitar\u2014",
        u"A-Are you sure, sir? You already have plenty on your hands right now.": u"T-Tem certeza, senhor? O senhor j\u00e1 tem muita coisa para resolver agora.",
        u"A-Are you sure? Maybe there\u2019s something we can do to help Sir G\u2014": u"T-Tem certeza? Talvez haja algo que possamos fazer para ajudar o senhor Go\u2014",
        u"A-Are you sure\u2026?": u"T-Tem certeza\u2026?",
        u"A-Are you\u2026 breaking up with me, Aiden\u2026?": u"A-Aiden\u2026 voc\u00ea est\u00e1\u2026 terminando comigo\u2026?",
        u"A-As long as you don\u2019t sneakily try to seduce me, sir\u2026": u"D-Desde que o senhor n\u00e3o tente me seduzir \u00e0s escondidas\u2026",
        u"A-ha! Found you two!": u"A-h\u00e1! Achei voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"AAAAAH! What the hell?! Why are you all here?!": u"AAAAAH! Que diabos?! Por que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o todos aqui?!",
        u"AAAHHH, WHAT THE FUCK?!": u"AAAHHH, QUE PORRA \u00c9 ESSA?!",
        u"AH! I was talking about your body, sir\u2026!! I-It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve last seen you like this\u2026": u"AH! Eu estava falando do seu corpo, senhor\u2026!! F-Faz algum tempo desde a \u00faltima vez que o vi assim\u2026",
        u"AIDEN, JIN, TAIGA AND YOICHI ALL NEAR-NAKED?! WHAT IS THIS SCENE UNFOLDING IN FRONT OF ME?!": u"AIDEN, JIN, TAIGA E YOICHI QUASE PELADOS?! QUE CENA \u00c9 ESSA DIANTE DOS MEUS OLHOS?!",
        u"AIDEN, WAKE UP! *takes blanket off*": u"AIDEN, ACORDE! *tira o cobertor*",
        u"AIDEN?! WHERE ARE YOUR PANTS?!": u"AIDEN?! ONDE EST\u00c3O SUAS CAL\u00c7AS?!",
        u"ALL OF US?! You\u2019re the only one who\u2019s been rude this whole time!!": u"TODOS N\u00d3S?! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 a \u00fanica que foi grosseira esse tempo todo!!",
        u"AM I SEEING WHAT I THINK I\u2019M SEEING?!": u"ESTOU VENDO O QUE ACHO QUE ESTOU VENDO?!",
        u"ARGH! I\u2019m so mad I didn\u2019t bring my DSLR camera for this trip! I wanna take a bunch of pictures of the interior for my design references!!": u"ARGH! Estou furioso por n\u00e3o ter trazido minha c\u00e2mera DSLR para esta viagem! Quero tirar um monte de fotos do interior como refer\u00eancia para meus projetos!!",
        u"ARGHHH\u2026 Come ooon\u2026 Don\u2019t do this to meee\u2026.": u"ARGHHH\u2026 Qual \u00e9\u00e9\u00e9\u2026 N\u00e3o fa\u00e7am isso comigooo\u2026",
        u"Aaahh\u2026! A-Aiden, I can\u2019t\u2014": u"Aaahh\u2026! A-Aiden, eu n\u00e3o consigo\u2014",
        u"Aaah\u2026 This is so embarrassing\u2026 I-I\u2019m so sorry, Darius. It\u2019s just, you look nothing like I remember, and it didn\u2019t even cross my mind that you\u2019re the same person.": u"Aaah\u2026 Que vergonha\u2026 M-Me desculpe, Darius. \u00c9 que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se parece em nada com o que eu lembrava, e nem passou pela minha cabe\u00e7a que fosse a mesma pessoa.",
        u"Aah\u2026! I didn\u2019t realize I was doing that\u2026!": u"Aah\u2026! Eu n\u00e3o tinha percebido que estava fazendo isso\u2026!",
        u"About last night\u2026": u"Sobre ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"About that, I\u2019ve been working with the local city hall ever since the end of the previous term. The good news is that I was able to secure all the necessary paperwork.": u"Quanto a isso, trabalho com a prefeitura local desde o fim da temporada anterior. A boa not\u00edcia \u00e9 que consegui providenciar toda a documenta\u00e7\u00e3o necess\u00e1ria.",
        u"About that\u2026 I\u2019m really sorry for walking out on you all so abruptly\u2026 ": u"Sobre isso\u2026 Sinto muito por ter sa\u00eddo e deixado voc\u00eas t\u00e3o de repente\u2026 ",
        u"About time you joined in!": u"At\u00e9 que enfim voc\u00ea entrou na brincadeira!",
        u"About what\u2026?": u"Sobre o qu\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"Abs.": u"Abd\u00f4men.",
        u"Absolutely~! The last few months on the project haven\u2019t really given me any time to consume my BL in peace!": u"Com certeza~! Os \u00faltimos meses no projeto n\u00e3o me deram tempo algum para consumir meu BL em paz!",
        u"According to the schedule, the site should\u2019ve been cleared yesterday. Yet, I saw it was still in progress, and took up this whole workday to finish.": u"Segundo o cronograma, o terreno deveria ter sido limpo ontem. Por\u00e9m, o servi\u00e7o ainda estava em andamento e consumiu todo o dia de hoje.",
        u"Ack!": u"Argh!",
        u"Ack\u2026 That\u2019s going to be tough\u2026 I\u2019ve gotten so used to calling you \u2018Sir\u2019 over the years\u2026 It\u2019s almost like it\u2019s part of your name too, haha.": u"Ack\u2026 Isso vai ser dif\u00edcil\u2026 Acostumei tanto a chamar o senhor de \u2018Sr.\u2019 ao longo dos anos\u2026 \u00c9 quase como se fizesse parte do seu nome tamb\u00e9m, haha.",
        u"Ack\u2026! I-It\u2019s not what you think! I wasn\u2019t slacking off\u2026!": u"Ack\u2026! N-N\u00e3o \u00e9 o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pensando! Eu n\u00e3o estava enrolando\u2026!",
        u"Actually, Aiden still hasn\u2019t made up his mind about it.": u"Na verdade, Aiden ainda n\u00e3o se decidiu.",
        u"Actually, I don\u2019t mind either. I did take a few painting classes growing up~": u"Na verdade, eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o me importo. Fiz algumas aulas de pintura quando era mais nova~",
        u"Actually, I was hoping to help you three with chores around the camp instead of all this legal work.": u"Na verdade, eu esperava ajudar voc\u00eas tr\u00eas nas tarefas do acampamento em vez de cuidar de todo este trabalho jur\u00eddico.",
        u"Actually, I\u2019ll stay here and keep Emilia company for the night!": u"Na verdade, vou ficar aqui e fazer companhia para Emilia esta noite!",
        u"Actually, I\u2019m in the same boat as Jin here. Knowing we were gonna go home today, I made sure I tried everything I wanted to yesterday.": u"Na verdade, estou na mesma situa\u00e7\u00e3o que Jin. Como sabia que ir\u00edamos embora hoje, fiz quest\u00e3o de experimentar ontem tudo o que queria.",
        u"Actually, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Na verdade, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Actually, for some reason, Emilia was trying to help clear up my role on this project.": u"Na verdade, por algum motivo, Emilia estava tentando ajudar a definir minha fun\u00e7\u00e3o neste projeto.",
        u"Actually, it was the opposite. She was really remorseful over the way she acted, and grateful over how we were taking care of her.": u"Na verdade, foi o contr\u00e1rio. Ela estava muito arrependida pela forma como agiu e agradecida por estarmos cuidando dela.",
        u"Actually, please make that two. ": u"Na verdade, fa\u00e7a dois, por favor. ",
        u"Actually, that reminds me \u2013 since when have you had a normal person schedule, Jin?!": u"Ali\u00e1s, isso me lembra \u2014 desde quando voc\u00ea tem hor\u00e1rio de gente normal, Jin?!",
        u"Actually, that\u2019s one of the reasons I dragged you with me, I wanted to show you something.": u"Na verdade, esse \u00e9 um dos motivos pelos quais arrastei voc\u00ea comigo. Queria lhe mostrar uma coisa.",
        u"Actually, there\u2019s a simple trick to know which ones to use.": u"Na verdade, h\u00e1 um truque simples para saber quais usar.",
        u"Actually, we aren\u2019t sure either.": u"Na verdade, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sabemos.",
        u"Actually, when we were discussing it with them, both Lloyd and Darius told us that they saw the opening was for work on Camp Buddy and signed up right away.": u"Na verdade, quando conversamos com eles, Lloyd e Darius disseram que viram que a vaga era para trabalhar no Camp Buddy e se candidataram imediatamente.",
        u"Actually\u2026 I got all the things I need from the shed. I\u2019ll leave the cleanup to you guys~! ": u"Na verdade\u2026 J\u00e1 peguei tudo de que precisava no galp\u00e3o. Vou deixar a limpeza com voc\u00eas~! ",
        u"Actually\u2026 Maybe Sir Goro has something specific for me.": u"Pensando bem\u2026 Talvez o Senhor Goro tenha algo espec\u00edfico para mim.",
        u"Actually\u2026 Since we\u2019re all here\u2026 As much as I hate to talk about this, especially so early in the morning, maybe we should address it\u2026": u"Na verdade\u2026 J\u00e1 que estamos todos aqui\u2026 Por mais que eu odeie falar disso, principalmente t\u00e3o cedo, talvez dev\u00eassemos resolver essa quest\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Advice? From me? ": u"Conselho? Meu? ",
        u"After all, I\u2019ve seen and tasted the stuff you made, and I have to say \u2013 I never thought I\u2019d see meat and chocolate in a dish together\u2026": u"Afinal, j\u00e1 vi e provei as coisas que voc\u00ea preparou e preciso dizer: nunca pensei que veria carne e chocolate juntos em um prato\u2026",
        u"After all, Mr. Clermont is someone I\u2019ve looked up to for a long time. I didn\u2019t think I\u2019d ever meet him in person, so his visit really caught me off guard.": u"Afinal, o senhor Clermont \u00e9 algu\u00e9m que admiro h\u00e1 muito tempo. Nunca imaginei que o conheceria pessoalmente, ent\u00e3o a visita realmente me pegou desprevenido.",
        u"After all, didn\u2019t you say to that bartender a while ago that we\u2019re together? This\u2019ll show them~": u"Afinal, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o disse h\u00e1 pouco para aquele bartender que estamos juntos? Isso vai mostrar para eles~",
        u"After all, it\u2019s been what\u2026? A decade since this place started? You\u2019re going to have to step up eventually!": u"Afinal, j\u00e1 faz o qu\u00ea\u2026? Uma d\u00e9cada desde que este lugar come\u00e7ou? Em algum momento voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que assumir!",
        u"After all, just look at you \u2013 you\u2019re more than ready for it.": u"Afinal, olhe s\u00f3 para voc\u00ea \u2013 est\u00e1 mais do que pronto para isso.",
        u"After all, last night is still fresh on our minds, and we should make that choice with clearer heads. ": u"Afinal, o que aconteceu ontem \u00e0 noite ainda est\u00e1 fresco em nossas mentes, e devemos tomar essa decis\u00e3o de cabe\u00e7a mais fria. ",
        u"After all, this is Aiden\u2019s first official day as a helper here! ": u"Afinal, este \u00e9 o primeiro dia oficial do Aiden como ajudante aqui! ",
        u"After all, we all know what happened with his father\u2026": u"Afinal, todos sabemos o que aconteceu com o pai dele\u2026",
        u"After all, we still have a situation on the site to deal with.": u"Afinal, ainda temos uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o na obra para resolver.",
        u"After all, you\u2019ve hooked a pretty big fish \u2013 having Clermont Inc. sponsor this camp.": u"Afinal, voc\u00eas fisgaram um peixe bem grande ao conseguir que a Clermont Inc. patrocinasse este acampamento.",
        u"After everything I learned at Camp Buddy and the way you believed in me, I wanted to prove how capable I could be.": u"Depois de tudo que aprendi no Camp Buddy e de como voc\u00ea acreditou em mim, eu queria provar do que era capaz.",
        u"After everything I\u2019ve learned\u2026  Can I ask why you wanted to show me all this, Goro?": u"Depois de tudo que descobri\u2026  Posso perguntar por que queria me mostrar tudo isso, Goro?",
        u"After everything that\u2019s happened at the hotel, I think it\u2019s best if we try and handle it away from here\u2026 but I do expect it to be an awkward bus ride back.": u"Depois de tudo que aconteceu no hotel, acho melhor tentarmos resolver isso longe daqui\u2026 mas imagino que a viagem de \u00f4nibus de volta ser\u00e1 bem constrangedora.",
        u"After everything you taught me, I\u2019m ready to lead and make the decisions, so they won\u2019t burden you anymore!": u"Depois de tudo que voc\u00ea me ensinou, estou pronto para liderar e tomar as decis\u00f5es, para que elas n\u00e3o pesem mais sobre voc\u00ea!",
        u"After grinding for months, wearing our bodies out day and night, we really deserve this.": u"Depois de meses trabalhando sem parar e desgastando nossos corpos dia e noite, realmente merecemos isso.",
        u"After losing all that and having to live life so frugally, you really get to see what a difference it makes.": u"Depois de perder tudo isso e ter que viver de forma t\u00e3o econ\u00f4mica, voc\u00ea realmente percebe a diferen\u00e7a que o dinheiro faz.",
        u"After my dad passed, I was so determined to pursue cooking knowing it was the one thing I was really good at.": u"Depois que meu pai faleceu, eu estava t\u00e3o determinado a seguir na cozinha, sabendo que era a \u00fanica coisa em que eu realmente era bom.",
        u"After my inspection and a meticulous review of everyone\u2019s progress so far \u2013 I have worked overnight to create a detailed timetable for the next few months.": u"Depois da inspe\u00e7\u00e3o e de uma an\u00e1lise meticulosa do progresso de todos, trabalhei durante a noite para criar um cronograma detalhado para os pr\u00f3ximos meses.",
        u"After that, I closed off my feelings, just like you\u2026": u"Depois disso, reprimi meus sentimentos, assim como o senhor\u2026",
        u"After that, I searched for Camp Buddy on the internet, and the first thing that popped up was Mr. Clermont\u2019s job opening! ": u"Depois disso, pesquisei Camp Buddy na internet, e a primeira coisa que apareceu foi a vaga do Sr. Clermont! ",
        u"After that, it became something we\u2019d always bond over. He started calling me his \u2018little chef\u2019 and we\u2019d always cook and eat together!": u"Depois disso, cozinhar virou algo que sempre nos unia. Ele come\u00e7ou a me chamar de \u2018pequeno chef\u2019, e n\u00f3s sempre cozinh\u00e1vamos e com\u00edamos juntos!",
        u"After the first term, I kept building up the camp until it had grown and spread.": u"Depois da primeira temporada, continuei desenvolvendo o acampamento at\u00e9 ele crescer e se expandir.",
        u"After this off season, I\u2019m ready to get back to it! I can\u2019t wait to teach the scouts again! ": u"Depois desta temporada de folga, estou pronto para voltar \u00e0 ativa! Mal posso esperar para ensinar os escoteiros de novo! ",
        u"After we finish this project\u2026 Let\u2019s leave the camp.": u"Depois que terminarmos este projeto\u2026 Vamos deixar o acampamento.",
        u"After what happened back at the hotel, I realized that I don\u2019t need to bury my past anymore.": u"Depois do que aconteceu no hotel, percebi que n\u00e3o preciso mais enterrar meu passado.",
        u"After what happened last night\u2026 We\u2019ve been quite worried about you.": u"Depois do que aconteceu ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 Ficamos bastante preocupados com voc\u00ea.",
        u"After what she did last night, we might actually get kicked out\u2026 I don\u2019t wanna spend tonight covered in snow\u2026": u"Depois do que ela fez ontem \u00e0 noite, talvez realmente nos expulsem\u2026 N\u00e3o quero passar a noite coberto de neve\u2026",
        u"After working with him throughout the project, I\u2019ve been trying to absorb all that knowledge and think like him too.": u"Depois de trabalhar com ele durante todo o projeto, venho tentando absorver todo esse conhecimento e pensar como ele tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"After working with you these past few months, I really got to see just how much stuff you have on your plate.": u"Depois de trabalhar com voc\u00ea nestes \u00faltimos meses, pude ver quanta coisa est\u00e1 sob sua responsabilidade.",
        u"After you left for your studies, Aiden and Andre had to leave too.": u"Depois que voc\u00ea foi embora para estudar, Aiden e Andre tamb\u00e9m tiveram que partir.",
        u"After you\u2019re done, I\u2019ll guess and see if I can get it right!": u"Quando terminar, eu tento adivinhar para ver se acerto!",
        u"Again, that\u2019s not the game, Yuri.": u"De novo, esse n\u00e3o \u00e9 o jogo, Yuri.",
        u"Ah perfect! Come with me then!": u"Ah, perfeito! Ent\u00e3o venha comigo!",
        u"Ah well, I\u2019m just not used to seeing you without Lloyd. ": u"Ah, bem, s\u00f3 n\u00e3o estou acostumado a ver voc\u00ea sem Lloyd. ",
        u"Ah well, about that\u2026": u"Ah, bem, sobre isso\u2026",
        u"Ah yes, that\u2019s Aiden\u2019s clothes! Thank you!": u"Ah, sim, s\u00e3o as roupas do Aiden! Obrigado!",
        u"Ah! Hello again, you two!": u"Ah! Ol\u00e1 de novo, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Ah! Hello, you two!": u"Ah! Ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Ah! I assume Clermont Inc. sent you?": u"Ah! Presumo que a Clermont Inc. tenha enviado voc\u00ea?",
        u"Ah! I thought you two might end up here at some point today.": u"Ah! Imaginei que voc\u00eas dois acabariam aparecendo por aqui em algum momento hoje.",
        u"Ah! It\u2019s ready!": u"Ah! Est\u00e1 pronta!",
        u"Ah! Jin replaced our office computer with a much better one! He even taught me how to use and troubleshoot it!": u"Ah! Jin substituiu o computador do escrit\u00f3rio por um muito melhor! Ele at\u00e9 me ensinou a us\u00e1-lo e solucionar problemas!",
        u"Ah! Mr. Clermont\u2019s party! One of our VIP Guests! We\u2019ve been expecting you!": u"Ah! O grupo do Sr. Clermont! Nossos h\u00f3spedes VIP! Est\u00e1vamos esperando por voc\u00eas!",
        u"Ah! Perfect timing! There they are!": u"Ah! Na hora certa! A\u00ed est\u00e3o eles!",
        u"Ah! That actually gives me an idea!": u"Ah! Isso me deu uma ideia!",
        u"Ah! There they are!": u"Ah! A\u00ed est\u00e3o eles!",
        u"Ah, Aiden\u2019s still asleep, sir! We kinda stayed up late last night, a lot of our cabinmates wanted to get to know him more.": u"Ah, Aiden ainda est\u00e1 dormindo, senhor! Ficamos acordados at\u00e9 tarde ontem; v\u00e1rios dos nossos companheiros de cabana queriam conhec\u00ea-lo melhor.",
        u"Ah, Aiden\u2026 Did I wake you up?": u"Ah, Aiden\u2026 Eu te acordei?",
        u"Ah, Aiden\u2026 I-": u"Ah, Aiden\u2026 Eu\u2014",
        u"Ah, Andre did tell me Aiden was taking over lunch duty since he wasn\u2019t feeling well.": u"Ah, Andre me disse que Aiden assumiria o almo\u00e7o porque ele n\u00e3o estava se sentindo bem.",
        u"Ah, Dad\u2026 I uhh\u2026": u"Ah, pai\u2026 Eu, hum\u2026",
        u"Ah, Dad\u2026 I uhh\u2026{fast}": u"Ah, pai\u2026 Eu, hum\u2026{fast}",
        u"Ah, Emilia\u2026 You\u2019re awake.": u"Ah, Emilia\u2026 Voc\u00ea acordou.",
        u"Ah, I apologize, that\u2019s not what I meant\u2026!": u"Ah, pe\u00e7o desculpas, n\u00e3o foi isso que quis dizer\u2026!",
        u"Ah, I believe you two haven\u2019t met yet! This is Jin! He\u2019s the tech specialist that we were expecting today!": u"Ah, acredito que voc\u00eas ainda n\u00e3o tenham se conhecido! Este \u00e9 Jin! Ele \u00e9 o especialista em tecnologia que esper\u00e1vamos hoje!",
        u"Ah, I didn\u2019t notice you two were here as well\u2026": u"Ah, n\u00e3o percebi que voc\u00eas dois tamb\u00e9m estavam aqui\u2026",
        u"Ah, I see. I didn\u2019t know it was that easy\u2026": u"Ah, entendi. N\u00e3o sabia que era t\u00e3o f\u00e1cil\u2026",
        u"Ah, I see...": u"Ah, entendo...",
        u"Ah, I shouldn\u2019t be thinking this way\u2026! I\u2019ll just focus on finding where I can help out today.  ": u"Ah, n\u00e3o deveria pensar assim\u2026! Vou me concentrar em descobrir onde posso ajudar hoje.  ",
        u"Ah, I shouldn\u2019t be thinking this way\u2026! I\u2019ll just focus on finding where I can help out today.{fast}": u"Ah, n\u00e3o deveria pensar assim\u2026! Vou me concentrar em descobrir onde posso ajudar hoje.{fast}",
        u"Ah, I was about to gather some myself to bring to the office. ": u"Ah, eu estava prestes a juntar um pouco para levar ao escrit\u00f3rio. ",
        u"Ah, I was just doing the rounds to see if everything\u2019s going well.": u"Ah, s\u00f3 estou fazendo uma ronda para ver se est\u00e1 tudo indo bem.",
        u"Ah, I would like to work right away, if that\u2019s okay. Thanks for the offer though.": u"Ah, eu gostaria de come\u00e7ar a trabalhar imediatamente, se n\u00e3o houver problema. Mas agrade\u00e7o a oferta.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m glad you took care of things.": u"Ah, fico feliz que tenha cuidado de tudo.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m glad you two are awake.": u"Ah, fico feliz que voc\u00eas dois estejam acordados.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m responsible for that. ": u"Ah, sou respons\u00e1vel por isso.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m sorry about that\u2026 and for going out without telling you.": u"Ah, desculpe por isso\u2026 e por ter sa\u00eddo sem avisar.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m sorry you had to hear that. But yes, I\u2019m quite alright.": u"Ah, desculpe voc\u00ea ter ouvido aquilo. Mas sim, estou bem.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m sorry you two have to hear me ramble about all this!": u"Ah, desculpem por terem que me ouvir divagar sobre tudo isso!",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m sorry, Aiden! I didn't mean to dig so deeply into that.": u"Ah, desculpe, Aiden! N\u00e3o queria entrar t\u00e3o fundo nisso.",
        u"Ah, I\u2019m sorry, sir! I didn't mean to dig so deeply into it.": u"Ah, desculpe, senhor! N\u00e3o queria me aprofundar tanto nisso.",
        u"Ah, Mr. Clermont! Thank you so much for coming, sir!": u"Ah, Sr. Clermont! Muito obrigado por vir, senhor!",
        u"Ah, Mr. Nagame, why don\u2019t you sit here with us for a moment?": u"Ah, Sr. Nagame, por que n\u00e3o se senta conosco por um momento?",
        u"Ah, Mr. Nomoru! Pardon my sudden visit, but I\u2019ve brought some assistance!": u"Ah, Sr. Nomoru! Perdoe minha visita repentina, mas trouxe alguma ajuda!",
        u"Ah, Sir Goro\u2026 I-": u"Ah, senhor Goro\u2026 Eu-",
        u"Ah, Sir Goro\u2026! S-Sorry, did I wake you?": u"Ah, Sr. Goro\u2026! D-Desculpe, eu acordei o senhor?",
        u"Ah, Yoshinori! What brings you here?": u"Ah, Yoshinori! O que traz voc\u00ea aqui?",
        u"Ah, Yoshinori, Goro, please take a seat!": u"Ah, Yoshinori, Goro, por favor, sentem-se!",
        u"Ah, Yoshinori, please take a seat!": u"Ah, Yoshinori, por favor, sente-se!",
        u"Ah, Yoshinori. Yes, I\u2019m here.": u"Ah, Yoshinori. Sim, estou aqui.",
        u"Ah, Yoshinori\u2026 One more thing.": u"Ah, Yoshinori\u2026 Mais uma coisa.",
        u"Ah, Yuri\u2019s watching over Emilia, our inspector\u2026 sort of.": u"Ah, Yuri est\u00e1 cuidando da Emilia, nossa inspetora\u2026 mais ou menos.",
        u"Ah, about that, Emilia\u2026": u"Ah, sobre isso, Emilia\u2026",
        u"Ah, ah, ah! I had three more bouquets of flowers back at the mess hall that you FORGOT!": u"Ah, ah, ah! Eu tinha mais tr\u00eas buqu\u00eas de flores no refeit\u00f3rio que voc\u00eas ESQUECERAM!",
        u"Ah, alright, never mind then.": u"Ah, certo, deixa para l\u00e1 ent\u00e3o.",
        u"Ah, do you want me to apply more pressure, sir\u2026?": u"Ah, quer que eu fa\u00e7a mais press\u00e3o, senhor\u2026?",
        u"Ah, excuse me, guys. I need to catch up with Aiden.": u"Ah, com licen\u00e7a, pessoal. Preciso alcan\u00e7ar o Aiden.",
        u"Ah, good evening, everyone. ": u"Ah, boa noite a todos. ",
        u"Ah, good job, Yoshinori. Let me come back right away and resume our hike.": u"Ah, bom trabalho, Yoshinori. Vou voltar imediatamente e retomar a caminhada.",
        u"Ah, gotcha\u2026!": u"Ah, entendi\u2026!",
        u"Ah, haha\u2026 I\u2019d like to say I\u2019m surprised, but cooking has been Aiden\u2019s favorite thing to do since he was little! ": u"Ah, haha\u2026 Gostaria de dizer que estou surpreso, mas cozinhar \u00e9 a atividade favorita do Aiden desde pequeno! ",
        u"Ah, hehe\u2026 I was honestly just tinkering with it until I figured it out \u2013 turns out it was pretty simple. ": u"Ah, hehe\u2026 Sinceramente, apenas mexi nos aparelhos at\u00e9 entender como funcionavam \u2014 no fim, era bem simples. ",
        u"Ah, hehe\u2026 I've always had trouble keeping up with you, sir. ": u"Ah, hehe\u2026 Sempre tive dificuldade para acompanhar o senhor.",
        u"Ah, hehe\u2026 You don\u2019t look like you\u2019re tired at all, sir.": u"Ah, hehe\u2026 O senhor nem parece cansado.",
        u"Ah, hello, Jin! ": u"Ah, ol\u00e1, Jin! ",
        u"Ah, here they are!": u"Ah, aqui est\u00e3o!",
        u"Ah, hey guys. Sorry about the slight delay. ": u"Ah, oi, pessoal. Desculpem pelo pequeno atraso. ",
        u"Ah, hopefully the fit isn\u2019t too loose on you. ": u"Ah, espero que n\u00e3o esteja folgado demais em voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Ah, it looks like we got here just in time, everyone else seems to be here already.": u"Ah, parece que chegamos bem na hora, todo mundo j\u00e1 est\u00e1 aqui.",
        u"Ah, it looks like you\u2019re all ready to go. The workers are gathered as well and the shuttle should arrive in a few minutes.": u"Ah, parece que todos est\u00e3o prontos para partir. Os trabalhadores tamb\u00e9m j\u00e1 est\u00e3o reunidos, e o transporte deve chegar em alguns minutos.",
        u"Ah, it seems Yuri\u2019s here as well.": u"Ah, parece que Yuri tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 aqui.",
        u"Ah, it\u2019s so nice to see this new part of our camp in full bloom. I feel like a proud mother seeing all my plants grow so prettily~": u"Ah, \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom ver esta nova parte do acampamento toda florida. Sinto-me como uma m\u00e3e orgulhosa vendo todas as minhas plantas crescerem t\u00e3o bonitas~",
        u"Ah, just in time. Do you two want to come with me?": u"Ah, bem na hora. Voc\u00eas dois querem vir comigo?",
        u"Ah, looks like you all have cleared up over there as well. Great work.": u"Ah, parece que voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m limparam tudo por l\u00e1. \u00d3timo trabalho.",
        u"Ah, looks like you guys are done with breakfast.": u"Ah, parece que voc\u00eas j\u00e1 terminaram o caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3.",
        u"Ah, not yet. Can you give us a little bit more time to browse the menu?": u"Ah, ainda n\u00e3o. Pode nos dar mais um pouco de tempo para olhar o card\u00e1pio?",
        u"Ah, of course! Let me lead the way!": u"Ah, claro! Deixe-me mostrar o caminho!",
        u"Ah, of course! Sorry for not introducing them right away, I got caught up with the reunion!": u"Ah, claro! Desculpem por n\u00e3o apresent\u00e1-los logo, acabei me empolgando com o reencontro!",
        u"Ah, perfect! You guys are here!": u"Ah, perfeito! Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o aqui!",
        u"Ah, right! I didn\u2019t get to tell you that Jin and I were working on this little website project, sir!": u"Ah, \u00e9! N\u00e3o cheguei a contar que eu e Jin est\u00e1vamos trabalhando em um pequeno projeto de site, senhor!",
        u"Ah, right\u2026 I did leave quite a mess back at the dinner\u2026 I\u2019ll have to talk to the manager and formally apologize.": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 Eu realmente deixei uma bela confus\u00e3o no jantar\u2026 Vou ter que falar com o gerente e pedir desculpas formalmente.",
        u"Ah, right\u2026!": u"Ah, certo\u2026!",
        u"Ah, right\u2026! ": u"Ah, certo\u2026! ",
        u"Ah, scouts! I\u2019m so glad to see you all here!": u"Ah, escoteiros! Fico t\u00e3o feliz em ver todos voc\u00eas aqui!",
        u"Ah, shit\u2026": u"Ah, merda\u2026",
        u"Ah, shit\u2026 I completely forgot that was today.": u"Ah, merda\u2026 Esqueci completamente que era hoje.",
        u"Ah, shit\u2026 I completely forgot that was today.{fast}": u"Ah, merda\u2026 Esqueci completamente que era hoje.{fast}",
        u"Ah, so it\u2019s gonna be like a little reunion! It\u2019s been a couple months since you\u2019ve all been together \u2013 you must really miss each other!": u"Ah, ent\u00e3o ser\u00e1 como uma pequena reuni\u00e3o! Faz alguns meses desde que estiveram todos juntos \u2014 voc\u00eas devem sentir muita saudade uns dos outros!",
        u"Ah, sorry about that!": u"Ah, desculpe!",
        u"Ah, sorry about that. I couldn\u2019t answer my phone while I was driving.": u"Ah, desculpe. N\u00e3o podia atender o telefone enquanto dirigia.",
        u"Ah, sorry. I was just thinking about how Emilia reacted back there.": u"Ah, desculpe. Eu s\u00f3 estava pensando em como Emilia reagiu l\u00e1 atr\u00e1s.",
        u"Ah, speaking of, that\u2019s my cue!": u"Ah, falando nisso, esse \u00e9 o meu chamado!",
        u"Ah, thank you very much. That should be everything we need.": u"Ah, muito obrigado. Isso esclarece tudo que precis\u00e1vamos saber.",
        u"Ah, thank you, Yoshinori. Take your time though, it\u2019s really alright.": u"Ah, obrigado, Yoshinori. Mas n\u00e3o tenha pressa, est\u00e1 tudo bem.",
        u"Ah, thanks Aiden. ": u"Ah, obrigado, Aiden. ",
        u"Ah, thanks! It\u2019s just what we need! ": u"Ah, obrigado! \u00c9 exatamente do que precisamos! ",
        u"Ah, that\u2019s good to know.": u"Ah, fico aliviado em saber.",
        u"Ah, that\u2019s perfect. I appreciate all the help.": u"Ah, perfeito. Agrade\u00e7o toda a ajuda.",
        u"Ah, that\u2019s right, you weren\u2019t here last term, Jin. Yes, we took the campers to the beach for a few days during the summer this year.": u"Ah, \u00e9 verdade, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava aqui na \u00faltima temporada, Jin. Sim, levamos os campistas \u00e0 praia por alguns dias durante o ver\u00e3o deste ano.",
        u"Ah, that\u2019s what I thought~": u"Ah, foi o que eu pensei~",
        u"Ah, the bartender\u2019s right over there. Let me just call him.": u"Ah, o bartender est\u00e1 logo ali. Vou cham\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Ah, there he is.": u"Ah, a\u00ed est\u00e1 ele.",
        u"Ah, there you are, Dad!": u"Ah, a\u00ed est\u00e1 voc\u00ea, Pai!",
        u"Ah, there you are, Yoshi! The shuttle just finished unloading the workers and their luggage. I\u2019m getting a little overwhelmed trying to assist everyone.": u"Ah, a\u00ed est\u00e1 voc\u00ea, Yoshi! O \u00f4nibus acabou de desembarcar os trabalhadores e as bagagens. Estou ficando um pouco sobrecarregada tentando ajudar todos.",
        u"Ah, there you are, everyone. You all must\u2019ve heard the news, right?": u"Ah, a\u00ed est\u00e3o voc\u00eas. Todos j\u00e1 devem ter ouvido a not\u00edcia, certo?",
        u"Ah, there you boys, are! I\u2019ve been looking for\u2014": u"Ah, a\u00ed est\u00e3o voc\u00eas, rapazes! Eu estava procurando por\u2014",
        u"Ah, was your father a professional chef of some kind?": u"Ah, seu pai era algum tipo de chef profissional?",
        u"Ah, we apologize for stepping out of scope. There were some unforeseen difficulties that required more manpower to complete the site clearing in time.": u"Ah, pedimos desculpas por agirmos fora de nossas fun\u00e7\u00f5es. Algumas dificuldades imprevistas exigiram mais m\u00e3o de obra para concluir a limpeza a tempo.",
        u"Ah, we had a meeting with Mr. Clermont earlier today.": u"Ah, tivemos uma reuni\u00e3o com o senhor Clermont hoje mais cedo.",
        u"Ah, we just finished a workout of our own too!": u"Ah, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m acabamos de terminar nosso pr\u00f3prio treino!",
        u"Ah, we met earlier. Though it\u2019s nice to finally meet you again, Yoshinori! ": u"Ah, n\u00f3s nos encontramos mais cedo. Mas \u00e9 bom finalmente rev\u00ea-lo, Yoshinori! ",
        u"Ah, we understand! We\u2019re glad to have had you around, sir!": u"Ah, entendemos! Ficamos felizes por ter recebido o senhor!",
        u"Ah, we were informed that we have a scheduled formal dinner tonight down at the restaurant.": u"Ah, fomos informados de que temos um jantar formal marcado para esta noite no restaurante.",
        u"Ah, welcome back, son\u2026 ": u"Ah, bem-vindo de volta, filho\u2026 ",
        u"Ah, welcome scouts! I wasn\u2019t expecting a visit from all of you.": u"Ah, bem-vindos, escoteiros! Eu n\u00e3o esperava a visita de todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Ah, well, it\u2019s not you guys\u2019 fault. I was already having trouble keeping up and it was the stuff Emilia said that really made me upset.": u"Ah, bem, a culpa n\u00e3o \u00e9 de voc\u00eas. Eu j\u00e1 estava tendo dificuldade para acompanhar, e foram as coisas que a Emilia disse que realmente me deixaram mal.",
        u"Ah, well. We'll continue this when we have a chance later, Yoshinori.  We don\u2019t want them getting the wrong idea.": u"Ah, bem. Continuaremos quando tivermos outra oportunidade, Yoshinori.  N\u00e3o queremos que eles entendam errado.",
        u"Ah, well\u2026": u"Ah, bem\u2026",
        u"Ah, well\u2026 Before Mr. Clermont left yesterday, he sorta gave me a shot at being a pro chef.": u"Ah, bem\u2026 Antes de partir ontem, o Sr. Clermont meio que me deu uma oportunidade de virar chef profissional.",
        u"Ah, well\u2026 I\u2019m only taking over while he\u2019s gone\u2026 ": u"Ah, bem\u2026 S\u00f3 estou assumindo enquanto ele est\u00e1 fora\u2026 ",
        u"Ah, well\u2026 That\u2019s exactly it\u2026": u"Ah, bem\u2026 Esse \u00e9 exatamente o problema\u2026",
        u"Ah, we\u2019re going into the woods soon so it\u2019s gonna be a little rocky! ": u"Ah, logo vamos entrar na floresta, ent\u00e3o o caminho vai ficar um pouco acidentado! ",
        u"Ah, we\u2019re not really allowed to bring visitors to the camp, actually\u2026 Today was just an exception since we had a meeting, and I\u2019ll be working until late tonight.": u"Ah, na verdade n\u00e3o podemos trazer visitantes ao acampamento\u2026 Hoje foi apenas uma exce\u00e7\u00e3o porque tivemos uma reuni\u00e3o e trabalharei at\u00e9 tarde.",
        u"Ah, what is it?": u"Ah, o que foi?",
        u"Ah, would you look at that. This angel outfit really shows off your innocence.": u"Ah, olhe s\u00f3. Essa roupa de anjo realmente destaca sua inoc\u00eancia.",
        u"Ah, y-yeah! I\u2019m sorry for passing out on you guys last night\u2026!": u"Ah, s-sim! Desculpem por ter apagado em cima de voc\u00eas ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026!",
        u"Ah, yeah\u2026 About that too\u2026": u"Ah, sim\u2026 Sobre isso tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"Ah, yeah\u2026 He wasn\u2019t in the office when I woke up.": u"Ah, sim\u2026 Ele n\u00e3o estava no escrit\u00f3rio quando acordei.",
        u"Ah, yes of course.": u"Ah, sim, claro.",
        u"Ah, yes! Here they are!": u"Ah, sim! Aqui est\u00e3o!",
        u"Ah, yes! The mess hall is usually full during mealtimes. It\u2019s a bit more packed than usual since the workers for the project moved in yesterday!": u"Ah, sim! O refeit\u00f3rio costuma ficar cheio nos hor\u00e1rios das refei\u00e7\u00f5es. Est\u00e1 um pouco mais lotado do que o normal porque os trabalhadores do projeto chegaram ontem!",
        u"Ah, yes! Yesterday, we were able to survey the land and mark the trees we\u2019ll need to cut down.": u"Ah, sim! Ontem, conseguimos inspecionar o terreno e marcar as \u00e1rvores que precisaremos derrubar.",
        u"Ah, yes, I am. I have a meeting scheduled with Mr. Clermont. ": u"Ah, sim. Tenho uma reuni\u00e3o marcada com o senhor Clermont. ",
        u"Ah, yes, dear!": u"Ah, sim, querido!",
        u"Ah, yes, of course. Very fitting for youngsters like you.": u"Ah, sim, claro. Bem apropriado para jovens como voc\u00eas.",
        u"Ah, yes, of course\u2026 Let me give you a tour.": u"Ah, sim, claro\u2026 Deixe-me gui\u00e1-la.",
        u"Ah, yes, we\u2019re expecting the first batch to be approximately thirty people.": u"Ah, sim, esperamos aproximadamente trinta pessoas no primeiro grupo.",
        u"Ah, yes. Can we have the menu please?": u"Ah, sim. Pode nos trazer o card\u00e1pio, por favor?",
        u"Ah, yes. Do you need anything?": u"Ah, sim. Precisa de alguma coisa?",
        u"Ah, yes. If you don\u2019t mind, Aiden, can you pick the meal courses for us? I trust your recommendations.": u"Ah, sim. Se n\u00e3o se importar, Aiden, poderia escolher os pratos para n\u00f3s? Confio nas suas recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Ah, yes. It\u2019s a good thing our staff was able to help the construction team. Or else we would\u2019ve been delayed further.": u"Ah, sim. Ainda bem que nossa equipe p\u00f4de ajudar o pessoal da constru\u00e7\u00e3o. Caso contr\u00e1rio, ter\u00edamos atrasado ainda mais.",
        u"Ah, yes. I\u2019ve been expecting you, Mr. Choi. Please, take a seat.": u"Ah, sim. Eu estava esperando pelo senhor, Sr. Choi. Por favor, sente-se.",
        u"Ah, yes. Thank you for helping us pack. I still have most of my personal stuff stored in the shed, though.": u"Ah, sim. Obrigado por nos ajudarem a arrumar tudo. Mas ainda tenho a maior parte das minhas coisas pessoais guardada no dep\u00f3sito.",
        u"Ah, yes. That would be Yoshinori and I, sir.": u"Ah, sim. Ser\u00edamos Yoshinori e eu, senhor.",
        u"Ah, yes. When you have to feed a hundred people three times a day, it takes a lot of time and effort.": u"Ah, sim. Quando \u00e9 preciso alimentar cem pessoas tr\u00eas vezes por dia, isso exige muito tempo e esfor\u00e7o.",
        u"Ah, yes. Yoshinori and I were hanging around earlier and decided to grab a meal.": u"Ah, sim. Eu e Yoshinori est\u00e1vamos passeando e decidimos comer alguma coisa.",
        u"Ah, you mean the meeting? We were just having coffee and chatting, and the conversation moved in that direction.": u"Ah, est\u00e1 falando da reuni\u00e3o? Est\u00e1vamos apenas tomando caf\u00e9 e conversando, e o assunto acabou indo nessa dire\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Ah, you\u2019re actually quite early \u2013 almost everyone else is still in their cabins, so please don\u2019t worry about it!": u"Ah, na verdade voc\u00ea chegou bem cedo \u2014 quase todos ainda est\u00e3o em suas cabanas, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se preocupe!",
        u"Ah, you\u2019re awake, Yoshinori.": u"Ah, voc\u00ea acordou, Yoshinori.",
        u"Ah, you\u2019re here, Aiden! I wondered what was taking so long.": u"Ah, voc\u00ea chegou, Aiden! Estava me perguntando por que estava demorando tanto.",
        u"Ah, you\u2019re up, Yoshinori.": u"Ah, voc\u00ea acordou, Yoshinori.",
        u"Ah, you\u2019re welcome\u2026": u"Ah, de nada\u2026",
        u"Ah-ah-ah! You don\u2019t have a choice!": u"Ah-ah-ah! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem escolha!",
        u"Ah-ah-ah~, what did I tell you about relying on other people? It\u2019s good to have a support system... and you couldn\u2019t even find your meds a while ago!": u"Ah-ah-ah~, o que eu disse sobre contar com outras pessoas? \u00c9 bom ter uma rede de apoio... e h\u00e1 pouco voc\u00ea nem conseguia encontrar seus rem\u00e9dios!",
        u"Ah. Hello.": u"Ah. Ol\u00e1.",
        u"Ah. There you are, you two!": u"Ah. A\u00ed est\u00e3o voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Aha! So, you\u2019re the one who took my booze, Snow-BALLS!": u"Aha! Ent\u00e3o foi voc\u00ea que pegou minha bebida, Bolas-de-Neve!",
        u"Aha! So, you\u2019re the one who took my oysters, Snow-BALLS!": u"Aha! Ent\u00e3o foi voc\u00ea que pegou minhas ostras, BOLAS-de-Neve!",
        u"Ahehe, I can\u2019t take all the credit, though. ": u"Ahehe, mas n\u00e3o posso ficar com todo o cr\u00e9dito. ",
        u"Ahehe, I didn\u2019t expect he would dig it that much!": u"Ahehe, n\u00e3o esperava que ele fosse gostar tanto!",
        u"Ahehe, I guess Emilia DID have quite the different upbringing from us\u2026": u"Ahehe, acho que Emilia realmente teve uma cria\u00e7\u00e3o bem diferente da nossa\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I guess Hiro and Yoichi still argue as much as they did before\u2026": u"Ahehe, acho que Hiro e Yoichi ainda discutem tanto quanto antes\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I guess I do sound a bit sulky saying all that, eh?": u"Ahehe, acho que realmente pare\u00e7o um pouco emburrado dizendo tudo isso, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Ahehe, I guess Yoichi does know how to push his buttons\u2026": u"Ahehe, acho que o Yoichi realmente sabe como tirar ele do s\u00e9rio\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I learned from the best, and I\u2019m only applying it.": u"Ahehe, aprendi com o melhor e s\u00f3 estou colocando em pr\u00e1tica.",
        u"Ahehe, I think he\u2019s misunderstanding us, sir\u2026": u"Ahehe, acho que ele est\u00e1 nos entendendo errado, senhor\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I wonder how Emilia will deal with that\u2026": u"Ahehe, fico imaginando como Emilia vai lidar com isso\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I'd say she definitely succeeded...": u"Ahehe, eu diria que ela definitivamente conseguiu\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, I\u2019m just glad it turned into such a great day for everyone.": u"Ahehe, s\u00f3 fico feliz que tenha se tornado um dia t\u00e3o bom para todos.",
        u"Ahehe, I\u2019m surprised you didn\u2019t kick me out then. Or even now.": u"Ahehe, estou surpreso que n\u00e3o tenha me expulsado naquela \u00e9poca. Ou mesmo agora.",
        u"Ahehe, Yuri specifically asked me to make sure you had everything\u2026": u"Ahehe, Yuri me pediu especificamente para garantir que o senhor n\u00e3o esquecesse nada\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, don\u2019t worry guys. We\u2019ll make sure to balance out our time.": u"Ahehe, n\u00e3o se preocupem, pessoal. Vamos equilibrar bem nosso tempo.",
        u"Ahehe, kinda feel like I missed out on that show\u2026 ": u"Ahehe, at\u00e9 parece que eu perdi um belo espet\u00e1culo\u2026 ",
        u"Ahehe, not at all \u2013 cooking was just his passion! And he just passed it down to me!": u"Ahehe, nada disso \u2014 cozinhar era apenas a paix\u00e3o dele! E ele passou essa paix\u00e3o para mim!",
        u"Ahehe, sorry guys\u2026 I just get hot when I sleep\u2026": u"Ahehe, desculpem, pessoal\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 fico com calor quando durmo\u2026",
        u"Ahehe, well it has gotten pretty cold lately\u2026": u"Ahehe, bem, ultimamente ficou bem frio\u2026",
        u"Aheheh, well you know I was cooking everything for the reception, and I was struggling to put my tie on! Good thing Yoshi came to help!": u"Aheheh, bem, voc\u00ea sabe que eu estava preparando tudo para a recep\u00e7\u00e3o e tive dificuldade para colocar a gravata! Ainda bem que Yoshi veio ajudar!",
        u"Ahehehe, I\u2019d better go after him, otherwise he might destroy the kitchen. Plus, it looks like we need some more food anyway.": u"Ahehehe, \u00e9 melhor eu ir atr\u00e1s dele, sen\u00e3o ele pode destruir a cozinha. Al\u00e9m disso, parece que precisamos de mais comida mesmo.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 At least it\u2019s not as bad as before, right?": u"Ahehe\u2026 Pelo menos n\u00e3o est\u00e1 t\u00e3o ruim quanto antes, certo?",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Compared to Camp Buddy, this is a completely different world.": u"Ahehe\u2026 Comparado ao Camp Buddy, este \u00e9 um mundo completamente diferente.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 He did say he was a heavy sleeper\u2026": u"Ahehe\u2026 Ele disse mesmo que tinha sono pesado\u2026",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 I didn\u2019t really understand all the tech stuff at first either, but Jin here has been teaching me a lot!": u"Hehe\u2026 No come\u00e7o, tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o entendia muito dessas coisas de tecnologia, mas o Jin tem me ensinado bastante!",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 I haven\u2019t experienced anything like it before, so I\u2019m counting on you to lead the way, sir.": u"Ahehe\u2026 Nunca vivi nada parecido, ent\u00e3o conto com o senhor para me guiar.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 I-I don\u2019t mind, really\u2026 In fact, I think it\u2019s really sweet coming from you.": u"Ahehe\u2026 E-Eu n\u00e3o me importo, de verdade\u2026 Na verdade, acho muito fofo vindo de voc\u00ea.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 I-I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll be able to keep up with you, sir.": u"Ahehe\u2026 A-Acho que n\u00e3o vou conseguir acompanhar o senhor.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 It\u2019s been a while since Yuri let us all drink at the camp.": u"Ahehe\u2026 Faz tempo que Yuri n\u00e3o deixava todo mundo beber no acampamento.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 It\u2019s really nothing, sir..": u"Ahehe\u2026 N\u00e3o foi nada, senhor\u2026",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 M-Maybe you guys just got too used to my cooking\u2026": u"Ahehe\u2026 T-Talvez voc\u00eas s\u00f3 tenham se acostumado demais com a minha comida\u2026",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Maybe I spoke too soon. ": u"Ahehe\u2026 Talvez eu tenha falado cedo demais. ",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Surprise?": u"Ahehe\u2026 Surpresa?",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Thanks a lot, pops. Now the pressure\u2019s on me!": u"Ahehe\u2026 Muito obrigado, paiz\u00e3o. Agora colocou toda a press\u00e3o em mim!",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Thanks, Yoshi. It suits you way better though.": u"Ahehe\u2026 Valeu, Yoshi. Mas combina muito mais com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 That\u2019s not what it was, Aiden.": u"Ahehe\u2026 N\u00e3o foi isso, Aiden.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 This is the first time I\u2019ve seen him asleep at night.": u"Ahehe\u2026 \u00c9 a primeira vez que vejo ele dormindo \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 We have to. Everyone\u2019s gonna look for us if we don\u2019t show up.": u"Ahehe\u2026 Temos que ir. Todo mundo vai procurar a gente se n\u00e3o aparecermos.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 What can I say\u2026? Call it a quirk.": u"Ahehe\u2026 O que posso dizer\u2026? Chame de mania.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Yeah\u2026": u"Hehe\u2026 Sim\u2026",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Yeah\u2026 Your food\u2019s gotten cold already.  ": u"Ahehe\u2026 Sim\u2026 Sua comida j\u00e1 esfriou.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 You knew exactly what I\u2019m thinking, huh?": u"Ahehe\u2026 Voc\u00ea sabia exatamente o que eu estava pensando, hein?",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 You really are too nice, Yoshi.": u"Hehe\u2026 Voc\u00ea realmente \u00e9 bom demais, Yoshi.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 You\u2019re always so clumsy, Aiden.": u"Hehe\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 sempre t\u00e3o desajeitado, Aiden.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 You\u2019re the one bringing it out for me.": u"Ahehe\u2026 \u00c9 voc\u00ea quem desperta isso em mim.",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 Yuri is really having a hard time with this, huh?": u"Ahehe\u2026 Yuri est\u00e1 mesmo tendo dificuldade para lidar com isso, hein?",
        u"Ahehe\u2026 just try not to faint, Jin.": u"Ahehe\u2026 s\u00f3 tente n\u00e3o desmaiar, Jin.",
        u"Ahh! It\u2019s been a while, Mr. Nomoru!": u"Ahh! H\u00e1 quanto tempo, senhor Nomoru!",
        u"Ahh, it\u2019s so nice to be enjoying everyone\u2019s company again!": u"Ahh, \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom aproveitar a companhia de todos novamente!",
        u"Ahh, it\u2019s so nice to be enjoying your cooking again, Aiden!": u"Ahh, \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom poder saborear sua comida novamente, Aiden!",
        u"Ahh, yeah\u2026 I remember!  That was when you were helping me earn my cooking badge.": u"Ahh, sim\u2026 Eu me lembro! Foi quando voc\u00ea me ajudava a conquistar o distintivo de culin\u00e1ria.",
        u"Ahh... but I\u2019m so close\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 mas estou t\u00e3o perto\u2026",
        u"Ahhh, this does feel good~ ": u"Ahhh, isso realmente \u00e9 gostoso~ ",
        u"Ahhh, yes~ I\u2019m still working on the title. I\u2019m stuck choosing between \u2018Schlonging for You\u2019~ or \u2018Booty and the Feast!\u2019": u"Ahhh, sim~ Ainda estou pensando no t\u00edtulo. Estou em d\u00favida entre \u2018Pirocando por Voc\u00ea\u2019~ ou \u2018A Bunda e o Banquete!\u2019",
        u"Ahhhh, this just gets me thinking about how differently I\u2019D do my wedding~": u"Ahhhh, isso s\u00f3 me faz pensar em como EU faria meu casamento de forma diferente~",
        u"Ahhh~ Home sweet home! Camp Buddy, I missed you!": u"Ahhh~ Lar, doce lar! Camp Buddy, senti sua falta!",
        u"Ahhh~ There he is! The man of the hour~ I was waiting for you, Yoshinori!": u"Ahhh~ A\u00ed est\u00e1 ele! O homem do momento~ Eu estava esperando por voc\u00ea, Yoshinori!",
        u"Ahhh~! That\u2019s more like it!": u"Ahhh~! Assim est\u00e1 melhor!",
        u"Ahhh\u2026 A nice hot shower after a long day of work really takes the edge off.": u"Ahhh\u2026 Um bom banho quente depois de um longo dia de trabalho realmente ajuda a relaxar.",
        u"Ahhh\u2026 I love you bottle\u2026 I love you too, couch\u2026 ": u"Ahhh\u2026 Eu te amo, garrafa\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m te amo, sof\u00e1\u2026 ",
        u"Ahhh\u2026 It\u2019s just you and me, now\u2026": u"Ahhh\u2026 Agora somos s\u00f3 eu e voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Ahhh\u2026 This is the life\u2026": u"Ahhh\u2026 Isso \u00e9 que \u00e9 vida\u2026",
        u"Ahhh\u2026 What a way to end your first night with me, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Ahhh\u2026 Que maneira de terminar sua primeira noite comigo, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Ahh~ That hits the spot!  ": u"Ahh~ Isso \u00e9 uma del\u00edcia!  ",
        u"Ahh~ The things I do to tickle you guys\u2019 pickle. ": u"Ahh~ As coisas que fa\u00e7o para animar o brinquedinho de voc\u00eas. ",
        u"Ahh\u2026 Crap\u2026 I had too much to drink\u2026 again.": u"Ahh\u2026 Droga\u2026 Bebi demais\u2026 de novo.",
        u"Ahh\u2026 It\u2019s good to be back!": u"Ahh\u2026 \u00c9 bom estar de volta!",
        u"Ahh\u2026 It\u2019s good to be back\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 \u00c9 bom estar de volta\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026 I\u2019m not sure how she\u2019ll take that\u2026 Surprisingly, it doesn\u2019t look like she\u2019s noticed anything at all\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 N\u00e3o sei como ela vai reagir\u2026 Surpreendentemente, parece que ainda n\u00e3o percebeu nada\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026 I\u2019m sorry, I must\u2019ve overslept a little\u2026 Did I miss anything? ": u"Ahh\u2026 Desculpem, acho que dormi um pouco demais\u2026 Perdi alguma coisa?",
        u"Ahh\u2026 That sounds delicious!  I guess\u2026 a quick bite wouldn\u2019t hurt.": u"Ahh\u2026 Parece delicioso! Acho que\u2026 uma mordida r\u00e1pida n\u00e3o faria mal.",
        u"Ahh\u2026 The grass feels good on my back.": u"Ahh\u2026 A grama est\u00e1 gostosa nas minhas costas.",
        u"Ahh\u2026 This was the perfect day, Goro\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 Este foi o dia perfeito, Goro\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026 This was the perfect day, Yoshi!": u"Ahh\u2026 Este foi o dia perfeito, Yoshi!",
        u"Ahh\u2026 To be blessed with such a show all for myself~ I love this job so much!": u"Ahh\u2026 Que b\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o ter todo esse espet\u00e1culo s\u00f3 para mim~ Eu amo tanto este trabalho!",
        u"Ahh\u2026 We made a mess, Aiden\u2026 We should\u2014": u"Ahh\u2026 Fizemos uma bagun\u00e7a, Aiden\u2026 Dever\u00edamos\u2014",
        u"Ahh\u2026 Well\u2026 I haven\u2019t really heard of most of these, but I recognize some of them from my dad\u2019s cookbook\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 Bem\u2026 Eu nunca ouvi falar da maioria dessas coisas, mas reconhe\u00e7o algumas do livro de receitas do meu pai\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026 You\u2019re so amazing, Yoshi\u2026 I can\u2019t believe you\u2019re really mine now\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 incr\u00edvel, Yoshi\u2026 N\u00e3o consigo acreditar que agora voc\u00ea \u00e9 realmente meu\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026 You\u2019re so sexy, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o sexy, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Ahh\u2026! You\u2019re so fucking tight, Yoshi\u2026!": u"Ahh\u2026! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 apertado pra caralho, Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"Ah\u2026 About that, sir\u2026! That was the reason I was looking for you!": u"Ah\u2026 Sobre isso, senhor\u2026! Foi por esse motivo que eu estava procurando pelo senhor!",
        u"Ah\u2026 About that.": u"Ah\u2026 Sobre isso.",
        u"Ah\u2026 At some point during our talk last night, she did say that\u2026 But I didn\u2019t think she meant like this\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Em algum momento da nossa conversa ontem \u00e0 noite, ela realmente disse isso\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o achei que fosse desse jeito\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 I apologize. I\u2019m probably going to be a lot to deal with when it comes to using computers \u2013 I barely know how the old one here works.": u"Ah\u2026 Pe\u00e7o desculpas. Provavelmente vou dar muito trabalho quando se trata de usar computadores \u2014 mal sei como funciona o antigo daqui.",
        u"Ah\u2026 I figured that\u2019d cause a commotion.": u"Ah\u2026 Imaginei que isso causaria uma como\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Ah\u2026 I know. I\u2019m sorry for going out without telling you.": u"Ah\u2026 Eu sei. Desculpe por ter sa\u00eddo sem avisar.",
        u"Ah\u2026 I really didn\u2019t mind, sir. In fact, I was more than happy to be someone you could talk to.": u"Ah\u2026 Eu realmente n\u00e3o me importava, senhor. Na verdade, ficava muito feliz por ser algu\u00e9m com quem o senhor podia conversar.",
        u"Ah\u2026 I understand\u2026 I wasn\u2019t there for you then...": u"Ah\u2026 Eu entendo\u2026 N\u00e3o estive ao seu lado naquela \u00e9poca...",
        u"Ah\u2026 It sounds like you two have been having a secret affair, huh?": u"Ah\u2026 Parece que voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o tendo um caso secreto, hein?",
        u"Ah\u2026 It suits you perfectly\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Combina perfeitamente com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 I\u2019m so embarrassed that you noticed\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Que vergonha voc\u00ea ter percebido\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 I\u2019m sorry. I kinda had trouble sleeping thinking about what happened yesterday with Emilia.": u"Ah\u2026 Desculpa. Tive um pouco de dificuldade para dormir pensando no que aconteceu ontem com a Emilia.",
        u"Ah\u2026 May I ask what upgrades they specifically suggested?": u"Ah\u2026 Posso perguntar quais melhorias eles sugeriram especificamente?",
        u"Ah\u2026 Of course, sir\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Claro, senhor\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 R-Really? ": u"Ah\u2026 S-S\u00e9rio? ",
        u"Ah\u2026 Thank you, sir. You look good as well\u2026!": u"Ah\u2026 Obrigado, senhor. O senhor tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 muito bonito\u2026!",
        u"Ah\u2026 Well, I really don\u2019t think I\u2019m ready for that, sir\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Bem, realmente n\u00e3o acho que estou pronto para isso, senhor\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 You\u2019re right\u2026 She did open up about the reasons why she did those things at the very least\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 Pelo menos ela se abriu sobre os motivos que a levaram a fazer aquelas coisas\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026 well, I\u2019m sure you all remember that I mentioned months ago that I was in a biker\u2019s club during my youth\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 bem, tenho certeza de que todos se lembram de eu ter mencionado, meses atr\u00e1s, que participei de um clube de motoqueiros na juventude\u2026",
        u"Ah\u2026! I hope I'm not disturbing you, Sir Goro!": u"Ah\u2026! Espero n\u00e3o estar incomodando, senhor Goro!",
        u"Ah\u2026! Please excuse me!": u"Ah\u2026! Com licen\u00e7a!",
        u"Ah\u2026! Yoshinori, you\u2019re back.": u"Ah\u2026! Yoshinori, voc\u00ea voltou.",
        u"Aiden again?! All you ever talk about is him!": u"Aiden de novo?! Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 sabe falar dele!",
        u"Aiden always tells me when I get urges like this that it\u2019s best not to ignore them\u2026": u"Aiden sempre diz que, quando sinto vontades assim, \u00e9 melhor n\u00e3o ignor\u00e1-las\u2026",
        u"Aiden and I actually talked it out last night.": u"Na verdade, eu e o Aiden conversamos sobre isso ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Aiden and I are actually here to grab a meal. We just happened to notice you were having a problem with the staff again.": u"Na verdade, eu e Aiden viemos comer alguma coisa. S\u00f3 acabamos percebendo que voc\u00ea estava tendo problemas com os funcion\u00e1rios de novo.",
        u"Aiden and I didn\u2019t hesitate to get our hands dirty, and we both learned a bunch of new things about construction from Darius and Lloyd.": u"Aiden e eu n\u00e3o hesitamos em p\u00f4r a m\u00e3o na massa, e aprendemos muitas coisas novas sobre constru\u00e7\u00e3o com Darius e Lloyd.",
        u"Aiden and I kept up our regular maintenance duties, but this time around we had Emilia doing most of the other chores like cleaning and laundry.": u"Eu e Aiden continuamos com nossas tarefas regulares de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o, mas desta vez Emilia ficou respons\u00e1vel pela maior parte das outras tarefas, como limpeza e lavanderia.",
        u"Aiden and Yoshi always seem to have fun with me when we do that.": u"Aiden e Yoshi sempre parecem se divertir comigo quando fazemos isso.",
        u"Aiden comes from a very different background, and you welcomed him with open arms, always making sure he felt included.": u"Aiden vem de uma realidade muito diferente, e voc\u00ea o recebeu de bra\u00e7os abertos, sempre garantindo que ele se sentisse inclu\u00eddo.",
        u"Aiden does a lot more than you think.": u"Aiden faz muito mais do que voc\u00ea imagina.",
        u"Aiden does more than you think.": u"Aiden faz mais do que voc\u00ea imagina.",
        u"Aiden does this all the time, even if it\u2019s just the two of us\u2026": u"Aiden faz isso o tempo todo, mesmo quando estamos s\u00f3 n\u00f3s dois\u2026",
        u"Aiden gave me some advice the other day and it paid off. ": u"Aiden me deu alguns conselhos outro dia e funcionou. ",
        u"Aiden had to wake up the earliest to prepare meals and other essential needs for more than thirty people. Including yourself.": u"Aiden precisava acordar antes de todos para preparar refei\u00e7\u00f5es e outras necessidades essenciais para mais de trinta pessoas. Incluindo voc\u00ea.",
        u"Aiden has always been a kind and caring person. I\u2019ve never seen him stay angry or hold grudges.": u"Aiden sempre foi uma pessoa gentil e atenciosa. Nunca o vi continuar com raiva ou guardar rancor.",
        u"Aiden hasn\u2019t said yes yet, actually. He\u2019s still giving it some time to think about.": u"Na verdade, Aiden ainda n\u00e3o aceitou. Ele est\u00e1 dando um tempo para pensar.",
        u"Aiden is a really talented cook just like you are, Mr. Andre! Look, he made this really yummy pizza from scratch just a little while ago! ": u"O Aiden \u00e9 um cozinheiro muito talentoso, assim como o senhor, senhor Andre! Veja, ele fez esta pizza deliciosa do zero h\u00e1 pouco tempo! ",
        u"Aiden is different.": u"Aiden \u00e9 diferente.",
        u"Aiden is really skilled at anything he does! We honestly wouldn\u2019t have made it this far without him.": u"Aiden \u00e9 muito habilidoso em tudo o que faz! Sinceramente, n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos chegado at\u00e9 aqui sem ele.",
        u"Aiden is tough and diligent. He can take anything you throw at him and make things work.": u"Aiden \u00e9 forte e dedicado. Ele consegue lidar com qualquer coisa que jogarem para ele e fazer dar certo.",
        u"Aiden knows for sure what\u2019s good just by looking at the ingredients!": u"O Aiden com certeza sabe o que \u00e9 bom s\u00f3 de olhar os ingredientes!",
        u"Aiden must have a reason that stems from something much deeper, Yoshinori\u2026 ": u"Aiden deve ter um motivo que vem de algo muito mais profundo, Yoshinori\u2026 ",
        u"Aiden takes care of the camp maintenance, Yuri handles the builders, and you have the most important job of dealing with things behind the scenes.": u"Aiden cuida da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento, Yuri coordena os construtores e o senhor tem o trabalho mais importante, cuidando de tudo nos bastidores.",
        u"Aiden was hot.": u"Aiden estava com calor.",
        u"Aiden was worried about the offer from Mr. Clermont, and everyone tried to give advice when they found out. ": u"Aiden estava preocupado com a oferta do Sr. Clermont, e todos tentaram dar conselhos quando ficaram sabendo. ",
        u"Aiden would make a great chef.": u"Aiden seria um \u00f3timo chef.",
        u"Aiden! Am I gonna have to deal with your dirty puns all night?": u"Aiden! Vou ter que aguentar suas piadas indecentes a noite inteira?",
        u"Aiden! Don\u2019t tease him like that!": u"Aiden! N\u00e3o provoque ele desse jeito!",
        u"Aiden! I can\u2019t believe you don\u2019t know what this is! We used to write in this book when we were younger, remember?": u"Aiden! N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe o que \u00e9! N\u00f3s escrev\u00edamos neste livro quando \u00e9ramos mais jovens, lembra?",
        u"Aiden! Put your apron down! ": u"Aiden! Abaixe o avental! ",
        u"Aiden! That\u2019s too far!": u"Aiden! Isso \u00e9 demais!",
        u"Aiden! W-Why are you butt naked?!": u"Aiden! P-Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 completamente pelado?!",
        u"Aiden! What the heck took you so long?! You were supposed to have Yoshi here an hour ago!": u"Aiden! Que diabos demorou tanto?! Voc\u00ea deveria ter trazido Yoshi para c\u00e1 uma hora atr\u00e1s!",
        u"Aiden's right. Besides, it's not often we get to hang out together like this.": u"Aiden tem raz\u00e3o. Al\u00e9m disso, n\u00e3o \u00e9 sempre que temos a oportunidade de passar um tempo juntos assim.",
        u"Aiden, I already lost count of how much you\u2019ve had. Don\u2019t you think you\u2019ve had enough\u2026?": u"Aiden, j\u00e1 perdi a conta de quanto voc\u00ea bebeu. N\u00e3o acha que j\u00e1 foi o bastante\u2026?",
        u"Aiden, can we get some more dressing for the\u2014": u"Aiden, podemos pegar mais molho para a\u2014",
        u"Aiden, come with me. Let\u2019s go back to our room for the night.": u"Aiden, vem comigo. Vamos voltar para o nosso quarto por hoje.",
        u"Aiden, don\u2019t go so fast\u2014": u"Aiden, n\u00e3o v\u00e1 t\u00e3o depressa\u2014",
        u"Aiden, how many times have we talked about this\u2026? You knew there were new people coming today\u2026": u"Aiden, quantas vezes j\u00e1 conversamos sobre isso\u2026? Voc\u00ea sabia que pessoas novas chegariam hoje\u2026",
        u"Aiden, is this really the best topic?": u"Aiden, esse \u00e9 mesmo o melhor assunto?",
        u"Aiden, it\u2019s time to make di\u2014": u"Aiden, est\u00e1 na hora de preparar o jan\u2014",
        u"Aiden, please\u2026": u"Aiden, por favor\u2026",
        u"Aiden, seriously I\u2014": u"Aiden, s\u00e9rio, eu\u2014",
        u"Aiden, start the fire, I\u2019ll go and prepare lunch.": u"Aiden, acenda o fogo. Vou preparar o almo\u00e7o.",
        u"Aiden, stop teasing our lead architect! He and Darius will be helping us with the renovations!": u"Aiden, pare de provocar o nosso arquiteto-chefe! Ele e Darius nos ajudar\u00e3o com as reformas!",
        u"Aiden, tell me what\u2019s on your mind\u2026": u"Aiden, me conta o que est\u00e1 passando pela sua cabe\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"Aiden, wait\u2014!": u"Aiden, espere\u2014!",
        u"Aiden, wait\u2026": u"Aiden, espere\u2026",
        u"Aiden, why don\u2019t you move Ms. Komarova\u2019s stuff? Yuri, you can help me pack my things as well.": u"Aiden, leve as coisas da Srta. Komarova. Yuri, voc\u00ea pode me ajudar a arrumar minhas coisas tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Aiden, you alright?": u"Aiden, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"Aiden, you shouldn\u2019t pressure Jin with stuff like that. Mr. Clermont pays a lot more than we could, I\u2019m sure.": u"Aiden, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria pressionar o Jin com coisas assim. Tenho certeza de que o Sr. Clermont paga muito mais do que poder\u00edamos pagar.",
        u"Aiden, your apron is untied. Be careful not to f\u2014": u"Aiden, seu avental est\u00e1 desamarrado. Cuidado para n\u00e3o ca\u2014",
        u"Aiden, your dad\u2019s looking for you.": u"Aiden, seu pai est\u00e1 procurando voc\u00ea.",
        u"Aiden? *taps the blanket*": u"Aiden? *toca no cobertor*",
        u"Aiden\u2019s not the same as you though, Emilia.": u"Mas Aiden n\u00e3o \u00e9 igual a voc\u00ea, Emilia.",
        u"Aiden\u2026 Are you okay\u2026?": u"Aiden\u2026 Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026?",
        u"Aiden\u2026 Don\u2019t encourage her\u2026 ": u"Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o incentiva ela\u2026 ",
        u"Aiden\u2026 It\u2019s not like we\u2019d never see each other again.": u"Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se nunca mais f\u00f4ssemos nos ver.",
        u"Aiden\u2026 I\u2019m so sorry\u2026": u"Aiden\u2026 Sinto muito\u2026",
        u"Aiden\u2026 The doctors have already told us there\u2019s no cure, and I\u2019ll always have to be hooked up like this\u2026": u"Aiden\u2026 Os m\u00e9dicos j\u00e1 disseram que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 cura e que eu sempre vou precisar ficar ligado a essas m\u00e1quinas\u2026",
        u"Aiden\u2026 Where are you\u2026?": u"Aiden\u2026 Onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1\u2026?",
        u"Aiden\u2026 You didn\u2019t have to do that. ": u"Aiden\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisava fazer isso. ",
        u"Aiden\u2026 You don\u2019t have to force him to speak up\u2026": u"Aiden\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa for\u00e7\u00e1-lo a falar\u2026",
        u"Aiden\u2026 You\u2019re the one who likes going bare in front of others\u2026 I think you\u2019d blend in here more than me.": u"Aiden\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 quem gosta de ficar pelado na frente dos outros\u2026 Acho que se encaixaria aqui melhor do que eu.",
        u"Aiden\u2026? Are you listening?": u"Aiden\u2026? Est\u00e1 ouvindo?",
        u"Airway, check... ": u"Vias a\u00e9reas, certo\u2026 ",
        u"Alas\u2026 The threads of fate have snapped, and only time will tell if destiny shall bring them back together again\u2026": u"Ai de mim\u2026 Os fios do destino se romperam, e s\u00f3 o tempo dir\u00e1 se o destino voltar\u00e1 a uni-los\u2026",
        u"All I felt was disappointment in myself\u2026": u"Tudo que senti foi decep\u00e7\u00e3o comigo mesmo\u2026",
        u"All I know is that Mr. Clermont chose her mostly because she\u2019s a former alumnus of the camp, on top of her credentials.": u"Tudo o que sei \u00e9 que o Sr. Clermont a escolheu principalmente por ela ser ex-integrante do acampamento, al\u00e9m das credenciais que possui.",
        u"All I needed to do was approach him, and everything just clicked since then!": u"S\u00f3 precisei me aproximar dele, e desde ent\u00e3o tudo simplesmente se encaixou!",
        u"All I needed was to ask Lloyd, after all. ": u"No fim, tudo que eu precisava fazer era perguntar ao Lloyd. ",
        u"All I\u2019m saying is that I\u2019m happy where all of us are now\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou dizendo que estou feliz com a situa\u00e7\u00e3o em que todos n\u00f3s estamos agora\u2026",
        u"All I\u2019m saying is that we should be content with where all of us are now\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou dizendo que dever\u00edamos estar satisfeitos com a situa\u00e7\u00e3o em que todos estamos agora\u2026",
        u"All custom made for me!": u"Tudo feito sob medida para mim!",
        u"All in all, it was amazing to see everyone work towards a common goal, all while enjoying our time together.": u"No fim das contas, foi incr\u00edvel ver todos trabalhando por um objetivo em comum enquanto aproveit\u00e1vamos nosso tempo juntos.",
        u"All of a sudden there was a hole in my heart\u2026": u"De repente, havia um vazio no meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"All of a sudden, I\u2019m doubting if this was the right decision\u2026": u"De repente, estou come\u00e7ando a duvidar se essa foi a decis\u00e3o certa\u2026",
        u"All of this is actually new to me. I\u2019m so out of my element. ": u"Na verdade, tudo isso \u00e9 novo para mim. Estou completamente fora do meu ambiente. ",
        u"All of this is new to me.": u"Tudo isso \u00e9 novo para mim.",
        u"All of us look up to you, and we\u2019re just happy you\u2019re alright now.": u"Todos n\u00f3s admiramos voc\u00ea e estamos felizes por voc\u00ea estar bem agora.",
        u"All of you are truly living the \u2018Buddy Oath\u2019 to your core, just like a true scout!": u"Todos voc\u00eas realmente vivem o \u2018Juramento Buddy\u2019 de cora\u00e7\u00e3o, como verdadeiros escoteiros!",
        u"All that was left in me was the promise that we made to each other, so I did everything in my power to make Camp Buddy the best it could be\u2026": u"Tudo que me restava era a promessa que fizemos um ao outro, ent\u00e3o fiz tudo ao meu alcance para tornar o Camp Buddy o melhor poss\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"All the activities Sir Goro made for us back at camp were great preparations for today, especially the group ones!": u"Todas as atividades que o senhor Goro preparou no acampamento foram \u00f3timos treinamentos para hoje, especialmente as atividades em grupo!",
        u"All the cabins seem to be fully occupied, and it would be inappropriate for me to share a room with the workers.": u"Todas as cabanas parecem ocupadas, e seria impr\u00f3prio eu dividir um quarto com os trabalhadores.",
        u"All the information so far lines up\u2026 I don\u2019t see how we could be wrong with all of this\u2026 ": u"Todas as informa\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 agora batem\u2026 N\u00e3o vejo como poder\u00edamos estar errados com tudo isso\u2026 ",
        u"All the more reason I want you to have it. And besides, I\u2019d really enjoy seeing you in it regularly.": u"Mais um motivo para eu querer que fique com ela. Al\u00e9m disso, eu adoraria ver voc\u00ea usando com frequ\u00eancia.",
        u"All these years I\u2019ve been holding back, and I don\u2019t know why\u2026": u"Todos esses anos eu fiquei me segurando, e nem sei por qu\u00ea\u2026",
        u"All this booze is way out of character for me\u2026 I\u2019ve been getting loose and careless since Goro\u2019s been spoiling me.": u"Toda essa bebida n\u00e3o combina nada comigo\u2026 Tenho ficado mais solto e descuidado desde que Goro come\u00e7ou a me mimar.",
        u"All this lying in bed is making it worse too.": u"E ficar deitado na cama desse jeito s\u00f3 piora.",
        u"All this negative energy is exactly why we need to go on a vacation detox.": u"Toda essa energia negativa \u00e9 exatamente o motivo de precisarmos de umas f\u00e9rias para desintoxicar.",
        u"All this time, we opened up to each other and did everything together\u2026 ": u"Durante todo esse tempo, nos abrimos um com o outro e fizemos tudo juntos\u2026 ",
        u"All this time, you\u2019ve been telling me how much I\u2019ve grown as a scoutmaster and a future leader.": u"Todo esse tempo, voc\u00ea vem dizendo o quanto cresci como chefe escoteiro e futuro l\u00edder.",
        u"All those classes you had for fine dining etiquette, and you can\u2019t even practice what you preach.": u"Todas aquelas aulas de etiqueta \u00e0 mesa, e voc\u00ea nem consegue praticar o que prega.",
        u"All we ever worried about was getting caught, stupid crushes, or promises we didn\u2019t fully understand.": u"Tudo com que nos preocup\u00e1vamos era sermos pegos, paix\u00f5es bobas ou promessas que nem entend\u00edamos direito.",
        u"All we have to do is to keep at it and stay true to the goals we have.": u"S\u00f3 precisamos continuar nos esfor\u00e7ando e permanecer fi\u00e9is aos nossos objetivos.",
        u"All we were doing was just surviving before we found Camp Buddy.": u"Antes de encontrarmos o Camp Buddy, tudo que faz\u00edamos era apenas sobreviver.",
        u"Allow me to explain all the amenities included in your package!": u"Permitam-me explicar todas as comodidades inclu\u00eddas no pacote!",
        u"Almost all of our time was spent working, but I made sure to take advantage of our shared tasks and spend plenty of quality time with him.": u"Passamos quase todo o tempo trabalhando, mas aproveitei nossas tarefas compartilhadas para passar bastante tempo de qualidade com ele.",
        u"Almost everyone says the same.": u"Quase todo mundo diz a mesma coisa.",
        u"Alright everyone, I\u2019ve relayed our plan to the workers. ": u"Certo, pessoal, j\u00e1 passei nosso plano aos trabalhadores. ",
        u"Alright let\u2019s do legs then!": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o vamos treinar as pernas!",
        u"Alright now that the girls are gone, circlejerk anyone?!": u"Certo, agora que as garotas foram embora, algu\u00e9m quer bater uma em roda?!",
        u"Alright then! Good night, you guys~!": u"Certo! Boa noite, pessoal~!",
        u"Alright then! I\u2019ll see you two tomorrow!": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o! Vejo voc\u00eas duas amanh\u00e3!",
        u"Alright then! Two \u2018Slippery Nipples\u2019 coming up!": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o! Dois \u2018Slippery Nipples\u2019 saindo!",
        u"Alright then, don\u2019t say I didn\u2019t warn you.": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o diga que n\u00e3o avisei.",
        u"Alright then, this meeting is adjourned! We\u2019ll see each other next week for another meeting.": u"Muito bem, esta reuni\u00e3o est\u00e1 encerrada! N\u00f3s nos veremos novamente na reuni\u00e3o da pr\u00f3xima semana.",
        u"Alright then. I\u2019ll see you two tomorrow.": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o. Vejo voc\u00eas duas amanh\u00e3.",
        u"Alright then. Just give me a few minutes, I\u2019ll be right back.": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o. S\u00f3 me d\u00ea alguns minutos, j\u00e1 volto.",
        u"Alright then. Since Ms. Komarova is out of commission for the moment, I\u2019ll take over and personally report the situation to Mr. Clermont first.": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o. Como a Srta. Komarova est\u00e1 impossibilitada de trabalhar no momento, vou assumir e informar pessoalmente a situa\u00e7\u00e3o ao Sr. Clermont primeiro.",
        u"Alright then~! See you again!": u"Est\u00e1 bem~! At\u00e9 a pr\u00f3xima!",
        u"Alright then\u2026 from now on, I\u2019ll call you Goro\u2026": u"Tudo bem\u2026 de agora em diante, vou chamar voc\u00ea de Goro\u2026",
        u"Alright!": u"Est\u00e1 bem!",
        u"Alright! But shhh\u2026 don\u2019t act suspicious and follow me!": u"Certo! Mas shhh\u2026 n\u00e3o pare\u00e7a suspeito e siga-me!",
        u"Alright! Come with me then!": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o venha comigo!",
        u"Alright! Count us off then, Yoshi!": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o fa\u00e7a a contagem, Yoshi!",
        u"Alright! Final round, so loser drinks what\u2019s left in the bottle AND has to do what the winner says!": u"Certo! Rodada final: quem perder bebe o que restou na garrafa E tem que fazer o que o vencedor mandar!",
        u"Alright! Good job, you two! That\u2019s a huge task off your to-do list!": u"Certo! Bom trabalho, voc\u00eas dois! Essa \u00e9 uma tarefa enorme a menos na lista!",
        u"Alright! I hope you don\u2019t mind sharing the same quarters I\u2019m in though. All the other cabins have been occupied by the construction workers.": u"Certo! Espero que n\u00e3o se importe de dividir os mesmos aposentos em que estou. Todas as outras cabanas foram ocupadas pelos trabalhadores da constru\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Alright! It\u2019s done \u2013 check it out!": u"Certo! Terminei \u2014 olhem s\u00f3!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019ll go grab some more mallows!": u"Certo! Vou buscar mais marshmallows!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019ll go next!": u"Certo! Eu sou o pr\u00f3ximo!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019m done playing house with you, dorks! ": u"Certo! Cansei de brincar de casinha com voc\u00eas, seus bob\u00f5es! ",
        u"Alright! I\u2019m gonna bring it out to the group then, bro!": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o vou levar isso para o pessoal, mano!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019m pumped up! Thanks, Yoshi!": u"Certo! Estou superanimada! Obrigada, Yoshi!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019m starving!": u"Beleza! Estou morrendo de fome!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019m starving! Dibs on everything!": u"Certo! Estou morrendo de fome! Tudo \u00e9 meu!",
        u"Alright! I\u2019ve got ten. And you?": u"Certo! Tenho dez. E voc\u00ea?",
        u"Alright! Keep it up, bro!": u"Certo! Continue assim, mano!",
        u"Alright! Let\u2019s split into pairs! Emilia and I will be one!": u"Certo! Vamos formar duplas! Eu e Emilia ficaremos juntas!",
        u"Alright! Let\u2019s start then!": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o vamos come\u00e7ar!",
        u"Alright! March! Three two one! Three two one!": u"Certo! Marchando! Tr\u00eas, dois, um! Tr\u00eas, dois, um!",
