        u"Alright! Round two\u2026 Rock, paper, scissors\u2026 Shoot!": u"Certo! Segundo round\u2026 Pedra, papel, tesoura\u2026 J\u00e1!",
        u"Alright! That delays a little bit of my sadness at least. ": u"Certo! Pelo menos isso adia um pouco a minha tristeza. ",
        u"Alright! The party is on! Come on, there\u2019s plenty of food in the mess hall!": u"Certo! A festa est\u00e1 de p\u00e9! Vamos, tem muita comida no refeit\u00f3rio!",
        u"Alright! Then if you two don't mind, I could use some big muscles to sort the other stuff. ": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o, se voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o se importarem, preciso de alguns m\u00fasculos fortes para separar as outras coisas. ",
        u"Alright! We got a whole bunch of people here again, so there\u2019s a lot of cooking to do!": u"Beleza! Temos um monte de gente aqui de novo, ent\u00e3o h\u00e1 muita comida para preparar!",
        u"Alright! What are we waiting for, then?! Let\u2019s go!": u"Certo! Ent\u00e3o o que estamos esperando?! Vamos!",
        u"Alright! Yuri and I will help you to your cabins so you can drop off your belongings first!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! A Yuri e eu os levaremos \u00e0s cabanas para que possam deixar seus pertences primeiro!",
        u"Alright, Aiden.": u"Certo, Aiden.",
        u"Alright, Aiden\u2026 Let\u2019s get you back to our room\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 bem, Aiden\u2026 Vamos voltar para nosso quarto\u2026",
        u"Alright, Dad and Yoshi~ This is your big moment!": u"Certo, Pai e Yoshi~ Este \u00e9 o grande momento de voc\u00eas!",
        u"Alright, Dad. I\u2019ll go check up on everyone else too and make sure they\u2019re ready.": u"Tudo bem, pai. Vou ver como os outros est\u00e3o e garantir que estejam prontos.",
        u"Alright, Emilia! You\u2019re coming with me! I have to put you into something \u2018special\u2019!": u"Certo, Emilia! Voc\u00ea vem comigo! Preciso colocar em voc\u00ea algo \u2018especial\u2019!",
        u"Alright, Goro!": u"Certo, Goro!",
        u"Alright, Gramps! That should be all your stuff! ": u"Pronto, vov\u00f4! Acho que trouxemos tudo!",
        u"Alright, I made up my mind! I\u2019m going for it!": u"Certo, j\u00e1 me decidi! Eu vou aceitar!",
        u"Alright, I suppose we should get started for the day as well, Yoshinori.": u"Certo, acho que n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m dever\u00edamos come\u00e7ar o trabalho do dia, Yoshinori.",
        u"Alright, I\u2019ll be right back!": u"Certo, j\u00e1 volto!",
        u"Alright, I\u2019ll go and heat up all of our cabins!": u"Certo, vou aquecer todas as nossas cabanas!",
        u"Alright, I\u2019ll go drill the holes for the wires and give the workers their new tasks!": u"Certo, vou fazer os furos para os fios e passar as novas tarefas aos trabalhadores!",
        u"Alright, I\u2019ll go get him up.": u"Certo, vou acord\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Alright, I\u2019m ready.": u"Certo, estou pronto.",
        u"Alright, Jin! Have you ever ACTUALLY been with another guy?! You\u2019re always going on and on about all these fantasies, but you gotta have experienced at least one, right!": u"Certo, Jin! Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 ficou DE VERDADE com outro cara?! Voc\u00ea vive falando dessas fantasias, mas deve ter vivido pelo menos uma, certo?!",
        u"Alright, Mr. Andre! We\u2019re ready!": u"Certo, senhor Andre! Estamos prontos!",
        u"Alright, Sir Goro. Thanks.": u"Certo, senhor Goro. Obrigado.",
        u"Alright, Taiga. I\u2019ll leave you in charge of Yoichi\u2026!": u"Certo, Taiga. Vou deixar Yoichi sob sua responsabilidade\u2026!",
        u"Alright, Yoshinori. I picked first, so it\u2019s your turn.": u"Certo, Yoshinori. Eu escolhi primeiro, ent\u00e3o agora \u00e9 sua vez.",
        u"Alright, Yoshinori. What is it?": u"Certo, Yoshinori. O que \u00e9?",
        u"Alright, Yoshi\u2026": u"Certo, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Alright, Yuri! See you later!": u"Certo, Yuri! At\u00e9 mais!",
        u"Alright, Yuri. I\u2019ll take it from here!": u"Est\u00e1 bem, Yuri. Assumo daqui!",
        u"Alright, alright! Hahaha!": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem! Hahaha!",
        u"Alright, alright, I\u2019ll get everyone started.": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem, vou colocar todos em marcha.",
        u"Alright, alright.": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Alright, alright. ": u"Certo, certo. ",
        u"Alright, alright. Let\u2019s wash up, then!": u"Certo, certo. Ent\u00e3o vamos nos lavar!",
        u"Alright, alright. No drinks for tonight! Right, Yoshi and Gramps? *wink wink*": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem. Nada de bebidas esta noite! Certo, Yoshi e Vov\u00f4? *pisca, pisca*",
        u"Alright, alright~ But I\u2019d rather you take your time~": u"T\u00e1 bom, t\u00e1 bom~ Mas eu preferia que voc\u00ea fosse com calma~",
        u"Alright, come on everyone, I wanna hear you all sing~": u"Certo, vamos l\u00e1, pessoal, quero ouvir todo mundo cantando~",
        u"Alright, dear! Everything should be ready now for our first official day of Camp Buddy!": u"Muito bem, querida! Tudo deve estar pronto para nosso primeiro dia oficial do Camp Buddy!",
        u"Alright, fine\u2026 Guess I could go and start doing a little prepwork for lunch before I swim.": u"Certo, tudo bem\u2026 Acho que posso ir adiantando um pouco o almo\u00e7o antes de nadar.",
        u"Alright, hold your horses, you gotta recover first!": u"Certo, calma a\u00ed, primeiro voc\u00ea precisa se recuperar!",
        u"Alright, if it\u2019ll help!": u"Est\u00e1 bem, se isso ajudar!",
        u"Alright, if you\u2019re sure\u2026": u"Tudo bem, se voc\u00ea tem certeza\u2026",
        u"Alright, it\u2019s gonna be a long ride! Who\u2019s up for some snacks?": u"Certo, ser\u00e1 uma viagem longa! Quem quer uns lanches?",
        u"Alright, lemme stretch some!": u"Certo, deixa eu me alongar!",
        u"Alright, let\u2019s check out where we should go next!": u"Certo, vamos ver aonde devemos ir agora!",
        u"Alright, let\u2019s decide where we should go next!": u"Certo, vamos decidir aonde iremos agora!",
        u"Alright, let\u2019s get you over to the water and wash you off.": u"Certo, vamos levar voc\u00ea at\u00e9 a \u00e1gua e limp\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Alright, let\u2019s go somewhere else!": u"Certo, vamos para outro lugar!",
        u"Alright, let\u2019s take a peek then, shall we?": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o vamos dar uma olhada, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"Alright, maybe somewhere in the back\u2026": u"Certo, talvez em algum lugar mais ao fundo\u2026",
        u"Alright, my turn to \u2018work\u2019 my muscle~": u"Certo, minha vez de \u2018treinar\u2019 meu m\u00fasculo~",
        u"Alright, please follow me.": u"Certo, por favor, siga-me.",
        u"Alright, sir! ": u"Certo, senhor! ",
        u"Alright, sir! I\u2019ll start on your-": u"Certo, senhor! Vou come\u00e7ar pelo seu\u2014",
        u"Alright, sir! I\u2019ll start on your-{fast}": u"Certo, senhor! Vou come\u00e7ar pelo seu\u2014{fast}",
        u"Alright, sir. What\u2019ll we have this time?": u"Certo, senhor. O que vamos pedir desta vez?",
        u"Alright, that takes care of this department. I might as well check on the others.": u"Certo, este departamento est\u00e1 resolvido. Melhor verificar os outros.",
        u"Alright, that was a good hike! Everyone knows the drill now, right? ": u"Certo, foi uma boa caminhada! Todos j\u00e1 sabem o procedimento, n\u00e3o \u00e9? ",
        u"Alright, that\u2019s almost everyone!": u"Certo, est\u00e1 quase todo mundo!",
        u"Alright, then let\u2019s start with the pool right away!": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o vamos come\u00e7ar imediatamente pela piscina!",
        u"Alright, then. Please follow me.": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o. Por favor, siga-me.",
        u"Alright, then...": u"Tudo bem, ent\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Alright, this entry is done, but I can\u2019t believe it\u2019s already past midnight! ": u"Certo, esta postagem est\u00e1 pronta, mas n\u00e3o acredito que j\u00e1 passou da meia-noite! ",
        u"Alright, this is going to sting a little. I\u2019ll start applying it to your face.": u"Certo, isto vai arder um pouco. Vou come\u00e7ar passando no seu rosto.",
        u"Alright, we\u2019re really going home today!": u"Certo, hoje n\u00f3s realmente vamos voltar para casa!",
        u"Alright, we\u2019ve arrived at our destination! ": u"Certo, chegamos ao nosso destino!",
        u"Alright.": u"Certo.",
        u"Alright. Good night, then.": u"Certo. Ent\u00e3o, boa noite.",
        u"Alright. Here we go\u2026": u"Certo. Vamos l\u00e1\u2026",
        u"Alright. Here you go, Yoshinori.": u"Certo. Aqui est\u00e1, Yoshinori.",
        u"Alright. I guess I can talk to Sir Goro about it.": u"Est\u00e1 bem. Acho que posso conversar com o senhor Goro sobre isso.",
        u"Alright. If you need anything at all, you know where to find me.": u"Tudo bem. Se precisar de qualquer coisa, sabe onde me encontrar.",
        u"Alright. In addition, Ms. Komarova will officially assist with the maintenance tasks, so please take her under your wing as well.": u"Certo. Al\u00e9m disso, a Srta. Komarova ajudar\u00e1 oficialmente nas tarefas de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o, ent\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m cuidem de orient\u00e1-la.",
        u"Alright. I\u2019ll leave Ms. Komarova in your care now. Please take care of her.": u"Certo. Vou deixar a Srta. Komarova aos cuidados de voc\u00eas agora. Por favor, cuidem bem dela.",
        u"Alright. Let\u2019s go then.": u"Certo. Ent\u00e3o vamos.",
        u"Alright~": u"Certo~",
        u"Alright~ A pair of \u2018Leg Spreaders\u2019 coming up!": u"Certo~ Dois \u2018Abre-Pernas\u2019 saindo!",
        u"Alright~ A pair of \u2018Sex on the Beach\u2019 coming up! ": u"Certo~ Um par de \u2018Sex on the Beach\u2019 saindo! ",
        u"Alright~ It\u2019s about time the two of us got some privacy!": u"Certo~ J\u00e1 estava na hora de termos um pouco de privacidade!",
        u"Alright~ Two \u2018Blow Job Shots\u2019 coming up! ": u"Certo~ Dois \u2018Blow Job Shots\u2019 saindo! ",
        u"Alright~ Two \u2018Cocksucking Cowboys\u2019, coming up!": u"Certo~ Dois \u2018Cowboys Chupadores de Pau\u2019, saindo!",
        u"Alright~!": u"Certo~!",
        u"Alright\u2026": u"Certo\u2026",
        u"Alright\u2026 ": u"Est\u00e1 bem\u2026 ",
        u"Alright\u2026 Better make sure I didn\u2019t forget anything\u2026": u"Certo\u2026 \u00c9 melhor garantir que n\u00e3o me esqueci de nada\u2026",
        u"Alright\u2026 I just wanted to make sure.": u"Certo\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 queria ter certeza.",
        u"Alriiight! Now that they\u2019re gone, we can make this way more \u2018interesting.\u2019": u"Ceeerto! Agora que elas sa\u00edram, podemos deixar isso bem mais \u2018interessante\u2019.",
        u"Also, I figured kitchen work would be pretty hectic, since there\u2019s plenty of workers to feed again. So, I came by to help!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, imaginei que o trabalho na cozinha estaria bem corrido, j\u00e1 que temos muitos trabalhadores para alimentar de novo. Ent\u00e3o vim ajudar!",
        u"Also, I thought it was super cool! His really huge muscles can take down trees like they\u2019re nothing! ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, achei muito legal! Os m\u00fasculos enormes dele derrubam \u00e1rvores como se n\u00e3o fossem nada! ",
        u"Also, he\u2019s drying stuff outdoors\u2026 in winter? Wouldn\u2019t it just get frozen? ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ele est\u00e1 secando roupa do lado de fora\u2026 no inverno? N\u00e3o vai simplesmente congelar? ",
        u"Also, shouldn\u2019t you all be with the other scouts for the badge activity?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00eas n\u00e3o deveriam estar com os outros escoteiros na atividade de distintivo?",
        u"Also, thanks for helping us move in! Things have barely changed here at all, haven\u2019t they?": u"E obrigado por nos ajudarem com a instala\u00e7\u00e3o! Quase nada mudou aqui, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Also, watching you sweat from nervousness was rather entertaining. ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, v\u00ea-lo suar de nervosismo foi bastante divertido. ",
        u"Also, we ended up clicking on a BL ad\u2026": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acabamos clicando num an\u00fancio de BL\u2026",
        u"Although I don\u2019t blame her\u2026 I\u2019m just as ready for a vacation where I don\u2019t have to worry about any responsibilities.": u"Embora eu n\u00e3o a culpe\u2026 Estou igualmente pronto para umas f\u00e9rias em que n\u00e3o precise me preocupar com responsabilidade alguma.",
        u"Although I don\u2019t think it\u2019s included in our room package, unlike the other areas.": u"Embora eu ache que n\u00e3o esteja inclu\u00eddo no pacote do quarto, ao contr\u00e1rio das outras \u00e1reas.",
        u"Although I guess it\u2019s gonna be an awkward trip back home\u2026 if she even wants to come with us.": u"Embora eu ache que a viagem de volta vai ser bem constrangedora\u2026 se ela sequer quiser vir conosco.",
        u"Although I wouldn\u2019t mind getting some action too~": u"Embora eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o me importasse de ter um pouco de a\u00e7\u00e3o~",
        u"Although I\u2019m pretty sure everyone got a clear view of your half-naked body when I was dragging you out\u2026": u"Embora eu tenha certeza de que todos viram muito bem seu corpo seminu quando eu o arrastei para fora\u2026",
        u"Although if you want to get creamed again, that\u2019s still an option.": u"Embora, se quiser ficar coberto de creme de novo, essa op\u00e7\u00e3o ainda existe.",
        u"Although the hanged man usually depicts sacrifice, it can also mean wisdom, or making the right choices.": u"Embora O Enforcado normalmente represente sacrif\u00edcio, tamb\u00e9m pode significar sabedoria ou tomar as decis\u00f5es certas.",
        u"Although, I can understand why you and everyone else were intimidated by me, given how strict and uptight I'd been over the last couple of years\u2026": u"Ainda assim, entendo por que voc\u00ea e os outros se sentiam intimidados por mim, considerando como fui severo e inflex\u00edvel nos \u00faltimos anos\u2026",
        u"Although, I guess technically you could say that I\u2019m working on something\u2026": u"Embora, tecnicamente, acho que d\u00e1 para dizer que estou trabalhando em alguma coisa\u2026",
        u"Although, I have to admit, every time you tell me that I\u2019ll be next in line for your role at Camp Buddy, I always wonder if I can really do it.": u"Embora eu tenha que admitir que, sempre que diz que serei o pr\u00f3ximo a ocupar a sua fun\u00e7\u00e3o no Camp Buddy, fico pensando se realmente conseguirei.",
        u"Although, I have to give props where they\u2019re due. If it weren\u2019t for Mr. Nagira being in charge of overseeing Mr. Flynn\u2019s department, things could\u2019ve been worse.": u"Contudo, devo reconhecer os m\u00e9ritos. Se o Sr. Nagira n\u00e3o estivesse supervisionando o setor do Sr. Flynn, as coisas poderiam ter sido piores.",
        u"Although, I think they\u2019d fit your body\u2026 I was around your build the last time I wore them.": u"Mas acho que serviriam em voc\u00ea\u2026 Eu tinha mais ou menos o seu porte da \u00faltima vez que as usei.",
        u"Although, I\u2019m pretty guilty of being distracted sometimes too.": u"Embora eu tamb\u00e9m seja bastante culpado de me distrair \u00e0s vezes.",
        u"Although, as much as I\u2019d like to stay here longer, hearing what Emilia said about our project has me concerned as well.": u"Embora eu adorasse ficar aqui por mais tempo, ouvir o que Emilia disse sobre nosso projeto tamb\u00e9m me deixou preocupado.",
        u"Although, it\u2019s already obvious that I can make Yoshinori cum buckets, way more than you can.": u"Embora j\u00e1 esteja \u00f3bvio que consigo fazer Yoshinori gozar litros, muito mais do que voc\u00ea.",
        u"Although, it\u2019s not unusual to feel intimidated by etiquette rules at first.": u"Embora n\u00e3o seja incomum se sentir intimidado pelas regras de etiqueta no come\u00e7o.",
        u"Although, now that you\u2019ve said it \u2013 you could consider it a check for a healthy working environment.": u"Embora, agora que mencionou, voc\u00ea poderia considerar isto uma verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de um ambiente de trabalho saud\u00e1vel.",
        u"Although, something\u2019s been bugging me\u2026": u"Mas uma coisa est\u00e1 me incomodando\u2026",
        u"Although, that might be for the best\u2026 We shouldn\u2019t publish anything like that on the blog.": u"Embora talvez seja melhor assim\u2026 N\u00e3o dever\u00edamos publicar algo desse tipo no blog.",
        u"Although, you were always the one who listened when I had problems with my family.  ": u"Embora voc\u00ea sempre tenha sido quem me ouvia quando eu tinha problemas com minha fam\u00edlia.",
        u"Although\u2026 I can\u2019t help but notice the brooch you attached to it.": u"Embora\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o tenha podido deixar de notar o broche que prendeu nele.",
        u"Always start with the utensil farthest away from your plate, working your way towards the dinner plate as the courses progress.": u"Sempre comece pelo talher mais distante do prato e v\u00e1 avan\u00e7ando em dire\u00e7\u00e3o a ele conforme os pratos forem servidos.",
        u"Am I dead? Did I die in my apartment alone from all the MSG in the instant noodles I ate and caffeine from all the coffee I drank?": u"Eu morri? Morri sozinho no meu apartamento por causa de todo o glutamato do macarr\u00e3o instant\u00e2neo e da cafe\u00edna de tanto caf\u00e9?",
        u"Am I gonna end up cleaning up after him again\u2026? I bet he\u2019ll just throw the snow at random places.": u"Vou acabar tendo que arrumar a bagun\u00e7a dele de novo\u2026? Aposto que vai jogar a neve em qualquer lugar.",
        u"Am I in heaven? Was I sent here because of my good deeds translating those BL doujins for free\u2026?": u"Estou no c\u00e9u? Fui enviado para c\u00e1 por minhas boas a\u00e7\u00f5es, traduzindo aqueles doujins BL de gra\u00e7a\u2026?",
        u"Am I not allowed to have an opinion? How come when I\u2019m the one talking all of you always assume that I have ill intentions?": u"Eu n\u00e3o tenho direito a uma opini\u00e3o? Por que, quando sou eu falando, todos voc\u00eas sempre presumem que tenho m\u00e1s inten\u00e7\u00f5es?",
        u"Am I not here right now? I stayed here all day yesterday, and what did you and Yuri have me do? Nothing!": u"Eu n\u00e3o estou aqui agora? Fiquei aqui o dia inteiro ontem, e o que voc\u00ea e Yuri me fizeram fazer? Nada!",
        u"Am not! I can top whoever I want, even you!": u"N\u00e3o sou! Posso ser ativo com quem eu quiser, at\u00e9 com voc\u00ea!",
        u"An all-expense paid trip to one of my company\u2019s resort islands! I thought you and Yoshinori deserved to have a wonderful honeymoon!": u"Uma viagem com todas as despesas pagas para uma das ilhas-resort da minha empresa! Achei que voc\u00ea e Yoshinori mereciam uma lua de mel maravilhosa!",
        u"An opportunity as big as this is once in a lifetime!": u"Uma oportunidade desse tamanho s\u00f3 aparece uma vez na vida!",
        u"And Emilia, you better get it this time, or else!": u"E Emilia, \u00e9 melhor acertar desta vez, ou vai ver!",
        u"And Gramps is retired now, so he has all the time in the world!": u"E o Vov\u00f4 est\u00e1 aposentado agora, ent\u00e3o tem todo o tempo do mundo!",
        u"And I admit that when you came back, I was still pretty biased, which made things worse between us.": u"E admito que, quando voc\u00ea voltou, eu ainda tinha muito preconceito contra voc\u00ea, o que piorou as coisas entre n\u00f3s.",
        u"And I bet you forgot about us again! I haven\u2019t seen any of you since yesterday!": u"E aposto que se esqueceram de n\u00f3s de novo! N\u00e3o vejo nenhum de voc\u00eas desde ontem!",
        u"And I can\u2019t believe I said all that to a scout.": u"E n\u00e3o acredito que disse tudo isso para um escoteiro.",
        u"And I can\u2019t think straight with all of you being so damn persistent!!": u"E n\u00e3o consigo pensar direito com todos voc\u00eas insistindo tanto!!",
        u"And I couldn\u2019t protect him. ": u"E eu n\u00e3o conseguia proteg\u00ea-lo. ",
        u"And I don\u2019t lie about things I can\u2019t do. I\u2019m not supposed to know everything, hmph!": u"E n\u00e3o minto sobre as coisas que n\u00e3o sei fazer. N\u00e3o tenho obriga\u00e7\u00e3o de saber tudo, hmph!",
        u"And I don\u2019t think it\u2019d be nearly as memorable as this.": u"E acho que n\u00e3o seria nem de longe t\u00e3o memor\u00e1vel quanto isto.",
        u"And I don\u2019t think we need anything more than what we already have\u2026 ": u"E n\u00e3o acho que precisamos de nada al\u00e9m do que j\u00e1 temos\u2026 ",
        u"And I don\u2019t think we\u2019ve missed out on anything together. I\u2019ve gotten to hold you like this even when you weren\u2019t my boyfriend.": u"E n\u00e3o acho que tenhamos perdido nada juntos. Eu j\u00e1 podia abra\u00e7ar voc\u00ea assim mesmo quando voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o era meu namorado.",
        u"And I don\u2019t want you all to think that any of it is your fault\u2026": u"E n\u00e3o quero que nenhum de voc\u00eas pense que alguma parte disso foi culpa sua\u2026",
        u"And I guess what happened at the dinner really pushed me to my limit\u2026": u"E acho que o que aconteceu no jantar realmente me levou ao meu limite\u2026",
        u"And I guess you know the rest, since after that we got to Camp Buddy!": u"E acho que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 sabe o resto, porque depois disso n\u00f3s chegamos ao Camp Buddy!",
        u"And I have to try and fix everything that happened at the restaurant last night\u2026 *sigh*": u"E ainda tenho que tentar consertar tudo que aconteceu no restaurante ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 *suspiro*",
        u"And I have you to thank for it.": u"E tenho voc\u00ea a agradecer por isso.",
        u"And I heard you taught him a lot of woodworking yourself, Yoshi.": u"E ouvi dizer que voc\u00ea mesmo ensinou muita carpintaria a ele, Yoshi.",
        u"And I knew Yuri was gonna ask you to do it, so I thought I'd take it off your list!": u"E eu sabia que a Yuri pediria isso a voc\u00ea, ent\u00e3o resolvi tirar essa tarefa da sua lista!",
        u"And I love you the most because you gave me a purpose in my dull and gray life\u2026 ": u"E amo voc\u00ea acima de tudo porque me deu um prop\u00f3sito na minha vida mon\u00f3tona e cinzenta\u2026 ",
        u"And I must say, this is one of the best mini vacations I\u2019ve taken in a long time!": u"E devo dizer que estas foram uma das melhores minif\u00e9rias que tive em muito tempo!",
        u"And I owe it all to Camp Buddy\u2026 That\u2019s why we\u2019re going to give it everything we\u2019ve got and face the future with the brightest smile.": u"E devo tudo isso ao Camp Buddy\u2026 Por isso vamos dar tudo de n\u00f3s e encarar o futuro com o sorriso mais radiante poss\u00edvel.",
        u"And I owe it to everyone here for giving me another chance.": u"E devo isso a todos aqui por terem me dado outra chance.",
        u"And I really like it~": u"E eu gosto muito~",
        u"And I think that covers all the locations around the camp! Did you guys see everything you wanted? ": u"E acho que passamos por todos os lugares do acampamento! Voc\u00eas viram tudo o que queriam? ",
        u"And I think you\u2019ve played a huge part in that regard.": u"E acho que voc\u00ea teve um papel enorme nisso.",
        u"And I thought a drink might help you relax some too, so I came looking for you as soon as we finished\u2026!": u"E pensei que uma bebida tamb\u00e9m pudesse ajud\u00e1-lo a relaxar um pouco, ent\u00e3o vim procur\u00e1-lo assim que terminamos\u2026!",
        u"And I thought he was just being his usual goody-two-shoes self, trying to act all serious for business.": u"E eu achando que ele s\u00f3 estava bancando o bom-mo\u00e7o de sempre, tentando parecer todo s\u00e9rio por causa do trabalho.",
        u"And I thought we were done getting spoiled\u2026": u"E eu achei que j\u00e1 tinham terminado de nos mimar\u2026",
        u"And I thought you were being serious\u2026": u"E eu achei que o senhor estava falando s\u00e9rio\u2026",
        u"And I thought you were my friend...": u"E eu achava que voc\u00ea era meu amigo...",
        u"And I used up all the firewood in the kitchen, so I needed to make some more anyways! ": u"E usei toda a lenha da cozinha, ent\u00e3o precisava cortar mais de qualquer maneira! ",
        u"And I was so close to getting through it, then I just had to go and screw it up at the last moment\u2026": u"E eu estava t\u00e3o perto de conseguir chegar at\u00e9 o fim, mas tinha que estragar tudo no \u00faltimo momento\u2026",
        u"And I was telling her about the last two terms.": u"E eu estava contando a ela sobre as duas \u00faltimas temporadas.",
        u"And I was wondering what you did to take things to the next level?": u"E fiquei me perguntando o que voc\u00ea fez para levar as coisas ao pr\u00f3ximo n\u00edvel.",
        u"And I would bet money that if you were up for grabs, you\u2019d be booked solid!": u"E apostaria dinheiro que, se estivessem dispon\u00edveis, teriam a agenda lotada!",
        u"And I'm worried that if I stop trying, then who will?": u"E fico preocupado que, se eu parar de tentar, quem vai continuar?",
        u"And I\u2019ll be honest, I already regret losing my temper back there. I said some pretty hurtful things.": u"E, para ser sincero, j\u00e1 me arrependo de ter perdido a cabe\u00e7a l\u00e1 dentro. Disse coisas bem dolorosas.",
        u"And I\u2019ll be honest, I already regret losing my temper back there. I said some pretty hurtful things.{fast}": u"E, para ser sincero, j\u00e1 me arrependo de ter perdido a cabe\u00e7a l\u00e1 dentro. Disse coisas bem dolorosas.{fast}",
        u"And I\u2019ll go for your buns.": u"E eu vou pegar suas bundas.",
        u"And I\u2019ll let you in on a little secret! That dish I made\u2026 was actually my dad\u2019s specialty!": u"E vou contar um segredinho! Aquele prato que fiz\u2026 na verdade era a especialidade do meu pai!",
        u"And I\u2019m about to add more to the pile too\u2026 ": u"E eu ainda vou colocar mais coisas na pilha\u2026 ",
        u"And I\u2019m curious\u2026 Who is she busy taking care of?": u"E estou curioso\u2026 De quem ela est\u00e1 cuidando?",
        u"And I\u2019m not gonna let you bark at the new guys and scare them out of the camp.": u"E n\u00e3o vou deixar voc\u00ea latir para os novatos e expuls\u00e1-los do acampamento de tanto medo.",
        u"And I\u2019m shocked he picked an important day like this of all days\u2026": u"E estou surpresa que tenha escolhido justamente um dia importante como este\u2026",
        u"And I\u2019m still here\u2026": u"E eu ainda estou aqui\u2026",
        u"And I\u2019m the president. My decisions are the final say for the camp. Even Mr. Clermont asks for my permission before making changes.": u"E eu sou o presidente. Minhas decis\u00f5es s\u00e3o finais no acampamento. At\u00e9 o Sr. Clermont pede minha autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o antes de fazer mudan\u00e7as.",
        u"And I\u2019m usually so good at that! What\u2019s wrong with me?!": u"E normalmente sou t\u00e3o boa nisso! O que h\u00e1 de errado comigo?!",
        u"And I\u2019ve never felt so alive! It\u2019s been years since I\u2019ve had this much fun!": u"E nunca me senti t\u00e3o vivo! Faz anos que n\u00e3o me divirto tanto!",
        u"And Yoshi? I walked up to him staring up at the sky earlier, lost in his thoughts again!": u"E o Yoshi? Encontrei-o olhando para o c\u00e9u mais cedo, perdido nos pr\u00f3prios pensamentos de novo!",
        u"And a little bird told me that someone here got engaged last year~": u"E um passarinho me contou que algu\u00e9m aqui ficou noivo no ano passado~",
        u"And about his attire\u2026 I forgot to tell you ahead of time, but he has this habit of wearing \u201cless\u201d to cool down from all his work\u2026": u"E quanto \u00e0 roupa dele\u2026 Esqueci de avisar, mas ele tem o h\u00e1bito de usar \u201cmenos\u201d para se refrescar depois de todo o trabalho\u2026",
        u"And after experiencing what we all thought was the peak of Camp Buddy, it turns out it wasn\u2019t really a good thing.": u"E depois de vivermos o que todos ach\u00e1vamos ser o auge do Camp Buddy, descobrimos que aquilo n\u00e3o era realmente algo bom.",
        u"And after he saw what Gramps was packing, that perv\u2019s eyes were definitely sparkling. ": u"E depois de ver o que o vov\u00f4 tinha no meio das pernas, os olhos daquele tarado com certeza brilharam. ",
        u"And all of these are free?!": u"E tudo isso \u00e9 de gra\u00e7a?!",
        u"And all of this is free. It\u2019s all part of the package Mr. Clermont got for us.": u"E tudo isso \u00e9 de gra\u00e7a. Faz parte do pacote que o Sr. Clermont conseguiu para n\u00f3s.",
        u"And all the new jobs that come up are being taken care of by the specialists.": u"E todos os novos trabalhos que aparecem est\u00e3o sendo realizados pelos especialistas.",
        u"And all we can do is control how we respond to those events and try our best no matter the circumstances.": u"E tudo que podemos fazer \u00e9 controlar como reagimos a esses acontecimentos e dar o nosso melhor, n\u00e3o importa a situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"And aren\u2019t we all ordering from the same menu? With that logic, anything we order would be \u201cSoPhIsTicAtEd\u201d.": u"E n\u00e3o estamos todos pedindo do mesmo card\u00e1pio? Seguindo essa l\u00f3gica, qualquer coisa que pedirmos seria \u201cSoFiStIcAdA\u201d.",
        u"And as they say, \u201cstrike while the iron is hot\u201d; the good publicity we\u2019re getting from the book is a great opportunity to divert into the camp itself!": u"E, como dizem, devemos \u201caproveitar enquanto o ferro est\u00e1 quente\u201d; a boa publicidade do livro \u00e9 uma grande oportunidade para direcionar a aten\u00e7\u00e3o ao pr\u00f3prio acampamento!",
        u"And because it\u2019s the off-season, that role naturally feels empty to you right now.": u"E, como estamos fora da temporada, \u00e9 natural que esse papel pare\u00e7a vazio para voc\u00ea agora.",
        u"And believe it or not\u2026 It\u2019s always been my fantasy to see you in them too\u2026": u"E, acredite ou n\u00e3o\u2026 Sempre foi uma fantasia minha ver voc\u00ea usando isso tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"And believe it or not\u2026 It\u2019s always been my fantasy to see you in them\u2026": u"E, acredite ou n\u00e3o\u2026 Sempre foi uma fantasia minha ver voc\u00ea usando isso\u2026",
        u"And besides Gramps, you did everything you could to deflect in the nicest way possible, but she wouldn\u2019t give it up\u2026": u"Al\u00e9m disso, Vov\u00f4, voc\u00ea fez tudo que podia para contornar a situa\u00e7\u00e3o da maneira mais educada poss\u00edvel, mas ela n\u00e3o desistia\u2026",
        u"And besides, I\u2019m sure I can find a way to see you every once in a while, and you\u2014": u"Al\u00e9m disso, tenho certeza de que consigo encontrar uma maneira de ver voc\u00ea de vez em quando, e voc\u00ea\u2014",
        u"And besides, from what\u2019s poking my butt, I can tell part of you doesn\u2019t wanna resist~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, pelo que est\u00e1 cutucando minha bunda, d\u00e1 para perceber que uma parte de voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer resistir~",
        u"And besides, the cabin is pretty cramped with six people sharing a room. They could use the extra space.": u"E, al\u00e9m disso, a cabana fica bem apertada com seis pessoas dividindo o quarto. Eles podem aproveitar o espa\u00e7o extra.",
        u"And besides, the colors match us too! Strawberry for me, vanilla for Dad and chocolate for Yoshi!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, as cores tamb\u00e9m combinam conosco! Morango para mim, baunilha para o papai e chocolate para o Yoshi!",
        u"And besides, we don\u2019t need to pack as many essential things. Usually hotels provide them, don\u2019t they?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, n\u00e3o precisamos levar tantas coisas b\u00e1sicas. Normalmente os hot\u00e9is as fornecem, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"And besides, we\u2019re way off on the other end of the coast, no one\u2019ll see us here~": u"E al\u00e9m disso, estamos bem longe, do outro lado da costa. Ningu\u00e9m vai nos ver aqui~",
        u"And besides, you pushed yourself out of your comfort zone knowing you\u2019d have to deal with a lot of people when you signed up to work with us. ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea se for\u00e7ou a sair da sua zona de conforto sabendo que teria que lidar com muita gente quando aceitou trabalhar conosco. ",
        u"And besides, you\u2019ve been leading this camp for many years now. While we had some setbacks, your performance the previous term was enough to prove that you have what it takes to carry the torch someday.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 lidera este acampamento h\u00e1 muitos anos. Embora tenhamos enfrentado alguns contratempos, seu desempenho na \u00faltima temporada provou que tem o necess\u00e1rio para um dia carregar essa responsabilidade.",
        u"And boy was I right! Everyone\u2019s melting from the heat, so I knew you must\u2019ve been going to some super-secret hideout!": u"E como eu estava certo! Todo mundo est\u00e1 derretendo de calor, ent\u00e3o eu sabia que voc\u00eas deviam estar indo para algum esconderijo ultrassecreto!",
        u"And by the sound of things, we\u2019ll probably be pretty busy from now till the start of next term, too.": u"E, pelo jeito, provavelmente continuaremos bem ocupados de agora at\u00e9 o in\u00edcio da pr\u00f3xima temporada tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"And considering you were left in charge of the entire camp with lots of staff and scouts, I saw how much you were dealing with.": u"E, considerando que voc\u00ea ficou respons\u00e1vel pelo acampamento inteiro, com v\u00e1rios funcion\u00e1rios e escoteiros, eu via o quanto tinha que lidar.",
        u"And considering your skills, that would be quite easy to acquire if you put in the work and time! ": u"E, considerando suas habilidades, seria bem f\u00e1cil conseguir isso se voc\u00ea dedicar tempo e esfor\u00e7o! ",
        u"And do I really have to dress up like an aristocrat?": u"E eu realmente preciso me vestir como um aristocrata?",
        u"And do you guys really think it\u2019s okay to talk about this kind of stuff out in public\u2026?": u"E voc\u00eas realmente acham que \u00e9 certo falar dessas coisas em p\u00fablico\u2026?",
        u"And don\u2019t pretend like you wouldn\u2019t be jealous if I didn\u2019t stay with you.": u"E n\u00e3o finja que n\u00e3o ficaria com ci\u00fames se eu n\u00e3o ficasse com voc\u00ea.",
        u"And don\u2019t think I haven\u2019t noticed that bulge in your shorts.": u"E n\u00e3o pense que n\u00e3o percebi esse volume no seu short.",
        u"And don\u2019t worry about being away! We can always keep in touch, send gifts, and maybe even meet up at a restaurant you\u2019ll be working in!": u"E n\u00e3o se preocupe com a dist\u00e2ncia! Podemos manter contato, mandar presentes e talvez at\u00e9 nos encontrar em algum restaurante onde voc\u00ea estiver trabalhando!",
        u"And don\u2019t worry about being away! We can always keep in touch, send gifts, and maybe even meet up at the restaurant you\u2019ll be working in!": u"E n\u00e3o se preocupe com a dist\u00e2ncia! Podemos manter contato, mandar presentes e talvez at\u00e9 nos encontrar no restaurante onde voc\u00ea estiver trabalhando!",
        u"And don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m on leave at the moment! I thought it would be a nice change of scenery to see Camp Buddy again. I\u2019m quite fond of it, now~ ": u"E n\u00e3o se preocupe, estou de folga no momento! Achei que seria uma boa mudan\u00e7a de ares rever o Camp Buddy. Agora estou bastante apegado a este lugar~ ",
        u"And don\u2019t worry, all of you. If Emilia insists on handling things immaturely, I won\u2019t hesitate to reprimand her.": u"E n\u00e3o se preocupem. Se Emilia insistir em agir de maneira imatura, n\u00e3o hesitarei em repreend\u00ea-la.",
        u"And either way, I did enjoy our trip here! W-Well\u2026 at least the first parts of it.": u"E, de qualquer forma, eu gostei da nossa viagem! B-Bem\u2026 pelo menos da primeira parte.",
        u"And even so, the people working on this project aren\u2019t machines \u2013 you can\u2019t prohibit them from expressing themselves.": u"E, mesmo assim, as pessoas trabalhando neste projeto n\u00e3o s\u00e3o m\u00e1quinas \u2014 voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode proibi-las de se expressar.",
        u"And even though we're much older, she's still stuck in her ways.": u"E mesmo estando muito mais velhos, ela continua presa aos mesmos h\u00e1bitos.",
        u"And ever since then, you\u2019ve always stripped to cool down, even at camp\u2026": u"E, desde ent\u00e3o, voc\u00ea sempre tira a roupa para se refrescar, at\u00e9 no acampamento\u2026",
        u"And everyone else knows that things are different now and won\u2019t let this one incident define you!": u"E todos sabem que as coisas s\u00e3o diferentes agora e n\u00e3o v\u00e3o deixar que este \u00fanico incidente defina o senhor!",
        u"And feel free to consult with Mr. Nagira here as well!": u"E fique \u00e0 vontade para consultar o Sr. Nagira tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"And for not being there when you needed me the most\u2026": u"E por n\u00e3o ter estado ao seu lado quando mais precisava de mim\u2026",
        u"And for that, I\u2019ll always be thankful\u2026": u"E por isso eu sempre serei grato\u2026",
        u"And for that, I\u2019m forever grateful!": u"E por isso serei eternamente grato!",
        u"And for those new ones, you\u2019ll know me when you know me. ": u"E, quanto aos novatos, voc\u00eas me conhecer\u00e3o quando me conhecerem.",
        u"And for your information, I KNOW what I\u2019m doing. ": u"E, para sua informa\u00e7\u00e3o, eu SEI o que estou fazendo.",
        u"And from the way she\u2019s been acting, she hates the job too.": u"E, pelo modo como vem agindo, ela tamb\u00e9m odeia o emprego.",
        u"And from what I understand, she\u2019s really been struggling ever since she began fending for herself.": u"E, pelo que entendi, ela vem enfrentando muitas dificuldades desde que come\u00e7ou a se virar sozinha.",
        u"And get Jin some tissues for whatever other \u2018fluids\u2019 he needs to get rid of.": u"E arranjem alguns len\u00e7os para Jin, para quaisquer outros \u2018fluidos\u2019 dos quais ele precise se livrar.",
        u"And her disrespecting the staff isn\u2019t going to get us any answers\u2026": u"E ela desrespeitar os funcion\u00e1rios n\u00e3o vai nos dar resposta alguma\u2026",
        u"And here I was, hoping that you\u2019d be the one to introduce me to everyone because you knew me the best!": u"E eu esperando que voc\u00ea me apresentasse a todos, j\u00e1 que \u00e9 quem melhor me conhece!",
        u"And honestly, I can\u2019t think of anyone better than Yoshi here.": u"E, sinceramente, n\u00e3o consigo pensar em ningu\u00e9m melhor do que Yoshi.",
        u"And honestly... It\u2019s something I don\u2019t aspire for anymore\u2026  ": u"E, sinceramente\u2026 Isso j\u00e1 n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo que eu queira alcan\u00e7ar\u2026  ",
        u"And honestly\u2026. It\u2019s something I don\u2019t aspire for anymore\u2026": u"E, sinceramente\u2026 Isso j\u00e1 n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo que eu queira alcan\u00e7ar\u2026",
        u"And how can I help it? Seeing you in only an apron is one of my favorite looks.": u"E como posso evitar? Ver voc\u00ea usando s\u00f3 um avental \u00e9 um dos meus visuais favoritos.",
        u"And how can you grow and utilize your full potential as a future leader if you keep sitting on the sidelines?!": u"E como pretende crescer e aproveitar todo o seu potencial como futuro l\u00edder se continuar sentado \u00e0 margem?!",
        u"And how dare you call yourself a professional when all you\u2019ve done is critique and never once lifted a finger to join in on the labor? ": u"E como se atreve a se chamar de profissional quando tudo que fez foi criticar e nunca levantou um dedo sequer para ajudar no trabalho? ",
        u"And how did you manage to pull that approval off with Aiden over here running around the camp? Did you hide him in the closet?": u"E como conseguiram essa aprova\u00e7\u00e3o com o Aiden correndo desse jeito pelo acampamento? Esconderam ele no arm\u00e1rio?",
        u"And if I hadn\u2019t, I wouldn\u2019t have found out that you packed nothing but your notebooks.": u"E, se n\u00e3o tivesse feito isso, n\u00e3o teria descoberto que voc\u00ea s\u00f3 colocou seus cadernos na mochila.",
        u"And if there\u2019s anything I\u2019ve learned from you and the scouts, removing her would only cause resentment when we could still resolve things together.": u"E, se aprendi alguma coisa com voc\u00ea e os escoteiros, \u00e9 que afast\u00e1-la s\u00f3 causaria ressentimento quando ainda podemos resolver as coisas juntos.",
        u"And if there\u2019s anything some of you aren\u2019t sure of, you can always ask me.": u"E se houver algo de que algum de voc\u00eas n\u00e3o tenha certeza, podem sempre me perguntar.",
        u"And if you ever need a \u2018hand\u2019, I\u2019ll gladly do the \u2018job\u2019!": u"E se algum dia precisar de uma \u2018m\u00e3ozinha\u2019, terei prazer em fazer o \u2018servi\u00e7o\u2019!",
        u"And if you feel like you need professional help, just tell us, alright?": u"E se sentir que precisa de ajuda profissional, \u00e9 s\u00f3 nos dizer, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"And if you need us to get you some professional help, just tell us, alright?": u"E se precisar que busquemos ajuda profissional para voc\u00ea, \u00e9 s\u00f3 dizer, certo?",
        u"And if you're worried about big changes, take it from me, it's much better on the other side.": u"E se est\u00e1 preocupado com grandes mudan\u00e7as, acredite em mim: depois que voc\u00ea atravessa essa fase, as coisas ficam muito melhores.",
        u"And in these darkest moments, Aiden\u2019s best trait really shined \u2013 his perseverance. It was the reason why I could move forward too.": u"E nos momentos mais sombrios, a melhor qualidade de Aiden realmente brilhou \u2014 sua perseveran\u00e7a. Foi gra\u00e7as a ela que eu tamb\u00e9m consegui seguir em frente.",
        u"And in these darkest moments, Goro\u2019s best trait really shined \u2013 his fortitude. It was the reason why I could move forward too.": u"E nesses momentos mais sombrios, a melhor qualidade de Goro realmente brilhou \u2014 sua for\u00e7a de esp\u00edrito. Foi por causa dela que eu tamb\u00e9m consegui seguir em frente.",
        u"And in those moments, we end up losing sight of what\u2019s right\u2026": u"E nesses momentos acabamos perdendo de vista o que \u00e9 certo\u2026",
        u"And it just felt so surreal turning down something I spent my whole life working towards\u2026": u"E foi t\u00e3o surreal recusar algo pelo qual trabalhei a vida inteira\u2026",
        u"And it looks like Goro cleaned up after me, too\u2026 ": u"E parece que Goro tamb\u00e9m limpou tudo depois\u2026 ",
        u"And it looks like she\u2019s harassing that waiter\u2026": u"E parece que ela est\u00e1 atormentando aquele gar\u00e7om\u2026",
        u"And it looks like we need to get your muscle down there back into shape \u2013 it\u2019s lookin\u2019 limp!": u"E parece que precisamos colocar seu m\u00fasculo a\u00ed embaixo de volta em forma \u2013 ele t\u00e1 parecendo meio mole!",
        u"And it made total sense for someone with a personality like hers in such a situation\u2026": u"E fazia todo sentido para algu\u00e9m com a personalidade dela numa situa\u00e7\u00e3o dessas\u2026",
        u"And it was about something so pointless, too! Ugh, I\u2019ll never forget that one either\u2026": u"E ainda foi por uma coisa t\u00e3o idiota! Urgh, dessa eu tamb\u00e9m nunca vou me esquecer\u2026",
        u"And it\u2019s all fiction, so there\u2019s no reason to take anything seriously~!": u"E \u00e9 tudo fic\u00e7\u00e3o, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para levar nada a s\u00e9rio~!",
        u"And it\u2019s crazy how we can even joke around with you too, sir\u2026": u"E \u00e9 incr\u00edvel como agora podemos at\u00e9 brincar com o senhor\u2026",
        u"And it\u2019s given me more than enough time to think about us\u2026": u"E isso me deu tempo mais do que suficiente para pensar sobre n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"And it\u2019s just like Yuri said, we\u2019re here to help you out. Our doors were open to you then and they still are now.": u"E, como Yuri disse, estamos aqui para ajudar. Nossas portas estavam abertas para voc\u00ea naquela \u00e9poca e continuam abertas agora.",
        u"And it\u2019s not too late to go back to everyone, they\u2019ll understand for sure.": u"E ainda n\u00e3o \u00e9 tarde para voltar para junto de todos, eles com certeza v\u00e3o entender.",
        u"And it\u2019s very important to taste everything on your plate, even if you\u2019re unsure you\u2019ll like it!": u"E \u00e9 muito importante provar tudo que estiver no prato, mesmo que n\u00e3o tenha certeza se vai gostar!",
        u"And last but not least, I have a strange issue with Mr. Flynn. According to my investigations, he was still exhibiting indecent behavior around camp.": u"Por \u00faltimo, mas n\u00e3o menos importante, tenho uma quest\u00e3o peculiar com o Sr. Flynn. Segundo minhas investiga\u00e7\u00f5es, ele continuou exibindo comportamentos indecentes no acampamento.",
        u"And last but not least, Mr. Nagira.": u"E por \u00faltimo, mas n\u00e3o menos importante, Sr. Nagira.",
        u"And last but not the least, I don\u2019t want to share a room with girls who keep gossiping about me just because they\u2019re jealous! ": u"E, por \u00faltimo, mas n\u00e3o menos importante, n\u00e3o quero dividir quarto com garotas que ficam fofocando sobre mim s\u00f3 porque t\u00eam inveja! ",
        u"And let\u2019s face it, all she ever did was gather our reports and pass them over to Mr. Clermont.": u"E vamos admitir, tudo que ela fez foi reunir nossos relat\u00f3rios e repass\u00e1-los ao Sr. Clermont.",
        u"And let\u2019s just say some of the other scouts found me and my hobbies kinda annoying.": u"E digamos que alguns dos outros escoteiros achavam eu e meus hobbies meio irritantes.",
        u"And like I said, I have long put that behind me.": u"E, como eu disse, deixei isso para tr\u00e1s h\u00e1 muito tempo.",
        u"And like I said, I\u2019ll be staying by your side throughout this whole thing!": u"E, como disse, permanecerei ao seu lado durante tudo isso!",
        u"And maybe for us\u2026": u"E talvez para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"And mine\u2019s rock! Looks like I win~": u"E o meu \u00e9 pedra! Parece que eu ganhei~",
        u"And more importantly, we can use this chance to further train you in the tasks and responsibilities of someone who will take over the camp one day.": u"E, mais importante, podemos aproveitar esta oportunidade para trein\u00e1-lo nas tarefas e responsabilidades de quem um dia assumir\u00e1 o acampamento.",
        u"And most importantly, it has come to my attention that Yoshinori has no permanent role around the camp!": u"E, mais importante, descobri que Yoshinori n\u00e3o tem uma fun\u00e7\u00e3o permanente no acampamento!",
        u"And my favorite part, that nice musky scent you give off ~!": u"E minha parte favorita: esse cheiro almiscarado gostoso que voc\u00ea exala~!",
        u"And not exactly. It\u2019s actually for Camp Buddy. ": u"N\u00e3o exatamente. Na verdade, \u00e9 para o Camp Buddy. ",
        u"And now that we\u2019re finished with everything, I feel like I could use a serious release\u2026": u"E agora que terminamos tudo, sinto que estou precisando muito aliviar a tens\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"And now that we\u2019re officially together\u2026 We\u2019re even sharing one bed\u2026 and unlike the vacation, now it\u2019s permanent\u2026": u"E agora que estamos oficialmente juntos\u2026 At\u00e9 dividimos a mesma cama\u2026 e, diferente das f\u00e9rias, agora \u00e9 permanente\u2026",
        u"And now with twice as many scouts, it\u2019s really overwhelming.": u"E agora, com o dobro de escoteiros, est\u00e1 realmente puxado.",
        u"And now, Goro Nomoru, do you take Yoshinori Nagira to be your husband?": u"E agora, Goro Nomoru, aceita Yoshinori Nagira como seu marido?",
        u"And now, the first thing he\u2019ll hear from us is another setback on the project.": u"E agora a primeira coisa que vai ouvir de n\u00f3s \u00e9 sobre mais um contratempo no projeto.",
        u"And now, we\u2019ve grown into something I could only wish for\u2026": u"E agora, nossa rela\u00e7\u00e3o se tornou algo que eu s\u00f3 poderia desejar\u2026",
        u"And now, with the choice you made, it\u2019s going to last forever.": u"E agora, com a escolha que fez, isso vai durar para sempre.",
        u"And now, you\u2019re kinda dealing with something even more than that \u2013 having to oversee not only my team, but the other incoming specialists too.": u"E agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 lidando com algo ainda maior: ter\u00e1 que supervisionar n\u00e3o apenas a minha equipe, mas tamb\u00e9m os outros especialistas que est\u00e3o chegando.",
        u"And obviously I helped Bro-Aiden with the cooking~": u"E obviamente ajudei o Mano-Aiden na cozinha~",
        u"And obviously, I had plenty of prep work to do before hand \u2013 looking this good takes time after all~": u"E obviamente eu tinha muitos preparativos para fazer antes \u2014 afinal, ficar t\u00e3o bonita assim leva tempo~",
        u"And of all people, Yuri even suggested that we drink together! We all laughed and talked as we reminisced about old times!": u"E, entre todas as pessoas, at\u00e9 Yuri sugeriu que beb\u00eassemos juntos! Todos rimos e conversamos enquanto relembr\u00e1vamos os velhos tempos!",
        u"And of course, I sorta wanted to impress you when we met again. Hahaha!": u"E, claro, eu meio que queria impressionar voc\u00ea quando nos reencontr\u00e1ssemos. Hahaha!",
        u"And on the bright side, at least I understand her better now. I just hope I get the chance to talk to her when we get back to camp...": u"E, pelo lado positivo, pelo menos agora eu a entendo melhor. S\u00f3 espero ter a chance de conversar com ela quando voltarmos ao acampamento\u2026",
        u"And on the bright side, at least I understand her better now. I just hope I get the chance to talk to her when we get back to camp\u2026": u"E, pelo lado bom, pelo menos agora eu a entendo melhor. S\u00f3 espero ter a chance de conversar com ela quando voltarmos ao acampamento\u2026",
        u"And on top of that, you were always encouraging me to cook, the one thing I knew I loved doing.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea sempre me incentivou a cozinhar, a \u00fanica coisa que eu sabia que adorava fazer.",
        u"And once you guys made me a scoutmaster, I really felt like I belonged here.": u"E quando voc\u00eas me tornaram chefe escoteiro, realmente senti que pertencia a este lugar.",
        u"And she had the nerve to boss us around and treat us so badly for over three months now!": u"E ela ainda teve a cara de pau de mandar na gente e nos tratar t\u00e3o mal por mais de tr\u00eas meses!",
        u"And she looks like she isn\u2019t a fan of introductions either\u2026": u"E tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o parece muito f\u00e3 de apresenta\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026",
        u"And since you failed to take that ring off, I\u2019m putting a curse on you~": u"E j\u00e1 que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o conseguiu tirar esse anel, vou lan\u00e7ar uma maldi\u00e7\u00e3o em voc\u00ea~",
        u"And speaking of streak, come on! Off with the onesie!": u"E falando em ficar sem nada, vamos! Tire o macac\u00e3o!",
        u"And thank you for letting me eat your food, Yoshinori!": u"E obrigado por me deixar comer a sua comida, Yoshinori!",
        u"And that I had the courage to propose to you\u2026": u"E que tive coragem de pedir voc\u00ea em casamento\u2026",
        u"And that chapter is with you, Yoshinori\u2026": u"E esse cap\u00edtulo \u00e9 ao seu lado, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"And that he shouldn\u2019t turn it down just because he\u2019s afraid of the future\u2026": u"E que n\u00e3o deveria recusar s\u00f3 porque tem medo do futuro\u2026",
        u"And that means\u2026?": u"E isso significa\u2026?",
        u"And that plan is\u2026?": u"E esse plano seria\u2026?",
        u"And that\u2019s because I really am happy with you, Yoshi.": u"E isso \u00e9 porque eu realmente sou feliz com voc\u00ea, Yoshi.",
        u"And that\u2019s not even including how busy we\u2019ll be.": u"E isso sem contar o quanto estaremos ocupados.",
        u"And that\u2019s not even mentioning the money \u2013 you\u2019d be pulling in almost five figures a month with the clientele he refers!": u"E isso sem falar no dinheiro \u2014 com os clientes que ele indicar, voc\u00ea poderia ganhar quase cinco d\u00edgitos por m\u00eas!",
        u"And that\u2019s scissors for me! Seeya, shirt!": u"E eu tirei tesoura! Tchau, camiseta!",
        u"And that\u2019s something that will forever stay in our hearts!": u"E isso \u00e9 algo que ficar\u00e1 para sempre em nossos cora\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"And that\u2019s the point\u2026 It\u2019s no secret that she dislikes being in Camp Buddy given her history\u2026": u"E esse \u00e9 o ponto\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 segredo que ela n\u00e3o gosta de estar no Camp Buddy, considerando o passado dela\u2026",
        u"And that\u2019s to be with you, Yoshi.": u"E isso \u00e9 ficar ao seu lado, Yoshi.",
        u"And that\u2019s when I met you! You were the reason Dad and I got a place to stay for good.": u"E foi a\u00ed que conheci voc\u00ea! Voc\u00ea foi a raz\u00e3o de meu pai e eu finalmente termos um lugar definitivo para ficar.",
        u"And that\u2019s when I started making more time for her as a father.": u"E foi a\u00ed que comecei a reservar mais tempo para ela como pai.",
        u"And that\u2019s where I come in, Aiden.": u"E \u00e9 a\u00ed que eu entro, Aiden.",
        u"And that\u2019s why I held back on her offer in the first place. ": u"E foi por isso que hesitei diante da proposta dela.",
        u"And that\u2019s why I paired Yoshinori with you, dear. Hahaha.": u"E foi por isso que formei uma dupla entre voc\u00ea e Yoshinori, querida. Hahaha.",
        u"And that\u2019s why this time\u2026 I\u2019m finally going to fight for what makes me truly happy.": u"E \u00e9 por isso que, desta vez\u2026 finalmente vou lutar pelo que realmente me faz feliz.",
        u"And the nose isn\u2019t the only tip that\u2019s red on this reindeer~": u"E o nariz n\u00e3o \u00e9 a \u00fanica ponta vermelha nesta rena~",
        u"And the only reason I\u2019m here is because of you\u2026": u"E a \u00fanica raz\u00e3o de eu estar aqui \u00e9 voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"And the only reason everyone else didn\u2019t understand you is because you never tried to meet them halfway either!": u"E a \u00fanica raz\u00e3o de todos os outros n\u00e3o entenderem voc\u00ea \u00e9 que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m nunca tentou fazer sua parte!",
        u"And then, thanks to your determination, I was able to start working here!": u"E ent\u00e3o, gra\u00e7as \u00e0 sua determina\u00e7\u00e3o, pude come\u00e7ar a trabalhar aqui!",
        u"And there goes the sauce.": u"E l\u00e1 se foi o molho.",
        u"And there we go! That should be all our stuff, Aiden!": u"E pronto! Acho que isso \u00e9 tudo o que precisamos, Aiden!",
        u"And there\u2019s no better time than the present, so let\u2019s get started!": u"E n\u00e3o h\u00e1 momento melhor que o presente, ent\u00e3o vamos come\u00e7ar!",
        u"And there\u2019s no one I\u2019d rather share it with than you guys!": u"E n\u00e3o h\u00e1 ningu\u00e9m com quem eu preferiria compartilhar tudo isso al\u00e9m de voc\u00eas!",
        u"And this time around, I\u2019ll make sure to protect your smile forever.": u"E desta vez vou garantir que seu sorriso esteja protegido para sempre.",
        u"And this time, you don\u2019t have to do any work!": u"E desta vez voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa trabalhar!",
        u"And to answer your question - Not much has changed for me, except that I\u2019m a scoutmaster now!": u"E, respondendo \u00e0 sua pergunta, pouca coisa mudou para mim, exceto que agora sou chefe escoteiro!",
        u"And to be honest, this trip is extra special.": u"E, para ser sincero, esta viagem \u00e9 ainda mais especial.",
        u"And to celebrate that\u2026 I got something for you\u2026": u"E para comemorar isso\u2026 Eu trouxe algo para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"And to think that my reason for turning it down was just because I was so afraid to be away from you.": u"E pensar que eu estava recusando tudo isso s\u00f3 porque tinha tanto medo de ficar longe de voc\u00ea.",
        u"And to think we only have a few months left \u2019til the project ends\u2026 I\u2019ll be losing the closest thing I have to a \u2018social circle\u2019.": u"E pensar que faltam apenas alguns meses para o projeto acabar\u2026 Vou perder a coisa mais pr\u00f3xima que tenho de um \u2018c\u00edrculo social\u2019.",
        u"And to think, you were the one always demanding your own private space.": u"E pensar que era voc\u00ea quem sempre exigia ter seu pr\u00f3prio espa\u00e7o.",
        u"And today marks exactly six months since we started dating, five months and 26 days since our engagement... and a month since our wedding.": u"E hoje faz exatamente seis meses desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar, cinco meses e 26 dias desde nosso noivado\u2026 e um m\u00eas desde nosso casamento.",
        u"And today marks exactly six months since we started dating.": u"E hoje faz exatamente seis meses desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar.",
        u"And we accept you for who you are \u2013 even the flaws you\u2019re not proud of, Dad! ": u"E n\u00f3s aceitamos voc\u00ea como \u00e9 \u2014 at\u00e9 mesmo as falhas das quais n\u00e3o se orgulha, pai! ",
        u"And we built a really huge obstacle course too! ": u"E tamb\u00e9m constru\u00edmos uma pista de obst\u00e1culos enorme! ",
        u"And we just assumed that she was credible since she was put here by Mr. Clermont.": u"E simplesmente presumimos que fosse confi\u00e1vel porque o Sr. Clermont a colocou aqui.",
        u"And we were only trying to find out the truth for the sake of our project\u2026": u"E s\u00f3 est\u00e1vamos tentando descobrir a verdade pelo bem do nosso projeto\u2026",
        u"And we wouldn\u2019t have come this far if you hadn\u2019t selflessly given yourself up for all of us\u2026": u"E n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos chegado t\u00e3o longe se o senhor n\u00e3o tivesse se dedicado de forma t\u00e3o altru\u00edsta a todos n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"And we\u2019re right on time, so let\u2019s get straight to business, shall we?": u"E estamos pontualmente no hor\u00e1rio, ent\u00e3o vamos direto aos neg\u00f3cios, certo?",
        u"And what I love the most about you is your dedication.": u"E o que eu mais amo em voc\u00ea \u00e9 a sua dedica\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"And what I\u2019ve observed is a trend with Ms. Emilia to be overly defensive when it comes to her reputation\u2026": u"E o que observei \u00e9 uma tend\u00eancia da Srta. Emilia a ficar excessivamente defensiva quando sua reputa\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 em jogo\u2026",
        u"And what about Camp Buddy?!": u"E o Camp Buddy?!",
        u"And what about my bags?! You\u2019re not expecting me to carry them back all the way to the top floor again, are you?!": u"E as minhas malas?! N\u00e3o esperam que eu carregue tudo de volta at\u00e9 o \u00faltimo andar, esperam?!",
        u"And what better person than the one who installed it!": u"E quem seria melhor do que a pessoa que instalou tudo!",
        u"And what? You\u2019re gonna sneak up and grab my crotch again?": u"E o qu\u00ea? Vai chegar de fininho e agarrar minha virilha de novo?",
        u"And what\u2019s up with these shoes? I can\u2019t even walk properly in them.": u"E qual \u00e9 a desses sapatos? Eu nem consigo andar direito com eles.",
        u"And when I found out that you were returning, I couldn\u2019t feel a thing\u2026": u"E quando descobri que voc\u00ea estava voltando, eu n\u00e3o conseguia sentir nada\u2026",
        u"And when I got back here, you acted as if we barely knew each other\u2026!!": u"E quando voltei para c\u00e1, voc\u00ea agiu como se mal nos conhec\u00eassemos\u2026!!",
        u"And when I was at my worst, you still saw the best in me.": u"E quando eu estava no meu pior, voc\u00ea ainda enxergou o melhor em mim.",
        u"And when it comes to my interests, he always tries to enjoy them with me! Even though he does like to tease me about them still\u2026": u"E quando se trata dos meus interesses, ele sempre tenta aproveit\u00e1-los comigo! Mesmo que ainda goste de me provocar por causa deles\u2026",
        u"And when it finally happened\u2026 I thought I was going to be fine\u2026": u"E quando finalmente aconteceu\u2026 achei que eu ficaria bem\u2026",
        u"And when we were reunited, I wanted things to go back to the way they were, but everything was already different.": u"E quando nos reencontramos, eu queria que tudo voltasse a ser como antes, mas tudo j\u00e1 estava diferente.",
        u"And who in the world writes shopping lists on paper nowadays?!": u"E quem neste mundo ainda escreve lista de compras no papel hoje em dia?!",
        u"And who knows, maybe you\u2019ll break your decade-long single curse, Dad!": u"E quem sabe voc\u00ea finalmente quebra essa maldi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma d\u00e9cada solteiro, pai!",
        u"And who knows, once I get the title and all, I\u2019d have to work elsewhere too\u2026": u"E quem sabe, depois de conseguir o t\u00edtulo e tudo mais, talvez eu tamb\u00e9m tenha que trabalhar em outro lugar\u2026",
        u"And who\u2019s the kid? Wait\u2014 Don\u2019t tell me you have a son already?! Sheesh, has it really been that long?!": u"E quem \u00e9 o garoto? Espere\u2026 N\u00e3o me diga que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 tem um filho?! Nossa, faz tanto tempo assim?!",
        u"And why do you have a bag of stuff? ": u"E por que est\u00e1 com uma bolsa cheia de coisas? ",
        u"And why is there a sweet bike parked by your office all of a sudden?!": u"E por que de repente tem uma moto irada estacionada perto do seu escrit\u00f3rio?!",
        u"And with plenty of new campers next year, it will be hard to monitor them all. The excess junk could be a hazard.": u"E, com tantos campistas novos no ano que vem, ser\u00e1 dif\u00edcil vigiar todos eles. O excesso de entulho pode ser perigoso.",
        u"And with you guys by my side, I\u2019m sure I can take on the challenge, no matter what!": u"E, com voc\u00eas ao meu lado, tenho certeza de que posso enfrentar esse desafio, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a!",
        u"And with your help, this\u2019ll be a breeze! You\u2019ll be my sous chef! ": u"E, com a sua ajuda, ser\u00e1 muito f\u00e1cil! Voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 o meu subchefe de cozinha! ",
        u"And yet here we are. Going against all odds.": u"E mesmo assim aqui estamos. Contrariando todas as probabilidades.",
        u"And yet we\u2019re supposed to believe that following the same leadership would make a difference?": u"E ainda devemos acreditar que seguir a mesma lideran\u00e7a faria alguma diferen\u00e7a?",
        u"And yet you pushed yourself throughout this project too\u2026": u"E mesmo assim voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m se esfor\u00e7ou ao limite durante este projeto\u2026",
        u"And yet, I became so distant over the years that I couldn\u2019t even return the favor.": u"Ainda assim, fiquei t\u00e3o distante ao longo dos anos que nem consegui retribuir.",
        u"And yet, I dragged you away from it\u2026 because I didn\u2019t want us to be so helpless, always relying on others\u2026": u"E mesmo assim eu arrastei voc\u00ea para longe de tudo aquilo\u2026 porque n\u00e3o queria que f\u00f4ssemos t\u00e3o impotentes, sempre dependendo dos outros\u2026",
        u"And yet\u2026 it only took one moment to undo it all.": u"E ainda assim\u2026 bastou um momento para desfazer tudo.",
        u"And you already said truth, so no takebacks.": u"E voc\u00ea j\u00e1 disse verdade, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o pode voltar atr\u00e1s.",
        u"And you aren\u2019t listening to what I\u2019m saying, are you?": u"E voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 ouvindo o que estou dizendo, est\u00e1?",
        u"And you chose the best person to pass the torch to! With Yoshi, the camp will be in good hands!": u"E escolheu a melhor pessoa para passar o bast\u00e3o! Com Yoshi, o acampamento estar\u00e1 em boas m\u00e3os!",
        u"And you forgot to put your apron on.": u"E esqueceu de colocar o avental.",
        u"And you have the nerve to say that I don\u2019t make time?!": u"E voc\u00ea ainda tem coragem de dizer que eu n\u00e3o arranjo tempo?!",
        u"And you still ramble about cheesy stuff like there\u2019s no tomorrow!": u"E voc\u00ea ainda fica falando essas coisas melosas como se n\u00e3o houvesse amanh\u00e3!",
        u"And you were planning to clean this all by yourself? There\u2019s no way you could\u2019ve finished it in a day\u2026!": u"E voc\u00ea planejava limpar tudo sozinho? N\u00e3o teria como terminar em um dia\u2026!",
        u"And you worked on me on top of that. Hahaha!": u"E ainda trabalhou em cima de mim. Hahaha!",
        u"And you worked on that with just the two of you?!": u"E voc\u00eas trabalharam nisso apenas os dois?!",
        u"And you, Mr. Flynn! You continue to exhibit indecent and explicit behavior around the camp despite my previous warnings!": u"E voc\u00ea, Sr. Flynn! Continua exibindo comportamento indecente e expl\u00edcito pelo acampamento apesar dos meus avisos anteriores!",
        u"And you\u2019ll be my first lap dance, cowboy!": u"E voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 o primeiro a ganhar uma dan\u00e7a no colo, caub\u00f3i!",
        u"And you\u2019re not out of the woods yet, Pipsqueak!": u"E voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o escapou, Baixinho!",
        u"And you\u2019re not supposed to shove it down your throat and swallow it like a pill! You\u2019re ruining the experience!": u"E n\u00e3o \u00e9 para enfiar tudo na garganta e engolir como um comprimido! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 estragando a experi\u00eancia!",
        u"And you\u2019re one sexy cowpoke who\u2019s been teasing me all night. I\u2019ve had enough holding back.": u"E voc\u00ea \u00e9 um caub\u00f3i sexy que passou a noite inteira me provocando. J\u00e1 cansei de me conter.",
        u"And you\u2019re one to talk, ever since you built this stupid camp!": u"E olha quem fala, desde que construiu este acampamento idiota!",
        u"And you\u2019re right that I\u2019ve got to put in the work too. ": u"E voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o, eu tamb\u00e9m preciso fazer minha parte. ",
        u"And, after thinking about it, I know why you ended up saying everything you did\u2026": u"E, depois de pensar melhor, entendo por que voc\u00ea acabou dizendo tudo aquilo\u2026",
        u"And, quite frankly, why both myself and Camp Buddy are even still around.": u"E, francamente, \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m por isso que eu e o Camp Buddy ainda estamos aqui.",
        u"And, today is also exactly six months since we started dating.": u"E hoje tamb\u00e9m faz exatamente seis meses desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar.",
        u"And?": u"E da\u00ed?",
        u"And\u2026 There go my scouts.": u"E\u2026 l\u00e1 v\u00e3o meus escoteiros.",
        u"And\u2026 about that\u2026 I really meant what I said last night\u2026": u"E\u2026 sobre isso\u2026 Eu realmente quis dizer o que disse ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"And\u2026 seeing how everyone here was part of Camp Buddy in the past, I feel I missed a part of my youth.": u"E\u2026 vendo como todos aqui fizeram parte do Camp Buddy no passado, sinto que perdi uma parte da minha juventude.",
        u"And\u2026 the timer is set!": u"E\u2026 o temporizador est\u00e1 pronto!",
        u"Anyone could walk back in you know. But then that\u2019s not even a concern for you.": u"Qualquer um pode entrar de novo, sabia? Mas isso nem \u00e9 uma preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o para voc\u00ea.",
        u"Anything would look good on hunks like you two, for sure~! Here, try this one, Aiden~!": u"Qualquer coisa ficaria \u00f3tima em dois gostos\u00f5es como voc\u00eas, com certeza~! Aqui, experimenta este, Aiden~!",
        u"Anywaaay, what did you boys work on today?": u"Enfiiim, no que voc\u00eas trabalharam hoje?",
        u"Anyway! I think we\u2019re done with the chopping! That should be all the prep work we need help with, all that\u2019s left is the actual cooking!": u"Enfim! Acho que terminamos de cortar tudo! Isso deve ser todo o preparo em que precisamos de ajuda; agora s\u00f3 falta cozinhar!",
        u"Anyway, Aiden, I actually came here to ask if you needed any help with the kitchen work or any of your other tasks.": u"Enfim, Aiden, na verdade vim perguntar se precisava de ajuda com o trabalho na cozinha ou com alguma outra tarefa.",
        u"Anyway, Dad! Now that Emilia is kicked out, you can use your room again~!": u"Enfim, Pai! Agora que Emilia saiu de l\u00e1, voc\u00ea pode usar seu quarto de novo~!",
        u"Anyway, I actually used to work out on something like this back in college!": u"De todo modo, eu treinava em algo parecido na \u00e9poca da faculdade!",
        u"Anyway, I am left with no choice but to cede to the camp president\u2019s decision, and will include this extensive break in our schedule.": u"Enfim, n\u00e3o me resta escolha a n\u00e3o ser ceder \u00e0 decis\u00e3o do presidente do acampamento e incluir essa longa pausa em nosso cronograma.",
        u"Anyway, I believe we\u2019ve covered everything for this introductory meeting. Welcome to the team, Jin!": u"Enfim, acredito que abordamos tudo nesta reuni\u00e3o introdut\u00f3ria. Bem-vindo \u00e0 equipe, Jin!",
        u"Anyway, I dunno about you guys but I\u2019m beat! Today has been crazy draining!": u"Enfim, n\u00e3o sei voc\u00eas, mas estou acabado! Hoje foi absurdamente cansativo!",
        u"Anyway, I guess we got all that we need for now! I\u2019ll call the suppliers and they should be able to deliver by sundown!": u"Enfim, acho que temos tudo de que precisamos por enquanto! Vou ligar para os fornecedores e eles devem conseguir entregar at\u00e9 o anoitecer!",
        u"Anyway, I heard that Sir Goro has gone missing today? Is that true?": u"Enfim, ouvi dizer que o Sr. Goro sumiu hoje. \u00c9 verdade?",
        u"Anyway, I should probably get to work and prep brunch!": u"Enfim, \u00e9 melhor eu come\u00e7ar a trabalhar e preparar o brunch!",
        u"Anyway, I think it\u2019s almost check-out time. Have you packed yet, dear?": u"Enfim, acho que est\u00e1 quase na hora do check-out. J\u00e1 arrumou suas coisas, querida?",
        u"Anyway, I think that should be all you guys\u2019 stuff, right? ": u"Enfim, acho que essas s\u00e3o todas as coisas de voc\u00eas, certo? ",
        u"Anyway, I wanted to give him some privacy and decided to step outside for a walk.": u"Enfim, quis dar um pouco de privacidade a ele e decidi sair para caminhar.",
        u"Anyway, I was just chatting with Lloyd and Darius here about how fortunate we were to find them!": u"Enfim, eu estava conversando com Lloyd e Darius sobre a sorte que tivemos de encontr\u00e1-los!",
        u"Anyway, I\u2019ll go place our order. Go and find us a table.": u"Enfim, vou fazer nosso pedido. V\u00e1 encontrar uma mesa para n\u00f3s.",
        u"Anyway, I\u2019ll make sure that you know exactly what to do in both of these fields from now on.": u"Enfim, garantirei que, de agora em diante, voc\u00ea saiba exatamente o que fazer nas duas \u00e1reas.",
        u"Anyway, I\u2019m done with the weights! ": u"Enfim, terminei com os pesos! ",
        u"Anyway, Yoichi. If you\u2019re still hungry, you\u2019re welcome to join us.": u"Enfim, Yoichi. Se ainda estiver com fome, pode se juntar a n\u00f3s.",
        u"Anyway, Yoshinori. I picked first, so it\u2019s your turn.": u"Enfim, Yoshinori. Eu escolhi primeiro, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 a sua vez.",
        u"Anyway, a special day like this is worth a treat! I bought you guys your favorite Neapolitan ice cream!": u"Enfim, um dia especial como este merece uma guloseima! Comprei o sorvete napolitano favorito de voc\u00eas!",
        u"Anyway, are you ready to continue with our walk? We've just started the patrol.": u"Enfim, est\u00e1 pronto para continuar nossa caminhada? Mal come\u00e7amos a patrulha.",
        u"Anyway, can I bunk with you guys for the night? Usually this goes on for hours and I can\u2019t sleep with all the groaning and sobbing.": u"Enfim, posso dormir com voc\u00eas esta noite? Normalmente isso dura horas, e eu n\u00e3o consigo dormir com todos aqueles gemidos e choros.",
        u"Anyway, come on! Let's go serve lunch!": u"Enfim, vamos! Vamos servir o almo\u00e7o!",
        u"Anyway, did you need anything from me?": u"Enfim, precisava de alguma coisa?",
        u"Anyway, don\u2019t mind if I strip down too~": u"Enfim, espero que n\u00e3o se importe se eu tamb\u00e9m tirar a roupa~",
        u"Anyway, is everyone clear on the tasks I\u2019ve given you?": u"Enfim, todos compreenderam as tarefas que atribu\u00ed?",
        u"Anyway, it\u2019s getting late... I wonder why nobody has called for us yet\u2026 ": u"Enfim, est\u00e1 ficando tarde... Ser\u00e1 que ningu\u00e9m vai chamar a gente\u2026? ",
        u"Anyway, it\u2019s not my business to pry.": u"Enfim, n\u00e3o \u00e9 da minha conta me intrometer.",
        u"Anyway, it\u2019s something that I wish my parents had taught me. Or anyone for that matter.": u"Enfim, \u00e9 algo que eu gostaria que meus pais tivessem me ensinado. Ou qualquer pessoa, na verdade.",
        u"Anyway, lemme just heat this up so you can take your meds and\u2014": u"Enfim, deixa eu esquentar isso para voc\u00ea tomar seus rem\u00e9dios e\u2014",
        u"Anyway, let me take this shirt off before it stains.": u"De todo modo, vou tirar esta camisa antes que manche.",
        u"Anyway, looks like we have a lot to clean, huh? We better start now so we\u2019ll finish before sundown.": u"Enfim, parece que temos muita coisa para limpar, n\u00e3o \u00e9? \u00c9 melhor come\u00e7armos agora para terminar antes do p\u00f4r do sol.",
        u"Anyway, make yourselves comfortable! You guys can start digging into the food Aiden prepared!": u"Enfim, fiquem \u00e0 vontade! Voc\u00eas j\u00e1 podem atacar a comida que Aiden preparou!",
        u"Anyway, quit stalling! Go get in your costume and fetch Aiden!": u"Enfim, pare de enrolar! V\u00e1 colocar sua fantasia e buscar o Aiden!",
        u"Anyway, quit stalling! Go get in your costume and fetch Dad!": u"Enfim, pare de enrolar! V\u00e1 colocar sua fantasia e buscar o Pai!",
        u"Anyway, shall we continue the tour? I noticed you haven\u2019t listed anything from our first department\u2026": u"Enfim, podemos continuar o passeio? Notei que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o anotou nada sobre nosso primeiro setor\u2026",
        u"Anyway, should we go start today\u2019s shift? We don\u2019t want the scouts doing all the work, right?": u"Enfim, vamos come\u00e7ar o trabalho de hoje? N\u00e3o queremos que os escoteiros fa\u00e7am tudo sozinhos, certo?",
        u"Anyway, since you weren\u2019t listening to me, I was asking when you\u2019ll be done cleaning up here? ": u"Enfim, j\u00e1 que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava me ouvindo, eu perguntei quando vai terminar de arrumar tudo por aqui. ",
        u"Anyway, thank you again for your concern, Yoshinori. Why don\u2019t we go and join Yuri?": u"De qualquer forma, agrade\u00e7o novamente a sua preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o, Yoshinori. Vamos nos juntar \u00e0 Yuri?",
        u"Anyway, that\u2019s all of the interesting stuff for now, I can show you the other pictures after we carry all this to our room.": u"Enfim, por enquanto isso \u00e9 tudo de interessante. Posso mostrar as outras fotos depois que levarmos tudo para o nosso quarto.",
        u"Anyway, that\u2019s enough reminiscing for now! If you don\u2019t mind, I\u2019d like to go and see Ms. Komarova to check on her condition.": u"Enfim, chega de nostalgia por enquanto! Se n\u00e3o se importarem, gostaria de ver a Srta. Komarova e saber como ela est\u00e1.",
        u"Anyway, that\u2019s enough worrying about me! Why don\u2019t we go check out some more stuff around the hotel?": u"Enfim, chega de se preocupar comigo! Por que n\u00e3o vamos conhecer mais coisas pelo hotel?",
        u"Anyway, the others are waiting for us to eat. Shall we go and join them?": u"Enfim, os outros est\u00e3o nos esperando para comer. Vamos nos juntar a eles?",
        u"Anyway, there\u2019s eight of us, so it\u2019s only natural to split the rooms into pairs\u2026 Is everyone good with that?": u"De todo modo, somos oito, ent\u00e3o o mais natural \u00e9 dividir os quartos em duplas\u2026 Todos concordam?",
        u"Anyway, try not to get too bothered by it. Let\u2019s sit down and enjoy our snacks.": u"Enfim, tente n\u00e3o se incomodar tanto com isso. Vamos sentar e aproveitar nossos lanches.",
        u"Anyway, we should make the most of the daylight. Let me just gear up, and we\u2019ll start working.": u"Enfim, devemos aproveitar ao m\u00e1ximo a luz do dia. Vou s\u00f3 pegar meu equipamento e come\u00e7aremos a trabalhar.",
        u"Anyway, we should probably get our seats. Looks like everyone else is moving in too.": u"De qualquer forma, acho melhor ocuparmos nossos lugares. Parece que todo mundo tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 se acomodando.",
        u"Anyway, we still have to inform the others and bring them their suits.": u"Enfim, ainda precisamos avisar os outros e levar os ternos deles.",
        u"Anyway, we\u2019ll be heading to sleep too!": u"Enfim, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m vamos dormir!",
        u"Anyway, what brings you to the office, Yoshinori?": u"Enfim, o que o traz ao escrit\u00f3rio, Yoshinori?",
        u"Anyway, what do you have in your hand there?": u"Enfim, o que voc\u00ea tem a\u00ed na m\u00e3o?",
        u"Anyway, when I was trying to get my cards out, I stumbled on my old badge collection from Camp Buddy.": u"Enfim, quando fui pegar minhas cartas, encontrei por acaso minha antiga cole\u00e7\u00e3o de ins\u00edgnias do Camp Buddy.",
        u"Anyway, where\u2019s our ringbearer and flower girl? I haven\u2019t seen them yet!": u"Enfim, onde est\u00e3o nosso pajem e nossa dama das flores? Ainda n\u00e3o os vi!",
        u"Anyway, why don\u2019t we get back to work? Let\u2019s cook our meals for today while we\u2019re at it.": u"Enfim, por que n\u00e3o voltamos ao trabalho? Vamos preparar as refei\u00e7\u00f5es de hoje enquanto estamos aqui.",
        u"Anyway, why don\u2019t we go over to the shed and help Yuri with whatever she\u2019s doing?": u"Enfim, por que n\u00e3o vamos at\u00e9 o galp\u00e3o ajudar Yuri com o que quer que ela esteja fazendo?",
        u"Anyway, why don\u2019t you all leave this to me? I could use a workout after sitting all day.": u"Enfim, por que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o deixam isso comigo? Um pouco de exerc\u00edcio me faria bem depois de passar o dia sentado.",
        u"Anyway, would you mind telling me exactly what you\u2019re having difficulty with about your work?": u"Enfim, poderia me dizer exatamente qual dificuldade est\u00e1 enfrentando no trabalho?",
        u"Anyway, you all need to start your day, so it\u2019s best I be on my way.": u"Enfim, voc\u00eas precisam come\u00e7ar o dia, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor eu ir.",
        u"Anyway, you guys must be super busy with groundwork, huh Yoshi? I\u2019ve barely seen anyone all day long! ": u"Enfim, voc\u00eas devem estar superocupados com o trabalho l\u00e1 fora, hein, Yoshi? Quase n\u00e3o vi ningu\u00e9m o dia inteiro! ",
        u"Anyway, you\u2019re all patched up! ": u"Enfim, est\u00e1 todo remendado! ",
        u"Anyways! Those logs aren\u2019t gonna split themselves, Yoshi! I better see a fresh pile of wood chopped by sundown!": u"Enfim! Essas toras n\u00e3o v\u00e3o se partir sozinhas, Yoshi! \u00c9 melhor eu encontrar uma bela pilha de lenha cortada at\u00e9 o p\u00f4r do sol!",
        u"Anyways, Darius! You didn\u2019t really get much of a chance to talk a while ago! How are you, my good man~?": u"Enfim, Darius! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o teve muita chance de conversar antes! Como voc\u00ea est\u00e1, meu caro~?",
        u"Anyways, I got us both some snacks\u2026 Let\u2019s eat and forget about all that drama.": u"Enfim, peguei alguns lanches para n\u00f3s dois\u2026 Vamos comer e esquecer todo esse drama.",
        u"Anyways, I think all we need to do is take the trash out, then we\u2019re done here!": u"Enfim, acho que s\u00f3 precisamos levar o lixo para fora e teremos terminado aqui!",
        u"Anyways, I\u2019ll let Ms. Komarova know as soon as possible that you will be declining her offer.": u"Enfim, avisarei \u00e0 Srta. Komarova o quanto antes que voc\u00ea recusar\u00e1 a proposta.",
        u"Anyways, I\u2019ve been sitting for so long my butt cheeks are getting cramped.": u"Enfim, estou sentado h\u00e1 tanto tempo que minhas n\u00e1degas est\u00e3o come\u00e7ando a ficar dormentes.",
        u"Anyways, Yuri and Emilia left a while ago to take the scouts back home.": u"Enfim, Yuri e Emilia sa\u00edram h\u00e1 um tempo para levar os escoteiros de volta para casa.",
        u"Anyways, go ahead, give it a taste while it\u2019s still hot!": u"Enfim, v\u00e1 em frente, experimente enquanto ainda est\u00e1 quente!",
        u"Anyways, let\u2019s help Yoshi out before he gets pushed around all day!": u"Enfim, vamos ajudar Yoshi antes que ela passe o dia inteiro mandando nele!",
        u"Anyways, now that everything\u2019s done for today, why don\u2019t we head back and get some rest?": u"Enfim, agora que terminamos tudo por hoje, por que n\u00e3o voltamos para descansar um pouco?",
        u"Anyways, there\u2019s another thing that didn\u2019t change \u2013 this place smells as good as I remember!": u"Enfim, h\u00e1 outra coisa que n\u00e3o mudou: este lugar tem um cheiro t\u00e3o bom quanto eu me lembrava!",
        u"Anyways, we\u2019re pretty grimy\u2026 Why don\u2019t we head back to our cabin and get washed up?": u"Enfim, estamos bem imundos\u2026 Por que n\u00e3o voltamos para a cabana e tomamos um banho?",
        u"Anywayyyy since it\u2019s a party, let\u2019s play a game while we drink!": u"Enfiiiim, j\u00e1 que \u00e9 uma festa, vamos jogar alguma coisa enquanto bebemos!",
        u"Anyway~ What brings you here, Yoshi? Food\u2019s not ready for another hour or two!": u"Enfim~ O que traz voc\u00ea aqui, Yoshi? A comida s\u00f3 ficar\u00e1 pronta daqui a uma ou duas horas!",
        u"Apparently it\u2019s all part of the package Mr. Clermont got for us\u2026": u"Aparentemente, tudo faz parte do pacote que o Sr. Clermont comprou para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"Apparently you lost your clothes too?": u"Pelo visto tamb\u00e9m perderam as roupas?",
        u"Apparently, Goro already sent a reply this morning\u2026": u"Aparentemente, Goro j\u00e1 enviou uma resposta esta manh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"Apparently, it\u2019s always better to be gentle with any first time.": u"Ao que parece, \u00e9 sempre melhor ser gentil numa primeira vez.",
        u"Apparently, they forgot to buy you a GOOD PERSONALITY, too!": u"Pelo visto, eles s\u00f3 esqueceram de comprar uma PERSONALIDADE DECENTE para voc\u00ea!",
        u"Are Aiden and Yoshi alright\u2026? Should we go after them\u2026?": u"O Aiden e o Yoshi est\u00e3o bem\u2026? Ser\u00e1 que devemos ir atr\u00e1s deles\u2026?",
        u"Are you all okay here if I leave for now?": u"Voc\u00eas ficam bem aqui se eu sair por enquanto?",
        u"Are you alright in here by yourself? ": u"Voc\u00ea fica bem aqui sozinho? ",
        u"Are you alright in there? You didn\u2019t get hurt from that fall, did you?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem a\u00ed dentro? N\u00e3o se machucou naquela queda, machucou?",
        u"Are you alright, Yoshi? You seem uneasy.": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshi? Parece inquieto.",
        u"Are you alright, Yoshinori? You seem to be spacing out again.": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshinori? Parece estar distra\u00eddo de novo.",
        u"Are you alright, dear?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, querida?",
        u"Are you alright?!": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem?!",
        u"Are you alright\u2026? You\u2019ve been acting off for a while now. ": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026? J\u00e1 faz um tempo que est\u00e1 agindo estranho. ",
        u"Are you boys sure it\u2019s alright to spend the day working here, though? You aren\u2019t skipping your studies, are you?": u"Mas voc\u00eas t\u00eam certeza de que podem passar o dia trabalhando aqui? N\u00e3o est\u00e3o faltando aos estudos, est\u00e3o?",
        u"Are you challenging me again, kiddo?": u"Est\u00e1 me desafiando de novo, garoto?",
        u"Are you excited for the first day of your culinary career?": u"Est\u00e1 animado para o primeiro dia da sua carreira culin\u00e1ria?",
        u"Are you feeling unwell, Jin? ": u"Est\u00e1 se sentindo mal, Jin? ",
        u"Are you feelin\u2019 alright, Gramps...?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 se sentindo bem, Vov\u00f4\u2026?",
        u"Are you for real?!": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando s\u00e9rio?!",
        u"Are you guys sure?! This isn\u2019t your job, so you don\u2019t have to\u2026": u"Voc\u00eas t\u00eam certeza?! Esse n\u00e3o \u00e9 o trabalho de voc\u00eas, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o precisam\u2026",
        u"Are you happy now?! Are you satisfied that you\u2019ve finally found something that you can use to bring me down?!": u"Est\u00e1 feliz agora?! Est\u00e1 satisfeito por finalmente ter encontrado algo que pode usar para me derrubar?!",
        u"Are you having the same doubts you talked about a few days ago?": u"Est\u00e1 tendo as mesmas d\u00favidas sobre as quais falou alguns dias atr\u00e1s?",
        u"Are you jealous?": u"Est\u00e1 com ci\u00fames?",
        u"Are you just going to stand over there and pretend I didn\u2019t see you?": u"Vai ficar a\u00ed parado fingindo que eu n\u00e3o vi voc\u00ea?",
        u"Are you kidding? I can\u2019t believe you made this in less than an hour! I was up all night making mine, hahaha!": u"Est\u00e1 brincando? N\u00e3o acredito que fez isso em menos de uma hora! Passei a noite inteira preparando a minha, hahaha!",
        u"Are you okay\u2026?": u"O senhor est\u00e1 bem\u2026?",
        u"Are you referring to my son, Felix?": u"Est\u00e1 se referindo ao meu filho, Felix?",
        u"Are you saying we\u2019ll take over both Aiden and Yuri\u2019s tasks?": u"Est\u00e1 dizendo que assumiremos as tarefas de Aiden e Yuri?",
        u"Are you secretly bribing them with food like Sheriff Brokeback over here?": u"Est\u00e1 subornando eles escondido com comida, igual ao Xerife Brokeback aqui?",
        u"Are you serious? They\u2019ve been literally inseparable since we started the project, wasn\u2019t that enough of a sign for you?": u"Est\u00e1 falando s\u00e9rio? Eles est\u00e3o literalmente insepar\u00e1veis desde que come\u00e7amos o projeto, isso n\u00e3o era sinal suficiente para voc\u00ea?",
        u"Are you sure it\u2019s alright for you to share a bed with Darius?": u"Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema em dividir a cama com Darius?",
        u"Are you sure it\u2019s alright to go out there with just that on\u2026? I mean\u2026 Won\u2019t you get cold?": u"Tem certeza de que est\u00e1 tudo bem sair usando s\u00f3 isso\u2026? Quero dizer\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai sentir frio?",
        u"Are you sure that\u2019s alright with you two?": u"Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema para voc\u00eas dois?",
        u"Are you sure you don\u2019t want to come with us and tour the hotel some?": u"Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o quer vir conosco conhecer um pouco o hotel?",
        u"Are you sure you really don\u2019t want to come with us, Yuri? I can cook up another one for you, if you\u2019d like!": u"Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o quer vir conosco, Yuri? Posso preparar outra para voc\u00ea, se quiser!",
        u"Are you sure you want to push your muscles even further today?": u"Tem certeza de que quer for\u00e7ar ainda mais seus m\u00fasculos hoje?",
        u"Are you sure you\u2019re really alright with working with me? It must\u2019ve been awkward having that talk with Emilia.": u"Tem certeza de que quer trabalhar comigo? Deve ter sido estranho ter aquela conversa com Emilia.",
        u"Are you sure?": u"Tem certeza?",
        u"Are you sure? I\u2019m not much use in the kitchen\u2026 ": u"Tem certeza? N\u00e3o sou muito \u00fatil na cozinha\u2026 ",
        u"Are you sure? You\u2019re still hungover\u2026": u"Tem certeza? Voc\u00ea ainda est\u00e1 de ressaca\u2026",
        u"Are you sure\u2026? I swear I heard-": u"Tem certeza\u2026? Eu jurava ter ouvido\u2014",
        u"Are you suuuure? \u2019Cause Aiden\u2019s rolling on the bed half-naked~": u"Tem certeeeza? Porque o Aiden est\u00e1 rolando na cama quase pelado~",
        u"Are you talking about Aiden?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando de Aiden?",
        u"Are you two sure you\u2019ll be alright? You\u2019re free to come with us if you want, you know\u2026": u"Voc\u00eas dois t\u00eam certeza de que v\u00e3o ficar bem? Podem vir conosco se quiserem, sabem\u2026",
        u"Are you worried about Mr. Clermont\u2019s offer?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 preocupado com a oferta do Sr. Clermont?",
        u"Are you worried about all the assignments you\u2019ve been given?": u"Est\u00e1 preocupado com todas as tarefas que recebeu?",
        u"Are you worried it'd be difficult to adjust and learn the new skills? Or is it about the environment, like back at the hotel?": u"Est\u00e1 preocupado que seja dif\u00edcil se adaptar e aprender novas habilidades? Ou \u00e9 por causa do ambiente, como aconteceu no hotel?",
        u"Aren\u2019t we already?": u"J\u00e1 n\u00e3o somos?",
        u"Aren\u2019t we missing someone\u2026? I haven\u2019t seen Ms. Yuri around.": u"N\u00e3o est\u00e1 faltando algu\u00e9m\u2026? Ainda n\u00e3o vi a Srta. Yuri por aqui.",
        u"Aren\u2019t you being too harsh?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 sendo rigoroso demais?",
        u"Aren\u2019t you coming in\u2026?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai entrar\u2026?",
        u"Aren\u2019t you coming, Sir Goro?": u"O senhor n\u00e3o vem, senhor Goro?",
        u"Aren\u2019t you forgetting something?": u"N\u00e3o est\u00e1 esquecendo alguma coisa?",
        u"Aren\u2019t you gonna lie down? You must be pretty tired too!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai se deitar? Tamb\u00e9m deve estar bem cansado!",
        u"Aren\u2019t you one? You just cracked mine a while ago, hahaha!": u"E voc\u00ea n\u00e3o \u00e9 um? Acabou de quebrar as minhas nozes h\u00e1 pouco, hahaha!",
        u"Aren\u2019t you the one who always brags about your family background when it has nothing to do with your skills whatsoever?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o \u00e9 quem vive se gabando da sua fam\u00edlia quando isso n\u00e3o tem absolutamente nada a ver com suas habilidades?",
        u"Argue? I was trying to help. You\u2019re all twisting the narrative on me.": u"Discuss\u00e3o? Eu estava tentando ajudar. Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o distorcendo tudo contra mim.",
        u"Around 160 centimeters, yeah. Shoes included. ": u"Cerca de 1,60 metro, sim. Incluindo os sapatos. ",
        u"As Camp Buddy\u2019s leader, I should be able to do my job with patience and kindness. Not with strictness and heartless professionalism.": u"Como l\u00edder do Camp Buddy, devo conseguir fazer meu trabalho com paci\u00eancia e gentileza. N\u00e3o com rigidez e profissionalismo sem cora\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"As a food connoisseur, I actually have quite a few connections with the best chefs and their masterclasses from around the world, if you\u2019re interested~": u"Como apreciador de gastronomia, tenho v\u00e1rios contatos com alguns dos melhores chefs e suas masterclasses pelo mundo, caso tenha interesse~",
        u"As a leader, I learned to handle people from all walks of life, resolve complex conflicts, and live in a culture where mutual respect was paramount.": u"Como l\u00edder, aprendi a lidar com pessoas de todos os tipos, resolver conflitos complexos e viver numa cultura em que o respeito m\u00fatuo era fundamental.",
        u"As a matter of fact, I can send a team as early as tomorrow to give them ample time to settle in and familiarize with the site, if that\u2019s alright on your end.": u"Na verdade, posso enviar uma equipe j\u00e1 amanh\u00e3, para que tenham bastante tempo para se instalar e conhecer o local, se estiver tudo bem para voc\u00eas.",
        u"As a parent myself, I couldn\u2019t understand that at all. ": u"Como pai, eu n\u00e3o conseguia entender aquilo de jeito nenhum. ",
        u"As awful as everything Emilia said about me back there was\u2026 She was right.": u"Por mais horr\u00edvel que tenha sido tudo o que a Emilia disse sobre mim\u2026 Ela tinha raz\u00e3o.",
        u"As complicated as it is, perhaps it needed to happen for us to understand her actions.": u"Por mais complicado que seja, talvez isso precisasse acontecer para entendermos as atitudes dela.",
        u"As difficult as our life was, the struggles felt worth it\u2026": u"Por mais dif\u00edcil que nossa vida fosse, todo aquele esfor\u00e7o parecia valer a pena\u2026",
        u"As embarrassing as it was, I guess, yeah\u2026 Hahaha.": u"Por mais constrangedor que tenha sido, acho que sim\u2026 Hahaha.",
        u"As expected\u2026 this place is just as amazing. It\u2019s got that same picturesque view as our room.": u"Como esperado\u2026 este lugar \u00e9 igualmente incr\u00edvel. Tem a mesma vista digna de cart\u00e3o-postal do nosso quarto.",
        u"As for Ms. Komarova, I believe we\u2019ve all agreed to focus on her recovery before we address her situation with Mr. Clermont.": u"Quanto \u00e0 Srta. Komarova, acredito que todos concordamos em focar na recupera\u00e7\u00e3o dela antes de tratar da situa\u00e7\u00e3o com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"As for Yuri and I, we\u2019ll keep handling all the required paperwork and coordination with Mr. Clermont. ": u"Quanto a mim e Yuri, continuaremos cuidando de toda a papelada necess\u00e1ria e da coordena\u00e7\u00e3o com o Sr. Clermont. ",
        u"As for me, I\u2019m going to stick with the helper role. ": u"Quanto a mim, vou continuar na fun\u00e7\u00e3o de ajudante. ",
        u"As for the appetizers\u2014": u"Quanto \u00e0s entradas\u2014",
        u"As for the financial part, we have a plan for it as well! ": u"Quanto \u00e0 parte financeira, tamb\u00e9m temos um plano! ",
        u"As for the rest of you! Go back to your cabins! There\u2019s nothing to see here!": u"E quanto ao resto de voc\u00eas! Voltem para suas cabanas! N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para ver aqui!",
        u"As for you, Yoshinori. I will leave you in charge of overseeing the schedule we have planned for this week while I take care of the remaining paperwork.": u"Quanto a voc\u00ea, Yoshinori, ficar\u00e1 encarregado de supervisionar o cronograma planejado para esta semana enquanto cuido da documenta\u00e7\u00e3o restante.",
        u"As frustrating as it is that we were tricked, I think we should let Yoshinori talk to her.": u"Por mais frustrante que seja termos sido enganados, acho que devemos deixar Yoshinori conversar com ela.",
        u"As happy as I am to have my little chef again, you can leave the kitchen work to me and spend fun time with everyone else!": u"Por mais feliz que eu esteja de ter meu pequeno chef de volta, pode deixar a cozinha comigo e aproveitar o tempo com o resto do pessoal!",
        u"As if, Gramps~ It was definitely me~": u"At\u00e9 parece, Vov\u00f4~ Com certeza fui eu~",
        u"As long as Sir Goro wants to, I don\u2019t mind.": u"Desde que o Sr. Goro queira, eu n\u00e3o me importo.",
        u"As long as there\u2019s no actual pain involved.": u"Contanto que n\u00e3o envolva dor de verdade.",
        u"As long as you\u2019re enjoying this vacation, then that\u2019s what matters.": u"Desde que esteja aproveitando estas f\u00e9rias, \u00e9 isso que importa.",
        u"As long as you\u2019re happy, whatever your decision, it\u2019ll always be the right choice.": u"Desde que voc\u00ea esteja feliz, qualquer que seja sua decis\u00e3o, ela sempre ser\u00e1 a escolha certa.",
        u"As much as Dad tried to hide it from me, I knew we were in a lot of debt.": u"Por mais que meu pai tentasse esconder de mim, eu sabia que est\u00e1vamos muito endividados.",
        u"As much as I\u2019d like that\u2026 I don\u2019t know how\u2026": u"Por mais que eu quisesse\u2026 N\u00e3o sei como\u2026",
        u"As much as I\u2019m your superior, I want us to lead Camp Buddy side by side, just like we did back then\u2026": u"Embora eu seja o seu superior, quero que lideremos o Camp Buddy lado a lado, assim como fizemos naquela \u00e9poca\u2026",
        u"As much as the work was physically exhausting, he kept smiling through everything, and it really encouraged me to keep doing my best.": u"Por mais fisicamente exaustivo que fosse o trabalho, ele continuava sorrindo, e isso me incentivava a dar o meu melhor.",
        u"As much as we wish we could\u2019ve been there for him, we were all on our own separate paths after the first term.": u"Por mais que desej\u00e1ssemos ter estado ao lado dele, todos seguimos caminhos diferentes depois da primeira temporada.",
        u"As silly as it sounds, this makes me feel like I\u2019m back in those younger days again.": u"Por mais bobo que pare\u00e7a, isso me faz sentir como se estivesse de volta \u00e0queles tempos de juventude.",
        u"As someone who\u2019s eaten in restaurants around the world, I can say your cooking is still one of the best I\u2019ve ever had! ": u"Como algu\u00e9m que j\u00e1 comeu em restaurantes pelo mundo todo, posso dizer que sua comida continua sendo uma das melhores que j\u00e1 provei! ",
        u"As soon as I arrived, I could tell she was trying to corner you.": u"Assim que cheguei, percebi que ela estava tentando encurralar voc\u00ea.",
        u"As soon as I heard I\u2019d be separated from you again, it just wasn\u2019t worth it anymore.": u"Assim que soube que ficaria separado de voc\u00ea novamente, simplesmente deixou de valer a pena.",
        u"As soon as I stood up, they looked directly at my crotch and started asking for something else.": u"Assim que me levantei, olharam diretamente para minha virilha e come\u00e7aram a pedir outra coisa.",
        u"As soon as we left Camp Buddy, Dad and I had to fend for ourselves again, and he kept trying to push himself to work despite being sick...": u"Assim que sa\u00edmos do Camp Buddy, meu pai e eu tivemos que voltar a nos virar sozinhos, e ele continuou se for\u00e7ando a trabalhar apesar de estar doente\u2026",
        u"As strange as it sounds, it\u2019s actually quite normal around here\u2026": u"Por mais estranho que pare\u00e7a, isso \u00e9 bastante normal por aqui\u2026",
        u"As the camp president, you would unintentionally leave out flaws that an inspector should know about. Not that anything\u2019s wrong with that \u2013 I\u2019m sure you understand.": u"Como presidente do acampamento, o senhor poderia omitir sem querer falhas que uma inspetora deveria conhecer. N\u00e3o que haja algo errado nisso \u2014 tenho certeza de que entende.",
        u"As the family\u2019s breadwinner, I was often away from home, leaving Yuri to spend time with her mother.": u"Como eu sustentava a fam\u00edlia, passava muito tempo fora de casa, deixando Yuri com a m\u00e3e.",
        u"As the figurehead, I should\u2019ve served as a guiding example by handling everything with patience and compassion.": u"Como l\u00edder, eu deveria ter servido de exemplo, lidando com tudo com paci\u00eancia e compaix\u00e3o.",
        u"As the only girl here\u2026 Do I have to, uhh\u2026 bunk with\u2026 her?": u"Como a \u00fanica garota aqui\u2026 Eu tenho que, ahn\u2026 dividir o quarto com\u2026 ela?",
        u"As the standing representative for quality assurance, I wanted to discuss some specific departmental concerns that need to be corrected.  ": u"Como representante respons\u00e1vel pela garantia de qualidade, gostaria de discutir algumas quest\u00f5es espec\u00edficas dos departamentos que precisam ser corrigidas.  ",
        u"As unfortunate as this news is, I must commend you for your honesty, Ms. Komarova. ": u"Por mais lament\u00e1vel que seja esta not\u00edcia, devo elogi\u00e1-la por sua honestidade, Srta. Komarova. ",
        u"As usual.": u"Como sempre.",
        u"As we had expected, there were times when Emilia would criticize the way Sir Goro had been running things, making her grow more and more frustrated. ": u"Como esper\u00e1vamos, houve momentos em que Emilia criticava a maneira como o Sr. Goro administrava as coisas, ficando cada vez mais frustrada. ",
        u"As well you should! I can\u2019t believe you\u2014": u"E \u00e9 bom mesmo! N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea\u2014",
        u"As you can see, the construction department has nearly entirely cleared the site despite some minor delays. I\u2019ve been told by our architect that we can proceed with earthworks very soon.": u"Como pode ver, apesar de alguns pequenos atrasos, o setor de constru\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 limpou quase todo o terreno. Nosso arquiteto disse que poderemos iniciar a terraplenagem muito em breve.",
        u"As you may have noticed from our meeting earlier, the issues I pointed out were all due to subpar leadership.": u"Como deve ter notado na reuni\u00e3o, todos os problemas que apontei decorreram de uma lideran\u00e7a abaixo do esperado.",
        u"As you may have noticed from our meeting earlier, your fellow scoutmasters aren\u2019t as \u2018mature\u2019 when it comes to their shortcomings in managing their departments.": u"Como deve ter notado na reuni\u00e3o, seus colegas chefes escoteiros n\u00e3o s\u00e3o t\u00e3o \u2018maduros\u2019 ao lidar com as pr\u00f3prias falhas na administra\u00e7\u00e3o dos setores.",
        u"As you should.": u"\u00c9 o m\u00ednimo que devem fazer.",
        u"As your scoutmaster, I feel bad I didn\u2019t know about all this\u2026": u"Como seu chefe escoteiro, sinto muito por n\u00e3o ter sabido de tudo isso\u2026",
        u"As you\u2019ve noted many times, the deadline is tight, and motivation is a key factor to ensuring completion.": u"Como voc\u00ea mesma destacou v\u00e1rias vezes, o prazo \u00e9 apertado, e a motiva\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 um fator essencial para garantir a conclus\u00e3o.",
        u"Ask about today's tasks.": u"Perguntar sobre as tarefas de hoje.",
        u"Ask the chef directly. Good idea.": u"Perguntar direto ao chef. Boa ideia.",
        u"Assist with meal prep.": u"Ajudar a preparar a refei\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"At Camp Buddy we let it slide, but not here in the city! What if someone had recorded you?": u"No Acampamento Buddy deixamos passar, mas aqui na cidade n\u00e3o! E se algu\u00e9m tivesse gravado voc\u00ea?",
        u"At first I was baffled too, but hearing just how big of an undertaking it was\u2026 It might be too much for a small group of people like us\u2026": u"No come\u00e7o eu tamb\u00e9m fiquei perplexo, mas ouvindo o tamanho desse empreendimento\u2026 Talvez seja demais para um grupo pequeno como o nosso\u2026",
        u"At first, I thought she was trying to be as professional as she could, or even genuinely wanted to help the camp.": u"No come\u00e7o, achei que ela estivesse tentando ser o mais profissional poss\u00edvel ou at\u00e9 que realmente quisesse ajudar o acampamento.",
        u"At first, I was impressed and happy that everything seemed to have worked out well\u2026 I actually came here to congratulate you personally.": u"A princ\u00edpio, fiquei impressionado e feliz por tudo parecer ter dado certo\u2026 Na verdade, vim pessoalmente para parabeniz\u00e1-los.",
        u"At least he\u2019s wearing underwear\u2026": u"Pelo menos ele est\u00e1 de cueca\u2026",
        u"At least let me make up for it\u2026!": u"Pelo menos deixe eu compensar\u2026!",
        u"At least you chose something that matches me. ": u"Pelo menos escolheu algo que combina comigo. ",
        u"At least, post-Emilia filler arc\u2026": u"Pelo menos, arco filler p\u00f3s-Emilia\u2026",
        u"At some point, I felt bad that I wasn\u2019t contributing anything to the discussion.": u"Em certo momento, senti-me mal por n\u00e3o contribuir em nada com a discuss\u00e3o.",
        u"At the end of the day, it doesn\u2019t matter. Some of us may have different schedules and routines, but we all adjusted to each other and finished the work according to all the deadlines.": u"No fim das contas, isso n\u00e3o importa. Alguns t\u00eam hor\u00e1rios e rotinas diferentes, mas todos nos adaptamos e conclu\u00edmos o trabalho dentro dos prazos.",
        u"At this point, I think we\u2019ll die of hypothermia before we finish all of this. ": u"A essa altura, acho que vamos morrer de hipotermia antes de terminar tudo isso. ",
        u"At this point, it must be her hobby\u2026": u"A essa altura, isso deve ser o hobby dela\u2026",
        u"At this rate, I don\u2019t think the city would be able to help us anytime soon. ": u"Desse jeito, acho que a prefeitura n\u00e3o conseguir\u00e1 nos ajudar t\u00e3o cedo. ",
        u"Attention! Straighten your back! ": u"Aten\u00e7\u00e3o! Endireite as costas! ",
        u"Attention, scouts! We\u2019ll be taking a short break! ": u"Aten\u00e7\u00e3o, escoteiros! Faremos uma breve pausa! ",
        u"Attitude problem?! Why I\u2014": u"Problema de atitude?! Ora, sua\u2014",
        u"Avoid knots and twisted grains \u2013 instead aim your blow near the edge of the round but not at the very center.": u"Evite n\u00f3s e fibras torcidas \u2014 em vez disso, mire o golpe perto da borda da tora, mas n\u00e3o exatamente no centro.",
        u"Aw, shucks, this is way too familiar for me, haha!": u"Ah, droga, isso \u00e9 familiar demais para mim, haha!",
        u"Awesome! I\u2019m glad I was able to help you some!": u"\u00d3timo! Fico feliz de ter conseguido ajudar!",
        u"Awesome! I\u2019m so hungry from all that work today! I can\u2019t wait!": u"Demais! Estou morrendo de fome depois de todo aquele trabalho hoje! Mal posso esperar!",
        u"Awesome! We got the job, Dar!": u"Incr\u00edvel! Conseguimos o emprego, Dar!",
        u"Awesooome! Didn\u2019t know you still had it in you, Gramps! Hahaha!": u"Incr\u00ed\u00ed\u00edvel! N\u00e3o sabia que o senhor ainda dava conta, vov\u00f4! Hahaha!",
        u"Aww thanks~ The secret ingredient is \u2018love.\u2019": u"Aww, obrigado~ O ingrediente secreto \u00e9 \u2018amor\u2019.",
        u"Aww that\u2019s really sweet, Goro\u2026! ": u"Aww, isso \u00e9 muito fofo, Goro\u2026! ",
        u"Aww that\u2019s really sweet, Yoshi! You\u2019re special to me tooooo~": u"Aww, isso \u00e9 muito fofo, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 muito especial para miiiiim~",
        u"Aww, Dad! Why did you have to pull the family card now\u2026?": u"Awn, pai! Por que precisava usar a carta da fam\u00edlia justo agora\u2026?",
        u"Aww, Dad\u2026": u"Aww, pai\u2026",
        u"Aww, Gramps! I\u2019m sure Yoichi already trusts and respects you \u2013 like I said, you\u2019re basically as much his grandpa as Yoshi is his dad!": u"Aww, Vov\u00f4! Tenho certeza de que o Yoichi j\u00e1 confia e respeita voc\u00ea \u2014 como eu disse, voc\u00ea \u00e9 praticamente o av\u00f4 dele, assim como o Yoshi \u00e9 o pai!",
        u"Aww, Gramps\u2026": u"Aww, vov\u00f4\u2026",
        u"Aww, Gramps\u2026 It\u2019s always so nice to hear a compliment from you.": u"Awn, Vov\u00f4\u2026 \u00c9 sempre t\u00e3o bom ouvir um elogio seu.",
        u"Aww, I think you embarrassed him, Lloyd, hehe\u2026": u"Aww, acho que voc\u00ea deixou ele sem gra\u00e7a, Lloyd, hehe\u2026",
        u"Aww, I wish I got to see their reactions! ": u"Aww, queria ter visto a rea\u00e7\u00e3o deles! ",
        u"Aww, I\u2019m a little bummed they aren\u2019t coming with us, though. ": u"Awn, mas fico um pouco triste por eles n\u00e3o virem conosco. ",
        u"Aww, Jin! Don\u2019t worry, there\u2019s still a few months of the project left to get some action~": u"Aww, Jin! N\u00e3o se preocupe, ainda faltam alguns meses de projeto para voc\u00ea conseguir alguma a\u00e7\u00e3o~",
        u"Aww, Jin! It\u2019s alright, I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll find someone!": u"Aww, Jin! Tudo bem, tenho certeza de que voc\u00ea vai encontrar algu\u00e9m!",
        u"Aww, Jin! You know you\u2019re supposed to wait a while to adjust before pulling out.": u"Aww, Jin! Voc\u00ea sabe que deve esperar um pouco para se acostumar antes de sair.",
        u"Aww, Jin~ We\u2019re your friends too! We don\u2019t mind you telling us about your hobbies!": u"Aww, Jin~ N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m somos seus amigos! N\u00e3o nos importamos que voc\u00ea conte sobre seus hobbies!",
        u"Aww, Scoutmaster Yoshi! That\u2019s really flattering!": u"Aww, chefe escoteiro Yoshi! Assim eu fico at\u00e9 sem gra\u00e7a!",
        u"Aww, Yoshi~": u"Awn, Yoshi~",
        u"Aww, Yoshi~ It\u2019s alright, you know I can handle myself, no problem.": u"Aww, Yoshi~ Tudo bem, voc\u00ea sabe que consigo cuidar de mim mesmo sem problema.",
        u"Aww, and I\u2019m the first one you thought of? That\u2019s really sweet, Yoshi~!": u"Aww, e eu fui a primeira pessoa em quem voc\u00ea pensou? Que fofo, Yoshi~!",
        u"Aww, and right when it was getting fun~": u"Aww, justo quando estava ficando divertido~",
        u"Aww, are you still feeling nervous, Jin?": u"Aww, ainda est\u00e1 nervoso, Jin?",
        u"Aww, but you and Yoshi looked so youthful with your skinny, twinky bodies! Not that I have complaints about your muscles now~": u"Awn, mas voc\u00ea e o Yoshi pareciam t\u00e3o jovenzinhos com aqueles corpos magros e delicados! N\u00e3o que eu tenha alguma reclama\u00e7\u00e3o dos m\u00fasculos de voc\u00eas agora~",
        u"Aww, come on guys! A little bit of pain can lead to a lot of pleasure, you know~": u"Awn, qual \u00e9, pessoal! Um pouco de dor pode levar a muito prazer, sabiam~",
        u"Aww, come on guys! Don\u2019t you think Aiden would look good tied up~?": u"Awn, qual \u00e9, pessoal! N\u00e3o acham que Aiden ficaria lindo amarrado~?",
        u"Aww, come on! It sounds fun! ": u"Aww, qual \u00e9! Parece divertido! ",
        u"Aww, come on, Aiden! I have some theories I wanted to test on you!": u"Aww, qual \u00e9, Aiden! Eu tinha algumas teorias que queria testar em voc\u00ea!",
        u"Aww, come on, Gramps, live a little! What\u2019s life if you don\u2019t break the rules every once in a while?": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Vov\u00f4, aproveite um pouco a vida! Que gra\u00e7a teria se n\u00e3o quebr\u00e1ssemos as regras de vez em quando?",
        u"Aww, come on, Yoshi, relax! She\u2019s already in bed! ": u"Aww, qual \u00e9, Yoshi, relaxe! Ela j\u00e1 foi dormir! ",
        u"Aww, dammit! You beat me to it, Gramps!": u"Aww, droga! Voc\u00ea foi mais r\u00e1pido, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"Aww, do I have to?": u"Aww, eu tenho mesmo que fazer isso?",
        u"Aww, if you\u2019re around, please call us! I\u2019d love to hear stories about your retirement!": u"Aww, se estiver por perto, ligue para n\u00f3s! Eu adoraria ouvir hist\u00f3rias sobre sua aposentadoria!",
        u"Aww, isn\u2019t that cute? You sound just like my dad right now, Yoshi~!": u"Awn, n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma gra\u00e7a? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando igualzinho ao meu pai agora, Yoshi~!",
        u"Aww, look at that~! It kinda looks like a dad sending his son off to prom~": u"Aww, olha s\u00f3~! Parece um pai mandando o filho para o baile de formatura~",
        u"Aww, poor Jin\u2026": u"Awn, pobre Jin\u2026",
        u"Aww, really? Where did I go wrong\u2026? I followed the recipe exactly.": u"Ah, s\u00e9rio? Onde foi que errei\u2026? Segui a receita exatamente.",
        u"Aww, shucks\u2026 I forgot we don\u2019t have the workers\u2026 They won\u2019t be coming back for a few more days\u2026": u"Ah, droga\u2026 Esqueci que estamos sem os trabalhadores\u2026 Eles s\u00f3 voltam daqui a alguns dias\u2026",
        u"Aww, thank you sweetie~ You boys have been a big help today too!": u"Aww, obrigada, querido~ Voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m ajudaram muito hoje!",
        u"Aww, thanks Mr. Clermont\u2026 I\u2019m flattered! But are you sure you\u2019re not just hungry?": u"Aww, obrigado, Sr. Clermont\u2026 Fico lisonjeado! Mas tem certeza de que n\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 fome?",
        u"Aww, that\u2019s really sweet, Darius!": u"Aww, isso \u00e9 muito fofo, Darius!",
        u"Aww, that\u2019s so sweet, Aiden! This is why you\u2019re my best friend!": u"Awn, que gentil, Aiden! \u00c9 por isso que voc\u00ea \u00e9 meu melhor amigo!",
        u"Aww, you really do miss them a lot, don't you?": u"Awn, voc\u00ea realmente sente muita falta deles, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Aww, you\u2019re gonna make me tear up, Yoshi\u2026": u"Aww, voc\u00ea vai me fazer chorar, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Awww, look how much my little chef has grown!": u"Awww, olha s\u00f3 como meu pequeno chef cresceu!",
        u"Awww, now I can\u2019t wait to hear them! I hope it\u2019s soon\u2026": u"Awww, agora mal posso esperar para ouvi-las! Espero que seja logo\u2026",
        u"Awww, would you look at these lovebirds~ Can\u2019t even wait for the altar!": u"Awww, olhem s\u00f3 esses pombinhos~ Nem conseguem esperar at\u00e9 o altar!",
        u"Awwww, Jin! You\u2019re such a softboi! We must protect you at all costs!!!": u"Awwww, Jin! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 um amorzinho! Precisamos proteg\u00ea-lo a qualquer custo!!!",
        u"Awwwww~ I\u2019m so jelly, I wanna get married toooooo~": u"Awwwww~ Estou morrendo de inveja, eu tamb\u00e9m quero me casaaaaaar~",
        u"Awwwww~!!! Look at you, Lloyd! You\u2019re like a fun-sized toy! Darius can play with you all night, hihi~   ": u"Awwwww~!!! Olha s\u00f3 voc\u00ea, Lloyd! Parece um brinquedinho em tamanho divertido! Darius pode brincar com voc\u00ea a noite toda, hihi~   ",
        u"Awwwww\u2026 There goes my artist AND subject.": u"Awwwww\u2026 L\u00e1 se v\u00e3o meu artista E meu modelo.",
        u"Awwww~ You made Dad cry, Yoshi!": u"Awwww~ Voc\u00ea fez o pai chorar, Yoshi!",
        u"Awww\u2026 But I\u2019m still groggy, Grampssss\u2026 Can we stay here a little longer?": u"Awww\u2026 Mas ainda estou grogue, Vov\u00f4\u00f4\u00f4\u2026 Podemos ficar aqui mais um pouco?",
        u"Aww~ Everyone\u2019s looking out for each other, just like the good ol\u2019 days~": u"Awn~ Todos cuidando uns dos outros, como nos bons e velhos tempos~",
        u"Aww~ He\u2019s not used to being praised this much, hahaha!": u"Aww~ Ele n\u00e3o est\u00e1 acostumado a receber tantos elogios, hahaha!",
        u"Aww~ I appreciate it, Yoichi.": u"Aww~ Eu agrade\u00e7o, Yoichi.",
        u"Aww~ I missed being called \u2018little chef\u2019!": u"Aww~ Senti falta de ser chamado de \u2018pequeno chef\u2019!",
        u"Aww~ Thanks, you guys! ": u"Aww~ Obrigada, pessoal! ",
        u"Aww~ You two are sounding like a proud dad and grand-dad~!": u"Aww~ Voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o parecendo um pai e um av\u00f4 orgulhosos~!",
        u"Aww~ look at you guys, missing your friends! That\u2019s really cute! Have you been keeping in touch at least?": u"Awn~ Olhem s\u00f3 para voc\u00eas, sentindo falta dos amigos! Isso \u00e9 t\u00e3o fofo! Pelo menos t\u00eam mantido contato?",
        u"Aww\u2026 But I wanted to sleep mooore\u2026": u"Aww\u2026 Mas eu queria dormir maaaais\u2026",
        u"Aww\u2026 I hate to leave\u2026 I\u2019m gonna miss you guys so much!!!": u"Aww\u2026 Odeio ter que ir embora\u2026 Vou sentir tanta falta de voc\u00eas!!!",
        u"Aww\u2026 I wanna join in the fun too.": u"Aww\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m quero participar da divers\u00e3o.",
        u"Aww\u2026 I wanted to work out some more.": u"Aww\u2026 Eu queria treinar mais um pouco.",
        u"Aww\u2026 I will miss having you around, sir\u2026 Do you really have to leave us?": u"Aww\u2026 Vou sentir falta de ter o senhor por perto\u2026 Precisa mesmo nos deixar?",
        u"Aww\u2026 It\u2019s so sweet everyone threw you a party, Sir Goro!": u"Aww\u2026 \u00c9 t\u00e3o fofo que todo mundo tenha feito uma festa para o senhor, Sr. Goro!",
        u"Aww\u2026 Look at the scouts! They\u2019re really enjoying themselves!": u"Aww\u2026 Olhem os escoteiros! Eles est\u00e3o se divertindo de verdade!",
        u"Aww\u2026 Maybe on a different route.": u"Aww\u2026 Talvez em outra rota.",
        u"Aww\u2026 Now if that isn\u2019t the sweetest thing I\u2019ve ever heard, I don\u2019t know what is!": u"Awn\u2026 Se isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 a coisa mais doce que j\u00e1 ouvi, n\u00e3o sei o que seria!",
        u"Aww\u2026 That\u2019s a bummer.": u"Awn\u2026 Que pena.",
        u"Aww\u2026 The first batch is totally wasted.": u"Aww\u2026 A primeira fornada foi totalmente desperdi\u00e7ada.",
        u"Aww\u2026 Well, I\u2019m really glad you like my cooking, Yoshi! ": u"Awn\u2026 Bem, fico muito feliz que goste da minha comida, Yoshi! ",
        u"Aye, aye! Captain!": u"Sim, sim, capit\u00e3o!",
        u"B-Background?!": u"P-Personagens secund\u00e1rios?!",
        u"B-Beach\u2026 W-White foam\u2026": u"P-Praia\u2026 E-Espuma branca\u2026",
        u"B-Besides, my stomach is still recovering from the bus ride this morning.": u"A-Al\u00e9m disso, meu est\u00f4mago ainda est\u00e1 se recuperando da viagem de \u00f4nibus desta manh\u00e3.",
        u"B-Best for me?!": u"M-Melhor para mim?!",
        u"B-But I\u2019m not giving up\u2026!": u"M-Mas eu n\u00e3o estou desistindo\u2026!",
        u"B-But it seems like you\u2019re just losing on purpose\u2026": u"M-Mas parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 perdendo de prop\u00f3sito\u2026",
        u"B-But like I said, I\u2019m totally alright now! Yoshi really helped me calm down last night!": u"M-Mas, como eu disse, agora estou totalmente bem! O Yoshi realmente me ajudou a me acalmar ontem \u00e0 noite!",
        u"B-But not in the same bed, sir\u2026!": u"M-Mas n\u00e3o na mesma cama, senhor\u2026!",
        u"B-But still\u2026": u"M-Mas mesmo assim\u2026",
        u"B-But the answer is no\u2026 I haven\u2019t.": u"M-Mas a resposta \u00e9 n\u00e3o\u2026 Nunca fiquei.",
        u"B-But the roads can get icy too\u2026!": u"M-Mas as estradas tamb\u00e9m podem ficar congeladas\u2026!",
        u"B-But we\u2019ve been doing it every night and morning\u2026": u"M-Mas temos feito isso toda noite e toda manh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"B-But we\u2019ve been exercising for a while now, Aiden\u2026 I\u2019m all sweaty\u2026": u"M-Mas j\u00e1 estamos nos exercitando h\u00e1 um tempo, Aiden\u2026 Eu t\u00f4 todo suado\u2026",
        u"B-But what about Sir Goro?": u"M-Mas e o Sr. Goro?",
        u"B-But, Dad!!": u"M-Mas, pai!!",
        u"B-But, sir\u2026": u"M-Mas, senhor\u2026",
        u"B-But-": u"M-Mas\u2014",
        u"B-But\u2026": u"M-Mas\u2026",
        u"B-But\u2026 I don\u2019t understand\u2026 This is what we\u2019ve all been working for.": u"M-Mas\u2026 eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 Foi por isso que todos n\u00f3s estivemos trabalhando.",
        u"B-But\u2026 Wh-Why? Don\u2019t you guys all have great career opportunities ahead of you?": u"M-Mas\u2026 P-Por qu\u00ea? Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o t\u00eam \u00f3timas oportunidades de carreira pela frente?",
        u"BLECH!": u"ECA!",
        u"BLECH! WOULD EVERYONE STOP SAYING THAT?!": u"BLECH! SER\u00c1 QUE TODO MUNDO PODE PARAR DE DIZER ISSO?!",
        u"BUTTCHEEKS! Do you have any food for us? I\u2019m starving!": u"BUND\u00c3O! Tem comida para a gente? Estou morrendo de fome!",
        u"Back at the firm everyone is so stiff and formal \u2013 I\u2019d love to be around people who can have a good time more often!": u"L\u00e1 na empresa todos s\u00e3o t\u00e3o r\u00edgidos e formais \u2014 eu adoraria conviver mais com pessoas que sabem se divertir!",
        u"Back of the queue? The bathroom\u2019s big enough for all of us.": u"Fim da fila? O banheiro \u00e9 grande o bastante para todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"Back off \u2013 It\u2019s about time I show you how it\u2019s really done!": u"Afaste-se \u2013 j\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de eu mostrar como se faz de verdade!",
        u"Back then, I wouldn\u2019t even dare to look at this myself, let alone show it to someone else.": u"Naquela \u00e9poca, eu nem ousaria olhar para isso sozinho, muito menos mostrar a outra pessoa.",
        u"Back to our workout!": u"De volta ao treino!",
        u"Back when I was a scout, I only got to come here to bring him his coffee\u2026": u"Quando eu era escoteiro, s\u00f3 vinha aqui para trazer o caf\u00e9 dele\u2026",
        u"Back when my wife and I separated\u2026 I thought I could handle it all myself, but I couldn\u2019t.": u"Quando eu e minha esposa nos separamos\u2026 achei que conseguiria lidar com tudo sozinho, mas n\u00e3o consegui.",
        u"Bad boy, Lloyd.": u"Garoto mau, Lloyd.",
        u"Bahaha! That\u2019s six marshmallows, no way you can handle more!": u"Bahaha! J\u00e1 s\u00e3o seis marshmallows, nem pensar que voc\u00ea aguenta mais!",
        u"Based on how the inspection went today, EVERYTHING is off from their initial targets.": u"Com base na inspe\u00e7\u00e3o de hoje, TUDO est\u00e1 fora das metas iniciais.",
        u"Based on the report Yuri gave me last night, it looks like they are a day behind on the site clearing.": u"Com base no relat\u00f3rio que Yuri me entregou ontem \u00e0 noite, parece que est\u00e3o um dia atrasados na limpeza do terreno.",
        u"Based on yesterday\u2019s meeting, I believe he\u2019s out today handling the permits at city hall. ": u"Com base na reuni\u00e3o de ontem, acredito que hoje ele esteja cuidando das licen\u00e7as na prefeitura. ",
        u"Be careful or Yuri and Jin might need to see a doctor.": u"Cuidado, ou Yuri e Jin podem acabar precisando de um m\u00e9dico.",
        u"Be careful, Aiden. It\u2019s\u2014": u"Tenha cuidado, Aiden. Est\u00e1\u2014",
        u"Be firm with your volitions, and you\u2019ll achieve your ideal happiness, or else it could lead to your ultimate regret!": u"Seja firme em suas vontades e alcan\u00e7ar\u00e1 sua felicidade ideal, caso contr\u00e1rio isso poder\u00e1 lev\u00e1-lo ao seu maior arrependimento!",
        u"Be quiet you! I\u2019m thinking...!": u"Fique quieta! Estou pensando\u2026!",
        u"Because I want you to know, that your happiness is all I\u2019ve ever wanted too.": u"Porque quero que saiba que a sua felicidade tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 tudo que eu sempre quis.",
        u"Because I\u2019m tired of you getting to just react over there! It\u2019s your turn!": u"Porque cansei de voc\u00ea ficar s\u00f3 reagindo a\u00ed! \u00c9 sua vez!",
        u"Because I\u2019ve seen firsthand how much Dad has gone through.": u"Porque vi de perto tudo pelo que o pai passou.",
        u"Because no matter how you look at it, I did something wrong. And neither of us can move forward if we don\u2019t come to an understanding.": u"Porque, n\u00e3o importa como se veja, eu fiz algo errado. E nenhum de n\u00f3s poder\u00e1 seguir em frente se n\u00e3o chegarmos a um entendimento.",
        u"Because of that, I can totally understand why you feel so frustrated when you\u2019re in that sort of situation.": u"Por isso, consigo entender perfeitamente por que voc\u00ea fica t\u00e3o frustrado quando est\u00e1 numa situa\u00e7\u00e3o dessas.",
        u"Because of that, I kept those feelings locked away... ": u"Por causa disso, mantive esses sentimentos trancados dentro de mim\u2026 ",
        u"Because quite frankly, you all looked like you could use some guidance.": u"Porque, francamente, todos voc\u00eas pareciam precisar de alguma orienta\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Becoming a scoutmaster there has always been my dream. And now that I've achieved that goal, it makes me look back at why I wanted it in the first place.": u"Tornar-me chefe escoteiro aqui sempre foi o meu sonho. E agora que alcancei esse objetivo, fico pensando no motivo pelo qual eu o desejava desde o in\u00edcio.",
        u"Before anything else, I believe we should at least introduce you to the team.": u"Antes de qualquer coisa, acredito que devemos ao menos apresent\u00e1-la \u00e0 equipe.",
        u"Before the workers arrived, there wasn\u2019t much to do, even when I helped you with the chores. ": u"Antes da chegada dos trabalhadores, n\u00e3o havia muito o que fazer, mesmo quando eu ajudava voc\u00ea nos afazeres. ",
        u"Before we get into business, we\u2019d like to invite you over for a lunch that we prepared. I know you all must be exhausted from the trip here.": u"Antes de tratarmos de neg\u00f3cios, gostar\u00edamos de convid\u00e1-los para o almo\u00e7o que preparamos. Sei que todos devem estar exaustos da viagem.",
        u"Beg for daddy\u2026": u"Implore para o papai\u2026",
        u"Being a father and a leader, I felt like I had to stay strong and not show any weakness.": u"Sendo pai e l\u00edder, sentia que precisava permanecer forte e n\u00e3o demonstrar nenhuma fraqueza.",
        u"Being a professional chef would be awesome, but I\u2019m where I\u2019m meant to be.": u"Ser chef profissional seria incr\u00edvel, mas estou onde deveria estar.",
        u"Being far away doesn\u2019t excuse the fact that I didn\u2019t put in the effort to try and reconnect\u2026": u"Estar longe n\u00e3o justifica o fato de eu n\u00e3o ter me esfor\u00e7ado para tentar restabelecer contato\u2026",
        u"Being in a place like this is kinda freaking me out, it\u2019s almost suffocating.": u"Estar num lugar assim est\u00e1 me deixando meio apavorado, chega a ser sufocante.",
        u"Being nice to me. After everything I did\u2026": u"Sendo gentil comigo. Depois de tudo o que fiz\u2026",
        u"Being partners was never meant for us\u2026": u"Nunca fomos feitos para ser parceiros\u2026",
        u"Being reunited with you was something I was waiting for all along, yet I didn\u2019t know where or how I\u2019d begin to reconnect\u2026": u"Reencontrar voc\u00ea era algo que eu esperava havia tanto tempo, mas eu n\u00e3o sabia onde nem como come\u00e7ar a me reaproximar\u2026",
        u"Believe it or not, I used to wear it underneath my everyday clothes\u2026": u"Acredite ou n\u00e3o, eu costumava usar isso por baixo das roupas do dia a dia\u2026",
        u"Believe it or not, I\u2019m excited to get back to work too! I\u2019ll be sure to cook up something nice as soon as we arrive! ": u"Acredite ou n\u00e3o, tamb\u00e9m estou animado para voltar ao trabalho! Vou preparar alguma coisa gostosa assim que chegarmos! ",
        u"Believe it or not, I\u2019m excited to get back to work! Fancy living is nice, but ehh... I don\u2019t think it\u2019s for me.": u"Acreditem ou n\u00e3o, estou animado para voltar ao trabalho! Vida chique \u00e9 legal, mas ehh\u2026 acho que n\u00e3o \u00e9 para mim.",
        u"Bend into a squat, adding the weight of your body to the force of impact.  ": u"Agache durante o movimento, acrescentando o peso do corpo \u00e0 for\u00e7a do impacto.  ",
        u"Bend your hips a little, Natsumi! You\u2019re too stiff!": u"Dobre um pouco o quadril, Natsumi! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 muito r\u00edgido!",
        u"Besides, Aiden knows how to have a good time~!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, Aiden sabe como se divertir~!",
        u"Besides, I don\u2019t think it ever got us in any serious trouble!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que nunca nos meteu em nenhum problema s\u00e9rio!",
        u"Besides, I only go to public bathhouses or small massage places. They\u2019re nothing compared to this one.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, s\u00f3 vou a casas de banho p\u00fablicas ou pequenos lugares de massagem. N\u00e3o chegam nem perto deste aqui.",
        u"Besides, I think I\u2019ll enjoy managing the deliveries. All I need to do is to watch over these\u2026 uhh\u2026 muscular\u2026 sweaty\u2026  and maybe half-naked delivery boys\u2026 Hihihi~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que vou gostar de cuidar das entregas. S\u00f3 preciso observar esses\u2026 hum\u2026 entregadores musculosos\u2026 suados\u2026 e talvez seminus\u2026 Hihihi~",
        u"Besides, I think it would be a great opportunity to teambuild and improve personal relationships, don\u2019t you think? ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que seria uma \u00f3tima oportunidade para fortalecer a equipe e melhorar as rela\u00e7\u00f5es pessoais, n\u00e3o acha? ",
        u"Besides, I think we can cut down the work too by reducing the amount of trees we\u2019ll take down.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que podemos reduzir o trabalho diminuindo a quantidade de \u00e1rvores que vamos derrubar.",
        u"Besides, I was so relaxed at the spa that I lost track of time and then ended up spending the whole day there yesterday.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, fiquei t\u00e3o relaxado no spa que perdi a no\u00e7\u00e3o do tempo e acabei passando o dia inteiro l\u00e1 ontem.",
        u"Besides, I\u2019m a lot more used to doing simple chores, so I\u2019m really glad you got the \u2018management\u2019 stuff covered!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, estou muito mais acostumado \u00e0s tarefas simples, ent\u00e3o fico feliz que voc\u00ea cuide da parte de \u2018administra\u00e7\u00e3o\u2019!",
        u"Besides, I\u2019m gonna show them to Dad someday to make him stop drinking!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, algum dia vou mostrar para o meu pai para fazer ele parar de beber!",
        u"Besides, Yuri takes too much time getting ready for something like this if I leave her to her own devices.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, a Yuri demora demais para se arrumar para algo assim se eu deix\u00e1-la por conta pr\u00f3pria.",
        u"Besides, are you sure you wanna play a game when the real thing is right in front of you~?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, tem certeza de que quer jogar quando a coisa de verdade est\u00e1 bem na sua frente~?",
        u"Besides, didn\u2019t you say you wanted to \u2018enjoy\u2019 the morning together?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o disse que queria \u2018aproveitar\u2019 a manh\u00e3 juntos?",
        u"Besides, do you really need all these contraptions? I think I\u2019ve done pretty good with just a couple weights and some body workouts!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ser\u00e1 que precisa mesmo de todos esses aparelhos? Acho que me sa\u00ed muito bem s\u00f3 com alguns pesos e exerc\u00edcios com o pr\u00f3prio corpo!",
        u"Besides, don\u2019t you have work to do with Sir Goro as well?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o tem trabalho para fazer com o senhor Goro?",
        u"Besides, don\u2019t you wanna use the kitchen here too?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o quer usar esta cozinha?",
        u"Besides, haven\u2019t you two been working out the whole day? It\u2019s already sunset.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o passaram o dia inteiro treinando? O sol j\u00e1 est\u00e1 se pondo.",
        u"Besides, if it weren\u2019t for that, I wouldn\u2019t have gotten close to Dar.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, se n\u00e3o fosse por isso, eu n\u00e3o teria me aproximado de Dar.",
        u"Besides, isn\u2019t it great we get to learn all this cool, new stuff from Sir Goro? ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, n\u00e3o \u00e9 \u00f3timo podermos aprender todas essas coisas novas e legais com o senhor Goro? ",
        u"Besides, it looks like all the snow here is still loose, so it shouldn\u2019t be too hard to pile it up somewhere else.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, parece que toda a neve aqui ainda est\u00e1 solta, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o deve ser t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil amonto\u00e1-la em outro lugar.",
        u"Besides, it\u2019d be really good training for them to deal with the wildest pinhead in the camp!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, seria um \u00f3timo treinamento para eles lidarem com o cabe\u00e7a-oca mais selvagem do acampamento!",
        u"Besides, it\u2019ll show the scoutmasters how flexible we are, no matter the task!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, mostraremos aos chefes escoteiros que somos vers\u00e1teis, n\u00e3o importa a tarefa!",
        u"Besides, it\u2019s a nice ice breaker~!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, \u00e9 uma \u00f3tima forma de quebrar o gelo~!",
        u"Besides, let\u2019s be honest, with how the last few days have been, we could both use some heat.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, sejamos sinceros, depois de como foram os \u00faltimos dias, n\u00f3s dois poder\u00edamos usar um pouco de calor.",
        u"Besides, the internet here is super slow, so it\u2019s taking a long time to download everything anyway\u2014": u"Al\u00e9m disso, a internet daqui \u00e9 muito lenta, ent\u00e3o levaria bastante tempo para baixar tudo de qualquer jeito\u2014",
        u"Besides, the less clothes in the room, the better~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, quanto menos roupa na sala, melhor~",
        u"Besides, the pups were tired of being cooped up indoors, so I thought they could run around here for a while. ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, os filhotes estavam cansados de ficar presos dentro de casa, ent\u00e3o achei que poderiam correr por aqui um pouco. ",
        u"Besides, we haven\u2019t even met her yet! We can\u2019t judge anyone without getting to know them first!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, nem a conhecemos ainda! N\u00e3o podemos julgar algu\u00e9m sem conhec\u00ea-la primeiro!",
        u"Besides, we need a trusty cameraman to film exciting videos for us~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, precisamos de um cinegrafista de confian\u00e7a para gravar v\u00eddeos empolgantes para n\u00f3s~",
        u"Besides, we\u2019re bringing the dogs too, and that\u2019s enough work for me already!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, vamos levar os cachorros tamb\u00e9m, e isso j\u00e1 d\u00e1 trabalho suficiente para mim!",
        u"Besides, we\u2019re going back to camp tomorrow, right? You don\u2019t wanna spend our last day stuck in our room, do you?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, vamos voltar ao acampamento amanh\u00e3, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer passar nosso \u00faltimo dia presos no quarto, quer?",
        u"Besides, you always try to hide it from me whenever something like this happens.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea sempre tenta esconder de mim quando algo assim acontece.",
        u"Besides, you guys are all so busy already. ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00eas j\u00e1 est\u00e3o todos t\u00e3o ocupados. ",
        u"Besides, your arms look great as they are.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, seus bra\u00e7os j\u00e1 est\u00e3o \u00f3timos como est\u00e3o.",
        u"Besides, you\u2019re more than worth it\u2026": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea vale muito mais do que isso\u2026",
        u"Besides, you\u2019re still at full mast, so there\u2019s still some left to pump out!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea ainda est\u00e1 com tudo em p\u00e9, ent\u00e3o ainda tem um pouco para botar pra fora!",
        u"Besides, you\u2019ve got that mysterious vibe going for you that makes people want to get to know you more~!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea tem esse ar misterioso que faz as pessoas quererem conhec\u00ea-lo melhor~!",
        u"Better luck next time, dear.": u"Mais sorte na pr\u00f3xima, querido.",
        u"Better than watching the grass die here.": u"Melhor do que ficar vendo a grama morrer aqui.",
        u"Better to be safe than sorry!": u"Melhor prevenir do que remediar!",
        u"Between cooking, laundry, repairs, and cleaning for a horde of workers, there was more to do than ever before.": u"Entre cozinhar, lavar roupas, fazer reparos e limpar para uma horda de trabalhadores, havia mais coisas para fazer do que nunca.",
        u"Between that and processing all the new applications from the brand-new website, there was more work than ever.": u"Entre isso e o processamento das novas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es do site, havia mais trabalho do que nunca.",
        u"Biceps.": u"B\u00edceps.",
        u"Bingo! That\u2019s what sambuca is!": u"Bingo! Isso \u00e9 sambuca!",
        u"Bingo~! You got that right! I\u2019ll give you a pass for that lapse in memory, since this place is so far away from civilization~": u"Bingo~! Acertou! Vou perdoar esse lapso de mem\u00f3ria, j\u00e1 que este lugar fica t\u00e3o longe da civiliza\u00e7\u00e3o~",
        u"Blech! No thanks, then!": u"Blech! N\u00e3o, obrigado!",
        u"Blech, you\u2019re just malnourished.": u"Blergh, voc\u00ea s\u00f3 \u00e9 desnutrido.",
        u"Bondage and Discipline.": u"Bondage e Disciplina.",
        u"Both of them sound\u2026 wrong.": u"Os dois parecem\u2026 errados.",
        u"Both the camp and I would go bankrupt if I did that, dear\u2026": u"Tanto o acampamento quanto eu ir\u00edamos \u00e0 fal\u00eancia se eu fizesse isso, querida\u2026",
        u"Both. I don\u2019t really care which, either feels good.": u"Os dois. Eu realmente n\u00e3o me importo com qual, os dois s\u00e3o bons.",
        u"Bottom\u2019s Up Nightclub is really living up to its name!": u"A boate Bottom\u2019s Up realmente faz jus ao nome!",
        u"Boy, wake up.": u"Garoto, acorde.",
        u"Boyfriend? Hehe\u2026 I really like the sound of that\u2026": u"Namorado? Hehe\u2026 Eu gosto muito de como isso soa\u2026",
        u"Brains and brawn.": u"Intelig\u00eancia e m\u00fasculos.",
        u"Bread rolls look good.": u"Os p\u00e3ezinhos parecem bons.",
        u"Bread rolls, you say? *lifts shirt up a little*": u"P\u00e3ezinhos, \u00e9? *levanta um pouco a camisa*",
        u"Bring it back!": u"Devolve aqui!",
        u"Bring it on! I bet you can\u2019t make me blush!": u"Manda ver! Aposto que n\u00e3o consegue me fazer corar!",
        u"Bring it on! I\u2019m not scared of anything this crazy lady throws at me! ": u"Manda ver! N\u00e3o tenho medo de nada que essa maluca jogar para cima de mim! ",
        u"Bro. You fell asleep in less than fifteen minutes.": u"Cara. Voc\u00ea dormiu em menos de quinze minutos.",
        u"Broken heart?! Wow, Lloyd you didn\u2019t have to call out Gramps\u2019 marriage like that.": u"Cora\u00e7\u00e3o partido?! Uau, Lloyd, n\u00e3o precisava expor o casamento do Vov\u00f4 desse jeito.",
        u"Brrr\u2026 It\u2019s really chilly. Lemme go and make us some hot soup.": u"Brrr\u2026 Est\u00e1 muito frio. Vou preparar uma sopa quentinha para n\u00f3s.",
        u"Brrr\u2026 It\u2019s so cold out here\u2026! So much for \u2018summer\u2019 camp!": u"Brrr\u2026 Est\u00e1 t\u00e3o frio aqui fora\u2026! Belo \u2018acampamento de ver\u00e3o\u2019!",
        u"Brr\u2026 I can already feel the cold, even from in here!": u"Brr\u2026 J\u00e1 consigo sentir o frio, mesmo aqui dentro!",
        u"Brr\u2026 It\u2019s really cold out here\u2026 I better get moving.": u"Brr\u2026 Est\u00e1 muito frio aqui fora\u2026 \u00c9 melhor eu me mexer.",
        u"Brute force isn\u2019t everything \u2013 it's more about the skill! Lemme show you how it's done~": u"For\u00e7a bruta n\u00e3o \u00e9 tudo \u2013 o que importa \u00e9 a t\u00e9cnica! Deixa eu mostrar como se faz~",
        u"Buddy Falls. I figured I\u2019d show you how beautiful it is during the winter\u2026": u"Cachoeira Buddy. Achei que deveria mostrar como ela fica linda durante o inverno\u2026",
        u"Building those muscles, eh? Good for you!": u"Criando m\u00fasculos, hein? Muito bem!",
        u"Building up those muscles I see!": u"Vejo que est\u00e1 fortalecendo esses m\u00fasculos!",
        u"Building.": u"Construir.",
        u"Business suits are one thing, but the last time I was in full formal wear was my prom.": u"Ternos de neg\u00f3cios s\u00e3o uma coisa, mas a \u00faltima vez que usei um traje totalmente formal foi no meu baile de formatura.",
        u"Business suits are one thing, but the last time I was in full formal wear was my prom. ": u"Ternos de trabalho s\u00e3o uma coisa, mas a \u00faltima vez que usei um traje completamente formal foi no meu baile de formatura. ",
        u"But Emilia over here forgot the shopping list!": u"Mas a Emilia aqui esqueceu a lista de compras!",
        u"But I actually made this one for you, sir!": u"Mas, na verdade, fiz este para o senhor!",
        u"But I assure you, with my services, we\u2019ll be able to integrate new things without having to compromise on the true spirit of your camp!": u"Mas garanto que, com meus servi\u00e7os, conseguiremos integrar novidades sem comprometer o verdadeiro esp\u00edrito do acampamento!",
        u"But I at least thought you\u2019d feel a little \u2018at-home\u2019 with all of these fancy things around.": u"Mas eu pelo menos achei que voc\u00ea se sentiria um pouco \u201cem casa\u201d cercada de todas essas coisas luxuosas.",
        u"But I could tell it was you right away thanks to that cheesy personality of yours!": u"Mas reconheci voc\u00ea na hora gra\u00e7as a essa sua personalidade melosa!",
        u"But I couldn\u2019t be happier than I am right now.": u"Mas eu n\u00e3o poderia estar mais feliz do que estou agora.",
        u"But I couldn\u2019t because I thought this thing was lost forever.": u"Mas n\u00e3o pude, porque pensei que estivesse perdido para sempre.",
        u"But I did get some lovely outfits for your scoutmasters, including you, Yoshi! What I\u2019m wearing is just a taste of what\u2019s to come!": u"Mas consegui umas roupas ador\u00e1veis para seus chefes escoteiros, inclusive voc\u00ea, Yoshi! O que estou usando \u00e9 s\u00f3 uma amostra do que vem por a\u00ed!",
        u"But I do have to say, it is somewhat comforting that this place is the same as it used to be, as unfortunate as that sounds.": u"Mas devo admitir que \u00e9 reconfortante este lugar continuar como antes, por mais lament\u00e1vel que isso pare\u00e7a.",
        u"But I don\u2019t mind having a different escort, if you truly insist.": u"Mas n\u00e3o me importo de ter outro acompanhante, se realmente insistir.",
        u"But I don\u2019t think she\u2019s ready to have that conversation yet.": u"Mas acho que ela ainda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 pronta para ter essa conversa.",
        u"But I don\u2019t understand\u2026! Why did you have to go as far as faking things just to come back to the camp?!": u"Mas eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026! Por que precisou chegar ao ponto de falsificar tudo s\u00f3 para voltar ao acampamento?!",
        u"But I feel like the decision should be obvious, Goro!": u"Mas acho que a decis\u00e3o deveria ser \u00f3bvia, Goro!",
        u"But I found out from Yuri that none of you told Mr. Clermont the issue about my credentials\u2026": u"Mas descobri pela Yuri que nenhum de voc\u00eas contou ao Sr. Clermont sobre o problema com minhas credenciais\u2026",
        u"But I gave my word to Yoshinori here that I\u2019ll try to take things slowly and make people more relaxed with this approach.": u"Mas dei minha palavra ao Yoshinori de que tentaria ir com calma e deixar as pessoas mais \u00e0 vontade com essa abordagem.",
        u"But I get what Jin is saying\u2026 Whether we wait or not, it doesn\u2019t change the fact that she\u2019d have nowhere to go.": u"Mas entendo o que Jin est\u00e1 dizendo\u2026 Esperarmos ou n\u00e3o n\u00e3o muda o fato de que ela n\u00e3o teria para onde ir.",
        u"But I guess I don\u2019t know if that\u2019s any worse than having the entire club watch your strip show\u2026": u"Mas acho que n\u00e3o sei se isso \u00e9 pior do que deixar a boate inteira assistir ao seu show de striptease\u2026",
        u"But I guess Yoshi sees something in her that we don\u2019t.": u"Mas acho que Yoshi v\u00ea nela alguma coisa que n\u00f3s n\u00e3o vemos.",
        u"But I guess it doesn\u2019t make sense for Camp Buddy to have something like that on hand.": u"Mas acho que n\u00e3o faria sentido o Camp Buddy ter algo assim dispon\u00edvel.",
        u"But I guess she thought I was on her side, and that was enough to shut her down.": u"Mas acho que ela pensou que eu estava do lado dela, e isso bastou para faz\u00ea-la se calar.",
        u"But I guess what caught me off guard were the last things Emilia said to me\u2026": u"Mas acho que o que mais me pegou de surpresa foram as \u00faltimas coisas que Emilia me disse\u2026",
        u"But I guess\u2026 it\u2019s not as hard as I thought it would be. Having you here is really encouraging.": u"Mas acho que\u2026 n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil quanto pensei que seria. Ter voc\u00ea aqui me d\u00e1 muita for\u00e7a.",
        u"But I had a great time spending this vacation with you, Aiden\u2026! ": u"Mas eu me diverti muito passando estas f\u00e9rias com voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026! ",
        u"But I have something very important I need to discuss with you.": u"Mas tenho algo muito importante que preciso discutir com o senhor.",
        u"But I have to admit, it was nice to have your company here for once.": u"Mas devo admitir que foi bom contar com a sua companhia aqui, para variar.",
        u"But I have to say, that honeymoon trip is the most fun I\u2019ve ever had.": u"Mas tenho que admitir, aquela viagem de lua de mel foi a maior divers\u00e3o que j\u00e1 tive.",
        u"But I honestly would\u2019ve done the same, sir\u2026": u"Mas, sinceramente, eu teria feito o mesmo, senhor\u2026",
        u"But I know all of you will do your best.": u"Mas sei que todos voc\u00eas dar\u00e3o o melhor de si.",
        u"But I need to know for sure you\u2019re alright\u2026": u"Mas eu preciso ter certeza de que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026",
        u"But I need you to understand\u2026 ": u"Mas preciso que voc\u00ea entenda\u2026 ",
        u"But I never thought of you like that, Emilia\u2026! ": u"Mas eu nunca pensei em voc\u00ea desse jeito, Emilia\u2026! ",
        u"But I realized it was a mistake, all along\u2026": u"Mas percebi que foi um erro desde o come\u00e7o\u2026",
        u"But I still would like to apologize for not consulting all of you first\u2026": u"Mas ainda gostaria de me desculpar por n\u00e3o ter consultado todos voc\u00eas antes\u2026",
        u"But I suppose as her father, it is different.": u"Mas suponho que, sendo o pai dela, seja diferente.",
        u"But I understand that you were going through a lot of things I didn\u2019t know about, sir\u2026": u"Mas entendo que o senhor estava passando por muitas coisas que eu desconhecia\u2026",
        u"But I understand why you lost your patience, sir\u2026 All of us were feeling the same way\u2026": u"Mas entendo por que o senhor perdeu a paci\u00eancia\u2026 Todos n\u00f3s est\u00e1vamos nos sentindo da mesma forma\u2026",
        u"But I understand, Goro\u2026 ": u"Mas eu entendo, Goro\u2026 ",
        u"But I want to know, what is a perfect vacation to you?": u"Mas quero saber: como seriam as f\u00e9rias perfeitas para voc\u00ea?",
        u"But I want to know, what is a perfect vacation to you?{fast}": u"Mas quero saber: como seriam as f\u00e9rias perfeitas para voc\u00ea?{fast}",
        u"But I was surprised, even after all these years, I\u2019ve never seen him open up and trust everyone with his feelings like he did back at the hotel.   ": u"Mas fiquei surpreso porque, mesmo depois de todos esses anos, nunca o tinha visto se abrir e confiar seus sentimentos a todos como fez no hotel.   ",
        u"But I was the same, Yoshi\u2026 We had to go through our own lives, so I never blamed you for that\u2026": u"Mas eu tamb\u00e9m fui assim, Yoshi\u2026 N\u00f3s precis\u00e1vamos seguir nossas pr\u00f3prias vidas, ent\u00e3o nunca culpei voc\u00ea por isso\u2026",
        u"But I wasn\u2019t.": u"Mas n\u00e3o fiquei.",
        u"But I wonder if Aiden\u2019s alright in the kitchen by himself\u2026 He\u2019s usually clumsy.": u"Mas ser\u00e1 que o Aiden est\u00e1 bem sozinho na cozinha\u2026? Ele costuma ser desastrado.",
        u"But I\u2019ll try to be more tolerant this time, especially with you around to make my stay pleasant again.": u"Mas tentarei ser mais tolerante desta vez, especialmente com voc\u00ea por perto para tornar minha estadia agrad\u00e1vel novamente.",
        u"But I\u2019m calling it right now, there\u2019s something really off about that girl\u2026 And I\u2019m not just talking about her attitude!": u"Mas vou dizer agora: h\u00e1 algo muito errado com aquela garota\u2026 E n\u00e3o estou falando apenas da atitude dela!",
        u"But I\u2019m glad everyone, including the scouts, kept an open mind and were able to give me time to change my ways.": u"Mas fico feliz que todos, inclusive os escoteiros, mantiveram a mente aberta e me deram tempo para mudar.",
        u"But I\u2019m glad that didn\u2019t end up being the case.": u"Mas fico feliz que n\u00e3o tenha sido assim.",
        u"But I\u2019m not forcing you, Aiden! I\u2019m just trying to\u2014": u"Mas eu n\u00e3o estou for\u00e7ando voc\u00ea, Aiden! S\u00f3 estou tentando\u2014",
        u"But I\u2019m not joking.": u"Mas eu n\u00e3o estou brincando.",
        u"But I\u2019m only thinking of what\u2019s best for you, Aiden!": u"Mas eu s\u00f3 estou pensando no que \u00e9 melhor para voc\u00ea, Aiden!",
        u"But I\u2019m still a little on edge by how lavish everything is. Makes me really miss our simple life back at camp.": u"Mas todo esse luxo ainda me deixa um pouco desconfort\u00e1vel. Faz eu sentir muita falta da nossa vida simples no acampamento.",
        u"But I\u2019m the manager here!": u"Mas eu sou a gerente aqui!",
        u"But Mr. Clermont, if I may?": u"Mas, Sr. Clermont, se me permite?",
        u"But Sir Goro has a point\u2026 Compared to the other group, we\u2019re lagging behind a bit.": u"Mas o Sr. Goro tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 Comparados ao outro grupo, estamos um pouco atrasados.",
        u"But Yoshi here has no excuse\u2026 I still can\u2019t believe you didn\u2019t recognize them, especially Darius!": u"Mas o Yoshi n\u00e3o tem desculpa\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o os reconheceu, principalmente o Darius!",
        u"But after seeing the opportunity, I just knew that I was the perfect fit!": u"Mas, quando vi a oportunidade, soube que era a pessoa perfeita para o cargo!",
        u"But afterwards, Lloyd acts as if nothing happened. ": u"Mas depois o Lloyd age como se nada tivesse acontecido. ",
        u"But all I gained was pain\u2026": u"Mas tudo que eu ganhei foi dor\u2026",
        u"But all of that is finally over\u2026": u"Mas tudo isso finalmente acabou\u2026",
        u"But all of us have changed, sir, including you!": u"Mas todos n\u00f3s mudamos, senhor, inclusive o senhor!",
        u"But before that, I have to make sure to report to the office first.": u"Mas, antes disso, preciso me apresentar no escrit\u00f3rio.",
        u"But believe it or not\u2026 I still ended up in the same position as you now\u2026": u"Mas, acredite ou n\u00e3o\u2026 Mesmo assim acabei na mesma situa\u00e7\u00e3o em que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 agora\u2026",
        u"But by entering the fantasy world of BL, there are so many options! It\u2019s vast, colorful, and full of any kind of romance you can think of!": u"Mas, entrando no mundo de fantasia dos BL, existem tantas possibilidades! \u00c9 vasto, colorido e cheio de todo tipo de romance que voc\u00ea possa imaginar!",
        u"But can you at least try to get along with her like Mr. Clermont asked?": u"Mas pode pelo menos tentar se dar bem com ela, como o Sr. Clermont pediu?",
        u"But don\u2019t get me wrong, I was really hoping she\u2019d act a little better knowing she\u2019d be in her element here.": u"Mas n\u00e3o me entendam mal, eu realmente esperava que ela se comportasse um pouco melhor sabendo que estaria no ambiente dela aqui.",
        u"But don\u2019t get me wrong, this is far more bearable than having to stay in that raggedy camp.": u"Mas n\u00e3o me entenda mal, isto \u00e9 muito mais suport\u00e1vel do que ter que ficar naquele acampamento caindo aos peda\u00e7os.",
        u"But don\u2019t get me wrong\u2026! I\u2019m really having fun today!": u"Mas n\u00e3o me entenda mal\u2026! Estou me divertindo muito hoje!",
        u"But don\u2019t worry \u2013 the originally scheduled downtime has already been considered and it shouldn\u2019t affect our targeted completion date.": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe \u2014 a pausa originalmente programada j\u00e1 foi considerada e n\u00e3o deve afetar nossa data prevista de conclus\u00e3o.",
        u"But don\u2019t worry, Aiden! Goro and I are going to make things work!": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden! Goro e eu vamos fazer dar certo!",
        u"But don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m here to help!~ ": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, estou aqui para ajudar!~",
        u"But don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m pretty sure we\u2019ll fit together.": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, tenho certeza de que caberemos juntos.",
        u"But don\u2019t worry, naughty or nice, you can still have your \u2018present\u2019.": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, malcriado ou bonzinho, voc\u00ea ainda pode ganhar seu \u2018presente\u2019.",
        u"But don\u2019t worry, you look really handsome in it.": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 muito bonito com ele.",
        u"But don\u2019t worry\u2026 I\u2019ll fuck you so hard tonight you\u2019ll be permanently loose.": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe\u2026 Vou foder voc\u00ea com tanta for\u00e7a esta noite que ficar\u00e1 frouxo para sempre.",
        u"But don\u2019t you miss having it?": u"Mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sente falta dela?",
        u"But eh, just chillin\u2019 and watching the sunset with you is way better.": u"Mas, eh, ficar aqui relaxando e vendo o p\u00f4r do sol com voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito melhor.",
        u"But eh\u2026 We can always figure out how to fix that when we get home!": u"Mas, bem\u2026 Sempre podemos descobrir como resolver isso quando voltarmos para casa!",
        u"But even after all this, I still prefer a vintage scotch on the rocks.": u"Mas, mesmo depois de tudo isso, ainda prefiro um bom scotch envelhecido com gelo.",
        u"But even so, after we were all separated and then reunited, we\u2019ve all been so carried away with our responsibilities these past few years.": u"Mesmo assim, depois que todos nos separamos e depois nos reencontramos, ficamos t\u00e3o envolvidos com nossas responsabilidades nos \u00faltimos anos.",
        u"But even then, I failed you at one point, putting us in a position that caused all the trouble we had to solve today.": u"Mas, mesmo assim, em certo momento eu falhei com voc\u00ea, colocando-nos numa situa\u00e7\u00e3o que causou todos os problemas que tivemos de resolver at\u00e9 hoje.",
        u"But even then, a part of me always hoped this camp would become something more because we were all pouring our hearts into it.": u"Mas, mesmo naquela \u00e9poca, uma parte de mim sempre esperou que este acampamento se tornasse algo maior, porque todos coloc\u00e1vamos nosso cora\u00e7\u00e3o nele.",
        u"But even though our work could get overwhelming, he would always make sure we enjoyed the few peaceful moments we got to spend with just the two of us. It\u2019s what encouraged me to keep doing my best.": u"Mas, mesmo quando o trabalho ficava sufocante, ele sempre fazia quest\u00e3o de aproveitarmos os poucos momentos tranquilos que t\u00ednhamos s\u00f3 n\u00f3s dois. Isso me incentivava a continuar dando o meu melhor.",
        u"But even with all that\u2026 I was never able to give you the life you deserved.": u"Mas, mesmo com tudo isso\u2026 nunca consegui dar a voc\u00ea a vida que merecia.",
        u"But everyone I met kept saying suggestive things left and right\u2026 I wasn\u2019t sure if everyone knew my dirty little secret\u2026": u"Mas todas as pessoas que conheci diziam coisas sugestivas a todo momento\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o sabia se todos conheciam meu segredinho indecente\u2026",
        u"But flipping through these pages\u2026 I only see good-looking men\u2026 with no clothes\u2026 and LOTS of fluids. ": u"Mas folheando essas p\u00e1ginas\u2026 s\u00f3 vejo homens bonitos\u2026 sem roupa\u2026 e MUITOS fluidos. ",
        u"But for the rest of the winter, it\u2019ll most likely be web design work for me!": u"Mas pelo resto do inverno, provavelmente vou trabalhar com web design!",
        u"But he ultimately decided not to take it, just because he\u2019d be separated from Camp Buddy\u2026 and me\u2026": u"Mas no fim ele decidiu recusar, s\u00f3 porque ficaria longe do Camp Buddy\u2026 e de mim\u2026",
        u"But hey, I had fun too. Thanks for working with me today.": u"Mas, ei, eu tamb\u00e9m me diverti. Obrigado por trabalhar comigo hoje.",
        u"But hey, I wouldn\u2019t say no to seeing you with a juicier butt~": u"Mas, ei, eu n\u00e3o reclamaria de ver voc\u00ea com uma bunda mais carnuda~",
        u"But hey, I\u2019m not complaining! I won\u2019t say no to more fancy living!": u"Mas ei, n\u00e3o estou reclamando! N\u00e3o vou recusar mais um pouco dessa vida chique!",
        u"But hey, you\u2019ve done as much for me. And not just by taking me back and giving me a home again.": u"Mas ei, voc\u00ea fez tanto por mim quanto eu por voc\u00ea. E n\u00e3o apenas por me aceitar de volta e me dar um lar novamente.",
        u"But honestly, they aren\u2019t that different from our own meetings back at camp.": u"Mas, sinceramente, elas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o t\u00e3o diferentes das nossas reuni\u00f5es no acampamento.",
        u"But if I\u2019m gonna be honest, ever since that whole fiasco back at the hotel, I\u2019ve been wanting to try some new things.": u"Mas, para ser sincero, desde toda aquela confus\u00e3o no hotel eu estava querendo experimentar coisas novas.",
        u"But if she crosses the line like that again, I\u2019m not going to hold myself back anymore!": u"Mas se ela passar dos limites daquele jeito de novo, n\u00e3o vou mais me segurar!",
        u"But if there\u2019s something I realized from all this\u2026 I\u2019ve always been making decisions for myself.": u"Mas, se percebi alguma coisa com tudo isso\u2026 \u00e9 que sempre estive tomando minhas pr\u00f3prias decis\u00f5es.",
        u"But if you want to do it your way, then so be it.": u"Mas se quer fazer do seu jeito, que assim seja.",
        u"But in all seriousness, I\u2019ll try to act more pro too. I\u2019d really hate it if I dragged everyone down just because of my habits\u2026": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, tamb\u00e9m tentarei agir de forma mais profissional. Eu odiaria prejudicar todos por causa dos meus h\u00e1bitos\u2026",
        u"But in all seriousness, you never showed anyone a sign of what you had to go through.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, voc\u00ea nunca demonstrou para ningu\u00e9m o que teve que enfrentar.",
        u"But in the end, it only hurt me\u2026 my wife\u2026 and my daughter in the process\u2026 And none of us were truly happy\u2026": u"Mas, no fim, isso s\u00f3 machucou a mim\u2026 minha esposa\u2026 e minha filha\u2026 E nenhum de n\u00f3s era realmente feliz\u2026",
        u"But it is, Yoshi! I would\u2019ve screwed up on the project if you hadn\u2019t covered for me this whole time!": u"Mas \u00e9 verdade, Yoshi! Eu teria estragado o projeto se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse me protegido esse tempo todo!",
        u"But it looks like I didn\u2019t handle it in the best way\u2026 ": u"Mas parece que n\u00e3o lidei com isso da melhor maneira\u2026 ",
        u"But it looks like you didn\u2019t finish yet.": u"Mas parece que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o terminou.",
        u"But it might be best if he doesn\u2019t\u2026": u"Mas talvez seja melhor se n\u00e3o voltar\u2026",
        u"But it never worked because we were never on the same wavelength!": u"Mas nunca deu certo porque a gente nunca esteve na mesma sintonia!",
        u"But it only made his health worse, and he still wasn't making enough to afford his medication...": u"Mas isso s\u00f3 piorou a sa\u00fade dele, e mesmo assim ele n\u00e3o ganhava o suficiente para pagar os medicamentos\u2026",
        u"But it only made me respect you even more, sir.": u"Mas isso s\u00f3 fez com que eu respeitasse ainda mais o senhor.",
        u"But it sounds like Yoshi knows everything already too.": u"Mas parece que o Yoshi tamb\u00e9m j\u00e1 sabe tudo.",
        u"But it wasn\u2019t always that serious either. Being teenagers, we had countless parties and all sorts of crazy ideas to entertain ourselves.": u"Mas nem sempre era t\u00e3o s\u00e9rio. Como adolescentes, tivemos in\u00fameras festas e todo tipo de ideia maluca para nos divertir.",
        u"But it wasn\u2019t me who made all of these changes possible\u2026": u"Mas n\u00e3o fui eu quem tornou todas essas mudan\u00e7as poss\u00edveis\u2026",
        u"But it\u2019s not just about the camp, Yoshinori\u2026! I thought you\u2019d understand\u2026": u"Mas n\u00e3o se trata apenas do acampamento, Yoshinori\u2026! Achei que voc\u00ea entenderia\u2026",
        u"But it\u2019s part of who you are, Jin! ": u"Mas isso faz parte de quem voc\u00ea \u00e9, Jin! ",
        u"But it\u2019s understandable, sir. You were dealing with a lot of things behind the scenes.": u"Mas \u00e9 compreens\u00edvel, senhor. O senhor estava lidando com muitas coisas nos bastidores.",
        u"But it\u2019s\u2026 barely covering anything\u2026": u"Mas ela\u2026 mal est\u00e1 cobrindo alguma coisa\u2026",
        u"But l believe we can all agree that can wait for a while, to buy some time and allow Emilia to recover.": u"Mas acredito que todos podemos concordar que isso pode esperar um pouco, para ganharmos tempo e permitirmos que Emilia se recupere.",
        u"But l believe we can all agree that can wait for a while, to buy some time and allow Ms. Komarova to regain her health.": u"Mas acredito que todos podemos concordar que isso pode esperar um pouco, para ganharmos tempo e permitir que a Srta. Komarova recupere a sa\u00fade.",
        u"But look over there! She\u2019s harassing that poor bellboy!": u"Mas olha ali! Ela est\u00e1 importunando aquele pobre carregador!",
        u"But luckily Sir Goro showed up and took control of the situation.": u"Mas, felizmente, o Sr. Goro apareceu e assumiu o controle da situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"But mine\u2019s\u2026 Uhh\u2026": u"Mas o meu \u00e9\u2026 Uhh\u2026",
        u"But none of us told Mr. Clermont yet, right? ": u"Mas nenhum de n\u00f3s contou ao Sr. Clermont ainda, certo? ",
        u"But none of what she said was true, sir. She was just desperate to defend herself like always, and can never admit when she\u2019s wrong.": u"Mas nada do que ela disse era verdade, senhor. Ela s\u00f3 estava desesperada para se defender, como sempre, e nunca consegue admitir quando est\u00e1 errada.",
        u"But now I get it after seeing it up close and personal\u2026 I-It was kinda hot\u2026": u"Mas agora eu entendo depois de ver de perto\u2026 F-Foi at\u00e9 meio excitante\u2026",
        u"But now it just feels liberating\u2026 it\u2019s making me realize how far I\u2019ve come.": u"Mas agora parece libertador\u2026 est\u00e1 me fazendo perceber o quanto avancei.",
        u"But now that we\u2019ve had our fun, it\u2019s time for us to get back to work!": u"Mas agora que j\u00e1 nos divertimos, \u00e9 hora de voltar ao trabalho!",
        u"But now, knowing that there\u2019s nothing to lose and everything to gain, I can finally make a choice for myself!": u"Mas agora, sabendo que n\u00e3o tenho nada a perder e tudo a ganhar, finalmente posso tomar uma decis\u00e3o por mim mesmo!",
        u"But now, you finally get to start over! And for real, this time!": u"Mas agora voc\u00ea finalmente pode recome\u00e7ar! E desta vez de verdade!",
        u"But now\u2026 I think I might just have the chance again, after everything settles down with this project.": u"Mas agora\u2026 acho que talvez eu tenha essa chance de novo, depois que tudo se acalmar com este projeto.",
        u"But on the other hand, Dad always made time for me no matter how busy he was with work!": u"Por outro lado, o pai sempre arranjava tempo para mim, n\u00e3o importava o quanto estivesse ocupado com o trabalho!",
        u"But on the other hand, you can\u2019t get any further if you keep playing it safe.": u"Por outro lado, voc\u00ea nunca vai avan\u00e7ar se continuar jogando pelo seguro.",
        u"But once he finds out about Emilia\u2019s lies\u2026 I\u2019m sure he won\u2019t hesitate to fire her\u2026": u"Mas quando descobrir as mentiras da Emilia\u2026 Tenho certeza de que n\u00e3o hesitar\u00e1 em demiti-la\u2026",
        u"But one of these days, you\u2019re going to come with us and we\u2019re going to party. And that\u2019s an order!": u"Mas um dia desses voc\u00ea vai vir conosco e n\u00f3s vamos festejar. E isso \u00e9 uma ordem!",
        u"But one thing is certain, we all had some of our greatest memories here at Camp Buddy last term\u2026 ": u"Mas uma coisa \u00e9 certa: todos n\u00f3s vivemos alguns dos nossos melhores momentos aqui no Camp Buddy na \u00faltima temporada\u2026 ",
        u"But only because you\u2019re doing a better job at giving me the special treatment I deserve than everyone else.": u"Mas apenas porque voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo um trabalho melhor que todos os outros em me dar o tratamento especial que mere\u00e7o.",
        u"But please let me help clear up your worries... and convince you why this opportunity is the best thing for you!": u"Mas, por favor, deixe-me ajudar a aliviar suas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026 e convencer voc\u00ea de por que esta oportunidade \u00e9 a melhor escolha para voc\u00ea!",
        u"But really, it never fails to amaze me just how much work you do around here compared to the rest of us.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, nunca deixo de me impressionar com o quanto voc\u00ea trabalha por aqui em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"But really, thank you both for giving me a different perspective about this off-season.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, obrigado aos dois por me darem uma perspectiva diferente sobre esta baixa temporada.",
        u"But really, thanks a lot, Yoshi. I feel better already.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, muito obrigado, Yoshi. J\u00e1 me sinto melhor.",
        u"But remember \u2013 you\u2019re a scoutmaster. Your job is to take care of the scouts and engage with them.": u"Mas lembre-se: voc\u00ea \u00e9 um chefe escoteiro. Seu trabalho \u00e9 cuidar dos escoteiros e conviver com eles.",
        u"But seeing that he\u2019s still got that part inside of him\u2026 I think you\u2019ve been really bringing it out of him.": u"Mas vendo que esse lado ainda existe dentro dele\u2026 Acho que voc\u00ea realmente tem feito isso voltar \u00e0 tona.",
        u"But seeing this\u2026 I don\u2019t understand why Goro left out something so important\u2026": u"Mas vendo isto\u2026 N\u00e3o entendo por que Goro omitiu algo t\u00e3o importante\u2026",
        u"But seriously, I can\u2019t believe you used to be embarrassed about it, Darius.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, n\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea tinha vergonha disso, Darius.",
        u"But seriously, have you noticed that it\u2019s been snowing nonstop the whole time we\u2019ve been here?": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, percebeu que est\u00e1 nevando sem parar desde que chegamos?",
        u"But seriously, it could\u2019ve been worse. Compared to how she was the last few months, this is pretty tame.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, poderia ter sido pior. Comparado a como ela esteve nos \u00faltimos meses, isso foi bem tranquilo.",
        u"But she claims that\u2019s she\u2019s still rich\u2026? Does that mean she\u2019s doing fine on her own?": u"Mas ela afirma que ainda \u00e9 rica\u2026? Isso significa que est\u00e1 se sustentando bem sozinha?",
        u"But sheesh\u2026 adulting really sucks. I kinda miss how simple our lives were during our first term.": u"Mas caramba\u2026 vida adulta \u00e9 uma droga. Sinto um pouco de falta de como nossas vidas eram simples durante nossa primeira temporada.",
        u"But since he\u2019s not here right now, we can\u2019t really proceed\u2026": u"Mas como ele n\u00e3o est\u00e1 aqui agora, n\u00e3o podemos prosseguir\u2026",
        u"But sometimes, it\u2019s alright to show vulnerability\u2026 It helps others to understand you better and find ways to help you.": u"Mas \u00e0s vezes n\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema em mostrar vulnerabilidade\u2026 Isso ajuda os outros a entender voc\u00ea melhor e encontrar maneiras de ajudar.",
        u"But still, I was blinded by the opportunity, thinking it was best for you, regardless of the cost. ": u"Mesmo assim, fiquei cego pela oportunidade, achando que era o melhor para voc\u00ea, independentemente do pre\u00e7o. ",
        u"But still, I\u2019d rather you all hadn\u2019t seen that.": u"Mesmo assim, eu preferia que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o tivessem visto aquilo.",
        u"But still\u2026": u"Mas mesmo assim\u2026",
        u"But still\u2026 \tI should\u2019ve respected your right to make your own choice\u2026": u"Mas, ainda assim\u2026 \tEu deveria ter respeitado seu direito de fazer sua pr\u00f3pria escolha\u2026",
        u"But still\u2026 If only I had more experience working with site conditions like this, we would\u2019ve been able to prevent it\u2026": u"Mesmo assim\u2026 Se eu tivesse mais experi\u00eancia trabalhando em condi\u00e7\u00f5es como estas, talvez tiv\u00e9ssemos conseguido evitar isso\u2026",
        u"But still\u2026 Maybe if I had stood up in the meeting, things wouldn\u2019t have escalated like that.": u"Mesmo assim\u2026 Talvez, se eu tivesse me manifestado na reuni\u00e3o, as coisas n\u00e3o teriam chegado a esse ponto.",
        u"But thankfully, Sir Goro didn\u2019t lose patience and guided me every step of the way until I was able to adjust.": u"Mas, felizmente, o Sr. Goro n\u00e3o perdeu a paci\u00eancia e me orientou em cada etapa at\u00e9 que eu conseguisse me adaptar.",
        u"But that explosive attitude sounds like something an Aries would do \u2013 they can be control freaks too.": u"Mas essa atitude explosiva parece coisa de \u00c1ries \u2014 eles tamb\u00e9m podem ser obcecados por controle.",
        u"But that\u2019s enough chitchat. Come on, let\u2019s get to work!": u"Mas chega de conversa. Vamos trabalhar!",
        u"But that\u2019s exactly the magic of it \u2013 BL itself is such an amazing artform~!": u"Mas essa \u00e9 justamente a magia \u2014 BL por si s\u00f3 \u00e9 uma forma de arte incr\u00edvel~!",
        u"But that\u2019s just it, Yoshinori\u2026 We\u2019ve already been given more than enough chances to make things right for the camp\u2026": u"Mas esse \u00e9 justamente o problema, Yoshinori\u2026 J\u00e1 recebemos chances mais do que suficientes para colocar as coisas em ordem no acampamento\u2026",
        u"But that\u2019s not your fault, Yoshinori. People naturally drift apart, even from those closest to them. ": u"Mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa sua, Yoshinori. As pessoas naturalmente se afastam, at\u00e9 mesmo daquelas mais pr\u00f3ximas. ",
        u"But that\u2019s not yours or anyone\u2019s fault, Yoshi\u2026 I got separated from you too back then, but look at us now.": u"Mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa sua nem de ningu\u00e9m, Yoshi\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m me separei de voc\u00ea naquela \u00e9poca, mas olha para n\u00f3s agora.",
        u"But that\u2019s super awesome though! This project is gonna be a lot more exciting with you guys here!": u"Mas isso \u00e9 demais! Este projeto vai ficar muito mais empolgante com voc\u00eas aqui!",
        u"But that\u2019s the thing, Yoshi. Even without knowing, you were able to pull my dad and I out of that situation!  ": u"Mas \u00e9 justamente isso, Yoshi. Mesmo sem saber, voc\u00ea conseguiu tirar meu pai e eu daquela situa\u00e7\u00e3o!  ",
        u"But that\u2019s the thing\u2026 All I wanted was to return to the person I once was\u2026": u"Mas esse \u00e9 o problema\u2026 Tudo que eu queria era voltar a ser a pessoa que j\u00e1 fui\u2026",
        u"But that\u2019s the whole point, right? It would be a waste if you work that hard and only end up back at Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Mas esse \u00e9 justamente o objetivo, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Seria um desperd\u00edcio se voc\u00ea se esfor\u00e7asse tanto para acabar simplesmente voltando ao Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"But that\u2019s what I was sayi\u2014": u"Mas era isso que eu estava dize\u2014",
        u"But the good news is, the storm has already passed, and the clean-up operations are already underway.": u"Mas a boa not\u00edcia \u00e9 que a tempestade j\u00e1 passou e as opera\u00e7\u00f5es de limpeza j\u00e1 come\u00e7aram.",
        u"But the most special thing about you is how you bring joy to people, always making sure we have a smile on our face.": u"Mas o mais especial em voc\u00ea \u00e9 como traz alegria \u00e0s pessoas, sempre garantindo que tenhamos um sorriso no rosto.",
        u"But the past shouldn\u2019t affect his future... There must be a way I can still change his mind!": u"Mas o passado n\u00e3o deveria afetar o futuro dele\u2026 Deve haver uma maneira de ainda faz\u00ea-lo mudar de ideia!",
        u"But the reason I'm telling you this is to give you a different perspective on why Aiden might have made the decision he did.": u"Mas estou contando isso para dar a voc\u00ea uma perspectiva diferente sobre o motivo de Aiden ter tomado essa decis\u00e3o.",
        u"But the stuff he was saying\u2026 It sounded like it\u2019s a big deal.": u"Mas as coisas que ele estava dizendo\u2026 Pareciam ser algo s\u00e9rio.",
        u"But the thing is\u2026 I don\u2019t see it as all that bad!": u"Mas a quest\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o vejo tudo isso como algo t\u00e3o ruim!",
        u"But the truth is, we really don\u2019t have anywhere else to go.": u"Mas a verdade \u00e9 que realmente n\u00e3o temos nenhum outro lugar para ir.",
        u"But the way I handled it only made things worse.": u"Mas a forma como lidei com isso s\u00f3 piorou as coisas.",
        u"But then I remembered\u2026": u"Mas ent\u00e3o me lembrei\u2026",
        u"But then again, we always just get beer.": u"Mas, pensando bem, a gente sempre acaba tomando cerveja.",
        u"But then again, your wild west style makes me wild and wet.": u"Pensando bem, esse seu estilo de velho oeste me deixa selvagem e molhado.",
        u"But then, in the middle of all that, I finally heard from you \u2013 asking me to come back to Camp Buddy.": u"Mas ent\u00e3o, no meio de tudo isso, finalmente recebi not\u00edcias suas \u2014 me pedindo para voltar ao Camp Buddy.",
        u"But then\u2026 That just makes me even more curious about what kind of person you were before I met you at Camp Buddy.": u"Mas ent\u00e3o\u2026 Isso s\u00f3 me deixa ainda mais curioso sobre que tipo de pessoa o senhor era antes de eu conhec\u00ea-lo no Camp Buddy.",
        u"But then\u2026 maybe it took so long for a good reason\u2026": u"Mas\u2026 talvez tenha demorado tanto por um bom motivo\u2026",
        u"But there\u2019s no point, Yoshi!  She\u2019ll just lie again, like she\u2019s been doing all along!": u"Mas n\u00e3o adianta, Yoshi!  Ela s\u00f3 vai mentir de novo, como vem fazendo esse tempo todo!",
        u"But they\u2019d better not get on my bad side.": u"Mas \u00e9 melhor n\u00e3o entrarem no meu lado ruim.",
        u"But things didn\u2019t work out for him \u2019cause he couldn\u2019t afford to get a degree even though he was pretty good at it.": u"Mas as coisas n\u00e3o deram certo para ele porque n\u00e3o tinha condi\u00e7\u00f5es de pagar uma forma\u00e7\u00e3o, apesar de cozinhar muito bem.",
        u"But to be honest, I lost count of how many rounds we did this time.": u"Mas, para ser sincero, perdi a conta de quantas rodadas fizemos desta vez.",
        u"But to give you a preface, it\u2019s mostly expansions to the camp! ": u"Mas, para dar uma ideia geral, tratam-se principalmente de expans\u00f5es do acampamento! ",
        u"But today is\u2026": u"Mas hoje \u00e9\u2026",
        u"But too bad nobody wants to be friends with you because you\u2019re such a BITCH!!!": u"Mas que pena que ningu\u00e9m quer ser sua amiga porque voc\u00ea \u00e9 uma VADIA!!!",
        u"But try not to worry about it and just focus on keeping the project going until the end.": u"Mas tente n\u00e3o se preocupar com isso e apenas se concentre em manter o projeto seguindo at\u00e9 o fim.",
        u"But very well, I\u2019ll leave the work to your team! ": u"Mas muito bem, deixarei o trabalho com sua equipe! ",
        u"But we did it, Vera! We\u2019re married! We made our vows!": u"Mas n\u00f3s fizemos isso, Vera! Somos casados! Fizemos nossos votos!",
        u"But we do look good together, sir! Hahaha!": u"Mas n\u00f3s realmente ficamos bem juntos, senhor! Hahaha!",
        u"But we have all the proof we need! Let\u2019s rat her out to Mr. Clermont!": u"Mas j\u00e1 temos todas as provas de que precisamos! Vamos entregar ela para o Sr. Clermont!",
        u"But we managed to get everything done! We\u2019ve all earned this break!": u"Mas conseguimos terminar tudo! Todos n\u00f3s merecemos esta folga!",
        u"But we really understand now why you ended up doing those things...": u"Mas agora realmente entendemos por que voc\u00ea acabou fazendo aquelas coisas...",
        u"But we still feel guilty that we may have pressured you during the dinner. I thought that asking for your opinion on everything would have been helpful, but it was the other way around.": u"Mas ainda nos sentimos culpados por talvez termos pressionado voc\u00ea durante o jantar. Achei que pedir sua opini\u00e3o sobre tudo ajudaria, mas acabou sendo o contr\u00e1rio.",
        u"But we\u2019d at least have a way to help if things don\u2019t work out for her.": u"Mas pelo menos ter\u00edamos uma forma de ajud\u00e1-la caso as coisas n\u00e3o deem certo para ela.",
        u"But what about the other nigh\u2014": u"Mas e aquela outra noi\u2014",
        u"But what happened after that? How did you end up passed out naked here?": u"Mas o que aconteceu depois? Como voc\u00ea acabou apagado e pelado aqui?",
        u"But when you left... I suddenly began to feel empty\u2026": u"Mas quando voc\u00ea foi embora\u2026 de repente comecei a me sentir vazio\u2026",
        u"But why though?": u"Mas por qu\u00ea?",
        u"But with Mr. Clermont here, I want to make sure there\u2019s no incidents.": u"Mas, com o Sr. Clermont aqui, quero garantir que n\u00e3o aconte\u00e7a nenhum incidente.",
        u"But with time\u2026 you slowly mended my broken heart\u2026 ": u"Mas, com o tempo\u2026 voc\u00ea foi lentamente curando meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o partido\u2026 ",
        u"But yeah! You guys came to the right place~ Isn\u2019t the view here amazing?": u"Mas sim! Voc\u00eas vieram ao lugar certo~ A vista daqui n\u00e3o \u00e9 incr\u00edvel?",
        u"But yeah, I kinda took a peek inside those stacks of papers while you were gone, and she\u2019s added a bunch of extra maintenance tasks on top of all my other work\u2026": u"Mas sim, dei uma olhada naquelas pilhas de papel enquanto voc\u00ea estava fora, e ela acrescentou v\u00e1rias tarefas de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o a todo o meu trabalho\u2026",
        u"But you already checked our stuff, like, three times this morning!": u"Mas voc\u00ea j\u00e1 conferiu as nossas coisas umas tr\u00eas vezes s\u00f3 esta manh\u00e3!",
        u"But you are though! Heck, you\u2019re the one who helped me become like this!": u"Mas voc\u00ea \u00e9! Ora, foi voc\u00ea quem me ajudou a ser assim!",
        u"But you can leave those docs to me, Gramps! I know where to put \u2018em!": u"Mas pode deixar esses documentos comigo, Vov\u00f4! Sei onde coloc\u00e1-los!",
        u"But you can still help me serve this out there! Here, let me grab some trays.": u"Mas ainda pode me ajudar a servir l\u00e1 fora! Aqui, vou pegar umas bandejas.",
        u"But you did that yourself...! You were the one who\u2019s opened up to me on your own.": u"Mas foi voc\u00ea que fez isso sozinho\u2026! Foi voc\u00ea quem decidiu se abrir comigo.",
        u"But you don\u2019t have to do that right now. We have everything under control with the work so far.": u"Mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa fazer isso agora. At\u00e9 aqui, temos o trabalho sob controle.",
        u"But you don\u2019t have to go back to that, sir! I never expected you to stay the same, especially after everything you\u2019ve been through\u2026": u"Mas o senhor n\u00e3o precisa voltar a ser aquela pessoa! Nunca esperei que continuasse igual, principalmente depois de tudo pelo que passou\u2026",
        u"But you don\u2019t have to keep bearing everything alone anymore\u2026 Everyone at Camp Buddy is here for you\u2026": u"Mas o senhor n\u00e3o precisa continuar carregando tudo sozinho\u2026 Todos no Camp Buddy est\u00e3o aqui pelo senhor\u2026",
        u"But you gotta admit, it was hella funny though.": u"Mas voc\u00ea tem que admitir que foi engra\u00e7ado pra caramba.",
        u"But you guys can go ahead! I can be at the back of the queue!": u"Mas voc\u00eas podem ir primeiro! Posso ficar no fim da fila!",
        u"But you know me! I\u2019m a go-with-the-flow kinda guy, and I try to make do with whatever\u2019s on my plate.": u"Mas voc\u00ea me conhece! Sou o tipo de cara que segue o fluxo e tento me virar com o que a vida coloca no meu prato.",
        u"But you must be excited that your retirement is finally here!": u"Mas voc\u00ea deve estar animado porque sua aposentadoria finalmente chegou!",
        u"But you really look like you\u2019re having fun here, sir!": u"Mas o senhor realmente parece estar se divertindo aqui!",
        u"But you really were, sir! How long ago was this?": u"Mas o senhor realmente era! H\u00e1 quanto tempo foi isso?",
        u"But you saying that while you\u2019re handing me your sweat-soaked shirt kinda ruins the mood.": u"Mas voc\u00ea dizer isso enquanto me entrega sua camisa encharcada de suor meio que estraga o momento.",
        u"But you still didn\u2019t answer my question! Why are you out here?": u"Mas voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o respondeu \u00e0 minha pergunta! Por que est\u00e1 aqui fora?",
        u"But you were only trying to protect all of us, sir\u2026": u"Mas o senhor s\u00f3 estava tentando proteger todos n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"But you were using the whole kitchen like a pro! It was super cool!": u"Mas voc\u00ea usou a cozinha inteira como um profissional! Foi muito legal!",
        u"But you're not okay.": u"Mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"But you, Yoichi and Taiga can get so loud and hyper\u2026 Keitaro, Natsumi and I can\u2019t even keep up\u2026": u"Mas voc\u00ea, Yoichi e Taiga ficam t\u00e3o barulhentos e agitados\u2026 Keitaro, Natsumi e eu nem conseguimos acompanhar\u2026",
        u"But you\u2019re doing it to find something she did wrong\u2026 And you\u2019re dragging Jin into this too\u2026": u"Mas voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo isso para achar algo que ela fez de errado\u2026 E tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 arrastando o Jin para isso\u2026",
        u"But you\u2019re doing this for yourself too, Aiden\u2026": u"Mas voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 fazendo isso por si mesmo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"But you\u2019re not who you used to be, sir.": u"Mas o senhor n\u00e3o \u00e9 mais quem costumava ser.",
        u"But you\u2019re right, if we just stay in the room, we\u2019ll probably get bored at some point.": u"Mas voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o: se ficarmos apenas no quarto, provavelmente acabaremos entediados.",
        u"But you\u2019re right. I will try to compare less and embrace what we have uniquely.": u"Mas voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o. Vou tentar comparar menos e valorizar o que temos de \u00fanico.",
        u"But you\u2019re right\u2026 It\u2019s as if she\u2019s forced herself to be here for some reason\u2026": u"Mas voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 \u00c9 como se ela estivesse se obrigando a ficar aqui por algum motivo\u2026",
        u"But you\u2019re so much more than that, Aiden! You\u2019re\u2014": u"Mas voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito mais do que isso, Aiden! Voc\u00ea \u00e9\u2014",
        u"But you\u2019ve done what you can for her now. It\u2019s her turn to realize that talking to her means that you care.": u"Mas agora voc\u00ea fez tudo que podia por ela. \u00c9 a vez dela perceber que o fato de voc\u00ea conversar com ela significa que se importa.",
        u"But you\u2019ve done what you can with her for now. It\u2019s her turn to realize that talking to her means that you care.": u"Mas, por enquanto, voc\u00ea fez tudo o que podia por ela. Agora \u00e9 a vez dela perceber que voc\u00ea conversar com ela significa que se importa.",
        u"But, S-Sir Goro\u2026!": u"Mas, S-Sr. Goro\u2026!",
        u"But, after reviewing the project\u2019s progress over the last two months, I\u2019ve decided that it\u2019s in everyone\u2019s best interest to take a few days off and let loose with a well-deserved break.": u"Mas, depois de analisar o progresso do projeto nos \u00faltimos dois meses, decidi que o melhor para todos \u00e9 tirar alguns dias de folga e relaxar com um descanso mais do que merecido.",
        u"But, even when you did, Aiden\u2026 I felt it in every single day we were together\u2026": u"Mas mesmo quando voc\u00ea fez isso, Aiden\u2026 Eu senti em cada dia que passamos juntos\u2026",
        u"But... Honestly, it\u2019s the other way around. I like how expressive he is. It\u2019s something I wish I was.": u"Mas... Sinceramente, \u00e9 o contr\u00e1rio. Gosto de como ele \u00e9 expressivo. \u00c9 algo que eu gostaria de ser.",
        u"Butterscotch, schnapps, and a whole lotta cream\u2026 ": u"Caramelo, schnapps e creme pra caramba\u2026 ",
        u"But\u2026": u"Mas\u2026",
        u"But\u2026 I also want to make up for all the previous years when I didn't manage Camp Buddy properly as its president.": u"Mas\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m quero compensar todos os anos anteriores em que n\u00e3o administrei o Camp Buddy devidamente como presidente.",
        u"But\u2026 I don\u2019t have insomnia.": u"Mas\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o tenho ins\u00f4nia.",
        u"But\u2026 I need you to know\u2026": u"Mas\u2026 preciso que voc\u00ea saiba\u2026",
        u"But\u2026 I\u2019m very up to date on all the forums! How could I have missed this sale?!": u"Mas\u2026 Estou sempre por dentro de todos os f\u00f3runs! Como pude perder essa venda?!",
        u"But\u2026 I\u2019ve been holding on to this place for so long, believing it\u2019s the only thing that makes all of us happy\u2026": u"Mas\u2026 h\u00e1 tanto tempo venho me agarrando a este lugar, acreditando que ele \u00e9 a \u00fanica coisa que nos faz felizes\u2026",
        u"But\u2026 does that mean we have to wait until we get back to camp?": u"Mas\u2026 isso significa que precisamos esperar at\u00e9 voltar ao acampamento?",
        u"But\u2026 we were in such different times of our lives, so I knew I couldn\u2019t pursue it.": u"Mas\u2026 est\u00e1vamos em momentos t\u00e3o diferentes de nossas vidas que eu sabia que n\u00e3o poderia levar isso adiante.",
        u"But\u2026 you\u2019re not okay, sir.": u"Mas\u2026 o senhor n\u00e3o est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Buuuut since I\u2019m here! I wanna talk to you both!": u"Maaaas j\u00e1 que estou aqui! Quero conversar com voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"By me included~ *wink*": u"Inclusive por mim~ *pisca*",
        u"By the way, Aiden. Is your sauce ready? I need it over here.": u"A prop\u00f3sito, Aiden. Seu molho est\u00e1 pronto? Preciso dele aqui.",
        u"By the way, I forgot to mention, but this might be relevant\u2026 Mr. Clermont called me a while ago\u2026": u"Ali\u00e1s, esqueci de mencionar, mas talvez isso seja importante\u2026 O Sr. Clermont me ligou h\u00e1 pouco\u2026",
        u"By the way, I know I\u2019ve been pretty clear about how much I\u2019ve enjoyed the trip so far, but how about you?": u"Ali\u00e1s, acho que deixei bem claro o quanto estou gostando da viagem at\u00e9 agora, mas e voc\u00ea?",
        u"By the way, aren\u2019t we missing someone from your group\u2026?": u"Ali\u00e1s, n\u00e3o est\u00e1 faltando algu\u00e9m do grupo de voc\u00eas\u2026?",
        u"By the way, look \u2013 my kitchen finally has a fan! It\u2019s funny how I never thought to add one in here before.": u"A prop\u00f3sito, olhe: minha cozinha finalmente tem um ventilador! \u00c9 engra\u00e7ado nunca ter pensado em colocar um aqui antes.",
        u"By the way, where\u2019s Yoshi? He\u2019d normally still be asleep, but it looks like he\u2019s already left.": u"A prop\u00f3sito, onde est\u00e1 o Yoshi? Normalmente ele ainda estaria dormindo, mas parece que j\u00e1 saiu.",
        u"By then, the project is scheduled to be complete! So, please enjoy your time at Camp Buddy for a few more months!": u"At\u00e9 l\u00e1, o projeto estar\u00e1 programado para estar conclu\u00eddo! Ent\u00e3o aproveite mais alguns meses no Camp Buddy!",
        u"By wrong crowd, he means a biker gang~!": u"Quando ele diz pessoas erradas, quer dizer uma gangue de motoqueiros~!",
        u"Bye, guys!": u"At\u00e9 mais, pessoal!",
        u"Bye.": u"At\u00e9.",
        u"Byeeee~!": u"Tchauzinho~!",
        u"C-Calm down, Yuri\u2026 I don\u2019t think she said that just to spite us\u2026": u"A-Acalme-se, Yuri\u2026 N\u00e3o acho que ela tenha dito aquilo s\u00f3 para nos provocar\u2026",
        u"C-Calm down, all of you! And Yoichi, let Taiga pick truth or dare!": u"A-Acalmem-se, todos voc\u00eas! E Yoichi, deixe Taiga escolher verdade ou desafio!",
        u"C-Cameraman?!": u"C-Cinegrafista?!",
        u"C-Can I ask why\u2026?": u"P-Posso perguntar por qu\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"C-Can anyone else stay with me\u2026?  ": u"A-Algu\u00e9m mais pode ficar comigo\u2026?  ",
        u"C-Can\u2019t we just enjoy the meal\u2026? ": u"N-N\u00e3o podemos simplesmente aproveitar a refei\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026? ",
        u"C-Come back down, Aiden\u2026!": u"D-Des\u00e7a de volta, Aiden\u2026!",
        u"C-Come back!!!": u"V-Volte!!!",
        u"C-Could this really be happening?!": u"I-Isso est\u00e1 mesmo acontecendo?!",
        u"C-Cut it out, you guys\u2026!": u"P-Parem com isso, voc\u00eas\u2026!",
        u"CANNONBALL!": u"BOMBAAA!",
        u"Call for distraction.": u"Chamar algu\u00e9m para distrair.",
        u"Call it delusional or cut from reality but it\u2019s what makes me happy. It helped me not to feel alone.": u"Pode chamar de del\u00edrio ou fuga da realidade, mas \u00e9 isso que me faz feliz. Isso me ajudou a n\u00e3o me sentir sozinho.",
        u"Call it sappy, but the way Aiden smiles whenever he\u2019s with you is truly something special.": u"Pode chamar de sentimental, mas a forma como o Aiden sorri sempre que est\u00e1 com voc\u00ea \u00e9 realmente especial.",
        u"Call it whatever, but it\u2019s great to end the trip with a blast! Literally!": u"Chame do que quiser, mas \u00e9 \u00f3timo terminar a viagem com tudo! Literalmente!",
        u"Call me Sous-chef Hyunjin Choi, then.": u"Ent\u00e3o pode me chamar de sous-chef Hyunjin Choi.",
        u"Call me prideful or whatever you want, but my dignity is the only thing that made me fight when I had nothing else!": u"Pode me chamar de orgulhosa ou do que quiser, mas minha dignidade foi a \u00fanica coisa que me fez continuar lutando quando eu n\u00e3o tinha mais nada!",
        u"Calm down, Emilia. There\u2019s nothing to get upset about.": u"Acalme-se, Emilia. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para ficar chateada.",
        u"Calm down, Ms. Komarova. ": u"Acalme-se, Sra. Komarova. ",
        u"Calm down, Yuri. Let the doctor explain everything. ": u"Acalme-se, Yuri. Deixe o m\u00e9dico explicar tudo. ",
        u"Calm down, Yuri\u2026 I don\u2019t think we have to take everything she said so personally.": u"Acalme-se, Yuri\u2026 N\u00e3o precisamos levar tudo que ela disse para o lado pessoal.",
        u"Calm down, Yuri\u2026 It\u2019s not like they\u2019re dying.": u"Calma, Yuri\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eles estivessem morrendo.",
        u"Calm down, dear. We can\u2019t do anything rash.": u"Acalme-se, querida. N\u00e3o podemos fazer nada precipitado.",
        u"Calm down, there\u2019s plenty for everyone~!": u"Calma, tem bastante para todo mundo~!",
        u"Calm down.": u"Acalme-se.",
        u"Camp Buddy will always be here for ya\u2019ll!": u"O Camp Buddy sempre estar\u00e1 aqui para voc\u00eas!",
        u"Camp Buddy will always be here for you all.": u"O Camp Buddy sempre estar\u00e1 aqui para todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Camp Buddy\u2026 This family we built\u2026 And you.": u"Camp Buddy\u2026 Esta fam\u00edlia que constru\u00edmos\u2026 E voc\u00ea.",
        u"Camping.": u"Acampamento.",
        u"Can I see? Can I see?!": u"Posso ver? Posso ver?!",
        u"Can confirm.": u"Confirmo.",
        u"Can somebody tell me what\u2019s going on?": u"Algu\u00e9m pode me dizer o que est\u00e1 acontecendo?",
        u"Can we at least talk\u2026?": u"Podemos pelo menos conversar\u2026?",
        u"Can we just go get the groceries already?! I really don\u2019t wanna spend all day outside on my feet\u2026": u"Podemos simplesmente ir fazer as compras?! Eu realmente n\u00e3o quero passar o dia inteiro em p\u00e9 l\u00e1 fora\u2026",
        u"Can we stop talking about my height already?! I don\u2019t know how we\u2019re always coming back to this topic! ": u"Podemos parar de falar da minha altura de uma vez?! N\u00e3o sei como sempre acabamos voltando a esse assunto! ",
        u"Can we stop talking about the damn offer for one minute?!": u"Podemos parar de falar dessa maldita oferta por um minuto?!",
        u"Can you at least give me a little time to think about what you\u2019re proposing? It\u2019s all very sudden, after all\u2026": u"Pode ao menos me dar um pouco de tempo para considerar sua proposta? Afinal, tudo isso foi muito repentino\u2026",
        u"Can you at least tell me what\u2019s on your mind right now?": u"Pode pelo menos me dizer o que est\u00e1 passando pela sua cabe\u00e7a agora?",
        u"Can you believe we have found ourselves again at the same place?": u"Consegue acreditar que acabamos novamente no mesmo lugar?",
        u"Can you finish in time?": u"Voc\u00ea consegue terminar a tempo?",
        u"Can you kindly escort her to her room, please?": u"Poderia, por gentileza, acompanh\u00e1-la at\u00e9 o quarto?",
        u"Can you really say anything is revealing when you\u2019re naked half the time anyway?": u"D\u00e1 mesmo para chamar alguma coisa de reveladora quando voc\u00ea passa metade do tempo pelado?",
        u"Can you sort these documents and bring them over to the office for me?": u"Pode organizar estes documentos e lev\u00e1-los ao meu escrit\u00f3rio?",
        u"Can\u2019t believe it took me this long to catch it from you, considering how much we\u2019re stuck together. Hahaha!": u"N\u00e3o acredito que demorei tanto para pegar isso de voc\u00ea, considerando o quanto vivemos grudados. Hahaha!",
        u"Can\u2019t help it! I wanna feel these premium sheets rub against my skin!": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar! Quero sentir esses len\u00e7\u00f3is de primeira qualidade ro\u00e7ando na minha pele!",
        u"Can\u2019t imagine myself calling him anything other than Gramps! Well, maybe \u2018Daddy\u2019 fits better!": u"N\u00e3o consigo me imaginar chamando ele de outra coisa al\u00e9m de Vov\u00f4! Bem, talvez \u2018Papai\u2019 combine mais!",
        u"Can\u2019t sleep?": u"N\u00e3o consegue dormir?",
        u"Can\u2019t unsee the stuff he tried to do to my poor stuffed panda\u2026": u"N\u00e3o d\u00e1 para desver as coisas que ele tentou fazer com meu pobre panda de pel\u00facia\u2026",
        u"Can\u2019t you just admit that you\u2019re making a problem when there isn\u2019t one?!": u"N\u00e3o pode simplesmente admitir que est\u00e1 criando um problema onde n\u00e3o existe?!",
        u"Can\u2019t you see the crowd loves it?!": u"N\u00e3o est\u00e1 vendo que o p\u00fablico adora?!",
        u"Can\u2019t you use your dog nose to sniff them out?": u"N\u00e3o pode usar seu nariz de cachorro para farejar?",
        u"Careful what you say, Aiden. Sir Goro\u2019s still in charge! You could get fired with one snap!": u"Cuidado com o que diz, Aiden. O Sr. Goro ainda est\u00e1 no comando! Ele pode demitir voc\u00ea num estalar de dedos!",
        u"Cat\u2019s out of the bag, I guess\u2026": u"Acho que o segredo foi descoberto\u2026",
        u"Ch-Chubby Buddy.": u"B-Buddy Gordinho.",
        u"Chat with Darius": u"Conversar com Darius",
        u"Chat with Lloyd": u"Conversar com Lloyd",
        u"Check on the construction.": u"Verificar a obra.",
        u"Check.": u"Certo.",
        u"Cheers, Yoshinori.": u"Sa\u00fade, Yoshinori.",
        u"Cherishing every moment with my family at camp.": u"Valorizar cada momento com minha fam\u00edlia no acampamento.",
        u"Chill out! Have fun, let loose and don\u2019t think about anything else!": u"Relaxe! Divirta-se, solte-se e n\u00e3o pense em mais nada!",
        u"Chill, Emilia. I\u2019m sure there\u2019s plenty of time for Yoshi to think about all that!": u"Calma, Emilia. Tenho certeza de que Yoshi ainda tem bastante tempo para pensar nisso tudo!",
        u"Chubby Buddy.": u"Buddy Gordinho.",
        u"Clean? Wow\u2026 Emilia, you\u2019re actually taking stuff off my list.": u"Limpar? Uau\u2026 Emilia, voc\u00ea realmente est\u00e1 tirando tarefas da minha lista.",
        u"Clear a spot around you\u2026 Spread your legs\u2026 Hold your axe like this\u2026": u"Limpe o espa\u00e7o ao seu redor\u2026 Afaste as pernas\u2026 Segure o machado assim\u2026",
        u"Clearly, all this time with men affected your sense of fashion too. You barely have anything feminine in your wardrobe!": u"Claramente, todo esse tempo cercada de homens tamb\u00e9m afetou seu senso de moda. Voc\u00ea quase n\u00e3o tem nada feminino no guarda-roupa!",
        u"Close, I\u2019m a Gemini! ": u"Quase, sou de G\u00eameos! ",
        u"Cocoa. Yum.": u"Cacau. Del\u00edcia.",
        u"Coffee? This late at night?": u"Caf\u00e9? T\u00e3o tarde da noite?",
        u"Come and grab me then!": u"Ent\u00e3o venha me pegar!",
        u"Come and have a taste~! Grab \u2019em while they're hot!": u"Venha provar~! Pegue enquanto est\u00e3o quentes!",
        u"Come chill with us for a bit, sir.": u"Venha relaxar um pouco com a gente, senhor.",
        u"Come here then.": u"Ent\u00e3o venha aqui.",
        u"Come here, Dad! Sit with us~!": u"Venha aqui, Pai! Sente-se conosco~!",
        u"Come in, take a seat.": u"Entre, sente-se.",
        u"Come in.": u"Entre.",
        u"Come in~!": u"Entre~!",
        u"Come join us.": u"Venha se juntar a n\u00f3s.",
        u"Come now, Goro. We\u2019re outside the workspace, we can be more personal and call each other by our names!": u"Ora, Goro. Estamos fora do ambiente de trabalho, podemos ser mais informais e nos chamar pelo nome!",
        u"Come on and put it in me already, Yoshi\u2026 ": u"Anda, coloca logo dentro de mim, Yoshi\u2026 ",
        u"Come on you two! Learn to relax, we deserve it after all!": u"Vamos, voc\u00eas dois! Aprendam a relaxar, afinal n\u00f3s merecemos!",
        u"Come on! Don\u2019t be lame, Yoshi!": u"Qual \u00e9! N\u00e3o estrague a brincadeira, Yoshi!",
        u"Come on! Enough distractions, back to the game you two!": u"Vamos! Chega de distra\u00e7\u00f5es, voc\u00eas dois, voltem ao jogo!",
        u"Come on! It\u2019ll be fun! You\u2019ll get in trouble if you just stand there after all!": u"Vamos! Vai ser divertido! Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 problemas se ficar a\u00ed parada!",
        u"Come on! Let\u2019s get on his bunk and work on tonight\u2019s entry! ": u"Vamos! Vamos subir na cama dele e trabalhar na postagem de hoje! ",
        u"Come on, Aiden! Let\u2019s have you try all the flavors first!": u"Vamos, Aiden! Primeiro, voc\u00ea precisa experimentar todos os sabores!",
        u"Come on, Aiden. You should know by now that I can tell when something\u2019s on your mind.": u"Qual \u00e9, Aiden. A essa altura voc\u00ea j\u00e1 deveria saber que percebo quando alguma coisa est\u00e1 incomodando voc\u00ea.",
        u"Come on, Aiden\u2026 Don\u2019t disturb Jin\u2019s work\u2026": u"Vamos, Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o atrapalhe o trabalho do Jin\u2026",
        u"Come on, Aiden\u2026 It\u2019s not all about size.": u"Qual \u00e9, Aiden\u2026 Tamanho n\u00e3o \u00e9 tudo.",
        u"Come on, Aiden\u2026 Let\u2019s get you dressed before\u2014": u"Vamos, Aiden\u2026 Vamos vestir voc\u00ea antes que\u2014",
        u"Come on, Aiden\u2026 Stop teasing me already\u2026": u"Qual \u00e9, Aiden\u2026 Pare de me provocar de uma vez\u2026",
        u"Come on, Dad! I swear I\u2019m not causing trouble! ": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, pai! Juro que n\u00e3o estou causando problemas! ",
        u"Come on, Dar! I wanna get filled up!": u"Vamos, Dar! Quero encher a barriga!",
        u"Come on, Dar! it\u2019s time to do some yoga! Bye, guys!": u"Vamos, Dar! Est\u00e1 na hora do yoga! Tchau, pessoal!",
        u"Come on, Dar. Let\u2019s hit the showers before we get caught up in any more of this.": u"Vamos, Dar. Vamos para os chuveiros antes que nos envolvam ainda mais nisso.",
        u"Come on, Emilia\u2026 We\u2019re on a vacation\u2026 Do you really want to spend your time here being sour?": u"Qual \u00e9, Emilia\u2026 Estamos de f\u00e9rias\u2026 Quer mesmo passar seu tempo aqui de mau humor?",
        u"Come on, Goro. We\u2019re outside the workspace now, we can be more personal and call each other by our names!": u"Qual \u00e9, Goro. Estamos fora do ambiente de trabalho agora; podemos ser mais informais e nos chamar pelo nome!",
        u"Come on, Sir Goro\u2026 Stop teasing me already\u2026": u"Vamos, Sr. Goro\u2026 Pare de me provocar\u2026",
        u"Come on, Yoshi \u2013 I can\u2019t feel the burn any other way~": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi \u2013 n\u00e3o consigo sentir o exerc\u00edcio de outro jeito~",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! Do better than that!": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi! Fa\u00e7a melhor que isso!",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! Don\u2019t be a party pooper, or I\u2019ll strip you myself!": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi! N\u00e3o estrague a divers\u00e3o, ou eu mesmo tiro sua roupa!",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! Don\u2019t look at it that way! Looking up people online is super normal, you know!": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi! N\u00e3o veja dessa forma! Pesquisar pessoas na internet \u00e9 supernormal, sabia?",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! Just because Jin and I are avid fans of the genre doesn\u2019t mean that\u2019s all we think about!": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi! S\u00f3 porque Jin e eu somos f\u00e3s \u00e1vidos do g\u00eanero n\u00e3o significa que s\u00f3 pensamos nisso!",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! We already setup the campsite, what the heck else do ya gotta do?!": u"Vamos, Yoshi! J\u00e1 montamos o acampamento, o que mais voc\u00ea ainda tem que fazer?!",
        u"Come on, Yoshi! You\u2019re like the foundation that keeps us all together here, you know!": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 como a base que mant\u00e9m todos n\u00f3s unidos aqui, sabia?",
        u"Come on, Yoshi. You already know the answer.": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 sabe a resposta.",
        u"Come on, Yoshi. You know I\u2019m kidding.": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea sabe que estou brincando.",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori. Chickening out now?": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshinori. Vai amarelar agora?",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori. Don\u2019t act like this is your first time.": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshinori. N\u00e3o aja como se fosse sua primeira vez.",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori. I know how much you want this\u2026": u"Vamos, Yoshinori. Eu sei o quanto voc\u00ea quer isso\u2026",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori. You don\u2019t have to be so stiff and formal around me. ": u"Ora, Yoshinori. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa ser t\u00e3o r\u00edgido e formal perto de mim. ",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori. it wasn\u2019t even that much\u2026": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshinori. Nem foi tanta coisa assim\u2026",
        u"Come on, Yoshinori\u2026 Show me how much you want it. ": u"Vamos, Yoshinori\u2026 Mostre o quanto voc\u00ea quer isso. ",
        u"Come on, Yoshi~ You\u2019ve been looking at my bod all day after all\u2026": u"Qual \u00e9, Yoshi~ Afinal, voc\u00ea ficou olhando pro meu corpo o dia inteiro\u2026",
        u"Come on, Yuri! Give her a chance! ": u"Vamos, Yuri! D\u00ea uma chance a ela!",
        u"Come on, Yuri! I really need that cooking badge! Come and taste the food I made! ": u"Vamos, Yuri! Eu realmente preciso daquele distintivo de culin\u00e1ria! Venha provar a comida que fiz! ",
        u"Come on, Yuri. We used most of that time to get dressed and have our breakfast.": u"Ora, Yuri. Usamos a maior parte desse tempo para nos vestir e tomar o caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3.",
        u"Come on, all of you. Every body type is good as long as you\u2019re healthy.": u"Vamos, pessoal. Todo tipo de corpo \u00e9 bom, desde que seja saud\u00e1vel.",
        u"Come on, boys! There\u2019s no time! The ceremony will be starting soon!!": u"Vamos, rapazes! N\u00e3o temos tempo! A cerim\u00f4nia vai come\u00e7ar em breve!!",
        u"Come on, cowboy. Let\u2019s see how you handle a hot-blooded bull.": u"Vamos, caub\u00f3i. Quero ver como voc\u00ea lida com um touro de sangue quente.",
        u"Come on, cowboy. Let\u2019s see you take this bull by the horns~": u"Vamos l\u00e1, caub\u00f3i. Quero ver voc\u00ea pegar este touro pelos chifres~",
        u"Come on, don\u2019t be so dramatic!": u"Vamos, n\u00e3o seja t\u00e3o dram\u00e1tica!",
        u"Come on, guys! Hurry up! We have to take a picture on a special day like this!": u"Vamos, pessoal! Depressa! Precisamos tirar uma foto em um dia especial como este!",
        u"Come on, guys! Quit the chit-chat and let\u2019s check out what our room looks like!": u"Vamos, pessoal! Chega de conversa e vamos ver como \u00e9 nosso quarto!",
        u"Come on, guys! That\u2019s why Yoshi\u2019s stepping up to take his place! I\u2019m sure Dad thought all of this out!": u"Qual \u00e9, pessoal! \u00c9 por isso que Yoshi vai assumir o lugar dele! Tenho certeza de que o Pai pensou em tudo!",
        u"Come on, guys. It\u2019s not like Gramps is dying or anything!": u"Qual \u00e9, pessoal. N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se o Vov\u00f4 estivesse morrendo!",
        u"Come on, he\u2019ll get used to it! Besides, everyone else seems to really like it so far!": u"Qual \u00e9, ele vai se acostumar! Al\u00e9m disso, todos os outros parecem estar gostando muito at\u00e9 agora!",
        u"Come on, join us in the pic\u2014": u"Vamos, apare\u00e7a na foto conos\u2014",
        u"Come on, let's hurry up and finish washing off. ": u"Vamos, \u00e9 melhor terminarmos logo de nos lavar. ",
        u"Come on, let\u2019s all get back to the party. ": u"Vamos, vamos todos voltar para a festa. ",
        u"Come on, let\u2019s get you inside. We can watch a nice movie and get it off our minds.": u"Vamos, entre. Podemos assistir a um filme legal e tirar isso da cabe\u00e7a.",
        u"Come on, let\u2019s go see if we can help him wrangle Yoichi and the pups.": u"Vamos, vamos ver se conseguimos ajud\u00e1-lo a controlar o Yoichi e os filhotes.",
        u"Come on, let\u2019s greet our first scout!": u"Vamos receber nosso primeiro escoteiro!",
        u"Come on, let\u2019s just distribute some snacks and water to everyone while we wait!": u"Vamos, podemos distribuir lanches e \u00e1gua para todos enquanto esperamos!",
        u"Come on, lighten up Yoshinori.": u"Vamos, anime-se, Yoshinori.",
        u"Come on, show your hands already! I\u2019m at seven.": u"Vamos, mostrem logo as m\u00e3os! Estou com sete.",
        u"Come on, something\u2019s definitely up! You\u2019ve barely said anything ever since Yuri showed us that picture!": u"Qual \u00e9, alguma coisa est\u00e1 acontecendo! Voc\u00ea quase n\u00e3o falou nada desde que a Yuri nos mostrou aquela foto!",
        u"Come on, that\u2019s enough cheese, you two! We\u2019re having fun tonight!": u"Qual \u00e9, chega de sentimentalismo, voc\u00eas dois! Hoje \u00e0 noite vamos nos divertir!",
        u"Come on, the wood\u2019s not even hard at all! Put some more force into it!": u"Vamos, a madeira nem \u00e9 t\u00e3o dura! Coloque mais for\u00e7a nisso!",
        u"Come on, they\u2019re over here!": u"Vamos, est\u00e3o aqui!",
        u"Come on, this checklist won\u2019t check itself!": u"Vamos, esta lista n\u00e3o vai se conferir sozinha!",
        u"Come on, where\u2019s that overflowing enthusiasm you had back then? ": u"Ora, onde est\u00e1 todo aquele entusiasmo transbordante que voc\u00ea tinha naquela \u00e9poca? ",
        u"Come on, you don\u2019t have to rub it in my face, Yuri.": u"Qual \u00e9, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa jogar isso na minha cara, Yuri.",
        u"Come on, you guys. You\u2019re not supposed to discourage him.": u"Qual \u00e9, pessoal. Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o deveriam desencoraj\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Come on, you should be used to me being half naked most of the time by now!": u"Qual \u00e9, a esta altura voc\u00ea j\u00e1 deveria estar acostumado a me ver seminu quase o tempo todo!",
        u"Come on, you two\u2026 ": u"Qual \u00e9, voc\u00eas dois\u2026 ",
        u"Come on, you're not very discreet or the 'cleanest' either. You\u2019ve leaving traces all over the place.": u"Qual \u00e9, voc\u00eas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o muito discretos nem exatamente os mais 'limpinhos'. Andam deixando rastros por todo lado.",
        u"Come on. You think I haven\u2019t noticed how you\u2019re calling him by just his name now?": u"Ah, qual \u00e9. Acha que eu n\u00e3o percebi que agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 chamando ele s\u00f3 pelo nome?",
        u"Come on. You think I haven\u2019t noticed how you\u2019re calling him by just his name now?{fast}": u"Ah, qual \u00e9. Acha que eu n\u00e3o percebi que agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 chamando ele s\u00f3 pelo nome?{fast}",
        u"Come onnn!!! We rarely have this many people around during the winter season! And besides, the holidays are just around the corner!": u"Qual \u00e9\u00e9\u00e9!!! Raramente temos tanta gente aqui durante o inverno! Al\u00e9m disso, as festas de fim de ano est\u00e3o logo a\u00ed!",
        u"Come ooon!!! We rarely have this many people around during the winter season! And besides, the holidays are just around the corner!": u"Qual \u00e9\u00e9\u00e9!!! Raramente temos tanta gente por aqui durante o inverno! Al\u00e9m disso, as festas de fim de ano est\u00e3o logo a\u00ed!",
        u"Come over and lay down here then. The bed\u2019s really comfortable.": u"Ent\u00e3o venha se deitar aqui. A cama \u00e9 muito confort\u00e1vel.",
        u"Come over here. I want to see your costume.": u"Venha aqui. Quero ver sua fantasia.",
        u"Come to think of it\u2026 How come we haven't done a background check on Emilia after all this time?": u"Pensando bem\u2026 Como \u00e9 que nunca fizemos uma pesquisa sobre o passado da Emilia depois de todo esse tempo?",
        u"Come with me for a moment. I\u2019d like to talk about something.": u"Venha comigo por um momento. Gostaria de conversar sobre uma coisa.",
        u"Come with me to the office and let\u2019s calm your nerves a bit with some tea.": u"Venha comigo ao escrit\u00f3rio. Vamos acalmar seus nervos com um pouco de ch\u00e1.",
        u"Come with me, Yoshinori.": u"Venha comigo, Yoshinori.",
        u"Come with me, Yoshinori. ": u"Venha comigo, Yoshinori. ",
        u"Come with me, it\u2019s almost time.": u"Venha comigo, est\u00e1 quase na hora.",
        u"Come with me, scouts. Let\u2019s get crafting.": u"Venham comigo, escoteiros. Vamos trabalhar.",
        u"Come with me, you two! I have party games to play with everyone!": u"Venham comigo, voc\u00eas dois! Tenho jogos de festa para brincar com todo mundo!",
        u"Come, Jin.": u"Venha, Jin.",
        u"Come, Yoshinori. Sit next to me.": u"Venha, Yoshinori. Sente-se ao meu lado.",
        u"Coming right up!": u"Saindo!",
        u"Coming. Just a sec!": u"J\u00e1 vou. S\u00f3 um segundo!",
        u"Compared to Camp Buddy, this is a completely different world.": u"Comparado ao Camp Buddy, este \u00e9 um mundo completamente diferente.",
        u"Congratulations again, Sir Goro!": u"Parab\u00e9ns novamente, senhor Goro!",
        u"Congratulations on finally being a part of Camp Buddy, Aiden!": u"Parab\u00e9ns por finalmente fazer parte do Camp Buddy, Aiden!",
        u"Congratulations, you two! You make quite the wonderful couple!": u"Parab\u00e9ns aos dois! Voc\u00eas formam um casal maravilhoso!",
        u"Consequently, all shuttles have been cancelled due to these conditions.": u"Consequentemente, todos os transportes foram cancelados devido a essas condi\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Consider it an open opportunity should Mr. Nomoru ever change his mind.": u"Considere a proposta em aberto caso o Sr. Nomoru mude de ideia algum dia.",
        u"Consider it an open opportunity should you ever change your mind.": u"Considere-a uma oportunidade em aberto caso algum dia mude de ideia.",
        u"Consider it done then! Yuri and I can arrange that with the president! *wink*": u"Ent\u00e3o, considere resolvido! Yuri e eu podemos acertar isso com o presidente! *pisca*",
        u"Consider this as part of the sponsorship. All you\u2019ll need to do as the camp president is give me your approval on the upgrade plans we proposed.": u"Considere isso parte do patroc\u00ednio. Tudo o que precisar\u00e1 fazer como presidente do acampamento \u00e9 aprovar os planos de melhorias que propusemos.",
        u"Consider yourself finished. I don\u2019t want you at this dinner, at Camp Buddy, or in my sight ever again.": u"Considere-se acabada. N\u00e3o quero voc\u00ea neste jantar, no Camp Buddy nem diante dos meus olhos nunca mais.",
        u"Considering how fancy everything was so far, I think that\u2019s what they were going for!": u"Considerando como tudo foi sofisticado at\u00e9 agora, acho que era essa a inten\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Considering the book\u2019s success, I\u2019ve personally offered Mr. Nagame here a percentage of the sales.": u"Considerando o sucesso do livro, ofereci pessoalmente ao Sr. Nagame uma porcentagem das vendas.",
        u"Cooking isn't my strongest suit.": u"Cozinhar n\u00e3o \u00e9 o meu ponto forte.",
        u"Cooking was the thing we bonded over, but it actually led me to you\u2026": u"A culin\u00e1ria foi o que nos uniu, mas ela tamb\u00e9m me levou at\u00e9 voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Cool! With Darius on our team, this will be a piece of cake!": u"Legal! Com Darius na equipe, isso vai ser moleza!",
        u"Could we please, PLEASE, change the topic?!": u"Podemos, por favor, POR FAVOR, mudar de assunto?!",
        u"Count Dar and I out! We aren\u2019t stripping when it\u2019s this cold out!": u"Eu e Dar estamos fora! N\u00e3o vamos tirar a roupa com esse frio!",
        u"Count me out! Arts and crafts are for nerds!": u"Estou fora! Artes e trabalhos manuais s\u00e3o coisa de nerd!",
        u"Couples dancing to the music, sharing a glass of wine, and all the fancy food they can eat!": u"Casais dan\u00e7ando ao som da m\u00fasica, compartilhando uma ta\u00e7a de vinho e comendo toda a comida chique que quiserem!",
        u"Court records show that they scammed their clients out of a lot of money, resulting in a bunch of lawsuits that stretched out for a couple of years\u2026": u"Os registros judiciais mostram que eles enganaram clientes e tiraram muito dinheiro deles, o que resultou em v\u00e1rios processos que se arrastaram por alguns anos\u2026",
        u"Cream\u2026 Pie\u2026": u"Creampie\u2026",
        u"Creating a fire is especially helpful, as the smoke could help rescue teams locate you faster. ": u"Acender uma fogueira \u00e9 especialmente \u00fatil, pois a fuma\u00e7a pode ajudar as equipes de resgate a encontr\u00e1-los mais rapidamente. ",
        u"Cringe.": u"Que vergonha alheia.",
        u"Cross your fingers.": u"Cruze os dedos.",
        u"Cum for me, Y-Yoshinori\u2026!": u"Goze para mim, Y-Yoshinori\u2026!",
        u"Cut out the ageism, Aiden.": u"Pare com esse preconceito de idade, Aiden.",
        u"C\u2019mon, Gramps! You never do stuff with us!": u"Qual \u00e9, Vov\u00f4! Voc\u00ea nunca faz nada com a gente!",
        u"C\u2026Cute\u2026": u"F\u2026Fofo\u2026",
        u"D-DO YOU NEED A WHEELCHAIR?! OR PERHAPS COLON SURGERY?!": u"V-VOC\u00ca PRECISA DE UMA CADEIRA DE RODAS?! OU TALVEZ DE UMA CIRURGIA NO C\u00d3LON?!",
        u"D-Dad! Shhh!": u"P-Pai! Shhh!",
        u"D-Dad?!": u"P-Pai?!",
        u"D-Dad\u2026 No\u2026 Please\u2026 Stop\u2026.": u"P-Pai\u2026 N\u00e3o\u2026 Por favor\u2026 Pare\u2026.",
        u"D-Dad\u2026! ": u"P-Pai\u2026! ",
        u"D-Dar! Don\u2019t throw me under the bus like that!": u"D-Dar! N\u00e3o me entregue desse jeito!",
        u"D-Dar! You\u2019re damaging my reputation as an architect!": u"D-Dar! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 acabando com minha reputa\u00e7\u00e3o de arquiteto!",
        u"D-Did you just call me Stutters\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00ea acabou de me chamar de Gaguinho\u2026?",
        u"D-Did you tell Mr. Clermont about this yet, Dad\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 contou isso ao Sr. Clermont, pai\u2026?",
        u"D-Do those balls jingle?": u"E-Essas bolas fazem barulho?",
        u"D-Do you just carry that around\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00ea simplesmente carrega isso por a\u00ed\u2026?",
        u"D-Do you really carry that around all the time, Yuri\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00ea realmente carrega isso o tempo todo, Yuri\u2026?",
        u"D-Does it feel good, Aiden\u2026?": u"E-Est\u00e1 gostoso, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"D-Doesn\u2019t that upset you\u2026?": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o o deixa triste\u2026?",
        u"D-Don\u2019t get me wrong, I am grateful for all her help.": u"N-N\u00e3o me entenda mal, sou grata por toda a ajuda dela.",
        u"D-Don\u2019t get me wrong, it really suits you. You look really good in it, in fact\u2026": u"N-N\u00e3o me entenda mal, ela combina muito com voc\u00ea. Na verdade, voc\u00ea fica muito bonito nela\u2026",
        u"D-Don\u2019t get the wrong idea, Aiden\u2026 I\u2019m not trying to be disrespectful to him, he\u2019s still our camp president!": u"N-N\u00e3o entenda errado, Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o estou tentando desrespeit\u00e1-lo, ele ainda \u00e9 o presidente do acampamento!",
        u"D-Don\u2019t listen to her, Aiden, I made a really yummy pizza back in the kitchen! If you come with me, I\u2019ll let you have the whole thing!": u"N-N\u00e3o d\u00ea ouvidos a ela, Aiden. Fiz uma pizza muito gostosa na cozinha! Se vier comigo, deixarei que coma tudo!",
        u"D-Don\u2019t listen to him, Jin\u2026 He\u2019s just messing with you. ": u"N-N\u00e3o d\u00ea ouvidos a ele, Jin\u2026 Ele s\u00f3 est\u00e1 brincando com voc\u00ea. ",
        u"D-Don\u2019t worry, everyone! I\u2019m sure he\u2019ll be back someday!": u"N-N\u00e3o se preocupem, pessoal! Tenho certeza de que ele voltar\u00e1 algum dia!",
        u"D-Don\u2019t worry\u2026 It\u2019s actually her public profile we\u2019re looking at\u2026 So, we\u2019re not invading her privacy at all\u2026": u"N-N\u00e3o se preocupe\u2026 Na verdade, estamos olhando o perfil p\u00fablico dela\u2026 Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o estamos invadindo a privacidade de ningu\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"D-Don\u2019t worry\u2026! I took care of it. ": u"N-N\u00e3o se preocupe\u2026! Eu cuidei de tudo. ",
        u"D-don\u2019t pity me! I\u2026 I don\u2019t need sympathy\u2026": u"N-N\u00e3o tenha pena de mim! Eu\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o preciso de compaix\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"DAMN! You grew, like, a thousand feet tall! I barely recognized you!": u"CARALHO! Voc\u00ea cresceu uns trezentos metros! Mal o reconheci!",
        u"DEAL!  Ohohoho, put your ugly-crying face on, \u2019cause I\u2019m the obvious winner when it comes to booze, Gramps!": u"FECHADO!  Ohohoho, prepara essa sua cara feia de choro, porque quando o assunto \u00e9 bebida, o vencedor \u00f3bvio sou eu, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"DO I LOOK LIKE I CARE?! There\u2019s no way I\u2019ll miss all of the action!!": u"PARECE QUE EU ME IMPORTO?! N\u00e3o vou perder toda essa a\u00e7\u00e3o de jeito nenhum!!",
        u"DOESN\u2019T MATTER! DO IT, TAIGA! SHOW US YOU\u2019RE A REAL MAN!": u"N\u00c3O IMPORTA! FA\u00c7A, TAIGA! MOSTRE QUE \u00c9 HOMEM DE VERDADE!",
        u"Dad already did this once after you left the first term\u2026 Keeping everything to himself, and pushing everyone away\u2026": u"O Pai j\u00e1 fez isso uma vez depois que voc\u00ea foi embora na primeira temporada\u2026 Guardando tudo para si e afastando todo mundo\u2026",
        u"Dad always made sure to cook something special for me after coming home from work.": u"Meu pai sempre fazia quest\u00e3o de preparar algo especial para mim quando voltava do trabalho.",
        u"Dad and I got woken up last night as soon as it hit. But we didn\u2019t think it\u2019d be this bad.": u"Meu pai e eu acordamos ontem \u00e0 noite assim que come\u00e7ou. Mas n\u00e3o imagin\u00e1vamos que seria t\u00e3o ruim.",
        u"Dad left super early a while ago\u2026 He said he\u2019s gonna run some errands\u2026 He didn\u2019t tell me what they were though\u2026": u"O papai saiu muito cedo\u2026 Disse que resolveria algumas coisas\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o contou o qu\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Dad said she\u2019s from a very wealthy family\u2026 I don\u2019t think she\u2019s used to a more \u201crustic\u201d lifestyle\u2026": u"Papai disse que ela vem de uma fam\u00edlia muito rica\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 acostumada a um estilo de vida mais \u201cr\u00fastico\u201d\u2026",
        u"Dad! She\u2019s not worth it!!": u"Pai! Ela n\u00e3o vale a pena!!",
        u"Dad!!! Mom!!! What\u2019s taking you so long?!": u"Pai!!! M\u00e3e!!! Por que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o demorando tanto?!",
        u"Dad, Yoshi! What\u2019s taking you guys so\u2014": u"Pai, Yoshi! Por que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o demorando tan\u2014",
        u"Dad...": u"Pai...",
        u"Daddy Yoshi.": u"Papai Yoshi.",
        u"Daddy mode on.": u"Modo papai ativado.",
        u"Dad\u2026": u"Pai\u2026",
        u"Dad\u2026 ": u"Pai\u2026",
        u"Dad\u2026 It\u2019s not your fault\u2026 ": u"Pai\u2026 N\u00e3o foi culpa sua\u2026 ",
        u"Dad\u2026!! H-How\u2019s Emilia?! What\u2019s her status?": u"Pai\u2026!! C-Como est\u00e1 Emilia?! Qual \u00e9 o estado dela?",
        u"Dammit\u2026 Scissors.": u"Droga\u2026 Tesoura.",
        u"Damn it\u2026 I can\u2019t believe you two saw me like that\u2026": u"Droga\u2026 N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00eas dois me viram daquele jeito\u2026",
        u"Damn!": u"Droga!",
        u"Damn! I scored one with you and I barely even remember, hahaha!": u"Caramba! Consegui transar com voc\u00ea e mal me lembro, hahaha!",
        u"Damn, look at all this cool stuff! They have a spa, caf\u00e9, gym and, oooh! A bar!": u"Caramba, veja quantas coisas legais! Tem spa, caf\u00e9, academia e, oooh! Um bar!",
        u"Damn, my whole body hurts\u2026 We got too wild last night\u2026": u"Droga, meu corpo inteiro est\u00e1 doendo\u2026 N\u00f3s exageramos demais ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"Damn\u2026 All of a sudden, you\u2019re the coolest guy in the camp, Gramps\u2026": u"Droga\u2026 De repente voc\u00ea virou o cara mais legal do acampamento, Vov\u00f4\u2026",
        u"Damn\u2026 Does every single place in this building have to be so extra? ": u"Caramba\u2026 Todo lugar neste pr\u00e9dio precisa ser t\u00e3o extravagante? ",
        u"Damn\u2026 I came so much\u2026 This is such a mess\u2026": u"Droga\u2026 Eu gozei tanto\u2026 Que bagun\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"Damn\u2026 you even oiled yourself up, Aiden\u2026 ": u"Caramba\u2026 voc\u00ea at\u00e9 passou \u00f3leo no corpo, Aiden\u2026 ",
        u"Dang it. You know me too well.": u"Droga. Voc\u00ea me conhece bem demais.",
        u"Dar and I plan to apply as scoutmasters, so you don\u2019t have to worry about us either!": u"Eu e Dar planejamos nos candidatar a chefes escoteiros, ent\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o precisam se preocupar conosco!",
        u"Dar! You do it!": u"Dar! Fa\u00e7a voc\u00ea!",
        u"Dar, I left that out for a reason, you know\u2026": u"Dar, eu omiti essa parte por um motivo, sabia\u2026",
        u"Dare, duh! What else would it be?": u"Desafio, d\u00e3! O que mais seria?",
        u"Darius and Lloyd might need an extra pair of hands with the repairs.": u"Darius e Lloyd podem precisar de uma ajuda extra com os reparos.",
        u"Darius does like to tease.": u"Darius realmente gosta de provocar.",
        u"Darius has always been a super crafty guy, even back when we were scouts! He actually gave me my first lesson in carpentry, and I\u2019ve still got those skills!  ": u"Darius sempre foi muito habilidoso, mesmo quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros! Na verdade, foi ele quem me deu minha primeira aula de carpintaria, e ainda tenho essas habilidades!  ",
        u"Darius is really lucky he has you, Lloyd.": u"Darius tem muita sorte de ter voc\u00ea, Lloyd.",
        u"Darius usually has trouble sleeping sometimes as well, and it works wonders for him.": u"Darius tamb\u00e9m tem dificuldade para dormir \u00e0s vezes, e isso faz maravilhas para ele.",
        u"Darius, my man! The one who\u2019s had the most \u201cgrowth\u201d out of all of us~": u"Darius, meu camarada! O que teve o maior \u201ccrescimento\u201d entre todos n\u00f3s~",
        u"Dar\u2026 you didn\u2019t have to put it so bluntly\u2026": u"Dar\u2026 voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisava falar de forma t\u00e3o direta\u2026",
        u"Definitely! I was already planning to make the expansion project my next feature on there!": u"Com certeza! Eu j\u00e1 estava planejando transformar o projeto de expans\u00e3o na pr\u00f3xima mat\u00e9ria do site!",
        u"Definitely, especially with all of these entertainers.": u"Com certeza, principalmente com todos esses artistas.",
        u"Definitely. We encourage our campers to engage with one another on a personal level.": u"Sem d\u00favida. Incentivamos nossos campistas a interagir pessoalmente uns com os outros.",
        u"Depends on how you play with them. ": u"Depende de como voc\u00ea brinca com elas. ",
        u"Depends on what your definition of a \u2018party game\u2019 is.": u"Depende do que voc\u00ea considera um \u2018jogo de festa\u2019.",
        u"Despite all of my shortcomings and the mistakes I\u2019ve made\u2026 you were the best thing that ever happened to me\u2026": u"Apesar de todas as minhas falhas e dos erros que cometi\u2026 voc\u00ea foi a melhor coisa que j\u00e1 me aconteceu\u2026",
        u"Despite all of us being so busy working on this project, I could see from Aiden\u2019s eyes that he was having the time of his life.": u"Apesar de todos estarmos t\u00e3o ocupados com este projeto, eu conseguia ver nos olhos do Aiden que ele estava vivendo um dos melhores momentos da vida.",
        u"Despite all the struggles we\u2019ve had and the times that things got muddled between us\u2026 You always stayed\u2026": u"Apesar de todas as dificuldades que enfrentamos e das vezes em que as coisas ficaram confusas entre n\u00f3s\u2026 Voc\u00ea sempre ficou\u2026",
        u"Despite how I acted\u2026 Thank you all for keeping an open mind\u2026": u"Apesar de como agi\u2026 Obrigado a todos por manterem a mente aberta\u2026",
        u"Dibs on Yoshi~!": u"Yoshi \u00e9 meu~!",
        u"Dibs on the window seat.": u"Eu fico com o lugar na janela.",
        u"Did I hear tissues?! The cleanliness police are here to the rescue!": u"Ouvi algu\u00e9m falar em len\u00e7os?! A pol\u00edcia da limpeza chegou para salvar o dia!",
        u"Did I interrupt your cuddle session, lovebirds?": u"Interrompi a sess\u00e3o de carinho de voc\u00eas, pombinhos?",
        u"Did I stutter? I said, You\u2019re. A. BITCH.": u"Eu gaguejei? Eu disse: Voc\u00ea. \u00c9. Uma. VADIA.",
        u"Did Mr. Clermont say anything else to you\u2026? ": u"O Sr. Clermont disse mais alguma coisa\u2026? ",
        u"Did any of those spark an interest for you? ": u"Alguma dessas op\u00e7\u00f5es despertou seu interesse? ",
        u"Did everything go according to schedule today?": u"Tudo correu conforme o cronograma hoje?",
        u"Did he go to sleep like this\u2026?!": u"Ele foi dormir desse jeito\u2026?!",
        u"Did he just call Aiden a\u2026 fool?": u"Ele acabou de chamar Aiden de\u2026 louco?",
        u"Did he tell you why he wanted to do it?": u"Ele disse por que queria fazer isso?",
        u"Did somebody say BUILDING?!": u"Algu\u00e9m disse CONSTRUIR?!",
        u"Did something happen\u2026?": u"Aconteceu alguma coisa\u2026?",
        u"Did you accept? It sounds like you didn\u2019t give him an answer yet.": u"Voc\u00ea aceitou? Parece que ainda n\u00e3o deu uma resposta a ele.",
        u"Did you check if he\u2019s in the mess hall? Maybe he\u2019s having his coffee.": u"Voc\u00ea verificou o refeit\u00f3rio? Talvez esteja tomando caf\u00e9.",
        u"Did you ever expect Camp Buddy to blow up like this, sir?": u"O senhor alguma vez imaginou que o Camp Buddy cresceria tanto assim?",
        u"Did you just make that up\u2026?": u"Voc\u00ea acabou de inventar isso\u2026?",
        u"Did you just say \u2018fuck\u2019?": u"Voc\u00ea acabou de dizer \u2018foder\u2019?",
        u"Did you know about this, Mr. Nomoru? Mr. Nagira?": u"Voc\u00eas sabiam disso, Sr. Nomoru? Sr. Nagira?",
        u"Did you not hear what I said?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o ouviu o que eu disse?",
        u"Did you really send me here just to punish me?! ": u"Voc\u00eas realmente me mandaram para c\u00e1 s\u00f3 para me castigar?! ",
        u"Did you really think they\u2019d serve pizza in a place like this? You really are out of touch!": u"Voc\u00ea realmente achou que serviriam pizza num lugar assim? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 mesmo por fora!",
        u"Did you take her up on the offer?": u"Voc\u00ea aceitou a oferta dela?",
        u"Did you two have a group \u2018workout\u2019 yesterday?": u"Voc\u00eas dois fizeram um \u2018treino\u2019 em grupo ontem?",
        u"Did you warn him that you\u2026 uhh\u2026 do \u201cthis\u201d to cool down?": u"Voc\u00ea o avisou que\u2026 hum\u2026 faz \u201cisso\u201d para se refrescar?",
        u"Did you\u2026 accept her offer?": u"Voc\u00ea\u2026 aceitou a proposta?",
        u"Didn\u2019t I just tell you that\u2019s what I like best~?": u"Eu n\u00e3o acabei de dizer que \u00e9 justamente disso que eu mais gosto~?",
        u"Didn\u2019t I tell you I wanted to take my time? ": u"Eu n\u00e3o disse que queria fazer isso com calma? ",
        u"Didn\u2019t Lloyd say he was done with yoga?": u"Lloyd n\u00e3o disse que j\u00e1 tinha terminado o yoga?",
        u"Didn\u2019t we just have a party last night? This seems like an excuse to have another one. ": u"N\u00f3s n\u00e3o acabamos de ter uma festa ontem \u00e0 noite? Isso parece uma desculpa para fazer outra. ",
        u"Didn\u2019t you add some custom body paint as well?": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o acrescentou uma pintura corporal personalizada?",
        u"Didn\u2019t you see me back there? I didn\u2019t know how to answer everyone\u2019s questions about the only thing I\u2019m supposed to be good at!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o me viu l\u00e1? Eu n\u00e3o sabia responder \u00e0s perguntas de todo mundo sobre a \u00fanica coisa em que eu deveria ser bom!",
        u"Didn\u2019t you see the look on that masseur\u2019s face when he called him? The guy was totally checking him out!": u"N\u00e3o viu a express\u00e3o do massagista quando o chamou? O cara estava devorando ele com os olhos!",
        u"Ding dong. ": u"Ding-dong. ",
        u"Ding, ding, dick!": u"Ding, ding, pau!",
        u"Dismissed!": u"Dispensados!",
        u"Disrespect me all you want, but it\u2019s not going to change how hopelessly rotten you are inside and out!": u"Pode me desrespeitar o quanto quiser, mas isso n\u00e3o vai mudar o quanto voc\u00ea \u00e9 irremediavelmente podre por dentro e por fora!",
        u"Do I ever!!": u"\u00c9 claro que quero!!",
        u"Do I need to use two shovels?": u"Preciso usar duas p\u00e1s?",
        u"Do I really have to answer this, Aiden?!": u"Eu realmente tenho que responder, Aiden?!",
        u"Do I really have to close my eyes?": u"Eu realmente preciso fechar os olhos?",
        u"Do it for your dad!": u"Fa\u00e7a isso pelo seu pai!",
        u"Do me a favor and watch over him so that he doesn\u2019t sneak off and get one behind my back.": u"Fa\u00e7a-me um favor e fique de olho nele para que n\u00e3o saia escondido e fa\u00e7a uma tatuagem pelas minhas costas.",
        u"Do note that these due dates are GENEROUSLY calculated, so I\u2019m expecting nothing less than for everyone to STRICTLY follow the schedule.": u"Observem que esses prazos foram calculados GENEROSAMENTE, ent\u00e3o espero nada menos que todos sigam RIGOROSAMENTE o cronograma.",
        u"Do the right thing for once, and keep everyone else out of your midlife crisis!": u"Fa\u00e7a a coisa certa pelo menos uma vez e deixe todo mundo fora da sua crise de meia-idade!",
        u"Do you guys think there\u2019s something wrong\u2026?": u"Voc\u00eas acham que aconteceu alguma coisa\u2026?",
        u"Do you have any idea how much that camera means to me?! My dad gave it to me for my birthday!!!": u"Voc\u00ea faz ideia do quanto essa c\u00e2mera significa para mim?! Meu pai me deu ela de anivers\u00e1rio!!!",
        u"Do you have everything you need?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com tudo de que precisa?",
        u"Do you have your bike fully checked and tuned up? It\u2019s going to be a long drive to where you\u2019re going.": u"Sua moto foi totalmente revisada e ajustada? Vai ser uma viagem longa at\u00e9 onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1 indo.",
        u"Do you mean from the cooking, or\u2026?": u"Voc\u00ea quer dizer cozinhando, ou\u2026?",
        u"Do you miss the times when you were in your biker group?": u"O senhor sente falta da \u00e9poca em que fazia parte do grupo de motociclistas?",
        u"Do you miss those times?": u"Sente falta daquela \u00e9poca?",
        u"Do you need any help checking your bags, Sir Goro?": u"Precisa de ajuda para conferir suas malas, Sr. Goro?",
        u"Do you need help or am I distracting you from the inspection?": u"Precisa de ajuda ou estou distraindo voc\u00ea da inspe\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Do you need me to wash your back again?": u"Precisa que eu lave suas costas de novo?",
        u"Do you really want canned beer in a place like this? Take a look at our menu~!": u"Querem mesmo cerveja em lata num lugar assim? Deem uma olhada no nosso card\u00e1pio~!",
        u"Do you really want to wait until it becomes a problem? It\u2019s better to deal with it now.": u"Voc\u00ea realmente quer esperar at\u00e9 isso virar um problema? \u00c9 melhor resolver agora.",
        u"Do you seriously believe I\u2019m the kind of person who just gives up?!": u"Voc\u00ea realmente acha que sou o tipo de pessoa que simplesmente desiste?!",
        u"Do you want me to hug you also?": u"Quer que eu abrace voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"Do you want me to wash your back? Or shampoo your hair?": u"Quer que eu lave suas costas? Ou passe xampu no seu cabelo?",
        u"Do you want to help us set up tents?": u"Quer nos ajudar a montar as barracas?",
        u"Do you want to wait until a serious concern arises? Do you want to break Mr. Clermont\u2019s trust on this project? I assume the answer to both is no.": u"Querem esperar at\u00e9 surgir um problema s\u00e9rio? Querem perder a confian\u00e7a do Sr. Clermont neste projeto? Suponho que a resposta a ambas seja n\u00e3o.",
        u"Does Sir Goro drink this much usually\u2026?": u"O Sr. Goro costuma beber tanto assim\u2026?",
        u"Does Yoichi realize that it doesn\u2019t work that way\u2026? We\u2019ll get food regardless of how much we shovel\u2026": u"Ser\u00e1 que Yoichi percebe que n\u00e3o funciona assim\u2026? Vamos receber comida independentemente de quanto retirarmos de neve\u2026",
        u"Does everyone else have their order ready as well?": u"Os demais j\u00e1 est\u00e3o prontos para fazer seus pedidos?",
        u"Does that leave me sharing rooms with you-know-who\u2026?": u"Isso significa que vou dividir o quarto com voc\u00ea-sabe-quem\u2026?",
        u"Does that make him a world-renowned author now? Haha!": u"Isso faz dele um autor mundialmente famoso agora? Haha!",
        u"Does that mean she\u2019s broke\u2026 and homeless\u2026?": u"Isso significa que ela est\u00e1 sem dinheiro\u2026 e sem casa\u2026?",
        u"Does that mean we gotta wait \u2019til spring to work again?": u"Isso significa que temos que esperar at\u00e9 a primavera para voltar ao trabalho?",
        u"Does that mean we won\u2019t tell on her then\u2026?": u"Isso significa que n\u00e3o vamos contar sobre ela, ent\u00e3o\u2026?",
        u"Does that mean we\u2019ll have to wait until spring to resume work?": u"Isso significa que teremos que esperar at\u00e9 a primavera para retomar o trabalho?",
        u"Does that mean you\u2019re good to wash up with us now?": u"Isso quer dizer que agora voc\u00ea vai tomar banho com a gente?",
        u"Does this mean we can\u2019t go home\u2026?": u"Isso significa que n\u00e3o podemos voltar para casa\u2026?",
        u"Does this mean you\u2019ll let me split wood now too, Sir Goro?!": u"Isso quer dizer que agora vai me deixar rachar lenha tamb\u00e9m, Sr. Goro?!",
        u"Doing what? ": u"Fazendo o qu\u00ea? ",
        u"Dominance.": u"Domina\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Don't doubt yourself.": u"N\u00e3o duvide de si mesmo.",
        u"Don't miss the chance.": u"N\u00e3o deixe essa chance passar.",
        u"Don't put words in my mouth!": u"N\u00e3o coloque palavras na minha boca!",
        u"Don't rope Sir Goro into this.": u"N\u00e3o envolva o Sr. Goro nisso.",
        u"Don't worry, I've checked your list twice and I know exactly what to give~": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, conferi sua lista duas vezes e sei exatamente o que dar~",
        u"Don't worry, there's not that much stuff to do now that it's off-season. I only have to feed what, like... six people?": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 tanta coisa para fazer agora que estamos na baixa temporada. S\u00f3 preciso alimentar o qu\u00ea\u2026 umas seis pessoas?",
        u"Don\u2019t act like you didn\u2019t enjoy being here with us, Emilia! You were always the first one up doing all the chores!": u"N\u00e3o finja que n\u00e3o gostou de ficar aqui conosco, Emilia! Voc\u00ea sempre era a primeira a levantar para fazer as tarefas!",
        u"Don\u2019t act so innocent, Yoshinori \u2013 We both know why you\u2019ve been staring at me this whole time.": u"N\u00e3o se fa\u00e7a de inocente, Yoshinori \u2014 n\u00f3s dois sabemos por que voc\u00ea ficou me encarando esse tempo todo.",
        u"Don\u2019t be shy, Darius! We all have dicks too!": u"N\u00e3o fique com vergonha, Darius! Todos n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m temos pau!",
        u"Don\u2019t be shy, Lloyd! Go straight for that sweet surprise he\u2019s hiding, I\u2019m sure it\u2019s extra-large and full of flavor!": u"N\u00e3o seja t\u00edmido, Lloyd! V\u00e1 direto para a doce surpresa que ele est\u00e1 escondendo, tenho certeza de que \u00e9 extragrande e cheia de sabor!",
        u"Don\u2019t be shy, Lloyd. ": u"N\u00e3o fique t\u00edmido, Lloyd.",
        u"Don\u2019t be silly, Aiden. It\u2019s nothing like that! I\u2019m just getting away from Dad for a little while.": u"N\u00e3o seja bobo, Aiden. N\u00e3o \u00e9 nada disso! S\u00f3 estou me afastando do meu pai por um tempinho.",
        u"Don\u2019t be silly, Aiden. You could\u2019ve gotten seriously hurt.": u"N\u00e3o seja bobo, Aiden. Voc\u00ea poderia ter se machucado seriamente.",
        u"Don\u2019t be so shallow, Aiden!": u"N\u00e3o seja t\u00e3o superficial, Aiden!",
        u"Don\u2019t be stupid, they\u2019ll starve to death here! They\u2019re coming with us, whether you like it or not. ": u"N\u00e3o seja idiota, eles morreriam de fome aqui! Eles v\u00eam conosco, goste voc\u00ea ou n\u00e3o. ",
        u"Don\u2019t be such a party pooper, Wolfboy! Costumes are always fun!": u"N\u00e3o seja estraga-prazeres, Garoto-Lobo! Fantasias s\u00e3o sempre divertidas!",
        u"Don\u2019t be surprised if you need a wheelchair after.": u"S\u00f3 n\u00e3o se surpreenda se precisar de uma cadeira de rodas depois.",
        u"Don\u2019t blame yourself for it, Yoshinori. Emilia\u2019s actions are her own.": u"N\u00e3o se culpe por isso, Yoshinori. Emilia \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pelas pr\u00f3prias a\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Don\u2019t blame yourself, Yoshi. I was the one who chose to hide everything from you.": u"N\u00e3o se culpe, Yoshi. Fui eu quem escolheu esconder tudo de voc\u00ea.",
        u"Don\u2019t bother. There are people here paid to be doing this.": u"N\u00e3o se incomode. H\u00e1 pessoas aqui que s\u00e3o pagas para fazer isso.",
        u"Don\u2019t close that mouth, Yoshinori. There\u2019s more for you.": u"N\u00e3o feche essa boca, Yoshinori. Tem mais para voc\u00ea.",
        u"Don\u2019t deny it, Yoshinori. I know that\u2019s what you want too\u2026": u"N\u00e3o negue, Yoshinori. Eu sei que \u00e9 isso que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m quer\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t doubt yourself, Aiden.": u"N\u00e3o duvide de si mesmo, Aiden.",
        u"Don\u2019t drink too fast, Aiden! The night is still young, haha!": u"N\u00e3o beba depressa demais, Aiden! A noite ainda \u00e9 jovem, haha!",
        u"Don\u2019t even get me started about that third leg \u2013 even when it\u2019s unerect, it says a lot about you, Gramps!": u"E nem me fa\u00e7a come\u00e7ar a falar dessa terceira perna \u2014 mesmo mole, ela diz muita coisa sobre o senhor, vov\u00f4!",
        u"Don\u2019t expect that from her. You\u2019ll just be disappointed.": u"N\u00e3o espere isso dela. Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 vai se decepcionar.",
        u"Don\u2019t forget about the after party~": u"N\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a da festa depois da festa~",
        u"Don\u2019t forget humping.": u"N\u00e3o esquece que ele tamb\u00e9m estava se esfregando neles.",
        u"Don\u2019t forget to put your blankets on, guys. Or Yoshi might sneak a peek~": u"N\u00e3o esque\u00e7am de se cobrir, pessoal. Ou o Yoshi pode dar uma espiadinha~",
        u"Don\u2019t get carried away with a speech again, Yoshi. Hahaha!": u"N\u00e3o se empolgue com outro discurso, Yoshi. Hahaha!",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, I feel just as bad that it came to this\u2026": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, tamb\u00e9m me sinto p\u00e9ssimo por ter chegado a esse ponto\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, I have my limits too. I could really use a massage tonight.": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, tamb\u00e9m tenho meus limites. Uma massagem cairia muito bem esta noite.",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, I was just happy to see you back, buff or not!": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, eu s\u00f3 estava feliz por ter voc\u00ea de volta, musculoso ou n\u00e3o!",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, I\u2019d pick our cozy cabins over a thousand-dollar room like this any day! ": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, eu escolheria nossas cabanas aconchegantes em vez de um quarto de mil d\u00f3lares como este qualquer dia! ",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, Jin. I tried to be friends with her, and I gave her lots of chances back then!": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, Jin. Eu tentei ser amiga dela e dei v\u00e1rias chances para ela naquela \u00e9poca!",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong, what you\u2019re doing now is just as labor intensive, but it\u2019s the stress factor that\u2019s often worse.": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, o que voc\u00ea faz agora exige tanto trabalho quanto, mas o n\u00edvel de estresse costuma ser pior.",
        u"Don\u2019t get me wrong\u2026 I love Camp Buddy with all my heart. It\u2019s my lifelong dream that I had the honor of sharing with everyone, especially you\u2026": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal\u2026 Amo o Camp Buddy de todo o cora\u00e7\u00e3o. \u00c9 o sonho da minha vida, que tive a honra de compartilhar com todos, especialmente com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t get the wrong idea here, boy. I\u2019m only agreeing once.": u"N\u00e3o entenda errado, garoto. S\u00f3 estou concordando desta vez.",
        u"Don\u2019t get the wrong idea, Jin. I assure you it\u2019s safe enough that you could maybe even use it for that journal project of yours.": u"N\u00e3o entenda errado, Jin. Garanto que \u00e9 inocente o bastante para talvez at\u00e9 usar naquele seu projeto do di\u00e1rio.",
        u"Don\u2019t get the wrong idea. I thought it\u2019d be nice to learn how to cook, and since you needed help, it was mutually beneficial.": u"N\u00e3o entenda errado. Achei que seria bom aprender a cozinhar e, como voc\u00ea precisava de ajuda, seria ben\u00e9fico para os dois.",
        u"Don\u2019t give Yoichi any ideas either, or he\u2019ll start using that as an excuse to boss me around.": u"E n\u00e3o d\u00ea ideias ao Yoichi, sen\u00e3o ele vai usar isso como desculpa para mandar em mim.",
        u"Don\u2019t give me that helpless look\u2026 I\u2019m all yours, Yoshinori\u2026": u"N\u00e3o fa\u00e7a essa cara de indefeso\u2026 Sou todo seu, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t go too fast, Aiden. You might pull a muscle.": u"N\u00e3o v\u00e1 r\u00e1pido demais, Aiden. Voc\u00ea pode distender um m\u00fasculo.",
        u"Don\u2019t jinx it, Lloyd.": u"N\u00e3o d\u00e1 azar, Lloyd.",
        u"Don\u2019t just look at me like that, Yoshi~ Tell me what you want~": u"N\u00e3o fica s\u00f3 me olhando desse jeito, Yoshi~ Me diz o que voc\u00ea quer~",
        u"Don\u2019t let Emilia\u2019s words get to you, Aiden! You know that\u2019s not true\u2026!": u"N\u00e3o deixe as palavras da Emilia entrarem na sua cabe\u00e7a, Aiden! Voc\u00ea sabe que isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade\u2026!",
        u"Don\u2019t let him fool you! He was just as excited as me, talking about you both while he was doing my hair and makeup!": u"N\u00e3o deixem ele enganar voc\u00eas! Ele estava t\u00e3o animado quanto eu, falando de voc\u00eas dois enquanto fazia meu cabelo e minha maquiagem!",
        u"Don\u2019t let me be the reason you stop reaching for your dream! ": u"N\u00e3o deixe que eu seja o motivo para voc\u00ea desistir de buscar seu sonho! ",
        u"Don\u2019t listen to Emilia, Aiden. She doesn\u2019t know what she\u2019s talking about.": u"N\u00e3o d\u00ea ouvidos \u00e0 Emilia, Aiden. Ela n\u00e3o sabe do que est\u00e1 falando.",
        u"Don\u2019t make it sound like I begged you! It was a mutual agreement! ": u"N\u00e3o fa\u00e7a parecer que eu implorei! Foi um acordo m\u00fatuo! ",
        u"Don\u2019t make it sound like you hated the idea\u2026 You\u2019re the one who\u2019s been going on about having a gal-pal, finally!": u"N\u00e3o fa\u00e7a parecer que odiou a ideia\u2026 Foi voc\u00ea quem ficou falando sem parar que finalmente teria uma amiga!",
        u"Don\u2019t make me wait too long, Goro\u2026": u"N\u00e3o me fa\u00e7a esperar muito, Goro\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t mention it!": u"N\u00e3o foi nada!",
        u"Don\u2019t mind if I do~!": u"Ser\u00e1 um prazer~!",
        u"Don\u2019t mistake pipsqueak here for a scout like I did, he\u2019s actually twice our age.": u"N\u00e3o confunda o baixinho aqui com um escoteiro como eu fiz; na verdade, ele tem o dobro da nossa idade.",
        u"Don\u2019t misunderstand. I still have the same sophistication as before~ ": u"N\u00e3o entenda mal. Ainda tenho a mesma sofistica\u00e7\u00e3o de antes~",
        u"Don\u2019t play coy, Yoshinori. I already know you love that part about me.": u"N\u00e3o se fa\u00e7a de t\u00edmido, Yoshinori. J\u00e1 sei que voc\u00ea adora esse meu lado.",
        u"Don\u2019t push it.": u"N\u00e3o abuse.",
        u"Don\u2019t put words in my mouth, Aiden!": u"N\u00e3o coloque palavras na minha boca, Aiden!",
        u"Don\u2019t put words in my mouth, Dynamite! ": u"N\u00e3o coloque palavras na minha boca, Dinamite! ",
        u"Don\u2019t say that, Dad! I\u2019m your son, and I\u2019m gonna take care of you no matter what\u2026!!": u"N\u00e3o diga isso, Pai! Eu sou seu filho e vou cuidar de voc\u00ea, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a\u2026!!",
        u"Don\u2019t say that, Yoshinori. I\u2019m very grateful for the last few months we\u2019ve worked together. I\u2019d stand by that decision no matter what.": u"N\u00e3o diga isso, Yoshinori. Sou muito grato pelos \u00faltimos meses em que trabalhamos juntos. Eu manteria essa decis\u00e3o independentemente de qualquer coisa.",
        u"Don\u2019t say that, Yuri! I\u2019m sure Sir Goro had a good reason to keep us in the camp, and he did his best to make everything interesting there!": u"N\u00e3o diga isso, Yuri! Tenho certeza de que o senhor Goro tinha um bom motivo para nos manter no acampamento e fez o poss\u00edvel para tornar tudo interessante!",
        u"Don\u2019t start acting like you two are so innocent! The three of us drank plenty during last summer term!": u"N\u00e3o comecem a agir como se fossem t\u00e3o inocentes! N\u00f3s tr\u00eas bebemos bastante durante a \u00faltima temporada de ver\u00e3o!",
        u"Don\u2019t stress yourself out, dear. It\u2019s out of anyone\u2019s control.": u"N\u00e3o se estresse, querida. Isso est\u00e1 fora do controle de qualquer um.",
        u"Don\u2019t sweat it, Gramps. We know you just had plenty of management matters to deal with.": u"N\u00e3o esquente com isso, Vov\u00f4. Sabemos que voc\u00ea tinha muitos assuntos administrativos para resolver.",
        u"Don\u2019t sweat it. It\u2019s not like we\u2019re sticking around the camp.  ": u"N\u00e3o esquenta. N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se f\u00f4ssemos ficar pelo acampamento.  ",
        u"Don\u2019t swing the hammer that hard, you dumbass! You\u2019re bending all the nails!": u"N\u00e3o bata com tanta for\u00e7a, seu idiota! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 entortando todos os pregos!",
        u"Don\u2019t take any of this personally, it\u2019s just my job after all.": u"N\u00e3o levem nada disso para o lado pessoal. Afinal, \u00e9 apenas meu trabalho.",
        u"Don\u2019t take any of this personally, it\u2019s just my job after all.{fast}": u"N\u00e3o levem nada disso para o lado pessoal. Afinal, \u00e9 apenas meu trabalho.{fast}",
        u"Don\u2019t take this the wrong way, but a decision like that is nothing more than a missed opportunity.": u"N\u00e3o me entenda mal, mas uma decis\u00e3o dessas n\u00e3o passa de uma oportunidade desperdi\u00e7ada.",
        u"Don\u2019t talk to me.": u"N\u00e3o fale comigo.",
        u"Don\u2019t tell me Emilia got under your skin too?!": u"N\u00e3o me diga que Emilia tamb\u00e9m mexeu com voc\u00ea?!",
        u"Don\u2019t tell me you\u2019re the one who\u2019s responsible for this?": u"N\u00e3o me diga que voc\u00ea \u00e9 o respons\u00e1vel por isso?",
        u"Don\u2019t think I forgot about you guys either, Yoshi and Gramps! There\u2019s plenty for everyone!": u"E n\u00e3o pensem que esqueci de voc\u00eas, Yoshi e Vov\u00f4! Tem bastante para todo mundo!",
        u"Don\u2019t think I haven\u2019t noticed how much you\u2019ve been belittling him since you first got here!": u"N\u00e3o pense que eu n\u00e3o percebi o quanto voc\u00ea vem menosprezando ele desde que chegou aqui!",
        u"Don\u2019t think I haven\u2019t noticed the way you\u2019ve been looking at me the whole day, Yoshinori\u2026": u"N\u00e3o pense que n\u00e3o percebi o jeito que voc\u00ea ficou me olhando o dia inteiro, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t think I haven\u2019t noticed where your eyes were all day\u2026 You\u2019ve been staring at this thing the whole time.": u"N\u00e3o pense que n\u00e3o percebi onde seus olhos ficaram o dia inteiro\u2026 Voc\u00ea passou o tempo todo encarando isto aqui.",
        u"Don\u2019t think about that now\u2026 We still have the morning to enjoy together\u2026": u"N\u00e3o pense nisso agora\u2026 Ainda temos a manh\u00e3 para aproveitar juntos\u2026",
        u"Don\u2019t worry Jin, I\u2019m in the same boat as you! I\u2019ve never been on a trip like this before.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Jin, estou no mesmo barco que voc\u00ea! Nunca fiz uma viagem assim antes.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry about it, Aiden. Like I said yesterday, I\u2019m really looking forward to working with you for the rest of the project.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden. Como disse ontem, estou ansioso para trabalhar com voc\u00ea durante o restante do projeto.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry about it. I already texted Yuri that we\u2019re headed out.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe. J\u00e1 mandei uma mensagem para Yuri dizendo que vamos sair.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry about me, you guys\u2026! I swear I\u2019m fine!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupem comigo, pessoal\u2026! Juro que estou bem!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry about the camp, I already texted Yuri that we\u2019re headed out.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe com o acampamento, j\u00e1 mandei mensagem para Yuri dizendo que estamos saindo.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry it\u2019ll feel better soon.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, logo vai melhorar.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry! It\u2019s just \u2018look, don\u2019t touch\u2019, and I\u2019ll keep my pants on!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe! \u00c9 s\u00f3 \u2018olhar, n\u00e3o tocar\u2019, e vou ficar de cal\u00e7a!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry! I\u2019m sure we can keep in touch!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe! Tenho certeza de que podemos manter contato!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Aiden! I\u2019ll lead the way, and you follow!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden! Eu mostrarei o caminho e voc\u00ea me acompanhar\u00e1!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Aiden. We\u2019ve overcome so many challenges before, and this won\u2019t be any different.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden. J\u00e1 superamos tantos desafios antes, e desta vez n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 diferente.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Aiden. Work will start up again soon, and before you know it, it\u2019ll be summer.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden. O trabalho vai recome\u00e7ar em breve e, quando perceber, ser\u00e1 ver\u00e3o.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, I brought my guitar along! We can pass the time with some carpool karaoke~!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupem, trouxe meu viol\u00e3o! Podemos passar o tempo cantando juntos no \u00f4nibus~!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, I can just sneak you in!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, posso colocar voc\u00ea escondido!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, I wasn\u2019t expecting you to actively participate. I understand that this was something out of your comfort zone.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, eu n\u00e3o esperava que participasse ativamente. Entendo que isso estava fora da sua zona de conforto.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll make it quick.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, serei r\u00e1pido.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m sure he\u2019ll understand eventually.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, tenho certeza de que ele vai entender com o tempo.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Jin! It\u2019s gonna be a good morning exercise after all! ": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Jin! Afinal, vai ser um \u00f3timo exerc\u00edcio matinal! ",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Jin! I\u2019d say having you here working with us counts!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Jin! Eu diria que estar aqui trabalhando conosco conta!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Jin. I\u2019m sure all of us will have a good time tonight!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Jin. Tenho certeza de que todos vamos nos divertir esta noite!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Lloyd. You\u2019ve stuffed bigger things in your mouth.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Lloyd. Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 colocou coisas maiores na boca.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Sir Goro! We\u2019re really excited to be back! A buddy is always ready to help, after all!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Sr. Goro! Estamos muito animados por voltar! Afinal, um buddy est\u00e1 sempre pronto para ajudar!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Yoshi! We brought meat!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Yoshi! N\u00f3s trouxemos carne!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Yoshi, I can take a hint!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Yoshi, eu sei entender uma indireta!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Yoshinori. I\u2019ll cover half of your bet.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Yoshinori. Vou pagar metade da sua aposta.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Yoshinori. There\u2019s plenty of time for us to try everything out. ": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Yoshinori. Temos bastante tempo para experimentar tudo. ",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, Yuri! I\u2019ve been tagging along with him since yesterday, and I\u2019m sure he\u2019s having a lot of fun!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, Yuri! Estou acompanhando ele desde ontem e tenho certeza de que est\u00e1 se divertindo bastante!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, dear. You and I will still talk all the time.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, querida. N\u00f3s ainda vamos conversar o tempo todo.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, everyone! Like Aiden said, he\u2019s alright! It\u2019s really no big deal!": u"N\u00e3o se preocupem, pessoal! Como o Aiden disse, ele est\u00e1 bem! N\u00e3o \u00e9 nada demais!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, everyone. We\u2019ll still drop by here every now and then to hang out with you all. ": u"N\u00e3o se preocupem, pessoal. Ainda vamos passar por aqui de vez em quando para ficar com voc\u00eas. ",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, sir. We\u2019ve overcome so many challenges before, and this won\u2019t be any different.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, senhor. J\u00e1 superamos tantos desafios antes, e este n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 diferente.",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, though! It\u2019s my treat!": u"Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe! Eu pago!",
        u"Don\u2019t worry, your secret is safe with me~ *wink*": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe, seu segredo est\u00e1 seguro comigo~ *pisca*",
        u"Don\u2019t worry. I didn\u2019t take any offense from it. ": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe. N\u00e3o me ofendi. ",
        u"Don\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll make sure you get your fill.": u"N\u00e3o se preocupe. Vou garantir que voc\u00ea fique satisfeito.",
        u"Don\u2019t you have a little over a decade before you retire, Gramps?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem mais de uma d\u00e9cada antes de se aposentar, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"Don\u2019t you know how much is at stake by keeping us locked up in here?! We\u2019re already behind schedule with our project!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe o quanto est\u00e1 em jogo ao nos manter presos aqui?! Nosso projeto j\u00e1 est\u00e1 atrasado!",
        u"Don\u2019t you like the attire, Aiden?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o gostou do traje, Aiden?",
        u"Don\u2019t you think it would be a lot better if you try and enjoy your time here instead of sulking all day?": u"N\u00e3o acha que seria muito melhor tentar aproveitar seu tempo aqui em vez de ficar emburrada o dia inteiro?",
        u"Don\u2019t you think it\u2019d be easier for you to let me handle my work on my own?": u"N\u00e3o acha que seria mais f\u00e1cil me deixar cuidar do meu trabalho sozinho?",
        u"Don\u2019t you use that for cooking?": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 usado para cozinhar?",
        u"Don\u2019t you wanna go out too? We could all go together if you want!": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o quer sair? Podemos ir todos juntos, se quiser!",
        u"Don\u2019t \u2018good morning\u2019 me! You\u2019ve got a lot of explaining to do!": u"Nada de \u2018bom dia\u2019! Voc\u00ea tem muita coisa para explicar!",
        u"Dope.": u"Irado.",
        u"Do\u2026 it\u2026?": u"Fazem\u2026 isso\u2026?",
        u"Dramatic?! You have no idea how terrible this is compared to my high-end lifestyle!": u"Dram\u00e1tica?! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o faz ideia de como isto \u00e9 horr\u00edvel comparado ao meu estilo de vida luxuoso!",
        u"Dress to impress, after all! I wouldn\u2019t be caught dead wearing a free tacky dress, unlike someone~": u"Afinal, \u00e9 preciso se vestir para impressionar! Eu jamais seria pega morta usando um vestido cafona de gra\u00e7a, ao contr\u00e1rio de certa pessoa~",
        u"Dripping sweat, flexing muscles\u2026": u"Suor escorrendo, m\u00fasculos flexionados\u2026",
        u"Drive safe, sir!": u"Dirija com cuidado, senhor!",
        u"Dude, you\u2019re naked too.": u"Cara, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 pelado.",
        u"Due to the circumstances, we have to take matters into our own hands and do as much as we can to get back on track.": u"Dadas as circunst\u00e2ncias, precisamos resolver as coisas por conta pr\u00f3pria e fazer o m\u00e1ximo poss\u00edvel para voltar aos trilhos.",
        u"Duh! I can sense bougie jewelry from a mile away! Real diamonds have a distinct sparkle to them that really catches the eye!": u"D\u00e3! Eu reconhe\u00e7o joias de luxo a quil\u00f4metros de dist\u00e2ncia! Diamantes de verdade t\u00eam um brilho caracter\u00edstico que chama muito a aten\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Duh! It\u2019s with the old\u2014": u"D\u00e3! Foi com o velho\u2014",
        u"Duh! That\u2019s the whole point, right?": u"D\u00e3! Essa \u00e9 justamente a ideia, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Duh! You should know I don\u2019t pack my own stuff!": u"D\u00e3! Voc\u00ea devia saber que n\u00e3o arrumo minhas pr\u00f3prias coisas!",
        u"Duh, it\u2019s our bathroom! And you\u2019re the one who barged in!": u"D\u00e3, este \u00e9 o nosso banheiro! E foi voc\u00ea que entrou sem avisar!",
        u"Dumbass, you\u2019re thinking of a different cancer.": u"Idiota, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pensando em outro tipo de c\u00e2ncer.",
        u"During the summer term, yes! But, this time, I just wanted to be available in case anyone needs something.": u"Durante a temporada de ver\u00e3o, sim! Mas desta vez eu s\u00f3 queria estar dispon\u00edvel caso algu\u00e9m precisasse de alguma coisa.",
        u"During your upswing, extend your body like I showed you earlier, raising your toes up a little, while sliding your other hand down to the handle to gain momentum.": u"Ao levantar o machado, estenda o corpo como mostrei antes, erguendo um pouco os calcanhares enquanto desliza a outra m\u00e3o pelo cabo para ganhar impulso.",
        u"Dynamite here just said he\u2019s a switch, go for him!": u"Dinamite acabou de dizer que \u00e9 vers\u00e1til, v\u00e1 atr\u00e1s dele!",
        u"E-Eh, why?": u"H-H\u00e3, por qu\u00ea?",
        u"E-Eh? Where\u2019d that come from?": u"E-Eh? De onde veio isso?",
        u"E-Eh\u2026 I don\u2019t know if any of this would look right on me\u2026": u"E-Eh\u2026 N\u00e3o sei se alguma dessas roupas ficaria bem em mim\u2026",
        u"E-Eh\u2026?": u"H-H\u00e3\u2026?",
        u"E-Even though it sounds kind of vague, it still sounds grim\u2026 Is Sir Goro going to be alright?": u"M-Mesmo parecendo meio vago, ainda soa sombrio\u2026 O Sr. Goro vai ficar bem?",
        u"E-Everyone can see us from here, Aiden\u2026": u"T-Todo mundo pode ver a gente daqui, Aiden\u2026",
        u"E-Everyone, else\u2026?": u"T-Todos os outros\u2026?",
        u"E-Everyone, settle down!!": u"T-Todos, acalmem-se!!",
        u"E-Everyone\u2026 You don\u2019t know how happy this makes me\u2026": u"P-Pessoal\u2026 Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o sabem o quanto isso me deixa feliz\u2026",
        u"EHEM, let Yoshinori think, all of you! Your comments aren\u2019t necessary!": u"AHAM, deixem Yoshinori pensar, todos voc\u00eas! Os coment\u00e1rios n\u00e3o s\u00e3o necess\u00e1rios!",
        u"EHEM, lucky for you two, I\u2019m a professional, so I\u2019ll let that slide!": u"AHAM, sorte de voc\u00eas dois que sou profissional, ent\u00e3o vou deixar essa passar!",
        u"EHEM, what do you sayyyyy?": u"AHAM, o que voc\u00ea diiiiz?",
        u"EMILIA! Don\u2019t you mess this up!": u"EMILIA! N\u00e3o estrague isso!",
        u"EURGH! How dare you?!": u"URGH! Como voc\u00ea ousa?!",
        u"EXCUSE ME?!": u"COMO \u00c9?!",
        u"EYY!": u"EI!",
        u"EYYY!!": u"EIII!!",
        u"Each room can accommodate up to four people. Here are your room keys, please feel free to divide your party as you see fit!": u"Cada quarto acomoda at\u00e9 quatro pessoas. Aqui est\u00e3o as chaves; fiquem \u00e0 vontade para dividir o grupo como preferirem!",
        u"Early age?! I\u2019m about as old as you are!": u"T\u00e3o jovem?! Tenho praticamente a sua idade!",
        u"Earth to Jin. Are you there? ": u"Al\u00f4, planeta Terra chamando Jin. Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 a\u00ed?",
        u"Easy for you to say with that meat cannon of yours.": u"F\u00e1cil falar, com esse canh\u00e3o de carne que voc\u00ea tem.",
        u"Easy for you to say with that meatstick of yours to flaunt around!": u"F\u00e1cil falar quando voc\u00ea tem esse neg\u00f3cio enorme para ficar exibindo por a\u00ed!",
        u"Easy~ Did you forget how flexible I am?": u"F\u00e1cil~ Esqueceu o quanto sou flex\u00edvel?",
        u"Eek! Yes, Dad!": u"Eek! Sim, pai!",
        u"Eh, I guess that\u2019s a lotta work for simple me. How about I just blow you instead?": u"Eh, acho que isso \u00e9 trabalho demais para algu\u00e9m simples como eu. Que tal eu s\u00f3 fazer um boquete em voc\u00ea?",
        u"Eh, I guess there never was a chance. One of you just doesn\u2019t swing that way.": u"Eh, acho que nunca houve chance mesmo. Um de voc\u00eas simplesmente n\u00e3o joga para esse time.",
        u"Eh, I guess you really are too old for this kind of stuff. Just when I thought you were finally one of the cool kids for once\u2026  ": u"\u00c9, acho que voc\u00ea realmente est\u00e1 velho demais para esse tipo de coisa. Justo quando pensei que finalmente faria parte da turma descolada\u2026  ",
        u"Eh, for what? Cleaning the pool?": u"H\u00e3, pelo qu\u00ea? Por limpar a piscina?",
        u"Eh, not bad.": u"Eh, nada mal.",
        u"Eh, what\u2019s that?": u"H\u00e3, o que \u00e9 isso?",
        u"Eh? Are you free today or something? ": u"H\u00e3? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 livre hoje ou algo assim? ",
        u"Eh? B-But sir, that was just Aiden\u2014": u"H\u00e3? M-Mas senhor, aquilo foi s\u00f3 ideia do Aiden\u2014",
        u"Eh? How did that happen?": u"H\u00e3? Como isso aconteceu?",
        u"Eh? I\u2019m not sure I understand\u2026": u"H\u00e3? N\u00e3o sei se entendi\u2026",
        u"Eh? Really?": u"Eh? S\u00e9rio?",
        u"Eh? What do you mean?": u"H\u00e3? O que quer dizer?",
        u"Eh? What is it?": u"H\u00e3? O que foi?",
        u"Eh? What was it?": u"H\u00e3? O que foi?",
        u"Eh? What\u2019s going on over there?": u"H\u00e3? O que est\u00e1 acontecendo a\u00ed?",
        u"Eh? What\u2019s going on?": u"H\u00e3? O que est\u00e1 acontecendo?",
        u"Eh? Where are you going?": u"H\u00e3? Aonde voc\u00ea vai?",
        u"Eh? Where is everybody?": u"H\u00e3? Onde est\u00e1 todo mundo?",
        u"Eh? Why are you saying sorry, Gramps? Emilia\u2019s the one who should apologize!": u"H\u00e3? Por que est\u00e1 pedindo desculpas, Vov\u00f4? Emilia \u00e9 quem deveria se desculpar!",
        u"Eh? Why would you do that? You know we have an indoor activity next!": u"H\u00e3? Por que faria isso? Voc\u00ea sabe que nossa pr\u00f3xima atividade \u00e9 em local fechado!",
        u"Eh? Why? Did you guys have a fight?": u"H\u00e3? Por qu\u00ea? Voc\u00eas brigaram?",
        u"Eh? You\u2019re supposed to be having fun, not cleaning, you two!": u"H\u00e3? Voc\u00eas deveriam estar se divertindo, n\u00e3o limpando!",
        u"Eh?! What for?": u"H\u00e3?! Para qu\u00ea?",
        u"Ehehe, it\u2019s really not that complicated\u2026 I do this kind of stuff when I\u2019m alone back at home!": u"Ehehe, n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o complicado assim\u2026 Eu fa\u00e7o esse tipo de coisa quando estou sozinho em casa!",
        u"Ehehe, sorry, it gets really hot in here, so it\u2019s easier to strip down while working!": u"Ehehe, desculpa, fica muito quente aqui, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 mais f\u00e1cil tirar a roupa enquanto trabalho!",
        u"Ehehe\u2026 It doesn\u2019t work the same way\u2026": u"Ehehe\u2026 N\u00e3o funciona do mesmo jeito\u2026",
        u"Ehhh? What?": u"H\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3? O qu\u00ea?",
        u"Ehhh\u2026 Come on, Yoshi. Don\u2019t beat yourself up so much about it!": u"Ehhh\u2026 Qual \u00e9, Yoshi. N\u00e3o se culpe tanto por isso!",
        u"Ehhh\u2026 You don\u2019t have to do that, Yoshi! ": u"Ahhh\u2026 N\u00e3o precisa fazer isso, Yoshi! ",
        u"Ehh\u2026 Easy for you guys to say, I\u2019ve been trying to figure out why there\u2019s a big-ass napkin on my plate. Should I tuck it into my shirt or something?": u"Ehh\u2026 F\u00e1cil para voc\u00eas falarem. Estou tentando entender por que tem um guardanapo enorme no meu prato. Devo enfiar na camisa ou algo assim?",
        u"Ehh\u2026 I dunno about that\u2026": u"Ehh\u2026 N\u00e3o sei\u2026",
        u"Ehh\u2026 I think the more accurate term was \u2018clingy\u2019. Yoshi\u2019s super nice to everyone, after all.": u"Ehh\u2026 Acho que o termo mais preciso seria \u2018grudenta\u2019. Afinal, Yoshi \u00e9 gentil demais com todo mundo.",
        u"Ehh\u2026 I-I\u2019m really flattered you think that, Mr. Clermont\u2026 But I don\u2019t think I\u2019m cut out for the big time\u2026": u"Ehh\u2026 E-Eu fico muito lisonjeado que pense assim, Sr. Clermont\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o acho que eu tenha jeito para algo t\u00e3o grande\u2026",
        u"Ehh\u2026 If you\u2019re sure\u2026": u"Ahh\u2026 Se tem certeza\u2026",
        u"Ehh\u2026 It\u2019s not official without the title.": u"Ehh\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 oficial sem o t\u00edtulo.",
        u"Ehh\u2026 I\u2019m still thinking about it.": u"Ehh\u2026 Ainda estou pensando.",
        u"Ehh\u2026 They already were. I mean\u2026 who wouldn\u2019t look at his junk?!": u"Ehh\u2026 Elas j\u00e1 estavam olhando. Quer dizer\u2026 quem n\u00e3o olharia para o neg\u00f3cio dele?!",
        u"Eh\u2026 All\u2019s good, you can forget about it and just focus on getting better.": u"Eh\u2026 Est\u00e1 tudo bem, pode esquecer isso e s\u00f3 se concentrar em melhorar.",
        u"Eh\u2026 I\u2019m doing that already. I\u2019m sure a little chit-chat here and there won\u2019t hurt anybody, haha!": u"Eh\u2026 J\u00e1 estou fazendo isso. Tenho certeza de que conversar um pouco de vez em quando n\u00e3o faz mal a ningu\u00e9m, haha!",
        u"Eh\u2026 I\u2019m not sure\u2026 Yuri just told me to put this on.": u"H\u00e3\u2026 N\u00e3o sei bem\u2026 A Yuri s\u00f3 mandou eu vestir isso.",
        u"Eh\u2026 Just a little\u2026 Everything\u2019s kind of a blur\u2026 ": u"\u00c9\u2026 S\u00f3 um pouco\u2026 Est\u00e1 tudo meio nebuloso\u2026 ",
        u"Eh\u2026 Just a little\u2026 Everything\u2019s kind of a blur\u2026 {fast}": u"\u00c9\u2026 S\u00f3 um pouco\u2026 Est\u00e1 tudo meio nebuloso\u2026 {fast}",
        u"Eh\u2026? But the name sounds really bad\u2026": u"H\u00e3\u2026? Mas esse nome parece muito ruim\u2026",
        u"Eh\u2026? You\u2019re not gunning to be a scoutmaster too?": u"H\u00e3\u2026? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer tentar virar chefe escoteira tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"Eighteen. YEARS. We\u2019re both sick of it!": u"Dezoito. ANOS. N\u00f3s dois estamos cansados disso!",
        u"Either way I think it\u2019s gonna be quite the experience! ": u"De qualquer forma, acho que vai ser uma experi\u00eancia e tanto! ",
        u"Either way, Gramps. We\u2019re just glad you\u2019re really okay now.": u"De qualquer forma, Vov\u00f4. S\u00f3 estamos felizes por voc\u00ea realmente estar bem agora.",
        u"Either way, I agree with Gramps\u2026 We should go inside and call it for now. ": u"De qualquer forma, concordo com o Vov\u00f4\u2026 Devemos entrar e encerrar por hoje. ",
        u"Either way, I appreciate your offer. I won\u2019t forget it.": u"De qualquer forma, agrade\u00e7o sua oferta. N\u00e3o vou esquecer.",
        u"Either way, I can\u2019t wait to meet her too! We\u2019re already friends with Mr. Lloyd, Darius and Hyunjin!": u"De qualquer forma, mal posso esperar para conhec\u00ea-la tamb\u00e9m! J\u00e1 somos amigos do Sr. Lloyd, Darius e Hyunjin!",
        u"Either way, I really don\u2019t mind doing them. It\u2019s what keeps these muscles alive after all!": u"De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o me importo de faz\u00ea-las. Afinal, \u00e9 isso que mant\u00e9m estes m\u00fasculos vivos!",
        u"Either way, I understand Aiden! I know he isn\u2019t used to that kind of environment, so it makes sense if he needs more time to decide!": u"De qualquer forma, eu entendo o Aiden! Sei que ele n\u00e3o est\u00e1 acostumado a esse tipo de ambiente, ent\u00e3o faz sentido precisar de mais tempo para decidir!",
        u"Either way, I\u2019ll always be right behind you and Gramps!": u"De qualquer forma, sempre estarei ao lado de voc\u00ea e do Vov\u00f4!",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m glad to see you both finally resolving things with each other. We\u2019ll need you two more than ever from here on out.": u"De qualquer forma, fico feliz em ver que voc\u00eas finalmente resolveram as coisas. Vamos precisar de voc\u00eas dois mais do que nunca daqui para frente.",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m glad you two had a great time last night. The bartender here\u2019s really good at their job.": u"De qualquer forma, fico feliz que voc\u00eas tenham se divertido ontem \u00e0 noite. O bartender daqui \u00e9 realmente muito bom no que faz.",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m here to the save the day! Since today is turning out to be special, it\u2019s only fair I cook something good too!": u"De qualquer forma, estou aqui para salvar o dia! Como hoje est\u00e1 ficando especial, nada mais justo que eu cozinhe algo bom tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m impressed, Yoshinori. Every day you\u2019re becoming more of a leader.": u"De qualquer forma, estou impressionado, Yoshinori. A cada dia voc\u00ea se torna mais um l\u00edder.",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m just glad we can try and move past it. It\u2019s possible we could get along with Emilia now after all.": u"De qualquer forma, fico feliz que possamos tentar deixar isso para tr\u00e1s. Talvez afinal consigamos nos dar bem com Emilia.",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m just glad we can try and move past it. It\u2019s possible we could get along with Ms. Komarova now after all.": u"De qualquer forma, fico feliz que possamos tentar deixar isso para tr\u00e1s. Talvez afinal consigamos nos dar bem com a Srta. Komarova.",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m keeping a close eye on her! ": u"De todo modo, vou ficar de olho nela! ",
        u"Either way, I\u2019m really glad you made a new friend! Now, come on, let\u2019s go after him!": u"De qualquer forma, fico muito feliz que tenha feito um novo amigo! Agora vamos atr\u00e1s dele!",
        u"Either way, my line is always open whenever you decide! Just give me a call!": u"De qualquer forma, minha linha estar\u00e1 sempre aberta quando voc\u00ea decidir! \u00c9 s\u00f3 me ligar!",
        u"Either way, that is very touching\u2026": u"De qualquer forma, isso \u00e9 muito comovente\u2026",
        u"Either way, that\u2019s a good mindset for the whole thing, Aiden.": u"De qualquer forma, essa \u00e9 uma boa maneira de encarar tudo, Aiden.",
        u"Either way, this is exciting news! ": u"De qualquer forma, \u00e9 uma not\u00edcia empolgante! ",
        u"Either way, we better make the most out of it. ": u"De todo modo, \u00e9 melhor aproveitarmos ao m\u00e1ximo. ",
        u"Either way, we have warm clothes packed.": u"De qualquer forma, trouxemos roupas quentes.",
        u"Either way, we need one more person, so I\u2019ll invite her!": u"De qualquer forma, precisamos de mais uma pessoa, ent\u00e3o vou convid\u00e1-la!",
        u"Either way, we should be able to take care of everything ourselves! ": u"De qualquer forma, devemos conseguir cuidar de tudo sozinhos! ",
        u"Either way, we shouldn\u2019t keep the inspector waiting. Come on, let\u2019s get ready and head over. ": u"De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o devemos deixar a inspetora esperando. Vamos nos arrumar e ir at\u00e9 l\u00e1.",
        u"Either way, we\u2019re all gonna need the energy! I assume we\u2019ll be clearing out snow till we can\u2019t feel our fingers again.": u"De qualquer forma, todos vamos precisar de energia! Imagino que vamos retirar neve at\u00e9 n\u00e3o sentirmos mais os dedos.",
        u"Either way, working at a summer camp exclusively puts people like Yoshinori and I at a disadvantage.": u"De qualquer forma, trabalhar exclusivamente num acampamento de ver\u00e3o deixa pessoas como eu e Yoshinori em desvantagem.",
        u"Either way, you handled the situation quite well if I do say so myself. I didn\u2019t see you have any problems taking charge. ": u"De qualquer forma, voc\u00ea lidou muito bem com a situa\u00e7\u00e3o, se quer saber minha opini\u00e3o. N\u00e3o vi voc\u00ea ter problema algum em assumir o comando. ",
        u"Either way, you know where to find me.": u"De qualquer forma, voc\u00ea sabe onde me encontrar.",
        u"Either way, you scouts helping out is already a huge boost! We managed to clear out a huge chunk of ice and snow in a short time!": u"De qualquer forma, a ajuda de voc\u00eas j\u00e1 fez uma enorme diferen\u00e7a! Conseguimos remover uma grande quantidade de gelo e neve em pouco tempo!",
        u"Emilia and Taiga talking to each other\u2026? What an unlikely pair.": u"Emilia e Taiga conversando\u2026? Que dupla improv\u00e1vel.",
        u"Emilia didn\u2019t say anything else back there to you, did she?": u"Emilia n\u00e3o lhe disse mais nada l\u00e1, disse?",
        u"Emilia sent me an angry email last night with tons of work, so I kinda wanted to get that over with.": u"Emilia me enviou um e-mail irritado ontem \u00e0 noite, cheio de trabalho, ent\u00e3o eu queria terminar logo.",
        u"Emilia wants everyone in the campsite. Now.": u"Emilia quer todo mundo na \u00e1rea do acampamento. Agora.",
        u"Emilia was only trying to prove a point from her perspective, and she must have reasons for the way she\u2019s been acting.": u"Emilia s\u00f3 estava tentando defender o ponto de vista dela, e deve ter motivos para estar agindo dessa maneira.",
        u"Emilia! I\u2019m so glad you accepted the offer!": u"Emilia! Fico t\u00e3o feliz que tenha aceitado a oferta!",
        u"Emilia! That\u2019s a nice name!~ ": u"Emilia! \u00c9 um belo nome!~",
        u"Emilia! That\u2019s not\u2014": u"Emilia! N\u00e3o \u00e9 isso\u2014",
        u"Emilia!! What happened?!": u"Emilia!! O que aconteceu?!",
        u"Emilia, I apologize for pushing you to talk last night\u2026 ": u"Emilia, pe\u00e7o desculpas por ter pressionado voc\u00ea a conversar ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 ",
        u"Emilia, I\u2026 ": u"Emilia, eu\u2026 ",
        u"Emilia, can we please just enjoy our dinner?": u"Emilia, podemos simplesmente aproveitar nosso jantar, por favor?",
        u"Emilia, keep it down\u2026 The other tables are looking at us\u2026": u"Emilia, fale mais baixo\u2026 As outras mesas est\u00e3o olhando para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"Emilia, not everything is about that! Sometimes it\u2019s about your passion and what makes you happy in the long run! ": u"Emilia, nem tudo \u00e9 sobre isso! \u00c0s vezes \u00e9 sobre sua paix\u00e3o e aquilo que vai fazer voc\u00ea feliz no longo prazo! ",
        u"Emilia, please calm down. You can see the staff are busy\u2026 Just wait for a little\u2026": u"Emilia, por favor, acalme-se. D\u00e1 para ver que os funcion\u00e1rios est\u00e3o ocupados\u2026 Espere s\u00f3 um pouco\u2026",
        u"Emilia, stop it already!": u"Emilia, pare com isso de uma vez!",
        u"Emilia, stop!": u"Emilia, pare!",
        u"Emilia, wait! Can we please talk?": u"Emilia, espere! Podemos conversar, por favor?",
        u"Emilia, where\u2019s the lamb sauce?! ": u"Emilia, cad\u00ea o molho do cordeiro?! ",
        u"Emilia, you don\u2019t have to try to be something that you aren\u2019t with us...": u"Emilia, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa tentar ser algo que n\u00e3o \u00e9 quando est\u00e1 conosco...",
        u"Emilia, you really amaze me every day with how much you\u2019ve changed.": u"Emilia, voc\u00ea realmente me surpreende todos os dias com o quanto mudou.",
        u"Emilia? Are you up? ": u"Emilia? Est\u00e1 acordada? ",
        u"Emilia?! Where are you?!": u"Emilia?! Onde voc\u00ea est\u00e1?!",
        u"Emilia\u2019s a rich snob. Emilia\u2019s annoying. Emilia\u2019s a bitch! How could I be myself when you all judged and hated me from the start?!": u"A Emilia \u00e9 uma rica esnobe. A Emilia \u00e9 irritante. A Emilia \u00e9 uma vadia! Como eu poderia ser eu mesma quando todos voc\u00eas me julgaram e odiaram desde o come\u00e7o?!",
        u"Emilia\u2019s attitude has been getting worse and worse to the point where it\u2019s causing us major problems\u2026": u"A atitude da Emilia est\u00e1 piorando cada vez mais, a ponto de estar causando grandes problemas para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"Emilia\u2019s been fighting alone all this time\u2026 And coming back here was almost a cry for help that I didn\u2019t realize\u2026": u"A Emilia vem lutando sozinha esse tempo todo\u2026 E voltar para c\u00e1 foi quase um pedido de ajuda que eu n\u00e3o percebi\u2026",
        u"Emilia\u2019s got a point \u2013 it\u2019s such a great opportunity!": u"A Emilia tem raz\u00e3o \u2014 \u00e9 uma oportunidade incr\u00edvel!",
        u"Emilia\u2026 I\u2019m really sorry to hear all that\u2026": u"Emilia\u2026 Sinto muito por ouvir tudo isso\u2026",
        u"Emilia\u2026 That\u2019s not\u2014": u"Emilia\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9\u2014",
        u"Enjoy the buffet.": u"Aproveitar o buf\u00ea.",
        u"Enough, Emilia\u2026 We don\u2019t have to talk about this\u2026 Not right now.": u"Chega, Emilia\u2026 N\u00e3o precisamos falar disso\u2026 N\u00e3o agora.",
        u"Escort Yuri to her room. Stay with her and keep her out of trouble. No objections.": u"Acompanhe Yuri at\u00e9 o quarto dela. Fique com ela e n\u00e3o deixe que se meta em problemas. Sem obje\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Especially after everything that happened with dad\u2026 ": u"Principalmente depois de tudo o que aconteceu com meu pai\u2026 ",
        u"Especially after getting a chance to talk to him about what happened back at the hotel.": u"Especialmente depois de ter a chance de conversar com ele sobre o que aconteceu no hotel.",
        u"Especially after how much we drank last night, hehe\u2026": u"Especialmente depois de tudo que bebemos ontem \u00e0 noite, hehe\u2026",
        u"Especially after how she mistreated him at the hotel\u2026 Or over the entire project, for that matter.": u"Principalmente depois de como ela o maltratou no hotel\u2026 Ou durante todo o projeto, ali\u00e1s.",
        u"Especially after seeing how excited you were for me. I didn\u2019t want to let you down\u2026": u"Principalmente depois de ver o quanto voc\u00ea estava animado por mim. Eu n\u00e3o queria decepcionar voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Especially after she attacked Yuri and Yoshi.": u"Principalmente depois que ela atacou Yuri e Yoshi.",
        u"Especially after things got so personal back at the hotel\u2026 ": u"Principalmente depois de tudo ter ficado t\u00e3o pessoal no hotel\u2026 ",
        u"Especially during the summer term when you have so many scouts around\u2026": u"Principalmente durante a temporada de ver\u00e3o, quando h\u00e1 tantos escoteiros por aqui\u2026",
        u"Especially knowing this could be our last night together\u2026 ": u"Principalmente sabendo que esta pode ser nossa \u00faltima noite juntos\u2026 ",
        u"Especially since I thought I was doing so much better working alongside him\u2026": u"Principalmente porque achei que estava me saindo muito melhor trabalhando ao lado dele\u2026",
        u"Especially since we're expecting so many new recruits. We don't want you getting swamped with work like the past few terms!": u"Ainda mais porque esperamos muitos recrutas novos. N\u00e3o queremos que voc\u00ea fique atolado de trabalho como nas \u00faltimas temporadas!",
        u"Especially since we\u2019re gonna have each other backs!": u"Ainda mais porque um cuidar\u00e1 do outro!",
        u"Especially since we\u2019re talking about something as serious as the one who holds this place together.": u"Especialmente porque estamos falando de algo t\u00e3o s\u00e9rio quanto a pessoa que mant\u00e9m este lugar funcionando.",
        u"Especially the costumes\u2026": u"Especialmente sobre as fantasias\u2026",
        u"Especially to you\u2026": u"Principalmente para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Especially when I know I have people who have my back.": u"Principalmente quando sei que tenho pessoas que me apoiam.",
        u"Especially when it\u2019s about something I tried reaching for in the past.": u"Principalmente quando se trata de algo que tentei alcan\u00e7ar no passado.",
        u"Especially when it\u2019s about turning down something I tried reaching for in the past.": u"Principalmente quando se trata de recusar algo que tentei alcan\u00e7ar no passado.",
        u"Especially when others have gone through their own pains and struggles similarly, if not worse than my own.": u"Principalmente quando outras pessoas passaram por suas pr\u00f3prias dores e dificuldades, semelhantes ou at\u00e9 piores que as minhas.",
        u"Especially you, Yoshi~ ": u"Especialmente voc\u00ea, Yoshi~ ",
        u"Eugh! Since when did you start talking like Spaghetti-boy?!": u"Eca! Desde quando voc\u00ea come\u00e7ou a falar como o Garoto Espaguete?!",
        u"Eugh, I didn\u2019t know I was going to get this gross and sweaty from all of this though\u2026 Why did I wear white?!": u"Eugh, eu n\u00e3o sabia que ficaria t\u00e3o suada e nojenta fazendo isso\u2026 Por que fui vestir branco?!",
        u"Eugh, on that note, I\u2019m coming with you, Aiden.": u"Eugh, nesse caso, vou com voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"Eugh, please don\u2019t. Come on, you guys!": u"Eugh, por favor, n\u00e3o. Vamos, pessoal!",
        u"Eugh. Don\u2019t give me that look, Yoshinori. It\u2019s just business.": u"Eca. N\u00e3o me olhe assim, Yoshinori. S\u00e3o apenas neg\u00f3cios.",
        u"Eugh. Why am I not surprised?": u"Eugh. Por que n\u00e3o estou surpresa?",
        u"Eughhhhhh\u2026 It pains me to say it, but\u2026 I am actually really happy for you two.": u"Eughhhhhh\u2026 D\u00f3i admitir, mas\u2026 na verdade estou muito feliz por voc\u00eas dois.",
        u"Eugh\u2026": u"Eca\u2026",
        u"Eugh\u2026 And you reek too\u2026 Did you fall in the dumpster or something?": u"Eca\u2026 E voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 fedendo\u2026 Caiu numa ca\u00e7amba de lixo ou algo assim?",
        u"Even after all these years, she still saw me as a friend, and she was right\u2026": u"Mesmo depois de todos esses anos, ela ainda me via como amigo, e ela tinha raz\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Even after everything I did\u2026": u"Mesmo depois de tudo que eu fiz\u2026",
        u"Even after taking me so many times, you\u2019re still tight\u2026 ": u"Mesmo depois de me receber tantas vezes, voc\u00ea ainda \u00e9 apertado\u2026 ",
        u"Even all the tarps I covered the materials with got blown away by the storm\u2026": u"At\u00e9 todas as lonas que usei para cobrir os materiais foram levadas pela tempestade\u2026",
        u"Even as adults, many people in our industry underestimate him or don\u2019t give him the respect he deserves.": u"Mesmo adultos, muitas pessoas do nosso setor o subestimam ou n\u00e3o lhe d\u00e3o o respeito que merece.",
        u"Even back then, I already knew my feelings for you went way beyond admiration.": u"Mesmo naquela \u00e9poca, eu j\u00e1 sabia que meus sentimentos pelo senhor iam muito al\u00e9m de admira\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Even before I knew her, this was one of her hobbies\u2026": u"Mesmo antes de eu conhec\u00ea-la, esse j\u00e1 era um dos hobbies dela\u2026",
        u"Even bigger than the sponsorship!": u"Ainda maior que o patroc\u00ednio!",
        u"Even during the colder months, you still have to put up with a hot kitchen. ": u"Mesmo durante os meses mais frios, voc\u00ea ainda precisa aguentar uma cozinha quente. ",
        u"Even if I tell you that\u2019s not true, you wouldn\u2019t believe me anyway.": u"Mesmo que eu diga que isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acreditaria em mim.",
        u"Even if it was on my butt, I\u2019d want the whole world to see!": u"Mesmo que fosse na minha bunda, eu gostaria que o mundo inteiro visse!",
        u"Even if we disregarded today\u2019s delay, there is still debris on the site. ": u"Mesmo ignorando o atraso de hoje, ainda h\u00e1 entulho no terreno.",
        u"Even putting aside his habits, he has no management skills whatsoever.": u"Mesmo deixando os h\u00e1bitos dele de lado, ele n\u00e3o tem nenhuma habilidade administrativa.",
        u"Even right now, you\u2019re staying here, missing out because I can\u2019t pull my shit together...!": u"At\u00e9 agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 aqui, perdendo tudo porque eu n\u00e3o consigo me recompor...!",
        u"Even so, it would\u2019ve been optimal if he were accessible in the same time frame as everyone else. Not to mention that it\u2019s a potential health concern. ": u"Ainda assim, seria ideal que estivesse dispon\u00edvel no mesmo hor\u00e1rio que todos. Sem falar no poss\u00edvel risco \u00e0 sa\u00fade.",
        u"Even still, I can already imagine how everything\u2019s going to look!": u"Mesmo assim, j\u00e1 consigo imaginar como tudo vai ficar!",
        u"Even still, I tried to save face by convincing everyone that I was only coming back to make enough money for college.": u"Mesmo assim, tentei manter as apar\u00eancias convencendo todo mundo de que eu s\u00f3 estava voltando para juntar dinheiro suficiente para a faculdade.",
        u"Even still, I tried to save face by convincing everyone that I was only coming back to make enough money for college. ": u"Mesmo assim, tentei manter as apar\u00eancias convencendo todo mundo de que s\u00f3 estava voltando para juntar dinheiro suficiente para a faculdade. ",
        u"Even still, it doesn\u2019t excuse my unnecessarily steely demeanor. ": u"Mesmo assim, isso n\u00e3o justifica minha postura desnecessariamente r\u00edgida. ",
        u"Even still, there was always a connection between us\u2026 and we certainly did some things that normally belong to couples.": u"Mesmo assim, sempre houve uma conex\u00e3o entre n\u00f3s\u2026 e certamente fizemos algumas coisas que normalmente s\u00e3o pr\u00f3prias de casais.",
        u"Even still\u2026 If I had only tried, then I would\u2019ve known about what you had to go through\u2026": u"Mesmo assim\u2026 Se eu pelo menos tivesse tentado, teria sabido pelo que voc\u00ea teve que passar\u2026",
        u"Even the part when he started straddling the pillow? HAHAHA! ": u"At\u00e9 a parte em que ele come\u00e7ou a montar no travesseiro? HAHAHA! ",
        u"Even the part when we\u2026 did \u2018it\u2019?": u"At\u00e9 a parte em que n\u00f3s\u2026 fizemos \u2018aquilo\u2019?",
        u"Even the part when...": u"At\u00e9 a parte em que...",
        u"Even though I felt strongly about my choice, I couldn\u2019t admit to you that I was letting it go like that.": u"Mesmo estando decidido sobre minha escolha, eu n\u00e3o conseguia admitir para voc\u00ea que estava abrindo m\u00e3o da oportunidade daquele jeito.",
        u"Even though I offered for them to continue staying at the camp and helping with their bills, Andre ultimately decided it was best for he and Aiden to no longer continue to burden the camp, so they left.": u"Embora eu tenha oferecido que continuassem no acampamento e me dispusesse a ajudar com as contas, Andre acabou decidindo que seria melhor ele e Aiden n\u00e3o continuarem sendo um peso para o acampamento, ent\u00e3o partiram.",
        u"Even though I pointed it out at the beginning, it seems that he refused to listen to initial warnings and there were still instances of such displays.": u"Embora eu tenha apontado isso no in\u00edcio, parece que ignorou os avisos, pois essas exibi\u00e7\u00f5es continuaram.",
        u"Even though I\u2019m used to it, you still manage to catch me off guard every time...": u"Embora eu esteja acostumado, voc\u00ea ainda consegue me pegar desprevenido todas as vezes...",
        u"Even though I\u2019ve been at it for years, you honestly already handle it much better than me.": u"Mesmo eu fazendo isso h\u00e1 anos, sinceramente voc\u00ea j\u00e1 lida com tudo muito melhor do que eu.",
        u"Even though I\u2019ve known you for so long, there\u2019s still so many things I\u2019m learning about you\u2026": u"Mesmo conhecendo voc\u00ea h\u00e1 tanto tempo, ainda h\u00e1 tantas coisas que estou descobrindo sobre voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Even though every department had its own shortcomings, when the ship sinks, the captain is to blame after all.": u"Embora cada setor tenha suas pr\u00f3prias falhas, quando o navio afunda, a culpa \u00e9 do capit\u00e3o.",
        u"Even though it\u2019d take a lot of time and effort, I think you could do it! ": u"Mesmo que exigisse muito tempo e esfor\u00e7o, acho que voc\u00ea conseguiria! ",
        u"Even though no one could hear us with the loud music playing, we weren\u2019t really hidden, so I\u2019m pretty sure someone saw us\u2026": u"Embora ningu\u00e9m pudesse nos ouvir com a m\u00fasica alta, n\u00e3o est\u00e1vamos realmente escondidos, ent\u00e3o tenho quase certeza de que algu\u00e9m nos viu\u2026",
        u"Even though she may have forged her credentials, her work ethic and commitment to the project are very much real.": u"Embora ela tenha falsificado suas credenciais, sua \u00e9tica de trabalho e seu compromisso com o projeto s\u00e3o muito reais.",
        u"Even though the conversation moved quickly, you were able to keep up with every concern Mr. Clermont brought up.": u"Embora a conversa avan\u00e7asse rapidamente, o senhor conseguiu acompanhar cada quest\u00e3o apresentada pelo senhor Clermont.",
        u"Even though the pain\u2019s been around for so long, it just\u2026 hurts.": u"Mesmo convivendo com essa dor h\u00e1 tanto tempo, ainda\u2026 d\u00f3i.",
        u"Even though we have a big team, there\u2019s just a ton of trees and clutter to get rid of.": u"Mesmo com uma equipe grande, h\u00e1 \u00e1rvores e entulho demais para remover.",
        u"Even though we never had much, Dad always made things work. I never felt like I was missing out on anything growing up.": u"Mesmo sem termos muita coisa, meu pai sempre dava um jeito. Enquanto crescia, nunca senti que me faltava alguma coisa.",
        u"Even though we\u2019ve been working at the site a lot lately, thanks to the snow I haven\u2019t even been breaking a sweat.": u"Mesmo trabalhando bastante na obra ultimamente, por causa da neve eu nem tenho suado.",
        u"Even when I was a scout here, you always handled me with compassion regardless of my immaturity\u2026": u"Mesmo quando eu era escoteira aqui, o senhor sempre me tratou com compaix\u00e3o apesar da minha imaturidade\u2026",
        u"Even when everyone left Camp Buddy after last year\u2019s scandal, you were the only one who stuck around.": u"Mesmo quando todos deixaram o Camp Buddy depois do esc\u00e2ndalo do ano passado, voc\u00ea foi o \u00fanico que ficou.",
        u"Even when she was a scout, all she ever did was complain and push people away\u2026": u"Mesmo quando era escoteira, tudo o que fazia era reclamar e afastar as pessoas\u2026",
        u"Even when we were reunited, it took me so long to break the walls I had built up\u2026 ": u"Mesmo quando nos reencontramos, levei muito tempo para derrubar as barreiras que eu havia criado\u2026 ",
        u"Even when you guys were scouts, all she ever did was complain and push people away\u2026": u"Mesmo quando voc\u00eas eram escoteiros, tudo o que ela fazia era reclamar e afastar as pessoas\u2026",
        u"Even with all the work, we still managed to sneak in another party for the holidays!": u"Mesmo com todo o trabalho, ainda conseguimos arranjar tempo para outra festa durante as festas de fim de ano!",
        u"Even your sweat smells good.": u"At\u00e9 seu suor \u00e9 cheiroso.",
        u"Even you\u2026 That\u2019s how you\u2019ve always seen me\u2026": u"At\u00e9 voc\u00ea\u2026 Foi assim que sempre me enxergou\u2026",
        u"Even you\u2026 That\u2019s how you\u2019ve always seen me\u2026{fast}": u"At\u00e9 voc\u00ea\u2026 Foi assim que sempre me enxergou\u2026{fast}",
        u"Eventually, I realized that I was raising my daughter on my own, and that Vera and I lacked the foundation to be a proper couple.": u"Com o tempo, percebi que estava criando minha filha sozinho e que eu e Vera n\u00e3o t\u00ednhamos a base necess\u00e1ria para sermos um casal de verdade.",
        u"Eventually, I started doing it for dad \u2018cause I know how tired he always was from work.": u"Com o tempo, comecei a cozinhar para o meu pai porque sabia como ele sempre voltava cansado do trabalho.",
        u"Ever heard of knocking?": u"J\u00e1 ouviu falar em bater na porta?",
        u"Ever since I got back, you all treated me as if I was the same child I was when we were scouts!": u"Desde que voltei, todos voc\u00eas me trataram como se eu ainda fosse a mesma crian\u00e7a da \u00e9poca em que \u00e9ramos escoteiros!",
        u"Ever since I was young, I've waited for the chance to be with you, Yoshi...": u"Desde que eu era jovem, esperei pela chance de ficar com voc\u00ea, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Ever since Sir Goro moved into our cabin, I started to see his more casual and playful side, which took some getting used to considering he\u2019s my boss.": u"Desde que o Sr. Goro se mudou para nossa cabana, comecei a conhecer seu lado mais casual e brincalh\u00e3o, o que levou um tempo para me acostumar, considerando que ele \u00e9 meu chefe.",
        u"Ever since Yuri and I became roommates, she\u2019s been giving me a lot of advice.": u"Desde que eu e Yuri viramos colegas de quarto, ela tem me dado muitos conselhos.",
        u"Ever since then, the same thing keeps happening, except in front of more and more people.": u"Desde ent\u00e3o, a mesma coisa continua acontecendo, s\u00f3 que na frente de cada vez mais pessoas.",
        u"Ever since we came back here, I\u2019ve seen how you\u2019ve been getting closer to Yoshi, even including the proposal!": u"Desde que voltamos para c\u00e1, vi como o senhor foi se aproximando de Yoshi, at\u00e9 chegar ao pedido de casamento!",
        u"Ever since we started dating, I started having these plans, and dreams for our future\u2026": u"Desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar, passei a fazer planos e a sonhar com nosso futuro\u2026",
        u"Ever since we\u2019ve been in a relationship, I started having these expectations, and I can\u2019t help but wonder if that was a mistake too\u2026": u"Desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar, passei a criar essas expectativas, e n\u00e3o consigo deixar de pensar se isso tamb\u00e9m foi um erro\u2026",
        u"Ever since you became a full-fledged scoutmaster, you hardly get to help me cook! ": u"Desde que se tornou um chefe escoteiro de verdade, voc\u00ea quase nunca consegue me ajudar a cozinhar! ",
        u"Every day I spent here was miserable. Everyone hated me for just saying things as they were.": u"Cada dia que passei aqui foi miser\u00e1vel. Todos me odiavam simplesmente por eu dizer as coisas como eram.",
        u"Every moment I have with you is worth a thousand lifetimes.": u"Cada momento que passo com voc\u00ea vale por mil vidas.",
        u"Every moment I spent outside of work, it made me realize what I had been missing out on for so long\u2026  ": u"Cada momento que passei fora do trabalho me fez perceber tudo o que eu vinha perdendo h\u00e1 tanto tempo\u2026  ",
        u"Every single claim you\u2019ve made, I\u2019ve disproven with facts and rationally explained how ridiculous your arguments were.": u"Cada alega\u00e7\u00e3o que voc\u00ea fez eu refutei com fatos e expliquei racionalmente o quanto seus argumentos eram absurdos.",
        u"Everybody else is already asleep, should we join them?": u"Todo mundo j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dormindo. Vamos fazer o mesmo?",
        u"Everybody likes to see my bod! They say it\u2019s my best quality after all!": u"Todo mundo gosta de ver meu corpo! Afinal, dizem que \u00e9 minha melhor qualidade!",
        u"Everybody say, \u2018Camp Buddy!\u2019": u"Todo mundo diga: \u2018Camp Buddy!\u2019",
        u"Everyone besides me has been doing such a good job lately\u2026 ": u"Ultimamente, todos, menos eu, t\u00eam feito um trabalho t\u00e3o bom\u2026",
        u"Everyone did what they thought was best in the moment, but that doesn\u2019t change the outcome.": u"Todos fizeram o que julgaram melhor naquele momento, mas isso n\u00e3o muda o resultado.",
        u"Everyone else has settled into their tents for the night, but\u2026": u"Todos os outros j\u00e1 se acomodaram nas barracas para passar a noite, mas\u2026",
        u"Everyone else is busy doing their own thing out there.": u"Todo mundo est\u00e1 ocupado com suas pr\u00f3prias coisas l\u00e1 fora.",
        u"Everyone else is going.": u"Todo mundo vai.",
        u"Everyone else seems to have their own groups already\u2026": u"Parece que todos os outros j\u00e1 t\u00eam seus grupos\u2026",
        u"Everyone else was a bit worried how she\u2019d react towards you.": u"Todos os outros estavam um pouco preocupados com a forma como ela reagiria com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Everyone else was kinda worried about you earlier today\u2026": u"Todo mundo estava meio preocupado com voc\u00ea mais cedo\u2026",
        u"Everyone else went ahead, you two\u2026 Calm down already.": u"Todos os outros j\u00e1 foram, voc\u00eas dois\u2026 Acalmem-se de uma vez.",
        u"Everyone is going out of their way to help me\u2026 even after everything I\u2019ve done\u2026": u"Todos est\u00e3o fazendo de tudo para me ajudar\u2026 mesmo depois de tudo o que fiz\u2026",
        u"Everyone just assumes he\u2019s either intimidating or uninteresting, which wasn\u2019t really fair \u2019cause they didn\u2019t even try to get to know him!": u"Todo mundo simplesmente achava que ele era intimidador ou desinteressante, o que n\u00e3o era nada justo porque nem tentavam conhec\u00ea-lo!",
        u"Everyone kept cowering behind that sorry excuse for a leader who just keeps abusing his power!": u"Todo mundo continuou se escondendo atr\u00e1s daquela desculpa pat\u00e9tica de l\u00edder que s\u00f3 sabe abusar do pr\u00f3prio poder!",
        u"Everyone proceeded to work for the rest of the winter, continuing where we left off with all the new goals set for us.": u"Todos continuaram trabalhando pelo restante do inverno, retomando de onde paramos com todos os novos objetivos definidos.",
        u"Everyone should follow the instructions I\u2019ve handed out today, but I will follow up with a revised schedule with STRICTER deadlines, as Mr. Nomoru requested.": u"Todos devem seguir as instru\u00e7\u00f5es que entreguei hoje, mas depois enviarei um cronograma revisado com prazos MAIS R\u00cdGIDOS, conforme solicitado pelo Sr. Nomoru.",
        u"Everyone worked extra hard to meet the deadlines and we managed to accomplish every target Emilia set for us.": u"Todos se esfor\u00e7aram ainda mais para cumprir os prazos, e alcan\u00e7amos todas as metas estabelecidas por Emilia.",
        u"Everyone, these are the new developers that Mr. Clermont hired to help with the expansion project!": u"Pessoal, estes s\u00e3o os novos profissionais que o Sr. Clermont contratou para ajudar no projeto de expans\u00e3o!",
        u"Everyone\u2019s been at Keitaro\u2019s place since the snowstorm, and we wanted to come over when we heard the camp needed help! ": u"Todo mundo est\u00e1 na casa do Keitaro desde a tempestade de neve, e quisemos vir quando soubemos que o acampamento precisava de ajuda! ",
        u"Everyone\u2019s been bringing it up nonstop, all day long! It\u2019s driving me insane! ": u"Todo mundo fala disso sem parar o dia inteiro! Isso est\u00e1 me deixando louco! ",
        u"Everyone\u2026? But I was\u2014 Wait\u2026": u"Todo mundo\u2026? Mas eu estava\u2014 Espera\u2026",
        u"Everything I knew, everything I grew up with, my whole world, it was gone in a flash!": u"Tudo o que eu conhecia, tudo com que cresci, meu mundo inteiro, desapareceu num instante!",
        u"Everything I taught you all will guarantee that everyone has a fun and safe time today!": u"Tudo o que ensinei garantir\u00e1 que todos tenham um dia divertido e seguro!",
        u"Everything got wilder when you took your pants off\u2026 People mistook you as one of the strippers\u2026": u"Tudo ficou mais louco quando tirou as cal\u00e7as\u2026 As pessoas confundiram voc\u00ea com um dos strippers\u2026",
        u"Everything he said had a point, and he even acknowledged all your efforts in the end!": u"Tudo que ele disse tinha fundamento, e no fim ele at\u00e9 reconheceu todos os seus esfor\u00e7os!",
        u"Everything here is primitive and disgusting! And the commoners here make me sick!": u"Tudo aqui \u00e9 primitivo e nojento! E esses plebeus me d\u00e3o nojo!",
        u"Everything is already served on a silver platter. It\u2019s all PAID, and you just have to say yes.": u"Tudo j\u00e1 est\u00e1 sendo oferecido de bandeja. Est\u00e1 tudo PAGO, e o senhor s\u00f3 precisa aceitar.",
        u"Everything is less interesting without him, so I prefer it when he\u2019s with me.": u"Tudo fica menos interessante sem ele, ent\u00e3o prefiro quando est\u00e1 comigo.",
        u"Everything made sense about why she\u2019s never around for me and Yuri\u2026": u"Tudo passou a fazer sentido sobre por que ela nunca est\u00e1 presente para mim e Yuri\u2026",
        u"Everything seems to be in order\u2026 And I don\u2019t think we even need to ask Mr. Clermont for more funding, either. ": u"Parece que est\u00e1 tudo em ordem\u2026 E acho que nem precisamos pedir mais verba ao Sr. Clermont. ",
        u"Everything that we\u2019ve worked so hard for\u2026 there\u2019s a possibility that it\u2019ll be lost thanks to what I\u2019ve done\u2026": u"Tudo pelo que trabalhamos tanto\u2026 existe a possibilidade de perdermos tudo por causa do que eu fiz\u2026",
        u"Everything will be alright now that I\u2019m here!": u"Agora que estou aqui, tudo ficar\u00e1 bem!",
        u"Everything will go back to the way it was once we get back to camp tomorrow\u2026": u"Tudo vai voltar ao normal quando retornarmos ao acampamento amanh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"Everything you felt and said was totally valid. Stuff like that happens when we\u2019re pushed to our limits, after all.": u"Tudo o que voc\u00ea sentiu e disse foi totalmente v\u00e1lido. Afinal, coisas assim acontecem quando somos levados ao nosso limite.",
        u"Everything you need to know is in there, so I don\u2019t want to hear any questions later.": u"Tudo que precisam saber est\u00e1 a\u00ed, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o quero ouvir perguntas depois.",
        u"Everything\u2019s going smoothly! I did a quick patrol around the camp too just to be sure!": u"Est\u00e1 tudo indo bem! Tamb\u00e9m fiz uma ronda r\u00e1pida pelo acampamento s\u00f3 para ter certeza!",
        u"Everywhere you look there\u2019s gold and crystals, it\u2019s almost blinding me. You sure this is a restaurant?": u"Para onde quer que voc\u00ea olhe tem ouro e cristais, chega a me deixar cego. Tem certeza de que isto \u00e9 um restaurante?",
        u"Everywhere you look there\u2019s gold and crystals\u2026 they\u2019re almost blinding me.": u"Para onde quer que se olhe h\u00e1 ouro e cristais\u2026 eles quase me deixam cego.",
        u"Everywhere you look, we\u2019re surrounded by naked guys! A bathhouse is basically a sex hotspot! ": u"Para onde quer que olhemos, estamos cercados de caras pelados! Uma casa de banho \u00e9 praticamente um ponto de encontro sexual! ",
        u"Ew, disgusting! I\u2019m not getting my hands dirty on something like that!": u"Eca, que nojo! N\u00e3o vou sujar as m\u00e3os com uma coisa dessas!",
        u"Ew.": u"Eca.",
        u"Exactly! You barely tell me anything about it! We all deserve to know!": u"Exatamente! Voc\u00ea quase n\u00e3o me conta nada sobre isso! Todos n\u00f3s merecemos saber!",
        u"Exactly, Lloyd. He\u2019s been doing this for a long time.": u"Exatamente, Lloyd. Ele faz isso h\u00e1 muito tempo.",
        u"Exactly, and there\u2019s no one more suited for the job than the person who set it up.": u"Exatamente, e ningu\u00e9m \u00e9 mais adequado para o trabalho do que a pessoa que montou tudo.",
        u"Exactly. ": u"Exatamente.",
        u"Exactly. A general cleanup has been long overdue. There's a lot of things scattered all over the place.": u"Exatamente. J\u00e1 passou da hora de fazermos uma limpeza geral. H\u00e1 muitas coisas espalhadas por toda parte.",
        u"Exactly. As big of an opportunity as it is for the camp, it also means bigger responsibilities that we may not be prepared for.": u"Exatamente. Por maior que seja a oportunidade para o acampamento, tamb\u00e9m significa responsabilidades maiores para as quais talvez n\u00e3o estejamos preparados.",
        u"Exactly. As big of an opportunity as it is for the camp, it also means heavy changes for us involved in management.": u"Exatamente. Por maior que seja a oportunidade para o acampamento, tamb\u00e9m significa grandes mudan\u00e7as para n\u00f3s que cuidamos da administra\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Exactly. But in my case, I\u2019m just getting started.": u"Exatamente. Mas, no meu caso, estou apenas come\u00e7ando.",
        u"Exactly. I\u2019m actually looking forward to what this vacation has in store for us.": u"Exatamente. Na verdade, estou ansioso para ver o que essas f\u00e9rias nos reservam.",
        u"Exactly. I\u2019m calling it already \u2013 this will be my favorite part of the day.": u"Exatamente. J\u00e1 posso dizer \u2014 esta vai ser minha parte favorita do dia.",
        u"Exactly. I\u2019m sure the camp\u2019s future is guaranteed with Yoshinori.": u"Exatamente. Tenho certeza de que o futuro do acampamento est\u00e1 garantido com Yoshinori.",
        u"Exactly. This is our chance to spend time with each other and loosen up.": u"Exatamente. Esta \u00e9 nossa chance de passarmos um tempo juntos e relaxarmos.",
        u"Exactly. We all have your back here, Yoshinori.": u"Exatamente. Todos n\u00f3s estamos ao seu lado, Yoshinori.",
        u"Exactly. We don\u2019t need to like her, but Mr. Clermont assigned her here for a reason. We have to trust his judgement.": u"Exatamente. N\u00e3o precisamos gostar dela, mas o Sr. Clermont a designou para c\u00e1 por algum motivo. Temos que confiar no julgamento dele.",
        u"Exactly\u2026 Just like what you had to do, I\u2019d have to leave, too\u2026 and go abroad\u2026": u"Exatamente\u2026 Assim como voc\u00ea teve que fazer, eu tamb\u00e9m teria que ir embora\u2026 e estudar no exterior\u2026",
        u"Excellent choices, sirs and madams. I will relay these to the chef!": u"Excelentes escolhas, senhoras e senhores. Vou repass\u00e1-las ao chef!",
        u"Excellent! It really shows how much you have prepared for this, Mr. Nomoru.": u"Excelente! Isso realmente demonstra o quanto se preparou para este projeto, senhor Nomoru.",
        u"Excellent! That\u2019s all for today\u2019s meeting. Let\u2019s get to work!": u"Excelente! Isso \u00e9 tudo para a reuni\u00e3o de hoje. Vamos trabalhar!",
        u"Excellent. And since it\u2019s already sundown, I believe we can all call it a day. ": u"Excelente. E, como o sol j\u00e1 se p\u00f4s, acredito que podemos encerrar por hoje.",
        u"Excellent. But before we conclude this meeting, I have other concerns that I would like to discuss with everyone.": u"Excelente. Mas antes de concluirmos esta reuni\u00e3o, tenho outras quest\u00f5es que gostaria de discutir com todos.",
        u"Excellent. I see now why Mr. Clermont chose you for this job.": u"Excelente. Agora entendo por que o Sr. Clermont escolheu voc\u00ea para este trabalho.",
        u"Excellent~! I expect nothing but great things from you, Yoshinori! It\u2019s a pleasure to work with you again!": u"Excelente~! Espero apenas grandes coisas de voc\u00ea, Yoshinori! \u00c9 um prazer trabalharmos juntos novamente!",
        u"Except I\u2019m the only one allowed to say it.": u"Mas s\u00f3 eu tenho permiss\u00e3o para dizer isso.",
        u"Except for that one time!": u"Exceto por aquela vez!",
        u"Excited about Mr. Clermont\u2019s offer?": u"Animado com a proposta do Sr. Clermont?",
        u"Excited about the offer?": u"Animado com a oferta?",
        u"Excuse me for coming in without knocking, sir! I have the firewood right h\u2014": u"Desculpe entrar sem bater, senhor! Trouxe a lenha bem a\u2014",
        u"Excuse me! I was trying to find the least drab outfit you own, turns out it was a hopeless cause!": u"Com licen\u00e7a! Eu estava tentando encontrar a roupa menos sem gra\u00e7a que voc\u00ea tem, mas acabou sendo uma causa perdida!",
        u"Excuse me, I wasn\u2019t \u2018invited\u2019. I simply had no choice since Yoshinori here wouldn\u2019t take \u2018no\u2019 for an answer.": u"Com licen\u00e7a, eu n\u00e3o fui \u2018convidada\u2019. Simplesmente n\u00e3o tive escolha, j\u00e1 que Yoshinori n\u00e3o aceitava um \u2018n\u00e3o\u2019 como resposta.",
        u"Excuse me, I\u2019m doing exactly as I should. Unlike some of you who can\u2019t even keep their elbows off the table.": u"Com licen\u00e7a, estou fazendo exatamente o que deveria. Ao contr\u00e1rio de alguns de voc\u00eas, que nem conseguem tirar os cotovelos da mesa.",
        u"Excuse me, are you Mr. Nomoru?": u"Com licen\u00e7a, o senhor \u00e9 o Sr. Nomoru?",
        u"Excuse me, but maintenance is not an easy job at all.": u"Com licen\u00e7a, mas manuten\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o \u00e9 um trabalho nada f\u00e1cil.",
        u"Excuse me, it\u2019s called Elongated Musk! It\u2019s my most expensive one to date.": u"Com licen\u00e7a, chama-se Elongated Musk! \u00c9 a mais cara que j\u00e1 comprei.",
        u"Excuse me, there\u2019s no need to be so rude. I\u2019ve just been trying to share my knowledge ever since we sat down.": u"Com licen\u00e7a, n\u00e3o precisa ser t\u00e3o grosseira. S\u00f3 estou tentando compartilhar meu conhecimento desde que nos sentamos.",
        u"Excuse me, waiter?": u"Com licen\u00e7a, gar\u00e7om?",
        u"Excuse me? I came with you to bring the scouts home AND waited on you to finish browsing that book store for HOURS!": u"Como \u00e9? Eu vim com voc\u00ea levar os escoteiros para casa E esperei HORAS at\u00e9 voc\u00ea terminar de olhar aquela livraria!",
        u"Excuse me?!": u"Como \u00e9 que \u00e9?!",
        u"Excuse me?! You\u2019re the last person I wanna hear that from! Hmph! ": u"Como \u00e9 que \u00e9?! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 a \u00faltima pessoa de quem quero ouvir isso! Hmpf! ",
        u"Expanding the camp we have right now is manageable, but opening another branch is a totally different story.": u"Expandir o acampamento que temos agora \u00e9 administr\u00e1vel, mas abrir outra unidade \u00e9 uma hist\u00f3ria completamente diferente.",
        u"Experiencing new things together.": u"Viver novas experi\u00eancias juntos.",
        u"Eyyy! The guests of honor are finally here!": u"Eeee! Os convidados de honra finalmente chegaram!",
        u"F-Feel free to have your way with me, Taiga\u2026": u"F-Fique \u00e0 vontade para fazer o que quiser comigo, Taiga\u2026",
        u"F-Fine! ": u"T-T\u00e1 bom! ",
        u"F-Fine! Let\u2019s just go!": u"T-Tudo bem! Vamos logo!",
        u"F-Footlong?!": u"T-Trinta cent\u00edmetros?!",
        u"F-Forgive me for asking, but\u2026 I\u2019ve been wondering why everyone\u2019s covered in dirt\u2026 Did something happen out there while I was asleep?": u"D-Desculpem a pergunta, mas\u2026 Eu estava me perguntando por que todos est\u00e3o cobertos de terra\u2026 Aconteceu algo enquanto eu dormia?",
        u"FDJASKLFSAFLK! What?! T-TOGETHER?!": u"FDJASKLFSAFLK! O qu\u00ea?! J-JUNTOS?!",
        u"FIRST OFF, I\u2019M NOT A KID! And I\u2019m definitely NOT HIS SON!": u"PARA COME\u00c7AR, N\u00c3O SOU CRIAN\u00c7A! E definitivamente N\u00c3O SOU FILHO DELE!",
        u"FLEX!{p=0.5}THOSE!! {p=0.5}GUNS!!!": u"FLEXIONE!{p=0.5}ESSES!! {p=0.5}M\u00daSCULOS!!!",
        u"FREAKING HUGE, you mean! You\u2019re so lucky!!": u"UMA ABERRA\u00c7\u00c3O DE GRANDE, isso sim! Voc\u00ea tem muita sorte!!",
        u"FUCK! ": u"PORRA! ",
        u"FWAH! That hits the spot!": u"UAAH! Era disso que eu precisava!",
        u"Face-as-red-as a strawberry.": u"Rosto-vermelho-como-um-morango.",
        u"Fair enough. You could lift me around better that way~": u"Faz sentido. Assim voc\u00ea conseguiria me levantar melhor~",
        u"Fair point, haha!": u"Faz sentido, haha!",
        u"Fair point. ": u"Faz sentido. ",
        u"Fancy doesn\u2019t always mean good food! So, we\u2019ll be the judge of that!": u"Chique nem sempre significa comida boa! Ent\u00e3o n\u00f3s vamos julgar isso!",
        u"Feeling closer to Sir Goro made it all worth it.": u"Sentir-me mais pr\u00f3ximo do Sr. Goro fez tudo valer a pena.",
        u"Feeling thirsty?": u"Est\u00e1 com sede?",
        u"Feeling warm, Yoshinori?": u"Est\u00e1 com calor, Yoshinori?",
        u"Feels good to have a warm and cozy room, without all the troubles of setting up a fireplace! Hahaha!": u"\u00c9 bom ter um quarto quentinho e aconchegante sem todo o trabalho de acender uma lareira! Hahaha!",
        u"Fight! Fight! Fight!": u"Briga! Briga! Briga!",
        u"Finally! It\u2019s about time we had an official tech guy around here!": u"Finalmente! J\u00e1 estava na hora de termos um t\u00e9cnico de verdade por aqui!",
        u"Finally! Some good food after days of trash!": u"Finalmente! Comida boa depois de dias comendo porcaria!",
        u"Finally! We can take a shower!! ": u"Finalmente! Podemos tomar banho!! ",
        u"Finally! What took you two so long?!": u"Finalmente! Por que voc\u00eas dois demoraram tanto?!",
        u"Finally, after months of hard work, we\u2019ve all reached the project completion we\u2019ve been aiming for.": u"Finalmente, depois de meses de trabalho duro, alcan\u00e7amos a conclus\u00e3o do projeto pela qual tanto trabalhamos.",
        u"Finally, right?! Now, nothing can escape my eyes! ": u"Finalmente, n\u00e9?! Agora nada escapar\u00e1 dos meus olhos! ",
        u"Finally. Something closer to home. ": u"Finalmente. Algo mais parecido com minha casa. ",
        u"Finally~! I get to join in the fun~": u"Finalmente~! Vou poder participar da divers\u00e3o~",
        u"Fine gentlemen, I like the sound of that~ ": u"Belos cavalheiros, gostei disso~ ",
        u"Fine then.": u"Tudo bem, ent\u00e3o.",
        u"Fine!": u"Est\u00e1 bem!",
        u"Fine! But I\u2019m getting some marshmallows too!": u"T\u00e1! Mas vou pegar marshmallows tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Fine! But I\u2019m not getting naked!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! Mas n\u00e3o vou ficar pelado!",
        u"Fine! But don\u2019t be surprised when we crash the office whenever we want!": u"Tudo bem! Mas n\u00e3o se surpreendam quando invadirmos o escrit\u00f3rio sempre que quisermos!",
        u"Fine! But one of these days, you\u2019re gonna be out partying with the rest of us! ": u"Est\u00e1 bem! Mas um dia destes, voc\u00ea vai sair para festejar com o resto de n\u00f3s! ",
        u"Fine! But you better not bore everyone with your lectures!": u"Tudo bem! Mas \u00e9 melhor n\u00e3o entediar todo mundo com suas palestras!",
        u"Fine! I never wanted to be here anyway!": u"\u00d3timo! Eu nunca quis estar aqui mesmo!",
        u"Fine! It\u2019s GIRTH!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! \u00c9 A GROSSURA!",
        u"Fine! It\u2019s HOW IT LOOKS!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! \u00c9 A APAR\u00caNCIA!",
        u"Fine! It\u2019s HOW YOU USE IT!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! \u00c9 COMO VOC\u00ca USA!",
        u"Fine! It\u2019s LENGTH!": u"Est\u00e1 bem! \u00c9 O COMPRIMENTO!",
        u"Fine, Fine\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem\u2026",
        u"Fine, I\u2019d rather do that anyway.": u"Tudo bem, prefiro fazer isso mesmo.",
        u"Fine, fine! Just make sure they don\u2019t come near me and slobber all over my face!": u"Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem! S\u00f3 n\u00e3o deixe que cheguem perto de mim e babem no meu rosto inteiro!",
        u"Fine.": u"Est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Fine. I\u2019ll give you until tomorrow morning to decide.": u"Est\u00e1 bem. Darei at\u00e9 amanh\u00e3 de manh\u00e3 para voc\u00ea decidir.",
        u"Fine. I\u2019ll join your group. But you won\u2019t see me doing any of that filthy work. ": u"Est\u00e1 bem. Vou entrar para o grupo. Mas n\u00e3o me ver\u00e3o fazendo nenhum trabalho imundo.",
        u"Fine. I\u2019ll take that with a grain of salt.": u"Est\u00e1 bem. Vou aceitar isso com certa cautela.",
        u"Fine\u2026 Let me grab our stuff\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 bem\u2026 Vou buscar nossas coisas\u2026",
        u"First it was the sponsorship, then our vacation, and now you\u2019re taking time out of your busy life to help us with even minor inconveniences.": u"Primeiro foi o patroc\u00ednio, depois nossas f\u00e9rias, e agora o senhor tira tempo da sua vida ocupada para nos ajudar at\u00e9 com pequenos inconvenientes.",
        u"First of all, we\u2019re not at camp, and second of all, even if we were, you\u2019re in no position to boss me around!  ": u"Primeiro, n\u00e3o estamos no acampamento; segundo, mesmo se estiv\u00e9ssemos, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 em posi\u00e7\u00e3o de mandar em mim!  ",
        u"First off, let\u2019s get you out of the sun right away.": u"Primeiro, vamos tirar voc\u00ea do sol imediatamente.",
        u"First round, Yoshi and me! Let\u2019s go!": u"Primeira rodada, eu e Yoshi! Vamos l\u00e1!",
        u"First that whole dinner fiasco, then the situation with Emilia, and now this\u2026": u"Primeiro toda aquela confus\u00e3o no jantar, depois a situa\u00e7\u00e3o com Emilia e agora isso\u2026",
        u"First timers, am I right? ": u"Primeira vez de voc\u00eas, n\u00e3o \u00e9? ",
        u"First!": u"Eu primeiro!",
        u"First, plan where you\u2019re going to aim by looking for cracks so you can align yourself with them as your target.": u"Primeiro, escolha onde vai mirar procurando rachaduras para poder se alinhar com elas como alvo.",
        u"Flex these guns~": u"Olhe s\u00f3 estes canh\u00f5es~",
        u"Follow me!": u"Sigam-me!",
        u"Food\u2019s coming right up soon! I\u2019ve already told our chef we were here!": u"A comida chegar\u00e1 em breve! J\u00e1 avisei ao nosso cozinheiro que estamos aqui!",
        u"Fooling around with your boss, you say? I know you want more\u2026": u"Brincar com seu chefe, \u00e9? Eu sei que voc\u00ea quer mais\u2026",
        u"For Aiden and Yoshinori, you\u2019ll both continue your maintenance tasks and staff welfare duties.": u"Quanto a Aiden e Yoshinori, voc\u00eas dois continuar\u00e3o com as tarefas de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o e de bem-estar da equipe.",
        u"For Dar, which one of these is spicy?": u"E para o Dar, qual desses \u00e9 apimentado?",
        u"For a long time, I was in a really dark place, where everything felt meaningless\u2026": u"Por muito tempo, fiquei em um lugar muito sombrio, onde tudo parecia n\u00e3o ter sentido\u2026",
        u"For a second there, I thought I heard\u2026": u"Por um instante, pensei ter ouvido\u2026",
        u"For a while, I did the exact thing my dad feared\u2026 I wasted away.": u"Por um tempo, fiz exatamente aquilo que meu pai temia\u2026 Eu me deixei definhar.",
        u"For an appetizer, I\u2019ll have the smoked salmon crostini with herbed mayo\u2014 Actually, hold the mayo, and use pesto instead~": u"De entrada, quero o crostini de salm\u00e3o defumado com maionese de ervas\u2014 Na verdade, sem maionese, use pesto no lugar~",
        u"For example, Ms. Nomoru isn\u2019t well-versed enough to be supervising the entire construction department.": u"Por exemplo, a Srta. Nomoru n\u00e3o tem experi\u00eancia suficiente para supervisionar todo o setor de constru\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"For example, did you know you\u2019re not supposed to blow on your food to cool it off?  You\u2019re supposed to wait at least a minute to let it cool down!": u"Por exemplo, sabiam que n\u00e3o se deve soprar a comida para esfri\u00e1-la?  \u00c9 preciso esperar pelo menos um minuto para que esfrie!",
        u"For example, installing security cameras and putting a hub here in the office will allow the staff to maintain safety, reducing the need for daily patrols.": u"Por exemplo, instalar c\u00e2meras de seguran\u00e7a e uma central aqui no escrit\u00f3rio permitir\u00e1 que a equipe mantenha a seguran\u00e7a, reduzindo a necessidade de patrulhas di\u00e1rias.",
        u"For example\u2026 we have one in the mess hall\u2026 the campgrounds\u2026 entrance\u2026 and here at the office!": u"Por exemplo\u2026 temos uma no refeit\u00f3rio\u2026 na \u00e1rea de acampamento\u2026 na entrada\u2026 e aqui no escrit\u00f3rio!",
        u"For me, It\u2019s the latter\u2026 BL is an escape from my ever-lingering social anxiety issues.": u"Para mim, \u00e9 a segunda op\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 BL \u00e9 uma fuga dos meus persistentes problemas de ansiedade social.",
        u"For me, I\u2019ll pick the T-bone steak, medium rare with a nice tall glass of red wine.": u"Para mim, vou escolher o T-bone ao ponto para malpassado, acompanhado de uma bela ta\u00e7a de vinho tinto.",
        u"For most of my life I lived with maids doing everything for me, and I didn\u2019t have the chance to learn anything useful.": u"Durante a maior parte da minha vida, tive empregadas fazendo tudo por mim e n\u00e3o tive a oportunidade de aprender nada \u00fatil.",
        u"For now, I trust Goro\u2019s judgment on how to handle the situation with Mr. Clermont.": u"Por enquanto, confio no julgamento de Goro sobre como lidar com a situa\u00e7\u00e3o com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"For now, leave it to me. I know exactly where we should go.": u"Por enquanto, deixe comigo. Sei exatamente aonde devemos ir.",
        u"For now, let\u2019s head back to camp. We\u2019ll figure out what to do next when we\u2019re all settled in.": u"Por enquanto, vamos voltar ao acampamento. Decidiremos o que fazer depois que todos estiverem acomodados.",
        u"For now, we just have to be patient.": u"Por enquanto, s\u00f3 precisamos ter paci\u00eancia.",
        u"For now, we\u2019ll have to make do.": u"Por enquanto, teremos que nos virar.",
        u"For once in my life, the path is clear and I know what I want for the future\u2026": u"Pela primeira vez na vida, o caminho est\u00e1 claro e sei o que quero para o futuro\u2026",
        u"For once, I agree with her. It\u2019s a little childish don\u2019t you think?": u"Pela primeira vez, concordo com ela. \u00c9 meio infantil, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"For once, I agree with this hairball. I got nothing but bad vibes from her. But then I could be wrong.  ": u"Dessa vez, concordo com essa bola de pelos. S\u00f3 senti uma energia ruim vindo dela. Mas posso estar enganado.  ",
        u"For once, I can really enjoy my time with you without any work or distractions, knowing that we finished our project!": u"Pela primeira vez, posso realmente aproveitar meu tempo com voc\u00ea sem trabalho nem distra\u00e7\u00f5es, sabendo que terminamos nosso projeto!",
        u"For real though, Aiden. We wouldn\u2019t always be looking forward to mealtimes if not for your cooking!": u"Falando s\u00e9rio, Aiden. A gente n\u00e3o ficaria sempre ansioso pelas refei\u00e7\u00f5es se n\u00e3o fosse pela sua comida!",
        u"For someone labeled as a chef, you seem to have a simple palette.": u"Para algu\u00e9m chamado de chef, voc\u00ea parece ter um paladar bem simples.",
        u"For starters, you kinda passed out on me\u2026 ": u"Para come\u00e7ar, voc\u00ea meio que desmaiou em cima de mim\u2026 ",
        u"For the appetizers and dessert, we\u2019ll take the chef\u2019s recommendations.": u"Para as entradas e a sobremesa, aceitaremos as recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es do chef.",
        u"For the first time in years, I\u2019m happy that Camp Buddy doesn\u2019t have to deal with the risk of closure or damage control anymore.": u"Pela primeira vez em anos, fico feliz que o Camp Buddy n\u00e3o precise mais lidar com o risco de fechar nem ficar consertando estragos.",
        u"For the longest time, I kept all of these memories locked away, thinking it was what I needed in order to change\u2026": u"Por muito tempo, mantive todas essas lembran\u00e7as trancadas, achando que era o que precisava fazer para mudar\u2026",
        u"For the longest time, you were someone all of us could count on no matter how tough things were\u2026  always handling everything by yourself.": u"Por muito tempo, o senhor foi algu\u00e9m com quem todos n\u00f3s pod\u00edamos contar, n\u00e3o importava o quanto as coisas ficassem dif\u00edceis\u2026 sempre resolvendo tudo sozinho.",
        u"For the main course, give me the petit beef wellington, obviously it had better be made with filet mignon and hand-kneaded puff pastry.": u"Como prato principal, quero o petit beef Wellington. Obviamente, \u00e9 melhor que seja feito com fil\u00e9-mignon e massa folhada sovada \u00e0 m\u00e3o.",
        u"For the main, the superior choice is obviously the slow roasted pork belly~ Flavorful and hearty.": u"Para o prato principal, a escolha superior \u00e9 obviamente a barriga de porco assada lentamente~ Saborosa e substanciosa.",
        u"For the most part, yeah\u2026! It took a few years for it to actually be useable though.": u"Na maior parte, sim\u2026! Mas levou alguns anos at\u00e9 ela realmente poder ser usada.",
        u"For the new branch, Mr. Clermont wants me\u2026 to be the president.": u"Para a nova unidade, o Sr. Clermont quer que eu\u2026 seja o presidente.",
        u"For the next few weeks, Aiden and I worked side by side on our tasks.": u"Nas semanas seguintes, Aiden e eu trabalhamos lado a lado em nossas tarefas.",
        u"For the next few weeks, Sir Goro and I worked side by side on our tasks.": u"Nas semanas seguintes, eu e o Sr. Goro trabalhamos lado a lado em nossas tarefas.",
        u"For the small price of two kidneys I bet.": u"Pelo m\u00f3dico pre\u00e7o de dois rins, aposto.",
        u"For the tech upgrades, Jin, you\u2019ll be working alongside the construction department to set up the necessary groundwork for security cameras and internet connections.": u"Quanto \u00e0s melhorias tecnol\u00f3gicas, Jin, voc\u00ea trabalhar\u00e1 junto ao departamento de constru\u00e7\u00e3o para preparar a infraestrutura necess\u00e1ria para c\u00e2meras de seguran\u00e7a e conex\u00f5es de internet.",
        u"For this camping trip, I want you all to work together in groups of six to set up camp!": u"Nesta viagem, quero que todos trabalhem em equipes de seis para montar o acampamento!",
        u"For tonight, we will be serving a three-course meal that includes an appetizer, a main, and a dessert!": u"Esta noite serviremos uma refei\u00e7\u00e3o de tr\u00eas pratos, incluindo entrada, prato principal e sobremesa!",
        u"For you, Aiden, I\u2019ll get you some porkchops and gravy. With mashed potatoes of course.": u"Para voc\u00ea, Aiden, vou pedir costeletas de porco com molho. E pur\u00ea de batatas, \u00e9 claro.",
        u"For you, Darius. Perhaps korma?": u"Para voc\u00ea, Darius. Talvez korma?",
        u"For your information, I put it in your phone, and you left that too!": u"Para sua informa\u00e7\u00e3o, coloquei no seu celular, e voc\u00ea esqueceu ele tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"For your information, I was having a good time before you came along.": u"Para sua informa\u00e7\u00e3o, eu estava me divertindo antes de voc\u00ea aparecer.",
        u"Forcing things on him will just make things worse\u2026 So, I\u2019m afraid there\u2019s really not much we do\u2026": u"For\u00e7ar as coisas s\u00f3 vai piorar a situa\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Ent\u00e3o, infelizmente, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito que possamos fazer\u2026",
        u"Forever, it\u2019s our buddy oath!": u"Para sempre, esse \u00e9 o nosso juramento de amigos!",
        u"Forgive me for interrupting, Ms. Komarova, but\u2026 ": u"Perdoe a interrup\u00e7\u00e3o, Srta. Komarova, mas\u2026",
        u"Forgive me for the assumption\u2026 But I thought you disliked your time here at the camp, along with everyone in it.": u"Perdoe a suposi\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Mas achei que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o gostava do tempo que passou aqui, nem de ningu\u00e9m do acampamento.",
        u"Freshly baked buns every day.": u"P\u00e3ezinhos fresquinhos todos os dias.",
        u"From Sir Goro\u2026": u"Pelo Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"From choosing to try and pursue a career despite failing, to accepting your offer to return and staying despite everything that happened along the way\u2026": u"Desde escolher tentar seguir uma carreira apesar de fracassar, at\u00e9 aceitar sua oferta para voltar e permanecer aqui apesar de tudo que aconteceu pelo caminho\u2026",
        u"From fiction.": u"Na fic\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"From here on out, we can really focus on what\u2019s ahead of us.": u"Daqui para frente, podemos realmente nos concentrar no que vem pela frente.",
