        u"Go get dressed in five minutes and let\u2019s have fun out there. Understood?": u"V\u00e1 se vestir em cinco minutos e vamos nos divertir l\u00e1 fora. Entendido?",
        u"Go get them and be back here in FIVE MINUTES!": u"V\u00e3o busc\u00e1-los e voltem aqui em CINCO MINUTOS!",
        u"Go on! I dare you!": u"Vamos! Eu desafio voc\u00ea!",
        u"Go on, Yoshi\u2026 Let it all out\u2026": u"Vai, Yoshi\u2026 Coloque tudo para fora\u2026",
        u"Go on, tell the poor fool, he\u2019s close to tears.": u"Vamos, contem para o pobre coitado, ele j\u00e1 est\u00e1 quase chorando.",
        u"Go on, try the jacket out.": u"Vamos, experimente a jaqueta.",
        u"Go share a bed with Aiden! Hihihi~": u"Vai dividir a cama com o Aiden! Hihihi~",
        u"Go with the dare, Jin!! Your heart wants it too!!": u"Escolha desafio, Jin!! Seu cora\u00e7\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m quer!!",
        u"Going out would be the best thing to do with so much free time. ": u"Sair seria a melhor coisa para fazer com tanto tempo livre. ",
        u"Good choice, sir! I\u2019ll be back in just a moment!": u"Boa escolha, senhor! Volto em um instante!",
        u"Good choice. If you\u2019d said dare, I\u2019d have had you sitting on Yoshi\u2019s lap!": u"Boa escolha. Se tivesse dito desafio, eu mandaria voc\u00ea sentar no colo do Yoshi!",
        u"Good day, Mr. Clermont.": u"Bom dia, senhor Clermont.",
        u"Good day, fine gentlemen~! Enjoying your time here at Spa Ankhme~?": u"Bom dia, cavalheiros~! Est\u00e3o aproveitando o tempo no Spa Ankhme~?",
        u"Good evening! Mind if we join in?": u"Boa noite! Se importam se nos juntarmos a voc\u00eas?",
        u"Good evening, ladies and gentlemen! Welcome to The Glory Whole! My name is Reimond, and I will be taking care of you for the evening!": u"Boa noite, senhoras e senhores! Bem-vindos ao The Glory Whole! Meu nome \u00e9 Reimond e cuidarei de voc\u00eas esta noite!",
        u"Good evening, sirs! I hope I\u2019m not interrupting, but I brought some oysters\u2026! I heard they go well with beer!": u"Boa noite, senhores! Espero n\u00e3o estar interrompendo, mas trouxe algumas ostras\u2026! Ouvi dizer que combinam bem com cerveja!",
        u"Good evening, you guys! ": u"Boa noite, pessoal! ",
        u"Good evening, you two! Enjoying the party so far?": u"Boa noite, voc\u00eas dois! Est\u00e3o aproveitando a festa?",
        u"Good evening, you two. Not hanging out with your friends?": u"Boa noite, voc\u00eas dois. N\u00e3o est\u00e3o com seus amigos?",
        u"Good heavens! This is delicious! ": u"Meu Deus! Isso est\u00e1 delicioso! ",
        u"Good heavens, Aiden\u2026  Even out here, you can\u2019t keep a shirt on?": u"Meu Deus, Aiden\u2026  Nem aqui voc\u00ea consegue ficar de camisa?",
        u"Good idea! I\u2019m supposed to hand over her lunch, but you can do that!": u"Boa ideia! Eu deveria levar o almo\u00e7o dela, mas voc\u00ea pode fazer isso!",
        u"Good job, everyone! ": u"Bom trabalho, pessoal! ",
        u"Good luck, Aiden\u2026 I\u2019ll be cheering for you.": u"Boa sorte, Aiden\u2026 Vou ficar torcendo por voc\u00ea.",
        u"Good luck, cutie.": u"Boa sorte, gatinho.",
        u"Good morning too, guys! ": u"Bom dia para voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m, pessoal!",
        u"Good morning! I\u2019m Yoshinori Nagira, a scoutmaster here at Camp Buddy. How can I help you?": u"Bom dia! Sou Yoshinori Nagira, chefe escoteiro aqui no Camp Buddy. Como posso ajud\u00e1-lo?",
        u"Good morning, Aiden.": u"Bom dia, Aiden.",
        u"Good morning, Jin!": u"Bom dia, Jin!",
        u"Good morning, Sir Goro!": u"Bom dia, senhor Goro!",
        u"Good morning, Sir Goro! Sorry for the delay. Aiden just had to give Mr. Clermont a call.": u"Bom dia, Sr. Goro! Desculpe a demora. Aiden s\u00f3 precisava ligar para o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Good morning, Yoshi!": u"Bom dia, Yoshi!",
        u"Good morning, Yoshinori.": u"Bom dia, Yoshinori.",
        u"Good morning, Yuri!": u"Bom dia, Yuri!",
        u"Good morning, Yuri.": u"Bom dia, Yuri.",
        u"Good morning, Yuri. Did you gather everyone for our work? I was hoping we could get back on schedule today.": u"Bom dia, Yuri. Voc\u00ea reuniu todo mundo para o trabalho? Eu esperava que pud\u00e9ssemos retomar o cronograma hoje.",
        u"Good morning, guys! I knew you\u2019d be awake at this time, Dad.": u"Bom dia, pessoal! Eu sabia que voc\u00eas estariam acordados a esta hora, pai.",
        u"Good morning, scouts! ": u"Bom dia, escoteiros! ",
        u"Good morning, sir!": u"Bom dia, senhor!",
        u"Good morning, sir! ": u"Bom dia, senhor! ",
        u"Good morning, sir! I\u2019m Yoshinori Nagira! I registered here for the summer!": u"Bom dia, senhor! Sou Yoshinori Nagira! Eu me inscrevi para passar o ver\u00e3o aqui!",
        u"Good morning, sir! Mr. Hyunjin Choi just arrived. He\u2019s the IT specialist scheduled for a meeting with you today.": u"Bom dia, senhor! O Sr. Hyunjin Choi acabou de chegar. Ele \u00e9 o especialista em TI que tem uma reuni\u00e3o marcada com o senhor hoje.",
        u"Good morning, s\u2014": u"Bom dia, se\u2014",
        u"Good morning.": u"Bom dia.",
        u"Good morning. Firstly, I\u2019d like to apologize on the behalf of Mr. Clermont\u2019s party. ": u"Bom dia. Antes de tudo, gostaria de pedir desculpas em nome do grupo do Sr. Clermont. ",
        u"Good morning. I\u2019m just having my coffee.": u"Bom dia. S\u00f3 estou tomando meu caf\u00e9.",
        u"Good night, Aiden!": u"Boa noite, Aiden!",
        u"Good night, Aiden.": u"Boa noite, Aiden.",
        u"Good night, Yoshinori.": u"Boa noite, Yoshinori.",
        u"Good night, Yoshi~": u"Boa noite, Yoshi~",
        u"Good night, guys!": u"Boa noite, pessoal!",
        u"Good night. I\u2019m going to sleep.": u"Boa noite. Vou dormir.",
        u"Good thing I came prepared! Here\u2019s some meds, Jin~! They might make you drowsy, though!": u"Ainda bem que vim preparado! Aqui est\u00e3o alguns rem\u00e9dios, Jin~! Mas talvez deem sono!",
        u"Good thing I don\u2019t drink alcohol. Hangovers are the worst\u2026": u"Ainda bem que n\u00e3o bebo \u00e1lcool. Ressaca \u00e9 horr\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"Good thing I lit the fireplace before we went to that party. You should be pretty cozy in here.": u"Ainda bem que acendi a lareira antes de irmos \u00e0 festa. Voc\u00ea deve ficar bem confort\u00e1vel aqui.",
        u"Good thing we don\u2019t have any plans for tonight, I\u2019d rather just stay in our room and wait for this trip to end!": u"Ainda bem que n\u00e3o temos planos para hoje \u00e0 noite. Prefiro ficar no quarto e esperar esta viagem acabar!",
        u"Good thing we expanded the camp\u2026 I don\u2019t think we would\u2019ve been able to accommodate everyone next term, if we hadn\u2019t.": u"Ainda bem que expandimos o acampamento\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o conseguir\u00edamos acomodar todo mundo na pr\u00f3xima temporada se n\u00e3o tiv\u00e9ssemos feito isso.",
        u"Good thing you have it with you, Yoshi.": u"Ainda bem que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com ele, Yoshi.",
        u"Good thing you know about these kinds of drinks, Yoshi! I swear I almost ordered a soda just so I didn\u2019t embarrass myself.": u"Ainda bem que conhece esse tipo de bebida, Yoshi! Juro que quase pedi um refrigerante s\u00f3 para n\u00e3o passar vergonha.",
        u"Good thing you warmed me up beforehand.": u"Ainda bem que voc\u00ea me aqueceu antes.",
        u"Good thinking, Dad~!": u"Boa ideia, pai~!",
        u"Good to know it works. It helps me protect Lloyd. ": u"\u00c9 bom saber que funciona. Isso me ajuda a proteger Lloyd. ",
        u"Good to know you liked that. I\u2019ve been holding that trick up my sleeve for a while now\u2026": u"Bom saber que gostou. Eu estava guardando esse truque na manga h\u00e1 um bom tempo\u2026",
        u"Good! Now come on, let\u2019s have a toast!": u"\u00d3timo! Agora vamos fazer um brinde!",
        u"Good! Other than that, you can continue working on the camp database website and any integrations.": u"\u00d3timo! Al\u00e9m disso, pode continuar trabalhando no site do banco de dados do acampamento e nas integra\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Good! Please let us know immediately if any other concerns come up!": u"\u00d3timo! Por favor, avise-nos imediatamente se surgir qualquer outra preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Good. I\u2019d rather be expelled from this place then forced to do menial labor.": u"\u00d3timo. Prefiro ser expulsa deste lugar a ser for\u00e7ada a fazer trabalho bra\u00e7al.",
        u"Good. I\u2019m counting on you both! ": u"\u00d3timo. Conto com voc\u00eas dois! ",
        u"Good. Just how I like it.": u"\u00d3timo. Exatamente como eu gosto.",
        u"Good. Now channel that motivation into that axe, and let\u2019s get back to chopping.": u"\u00d3timo. Agora canalize essa motiva\u00e7\u00e3o nesse machado e vamos voltar ao trabalho.",
        u"Goodbye now.": u"Adeus.",
        u"Goodbye!": u"At\u00e9 logo!",
        u"Goodbye, Goro\u2026": u"Adeus, Goro\u2026",
        u"Goodbye, Yoshinori.": u"Adeus, Yoshinori.",
        u"Goodbye, Yuri.": u"Adeus, Yuri.",
        u"Goodbye, guys! It\u2019s been a pleasure working with everyone!": u"Tchau, pessoal! Foi um prazer trabalhar com todos voc\u00eas!",
        u"Goodbye\u2026 Yoshi\u2026": u"Adeus\u2026 Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Goodness fucking gracious! How dare you sneak up on me like that!": u"Meu Deus do c\u00e9u! Como ousa se aproximar de mim sorrateiramente desse jeito!",
        u"Goodness gracious, I can\u2019t believe all of you wasted your opportunity to order something more sophisticated.": u"Meu Deus, n\u00e3o acredito que todos voc\u00eas desperdi\u00e7aram a oportunidade de pedir algo mais sofisticado.",
        u"Goodness gracious, I was getting there\u2026 Am I not allowed to set the mood? ": u"Minha nossa, eu estava chegando l\u00e1\u2026 N\u00e3o posso preparar o clima?",
        u"Goodness gracious, when did you get so impatient?!": u"Minha nossa, desde quando ficou t\u00e3o impaciente?!",
        u"Goodness gracious\u2026 This is your used underwear! I think I\u2019m gonna puke!": u"Meu Deus\u2026 Isso \u00e9 sua cueca usada! Acho que vou vomitar!",
        u"Goodness, Aiden\u2026 ": u"Minha nossa, Aiden\u2026 ",
        u"Goodness\u2026 I think I woke up way too late\u2026": u"Nossa\u2026 Acho que acordei tarde demais\u2026",
        u"Goodnight, Yoshinori.": u"Boa noite, Yoshinori.",
        u"Goodnight, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Boa noite, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Goodnight, sir!": u"Boa noite, senhor!",
        u"Goodt, more for ursh!": u"\u00d3timo, mais pra genti!",
        u"Goooooooooood morning, you two~! Lovely day we\u2019re having today, aren\u2019t we?": u"Booooooooom dia, voc\u00eas dois~! Que belo dia estamos tendo hoje, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Goro and I kept the entire project well-managed, making sure we stayed on schedule, while Yuri assisted us and Aiden\u2019s department on the side.": u"Goro e eu mantivemos todo o projeto bem administrado, garantindo que segu\u00edssemos o cronograma, enquanto Yuri nos ajudava e tamb\u00e9m auxiliava o departamento de Aiden.",
        u"Goro has so much responsibility, and taking it on myself is intimidating...": u"Goro tem tanta responsabilidade, e assumir tudo isso sozinho \u00e9 intimidador\u2026",
        u"Goro told me on our way back he\u2019ll let Emilia recover first before we address the situation with her.": u"Goro me disse na volta que vai deixar Emilia se recuperar antes de tratarmos da situa\u00e7\u00e3o dela.",
        u"Goro was brighter and happier than I\u2019d ever seen him before \u2013 we were both looking forward to the future, with the camp and with each other!": u"Goro estava mais radiante e feliz do que eu jamais o vira \u2014 n\u00f3s dois aguard\u00e1vamos ansiosos pelo futuro, tanto com o acampamento quanto um com o outro!",
        u"Goro? Are you in here?": u"Goro? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 aqui?",
        u"Goro\u2019s right. And like I said, we have to at least hear Emilia\u2019s side before we make any decisions.": u"Goro tem raz\u00e3o. E, como eu disse, precisamos pelo menos ouvir o lado de Emilia antes de tomar qualquer decis\u00e3o.",
        u"Goro\u2019s the one who taught me how to handle this kind of stuff.": u"Foi Goro quem me ensinou a lidar com esse tipo de coisa.",
        u"Goro\u2026 I want you to go rough on me\u2026": u"Goro\u2026 Quero que voc\u00ea seja bruto comigo\u2026",
        u"Goro\u2026 We\u2019ve both come so far since we first met here so many years ago.": u"Goro\u2026 N\u00f3s dois percorremos um caminho t\u00e3o longo desde que nos conhecemos aqui, tantos anos atr\u00e1s.",
        u"Goro\u2026 you\u2019re way too romantic\u2026": u"Goro\u2026 voc\u00ea \u00e9 rom\u00e2ntico demais\u2026",
        u"Gosh, Yuri...! You scared me!": u"Nossa, Yuri...! Voc\u00ea me assustou!",
        u"Got any idea what\u2019s going on?": u"Alguma ideia do que est\u00e1 acontecendo?",
        u"Got any ideas?": u"Tem alguma ideia?",
        u"Got it! I\u2019ll head there right away!": u"Entendido! Vou para l\u00e1 agora mesmo!",
        u"Gotcha! See ya, Yoshi!": u"Entendi! At\u00e9 mais, Yoshi!",
        u"Gotcha, Gramps! You\u2019ve got nothing to worry about!": u"Entendido, Vov\u00f4! N\u00e3o precisa se preocupar com nada!",
        u"Gotta go!": u"Tenho que ir!",
        u"Gotta learn some new tricks in the kitchen if I\u2019m gonna be a chef, am I right?": u"Tenho que aprender alguns truques novos na cozinha se vou ser chef, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Grah, it was a bear! ": u"Grah, era um urso! ",
        u"Gramps sounded exactly like he was back then, huh? Burning with passion.": u"O Vov\u00f4 soou exatamente como naquela \u00e9poca, hein? Cheio de paix\u00e3o.",
        u"Gramps was the number one tough guy in a group of tough guys! That\u2019s crazy!": u"Vov\u00f4 era o dur\u00e3o n\u00famero um de um grupo de dur\u00f5es! Que loucura!",
        u"Great job, everyone!": u"\u00d3timo trabalho, pessoal!",
        u"Great! And with that, I think it\u2019s about time for me to leave.": u"\u00d3timo! E, com isso, acho que est\u00e1 na hora de eu partir.",
        u"Great! If we\u2019re all clear, then this meeting is adjourned.": u"\u00d3timo! Se todos compreenderam, a reuni\u00e3o est\u00e1 encerrada.",
        u"Great! I\u2019ll be back soon, Aiden!": u"\u00d3timo! Voltarei logo, Aiden!",
        u"Great! Let\u2019s go then!": u"\u00d3timo! Ent\u00e3o vamos!",
        u"Great! With that being said, I can schedule a shuttle to pick everyone up as early as tomorrow from Camp Buddy!": u"\u00d3timo! Sendo assim, posso agendar um transporte para buscar todos no Camp Buddy j\u00e1 amanh\u00e3!",
        u"Great, that\u2019s two more! Welcome to the group!": u"\u00d3timo, j\u00e1 temos mais dois! Bem-vindos ao grupo!",
        u"Great, then I should probably get dressed. ": u"\u00d3timo, ent\u00e3o provavelmente devo me vestir. ",
        u"Great, then please follow me!": u"\u00d3timo, ent\u00e3o, por favor, sigam-me!",
        u"Great, then show me how it\u2019s done and let\u2019s get that cooking badge! ": u"\u00d3timo, ent\u00e3o me mostre como se faz e vamos conquistar aquele distintivo de culin\u00e1ria! ",
        u"Great.": u"\u00d3timo.",
        u"Great. Another nerd who looks like he doesn\u2019t have friends, \u2014": u"\u00d3timo. Outro nerd com cara de quem n\u00e3o tem amigos, \u2014",
        u"Great. I want to make sure you\u2019re comfortable during your stay here. Mr. Clermont told me quite a lot about you and your work.": u"\u00d3timo. Quero garantir que fique confort\u00e1vel durante sua estadia. O Sr. Clermont me contou bastante sobre voc\u00ea e seu trabalho.",
        u"Greetings! Welcome to the Grand O\u2019 Hotel. You deserve a release!": u"Sauda\u00e7\u00f5es! Bem-vindos ao Grand O\u2019 Hotel. Voc\u00eas merecem relaxar!",
        u"Grope his pecs.": u"Apalpar o peito dele.",
        u"Grow five inches taller and then maybe I\u2019ll listen.": u"Cres\u00e7a uns quinze cent\u00edmetros e talvez eu escute.",
        u"Growing up, I never really got along with her\u2026": u"Enquanto crescia, nunca me dei muito bem com ela\u2026",
        u"Growing up, Yuri did have a hard time letting go of stuff she found interesting. Whenever she started a hobby, she would obsess over it.": u"Durante a inf\u00e2ncia, Yuri tinha dificuldade para se desfazer das coisas que achava interessantes. Sempre que come\u00e7ava um passatempo, ficava obcecada por ele.",
        u"Growing up, it was just Dad and I, and we didn\u2019t have much.": u"Enquanto eu crescia, \u00e9ramos apenas eu e o papai, e n\u00e3o t\u00ednhamos muita coisa.",
        u"Grrrrr\u2026! No way am I accepting this! We\u2019re doing another round!": u"Grrrrr\u2026! De jeito nenhum vou aceitar isso! Vamos fazer outra rodada!",
        u"Grrr\u2026 Grr\u2026 *heavy breathing*": u"Grrr\u2026 Grr\u2026 *respira\u00e7\u00e3o pesada*",
        u"Grrr\u2026 Grr\u2026 *heavy breathing*{fast}": u"Grrr\u2026 Grr\u2026 *respira\u00e7\u00e3o pesada*{fast}",
        u"Guess I could use a shower too. I do feel kinda gross after digging around in those pipes.": u"Acho que eu tamb\u00e9m poderia tomar um banho. Estou meio nojento depois de mexer naqueles canos.",
        u"Guess I don\u2019t mind having bigger cheeks to smack.": u"Acho que n\u00e3o me importaria de ter bochechas maiores para dar uns tapas.",
        u"Guess I was wrong about Gramps. He\u2019s not as stuck-up as I thought, \u2019cuz that massage definitely has a happy ending.": u"Acho que estava errado sobre o vov\u00f4. Ele n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o certinho quanto pensei, porque aquela massagem com certeza tem final feliz.",
        u"Guess I\u2019ll go see for myself.": u"Acho que vou ver por mim mesmo.",
        u"Guess I\u2019ll join you skinny-dipping, Aiden.": u"Acho que vou nadar pelado com voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"Guess that leaves me and Jin.": u"Acho que sobrou eu e Jin.",
        u"Guess the answer is no.": u"Acho que a resposta \u00e9 n\u00e3o.",
        u"Guess we know why Yuri didn\u2019t hang out here, huh?": u"Acho que agora sabemos por que a Yuri n\u00e3o ficou por aqui, n\u00e9?",
        u"Guess you could call this entire trip our honeymoon then?": u"Ent\u00e3o acho que podemos chamar esta viagem inteira de nossa lua de mel?",
        u"Guess you realized you never could.": u"Acho que percebeu que nunca conseguiria.",
        u"Guess you spoke too soon, Aiden.": u"Acho que falou cedo demais, Aiden.",
        u"Guess you\u2019re doing whatever I say now, Yoshinori.": u"Acho que agora voc\u00ea vai fazer tudo que eu mandar, Yoshinori.",
        u"Guuuuuh\u2026 Maybe I should stay after all\u2026": u"Guuuuuh\u2026 Talvez eu devesse ficar, afinal\u2026",
        u"Guuuuuuuhhhhhhhh\u2026!! Stop making scenarios in my head! I\u2019m getting a nosebleed just thinking about it!": u"Guuuuuuuhhhhhhhh\u2026!! Pare de colocar essas cenas na minha cabe\u00e7a! S\u00f3 de pensar j\u00e1 estou tendo uma hemorragia nasal!",
        u"Guys\u2026 Please be more sensitive to Aiden\u2026 ": u"Pessoal\u2026 Por favor, tenham um pouco mais de considera\u00e7\u00e3o com o Aiden\u2026 ",
        u"G\u2019morning, Gramps!  ": u"Bom dia, Vov\u00f4!  ",
        u"H-HEY!!! WHY DID YOU SKIP ME?!!": u"E-EI!!! POR QUE VOC\u00ca ME PULOU?!!",
