        u"Haha! Looks like y\u2019all are having fun being scoutmasters! I bet you it\u2019s gonna be way more fun when the real term starts!": u"Haha! Parece que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o se divertindo como chefes escoteiros! Aposto que vai ser muito mais divertido quando a temporada de verdade come\u00e7ar!",
        u"Haha! Somehow I enjoy this Yuri more.": u"Haha! Por algum motivo, gosto mais desta Yuri.",
        u"Haha! That\u2019s quite fascinating.": u"Haha! Isso \u00e9 fascinante.",
        u"Haha! That\u2019s right!": u"Haha! Isso mesmo!",
        u"Haha! That\u2019s what you get for not paying attention to what\u2019s around you, geezer!": u"Haha! \u00c9 isso que acontece quando voc\u00ea n\u00e3o presta aten\u00e7\u00e3o ao que est\u00e1 ao redor, velhote!",
        u"Haha! There\u2019s plenty of other drinks I\u2019d recommend!": u"Haha! H\u00e1 muitas outras bebidas que eu recomendaria!",
        u"Haha! Way to go making the moves on little Lloyd! ": u"Haha! Mandou bem tomando a iniciativa com o pequeno Lloyd! ",
        u"Haha! Why, is it like kid-size or something?": u"Haha! Por qu\u00ea, era tamanho infantil ou algo assim?",
        u"Haha! Yoshi\u2019s known me for forever, and he\u2019s still not used to it!": u"Haha! Yoshi me conhece desde sempre e ainda n\u00e3o se acostumou!",
        u"Haha! You think you\u2019ve got the energy left to tour around the hotel?": u"Haha! Acha que ainda tem energia para passear pelo hotel?",
        u"Haha! You\u2019ve always been the quiet kind, but I thought you\u2019d get over that after so many years! ": u"Haha! Voc\u00ea sempre foi do tipo calado, mas achei que superaria isso depois de tantos anos! ",
        u"Haha, I agree. Thank goodness the water\u2019s cool, we needed an escape from the heat.": u"Haha, concordo. Ainda bem que a \u00e1gua est\u00e1 fresca; precis\u00e1vamos escapar do calor.",
        u"Haha, I could say the same. We get to live like millionaires for a few days. ": u"Haha, posso dizer o mesmo. Podemos viver como milion\u00e1rios por alguns dias. ",
        u"Haha, I guess I got a little too drunk! The staff didn\u2019t seem to mind though, they got a free view of my bod while I was napping~": u"Haha, acho que fiquei b\u00eabado demais! Mas os funcion\u00e1rios n\u00e3o pareceram se importar; ganharam uma vista gr\u00e1tis do meu corpo enquanto eu cochilava~",
        u"Haha, I guess I shouldn't have expected any different. You've been taking care of everyone here for as long as I can remember, after all.": u"Haha, acho que eu n\u00e3o deveria esperar outra coisa. Afinal, voc\u00ea cuida de todos aqui desde que me lembro.",
        u"Haha, I guess I shouldn\u2019t be surprised by your preparedness. You really are a scout at heart.": u"Haha, acho que n\u00e3o deveria me surpreender com o quanto voc\u00ea \u00e9 preparado. Voc\u00ea realmente \u00e9 escoteiro de cora\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Haha, I guess it\u2019s a team effort then!": u"Haha, ent\u00e3o acho que foi um trabalho em equipe!",
        u"Haha, I guess you\u2019re right, Aiden.": u"Haha, acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o, Aiden.",
        u"Haha, I guess you\u2019re right, sir\u2026": u"Haha, acho que o senhor tem raz\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Haha, I had to keep an eye on you and make sure you\u2019re not just working all day long.": u"Haha, eu precisava ficar de olho em voc\u00ea e garantir que n\u00e3o passasse o dia inteiro trabalhando.",
        u"Haha, I have joined Aiden for a few of his workout sessions. But I do try and keep myself in the best shape possible so that I have no issues with our activities!": u"Haha, acompanhei o Aiden em algumas sess\u00f5es de treino. Mas procuro me manter na melhor forma poss\u00edvel para n\u00e3o ter problemas com as nossas atividades!",
        u"Haha, I hope it meets your expectations!": u"Haha, espero que esteja \u00e0 altura das expectativas!",
        u"Haha, I hope so! Thank you again for the invite, and I\u2019ll look forward to another fun gathering with you all~": u"Haha, espero que sim! Obrigado novamente pelo convite, e ficarei ansioso por outra reuni\u00e3o divertida com todos voc\u00eas~",
        u"Haha, I knew you boys would like it.": u"Haha, eu sabia que voc\u00eas garotos iriam gostar.",
        u"Haha, I knew you\u2019d approve them right away.": u"Haha, eu sabia que voc\u00ea aprovaria todos imediatamente.",
        u"Haha, I know! But I seriously am happy for you two!": u"Haha, eu sei! Mas estou realmente feliz por voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Haha, I know, but this is more fun!": u"Haha, eu sei, mas assim \u00e9 mais divertido!",
        u"Haha, I never thought I\u2019d see the day that she wouldn\u2019t enjoy shipping someone, as she calls it.": u"Haha, nunca pensei que veria o dia em que ela n\u00e3o gostaria de \u2018shippar\u2019 algu\u00e9m, como ela diz.",
        u"Haha, I promise we\u2019ll have all sorts of activities to suit everyone\u2019s interests!": u"Haha, prometo que teremos todo tipo de atividade para atender aos interesses de todos!",
        u"Haha, I think Yuri wanted to sneak in some more time with them for her usual questioning.": u"Haha, acho que Yuri queria aproveitar mais um tempo com eles para fazer as perguntas de sempre.",
        u"Haha, I think it\u2019s sweet you made these for everyone, Yuri.": u"Haha, acho fofo voc\u00ea ter feito isso para todo mundo, Yuri.",
        u"Haha, I think this is just a bit of a different situation, dear.": u"Haha, acho que esta \u00e9 apenas uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o um pouco diferente, querida.",
        u"Haha, I thought I looked so cool and tough wearing all that grunge and leather.": u"Haha, eu achava que parecia t\u00e3o descolado e dur\u00e3o usando todo aquele estilo grunge e couro.",
        u"Haha, I wouldn't say no to some company~! You'll probably enjoy working up a sweat after all those boring tasks you've been doing!": u"Haha, n\u00e3o recusaria um pouco de companhia~! Voc\u00ea provavelmente vai gostar de suar um pouco depois de todas aquelas tarefas tediosas!",
        u"Haha, I\u2019d run out of money way before I had any gains to show from a membership at this gym.": u"Haha, meu dinheiro acabaria muito antes de eu ter qualquer resultado para mostrar com uma mensalidade nesta academia.",
        u"Haha, I\u2019ll have to start making more regular trips here to join in on the fun!": u"Haha, vou ter que come\u00e7ar a visitar este lugar com mais frequ\u00eancia para participar da divers\u00e3o!",
        u"Haha, I\u2019m just doing what Goro would. ": u"Haha, s\u00f3 estou fazendo o que Goro faria. ",
        u"Haha, I\u2019m just kidding! You\u2019ve been frowning this whole time \u2013 you don\u2019t want wrinkles on your face, do you?": u"Haha, estou brincando! Voc\u00ea passou esse tempo todo franzindo a testa \u2014 n\u00e3o quer ficar com rugas, quer?",
        u"Haha, I\u2019m not too surprised that this is your kind of place, sir.": u"Haha, n\u00e3o me surpreende muito que este seja seu tipo de lugar, senhor.",
        u"Haha, I\u2019m sure, which is what brings me to what I\u2019ve wanted to say\u2026": u"Haha, imagino, e isso me leva ao que eu queria dizer\u2026",
        u"Haha, I\u2019ve seen you pull off even tighter deadlines. But I\u2019m happy to make it easier on you today!": u"Haha, j\u00e1 vi voc\u00ea cumprir prazos ainda mais apertados. Mas fico feliz em facilitar as coisas para voc\u00ea hoje!",
        u"Haha, Natsumi is officially the best scout we have, and for three terms in a row now!": u"Haha, Natsumi \u00e9 oficialmente o melhor escoteiro que temos, e j\u00e1 faz tr\u00eas temporadas seguidas!",
        u"Haha, Yoshi does have a good eye for people, so maybe we should just give her a chance! ": u"Haha, Yoshi sabe julgar bem as pessoas, ent\u00e3o talvez dev\u00eassemos apenas dar uma chance a ela!",
        u"Haha, Yoshi\u2019s always had a knack for reaching out to people.": u"Haha, o Yoshi sempre teve talento para se aproximar das pessoas.",
        u"Haha, Yoshi\u2019s stuck his nose all over the place, huh?": u"Haha, o Yoshi meteu o nariz em tudo quanto \u00e9 lugar, hein?",
        u"Haha, Yuri would be glad if we stopped. She\u2019s always scolding us for drinking anyway. ": u"Haha, a Yuri ficaria contente se par\u00e1ssemos. De qualquer forma, ela vive nos repreendendo por beber. ",
        u"Haha, actually, I know a thing or two about multimedia editing too! In fact, I used to do photo restoration as a side job before.": u"Haha, na verdade, tamb\u00e9m entendo uma coisinha ou outra de edi\u00e7\u00e3o multim\u00eddia! Eu costumava trabalhar com restaura\u00e7\u00e3o de fotos como atividade paralela.",
        u"Haha, alright then! We\u2019ll be right back!": u"Haha, certo ent\u00e3o! J\u00e1 voltamos!",
        u"Haha, alright!": u"Haha, est\u00e1 bem!",
        u"Haha, alright! I want to see more photos of you with your bike!": u"Haha, certo! Quero ver mais fotos suas com a moto!",
        u"Haha, alright! Let\u2019s go, you two! The rest of you, have fun!": u"Haha, certo! Vamos, voc\u00eas dois! O resto, divirtam-se!",
        u"Haha, alright, alright.": u"Haha, certo, certo.",
        u"Haha, alright, sure! Show me the how it\u2019s done!": u"Haha, certo, claro! Mostre como se faz!",
        u"Haha, alright. Just let me know in the future, Jin!": u"Haha, certo. \u00c9 s\u00f3 me avisar depois, Jin!",
        u"Haha, and it\u2019s always been one of Aiden\u2019s least favorite tasks, so I\u2019m sure he\u2019s happy to pawn it off on a friend~": u"Haha, e essa sempre foi uma das tarefas que Aiden menos gosta, ent\u00e3o tenho certeza de que est\u00e1 feliz por pass\u00e1-la a um amigo~",
        u"Haha, are you really still embarrassed about it? We\u2019re all so used to it by now!": u"Haha, voc\u00ea ainda fica constrangido com isso? A essa altura todos n\u00f3s j\u00e1 estamos acostumados!",
        u"Haha, at least it\u2019s cozy in here with the heater on.": u"Haha, pelo menos est\u00e1 aconchegante aqui dentro com o aquecedor ligado.",
        u"Haha, being in a giant pool like this feels kinda nostalgic though \u2013 it\u2019s been a long time since we\u2019ve been swimming together!": u"Haha, estar numa piscina enorme assim d\u00e1 uma certa nostalgia \u2014 faz muito tempo desde que nadamos juntos!",
        u"Haha, but I think he\u2019s really happy for us!": u"Haha, mas acho que ele est\u00e1 realmente feliz por n\u00f3s!",
        u"Haha, can\u2019t blame Jin though! He was probably ready to get back to the room anyway~": u"Haha, mas n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para culpar o Jin! Ele provavelmente j\u00e1 estava pronto para voltar para o quarto mesmo~",
        u"Haha, come on, Yoshi! Let loose and try to have fun! ": u"Haha, qual \u00e9, Yoshi! Relaxe e tente se divertir! ",
        u"Haha, come on, you guys know me \u2013 I\u2019d rather be in loose clothes or nothing at all!": u"Haha, qual \u00e9, voc\u00eas me conhecem \u2014 prefiro roupas folgadas ou roupa nenhuma!",
        u"Haha, didn\u2019t work this time, Gramps.": u"Haha, desta vez n\u00e3o funcionou, Vov\u00f4.",
        u"Haha, don't worry about me \u2013 this is really the least I can do after all.": u"Haha, n\u00e3o se preocupe comigo \u2014 afinal, isso \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer.",
        u"Haha, don\u2019t worry! We\u2019ll just go there to chill this time.": u"Haha, relaxa! Desta vez, vamos s\u00f3 ficar de boa por l\u00e1.",
        u"Haha, don\u2019t worry, Aiden. You didn\u2019t mess it up at all \u2013 this entire time with you has been great.": u"Haha, n\u00e3o se preocupe, Aiden. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estragou nada \u2014 todo esse tempo com voc\u00ea foi \u00f3timo.",
        u"Haha, don\u2019t worry, Yuri, the rest of us will play with you.": u"Haha, n\u00e3o se preocupe, Yuri, o resto de n\u00f3s vai jogar com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Haha, everyone seems really overwhelmed with the hotel, and we\u2019re only in the lobby. ": u"Haha, todo mundo parece impressionado demais com o hotel, e ainda estamos s\u00f3 no sagu\u00e3o. ",
        u"Haha, give them some time. It takes some getting used to.": u"Haha, d\u00ea um tempo a eles. Leva um pouco para se acostumar.",
        u"Haha, here we go with fanboy Yoshi.": u"Haha, l\u00e1 vem o Yoshi f\u00e3 do Goro.",
        u"Haha, it feels like we\u2019re all in a big sleepover or something, am I right?": u"Haha, parece que estamos todos numa grande festa do pijama, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Haha, it figures you\u2019d get turned on from finishing a project!": u"Haha, tinha que ser voc\u00ea para ficar excitado depois de terminar um projeto!",
        u"Haha, it looks like you've got everything covered, huh?": u"Haha, parece que voc\u00ea tem tudo sob controle, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Haha, it seems like you\u2019re working on your people-handling skills!": u"Haha, parece que o senhor est\u00e1 aprimorando sua habilidade para lidar com as pessoas!",
        u"Haha, it sounds like you guys have had your own struggles with the storm the last few days.": u"Haha, parece que voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m tiveram seus pr\u00f3prios problemas com a tempestade nos \u00faltimos dias.",
        u"Haha, it takes quite a bit of getting used to.": u"Haha, \u00e9 preciso bastante tempo para se acostumar.",
        u"Haha, it takes time, Jin! You don\u2019t build muscle in a day, after all.": u"Haha, leva tempo, Jin! Afinal, ningu\u00e9m ganha m\u00fasculos em um dia.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s already sunset though. I think we\u2019ve worked out enough for today.": u"Haha, mas o sol j\u00e1 est\u00e1 se pondo. Acho que treinamos o suficiente por hoje.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s alright! We\u2019re gonna go on more trips like this in the future, I\u2019m sure!": u"Haha, tudo bem! Tenho certeza de que faremos mais viagens assim no futuro!",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s alright, Yuri. I can manage!": u"Haha, tudo bem, Yuri. Eu dou conta!",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s alright, getting you tipsy worked like a charm. You slept like a baby.": u"Haha, tudo bem. Deixar voc\u00ea meio b\u00eabado funcionou perfeitamente. Voc\u00ea dormiu como um beb\u00ea.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s alright~ I\u2019ll let you two take the spotlight for a minute! ": u"Haha, tudo bem~ Vou deixar voc\u00eas dois ficarem no centro das aten\u00e7\u00f5es por um minuto! ",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s always fun to watch them gush about this stuff though! Dar and I have learned to trigger them too~": u"Haha, mas \u00e9 sempre divertido ver como eles ficam empolgados com essas coisas! Eu e Dar tamb\u00e9m aprendemos a provocar os dois~",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve been to Camp Buddy and I wanted to have a little tour, and Mr. Nomoru was nice enough to give me a very good one.": u"Haha, faz um tempo desde que vim ao Camp Buddy e queria fazer um pequeno passeio, e o Sr. Nomoru teve a gentileza de me mostrar tudo muito bem.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s good to see you two getting along better.": u"Haha, \u00e9 bom ver voc\u00eas duas se dando melhor.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s just if he wants to! I\u2019m just saying it\u2019s a possibility!": u"Haha, s\u00f3 se ele quiser! Estou apenas dizendo que \u00e9 uma possibilidade!",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s really nice to see you get excited when it comes to anything art related.": u"Haha, \u00e9 muito bom ver voc\u00ea se empolgar quando o assunto \u00e9 arte.",
        u"Haha, it\u2019s really nice to talk with you like this, Darius!": u"Haha, \u00e9 muito bom conversar assim com voc\u00ea, Darius!",
        u"Haha, let Jin be, Aiden. As long as he\u2019s enjoying his vacation, then he can do whatever he wants!": u"Haha, deixe Jin em paz, Aiden. Desde que esteja aproveitando as f\u00e9rias, pode fazer o que quiser!",
        u"Haha, looks like everyone really does get up earlier than me. ": u"Haha, parece que todo mundo realmente acorda mais cedo do que eu. ",
        u"Haha, looks like you got demoted, huh Gramps?": u"Haha, parece que foi rebaixado, hein, vov\u00f4?",
        u"Haha, maybe he\u2019ll have to lead a new bike club soon.": u"Haha, talvez ele tenha que liderar um novo clube de motociclistas em breve.",
        u"Haha, maybe it\u2019s their dessert!": u"Haha, talvez seja a sobremesa deles!",
        u"Haha, me too. Now come on, let\u2019s get started for the day!": u"Haha, eu tamb\u00e9m. Agora vamos, temos que come\u00e7ar o trabalho de hoje!",
        u"Haha, no can do! The cold messes up our workouts!": u"Haha, n\u00e3o d\u00e1! O frio atrapalha nossos treinos!",
        u"Haha, no need to apologize, Natsumi. Having you all with us today is all Yoshinori and I could\u2019ve wanted.": u"Haha, n\u00e3o precisa se desculpar, Natsumi. Ter todos voc\u00eas conosco hoje \u00e9 tudo que Yoshinori e eu poder\u00edamos desejar.",
        u"Haha, not exactly \u2013 poor Yoshi here\u2019s been losing his mind without stuff to keep him busy!": u"Haha, n\u00e3o exatamente \u2014 o pobre Yoshi estava ficando maluco sem nada para mant\u00ea-lo ocupado!",
        u"Haha, now you know the real history.": u"Haha, agora voc\u00ea conhece a verdadeira hist\u00f3ria.",
        u"Haha, okay, okay, fair enough! You two can have a pass this time.": u"Haha, certo, certo, justo! Desta vez voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o dispensados.",
        u"Haha, one day, perhaps!": u"Haha, talvez um dia!",
        u"Haha, relax, Yuri! It\u2019s these two\u2019s big day, after all! We should congratulate them!": u"Haha, relaxa, Yuri! Afinal, hoje \u00e9 o grande dia deles! Dever\u00edamos parabeniz\u00e1-los!",
        u"Haha, same, but I held back on the beers this time \u2013 don\u2019t wanna wake up to our sponsorship getting cancelled \u2019cause I lost all my clothes again!  ": u"Haha, eu tamb\u00e9m, mas desta vez maneirei na cerveja \u2014 n\u00e3o quero acordar e descobrir que nosso patroc\u00ednio foi cancelado porque perdi todas as roupas de novo!  ",
        u"Haha, see you guys later! Yoshi and I are gonna keep chilling here for now.": u"Haha, at\u00e9 mais, pessoal! Eu e o Yoshi vamos continuar relaxando aqui por enquanto.",
        u"Haha, seems like you might\u2019ve partied a bit too much last night.": u"Haha, parece que voc\u00ea festejou um pouco demais ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Haha, sorry, Yoichi! It must\u2019ve slipped my mind.": u"Haha, desculpa, Yoichi! Devo ter esquecido.",
        u"Haha, sounds like you\u2019re very excited to see your friends, Yoichi~!": u"Haha, parece que est\u00e1 muito animado para ver seus amigos, Yoichi~!",
        u"Haha, sure thing, Yoshi!": u"Haha, claro, Yoshi!",
        u"Haha, that kinda reminds me of the Buddy Law, sir.": u"Haha, isso me lembra um pouco a Lei Buddy, senhor.",
        u"Haha, that\u2019s mostly all we did at my house.": u"Haha, era praticamente s\u00f3 isso que faz\u00edamos na minha casa.",
        u"Haha, the job\u2019s not all the fun and games I thought when we were young, but I couldn\u2019t be any happier here. This is more than just a job to me, after all.": u"Haha, o trabalho n\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 divers\u00e3o como eu imaginava quando \u00e9ramos jovens, mas n\u00e3o poderia estar mais feliz aqui. Afinal, isto \u00e9 mais que um emprego para mim.",
        u"Haha, there goes your record you stupid Wolfboy!": u"Haha, l\u00e1 se foi seu recorde, seu Garoto-Lobo idiota!",
        u"Haha, there was nothing to worry about after all, Darius.": u"Haha, no fim das contas n\u00e3o havia nada com que se preocupar, Darius.",
        u"Haha, there\u2019s still a few days left in the trip after all.": u"Haha, afinal, ainda temos alguns dias de viagem pela frente.",
        u"Haha, this really reminds me of the costume party during camp. It feels nostalgic!": u"Haha, isso realmente me lembra a festa \u00e0 fantasia durante o acampamento. Que nostalgia!",
        u"Haha, true. But we somehow finished touring around even earlier than yesterday, so there\u2019s still a few hours left before bed.": u"Haha, verdade. Mas de algum jeito terminamos o passeio ainda mais cedo que ontem, ent\u00e3o ainda faltam algumas horas para dormir.",
        u"Haha, we were just looking around for a place to hang out! Staying in our room can get boring, after all.": u"Haha, est\u00e1vamos procurando um lugar para passar o tempo! Afinal, ficar no quarto pode ser entediante.",
        u"Haha, well I did spend most of the summer helping Bro Aiden out in here.": u"Haha, bem, passei boa parte do ver\u00e3o ajudando o mano Aiden aqui.",
        u"Haha, well I guess I won\u2019t complain about that then.": u"Haha, bem, acho que n\u00e3o vou reclamar disso.",
        u"Haha, well it sounds like you\u2019ve fully made up your mind! I won\u2019t try and convince you any further!": u"Haha, bem, parece que voc\u00ea realmente tomou sua decis\u00e3o! N\u00e3o vou mais tentar convenc\u00ea-lo!",
        u"Haha, well it\u2019s not too different from this except with dancing and some extra cringe.": u"Haha, bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 muito diferente disso, tirando a dan\u00e7a e uma dose extra de vergonha alheia.",
        u"Haha, we\u2019re glad you enjoyed being here so much, sir. We wouldn\u2019t have been able to clean up everything as quickly without your help, either. ": u"Haha, ficamos felizes que tenha gostado tanto de estar aqui, senhor. Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos conseguido limpar tudo t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido sem sua ajuda. ",
        u"Haha, we\u2019re just as surprised! Even though we took different paths after that first term, we ended up being reunited like this \u2013 and for the future of the camp too!": u"Haha, estamos igualmente surpresos! Embora tenhamos seguido caminhos diferentes depois daquela primeira temporada, acabamos reunidos desta forma \u2014 e pelo futuro do acampamento!",
        u"Haha, we\u2019re mostly just cleaning up after him.": u"Haha, basicamente s\u00f3 estamos limpando o que ele deixa para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"Haha, what can I say? You\u2019ve always been my role model after all!": u"Haha, o que posso dizer? Afinal, o senhor sempre foi meu exemplo!",
        u"Haha, what happened to the scout who never ran out of energy back then?": u"Haha, o que aconteceu com aquele escoteiro que nunca ficava sem energia?",
        u"Haha, whatever you like, then! ": u"Haha, como preferir, ent\u00e3o! ",
        u"Haha, why am I not surprised that\u2019s what you wanted to do?": u"Haha, por que n\u00e3o estou surpreso que era isso que voc\u00ea queria fazer?",
        u"Haha, why should we bother hiding it? We always have room for more~": u"Haha, por que dever\u00edamos nos dar ao trabalho de esconder? Sempre temos espa\u00e7o para mais um~",
        u"Haha, why would I need to when I have you around to cook for me~?": u"Haha, por que eu precisaria, se tenho voc\u00ea por perto para cozinhar para mim~?",
        u"Haha, with any luck, she\u2019ll keep Yuri from going too crazy.": u"Haha, com sorte, ela vai impedir Yuri de exagerar demais.",
        u"Haha, yeah! Although I think we left some dirty dishes last night\u2026": u"Haha, \u00e9! Embora eu ache que deixamos alguns pratos sujos ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"Haha, yeah! Do that!": u"Haha, isso! Faz isso!",
        u"Haha, yeah! I remember that you\u2019d make it a point to go to the local sauna once a week when I was a scout.": u"Haha, sim! Lembro que o senhor fazia quest\u00e3o de ir \u00e0 sauna local uma vez por semana quando eu era escoteiro.",
        u"Haha, yeah! Welcome to my world! That\u2019s why my little chef, Hiro, was such a big help back during the summer!": u"Haha, sim! Bem-vindo ao meu mundo! Por isso o meu pequeno chef, Hiro, ajudou tanto durante o ver\u00e3o!",
        u"Haha, yeah, it\u2019s like a pressure cooker in here, \u2019specially when the people start coming inside the mess hall!": u"Haha, sim, isto aqui vira uma panela de press\u00e3o, principalmente quando as pessoas come\u00e7am a entrar no refeit\u00f3rio!",
        u"Haha, yeah, sorry guys. ": u"Haha, sim, desculpem, pessoal. ",
        u"Haha, yeah\u2026": u"Haha, sim\u2026",
        u"Haha, you already had everything you needed to succeed from the start.": u"Haha, desde o come\u00e7o voc\u00ea j\u00e1 tinha tudo de que precisava para ter sucesso.",
        u"Haha, you can count on me, Yuri~ Take the chance you have and do the things you always wanted to.": u"Haha, pode contar comigo, Yuri~ Aproveite esta oportunidade e fa\u00e7a as coisas que sempre quis fazer.",
        u"Haha, you could almost say this was a \u2018scoutmaster season!\u2019": u"Haha, quase d\u00e1 para dizer que esta foi uma \u2018temporada dos chefes escoteiros!\u2019",
        u"Haha, you do look a tad red, Yoshinori. ": u"Haha, voc\u00ea realmente parece um pouco vermelho, Yoshinori. ",
        u"Haha, you do spend a lot of time with them now, sir.": u"Haha, o senhor realmente passa bastante tempo com eles agora.",
        u"Haha, you got carried away with your speech again, Yoshi.": u"Haha, voc\u00ea se empolgou com o discurso de novo, Yoshi.",
        u"Haha, you guys should\u2019ve seen him over the last few years, then! He was the stiffest and scariest guy you\u2019d ever met!": u"Haha, ent\u00e3o voc\u00eas deveriam ter visto ele nos \u00faltimos anos! Era o cara mais r\u00edgido e assustador que voc\u00eas poderiam conhecer!",
        u"Haha, you should know Taiga\u2019s quite the crafty scout!": u"Haha, voc\u00ea devia saber que Taiga \u00e9 um escoteiro muito habilidoso com trabalhos manuais!",
        u"Haha, you shoulda been with us last term, when we went to the beach with the scouts!": u"Haha, voc\u00ea devia ter estado com a gente no \u00faltimo per\u00edodo, quando fomos \u00e0 praia com os escoteiros!",
        u"Haha, you should\u2019ve seen him with the axe! Those trees toppled down with just a couple swings!": u"Haha, voc\u00ea deveria t\u00ea-lo visto com o machado! Aquelas \u00e1rvores ca\u00edram com apenas alguns golpes!",
        u"Haha, you were clumsy, especially back in the days. You\u2019d always show up with lots of bandages.": u"Haha, voc\u00ea era desajeitado, principalmente antigamente. Sempre aparecia cheio de curativos.",
        u"Haha, you were moaning so loud too!": u"Haha, e voc\u00ea estava gemendo t\u00e3o alto!",
        u"Haha, you\u2019re acting like a scoutmaster even now, Yoshinori.": u"Haha, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 agindo como chefe escoteiro at\u00e9 agora, Yoshinori.",
        u"Haha, you\u2019re just as energetic as ever, Aiden.": u"Haha, voc\u00ea continua t\u00e3o cheio de energia quanto sempre, Aiden.",
        u"Haha, you\u2019re quite the role model, as always! Believe it or not, you\u2019re one of the people I looked up to when it came to leadership.": u"Haha, voc\u00ea continua sendo um grande exemplo! Acredite ou n\u00e3o, voc\u00ea era uma das pessoas em quem eu me inspirava quando o assunto era lideran\u00e7a.",
        u"Haha, you\u2019re right, Gramps. A couple more rounds and you\u2019ll have Yoshi and I stripped bare.": u"Haha, tem raz\u00e3o, Vov\u00f4. Mais algumas rodadas e voc\u00ea vai deixar eu e Yoshi pelados.",
        u"Haha, yup! But you were the instigator tonight, Yoshi~": u"Haha, sim! Mas hoje \u00e0 noite foi voc\u00ea quem come\u00e7ou, Yoshi~",
        u"Haha, yup! The little guy was begging to come help, and I just couldn\u2019t say no to that face.": u"Haha, sim! O baixinho estava implorando para ajudar, e eu simplesmente n\u00e3o consegui dizer n\u00e3o para essa carinha.",
        u"Hahaha!  You\u2019ve always been the country kind of guy, Yoshinori. It\u2019ll really be interesting to see you get a taste of city life.": u"Hahaha!  Voc\u00ea sempre foi um cara do interior, Yoshinori. Vai ser muito interessante ver voc\u00ea experimentar um pouco da vida na cidade.",
        u"Hahaha! Alright, alright! But just because you helped me today!": u"Hahaha! Est\u00e1 bem, est\u00e1 bem! Mas s\u00f3 porque voc\u00ea me ajudou hoje!",
        u"Hahaha! Anyways, I\u2019ll tag along with you~ I can just chill on the couch at the office while you work!": u"Hahaha! Enfim, vou com voc\u00ea~ Posso ficar relaxando no sof\u00e1 do escrit\u00f3rio enquanto voc\u00ea trabalha!",
        u"Hahaha! Can\u2019t believe that worked, Gramps!": u"Hahaha! N\u00e3o acredito que isso funcionou, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"Hahaha! Come on, Gramps! Nothing wrong with a bunch of dudes stripping down together! Speaking of\u2026": u"Hahaha! Qual \u00e9, Vov\u00f4! N\u00e3o tem nada de errado em um bando de caras tirando a roupa juntos! Falando nisso\u2026",
        u"Hahaha! Come on, you asked for that one!": u"Hahaha! Qual \u00e9, voc\u00ea pediu por essa!",
        u"Hahaha! Don\u2019t mention it! I feel indebted to you all as well, you know.": u"Hahaha! N\u00e3o h\u00e1 de qu\u00ea! Eu tamb\u00e9m me sinto em d\u00edvida com todos voc\u00eas, sabia?",
        u"Hahaha! Don\u2019t you think we did lots of that already?": u"Hahaha! N\u00e3o acha que j\u00e1 fizemos bastante disso?",
        u"Hahaha! Getting dibs on the most difficult one, I see. ": u"Hahaha! Escolhendo a tarefa mais dif\u00edcil primeiro, pelo visto.",
        u"Hahaha! Guess my prophecy about Darius splitting someone in half will come true.": u"Hahaha! Acho que minha profecia sobre o Darius partir algu\u00e9m ao meio vai se realizar.",
        u"Hahaha! Guess we really worked him up~": u"Hahaha! Acho que deixamos ele bem excitado~",
        u"Hahaha! He totally would!": u"Hahaha! Com certeza faria isso!",
        u"Hahaha! Honestly, I can\u2019t blame those guys after seeing Gramps\u2019 monster cock.": u"Hahaha! Sinceramente, n\u00e3o posso culpar aqueles caras depois de verem o pau monstruoso do vov\u00f4.",
        u"Hahaha! I can imagine!": u"Hahaha! Imagino!",
        u"Hahaha! I can\u2019t believe you spied on Gramps like that, Yoshi!": u"Hahaha! N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea espionou o Vov\u00f4 daquele jeito, Yoshi!",
        u"Hahaha! I could get drunk on this stuff every night! Damn, it\u2019s tasty!": u"Hahaha! Eu poderia ficar b\u00eabado com isso toda noite! Caramba, \u00e9 gostoso!",
        u"Hahaha! I do feel better after a hot shower, though!": u"Hahaha! Mas me sinto bem melhor depois de um banho quente!",
        u"Hahaha! I don\u2019t think so, I think Darius just thought the conversation was over.": u"Hahaha! Acho que n\u00e3o. Acho que Darius apenas entendeu que a conversa tinha terminado.",
        u"Hahaha! I figured Yuri and Aiden were right that I\u2019m not getting any younger. Might as well laugh about it, don't you think?": u"Hahaha! Percebi que Yuri e Aiden t\u00eam raz\u00e3o: n\u00e3o estou ficando mais jovem. \u00c9 melhor rir disso, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"Hahaha! I guess it doesn\u2019t sound bad at all when you put it that way!": u"Hahaha! Acho que n\u00e3o parece nada ruim quando voc\u00ea fala desse jeito!",
        u"Hahaha! I like the sound of that~!": u"Hahaha! Gostei disso~!",
        u"Hahaha! I pay attention~": u"Hahaha! Eu presto aten\u00e7\u00e3o~",
        u"Hahaha! I told him he couldn\u2019t tell me where to piss!": u"Hahaha! Eu disse que ele n\u00e3o podia mandar onde eu devo mijar!",
        u"Hahaha! I understand why Aiden does it so often. You make it too easy.": u"Hahaha! Entendo por que Aiden faz isso tanto. Voc\u00ea facilita demais.",
        u"Hahaha! It\u2019s about time! I was getting worried I was going to die before you confessed!": u"Hahaha! J\u00e1 estava na hora! Eu estava come\u00e7ando a achar que morreria antes de voc\u00eas se declararem!",
        u"Hahaha! It\u2019s not really that far of a ride, we should be fine!": u"Hahaha! O trajeto nem \u00e9 t\u00e3o longo assim, vamos ficar bem!",
        u"Hahaha! I\u2019m just messing with you, Yoshi!": u"Hahaha! Estou apenas brincando com voc\u00ea, Yoshi!",
        u"Hahaha! I\u2019m just teasing you! ": u"Hahaha! Estou apenas provocando voc\u00ea! ",
        u"Hahaha! I\u2019m not as fragile as I look, you know! I used to be quite tough back in my more youthful days!  ": u"Hahaha! N\u00e3o sou t\u00e3o fr\u00e1gil quanto pare\u00e7o, sabia! Eu era bem resistente nos meus tempos de juventude!  ",
        u"Hahaha! Look what you just did, Gramps! You scared him with your anaconda!": u"Hahaha! Olhe o que acabou de fazer, vov\u00f4! Assustou o rapaz com sua anaconda!",
        u"Hahaha! Now this DOES feel like old times! You used to be such a troublemaker, Aiden.": u"Hahaha! Agora isto REALMENTE parece os velhos tempos! Voc\u00ea era um grande encrenqueiro, Aiden.",
        u"Hahaha! Now we\u2019re talking, Yoshi!": u"Hahaha! Agora estamos falando, Yoshi!",
        u"Hahaha! Okay, that\u2019s a fair point. It is a little chilly in this now, though.": u"Hahaha! Certo, justo. Mas est\u00e1 um pouco frio usando isso agora.",
        u"Hahaha! Round three, here we \u2018come\u2019!": u"Hahaha! Terceiro round, l\u00e1 vamos n\u00f3s!",
        u"Hahaha! So much for your winning streak, Gramps!": u"Hahaha! E l\u00e1 se foi sua sequ\u00eancia de vit\u00f3rias, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"Hahaha! Teasing doesn\u2019t suit you, Yoshinori.": u"Hahaha! Provocar n\u00e3o combina com voc\u00ea, Yoshinori.",
        u"Hahaha! That eager to make me relive my glory days, huh?": u"Hahaha! T\u00e3o ansioso assim para me fazer reviver meus dias de gl\u00f3ria, hein?",
        u"Hahaha! That\u2019s a funny one, Dar!": u"Hahaha! Essa foi boa, Dar!",
        u"Hahaha! That\u2019s the same look you had every time you messed up, even after I taught you!": u"Hahaha! Essa \u00e9 a mesma express\u00e3o que fazia sempre que errava, mesmo depois de eu ensin\u00e1-lo!",
        u"Hahaha! That\u2019s what you get for sticking around me too much, Yoshi~": u"Hahaha! \u00c9 isso que acontece quando voc\u00ea fica muito tempo perto de mim, Yoshi~",
        u"Hahaha! They really want a piece of me, don\u2019t they~?": u"Hahaha! Eles realmente querem um peda\u00e7o de mim, n\u00e3o \u00e9~?",
        u"Hahaha! Well, maybe it really was fate then that landed you here!": u"Hahaha! Bem, talvez tenha sido mesmo o destino que trouxe voc\u00eas at\u00e9 aqui!",
        u"Hahaha! We\u2019re scoutmasters!": u"Hahaha! Somos chefes escoteiros!",
        u"Hahaha! What a fun idea! Tell me all the other nicknames you have, lad! ": u"Hahaha! Que ideia divertida! Conte todos os outros apelidos que voc\u00ea tem, rapaz! ",
        u"Hahaha! Who\u2019s the fluffy pups? Yes, you are!": u"Hahaha! Quem s\u00e3o os filhotinhos fofos? S\u00e3o voc\u00eas!",
        u"Hahaha! Yeah, \u2018cause that\u2019s your job, right?": u"Hahaha! Sim, porque esse trabalho \u00e9 seu, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Hahaha! Yoshinori, I\u2019m glad you\u2019re around to be a voice of reason for my son here.": u"Hahaha! Yoshinori, fico feliz que esteja por perto para ser a voz da raz\u00e3o do meu filho.",
        u"Hahaha! Yoshi\u2019s turned all red again!": u"Hahaha! Yoshi ficou todo vermelho de novo!",
        u"Hahaha! You did save me a ton of time!": u"Hahaha! Voc\u00ea realmente me poupou muito tempo!",
        u"Hahaha! You know she can\u2019t resist when it comes to her fantasies!": u"Hahaha! Voc\u00ea sabe que ela n\u00e3o resiste \u00e0s pr\u00f3prias fantasias!",
        u"Hahaha! You should be used to it by now!": u"Hahaha! A essa altura voc\u00ea j\u00e1 deveria estar acostumado!",
        u"Hahaha! You still remember, huh?": u"Hahaha! Voc\u00ea ainda se lembra, hein?",
        u"Hahaha! You sure?": u"Hahaha! Tem certeza?",
        u"Hahaha! Your reaction always cracks me up, even after all this time.": u"Hahaha! Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o sempre me faz rir, mesmo depois de todo esse tempo.",
        u"Hahaha! Your reaction is priceless!!": u"Hahaha! Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o tem pre\u00e7o!!",
        u"Hahaha! You\u2019re not even denying it!": u"Hahaha! Voc\u00ea nem est\u00e1 negando!",
        u"Hahaha! You\u2019re not really used to the compliments, huh sir?": u"Hahaha! O senhor realmente n\u00e3o est\u00e1 acostumado a receber elogios, hein?",
        u"Hahaha! You\u2019re red as a tomato, Yoshi!": u"Hahaha! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 vermelho como um tomate, Yoshi!",
        u"Hahaha!! Don\u2019t get too flustered, Yoshinori! ": u"Hahaha!! N\u00e3o fique t\u00e3o perturbado, Yoshinori! ",
        u"Hahaha, I don\u2019t mean it that way, Yoshinori! Yuri\u2019s my daughter.": u"Hahaha, n\u00e3o quis dizer desse jeito, Yoshinori! Yuri \u00e9 minha filha.",
        u"Hahaha, I guess that\u2019s true. I do have quite a lot of  art and literature in my collection.": u"Hahaha, acho que \u00e9 verdade. Tenho mesmo muitas obras de arte e literatura em minha cole\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Hahaha, Yoshi and I looked like headless chickens, not knowing what to order!": u"Hahaha, eu e o Yoshi parec\u00edamos duas baratas tontas sem saber o que pedir!",
        u"Hahaha, alright!": u"Hahaha, certo!",
        u"Hahaha, and you thought I was the one being nervous earlier.": u"Hahaha, e antes voc\u00ea pensava que eu era quem estava nervoso.",
        u"Hahaha, but that just shows how good of friends they are!": u"Hahaha, mas isso s\u00f3 mostra como eles s\u00e3o bons amigos!",
        u"Hahaha, did you really only just notice? It\u2019s been like that since we woke up.": u"Hahaha, voc\u00ea s\u00f3 percebeu agora? Est\u00e1 assim desde que acordamos.",
        u"Hahaha, do you want to give me something to gawk at so badly?": u"Hahaha, quer tanto assim me dar alguma coisa para ficar admirando?",
        u"Hahaha, exactly, sir! It\u2019s a good thing though!": u"Hahaha, exatamente, senhor! Mas isso \u00e9 algo bom!",
        u"Hahaha, he looked really embarrassed.": u"Hahaha, ele parecia muito envergonhado.",
        u"Hahaha, it looks like Sir Goro\u2019s just as excited that the scouts are back and he just won\u2019t admit it.": u"Hahaha, parece que o Sr. Goro est\u00e1 t\u00e3o animado quanto n\u00f3s com a volta dos escoteiros, s\u00f3 n\u00e3o quer admitir.",
        u"Hahaha, let it go, Yuri! Gramps\u2019 face is already red!": u"Hahaha, deixa isso para l\u00e1, Yuri! O rosto do Vov\u00f4 j\u00e1 est\u00e1 vermelho!",
        u"Hahaha, let\u2019s take a break for a while, then!": u"Hahaha, ent\u00e3o vamos fazer uma pausa!",
        u"Hahaha, of course!": u"Hahaha, claro!",
        u"Hahaha, of course.": u"Hahaha, claro.",
        u"Hahaha, of course. Now, I believe we\u2019ve covered all matters that needed to be discussed today?": u"Hahaha, \u00e9 claro. Agora, creio que abordamos todos os assuntos que precisavam ser discutidos hoje, certo?",
        u"Hahaha, so much for patience, huh? That\u2019s the first time I\u2019ve seen Gramps blow a gasket in a while!": u"Hahaha, e l\u00e1 se foi a paci\u00eancia, hein? Faz tempo que n\u00e3o vejo o Vov\u00f4 perder a cabe\u00e7a assim!",
        u"Hahaha, spare me the compliments, Jin. ": u"Hahaha, poupe-me dos elogios, Jin. ",
        u"Hahaha, thank you!": u"Hahaha, obrigado!",
        u"Hahaha, that's true, but it's hard to please you, Gramps! You only praise us once in a blue moon!": u"Hahaha, \u00e9 verdade, mas \u00e9 dif\u00edcil agrad\u00e1-lo, Vov\u00f4! Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 nos elogia uma vez na vida e outra na morte!",
        u"Hahaha, that\u2019s just what I\u2019d expect, Yoshi!": u"Hahaha, \u00e9 exatamente o que eu esperava de voc\u00ea, Yoshi!",
        u"Hahaha, there you go again, Aiden\u2026": u"Hahaha, l\u00e1 vem voc\u00ea de novo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"Hahaha, totally the opposite of the snot-covered face we just saw!": u"Hahaha, totalmente o oposto daquela cara toda melequenta que acabamos de ver!",
        u"Hahaha, what else is new?": u"Hahaha, nenhuma novidade, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Hahaha, yeah. Just let her process it.": u"Hahaha, \u00e9. S\u00f3 deixe ela assimilar isso.",
        u"Hahahaha! Good one, bro!": u"Hahahaha! Essa foi boa, cara!",
        u"Hahahaha! Not bad, Yoshinori!": u"Hahahaha! Nada mal, Yoshinori!",
        u"Hahahaha! Why, I wouldn\u2019t put you in such an impossible situation, Mr. Nomoru!": u"Hahahaha! Ora, eu n\u00e3o o colocaria em uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e3o imposs\u00edvel, senhor Nomoru!",
        u"Hahaha\u2026 Maybe it is a good idea to have you both stay in here\u2026": u"Hahaha\u2026 Talvez seja mesmo uma boa ideia voc\u00eas dois ficarem aqui dentro\u2026",
        u"Haha\u2026 Now who\u2019s the sentimental one?": u"Haha\u2026 E quem \u00e9 a sentimental agora?",
        u"Haha\u2026! I was just joking, sir!": u"Haha\u2026! Eu estava s\u00f3 brincando, senhor!",
        u"Hahhh... See that, Aiden? That's the sound he makes when he's actually into it.": u"Hahhh... Viu isso, Aiden? Esse \u00e9 o som que ele faz quando est\u00e1 gostando de verdade.",
        u"Hahhh... Show us everything you've got, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Hahhh\u2026 Mostre tudo que voc\u00ea tem, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Hahhh... You must be getting close, Yoshinori... Let it all out.": u"Hahhh... Voc\u00ea deve estar quase l\u00e1, Yoshinori... Solta tudo.",
        u"Hahhhh! So, now that I\u2019ve taken care of that, it looks like you owe me. ": u"Hahhhh! Agora que cuidei disso, parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 me devendo. ",
        u"Hahhh\u2026 Harder\u2026": u"Hahhh\u2026 Mais forte\u2026",
        u"Hahhh\u2026 It\u2019s been so long, Yoshinori\u2026 I forgot how tight you were\u2026": u"Hahhh\u2026 Faz tanto tempo, Yoshinori\u2026 Eu tinha esquecido como voc\u00ea era apertado\u2026",
        u"Hahhh\u2026 You alright, Yoshi\u2026?": u"Hahhh\u2026 Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshi\u2026?",
        u"Hahhh\u2026 You feel amazing, Yoshinori.": u"Hahhh\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 incr\u00edvel, Yoshinori.",
        u"Hahhh\u2026 Your chimney is quite tight, Yoshinori. But don\u2019t worry, I\u2019m squeezing through it carefully~": u"Hahhh\u2026 Sua chamin\u00e9 \u00e9 bem apertada, Yoshinori. Mas n\u00e3o se preocupe, estou passando por ela com cuidado~",
        u"Hah\u2026! Don\u2019t even think for a second that you\u2019re the one in control, Yoshinori!": u"Hah\u2026! Nem pense por um segundo que \u00e9 voc\u00ea quem est\u00e1 no controle, Yoshinori!",
        u"Hah\u2026! You think I\u2019m just gonna sit here and let you do all the work? ": u"Hah\u2026! Acha que vou ficar aqui sentado deixando voc\u00ea fazer todo o trabalho? ",
        u"Hang in there, Emilia\u2026!": u"Aguente firme, Emilia\u2026!",
        u"Hangout and talk.": u"Ficar conversando.",
