        u"Have fun on your date with the cute new guy, Yoshi~! ": u"Divirta-se no encontro com o novato bonitinho, Yoshi~! ",
        u"Have fun~": u"Divirtam-se~",
        u"Have some breakfast.": u"Tomar caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3.",
