        u"Have you tried sipping a nice, warm cup of chamomile tea before bed? It\u2019s a natural and organic treatment for insomnia! ": u"J\u00e1 tentou tomar uma boa x\u00edcara de ch\u00e1 de camomila quente antes de dormir? \u00c9 um tratamento natural e org\u00e2nico para ins\u00f4nia!",
        u"Haven\u2019t you gushed over everyone enough today?!": u"Voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o elogiou todo mundo o suficiente por hoje?!",
        u"Having a family at a young age, I kept pushing for the idea of a perfect one. ": u"Por ter formado uma fam\u00edlia ainda jovem, continuei insistindo na ideia de uma fam\u00edlia perfeita. ",
        u"Having a family, I had to let go of my reckless ways in order to be a good husband, and especially a good father.  The rest is history.": u"Quando formei uma fam\u00edlia, tive que abandonar meu jeito imprudente para ser um bom marido e, principalmente, um bom pai.  O resto \u00e9 hist\u00f3ria.",
        u"Having a family, I had to let go of my reckless ways in order to be a good husband, and especially a good father.  The rest is history.{fast}": u"Quando formei uma fam\u00edlia, tive que abandonar meu jeito imprudente para ser um bom marido e, principalmente, um bom pai.  O resto \u00e9 hist\u00f3ria.{fast}",
        u"Having second thoughts about Mr. Clermont\u2019s offer?": u"Est\u00e1 tendo d\u00favidas sobre a proposta do Sr. Clermont?",
        u"Having sex is also a way to \u2018relax\u2019~ So don\u2019t be shy to admit it, Gramps!": u"Fazer sexo tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 uma forma de \u2018relaxar\u2019~ Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o tenha vergonha de admitir, vov\u00f4!",
        u"Having someone to cook with or cook for is what makes a dish a lot more special.": u"Ter algu\u00e9m com quem cozinhar ou para quem cozinhar \u00e9 o que torna um prato muito mais especial.",
        u"Having someone to tell all my thoughts to is still new to me. It really does help.  ": u"Ter algu\u00e9m para quem contar todos os meus pensamentos ainda \u00e9 novidade para mim. Realmente ajuda.  ",
        u"Having this isn\u2019t always a good thing either, you know\u2026! Sometimes it\u2019s impossible to keep it hidden away when you have any unexpected\u2014": u"Ter isto tamb\u00e9m nem sempre \u00e9 bom, sabiam\u2026?! \u00c0s vezes \u00e9 imposs\u00edvel escond\u00ea-la quando acontece alguma coisa inesperada\u2014",
        u"Having three men being \u2018hands-on\u2019 really motivated me\u2026!": u"Ter tr\u00eas homens colocando a m\u00e3o na massa realmente me motivou\u2026!",
        u"Having two men being \u2018hands-on\u2019 really motivated me\u2026!": u"Ter dois homens colocando a m\u00e3o na massa realmente me motivou\u2026!",
        u"Having you all here has been one of the best times I\u2019ve had working here!": u"Ter todos voc\u00eas aqui foi uma das melhores experi\u00eancias que j\u00e1 tive trabalhando neste lugar!",
