        u"He actually got an offer.": u"Na verdade, ele recebeu uma oferta.",
        u"He already is.": u"Ele j\u00e1 \u00e9.",
        u"He already kinda is.": u"De certa forma, ele j\u00e1 \u00e9.",
        u"He also took care of the sanitation of facilities and occasional repairs on top of that, which he always handled without fail.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, cuidava da limpeza das instala\u00e7\u00f5es e de reparos ocasionais, sempre sem falhar.",
        u"He always listens to everything I have to say, and you guys know I run my mouth a lot.": u"Ele sempre escuta tudo o que tenho a dizer, e voc\u00eas sabem que eu falo pra caramba.",
        u"He always managed to turn something bad around, and found a reason to appreciate the littlest things, despite his illness.": u"Ele sempre conseguia transformar algo ruim e encontrava motivos para valorizar at\u00e9 as menores coisas, apesar da doen\u00e7a.",
        u"He always talks about how painful it would be to get it done, but I could take it!": u"Ele sempre fala de como seria doloroso fazer, mas eu aguentaria!",
        u"He and I already talked about it, and we\u2019re on the same page.": u"N\u00f3s j\u00e1 conversamos sobre isso e estamos de acordo.",
        u"He annoys everyone else here too, but you\u2019ll get used to him.": u"Ele tamb\u00e9m irrita todo mundo daqui, mas voc\u00ea vai se acostumar.",
        u"He asked me for everyone\u2019s uniform measurements a few weeks ago, so he got all of our sizes.": u"Ele me pediu as medidas dos uniformes de todo mundo algumas semanas atr\u00e1s, ent\u00e3o conseguiu os tamanhos de todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"He came running and screaming to see me as soon as he saw it.": u"Ele veio correndo e gritando atr\u00e1s de mim assim que viu.",
        u"He did mine a while ago and it was pretty spot-on about my past. I was really surprised and kinda spooked at the same time!": u"Ele fez uma leitura para mim h\u00e1 um tempo e acertou bastante sobre meu passado. Fiquei muito surpreso e meio assustado ao mesmo tempo!",
        u"He did seem to be in a hurry\u2026 He didn\u2019t even drink his coffee\u2026 ": u"Ele parecia estar com pressa\u2026 Nem tomou o caf\u00e9\u2026 ",
        u"He did show me that in one of our meetings. Pretty impressive work.": u"Ele realmente me mostrou isso em uma de nossas reuni\u00f5es. Um trabalho bastante impressionante.",
        u"He did.": u"Ele fez isso mesmo.",
        u"He didn't have enough money to afford all the expenses, so I insisted on contributing to help him.": u"Ele n\u00e3o tinha dinheiro suficiente para arcar com todas as despesas, ent\u00e3o insisti em contribuir para ajud\u00e1-lo.",
        u"He didn\u2019t choose you. You just ran off with him.": u"Ele n\u00e3o escolheu voc\u00ea. Voc\u00ea simplesmente saiu correndo com ele.",
        u"He didn\u2019t have many friends because the other scouts were easily intimidated by him.": u"Ele n\u00e3o tinha muitos amigos porque os outros escoteiros se sentiam facilmente intimidados por ele.",
        u"He does always come up with ways to make them fun for everyone.": u"Ele sempre encontra um jeito de torn\u00e1-las divertidas para todos.",
        u"He does look rather imposing\u2026 But in a good way\u2026": u"Ele realmente parece bastante imponente\u2026 Mas de um jeito bom\u2026",
        u"He does. He\u2019s as clean as a baby.": u"\u00c9 verdade. Ele \u00e9 limpinho como um beb\u00ea.",
        u"He doesn\u2019t have time to handle every issue that arises. So, that\u2019s where I come in.": u"Ele n\u00e3o tem tempo para lidar com cada problema que surgir. \u00c9 a\u00ed que eu entro.",
        u"He doesn\u2019t really pry into others unless he has to.": u"Ele n\u00e3o costuma investigar os sentimentos dos outros a menos que precise.",
        u"He had his underwear on last night\u2026!": u"Ele estava de cueca ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026!",
        u"He had to work multiple jobs at once, trying to earn enough for us both.": u"Ele precisava trabalhar em v\u00e1rios empregos ao mesmo tempo, tentando ganhar o suficiente para n\u00f3s dois.",
        u"He handles so much and does it all so well. I\u2019m content to keep assisting him for now.": u"Ele cuida de tanta coisa e faz tudo t\u00e3o bem. Por enquanto, estou satisfeito em continuar ajudando.",
        u"He has sensitive skin.": u"Ele tem a pele sens\u00edvel.",
        u"He humiliated your beloved camp, putting the sponsorship at risk, by getting drunk and once again flaunting his obscenity in a public place!": u"Ele humilhou o amado acampamento de voc\u00eas, colocando o patroc\u00ednio em risco, ao ficar b\u00eabado e mais uma vez exibir sua obscenidade em p\u00fablico!",
        u"He just really needs some time to himself for now\u2026 Once he gets through with it, he\u2019ll want to see all of us again.": u"Por enquanto, ele realmente precisa de um tempo para si\u2026 Quando superar tudo isso, vai querer ver todos n\u00f3s novamente.",
        u"He lied to oversell his size.": u"Ele mentiu para aumentar o tamanho.",
        u"He looks quite busy on his computer\u2026": u"Ele parece bem ocupado no computador\u2026",
        u"He made us go on that trip hoping to improve our relationship with Ms. Komarova, and we know how that went\u2026": u"Ele nos fez fazer aquela viagem esperando melhorar nossa rela\u00e7\u00e3o com a Srta. Komarova, e sabemos como isso terminou\u2026",
        u"He means it\u2019s good luck.": u"Ele quer dizer que \u00e9 boa sorte.",
