        u"Heh, looks like he passed out. That boy can never handle his liquor.": u"Heh, parece que ele apagou. Esse garoto nunca aguenta a bebida.",
        u"Heh, looks like he's too out of it to say it was me.": u"Heh, parece que ele est\u00e1 atordoado demais para dizer que fui eu.",
        u"Heh, maybe he\u2019d like a job as your sous chef one day.": u"Heh, talvez um dia ele queira trabalhar como seu sous-chef.",
        u"Heh, maybe you're more nice than naughty~ Keep it up, and you\u2019ll get another load of gifts! ": u"Heh, talvez voc\u00ea seja mais bonzinho do que malcriado~ Continue assim e vai ganhar outra carga de presentes! ",
        u"Heh, right Yoshinori?": u"Heh, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Yoshinori?",
        u"Heh, see where this is going now? You\u2019re all chained up for some wrestling!": u"Heh, j\u00e1 entendeu onde isso vai dar? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 todo acorrentado para uma luta corporal!",
        u"Heh, seems like you\u2019re totally out of it. Not that I blame you.": u"Heh, parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 completamente fora de si. N\u00e3o que eu o culpe.",
        u"Heh, so much for being a prepared scoutmaster, right?": u"Heh, e eu que deveria ser um chefe escoteiro preparado, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Heh, speaking of\u2026 I still want to show you one last picture.": u"Heh, falando nisso\u2026 Ainda quero lhe mostrar uma \u00faltima foto.",
        u"Heh, that sounds like a mouthful.": u"Heh, esse nome enche a boca.",
        u"Heh, that\u2019s a good boy. Alright then\u2026": u"Heh, assim que eu gosto. Muito bem, ent\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Heh, thought you said you were gonna kick my ass. ": u"Heh, achei que tinha dito que ia acabar comigo. ",
        u"Heh, wait till you see it with the campers. This place is cramped! ": u"Heh, espere at\u00e9 ver com os campistas. Este lugar fica lotado! ",
        u"Heh, watch where you\u2019re looking.": u"Heh, cuidado para onde est\u00e1 olhando.",
        u"Heh, well look what you did, Yoshi~": u"Heh, olha s\u00f3 o que voc\u00ea fez, Yoshi~",
        u"Heh, when you first brought him, you had no idea how to handle him either, Yoshinori.": u"Heh, quando voc\u00ea o trouxe pela primeira vez, tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o fazia ideia de como lidar com ele, Yoshinori.",
        u"Heh, you could almost say this was a \u2018scoutmaster season\u2019.  ": u"Heh, quase d\u00e1 para dizer que esta foi uma \u2018temporada dos chefes escoteiros\u2019.  ",
        u"Heh, you know me well.": u"Heh, voc\u00ea me conhece bem.",
        u"Heh, you may have had your fun groping me all over before, but it\u2019s my turn now.": u"Heh, voc\u00ea pode ter se divertido me apalpando antes, mas agora \u00e9 a minha vez.",
        u"Heh, you really like fancy living, huh?": u"Heh, voc\u00ea realmente gosta de uma vida luxuosa, hein?",
        u"Heh, you seem pretty confident about that.": u"Heh, voc\u00ea parece bem confiante disso.",
        u"Heh, you should know better by now, Yoshi.": u"Heh, a esta altura voc\u00ea j\u00e1 devia saber, Yoshi.",
        u"Heh, you should\u2019ve seen the look on your face the entire meeting, Yoshinori. You looked like a lost kid in a mall.": u"Heh, voc\u00ea deveria ter visto a pr\u00f3pria express\u00e3o durante toda a reuni\u00e3o, Yoshinori. Parecia uma crian\u00e7a perdida em um shopping.",
        u"Heh, you tried. It was a good workout though, wasn\u2019t it?": u"Heh, voc\u00ea tentou. Mas foi um bom exerc\u00edcio, n\u00e3o foi?",
        u"Heh, your ass is as good as I remember, Yoshinori.": u"Heh, sua bunda \u00e9 t\u00e3o boa quanto eu me lembrava, Yoshinori.",
        u"Heh. Said like a true scoutmaster.": u"Heh. Falou como um verdadeiro chefe escoteiro.",
        u"Heh. Suddenly my drawing doesn\u2019t look so bad.": u"Heh. De repente meu desenho n\u00e3o parece t\u00e3o ruim.",
        u"Heh. That\u2019s what was I telling Yoshinori here.": u"Heh. Era exatamente isso que eu estava dizendo ao Yoshinori.",
        u"Heh... That\u2019s exactly why I brought you here.": u"Heh\u2026 Foi exatamente por isso que trouxe voc\u00ea aqui.",
        u"Hehe! Of course, Yoshi, us BL lovers gotta stick together! ": u"Hehe! Claro, Yoshi, n\u00f3s, amantes de BL, precisamos permanecer unidos! ",
        u"Hehe! Well, you\u2019re looking at the number one bidder in BL black market! ": u"Hehe! Bem, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 diante da maior arrematante do mercado clandestino de BL! ",
        u"Hehe, Camp Buddy apparently~": u"Hehe, no Camp Buddy, pelo visto~",
        u"Hehe, I can wash your back if you want~ Or maybe you want me to go lower than that~": u"Hehe, posso lavar suas costas se quiser~ Ou talvez queira que eu des\u00e7a um pouco mais~",
        u"Hehe, I couldn\u2019t help it \u2013 look how drenched in sweat it is.": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o consegui evitar \u2014 olha como ela est\u00e1 encharcada de suor.",
        u"Hehe, I definitely have! I can show you guys tomorrow!": u"Hehe, claro que tirei! Posso mostrar para voc\u00eas amanh\u00e3!",
        u"Hehe, I didn\u2019t know they were \u2018that\u2019 close.": u"Hehe, eu n\u00e3o sabia que eles eram \u2018t\u00e3o\u2019 pr\u00f3ximos assim.",
        u"Hehe, I figured I\u2019d wear my special cologne for this occasion.": u"Hehe, achei que usaria minha col\u00f4nia especial para esta ocasi\u00e3o.",
        u"Hehe, I figured it would be a lot more fun if everyone came along, so I invited them too!": u"Hehe, achei que seria muito mais divertido se todos viessem, ent\u00e3o convidei eles tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Hehe, I figured you\u2019d want to relax, especially after working up a sweat.": u"Hehe, imaginei que voc\u00ea fosse querer relaxar, especialmente depois de suar tanto.",
        u"Hehe, I guess if you put it that way.": u"Hehe, pensando dessa forma, acho que sim.",
        u"Hehe, I guess this could be fun just for tonight... Even though these clothes are stuffy, we do look good together, don\u2019t we?": u"Hehe, acho que isso pode ser divertido s\u00f3 por esta noite... Mesmo que estas roupas sejam desconfort\u00e1veis, n\u00f3s ficamos bem juntos, n\u00e3o ficamos?",
        u"Hehe, I guess, you\u2019re right! What do you wanna work on?": u"Hehe, acho que tem raz\u00e3o! O que quer exercitar?",
        u"Hehe, I guess, you\u2019re right! What do you wanna work on?{fast}": u"Hehe, acho que tem raz\u00e3o! O que quer exercitar?{fast}",
        u"Hehe, I love it when you take charge like that, Sir Goro. Reminds me of when we were scouts!": u"Hehe, adoro quando o senhor assume o comando assim, Sr. Goro. Faz lembrar de quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros!",
        u"Hehe, I really like seeing your soft side.": u"Hehe, eu gosto muito de ver seu lado sens\u00edvel.",
        u"Hehe, I remember my first time leading the scouts\u2026 I was just as clueless as they were.": u"Hehe, lembro da primeira vez que liderei os escoteiros\u2026 Eu estava t\u00e3o perdida quanto eles.",
        u"Hehe, I think you\u2019ll enjoy this one, dear.": u"Hehe, acho que voc\u00ea vai gostar deste, querida.",
        u"Hehe, I told you!": u"Hehe, eu avisei!",
        u"Hehe, I wouldn\u2019t mind you covering me in something else~": u"Hehe, eu n\u00e3o me importaria se voc\u00ea me cobrisse com outra coisa~",
        u"Hehe, I\u2019d rather you turn up the \u201cheat\u201d, if you know what I mean~ ": u"Hehe, eu preferiria que voc\u00ea aumentasse o \u201ccalor\u201d, se \u00e9 que me entende~ ",
        u"Hehe, I\u2019d say it was pretty fun! I have lots of memories about it!": u"Hehe, eu diria que foi bem divertida! Tenho muitas lembran\u00e7as dela!",
        u"Hehe, I\u2019m really glad you two are getting along a little better now, Emilia\u2026 ": u"Hehe, fico muito feliz que voc\u00eas duas estejam se dando um pouco melhor agora, Emilia\u2026 ",
        u"Hehe, Yoshi would be popular for sure~! He\u2019s quite the beefcake!": u"Hehe, Yoshi com certeza seria popular~! Ele \u00e9 um baita gostos\u00e3o!",
        u"Hehe, Yoshinori\u2026 We're not that young anymore\u2026": u"Hehe, Yoshinori\u2026 N\u00f3s j\u00e1 n\u00e3o somos t\u00e3o jovens assim\u2026",
        u"Hehe, alright, you got me.": u"Hehe, est\u00e1 bem, voc\u00ea me convenceu.",
        u"Hehe, and it looks like Yoshi\u2019s full already~ ": u"Hehe, e parece que Yoshi j\u00e1 est\u00e1 bem cheio~",
        u"Hehe, and you said I was the one who\u2019s getting cheesy!": u"Hehe, e voc\u00ea disse que eu estava ficando sentimental!",
        u"Hehe, and you said I was the pervert\u2026~": u"Hehe, e voc\u00ea disse que eu era o pervertido\u2026~",
        u"Hehe, are you staring at my thing?": u"Hehe, est\u00e1 olhando para o meu neg\u00f3cio?",
        u"Hehe, are you sure you didn\u2019t come here for a special kind of \u2018release\u2019?": u"Hehe, tem certeza de que n\u00e3o vinha em busca de um tipo especial de \u2018al\u00edvio\u2019?",
        u"Hehe, but you never stopped me, Gramps. ": u"Hehe, mas voc\u00ea nunca me impediu, Vov\u00f4. ",
        u"Hehe, by the looks of things, he\u2019s doing just that.": u"Hehe, pelo jeito \u00e9 exatamente isso que ele est\u00e1 fazendo.",
        u"Hehe, can\u2019t argue with that~": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para discutir com isso~",
        u"Hehe, did they like the show?": u"Hehe, eles gostaram do show?",
        u"Hehe, do I? Why don\u2019t you come with me and get to know me better?": u"Hehe, pare\u00e7o? Por que n\u00e3o vem comigo para me conhecer melhor?",
        u"Hehe, doin\u2019 some good ol\u2019 day drinking, Gramps?": u"Hehe, tomando aquela boa e velha birita de dia, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"Hehe, don\u2019t act like you didn\u2019t have a lot of fun, Lloyd. You basically arm wrestled Darius\u2019 dick!": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o finja que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se divertiu muito, Lloyd. Voc\u00ea praticamente disputou uma queda de bra\u00e7o com o pau do Darius!",
        u"Hehe, don\u2019t forget we\u2019re here to get rid of it.": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o esque\u00e7a que estamos aqui para nos livrar dela.",
        u"Hehe, don\u2019t get too relaxed, we only have an hour before we have to start prepping for dinner!": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o relaxe demais, s\u00f3 temos uma hora antes de come\u00e7ar a preparar o jantar!",
        u"Hehe, don\u2019t pretend you don\u2019t like it too \u2013 your face earlier said it all~": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o finja que tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o gosta \u2014 sua cara antes disse tudo~",
        u"Hehe, don\u2019t say thanks yet until you\u2019re fully moved in.": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o agrade\u00e7a antes de estar totalmente instalado.",
        u"Hehe, even if you won\u2019t say it, I can tell from your face~": u"Hehe, mesmo que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o admita, d\u00e1 pra ver pela sua cara~",
        u"Hehe, everyone\u2019s super excited, huh?": u"Hehe, todo mundo est\u00e1 superanimado, hein?",
        u"Hehe, first it was the stars-thingy, then the spooky cards, and now this\u2026": u"Hehe, primeiro foi aquela coisa das estrelas, depois as cartas assustadoras, e agora isso\u2026",
        u"Hehe, funny how I\u2019d find that out in a place like this!": u"Hehe, engra\u00e7ado eu descobrir isso num lugar assim!",
        u"Hehe, good to know you\u2019re still Yuri under there.": u"Hehe, bom saber que voc\u00ea ainda \u00e9 a Yuri por baixo disso tudo.",
        u"Hehe, have a couple more of those, and you'll be too \\\"relaxed\\\" to let her bug you!": u"Hehe, tome mais algumas e ficar\u00e1 \\\"relaxado\\\" demais para se incomodar com ela!",
        u"Hehe, he's already speechless cause of me.": u"Hehe, ele j\u00e1 ficou sem palavras por minha causa.",
        u"Hehe, hearing you say that makes you sound like my dad. ": u"Hehe, ouvir voc\u00ea dizer isso faz voc\u00ea parecer o meu pai. ",
        u"Hehe, here let me do it for you.": u"Hehe, vem c\u00e1, deixa eu fazer para voc\u00ea.",
        u"Hehe, he\u2019s got a point. ": u"Hehe, ele tem raz\u00e3o. ",
        u"Hehe, hope we\u2019re not interrupting anything spicy~": u"Hehe, espero que n\u00e3o estejamos interrompendo nada picante~",
        u"Hehe, if you put it that way\u2026": u"Hehe, se voc\u00ea coloca desse jeito\u2026",
        u"Hehe, isn\u2019t he cute?": u"Hehe, ele n\u00e3o \u00e9 fofo?",
        u"Hehe, it feels so nostalgic to have you in the kitchen again, Yoshi.": u"Hehe, \u00e9 t\u00e3o nost\u00e1lgico ter voc\u00ea na cozinha de novo, Yoshi.",
        u"Hehe, it looks perfect on you. I have to say, leather suits you very well.": u"Hehe, ficou perfeita em voc\u00ea. Tenho que admitir, couro combina muito bem com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Hehe, it's about time you two let me join in. You\u2019ve both been fucking around the camp without inviting me!": u"Hehe, j\u00e1 estava na hora de voc\u00eas dois me deixarem participar. Voc\u00eas ficam transando pelo acampamento sem me convidar!",
        u"Hehe, it\u2019s about time I teach you a lesson about who\u2019s the boss here.": u"Hehe, j\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de eu te ensinar quem \u00e9 que manda aqui.",
        u"Hehe, it\u2019s all thanks to you, Yoshi! You\u2019ve been vouching for me since day one! ": u"Hehe, tudo gra\u00e7as a voc\u00ea, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea me defende desde o primeiro dia! ",
        u"Hehe, it\u2019s alright! I wasn\u2019t a scout back then, so that\u2019s probably why you don\u2019t recognize me.": u"Hehe, tudo bem! Eu n\u00e3o era escoteiro naquela \u00e9poca, ent\u00e3o deve ser por isso que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o me reconhece.",
        u"Hehe, it\u2019s pretty easy to get you hard~ ": u"Hehe, \u00e9 bem f\u00e1cil deixar voc\u00ea duro~ ",
        u"Hehe, just look at Emilia, she almost got away with being our manager~  ": u"Hehe, \u00e9 s\u00f3 olhar para Emilia, ela quase conseguiu se passar pela nossa gerente~  ",
        u"Hehe, knowing Yoshi, maybe he\u2019s already getting a head start and working on the site.": u"Hehe, conhecendo o Yoshi, talvez ele j\u00e1 tenha se adiantado e come\u00e7ado a trabalhar na obra.",
        u"Hehe, knowing you, you\u2019d probably throw another costume party.": u"Hehe, conhecendo voc\u00ea, provavelmente organizaria outra festa \u00e0 fantasia.",
        u"Hehe, leave it to Ms. Yuri to make any party a lot more colorful!": u"Hehe, pode deixar com a Srta. Yuri para tornar qualquer festa muito mais colorida!",
        u"Hehe, like that time I spilled hot soup all over your pants~": u"Hehe, como naquela vez em que derramei sopa quente na sua cal\u00e7a inteira~",
        u"Hehe, look at what a mess you are, Yoshinori. Can you imagine what would happen if the scouts saw you like this?": u"Hehe, olhe a bagun\u00e7a que voc\u00ea est\u00e1, Yoshinori. Consegue imaginar o que aconteceria se os escoteiros vissem voc\u00ea assim?",
        u"Hehe, looks like I\u2019m the one doing the riding tonight~": u"Hehe, parece que sou eu quem vai cavalgar esta noite~",
        u"Hehe, looks like a lover\u2019s quarrel~": u"Hehe, parece uma briga de casal~",
        u"Hehe, looks like someone\u2019s ready to ride tonight~": u"Hehe, parece que algu\u00e9m est\u00e1 pronto para cavalgar esta noite~",
        u"Hehe, looks like you finally decided to get out of your room and hang around, huh Jin?": u"Hehe, parece que finalmente decidiu sair do quarto e dar uma volta, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Jin?",
        u"Hehe, maybe in another timeline. ": u"Hehe, talvez em outra linha do tempo. ",
        u"Hehe, maybe we can land a couple more sponsorships for the camp, Gramps~": u"Hehe, talvez consigamos mais alguns patroc\u00ednios para o acampamento, Vov\u00f4~",
        u"Hehe, no surprise there.": u"Hehe, nenhuma surpresa.",
        u"Hehe, now we\u2019re talking!": u"Hehe, agora sim!",
        u"Hehe, our room has a mini-bar.": u"Hehe, nosso quarto tem um frigobar.",
        u"Hehe, she\u2019s been pushing us to finish all day so we\u2019d have time for it.": u"Hehe, ela ficou nos pressionando para terminar o dia inteiro para termos tempo para isso.",
        u"Hehe, since Aiden is an official part of our squad now, we should add one more flavor next time!": u"Hehe, j\u00e1 que o Aiden agora faz parte oficialmente do nosso grupo, dever\u00edamos acrescentar mais um sabor da pr\u00f3xima vez!",
        u"Hehe, sorry about that.": u"Hehe, desculpe por isso.",
        u"Hehe, sorry, Gramps! We got carried away\u2026": u"Hehe, desculpa, Vov\u00f4! N\u00f3s nos empolgamos\u2026",
        u"Hehe, thanks, Gramps. ": u"Hehe, obrigado, vov\u00f4. ",
        u"Hehe, that feels nice and warm in my tummy~ I kinda want more! ": u"Hehe, isso fica t\u00e3o gostoso e quentinho na minha barriga~ Acho que quero mais! ",
        u"Hehe, that sounds about right~!": u"Hehe, parece mais do que justo~!",
        u"Hehe, that\u2019s the point.": u"Hehe, essa \u00e9 a ideia.",
        u"Hehe, there\u2019s no stopping them, Natsumi\u2026": u"Hehe, n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para par\u00e1-los, Natsumi\u2026",
        u"Hehe, this is your idea so it\u2019s all on you~! ": u"Hehe, a ideia foi sua, ent\u00e3o a culpa \u00e9 toda sua~! ",
        u"Hehe, those were some of our best memories together, after all.": u"Hehe, afinal, aquelas foram algumas das nossas melhores lembran\u00e7as juntos.",
        u"Hehe, throuples.": u"Hehe, trisal.",
        u"Hehe, trying to shake off your hangover?": u"Hehe, tentando se livrar da ressaca?",
        u"Hehe, was I at least good at it?": u"Hehe, pelo menos eu fui bom nisso?",
        u"Hehe, watch out Darius! He might go grabbing for your polearm.": u"Hehe, cuidado, Darius! Ele pode acabar agarrando a sua lan\u00e7a.",
        u"Hehe, well I have a free ticket to ride here, just for you~": u"Hehe, bem, tenho aqui um ingresso gr\u00e1tis para cavalgar, s\u00f3 para voc\u00ea~",
        u"Hehe, well feel free to eat as much as you want here, boys! There\u2019s plenty for everyone~": u"Hehe, bem, fiquem \u00e0 vontade para comer o quanto quiserem aqui, garotos! Tem bastante para todos~",
        u"Hehe, what can I say? You liked it, so I leaned into it!": u"Hehe, o que posso dizer? Voc\u00ea gostou, ent\u00e3o continuei fazendo!",
        u"Hehe, what made you guys drop by? Need anything? ": u"Hehe, o que trouxe voc\u00eas aqui? Precisam de alguma coisa? ",
        u"Hehe, yeah Jin, you\u2019re supposed to take it slow \u2013 if you go too fast, it can be painful~": u"Hehe, \u00e9, Jin, tem que ir devagar \u2014 se for r\u00e1pido demais, pode doer~",
        u"Hehe, yeah, we have. Who are we kidding at this point?": u"Hehe, sim. Quem estamos tentando enganar a essa altura?",
        u"Hehe, yeah... We really did make a mess. ": u"Hehe, \u00e9... N\u00f3s realmente fizemos uma bagun\u00e7a. ",
        u"Hehe, yeah\u2026 Your food\u2019s gotten cold already.": u"Hehe, sim\u2026 A comida de voc\u00eas j\u00e1 esfriou.",
        u"Hehe, you better behave this time around, Yoshinori. The bath\u2019s a lot more crowded than yesterday.": u"Hehe, \u00e9 melhor voc\u00ea se comportar desta vez, Yoshinori. O banho est\u00e1 bem mais cheio do que ontem.",
        u"Hehe, you do tend to be private with your work, sir. ": u"Hehe, o senhor costuma mesmo ser reservado quanto ao seu trabalho. ",
        u"Hehe, you got more than what you asked for.": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea conseguiu mais do que pediu.",
        u"Hehe, you guys are just overthinking it~": u"Hehe, voc\u00eas est\u00e3o pensando demais nisso~",
        u"Hehe, you guys sure had a long day today, huh?": u"Hehe, voc\u00eas tiveram um dia bem longo hoje, n\u00e3o foi?",
        u"Hehe, you know I\u2019m into that.": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea sabe que gosto disso.",
        u"Hehe, you know what will make this a lot better?": u"Hehe, sabe o que deixaria isso muito melhor?",
        u"Hehe, you never know, the look might fit you~": u"Hehe, nunca se sabe, talvez esse visual combine com voc\u00ea~",
        u"Hehe, you read my mind. Let\u2019s go.": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea leu minha mente. Vamos.",
        u"Hehe, you really had to leave out Sir Goro from that statement, huh, Keitaro? ": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea realmente precisou deixar o Sr. Goro de fora dessa frase, hein, Keitaro? ",
        u"Hehe, you sure all that techie jargon didn\u2019t just confuse you?": u"Hehe, tem certeza de que todo aquele jarg\u00e3o t\u00e9cnico n\u00e3o deixou voc\u00ea confuso?",
        u"Hehe, you sure it\u2019s not my jacked bod and charming personality?": u"Hehe, tem certeza de que n\u00e3o \u00e9 meu corp\u00e3o musculoso e minha personalidade encantadora?",
        u"Hehe, you sure? You know I was the mean one last term, right?": u"Hehe, tem certeza? Sabe que eu era o malvado na temporada passada, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Hehe, you think so?": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea acha?",
        u"Hehe, you wore him out that bad, huh, Gramps? ": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea cansou tanto ele assim, hein, Vov\u00f4? ",
        u"Hehe, you worked up an appetite in there, didn\u2019t you~?": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea abriu o apetite l\u00e1 dentro, n\u00e3o foi~?",
        u"Hehe, you\u2019re all served up and ready for me, Yoshi~!": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 todo servido e pronto para mim, Yoshi~!",
        u"Hehe, you\u2019re already panting, Yoshi~ We haven\u2019t even started moving yet!": u"Hehe, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 ofegante, Yoshi~ N\u00f3s nem come\u00e7amos a nos mexer ainda!",
        u"Hehe, you\u2019re lucky you\u2019re covered from the cold at least. I\u2019m just relieved mine came with spare matching pants.": u"Hehe, pelo menos voc\u00ea tem sorte de estar protegido do frio. S\u00f3 estou aliviado que a minha veio com uma cal\u00e7a combinando de reserva.",
        u"Hehe, \u201cdeal-though\u201d\u2026": u"Hehe, \u201cdemais\u201d\u2026",
