        u"Hehe\u2026 I can always count on you to take my mind off of things\u2026 it just makes me want to cuddle with you more\u2026": u"Hehe\u2026 Sempre posso contar com voc\u00ea para me fazer esquecer dos problemas\u2026 Isso s\u00f3 me d\u00e1 mais vontade de ficar agarrado com voc\u00ea\u2026",
