        u"Here, wear this.": u"Aqui, vista isto.",
        u"Here, why don\u2019t you check out some of these fanfics I\u2019m reading~! Maybe you can pick up a tip or two~": u"Aqui, por que n\u00e3o d\u00e1 uma olhada em algumas destas fanfics que estou lendo~? Talvez aprenda uma dica ou duas~",
        u"Here, why don\u2019t you check out some of these fanfics I\u2019m reading~! Who knows maybe it\u2019s your cup of tea~?": u"Aqui, por que n\u00e3o d\u00e1 uma olhada em algumas dessas fanfics que estou lendo~! Quem sabe n\u00e3o faz seu estilo~?",
        u"Here, why don\u2019t you lay down with me?": u"Venha, por que n\u00e3o se deita comigo?",
        u"Here, you can chop these veggies that Aiden needed. I can\u2019t leave my station since this stew needs to be stirred constantly.": u"Aqui, voc\u00ea pode cortar estes legumes que Aiden precisa. N\u00e3o posso sair daqui porque este ensopado precisa ser mexido o tempo todo.",
        u"Here. The hotel staff delivered us sets of formalwear to choose from.": u"Aqui. Os funcion\u00e1rios do hotel entregaram v\u00e1rios trajes formais para escolhermos.",
        u"Here~": u"Aqui~",
        u"Here\u2019s a prescription for her medicine. ": u"Aqui est\u00e1 uma receita para o medicamento dela. ",
        u"Here\u2019s the cream, sir!": u"Aqui est\u00e1 o creme, senhor!",
        u"Here\u2019s the last of the dishes, Aiden.": u"Aqui est\u00e1 o restante da lou\u00e7a, Aiden.",
        u"Here\u2019s the list!": u"Aqui est\u00e1 a lista!",
        u"Here\u2019s the pizza I made! Fresh from the \u201cmeekrowahv\u00e9\u201d!": u"Aqui est\u00e1 a pizza que fiz! Fresquinha do \u201cmicro-ond\u00ea\u201d!",
        u"Here\u2019s to both of us coming back here together someday!": u"Um brinde a n\u00f3s dois voltarmos para c\u00e1 juntos algum dia!",
        u"Hey there! Looks like something\u2019s interesting\u2019s going on here.": u"Ol\u00e1! Parece que tem alguma coisa interessante acontecendo aqui.",
        u"Hey there, Aiden! I came to h\u2014": u"Ei, Aiden! Vim aju\u2014",
        u"Hey there, Aiden! Your client\u2019s looking for you!": u"Ei, Aiden! Seu cliente est\u00e1 procurando voc\u00ea!",
        u"Hey there, Aiden! \u2026And Hiro?": u"Ol\u00e1, Aiden! \u2026E Hiro?",
        u"Hey there, Emilia.": u"Oi, Emilia.",
        u"Hey there, Jin! ": u"Oi, Jin! ",
        u"Hey there, Yoshi and Gramps! I just happened to walk by and saw Yuri trying to empty the shed all by herself.": u"Ol\u00e1, Yoshi e Vov\u00f4! Eu estava passando e vi a Yuri tentando esvaziar o galp\u00e3o sozinha.",
        u"Hey there, Yoshi! ": u"Oi, Yoshi! ",
        u"Hey there, Yuri and Aiden! You both look amazing too!": u"Ol\u00e1, Yuri e Aiden! Voc\u00eas dois tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o incr\u00edveis!",
        u"Hey there, Yuri! How was the orientation?": u"Ol\u00e1, Yuri! Como foi a orienta\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Hey there, Yuri, Jin!": u"Oi, Yuri, Jin!",
        u"Hey there, guys! How\u2019s everything going here?": u"Ei, pessoal! Como est\u00e3o as coisas por aqui?",
        u"Hey there, guys! I hear Yoichi\u2019s being a bit unruly again.": u"Ei, pessoal! Ouvi dizer que o Yoichi est\u00e1 meio indisciplinado de novo.",
        u"Hey there, you guys! Yeah, we just had a group workout after the site repairs today!": u"E a\u00ed, pessoal! Sim, acabamos de fazer um treino em grupo depois dos reparos na obra hoje!",
        u"Hey there, you two!": u"Ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Hey there, you two! ": u"Ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas dois! ",
        u"Hey there, you two! Whatcha doin\u2019?": u"Ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas dois! O que est\u00e3o fazendo?",
        u"Hey there~! Wanna have some fun toni-": u"Ol\u00e1~! Querem se divertir esta noi\u2014",
        u"Hey!": u"Ei!",
        u"Hey! Don\u2019t blame me! You\u2019re the one who forgot it!": u"Ei! N\u00e3o me culpe! Foi voc\u00ea quem esqueceu!",
        u"Hey! How else was I supposed to react to that?! ": u"Ei! Como mais eu deveria reagir a isso?! ",
        u"Hey! I can\u2019t find the freakin\u2019 mallows! Where\u2019d you guys hide them?!": u"Ei! N\u00e3o consigo achar os malditos marshmallows! Onde voc\u00eas esconderam?!",
        u"Hey! I didn\u2019t sign up for this! You said we\u2019re gonna blow some snow!": u"Ei! Eu n\u00e3o me inscrevi para isso! Voc\u00ea disse que \u00edamos limpar neve!",
        u"Hey! It was fine until you started backseat driving!": u"Ei! Estava tudo bem at\u00e9 voc\u00ea come\u00e7ar a dar palpite do banco do passageiro!",
        u"Hey! It\u2019s a lot better than being snobby and pretending to be rich!": u"Ei! \u00c9 muito melhor do que ser esnobe e fingir que \u00e9 rica!",
        u"Hey! Leave some for me!": u"Ei! Deixe um pouco para mim!",
        u"Hey! No avoiding chores, Torch-head!": u"Ei! Nada de fugir das tarefas, Cabe\u00e7a-de-Tocha!",
        u"Hey! Not you too, Dar!": u"Ei! Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o, Dar!",
        u"Hey! Speak for yourself, Gramps! Look at you with all these empty glasses lying around.": u"Ei! Olha quem fala, Vov\u00f4! Olha s\u00f3 todos esses copos vazios espalhados a\u00ed.",
        u"Hey! Speak for yourselves! You guys are wearing full-on kinky shit!": u"Ei! Olhem quem fala! Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o usando umas paradas fetichistas completas!",
        u"Hey! We\u2019re not scouts right now, we work here just like y\u2019all!": u"Ei! N\u00e3o somos escoteiros agora, trabalhamos aqui igual a voc\u00eas!",
        u"Hey! We\u2019re really not!": u"Ei! N\u00e3o estamos mesmo!",
        u"Hey! What the hell, I worked hard on that!": u"Ei! Que diabos, eu trabalhei duro nisso!",
        u"Hey! What\u2019s going on in here?! Yuri was screaming and running away from\u2014": u"Ei! O que est\u00e1 acontecendo aqui?! Yuri estava gritando e correndo para longe de\u2014",
        u"Hey! What\u2019s that supposed to mean?": u"Ei! O que isso quer dizer?",
        u"Hey! Who said my turn was over?!": u"Ei! Quem disse que minha vez acabou?!",
        u"Hey! Why are you two acting so sus?": u"Ei! Por que voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o t\u00e3o suspeitos?",
        u"Hey! You didn\u2019t even use your tongues!": u"Ei! Voc\u00eas nem usaram a l\u00edngua!",
        u"Hey! You never know! Maybe not for long!": u"Ei! Nunca se sabe! Talvez n\u00e3o por muito tempo!",
        u"Hey! You should be thanking me, Torch-head! You\u2019re the one who wanted to come back here the most!": u"Ei! Devia estar me agradecendo, Cabe\u00e7a-de-Tocha! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 quem mais queria voltar para c\u00e1!",
        u"Hey! You\u2019re just as bad as me! You spent half the time in front of the mirror deciding which tie matched the best!": u"Ei! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o ruim quanto eu! Passou metade do tempo na frente do espelho decidindo qual gravata combinava melhor!",
        u"Hey! You\u2019re not any taller!": u"Ei! Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o \u00e9 mais alto!",
        u"Hey!! I am wearing something! See?! I\u2019m wearing undies underneath right now! ": u"Ei!! Eu estou vestindo alguma coisa! Est\u00e1 vendo?! Estou usando cueca por baixo agora! ",
        u"Hey, Aiden! Are you h\u2014": u"Ei, Aiden! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 a\u2014",
        u"Hey, Aiden! Let me read yours! ": u"Ei, Aiden! Deixe-me ler o seu! ",
        u"Hey, Aiden, I\u2026 ": u"Ei, Aiden, eu\u2026 ",
        u"Hey, Aiden.": u"Ei, Aiden.",
        u"Hey, Aiden... What are you doing here?": u"Ei, Aiden\u2026 O que est\u00e1 fazendo aqui?",
        u"Hey, Buttcheeks! Where\u2019s the ketchup?! ": u"Ei, Bund\u00e3o! Cad\u00ea o ketchup?! ",
        u"Hey, Dad! Sorry, I had to work overtime again\u2026! And I got stuck in a traffic jam too!": u"Ei, Pai! Desculpe, tive que fazer hora extra de novo\u2026! E ainda fiquei preso no tr\u00e2nsito!",
        u"Hey, Gramps! ": u"Ei, vov\u00f4! ",
        u"Hey, I don\u2019t think we ever got ourselves into anything serious! Right, Gramps?": u"Ei, acho que nunca nos metemos em nada grave! N\u00e3o \u00e9, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"Hey, I saw that!!": u"Ei, eu vi isso!!",
        u"Hey, I was calm the whole time I was showing him around\u2026 I made sure not to show my excitement until after he left.": u"Ei, mantive a calma durante todo o passeio\u2026 Fiz quest\u00e3o de n\u00e3o demonstrar minha empolga\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 ele ir embora.",
        u"Hey, I\u2019m back. It\u2019s all fixed now. Did I miss anything?": u"Ei, voltei. Est\u00e1 tudo resolvido. Perdi alguma coisa?",
        u"Hey, I\u2019m being serious!": u"Ei, estou falando s\u00e9rio!",
        u"Hey, I\u2019m not letting you take all the credit! They\u2019re my babies too!": u"Ei, n\u00e3o vou deixar voc\u00ea ficar com todo o m\u00e9rito! Elas tamb\u00e9m s\u00e3o meus beb\u00eas!",
        u"Hey, Jin! You\u2019re getting front-row seats for the beefcake show! Check out these muscles!": u"Ei, Jin! Voc\u00ea conseguiu um lugar na primeira fila para o show dos musculosos! Olhe estes m\u00fasculos!",
        u"Hey, Mr. Andre! How come you\u2019ve never brought Aiden here before? He\u2019s a really great guy, and his cooking is amazing, just like yours!": u"Ei, senhor Andre! Por que nunca trouxe o Aiden aqui antes? Ele \u00e9 um cara muito legal, e a comida dele \u00e9 incr\u00edvel, assim como a sua!",
        u"Hey, Naoto! You got a client asking for a bro job!": u"Ei, Naoto! Tem um cliente pedindo um servi\u00e7o entre irm\u00e3os!",
        u"Hey, Sheriff Brokeback! Who is this guy?": u"Ei, Xerife Brokeback! Quem \u00e9 esse cara?",
        u"Hey, Yoichi! I\u2019ve got something more fun for you to do! ": u"Ei, Yoichi! Tenho uma coisa mais divertida para voc\u00ea fazer! ",
        u"Hey, Yoshi! Come over here, I saved you a plate!": u"Ei, Yoshi! Venha aqui, guardei um prato para voc\u00ea!",
        u"Hey, Yoshi! Hold up a sec.": u"Ei, Yoshi! Espere um segundo.",
        u"Hey, Yoshi! Yuri told us to fetch you, \u2019cause the workers are already here!": u"Ei, Yoshi! A Yuri mandou que vi\u00e9ssemos busc\u00e1-lo porque os trabalhadores j\u00e1 chegaram!",
        u"Hey, Yoshi. Help me out some, will ya?": u"Ei, Yoshi. Me d\u00ea uma ajuda, pode ser?",
        u"Hey, Yoshi. Help me out some, will ya?{fast}": u"Ei, Yoshi. Me d\u00ea uma ajuda, pode ser?{fast}",
        u"Hey, Yoshi. You gonna help take the ring off or what?": u"Ei, Yoshi. Vai me ajudar a tirar o anel ou n\u00e3o?",
        u"Hey, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Ei, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Hey, Yoshinori\u2026 Don\u2019t just stand there.": u"Ei, Yoshinori\u2026 N\u00e3o fique s\u00f3 parado a\u00ed.",
        u"Hey, Yoshinori\u2026 Pull yourself together~": u"Ei, Yoshinori\u2026 Recomponha-se~",
        u"Hey, Yoshi\u2026": u"Ei, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Hey, Yoshi\u2026 Snap out of it\u2026": u"Ei, Yoshi\u2026 Volta pra realidade\u2026",
        u"Hey, Yoshi\u2026.": u"Ei, Yoshi\u2026.",
        u"Hey, Yuri!": u"Ei, Yuri!",
        u"Hey, Yuri~ Hey, Gramps!": u"Ei, Yuri~ Ei, vov\u00f4!",
        u"Hey, Yuri\u2026 Don\u2019t work her up too much, she\u2019s still recovering\u2026": u"Ei, Yuri\u2026 N\u00e3o a deixe agitada demais, ela ainda est\u00e1 se recuperando\u2026",
        u"Hey, are you alright?": u"Ei, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"Hey, are you alright\u2026?": u"Ei, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026?",
        u"Hey, are you guys coming? ": u"Ei, voc\u00eas v\u00eam ou n\u00e3o? ",
        u"Hey, at least we had fun, Aiden.": u"Ei, pelo menos nos divertimos, Aiden.",
        u"Hey, bro! Long time, no see!": u"Ei, cara! Quanto tempo!",
        u"Hey, count me in as well~! I wouldn\u2019t mind getting my hands dirty, especially after all that pampering from our vacation!": u"Ei, podem contar comigo tamb\u00e9m~! N\u00e3o me importo de sujar as m\u00e3os, principalmente depois de todos aqueles mimos nas f\u00e9rias!",
        u"Hey, don\u2019t change the subject! We need to go on a vacation too!": u"Ei, n\u00e3o mude de assunto! N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m precisamos viajar!",
        u"Hey, don\u2019t zone out on me, Yoshi\u2026 We haven\u2019t gotten to the best part yet~": u"Ei, n\u00e3o fica viajando, Yoshi\u2026 Ainda nem chegamos \u00e0 melhor parte~",
        u"Hey, dude. Wake up. We have guests coming.": u"Ei, cara. Acorda. Temos clientes chegando.",
        u"Hey, everyone! Why don\u2019t we take a break?": u"Ei, pessoal! Que tal fazermos uma pausa?",
        u"Hey, fast food isn\u2019t trash! That stuff is my favorite. ": u"Ei, fast food n\u00e3o \u00e9 porcaria! \u00c9 minha comida favorita. ",
        u"Hey, get back here!": u"Ei, volte aqui!",
        u"Hey, guys!": u"Ei, pessoal!",
        u"Hey, guys! ": u"Ei, pessoal! ",
        u"Hey, guys! Good morn\u2014 ": u"Ei, pessoal! Bom di\u2014 ",
        u"Hey, guys! Looks like you\u2019re all ready to go!": u"Ei, pessoal! Parece que todos est\u00e3o prontos para ir!",
        u"Hey, guys! Over here!": u"Ei, pessoal! Aqui!",
        u"Hey, guys! We\u2019ve finished loading up all the luggage!": u"Ei, pessoal! Terminamos de colocar toda a bagagem!",
        u"Hey, guys, good morning!": u"Ei, pessoal, bom dia!",
        u"Hey, guys, good morning! For real, this time!": u"Ei, pessoal, bom dia! Desta vez de verdade!",
        u"Hey, guys, take a little break! We brought lunch!": u"Ei, pessoal, fa\u00e7am uma pausa! Trouxemos o almo\u00e7o!",
        u"Hey, hey! Don\u2019t squeeze too much, it tickles\u2026!!": u"Ei, ei! N\u00e3o apertem tanto, faz c\u00f3cegas\u2026!!",
        u"Hey, hey. Get a hold of yourself.": u"Ei, ei. Controle-se.",
        u"Hey, if you got the goods, why not show \u2018em off? ": u"Ei, se voc\u00ea tem um belo pacote, por que n\u00e3o exibi-lo? ",
        u"Hey, if you got the goods, why not show \u2018em off? {fast}": u"Ei, se voc\u00ea tem um belo pacote, por que n\u00e3o exibi-lo? {fast}",
        u"Hey, if you\u2019d have let me, I\u2019d be at the ceremony in just that, too!": u"Ei, se tivessem deixado, eu estaria na cerim\u00f4nia usando s\u00f3 isso tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Hey, it\u2019s better than dying of boredom. These muscles could use some working out anyways.": u"Ei, \u00e9 melhor do que morrer de t\u00e9dio. De qualquer forma, estes m\u00fasculos precisam de um pouco de exerc\u00edcio.",
        u"Hey, it\u2019s fun to tease her! And you for that matter~": u"Ei, \u00e9 divertido provocar ela! E provocar voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m~",
        u"Hey, it\u2019s nice to meet you, man! You can just call me Lloyd \u2013 looking forward to working with you!": u"Ei, \u00e9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-lo, cara! Pode me chamar de Lloyd \u2014 estou ansioso para trabalhar com voc\u00ea!",
        u"Hey, it\u2019s not my place to judge what you\u2019re into. But I\u2019m pretty sure the whole camp could get shut down if the wrong person saw\u2026": u"Ei, n\u00e3o cabe a mim julgar do que voc\u00ea gosta. Mas tenho quase certeza de que o acampamento inteiro poderia ser fechado se a pessoa errada visse\u2026",
        u"Hey, lighten up a bit, will you? I expected you to be less of a worrywart now that everything is going well.": u"Ei, anime-se um pouco, est\u00e1 bem? Achei que voc\u00ea estaria menos preocupado agora que tudo est\u00e1 indo bem.",
        u"Hey, mine\u2019s pretty long too!": u"Ei, o meu tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 bem comprido!",
        u"Hey, mine\u2019s pretty thick too!": u"Ei, o meu tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 bem grosso!",
        u"Hey, no fair! You started too fast!": u"Ei, assim n\u00e3o vale! Voc\u00ea come\u00e7ou r\u00e1pido demais!",
        u"Hey, not bad, Jin! You may not have a lot of muscle, but that slender frame is good to look at~": u"Ei, nada mal, Jin! Voc\u00ea pode n\u00e3o ter muitos m\u00fasculos, mas esse corpo esbelto \u00e9 bonito de olhar~",
        u"Hey, someone\u2019s gotta do it.": u"Ei, algu\u00e9m precisa fazer isso.",
        u"Hey, speaking of that, you\u2019re the messiest and sloppiest roommate ever! You dumped all my stuff on the floor!": u"Ei, falando nisso, voc\u00ea \u00e9 a colega de quarto mais bagunceira e desleixada de todas! Jogou todas as minhas coisas no ch\u00e3o!",
        u"Hey, that\u2019s no fair using Yoshi against me!": u"Ei, n\u00e3o \u00e9 justo usar Yoshi contra mim!",
        u"Hey, the game\u2019s over already! And you\u2019re not supposed to call me nicknames too, Dar!": u"Ei, a brincadeira j\u00e1 acabou! E voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o deveria me chamar por apelidos, Dar!",
        u"Hey, there. Where were those two headed? I think I know them.": u"Ei. Para onde aqueles dois foram? Acho que os conhe\u00e7o.",
        u"Hey, uh\u2026 Yoshi\u2026 Are we gonna meet up soon? We haven\u2019t seen each other in person for months now\u2026": u"Ei, ahn\u2026 Yoshi\u2026 Vamos nos encontrar em breve? J\u00e1 faz meses que n\u00e3o nos vemos pessoalmente\u2026",
        u"Hey, watch it, boy.": u"Ei, cuidado, garoto.",
        u"Hey, why didn\u2019t you call everyone over for the booze?!": u"Ei, por que n\u00e3o chamaram todo mundo para a bebida?!",
        u"Hey, ya\u2019ll! Food\u2019s ready! I made hotdogs and burgers!": u"Ei, pessoal! A comida est\u00e1 pronta! Fiz cachorros-quentes e hamb\u00fargueres!",
        u"Hey, you don\u2019t have to worry about me, Yoshi! I\u2019m totally fine now!": u"Ei, n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar comigo, Yoshi! Agora estou totalmente bem!",
        u"Hey, you sure you\u2019re gonna work with all those clothes on? ": u"Ei, tem certeza de que vai trabalhar com toda essa roupa? ",
        u"Hey, you two! No having fun without inviting the rest of us! ": u"Ei, voc\u00eas dois! Nada de se divertirem sem convidar o resto de n\u00f3s! ",
        u"Hey, you two! Quit fooling around in there! Everyone else\u2019s done!": u"Ei, voc\u00eas dois! Parem de enrolar a\u00ed dentro! Todo mundo j\u00e1 terminou!",
        u"Hey, you\u2019re forgetting you\u2019re not the one who\u2019s in charge here. And calling me by my name seems pretty disrespectful right now.": u"Ei, est\u00e1 esquecendo que n\u00e3o \u00e9 voc\u00ea quem manda aqui. E me chamar pelo nome parece bastante desrespeitoso agora.",
        u"Hey, you\u2019re talking to the guy who walks around the camp naked.": u"Ei, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando com o cara que anda pelado pelo acampamento.",
        u"Heya, Gramps! How\u2019s it hanging?": u"E a\u00ed, Vov\u00f4! Como v\u00e3o as coisas?",
        u"Heyyy! There are plenty of studies that discuss these mystic energies! It\u2019s totally legit!": u"Eiii! Existem v\u00e1rios estudos que falam dessas energias m\u00edsticas! \u00c9 totalmente leg\u00edtimo!",
        u"Heyyy! There are plenty of studies that talk about these mystic energies! It could be real!": u"Eeei! H\u00e1 muitos estudos que falam dessas energias m\u00edsticas! Pode ser verdade!",
        u"Heyyy, Darius, my man! How\u2019s it going?": u"Eeei, Darius, meu camarada! Como vai?",
        u"Heyy\u2026 What\u2019s with that dazed smile, Yoshi?": u"Eii\u2026 Que sorriso distra\u00eddo \u00e9 esse, Yoshi?",
        u"Hey\u2026 I make sure the food is clean\u2026 and tasty~! ": u"Ei\u2026 Eu garanto que a comida esteja limpa\u2026 e gostosa~! ",
        u"Hey\u2026 You alright, Aiden\u2026?": u"Ei\u2026 Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Hey\u2026 You alright, Yoshinori\u2026?": u"Ei\u2026 Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshinori\u2026?",
        u"He\u2019s a fanatic.": u"Ele \u00e9 fan\u00e1tico.",
        u"He\u2019s a good sport, you know. Very steadfast and perseverant no matter what\u2019s thrown at him.": u"Ele sabe levar as coisas numa boa. \u00c9 muito firme e perseverante, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a.",
        u"He\u2019s a lot more carefree, and always smiling. ": u"Ele fica muito mais despreocupado e est\u00e1 sempre sorrindo. ",
        u"He\u2019s a night owl.": u"Ele \u00e9 uma criatura noturna.",
        u"He\u2019s a real fluffy panda now\u2026": u"Agora ele \u00e9 um verdadeiro panda fofinho\u2026",
        u"He\u2019s all weird and cringey, nothing like what you guys see when he\u2019s at work as our scoutmaster!": u"Ele fica todo esquisito e vergonhoso, nada parecido com o que voc\u00eas veem quando ele est\u00e1 trabalhando como nosso chefe escoteiro!",
        u"He\u2019s also a huge fan of the spirit of this place, and wants to allow more people to experience it.": u"Ele tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 um grande admirador do esp\u00edrito deste lugar e quer permitir que mais pessoas tenham essa experi\u00eancia.",
        u"He\u2019s always been like that, though. Not just as the camp president, but also as my dad.": u"Mas ele sempre foi assim. N\u00e3o s\u00f3 como presidente do acampamento, mas tamb\u00e9m como meu pai.",
        u"He\u2019s been by himself back at home ever since I started working here, so I asked Sir Goro a favor to let me bring him for today. ": u"Ele fica sozinho em casa desde que comecei a trabalhar aqui, ent\u00e3o pedi ao senhor Goro o favor de me deixar traz\u00ea-lo hoje. ",
        u"He\u2019s been learning plenty from me, but there\u2019s still more to turnover before the next summer term.": u"Ele j\u00e1 aprendeu bastante comigo, mas ainda h\u00e1 muita coisa que preciso passar a ele antes da pr\u00f3xima temporada de ver\u00e3o.",
        u"He\u2019s been really satisfied with all of our progress so far, and I want to keep the streak going.": u"Ele tem ficado muito satisfeito com todo o nosso progresso at\u00e9 agora, e quero continuar assim.",
        u"He\u2019s been the obvious pick all this time, I guess I just didn\u2019t see it for some reason.": u"Ele foi a escolha \u00f3bvia esse tempo todo, acho que por algum motivo eu simplesmente n\u00e3o percebi.",
        u"He\u2019s busy taking pictures of the building.": u"Est\u00e1 ocupado tirando fotos do pr\u00e9dio.",
        u"He\u2019s doing it to be taller.": u"Ele est\u00e1 fazendo isso para ficar mais alto.",
        u"He\u2019s gonna let me help cook today too, so it\u2019s gonna be extra special!": u"Ele tamb\u00e9m vai me deixar ajudar a cozinhar hoje, ent\u00e3o ser\u00e1 ainda mais especial!",
        u"He\u2019s gonna sponsor everything, from my accommodations to the actual scholarships\u2026": u"Ele vai bancar tudo, desde minha hospedagem at\u00e9 a pr\u00f3pria bolsa de estudos\u2026",
        u"He\u2019s guessing your horoscope.": u"Ele est\u00e1 tentando adivinhar seu signo.",
        u"He\u2019s having some cramps in his humps.": u"Ele est\u00e1 com umas c\u00e3ibras nas curvas.",
        u"He\u2019s just looking for an excuse to get naked.": u"Ele s\u00f3 est\u00e1 procurando uma desculpa para ficar pelado.",
        u"He\u2019s keeping up pretty nicely.": u"Ele est\u00e1 acompanhando muito bem.",
        u"He\u2019s not coming back, is he?": u"Ele n\u00e3o vai voltar, vai?",
        u"He\u2019s not one of your staff, is he?": u"Ele n\u00e3o faz parte da sua equipe, faz?",
        u"He\u2019s old enough, Yoshinori. Let the boy have a good time. ": u"Ele j\u00e1 \u00e9 adulto, Yoshinori. Deixe o rapaz se divertir. ",
        u"He\u2019s only thirty-eight.": u"Ele s\u00f3 tem trinta e oito.",
        u"He\u2019s quite the energetic person, huh\u2026?  ": u"Ele \u00e9 uma pessoa bem en\u00e9rgica, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?  ",
        u"He\u2019s really stepped up to the scoutmaster role these last few months, and that\u2019s not even counting all the other work he does that you don\u2019t even see. ": u"Nos \u00faltimos meses, ele realmente assumiu a fun\u00e7\u00e3o de chefe escoteiro, sem contar todo o trabalho que faz e que voc\u00ea nem v\u00ea.",
        u"He\u2019s taken it all in stride, and even been nice to you the entire time, but you still won\u2019t let up!": u"Ele levou tudo numa boa e foi gentil com voc\u00ea o tempo inteiro, mas, ainda assim, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o d\u00e1 tr\u00e9gua!",
        u"He\u2019s taking a short nap.": u"Ele est\u00e1 tirando um cochilo.",
        u"He\u2019s the cook\u2019s son. Don\u2019t you remember?": u"Ele \u00e9 filho do cozinheiro. N\u00e3o se lembra?",
        u"He\u2019s the reason why I always try to look on the bright side and cherish what I have!": u"\u00c9 por causa dele que sempre tento ver o lado bom das coisas e valorizar o que tenho!",
