        u"Hihi~ The serving\u2019s so cute and tiny!": u"Hihi~ A por\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o bonitinha e pequena!",
        u"Hihi~ You both look really handsome too! Formal wear might be my new kink~": u"Hihi~ Voc\u00eas dois tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o muito bonitos! Roupas formais podem virar meu novo fetiche~",
