        u"Hiro\u2026 I don\u2019t think that\u2019s a good idea\u2026": u"Hiro\u2026 N\u00e3o acho que seja uma boa ideia\u2026",
        u"His condition continued to worsen until he could no longer work at the camp, and Aiden focused on both caring for him and taking over his job.": u"A condi\u00e7\u00e3o dele continuou piorando at\u00e9 que n\u00e3o p\u00f4de mais trabalhar no acampamento, e Aiden passou a cuidar dele e assumir seu trabalho.",
        u"His condition was bound to get worse over time, so as the years went by, the smile on Dad\u2019s face began to fade away\u2026": u"A condi\u00e7\u00e3o dele inevitavelmente pioraria com o tempo, ent\u00e3o, conforme os anos passaram, o sorriso no rosto do Pai come\u00e7ou a desaparecer\u2026",
        u"His happiness is what matters.": u"A felicidade dele \u00e9 o que importa.",
        u"His nose was bleeding, Aiden.": u"O nariz dele estava sangrando, Aiden.",
        u"His works really inspired me to do some self-reflection in the past. ": u"As obras dele realmente me inspiraram a fazer uma reflex\u00e3o pessoal no passado. ",
        u"Hm? Is everything alright back there?": u"Hum? Est\u00e1 tudo bem l\u00e1 atr\u00e1s?",
