        u"Hm? Where\u2019s Yuri? Shouldn\u2019t she be with you?": u"Hm? Onde est\u00e1 Yuri? Ela n\u00e3o deveria estar com voc\u00ea?",
        u"Hmm, I see\u2026 ": u"Hmm, entendo\u2026",
        u"Hmm, if I had to guess, based on your bold behavior, Yoichi \u2013 you\u2019re either an Aries or an Aquarius!": u"Hmm, se eu tivesse que adivinhar pelo seu comportamento ousado, Yoichi \u2014 voc\u00ea \u00e9 \u00c1ries ou Aqu\u00e1rio!",
        u"Hmm, if I recall, you had a fairly severe case of it on one our trips too\u2026": u"Hmm, se bem me lembro, voc\u00ea teve uma queimadura bem forte em uma das nossas viagens tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"Hmm, it looks your favorite meatballs ran out, sir.": u"Hmm, parece que suas alm\u00f4ndegas favoritas acabaram, senhor.",
        u"Hmm, it seems like there\u2019s quite the commotion outside. I wonder if something happened.": u"Hmm, parece que h\u00e1 bastante agita\u00e7\u00e3o l\u00e1 fora. Ser\u00e1 que aconteceu alguma coisa?",
        u"Hmm, it was honestly our lowest turnout ever.": u"Hmm, sinceramente, foi a nossa menor participa\u00e7\u00e3o de todas.",
        u"Hmm, it\u2019s mostly stuff from my past that I stopped looking back at.": u"Hmm, s\u00e3o principalmente coisas do meu passado para as quais parei de olhar.",
        u"Hmm, okay, let\u2019s see\u2026": u"Hmm, certo, vamos ver\u2026",
        u"Hmm, that may be so, but I\u2019ve been down this road before.": u"Hmm, talvez seja, mas j\u00e1 passei por esse caminho antes.",
        u"Hmm, well, since you\u2019re flirting, I guess I can give you a pass~ ": u"Hmm, bem, j\u00e1 que est\u00e1 flertando, acho que posso deixar passar~ ",
        u"Hmm, you have quite a lot of interesting hobbies, Lloyd.": u"Hmm, voc\u00ea tem muitos passatempos interessantes, Lloyd.",
        u"Hmm? How so?": u"Hmm? Como assim?",
        u"Hmm? This wasn\u2019t included in your reports. Please elaborate.": u"Hmm? Isso n\u00e3o estava nos relat\u00f3rios. Por favor, explique.",
        u"Hmm? What do you mean exactly?": u"Hmm? O que quer dizer exatamente?",
        u"Hmm? What is it, Yoshinori?": u"Hum? O que foi, Yoshinori?",
        u"Hmm? What makes you think otherwise?": u"Hmm? O que faz voc\u00ea pensar o contr\u00e1rio?",
        u"Hmm? What\u2019s wrong, Dar? Aren\u2019t you coming?": u"Hmm? O que foi, Dar? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vem?",
        u"Hmm? Who\u2019s this \u2018sir\u2019 you\u2019re calling for help~?": u"Hmm? Quem \u00e9 esse \u2018senhor\u2019 que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 chamando para ajudar~?",
        u"Hmmm, I suppose a vacation with tons of options like this could be a bit overwhelming.": u"Hmmm, imagino que f\u00e9rias com tantas op\u00e7\u00f5es assim possam ser um pouco demais.",
        u"Hmmm, I wonder if they\u2019re struggling to find a label.": u"Hmmm, ser\u00e1 que eles est\u00e3o tendo dificuldade para definir o relacionamento?",
        u"Hmmmm\u2026 Since I\u2019m cooking for a bunch of active dudes, I\u2019m expecting them to have huge appetites!": u"Hmmmm\u2026 Como estou cozinhando para um grupo de homens ativos, espero que tenham um apetite enorme!",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 I guess I don\u2019t mind telling you, if you really want to know\u2026": u"Hmmm\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o me importo de contar, se voc\u00ea realmente quer saber\u2026",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 I know the hotel staff informed him about us being stuck at the hotel, but I think that\u2019s all he knows so far.": u"Hmmm\u2026 Sei que a equipe do hotel informou que ficamos presos l\u00e1, mas acho que isso \u00e9 tudo que ele sabe at\u00e9 agora.",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 I suppose it makes me feel closer to you and more\u2026 intimate.": u"Hmmm\u2026 Acho que isso me faz sentir mais pr\u00f3ximo de voc\u00ea e mais\u2026 \u00edntimo.",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 I suppose it makes me feel closer to you and more\u2026 intimate.{fast}": u"Hmmm\u2026 Acho que isso me faz sentir mais pr\u00f3ximo de voc\u00ea e mais\u2026 \u00edntimo.{fast}",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 Is this the same person you had sex with, Yoshi~?": u"Hmmm\u2026 \u00c9 a mesma pessoa com quem voc\u00ea fez sexo, Yoshi~?",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 I\u2019m not really sure! Last thing I remember, I was taking a break after finishing up with a client, and the rest is a blur!": u"Hmmm\u2026 N\u00e3o tenho muita certeza! A \u00faltima coisa de que lembro \u00e9 que estava fazendo uma pausa depois de terminar com um cliente, e o resto \u00e9 um borr\u00e3o!",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 Maybe I\u2019m just imagining things, but\u2026": u"Hmmm\u2026 Talvez eu esteja s\u00f3 imaginando coisas, mas\u2026",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 That\u2019s odd. Sir Goro is always awake this time of day. I wonder if he overslept?": u"Hmmm\u2026 Que estranho. O Sr. Goro sempre est\u00e1 acordado a esta hora. Ser\u00e1 que dormiu demais?",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 alright. I guess I can still get some good info out of all of you.": u"Hmmm\u2026 tudo bem. Acho que ainda consigo arrancar boas informa\u00e7\u00f5es de voc\u00eas.",
        u"Hmmm\u2026 right now, while I do feel like that\u2019s the correct choice, I fear that\u2019s a big decision to jump straight to.": u"Hmmm\u2026 agora, embora eu ache que essa seja a escolha certa, temo que seja uma decis\u00e3o grande demais para tomarmos de imediato.",
        u"Hmm\u2026": u"Hum\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Actually, I was planning to oversee the construction today.": u"Hum\u2026 Na verdade, eu planejava supervisionar a constru\u00e7\u00e3o hoje.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 As grateful as I am that you're always so willing to help, we should really get more staff around here for next year's term.": u"Hmm\u2026 Por mais grato que eu seja pela sua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o em ajudar, realmente dever\u00edamos contratar mais funcion\u00e1rios para a temporada do ano que vem.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 But the thing is\u2026 I don\u2019t feel so sure, after thinking about it.": u"Hmm\u2026 Mas a quest\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026 Depois de pensar melhor, j\u00e1 n\u00e3o tenho tanta certeza.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Can I request some sausage and eggs\u2026? I\u2019m really craving them for some reason.": u"Hmm\u2026 Posso pedir lingui\u00e7a com ovos\u2026? Por algum motivo estou com muita vontade.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Clearly, our camp is understaffed. And every little bit of help counts at this point.": u"Hmm\u2026 Claramente, nosso acampamento est\u00e1 com poucos funcion\u00e1rios. E toda ajuda conta neste momento.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Do you think it\u2019d help if we ask the others about it? So that it\u2019s not just my opinion?": u"Hmm\u2026 Acha que ajudaria se pergunt\u00e1ssemos aos outros? Assim n\u00e3o seria apenas a minha opini\u00e3o.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 He must not be at camp then\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 Ent\u00e3o ele n\u00e3o deve estar no acampamento\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Her being so persistent to stay at camp does contradict her other views\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 A insist\u00eancia dela em permanecer no acampamento realmente contradiz as outras opini\u00f5es que demonstra\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 How about we workout together? It\u2019s been a while since we stretched our muscles, after all!": u"Hmm\u2026 Que tal treinarmos juntos? Afinal, faz tempo que n\u00e3o exercitamos nossos m\u00fasculos!",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I can\u2019t tell either\u2026 But what I do know is you tried your best.": u"Hmm\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei dizer\u2026 Mas sei que voc\u00ea fez o seu melhor.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I do think it\u2019s a good idea to move back in. ": u"Hmm\u2026 Acho que \u00e9 uma boa ideia voltar para o meu quarto. ",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I guess I can appreciate how much work was put into this\u2026 even the way the genitals are drawn are very detailed.": u"Hmm\u2026 Acho que consigo apreciar o trabalho colocado nisso\u2026 at\u00e9 a maneira como os genitais s\u00e3o desenhados \u00e9 muito detalhada.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I guess we should.": u"Hmm\u2026 Acho que devemos.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I understand that it\u2019s due to the nature of this camp\u2026 But for the sake of emergencies, productivity, and marketing, we really need to consider integrating technology, at least on the administrative end.": u"Hum\u2026 Entendo que isso se deve \u00e0 natureza do acampamento\u2026 Mas, pensando em emerg\u00eancias, produtividade e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o, precisamos considerar a integra\u00e7\u00e3o da tecnologia, pelo menos na parte administrativa.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 If you all want, I can help suggest dishes for each of you that might be to your liking. ": u"Hmm\u2026 Se quiserem, posso sugerir pratos para cada um que talvez sejam do gosto de voc\u00eas. ",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Is Sir Goro not here? I wonder if he\u2019s out again today.": u"Hum\u2026 O Senhor Goro n\u00e3o est\u00e1 aqui? Ser\u00e1 que saiu novamente hoje?",
        u"Hmm\u2026 It seems Aiden kept that from you then\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 Ent\u00e3o parece que Aiden escondeu isso de voc\u00ea\u2026",
