        u"Hmm\u2026 It sounds pretty serious, though.": u"Hmm\u2026 Mas parece algo bem s\u00e9rio.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 I\u2019m not surprised she said all that.": u"Hmm\u2026 N\u00e3o me surpreende que ela tenha dito tudo isso.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Let me ask the receptionist if there any events for tonight.": u"Hmm\u2026 Deixe-me perguntar \u00e0 recepcionista se h\u00e1 algum evento para esta noite.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Let\u2019s just say I just saw something promising in you, from the way you acted, to the way you were willing to lead and take charge.": u"Hmm\u2026 Digamos que vi algo promissor em voc\u00ea, desde a maneira como agia at\u00e9 a sua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o para liderar e assumir o comando.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Lloyd\u2019s not exactly shy with his thoughts, but it\u2019s usually only about his own feelings.": u"Hmm\u2026 Lloyd n\u00e3o \u00e9 exatamente t\u00edmido para falar o que pensa, mas normalmente s\u00f3 fala dos pr\u00f3prios sentimentos.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Now that you mention it, she really acts like it\u2019s been forever since she stayed in a fancy place like this\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 Agora que voc\u00ea mencionou, ela realmente age como se fizesse uma eternidade desde a \u00faltima vez que ficou num lugar chique assim\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Outside of the fundraising we did last term\u2026 I guess you\u2019re right.": u"Hmm\u2026 Tirando a arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o que fizemos na temporada passada\u2026 acho que tem raz\u00e3o.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 Perhaps Mr. Clermont directly ordered her to make those changes\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 Talvez o Sr. Clermont tenha ordenado diretamente essas mudan\u00e7as\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 The only piece of technology we have here is our personal computer.": u"Hum\u2026 O \u00fanico equipamento tecnol\u00f3gico que temos aqui \u00e9 nosso computador pessoal.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 The weather forecast did say the next couple days would be a lot clearer.  So, it\u2019s not entirely impossible to work, as long as safety measures are taken.": u"Hmm\u2026 A previs\u00e3o do tempo disse que os pr\u00f3ximos dias seriam bem mais tranquilos. Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o \u00e9 totalmente imposs\u00edvel trabalhar, desde que sejam tomadas medidas de seguran\u00e7a.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 The workers are scheduled to arrive tomorrow, so maybe we can prepare for that?": u"Hmm\u2026 Os trabalhadores devem chegar amanh\u00e3, ent\u00e3o talvez possamos preparar tudo para isso?",
        u"Hmm\u2026 We barely fit in here. Are you doing alright, Yoshinori?": u"Hmm\u2026 Mal cabemos aqui. Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshinori?",
        u"Hmm\u2026 We won\u2019t deny that she can be strict and demanding when it comes to doing her job. But you can\u2019t judge a book by its cover.": u"Hmm\u2026 N\u00e3o vamos negar que ela pode ser r\u00edgida e exigente quando se trata do trabalho. Mas n\u00e3o se deve julgar um livro pela capa.",
        u"Hmm\u2026 What are you all trying to say?": u"Hmm\u2026 O que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o querendo dizer?",
        u"Hmm\u2026 When was this taken again?": u"Hmm\u2026 Quando esta foto foi tirada mesmo?",
        u"Hmm\u2026 You seem to have a broken lifeline\u2026": u"Hmm\u2026 Parece que sua linha da vida est\u00e1 interrompida\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026 you seem to have a broken heart line...": u"Hmm\u2026 parece que sua linha do cora\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 interrompida\u2026",
        u"Hmm\u2026. There\u2019s just something in Gramps\u2019 eyes whenever I see him with you, and that goes way back to when you were still a scout.": u"Hmm\u2026 H\u00e1 algo diferente no olhar do Vov\u00f4 sempre que o vejo com voc\u00ea, e isso vem desde a \u00e9poca em que voc\u00ea ainda era escoteiro.",
        u"Hmph!": u"Hmpf!",
        u"Hmph! All I\u2019m saying is, you can cherish the past, but it\u2019s best to focus on what\u2019s ahead!": u"Hmpf! S\u00f3 estou dizendo que voc\u00ea pode valorizar o passado, mas \u00e9 melhor se concentrar no que vem pela frente!",
        u"Hmph! Did the handbook know it was gonna be this hot today?": u"Humpf! O manual sabia que hoje estaria t\u00e3o quente?",
        u"Hmph! Emilia is lucky she gets to stay! ": u"Hmph! Emilia tem sorte de poder ficar! ",
        u"Hmph! If you assumed I needed you or anyone\u2019s help then you\u2019re sorely mistaken.": u"Hmph! Se achou que eu precisava da sua ajuda ou da ajuda de qualquer pessoa, est\u00e1 muito enganado.",
        u"Hmph! It\u2019s because you changed the topic!": u"Humpf! A culpa \u00e9 sua por ter mudado de assunto!",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019ll get there before you then!": u"Hmph! Ent\u00e3o vou chegar l\u00e1 antes de voc\u00ea!",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019m a little disappointed, I thought you\u2019d be more eager to catch up with an old colleague!": u"Hmph! Estou um pouco decepcionada. Achei que estaria mais ansioso para conversar com uma velha colega!",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019m a lot stronger than I look, Aiden. ": u"Hmpf! Sou muito mais forte do que pare\u00e7o, Aiden. ",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019m not taking part in this!": u"Hmph! N\u00e3o vou participar disso!",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019m starting to have second thoughts about coming back here!": u"Hmpf! Estou come\u00e7ando a me arrepender de ter voltado aqui!",
        u"Hmph! I\u2019m way past being a rich snob!": u"Hmph! J\u00e1 superei essa fase de esnobe rica!",
        u"Hmph! Since when did you become such a buzzkill?": u"Hmph! Desde quando voc\u00ea ficou t\u00e3o estraga-prazeres?",
        u"Hmph! Speaking of which, Yoshinori\u2026 you\u2019re the prime example of someone who has been corrupted for so many years. ": u"Hmph! Falando nisso, Yoshinori\u2026 voc\u00ea \u00e9 o principal exemplo de algu\u00e9m que foi corrompido durante tantos anos. ",
        u"Hmph! This is why I was trying to do this on my own!": u"Hmpf! \u00c9 por isso que eu estava tentando fazer isso sozinha!",
        u"Hmph! We\u2019re already professionals, I\u2019m not going to be childish and spiteful like her!": u"Hmph! N\u00f3s j\u00e1 somos profissionais, eu n\u00e3o vou agir de forma infantil e rancorosa como ela!",
        u"Hmph! Why shouldn\u2019t I? She and I never got along in the first place!": u"Hmph! E por que n\u00e3o? N\u00f3s nunca nos demos bem desde o in\u00edcio!",
        u"Hmph! You don\u2019t get it, Yoshi! She\u2019s bossy and mean at work, and she has the nerve to throw shade at me every chance she gets!": u"Hmph! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o entende, Yoshi! Ela \u00e9 mandona e maldosa no trabalho e ainda tem a aud\u00e1cia de me alfinetar sempre que pode!",
        u"Hmph, I already have one on my wrist! You didn\u2019t care about that!": u"Humpf, j\u00e1 tenho uma no pulso! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se importou com essa!",
        u"Hmph, I don\u2019t see you complaining whenever I let you wear them!": u"Hmph, n\u00e3o vejo voc\u00ea reclamando quando deixo voc\u00ea usar minhas roupas!",
        u"Hmph, I doubt it! There\u2019s no way I could deal with her strange hobbies and manic episodes!": u"Hmph, duvido! N\u00e3o tem como eu aguentar os hobbies estranhos e os ataques de euforia dela!",
        u"Hmph, I should be asking you. I didn\u2019t expect you to try and sneak up on me while I\u2019m getting dressed.": u"Hmph, eu \u00e9 que deveria perguntar. N\u00e3o esperava que tentasse se aproximar \u00e0s escondidas enquanto eu me vestia.",
        u"Hmph, I\u2019m just trying to fit in with the group. ": u"Hmph, s\u00f3 estou tentando me enturmar com o grupo. ",
        u"Hmph, bold of you people to assume I want to share a room with the likes of you! ": u"Humpf, muita ousadia de voc\u00eas presumirem que eu gostaria de dividir um quarto com gente como voc\u00eas! ",
        u"Hmph, bold of you to assume I want to share a room with the likes of you! ": u"Hmph, muita ousadia sua presumir que eu queira dividir um quarto com algu\u00e9m como voc\u00ea! ",
        u"Hmph, don\u2019t get cocky, boy. I\u2019m only sharing Yoshinori tonight until we settle our bet.": u"Hmph, n\u00e3o fique convencido, garoto. S\u00f3 vou dividir Yoshinori esta noite at\u00e9 resolvermos nossa aposta.",
        u"Hmph, fine! Truth or dare, Dynamite!": u"Hmph, est\u00e1 bem! Verdade ou desafio, Dynamite!",
        u"Hmph, fine. Last one is you, Taiga! Speak up.": u"Hmph, tudo bem. S\u00f3 falta voc\u00ea, Taiga! Fale.",
        u"Hmph, hardly! Your sloppy pumping doesn't do anything!": u"Hmph, nem de longe! Essas suas investidas desajeitadas n\u00e3o fazem nada!",
        u"Hmph, he\u2019s not theirs to ogle! ": u"Hmph, ele n\u00e3o \u00e9 deles para ficarem secando! ",
        u"Hmph, it actually wasn\u2019t! I\u2019ll have you know you two almost ruined that for me too!": u"Hmph, na verdade n\u00e3o foi! Saibam que voc\u00eas dois quase estragaram isso para mim tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Hmph, killjoy! Young Yoshi would\u2019ve said yes!": u"Hmph, estraga-prazeres! O jovem Yoshi teria dito sim!",
        u"Hmph, not at all, Aiden! ": u"Hmpf, nada disso, Aiden! ",
        u"Hmph, that excuse is as fake as it gets, Yoshi. You just wanna see too.": u"Hmph, essa desculpa n\u00e3o engana ningu\u00e9m, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m s\u00f3 quer ver.",
        u"Hmph, that\u2019s cheating \u2013 your monster dick is doing all the work for you! Your humping is totally sloppy!": u"Hmph, isso \u00e9 trapa\u00e7a \u2013 seu pau monstruoso est\u00e1 fazendo todo o trabalho! Suas investidas s\u00e3o totalmente desajeitadas!",
        u"Hmph, then tell me how it completely explains the coincidences! ": u"Hmph, ent\u00e3o me diga como ela explica perfeitamente todas as coincid\u00eancias!",
        u"Hmph, took you long enough! Spending all that time with the old geezer is finally paying off.": u"Hmph, demorou! Todo esse tempo com o velho finalmente est\u00e1 dando resultado.",
