        u"Hmph. Or is it because you think I won\u2019t stand a chance just because you\u2019re younger?": u"Hmph. Ou voc\u00ea acha que eu n\u00e3o tenho chance s\u00f3 porque voc\u00ea \u00e9 mais jovem?",
