        u"Honestly though, I thought she\u2019d be a lot less aggressive in front of Mr. Clermont, but she didn\u2019t even think twice about calling each of us out like that\u2026": u"Sinceramente, achei que ela seria bem menos agressiva na frente do Sr. Clermont, mas ela nem pensou duas vezes antes de criticar cada um de n\u00f3s daquele jeito\u2026",
