        u"How about a massage? We take pride in our quality \u2018extra service\u2019 with guaranteed \u2018happy endings!\u2019": u"Que tal uma massagem? Temos orgulho de nosso \u2018servi\u00e7o extra\u2019 de qualidade, com \u2018finais felizes\u2019 garantidos!",
        u"How about breaking down the scrap materials?": u"Que tal quebrar os materiais descartados?",
        u"How about some cream-filled donut holes!": u"Que tal alguns bolinhos de donut recheados com creme!",
        u"How about that whole wheat baguette, sir?": u"Que tal aquela baguete integral, senhor?",
        u"How about we check out the lobby again, sir?": u"Que tal darmos outra olhada no sagu\u00e3o, senhor?",
        u"How about we check out the lobby again?": u"Que tal darmos outra olhada no sagu\u00e3o?",
        u"How about we check out the lobby?": u"Que tal darmos uma olhada no sagu\u00e3o?",
        u"How about we order your specialty mix instead?": u"Que tal pedirmos a especialidade da casa?",
        u"How about we take a dip at the bathhouse again?": u"Que tal darmos outro mergulho nas termas?",
        u"How about we take a dip in the bathhouse again, sir?": u"Que tal darmos outro mergulho na casa de banho, senhor?",
        u"How about we try this one? Maybe it works over here!": u"Que tal tentarmos este? Talvez esteja funcionando!",
        u"How about you try \u2018Sit on my Face\u2019, Aiden?": u"Que tal experimentar um \u2018Sit on my Face\u2019, Aiden?",
        u"How about you, Darius? Don\u2019t you have a hobby?": u"E voc\u00ea, Darius? N\u00e3o tem um passatempo?",
        u"How about you, Jin? Want some?": u"E voc\u00ea, Jin? Quer um pouco?",
        u"How about you, Lloyd and Darius?! ": u"E voc\u00eas, Lloyd e Darius?! ",
        u"How about you? The next term should\u2019ve started by now right?": u"E voc\u00ea? A pr\u00f3xima temporada j\u00e1 deve ter come\u00e7ado, certo?",
        u"How am I supposed to with all of you talking over each other like you\u2019ve never seen food on a plate before?": u"Como vou fazer isso com todos voc\u00eas falando uns por cima dos outros como se nunca tivessem visto comida num prato?",
        u"How are you feeling, Aiden?": u"Como voc\u00ea est\u00e1 se sentindo, Aiden?",
        u"How are you feeling\u2026?": u"Como est\u00e1 se sentindo\u2026?",
        u"How are you guys withstanding this heat?! ": u"Como voc\u00eas est\u00e3o aguentando esse calor?! ",
        u"How are you, Emilia?": u"Como est\u00e1, Emilia?",
        u"How are you, man?! It\u2019s been forever!": u"Como voc\u00ea est\u00e1, cara?! Faz uma eternidade!",
        u"How can I help, Yuri?": u"Como posso ajudar, Yuri?",
        u"How can I understand?! It\u2019s one thing to turn away from a huge opportunity, but now you even want us just to leave everything behind?!": u"Como posso entender?! Uma coisa \u00e9 recusar uma oportunidade enorme, mas agora voc\u00ea quer que simplesmente deixemos tudo para tr\u00e1s?!",
        u"How can you not have time?! You know I\u2019ve been planning this activity for weeks, and\u2014": u"Como pode n\u00e3o ter tempo?! Voc\u00ea sabe que planejo esta atividade h\u00e1 semanas e\u2014",
        u"How come Dad didn\u2019t tell us about it?! This is like the biggest offer we\u2019ve ever received! ": u"Por que o Pai n\u00e3o contou para n\u00f3s?! Essa deve ser a maior proposta que j\u00e1 recebemos! ",
        u"How come those two are allowed to go on dates and we\u2019re not?!": u"Como \u00e9 que aqueles dois podem sair em encontros e n\u00f3s n\u00e3o?!",
        u"How come you\u2019ve never brought us somewhere like this before, Dad?!": u"Como \u00e9 que voc\u00ea nunca nos trouxe a um lugar assim antes, pai?!",
        u"How could you not remember?! You were in the same batch as them!": u"Como voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se lembra?! Voc\u00eas eram da mesma turma!",
        u"How could you think that after all we\u2019ve been through, Aiden?!": u"Como voc\u00ea pode pensar isso depois de tudo que passamos, Aiden?!",
        u"How could you think that?!": u"Como voc\u00ea pode pensar isso?!",
        u"How dare you talk to her like that?!": u"Como ousa falar com ela desse jeito?!",
        u"How did it go?": u"Como foi?",
        u"How did it go? ": u"Como foi? ",
        u"How does this work again?": u"Como isso funciona mesmo?",
        u"How else are we supposed to take it when everything you say is condescending?!": u"De que outra forma devemos interpretar quando tudo que voc\u00ea diz \u00e9 condescendente?!",
        u"How exactly do you think that has any serious effect on our productivity?": u"Como exatamente acha que isso afeta seriamente nossa produtividade?",
        u"How have you two been doing, you know\u2026 relationship-wise?": u"Como voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o, sabe\u2026 em rela\u00e7\u00e3o ao relacionamento?",
        u"How long do I have to wait\u2026 again?": u"Quanto tempo vou ter que esperar\u2026 de novo?",
        u"How long have you been standing there? I didn\u2019t notice you come in at all!": u"H\u00e1 quanto tempo est\u00e1 parado a\u00ed? Nem percebi voc\u00ea entrando!",
        u"How long have you been standing there?! Were you spying on me?!": u"H\u00e1 quanto tempo voc\u00ea est\u00e1 a\u00ed?! Estava me espionando?!",
        u"How scandalous. To think cards like that are in the deck.": u"Que indecente. E pensar que existem cartas assim no baralho.",
        u"How scandalous\u2026 I\u2019m not taking any part in this.": u"Que esc\u00e2ndalo\u2026 N\u00e3o vou participar disso.",
        u"How the hell else am I supposed to get them in, then?!": u"E como diabos eu deveria enfi\u00e1-los ent\u00e3o?!",
        u"How was I supposed to do everything on my own, when I\u2019d never been taught how to even take care of myself!?": u"Como eu deveria fazer tudo sozinha se nunca me ensinaram nem a cuidar de mim mesma?!",
        u"How were your errands though, Dad? What did you end up doing today?": u"Mas como foram seus afazeres, pai? O que acabou fazendo hoje?",
        u"However, I must admit, I feel like a proud father seeing those two like this\u2026": u"Mas devo admitir que me sinto como um pai orgulhoso vendo os dois assim\u2026",
        u"However, I need you to understand that I\u2019m trying to change too. Or at least to be back to how I was long ago.": u"No entanto, preciso que entenda que tamb\u00e9m estou tentando mudar. Ou pelo menos voltar a ser como eu era h\u00e1 muito tempo.",
        u"However, Ms. Komarova. It\u2019s apparent to me that you\u2019ve been failing to empathize with your co-workers, and it has led to high levels of tension in the project.": u"Entretanto, Srta. Komarova, est\u00e1 claro para mim que lhe faltou empatia com seus colegas de trabalho, e isso gerou muita tens\u00e3o no projeto.",
        u"However, as I said earlier, I will continue to lead alongside Yoshinori for the remaining span of the project, so nothing will change until then!": u"Por\u00e9m, como disse antes, continuarei liderando ao lado de Yoshinori pelo restante do projeto, ent\u00e3o nada mudar\u00e1 at\u00e9 l\u00e1!",
        u"However, it was a part of today\u2019s agenda.": u"No entanto, isso j\u00e1 fazia parte da pauta de hoje.",
        u"However, there are equally important suggestions on top of this, such as technology integration, gear upgrades and a new curriculum to establish safety interests.": u"Entretanto, h\u00e1 outras sugest\u00f5es igualmente importantes, como integra\u00e7\u00e3o tecnol\u00f3gica, moderniza\u00e7\u00e3o dos equipamentos e um novo curr\u00edculo voltado \u00e0 seguran\u00e7a.",
        u"However, with your permission, I\u2019d like to offer her a position here at Camp Buddy.": u"No entanto, com sua permiss\u00e3o, gostaria de oferecer a ela uma fun\u00e7\u00e3o aqui no Camp Buddy.",
        u"How\u2019d she take that?": u"Como ela reagiu?",
        u"How\u2019s everyone holding up? ": u"Como todos est\u00e3o se saindo? ",
        u"How\u2019s that for a side dish, Yoshi~?": u"Que tal isso como acompanhamento, Yoshi~?",
        u"How\u2019s the ride so far? Hope you\u2019re enjoying it~!": u"Como est\u00e1 o passeio at\u00e9 agora? Espero que esteja gostando~!",
        u"Hrnngg\u2026! S-Sir\u2026!!": u"Hrnngg\u2026! S-Senhor\u2026!!",
        u"Hug tightly.": u"Abra\u00e7\u00e1-lo com for\u00e7a.",
        u"Huh, looks like he\u2019s headed into that exercise room\u2026 ": u"Hum, parece que ele est\u00e1 indo para aquela sala de exerc\u00edcios\u2026 ",
        u"Huh, no wonder my butt was pretty sore when I woke up! I thought I was just having a wet dream, hahaha!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o \u00e9 \u00e0 toa que minha bunda estava t\u00e3o dolorida quando acordei! Pensei que s\u00f3 tivesse tido um sonho molhado, hahaha!",
        u"Huh, so this is what you\u2019re really into, Yoshinori?": u"H\u00e3, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 disso que voc\u00ea realmente gosta, Yoshinori?",
        u"Huh? But they only have one round left!": u"H\u00e3? Mas eles s\u00f3 t\u00eam mais uma rodada!",
        u"Huh? Did you suddenly change your mind or something?": u"H\u00e3? Voc\u00ea mudou de ideia de repente ou algo assim?",
        u"Huh? Do we have visitors?": u"H\u00e3? Temos visitas?",
        u"Huh? Do we know you\u2026?": u"H\u00e3? N\u00f3s conhecemos voc\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"Huh? Is somebody else in here?": u"H\u00e3? Tem mais algu\u00e9m aqui?",
        u"Huh? Jin, what are you doing?": u"H\u00e3? Jin, o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?",
        u"Huh? That voice sounds familiar. ": u"Huh? Essa voz parece familiar. ",
        u"Huh? There\u2019s a journal project?": u"H\u00e3? Tem um projeto de di\u00e1rio?",
        u"Huh? We\u2019re talking about our exercise sesh yesterday! I was doing yoga and he was lifting!": u"Huh? Estamos falando do nosso treino de ontem! Eu estava fazendo yoga e ele estava levantando peso!",
        u"Huh? What do you mean, Aiden?": u"H\u00e3? O que voc\u00ea quer dizer, Aiden?",
        u"Huh? What do you mean?": u"H\u00e3? Como assim?",
        u"Huh? What do you mean?  ": u"H\u00e3? O que quer dizer?  ",
        u"Huh? What happened with her? Is she sick?": u"H\u00e3? O que aconteceu com ela? Est\u00e1 doente?",
        u"Huh? What happened?": u"H\u00e3? O que aconteceu?",
        u"Huh? What is it, Jin?": u"H\u00e3? O que \u00e9, Jin?",
        u"Huh? What is she doing over there?": u"H\u00e3? O que ela est\u00e1 fazendo ali?",
        u"Huh? What makes you think you don't, Yoshinori? ": u"H\u00e3? O que faz voc\u00ea pensar que n\u00e3o tem, Yoshinori?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s going on here?": u"H\u00e3? O que est\u00e1 acontecendo aqui?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s the matter, Jin?": u"H\u00e3? O que houve, Jin?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s this\u2026? A box?": u"H\u00e3? O que \u00e9 isso\u2026? Uma caixa?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s with that look? And is that drool I see on your face?": u"H\u00e3? O que \u00e9 essa cara? E isso no seu rosto \u00e9 baba?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s with that look? And is that drool I see on your face?{fast}": u"H\u00e3? O que \u00e9 essa cara? E isso no seu rosto \u00e9 baba?{fast}",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s wrong with Buttcheeks?": u"H\u00e3? O que deu no Bund\u00e3o?",
        u"Huh? What\u2019s wrong with that? And why do you care?": u"Huh? O que h\u00e1 de errado nisso? E por que voc\u00ea se importa?",
        u"Huh? Why are you two just standing here, looking weird?": u"H\u00e3? Por que voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o parados aqui, com essa cara estranha?",
        u"Huh? Why? Isn\u2019t that already the same thing you\u2019re doing here?": u"H\u00e3? Por qu\u00ea? N\u00e3o \u00e9 basicamente a mesma coisa que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 faz aqui?",
        u"Huh? You guys grew up together??": u"H\u00e3? Voc\u00eas cresceram juntos??",
        u"Huh?! No way! That sounds embarrassing! And would you stop calling me that?!": u"H\u00e3?! Nem pensar! Isso parece constrangedor! E d\u00e1 para parar de me chamar assim?!",
        u"Huh?? What do you mean?  ": u"H\u00e3?? Como assim?  ",
        u"Huh??? For what?": u"H\u00e3??? Para qu\u00ea?",
        u"Huhhh? Why would we? You don\u2019t have like three dicks and one ball down there, do you?": u"H\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3? Por que a gente riria? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem tipo tr\u00eas paus e uma bola a\u00ed embaixo, tem?",
        u"Huhuhu I\u2019m moving as fast as I can\u2026": u"Huhuhu, estou indo o mais r\u00e1pido que consigo\u2026",
        u"Huhuhu!! First Lloyd, Darius, and Jin are leaving, and now Aiden too! I can\u2019t take all of this! I\u2019m gonna cry!": u"Huhuhu!! Primeiro Lloyd, Darius e Jin v\u00e3o embora, e agora Aiden tamb\u00e9m! N\u00e3o aguento tudo isso! Vou chorar!",
        u"Huhuhu!! First Lloyd, Darius, and Jin are leaving, and soon Dad too! I can\u2019t take all of this! I\u2019m gonna cry!": u"Huhuhu!! Primeiro Lloyd, Darius e Jin est\u00e3o indo embora, e logo o Pai tamb\u00e9m! N\u00e3o aguento tudo isso! Vou chorar!",
        u"Huhuhu, Dar\u2026 Don\u2019t say that out of pity\u2026": u"Huhuhu, Dar\u2026 N\u00e3o diga isso por pena\u2026",
        u"Huhuhuhu\u2026 Be sure to keep in touch!": u"Huhuhuhu\u2026 N\u00e3o deixem de manter contato!",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 Even with all of us shoveling here, we didn\u2019t even clear it halfway\u2026": u"Huhuhu\u2026 Mesmo com todos n\u00f3s usando as p\u00e1s, n\u00e3o conseguimos limpar nem metade\u2026",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 I miss them already!": u"Huhuhu\u2026 J\u00e1 estou com saudade deles!",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 It does\u2026 What do I doooo, guys?": u"Huhuhu\u2026 D\u00f3i\u2026 O que eu fa\u00e7ooo, pessoal?",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 No more fortune-telling sessions and crystal healings in the morning either\u2026": u"Huhuhu\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o teremos mais sess\u00f5es de adivinha\u00e7\u00e3o e cura com cristais pela manh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 This makes me wanna cry\u2026 ": u"Huhuhu\u2026 Isso me d\u00e1 vontade de chorar\u2026 ",
        u"Huhuhu\u2026 To think I was the one stripped\u2026": u"Huhuhu\u2026 E pensar que fui eu quem acabou sem roupa\u2026",
        u"Huh\u2026 But I have to be naked too, don\u2019t I?": u"H\u00e3\u2026 Mas eu tamb\u00e9m tenho que ficar pelado, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Huh\u2026 I probably hugged him too tight when I was thanking him for the fan. No wonder he left all of a sudden.": u"H\u00e3\u2026 Provavelmente o abracei com muita for\u00e7a quando agradeci pelo ventilador. N\u00e3o \u00e9 de admirar que tenha sa\u00eddo de repente.",
        u"Huh\u2026 I thought she\u2019d be in her room\u2026 I hope she\u2019s not causing a commotion again. ": u"Huh\u2026 Achei que ela estaria no quarto\u2026 Espero que n\u00e3o esteja causando outro esc\u00e2ndalo. ",
        u"Huh\u2026 I thought she\u2019d be in her room\u2026 I wonder what she's doing here by herself.": u"Hum\u2026 Pensei que estaria no quarto\u2026 O que ser\u00e1 que est\u00e1 fazendo aqui sozinha?",
        u"Huh\u2026 I\u2019d forgotten how delicate you can be when it comes to crafting.": u"Huh\u2026 Eu tinha esquecido como voc\u00ea pode ser delicado quando se trata de trabalhos manuais.",
        u"Huh\u2026 I\u2019m not sure I\u2019d be into that.": u"Huh\u2026 N\u00e3o sei se eu gostaria disso.",
        u"Huh\u2026 he does seem pretty clingy, huh?": u"H\u00e3\u2026 ele parece bem grudado, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Huh\u2026? I thought he was outside already.": u"H\u00e3\u2026? Achei que ele j\u00e1 estivesse l\u00e1 fora.",
        u"Huh\u2026? Wh-What are you saying, Aiden\u2026?": u"H\u00e3\u2026? O-O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 dizendo, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Huh\u2026? Wh-What are you saying, Goro...?": u"H\u00e3\u2026? O-O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 dizendo, Goro\u2026?",
        u"Huh\u2026? Who\u2019s\u2014": u"Huh\u2026? Quem est\u00e1\u2014",
        u"Hurr durr. Do you know\u2026 the muffin man?": u"Hurr durr. Voc\u00ea conhece\u2026 o homem do muffin?",
        u"Hurry up, blow the candles off your fire-cake already!": u"Anda logo, apague as velas desse bolo em chamas!",
        u"Hurry up\u2026 I\u2019m ready for my punishment\u2026": u"Ande logo\u2026 Estou pronto para minha puni\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Hush and just join in!": u"Shhh, apenas venha junto!",
        u"Hush, Yuri\u2026!": u"Quietinha, Yuri\u2026!",
        u"I QUIT!!! ": u"EU ME DEMITO!!! ",
        u"I SAID GET OVER HERE, YOU FLEABAG!": u"EU MANDEI VOC\u00ca VIR AQUI, SEU SACO DE PULGAS!",
        u"I TAKE IT BACK! LET ME OVER THERE!": u"EU VOLTO ATR\u00c1S! DEIXE-ME IR A\u00cd!",
        u"I actually am though\u2026": u"Na verdade, eu sou\u2026",
        u"I actually talked a little with Emilia about her behavior last night. Unfortunately, she wouldn\u2019t admit that there was anything wrong with her attitude. ": u"Na verdade, conversei um pouco com a Emilia sobre o comportamento dela ontem \u00e0 noite. Infelizmente, ela n\u00e3o quis admitir que havia algo errado com sua atitude. ",
        u"I actually thought you\u2019d be bunking with Yuri though, sir. Since she\u2019s your daughter after all.": u"Na verdade, achei que o senhor dividiria o quarto com Yuri. Afinal, ela \u00e9 sua filha.",
        u"I actually tried to close the jacket, but there's no buttons. I think she did that on purpose.": u"Na verdade tentei fechar a jaqueta, mas n\u00e3o tem bot\u00f5es. Acho que ela fez isso de prop\u00f3sito.",
        u"I actually used packaged dough from the freezer since I didn\u2019t know how to make bread\u2026 And I didn\u2019t know how to use the oven either\u2026": u"Na verdade, usei massa pronta do congelador porque n\u00e3o sabia fazer p\u00e3o\u2026 E tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sabia usar o forno\u2026",
        u"I actually would\u2019ve picked some for you guys, had I known you were coming.": u"Na verdade, eu teria escolhido algumas para voc\u00eas se soubesse que viriam.",
        u"I advise that you all be cautious in how you deal with her when she wakes up, and it may be beneficial for her to seek additional help after this.": u"Aconselho que todos tenham cuidado ao lidar com ela quando acordar, e talvez seja ben\u00e9fico que ela procure ajuda adicional depois disso.",
        u"I agree with Yoichi for once! We need some nutritious food back in our bodies!": u"Dessa vez concordo com Yoichi! Precisamos colocar comida nutritiva de volta no corpo!",
        u"I agree with you, Mr. Clermont. I\u2019ll have my staff prepare for their arrival. We\u2019ll allot some of the vacant cabins for temporary housing throughout the construction.": u"Concordo, senhor Clermont. Pedirei \u00e0 equipe que se prepare para a chegada deles. Reservaremos algumas cabanas vazias como alojamento tempor\u00e1rio durante a constru\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I agree \u2013 I don\u2019t think I could ever go back to my old diet after being here.": u"Concordo \u2014 acho que nunca mais conseguiria voltar \u00e0 minha antiga alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o depois de ficar aqui.",
        u"I agree, sir. I\u2019m ready for a good night sleep.": u"Concordo, senhor. Estou pronto para uma boa noite de sono.",
        u"I agree, sir\u2026! Nothing is more important to me than all of you!": u"Concordo, senhor\u2026! Nada \u00e9 mais importante para mim do que todos voc\u00eas!",
        u"I agree. Ever since the first term, you two have had one of the closest bonds amongst all the scouts.": u"Concordo. Desde a primeira temporada, voc\u00eas dois t\u00eam um dos la\u00e7os mais fortes entre todos os escoteiros.",
        u"I agree. I think it\u2019s worth giving it some more thought, Aiden. This is a huge decision, after all.": u"Concordo. Acho que vale a pena pensar um pouco mais, Aiden. Afinal, \u00e9 uma decis\u00e3o enorme.",
        u"I agree. It\u2019s convenient that I don\u2019t have to say anything when Lloyd is around.": u"Concordo. \u00c9 conveniente n\u00e3o precisar dizer nada quando Lloyd est\u00e1 por perto.",
        u"I agree. I\u2019m glad we were finally able to put our pasts behind us.": u"Concordo. Fico feliz que finalmente conseguimos deixar nosso passado para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"I agree. Their presence here today really boosted our morale.": u"Concordo. A presen\u00e7a deles aqui hoje realmente elevou nosso \u00e2nimo.",
        u"I agree. There\u2019s so much out there to see.": u"Concordo. H\u00e1 tanta coisa para ver por a\u00ed.",
        u"I agree. You two look like you could use a shower too.": u"Concordo. Voc\u00eas dois tamb\u00e9m parecem estar precisando de um banho.",
        u"I agreed to keep that child, but you know I never wanted to be a mother, and I should never have agreed to be your wife!": u"Concordei em ficar com aquela crian\u00e7a, mas voc\u00ea sabe que nunca quis ser m\u00e3e, e eu nunca deveria ter aceitado ser sua esposa!",
        u"I agree\u2026": u"Concordo\u2026",
        u"I agree\u2026 It is odd that someone with her work ethic and skill level qualified to be our sponsor\u2019s representative.": u"Concordo\u2026 \u00c9 estranho algu\u00e9m com a \u00e9tica de trabalho e o n\u00edvel de habilidade dela ter se qualificado para representar nosso patrocinador.",
        u"I already got a work out in this morning.": u"Eu j\u00e1 treinei esta manh\u00e3.",
        u"I already hung out in the caf\u00e9 all day yesterday, so I wanted a change of scenery while I\u2019m enjoying my BL~": u"J\u00e1 passei o dia inteiro no caf\u00e9 ontem, ent\u00e3o queria mudar de ambiente enquanto aproveito meu BL~",
        u"I already told you I need more time to think about it!": u"Eu j\u00e1 disse que preciso de mais tempo para pensar!",
        u"I already told you it\u2019s not true!! What else do you want me to say?!": u"Eu j\u00e1 disse que n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade!! O que mais quer que eu diga?!",
        u"I also believe that continuing to work alongside Yoshinori will allow us to maintain the spirit and quality of the camp better than we otherwise could.": u"Tamb\u00e9m acredito que continuar trabalhando ao lado de Yoshinori nos permitir\u00e1 preservar melhor o esp\u00edrito e a qualidade do acampamento.",
        u"I also don\u2019t want to be late for my meeting with the camp president\u2026! ": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o quero me atrasar para a reuni\u00e3o com o presidente do acampamento\u2026! ",
        u"I also expect you all to take my evaluations from yesterday into account. ": u"Tamb\u00e9m espero que todos levem em considera\u00e7\u00e3o minhas avalia\u00e7\u00f5es de ontem. ",
        u"I also wanted to check myself once I heard one of our important staff members was ill!": u"Tamb\u00e9m quis vir pessoalmente assim que soube que uma de nossas importantes funcion\u00e1rias estava doente!",
        u"I also wished to see if you all had been able to work out the issues I saw a week ago during our meeting.": u"Tamb\u00e9m queria saber se voc\u00eas conseguiram resolver os problemas que vi uma semana atr\u00e1s durante nossa reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"I always like to be a step ahead of everybody else.": u"Gosto de estar sempre um passo \u00e0 frente de todos.",
        u"I always make sure to do plenty of stretching, especially if there\u2019s gonna be a lot of physical labor during the day. ": u"Sempre fa\u00e7o bastante alongamento, principalmente quando teremos muito trabalho bra\u00e7al durante o dia. ",
        u"I always prefer the sporty stuff too, so I\u2019ve got the athletic scouts covered!": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m sempre prefiro as atividades esportivas, ent\u00e3o cuido dos escoteiros atl\u00e9ticos!",
        u"I am curious though, how did you guys end up getting hired to work for Camp Buddy? Was it really a twist in fate? ": u"Mas estou curiosa: como voc\u00eas acabaram contratados para trabalhar no Camp Buddy? Foi mesmo uma reviravolta do destino? ",
        u"I am disappointed to be explaining all of this, as I thought a former alumnus would\u2019ve understood these aspects better.": u"Fico decepcionado por precisar explicar tudo isso, pois achei que uma ex-aluna compreenderia melhor esses aspectos.",
        u"I am kind of a shut-in, so I don\u2019t often get the chance to make new friends, even online.": u"Sou um pouco recluso, ent\u00e3o raramente tenho a oportunidade de fazer novos amigos, mesmo pela internet.",
        u"I am looking for a\u2026 Mr. Goro Nomoru? I have an appointment with him today\u2026!": u"Estou procurando pelo\u2026 Sr. Goro Nomoru? Tenho uma reuni\u00e3o marcada com ele hoje\u2026!",
        u"I am more honored than ever to be your sponsor.": u"Sinto-me mais honrado do que nunca por ser o patrocinador de voc\u00eas.",
        u"I am not qualified for the position and will be resigning effective immediately.": u"N\u00e3o sou qualificada para o cargo e estou me demitindo com efeito imediato.",
        u"I am not sure what that means, but this concerns you, Mr. Flynn. ": u"N\u00e3o sei exatamente o que isso significa, mas a quest\u00e3o diz respeito ao Sr. Flynn.",
        u"I am planning on taking Lloyd out on the holidays. We\u2019re going deep in space.": u"Estou planejando levar Lloyd para sair nas f\u00e9rias. Vamos explorar o espa\u00e7o profundo.",
        u"I am really curious, though\u2026 How did she react when you confronted her, Yoshi?": u"Mas estou muito curioso\u2026 Como ela reagiu quando voc\u00ea a confrontou, Yoshi?",
        u"I am so grateful we had the chance to continue where our stories left off\u2026 and it helped me learn even more about him and his past.": u"Sou muito grato por termos tido a chance de continuar de onde nossas hist\u00f3rias pararam\u2026 e isso me ajudou a conhecer ainda mais sobre ele e seu passado.",
        u"I am. I don\u2019t want to live like that anymore.": u"Estou. N\u00e3o quero mais viver daquele jeito.",
        u"I am. Jin here has done excellent work for us over the course of the project, and I\u2019d hate to lose him. ": u"Sim. Jin fez um trabalho excelente para n\u00f3s durante o projeto, e eu odiaria perd\u00ea-lo. ",
        u"I am\u2026 It\u2019s what I\u2019ve done for so long\u2026 It\u2019s pretty much hard-wired into me.": u"Estou\u2026 \u00c9 o que fa\u00e7o h\u00e1 tanto tempo\u2026 Est\u00e1 praticamente gravado em mim.",
        u"I apologize for not informing you beforehand.": u"Pe\u00e7o desculpas por n\u00e3o t\u00ea-lo informado com anteced\u00eancia.",
        u"I apologize, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Pe\u00e7o desculpas, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I appreciate all the work you\u2019ve put into sponsoring our camp, Mr. Clermont. I am extremely grateful.": u"Agrade\u00e7o todo o trabalho que dedicou ao patroc\u00ednio do nosso acampamento, senhor Clermont. Sou imensamente grato.",
        u"I appreciate your honesty, Yoshinori. And I know exactly what you mean when you say that.": u"Agrade\u00e7o sua sinceridade, Yoshinori. E sei exatamente o que quer dizer com isso.",
        u"I asked Yuri to teach me to do some chores today. But ugh\u2026 I didn\u2019t sign up for\u2026 this.": u"Pedi para a Yuri me ensinar algumas tarefas dom\u00e9sticas hoje. Mas ugh\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o me inscrevi para\u2026 isso.",
        u"I assume Yuri fetched you?": u"Imagino que a Yuri tenha ido cham\u00e1-lo.",
        u"I assume you\u2019re the one who informed the scouts of our situation, Yoshinori?": u"Imagino que tenha sido voc\u00ea quem informou os escoteiros sobre nossa situa\u00e7\u00e3o, Yoshinori?",
        u"I barely remember what it felt like because of how drunk I was!": u"Mal consigo lembrar como foi porque eu estava b\u00eabado demais!",
        u"I beg to differ. A restaurant this high-caliber would definitely deliver more sophistication than just plain pork and beans.": u"Discordo. Um restaurante deste n\u00edvel certamente oferece muito mais sofistica\u00e7\u00e3o do que simples carne de porco com feij\u00e3o.",
        u"I beg to differ; I\u2019ve never felt so alive! It\u2019s been years since I\u2019ve had this much fun!": u"Discordo; nunca me senti t\u00e3o vivo! Faz anos que n\u00e3o me divirto tanto!",
        u"I believe I could eat your meals every day and be quite happy!": u"Acho que poderia comer suas refei\u00e7\u00f5es todos os dias e ser muito feliz!",
        u"I believe drinking scalding black coffee alone with no cream or sugar like Sir Goro is a lot more concerning\u2026 ": u"Acho muito mais preocupante tomar caf\u00e9 preto escaldante, sem creme nem a\u00e7\u00facar, como o Sr. Goro\u2026 ",
        u"I believe he is referring to me.": u"Acredito que ele esteja se referindo a mim.",
        u"I believe it\u2019s even older than that, since I got it before the camp was even established\u2026": u"Acredito que seja ainda mais antigo, pois o adquiri antes mesmo de o acampamento ser fundado\u2026",
        u"I believe that if we conserve some of them, they\u2019ll complement the structures we\u2019re building here.": u"Acredito que, se preservarmos algumas delas, elas complementar\u00e3o as estruturas que estamos construindo aqui.",
        u"I believe this is more than just a business \u2013 it\u2019s about what your place stands for in this generation!": u"Acredito que isto seja mais do que um simples neg\u00f3cio: trata-se do que este lugar representa para esta gera\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"I believe we all share the same sentiment that working at Camp Buddy is more than just a job for all of us.": u"Acredito que todos compartilhamos o sentimento de que trabalhar no Camp Buddy \u00e9 mais do que apenas um emprego.",
        u"I believe you and I share a common trait when it comes to managing our emotions.": u"Acredito que eu e voc\u00ea temos algo em comum quando se trata de lidar com nossas emo\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"I bet Lloyd feels the same way, but he\u2019s holding back \u2019cause he thinks you\u2019re comfortable with how things are.": u"Aposto que o Lloyd sente o mesmo, mas est\u00e1 se segurando porque acha que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 confort\u00e1vel com as coisas como est\u00e3o.",
        u"I bet a lot of people would love to have a piece of Gramps over here! Even right now, a couple are checking him out!": u"Aposto que muita gente adoraria provar um peda\u00e7o do Vov\u00f4 aqui! At\u00e9 agora mesmo tem algumas pessoas secando ele!",
        u"I bet it\u2019s completely different at night.": u"Aposto que \u00e9 completamente diferente \u00e0 noite.",
        u"I bet she denied everything.": u"Aposto que negou tudo.",
        u"I bet that\u2019s way more up your alley!": u"Aposto que isso faz muito mais o seu estilo!",
        u"I bet the facilities included in our package will be just as extravagant.  I can\u2019t wait to try them with you.": u"Aposto que as instala\u00e7\u00f5es inclu\u00eddas no pacote ser\u00e3o igualmente extravagantes.  Mal posso esperar para experiment\u00e1-las com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I bet they don\u2019t know where the shovels are! Stay right here, Yoshi!": u"Aposto que eles n\u00e3o sabem onde ficam as p\u00e1s! Fique aqui, Yoshi!",
        u"I bet when you eventually don\u2019t get your way with Yoshinori, you\u2019ll cut him off just the same. ": u"Aposto que, quando eventualmente n\u00e3o conseguir o que quer com Yoshinori, vai descart\u00e1-lo do mesmo jeito. ",
        u"I bet you can\u2019t even fry an egg.": u"Aposto que voc\u00ea nem sabe fritar um ovo.",
        u"I bet you\u2019ll like \u2018Sex on the Beach\u2019, Aiden!": u"Aposto que vai gostar de \u2018Sex on the Beach\u2019, Aiden!",
        u"I better clean you up before going to bed\u2026": u"\u00c9 melhor limpar voc\u00ea antes de irmos para a cama\u2026",
        u"I better get dressed and find him. He should be at the kitchen right now.": u"\u00c9 melhor eu me vestir e procur\u00e1-lo. Ele deve estar na cozinha agora.",
        u"I better get dressed and head there.": u"\u00c9 melhor eu me vestir e ir para l\u00e1.",
        u"I better get dressed and head to his office.": u"\u00c9 melhor eu me vestir e ir ao escrit\u00f3rio dele.",
        u"I better get these dirty clothes off of you and get you comfortable\u2026": u"\u00c9 melhor tirar estas roupas sujas e deixar voc\u00ea confort\u00e1vel\u2026",
        u"I blame Aiden! He\u2019s the one who started it!": u"A culpa \u00e9 do Aiden! Foi ele quem come\u00e7ou!",
        u"I brought everyone\u2019s favorites~! All homemade too! ": u"Trouxe os favoritos de todo mundo~! E tudo feito em casa! ",
        u"I brought some barf bags too in case you\u2014": u"Tamb\u00e9m trouxe alguns sacos para v\u00f4mito caso voc\u00ea\u2014",
        u"I brought you your morning coffee before we started work today! I figured-": u"Trouxe seu caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3 antes de come\u00e7armos o trabalho hoje! Pensei que\u2014",
        u"I called Felix and Seto too, but they\u2019re away on a vacation, sadly.": u"Tamb\u00e9m liguei para Felix e Seto, mas infelizmente est\u00e3o viajando.",
        u"I came here for a snack, but I got a whole cake instead! ": u"Vim aqui buscar um lanche, mas ganhei um bolo inteiro! ",
        u"I came here for work, and there\u2019s a LOT of stuff I need to inspect on my checklist, after all.": u"Vim aqui a trabalho e, afinal, h\u00e1 MUITAS coisas que preciso verificar na minha lista.",
        u"I can already feel your hole throbbing for me, and you\u2019re hard as a rock under there.": u"J\u00e1 consigo sentir sua entrada pulsando por mim, e voc\u00ea est\u00e1 duro como pedra a\u00ed embaixo.",
        u"I can already see it, \u201cCamp Buddy, an origin story of where a master chef started his culinary journey\u201d.": u"J\u00e1 consigo ver: \u201cCamp Buddy, a hist\u00f3ria de origem de onde um grande chef iniciou sua jornada culin\u00e1ria\u201d.",
        u"I can die here now\u2026 This is definitely a real-life representation of my fantasies. ": u"J\u00e1 posso morrer aqui\u2026 Isso definitivamente \u00e9 uma representa\u00e7\u00e3o das minhas fantasias na vida real. ",
        u"I can drive for you, sir!": u"Posso dirigir para o senhor!",
        u"I can finally fully focus on myself~ There\u2019s so much BL I have to catch up on!": u"Finalmente posso me concentrar totalmente em mim mesma~ Tenho tanto BL atrasado para colocar em dia!",
        u"I can help you out! We came to assist you, after all!": u"Posso ajudar! Afinal, viemos justamente para dar uma m\u00e3o!",
        u"I can help you prep and cut up the ingredients to save you some time!": u"Posso ajudar a preparar e cortar os ingredientes para economizar o seu tempo!",
        u"I can help you teach everyone, Dad! I\u2019ve learned a lot from our camping days together, after all!": u"Posso ajudar voc\u00ea a ensinar todo mundo, pai! Afinal, aprendi muito com nossos dias acampando juntos!",
        u"I can imagine it a lot better now\u2026": u"Agora consigo imaginar muito melhor\u2026",
        u"I can imagine. You must be used to working with a lot of people to get a project done.": u"Posso imaginar. Voc\u00ea deve estar acostumado a trabalhar com muitas pessoas para concluir um projeto.",
        u"I can just do maintenance tasks around the camp and keep things in tip-top shape. ": u"Posso simplesmente cuidar da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento e manter tudo em perfeitas condi\u00e7\u00f5es. ",
        u"I can loosen them up again. ": u"Eu posso relaxar elas de novo. ",
        u"I can only dream that I\u2019d have a body as nice as any of you guys\u2026": u"S\u00f3 posso sonhar em ter um corpo t\u00e3o bonito quanto o de qualquer um de voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"I can only imagine all the sweaty, wet, island sex they\u2019ll have there.": u"S\u00f3 consigo imaginar todo o sexo suado e molhado que eles v\u00e3o fazer naquela ilha.",
        u"I can really see that he wants to be closer to everyone, just like how he was when he was our scoutmaster\u2026": u"D\u00e1 para ver que ele realmente quer se aproximar de todos, como era quando foi nosso chefe escoteiro\u2026",
        u"I can see that very clearly.": u"Isso est\u00e1 bem evidente.",
        u"I can still change his mind.": u"Ainda posso faz\u00ea-lo mudar de ideia.",
        u"I can take it from here and sort out the things I want to keep.": u"Posso assumir daqui e separar as coisas que quero guardar.",
        u"I can tell. He\u2019s always been the kinda guy who doesn\u2019t show any emotion and bottles everything up.": u"D\u00e1 para perceber. Ele sempre foi o tipo de cara que n\u00e3o demonstra emo\u00e7\u00e3o e guarda tudo para si.",
        u"I can understand that, but you won\u2019t know what you\u2019re missing unless you give it a chance!": u"Eu entendo, mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai saber o que est\u00e1 perdendo se n\u00e3o der uma chance!",
        u"I can't believe I didn't know about this... How were they able to find work or a place to stay after they left with Andre being sick?": u"N\u00e3o acredito que eu n\u00e3o sabia disso\u2026 Como conseguiram trabalho ou um lugar para morar depois que partiram, com Andre doente?",
        u"I cannot believe what I\u2019m hearing! You\u2019re all just trying to discredit me, just like you did in that meeting!": u"N\u00e3o acredito no que estou ouvindo! Voc\u00eas s\u00f3 est\u00e3o tentando me desacreditar, como fizeram naquela reuni\u00e3o!",
        u"I can\u2019t believe I never knew anything even after all these years. These are some really crazy revelations, sir.": u"N\u00e3o acredito que nunca soube de nada mesmo depois de todos esses anos. Essas revela\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o realmente malucas, senhor.",
        u"I can\u2019t believe I\u2019m really staying in the same room as Goro from now on\u2026": u"N\u00e3o acredito que realmente vou ficar no mesmo quarto que Goro de agora em diante\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t believe how we lived such opposite lives, Goro\u2026": u"N\u00e3o acredito como vivemos vidas t\u00e3o opostas, Goro\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t believe it! You\u2019re a legend! I\u2019ve read all your fanfics! I love them so much!": u"N\u00e3o acredito! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 uma lenda! Li todas as suas fanfics! Eu as adoro!",
        u"I can\u2019t believe no one welcomed me either, do they even know who sent us here?! Where\u2019s my room?! I thought this was a five-star luxury hotel?! ": u"N\u00e3o acredito que ningu\u00e9m veio me receber tamb\u00e9m! Eles sequer sabem quem nos mandou para c\u00e1?! Onde est\u00e1 meu quarto?! Achei que este fosse um hotel cinco estrelas de luxo?! ",
        u"I can\u2019t believe she\u2019s just gonna run away after everything she did! ": u"N\u00e3o acredito que ela simplesmente vai fugir depois de tudo o que fez! ",
        u"I can\u2019t believe that my scoutmasters are actually getting married\u2026 *sniff* It\u2019s just so heartwarming\u2026": u"N\u00e3o acredito que meus chefes escoteiros realmente v\u00e3o se casar\u2026 *sniff* \u00c9 t\u00e3o emocionante\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t believe that when we started this project months ago, I was worried about not being able to do anything.": u"N\u00e3o acredito que, quando come\u00e7amos este projeto meses atr\u00e1s, eu estava preocupado por achar que n\u00e3o conseguiria fazer nada.",
        u"I can\u2019t believe that\u2019s how everything really started\u2026": u"N\u00e3o acredito que foi assim que tudo realmente come\u00e7ou\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t believe this blatant bias went on for years!  Your confrontational behavior and all your frivolous whims in and out of the camp just shows how hopelessly unprofessional you are! ": u"N\u00e3o acredito que esse favoritismo descarado tenha durado anos!  Seu comportamento confrontador e todos os seus caprichos f\u00fateis dentro e fora do acampamento s\u00f3 mostram o quanto voc\u00ea \u00e9 irremediavelmente antiprofissional! ",
        u"I can\u2019t believe we all got fooled by her! ": u"N\u00e3o acredito que todos n\u00f3s fomos enganados por ela! ",
        u"I can\u2019t believe we really made it this far.": u"N\u00e3o acredito que realmente chegamos t\u00e3o longe.",
        u"I can\u2019t believe you had the nerve to barge into my room to not only verbally assault me, but accuse me of such a heinous thing!": u"N\u00e3o acredito que teve a aud\u00e1cia de invadir meu quarto para n\u00e3o s\u00f3 me atacar verbalmente, mas tamb\u00e9m me acusar de uma coisa t\u00e3o absurda!",
        u"I can\u2019t believe you served me something raw! Touch this meat and tell me that\u2019s not just taken straight out of the fridge!": u"N\u00e3o acredito que me serviu algo cru! Toque nesta carne e diga que ela n\u00e3o acabou de sair da geladeira!",
        u"I can\u2019t believe you were ignoring everything I was saying, Yoshi.": u"N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea estava ignorando tudo o que eu dizia, Yoshi.",
        u"I can\u2019t blame you for holding me to such a high standard even after all these years \u2013 I come from an unforgettably prestigious background after all~": u"N\u00e3o posso culp\u00e1-lo por ainda esperar tanto de mim depois de todos esses anos \u2014 afinal, venho de uma origem inesquecivelmente prestigiosa~",
        u"I can\u2019t even imagine what would\u2019ve happened if Sir Goro and the scouts caught us\u2026 Or worse, Yuri\u2026": u"Nem consigo imaginar o que teria acontecido se o Sr. Goro e os escoteiros pegassem a gente\u2026 Ou pior, a Yuri\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t even imagine what would\u2019ve happened if the scouts or Aiden caught us\u2026 Or worse, Yuri\u2026": u"Nem consigo imaginar o que teria acontecido se os escoteiros ou Aiden nos pegassem\u2026 Ou pior, Yuri\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t even keep a job long enough to survive!\tIf I hadn\u2019t done anything, I\u2019d be living on the streets too!": u"Eu nem consigo manter um emprego por tempo suficiente para sobreviver!\tSe eu n\u00e3o tivesse feito nada, tamb\u00e9m estaria morando na rua!",
        u"I can\u2019t even think about it!": u"N\u00e3o consigo nem pensar nisso!",
        u"I can\u2019t exercise with you teasing me like this.": u"N\u00e3o consigo me exercitar com voc\u00ea me provocando desse jeito.",
        u"I can\u2019t fight this feeling anymore\u2026": u"N\u00e3o consigo mais lutar contra este sentimento\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t help but be curious about what kind of person you were before I met you at Camp Buddy, sir.": u"N\u00e3o consigo deixar de ficar curioso sobre que tipo de pessoa o senhor era antes de eu conhec\u00ea-lo no Camp Buddy.",
        u"I can\u2019t help but notice the brooch you attached to your suit.": u"N\u00e3o pude deixar de notar o broche que prendeu ao terno.",
        u"I can\u2019t help it anymore\u2026 I want you, Aiden\u2026": u"N\u00e3o consigo mais me segurar\u2026 Eu quero voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t help it! I just have so much fun hanging out with you!": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar! Eu me divirto demais passando tempo com voc\u00ea!",
        u"I can\u2019t help it. I just love spending time with you that much.": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar. Eu simplesmente amo passar tanto tempo com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I can\u2019t help it. You know how I love going to places like this.": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar. Voc\u00ea sabe como adoro ir a lugares assim.",
        u"I can\u2019t help it\u2026 I don\u2019t wanna make a mess\u2026": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar\u2026 N\u00e3o quero fazer bagun\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t help it\u2026 I\u2019ve been thinking about doing it with you all day\u2026": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar\u2026 Passei o dia inteiro pensando em fazer isso com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t hold it anymore, Aiden\u2026 I want you\u2026": u"N\u00e3o consigo mais me segurar, Aiden\u2026 Eu quero voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t imagine how the scoutmasters were planning to do it by themselves\u2026": u"Nem consigo imaginar como os chefes escoteiros pretendiam fazer tudo sozinhos\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t let myself focus on what I couldn\u2019t do for you then\u2026": u"N\u00e3o posso continuar focando no que n\u00e3o consegui fazer por voc\u00ea naquela \u00e9poca\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t promise you it\u2019ll work, but I\u2019ll do my best to convince him, okay?": u"N\u00e3o posso prometer que dar\u00e1 certo, mas farei o poss\u00edvel para convenc\u00ea-lo, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"I can\u2019t remember the last time I opened this one. ": u"Nem me lembro da \u00faltima vez que abri esta. ",
        u"I can\u2019t stand being here for another minute! Why did you even send me here?!": u"N\u00e3o aguento ficar aqui nem mais um minuto! Por que voc\u00eas me mandaram para c\u00e1?!",
        u"I can\u2019t stand you! You\u2019re so whiney and entitled! Why are you even at this camp?!": u"Eu n\u00e3o suporto voc\u00ea! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o chorona e acha que tem direito a tudo! Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 neste acampamento?!",
        u"I can\u2019t take all the credit, though. Dar is the real MVP in making all my designs a reality.": u"Mas n\u00e3o posso ficar com todo o cr\u00e9dito. Dar \u00e9 o verdadeiro MVP por transformar todos os meus projetos em realidade.",
        u"I can\u2019t wait anymore, Yoshinori\u2026 I\u2019m going in.": u"N\u00e3o consigo esperar mais, Yoshinori\u2026 Vou entrar.",
        u"I can\u2019t wait for the scouts to see how much this place has grown!": u"Mal posso esperar para os escoteiros verem o quanto este lugar cresceu!",
        u"I can\u2019t wait for them to see what I\u2019ve done!!": u"Mal posso esperar para eles verem o que eu fiz!!",
        u"I can\u2019t wait for this season to be over though. I really prefer the heat.": u"Mesmo assim, mal posso esperar para esta esta\u00e7\u00e3o acabar. Eu realmente prefiro o calor.",
        u"I can\u2019t wait to see the look on their faces when they do! And of course, when they try my new and improved menu!": u"Mal posso esperar para ver a cara deles! E, claro, quando experimentarem meu card\u00e1pio novo e melhorado!",
        u"I can\u2019t wait to see the look on their faces when they do. All the new buildings and the fun new activities we\u2019ve prepared.": u"Mal posso esperar para ver a express\u00e3o deles quando voltarem. Todos os pr\u00e9dios novos e as atividades divertidas que preparamos.",
        u"I can\u2019t wait, Yoshi\u2026 Put it in me already\u2026": u"N\u00e3o aguento mais esperar, Yoshi\u2026 Coloca logo dentro de mim\u2026",
        u"I can\u2019t work well without it, so I thought it\u2019d give Jin a boost.": u"Eu n\u00e3o consigo trabalhar direito sem caf\u00e9, ent\u00e3o achei que daria um impulso ao Jin.",
        u"I can\u2019t work well without it, so I thought it\u2019d give you a boost too.": u"N\u00e3o consigo trabalhar bem sem ele, ent\u00e3o achei que tamb\u00e9m daria uma energia para voc\u00ea.",
        u"I cause nothing but trouble to everyone, especially you, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 causo problemas para todo mundo, principalmente para voc\u00ea, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I continue to wish for this place\u2019s success, and hope that Camp Buddy will prosper for many years to come.": u"Continuarei desejando o sucesso deste lugar e espero que o Camp Buddy prospere por muitos anos.",
        u"I continued to learn more management skills from Goro, and soon we were both so in sync that the meetings and paperwork gave us no trouble!": u"Continuei aprendendo mais sobre administra\u00e7\u00e3o com Goro, e logo est\u00e1vamos t\u00e3o sincronizados que reuni\u00f5es e papelada n\u00e3o nos davam trabalho algum!",
        u"I could barely keep up with the pace of the discussion. I wish I could've contributed as much as you did!": u"Mal consegui acompanhar o ritmo da discuss\u00e3o. Gostaria de ter contribu\u00eddo tanto quanto o senhor!",
        u"I could help out! At least that's more manpower\u2026!": u"Eu posso ajudar! Pelo menos \u00e9 mais uma pessoa para trabalhar\u2026!",
        u"I could really use a reward for all that hard work~": u"Eu bem que merecia uma recompensa por todo aquele trabalho duro~",
        u"I could really use it over here\u2026": u"Eu realmente poderia usar uma massagem bem aqui\u2026",
        u"I could say the same for you! And\u2026 well, everyone for that matter. ": u"Eu poderia dizer o mesmo de voc\u00ea! E\u2026 bem, de todos, na verdade.",
        u"I could see Aiden beginning to rethink his role at the camp from all the criticisms, and all I could do was try to have his back and reassure him.": u"Eu via Aiden come\u00e7ando a repensar seu papel no acampamento por causa das cr\u00edticas, e s\u00f3 podia apoi\u00e1-lo e tranquiliz\u00e1-lo.",
        u"I could see how Sir Goro was trying his best to control himself and stay focused on the task. The least I could do was always keep him company.": u"Eu conseguia ver o quanto o Sr. Goro se esfor\u00e7ava para se controlar e manter o foco no trabalho. O m\u00ednimo que eu podia fazer era sempre lhe fazer companhia.",
        u"I could tell that the opportunity he was offered made him more inspired and determined to try out new things!": u"Dava para perceber que a oportunidade que recebeu o deixou mais inspirado e determinado a experimentar coisas novas!",
        u"I could use a coffee\u2026 I haven\u2019t had one today because I was rush packing.": u"Um caf\u00e9 cairia bem\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o tomei nenhum hoje porque estava arrumando as coisas \u00e0s pressas.",
        u"I could use a coffee\u2026 That whole scene earlier almost gave me a migraine\u2026  ": u"Um caf\u00e9 cairia bem\u2026 Aquela cena de antes quase me deu uma enxaqueca\u2026  ",
        u"I couldn\u2019t even sleep properly thanks to that\u2026 Holding it in wasn\u2019t a good idea, after all.": u"Nem consegui dormir direito por causa disso\u2026 No fim das contas, segurar a vontade n\u00e3o foi uma boa ideia.",
        u"I couldn\u2019t have asked for anything more\u2026 So, I just wanted that to last for as long as I could.": u"Eu n\u00e3o poderia pedir mais nada\u2026 Ent\u00e3o s\u00f3 queria que isso durasse o m\u00e1ximo poss\u00edvel.",
        u"I couldn\u2019t help it! It was more perfectly-timed than any reading I\u2019ve ever had! ": u"Eu n\u00e3o consegui me conter! O momento foi mais perfeito do que qualquer leitura que j\u00e1 fiz! ",
        u"I couldn\u2019t remember anything much after that\u2026 ": u"Depois disso, n\u00e3o consigo me lembrar de muita coisa\u2026 ",
        u"I couldn\u2019t sleep last night\u2026 I was just thinking about everything that happened and what I\u2019d done.": u"N\u00e3o consegui dormir ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 Fiquei pensando em tudo que aconteceu e no que eu tinha feito.",
        u"I could\u2019ve made you wear something much better like a grunge leather daddy, a gladiator, or a caveman! Ugh\u2026 the wasted potential!": u"Eu poderia ter feito voc\u00ea vestir algo muito melhor, como um leather daddy grunge, um gladiador ou um homem das cavernas! Ugh\u2026 que potencial desperdi\u00e7ado!",
        u"I decided that I\u2019d do whatever it took to be the best version of myself by the time we met again.": u"Decidi que faria o que fosse necess\u00e1rio para me tornar a melhor vers\u00e3o de mim mesmo at\u00e9 nos encontrarmos novamente.",
        u"I demand you come here and pick me up from this place once and for all!": u"Eu exijo que venha aqui me buscar neste lugar de uma vez por todas!",
        u"I did a bunch of interviews for my part-time jobs back in college, so I think I can give you some tips!": u"Fiz v\u00e1rias entrevistas para meus empregos de meio per\u00edodo na faculdade, ent\u00e3o acho que posso dar algumas dicas!",
        u"I did notice you tossing and turning last night\u2026 but try not to worry so much, Yoshinori.": u"Eu percebi voc\u00ea se revirando na cama ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 mas tente n\u00e3o se preocupar tanto, Yoshinori.",
        u"I did something wrong, regardless of my reasons, so I will apologize. We are adults, after all.": u"Eu fiz algo errado, independentemente dos meus motivos, ent\u00e3o vou pedir desculpas. Afinal, somos adultos.",
        u"I did text him letting him know about today\u2026 He said to congratulate everyone, but that he wouldn\u2019t make it.": u"Mandei uma mensagem avisando sobre hoje\u2026 Ele disse para parabenizar todo mundo, mas que n\u00e3o conseguiria vir.",
        u"I did try my best making this food though! I used a recipe, but I made sure to add my own twist, and\u2014": u"Mas fiz o poss\u00edvel ao preparar esta comida! Usei uma receita, por\u00e9m acrescentei o meu toque pessoal e\u2014",
        u"I did, but I can\u2019t say the same for this guy. I think he\u2019s planning on running in the snow naked.": u"Eu levei, mas n\u00e3o posso dizer o mesmo desse cara. Acho que ele pretende correr pelado na neve.",
        u"I did.": u"Eu esqueci.",
        u"I didn\u2019t come here to eat something that common! Now, cook this meat up before I sue this entire place!": u"Eu n\u00e3o vim aqui para comer uma coisa t\u00e3o comum! Agora cozinhe essa carne antes que eu processe este lugar inteiro!",
        u"I didn\u2019t consider that there would be a freak snowstorm we\u2019d be dealing with\u2026": u"N\u00e3o considerei que ter\u00edamos que lidar com uma tempestade de neve t\u00e3o fora do comum\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t expect anything like this would come out of our search\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o esperava descobrir nada parecido com isso na nossa pesquisa\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t expect he\u2019d play along. Thought you were just a boring giant.": u"N\u00e3o esperava que entrasse na brincadeira. Achei que fosse s\u00f3 um gigante sem gra\u00e7a.",
        u"I didn\u2019t expect to be included! I thought I was just going to be the observer!!": u"Eu n\u00e3o esperava fazer parte disso! Achei que seria apenas o observador!!",
        u"I didn\u2019t expect you guys to be the PDA-type, though.": u"Mas n\u00e3o esperava que voc\u00eas fossem do tipo que demonstra afeto em p\u00fablico.",
        u"I didn\u2019t get the chance to respond\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o tive a chance de responder\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t give her an answer just yet\u2026": u"Ainda n\u00e3o dei uma resposta\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t hear anything like that from Dad though\u2026 Is that really true?": u"Mas n\u00e3o ouvi nada disso do papai\u2026 Ser\u00e1 que \u00e9 verdade?",
        u"I didn\u2019t know any better back then, so I often lashed out whenever I saw them argue.": u"Naquela \u00e9poca eu n\u00e3o entendia as coisas direito, ent\u00e3o costumava explodir sempre que os via discutindo.",
        u"I didn\u2019t know my way around, and I was so overwhelmed with how different it had become\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia mais me localizar, e fiquei muito sobrecarregado com o quanto tudo havia mudado\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t know the reason Mr. Clermont asked for our measurements too, but I didn\u2019t question it.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sabia por que o Sr. Clermont pediu nossas medidas, mas n\u00e3o questionei.",
        u"I didn\u2019t know things seemed so hopeless for her if she were to lose her job at Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que a situa\u00e7\u00e3o parecia t\u00e3o desesperadora para ela caso perdesse o emprego no Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t know you were so talented, Yuri\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea era t\u00e3o talentosa, Yuri\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t know you were such a daredevil, Goro\u2026! We didn\u2019t even put helmets on! We might not make it back home alive at this rate\u2026!": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea era t\u00e3o aventureiro, Goro\u2026! Nem colocamos capacetes! Desse jeito, talvez nem voltemos vivos para casa\u2026!",
        u"I didn\u2019t know, Aiden\u2026 ": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia, Aiden\u2026 ",
        u"I didn\u2019t mean to neglect work today. I just had something really important to take care of.": u"N\u00e3o quis negligenciar o trabalho hoje. S\u00f3 tinha algo muito importante para resolver.",
        u"I didn\u2019t mean to walk out on you like that, I just panicked \u2019cause I didn\u2019t want to say anything worse\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o queria sair daquele jeito, s\u00f3 entrei em p\u00e2nico porque n\u00e3o queria acabar dizendo algo pior\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t order any room service! Leave me alone!": u"Eu n\u00e3o pedi servi\u00e7o de quarto! Me deixe em paz!",
        u"I didn\u2019t realize that most of the stuff in the shed belonged to you\u2026 I thought it was full of tools or something\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o sabia que a maior parte das coisas no galp\u00e3o era sua\u2026 Pensei que estivesse cheio de ferramentas ou algo assim\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t see you lift a finger to help any of the departments the entire time\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o vi voc\u00ea mover um dedo para ajudar nenhum dos departamentos durante todo esse tempo\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t think I could keep a secret like that forever either\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o achava que conseguiria guardar um segredo desses para sempre\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t think it\u2019d be this bad.": u"N\u00e3o achei que seria t\u00e3o ruim.",
        u"I didn\u2019t want to risk the only chance I had, so I kept my feelings to myself\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o queria arriscar a \u00fanica chance que tinha, ent\u00e3o guardei meus sentimentos para mim\u2026",
        u"I didn\u2019t want you to feel bad for me, or change the way you see me because of it.": u"Eu n\u00e3o queria que voc\u00ea sentisse pena de mim nem mudasse a forma como me v\u00ea por causa disso.",
        u"I disagree, sir! You don't look old at all, especially not to me!": u"Discordo, senhor! O senhor n\u00e3o parece velho, principalmente para mim!",
        u"I do feel bad that it took us all afternoon though\u2026 You probably could\u2019ve finished a lot faster if it weren\u2019t for me.": u"Mas me sinto mal por termos levado a tarde inteira\u2026 Voc\u00ea provavelmente teria terminado muito mais r\u00e1pido se n\u00e3o fosse por mim.",
        u"I do have to address some concerns related to Ms. Komarova\u2019s overall well-being.": u"Mas preciso abordar algumas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es relacionadas ao bem-estar geral da Srta. Komarova.",
        u"I do have to admit, when I saw in the job briefing that there are only four full-time employees here at the camp, I wondered how you all managed to keep everything running\u2026": u"Tenho que admitir que, quando vi no resumo do trabalho que h\u00e1 apenas quatro funcion\u00e1rios em tempo integral no acampamento, fiquei imaginando como voc\u00eas conseguiam manter tudo funcionando\u2026",
        u"I do kinda wish my old man was still here to see all this\u2026": u"Eu queria que meu velho ainda estivesse aqui para ver tudo isso\u2026",
        u"I do like it big\u2026": u"Eu gosto quando \u00e9 grande\u2026",
        u"I do like marshmallows. I put them in my cocoa all the time.": u"Eu gosto de marshmallows. Coloco no meu chocolate quente o tempo todo.",
        u"I do pay attention to what you often eat during mealtimes, after all.": u"Afinal, eu presto aten\u00e7\u00e3o no que voc\u00eas costumam comer durante as refei\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"I do remember seeing you with him sometimes whenever we were at the mess hall.": u"Eu me lembro de ver voc\u00ea com ele algumas vezes quando est\u00e1vamos no refeit\u00f3rio.",
        u"I do want to turn my life around! And I\u2019m not going to waste this chance!": u"Eu quero mudar minha vida! E n\u00e3o vou desperdi\u00e7ar esta chance!",
        u"I do what I do best.": u"Eu fa\u00e7o aquilo que sei fazer melhor.",
        u"I do wish he could come with me more often, but Sir Goro has already done enough for me that I don\u2019t want to ask any more of him. ": u"Eu gostaria que ele pudesse vir comigo com mais frequ\u00eancia, mas o senhor Goro j\u00e1 fez muito por mim e n\u00e3o quero pedir ainda mais. ",
        u"I do!": u"Aceito!",
        u"I do! I love it! Thank you!": u"Sim! Eu adorei! Obrigado!",
        u"I do, but I can\u2019t imagine how badly my life would\u2019ve turned out if I hadn\u2019t grown out of it.": u"Sinto, mas nem consigo imaginar como minha vida teria terminado mal se eu n\u00e3o tivesse amadurecido e deixado aquilo para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"I do.": u"Lembro.",
        u"I don't even know where to start.": u"Nem sei por onde come\u00e7ar.",
        u"I don't have any plans.": u"N\u00e3o tenho nenhum plano.",
        u"I don't mind.": u"Eu n\u00e3o me importo.",
        u"I don't want you to get stressed.": u"N\u00e3o quero que o senhor fique estressado.",
        u"I don\u2019t actually remember\u2026 The bartender mixed something up for us, I forgot to ask what it was called.": u"Na verdade, eu n\u00e3o lembro\u2026 O bartender preparou alguma coisa para n\u00f3s, e eu esqueci de perguntar o nome.",
        u"I don\u2019t blame you though. You have way more important duties now anyways.": u"Mas n\u00e3o o culpo. De qualquer forma, agora voc\u00ea tem responsabilidades muito mais importantes.",
        u"I don\u2019t blame you, though! I know you like to ogle mine, so I make sure they\u2019re strong and solid for you~": u"Mas n\u00e3o o culpo! Sei que gosta de admirar o meu, ent\u00e3o fa\u00e7o quest\u00e3o de mant\u00ea-lo forte e firme para voc\u00ea~",
        u"I don\u2019t care what her opinion of me is, but knowing how hard you\u2019ve worked, I wasn\u2019t going to stand by while she disrespected you like that.": u"N\u00e3o me importa o que ela pensa de mim, mas, sabendo o quanto voc\u00ea trabalhou, eu n\u00e3o ficaria parado enquanto ela o desrespeitava daquela forma.",
        u"I don\u2019t care what others think! I already walk around the camp naked every day!": u"N\u00e3o me importo com o que os outros pensam! J\u00e1 ando pelado pelo acampamento todos os dias!",
        u"I don\u2019t deny that I have flaws in my leadership\u2026 perhaps this project is a good opportunity for me to correct those.": u"N\u00e3o nego que minha lideran\u00e7a tenha falhas\u2026 Talvez este projeto seja uma boa oportunidade para corrigi-las.",
        u"I don\u2019t disagree, but what bothered me the most is how she kept digging into everyone, especially you\u2026": u"N\u00e3o discordo, mas o que mais me incomodou foi a forma como ela continuou atacando todo mundo, principalmente voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t get it! How did this slip by my radar?! ": u"Eu n\u00e3o entendo! Como isso passou despercebido por mim?! ",
        u"I don\u2019t give a damn about what you think of me, but I\u2019m not going to let you attack my daughter and Yoshinori like this!": u"N\u00e3o dou a m\u00ednima para o que pensa de mim, mas n\u00e3o vou deixar voc\u00ea atacar minha filha e Yoshinori desse jeito!",
        u"I don\u2019t give a damn, Yoshi\u2026 They can watch us for all I care\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o dou a m\u00ednima, Yoshi\u2026 Por mim, eles podem ficar olhando\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t have any plans until the workers arrive, and since Yuri\u2019s got the deliveries covered\u2026": u"N\u00e3o tenho planos at\u00e9 os trabalhadores chegarem e, como a Yuri j\u00e1 cuida das entregas\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t have any right to talk about his personal life to others, but I think it would help you understand better if you knew how things happened\u2026": u"N\u00e3o tenho o direito de falar da vida pessoal dele para os outros, mas acho que ajudaria voc\u00ea a entender melhor se soubesse como tudo aconteceu\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t have to worry about wearing anything! Just let it all hang loose and let the breeze flow through your legs.": u"N\u00e3o preciso me preocupar em usar nada! \u00c9 s\u00f3 deixar tudo solto e sentir a brisa passando entre as pernas.",
        u"I don\u2019t hold anything against you, sir\u2026": u"N\u00e3o guardo nenhum ressentimento contra o senhor\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t hold anything against you.": u"N\u00e3o guardo ressentimento.",
        u"I don\u2019t know about you guys, but I have a really bad gut feeling about that Emilia. ": u"N\u00e3o sei quanto a voc\u00eas, mas tenho um p\u00e9ssimo pressentimento sobre Emilia.",
        u"I don\u2019t know about you guys, but I won\u2019t be saying no to a fancy dinner night~!  ": u"N\u00e3o sei voc\u00eas, mas eu n\u00e3o vou recusar uma noite de jantar chique~!  ",
        u"I don\u2019t know how they did it, but even the water here feels expensive\u2026": u"N\u00e3o sei como fizeram isso, mas at\u00e9 a \u00e1gua daqui parece cara\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t know how to thank you, Mr. Clermont. You\u2019ve done so much for us over these past few months.": u"N\u00e3o sei como agradecer, Sr. Clermont. O senhor fez tanto por n\u00f3s nestes \u00faltimos meses.",
        u"I don\u2019t know how we would have been able to pull off all of these amazing changes if not for their expertise!": u"N\u00e3o sei como ter\u00edamos conseguido realizar todas essas mudan\u00e7as incr\u00edveis sem a experi\u00eancia deles!",
        u"I don\u2019t know how you even find the time, Yuri\u2026": u"Nem sei como voc\u00ea encontra tempo para isso, Yuri\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t know how you even find the time, dear\u2026": u"Nem sei como voc\u00ea encontra tempo para isso, querida\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t know how, but as soon as he gears up in his camp uniform, he\u2019s enthusiastic and happy all of a sudden.": u"N\u00e3o sei como, mas assim que veste o uniforme do acampamento, de repente fica todo entusiasmado e alegre.",
        u"I don\u2019t know if I can relax in some place as fancy as this\u2026 You know me, I\u2019d rather be outdoors.  ": u"N\u00e3o sei se consigo relaxar num lugar t\u00e3o sofisticado\u2026 Voc\u00ea me conhece, prefiro ficar ao ar livre.  ",
        u"I don\u2019t know if it\u2019s just me, but\u2026 Doesn\u2019t Sir Goro seem a bit closer to Yoshinori than everybody else\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 impress\u00e3o minha, mas\u2026 O Sr. Goro n\u00e3o parece um pouco mais pr\u00f3ximo de Yoshinori do que de todo mundo\u2026?",
        u"I don\u2019t know what I\u2019ll do yet\u2026 But regardless, thank you for supporting my decision, Yoshinori.": u"Ainda n\u00e3o sei o que vou fazer\u2026 Mas, de qualquer forma, obrigado por apoiar minha decis\u00e3o, Yoshinori.",
        u"I don\u2019t know what held me back either\u2026 But all I know is I\u2019ve always wanted to be there for you.": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei o que me impediu\u2026 S\u00f3 sei que sempre quis estar ao seu lado.",
        u"I don\u2019t know what to say, sir\u2026 but I won\u2019t deny it.": u"N\u00e3o sei o que dizer, senhor\u2026 mas n\u00e3o vou negar.",
        u"I don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about! Wh-Who told you all of this?!": u"N\u00e3o sei do que est\u00e1 falando! Q-Quem contou tudo isso para voc\u00ea?!",
        u"I don\u2019t know, ask this pink thing what\u2019s grinding her gears!! ": u"N\u00e3o sei, pergunte a essa coisa rosa o que est\u00e1 irritando ela!! ",
        u"I don\u2019t know, but she\u2019s already gathered all the workers. You guys should just go and see for yourselves.": u"N\u00e3o sei, mas ela j\u00e1 reuniu todos os trabalhadores. \u00c9 melhor voc\u00eas irem ver por conta pr\u00f3pria.",
        u"I don\u2019t know, honestly. I\u2019m pretty drained after working all day on site.": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o sei. Estou bem exausto depois de trabalhar o dia inteiro na obra.",
        u"I don\u2019t know~ Why don\u2019t you ask Yoshi?": u"N\u00e3o sei~ Por que n\u00e3o pergunta ao Yoshi?",
        u"I don\u2019t know\u2026 Dad told me to stay here and\u2014": u"N\u00e3o sei\u2026 O papai mandou que eu ficasse aqui e\u2014",
        u"I don\u2019t know\u2026 I\u2019ve heard a lot of things about her\u2026 So, I just try and stay away.": u"N\u00e3o sei\u2026 Ouvi muitas coisas sobre ela\u2026 Ent\u00e3o procuro manter dist\u00e2ncia.",
        u"I don\u2019t mean anything bad, but\u2026 are you sure about that, sir? I mean\u2026 this has been your life\u2019s work! ": u"N\u00e3o quero dizer nada de ruim, mas\u2026 tem certeza disso, senhor? Quero dizer\u2026 este foi o trabalho da sua vida! ",
        u"I don\u2019t mind showing you.": u"N\u00e3o me importo de mostrar a voc\u00ea.",
        u"I don\u2019t mind that \u2013 I could use the peace and quiet. Hosting the party tonight really drained me.": u"N\u00e3o me importo \u2014 eu estava precisando de paz e sil\u00eancio. Organizar a festa esta noite realmente acabou comigo.",
        u"I don\u2019t mind though! He always does his best to make me feel like I don\u2019t have to change anything about myself!": u"Mas eu n\u00e3o me importo! Ele sempre faz o poss\u00edvel para que eu sinta que n\u00e3o preciso mudar nada em mim!",
        u"I don\u2019t mind. It can get dull and quiet there easily.": u"N\u00e3o me importo. L\u00e1 pode ficar mon\u00f3tono e silencioso facilmente.",
        u"I don\u2019t mind. It\u2019s almost the end of the day anyway.": u"Por mim tudo bem. O dia j\u00e1 est\u00e1 quase acabando mesmo.",
        u"I don\u2019t mind. Maybe they\u2019re up to something interesting.": u"Por mim tudo bem. Talvez estejam fazendo algo interessante.",
        u"I don\u2019t mind. Maybe they\u2019re up to something interesting. ": u"Por mim tudo bem. Talvez estejam fazendo algo interessante. ",
        u"I don\u2019t mind. The more hands, the better, right?": u"Por mim tudo bem. Quanto mais m\u00e3os, melhor, certo?",
        u"I don\u2019t mind\u2026 I will go down with this ship\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o me importo\u2026 Vou afundar junto com esse ship\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t need other people to enjoy a vacation! Especially now that I\u2019m finally in a place up to my standards.": u"N\u00e3o preciso de outras pessoas para aproveitar as f\u00e9rias! Principalmente agora que finalmente estou num lugar \u00e0 altura dos meus padr\u00f5es.",
        u"I don\u2019t really get many chances to help you out like this.": u"N\u00e3o tenho muitas oportunidades de ajudar voc\u00ea assim.",
        u"I don\u2019t remember forbidding it.": u"N\u00e3o me lembro de ter proibido.",
        u"I don\u2019t remember there being an appointment on his schedule.": u"N\u00e3o me lembro de haver nenhum compromisso na agenda dele.",
        u"I don\u2019t see the issue here.": u"N\u00e3o vejo problema algum nisso.",
        u"I don\u2019t see why not? I\u2019d love to join the celebration!": u"Por que n\u00e3o? Adoraria participar da comemora\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"I don\u2019t talk about it for a reason. I can\u2019t imagine the scouts would appreciate knowing their leader was once not a good example. ": u"Eu n\u00e3o falo sobre isso por um motivo. N\u00e3o consigo imaginar que os escoteiros gostariam de saber que seu l\u00edder j\u00e1 foi um mau exemplo. ",
        u"I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve seen this journal of yours before\u2026": u"Acho que nunca vi esse seu di\u00e1rio antes\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think even a shower could cool me down after what I just saw!": u"Acho que nem um banho conseguiria me esfriar depois do que acabei de ver!",
        u"I don\u2019t think it was even a reading\u2026": u"Acho que isso nem foi uma leitura\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think of you that way, sir\u2026 ": u"Eu n\u00e3o penso no senhor desse jeito\u2026 ",
        u"I don\u2019t think so\u2026 The court records show an eviction notice for not only their multi-million-dollar estate but also to an apartment unit named under Ms. Emilia herself\u2026": u"Acho que n\u00e3o\u2026 Os registros judiciais mostram uma ordem de despejo n\u00e3o apenas da propriedade multimilion\u00e1ria deles, mas tamb\u00e9m de um apartamento registrado no nome da pr\u00f3pria Srta. Emilia\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think that was her intent\u2026 She had a lot of problems to deal with, even back then.": u"N\u00e3o acho que essa fosse a inten\u00e7\u00e3o dela\u2026 Ela tinha muitos problemas para enfrentar, mesmo naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"I don\u2019t think that was her intent\u2026 She\u2019s had a lot of problems she had to deal with even back then.": u"N\u00e3o acho que essa fosse a inten\u00e7\u00e3o dela\u2026 Ela j\u00e1 tinha muitos problemas com os quais lidar naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"I don\u2019t think that we\u2019ll be able to finish all the chopping today, unfortunately\u2026": u"Infelizmente, acho que n\u00e3o conseguiremos terminar todo o corte hoje\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think that\u2019s a very productive motto, Aiden\u2026": u"N\u00e3o acho que esse seja um lema muito produtivo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think that\u2019s gonna work\u2026 We need to address the workers before they can start.": u"Acho que isso n\u00e3o vai funcionar\u2026 Precisamos orientar os trabalhadores antes que possam come\u00e7ar.",
        u"I don\u2019t think there\u2019s anything wrong with it, Yoshinori. Or\u2026 is there?": u"N\u00e3o vejo nada de errado nisso, Yoshinori. Ou\u2026 existe algum problema?",
        u"I don\u2019t think there\u2019s anything wrong with the way Sir Goro has been leading the project so far\u2026 Are you sure you\u2019re just not looking too much into it?": u"N\u00e3o acho que haja algo errado na forma como o Sr. Goro tem liderado o projeto\u2026 Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 exagerando?",
        u"I don\u2019t think things will be the same without Sir Goro\u2026": u"Acho que as coisas n\u00e3o ser\u00e3o iguais sem o Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t think this will work for us\u2026 ": u"Acho que isso n\u00e3o vai funcionar para n\u00f3s\u2026 ",
        u"I don\u2019t think we\u2019re supposed to\u2014": u"Acho que n\u00e3o dever\u00edamos\u2014",
        u"I don\u2019t think you can hide that huge thing even if you pull your pants back up.": u"Acho que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o consegue esconder essa coisa enorme nem se puxar a roupa de volta.",
        u"I don\u2019t think \u2018sorry\u2019 is even in her vocabulary.": u"Acho que \u2018desculpa\u2019 nem existe no vocabul\u00e1rio dela.",
        u"I don\u2019t understand either\u2026 I thought he\u2019d at least ask my opinion about it\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 Achei que pelo menos pediria minha opini\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t understand why you hate making time for us.": u"N\u00e3o entendo por que voc\u00ea odeia reservar tempo para n\u00f3s.",
        u"I don\u2019t understand\u2026 ": u"Eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 ",
        u"I don\u2019t understand\u2026 How can you forgive me just like that?": u"Eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 Como consegue me perdoar assim, t\u00e3o facilmente?",
        u"I don\u2019t understand\u2026 Why would you apologize just like that\u2026?": u"Eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 Por que voc\u00ea pediria desculpas assim\u2026?",
        u"I don\u2019t usually believe in things like these but\u2026 I must say, this is some lighthearted entertainment.": u"Normalmente n\u00e3o acredito nessas coisas, mas\u2026 admito que \u00e9 um passatempo divertido.",
        u"I don\u2019t wanna be rude, but\u2026 I did think something was oddly familiar about you both since we first met\u2026": u"N\u00e3o quero ser indelicado, mas\u2026 desde que nos conhecemos, achei que havia algo estranhamente familiar em voc\u00eas dois\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t wanna rush the decision. It could be a huge change for me, and you, after all.": u"N\u00e3o quero tomar essa decis\u00e3o \u00e0s pressas. Afinal, pode ser uma mudan\u00e7a enorme para mim e para voc\u00ea.",
        u"I don\u2019t want this ugly uniform, I want my own designer wardrobe! ": u"Eu n\u00e3o quero este uniforme horroroso, quero minhas pr\u00f3prias roupas de grife! ",
        u"I don\u2019t want to leave\u2026 ": u"Eu n\u00e3o quero ir embora\u2026 ",
        u"I don\u2019t want to live a lie anymore\u2026": u"N\u00e3o quero mais viver uma mentira\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t want to risk letting you go again\u2026 because everything I want is already here...": u"N\u00e3o quero correr o risco de deixar voc\u00ea partir novamente\u2026 porque tudo o que quero j\u00e1 est\u00e1 aqui\u2026",
        u"I don\u2019t want to sound desperate, but I just really think it\u2019s not too late for us to catch up.": u"N\u00e3o quero parecer desesperado, mas realmente acho que ainda n\u00e3o \u00e9 tarde para recuperarmos o tempo perdido.",
        u"I don\u2019t want to spoil it. Just come with me.": u"N\u00e3o quero estragar a surpresa. Apenas venha comigo.",
        u"I don\u2019t want you to get stressed because of Emilia.": u"N\u00e3o quero que o senhor fique estressado por causa da Emilia.",
        u"I doubt he\u2019ll be able to help anytime soon. I just saw Aiden busy with some other chores, so I didn\u2019t bother asking him.": u"Duvido que ele possa ajudar t\u00e3o cedo. Acabei de ver o Aiden ocupado com outras tarefas, ent\u00e3o nem quis incomod\u00e1-lo.",
        u"I doubt it. But let\u2019s see.": u"Duvido. Mas vamos ver.",
        u"I doubt it. I don\u2019t think the hotel would let us overstay, after all\u2026 ": u"Duvido. Afinal, n\u00e3o acho que o hotel deixaria a gente passar do hor\u00e1rio de sa\u00edda\u2026 ",
        u"I doubt it. Like you said back there, he already knew about the winter break. She\u2019s just trying to nitpick and micromanage like she did yesterday!": u"Duvido. Como o senhor disse, ele j\u00e1 sabia da pausa de inverno. Ela s\u00f3 est\u00e1 procurando defeitos e tentando controlar tudo nos m\u00ednimos detalhes, como ontem!",
        u"I doubt someone like him would do something silly like that\u2026": u"Duvido que algu\u00e9m como ele faria algo t\u00e3o bobo\u2026",
        u"I doubt they\u2019d be able to look you in the eye again.": u"Duvido que conseguissem olhar voc\u00ea nos olhos novamente.",
        u"I dunno how Dad did it all by himself before either.": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sei como o papai fazia tudo sozinho antes.",
        u"I dunno, I\u2019m kinda digging it~": u"Sei n\u00e3o, eu meio que estou gostando~",
        u"I dunno, Yoshi\u2026 Maybe you hanging out with me so much is starting to cause a problem. ": u"N\u00e3o sei, Yoshi\u2026 Talvez voc\u00ea passar tanto tempo comigo esteja come\u00e7ando a causar problemas. ",
        u"I dunno, Yoshi\u2026 Shouldn\u2019t you be doing something else for today\u2019s badge activity?": u"N\u00e3o sei, Yoshi\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria estar fazendo outra coisa para a atividade de distintivo de hoje?",
        u"I dunnoooo... You\u2019re always the first one to arrive at the mess hall every morning too\u2026": u"Sei n\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o... Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 sempre a primeira a chegar ao refeit\u00f3rio toda manh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"I dunno~ You tell them, Yoshi~": u"N\u00e3o sei~ Conte voc\u00ea para eles, Yoshi~",
        u"I dunno\u2026 Maybe I should think about it some more\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o sei\u2026 Talvez eu devesse pensar um pouco mais\u2026?",
        u"I dunno\u2026 She always called you a \u201cspecial friend\u201d back then.": u"Sei n\u00e3o\u2026 Naquela \u00e9poca ela sempre chamava voc\u00ea de \u201camigo especial\u201d.",
        u"I estimate with the four of us\u2026 we could clear at least the important parts of the site by the day the workers return.": u"Estimo que, com n\u00f3s quatro\u2026 podemos liberar pelo menos as partes importantes da obra at\u00e9 o dia em que os trabalhadores voltarem.",
        u"I even pushed my own daughter away, assigning her to a different place, and shutting down any attempts she made to reach me\u2026": u"Cheguei at\u00e9 a afastar minha pr\u00f3pria filha, colocando-a em outro lugar e rejeitando todas as tentativas dela de se aproximar de mim\u2026",
        u"I expect the hotel will have some nice food as well, so I\u2019m betting today won\u2019t be your only cheat day.": u"Imagino que o hotel tamb\u00e9m tenha boa comida, ent\u00e3o aposto que hoje n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 seu \u00fanico dia do lixo.",
        u"I expected him to be disappointed, but he was very understanding. And then following it up with yet another business opportunity\u2026": u"Eu esperava que ele ficasse decepcionado, mas foi muito compreensivo. E depois ainda veio com outra oportunidade de neg\u00f3cios\u2026",
        u"I fan foo!": u"Eu con fingo!",
        u"I feel bad about being a shut-in for so long\u2026 I can\u2019t help but feel like I\u2019ve missed out on a lot.": u"Sinto-me mal por ter sido t\u00e3o recluso por tanto tempo\u2026 N\u00e3o consigo evitar a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de que perdi muitas coisas.",
        u"I feel like Emilia\u2019s not going to make it easy for us for some reason\u2026": u"Sinto que, por algum motivo, Emilia n\u00e3o vai facilitar as coisas para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"I feel like a huge weight has been lifted from my shoulders\u2026 And I\u2019m really grateful it was you who did it\u2026": u"Sinto como se um peso enorme tivesse sa\u00eddo dos meus ombros\u2026 E sou muito grato por ter sido voc\u00ea quem me ajudou\u2026",
        u"I feel like you\u2019ve helped me get rid of a huge weight off my chest\u2026 and for that I\u2019m grateful.": u"Sinto que voc\u00ea me ajudou a tirar um enorme peso do peito\u2026 e sou grato por isso.",
        u"I feel the same way\u2026": u"Eu sinto o mesmo\u2026",
        u"I fell in love with you from the moment we first met and I saw your smile\u2026   ": u"Eu me apaixonei por voc\u00ea desde o momento em que nos conhecemos e vi seu sorriso\u2026   ",
        u"I felt bad forcing her to talk, and I even started to doubt if it was right to confront her to begin with\u2026": u"Eu me senti mal por for\u00e7\u00e1-la a conversar e at\u00e9 comecei a duvidar se foi certo confront\u00e1-la desde o in\u00edcio\u2026",
        u"I felt how much you cared for me, and how happy you were with me\u2026": u"Eu sentia o quanto voc\u00ea se importava comigo e como ficava feliz ao meu lado\u2026",
        u"I felt like it was tearing me apart, and I panicked and took a lot of my sleeping pills, hoping they would calm me down\u2026": u"Eu sentia como se aquilo estivesse me destruindo por dentro, entrei em p\u00e2nico e tomei muitos dos meus comprimidos para dormir, esperando que me acalmassem\u2026",
        u"I felt the same way too, Sir Goro\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m me sentia assim, Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"I figured I\u2019d show you what I looked like during my biker days rather than just leaving it to your imagination.": u"Achei melhor mostrar como eu era na \u00e9poca de motoqueiro em vez de deixar tudo para sua imagina\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I figured maybe since you two were past acquaintances, it had something to do with that.": u"Imaginei que talvez tivesse rela\u00e7\u00e3o com o fato de voc\u00eas terem sido conhecidos no passado.",
        u"I figured that if we focused on the same departments, then we can guarantee that Emilia won\u2019t have anything to call us out for!": u"Pensei que, se nos concentrarmos nos mesmos setores, podemos garantir que Emilia n\u00e3o ter\u00e1 nada para criticar!",
        u"I figured we should show up for work early now that we have an inspector.": u"Achei melhor chegarmos cedo ao trabalho agora que temos uma inspetora.",
        u"I figured we would be using a lot more now that the weather's getting colder.": u"Imaginei que usar\u00edamos muito mais agora que o tempo est\u00e1 esfriando.",
        u"I figured we\u2019d get at least one or two comments from you.": u"Imaginei que ouvir\u00edamos pelo menos um ou dois coment\u00e1rios seus.",
        u"I figured you\u2019d be up soon, so I went ahead and made you some coffee!": u"Imaginei que voc\u00ea acordaria logo, ent\u00e3o j\u00e1 preparei um caf\u00e9 para voc\u00ea!",
        u"I figured you\u2019d enjoy it, especially after that long bus ride.": u"Imaginei que voc\u00ea gostaria, principalmente depois daquela longa viagem de \u00f4nibus.",
        u"I finally see now\u2026": u"Agora finalmente entendo\u2026",
        u"I find the genre itself so special! Seeing two men allowing themselves to be vulnerable and passionate towards each other, never fails to light a fire in me that words can\u2019t explain!": u"Acho o g\u00eanero em si t\u00e3o especial! Ver dois homens se permitindo ser vulner\u00e1veis e apaixonados um pelo outro sempre acende em mim algo que palavras n\u00e3o conseguem explicar!",
        u"I forgive you\u2026 And I\u2019m sure the rest of us feel the same way\u2026": u"Eu perdoo voc\u00ea\u2026 E tenho certeza de que os outros sentem o mesmo\u2026",
        u"I gave it to a friend, when I had Yuri. But I still have the original keys with me.": u"Eu a dei para um amigo quando tive Yuri. Mas ainda tenho as chaves originais comigo.",
        u"I get it! I\u2019m just as excited as you are!": u"Eu entendo! Estou t\u00e3o animado quanto voc\u00ea!",
        u"I get you. It\u2019s only been two days, and I have to admit I\u2019m feeling kind of homesick too. ": u"Eu entendo. S\u00f3 se passaram dois dias e tenho que admitir que tamb\u00e9m estou sentindo um pouco de saudade de casa. ",
        u"I getcha. It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve served and cleaned up for that many people!": u"Entendo. Faz tempo que n\u00e3o sirvo e limpo tudo para tanta gente!",
        u"I got up earlier than yesterday just in case something happened again.": u"Levantei mais cedo do que ontem, caso alguma coisa acontecesse novamente.",
        u"I gotta admit, I felt so full after I couldn\u2019t eat a single bite of lunch or dinner, hahaha!": u"Tenho que admitir, fiquei t\u00e3o cheio depois que n\u00e3o consegui comer nem uma mordida no almo\u00e7o ou no jantar, hahaha!",
        u"I gotta ask the scoutmasters to let you join for the next one!": u"Preciso pedir aos chefes escoteiros que deixem voc\u00ea participar da pr\u00f3xima!",
        u"I gotta get out there \u2013 your turn now, Yoshi!": u"Preciso ir l\u00e1 fora \u2014 agora \u00e9 sua vez, Yoshi!",
        u"I gotta say though, you guys were pretty busy yourselves today too.": u"Mas preciso dizer que voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m estiveram bem ocupados hoje.",
        u"I gotta say though\u2026 it feels really weird to have you take care of me like this. ": u"Mas tenho que dizer\u2026 \u00e9 muito estranho ter voc\u00ea cuidando de mim assim. ",
        u"I gotta say though\u2026 it feels really weird to have you take care of me like this.{fast}": u"Mas tenho que dizer\u2026 \u00e9 muito estranho ter voc\u00ea cuidando de mim assim.{fast}",
        u"I gotta say, I had tons of fun with that whole \u2018clubbing\u2019 thing last night! I could get used to it! ": u"Tenho que admitir, me diverti pra caramba com essa coisa de \u2018balada\u2019 ontem \u00e0 noite! Eu poderia me acostumar com isso! ",
        u"I gotta say, Yoshi. You\u2019ve gotten really good at this over the last few months.": u"Tenho que admitir, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea ficou muito bom nisso nos \u00faltimos meses.",
        u"I gotta say, Yoshi~ You picked the perfect spot for us to have a vacation! ": u"Tenho que admitir, Yoshi~ Voc\u00ea escolheu o lugar perfeito para nossas f\u00e9rias! ",
        u"I gotta say, it\u2019s making me feel a little tingle, if you know what I mean~": u"Tenho que admitir que est\u00e1 me dando um certo formigamento, se \u00e9 que me entende~",
        u"I gotta tell you, Aiden, you\u2019re such a Gemini! Very adaptable, a multitasker, and quite the charmer!": u"Tenho que dizer, Aiden, voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito geminiano! Muito adapt\u00e1vel, faz v\u00e1rias coisas ao mesmo tempo e \u00e9 bastante charmoso!",
        u"I guess Aiden has started to rub off on me!": u"Acho que o jeito do Aiden est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando a pegar em mim!",
        u"I guess Dar and I better get to work too. Don\u2019t wanna get marked as delayed again, right?  ": u"Acho melhor eu e Dar come\u00e7armos a trabalhar tamb\u00e9m. N\u00e3o queremos ser marcados como atrasados de novo, certo?  ",
        u"I guess Emilia\u2019s stay here gave me a good push to actually do it.": u"Acho que a estadia de Emilia me deu o empurr\u00e3o de que precisava para realmente fazer isso.",
        u"I guess I can handle it alone this time\u2026": u"Acho que desta vez consigo cuidar disso sozinho\u2026",
        u"I guess I can understand why\u2026 You both went through a lot that you wanted to make up for.": u"Acho que consigo entender o motivo\u2026 Voc\u00eas dois passaram por muita coisa e queriam compensar seus erros.",
        u"I guess I do feel a lot more festive now wearing this~ ": u"Acho que realmente estou me sentindo mais no clima festivo usando isso~ ",
        u"I guess I have always wondered\u2026 What\u2019s it like having Sir Goro as your father?": u"Acho que sempre me perguntei\u2026 Como \u00e9 ter o Sr. Goro como pai?",
        u"I guess I shouldn\u2019t be surprised, but the room is luxurious too.": u"Acho que n\u00e3o deveria estar surpreso, mas o quarto tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 luxuoso.",
        u"I guess I\u2019ll get dressed too and see if there\u2019s anything I can assist Goro with for Mr. Clermont.": u"Acho que tamb\u00e9m vou me vestir e ver se posso ajudar Goro em alguma coisa com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"I guess I\u2019ll go ahead as well\u2026 With all these new deadlines, I might need to get some more work done before bed\u2026": u"Acho que tamb\u00e9m vou indo\u2026 Com todos esses novos prazos, talvez precise adiantar mais trabalho antes de dormir\u2026",
        u"I guess I\u2019ll just order the longest-spelled one! ": u"Acho que vou pedir o que tiver o nome mais comprido! ",
        u"I guess I\u2019m just not used to having friends to hang out with\u2026 But I promise I\u2019ll try not to spend the whole trip on my phone or computer!": u"Acho que n\u00e3o estou acostumado a ter amigos com quem sair\u2026 Mas prometo tentar n\u00e3o passar a viagem inteira no celular ou no computador!",
        u"I guess I\u2019m just not used to the new environment yet\u2026 Camp Buddy is undergoing a huge change after all.": u"Acho que ainda n\u00e3o estou acostumado com o novo ambiente\u2026 Afinal, o Camp Buddy est\u00e1 passando por uma enorme mudan\u00e7a.",
        u"I guess accepting compliments wasn\u2019t part of the job description.": u"Acho que aceitar elogios n\u00e3o fazia parte da descri\u00e7\u00e3o do cargo.",
        u"I guess all our initiative paid off, then! We\u2019ll get things back on track today, sir!": u"Ent\u00e3o parece que toda a nossa iniciativa valeu a pena! Vamos colocar tudo de volta nos trilhos hoje, senhor!",
        u"I guess he really has softened up these past few months, huh? ": u"Acho que ele realmente ficou mais compreensivo nesses \u00faltimos meses, hein? ",
        u"I guess he was collecting them to get these clothes made for us.": u"Acho que estava coletando as medidas para mandar fazer estas roupas para n\u00f3s.",
        u"I guess if he does it all the time then his body must have already developed its own circadian rhythm.": u"Acho que, se ele faz isso o tempo todo, seu corpo j\u00e1 deve ter desenvolvido um ritmo circadiano pr\u00f3prio.",
        u"I guess if you put it that way\u2026": u"Acho que, colocando dessa forma\u2026",
        u"I guess in a way I understand how Darius feels. ": u"Acho que, de certa forma, entendo como Darius se sente. ",
        u"I guess in a way, this project helped me get to know you all better, and it made me feel like I was part of all the amazing memories you shared.": u"Acho que, de certa forma, esse projeto me ajudou a conhecer melhor todos voc\u00eas e me fez sentir parte de todas essas lembran\u00e7as incr\u00edveis que compartilharam.",
        u"I guess it can't be helped, Yuri. There's been a ton of legal paperwork for Sir Goro to work on ever since the last term ended.": u"Acho que n\u00e3o tem jeito, Yuri. Desde o fim da \u00faltima temporada, o senhor Goro tem uma tonelada de documentos legais para resolver.",
        u"I guess it can\u2019t be helped\u2026 I haven\u2019t had time for anything like that in a long time\u2026 ": u"Acho que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 o que fazer\u2026 Faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o tenho tempo para algo assim\u2026",
        u"I guess it does make sense though. You\u2019re so tall and buff, so being quiet on top of that can come off intimidating to others.": u"Mas acho que faz sentido. Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o alto e musculoso que, sendo calado ainda por cima, pode parecer intimidador para os outros.",
        u"I guess it is better\u2026 But I still look like your secretary or something, Dar\u2026": u"Acho que ficou melhor\u2026 Mas ainda pare\u00e7o seu secret\u00e1rio ou algo assim, Dar\u2026",
        u"I guess it lives up to its name as the best hotel around\u2026": u"Acho que ele faz jus \u00e0 fama de melhor hotel da regi\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I guess it makes sense that a quiet person needs someone active around to balance things out.": u"Acho que faz sentido uma pessoa quieta precisar de algu\u00e9m agitado por perto para equilibrar as coisas.",
        u"I guess it only now hit me that we\u2019ve finally reached the finish line.": u"Acho que s\u00f3 agora caiu a ficha de que finalmente chegamos \u00e0 linha de chegada.",
        u"I guess it was a good idea to take a risk and try something new, huh?": u"Acho que foi uma boa ideia arriscar e tentar algo novo, hein?",
        u"I guess knowing her, it is odd. ": u"Conhecendo-a, acho que realmente \u00e9 estranho.",
        u"I guess let\u2019s bring Aiden back to his quarters\u2026": u"Acho melhor levarmos Aiden de volta para os aposentos dele\u2026",
        u"I guess let\u2019s try \u2018Never Have I Ever.\u2019 How does it work again exactly?": u"Acho que podemos tentar \u2018Eu Nunca\u2019. Como funciona mesmo?",
        u"I guess my dad isn\u2019t the only one getting old.": u"Pelo visto, meu pai n\u00e3o \u00e9 o \u00fanico que est\u00e1 ficando velho.",
        u"I guess that gives us something to do today, Yoshinori.": u"Acho que isso nos d\u00e1 algo para fazer hoje, Yoshinori.",
        u"I guess that makes sense\u2026": u"Acho que isso faz sentido\u2026",
        u"I guess that makes sense\u2026 It was time to move on then.": u"Acho que faz sentido\u2026 Naquela \u00e9poca era hora de seguir em frente.",
        u"I guess that was first time you\u2019ve raised your voice like that around us, sir.": u"Acho que foi a primeira vez que o senhor levantou a voz daquele jeito perto de n\u00f3s.",
        u"I guess that\u2019ll kill some time. Sure, why not!": u"Acho que isso far\u00e1 o tempo passar. Claro, por que n\u00e3o?",
        u"I guess that\u2019ll kill some time. Sure, why not!  ": u"Acho que isso vai matar um pouco do tempo. Claro, por que n\u00e3o?  ",
        u"I guess that\u2019s all of my stuff. I\u2019m ready to leave now\u2026": u"Acho que essas s\u00e3o todas as minhas coisas. Estou pronto para ir agora\u2026",
        u"I guess that\u2019s my cue to hit the hay for now\u2026 ": u"Acho que esse \u00e9 meu sinal para cair na cama\u2026",
        u"I guess that\u2019s our cue to get started as well, Yoshinori. ": u"Acho que essa \u00e9 a nossa deixa para come\u00e7armos tamb\u00e9m, Yoshinori. ",
        u"I guess that\u2019s the best thing to do with so much free time. Why don\u2019t we go somewhere too?!": u"Acho que \u00e9 a melhor coisa para fazer com tanto tempo livre. Por que n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o vamos a algum lugar?!",
        u"I guess that\u2019s true\u2026 I was almost sure she\u2019d flip out when nobody wanted to share a room with her. ": u"Acho que \u00e9 verdade\u2026 Eu tinha quase certeza de que ela surtaria quando ningu\u00e9m quisesse dividir o quarto com ela. ",
        u"I guess that\u2019s why I\u2019m so passionate about being a scoutmaster\u2026 it\u2019s like I get to relive those memories through the scouts.": u"Acho que \u00e9 por isso que sou t\u00e3o apaixonado por ser chefe escoteiro\u2026 \u00c9 como se eu pudesse reviver aquelas lembran\u00e7as atrav\u00e9s dos escoteiros.",
        u"I guess the autumn season made it worse too\u2026 Everything\u2019s covered in leaves.": u"Acho que o outono tamb\u00e9m piorou a situa\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Tudo est\u00e1 coberto de folhas.",
        u"I guess the work environment could make or break it too. I get along better with everyone here at Camp Buddy than anywhere else I\u2019ve worked.": u"Acho que o ambiente de trabalho tamb\u00e9m pode fazer toda a diferen\u00e7a. Eu me dou melhor com todos aqui no Camp Buddy do que em qualquer outro lugar onde j\u00e1 trabalhei.",
        u"I guess they were still too little to be active during the summer and fall, too. ": u"Acho que eles ainda eram pequenos demais para serem ativos durante o ver\u00e3o e o outono. ",
        u"I guess this is your idea of a vacation.": u"Acho que essa \u00e9 sua ideia de f\u00e9rias.",
        u"I guess today is treat-yourself day, huh?": u"Acho que hoje \u00e9 dia de se mimar, hein?",
        u"I guess we should go and join them.": u"Acho que devemos ir com eles.",
        u"I guess we should say this is redemption for last night\u2019s hell of a dinner~": u"Acho que podemos dizer que esta \u00e9 a nossa reden\u00e7\u00e3o pelo jantar infernal de ontem~",
        u"I guess we should\u2019ve brought Gramps with us, huh\u2026? He usually knows these kinds of things\u2026": u"Acho que dev\u00edamos ter trazido o vov\u00f4, hein\u2026? Ele costuma entender dessas coisas\u2026",
        u"I guess we\u2019re all trying to say you like Aiden\u2019s cooking too. There\u2019s no shame in admitting that, right\u2026?": u"Acho que todos estamos tentando dizer que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m gosta da comida do Aiden. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 vergonha em admitir isso, certo\u2026?",
        u"I guess we\u2019re getting an exclusive sneak peek, then! ": u"Ent\u00e3o acho que estamos tendo uma pr\u00e9via exclusiva! ",
        u"I guess what I\u2019m saying is that running away won\u2019t solve anything\u2026 ": u"Acho que o que estou dizendo \u00e9 que fugir n\u00e3o vai resolver nada\u2026 ",
        u"I guess what we talked about this morning came true, huh? ": u"Acho que aquilo sobre o que conversamos esta manh\u00e3 acabou se tornando realidade, hein? ",
        u"I guess you could say it was a lucky break\u2026": u"Acho que pode dizer que foi um golpe de sorte\u2026",
        u"I guess you could say that. It\u2019ll be a good chance to catch up.": u"Acho que pode dizer isso. Ser\u00e1 uma boa oportunidade para colocar a conversa em dia.",
        u"I guess you could say that\u2026 Today turned out to be a busy day.": u"Acho que se pode dizer isso\u2026 Hoje acabou sendo um dia cheio.",
        u"I guess you do have a point\u2026 I mean, I know I have more fun with my job here at the camp, especially when the scouts are around. ": u"Acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 Quero dizer, sei que me divirto mais com o meu trabalho no acampamento, principalmente quando os escoteiros est\u00e3o por perto. ",
        u"I guess you have a point\u2026": u"Acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I guess you really won him over with your cooking, didn\u2019t you, Aiden?": u"Acho que voc\u00ea realmente o conquistou com a sua comida, n\u00e3o foi, Aiden?",
        u"I guess you\u2019re right\u2026 We\u2019ll just have to find a way!": u"Acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 S\u00f3 teremos que encontrar um jeito!",
        u"I guess, I should take the time to thank both of you as well\u2026 for having a constant open mind and giving someone like me a second chance.": u"Acho que tamb\u00e9m deveria aproveitar para agradecer a voc\u00eas dois\u2026 por sempre manterem a mente aberta e darem uma segunda chance a algu\u00e9m como eu.",
        u"I guess, I was just trying to tell you how grateful I am for everything this summer.": u"Acho que eu s\u00f3 estava tentando dizer o quanto sou grato por tudo neste ver\u00e3o.",
        u"I guess, we don\u2019t really have a choice, sir\u2026 ": u"Acho que n\u00e3o temos muita escolha, senhor\u2026 ",
        u"I guess...": u"Acho que sim...",
        u"I guess\u2026": u"Acho que sim\u2026",
        u"I guess\u2026 I do know a little bit about it, yeah\u2026": u"Acho que sim\u2026 Entendo um pouco, \u00e9\u2026",
        u"I guess\u2026 they\u2019re getting the hang of it\u2026": u"Acho que\u2026 eles est\u00e3o pegando o jeito\u2026",
        u"I had a feeling that you\u2019d end up choosing that, Aiden.": u"Eu tinha a impress\u00e3o de que voc\u00ea acabaria escolhendo isso, Aiden.",
        u"I had actually been dressed for a half an hour already, and went looking for Aiden. ": u"Na verdade eu j\u00e1 estava pronto havia meia hora e fui procurar Aiden. ",
        u"I had already drafted most of the stuff before I got here today, but after seeing the actual site, there will need to be some adjustments.": u"Eu j\u00e1 tinha esbo\u00e7ado quase tudo antes de chegar hoje, mas, depois de ver o local de verdade, ser\u00e3o necess\u00e1rios alguns ajustes.",
        u"I had been assigned to manage the construction team, while Aiden handled staff welfare and overall camp maintenance.": u"Fiquei respons\u00e1vel pela equipe de constru\u00e7\u00e3o, enquanto Aiden cuidava do bem-estar dos funcion\u00e1rios e da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o geral.",
        u"I had everything under control, though\u2026! Everyone got back to work pretty smoothly.": u"Mas eu mantive tudo sob controle\u2026! Todos voltaram ao trabalho sem grandes problemas.",
        u"I had hoped to put all of those toxic traits behind me after the last summer.": u"Eu esperava ter deixado todos esses tra\u00e7os t\u00f3xicos para tr\u00e1s depois do \u00faltimo ver\u00e3o.",
        u"I had hoped to redeem myself not only with the scouts, but also with all of you, who\u2019ve been with me and the camp through thick and thin\u2026": u"Eu esperava me redimir n\u00e3o apenas com os escoteiros, mas tamb\u00e9m com todos voc\u00eas, que estiveram ao meu lado e ao lado do acampamento nos bons e maus momentos\u2026",
        u"I had it coming\u2026 For all the mistakes I\u2019ve made in the past.": u"Eu mereci isso\u2026 Por todos os erros que cometi no passado.",
        u"I had no idea how I was gonna bring you back to our room, especially since you were fully naked\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o fazia ideia de como levaria voc\u00ea de volta ao quarto, principalmente porque estava completamente pelado\u2026",
        u"I had no idea those big manly hands could do something so pretty!": u"Eu n\u00e3o fazia ideia de que essas m\u00e3os grandes e m\u00e1sculas conseguiam fazer algo t\u00e3o bonito!",
        u"I had that coming.": u"Eu pedi por essa.",
        u"I had the chance to learn some of that when I was here as a scout, but I didn\u2019t realize how important it was.": u"Tive a chance de aprender algumas dessas coisas quando fui escoteira aqui, mas n\u00e3o percebi como eram importantes.",
        u"I had to do whatever it took to get my life back, no matter how I got there!": u"Eu precisava fazer o que fosse necess\u00e1rio para recuperar minha vida, n\u00e3o importava como chegaria l\u00e1!",
        u"I hadn\u2019t seen it in years and I had a crazy thought\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o a via havia anos e tive uma ideia maluca\u2026",
        u"I hate that you all had to see me like that\u2026 ": u"Odeio que todos voc\u00eas tenham precisado me ver daquele jeito\u2026 ",
        u"I hate to admit it, but she made really great points that made me realize the mistakes I made about how I come across to everyone.": u"Odeio admitir, mas ela levantou \u00f3timos pontos que me fizeram perceber os erros na forma como eu me apresentava aos outros.",
        u"I hate to break it to you but you\u2019re just gonna have to deal with me forever.": u"Sinto informar, mas voc\u00ea vai ter que me aguentar para sempre.",
        u"I hate to stay and listen to your pointless bickering, so I\u2019d best be on my way.": u"Detestaria ficar ouvindo suas discuss\u00f5es in\u00fateis, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor eu ir embora.",
        u"I have a bad feeling the blizzard has something to do with it. Let\u2019s catch up with them.": u"Tenho um mau pressentimento de que a nevasca tem algo a ver com isso. Vamos alcan\u00e7\u00e1-los.",
        u"I have a brooch that\u2019s perfect for the occasion. It\u2019s not much, but it\u2019ll help a little bit.": u"Tenho um broche perfeito para a ocasi\u00e3o. N\u00e3o \u00e9 grande coisa, mas vai ajudar um pouco.",
        u"I have a daughter.": u"Eu tenho uma filha.",
        u"I have a great deal of experience leading groups of people even before Camp Buddy, so don\u2019t tell me how to do my job.": u"Tenho muita experi\u00eancia liderando grupos de pessoas desde antes do Camp Buddy, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o me diga como fazer meu trabalho.",
        u"I have a hard time imagining you being in a similar position as I was.": u"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil imaginar voc\u00ea numa situa\u00e7\u00e3o parecida com a minha.",
        u"I have a huge roasted chicken sitting in the oven, and I\u2019m sure it would go well with some champagne!": u"Tenho um frango assado enorme no forno e tenho certeza de que combinaria muito bem com champanhe!",
        u"I have a lot of extra income online, not to mention my crypto\u2026 So, it doesn\u2019t really matter for me\u2026": u"Tenho bastante renda extra pela internet, sem falar nas minhas criptomoedas\u2026 Ent\u00e3o isso n\u00e3o faz muita diferen\u00e7a para mim\u2026",
        u"I have conducted a meeting with their association and asked for a business consultation on how to improve the camp.": u"Realizei uma reuni\u00e3o com a associa\u00e7\u00e3o e solicitei uma consultoria empresarial sobre como melhorar o acampamento.",
        u"I have no choice but to step in.": u"N\u00e3o tenho escolha a n\u00e3o ser assumir quando necess\u00e1rio.",
        u"I have no doubts about that, sir\u2026 But I had just hoped that going into this season, you wouldn\u2019t have to deal with something like this.": u"N\u00e3o tenho d\u00favidas disso, senhor\u2026 Mas eu esperava que, ao entrarmos nesta temporada, o senhor n\u00e3o precisasse lidar com algo assim.",
        u"I have no idea what that is!": u"N\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia do que seja isso!",
        u"I have no money, I have no home, and I could barely survive\u2026 I don\u2019t even have a family to rely on.": u"N\u00e3o tenho dinheiro, n\u00e3o tenho casa e mal conseguia sobreviver\u2026 Nem sequer tenho uma fam\u00edlia com quem contar.",
        u"I have no objection. ": u"N\u00e3o tenho obje\u00e7\u00f5es. ",
        u"I have no objections \u2013 I would be honored to have all these talented and dedicated people as scoutmasters!": u"N\u00e3o tenho nenhuma obje\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 seria uma honra ter todas essas pessoas talentosas e dedicadas como chefes escoteiros!",
        u"I have nothing left outside of Camp Buddy\u2026 This really was the last chance I had, yet I took it for granted by being so greedy and arrogant\u2026": u"N\u00e3o me resta nada fora do Camp Buddy\u2026 Esta realmente era minha \u00faltima chance, mas eu a desperdicei sendo t\u00e3o gananciosa e arrogante\u2026",
        u"I have so much to learn when it comes to building stuff\u2026": u"Ainda tenho tanta coisa para aprender sobre constru\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I have some of my burger left if you\u2019re still hungry, Yoichi\u2026 I\u2019m already full.": u"Ainda tenho um pouco do meu hamb\u00farguer se estiver com fome, Yoichi\u2026 J\u00e1 estou cheio.",
        u"I have to admit, I have gotten quite attached to these pups over the last few months.": u"Tenho que admitir que me apeguei bastante a esses filhotes nos \u00faltimos meses.",
        u"I have to admit, I might be a little rusty now from doing nothing but paperwork for weeks.": u"Tenho que admitir que talvez eu esteja um pouco enferrujado depois de passar semanas cuidando apenas da papelada.",
        u"I have to admit, I was thrilled when I confirmed you were working here at Camp Buddy. It\u2019s just a pleasure to be reunited, don\u2019t you think so?": u"Tenho que admitir que fiquei radiante ao confirmar que voc\u00ea trabalhava no Camp Buddy. \u00c9 um prazer nos reencontrarmos, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"I have to admit\u2026 I\u2019ve never had anyone to say all these things to.": u"Tenho que admitir\u2026 Nunca tive ningu\u00e9m com quem pudesse falar sobre todas essas coisas.",
        u"I have to file a report to Mr. Clermont by the end of the week, so that means we have to finish the weekly checklist before then.": u"Preciso entregar um relat\u00f3rio ao Sr. Clermont at\u00e9 o fim da semana, ent\u00e3o temos que concluir a lista de tarefas semanais antes disso.",
        u"I have to get ready quick!": u"Preciso me arrumar depressa!",
        u"I have to get up earlier than usual and meal prep or we might get called out for being late again.": u"Tenho que acordar mais cedo e adiantar as refei\u00e7\u00f5es, ou poder\u00e3o nos criticar por atrasos de novo.",
        u"I have to go back there and clean it quick-": u"Preciso voltar l\u00e1 e limpar isso r\u00e1pido\u2014",
        u"I have to go\u2026 to the bathroom\u2026 ": u"Eu preciso ir\u2026 ao banheiro\u2026 ",
        u"I have to go\u2026 to the toilet\u2026 ": u"Eu preciso ir\u2026 ao banheiro\u2026 ",
        u"I have to prove myself to him first. ": u"Primeiro preciso provar meu valor para ele. ",
        u"I have to say though, your costume suits you very well. You\u2019re quite the expert at nut cracking, as I saw.": u"Mas tenho que admitir, sua fantasia combina muito bem com voc\u00ea. Pelo que vi, voc\u00ea \u00e9 mesmo especialista em quebrar nozes.",
        u"I have to say, I'm pleasantly surprised meeting you today. When Mr. Clermont said he\u2019d send an IT expert, I thought it would be someone who\u2019s a lot older.": u"Devo dizer que conhec\u00ea-lo hoje foi uma agrad\u00e1vel surpresa. Quando o Sr. Clermont disse que enviaria um especialista em TI, imaginei que seria algu\u00e9m bem mais velho.",
        u"I have to say, I\u2019m surprised you two aren\u2019t exclusive. But then again, Aiden\u2019s really not the possessive type.": u"Tenho que admitir que estou surpreso que voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o sejam exclusivos. Mas, pensando bem, Aiden realmente n\u00e3o \u00e9 do tipo possessivo.",
        u"I have to say, sir\u2026 I\u2019m actually glad that you\u2019re moving in here with us.": u"Tenho que admitir, senhor\u2026 Na verdade, fico feliz que esteja vindo morar aqui conosco.",
        u"I have to say, you\u2019re not too shabby after all, Yoshinori. You managed to keep up with me.": u"Tenho que admitir, voc\u00ea at\u00e9 que se saiu bem, Yoshinori. Conseguiu me acompanhar.",
        u"I haven\u2019t felt that good in a while! ": u"Fazia tempo que eu n\u00e3o me sentia t\u00e3o bem! ",
        u"I haven\u2019t seen my journal in years! Let me have my moment! ": u"Faz anos que n\u00e3o vejo o meu di\u00e1rio! Deixem-me aproveitar este momento! ",
        u"I haven\u2019t seen that in years. I\u2019m surprised you still have it.": u"N\u00e3o o vejo h\u00e1 anos. Estou surpreso que ainda esteja com ele.",
        u"I hear you\u2019re all scheduled to leave today. There\u2019s no need to admit her to a hospital right now.": u"Ouvi dizer que todos voc\u00eas est\u00e3o programados para partir hoje. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade de intern\u00e1-la em um hospital neste momento.",
        u"I heard a commotion, is everything\u2014": u"Ouvi uma confus\u00e3o, est\u00e1 tudo\u2014",
        u"I heard monster cocks need a lot of blood pumping into them to keep up, so maybe that\u2019s why~": u"Ouvi dizer que paus monstruosos precisam de muito sangue para continuar firmes, ent\u00e3o talvez seja por isso~",
        u"I heard screaming did someone\u2014 oh\u2026": u"Ouvi gritos, algu\u00e9m\u2014 ah\u2026",
        u"I heard screams, what\u2019s going\u2014": u"Ouvi gritos, o que est\u00e1 aconte\u2014",
        u"I held on to that, but you forgot about me as soon as I left Camp Buddy!": u"Eu me agarrei a isso, mas voc\u00ea se esqueceu de mim assim que deixei o Camp Buddy!",
        u"I honestly agree\u2026 I think this is the perfect opportunity for us all to come to an agreement and about how to move forward with building this team\u2026 ": u"Sinceramente, concordo\u2026 Acho que esta \u00e9 a oportunidade perfeita para chegarmos a um acordo sobre como seguir em frente com a forma\u00e7\u00e3o desta equipe\u2026 ",
        u"I honestly can\u2019t believe I managed it; we were both so young for all that responsibility. ": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o acredito que consegui; \u00e9ramos t\u00e3o jovens para toda aquela responsabilidade. ",
        u"I honestly don\u2019t blame you, Aiden. She was really pushing your buttons for some reason.": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o culpo voc\u00ea, Aiden. Por algum motivo, ela estava realmente tentando provocar voc\u00ea.",
        u"I honestly don\u2019t know where I\u2019d have ended up if you weren\u2019t there for me\u2026": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o sei onde eu teria ido parar se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estivesse ao meu lado\u2026",
        u"I hope I can return the favor and help you enjoy your time at camp again.": u"Espero poder retribuir e ajud\u00e1-lo a voltar a aproveitar o seu tempo no acampamento.",
        u"I hope I\u2019m able to help influence Yoichi\u2019s growth in a positive way from here on out as well.": u"Espero tamb\u00e9m conseguir influenciar positivamente o crescimento do Yoichi daqui para frente.",
        u"I hope I\u2019m not interrupting an intimate moment, but may I interest you in some drinks?": u"Espero n\u00e3o estar interrompendo um momento \u00edntimo, mas posso oferecer algumas bebidas?",
        u"I hope I\u2019m not interrupting anything.": u"Espero n\u00e3o estar interrompendo nada.",
        u"I hope I\u2019m not interrupting you by coming earlier than scheduled, Mr. Nomoru.": u"Espero n\u00e3o estar interrompendo por ter chegado antes do hor\u00e1rio, Sr. Nomoru.",
        u"I hope Sir Goro\u2019s okay, though\u2026": u"Espero que o Sr. Goro esteja bem\u2026",
        u"I hope everyone enjoyed their appetizers, as the main course is ready! Please enjoy!": u"Espero que tenham gostado das entradas, pois o prato principal est\u00e1 pronto! Bom apetite!",
        u"I hope it won\u2019t be a hassle for you to stay here with us, Sir Goro\u2026": u"Espero que n\u00e3o seja inc\u00f4modo ficar aqui conosco, Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"I hope someday Lloyd and I will be as colorful as you two\u2019s relationship.": u"Espero que algum dia eu e Lloyd tenhamos uma rela\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e3o cheia de vida quanto a de voc\u00eas dois.",
        u"I hope this many people is enough, though. I tried inviting Eduard and Lee, but they\u2019re both busy today.": u"Espero que essa quantidade de gente seja suficiente. Tentei convidar Eduard e Lee, mas os dois est\u00e3o ocupados hoje.",
        u"I hope we both can enjoy our time here at camp together this time around! It\u2019s never too late to make friends, after all. ": u"Espero que desta vez possamos aproveitar juntos nosso tempo aqui no acampamento! Afinal, nunca \u00e9 tarde demais para fazer amigos. ",
        u"I hope we didn\u2019t bother you!": u"Espero que n\u00e3o tenhamos incomodado!",
        u"I hope we get to continue this when we move on to our next job.": u"Espero que possamos continuar assim quando formos para nosso pr\u00f3ximo trabalho.",
        u"I hope we\u2019re not in trouble, then\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o espero que n\u00e3o estejamos encrencados\u2026",
        u"I hope you all know the lyrics to \u2018Greatest Memories\u2019! ": u"Espero que todos saibam a letra de \u2018Greatest Memories\u2019! ",
        u"I hope you can forgive me for not understanding\u2026": u"Espero que possa me perdoar por n\u00e3o ter entendido\u2026",
        u"I hope you can forgive us too for not understanding sooner.": u"Espero que tamb\u00e9m possa nos perdoar por n\u00e3o termos entendido antes.",
        u"I hope you can use me\u2026 and my skills\u2026 for the camp!": u"Espero que possa fazer uso de mim\u2026 e das minhas habilidades\u2026 pelo acampamento!",
        u"I hope you don\u2019t feel too pressured when interacting with us, Jin. ": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se sinta muito pressionado ao interagir conosco, Jin. ",
        u"I hope you don\u2019t mind if I stay here with you\u2026": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se importe se eu ficar aqui com o senhor\u2026",
        u"I hope you don\u2019t mind the incense though. It helps me relax and loosen up.": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se importe com o incenso. Ele me ajuda a relaxar e a soltar o corpo.",
        u"I hope you don\u2019t mind, but I brought my head scoutmaster with me today \u2013 this is Yoshinori Nagira.": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se importe, mas hoje trouxe comigo o chefe escoteiro principal \u2014 este \u00e9 Yoshinori Nagira.",
        u"I hope you guys don\u2019t mind if I join the scouts\u2026 I\u2019m actually really starving now.": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se importem se eu for com os escoteiros\u2026 Estou realmente morrendo de fome agora.",
        u"I hope you understand, Mr. Clermont, but I\u2019m more than satisfied with the state of Camp Buddy.": u"Espero que entenda, Sr. Clermont, mas estou mais do que satisfeito com o estado atual do Camp Buddy.",
        u"I hope you understand, Mr. Clermont, but there\u2019s just some unexpected things that occurred yesterday\u2026": u"Espero que entenda, Sr. Clermont, mas algumas coisas inesperadas aconteceram ontem\u2026",
        u"I hope you understand, Mr. Clermont, but we\u2019re more than satisfied with the state of Camp Buddy.": u"Espero que entenda, Sr. Clermont, mas estamos mais do que satisfeitos com o estado atual do Camp Buddy.",
        u"I hope you\u2019ll stick around for the after party as well.": u"Espero que tamb\u00e9m fiquem para a festa depois da cerim\u00f4nia.",
        u"I hope you\u2019re not intimidated by them, everyone here is very friendly!": u"Espero que n\u00e3o se sinta intimidado por eles; todos aqui s\u00e3o muito amig\u00e1veis!",
        u"I hope you\u2019re ready for what\u2019s coming.": u"Espero que esteja pronto para o que vem agora.",
        u"I hope you\u2019re ready to finish what you started.": u"Espero que esteja pronto para terminar o que come\u00e7ou.",
        u"I hope you\u2019re ready to finish what you started\u2026~": u"Espero que esteja pronto para terminar o que come\u00e7ou\u2026~",
        u"I hope you\u2019re ready, Aiden\u2026": u"Espero que esteja pronto, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I hope you\u2019ve found Camp Buddy welcoming at least!": u"Espero que pelo menos tenha se sentido acolhido no Camp Buddy!",
        u"I interpreted my reading as \u201cNew Beginnings,\u201d and that\u2019s already true from the changes happening so far!": u"Interpretei a leitura como \u201cNovos Come\u00e7os\u201d, e isso j\u00e1 est\u00e1 se confirmando com todas essas mudan\u00e7as!",
        u"I just arrived. What happened?": u"Acabei de chegar. O que aconteceu?",
        u"I just can't help but think about how almost everyone gave up on her when we were scouts.": u"N\u00e3o consigo deixar de pensar em como quase todo mundo desistiu dela quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros.",
        u"I just can\u2019t deny it anymore. That all I\u2019ve always been was a burden and a disappointment\u2026": u"Eu simplesmente n\u00e3o consigo mais negar. Tudo o que eu sempre fui \u00e9 um peso e uma decep\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I just can\u2019t help but feel\u2026 irrelevant.": u"N\u00e3o consigo evitar a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de que sou\u2026 irrelevante.",
        u"I just can\u2019t let that stand.": u"N\u00e3o posso simplesmente aceitar isso.",
        u"I just can\u2019t understand why that was enough for her to go this far\u2026": u"S\u00f3 n\u00e3o consigo entender por que isso foi suficiente para ela chegar t\u00e3o longe\u2026",
        u"I just chose not to tell you, stupid.": u"Eu apenas escolhi n\u00e3o lhe contar, idiota.",
        u"I just couldn\u2019t let her keep berating everyone, especially you, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Eu simplesmente n\u00e3o podia deixar que ela continuasse destratando todo mundo, principalmente voc\u00ea, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I just don\u2019t know what to say sometimes.": u"\u00c0s vezes, s\u00f3 n\u00e3o sei o que dizer.",
        u"I just don\u2019t understand how she can get away with so much\u2026 I mean, I know she\u2019s a QA manager but she always demands the most unnecessary stuff!": u"N\u00e3o entendo como ela consegue se safar de tanta coisa\u2026 Sei que \u00e9 gerente de controle de qualidade, mas sempre exige as coisas mais desnecess\u00e1rias!",
        u"I just don\u2019t understand\u2026 What are you getting out of this?": u"Eu simplesmente n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 O que voc\u00ea ganha com isso?",
        u"I just fancied it up on the plate and added my own twist!": u"Eu s\u00f3 deixei a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o mais chique e dei meu pr\u00f3prio toque!",
        u"I just feel even more worn out\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 estou me sentindo ainda mais acabado\u2026",
        u"I just finished everything in the kitchen for today. Looks like you guys are on break now too!": u"Acabei de terminar tudo na cozinha por hoje. Parece que voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o de folga agora!",
        u"I just forgot I shouldn\u2019t sit down so quickly\u2026! H-Haha\u2026!": u"S\u00f3 esqueci que n\u00e3o devia me sentar t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido\u2026! H-Haha\u2026!",
        u"I just got back. Are you alright\u2026? You look troubled\u2026": u"Acabei de voltar. Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem\u2026? Parece preocupado\u2026",
        u"I just got caught off guard by what I read\u2026": u"S\u00f3 fui pego de surpresa pelo que li\u2026",
        u"I just had to drop off a report from the workers! I\u2019ll be heading out to work with Emilia soon.": u"S\u00f3 precisava entregar um relat\u00f3rio dos trabalhadores! Logo vou sair para trabalhar com Emilia.",
        u"I just hope that you finding out about all of this won\u2019t change the way you see me.": u"S\u00f3 espero que descobrir tudo isso n\u00e3o mude a maneira como voc\u00ea me v\u00ea.",
        u"I just hope there\u2019s a wi-fi connection there\u2026 that\u2019s all I need to survive.": u"S\u00f3 espero que tenha Wi-Fi l\u00e1\u2026 \u00e9 tudo de que preciso para sobreviver.",
        u"I just look short because Dar is with me all the time, and everyone keeps comparing us!": u"Eu s\u00f3 pare\u00e7o baixo porque Dar est\u00e1 sempre comigo e todos ficam nos comparando!",
        u"I just need to ensure that Emilia doesn\u2019t continue to bring out the worst in me.": u"S\u00f3 preciso garantir que Emilia n\u00e3o continue trazendo \u00e0 tona o pior de mim.",
        u"I just need to understand why, Goro\u2026 ": u"Eu s\u00f3 preciso entender o motivo, Goro\u2026 ",
        u"I just realized something\u2026 Did you trick us into working on our vacation?!": u"Acabei de perceber uma coisa\u2026 Voc\u00ea nos enganou para trabalharmos durante as f\u00e9rias?!",
        u"I just reassured him that we can handle everything here at camp for now.": u"Eu apenas garanti a ele que, por enquanto, conseguimos cuidar de tudo aqui no acampamento.",
        u"I just see you two as a perfect example of what I want to have as a relationship.": u"S\u00f3 vejo voc\u00eas dois como um exemplo perfeito do tipo de relacionamento que eu gostaria de ter.",
        u"I just sit in front of my computer all day either doing work or playing games\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 fico sentado diante do computador o dia inteiro, trabalhando ou jogando\u2026",
        u"I just think that everything you\u2019ve brought up so far hasn\u2019t been relevant to the project but are rather personal issues you have with us. ": u"S\u00f3 acho que nada do que voc\u00ea mencionou at\u00e9 agora \u00e9 relevante para o projeto; s\u00e3o mais quest\u00f5es pessoais que voc\u00ea tem conosco. ",
        u"I just thought that\u2026 you would at least talk to me about it first\u2026 ": u"Eu s\u00f3 achei que\u2026 pelo menos conversaria comigo sobre isso primeiro\u2026 ",
        u"I just thought we would dip our feet in, or wash our faces\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 pensei que molhar\u00edamos os p\u00e9s ou lavar\u00edamos o rosto\u2026",
        u"I just thought\u2026 It\u2019s up to me to how I take it, and I decided I don\u2019t wanna hold anything against you.": u"S\u00f3 pensei\u2026 Cabe a mim decidir como encarar isso, e decidi que n\u00e3o quero guardar nada contra voc\u00ea.",
        u"I just want to know why you\u2019ve been acting this way for months now\u2026!": u"Eu s\u00f3 quero saber por que voc\u00ea vem agindo assim h\u00e1 meses\u2026!",
        u"I just want to move on to a new chapter\u2026 And I want you in it\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 quero seguir para um novo cap\u00edtulo\u2026 E quero voc\u00ea nele\u2026",
        u"I just want you right now\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 quero voc\u00ea agora\u2026",
        u"I just want you to be as comfortable around me as you were back then.": u"S\u00f3 quero que se sinta t\u00e3o \u00e0 vontade comigo quanto naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"I just want you to know that I don\u2019t have anything personal against you. We all have our own struggles, and I apologize for not attempting to learn yours.": u"S\u00f3 quero que saiba que n\u00e3o tenho nada pessoal contra voc\u00ea. Todos temos nossas pr\u00f3prias dificuldades, e pe\u00e7o desculpas por n\u00e3o ter tentado entender as suas.",
        u"I just wanted to ask when we'd start our hike again, sir!": u"Eu s\u00f3 queria perguntar quando retomar\u00edamos a caminhada, senhor!",
        u"I just wish we had known sooner! We could\u2019ve at least worn something more formal\u2026": u"S\u00f3 queria que tiv\u00e9ssemos sabido antes! Poder\u00edamos pelo menos ter usado algo mais formal\u2026",
        u"I just\u2026 want to go home\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3\u2026 quero ir para casa\u2026",
        u"I kind of like looking scary. ": u"Eu at\u00e9 gosto de parecer assustador. ",
        u"I kind of want mine to be as nice as yours, Sir Goro\u2026": u"Quero que o meu fique t\u00e3o bonito quanto o seu, Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"I kinda held back on the beers this time \u2013 don\u2019t wanna wake up to our sponsorship getting cancelled \u2019cause I lost all my clothes again!  ": u"Desta vez eu peguei leve na cerveja \u2014 n\u00e3o quero acordar e descobrir que nosso patroc\u00ednio foi cancelado porque perdi todas as roupas de novo!  ",
        u"I kinda need help with the measurements because\u2026 I can\u2019t reach them.": u"Eu meio que preciso de ajuda com as medidas porque\u2026 n\u00e3o consigo alcan\u00e7ar.",
        u"I kinda wanna know too. What are you into, Yoshi?": u"Tamb\u00e9m quero saber. Do que voc\u00ea gosta, Yoshi?",
        u"I kinda wanna know too. What are you into, Yoshi?{fast}": u"Tamb\u00e9m quero saber. Do que voc\u00ea gosta, Yoshi?{fast}",
        u"I kinda wanna try some of them!": u"Estou com vontade de experimentar alguns!",
        u"I kinda want to try one as well\u2026": u"Eu meio que quero experimentar um tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"I knew about his health from when he applied to the camp, but he wanted to keep it hidden from everyone.": u"Eu sabia da condi\u00e7\u00e3o de sa\u00fade dele desde quando se candidatou ao acampamento, mas ele queria esconder isso de todos.",
        u"I knew how busy and stressed you were, so I tried my hardest on my own, hoping that I could make things good for you\u2026": u"Eu sabia o quanto voc\u00ea estava ocupado e estressado, ent\u00e3o me esforcei ao m\u00e1ximo sozinho, esperando conseguir melhorar as coisas para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I knew how much Dad wanted to give me a perfect family, so I\u2019ve always had a soft spot for him.": u"Eu sabia o quanto o pai queria me dar uma fam\u00edlia perfeita, ent\u00e3o sempre tive um carinho especial por ele.",
        u"I knew it must\u2019ve a sign! My future showed that I would be \u2018Crafting in Camp Buddy\u2019!": u"Eu sabia que devia ser um sinal! Meu futuro mostrava que eu estaria \u2018Fazendo Artesanato no Camp Buddy\u2019!",
        u"I knew it was wrong\u2026 But at that moment, everything was dark and I felt like there was no way out for me\u2026": u"Eu sabia que era errado\u2026 Mas naquele momento tudo parecia escuro, e eu sentia que n\u00e3o havia sa\u00edda para mim\u2026",
        u"I knew it\u2026 You guys think it\u2019s\u2014": u"Eu sabia\u2026 Voc\u00eas acham que \u00e9\u2014",
        u"I knew something was absolutely off about her! She\u2019s a freaking phony!!": u"Eu sabia que havia algo completamente errado com ela! Ela \u00e9 uma baita farsante!!",
        u"I knew something was fishy about her! I\u2019ve had this gut feeling since the moment she got here!": u"Eu sabia que havia algo suspeito nela! Tenho esse pressentimento desde o momento em que ela chegou!",
        u"I knew that was a bad idea.": u"Eu sabia que isso era uma m\u00e1 ideia.",
        u"I knew you were trying to move on, so I didn\u2019t want to bring it up unless you did.": u"Eu sabia que voc\u00ea estava tentando seguir em frente, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o queria tocar no assunto a menos que voc\u00ea tocasse.",
        u"I knew you\u2019d change your mind\u2026! Now come here and give me a kiss!": u"Eu sabia que voc\u00ea mudaria de ideia\u2026! Agora vem aqui e me d\u00e1 um beijo!",
        u"I knew you\u2019d like this place! The beach is nice and private, with nobody telling us what to do! ": u"Eu sabia que voc\u00ea gostaria daqui! A praia \u00e9 \u00f3tima e reservada, sem ningu\u00e9m dizendo o que devemos fazer! ",
        u"I know Gramps\u2019 costume is some serious eye candy, but we got another round to play! Quit staring and let\u2019s go!": u"Eu sei que a fantasia do Vov\u00f4 \u00e9 um baita col\u00edrio para os olhos, mas temos outra rodada para jogar! Pare de encarar e vamos!",
        u"I know I don\u2019t have as much history with her as everyone else here, so I\u2019ve been paying closer attention to her\u2026": u"Sei que n\u00e3o tenho tanta hist\u00f3ria com ela quanto todos voc\u00eas, ent\u00e3o tenho prestado mais aten\u00e7\u00e3o nela\u2026",
        u"I know I had good reasons to be upset, but I still took it too far sometimes with what I said and how I acted\u2026": u"Sei que tinha bons motivos para estar chateada, mas \u00e0s vezes ainda fui longe demais com o que disse e com a forma como agi\u2026",
        u"I know I left without telling anyone, but I wanted to surprise you.": u"Sei que sa\u00ed sem contar a ningu\u00e9m, mas queria fazer uma surpresa.",
        u"I know I told you I\u2019d only talk about this once, but\u2026": u"Eu sei que disse que s\u00f3 falaria disso uma vez, mas\u2026",
        u"I know I\u2019ll be happy being Camp Buddy\u2019s special chef!": u"Sei que serei feliz sendo o chef especial do Camp Buddy!",
        u"I know I\u2019m not the same guy I used to be, but I\u2019m really trying my best\u2026 for us\u2026": u"Eu sei que n\u00e3o sou mais o mesmo homem de antes, mas estou realmente dando o meu melhor\u2026 por n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"I know I\u2019m nowhere near to making up for them\u2026 But it\u2019s better late than never.": u"Sei que estou longe de compensar tudo\u2026 Mas antes tarde do que nunca.",
        u"I know I\u2019ve said this a lot already, but thank you for encouraging me to not be ashamed of my past and\u2026": u"Sei que j\u00e1 disse isso muitas vezes, mas obrigado por me incentivar a n\u00e3o ter vergonha do meu passado e\u2026",
        u"I know I\u2019ve said this like a thousand times already, but I\u2019m so ready to be back at the camp!": u"Sei que j\u00e1 disse isso umas mil vezes, mas estou mais do que pronto para voltar ao acampamento!",
        u"I know Yoshi gets really crazy when he's had too much to drink!": u"Eu sei que o Yoshi fica completamente maluco quando bebe demais!",
        u"I know a place not too far from here where we could chill! ": u"Conhe\u00e7o um lugar n\u00e3o muito longe daqui onde poder\u00edamos nos refrescar! ",
        u"I know better now than to get tricked by fake people like you!": u"Agora eu sei muito bem que n\u00e3o devo ser enganada por pessoas falsas como voc\u00ea!",
        u"I know everyone was just jealous of my higher status, so the only thing they could do was to cast me out.": u"Sei que tinham inveja da minha posi\u00e7\u00e3o superior, ent\u00e3o a \u00fanica coisa que podiam fazer era me excluir.",
        u"I know exactly what that\u2019s like...": u"Sei exatamente como \u00e9 isso\u2026",
        u"I know from that look on your face how much you want to take it further~": u"Sei por essa express\u00e3o no seu rosto o quanto voc\u00ea quer ir al\u00e9m~",
        u"I know from what I\u2019ve seen, he\u2019s protective of you, but at the same time lets you do the things you enjoy.": u"Pelo que vi, sei que ele protege voc\u00ea, mas ao mesmo tempo deixa que fa\u00e7a as coisas de que gosta.",
        u"I know having a family was never our plan, but it\u2019s been nineteen years! ": u"Sei que ter uma fam\u00edlia nunca fez parte dos nossos planos, mas j\u00e1 se passaram dezenove anos! ",
        u"I know how bad you wanna play with your new toy~": u"Eu sei o quanto voc\u00ea quer brincar com seu brinquedo novo~",
        u"I know how busy you\u2019ve been, and how rare it is for us to get to spend a vacation together, so\u2026": u"Sei o quanto o senhor tem estado ocupado e como \u00e9 raro conseguirmos passar f\u00e9rias juntos, ent\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I know it hasn\u2019t been easy for you, but at the very least you tried your best to have fun with me and everyone else\u2026": u"Sei que n\u00e3o foi f\u00e1cil para voc\u00ea, mas pelo menos voc\u00ea fez o poss\u00edvel para se divertir comigo e com todo mundo\u2026",
        u"I know it may not be as ideal and comfortable as you wanted it to be, but\u2026 it\u2019s for your own good!": u"Sei que talvez n\u00e3o seja t\u00e3o ideal e confort\u00e1vel quanto voc\u00ea gostaria, mas\u2026 \u00e9 para o seu pr\u00f3prio bem!",
        u"I know it might be messy, but sometimes that needs to happen to get over things, right\u2026?": u"Sei que pode ser complicado, mas \u00e0s vezes isso precisa acontecer para conseguirmos superar as coisas, certo\u2026?",
        u"I know it sounds overwhelming, but it'd be worth it in the end, I'm sure!": u"Sei que parece muita coisa de uma vez, mas tenho certeza de que no fim valeria a pena!",
        u"I know it's a lot...": u"Sei que \u00e9 muita coisa\u2026",
        u"I know it\u2019s boring. I don\u2019t have any \u2018fun\u2019 hobbies.": u"Sei que \u00e9 entediante. N\u00e3o tenho passatempos \u2018divertidos\u2019.",
        u"I know it\u2019s inexcusable, especially since I\u2019m the only one you would\u2019ve counted on.": u"Sei que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 desculpa, principalmente porque eu era a \u00fanica pessoa com quem voc\u00ea poderia ter contado.",
        u"I know it\u2019s not the standard policy, but sometimes we gotta bend the rules a little, don\u2019t we?": u"Sei que n\u00e3o \u00e9 o procedimento padr\u00e3o, mas \u00e0s vezes precisamos flexibilizar um pouco as regras, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"I know it\u2019s only been a few months, but I could hardly wait to see everyone again!": u"Sei que s\u00f3 se passaram alguns meses, mas eu mal podia esperar para rever todo mundo!",
        u"I know life can really suck sometimes, but you can still make something out of it if you give it another shot\u2026!": u"Eu sei que \u00e0s vezes a vida pode ser uma droga, mas voc\u00ea ainda pode construir alguma coisa se der mais uma chance\u2026!",
        u"I know my situation was different, but if I hadn't taken that chance I'd have never been here with you guys, and made all my friends.": u"Sei que minha situa\u00e7\u00e3o era diferente, mas, se eu n\u00e3o tivesse aproveitado aquela chance, nunca estaria aqui com voc\u00eas nem teria feito todos os meus amigos.",
        u"I know now where his happiness and pain comes from, and from this, we were able to make our new promise to each other.": u"Agora sei de onde v\u00eam sua felicidade e sua dor e, com isso, conseguimos fazer uma nova promessa um ao outro.",
        u"I know right? It\u2019s a really nice vacation do-over for Aiden!": u"Pois \u00e9! \u00c9 uma \u00f3tima segunda chance de f\u00e9rias para o Aiden!",
        u"I know right? It\u2019s a really nice vacation do-over for them!": u"N\u00e9? \u00c9 uma \u00f3tima segunda chance de f\u00e9rias para eles!",
        u"I know right? It\u2019s been a while since we hung out here. And it looks like we got the whole pier to ourselves!": u"Eu sei, n\u00e9? Faz tempo que n\u00e3o ficamos aqui. E parece que temos o p\u00eder inteiro s\u00f3 para n\u00f3s!",
        u"I know right?! Can you believe it!? It\u2019s like a buffet of smoking hot men!": u"Eu sei, n\u00e9?! D\u00e1 para acreditar!? \u00c9 como um buf\u00ea de homens gostos\u00edssimos!",
        u"I know right?! I never got the chance to get to know Sir Goro this well when we were scouts!": u"Eu sei, n\u00e9?! Nunca tive a chance de conhecer o Sr. Goro t\u00e3o bem quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros!",
        u"I know that for many of us, today is bittersweet without our leader, but I\u2019m sure that no matter where he is, he\u2019s proud of us.": u"Sei que, para muitos de n\u00f3s, hoje \u00e9 um dia agridoce sem nosso l\u00edder, mas tenho certeza de que, onde quer que esteja, ele est\u00e1 orgulhoso de n\u00f3s.",
        u"I know that look when I see it~": u"Eu reconhe\u00e7o esse olhar quando vejo~",
        u"I know that she\u2019s a camp alumnus, but is that really enough reason to continue when she obviously can\u2019t and has never gotten along with everyone?": u"Sei que ela \u00e9 ex-integrante do acampamento, mas isso realmente \u00e9 motivo suficiente para continuar quando claramente n\u00e3o consegue e nunca conseguiu se dar bem com todos?",
        u"I know that side of him was gone for the last few years, after we went our separate ways and came back.": u"Sei que esse lado dele desapareceu nos \u00faltimos anos, depois que seguimos caminhos separados e nos reencontramos.",
        u"I know that we all started off on the wrong foot with Emilia, but we moved past our differences.": u"Sei que todos come\u00e7amos com o p\u00e9 esquerdo com Emilia, mas superamos nossas diferen\u00e7as.",
        u"I know that we\u2019ve achieved our preliminary goals, but based on Ms. Komarova\u2019s account, it seems that there were difficulties encountered along the way.": u"Sei que alcan\u00e7amos nossas metas preliminares, mas, segundo o relato da Srta. Komarova, parece que houve dificuldades ao longo do caminho.",
        u"I know that your intentions are in the right place, and they go beyond just for the sake of the camp, exactly like what I saw in you that day.  ": u"Sei que suas inten\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o sinceras e v\u00e3o al\u00e9m do simples bem do acampamento, exatamente como percebi em voc\u00ea naquele dia.  ",
        u"I know that, Aiden\u2026 but\u2026": u"Eu sei disso, Aiden\u2026 mas\u2026",
        u"I know that\u2019s a long time from now, but\u2026 when it happens, you can count on me to stay with you here!": u"Sei que ainda falta muito tempo, mas\u2026 quando isso acontecer, pode contar comigo para ficar aqui ao seu lado!",
        u"I know this is going to sound unreasonable, but\u2026": u"Sei que isso vai parecer irracional, mas\u2026",
        u"I know this is gonna sound silly, but I can\u2019t wait to sleep! The faster I go to bed, the sooner the trip starts!": u"Sei que vai parecer bobagem, mas mal posso esperar para dormir! Quanto mais cedo eu for para a cama, mais cedo a viagem come\u00e7a!",
        u"I know this is just my first day, but, for some reason, you guys make me feel like I\u2019ve been a part of this for a long time!": u"Sei que este \u00e9 apenas meu primeiro dia, mas, por algum motivo, voc\u00eas me fazem sentir como se eu fizesse parte disso h\u00e1 muito tempo!",
        u"I know this is sounding unfair to you, but\u2026 I\u2019ve been lonely like this for far too long\u2026": u"Sei que isso pode parecer injusto com voc\u00ea, mas\u2026 j\u00e1 me sinto sozinho assim h\u00e1 tempo demais\u2026",
        u"I know this may be a little overwhelming, but I assume it\u2019s not new to you to be handling a large amount of people working on a common goal.": u"Sei que isto pode parecer um pouco assustador, mas imagino que administrar muitas pessoas trabalhando por um objetivo comum n\u00e3o seja novidade para o senhor.",
        u"I know this might be sudden... But I\u2019ve been preparing for this moment for a long time, and only today did I have the courage to do anything\u2026": u"Sei que isso pode parecer repentino\u2026 Mas venho me preparando para este momento h\u00e1 muito tempo, e s\u00f3 hoje tive coragem de fazer alguma coisa\u2026",
        u"I know we all feel duped, but we should let Yoshi talk to her.": u"Sei que todos nos sentimos enganados, mas devemos deixar Yoshi conversar com ela.",
        u"I know we have our differences\u2026 But, I won\u2019t let a disagreement get in the way of your well-being.": u"Sei que temos nossas diferen\u00e7as\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o vou deixar que uma desaven\u00e7a fique acima do seu bem-estar.",
        u"I know we need as many hands as possible\u2026 So, I really don\u2019t mind the work, even though I\u2019m slow.": u"Sei que precisamos de toda ajuda poss\u00edvel\u2026 Ent\u00e3o realmente n\u00e3o me importo de trabalhar, mesmo sendo lento.",
        u"I know we\u2019re supposed to work on our relationship with her, especially after what happened yesterday.": u"Sei que devemos melhorar nossa rela\u00e7\u00e3o com ela, principalmente depois do que aconteceu ontem.",
        u"I know we\u2019ve been able to spend a great deal of time together working, but this is the perfect opportunity for us both to focus on enjoying each other\u2019s company.": u"Sei que conseguimos passar bastante tempo juntos trabalhando, mas esta \u00e9 a oportunidade perfeita para n\u00f3s dois nos concentrarmos em aproveitar a companhia um do outro.",
        u"I know we\u2019ve been so busy with the project, but I haven\u2019t got the chance to check in.": u"Sei que estivemos muito ocupados com o projeto, mas ainda n\u00e3o tive a chance de perguntar.",
        u"I know we\u2019ve been spending a lot more time together lately, but this time around it\u2019s a hundred percent quality time! No doing laundry or washing dishes, hahaha!": u"Sei que temos passado muito mais tempo juntos ultimamente, mas desta vez ser\u00e1 cem por cento tempo de qualidade! Nada de lavar roupas ou lou\u00e7as, hahaha!",
        u"I know we\u2019ve only been together for the summer, but it\u2019s the best one I\u2019ve ever had!": u"Sei que estivemos juntos apenas durante o ver\u00e3o, mas foi o melhor ver\u00e3o que j\u00e1 tive!",
        u"I know what\u2019s hurting you right now is something else much deeper\u2026": u"Sei que o que est\u00e1 machucando o senhor agora \u00e9 algo muito mais profundo\u2026",
        u"I know you can do it, Aiden!": u"Eu sei que voc\u00ea consegue, Aiden!",
        u"I know you can do it.": u"Eu sei que voc\u00ea consegue.",
        u"I know you can take it, Aiden\u2026": u"Eu sei que voc\u00ea aguenta, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I know you can take it, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Eu sei que voc\u00ea aguenta, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I know you guys have been successful with your careers, but know that Camp Buddy\u2019s doors are always open to welcome you back!": u"Sei que voc\u00eas tiveram sucesso em suas carreiras, mas saibam que as portas do Camp Buddy estar\u00e3o sempre abertas para receb\u00ea-los de volta!",
        u"I know you just wanna help, but you just can't change some people, Yoshi...": u"Sei que s\u00f3 quer ajudar, mas algumas pessoas simplesmente n\u00e3o mudam, Yoshi...",
        u"I know you try your best to be reliable, so much so that you\u2019re willing to work on anything, whether it\u2019s part of your job or not\u2026": u"Sei que voc\u00ea se esfor\u00e7a para ser confi\u00e1vel, tanto que aceita trabalhar em qualquer coisa, fa\u00e7a parte do seu servi\u00e7o ou n\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I know you wanted to go home\u2026": u"Eu sei que voc\u00ea queria voltar para casa\u2026",
        u"I know you will\u2026 But that\u2019s not all I wanted to show you\u2026 ": u"Eu sei que vai\u2026 Mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 tudo que eu queria lhe mostrar\u2026 ",
        u"I know you're afraid...": u"Sei que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com medo\u2026",
        u"I know you\u2019re a fighter, Emilia. And fighters don\u2019t go down easily, no matter what! ": u"Sei que voc\u00ea \u00e9 uma lutadora, Emilia. E lutadores n\u00e3o caem facilmente, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a! ",
        u"I know you\u2019re a fighter, Emilia. We both are\u2026 And fighters don\u2019t go down easily, no matter what! ": u"Sei que voc\u00ea \u00e9 uma lutadora, Emilia. N\u00f3s duas somos\u2026 E lutadores n\u00e3o caem facilmente, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a! ",
        u"I know you\u2019re tired, but there must be another way\u2026!": u"Sei que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 cansado, mas deve haver outra maneira\u2026!",
        u"I know, I couldn\u2019t believe it either.": u"Eu sei, eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o consegui acreditar.",
        u"I know, I know! Now, why don\u2019t you two get out of your fancy suits and take the rest of the night off? ": u"Eu sei, eu sei! Agora, por que voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o tiram esses ternos elegantes e descansam pelo restante da noite? ",
        u"I know, I know! We just won\u2019t spend as much time together if we aren\u2019t roomies!": u"Eu sei, eu sei! S\u00f3 n\u00e3o vamos passar tanto tempo juntos se n\u00e3o formos mais colegas de quarto!",
        u"I know, I know, I\u2019m just kidding around. Everyone hasn\u2019t cracked a smile since that meeting.": u"Eu sei, eu sei, s\u00f3 estou brincando. Ningu\u00e9m deu um sorriso desde aquela reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"I know, I know, I\u2019m just kidding, hahaha! You should see the look on your face!": u"Eu sei, eu sei, s\u00f3 estou brincando, hahaha! Voc\u00ea precisava ver sua express\u00e3o!",
        u"I know, I know. But we don\u2019t want people choking on their food on the last day, right?": u"Eu sei, eu sei. Mas n\u00e3o queremos ningu\u00e9m engasgando com a comida no \u00faltimo dia, certo?",
        u"I know, I know. Your job is very important after all~ ": u"Eu sei, eu sei. Afinal, seu trabalho \u00e9 muito importante~ ",
        u"I know, but\u2026 I just can\u2019t help but feel guilty the whole time we were here\u2026": u"Eu sei, mas\u2026 n\u00e3o consigo deixar de me sentir culpado por todo o tempo que estivemos aqui\u2026",
        u"I know, right Yoshi?! This suit and tie are so tight I feel like I can\u2019t breathe!": u"Pois \u00e9, Yoshi?! Este terno e esta gravata s\u00e3o t\u00e3o apertados que parece que n\u00e3o consigo respirar!",
        u"I know, right? But don\u2019t let him downplay it \u2013 he was actually their leader, too!": u"Pois \u00e9! Mas n\u00e3o deixe ele minimizar a hist\u00f3ria \u2014 ele tamb\u00e9m era o l\u00edder deles!",
        u"I know, right? Even the people walking around look hella rich\u2026 I kinda feel a little out of place here.": u"Pois \u00e9! At\u00e9 as pessoas andando por aqui parecem ricas pra caramba\u2026 Eu me sinto meio deslocado.",
        u"I know, right? Honestly, I can\u2019t think of any way that we contributed to society back then.": u"Pois \u00e9. Sinceramente, n\u00e3o consigo pensar em nenhuma maneira pela qual contribu\u00edamos para a sociedade naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"I know, right? She suddenly came in and offered to help with today\u2019s lunch service!": u"Eu sei, n\u00e9? Ela apareceu de repente e se ofereceu para ajudar a preparar o almo\u00e7o de hoje!",
        u"I know, right?! It took me so long to get this copy! But the yaoi gods blessed me when I saw on a forum that a store was selling one signed copy! ": u"Pois \u00e9?! Demorei tanto para conseguir este exemplar! Mas os deuses do yaoi me aben\u00e7oaram quando vi num f\u00f3rum que uma loja estava vendendo um exemplar autografado! ",
        u"I know. As much as we\u2019re all overwhelmed by his generosity, it would be best to just appreciate it.": u"Eu sei. Por mais que a generosidade dele esteja deixando todos n\u00f3s impressionados, \u00e9 melhor simplesmente apreciarmos.",
        u"I knowwww\u2026 Huhuhu\u2026 You didn\u2019t have to say that again, Dar\u2026": u"Eu seeeei\u2026 Huhuhu\u2026 N\u00e3o precisava dizer isso de novo, Dar\u2026",
        u"I know\u2026 And I think she genuinely wants to help me out too, but that evaluation a while ago really seemed unnecessarily harsh.": u"Eu sei\u2026 E acho que ela realmente quer me ajudar, mas aquela avalia\u00e7\u00e3o pareceu desnecessariamente severa.",
        u"I know\u2026 But for someone like Emilia who struggled to socialize, or even have friends to begin with, I was her only option\u2026": u"Eu sei\u2026 Mas para algu\u00e9m como Emilia, que tinha dificuldade para socializar ou sequer fazer amigos, eu era a \u00fanica op\u00e7\u00e3o dela\u2026",
        u"I know\u2026 I realize now that I let the wrong things define who I was, and it was my main drive for acting the way I did.": u"Eu sei\u2026 Agora percebo que deixei as coisas erradas definirem quem eu era, e isso foi o principal motivo de eu agir daquela maneira.",
        u"I learn a lot of things from you too. You just don\u2019t realize it!": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m aprendo muitas coisas com voc\u00ea. Voc\u00ea simplesmente n\u00e3o percebe!",
        u"I let no one see my weakness, and it started a vicious cycle where I grew more and more bitter each day for letting you go\u2026": u"N\u00e3o deixava ningu\u00e9m ver minhas fraquezas, e isso iniciou um ciclo vicioso no qual eu ficava cada dia mais amargurado por ter deixado voc\u00ea partir\u2026",
        u"I let no one see my weakness, and it started a vicious cycle where I grew more and more bitter each day\u2026": u"N\u00e3o deixava ningu\u00e9m ver minhas fraquezas, e isso iniciou um ciclo vicioso no qual eu ficava cada dia mais amargurado\u2026",
        u"I like Lloyd\u2019s height the best.": u"Eu prefiro a altura de Lloyd.",
        u"I like coffee. I like alcohol. But not together.": u"Gosto de caf\u00e9. Gosto de \u00e1lcool. Mas n\u00e3o juntos.",
        u"I like tea.": u"Eu gosto de ch\u00e1.",
        u"I like where this is going~": u"Estou gostando do rumo desta conversa~",
        u"I like your bowtie. It\u2019s cute.": u"Eu gosto da sua gravata-borboleta. \u00c9 fofa.",
        u"I liked it better when she stayed quiet in the shuttle.": u"Eu preferia quando ela ficava quieta no transporte.",
        u"I literally never thought the badges would be used like that\u2026": u"Eu literalmente nunca imaginei que as ins\u00edgnias seriam usadas desse jeito\u2026",
        u"I look back on those days fondly as well. Having scouts like you in the very first term really helped solidify my passion for Camp Buddy.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m me lembro daqueles dias com carinho. Ter escoteiros como voc\u00eas j\u00e1 na primeira temporada ajudou a consolidar minha paix\u00e3o pelo Camp Buddy.",
        u"I lost a point.": u"Eu perdi um ponto.",
        u"I lost myself along the way, and despite expanding the camp to what I thought was successful, all of it became meaningless\u2026": u"Eu me perdi no caminho e, apesar de expandir o acampamento at\u00e9 o que eu considerava um sucesso, tudo aquilo perdeu o sentido\u2026",
        u"I love you Aiden\u2026": u"Eu te amo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I love you so much, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu te amo tanto, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I love you too, Aiden\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m amo voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I love you too, Goro\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m amo voc\u00ea, Goro\u2026",
        u"I love you too, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m amo voc\u00ea, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I love you too, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m te amo, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I love you too...": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m te amo\u2026",
        u"I love you too\u2026": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m amo voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I love you!": u"Eu te amo!",
        u"I love you, Goro\u2026": u"Eu amo voc\u00ea, Goro\u2026",
        u"I love you, Yoshinori.": u"Eu amo voc\u00ea, Yoshinori.",
        u"I love you, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Eu amo voc\u00ea, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I love you, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu te amo, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I loved you more when I saw your strength to endure everything you\u2019ve been through\u2026  ": u"Eu amei voc\u00ea ainda mais quando vi sua for\u00e7a para suportar tudo pelo que passou\u2026  ",
        u"I made it my personal tradition to offer a journal when I see scouts full of inspiration, such as Mr. Akatora and Mr. Nagame!": u"Transformei em tradi\u00e7\u00e3o pessoal oferecer um di\u00e1rio quando encontro escoteiros cheios de inspira\u00e7\u00e3o, como o senhor Akatora e o senhor Nagame!",
        u"I made some burgers actually! Thought you guys need the extra protein from all that manual labor!": u"Na verdade, fiz hamb\u00fargueres! Achei que voc\u00eas precisariam de prote\u00edna extra depois de tanto trabalho bra\u00e7al!",
        u"I made sure not to make the same mistake again! You\u2019re keeping that on, whether you like it or not!": u"Desta vez fiz quest\u00e3o de n\u00e3o cometer o mesmo erro! Voc\u00ea vai continuar usando isso, goste ou n\u00e3o!",
        u"I managed to get things moving, but\u2026 I could\u2019ve really used your help.": u"Consegui colocar tudo em andamento, mas\u2026 sua ajuda teria sido muito \u00fatil.",
        u"I may have given up a lot of things, but I\u2019ve also earned more than I ever hoped for.": u"Posso ter aberto m\u00e3o de muitas coisas, mas tamb\u00e9m conquistei mais do que jamais esperava.",
        u"I mean it! It\u2019s about time that you had someone who can take care of you properly, Dad.": u"Estou falando s\u00e9rio! J\u00e1 estava na hora de voc\u00ea ter algu\u00e9m que cuide direito de voc\u00ea, Pai.",
        u"I mean it, though! It\u2019s one thing to lead the scouts, but it takes a whole other level of skill to coordinate a project like this.": u"Estou falando s\u00e9rio! Uma coisa \u00e9 liderar os escoteiros, mas coordenar um projeto desses exige um n\u00edvel totalmente diferente de habilidade.",
        u"I mean just look at that view\u2026 You can see the entire city from here\u2026": u"Olhe s\u00f3 aquela vista\u2026 D\u00e1 para ver a cidade inteira daqui\u2026",
        u"I mean that usually adds a lot of fuel to the flame.": u"Quero dizer, isso geralmente coloca bastante lenha na fogueira.",
        u"I mean who even uses a landline and a fax machine nowadays?": u"Quero dizer, quem ainda usa telefone fixo e fax hoje em dia?",
        u"I mean, I just got this offer yesterday\u2026 Maybe I got myself way too hyped up about it in the moment. ": u"Quero dizer, recebi essa oferta s\u00f3 ontem\u2026 Talvez eu tenha me empolgado demais no momento. ",
        u"I mean, I\u2019m happy when Lloyd is around. ": u"Quero dizer que fico feliz quando Lloyd est\u00e1 por perto. ",
        u"I mean, I\u2019m living proof! ": u"Quero dizer, eu sou a prova viva! ",
        u"I mean, come on! We\u2019ve been together for 9 years now! What point is there in hiding?": u"Quero dizer, qual \u00e9! Estamos juntos h\u00e1 9 anos! Qual \u00e9 o sentido de esconder?",
        u"I mean, it\u2019s just some snow after all\u2026 how hard can it be?  ": u"Quero dizer, afinal \u00e9 s\u00f3 um pouco de neve\u2026 qu\u00e3o dif\u00edcil pode ser?  ",
        u"I mean, look at her! She\u2019s been harassing that poor bellboy for a solid thirty minutes now!": u"Olha para ela! J\u00e1 faz uns trinta minutos que est\u00e1 atormentando aquele pobre mensageiro!",
        u"I mean, they were fine, but not great when it\u2019s ten chapters in one sitting!": u"Quero dizer, eram boas, mas n\u00e3o quando s\u00e3o dez cap\u00edtulos de uma vez!",
        u"I mean, you saw how I was last term when we almost closed down the camp\u2026": u"Quero dizer, voc\u00ea viu como eu fiquei na temporada passada quando quase fechamos o acampamento\u2026",
        u"I meant in the same stall, silly. ": u"Quis dizer no mesmo box, bobo. ",
        u"I meant tender loving care, silly! Sheesh\u2026": u"Eu quis dizer ternura, zelo e carinho, bobo! Nossa\u2026",
        u"I mean\u2026 Gramps has loosened up a lot ever since the last term, and Yoshi isn\u2019t such a worrywart anymore.": u"Quero dizer\u2026 O Vov\u00f4 relaxou bastante desde a \u00faltima temporada, e o Yoshi n\u00e3o \u00e9 mais t\u00e3o preocupado.",
        u"I mean\u2026 He\u2019s using his dessert spoon for the main course, his elbows are on the table, and I can hear his chewing from over here! ": u"Quero dizer\u2026 Ele est\u00e1 usando a colher de sobremesa no prato principal, os cotovelos est\u00e3o sobre a mesa e consigo ouvir ele mastigando daqui! ",
        u"I mean\u2026 I can\u2019t help it! After being so busy for the last two months, we finally get some time to relax!": u"Quero dizer\u2026 n\u00e3o consigo evitar! Depois de passarmos os \u00faltimos dois meses t\u00e3o ocupados, finalmente teremos um tempo para relaxar!",
        u"I mean\u2026 If you hadn\u2019t pushed me to talk, I wouldn\u2019t have been able to open up.": u"Quero dizer\u2026 Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse insistido para eu falar, eu n\u00e3o teria conseguido me abrir.",
        u"I mean\u2026 It doesn\u2019t make sense that she would go out of her way to put herself in such trouble without a motive.": u"Quero dizer\u2026 N\u00e3o faria sentido ela se colocar em tantos problemas sem ter um motivo.",
        u"I mean\u2026 I\u2019m glad you seem okay this morning, but I dunno if you were just tryna keep up appearances\u2026": u"Quero dizer\u2026 Fico feliz que pare\u00e7a bem esta manh\u00e3, mas n\u00e3o sei se est\u00e1 apenas tentando manter as apar\u00eancias\u2026",
        u"I mean\u2026 Just look at this place, what other bathhouses have you seen with waiters going around delivering you drinks?": u"Quer dizer\u2026 Olhe s\u00f3 este lugar. Em que outra casa de banho voc\u00ea viu gar\u00e7ons andando por a\u00ed e servindo bebidas?",
        u"I mean\u2026 This looks really dangerous. You\u2019ve missed and sent that axe flying about three times now. ": u"Quer dizer\u2026 Isso parece muito perigoso. Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 errou e fez esse machado sair voando umas tr\u00eas vezes. ",
        u"I mean\u2026 We are at \u201cCamp\u201d Buddy\u2026 Why else would we be setting up tents and making a campfire?": u"Quero dizer\u2026 Estamos no \u201cCamp\u201d Buddy\u2026 Por que mais montar\u00edamos barracas e far\u00edamos uma fogueira?",
        u"I mean\u2026 You could\u2019ve just told us that to begin with!": u"Quero dizer\u2026 Voc\u00ea poderia simplesmente ter nos contado isso desde o come\u00e7o!",
        u"I mean\u2026 after what happened last night\u2026": u"Quero dizer\u2026 depois do que aconteceu ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"I mean\u2026 look at all those servers and dancers! They sure know how to entertain their guests, huh?": u"Quero dizer\u2026 olhe todos aqueles gar\u00e7ons e dan\u00e7arinos! Eles realmente sabem como entreter os h\u00f3spedes, hein?",
        u"I mean\u2026 you\u2019re the toughest guy I\u2019ve ever known.": u"Quero dizer\u2026 o senhor \u00e9 o homem mais forte que j\u00e1 conheci.",
        u"I might as well empty it before Goro comes out of\u2014": u"J\u00e1 que estou aqui, posso esvazi\u00e1-la antes que Goro saia do\u2014",
        u"I might have no experience as a camp leader, father, or a husband, but\u2026 I\u2019ll try my best to listen and understand!": u"Talvez eu n\u00e3o tenha experi\u00eancia como l\u00edder de acampamento, pai ou marido, mas\u2026 vou fazer o poss\u00edvel para ouvir e entender!",
        u"I might not know the full story\u2026 But you\u2019ve gone through so much and now\u2019s not the time to give up.": u"Talvez eu n\u00e3o conhe\u00e7a toda a hist\u00f3ria\u2026 Mas voc\u00ea passou por tanta coisa, e agora n\u00e3o \u00e9 hora de desistir.",
        u"I must say, this wasn\u2019t really a surprise to me. Your pair has always had a special closeness.": u"Devo dizer que isso n\u00e3o foi exatamente uma surpresa para mim. Voc\u00eas dois sempre tiveram uma proximidade especial.",
        u"I need some advice.": u"Preciso de um conselho.",
        u"I need some firewood for the office since the air is getting a little chilly now.": u"Preciso de lenha para o escrit\u00f3rio, j\u00e1 que o tempo est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando a esfriar.",
        u"I need time\u2026 and space...": u"Preciso de tempo\u2026 e espa\u00e7o\u2026",
        u"I need to get help!": u"Preciso buscar ajuda!",
        u"I need to talk to you.": u"Preciso falar com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I need you to stay put for a while until the meeting is over. I promise I won\u2019t be gone for too long, so don\u2019t go goofing around, okay?": u"Preciso que fique aqui por um tempo, at\u00e9 a reuni\u00e3o terminar. Prometo que n\u00e3o demorarei, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o saia fazendo travessuras, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"I need you to tell me what's on your mind.": u"Preciso que voc\u00ea me diga o que est\u00e1 pensando.",
        u"I needed to stretch my muscles too\u2026 Working in the office all day made me stagnant.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m precisava exercitar os m\u00fasculos\u2026 Trabalhar o dia inteiro no escrit\u00f3rio me deixou parado demais.",
        u"I never experienced them growing up, and always was disgusted by \u2018dirty work.\u2019": u"Nunca tive essa experi\u00eancia enquanto crescia e sempre senti repulsa por \u2018trabalho sujo\u2019.",
        u"I never got the chance to join something like this when I was little, so I\u2019m really looking forward to experiencing it now!": u"Nunca tive a oportunidade de participar de algo assim quando era pequeno, ent\u00e3o estou muito ansioso para viver essa experi\u00eancia agora!",
        u"I never got the full the story but, it helps me understand why she acts like that\u2026": u"Eu nunca soube a hist\u00f3ria toda, mas isso me ajuda a entender por que ela age desse jeito\u2026",
        u"I never knew how truly lonely I was\u2026 ": u"Nunca percebi o quanto eu realmente estava sozinho\u2026 ",
        u"I never thought I\u2019d get another chance to open up to you like that and let everything out\u2026": u"Nunca pensei que teria outra chance de me abrir assim com voc\u00ea e colocar tudo para fora\u2026",
        u"I never thought I\u2019d see the day where I had to let everything out\u2026": u"Nunca pensei que chegaria o dia em que eu precisaria colocar tudo para fora\u2026",
        u"I never thought of you like that though.": u"Mas nunca pensei em voc\u00ea dessa forma.",
        u"I never thought the day would come that I\u2019d wake up to you hugging me\u2026": u"Nunca pensei que chegaria o dia em que eu acordaria com voc\u00ea me abra\u00e7ando\u2026",
        u"I never thought the day would come where I could stand here with you, like this.": u"Nunca pensei que chegaria o dia em que eu poderia estar aqui diante de voc\u00ea, assim.",
        u"I never tried making it before, \u2019cause I knew I couldn\u2019t cook it the same way my Dad did\u2026 But I\u2019d say it was pretty close!": u"Nunca tinha tentado fazer antes, porque sabia que n\u00e3o conseguiria cozinhar exatamente como meu pai\u2026 Mas eu diria que ficou bem parecido!",
        u"I noticed you seemed a bit upset when you got the call\u2026 So, I thought you might need some company!": u"Notei que o senhor pareceu um pouco perturbado quando recebeu a liga\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Ent\u00e3o pensei que talvez precisasse de companhia!",
        u"I noticed you seemed a little upset.": u"Notei que o senhor parecia um pouco perturbado.",
        u"I now declare you married! You may now kiss!": u"Eu os declaro casados! Podem se beijar!",
        u"I only adjusted the schedule based on the issues that were made apparent to me yesterday during my survey!": u"Apenas ajustei o cronograma com base nos problemas que ficaram evidentes durante minha avalia\u00e7\u00e3o de ontem!",
        u"I only had myself to blame for being at the top of all of it\u2026 and it only made me more bitter at my own inaction.": u"Eu s\u00f3 podia culpar a mim mesmo por estar no comando de tudo\u2026 e isso s\u00f3 me deixou ainda mais amargurado com minha pr\u00f3pria ina\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I only know the signs according to the months, though. I\u2019m really interested to know more about them!": u"Mas eu s\u00f3 conhe\u00e7o os signos de acordo com os meses. Tenho muito interesse em aprender mais sobre eles!",
        u"I only know them from college parties, honestly. I have no idea about the rest of the menu either, hahaha!": u"Sinceramente, s\u00f3 conhe\u00e7o das festas da faculdade. Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia do restante do card\u00e1pio, hahaha!",
        u"I only met her parents once when they enrolled her in the camp. And let\u2019s just say they made a\u2026 lasting impression.": u"S\u00f3 conheci os pais dela uma vez, quando a matricularam no acampamento. E digamos que eles deixaram uma\u2026 impress\u00e3o duradoura.",
        u"I only see these kinds of fancy places in movies. It feels so surreal to actually be in one.": u"Eu s\u00f3 vejo lugares chiques assim nos filmes. \u00c9 t\u00e3o surreal estar realmente em um deles.",
        u"I overheard that one of the management staff was being too \u201cfriendly\u201d with the construction crew, which was causing a lot of distractions.": u"Disseram que um membro da administra\u00e7\u00e3o estava sendo \u201camig\u00e1vel\u201d demais com a equipe de constru\u00e7\u00e3o, causando muitas distra\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"I owe that place so much for allowing me to become a better version of myself, to bond with my daughter, and most importantly\u2026 to have met you.": u"Devo muito \u00e0quele lugar por me permitir me tornar uma vers\u00e3o melhor de mim mesmo, criar la\u00e7os com minha filha e, acima de tudo\u2026 conhecer voc\u00ea.",
        u"I pay attention.": u"Eu presto aten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I personally know that he is skillful in management; but I assume it\u2019s hard for him to step up if the figure of authority is not allowing him to use his full potential.": u"Sei pessoalmente que ele \u00e9 competente na administra\u00e7\u00e3o, mas suponho que seja dif\u00edcil assumir responsabilidades quando a figura de autoridade n\u00e3o permite que use todo o seu potencial.",
        u"I personally prefer a cozier and calmer ambience when I\u2019m having my drinks.": u"Pessoalmente, prefiro um ambiente mais aconchegante e tranquilo quando estou bebendo.",
        u"I personally prioritized those who had a familiarity with the camp during the application process.": u"Eu pessoalmente dei prioridade a quem j\u00e1 tinha familiaridade com o acampamento durante o processo seletivo.",
        u"I picked up a trick or two from that fancy hotel! You know what they say, if you can\u2019t beat \u2019em, join them!": u"Aprendi um truque ou outro naquele hotel chique! Sabe como dizem: se n\u00e3o pode venc\u00ea-los, junte-se a eles!",
        u"I pledged to myself that if I found someone selling it, I\u2019d definitely buy it \u2013 no matter how high the price!": u"Prometi a mim mesmo que, se encontrasse algu\u00e9m vendendo, certamente compraria \u2014 n\u00e3o importava o pre\u00e7o!",
        u"I prefer your cooking.": u"Prefiro a sua comida.",
        u"I probably need to save a lot of money for that though.": u"Mas provavelmente preciso economizar muito dinheiro para isso.",
        u"I probably wouldn\u2019t have given you that brooch if it weren\u2019t for that quality of yours.": u"Provavelmente n\u00e3o teria lhe dado o broche se n\u00e3o fosse por essa sua caracter\u00edstica.",
        u"I promise I\u2019ll be quick, sir.": u"Prometo que serei r\u00e1pido, senhor.",
        u"I promise I\u2019ll make it quick\u2026": u"Prometo que vou ser r\u00e1pido\u2026",
        u"I promise it\u2019s not pervy at all! Hihihi~": u"Prometo que n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada pervertido! Hihihi~",
        u"I promise we\u2019ll be fine, Aiden! Long distance is hard, but we can make it work.": u"Prometo que vamos ficar bem, Aiden! Relacionamento \u00e0 dist\u00e2ncia \u00e9 dif\u00edcil, mas podemos fazer dar certo.",
        u"I promise we\u2019re doing our best to make it all worth it, so the camp can have an amazing future!": u"Prometo que estamos fazendo o poss\u00edvel para fazer tudo valer a pena e garantir um futuro incr\u00edvel para o acampamento!",
        u"I promise, just a quick peek\u2026!": u"Eu prometo, vai ser s\u00f3 uma espiadinha\u2026!",
        u"I promise, you won\u2019t regret it!": u"Eu prometo, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai se arrepender!",
        u"I promised you that I\u2019d make something out of myself, and that was what Dad would\u2019ve wanted for me too\u2026": u"Prometi a voc\u00ea que faria algo da minha vida, e era isso que o Pai tamb\u00e9m teria desejado para mim\u2026",
        u"I put all my blood, sweat, and tears into it\u2026 expanding over and over with blind ambition, until it grew into something I could barely handle\u2026": u"Coloquei todo o meu sangue, suor e l\u00e1grimas nisso\u2026 expandindo sem parar, movido por uma ambi\u00e7\u00e3o cega, at\u00e9 que cresceu a ponto de eu mal conseguir administrar\u2026",
        u"I put some of my creamy special sauce on it, since you liked it so much yesterday~ ": u"Coloquei um pouco do meu molho especial cremoso, j\u00e1 que voc\u00ea gostou tanto ontem~ ",
        u"I realized back then that there\u2019s so much more I could do to help if I was stronger and healthier.": u"Naquela \u00e9poca percebi que poderia ajudar muito mais se fosse mais forte e saud\u00e1vel.",
        u"I realized that I had to take over and find a way to give Yuri the childhood she deserved.": u"Percebi que precisava assumir a responsabilidade e encontrar uma forma de dar a Yuri a inf\u00e2ncia que ela merecia.",
        u"I really admire all the confidence and guts it took to do that, and I figured I needed to start having some of that myself!": u"Admiro muito toda a confian\u00e7a e coragem necess\u00e1rias para fazer isso, e percebi que eu precisava come\u00e7ar a ter um pouco disso tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"I really appreciate that you all gave me a bit of time to calm down and stay here until I recover\u2026": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito por todos voc\u00eas terem me dado um tempo para me acalmar e ficar aqui at\u00e9 me recuperar\u2026",
        u"I really appreciate you saying all that, Aiden. I\u2019m really flattered you see me like that.": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito por dizer tudo isso, Aiden. Fico muito lisonjeado por voc\u00ea me enxergar dessa forma.",
        u"I really appreciate your concern, Mr. Clermont. Thank you for understanding.": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito sua preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o, Sr. Clermont. Obrigado pela compreens\u00e3o.",
        u"I really appreciate your generosity, Mr. Clermont. Thank you for giving me a chance.": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito sua generosidade, Sr. Clermont. Obrigado por me dar uma chance.",
        u"I really appreciate your generosity, Mr. Clermont. Thank you for giving us a chance.": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito sua generosidade, Sr. Clermont. Obrigado por nos dar essa oportunidade.",
        u"I really appreciate your intentions, Yoshinori, but you don\u2019t have to take over.": u"Agrade\u00e7o muito as suas inten\u00e7\u00f5es, Yoshinori, mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa assumir o comando.",
        u"I really can\u2019t believe that I\u2019m talking to THE pinkbutterfly69\u2026 and I\u2019m looking at the long-lost \u201cHomeRun!\u201d doujinshi\u2026 ": u"Ainda n\u00e3o acredito que estou falando com A pinkbutterfly69\u2026 e olhando para o doujinshi perdido de \u201cHomeRun!\u201d\u2026 ",
        u"I really can\u2019t fathom how you could all let that go so easily, when I\u2019ve done nothing but let my bitterness consume me\u2026": u"Eu realmente n\u00e3o consigo entender como todos voc\u00eas conseguem deixar isso para tr\u00e1s t\u00e3o facilmente, quando eu n\u00e3o fiz nada al\u00e9m de me deixar consumir pela amargura\u2026",
        u"I really didn\u2019t want to burden you more\u2026 I was just happy enough to be with you again.": u"Eu realmente n\u00e3o queria sobrecarregar voc\u00ea ainda mais\u2026 S\u00f3 estar com voc\u00ea novamente j\u00e1 me deixava feliz.",
        u"I really do trust you, Yoshinori\u2026 Thanks for helping me get through it\u2026": u"Eu realmente confio em voc\u00ea, Yoshinori\u2026 Obrigado por me ajudar a superar isso\u2026",
        u"I really don\u2019t deserve all this kindness\u2026": u"Eu realmente n\u00e3o mere\u00e7o toda essa bondade\u2026",
        u"I really don\u2019t know, if I should take it or not, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu realmente n\u00e3o sei se devo aceitar ou n\u00e3o, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I really don\u2019t think it\u2019s something to be ashamed of\u2026 ": u"Realmente n\u00e3o acho que seja algo de que se envergonhar\u2026 ",
        u"I really don\u2019t want to talk about it. There\u2019s nothing we can do about it anyways.": u"Realmente n\u00e3o quero falar sobre isso. De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada que possamos fazer.",
        u"I really gotta hand it to you, Aiden. You really impressed Mr. Clermont with your cooking.": u"Tenho que admitir, Aiden. Voc\u00ea realmente impressionou o Sr. Clermont com sua comida.",
        u"I really hate seeing him whenever he\u2019s drunk like this.": u"Eu odeio ver ele quando fica b\u00eabado desse jeito.",
        u"I really hope I can help.": u"Espero mesmo conseguir ajudar.",
        u"I really needed a change in scenery, and to stop coding all alone in a dark room.": u"Eu realmente precisava mudar de ambiente e parar de programar sozinho num quarto escuro.",
        u"I really regret being closed-minded this whole time, and I never considered that you had reasons for your actions\u2026": u"Eu realmente me arrependo de ter sido t\u00e3o cabe\u00e7a-dura esse tempo todo e de nunca ter considerado que voc\u00ea tinha motivos para agir assim\u2026",
        u"I really screwed up big time\u2026!": u"Eu estraguei tudo de verdade\u2026!",
        u"I really think the way I brought everything up to her went wrong at some point.  ": u"Realmente acho que a maneira como falei de tudo com ela deu errado em algum momento.  ",
        u"I really think the way I brought everything up with her just went wrong. ": u"Realmente acho que a maneira como toquei naquele assunto com ela deu errado. ",
        u"I really thought I could make it work, and give that kind of life to you myself, but here I am\u2026": u"Eu realmente achei que conseguiria fazer dar certo e proporcionar esse tipo de vida a voc\u00ea por conta pr\u00f3pria, mas aqui estou\u2026",
        u"I really thought I knew you well enough by now, but I can\u2019t figure this out\u2026": u"Eu realmente achei que j\u00e1 conhecia voc\u00ea bem o bastante, mas n\u00e3o consigo entender isso\u2026",
        u"I really thought it\u2019d be bigger than just one-bite.": u"Eu realmente achei que seria maior do que uma \u00fanica mordida.",
        u"I really tried, but I don\u2019t think she was ready at all to talk through and fix things\u2026": u"Eu realmente tentei, mas acho que ela n\u00e3o estava nem um pouco pronta para conversar e resolver as coisas\u2026",
        u"I really want \u2018him\u2019 to taste this\u2014": u"Quero muito que \u2018ele\u2019 prove isso\u2014",
        u"I really wish I could stay like this with you forever\u2026": u"Eu realmente queria poder ficar assim com voc\u00ea para sempre\u2026",
        u"I really, really wanted to show this to last year\u2019s scouts and give them a little history of the camp\u2026": u"Eu queria muito, muito mostrar isto aos escoteiros do ano passado e contar um pouco da hist\u00f3ria do acampamento\u2026",
        u"I refused to guide you and believed there was nothing I could do to help, considering how helpless I was myself\u2026": u"Recusei-me a orientar voc\u00ea e acreditava que n\u00e3o havia nada que eu pudesse fazer para ajudar, considerando o quanto eu mesmo me sentia impotente\u2026",
        u"I regret to inform you my professional identity has been far from the truth, sir.": u"Lamento informar que minha identidade profissional esteve muito longe da verdade, senhor.",
        u"I remember Aiden and I getting some \u2018blow job\u2019 shots.": u"Eu lembro que eu e o Aiden tomamos uns shots de \u2018Boquete\u2019.",
        u"I request that you\u2019d be more empathetic to everyone here as your co-workers.": u"Pe\u00e7o que tenha mais empatia por todos aqui como seus colegas de trabalho.",
        u"I ruined my family\u2026 I was never going to be good enough\u2026 Everything was a mistake.": u"Eu arruinei minha fam\u00edlia\u2026 Eu nunca seria bom o bastante\u2026 Tudo foi um erro.",
        u"I said enough. We don\u2019t need to hear anything else, especially from you Ms. Komarova.": u"Eu disse que chega. N\u00e3o precisamos ouvir mais nada, principalmente da senhora, Srta. Komarova.",
        u"I say we give it a shot right away! You guys can help me fix up the photos correctly based on your memory, and then we\u2019ll transcribe the events from that day!": u"Digo que devemos tentar agora mesmo! Voc\u00eas podem me ajudar a restaurar corretamente as fotos com base nas lembran\u00e7as e depois transcreveremos os acontecimentos daquele dia!",
        u"I see Gramps and Mr. Clermont doing just that over there! Let\u2019s join \u2019em!": u"Estou vendo o Vov\u00f4 e o Sr. Clermont fazendo exatamente isso ali! Vamos com eles!",
        u"I see Lloyd and Darius with Mr. Clermont doing just that over there! Let\u2019s join them!": u"Estou vendo Lloyd e Darius fazendo exatamente isso com o Sr. Clermont ali! Vamos nos juntar a eles!",
        u"I see Taiga is helping out too! You should know he\u2019s quite the craftsman!": u"Vejo que o Taiga tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 ajudando! Saiba que ele \u00e9 bem habilidoso com trabalhos manuais!",
        u"I see you all looking~! Wanna see what I\u2019m packing~?!": u"Estou vendo todo mundo olhar~! Querem ver o que tenho aqui~?!",
        u"I see, I see\u2026 I kinda understand now. We all need an outlet after all!": u"Entendo\u2026 Acho que agora estou come\u00e7ando a compreender. Afinal, todos precisamos de uma v\u00e1lvula de escape!",
        u"I see. I apologize for the short delay. Let me come back right away.": u"Entendo. Pe\u00e7o desculpas pelo breve atraso. Voltarei imediatamente.",
        u"I see\u2026": u"Entendo\u2026",
        u"I see\u2026 ": u"Entendo\u2026 ",
        u"I see\u2026 I apologize for being persistent.": u"Entendo\u2026 Pe\u00e7o desculpas pela insist\u00eancia.",
        u"I see\u2026 It sounds fun there.": u"Entendo\u2026 Parece divertido a\u00ed.",
        u"I see\u2026 Mr. Clermont always does talk about how happy he is Felix got to experience this place, so that makes a lot of sense!": u"Entendo\u2026 O Sr. Clermont sempre fala sobre como est\u00e1 feliz por Felix ter tido a oportunidade de conhecer este lugar, ent\u00e3o faz bastante sentido!",
        u"I see\u2026 That\u2019s a shame\u2026": u"Entendo\u2026 \u00c9 uma pena\u2026",
        u"I see\u2026~": u"Entendo\u2026~",
        u"I sensed a bit of hesitation there\u2026 Don\u2019t be shy, you can tell me what\u2019s wrong!": u"Percebi um pouco de hesita\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 N\u00e3o seja t\u00edmido, pode me dizer o que h\u00e1 de errado!",
        u"I sent everyone a message to make sure they are prepared to go, including Emilia\u2026": u"Mandei uma mensagem para todos para garantir que estivessem preparados para partir, inclusive para a Emilia\u2026",
        u"I should be asking you that! You\u2019re the one who always makes us go to sleep on time!": u"Eu \u00e9 que deveria perguntar isso! \u00c9 voc\u00ea que sempre faz a gente dormir na hora certa!",
        u"I should be the one saying that though. ": u"Mas quem deveria dizer isso sou eu. ",
        u"I should be the one saying that! Look at yourself, you might as well be naked!": u"Eu \u00e9 que deveria dizer isso! Olha para voc\u00ea, desse jeito \u00e9 como se estivesse pelado!",
        u"I should check on her today to see if she\u2019s feeling any better.": u"Eu deveria ir v\u00ea-la hoje para saber se est\u00e1 se sentindo melhor.",
        u"I should go and check.": u"Devo ir verificar.",
        u"I should watch over you more often.": u"Eu deveria cuidar mais de voc\u00ea.",
        u"I shouldn\u2019t be so selfish\u2026 If I\u2019m not going to do it for myself, I should at least do it for you and my dad since you\u2019ve both supported me for so long.": u"Eu n\u00e3o deveria ser t\u00e3o ego\u00edsta\u2026 Se n\u00e3o vou fazer isso por mim, deveria pelo menos fazer por voc\u00ea e pelo meu pai, j\u00e1 que voc\u00eas dois me apoiaram por tanto tempo.",
        u"I shouldn\u2019t make everyone else pay the price just for my own desires\u2026 ": u"Eu n\u00e3o deveria fazer todos os outros pagarem o pre\u00e7o apenas pelos meus pr\u00f3prios desejos\u2026 ",
        u"I should\u2019ve dragged Aiden with me, he\u2019d know what to do to fix this!": u"Eu deveria ter arrastado Aiden comigo, ele saberia como consertar isto!",
        u"I should\u2019ve expected this considering the rest of the hotel, but this place is incredible\u2026": u"Eu j\u00e1 deveria esperar por isso considerando o resto do hotel, mas este lugar \u00e9 incr\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"I should\u2019ve expected this considering the rest of the hotel, but this place is just as extravagant\u2026": u"Eu deveria ter esperado isso considerando o resto do hotel, mas este lugar \u00e9 igualmente extravagante\u2026",
        u"I spent most of the night hopping from client to client, and man were they thirsty! ": u"Passei a maior parte da noite indo de cliente em cliente, e cara, como eles estavam sedentos! ",
        u"I spoke with Dad over the phone this morning too\u2026 He doesn\u2019t plan on coming back yet but he was apologizing for leaving everything behind.": u"Tamb\u00e9m falei com o Pai por telefone esta manh\u00e3\u2026 Ele ainda n\u00e3o pretende voltar, mas pediu desculpas por ter deixado tudo para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"I started hating myself for letting Dad go\u2026 And for being the reason he had to suffer his whole life\u2026": u"Comecei a me odiar por ter deixado o Pai partir\u2026 E por achar que eu era o motivo de ele ter sofrido a vida inteira\u2026",
        u"I started taking what I had left for granted, not realizing how much people around me cared.": u"Comecei a n\u00e3o dar valor ao que ainda tinha, sem perceber o quanto as pessoas ao meu redor se importavam comigo.",
        u"I still can\u2019t believe that someone like Mr. Clermont really sponsored Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Ainda n\u00e3o consigo acreditar que algu\u00e9m como o senhor Clermont realmente patrocinou o Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"I still do, but between the last term and this project, there\u2019s not really been any chance.": u"Ainda fa\u00e7o isso, mas entre a \u00faltima temporada e este projeto, realmente n\u00e3o tive oportunidade.",
        u"I still don\u2019t understand how you got away with being naked in the kitchen all those other times. I\u2019m pretty sure that\u2019s a sanitary code violation.": u"Ainda n\u00e3o entendo como voc\u00ea se safou ficando pelado na cozinha todas aquelas vezes. Tenho quase certeza de que isso viola as normas sanit\u00e1rias.",
        u"I still feel guilty about all this\u2026 And you even had to make the call, too\u2026": u"Ainda me sinto culpado por tudo isso\u2026 E voc\u00ea ainda teve que fazer a liga\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I still have no clue what you\u2019re trying to say\u2026": u"Ainda n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia do que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 tentando dizer\u2026",
        u"I still look up to you, just like I did back then, sir\u2026": u"Eu ainda admiro o senhor, assim como naquela \u00e9poca\u2026",
        u"I still need ingredients, you stupid Wolfboy! I didn\u2019t expect us to be locked up inside for so long.": u"Eu ainda preciso de ingredientes, seu Garoto-Lobo idiota! N\u00e3o esperava que fic\u00e1ssemos presos dentro de casa por tanto tempo.",
        u"I support you regardless. And I think that applies to the rest of us here at Camp Buddy as well.": u"Eu apoio voc\u00ea de qualquer forma. E acho que isso tamb\u00e9m vale para todos n\u00f3s aqui no Camp Buddy.",
        u"I suppose I could whip us something up~": u"Acho que posso preparar alguma coisinha para n\u00f3s~",
        u"I suppose I should go and report to Mr. Clermont that everyone departed safely.": u"Acho que devo ir informar ao Sr. Clermont que todos partiram em seguran\u00e7a.",
        u"I suppose I\u2019ll help as well. It IS my stuff after all.": u"Acho que tamb\u00e9m vou ajudar. Afinal, s\u00e3o as MINHAS coisas.",
        u"I suppose it was alright. I taught Yuri a thing or two about makeup since she clearly knows nothing.": u"Acho que foi razo\u00e1vel. Ensinei uma coisa ou outra sobre maquiagem para a Yuri, j\u00e1 que claramente ela n\u00e3o entende nada.",
        u"I suppose you work better during those hours, but isn\u2019t that a little\u2026 unhealthy?": u"Suponho que voc\u00ea trabalhe melhor nesse hor\u00e1rio, mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 um pouco\u2026 prejudicial \u00e0 sa\u00fade?",
        u"I swear I thought it was something like pizza\u2026": u"Eu juro que achei que fosse algo parecido com pizza\u2026",
        u"I swear this godforsaken camp will be the end of me! I\u2019m surrounded by idiots! ": u"Juro que este acampamento esquecido por Deus ser\u00e1 meu fim! Estou cercada de idiotas!",
        u"I swear, I\u2019m sweating bullets in this shirt! ": u"Juro, estou suando em bicas com esta camisa! ",
        u"I swept the shed spotless too. Never realized there was so much space in there without all this stuff!": u"Tamb\u00e9m varri o galp\u00e3o at\u00e9 deix\u00e1-lo impec\u00e1vel. Nunca percebi quanto espa\u00e7o havia ali sem toda essa tralha!",
        u"I think I had something different in mind when you guys said you were going to work on my body\u2026 ": u"Acho que eu tinha outra coisa em mente quando voc\u00eas disseram que iam trabalhar meu corpo\u2026 ",
        u"I think I have a new kink\u2026": u"Acho que descobri um fetiche novo\u2026",
        u"I think I may have upset her even more than when we were with Mr. Clermont.": u"Acho que talvez eu tenha deixado ela ainda mais irritada do que quando est\u00e1vamos com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"I think I understand now\u2026 You don\u2019t deserve to suffer like that again, just because we aren\u2019t satisfied with what we have\u2026": u"Acho que entendo agora\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o merece sofrer assim novamente s\u00f3 porque n\u00e3o estamos satisfeitos com o que j\u00e1 temos\u2026",
        u"I think I\u2019m partly to blame for that. The time I left you in charge on your own without proper guidance caused a far greater burden on you.": u"Acho que tenho parte da culpa. O per\u00edodo em que o deixei sozinho no comando, sem a orienta\u00e7\u00e3o adequada, imp\u00f4s a voc\u00ea um fardo muito maior.",
        u"I think I\u2019ve proven how skilled I am over the last few months with actual results.": u"Acho que provei o quanto sou competente nos \u00faltimos meses com resultados concretos.",
        u"I think even Sir Goro and Yuri are getting overwhelmed, so I stepped in a little bit on the managerial side.": u"Acho que at\u00e9 o Sr. Goro e Yuri est\u00e3o ficando sobrecarregados, ent\u00e3o comecei a ajudar um pouco na parte administrativa.",
        u"I think everyone\u2019s at the mess hall having breakfast. Maybe we should take the chance to talk about it before work begins today.": u"Acho que todos est\u00e3o no refeit\u00f3rio tomando caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3. Talvez dev\u00eassemos aproveitar para conversar sobre isso antes do trabalho come\u00e7ar hoje.",
        u"I think everyone\u2019s at the mess hall having breakfast. Maybe we should take the chance to talk before work begins today.": u"Acho que todos est\u00e3o no refeit\u00f3rio tomando caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3. Talvez dev\u00eassemos aproveitar para conversar antes do trabalho come\u00e7ar hoje.",
        u"I think everything you did was worth it, sir.": u"Acho que tudo o que o senhor fez valeu a pena.",
        u"I think he\u2019s in his office with Mr. Clermont.": u"Acho que ele est\u00e1 no escrit\u00f3rio com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"I think he\u2019s lost.": u"Acho que ele est\u00e1 perdido.",
        u"I think it would be a lot better if you used the oven and cooked it a bit longer, since the dough you made is a little thick.": u"Acho que ficaria muito melhor se usasse o forno e assasse por mais tempo, pois a massa que fez \u00e9 um pouco grossa.",
        u"I think it would be a waste of time to stop, especially since we\u2019ll have already built up our momentum by then.": u"Acho que seria desperd\u00edcio de tempo parar, especialmente porque j\u00e1 teremos adquirido ritmo at\u00e9 l\u00e1.",
        u"I think it\u2019d be fun to drive around somewhere just exploring!": u"Acho que seria divertido dirigir por algum lugar simplesmente explorando!",
        u"I think it\u2019ll be fun! It\u2019s my first time actually joining you guys camping, after all!": u"Acho que vai ser divertido! Afinal, \u00e9 a primeira vez que acampo de verdade com voc\u00eas!",
        u"I think it\u2019s fine to let Yoichi do his thing. I mean, he\u2019ll get a lot more work done this way.": u"Acho melhor deixar o Yoichi fazer do jeito dele. Assim ele vai acabar trabalhando muito mais.",
        u"I think it\u2019s kinda funny to get caught~": u"Acho at\u00e9 engra\u00e7ado ser pego~",
        u"I think it\u2019s too late for that, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Acho que \u00e9 tarde demais para isso, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I think she genuinely wants to help me out, but that evaluation a while ago really seemed unnecessarily harsh.": u"Acho que ela realmente quer me ajudar, mas aquela avalia\u00e7\u00e3o pareceu desnecessariamente severa.",
        u"I think so too.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m acho.",
        u"I think so too. Aiden could really make it big out there.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m acho. Aiden could really make it big out there.",
        u"I think that defeats the purpose. If Sir Goro sticks around, it would be in his nature to assist the camp in every way he can. ": u"Acho que isso acabaria com o prop\u00f3sito. Se o Sr. Goro continuar por aqui, ser\u00e1 da natureza dele ajudar o acampamento de todas as formas poss\u00edveis. ",
        u"I think that should be everything\u2026": u"Acho que isso \u00e9 tudo\u2026",
        u"I think that\u2019s ratatouille.": u"Acho que isso \u00e9 ratatouille.",
        u"I think that\u2019s the last of it, right guys?": u"Acho que isso \u00e9 tudo, certo, pessoal?",
        u"I think that\u2019s the last sack. We can take it from here.": u"Acho que esse \u00e9 o \u00faltimo saco. Podemos cuidar do resto daqui.",
        u"I think the best way for me to improve would be to work in his department!": u"Acho que a melhor maneira de eu melhorar seria trabalhar no departamento dele!",
        u"I think the first thing we should look into is her professional profile\u2026": u"Acho que a primeira coisa que devemos procurar \u00e9 o perfil profissional dela\u2026",
        u"I think the puppies might like you more than me actually!": u"Na verdade, acho que os filhotes talvez gostem mais do senhor do que de mim!",
        u"I think the snow cover is really pretty, though...": u"Mas acho a camada de neve muito bonita...",
        u"I think these are what you\u2019re looking for.": u"Acho que isto \u00e9 o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 procurando.",
        u"I think they put some kind of lavender scent in it\u2026": u"Acho que colocaram algum tipo de ess\u00eancia de lavanda nela\u2026",
        u"I think they\u2019re way more than finished.": u"Acho que eles j\u00e1 terminaram mais do que o suficiente.",
        u"I think this is a good start if we\u2019re really planning on easing the work away from you!": u"Acho que este \u00e9 um bom come\u00e7o se realmente queremos diminuir sua carga de trabalho!",
        u"I think this is the first time in a while that you\u2019ve done a hands-on activity with the scouts, isn\u2019t it, sir?": u"Acho que faz bastante tempo desde a \u00faltima vez que o senhor participou de uma atividade pr\u00e1tica com os escoteiros, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"I think this was meant to happen all along. And it\u2019s actually for the best, in a way we didn\u2019t realize before.": u"Acho que isso estava destinado a acontecer. E, na verdade, \u00e9 melhor assim, de uma forma que n\u00e3o perceb\u00edamos antes.",
        u"I think understanding the camp\u2019s origins would really help me with my work here.": u"Acho que entender as origens do acampamento ajudaria muito no meu trabalho aqui.",
        u"I think we broke him.": u"Acho que quebramos ele.",
        u"I think we can all agree that each department has had its own communication issues that can be improved upon.": u"Acho que todos concordamos que cada departamento teve seus pr\u00f3prios problemas de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o, que podem ser melhorados.",
        u"I think we can all agree that this is just a simple misunderstanding that\u2019s been blown out of proportion.": u"Acho que todos podemos concordar que isto \u00e9 apenas um simples mal-entendido que tomou propor\u00e7\u00f5es maiores do que deveria.",
        u"I think we could use some \u2018Liquid Viagra\u2019!": u"Acho que poder\u00edamos tomar um \u2018Viagra L\u00edquido\u2019!",
        u"I think we settled it in the best way possible, Goro. Now I\u2019m glad it\u2019ll finally be off your chest!": u"Acho que resolvemos da melhor forma poss\u00edvel, Goro. Fico feliz que finalmente tenha tirado esse peso das costas!",
        u"I think we settled it in the best way possible, Yuri. ": u"Acho que resolvemos isso da melhor forma poss\u00edvel, Yuri. ",
        u"I think what I\u2019ve witnessed here is a testament to the true Camp Buddy spirit!": u"Acho que o que presenciei aqui \u00e9 uma verdadeira demonstra\u00e7\u00e3o do esp\u00edrito do Camp Buddy!",
        u"I think you forgot to tell me your name!": u"Acho que voc\u00ea esqueceu de dizer seu nome!",
        u"I think you look cute. I like your legs.": u"Acho que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fofo. Gosto das suas pernas.",
        u"I think you misunderstood\u2026": u"Acho que voc\u00ea entendeu errado\u2026",
        u"I think you read that as grass\u2026": u"Acho que voc\u00ea leu isso como grass\u2026",
        u"I think you settled it in the best way possible, Goro. Now I\u2019m glad it\u2019ll finally be off your chest.": u"Acho que resolveu isso da melhor forma poss\u00edvel, Goro. Fico feliz que finalmente tenha tirado esse peso das costas.",
        u"I think you\u2019d like a \u2018Slippery Nipple!\u2019": u"Acho que gostaria de um \u2018Slippery Nipple\u2019!",
        u"I think you\u2019re super cute and charming, Lloyd! You have the blessing of eternal youth coursing through your veins! ": u"Eu acho voc\u00ea superfofo e charmoso, Lloyd! A b\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o da juventude eterna corre em suas veias! ",
        u"I think\u2026 I owe you all an explanation at least\u2026": u"Acho que\u2026 pelo menos devo uma explica\u00e7\u00e3o a todos voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"I thought I belonged there\u2026 but I was wrong\u2026": u"Achei que pertencia \u00e0quele lugar\u2026 mas estava errada\u2026",
        u"I thought I heard something else\u2026 I\u2019m still sort of groggy\u2026": u"Pensei ter ouvido outra coisa\u2026 Ainda estou meio sonolento\u2026",
        u"I thought I told you to wait for your turn. And what\u2019s with those tears in your eyes?  ": u"Achei que tinha mandado voc\u00ea esperar sua vez. E o que s\u00e3o essas l\u00e1grimas nos seus olhos?  ",
        u"I thought I was dreaming, Yoshi\u2026": u"Achei que estivesse sonhando, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I thought I\u2019d find you here\u2026!": u"Achei que encontraria voc\u00ea aqui\u2026!",
        u"I thought about wearing it to the party, but Yuri didn\u2019t want anyone to see me like this.": u"Pensei em us\u00e1-la na festa, mas Yuri n\u00e3o queria que ningu\u00e9m me visse assim.",
        u"I thought all along that Aiden stayed at Camp Buddy until his dad passed away.": u"Esse tempo todo achei que Aiden tivesse ficado no Camp Buddy at\u00e9 o pai dele falecer.",
        u"I thought greeting thirty men would be fun, but it was so much more work than I expected.": u"Achei que receber trinta homens seria divertido, mas deu muito mais trabalho do que eu esperava.",
        u"I thought he was going to pass out.": u"Achei que ele fosse desmaiar.",
        u"I thought if I held myself to a high standard, that I\u2019d be able to fit in and be someone important again.": u"Achei que, se exigisse muito de mim mesma, conseguiria me encaixar e voltar a ser algu\u00e9m importante.",
        u"I thought it might be a bit of a good luck charm for today!": u"Pensei que poderia servir como um amuleto da sorte para hoje!",
        u"I thought it was just her usual entitlement, but she does come off desperate and craving to be treated like royalty\u2026": u"Achei que fosse apenas a arrog\u00e2ncia habitual dela, mas realmente parece desesperada para ser tratada como realeza\u2026",
        u"I thought it would be best if I concentrate my efforts on the construction and staff management departments.": u"Achei melhor concentrar meus esfor\u00e7os nos setores de constru\u00e7\u00e3o e administra\u00e7\u00e3o da equipe.",
        u"I thought it would be best if we concentrated our efforts and made one perfect Camp Buddy.": u"Achei que seria melhor concentrarmos nossos esfor\u00e7os e criarmos um Camp Buddy perfeito.",
        u"I thought it would be best to head over straight away and assess what could be done, as well as bring some snow blowers to assist with your cleanup.": u"Achei melhor vir imediatamente avaliar o que poderia ser feito e tamb\u00e9m trazer alguns sopradores de neve para ajudar na limpeza.",
        u"I thought it\u2019d be a great way to welcome you back for the trip!": u"Achei que seria uma \u00f3tima maneira de dar as boas-vindas ao senhor nesta viagem!",
        u"I thought it\u2019s what we\u2019ve been fighting for this entire time\u2026!  ": u"Achei que era por isso que estivemos lutando todo esse tempo\u2026!  ",
        u"I thought nobody was in here since the cabin was empty and the bathroom was unlocked\u2026!": u"Achei que n\u00e3o tinha ningu\u00e9m aqui porque a cabana estava vazia e o banheiro estava destrancado\u2026!",
        u"I thought she would listen to you at least\u2026 ": u"Achei que pelo menos ouviria voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"I thought so.": u"Foi o que pensei.",
        u"I thought that you needed a quick and concise inspection\u2026": u"Eu pensei que voc\u00ea precisava de uma inspe\u00e7\u00e3o r\u00e1pida e objetiva\u2026",
        u"I thought there\u2019s no time like the present to pick up some skills!": u"Pensei que n\u00e3o havia momento melhor que agora para aprender algumas habilidades!",
        u"I thought to myself\u2026 I was already lucky enough to have met you\u2026 ": u"Eu pensava comigo mesmo\u2026 J\u00e1 tinha tido sorte suficiente s\u00f3 por ter conhecido voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"I thought we could at least wait to get back to camp before we talked about this\u2026": u"Achei que ao menos poder\u00edamos esperar at\u00e9 voltarmos ao acampamento antes de falar sobre isso\u2026",
        u"I thought we were just having a regular dinner, but you came out there with that really fancy dish.": u"Achei que ter\u00edamos apenas um jantar normal, mas voc\u00ea apareceu com aquele prato super sofisticado.",
        u"I thought we were talking about cooking\u2026 ": u"Achei que estiv\u00e9ssemos falando de culin\u00e1ria\u2026 ",
        u"I thought we\u2019d be stuck in these sticky clothes for the rest of the day!": u"Achei que ficar\u00edamos presos nessas roupas grudentas pelo resto do dia!",
        u"I thought you believed in me, Goro\u2026": u"Achei que voc\u00ea acreditava em mim, Goro\u2026",
        u"I thought you could rely on me, Goro\u2026": u"Achei que voc\u00ea pudesse confiar em mim, Goro\u2026",
        u"I thought you liked my fanfics?! ": u"Achei que voc\u00ea tivesse gostado das minhas fanfics?! ",
        u"I thought you told me that I was already good enough\u2026?": u"Achei que voc\u00ea tivesse dito que eu j\u00e1 era bom o bastante\u2026?",
        u"I thought you were different. I thought you accepted me for who I was. But you were just like everyone else!": u"Achei que voc\u00ea fosse diferente. Achei que me aceitasse como eu era. Mas voc\u00ea era igual a todos os outros!",
        u"I thought you were serious.": u"Achei que o senhor estava falando s\u00e9rio.",
        u"I thought you\u2019d never ask!": u"Pensei que nunca fosse pedir!",
        u"I told Mr. Clermont I would be arriving ahead of schedule. The best inspections are done unexpectedly, after all.": u"Avisei ao Sr. Clermont que chegaria antes do previsto. Afinal, as melhores inspe\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o feitas de surpresa.",
        u"I told Yoshi this last night, but the truth is I\u2019ve been feeling a little out of place during our stay here.": u"Contei isso ao Yoshi ontem \u00e0 noite, mas a verdade \u00e9 que tenho me sentido um pouco deslocado durante nossa estadia aqui.",
        u"I told him I was interested in the whole thing\u2026 and then he told me the details\u2026": u"Disse que estava interessado na proposta\u2026 e ent\u00e3o ele me contou os detalhes\u2026",
        u"I told him that too, but he\u2019s determined to get fit for some cosplay!": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m disse isso, mas ele est\u00e1 determinado a entrar em forma para fazer cosplay!",
        u"I told you all, I\u2019m fine already! I\u2019m not helpless!": u"J\u00e1 disse a todos voc\u00eas, eu estou bem! N\u00e3o sou indefesa!",
        u"I told you it was gonna be hot in here! Just do like me!": u"Eu disse que faria calor aqui! Fa\u00e7a como eu!",
        u"I told you it\u2019s no use! Let\u2019s just stay out of it! ": u"Eu disse que n\u00e3o adianta! Vamos apenas ficar fora disso! ",
        u"I told you to let me carry them for you\u2026": u"Eu disse para deixar que eu carregasse para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I told you, he\u2019s gonna be fine, Yoshi. He\u2019ll be back to normal tomorrow morning like nothing happened.": u"Eu j\u00e1 falei, ele vai ficar bem, Yoshi. Amanh\u00e3 de manh\u00e3 vai estar normal de novo, como se nada tivesse acontecido.",
        u"I told you, stop calling me a bitch!!! ": u"Eu j\u00e1 falei para parar de me chamar de vadia!!! ",
        u"I totally get why it\u2019s so hard to even bring something like that up, though\u2026 \u2019Cause sometimes we get too afraid, like what if the other person isn\u2019t thinking the same, and we\u2019re just risking what we already have?": u"Mas eu entendo perfeitamente por que \u00e9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil tocar nesse assunto\u2026 \u00c0s vezes ficamos com medo: e se a outra pessoa n\u00e3o sentir o mesmo e estivermos apenas colocando em risco o que j\u00e1 temos?",
        u"I tried calling him and his phone was just ringing\u2026 Maybe he\u2019s in a meeting?": u"Tentei ligar, mas o telefone s\u00f3 chamava\u2026 Talvez esteja em uma reuni\u00e3o?",
        u"I tried numbing myself from any emotion, convinced that I had to stay strong and tough, always\u2026": u"Tentei me tornar insens\u00edvel a qualquer emo\u00e7\u00e3o, convencido de que precisava ser sempre forte e dur\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I tried to change my ways, and only wanted to be a good husband and father. I did everything in my power to keep us together.": u"Tentei mudar meu jeito e s\u00f3 queria ser um bom marido e pai. Fiz tudo ao meu alcance para nos manter unidos.",
        u"I truly regret that my actions led you all to feel that way.": u"Lamento sinceramente que minhas atitudes tenham feito todos voc\u00eas se sentirem assim.",
        u"I trust his judgment when it comes to Camp Buddy, and I believe we worked as best as we could.": u"Confio no julgamento dele quando se trata do Camp Buddy e acredito que trabalhamos da melhor maneira poss\u00edvel.",
        u"I trust you with the camp.": u"Confio o acampamento a voc\u00ea.",
        u"I understand how Aiden did it, since I see him working out pretty regularly. But I wasn\u2019t aware that you trained as well, Yoshinori.": u"Entendo como Aiden conseguiu, pois o vejo se exercitar com bastante frequ\u00eancia. Mas eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m treinava, Yoshinori.",
        u"I understand now all the concerns your team expressed, and quite frankly this could have been avoided if the screening had been done properly.": u"Agora entendo todas as preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es que sua equipe expressou e, francamente, isso poderia ter sido evitado se a sele\u00e7\u00e3o tivesse sido feita corretamente.",
        u"I understand that it\u2019s a sudden offer, and a rather intimidating prospect, so please take your time to consider!": u"Entendo que \u00e9 uma oferta repentina e uma perspectiva bastante intimidadora, ent\u00e3o pense com calma!",
        u"I understand that we\u2019re quite far behind when it comes to adapting to the digital age, so we\u2019re counting on your knowledge and recommendations to make the necessary improvements.": u"Entendo que estamos bastante atrasados na adapta\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 era digital, portanto contamos com seu conhecimento e suas recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es para realizar as melhorias necess\u00e1rias.",
        u"I understand that what we just uncovered solidifies her removal from the project, but\u2026 you\u2019ve seen how things turn out if we let ourselves get carried away.": u"Entendo que o que acabamos de descobrir praticamente confirma que ela deve ser retirada do projeto, mas\u2026 voc\u00eas viram o que acontece quando nos deixamos levar.",
        u"I understand we\u2019re in a bit of a situation here?": u"Pelo que entendi, estamos enfrentando uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o complicada?",
        u"I understand why you\u2019d be afraid of something like this, but I think it'll be worth it in the long run!": u"Entendo por que algo assim deixaria voc\u00ea com medo, mas acho que no longo prazo vai valer a pena!",
        u"I understand why you\u2019re upset, and you have every right to be.": u"Entendo por que est\u00e1 chateado, e voc\u00ea tem todo o direito de estar.",
        u"I understand your concerns, Yuri. But we have to work together for now and stay professional, especially since she was sent directly by our sponsor.": u"Entendo suas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es, Yuri. Mas, por enquanto, precisamos trabalhar juntos e manter o profissionalismo, especialmente porque ela foi enviada diretamente pelo patrocinador.",
        u"I understand your decision to remove Emilia as our inspector.": u"Entendo sua decis\u00e3o de remover Emilia do cargo de inspetora.",
        u"I understand your decision to remove Ms.  Komarova as our inspector.": u"Entendo sua decis\u00e3o de retirar a Srta. Komarova do cargo de inspetora.",
        u"I understand you\u2019re feeling pressured about the whole thing, but I promise that you\u2019ll be fine!": u"Entendo que esteja se sentindo pressionado com tudo isso, mas prometo que vai ficar tudo bem!",
        u"I understand, Aiden\u2026": u"Eu entendo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I understand, Aiden\u2026 I was stupid to not have realized that\u2026": u"Eu entendo, Aiden\u2026 Fui idiota por n\u00e3o ter percebido isso\u2026",
