        u"I want to get along with everyone. But unlike Lloyd, I can\u2019t keep a conversation going.": u"Quero me dar bem com todos. Mas, ao contr\u00e1rio do Lloyd, n\u00e3o consigo manter uma conversa.",
        u"I want to live the rest of my life with you\u2026 To be partners in heart and soul\u2026": u"Quero passar o resto da minha vida com voc\u00ea\u2026 Quero que sejamos parceiros de corpo e alma\u2026",
