        u"I was able to finish it! ": u"Consegui terminar! ",
        u"I was actually curious, so I looked this restaurant up online before I got here\u2026 and it\u2019s crazy how the food looked like art on a plate\u2026": u"Eu estava curioso, ent\u00e3o pesquisei este restaurante na internet antes de vir\u2026 e \u00e9 incr\u00edvel como a comida parecia uma obra de arte no prato\u2026",
        u"I was afraid of what would happen if I showed up empty-handed, but you never looked down on me or judged me.": u"Eu tinha medo do que aconteceria se aparecesse de m\u00e3os vazias, mas voc\u00ea nunca me menosprezou nem me julgou.",
        u"I was always so amazed at how he could turn the simplest and cheapest stuff into something amazing, so I got interested in it too.": u"Eu sempre ficava impressionado com a forma como ele transformava os ingredientes mais simples e baratos em algo incr\u00edvel, ent\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m comecei a me interessar por cozinha.",
        u"I was busy having mind-blowing sex with you, sorry~": u"Eu estava ocupado fazendo um sexo incr\u00edvel com voc\u00ea, desculpa~",
        u"I was desperate to get out of the hole I was left in by my parents. ": u"Eu estava desesperada para sair do buraco em que meus pais me deixaram. ",
        u"I was discussing with Yuri about moving forward\u2026 and that includes my position here at the camp.": u"Eu estava conversando com Yuri sobre seguir em frente\u2026 e isso inclui minha posi\u00e7\u00e3o aqui no acampamento.",
        u"I was expecting she\u2019d throw a fit at me for interrupting, considering our debacle last night.": u"Eu esperava que ela tivesse um ataque comigo por interromp\u00ea-la, considerando a confus\u00e3o de ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"I was getting worried you\u2019d be sore from all that beating.": u"Eu estava come\u00e7ando a me preocupar que voc\u00ea ficaria dolorido depois de apanhar tanto.",
        u"I was going to forgive her\u2026 and try to work things out so we could still be a family\u2026 but I shouldn\u2019t force her anymore.": u"Eu ia perdo\u00e1-la\u2026 e tentar resolver as coisas para que ainda pud\u00e9ssemos ser uma fam\u00edlia\u2026 mas n\u00e3o devo mais for\u00e7\u00e1-la.",
        u"I was going to send him off, but I still have to work on this laundry.": u"Eu ia me despedir dele, mas ainda preciso cuidar dessa roupa.",
        u"I was honestly about to say something, but I\u2019m glad Yoshinori stepped in before I did. If I had, I would\u2019ve been much more blunt with her.": u"Sinceramente, eu estava prestes a dizer alguma coisa, mas fico feliz que Yoshinori tenha intervindo antes. Se fosse eu, teria sido muito mais direto com ela.",
        u"I was hoping that\u2019d happen\u2026 *cough* I-I don\u2019t mean our project getting cancelled\u2026!": u"Eu estava torcendo para isso acontecer\u2026 *tosse* N-N\u00e3o quis dizer o projeto ser cancelado\u2026!",
        u"I was hoping you would feel the same way once you heard my reason\u2026 but I still should\u2019ve told you.": u"Eu esperava que voc\u00ea sentisse o mesmo depois de ouvir meu motivo\u2026 mas ainda assim deveria ter conversado com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I was just chopping some wood over here. You need anything?": u"Eu estava cortando um pouco de lenha aqui. Precisa de alguma coisa?",
        u"I was just happy to be around you again, and I was afraid to lose what we had when we were younger.": u"Eu s\u00f3 estava feliz por estar perto de voc\u00ea de novo e tinha medo de perder o que t\u00ednhamos quando \u00e9ramos mais novos.",
        u"I was just passing by and happened to see you here.": u"Eu estava passando e vi voc\u00ea aqui.",
        u"I was just thinking about how much Camp Buddy has changed over the years\u2026": u"Eu s\u00f3 estava pensando no quanto o Camp Buddy mudou ao longo dos anos\u2026",
        u"I was lost for guidance, yet I couldn\u2019t bring myself to approach you, thinking that it would only burden you more\u2026 ": u"Eu estava sem orienta\u00e7\u00e3o, mas n\u00e3o conseguia me aproximar de voc\u00ea, achando que isso s\u00f3 colocaria mais peso sobre seus ombros\u2026 ",
        u"I was made aware that the annex area beside the camp was meant for upgrades. This was the biggest job that they suggested.": u"Fui informado de que a \u00e1rea anexa ao lado do acampamento era destinada a melhorias. Esta foi a maior obra sugerida.",
        u"I was more badass than you!": u"Eu era mais dur\u00e3o que voc\u00ea!",
