        u"I was planning to head over to the obstacle course and clean the place up.": u"Eu estava planejando ir at\u00e9 a pista de obst\u00e1culos para limpar o lugar.",
        u"I was pleasantly surprised to find out Mr. Clermont arranged a fine dining experience for us tonight! Truly such a treat~!": u"Fiquei agradavelmente surpresa ao descobrir que o Sr. Clermont organizou uma experi\u00eancia gastron\u00f4mica requintada para n\u00f3s esta noite! Que mimo~!",
        u"I was popping something else.": u"Eu estava estourando outra coisa.",
        u"I was pretty shocked at how different and mentally taxing management could be.": u"Fiquei bastante surpreso com o quanto a administra\u00e7\u00e3o podia ser diferente e mentalmente desgastante.",
