        u"I was so focused on trying to encourage you about the offer, even though I knew it was bothering you.": u"Eu estava t\u00e3o focado em tentar incentivar voc\u00ea a aceitar a proposta, mesmo sabendo que aquilo estava incomodando voc\u00ea.",
        u"I was so nervous that I\u2019d screw up dealing with so many new people. But you really made me feel warm and welcome from the get-go!": u"Eu estava muito nervoso com a possibilidade de estragar tudo ao lidar com tantas pessoas novas. Mas voc\u00ea realmente me fez sentir acolhido desde o in\u00edcio!",
        u"I was surprised when you woke me up this morning and our bags were already packed, and all you\u2019d say was that we were driving somewhere!": u"Fiquei surpreso quando voc\u00ea me acordou hoje de manh\u00e3 e nossas malas j\u00e1 estavam prontas, e tudo que dizia era que \u00edamos de carro para algum lugar!",
        u"I was taking away an opportunity not only from the camp, but from you\u2026 all for my own selfish reasons\u2026   ": u"Eu estava tirando uma oportunidade n\u00e3o apenas do acampamento, mas tamb\u00e9m de voc\u00ea\u2026 tudo por motivos ego\u00edstas\u2026   ",
