        u"I was there from that very first term when you two became close friends \u2013 it was something I\u2019ve always observed and admired.": u"Eu estava l\u00e1 desde aquela primeira temporada em que voc\u00eas se tornaram grandes amigos \u2014 foi algo que sempre observei e admirei.",
        u"I was tired of us not having a label and being all secretive of our relationship around everyone.": u"Eu estava cansado de n\u00e3o termos uma defini\u00e7\u00e3o e de escondermos nosso relacionamento de todo mundo.",
        u"I was trying my best to control my anger\u2026 But in the end, I couldn\u2019t\u2026": u"Eu estava fazendo o m\u00e1ximo para controlar minha raiva\u2026 Mas, no fim, n\u00e3o consegui\u2026",
        u"I was trying to moderate our drinks, but I still lost count in the end\u2026": u"Eu estava tentando controlar o quanto a gente bebia, mas no fim at\u00e9 eu perdi a conta\u2026",
