        u"I was worried he\u2019d be stressing out about that commitment to Mr. Clermont to make up with Emilia, or other random stuff like that just now. ": u"Eu estava preocupada que ele estivesse se estressando com aquele compromisso com o Sr. Clermont de fazer as pazes com Emilia, ou alguma outra coisa aleat\u00f3ria dessas. ",
        u"I was worried you might not enjoy it here as much because of that, knowing how you prefer simpler things. ": u"Fiquei preocupado que talvez n\u00e3o gostasse tanto daqui por causa disso, sabendo que prefere coisas mais simples. ",
