        u"I will be giving general feedback on each department I had an issue with.": u"Apresentarei uma avalia\u00e7\u00e3o geral de cada setor em que encontrei problemas.",
        u"I will be taking over in Goro\u2019s place for the time being\u2026": u"Por enquanto, assumirei o lugar de Goro\u2026",
        u"I will come back to Camp Buddy\u2026 Once I become a professional chef\u2026": u"Eu vou voltar para o Camp Buddy\u2026 Assim que me tornar um chef profissional\u2026",
        u"I will do my best to make everything right from hereon.": u"Farei o poss\u00edvel para corrigir tudo daqui em diante.",
        u"I will fulfill my duties until the end of our commitment\u2026 and count on you wholeheartedly for the future, Yoshinori\u2026  ": u"Cumprirei minhas responsabilidades at\u00e9 o fim do nosso compromisso\u2026 e confiarei plenamente em voc\u00ea para o futuro, Yoshinori\u2026  ",
        u"I will help as well.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m vou ajudar.",
        u"I will let you take the front end of the march, and I will watch over your side to make sure everyone follows your lead. What do you think?": u"Deixarei que assuma a frente da marcha e ficarei ao seu lado para garantir que todos sigam a sua lideran\u00e7a. O que acha?",
        u"I will make the needed adjustments based on the updated scope we discussed today, and I\u2019ll head there tomorrow to claim all the permits.": u"Farei os ajustes necess\u00e1rios com base no escopo atualizado que discutimos hoje e irei at\u00e9 l\u00e1 amanh\u00e3 buscar todas as licen\u00e7as.",
        u"I will make up for everything, mark my words! And I\u2014": u"Vou compensar por tudo, podem acreditar! E eu\u2014",
        u"I will miss you though, Aiden\u2026 ": u"Mas vou sentir sua falta, Aiden\u2026 ",
        u"I will never agree to being the subject of a \u2018fellatio conga line\u2019, especially with a bunch of strangers! ": u"Jamais aceitarei ser o centro de uma \u2018fila de fela\u00e7\u00e3o\u2019, principalmente com um bando de desconhecidos! ",
        u"I will still finish my commitment to this project, but after that I\u2019m not sure\u2026": u"Ainda vou cumprir meu compromisso com este projeto, mas depois disso n\u00e3o tenho certeza\u2026",
        u"I will. Thank you again.": u"Vou descansar. Obrigada novamente.",
        u"I wish I could! Trust me I tried, but that ring\u2019s stuck on there!": u"Eu queria! Acredite, tentei, mas aquele anel ficou preso!",
        u"I wish I could've helped him more.": u"Gostaria de ter ajudado mais.",
        u"I wish I had a surprise for you, but you really caught me off guard when you said we were going out today. ": u"Queria ter uma surpresa para voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m, mas voc\u00ea realmente me pegou desprevenido quando disse que sair\u00edamos hoje. ",
        u"I wish I had that same kind of confidence and ability to take charge when needed.": u"Eu gostaria de ter essa mesma confian\u00e7a e capacidade de assumir o comando quando necess\u00e1rio.",
        u"I wish I wasn\u2019t such an introvert...": u"Queria n\u00e3o ser t\u00e3o introvertido\u2026",
        u"I wish I\u2019d brought my camera to take a picture of this\u2026": u"Queria ter trazido minha c\u00e2mera para tirar uma foto disso\u2026",
        u"I wish I\u2019d had the courage to ask you exactly what happened when we were apart.  ": u"Eu gostaria de ter tido coragem de perguntar exatamente o que aconteceu enquanto estivemos separados.  ",
        u"I wish I\u2019d had the courage to ask you how exactly things went down when we were apart.": u"Queria ter tido coragem de perguntar exatamente o que aconteceu enquanto estivemos separados.",
        u"I wish he could stay.": u"Gostaria que ele pudesse ficar.",
        u"I wish that were true, we\u2019ve known each other for so long.": u"Queria que fosse verdade, n\u00f3s nos conhecemos h\u00e1 tanto tempo.",
        u"I wish you were a scout too, but this works just as well! As long as we get to hang out and have fun together!": u"Eu queria que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m fosse escoteiro, mas assim funciona igualmente bem! O importante \u00e9 podermos passar tempo e nos divertir juntos!",
        u"I wish.": u"Quem me dera.",
        u"I won't deny it.": u"N\u00e3o vou negar.",
        u"I won't go without you.": u"Eu n\u00e3o vou sem voc\u00ea.",
        u"I wonder if Dad\u2019s done with the other bathrooms too.": u"Ser\u00e1 que o pai j\u00e1 terminou os outros banheiros tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"I wonder if Mr. Clermont did that on purpose\u2026": u"Ser\u00e1 que o Sr. Clermont fez isso de prop\u00f3sito\u2026",
        u"I wonder if it still fits you, though\u2026?": u"Ser\u00e1 que ainda serve em voc\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"I wonder what kind of food we\u2019ll have here? Probably nothing I could ever make back at camp!": u"Que tipo de comida ser\u00e1 que teremos aqui? Provavelmente nada que eu conseguiria fazer no acampamento!",
        u"I won\u2019t deny I would love to ride again - one day, perhaps!": u"N\u00e3o vou negar que adoraria pilotar novamente \u2014 talvez um dia!",
        u"I won\u2019t deny, I would love to put it on and go for a ride again.": u"N\u00e3o vou negar, eu adoraria vesti-la e dar uma volta de moto novamente.",
        u"I won\u2019t ever risk letting us be apart again\u2026": u"Nunca mais vou correr o risco de nos deixar separados\u2026",
        u"I won\u2019t go without you, sir\u2026": u"N\u00e3o vou sem o senhor\u2026",
        u"I won\u2019t go without you.": u"Eu n\u00e3o vou sem voc\u00ea.",
        u"I won\u2019t let you keep disrespecting him like this!": u"N\u00e3o vou deixar voc\u00ea continuar desrespeitando ele desse jeito!",
        u"I won\u2019t say no to some free cash!! Drinks are on me now!": u"N\u00e3o vou recusar dinheiro de gra\u00e7a!! Agora eu pago as bebidas!",
        u"I won\u2019t say no to that~ Where do you wanna start?": u"N\u00e3o vou recusar~ Por onde quer come\u00e7ar?",
        u"I won\u2019t say no to that~ Where do you wanna start?{fast}": u"N\u00e3o vou recusar~ Por onde quer come\u00e7ar?{fast}",
        u"I won\u2019t take up too much of her time, I just want to wish her well.": u"N\u00e3o vou tomar muito do tempo dela, s\u00f3 quero desejar melhoras.",
        u"I won\u2019t. And It doesn\u2019t matter as long as we do our jobs.": u"N\u00e3o vou. E isso n\u00e3o importa, desde que fa\u00e7amos nosso trabalho.",
        u"I won\u2019t\u2026!": u"Eu n\u00e3o vou\u2026!",
        u"I would have if I wasn\u2019t so rudely interrupted.": u"Eu faria isso se n\u00e3o tivesse sido interrompida de forma t\u00e3o grosseira.",
        u"I would like to extend my apologies again about what transpired with Ms. Komarova at the hotel, however. ": u"Ainda assim, gostaria de pedir desculpas novamente pelo que aconteceu com a Srta. Komarova no hotel. ",
        u"I would like to raise a concern about that, sir. ": u"Gostaria de apresentar uma preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o a esse respeito, senhor. ",
        u"I would say as soon as possible since our deadline is tight. ": u"Eu diria que o mais breve poss\u00edvel, pois nosso prazo \u00e9 apertado. ",
        u"I would understand if you wanted to stay in the cabin with the boys for a while longer, though.": u"Mas eu entenderia se quisesse ficar mais um tempo na cabana com os rapazes.",
        u"I would usually have whiskey. But with how many options there are, it\u2019d be a shame to not try something new.": u"Normalmente eu beberia u\u00edsque. Mas com tantas op\u00e7\u00f5es, seria uma pena n\u00e3o experimentar algo novo.",
        u"I would've done the same.": u"Eu teria feito o mesmo.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t be caught dead following or adding her as a friend just to see what she posts.": u"Nem morta eu seguiria ou adicionaria ela como amiga s\u00f3 para ver o que posta.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t even mind if you went back to calling me \u2018sir\u2019 here, hehe.": u"Eu nem me importaria se voc\u00ea voltasse a me chamar de \u2018senhor\u2019 aqui, hehe.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t have minded having an experience like Camp Buddy growing up too, haha! ": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o teria me importado de ter uma experi\u00eancia como o Camp Buddy enquanto crescia, haha! ",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t if it weren\u2019t for you.": u"Eu n\u00e3o estaria se n\u00e3o fosse por voc\u00ea.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t mind.": u"Eu n\u00e3o me importaria.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t say no to trying out some more drinks.": u"N\u00e3o recusaria experimentar mais algumas bebidas.",
        u"I wouldn\u2019t say that Aiden doesn\u2019t have the experience \u2013 he\u2019s been the chef at Camp Buddy for years now.": u"Eu n\u00e3o diria que o Aiden n\u00e3o tem experi\u00eancia \u2014 ele \u00e9 o cozinheiro do Camp Buddy h\u00e1 anos.",
        u"I would\u2019ve liked it better if we did.": u"Eu teria gostado mais se tiv\u00e9ssemos nos empolgado.",
        u"I'd rather not share.": u"Prefiro n\u00e3o compartilhar.",
        u"I'll cover for you.": u"Eu cuidarei disso por voc\u00ea.",
        u"I'll help you cook.": u"Vou ajud\u00e1-lo a cozinhar.",
        u"I'll never forget the gratitude in his smile and the hopefulness in his face, so I respected his decision and let them go.": u"Nunca esquecerei a gratid\u00e3o no sorriso dele e a esperan\u00e7a em seu rosto, ent\u00e3o respeitei sua decis\u00e3o e deixei que partissem.",
        u"I'll support him no matter what.": u"Vou apoi\u00e1-lo, n\u00e3o importa o que aconte\u00e7a.",
        u"I'll try my best then...": u"Ent\u00e3o vou me esfor\u00e7ar\u2026",
        u"I'm glad you're excited for this. I can tell by how much you've been fidgeting with your suit this whole time.": u"Fico feliz que esteja animado. Percebo isso pelo quanto ficou mexendo no terno durante todo esse tempo.",
        u"I'm here to report.": u"Vim fazer um relat\u00f3rio.",
        u"I'm not forcing you!": u"Eu n\u00e3o estou for\u00e7ando voc\u00ea!",
        u"I'm not sure it would close even with that... It looks tight on your arms already.": u"Nem sei se fecharia mesmo com bot\u00f5es\u2026 J\u00e1 parece apertada nos seus bra\u00e7os.",
        u"I'm not sure why we don't.": u"N\u00e3o sei por que n\u00e3o permitimos.",
        u"I'm on a vacation with my boss.": u"Estou de f\u00e9rias com meu chefe.",
        u"I'm only thinking of what's best for you!": u"S\u00f3 estou pensando no que \u00e9 melhor para voc\u00ea!",
        u"I'm ready, sir!": u"Estou pronto, senhor!",
        u"I'm staying here.": u"Eu vou ficar aqui.",
        u"I'm surprised, Yoshinori. You're not usually winded so easily. ": u"Estou surpreso, Yoshinori. Voc\u00ea normalmente n\u00e3o perde o f\u00f4lego t\u00e3o f\u00e1cil.",
        u"I've been so impressed with how hard you've all worked, so I thought it would be fitting to set up a celebratory trip! I booked an exclusive hotel for everyone to stay at this weekend!": u"Fiquei t\u00e3o impressionado com o empenho de todos que achei apropriado organizar uma viagem de comemora\u00e7\u00e3o! Reservei um hotel exclusivo para todos se hospedarem neste fim de semana!",
        u"I, uh\u2026": u"Eu, ahn\u2026",
        u"I, uh\u2026 don\u2019t know what that is\u2026": u"Eu, h\u00e3\u2026 n\u00e3o sei o que \u00e9 isso\u2026",
        u"I-I am. I\u2019ve never been to fine dining before\u2026": u"E-Eu estou. Nunca fui a um restaurante requintado antes\u2026",
        u"I-I apologize for walking into your private space, sir\u2026!": u"P-Pe\u00e7o desculpas por entrar em seu espa\u00e7o particular, senhor\u2026!",
        u"I-I beg to differ\u2026": u"E-Eu discordo\u2026",
        u"I-I can do it myself just fine\u2026!": u"E-Eu consigo fazer sozinho perfeitamente\u2026!",
        u"I-I can only imagine how scary she must\u2019ve been\u2026": u"S-S\u00f3 consigo imaginar o quanto ela deve ter ficado assustadora\u2026",
        u"I-I can\u2019t believe that worked\u2026 ": u"N-N\u00e3o acredito que isso funcionou\u2026 ",
        u"I-I can\u2019t help it with you looking like that\u2026! It\u2019s driving me crazy!": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o consigo evitar vendo voc\u00ea assim\u2026! Est\u00e1 me deixando louco!",
        u"I-I can\u2019t help it\u2026 you guys\u2026 ": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o consigo evitar\u2026 pessoal\u2026 ",
        u"I-I can\u2019t-": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o consigo\u2014",
        u"I-I could have handled myself just fine, thank you very much\u2026!": u"E-Eu poderia ter me virado muito bem sozinha, muito obrigada\u2026!",
        u"I-I could use some more details\u2026 It sounds like Aiden was about to get to the juicy part.": u"E-Eu aceitaria mais alguns detalhes\u2026 Parece que o Aiden estava chegando na parte mais picante.",
        u"I-I couldn\u2019t help it, sir! You were being rough on me\u2026": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o consegui evitar, senhor! Voc\u00ea estava sendo bruto comigo\u2026",
        u"I-I did get that idea from the few times I met her back when we were scouts. ": u"E-Eu tive essa impress\u00e3o nas poucas vezes em que a conheci quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros. ",
        u"I-I did notice that there are only four beds, so I can sleep on the couch\u2026! ": u"E-Eu percebi que h\u00e1 apenas quatro camas, ent\u00e3o posso dormir no sof\u00e1\u2026! ",
        u"I-I didn\u2019t know you were watching over us like that, sir\u2026": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o sabia que o senhor observava a gente desse jeito\u2026",
        u"I-I didn\u2019t think you guys were up to something like that\u2026": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o imaginava que voc\u00eas faziam coisas assim\u2026",
        u"I-I do have something I\u2019ve been dying to know.": u"E-Eu tenho algo que estou morrendo de vontade de saber.",
        u"I-I do, sir!": u"E-Eu quero, senhor!",
        u"I-I don\u2019t even know where to start.": u"E-Eu nem sei por onde come\u00e7ar.",
        u"I-I don\u2019t get it\u2026 What are you all seeing?!": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026 O que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o vendo?!",
        u"I-I don\u2019t know about that, Sir Aiden, hehe\u2026": u"N-N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 para tanto, Sr. Aiden, hehe\u2026",
        u"I-I don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about sir\u2026!": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o sei do que o senhor est\u00e1 falando\u2026!",
        u"I-I don\u2019t know, are those legs or arms? And why are there an uneven number of fingers??": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o sei, isso s\u00e3o pernas ou bra\u00e7os? E por que tem um n\u00famero diferente de dedos em cada lado?!",
        u"I-I don\u2019t need strangers giving me useless life lessons!": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o preciso de estranhos me dando li\u00e7\u00f5es de vida in\u00fateis!",
        u"I-I don\u2019t think he\u2019s shoveling the right place either\u2026 The site\u2019s way over there\u2026": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o acho que ele esteja retirando neve do lugar certo\u2026 O canteiro fica l\u00e1 longe\u2026",
        u"I-I don\u2019t think that was our intent, Lloyd\u2026": u"A-Acho que essa n\u00e3o era nossa inten\u00e7\u00e3o, Lloyd\u2026",
        u"I-I don\u2019t think that\u2019s how we got started, Aiden\u2026": u"A-Acho que n\u00e3o foi assim que come\u00e7amos, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I-I don\u2019t understand\u2026! There\u2019s no reason why we can\u2019t be together and still stay at the camp!": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o entendo\u2026! N\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para n\u00e3o podermos ficar juntos e ainda permanecer no acampamento!",
        u"I-I do\u2026": u"E-Eu gosto\u2026",
        u"I-I feel so full, Goro\u2026": u"E-Eu me sinto t\u00e3o cheio, Goro\u2026",
        u"I-I figured I couldn\u2019t have done it if it weren\u2019t for Camp Buddy, so it was better to put it into the sponsorship.": u"E-Eu pensei que n\u00e3o teria conseguido sem o Camp Buddy, ent\u00e3o achei melhor colocar o dinheiro no patroc\u00ednio.",
        u"I-I guess I did feel the same when I first met him\u2026 But that changed so quickly as soon as he started to talk.": u"A-Acho que me senti assim quando o conheci\u2026 Mas isso mudou muito r\u00e1pido assim que ele come\u00e7ou a conversar.",
        u"I-I guess I kinda didn\u2019t know how to get close to him back then since everyone was calling him Serious Darius\u2026 I thought it was because he was a troublemaker or something\u2026": u"A-Acho que naquela \u00e9poca eu n\u00e3o sabia muito bem como me aproximar dele, pois todos o chamavam de Darius Dur\u00e3o\u2026 Pensei que fosse porque ele era encrenqueiro ou algo assim\u2026",
        u"I-I guess now that we know what happened to her, all of her attitude and behavior makes sense\u2026": u"A-Acho que agora que sabemos o que aconteceu com ela, toda aquela atitude e comportamento fazem sentido\u2026",
        u"I-I guess that is a lot of cash\u2026": u"A-Acho que realmente \u00e9 muito dinheiro\u2026",
        u"I-I guess what I\u2019m trying to say is that\u2026": u"A-Acho que o que estou tentando dizer \u00e9 que\u2026",
        u"I-I guess you could say that. Aiden and I are pretty close\u2026": u"A-Acho que pode dizer isso. Aiden e eu somos bem pr\u00f3ximos\u2026",
        u"I-I guess you guys are right\u2026 Maybe there is still hope for me soon.": u"A-Acho que voc\u00eas t\u00eam raz\u00e3o\u2026 Talvez ainda haja esperan\u00e7a para mim em breve.",
        u"I-I guess you\u2019re right, hahaha\u2026": u"A-Acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o, hahaha\u2026",
        u"I-I had so much anxiety thinking about what Emilia had done to you\u2026 ": u"E-Eu fiquei t\u00e3o ansioso pensando no que Emilia tinha feito com o senhor\u2026 ",
        u"I-I have grown really attached to Sir Goro over the months\u2026 It\u2019s nice having a daddy\u2014 I mean, father figure\u2026": u"E-Eu me apeguei muito ao Sr. Goro ao longo desses meses\u2026 \u00c9 bom ter um daddy\u2014 Quero dizer, uma figura paterna\u2026",
        u"I-I have to go\u2026!": u"E-Eu preciso ir\u2026!",
        u"I-I just did that!": u"E-Eu acabei de colocar!",
        u"I-I just never thought, after all this time together, that you were going through something like that\u2026": u"E-Eu nunca imaginei, depois de todo esse tempo juntos, que voc\u00ea estivesse passando por algo assim\u2026",
        u"I-I knew that! But I\u2019m not trying to get salmonella on my vacation, is that too hard to understand?!": u"E-Eu sabia disso! Mas n\u00e3o quero pegar salmonela nas minhas f\u00e9rias, \u00e9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil entender?!",
        u"I-I knew you were gonna say something like that\u2026!": u"E-Eu sabia que diria algo assim\u2026!",
        u"I-I know it\u2019s not my place, sir, but\u2026 if you need someone to talk to, I\u2019m always here!": u"E-Eu sei que n\u00e3o \u00e9 da minha conta, senhor, mas\u2026 se precisar de algu\u00e9m para conversar, estarei sempre aqui!",
        u"I-I know it\u2019s sounds stupid\u2026 I\u2019m honestly embarrassed telling you all of this, sir\u2026": u"E-Eu sei que parece bobagem\u2026 Sinceramente, tenho vergonha de contar tudo isso ao senhor\u2026",
        u"I-I know it\u2019s sounds stupid\u2026 I\u2019m honestly embarrassed telling you all of this\u2026": u"E-Eu sei que parece bobagem\u2026 Sinceramente, estou com vergonha de contar tudo isso\u2026",
        u"I-I know that you\u2019re out of the country! Shouldn\u2019t I have gone with you?!": u"E-Eu sei que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o fora do pa\u00eds! Eu n\u00e3o deveria ter ido com voc\u00eas?!",
        u"I-I know you said you quit\u2026 But can you at least come back with us to camp? ": u"E-Eu sei que disse que se demite\u2026 Mas pode pelo menos voltar conosco para o acampamento? ",
        u"I-I love you, Aiden\u2026": u"E-Eu te amo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I-I mean, characters\u2026! Ahehehe\u2026": u"Q-Quero dizer, personagens\u2026! Ahehehe\u2026",
        u"I-I mean, i-it\u2019s time for breakfast, sir\u2026! ": u"Q-Quero dizer, e-est\u00e1 na hora do caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3, senhor\u2026! ",
        u"I-I mean\u2026 she always goes on about how rich she is, right\u2026?": u"Q-Quero dizer\u2026 ela vive falando de como \u00e9 rica, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"I-I promise I\u2019ll stay up this time!": u"P-Prometo que desta vez ficarei acordado!",
        u"I-I really don\u2019t wanna ruin this suit\u2026 I don\u2019t have the money to pay for something like this\u2026": u"E-Eu realmente n\u00e3o quero estragar este terno\u2026 N\u00e3o tenho dinheiro para pagar por algo assim\u2026",
        u"I-I see\u2026": u"E-Entendo\u2026",
        u"I-I see\u2026 I didn\u2019t realize I\u2019d had such an impact on you, Lloyd.": u"E-Entendo\u2026 N\u00e3o percebi que tinha causado tanto impacto em voc\u00ea, Lloyd.",
        u"I-I sort of expected something fancy from just the exterior, but this is far more extravagant than I what was prepared for. Mr. Clermont has really outdone himself\u2026": u"E-Eu j\u00e1 esperava algo sofisticado s\u00f3 de ver o exterior, mas isto \u00e9 muito mais extravagante do que eu estava preparado para encontrar. O Sr. Clermont realmente se superou\u2026",
        u"I-I still keep my points\u2026": u"E-Eu ainda fico com meus pontos\u2026",
        u"I-I think I\u2019ll just be the observer too\u2026": u"E-Eu acho que tamb\u00e9m vou ficar s\u00f3 observando\u2026",
        u"I-I think that means something else.": u"A-Acho que isso significa outra coisa.",
        u"I-I think we\u2019re done here! We still got lots of work left to do tomorrow!": u"A-Acho que terminamos por aqui! Ainda temos muito trabalho para fazer amanh\u00e3!",
        u"I-I thought so too, but it definitely got too hot and heavy in there for me to handle\u2026": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m achei, mas a coisa definitivamente ficou quente e intensa demais para eu aguentar\u2026",
        u"I-I understand why you kept that from me, though\u2026 ": u"E-Eu entendo por que voc\u00ea escondeu isso de mim\u2026 ",
        u"I-I wanted to check on you, sir\u2026!": u"E-Eu queria saber como o senhor estava\u2026!",
        u"I-I was actually thinking about it on our way home\u2026 As embarrassing as it was to argue with Emilia in front of Mr. Clermont, I had to do it because\u2026": u"N-Na verdade, eu estava pensando nisso na volta para casa\u2026 Por mais constrangedor que tenha sido discutir com Emilia na frente do Sr. Clermont, precisei fazer isso porque\u2026",
        u"I-I was actually thinking about it on our way home\u2026 As embarrassing as it was to argue with Emilia in front of Mr. Clermont, I had to do it because\u2026{fast}": u"N-Na verdade, eu estava pensando nisso na volta para casa\u2026 Por mais constrangedor que tenha sido discutir com Emilia na frente do Sr. Clermont, precisei fazer isso porque\u2026{fast}",
        u"I-I was just thinking that maybe when things settle down a bit during the summer, we can find time!": u"E-Eu s\u00f3 estava pensando que talvez, quando as coisas se acalmarem um pouco durante o ver\u00e3o, possamos encontrar tempo!",
        u"I-I was just wondering what we\u2019re having for breakfast.": u"E-Eu s\u00f3 estava me perguntando o que teremos no caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3.",
        u"I-I was starting to feel a little too exposed out there\u2026": u"E-Eu estava come\u00e7ando a me sentir exposto demais l\u00e1 fora\u2026",
        u"I-I was thinking the same thing, sir\u2026! After all, I realized I\u2019m at my best when I\u2019m working with you.": u"E-Eu estava pensando a mesma coisa, senhor\u2026! Afinal, percebi que dou o meu melhor quando trabalho com o senhor.",
        u"I-I was thinking the same thing, sir\u2026! You look so stylish for a camp president!": u"E-Eu estava pensando a mesma coisa, senhor\u2026! O senhor \u00e9 muito elegante para um presidente de acampamento!",
        u"I-I wasn\u2019t even here the first term\u2026": u"E-Eu nem estava aqui na primeira temporada\u2026",
