        u"I-I wouldn\u2019t say skimpy, but it was definitely tiny enough to be distracting\u2026": u"E-Eu n\u00e3o diria min\u00fascula, mas com certeza era pequena o bastante para distrair\u2026",
        u"I-I, uhh\u2026 S-Sorry, my gloves were in the way\u2026": u"E-Eu, ahn\u2026 D-Desculpa, minhas luvas estavam atrapalhando\u2026",
        u"I-I, uh\u2014": u"E-Eu, uh\u2014",
        u"I-If it helps\u2026 I\u2019ll promise to change my habits from now on\u2026!": u"S-Se ajudar\u2026 prometo mudar meus h\u00e1bitos de agora em diante\u2026!",
        u"I-If it\u2019s okay with you, I can actually lead the scouts for the rest of the hike! You don\u2019t have to worry about any of us getting lost since I\u2019ve got the map memorized!": u"S-Se estiver tudo bem para o senhor, posso liderar os escoteiros durante o restante da caminhada! N\u00e3o precisa se preocupar que algu\u00e9m se perca, pois memorizei o mapa!",
