        u"I-It depends\u2026 I have several definitions of fun...": u"D-Depende\u2026 Tenho v\u00e1rias defini\u00e7\u00f5es de divers\u00e3o...",
        u"I-It doesn\u2019t stop there\u2026 The public records led me to a police report about Ms. Emilia being involved in a physical altercation with a co-worker at a retail store.": u"E-E n\u00e3o para por a\u00ed\u2026 Os registros p\u00fablicos me levaram a um boletim policial sobre a Srta. Emilia ter se envolvido numa briga f\u00edsica com um colega de trabalho em uma loja.",
