        u"I-I\u2019m sorry\u2026! It\u2019s just, I was supposed to be here a day earlier, but I had to reschedule.": u"D-Desculpem\u2026! \u00c9 que eu deveria ter chegado um dia antes, mas precisei remarcar.",
        u"I-I\u2019m sure Jin has enough story for now, so let\u2019s go to bed!": u"T-Tenho certeza de que Jin j\u00e1 tem hist\u00f3ria suficiente por enquanto, ent\u00e3o vamos dormir!",
        u"I-I\u2019m sure she already knows\u2026 In fact, she probably would have been first one to notice.": u"T-Tenho certeza de que ela j\u00e1 sabe\u2026 Na verdade, provavelmente foi a primeira a perceber.",
        u"I-I\u2019m sure there\u2019s a way for us to fix this, sir.": u"T-Tenho certeza de que existe uma maneira de consertarmos isso, senhor.",
        u"I-I\u2019m sure they\u2019re just having a normal morning, Aiden.": u"T-Tenho certeza de que eles s\u00f3 est\u00e3o tendo uma manh\u00e3 normal, Aiden.",
        u"I-I\u2019m used to it\u2026 And I love it when you\u2019re rough on me\u2026": u"E-Eu estou acostumado\u2026 E adoro quando voc\u00ea \u00e9 bruto comigo\u2026",
        u"I-I\u2019m very\u2026 very tired, Aiden\u2026": u"E-Eu estou muito\u2026 muito cansado, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I-I\u2019m working on it, s-sir\u2026!": u"E-Estou tentando, s-senhor\u2026!",
        u"I-I\u2019ve been looking for you, sir\u2026 I couldn\u2019t find you around the hotel\u2026": u"E-Eu estava procurando o senhor\u2026 N\u00e3o consegui encontr\u00e1-lo pelo hotel\u2026",
        u"IT\u2019S SO YUMMY!!! This is the best pizza I\u2019ve ever tasted in my entire life!": u"EST\u00c1 DELICIOSA!!! Esta \u00e9 a melhor pizza que j\u00e1 provei em toda a minha vida!",
        u"If I did, my face would be\u2026": u"Se eu fizesse, meu rosto ficaria\u2026",
        u"If I didn\u2019t have that shawl, I\u2019d have basically been naked.": u"Se eu n\u00e3o tivesse aquele xale, teria ficado praticamente pelado.",
        u"If I had controlled myself better, then none of that would\u2019ve happened.": u"Se eu tivesse me controlado melhor, nada daquilo teria acontecido.",
        u"If I had known, I would\u2019ve woken up sooner! ": u"Se eu soubesse, teria acordado mais cedo! ",
        u"If I had only told you sooner that I wasn't gonna accept the offer, we wouldn't have argued...": u"Se eu tivesse contado antes que n\u00e3o aceitaria a proposta, n\u00f3s n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos discutido\u2026",
        u"If I had told the younger Yoshinori that he was going to be in charge, he\u2019d never have been able to calm down! ": u"Se eu tivesse dito ao jovem Yoshinori que ele assumiria o comando, ele jamais teria conseguido se acalmar! ",
        u"If I may add to the conversation\u2026 There\u2019s something very peculiar I\u2019ve noticed about Ms. Emilia\u2019s huge outbursts\u2026": u"Se eu puder acrescentar algo\u2026 H\u00e1 algo muito peculiar que percebi nos grandes ataques da Srta. Emilia\u2026",
        u"If I may \u2013 I, too, was honestly concerned about this in the beginning, but despite Jin\u2019s schedule being different from us, he had no problems communicating with the rest of the team.": u"Se me permite \u2014 eu tamb\u00e9m estava preocupado com isso no in\u00edcio, mas, apesar do hor\u00e1rio de Jin ser diferente do nosso, ele n\u00e3o teve problemas para se comunicar com o restante da equipe.",
        u"If I may, sir\u2026": u"Se me permite, senhor\u2026",
        u"If I may, the weather can get quite harsh during the winter around these parts\u2026": u"Se me permite, o clima nesta regi\u00e3o pode ser bastante rigoroso durante o inverno\u2026",
        u"If I were him, I\u2019d be really disappointed. ": u"Se eu fosse ele, ficaria muito decepcionado. ",
        u"If I\u2019m always around, I\u2019m sure we can work things out!": u"Se eu estiver sempre por perto, tenho certeza de que resolveremos tudo!",
        u"If I\u2019m being honest, you\u2019re probably the only one who can get along with her when it comes to work\u2026": u"Para ser sincero, voc\u00ea provavelmente \u00e9 o \u00fanico que consegue se dar bem com ela no trabalho\u2026",
        u"If Mr. Clermont hadn\u2019t stepped in, I wouldn\u2019t have realized how uncomfortable you and everyone else were.": u"Se o Sr. Clermont n\u00e3o tivesse interferido, eu n\u00e3o teria percebido o quanto voc\u00ea e todos os outros estavam desconfort\u00e1veis.",
        u"If Yoshi\u2019s a sappy drunk, and I\u2019m a wild drunk, then you\u2019re a mopey drunk, Gramps!": u"Se o Yoshi fica sentimental quando bebe e eu fico doid\u00e3o, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea fica choramingando, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"If all of that\u2019s true, then how did she even manage to pass through Mr. Clermont\u2019s screening?": u"Se tudo isso for verdade, como ela conseguiu passar pela avalia\u00e7\u00e3o do Sr. Clermont?",
        u"If anyone else has done it, they lose a point, and if they lose three points then they\u2019re out!": u"Se outra pessoa j\u00e1 tiver feito aquilo, perde um ponto, e quem perder tr\u00eas pontos est\u00e1 fora!",
        u"If anything comes up again, don\u2019t hesitate to ask me, alright? ": u"Se surgir qualquer outra coisa, n\u00e3o hesitem em me procurar, certo? ",
        u"If anything, Emilia\u2019s the one who\u2019s been causing trouble ever since she showed up.": u"Na verdade, a Emilia \u00e9 quem vem causando problemas desde que apareceu.",
        u"If anything, I should be the one apologizing\u2026 not only for my lies but also for causing you all trouble\u2026": u"Na verdade, eu \u00e9 que deveria pedir desculpas\u2026 n\u00e3o s\u00f3 pelas minhas mentiras, mas tamb\u00e9m por ter causado tantos problemas a todos voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"If anything, all of these are personal issues which are a direct result of you refusing to get along with your fellow co-workers.": u"Na verdade, tudo isso s\u00e3o quest\u00f5es pessoais resultantes diretamente da sua recusa em se dar bem com seus colegas de trabalho.",
        u"If anything, all of you just can\u2019t accept honest criticism!": u"Na verdade, voc\u00eas \u00e9 que n\u00e3o conseguem aceitar cr\u00edticas sinceras!",
        u"If he found out later that we\u2019d been hiding such a thing from him, I\u2019m sure it would be much worse.": u"Se descobrisse depois que est\u00e1vamos escondendo algo assim dele, tenho certeza de que seria muito pior.",
        u"If he heard about me having an opportunity to become a pro chef, he\u2019d be over the moon.": u"Se ele soubesse que tenho a oportunidade de me tornar um chef profissional, ficaria feliz demais.",
        u"If he were here, he would definitely help me jack off\u2026": u"Se ele estivesse aqui, com certeza me ajudaria a bater uma\u2026",
        u"If it helps, they texted me that they\u2019re already on their way back.": u"Se serve de consolo, eles me mandaram mensagem dizendo que j\u00e1 est\u00e3o voltando.",
        u"If it helps, we\u2019re doing this to clear our doubts about her.": u"Se serve de consolo, estamos fazendo isso para esclarecer nossas d\u00favidas sobre ela.",
        u"If it wasn\u2019t pity, then why would you do all this for me, since the beginning\u2026?": u"Se n\u00e3o era por pena, ent\u00e3o por que voc\u00ea fez tudo isso por mim desde o come\u00e7o\u2026?",
        u"If it weren\u2019t for the other people out there at the bath, I would\u2019ve given it to you already.": u"Se n\u00e3o fossem as outras pessoas l\u00e1 fora no banho, eu j\u00e1 teria dado a voc\u00ea.",
        u"If it weren\u2019t for the ruckus outside, I wouldn\u2019t have woken up either.": u"Se n\u00e3o fosse a barulheira l\u00e1 fora, eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o teria acordado.",
        u"If it weren\u2019t for you choosing that life, Camp Buddy might never have been formed, and we wouldn\u2019t have even met!": u"Se o senhor n\u00e3o tivesse escolhido essa vida, talvez o Camp Buddy nunca tivesse sido criado, e n\u00f3s nem ter\u00edamos nos conhecido!",
        u"If it\u2019s alright with you, I\u2019d like to start here in your office!": u"Se estiver de acordo, gostaria de come\u00e7ar aqui no seu escrit\u00f3rio!",
        u"If it\u2019s not gonna be seen then what\u2019s the point?": u"Se n\u00e3o for para ser vista, ent\u00e3o qual \u00e9 o sentido?",
        u"If only I had known sooner, I could\u2019ve at least taken some of the load off of you\u2026": u"Se eu soubesse antes, poderia pelo menos ter tirado um pouco desse peso das suas costas\u2026",
        u"If only I knew more, I could\u2019ve done something to help.": u"Se eu soubesse, poderia ter feito alguma coisa para ajudar.",
        u"If only everyone had listened to my recommendations, then you wouldn\u2019t have missed out~": u"Se todos tivessem ouvido minhas recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es, n\u00e3o teriam perdido a oportunidade~",
        u"If only there was some way to have Aiden stay here\u2026": u"Se ao menos houvesse alguma maneira de o Aiden ficar aqui\u2026",
        u"If only we had more information about her we could use\u2026": u"Se ao menos tiv\u00e9ssemos mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es sobre ela para usar\u2026",
        u"If only you knew how much of that I was able to apply in my job as an architect.": u"Se soubesse o quanto consegui aplicar disso no meu trabalho como arquiteto.",
        u"If pursuing his passion would mean he\u2019d be away from all of us, and that was enough for him to turn away from his dream\u2026 ": u"Se seguir sua paix\u00e3o significaria ficar longe de todos n\u00f3s, e isso foi suficiente para faz\u00ea-lo abrir m\u00e3o do sonho\u2026 ",
        u"If that can knock this big guy out, that should solve your insomnia problems!": u"Se isso consegue apagar esse grandalh\u00e3o, deve resolver seus problemas de ins\u00f4nia!",
        u"If that meeting had lasted any longer, I bet she\u2019d really have started digging into me.": u"Se a reuni\u00e3o tivesse durado mais, aposto que teria come\u00e7ado a investigar tudo sobre mim.",
        u"If that's what Aiden wants.": u"Se \u00e9 isso que Aiden quer.",
        u"If that\u2019s the case then pack your bags, Yuri! We\u2019re going to see that new \u2018JS\u2019 movie!": u"Se \u00e9 assim, fa\u00e7a as malas, Yuri! Vamos assistir \u00e0quele novo filme \u2018JS\u2019!",
        u"If that\u2019s the case, shall we get you and your suitcases settled in? You must be tired from your trip.": u"Nesse caso, vamos acomodar voc\u00ea e suas malas? Deve estar cansado da viagem.",
        u"If that\u2019s the case, then I suppose I\u2019ll share a room with you, Yoshinori. ": u"Nesse caso, acho que vou dividir um quarto com voc\u00ea, Yoshinori. ",
        u"If that\u2019s the case, then I\u2019ll have to shower elsewhere.": u"Nesse caso, terei que tomar banho em outro lugar.",
        u"If that\u2019s the case, then I\u2019ll support you while you reach for your dream.": u"Se for assim, ent\u00e3o vou apoiar voc\u00ea enquanto busca seu sonho.",
        u"If that\u2019s the case, then pack your bags, Yuri! We\u2019re going to see that new \u2018JS\u2019 movie!": u"Se \u00e9 assim, ent\u00e3o fa\u00e7a as malas, Yuri! Vamos assistir \u00e0quele novo filme de \u2018JS\u2019!",
        u"If that\u2019s what Aiden wants, there\u2019s actually a chance.": u"Se \u00e9 isso que Aiden quer, existe mesmo uma oportunidade.",
        u"If that\u2019s what it takes to finally pursue your lifelong dream, I\u2019m sure it\u2019d be worth it!": u"Se \u00e9 isso que precisa fazer para finalmente correr atr\u00e1s do sonho da sua vida, tenho certeza de que valeria a pena!",
        u"If that\u2019s what she wants, then good riddance to her!": u"Se \u00e9 isso que ela quer, ent\u00e3o j\u00e1 vai tarde!",
        u"If there are no more questions, then this meeting is adjourned.": u"Se n\u00e3o houver mais perguntas, damos por encerrada esta reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"If there was any silver lining, it was during that time that I learned most of the concepts and principles I carry today.": u"Se houve algo positivo, foi nessa \u00e9poca que aprendi a maioria dos conceitos e princ\u00edpios que carrego comigo at\u00e9 hoje.",
        u"If they had been supervising as per the plan, these issues might not have happened.": u"Se estivessem supervisionando conforme o planejado, talvez esses problemas n\u00e3o tivessem acontecido.",
        u"If we can give the scouts unforgettable memories at camp, there\u2019s no reason we can\u2019t do that for ourselves too!": u"Se podemos proporcionar lembran\u00e7as inesquec\u00edveis aos escoteiros no acampamento, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 raz\u00e3o para n\u00e3o fazermos o mesmo por n\u00f3s!",
        u"If we didn\u2019t have to clean up after Wolfboy tossing snow around, we could\u2019ve been done by now!": u"Se n\u00e3o tiv\u00e9ssemos que arrumar a bagun\u00e7a do Garoto-Lobo jogando neve para todo lado, j\u00e1 poder\u00edamos ter terminado!",
        u"If we fooled around?": u"Se a gente se divertisse um pouco?",
        u"If we work together, then we can share the burden and grow as partners.": u"Se trabalharmos juntos, podemos dividir o peso e crescer como parceiros.",
        u"If you all feel so strongly about it, then I\u2019m in no place to disagree. You know what\u2019s best for your camp.": u"Se todos se sentem t\u00e3o convictos disso, n\u00e3o cabe a mim discordar. Voc\u00eas sabem o que \u00e9 melhor para o acampamento.",
        u"If you came here to help me cook, you\u2019re a bit late cause I just finished up!": u"Se veio aqui para me ajudar a cozinhar, chegou um pouco tarde porque acabei de terminar!",
        u"If you came here to ruin my oh-so-perfect-day. Congratulations, you just did.": u"Se veio aqui para estragar meu dia t\u00e3o perfeito, parab\u00e9ns, acabou de conseguir.",
        u"If you can get your demands fulfilled on a whim, then why can\u2019t I as well?!": u"Se voc\u00ea consegue tudo o que quer num estalar de dedos, ent\u00e3o por que eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o posso?!",
        u"If you do a certain thing over and over, you\u2019ll realize it\u2019s not as complicated as you think.": u"Quando fazemos determinada coisa repetidas vezes, percebemos que ela n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o complicada quanto parece.",
        u"If you do, I\u2019ll have to punish you. Understood?": u"Se fizer isso, vou ter que puni-lo. Entendido?",
        u"If you do, I\u2019ll smack you!": u"Se fizer isso, vou dar um tapa em voc\u00ea!",
        u"If you guys are looking to find some triple action to spice things up, you know where to find me~!": u"Se estiverem procurando uma a\u00e7\u00e3o a tr\u00eas para apimentar as coisas, sabem onde me encontrar~!",
        u"If you guys like dudes so much, why not go and get one~?": u"Se voc\u00eas gostam tanto de homens, por que n\u00e3o v\u00e3o atr\u00e1s de um~?",
        u"If you guys want to check it out more and explore each page, I\u2019d be happy to give you a separate soft copy!": u"Se quiserem conferir melhor e explorar cada p\u00e1gina, ficarei feliz em entregar uma c\u00f3pia digital separada!",
        u"If you guys want to check it out more and explore each page, I\u2019d be happy to give you guys a soft copy!": u"Se quiserem olhar com mais calma e explorar cada p\u00e1gina, ficarei feliz em dar uma c\u00f3pia digital para voc\u00eas!",
        u"If you guys want to see him so bad, you can from the window. But don\u2019t say I didn\u2019t warn you!": u"Se voc\u00eas querem tanto ver, podem olhar pela janela. Mas n\u00e3o digam que eu n\u00e3o avisei!",
        u"If you guys want, we could look that up online\u2026 ": u"Se voc\u00eas quiserem, podemos pesquisar isso na internet\u2026 ",
        u"If you had told the me from almost ten years ago, I wouldn\u2019t have believed it.": u"Se tivesse contado isso \u00e0 Emilia de quase dez anos atr\u00e1s, eu n\u00e3o teria acreditado.",
        u"If you hadn\u2019t done that, we might\u2019ve seen Gramps vs Emilia round two in the lobby this morning, hehe!": u"Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse feito isso, talvez tiv\u00e9ssemos visto Vov\u00f4 contra Emilia, segundo round, no sagu\u00e3o esta manh\u00e3, hehe!",
        u"If you keep doing that, I\u2019ll\u2014": u"Se continuar fazendo isso, eu vou\u2014",
        u"If you keep this up, you\u2019ll be bear food later tonight!": u"Se continuar assim, acabar\u00e1 virando comida de urso esta noite!",
        u"If you need any carpentry or masonry work done skillfully, my partner here has mastered both crafts!": u"Se precisarem de trabalhos especializados de carpintaria ou alvenaria, meu parceiro domina os dois of\u00edcios!",
        u"If you need any further clarifications on your tasks or schedules, please refer to Architect Sirius and Foreman Najjar for more details! ": u"Se precisarem de mais esclarecimentos sobre suas tarefas ou hor\u00e1rios, consultem o Arquiteto Sirius e o Encarregado Najjar para mais detalhes! ",
        u"If you need any more details, you can find them in the report we\u2019ve provided.": u"Caso precise de mais detalhes, eles est\u00e3o no relat\u00f3rio que fornecemos.",
        u"If you need anything else, our front desk is available 24/7, so please don\u2019t hesitate to call us!": u"Se precisarem de qualquer outra coisa, nossa recep\u00e7\u00e3o funciona 24 horas por dia, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o hesitem em nos chamar!",
        u"If you really hate it here so much why did you join?": u"Se voc\u00ea odeia tanto este lugar, por que entrou para o acampamento?",
        u"If you stick around, we\u2019ll get Yoshi to serve food with me in just an apron every meal!": u"Se ficar por aqui, vamos fazer o Yoshi servir comida comigo usando s\u00f3 um avental em todas as refei\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"If you two join, I\u2019ll give you a treat. Heard you like burgers and mallows.": u"Se voc\u00eas dois participarem, dou uma recompensa. Ouvi dizer que gostam de hamb\u00fargueres e marshmallows.",
        u"If you wanna be buff like me, I can give you a \u201chuge tip,\u201d if you know what I mean~": u"Se quiser ficar forte como eu, posso lhe dar uma \u201cdica enorme\u201d, se \u00e9 que me entende~",
        u"If you want it so much, then sure. I don\u2019t mind sharing.": u"Se voc\u00ea quer tanto, tudo bem. N\u00e3o me importo de compartilhar.",
        u"If you want me to be even more honest, I believe the overall management is what troubles me the most.": u"Para ser ainda mais sincera, acredito que a administra\u00e7\u00e3o geral \u00e9 o que mais me preocupa.",
        u"If you want me to be even more honest, I think the staff concerns are what troubles me the most.": u"Para ser ainda mais sincera, acho que os problemas com a equipe s\u00e3o o que mais me preocupa.",
        u"If you want to keep feeding him false hope, then by all means! Let him live with all your pathetic lies!": u"Se quer continuar alimentando falsas esperan\u00e7as nele, fique \u00e0 vontade! Deixe ele viver com todas as suas mentiras pat\u00e9ticas!",
        u"If you want to ogle my body, you could at least try and be a little more subtle about it.": u"Se quer ficar admirando meu corpo, poderia pelo menos tentar ser um pouco mais discreto.",
        u"If you want, I can frame it for you to hang inside the office, Yuri.": u"Se quiser, posso emoldur\u00e1-la para voc\u00ea pendurar no escrit\u00f3rio, Yuri.",
        u"If you want, I can help you instead! I know how to swing an axe around too, after all~": u"Se quiser, posso ajudar no lugar dele! Afinal, eu tamb\u00e9m sei manejar um machado~",
        u"If you want, maybe I could watch you this time and give you some pointers\u2026?": u"Se quiser, talvez eu possa observar desta vez e dar algumas dicas\u2026?",
        u"If you want, we can call Mr. Clermont right now and it\u2019ll help clear your doubts!": u"Se quiser, podemos ligar para o Sr. Clermont agora mesmo e esclarecer suas d\u00favidas!",
        u"If you would allow us to fix the communication problems brought up, I\u2019m sure we can still work this out.": u"Se nos permitir corrigir os problemas de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o levantados, tenho certeza de que ainda podemos resolver isso.",
        u"If you would let me in, then I\u2019ll explain.": u"Se me deixar entrar, eu explico.",
        u"If you're trying to kiss up to me so that you'll be promoted to camp president, you'll have to try harder than that.": u"Se est\u00e1 tentando me bajular para ser promovido a presidente do acampamento, ter\u00e1 que se esfor\u00e7ar mais.",
        u"If your dick wasn\u2019t standing to attention at me, maybe I wouldn\u2019t have gotten the hint.": u"Se o seu pau n\u00e3o estivesse em posi\u00e7\u00e3o de sentido para mim, talvez eu n\u00e3o tivesse entendido a dica.",
        u"If your team gets separated, it\u2019s important to stay calm and find a solution with your partner!": u"Se a equipe se separar, \u00e9 importante manter a calma e encontrar uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o com a sua dupla!",
        u"If you\u2019d like to take a closer look, I can walk you around the site for\u2014": u"Se quiser examinar mais de perto, posso acompanh\u00e1-la pelo terreno para\u2014",
        u"If you\u2019d like, I could reach out to Mr. Clermont and make some arrangements for a different inspector\u2026": u"Se quiser, posso entrar em contato com o Sr. Clermont e providenciar outra inspetora\u2026",
        u"If you\u2019ll excuse me, I need to savor this meal the heavens blessed me with!": u"Se me d\u00e1 licen\u00e7a, preciso saborear esta refei\u00e7\u00e3o com que os c\u00e9us me aben\u00e7oaram!",
        u"If you\u2019re going to act like this, let\u2019s get this tour over with!": u"Se vai agir assim, vamos terminar logo este passeio!",
        u"If you\u2019re not too busy, maybe you can help me out, Yoshi?": u"Se n\u00e3o estiver muito ocupado, talvez possa me ajudar, Yoshi?",
        u"If you\u2019re so shy then here, I\u2019ll show you mine first!": u"Se voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com tanta vergonha, ent\u00e3o olha, eu mostro o meu primeiro!",
        u"If you\u2019re the professional you say you are, then surely you can tell the difference between what you\u2019ve said and what matters.": u"Se voc\u00ea \u00e9 a profissional que diz ser, certamente consegue distinguir o que disse daquilo que realmente importa.",
        u"If you\u2019re worried about how to talk to Mr. Clermont, I have some good talking points and questions to ask during the call!": u"Se est\u00e1 preocupado em como conversar com o Sr. Clermont, tenho alguns bons t\u00f3picos e perguntas para fazer durante a liga\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"If \u2018starting a conversation\u2019 means being a rude and condescending bitch, then no thanks!": u"Se \u2018puxar conversa\u2019 significa ser uma vaca grosseira e condescendente, ent\u00e3o passo!",
        u"In Yuri\u2019s case, though\u2026 I think she just likes the art aspect of it\u2026 She is a very creative person.": u"No caso da Yuri\u2026 Acho que ela simplesmente gosta do lado art\u00edstico\u2026 Ela \u00e9 uma pessoa muito criativa.",
        u"In a couple ways, yeah~": u"De algumas formas, sim~",
        u"In a sense, I thought to myself that this place allowed me to return to what I used to be. But then, what I used to be was a horrible person to begin with\u2026": u"De certa forma, achei que este lugar me permitiria voltar a ser quem eu era. Mas, pensando bem, quem eu era j\u00e1 era uma pessoa horr\u00edvel desde o come\u00e7o\u2026",
        u"In a way, it made me more confident having you around for the meeting.": u"De certa forma, sua presen\u00e7a na reuni\u00e3o me deixou mais confiante.",
        u"In addition, I let my own personal issues with the other staff members here get in the way of progress, hindering the project multiple times.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, deixei meus problemas pessoais com os outros funcion\u00e1rios daqui atrapalharem o progresso, prejudicando o projeto v\u00e1rias vezes.",
        u"In addition, if Camp Buddy comes upon a concern or issue, especially in the case of the project, please do let me know right away!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, se surgir qualquer problema ou preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o no Camp Buddy, especialmente em rela\u00e7\u00e3o ao projeto, avisem-me imediatamente!",
        u"In all my years here, I\u2019ve never seen a group of scouts that have the same sense of unity and camaraderie that you have for each other and the camp!": u"Em todos os meus anos aqui, nunca vi um grupo de escoteiros com o mesmo senso de uni\u00e3o e camaradagem que voc\u00eas t\u00eam entre si e com o acampamento!",
        u"In any case, I\u2019m sure you need to rest\u2026 So please, take it easy and we can talk when\u2014": u"De qualquer forma, tenho certeza de que precisa descansar\u2026 Ent\u00e3o, por favor, fique tranquila e podemos conversar quando\u2014",
        u"In case you truly get lost, do not panic, remember to conserve your energy, and stay in place.": u"Caso realmente se percam, n\u00e3o entrem em p\u00e2nico, lembrem-se de poupar energia e permane\u00e7am no mesmo lugar.",
        u"In fact, I haven\u2019t seen you hang out with anyone since we got here\u2026 Maybe you should try to join us and use this chance to get to know everyone!": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o vi voc\u00ea passar tempo com ningu\u00e9m desde que chegamos\u2026 Talvez devesse tentar se juntar a n\u00f3s e aproveitar a oportunidade para conhecer melhor todo mundo!",
        u"In fact, I never heard anything from you after we all finished our first term.": u"Na verdade, nunca mais tive not\u00edcias suas depois que todos conclu\u00edmos nossa primeira temporada.",
        u"In fact, I still have all my outfit and old stuff in the other boxes.": u"Na verdade, ainda tenho minha roupa e todas as coisas antigas nas outras caixas.",
        u"In fact, I still have all my outfit and old stuff in the other boxes.{fast}": u"Na verdade, ainda tenho minha roupa e todas as coisas antigas nas outras caixas.{fast}",
        u"In fact, I\u2019d like you to have it.": u"Na verdade, quero que fique com ela.",
        u"In fact, I\u2019d say this is one of the best mini vacations I\u2019ve taken in a long time!": u"Na verdade, eu diria que estas foram uma das melhores minif\u00e9rias que tive em muito tempo!",
        u"In fact, I\u2019ve already consulted with Mr. Clermont and he has given his approval for the break.": u"Na verdade, j\u00e1 consultei o Sr. Clermont e ele aprovou a pausa.",
        u"In fact, I\u2019ve never thought any less of you.": u"Na verdade, nunca pensei menos do senhor.",
        u"In fact, before Mr. Clermont left yesterday, he actually offered Aiden a chance at a professional certification to be a chef.": u"Na verdade, antes de partir ontem, o Sr. Clermont ofereceu ao Aiden a chance de obter uma certifica\u00e7\u00e3o profissional para se tornar chef.",
        u"In fact, that was when I gave you that brooch.": u"Na verdade, foi naquela ocasi\u00e3o que lhe dei o broche.",
        u"In fact, you all wouldn\u2019t even need a sponsorship if it wasn\u2019t for how badly you handled last year\u2019s scandal and ruined the camp\u2019s reputation!": u"Na verdade, voc\u00eas nem precisariam de patroc\u00ednio se n\u00e3o tivessem lidado t\u00e3o mal com o esc\u00e2ndalo do ano passado e arruinado a reputa\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento!",
        u"In its current state, it won\u2019t even scratch off a portion of our scope. It would be much faster and cheaper to build a new one.": u"No estado atual, ele n\u00e3o daria conta nem de uma parte do nosso trabalho. Seria muito mais r\u00e1pido e barato montar um novo.",
        u"In my entire time at the camp, nobody else has earned more badges than him!": u"Em todo o meu tempo no acampamento, ningu\u00e9m conquistou mais ins\u00edgnias do que ele!",
        u"In my head, I couldn\u2019t reach out to you until I had something to show for myself.": u"Na minha cabe\u00e7a, eu n\u00e3o podia procurar voc\u00ea at\u00e9 ter conquistado algo para mostrar.",
        u"In my head, I was counting on you, Yoshinori, to succeed\u2026 begging you to bring back the spirit that was lost\u2026": u"Na minha cabe\u00e7a, eu contava com voc\u00ea, Yoshinori, para ter sucesso\u2026 implorando para que trouxesse de volta o esp\u00edrito que havia se perdido\u2026",
        u"In my head, I wasn\u2019t just following in my dad\u2019s footsteps, but also trying to fulfill my end of our promise to be back together.": u"Na minha cabe\u00e7a, eu n\u00e3o estava apenas seguindo os passos do meu pai, mas tamb\u00e9m tentando cumprir minha parte da nossa promessa de ficarmos juntos novamente.",
        u"In my mind, I was going to make it big and successful by the time you came back\u2026 thinking it would make you, my daughter, and myself happy.": u"Na minha cabe\u00e7a, eu faria o acampamento crescer e se tornar um sucesso at\u00e9 voc\u00ea voltar\u2026 achando que isso faria voc\u00ea, minha filha e eu felizes.",
        u"In my stay here so far, I find it kinda hard to imagine him that way\u2026 He\u2019s like the calmest and gentlest boss I\u2019ve ever had.": u"Pelo tempo que estou aqui, \u00e9 dif\u00edcil imagin\u00e1-lo desse jeito\u2026 Ele \u00e9 tipo o chefe mais calmo e gentil que j\u00e1 tive.",
        u"In my younger days, I was really into motorcycles and riding was my biggest hobby.": u"Quando era mais jovem, eu gostava muito de motocicletas, e pilotar era meu maior hobby.",
        u"In nine years, not once did I get a call or a letter asking how I\u2019ve been\u2026!": u"Em nove anos, n\u00e3o recebi uma \u00fanica liga\u00e7\u00e3o ou carta perguntando como eu estava\u2026!",
        u"In our spare time, Goro would take me out on his motorcycle to different places. We made a habit of going on dates on the weekend.": u"Em nosso tempo livre, Goro me levava de moto para v\u00e1rios lugares. Criamos o h\u00e1bito de sair em encontros nos fins de semana.",
        u"In the evenings, we\u2019d work with Jin towards the technological goals of the project. Sometimes even joining him in his sleepless nights.": u"\u00c0 noite, trabalh\u00e1vamos com Jin nos objetivos tecnol\u00f3gicos do projeto. \u00c0s vezes at\u00e9 acompanh\u00e1vamos suas noites sem dormir.",
        u"In the meantime, I shall relay madam\u2019s order to our chef. I\u2019ll be back soon to take the rest of your orders!": u"Enquanto isso, vou passar o pedido da senhora ao nosso chef. Voltarei em breve para anotar os pedidos de voc\u00eas!",
        u"In the past, I never thought I\u2019d see you this way.": u"No passado, nunca pensei que veria voc\u00ea dessa forma.",
        u"In this case, you spend some money for a random chance to get stuff you can use to get better in the game!": u"Nesse caso, voc\u00ea gasta dinheiro por uma chance aleat\u00f3ria de conseguir coisas que pode usar para ficar melhor no jogo!",
        u"Indeed. We won\u2019t take up any more of your time.": u"De fato. N\u00e3o tomaremos mais o seu tempo.",
        u"Instead, I can\u2019t help but wonder what kind of person you were before I met you at Camp Buddy, sir.": u"Em vez disso, n\u00e3o consigo deixar de imaginar que tipo de pessoa o senhor era antes de eu conhec\u00ea-lo no Camp Buddy.",
        u"Instead, I\u2019m burdening you like this\u2026 because I couldn\u2019t take care of my own health\u2026": u"Em vez disso, estou sendo um fardo para voc\u00ea\u2026 porque n\u00e3o consegui cuidar da minha pr\u00f3pria sa\u00fade\u2026",
        u"Instead, we should do our best to cherish it and make sure we don\u2019t lose sight of what\u2019s truly important\u2026": u"Em vez disso, devemos fazer o poss\u00edvel para valorizar o que temos e garantir que n\u00e3o percamos de vista o que realmente importa\u2026",
        u"Instead, you all let just one person decide everything. And he didn\u2019t even choose appetizers and desserts!": u"Em vez disso, deixaram uma \u00fanica pessoa decidir tudo. E ele nem sequer escolheu as entradas e as sobremesas!",
        u"Interestiiiing~ So that answers that for Yoichi, Darius and Lloyd. The rest of you, speak up!": u"Interessaaante~ Ent\u00e3o j\u00e1 temos a resposta de Yoichi, Darius e Lloyd. O resto de voc\u00eas, falem!",
        u"Interesting\u2026 Must be some boujee summer camp to get the most expensive hotel in the city.": u"Interessante\u2026 Deve ser um acampamento muito chique para conseguirem o hotel mais caro da cidade.",
        u"Is Mr. Flynn really a scoutmaster, or still a helper? He contrastingly handles maintenance and culinary tasks, which are supposed to be done by two different people.": u"O Sr. Flynn \u00e9 mesmo chefe escoteiro ou ainda \u00e9 ajudante? Ele cuida tanto da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o quanto da cozinha, fun\u00e7\u00f5es que deveriam caber a duas pessoas diferentes.",
        u"Is everything alright here? I heard a commotion\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem aqui? Ouvi uma confus\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Is everything alright h\u2014": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem aqu\u2014",
        u"Is everything alright, Sir Goro?": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, senhor Goro?",
        u"Is everything okay over here, sir? ": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem por aqui, senhor? ",
        u"Is he talking about Lloyd and Darius\u2026?": u"Ele est\u00e1 falando do Lloyd e do Darius\u2026?",
        u"Is he\u2026 talking to that bottle\u2026?": u"Ele est\u00e1\u2026 falando com aquela garrafa\u2026?",
        u"Is it a monster cock?": u"\u00c9 um pau monstruoso?",
        u"Is it alright with you if we address each other by our first names?": u"Tudo bem se nos tratarmos pelo primeiro nome?",
        u"Is it just me, or is everyone else really excited too?": u"Sou s\u00f3 eu ou todo mundo tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 muito animado?",
        u"Is it really okay to leave him alone like that, though? Should we check on him to be sure?": u"Mas ser\u00e1 que \u00e9 mesmo uma boa ideia deixar ele sozinho assim? N\u00e3o dever\u00edamos dar uma olhada s\u00f3 para ter certeza?",
        u"Is it true? Are you really going to be a pro chef now, Aiden?!": u"\u00c9 verdade? Voc\u00ea realmente vai virar chef profissional agora, Aiden?!",
        u"Is it wrong to want the life I used to have, where everyone at least saw me as someone who mattered\u2026 just for a while?": u"\u00c9 errado querer a vida que eu tinha antes, quando pelo menos todos me viam como algu\u00e9m importante\u2026 mesmo que s\u00f3 por um tempo?",
        u"Is someone in the bushes\u2026?": u"Tem algu\u00e9m nos arbustos\u2026?",
        u"Is that a real question? Of course I did! I made chicken noodle soup, and there\u2019s cocoa too! All fresh and steaming hot!   ": u"Essa pergunta \u00e9 s\u00e9ria? Claro que sim! Fiz sopa de frango com macarr\u00e3o, e tamb\u00e9m tem chocolate quente! Tudo fresquinho e bem quente!   ",
        u"Is that all? We\u2019re wasting that \u2018precious work time\u2019 right now with this meeting.": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 isso? Estamos desperdi\u00e7ando esse \u2018precioso tempo de trabalho\u2019 agora mesmo com esta reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"Is that because I\u2019m short?!": u"\u00c9 porque sou baixo?!",
        u"Is that clear?": u"Est\u00e1 claro?",
        u"Is that place really your only dream?! Is that the only thing that\u2019ll make you happy?!": u"Aquele lugar \u00e9 mesmo o seu \u00fanico sonho?! \u00c9 a \u00fanica coisa que vai fazer voc\u00ea feliz?!",
        u"Is that really necessary? We regularly receive our tasks from Mr. Clermont himself. And as far as I know we haven\u2019t had any problems when it comes to communication.": u"Isso \u00e9 realmente necess\u00e1rio? Recebemos nossas tarefas regularmente do pr\u00f3prio Sr. Clermont e, at\u00e9 onde sei, n\u00e3o tivemos problemas de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Is that really the reason\u2026?": u"Esse \u00e9 mesmo o motivo\u2026?",
        u"Is that so\u2026?": u"\u00c9 mesmo\u2026?",
        u"Is that too much to ask?!": u"\u00c9 pedir demais?!",
        u"Is that what you were daydreaming about before? ": u"Era nisso que voc\u00ea estava pensando antes? ",
        u"Is that why you gave a journal just like this to some of the scouts when they first arrived at camp?": u"Foi por isso que voc\u00ea deu um di\u00e1rio igual a este para alguns escoteiros quando chegaram ao acampamento?",
        u"Is that why you let Emilia stay\u2026? ": u"Foi por isso que deixou Emilia ficar\u2026? ",
        u"Is that why your dick is out?": u"\u00c9 por isso que seu pau est\u00e1 para fora?",
        u"Is that\u2026 the limited edition\u2026 rare\u2026 unavailable-on-the-market\u2026": u"Seria essa\u2026 a edi\u00e7\u00e3o limitada\u2026 rara\u2026 indispon\u00edvel no mercado\u2026",
        u"Is the coast clear?": u"A barra est\u00e1 limpa?",
        u"Is there a reason, why you\u2019re always so quiet?": u"Existe algum motivo para voc\u00ea ser sempre t\u00e3o calado?",
        u"Is there anything I can do to help you cool down\u2026?": u"Posso fazer alguma coisa para ajudar voc\u00ea a se refrescar\u2026?",
        u"Is there anything I can help with, sir?": u"Posso ajudar em alguma coisa, senhor?",
        u"Is there even a chance of her getting along with us like Mr. Clermont asked?": u"Ser\u00e1 que existe alguma chance de ela se dar bem com a gente como o Sr. Clermont pediu?",
        u"Is this about the apron again? You guys should make that a part of the camp briefing already! ": u"Isso \u00e9 sobre o avental de novo? Voc\u00eas j\u00e1 deveriam incluir isso na orienta\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento! ",
        u"Is this the same jacket from the picture you showed me earlier, Goro\u2026?": u"Esta \u00e9 a mesma jaqueta da foto que voc\u00ea me mostrou mais cedo, Goro\u2026?",
        u"Is this what you wanted to show me\u2026?": u"Era isso que voc\u00ea queria me mostrar\u2026?",
        u"Is this where you boys have been?! I was looking all over the campsite for you!": u"Ent\u00e3o era aqui que voc\u00eas estavam?! Eu procurei por todo o acampamento!",
        u"Is this your first time taking a group shower too, Darius?": u"Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 sua primeira vez tomando banho em grupo, Darius?",
        u"Is this\u2026 part of your review\u2026? ": u"Isto faz\u2026 parte da sua avalia\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026?",
        u"Is your inner cowboy calling for action?": u"Seu caub\u00f3i interior est\u00e1 pedindo a\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Isn't that the same kinda thing you read in a fortune cookie\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 o tipo de coisa que vem escrito num biscoito da sorte\u2026?",
        u"Isn\u2019t it amusing to see a bunch of grown men in such costumes enjoying a tall glass of beer?": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 divertido ver um grupo de homens adultos usando essas fantasias enquanto toma um belo copo de cerveja?",
        u"Isn\u2019t it obvious already? We\u2019re gonna have a \u201cnot-so-small\u201d contest on who\u2019s got the best D!": u"Ainda n\u00e3o ficou \u00f3bvio? Vamos fazer uma competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u201cnada pequena\u201d para decidir quem tem o melhor pau!",
        u"Isn\u2019t that a good thing, though?": u"Mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma coisa boa?",
        u"Isn\u2019t that a good thing, though? We\u2019re on vacation, after all!": u"Mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 bom? Afinal, estamos de f\u00e9rias!",
        u"Isn\u2019t that right, Jin?": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9, Jin?",
        u"Isn\u2019t that right, Yoshi? *wink*": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 mesmo, Yoshi? *pisca*",
        u"Isn\u2019t that your journal, Yuri?!": u"Esse n\u00e3o \u00e9 o seu di\u00e1rio, Yuri?!",
        u"Isn\u2019t there a way around this? Like, you know, Gramps can just lay back and let us do all the work!": u"N\u00e3o tem outro jeito? Tipo, o Vov\u00f4 poderia simplesmente relaxar e deixar todo o trabalho para n\u00f3s!",
        u"Isn\u2019t this place cool?!": u"Este lugar n\u00e3o \u00e9 incr\u00edvel?!",
        u"It actually makes me see you as even stronger than I did before.  ": u"Na verdade, isso me faz enxergar voc\u00ea como algu\u00e9m ainda mais forte do que antes.  ",
        u"It actually surprised me that Aiden, out of all people, would take it upon himself to watch over Emilia.": u"Na verdade, fiquei surpreso que justamente o Aiden tenha decidido cuidar da Emilia.",
        u"It all makes sense now why she\u2019s like a headless chicken \u2018managing\u2019 us!": u"Agora faz todo sentido ela parecer uma barata tonta \u2018gerenciando\u2019 a gente!",
        u"It also goes against the spirit of the camp, especially the social aspect of it.": u"Isso tamb\u00e9m vai contra o esp\u00edrito do acampamento, principalmente seu aspecto social.",
        u"It also worked out really well \u2013 since I spent a lot of time at this camp as a scout, my architectural style became focused around rustic and cozy designs!": u"Tamb\u00e9m deu muito certo: como passei bastante tempo neste acampamento quando era escoteiro, meu estilo arquitet\u00f4nico acabou se concentrando em projetos r\u00fasticos e aconchegantes!",
        u"It always upset me to see Dad trying so hard to work things out with her, even though it was pointless. Mom was never on the same page as him.": u"Sempre me incomodava ver o pai se esfor\u00e7ando tanto para fazer as coisas darem certo com ela, mesmo sendo in\u00fatil. Mam\u00e3e nunca estava na mesma sintonia que ele.",
        u"It baffles me how out of touch I am with modern times, that even something like games can be used as a business\u2026": u"Fico impressionado com o quanto estou por fora dos tempos modernos, a ponto de at\u00e9 algo como jogos poder ser usado como neg\u00f3cio\u2026",
        u"It baffles me why you\u2019re having second thoughts about this. Help is literally being served to you on a silver\u2014no, gold platter!": u"N\u00e3o entendo por que est\u00e1 hesitando. A ajuda est\u00e1 literalmente sendo oferecida numa bandeja de prata \u2014 n\u00e3o, de ouro!",
        u"It better not be the last, okay\u2026?": u"\u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o ser a \u00faltima, est\u00e1 bem\u2026?",
        u"It brings a tear to my eye. Why I remember\u2014": u"Isso chega a me emocionar. Eu me lembro de quando\u2014",
        u"It brings me back.": u"Me traz lembran\u00e7as.",
        u"It can range from wholesome and cute friends falling in love, to hardcore, smut BDSM cock and ball torture! ": u"Pode ir desde amigos fofos e ador\u00e1veis se apaixonando at\u00e9 putaria BDSM pesada com tortura de pau e bolas! ",
        u"It can\u2019t be helped, Lloyd\u2026 Our job is contractual after all\u2026": u"N\u00e3o tem jeito, Lloyd\u2026 Afinal, nosso trabalho \u00e9 por contrato\u2026",
        u"It can\u2019t be helped. She made quite the impression from the very start.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 o que fazer. Ela causou uma baita impress\u00e3o desde o in\u00edcio.",
        u"It could potentially be a hazardous environment for our workers, and there would be additional costs for the necessary equipment to work in such conditions.": u"Isso poderia criar um ambiente perigoso para nossos trabalhadores, al\u00e9m dos custos adicionais com o equipamento necess\u00e1rio para trabalhar nessas condi\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"It couldn't be helped.": u"N\u00e3o havia o que fazer.",
        u"It couldn\u2019t be helped though\u2026 You were quite the showoff when you were a scout.": u"Mas n\u00e3o havia como evitar\u2026 Voc\u00ea gostava bastante de se exibir quando era escoteiro.",
        u"It couldn\u2019t be helped, sir\u2026 There\u2019s nothing we can do to change what\u2019s already happened\u2026": u"N\u00e3o havia o que fazer, senhor\u2026 N\u00e3o podemos mudar o que j\u00e1 aconteceu\u2026",
        u"It definitely was! How else could you explain all those things happening?! ": u"Claro que foi! De que outra forma explicaria todas essas coisas acontecendo?! ",
        u"It didn't affect his ability to work at first, but eventually he needed medical treatment.": u"No come\u00e7o isso n\u00e3o afetava sua capacidade de trabalhar, mas com o tempo ele precisou de tratamento m\u00e9dico.",
        u"It didn\u2019t fit him.": u"N\u00e3o serviu nele.",
        u"It didn\u2019t fit\u2026? I could\u2019ve sworn I\u2019ve gotten your measurements before, right\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o serviu\u2026? Eu poderia jurar que j\u00e1 tinha suas medidas, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"It does make me wonder how many of them will come back next year.": u"Isso me faz pensar em quantos deles voltar\u00e3o no ano que vem.",
        u"It does take a while to turn on\u2026 We usually just go to the internet caf\u00e9 nearby if we need something done digitally.": u"Ele realmente demora para ligar\u2026 Normalmente vamos ao cibercaf\u00e9 mais pr\u00f3ximo quando precisamos fazer algo digitalmente.",
        u"It doesn\u2019t matter now, sir, \u2019cause it\u2019s all in the past\u2026": u"Isso n\u00e3o importa mais, senhor, porque tudo ficou no passado\u2026",
        u"It doesn\u2019t matter. Just answer my question.": u"N\u00e3o importa. Apenas responda \u00e0 minha pergunta.",
        u"It doesn\u2019t say anywhere in the camp rules that you can\u2019t! So, you have no excuses, hahaha!": u"N\u00e3o est\u00e1 escrito em lugar nenhum das regras do acampamento que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode! Ent\u00e3o, ficou sem desculpas, hahaha!",
        u"It even feels weird with you saying it.": u"At\u00e9 parece estranho ouvir voc\u00ea dizer isso.",
        u"It feels familiar.": u"Parece familiar.",
        u"It feels really nostalgic\u2026 It reminds me of how we used to be back then.": u"\u00c9 muito nost\u00e1lgico\u2026 Faz lembrar como \u00e9ramos naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"It feels so surreal hearing that from you, sir\u2026": u"Parece t\u00e3o surreal ouvir isso do senhor\u2026",
        u"It feels wrong.": u"Parece errado.",
        u"It felt so good though\u2026 I guess I\u2019ve been holding that in for so long\u2026": u"Mas foi t\u00e3o bom\u2026 Acho que eu estava segurando isso h\u00e1 tanto tempo\u2026",
        u"It got even wilder when you took your pants off\u2026 People mistook you as one of the strippers\u2026": u"Ficou ainda mais louco quando tirou as cal\u00e7as\u2026 As pessoas confundiram voc\u00ea com um dos strippers\u2026",
        u"It has been nothing but absolute stress and displeasure to deal with you, and quite frankly you\u2019ve long overstayed your welcome!": u"Lidar com voc\u00ea n\u00e3o trouxe nada al\u00e9m de estresse e desgosto e, francamente, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 passou h\u00e1 muito tempo dos limites da nossa hospitalidade!",
        u"It has been snowing ever since we got here.": u"Est\u00e1 nevando desde que chegamos.",
        u"It has to be something that you do just for fun~ ": u"Precisa ser algo que fa\u00e7a s\u00f3 por divers\u00e3o~ ",
        u"It has to come from you\u2026 I\u2019m sure you\u2019re tired of living in your old ways too.": u"A mudan\u00e7a precisa partir de voc\u00ea\u2026 Tenho certeza de que tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 cansada de viver como antes.",
        u"It hurts both me and my wallet\u2026 But if it\u2019s for my 2-D husbandos, I don\u2019t mind!": u"Isso d\u00f3i em mim e na minha carteira\u2026 Mas, se for pelos meus husbandos 2D, n\u00e3o me importo!",
        u"It hurts to see you wasting your life on me like this with every passing day\u2026": u"D\u00f3i ver voc\u00ea desperdi\u00e7ando sua vida comigo desse jeito a cada dia que passa\u2026",
        u"It is getting colder every day too. Did you guys pack some warmer clothes?": u"Tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 ficando mais frio a cada dia. Voc\u00eas levaram roupas mais quentes?",
        u"It is hard to imagine, but that just makes me wonder what it was like even more!": u"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil imaginar, mas isso s\u00f3 me deixa ainda mais curioso para saber como era!",
        u"It is pretty strange for him to be absent like that without any warning.": u"\u00c9 bem estranho ele desaparecer assim sem avisar.",
        u"It is true, though. Yoshinori here is quite the perfect fit for you, Goro. ": u"Mas \u00e9 verdade. Yoshinori combina perfeitamente com voc\u00ea, Goro. ",
        u"It is, sir. Thank you very much for your generosity.": u"Sim, senhor. Muito obrigado por sua generosidade.",
        u"It is. But I want us to be more.": u"\u00c9. Mas eu quero que sejamos mais do que isso.",
        u"It is. But Lloyd and I also finished up the repairs today, so we wanted to celebrate.": u"\u00c9. Mas eu e Lloyd tamb\u00e9m terminamos os reparos hoje, ent\u00e3o quer\u00edamos comemorar.",
        u"It just doesn\u2019t make sense why he\u2019d give up like that\u2026": u"Simplesmente n\u00e3o faz sentido ele desistir desse jeito\u2026",
        u"It just makes it more exciting, right\u2026?": u"Isso s\u00f3 deixa tudo mais excitante, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"It just makes me wonder.": u"Isso s\u00f3 me deixa curioso.",
        u"It just so happens that I stumbled upon Yoichi here playing with his puppies and\u2014": u"Por acaso encontrei o Yoichi aqui brincando com os filhotes e\u2014",
        u"It looks a lot cooler in person\u2026!": u"Ela \u00e9 muito mais legal pessoalmente\u2026!",
        u"It looks dope.": u"Ela \u00e9 irada.",
        u"It looks good on you, Lloyd.": u"Ficou bom em voc\u00ea, Lloyd.",
        u"It looks like Lloyd and Darius are in a rush to check the expansion site.": u"Parece que Lloyd e Darius est\u00e3o com pressa para verificar a \u00e1rea da expans\u00e3o.",
        u"It looks like Yuri\u2019s hosting a game with some of the scouts.": u"Parece que Yuri est\u00e1 fazendo uma atividade com alguns dos escoteiros.",
        u"It looks like a bad burn, but only on your front side.  Applying cream should do the trick.": u"Parece uma queimadura forte, mas s\u00f3 na parte da frente.  Passar o creme deve resolver.",
        u"It looks like a lizard. Does it stand for anything?": u"Parece um lagarto. Ele representa alguma coisa?",
        u"It looks like all the snow is still loose, so it shouldn\u2019t be too hard to manually pile it up elsewhere.": u"Parece que toda a neve ainda est\u00e1 solta, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o deve ser t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil junt\u00e1-la manualmente em outro lugar.",
        u"It looks like he\u2019s a little bit car sick\u2026": u"Parece que ele est\u00e1 um pouco enjoado com a viagem\u2026",
        u"It looks like it\u2026": u"Parece que sim\u2026",
        u"It looks like rainbow pepperoni..": u"Parece pepperoni de arco-\u00edris\u2026",
        u"It looks like she hasn\u2019t posted anything before this too. Let me see if she linked her Fakebook and Twatter here too\u2026 ": u"Parece que ela tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o postou nada antes disso. Deixa eu ver se ela vinculou o Fakebook e o Twatter aqui tamb\u00e9m\u2026 ",
        u"It looks like she\u2019s on her laptop. Is she working?": u"Parece que ela est\u00e1 no notebook. Est\u00e1 trabalhando?",
        u"It looks like the snowstorm hit harder here than expected while we were away\u2026 ": u"Parece que a tempestade de neve atingiu este lugar com mais for\u00e7a do que esper\u00e1vamos enquanto est\u00e1vamos fora\u2026 ",
        u"It looks like there\u2019s no chance any of us can get along with her. She\u2019s made up her mind that we\u2019re all out to get her.": u"Parece que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 chance de nenhum de n\u00f3s conseguir se dar bem com ela. Ela colocou na cabe\u00e7a que todos estamos contra ela.",
        u"It looks like two of us have to share one as well\u2026": u"Parece que dois de n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m ter\u00e3o que dividir uma\u2026",
        u"It looks like we need to be more prepared for the unexpected from here on. ": u"Parece que, de agora em diante, precisamos estar mais preparados para os imprevistos. ",
        u"It looks like you\u2019re doing something fun, though! Are you guys playing cards?": u"Mas parece que est\u00e3o fazendo algo divertido! Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o jogando cartas?",
        u"It looks quite cold out there\u2026 ": u"Parece estar bem frio l\u00e1 fora\u2026 ",
        u"It made me feel even more distant from her instead of wanting to build a relationship.": u"Isso me fez sentir ainda mais distante dela, em vez de querer construir uma rela\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"It made me realize how easy it is to take for granted how much serious, but not always exciting, work Sir Goro does behind the scenes outside of the camp\u2026 ": u"Isso me fez perceber como \u00e9 f\u00e1cil n\u00e3o dar valor \u00e0 quantidade de trabalho s\u00e9rio, embora nem sempre empolgante, que o Sr. Goro faz nos bastidores fora do acampamento\u2026 ",
        u"It made me realize that I haven\u2019t changed at all\u2026 I\u2019m still that bitter old man with anger issues\u2026": u"Isso me fez perceber que n\u00e3o mudei nada\u2026 Ainda sou aquele velho amargurado com problemas de raiva\u2026",
        u"It made me realize that I haven\u2019t changed at all\u2026 I\u2019m still that bitter old man with anger issues\u2026{fast}": u"Isso me fez perceber que n\u00e3o mudei nada\u2026 Ainda sou aquele velho amargurado com problemas de raiva\u2026{fast}",
        u"It made me realize that ever since I became a scoutmaster, I\u2019ve been so single-mindedly focused on the present and future of Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Isso me fez perceber que, desde que me tornei chefe escoteiro, tenho me concentrado exclusivamente no presente e no futuro do Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"It made me see things differently and be content with what I have today.": u"Ele me fez enxergar as coisas de outra forma e ficar satisfeito com o que tenho hoje.",
        u"It makes me wonder what kind of hotel it is. Mr. Clermont didn\u2019t really give us any details.": u"Fico imaginando que tipo de hotel \u00e9. O Sr. Clermont n\u00e3o nos deu muitos detalhes.",
        u"It makes no sense why he has the same position as you given that he doesn\u2019t meet the qualifications.": u"N\u00e3o faz sentido ele ocupar o mesmo cargo que voc\u00ea sem cumprir as qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"It means positivity, flexibility and regeneration, three things that matter when facing challenges in life!": u"Significa positividade, flexibilidade e regenera\u00e7\u00e3o, tr\u00eas coisas importantes ao enfrentar os desafios da vida!",
        u"It must be easy to bulk up when you\u2019ve got a place like this!": u"Deve ser f\u00e1cil ganhar m\u00fasculos quando se tem um lugar assim!",
        u"It must\u2019ve been nice that you guys had a little bit of a break before this project began then, huh?": u"Ent\u00e3o deve ter sido bom voc\u00eas terem tido um pequeno descanso antes do in\u00edcio deste projeto, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"It must\u2019ve been so difficult to make all those sacrifices.": u"Deve ter sido muito dif\u00edcil fazer todos aqueles sacrif\u00edcios.",
        u"It only made her worse.": u"S\u00f3 deixou ela pior.",
        u"It only made him more anxious, so I tried to motivate him to accept it.": u"Isso s\u00f3 o deixou mais ansioso, ent\u00e3o tentei motiv\u00e1-lo a aceitar.",
        u"It only made me shut off even more, and I felt like all our hardships were for nothing\u2026 It was a cycle of self-destruction\u2026": u"Isso s\u00f3 fez com que eu me fechasse ainda mais, e eu sentia que todas as nossas dificuldades tinham sido em v\u00e3o\u2026 Era um ciclo de autodestrui\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"It really doesn\u2019t make sense to me why you even chose to come back and work with us if you hate it so much\u2026": u"Eu realmente n\u00e3o entendo por que voc\u00ea escolheu voltar e trabalhar com a gente se odeia tanto aquele lugar\u2026",
        u"It really feels like you don\u2019t think I\u2019m cut out for it at all\u2026": u"Realmente parece que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acha que sou capaz disso\u2026",
        u"It really feels like you don\u2019t trust me at all\u2026": u"Realmente parece que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o confia em mim\u2026",
        u"It really has been a while since I\u2019ve helped out in the kitchen. I hope we can finish in time.": u"Realmente faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o ajudo na cozinha. Espero que possamos terminar a tempo.",
        u"It really has been a while, hasn\u2019t it, Yoshi\u2026?": u"Realmente j\u00e1 faz um tempo, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Yoshi\u2026?",
        u"It really is too bad he can\u2019t stay, then\u2026 I think he could really make a difference at the camp.": u"\u00c9 realmente uma pena que ele n\u00e3o possa ficar\u2026 Acho que faria uma grande diferen\u00e7a no acampamento.",
        u"It really seems out of character, especially with the way you\u2019ve always presented yourself to us, sir.": u"Realmente parece n\u00e3o combinar com o senhor, principalmente pela maneira como sempre se apresentou para n\u00f3s.",
        u"It really was a great day, wasn\u2019t it Yoshinori?": u"Realmente foi um \u00f3timo dia, n\u00e3o foi, Yoshinori?",
        u"It reflects upheavals at the early stages of your romantic life, but in the latter part it shows a promising partnership that will last for a lifetime!": u"Isso representa turbul\u00eancias no in\u00edcio da sua vida amorosa, mas a parte final mostra uma parceria promissora que durar\u00e1 a vida toda!",
        u"It seemed out of character.": u"Parecia n\u00e3o combinar com o senhor.",
        u"It seemed the public recognized the potential I saw from it and your camp. It was such a breath of fresh air from anything that\u2019s out there in the market!": u"Parece que o p\u00fablico reconheceu o potencial que vi no livro e no acampamento. Foi uma novidade muito bem-vinda em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com tudo o que existe no mercado!",
        u"It seems Ms. Komarova is quite fond of you. She had a different tone when talking with you.": u"Parece que a Srta. Komarova gosta bastante de voc\u00ea. Ela usou um tom diferente ao falar consigo.",
        u"It seems a lot more like a club than a casual pub\u2026": u"Parece muito mais uma boate do que um pub casual\u2026",
        u"It seems like most of the boxes we opened out here so far just have random items in them.": u"Parece que a maioria das caixas que abrimos at\u00e9 agora s\u00f3 cont\u00e9m objetos aleat\u00f3rios.",
        u"It seems like your lucky charm didn\u2019t work one bit. Hahaha!": u"Parece que o seu amuleto da sorte n\u00e3o funcionou nem um pouco. Hahaha!",
        u"It seems that Taiga and I have a lot in common, believe it or not.": u"Parece que eu e Taiga temos muito em comum, acredite ou n\u00e3o.",
        u"It seems today was just scratching the surface of the work that\u2019s going to be done here, and our first big trial is going to be an inspection in a week\u2019s time.": u"Parece que hoje apenas tocamos a superf\u00edcie de todo o trabalho que ser\u00e1 realizado aqui, e nosso primeiro grande teste ser\u00e1 uma inspe\u00e7\u00e3o daqui a uma semana.",
        u"It shocked me seeing him open up like that yesterday, letting everyone ask stuff I never guessed he\u2019d wanna answer.": u"Fiquei chocado ao v\u00ea-lo se abrir daquele jeito ontem, deixando todo mundo perguntar coisas que eu nunca imaginei que ele aceitaria responder.",
        u"It should be obvious that these routines are for health and wellness, not leisure. Which I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll agree is a requisite for labor-intensive jobs such as the ones Mr. Najjar and Mr. Sirius have.": u"Deveria ser \u00f3bvio que essas rotinas s\u00e3o para sa\u00fade e bem-estar, n\u00e3o lazer. E tenho certeza de que concordar\u00e1 que isso \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio em trabalhos fisicamente exigentes como os do Sr. Najjar e do Sr. Sirius.",
        u"It should be right along the hallway! Please follow m\u2014": u"Fica logo ali no corredor! Por favor, sigam-m\u2014",
        u"It should definitely be something green! That\u2019s totally your color! ": u"Com certeza deveria ser algo verde! Essa cor combina totalmente com voc\u00ea! ",
        u"It smells like sweat and protein shakes\u2026! Try opening up a window!": u"Cheira a suor e shake de prote\u00edna\u2026! Tentem abrir uma janela!",
        u"It sounds like a lot, and I feel like I should be concerned\u2026": u"Parece muita coisa, e sinto que deveria ficar preocupado\u2026",
        u"It sounds like it\u2019d be great for the camp\u2019s future!": u"Parece que seria \u00f3timo para o futuro do acampamento!",
        u"It sounds like there\u2019ll be so many new things to try out here\u2026!": u"Parece que haver\u00e1 tantas coisas novas para experimentar aqui\u2026!",
        u"It stands for Bondage and Discipline, Sadism and Masochism, and Submission and Dominance.": u"Significa Bondage e Disciplina, Sadismo e Masoquismo, e Submiss\u00e3o e Domina\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"It started affecting her studies\u2026 and even her overall demeanor changed thanks to all the pent-up frustrations\u2026": u"Isso come\u00e7ou a afetar os estudos dela\u2026 e at\u00e9 seu comportamento mudou por causa de toda a frustra\u00e7\u00e3o acumulada\u2026",
        u"It sure is, you hillbilly! The letters stand for Bondage and Discipline, Sadism and Masochism, and Submission and Dominance! ": u"Claro que s\u00e3o, seu caipira! As letras significam Bondage e Disciplina, Sadismo e Masoquismo, al\u00e9m de Submiss\u00e3o e Domina\u00e7\u00e3o! ",
        u"It takes a lot of skill to write a script, let alone visualize it with hand-drawn illustrations!": u"\u00c9 preciso muita habilidade para escrever um roteiro, ainda mais para visualiz\u00e1-lo com ilustra\u00e7\u00f5es desenhadas \u00e0 m\u00e3o!",
        u"It takes courage to tear your walls down, and allow someone to see how you truly feel inside\u2026": u"\u00c9 preciso coragem para derrubar suas barreiras e permitir que algu\u00e9m veja como voc\u00ea realmente se sente por dentro\u2026",
        u"It takes me back to when we had that other all-girls branch Dad left me in charge of\u2026": u"Isso me lembra de quando t\u00ednhamos aquela outra unidade s\u00f3 para garotas que o Pai deixou sob minha responsabilidade\u2026",
        u"It took me so long to start making up for all the mistakes I\u2019ve made in the past, and I really believed that it wasn\u2019t too late to change.": u"Demorei tanto para come\u00e7ar a reparar todos os erros que cometi no passado, e realmente acreditei que ainda n\u00e3o era tarde demais para mudar.",
        u"It turns out another reason he wanted to visit was to discuss it.": u"Acontece que outro motivo para ele querer nos visitar era justamente conversar sobre isso.",
        u"It used to be your dad\u2019s dream, and now you get to fulfill that for him!": u"Esse era o sonho do seu pai, e agora voc\u00ea pode realiz\u00e1-lo por ele!",
        u"It was Yoshinori\u2019s idea to throw you a party, though!": u"Mas foi ideia do Yoshinori fazer uma festa para voc\u00ea!",
        u"It was a difficult time for you, I can't even comprehend how much you both had to go through in the last few years...": u"Foi uma \u00e9poca dif\u00edcil para voc\u00ea. Eu nem consigo imaginar tudo pelo que voc\u00eas dois tiveram que passar nos \u00faltimos anos\u2026",
        u"It was a huge deal, actually\u2026 Keitaro\u2019s book did so well on the market that Mr. Clermont offered an even bigger budget to improve the camp.": u"Na verdade, foi algo muito importante\u2026 O livro do Keitaro teve um desempenho t\u00e3o bom no mercado que o senhor Clermont ofereceu um or\u00e7amento ainda maior para melhorar o acampamento.",
        u"It was a little stressful.": u"Foi um pouco estressante.",
        u"It was a miracle nobody found us, or else it would\u2019ve been a disaster.": u"Foi um milagre ningu\u00e9m ter encontrado a gente, sen\u00e3o teria sido um desastre.",
        u"It was a ton of fun! We have lots of stories about it, haha!": u"Foi muito divertido! Temos v\u00e1rias hist\u00f3rias sobre aquela noite, haha!",
        u"It was actually all quite impressive \u2013 they laid out not only their personal plans but also ideas for the camp as well.": u"Na verdade, foi tudo bastante impressionante \u2014 eles apresentaram n\u00e3o apenas seus planos pessoais, mas tamb\u00e9m ideias para o acampamento.",
        u"It was actually the first time we showered together!": u"Na verdade, foi a primeira vez que tomamos banho juntos!",
        u"It was already hard enough trying to raise me, keep a roof over our heads and put food on the table all by himself!": u"J\u00e1 era dif\u00edcil o bastante me criar, manter um teto sobre nossas cabe\u00e7as e colocar comida na mesa sozinho!",
        u"It was as if those times from the past froze, and never thawed until recently.": u"Era como se aqueles tempos do passado tivessem congelado e s\u00f3 recentemente come\u00e7assem a descongelar.",
        u"It was entertaining seeing how long you could keep yourself calm~": u"Foi divertido ver por quanto tempo voc\u00ea conseguia se manter calmo~",
        u"It was entertaining seeing how long you could keep yourself calm~{fast}": u"Foi divertido ver por quanto tempo voc\u00ea conseguia se manter calmo~{fast}",
        u"It was getting boring with these dorks too; all we do is just sit around and play stupid video games. ": u"Tamb\u00e9m estava ficando chato com esses idiotas; a gente s\u00f3 fica sentado jogando videogame idiota. ",
        u"It was his incredible planning that let us build everything from the ground up. ": u"Foi o planejamento incr\u00edvel dele que nos permitiu construir tudo desde o come\u00e7o. ",
        u"It was in my riding days that I met Vera and we had our child.": u"Foi na \u00e9poca em que eu pilotava que conheci Vera e tivemos nossa filha.",
        u"It was in the e-mail chain you requested access to. Did you get a chance to read it?": u"Estava na sequ\u00eancia de e-mails \u00e0 qual voc\u00ea pediu acesso. Teve a oportunidade de ler?",
        u"It was just a dream\u2026": u"Foi s\u00f3 um sonho\u2026",
        u"It was more than just me who saw you naked, Aiden\u2026 Remember?": u"N\u00e3o fui apenas eu que vi voc\u00ea pelado, Aiden\u2026 Lembra?",
        u"It was my idea.": u"A ideia foi minha.",
        u"It was my pleasure, Mr. Nagira.": u"O prazer foi meu, Sr. Nagira.",
        u"It was my pleasure, Mr. Nomoru.": u"O prazer foi meu, Sr. Nomoru.",
        u"It was nowhere near as grand as this one, that\u2019s for sure": u"Com certeza, n\u00e3o chegava nem perto de ser t\u00e3o grandiosa quanto esta.",
        u"It was obvious you and Yoshi were into each other when we were scouts, but it took a long time for you to make it official.": u"Era \u00f3bvio que voc\u00ea e o Yoshi gostavam um do outro quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros, mas demorou bastante para voc\u00eas oficializarem.",
        u"It was only a matter of time until we found out about it. ": u"Era apenas uma quest\u00e3o de tempo at\u00e9 descobrirmos. ",
        u"It was out of our control. None of us could\u2019ve predicted this would happen.": u"Estava fora do nosso controle. Nenhum de n\u00f3s poderia prever que isso aconteceria.",
        u"It was quite the experience with you guys though\u2026": u"Mas foi uma experi\u00eancia e tanto com voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"It was quite the ride \u2013 we encountered problems that couldn\u2019t be predicted from when we were scouts, or even from before we returned to camp.": u"Foi uma verdadeira jornada \u2014 enfrentamos problemas que jamais poder\u00edamos prever quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros, nem mesmo antes de voltarmos ao acampamento.",
        u"It was really nice having you in the scoutmaster\u2019s quarters for a while.": u"Foi muito bom ter voc\u00ea nos aposentos dos chefes escoteiros por um tempo.",
        u"It was selfish\u2026 and I truly regret it\u2026": u"Foi ego\u00edsmo\u2026 e eu me arrependo profundamente\u2026",
        u"It was silly.": u"Foi bobagem.",
        u"It was so unfair that I projected all my insecurities towards you\u2026 You didn\u2019t deserve to be treated like that...": u"Foi t\u00e3o injusto eu descontar todas as minhas inseguran\u00e7as em voc\u00ea\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o merecia ser tratado daquele jeito...",
        u"It was the only thing I could do to make you proud of me...": u"Era a \u00fanica coisa que eu podia fazer para deixar voc\u00ea orgulhoso de mim...",
        u"It was the reason I got to stay here at Camp Buddy in the first place!": u"Foi gra\u00e7as a ele que pude ficar aqui no Camp Buddy desde o in\u00edcio!",
        u"It was the right thing to do, sir.": u"Foi a coisa certa a fazer, senhor.",
        u"It was the right thing to do.": u"Foi a coisa certa a fazer.",
        u"It was the wildest time of my life, where I lived in the moment and nothing else mattered as long as I was having fun.": u"Foi a \u00e9poca mais selvagem da minha vida, quando eu vivia o momento e nada mais importava enquanto estivesse me divertindo.",
        u"It was there that I saw you begin to have friends\u2026 dreams\u2026 and hope for the future\u2026": u"Foi l\u00e1 que vi voc\u00ea come\u00e7ar a ter amigos\u2026 sonhos\u2026 e esperan\u00e7a para o futuro\u2026",
        u"It was unfair and narrow-minded of me to even think like that\u2026": u"Foi injusto e ego\u00edsta da minha parte sequer pensar assim\u2026",
        u"It was way worse before Camp Buddy too...": u"E era muito pior antes do Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"It was worth it too! I\u2019ve been able to eat all the delicious food you\u2019ve made over the years, and it\u2019s still the best I\u2019ve ever had! ": u"Tamb\u00e9m valeu a pena! Pude comer toda a comida deliciosa que preparou ao longo dos anos, e ainda \u00e9 a melhor que j\u00e1 provei! ",
        u"It was worth it.": u"Valeu a pena.",
        u"It was wrong of me to make such a huge decision on my own\u2026": u"Foi errado da minha parte tomar uma decis\u00e3o t\u00e3o grande sozinho\u2026",
        u"It was you all along, Goro\u2026 I was only there to listen, and allow you to grow at your own pace\u2026": u"Foi voc\u00ea o tempo todo, Goro\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 estava l\u00e1 para ouvir e permitir que voc\u00ea crescesse no seu pr\u00f3prio ritmo\u2026",
        u"It was, but it was the right thing to do.": u"Foi, mas era a coisa certa a fazer.",
        u"It was. But I don\u2019t regret them.": u"Foi. Mas n\u00e3o me arrependo deles.",
        u"It wasn't a productive conversation.": u"A conversa n\u00e3o estava sendo produtiva.",
        u"It wasn\u2019t a productive conversation anymore.": u"A conversa j\u00e1 n\u00e3o estava sendo produtiva.",
        u"It wasn\u2019t even until today that I found out you and your dad had to leave Camp Buddy after the first term\u2026": u"Foi s\u00f3 hoje que descobri que voc\u00ea e seu pai tiveram que deixar o Camp Buddy depois da primeira temporada\u2026",
        u"It wasn\u2019t just me, Jin helped me plan them out too!": u"N\u00e3o fui s\u00f3 eu, Jin tamb\u00e9m me ajudou a planej\u00e1-las!",
        u"It was\u2026 pretty nerve-racking\u2026 It\u2019s so different from the ones we usually have back at camp.": u"Foi\u2026 bastante estressante\u2026 \u00c9 muito diferente das reuni\u00f5es que costumamos ter no acampamento.",
        u"It will be very complicated to explain everything to Mr. Clermont.": u"Vai ser muito complicado explicar tudo ao Sr. Clermont.",
        u"It won\u2019t be, Aiden.  ": u"N\u00e3o vai ser, Aiden.  ",
        u"It would defeat the spirit of the camp.": u"Isso contrariaria o esp\u00edrito do acampamento.",
        u"It would take a real expert to conceptualize and deliver this level of craftmanship! ": u"Foi preciso um verdadeiro especialista para conceber e executar este n\u00edvel de acabamento! ",
        u"It would\u2019ve been much safer for the campers that way.": u"Teria sido muito mais seguro para os campistas desse jeito.",
        u"It'll be over soon.": u"Logo vai acabar.",
        u"It's a chance to spend time with everyone.": u"\u00c9 uma chance de passar um tempo com todo mundo.",
        u"It's a good thing you were there.": u"Ainda bem que o senhor estava presente.",
        u"It's all in the past.": u"Tudo isso ficou no passado.",
        u"It's alright. I want us to get rid of a lot of clutter before Mr. Clermont's ocular visit. ": u"Tudo bem. Quero que nos livremos de boa parte da bagun\u00e7a antes da visita de inspe\u00e7\u00e3o do senhor Clermont. ",
        u"It's different.": u"\u00c9 diferente.",
        u"It's for your own good!": u"\u00c9 para o seu pr\u00f3prio bem!",
        u"It's not Aiden's fault.": u"A culpa n\u00e3o \u00e9 do Aiden.",
        u"It's not a bad thing.": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 ruim.",
        u"It's not something to be ashamed of.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 algo de que se envergonhar.",
        u"It's not up to me.": u"N\u00e3o cabe a mim decidir.",
        u"It's not your fault, Aiden... I know how big of a decision this is for you\u2026": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa sua, Aiden\u2026 Eu sei o quanto esta decis\u00e3o \u00e9 importante para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"It's not your fault, Aiden... I was being insensitive to your feelings, after all...": u"N\u00e3o foi culpa sua, Aiden\u2026 Afinal, eu estava sendo insens\u00edvel com seus sentimentos\u2026",
        u"It's so different from back at camp.": u"\u00c9 muito diferente das reuni\u00f5es no acampamento.",
        u"It's the least I could do.": u"\u00c9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer.",
        u"It's the opposite!": u"\u00c9 exatamente o contr\u00e1rio!",
        u"It's too bad he can't stay.": u"\u00c9 uma pena que ele n\u00e3o possa ficar.",
        u"It's up to him to decide.": u"Cabe a ele decidir.",
        u"It's what he likes doing.": u"\u00c9 o que ele gosta de fazer.",
        u"It\u2019d be much easier for everyone to have an in-house technician, right? I\u2019d say that\u2019s a win-win!": u"Seria muito mais f\u00e1cil para todos ter um t\u00e9cnico aqui mesmo, certo? Eu diria que todo mundo sai ganhando!",
        u"It\u2019d be nice to relax a little bit, so how about we try the spa?": u"Seria bom relaxar um pouco, ent\u00e3o que tal experimentarmos o spa?",
        u"It\u2019d be really exciting to travel the world with you, sir!": u"Seria muito emocionante viajar pelo mundo com o senhor!",
        u"It\u2019d be really rude to turn down Mr. Clermont\u2019s generous offer.": u"Seria muita falta de educa\u00e7\u00e3o recusar a oferta generosa do Sr. Clermont.",
        u"It\u2019ll also give me an idea of what we\u2019re dealing with for the project.": u"Isso tamb\u00e9m me dar\u00e1 uma ideia do que teremos pela frente no projeto.",
        u"It\u2019ll be a special section about the spiciest moments with a certain someone~": u"Vai ser uma se\u00e7\u00e3o especial sobre os momentos mais picantes com uma certa pessoa~",
        u"It\u2019ll be fine, Yoshi and Gramps are gonna be there with her! ": u"Vai ficar tudo bem, Yoshi e Vov\u00f4 estar\u00e3o l\u00e1 com ela! ",
        u"It\u2019ll be fine, Yoshinori. Just follow my lead.": u"Ficar\u00e1 tudo bem, Yoshinori. Apenas siga a minha lideran\u00e7a.",
        u"It\u2019ll be fine, Yuri. Trust me, I know what to do this time.": u"Vai ficar tudo bem, Yuri. Confie em mim, desta vez sei o que fazer.",
        u"It\u2019ll be good to document our experiences here. Besides, natural, candid shots are more fun to look at.": u"Ser\u00e1 bom registrar nossas experi\u00eancias aqui. Al\u00e9m disso, fotos naturais e espont\u00e2neas s\u00e3o mais divertidas de ver.",
        u"It\u2019ll be just like having a campfire song.": u"Ser\u00e1 como cantar ao redor da fogueira.",
        u"It\u2019ll be much quieter, and we won\u2019t be busy at all.": u"Vai estar bem mais tranquilo, e n\u00e3o estaremos ocupados.",
        u"It\u2019ll definitely be hard to top.": u"Com certeza vai ser dif\u00edcil superar isso.",
        u"It\u2019ll get very cold in the evenings so everyone, including the pups, can stay in the cabins for the night. ": u"Vai ficar muito frio \u00e0 noite, ent\u00e3o todos, inclusive os filhotes, podem dormir nas cabanas. ",
        u"It\u2019ll run faster once we get your internet here upgraded! But that\u2019s work for another day!": u"Ele funcionar\u00e1 ainda mais r\u00e1pido quando melhorarmos a internet daqui! Mas esse trabalho fica para outro dia!",
        u"It\u2019ll take you way longer than that, Aiden! Your costume has too many layers!": u"Vai demorar muito mais que isso, Aiden! Sua fantasia tem camadas demais!",
        u"It\u2019s Emilia. Emilia Komarova.": u"\u00c9 Emilia. Emilia Komarova.",
        u"It\u2019s Mr. Clermont we\u2019re talking about after all\u2026": u"Afinal, estamos falando do Sr. Clermont\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s Yoshinori\u2026 Can I come in? ": u"\u00c9 o Yoshinori\u2026 Posso entrar? ",
        u"It\u2019s a JOB! It\u2019s always about the money!": u"\u00c9 um EMPREGO! \u00c9 sempre sobre dinheiro!",
        u"It\u2019s a bath. There\u2019s no point.": u"\u00c9 um banho. N\u00e3o faz sentido.",
        u"It\u2019s a bit of a shame you boys have to see the camp in this state.": u"\u00c9 uma pena voc\u00eas terem que ver o acampamento nesse estado.",
        u"It\u2019s a bummer Gramps barged in just when things were really heating up.": u"\u00c9 uma pena o Vov\u00f4 ter entrado justo quando as coisas estavam esquentando de verdade.",
        u"It\u2019s a bummer that the scouts don\u2019t have a costume, though\u2026": u"\u00c9 uma pena que os escoteiros n\u00e3o tenham fantasias\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s a common misconception that groups like us were violent, good-for-nothing delinquents.": u"\u00c9 um equ\u00edvoco comum achar que grupos como o nosso eram formados por delinquentes violentos e imprest\u00e1veis.",
        u"It\u2019s a girl\u2019s intuition. You guys wouldn\u2019t understand.": u"\u00c9 intui\u00e7\u00e3o feminina. Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o entenderiam.",
        u"It\u2019s a good thing no one walked in on us, or that would\u2019ve been\u2014": u"Ainda bem que ningu\u00e9m entrou enquanto est\u00e1vamos l\u00e1, sen\u00e3o teria sido\u2014",
        u"It\u2019s a good thing this hotel had an in-house doctor available to help.": u"Ainda bem que este hotel tinha um m\u00e9dico dispon\u00edvel no local para ajudar.",
        u"It\u2019s a good thing you came to the rescue, huh? Haha!": u"Ainda bem que voc\u00ea veio me salvar, hein? Haha!",
        u"It\u2019s a good thing you got the hang of it in the end though! ": u"Mas ainda bem que acabou pegando o jeito! ",
        u"It\u2019s a good thing you were there, sir.": u"Ainda bem que o senhor estava presente.",
        u"It\u2019s a huge step for you, I\u2019m sure. But I\u2019m really proud that you\u2019re off to a great start.": u"Tenho certeza de que \u00e9 um grande passo para voc\u00ea. Mas estou muito orgulhoso por estar come\u00e7ando t\u00e3o bem.",
        u"It\u2019s a little embarrassing that she\u2019s making a scene\u2026 a lot of people are starting to look at us\u2026": u"\u00c9 um pouco constrangedor ela fazer esse esc\u00e2ndalo\u2026 muita gente est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando a olhar para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s a lot more complicated than that\u2026": u"\u00c9 muito mais complicado do que isso\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s a mix of cream, coffee and hazelnut liqueur!": u"\u00c9 uma mistura de creme, caf\u00e9 e licor de avel\u00e3!",
        u"It\u2019s a mix of vodka, peach schnapps, cranberry and orange! ": u"\u00c9 uma mistura de vodca, licor de p\u00eassego, cranberry e laranja! ",
        u"It\u2019s a pickle, for fuck\u2019s sake!": u"\u00c9 um picles, porra!",
        u"It\u2019s a pleasure to meet you, uhh\u2026 Mr. Choi?": u"\u00c9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-lo, hum\u2026 Sr. Choi?",
        u"It\u2019s a promise!": u"\u00c9 uma promessa!",
        u"It\u2019s a relief to know I\u2019ll be working with someone around my age too, Lloyd! ": u"\u00c9 um al\u00edvio saber que tamb\u00e9m trabalharei com algu\u00e9m da minha idade, Lloyd! ",
        u"It\u2019s a report from Jin about the technical progress\u2026 I didn\u2019t have time to read it last night, and this morning I\u2019ve been rushing to get to town.": u"\u00c9 um relat\u00f3rio do Jin sobre o progresso t\u00e9cnico\u2026 N\u00e3o tive tempo de l\u00ea-lo ontem \u00e0 noite e hoje de manh\u00e3 estou correndo para chegar \u00e0 cidade.",
        u"It\u2019s a shame that you guys have to see them worn down from the storm\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 uma pena voc\u00eas terem que v\u00ea-los danificados pela tempestade\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s a shame we\u2019re going to be checking out tomorrow.": u"\u00c9 uma pena que vamos fazer o check-out amanh\u00e3.",
        u"It\u2019s a simple mix of coffee and vodka!": u"\u00c9 uma mistura simples de caf\u00e9 e vodca!",
        u"It\u2019s a simple mix of digestif and energy drink!": u"\u00c9 uma mistura simples de digestivo e energ\u00e9tico!",
        u"It\u2019s a threesome then! Take your clothes off and let\u2019s go put on a great show~!": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 um m\u00e9nage! Tire a roupa e vamos dar um grande espet\u00e1culo~!",
        u"It\u2019s a totally different world from my usual work! Everything is always bright and full of laughter! Not to mention the good food!": u"\u00c9 um mundo completamente diferente do meu trabalho habitual! Tudo aqui \u00e9 sempre alegre e cheio de risadas! Sem falar na boa comida!",
        u"It\u2019s a vegetable!": u"\u00c9 um vegetal!",
        u"It\u2019s about how you change from here on out.": u"O que importa \u00e9 como voc\u00ea muda daqui para frente.",
        u"It\u2019s about time I let go\u2026": u"J\u00e1 passou da hora de eu deixar isso para tr\u00e1s\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s about time I teach you a lesson about who\u2019s the boss here.": u"J\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de eu ensinar quem \u00e9 que manda aqui.",
        u"It\u2019s about time someone said those things to her. She deserved it.": u"J\u00e1 estava na hora de algu\u00e9m dizer essas coisas para ela. Ela mereceu.",
        u"It\u2019s about time someone said those things to her. She needs to learn a lesson.": u"J\u00e1 estava na hora de algu\u00e9m dizer essas coisas para ela. Ela precisa aprender uma li\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"It\u2019s about time this camp let go of its outdated ways and let the new generation take over.": u"J\u00e1 passou da hora de este acampamento abandonar seus m\u00e9todos ultrapassados e deixar a nova gera\u00e7\u00e3o assumir.",
        u"It\u2019s about time we got down and dirty!": u"J\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de pegarmos pesado!",
        u"It\u2019s about time you got in costume too, Yoshi.": u"At\u00e9 que enfim voc\u00ea colocou uma fantasia tamb\u00e9m, Yoshi.",
        u"It\u2019s about time you joined the party, Jin! When we left you were still in the shower!": u"At\u00e9 que enfim voc\u00ea apareceu, Jin! Quando sa\u00edmos, voc\u00ea ainda estava no banho!",
        u"It\u2019s about to be stuffed somewhere else~": u"Ela est\u00e1 prestes a rechear outro lugar~",
        u"It\u2019s actually a fairly accurate statement! Why, we\u2019re already working on several foreign language translations for your work as well!": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o est\u00e1 muito longe da verdade! J\u00e1 estamos trabalhando em v\u00e1rias tradu\u00e7\u00f5es da sua obra para outros idiomas!",
        u"It\u2019s actually pretty common for Dad to be in this kind of getup!": u"Na verdade, \u00e9 bem comum o papai usar esse tipo de roupa!",
        u"It\u2019s all in the mess hall! Get it while it\u2019s hot!": u"Est\u00e1 tudo no refeit\u00f3rio! Aproveitem enquanto est\u00e1 quente!",
        u"It\u2019s all over the news, too. It seems that the entire capital welcomed winter with a blizzard.": u"Tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 em todos os notici\u00e1rios. Parece que a capital inteira recebeu o inverno com uma nevasca.",
        u"It\u2019s almost as if I led her to do this\u2026": u"\u00c9 quase como se eu tivesse levado ela a fazer isso\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s almost as if I\u2019ve been dragging you down and keeping you from enjoying this trip\u2026": u"\u00c9 quase como se eu estivesse te arrastando para baixo e impedindo voc\u00ea de aproveitar esta viagem\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s almost cruel, isn\u2019t it\u2026?": u"\u00c9 quase cruel, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"It\u2019s alright Emilia, you girls go ahead. I\u2019ll take charge here.": u"Tudo bem, Emilia, voc\u00eas duas podem ir. Eu cuido das coisas aqui.",
        u"It\u2019s alright! At least you gave it a try! It did make me stuffed, so it\u2019s a win either way!": u"Tudo bem! Pelo menos voc\u00ea tentou! Ela me deixou cheio, ent\u00e3o de qualquer forma foi uma vit\u00f3ria!",
        u"It\u2019s alright! It saves us a lot of work!": u"Tudo bem! Isso nos poupa muito trabalho!",
        u"It\u2019s alright! It smells good, actually!": u"Tudo bem! Na verdade, o cheiro \u00e9 bom!",
        u"It\u2019s alright! It\u2019s my job to help after all!": u"Tudo bem! Afinal, meu trabalho \u00e9 ajudar!",
        u"It\u2019s alright! I\u2019m quite full already. Besides, I have several appointments tomorrow, too!": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem! J\u00e1 estou bastante satisfeito. Al\u00e9m disso, tenho v\u00e1rios compromissos amanh\u00e3!",
        u"It\u2019s alright! You guys are a huge help already! ": u"Tudo bem! Voc\u00eas j\u00e1 est\u00e3o ajudando muito! ",
        u"It\u2019s alright, Emilia. We\u2019re good with our orders.": u"Tudo bem, Emilia. J\u00e1 estamos satisfeitos com nossos pedidos.",
        u"It\u2019s alright, I\u2019m glad you did. You can go finish up, but make sure and dress warmly.": u"Tudo bem, fico feliz que tenha vindo. Pode terminar de arrumar as coisas, mas vista-se bem para o frio.",
        u"It\u2019s alright, Yoshi. It\u2019s about time Mr. Clermont hears the truth.": u"Tudo bem, Yoshi. Est\u00e1 na hora de o Sr. Clermont saber a verdade.",
        u"It\u2019s alright, Yoshinori. There\u2019s no need for privacy, especially with you. We\u2019ve gone hand in hand over the years.": u"Tudo bem, Yoshinori. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade de privacidade, principalmente com voc\u00ea. Caminhamos lado a lado ao longo dos anos.",
        u"It\u2019s alright, everyone, we\u2019re about finished. What brings you all here anyway?": u"Tudo bem, pessoal, j\u00e1 estamos quase terminando. Mas o que trouxe todos voc\u00eas aqui?",
        u"It\u2019s alright, it can\u2019t be helped. I assume we need a budget approval to order these?": u"Tudo bem, n\u00e3o tinha como evitar. Imagino que precisamos de aprova\u00e7\u00e3o do or\u00e7amento para fazer o pedido?",
        u"It\u2019s alright, things happen! We just have to make the best of it!": u"Tudo bem, essas coisas acontecem! S\u00f3 precisamos aproveitar a situa\u00e7\u00e3o da melhor maneira poss\u00edvel!",
        u"It\u2019s alright. I\u2019m sure he had a good reason! We\u2019ll keep everything in place until he comes back.": u"Tudo bem. Tenho certeza de que ele teve um bom motivo! Vamos manter tudo em ordem at\u00e9 ele voltar.",
        u"It\u2019s alright. The rest of us will play.": u"Tudo bem. O resto de n\u00f3s vai jogar.",
        u"It\u2019s alright\u2026 I understand\u2026": u"Tudo bem\u2026 Eu entendo\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s also not much better than being naked in this weather\u2026 The cold outside felt miserable.": u"E tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o \u00e9 muito melhor do que ficar nu neste clima\u2026 O frio l\u00e1 fora estava terr\u00edvel.",
        u"It\u2019s always been great to see you share your hobbies with us, Lloyd! This entire project wouldn\u2019t be as fun without them.": u"Sempre foi \u00f3timo ver voc\u00ea compartilhar seus hobbies conosco, Lloyd! Este projeto inteiro n\u00e3o seria t\u00e3o divertido sem eles.",
        u"It\u2019s an honor to be a part of all this\u2026 I\u2019ll try my hardest to make Camp Buddy the best it can be.": u"\u00c9 uma honra fazer parte de tudo isso\u2026 Vou me esfor\u00e7ar ao m\u00e1ximo para tornar o Camp Buddy o melhor poss\u00edvel.",
        u"It\u2019s around the time you got me my first camera, Dad~! Almost a decade ago, during Camp Buddy's first-ever term! ": u"Foi mais ou menos quando voc\u00ea me deu a minha primeira c\u00e2mera, pai~! Quase uma d\u00e9cada atr\u00e1s, durante a primeira temporada do Camp Buddy! ",
        u"It\u2019s awfully convenient for all of you to point at me for your own shortcomings, isn\u2019t it?": u"\u00c9 muito conveniente para voc\u00eas apontarem o dedo para mim por causa das pr\u00f3prias falhas, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"It\u2019s barbecue~! Just how you like it!": u"\u00c9 barbecue~! Do jeitinho que voc\u00ea gosta!",
        u"It\u2019s because I already called Mr. Clermont\u2026": u"\u00c9 porque eu j\u00e1 liguei para o Sr. Clermont\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s because I love you\u2026": u"\u00c9 porque eu amo voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s because I thought there was nothing else to do! I\u2019ve been scammed!": u"\u00c9 porque achei que n\u00e3o havia mais nada para fazer! Fui enganada!",
        u"It\u2019s been a hot minute since my last one! But better late than never!": u"J\u00e1 faz um bom tempo desde a \u00faltima! Mas antes tarde do que nunca!",
        u"It\u2019s been a long time since I wore something this nice.": u"Faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o uso algo t\u00e3o elegante.",
        u"It\u2019s been a long time since we got to talk like this, and it really brought me back to the days when I was there to guide you as your scoutmaster.": u"Fazia muito tempo que n\u00e3o convers\u00e1vamos assim, e isso realmente me fez lembrar dos dias em que eu o orientava como seu chefe escoteiro.",
        u"It\u2019s been a roller-coaster ride, huh\u2026?": u"Foi uma verdadeira montanha-russa, n\u00e3o foi\u2026?",
        u"It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve seen you chop wood, sir.": u"Faz tempo que n\u00e3o vejo o senhor cortar lenha.",
        u"It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve seen you smile that wide, Sir Goro.": u"Faz tempo que n\u00e3o vejo o senhor sorrir desse jeito, Sr. Goro.",
        u"It\u2019s been a while \u2013 we\u2019ve been so busy with work, there hasn\u2019t been time.": u"J\u00e1 faz um tempo \u2014 ficamos t\u00e3o ocupados com o trabalho que n\u00e3o tivemos tempo.",
        u"It\u2019s been almost what\u2026? A decade? Aren\u2019t you going to let me catch up with what\u2019s been happening in your life?": u"J\u00e1 faz quase o qu\u00ea\u2026? Uma d\u00e9cada? N\u00e3o vai me contar o que aconteceu em sua vida?",
        u"It\u2019s been fun to watch them.": u"Tem sido divertido assistir.",
        u"It\u2019s been months since we last saw each other, Yoshi. You always say you\u2019ll make it up to me, but nothing\u2019s changed.": u"J\u00e1 faz meses desde a \u00faltima vez que nos vimos, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea sempre diz que vai compensar, mas nada mudou.",
        u"It\u2019s been nearly a decade, and now I finally get to witness this most awaited moment with my own two eyes~!": u"J\u00e1 faz quase uma d\u00e9cada, e finalmente posso testemunhar este momento t\u00e3o esperado com meus pr\u00f3prios olhos~!",
        u"It\u2019s been nice to have some time to actually focus on ourselves, too!": u"Tamb\u00e9m tem sido bom ter algum tempo para realmente nos concentrarmos em n\u00f3s mesmos!",
        u"It\u2019s been over five years\u2026 and I\u2019m only getting worse\u2026": u"J\u00e1 se passaram mais de cinco anos\u2026 e eu s\u00f3 estou piorando\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s been so hard to pretend that I\u2019m comfortable with everything, when I know I don\u2019t really belong in a place like this\u2026": u"Tem sido t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil fingir que estou confort\u00e1vel com tudo, quando sei que realmente n\u00e3o perten\u00e7o a um lugar como este\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s been so nice to spend time with you privately, and now we\u2019re headed back to share a room with everyone again.": u"Foi t\u00e3o bom passar um tempo a s\u00f3s com voc\u00ea, e agora vamos voltar a dividir um quarto com todo mundo.",
        u"It\u2019s been so unfair this whole time, not only for us, but for the project too!": u"Isso foi t\u00e3o injusto esse tempo todo, n\u00e3o apenas conosco, mas tamb\u00e9m com o projeto!",
        u"It\u2019s been well-maintained even after all these years, but I still had it outfitted and tuned up to be ready for tonight.": u"Ela foi muito bem cuidada mesmo depois de todos esses anos, mas ainda mandei fazer alguns ajustes e uma revis\u00e3o para deix\u00e1-la pronta para esta noite.",
        u"It\u2019s bittersweet too, though\u2026 Everyone\u2019s going to be leaving soon.": u"Mas tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 agridoce\u2026 Todo mundo vai embora em breve.",
        u"It\u2019s clean and well-maintained, as well as the biggest room in the camp. It should meet all of your requirements.": u"\u00c9 limpo, bem conservado e tamb\u00e9m o maior quarto do acampamento. Deve atender a todas as suas exig\u00eancias.",
        u"It\u2019s common sense to ensure that there is plenty of time at the tail-end of any project to allow for any setbacks, which was my main reason for the extended work period!": u"\u00c9 senso comum garantir bastante tempo no fim de qualquer projeto para lidar com poss\u00edveis contratempos, e essa foi minha principal raz\u00e3o para prolongar o per\u00edodo de trabalho!",
        u"It\u2019s covered in snow! I didn\u2019t even notice that it stormed last night\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 coberta de neve! Eu nem percebi que houve uma tempestade ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s crazy how close those two have gotten over the last few days\u2026": u"\u00c9 incr\u00edvel como essas duas ficaram pr\u00f3ximas nos \u00faltimos dias\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s crazy how different my priorities were back then.": u"\u00c9 louco pensar em como minhas prioridades eram diferentes naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"It\u2019s crazy to me that you\u2019re drinking yours iced, considering how cold it is outside, Jin! You sure are tougher than you look.": u"Acho loucura voc\u00ea tomar o seu gelado com esse frio l\u00e1 fora, Jin! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 mais resistente do que parece.",
        u"It\u2019s crazy to think that I was gonna walk away from the chance, just because I was too afraid to get out of my comfort zone\u2026": u"\u00c9 loucura pensar que eu ia abrir m\u00e3o dessa chance s\u00f3 porque estava com medo demais de sair da minha zona de conforto\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s cream and coffee liqueur! You\u2019ll love it!": u"\u00c9 licor de creme e caf\u00e9! Voc\u00ea vai adorar!",
        u"It\u2019s cream liqueur mixed with sambuca!": u"\u00c9 licor de creme misturado com sambuca!",
        u"It\u2019s different from the work that I\u2019m used to, but I\u2019m just glad to be useful again.": u"\u00c9 diferente do trabalho a que estou acostumado, mas fico feliz por voltar a ser \u00fatil.",
        u"It\u2019s embarrassing that we were that noticeable, sir.": u"\u00c9 constrangedor saber que \u00e9ramos t\u00e3o \u00f3bvios assim, senhor.",
        u"It\u2019s fine Yoshi! It\u2019s been a while since I had some quality time with them anyway! Besides, Emilia wanted to get to know them too!": u"Tudo bem, Yoshi! J\u00e1 fazia um tempo que eu n\u00e3o passava um tempo legal com eles! Al\u00e9m disso, Emilia tamb\u00e9m queria conhec\u00ea-los melhor!",
        u"It\u2019s fine! I\u2019ll take the picture; this is your moment after all!": u"Tudo bem! Eu tiro a foto; afinal, este \u00e9 o momento de voc\u00eas!",
        u"It\u2019s fine! The shuttle just arrived anyway.": u"Tudo bem! O transporte acabou de chegar.",
        u"It\u2019s fine! We need to start working too! It was a pleasure meeting you, Jin!": u"Tudo bem! Tamb\u00e9m precisamos come\u00e7ar a trabalhar! Foi um prazer conhec\u00ea-lo, Jin!",
        u"It\u2019s fine! We needed to rest a little anyways!": u"Tudo bem! Precis\u00e1vamos descansar um pouco mesmo!",
        u"It\u2019s fine, Aiden. I\u2019ll teach you later.": u"Tudo bem, Aiden. Eu ensino depois.",
        u"It\u2019s fine, Aiden. This is a new experience for all of us.": u"Tudo bem, Aiden. Esta \u00e9 uma experi\u00eancia nova para todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"It\u2019s fine, Dad. We all saw what happened there, and it was really Emilia that crossed the line.": u"Tudo bem, pai. Todos vimos o que aconteceu, e foi Emilia quem realmente passou dos limites.",
        u"It\u2019s fine, Yoshi! It\u2019s just us here, anyways!": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Yoshi! De qualquer forma, s\u00f3 estamos n\u00f3s aqui!",
        u"It\u2019s fine, Yoshinori. I can handle it.": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, Yoshinori. Eu consigo resolver.",
        u"It\u2019s fine, but\u2026 Are you sure we can leave your dad like that?": u"Tudo bem, mas\u2026 Tem certeza de que podemos deixar seu pai daquele jeito?",
        u"It\u2019s fine.": u"Tudo bem.",
        u"It\u2019s fine. He won\u2019t take up much space.": u"Tudo bem. Ele n\u00e3o ocupa muito espa\u00e7o.",
        u"It\u2019s fine. How did it go?": u"Tudo bem. Como foi?",
        u"It\u2019s fine. Leave the packing to me.": u"Tudo bem. Deixe que eu arrumo as coisas.",
        u"It\u2019s fine. The shuttle just arrived anyway.": u"Tudo bem. O \u00f4nibus acabou de chegar.",
        u"It\u2019s fine. We prefer to relax by ourselves.": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem. Preferimos relaxar sozinhos.",
        u"It\u2019s going to take some time getting used to, but I\u2019ll try\u2026 Goro\u2026": u"Vai levar algum tempo para eu me acostumar, mas vou tentar\u2026 Goro\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s honestly quite a stretch to claim that bloodline has anything to do with technical skills like culinary arts.": u"Sinceramente, \u00e9 exagero afirmar que linhagem familiar tem alguma rela\u00e7\u00e3o com habilidades t\u00e9cnicas como a culin\u00e1ria.",
        u"It\u2019s honestly the least I could do, sir. ": u"Sinceramente, \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo que eu poderia fazer, senhor. ",
        u"It\u2019s hot as hell inside that kitchen, I tell you! I don\u2019t know if I can handle the heat any longer\u2026!!": u"Est\u00e1 quente para caramba naquela cozinha, pode acreditar! N\u00e3o sei se aguento esse calor por mais tempo\u2026!!",
        u"It\u2019s how I got to know him in the first place.": u"Foi assim que o conheci.",
        u"It\u2019s how I usually release all the stress and soreness from working the entire week. I\u2019m not getting any younger after all.": u"\u00c9 assim que costumo aliviar todo o estresse e as dores de trabalhar a semana inteira. Afinal, n\u00e3o estou ficando mais jovem.",
        u"It\u2019s important to get straight to the point and accomplish as much as possible in every meeting.": u"\u00c9 importante ir direto ao ponto e resolver o m\u00e1ximo poss\u00edvel em cada reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"It\u2019s just a thought, but have you considered joining our staff?": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 uma ideia, mas j\u00e1 pensou em fazer parte da nossa equipe?",
        u"It\u2019s just all too sudden\u2026 after everything we\u2019ve been through\u2026": u"\u00c9 tudo t\u00e3o repentino\u2026 depois de tudo pelo que passamos\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s just easier if I do it out here.": u"\u00c9 mais f\u00e1cil eu fazer isso aqui fora.",
        u"It\u2019s just like when I was a scout and everything was fresh and exciting!": u"\u00c9 como quando eu era escoteiro e tudo era novo e empolgante!",
        u"It\u2019s just really hard to wrap my head around the fact we\u2019re doing all of this together.": u"\u00c9 muito dif\u00edcil assimilar o fato de estarmos fazendo tudo isso juntos.",
        u"It\u2019s just so different from our usual routine.": u"\u00c9 t\u00e3o diferente da nossa rotina habitual.",
        u"It\u2019s just the two of us here, why are you in such a hurry? All you\u2019ve talked about is work ever since I got here.": u"Estamos s\u00f3 n\u00f3s dois aqui, por que tanta pressa? Desde que cheguei, voc\u00ea s\u00f3 fala de trabalho.",
        u"It\u2019s just the usual weekly meeting to discuss the progress of the sponsorship. I figured it wasn\u2019t worth mentioning.": u"\u00c9 apenas a reuni\u00e3o semanal de costume para discutirmos o andamento do patroc\u00ednio. Achei que nem valia a pena mencionar.",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 I can\u2019t help but think everyone else has changed for the better except me, you know?": u"\u00c9 que\u2026 N\u00e3o consigo evitar a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de que todos mudaram para melhor, menos eu, sabe?",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 I need to face the consequences of my actions. ": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 que\u2026 preciso enfrentar as consequ\u00eancias das minhas a\u00e7\u00f5es. ",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 I\u2019ve been thinking\u2026": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 que\u2026 estive pensando\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 We\u2019ve been working together for the past decade and\u2026 we\u2019ve stayed the same for years\u2026": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 que\u2026 Trabalhamos juntos h\u00e1 dez anos e\u2026 continuamos iguais h\u00e1 anos\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 a lot of expectations for someone like me.": u"S\u00e3o apenas\u2026 expectativas demais para algu\u00e9m como eu.",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 a lot of expectations for someone like me.{fast}": u"S\u00e3o apenas\u2026 expectativas demais para algu\u00e9m como eu.{fast}",
        u"It\u2019s just\u2026 my imagination has been running wild since I arrived here for some reason\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 que\u2026 por algum motivo, minha imagina\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 correndo solta desde que cheguei\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s kind of exciting though, isn\u2019t it? We\u2019ve had such a quiet last couple of weeks so some hustle and bustle is fun for a change!": u"Mas \u00e9 um pouco empolgante, n\u00e3o \u00e9? As \u00faltimas semanas foram t\u00e3o tranquilas que um pouco de agita\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 divertido para variar!",
        u"It\u2019s kinda complicated to tell the whole story, but if I were to sum it up in one word, I guess it\u2019s\u2026 communication?": u"\u00c9 meio complicado contar a hist\u00f3ria toda, mas, se eu tivesse que resumir em uma palavra, acho que seria\u2026 comunica\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"It\u2019s kinda crazy how we\u2019ve all come full circle and are sharing a common goal once again! ": u"\u00c9 meio louco como tudo deu uma volta completa e agora compartilhamos novamente o mesmo objetivo! ",
        u"It\u2019s kinda hot\u2026 I mean, it\u2019s cold! It\u2019s getting really cold out here, huh?!": u"Est\u00e1 meio quente\u2026 Quer dizer, frio! Est\u00e1 ficando bem frio aqui fora, hein?!",
        u"It\u2019s kinda like that capsule toy vending machine, Keitaro!": u"\u00c9 meio como aquelas m\u00e1quinas de brinquedos em c\u00e1psulas, Keitaro!",
        u"It\u2019s like a vacation for him!": u"\u00c9 como se fossem f\u00e9rias para ele!",
        u"It\u2019s like being smushed by two giant marshmallows\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 como ser esmagado entre dois marshmallows gigantes\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s like the old saying, \u2018know your enemy!\u2019 ": u"\u00c9 como diz o velho ditado: \u2018conhe\u00e7a o seu inimigo\u2019! ",
        u"It\u2019s like you don\u2019t even care about me! You\u2019re the worst\u2014": u"\u00c9 como se nem se importassem comigo! Voc\u00eas s\u00e3o os piores\u2014",
        u"It\u2019s like you two are on opposite wavelengths!": u"\u00c9 como se voc\u00eas dois estivessem em frequ\u00eancias opostas!",
        u"It\u2019s lively.": u"Est\u00e1 animado.",
        u"It\u2019s looking a little rough, too\u2026 Are those water stains all over it?": u"Tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 meio acabado\u2026 Essas marcas por toda parte s\u00e3o manchas de \u00e1gua?",
        u"It\u2019s my duty as a scoutmaster to prepare everyone for a trip like this through the exercises and lessons we\u2019ve done so far.": u"\u00c9 meu dever como chefe escoteiro preparar todos para uma viagem como esta por meio dos exerc\u00edcios e das aulas que tivemos at\u00e9 agora.",
        u"It\u2019s my duty to prevent these issues and direct everyone to achieve our mutual goals. ": u"\u00c9 meu dever evitar esses problemas e orientar todos para alcan\u00e7armos nossos objetivos em comum.",
        u"It\u2019s my pleasure, Jin! That really means a lot coming from you!": u"O prazer \u00e9 meu, Jin! Isso significa muito vindo de voc\u00ea!",
        u"It\u2019s my pleasure, Yoshi! Always at your service!": u"\u00c9 um prazer, Yoshi! Sempre \u00e0s suas ordens!",
        u"It\u2019s my pleasure, sir! Thank you for having me\u2026!": u"O prazer \u00e9 meu, senhor! Obrigado por me receber\u2026!",
        u"It\u2019s my pleasure.": u"O prazer \u00e9 meu.",
        u"It\u2019s nice seeing you two here, Lloyd, Darius.": u"Que bom ver voc\u00eas dois aqui, Lloyd, Darius.",
        u"It\u2019s nice that you get to join us this time around, sir! We rarely get the chance to do something like this together.": u"\u00c9 bom o senhor poder se juntar a n\u00f3s desta vez! Raramente temos a oportunidade de fazer algo assim juntos.",
        u"It\u2019s nice to meet you too, Yuri! You can call me Yoshi!": u"Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-la, Yuri! Pode me chamar de Yoshi!",
        u"It\u2019s nice to meet you, Sir Goro! Thank you for having me!": u"\u00c9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-lo, Senhor Goro! Obrigado por me receber!",
        u"It\u2019s nice to take a break in a place like this every once in a while. We\u2019re not going to stay here forever, after all.": u"\u00c9 bom descansar num lugar assim de vez em quando. Afinal, n\u00e3o ficaremos aqui para sempre.",
        u"It\u2019s nice.": u"Est\u00e1 gostoso.",
        u"It\u2019s no problem, Aiden. I rarely get the chance to help.": u"N\u00e3o foi nada, Aiden. Raramente tenho a oportunidade de ajudar.",
        u"It\u2019s no problem, it\u2019s the least we could do. He\u2019s been such a huge help to the camp, after all.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema, \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo que pod\u00edamos fazer. Afinal, ele tem ajudado muito o acampamento.",
        u"It\u2019s no problem. Aiden was just getting us caught up a little on Ms. Komarova\u2019s condition, but he said that you and Yuri talked to her more than he did.": u"Sem problema. Aiden estava nos atualizando sobre o estado da Srta. Komarova, mas disse que voc\u00ea e Yuri conversaram mais com ela do que ele.",
        u"It\u2019s no problem. I don\u2019t mind having some extra company.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema. N\u00e3o me importo de ter companhia extra.",
        u"It\u2019s no problem. I\u2019m just having my morning coffee.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema. Estou apenas tomando meu caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3.",
        u"It\u2019s no secret that the reason the other branches of Camp Buddy closed down was because of his mismanagement! ": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 segredo que as outras unidades do Camp Buddy fecharam por causa da m\u00e1 administra\u00e7\u00e3o dele! ",
        u"It\u2019s none of your business! And don\u2019t you dare tell anyone what you\u2019ve heard!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 da sua conta! E nem ouse contar para algu\u00e9m o que ouviu!",
        u"It\u2019s none of your business. Just leave me alone.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 da sua conta. Apenas me deixe em paz.",
        u"It\u2019s not ALL good though, you just went from dad to grandpa energy.  ": u"Mas nem TUDO \u00e9 elogio; voc\u00ea s\u00f3 passou de energia de pai para energia de vov\u00f4.  ",
        u"It\u2019s not a bad thing, Aiden.": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 ruim, Aiden.",
        u"It\u2019s not a big setback at all, is it? Everyone really worked hard to make up for it too.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 um atraso t\u00e3o grave, \u00e9? Todos tamb\u00e9m trabalharam muito para compens\u00e1-lo.",
        u"It\u2019s not a field trip without some junk food! And besides, it\u2019s my cheat day!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma excurs\u00e3o sem umas porcarias para comer! Al\u00e9m disso, hoje \u00e9 meu dia do lixo!",
        u"It\u2019s not about the skill, it\u2019s about the company! Food made with TLC is the best kind! ": u"N\u00e3o se trata de habilidade, mas da companhia! A melhor comida \u00e9 feita com carinho! ",
        u"It\u2019s not all about the size, it\u2019s how you use it!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 o tamanho que importa, mas como voc\u00ea usa!",
        u"It\u2019s not as cold today, so don\u2019t worry \u2018cause I fitted this bad boy out with some winter tires, so we\u2019re covered!": u"Hoje n\u00e3o est\u00e1 t\u00e3o frio, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se preocupe. Coloquei pneus de inverno nesta belezinha, estamos seguros!",
        u"It\u2019s not been too bad, but like Hiro said, we weren\u2019t really prepared to be stuck indoors.": u"N\u00e3o foi t\u00e3o ruim, mas, como Hiro disse, n\u00e3o est\u00e1vamos preparados para ficar presos dentro de casa.",
        u"It\u2019s not call time for thirty more minutes. What\u2019s going on?": u"Ainda faltam trinta minutos para o hor\u00e1rio marcado. O que est\u00e1 acontecendo?",
        u"It\u2019s not easy being a receiver, you know\u2026 Especially with someone your size.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 f\u00e1cil ficar por baixo, sabia\u2026 Especialmente com algu\u00e9m do seu tamanho.",
        u"It\u2019s not even about getting along. She\u2019s just a flat-out bitch! ": u"Nem \u00e9 quest\u00e3o de se dar bem. Ela \u00e9 simplesmente uma vaca! ",
        u"It\u2019s not fair, we don\u2019t have as many muscles as them!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 justo, n\u00e3o temos tantos m\u00fasculos quanto eles!",
        u"It\u2019s not gonna be the same\u2026!": u"N\u00e3o vai ser a mesma coisa\u2026!",
        u"It\u2019s not gonna be the same\u2026!{fast}": u"N\u00e3o vai ser a mesma coisa\u2026!{fast}",
        u"It\u2019s not just about this stupid camera! You get away with EVERYTHING!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 por causa dessa c\u00e2mera idiota! Voc\u00ea pode fazer TUDO o que quiser!",
        u"It\u2019s not just work! It\u2019s a learning experience, and it\u2019ll be fun! ": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 apenas trabalho! \u00c9 uma experi\u00eancia de aprendizado e ser\u00e1 divertido!",
        u"It\u2019s not like Emilia\u2019s gonna be at Camp Buddy forever, you know! Just endure her \u2019til we finish the project!": u"Emilia n\u00e3o vai ficar no Camp Buddy para sempre, sabia? Apenas aguente at\u00e9 terminarmos o projeto!",
        u"It\u2019s not like I have a choice\u2026 I\u2019d much rather have a desk job than this.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eu tivesse escolha\u2026 Eu preferiria muito mais um trabalho de escrit\u00f3rio do que isso.",
        u"It\u2019s not like I have much of a choice since she moved in with me!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eu tivesse muita escolha desde que ela foi morar comigo!",
        u"It\u2019s not like that, Emilia. We\u2019re not just following Sir Goro because he\u2019s our leader.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 assim, Emilia. N\u00e3o seguimos o Sr. Goro simplesmente porque ele \u00e9 nosso l\u00edder.",
        u"It\u2019s not like that, sir! I was actually dying to get in the kitchen and help Bro Aiden out!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 isso, senhor! Na verdade eu estava louco para vir \u00e0 cozinha ajudar o mano Aiden!",
        u"It\u2019s not my fault that you look like one!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa minha se voc\u00ea parece uma!",
        u"It\u2019s not my fault you make it so easy for me.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa minha se voc\u00ea facilita tanto.",
        u"It\u2019s not normal for the leadership to engage in behavior like he does. And frankly, it makes the whole camp look bad.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 normal que algu\u00e9m da lideran\u00e7a se comporte como ele. E, sinceramente, isso prejudica a imagem de todo o acampamento.",
        u"It\u2019s not that I don\u2019t want to, but more of I\u2019m not confident at all\u2026": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que eu n\u00e3o queira, \u00e9 mais porque n\u00e3o tenho confian\u00e7a nenhuma\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s not that I\u2019m giving up on our dream, but that I\u2019m ready to move on to a different chapter\u2026 ": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 que eu esteja desistindo do nosso sonho, mas estou pronto para seguir para um novo cap\u00edtulo\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s not that hard, just don\u2019t make a mess.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil, s\u00f3 n\u00e3o fa\u00e7a bagun\u00e7a.",
        u"It\u2019s not that serious, honestly. I\u2019m probably just adjusting to all the changes around here slower than everyone else.": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o s\u00e9rio. Provavelmente s\u00f3 estou me adaptando a todas as mudan\u00e7as daqui mais devagar que os outros.",
        u"It\u2019s not too surprising, though! Yoshi\u2019s been helping Gramps with all the management stuff, so it\u2019ll be easier if they stay together!": u"Mas n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o surpreendente! Yoshi vem ajudando o Vov\u00f4 com toda a parte administrativa, ent\u00e3o ser\u00e1 mais f\u00e1cil se ficarem juntos!",
        u"It\u2019s not up for just me to decide, though\u2026": u"Mas n\u00e3o cabe s\u00f3 a mim decidir\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s not your fault, I made some mistakes too. Maybe I\u2019m really just not cut out for having a good life after all\u2026": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa sua, eu tamb\u00e9m cometi erros. Talvez eu realmente n\u00e3o tenha nascido para ter uma vida boa, afinal\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s not your fault, Yoshi\u2026 There must\u2019ve been something we all didn\u2019t understand about him... ": u"N\u00e3o foi culpa sua, Yoshi\u2026 Deve haver algo sobre ele que nenhum de n\u00f3s conseguiu entender\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s not, it\u2019s fun! Plus, you get to eat a bunch of marshmallows~": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9, \u00e9 divertido! Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00ea come um monte de marshmallows~",
        u"It\u2019s nothing new anyway. People call me \u2018Serious Darius\u2019 for a reason.": u"De todo modo, n\u00e3o \u00e9 novidade. As pessoas me chamam de \u2018Darius S\u00e9rio\u2019 por algum motivo.",
        u"It\u2019s nothing new honestly. At least he\u2019s getting a lot done.": u"Sinceramente, n\u00e3o \u00e9 novidade. Pelo menos ele est\u00e1 fazendo bastante coisa.",
        u"It\u2019s nothing serious, Mr. Clermont. She\u2019s talking about the times where we needed to wear less clothing to cool off from the work. You know how men are.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 nada s\u00e9rio, Sr. Clermont. Ela se refere \u00e0s vezes em que precis\u00e1vamos usar menos roupa para nos refrescar durante o trabalho. Sabe como os homens s\u00e3o.",
        u"It\u2019s nowhere close to what I\u2019m used to. ": u"N\u00e3o chega nem perto do que estou acostumada. ",
        u"It\u2019s okay to not be okay sometimes, Aiden\u2026 You don\u2019t have to bear it alone anymore. ": u"Tudo bem n\u00e3o estar bem \u00e0s vezes, Aiden\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa mais carregar isso sozinho. ",
        u"It\u2019s okay! The place is really close by and isolated, and plus everyone will be busy setting up!": u"Tudo bem! O lugar \u00e9 bem pr\u00f3ximo e isolado, al\u00e9m disso, todos estar\u00e3o ocupados montando o acampamento!",
        u"It\u2019s okay, Aiden. Just hand me your glass!": u"Tudo bem, Aiden. S\u00f3 me d\u00ea a sua ta\u00e7a!",
        u"It\u2019s okay, Emilia, We\u2019re approved by The Health Inspection Culinary Collective Association or T.H.I.C.C. Ass.  ": u"Tudo bem, Emilia, somos aprovados pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Coletiva de Inspe\u00e7\u00e3o Culin\u00e1ria e Sanit\u00e1ria, ou A.C.I.C.S.  ",
        u"It\u2019s okay, Yoshi! I rarely have the chance to eat ice cream, so I don\u2019t know what my favorite flavor is yet!": u"Tudo bem, Yoshi! Raramente tenho a oportunidade de tomar sorvete, ent\u00e3o ainda nem sei qual \u00e9 o meu sabor favorito!",
        u"It\u2019s okay, Yuri, we can always share online! I gave you my Dicksword ID.": u"Tudo bem, Yuri, sempre podemos compartilhar pela internet! Eu te passei meu ID do Dicksword.",
        u"It\u2019s okay. ": u"Tudo bem. ",
        u"It\u2019s okay. I\u2019m used to Aiden joking around.": u"Tudo bem. Estou acostumado com as brincadeiras do Aiden.",
        u"It\u2019s okay\u2026! I\u2019m used to skipping meals anyway! I tend to work on a very weird schedule\u2026 ": u"Tudo bem\u2026! De qualquer forma, estou acostumado a pular refei\u00e7\u00f5es! Costumo trabalhar em hor\u00e1rios muito estranhos\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s one thing when it\u2019s work-related, but it\u2019s entirely another when you force everyone into a situation where they\u2019re not even allowed to think for themselves!": u"Uma coisa \u00e9 quando se trata de trabalho, outra completamente diferente \u00e9 quando voc\u00ea for\u00e7a todos a uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o em que nem podem pensar por conta pr\u00f3pria!",
        u"It\u2019s only a one-night gig, Gramps! They said I could get all those fancy drinks I can\u2019t pronounce in exchange!": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 um bico de uma noite, Vov\u00f4! Disseram que em troca eu poderia tomar todas aquelas bebidas chiques cujos nomes nem sei pronunciar!",
        u"It\u2019s only a one-night trip, so how much stuff could we need?": u"\u00c9 uma viagem de apenas uma noite, ent\u00e3o de quantas coisas poder\u00edamos precisar?",
        u"It\u2019s only been three seconds, Lloyd.": u"S\u00f3 se passaram tr\u00eas segundos, Lloyd.",
        u"It\u2019s only her first day here and she\u2019s already crossing the line!": u"\u00c9 apenas o primeiro dia dela aqui e ela j\u00e1 est\u00e1 passando dos limites!",
        u"It\u2019s only natural that unexpected things happen during a project, and Sir Goro and I dealt with them as they came up.": u"\u00c9 natural que imprevistos aconte\u00e7am durante um projeto, e eu e o Sr. Goro lidamos com eles conforme surgiam.",
        u"It\u2019s our pleasure, Sir Goro! We\u2019re just excited to be back here before the next summer term! We\u2019ve all missed it!": u"O prazer \u00e9 nosso, Sr. Goro! Estamos animados por voltar antes da pr\u00f3xima temporada de ver\u00e3o! Todos sentimos falta daqui!",
        u"It\u2019s over.": u"Acabou.",
        u"It\u2019s over\u2026": u"Acabou\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s password protected too, so you don\u2019t have to worry about anyone else sneaking a peek!": u"Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 protegido por senha, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar com ningu\u00e9m dando uma espiadinha!",
        u"It\u2019s perfect for you, and you\u2019d be a huge success at it!": u"Isso combina perfeitamente com voc\u00ea, e tenho certeza de que faria muito sucesso!",
        u"It\u2019s perfect with the delicious dessert, fruity drinks, and all the hardcore smut I can read! ": u"\u00c9 perfeito com as sobremesas deliciosas, bebidas frutadas e toda a putaria pesada que posso ler! ",
        u"It\u2019s perfect, it\u2019s perfect! Aiden you\u2019re the beeeest!": u"Est\u00e1 perfeito, est\u00e1 perfeito! Aiden, voc\u00ea \u00e9 o melhoooor!",
        u"It\u2019s perfectly normal to feel a little out of place with the current state of the camp.": u"\u00c9 perfeitamente normal sentir-se um pouco deslocado diante da situa\u00e7\u00e3o atual do acampamento.",
        u"It\u2019s pretty sunny outside. Almost like the blizzard didn\u2019t happen.": u"Est\u00e1 bem ensolarado l\u00e1 fora. Parece at\u00e9 que a nevasca nunca aconteceu.",
        u"It\u2019s pretty telling how incompetent the one in charge really is when the only thing that saved the camp from disgrace... was the scouts.": u"\u00c9 bastante revelador o quanto quem est\u00e1 no comando \u00e9 incompetente quando a \u00fanica coisa que salvou o acampamento da desgra\u00e7a... foram os escoteiros.",
        u"It\u2019s pretty vague, but I\u2019m trying my best to ask around and see if there\u2019s anything I can help with.": u"\u00c9 bastante vago, mas estou fazendo o poss\u00edvel para perguntar por a\u00ed e descobrir se posso ajudar em alguma coisa.",
        u"It\u2019s quiet and peaceful, and there\u2019s no big distractions like work!": u"\u00c9 tranquilo e sossegado, sem grandes distra\u00e7\u00f5es como o trabalho!",
        u"It\u2019s quite alright, sir. I don\u2019t think any of us were aware, so you can\u2019t be blamed.": u"Est\u00e1 tudo bem, senhor. Acho que nenhum de n\u00f3s sabia, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o podemos culp\u00e1-lo.",
        u"It\u2019s quite surreal that the project is really done, huh? Camp Buddy is two times bigger than it was.": u"\u00c9 bem surreal pensar que o projeto realmente acabou, hein? O Camp Buddy est\u00e1 duas vezes maior do que antes.",
        u"It\u2019s rare that I attend events like this, and even rarer with a group of friends\u2026": u"\u00c9 raro eu participar de eventos assim, e mais raro ainda com um grupo de amigos\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s reached a point where it\u2019s affecting my life yet again\u2026": u"Chegou a um ponto em que isso est\u00e1 afetando minha vida de novo\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s really absurd that you all continue to humor this beggar and claim that he\u2019s of such great value!": u"\u00c9 realmente absurdo que voc\u00eas continuem dando moral para esse mendigo e afirmando que ele tem tanto valor!",
        u"It\u2019s really going to be different without you guys\u2026": u"Vai ser muito diferente sem voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s really hot in here!": u"Est\u00e1 muito quente aqui!",
        u"It\u2019s really nice to see you after all these years! I thought I\u2019d never see you again!": u"\u00c9 muito bom v\u00ea-lo depois de todos esses anos! Pensei que nunca o veria de novo!",
        u"It\u2019s really not something one person can do. So please let me help you.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 mesmo algo que uma pessoa consiga fazer sozinha. Ent\u00e3o, por favor, deixe-me ajudar.",
        u"It\u2019s really not that big of a deal! They\u2019re just chores after all!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 nada demais! Afinal, s\u00e3o apenas tarefas dom\u00e9sticas!",
        u"It\u2019s really not, Aiden. You just need to slow down and make less noise than usual. All of us can do that.": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o, Aiden. S\u00f3 precisa ir mais devagar e fazer menos barulho que o normal. Todos n\u00f3s conseguimos fazer isso.",
        u"It\u2019s really rare to see you two apart. You guys are usually stuck together like glue!": u"\u00c9 muito raro ver voc\u00eas dois separados. Normalmente ficam grudados como cola!",
        u"It\u2019s really sweet, and it makes me wanna\u2014": u"\u00c9 bem docinho, e me d\u00e1 vontade de\u2014",
        u"It\u2019s sad knowing we\u2019ll have to part ways after this. ": u"\u00c9 triste saber que teremos que seguir caminhos separados depois disso. ",
        u"It\u2019s so different when we had to take care of the scouts. Bigger men have bigger needs, if you know what I mean?": u"\u00c9 muito diferente de quando cuid\u00e1vamos dos escoteiros. Homens maiores t\u00eam necessidades maiores, se \u00e9 que me entendem.",
        u"It\u2019s so hard for me to imagine Sir Goro being strict... He's been cuddly and gentle with me ever since I first met him.": u"\u00c9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil imaginar o Sr. Goro sendo r\u00edgido\u2026 Ele sempre foi carinhoso e gentil comigo desde que o conheci.",
        u"It\u2019s so hard to believe that we\u2019ve been doing absolutely nothing for the past few weeks\u2026 considering how full our hands were for over half a year.": u"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil acreditar que n\u00e3o fizemos absolutamente nada nas \u00faltimas semanas\u2026 considerando o quanto estivemos ocupados por mais de meio ano.",
        u"It\u2019s so interesting to see everyone not wearing our uniforms for once! I think our scoutmasters look really \u2018cool\u2019!": u"\u00c9 t\u00e3o interessante ver todo mundo sem nossos uniformes pela primeira vez! Acho que nossos chefes escoteiros est\u00e3o bem \u2018legais\u2019!",
        u"It\u2019s so wildly different from the idea I had of relationships, especially after what I saw growing up.": u"\u00c9 t\u00e3o diferente da ideia que eu tinha de relacionamentos, principalmente depois do que vi enquanto crescia.",
        u"It\u2019s something I made way back when I was preparing for Camp Buddy\u2019s launch.": u"\u00c9 algo que fiz h\u00e1 muito tempo, quando me preparava para a inaugura\u00e7\u00e3o do Camp Buddy.",
        u"It\u2019s something we\u2019ve foreseen as well. In fact, we actually began refurbishing old, run-down cabins last summer in preparation for the next term.": u"\u00c9 algo que tamb\u00e9m previmos. Na verdade, come\u00e7amos a reformar cabanas antigas e deterioradas no ver\u00e3o passado, em prepara\u00e7\u00e3o para a pr\u00f3xima temporada.",
        u"It\u2019s still new to me to initiate though.": u"Ainda \u00e9 novidade para mim tomar a iniciativa.",
        u"It\u2019s still surreal though, you seem so calm and well-put together now for your age. ": u"Ainda parece surreal, voc\u00ea parece t\u00e3o calmo e centrado agora para sua idade. ",
        u"It\u2019s such an honor to know that you\u2019re a true testament to what this place stands for!": u"\u00c9 uma honra saber que voc\u00eas representam t\u00e3o bem tudo aquilo que este lugar significa!",
        u"It\u2019s super easy! Just put a marshmallow in your mouth and say \u2018Chubby Buddy!\u2019": u"\u00c9 superf\u00e1cil! \u00c9 s\u00f3 colocar um marshmallow na boca e dizer \u2018Chubby Buddy\u2019!",
        u"It\u2019s supposed to be the other way around\u2026": u"Era para ser ao contr\u00e1rio\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s taken a long time for me to realize that what I felt for you has turned into something more\u2026": u"Levei muito tempo para perceber que o que eu sentia por voc\u00ea se transformou em algo a mais\u2026",
        u"It\u2019s thanks to that attitude that Yoichi is who he is today. ": u"\u00c9 gra\u00e7as a essa atitude que o Yoichi \u00e9 quem \u00e9 hoje. ",
        u"It\u2019s that side thing we started, Yoshi. I never had the time to get back to it since we\u2019ve been so busy lately.": u"\u00c9 aquele projeto paralelo que come\u00e7amos, Yoshi. Nunca tive tempo de retom\u00e1-lo porque estivemos muito ocupados ultimamente.",
        u"It\u2019s the biggest dick I\u2019ve ever seen!! Who knew you were packing this much, dude?! ": u"\u00c9 o maior pau que eu j\u00e1 vi!! Quem diria que voc\u00ea escondia tudo isso a\u00ed, cara?! ",
        u"It\u2019s the first time this year I\u2019ve had a normal sleep schedule. I\u2019ll try to keep up with it, like I promised\u2026!": u"\u00c9 a primeira vez neste ano que tenho um hor\u00e1rio normal de sono. Vou tentar manter assim, como prometi\u2026!",
        u"It\u2019s the least I could do, Aiden.": u"\u00c9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer, Aiden.",
        u"It\u2019s the least I could\u2019ve done. I could tell you honestly wanted to do your best to help him.": u"Era o m\u00ednimo que eu podia fazer. Dava para perceber que voc\u00ea realmente queria fazer o poss\u00edvel para ajud\u00e1-lo.",
        u"It\u2019s the other way around, actually! I\u2019ve been told that you don\u2019t have a stay-in computer technician here at camp. ": u"Na verdade, \u00e9 o contr\u00e1rio! Disseram-me que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o t\u00eam um t\u00e9cnico de inform\u00e1tica permanente aqui no acampamento. ",
        u"It\u2019s the perfect chance for me to get to know Jin more\u2026 intimately. ": u"\u00c9 a oportunidade perfeita para eu conhecer Jin de forma mais\u2026 \u00edntima. ",
        u"It\u2019s three ice-cream flavors in one, Aiden! Dad always gets this one since we can\u2019t agree on just one! ": u"S\u00e3o tr\u00eas sabores de sorvete em um, Aiden! O papai sempre compra este porque n\u00e3o conseguimos concordar com um \u00fanico sabor! ",
        u"It\u2019s time for breakfast!": u"Est\u00e1 na hora do caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3!",
        u"It\u2019s time for me to find myself again.": u"Est\u00e1 na hora de eu me reencontrar.",
        u"It\u2019s time for our trip back to camp, do you need help with your bags?": u"Est\u00e1 na hora de voltarmos ao acampamento, precisa de ajuda com as malas?",
        u"It\u2019s time for sausage, sir!": u"Est\u00e1 na hora da lingui\u00e7a, senhor!",
        u"It\u2019s time to take some pictures!!! ": u"Hora de tirar umas fotos!!! ",
        u"It\u2019s tough to even move around in this mess\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 dif\u00edcil at\u00e9 se locomover no meio dessa bagun\u00e7a\u2026 ",
        u"It\u2019s true though, Yoshinori. You\u2019ve been a fine leader to the scouts, and quite the father figure for Yoichi.": u"Mas \u00e9 verdade, Yoshinori. Voc\u00ea tem sido um \u00f3timo l\u00edder para os escoteiros e praticamente uma figura paterna para o Yoichi.",
        u"It\u2019s true though~ When are you gonna make her call you that, Yoshi?": u"Mas \u00e9 verdade~ Quando vai fazer ela chamar voc\u00ea assim, Yoshi?",
        u"It\u2019s true.": u"\u00c9 verdade.",
        u"It\u2019s unrealistic to expect a homecook to replicate a dish like this if he\u2019s not even aware of basic dining etiquette.": u"\u00c9 irreal esperar que um cozinheiro caseiro reproduza um prato desses se ele nem conhece a etiqueta b\u00e1sica \u00e0 mesa.",
        u"It\u2019s unreasonable to ask your team of four people to handle all of this. ": u"N\u00e3o seria razo\u00e1vel pedir que uma equipe de quatro pessoas cuidasse de tudo isso. ",
        u"It\u2019s up to the individual as to what they do with the knowledge seen on their path.": u"Cabe a cada pessoa decidir o que fazer com o conhecimento revelado em seu caminho.",
        u"It\u2019s what I do best, Yoshi!": u"\u00c9 o que fa\u00e7o de melhor, Yoshi!",
        u"It\u2019s what you didn\u2019t say! ": u"\u00c9 o que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o disse! ",
        u"It\u2019s where I met Lloyd, and coming back here gave me the chance to take things with him to the next level.": u"Foi aqui que conheci Lloyd, e voltar para c\u00e1 me deu a chance de levar nossa rela\u00e7\u00e3o a outro n\u00edvel.",
        u"It\u2019s your choice, Yoshinori.": u"A escolha \u00e9 sua, Yoshinori.",
        u"It\u2019s your choice, Yoshinori.{fast}": u"A escolha \u00e9 sua, Yoshinori.{fast}",
        u"It\u2019s your most special day, after all!": u"Afinal, \u00e9 o dia mais especial de voc\u00eas!",
        u"It\u2019s your turn, Jin, and you better not bully us!": u"\u00c9 sua vez, Jin, e \u00e9 melhor n\u00e3o pegar no nosso p\u00e9!",
        u"I\u2014": u"Eu\u2014",
        u"I\u2019d also like to give a special thanks to Mr. Clermont, as without him we\u2019d never have had this opportunity to grow.": u"Tamb\u00e9m gostaria de fazer um agradecimento especial ao Sr. Clermont, pois sem ele nunca ter\u00edamos tido esta oportunidade de crescer.",
        u"I\u2019d also like to take this chance to tell you all something very important\u2026": u"Tamb\u00e9m gostaria de aproveitar esta oportunidade para contar algo muito importante a todos\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d also love to meet the scouts again! Is Mr. Nagame over there?": u"Tamb\u00e9m adoraria rever os escoteiros! O Sr. Nagame est\u00e1 ali?",
        u"I\u2019d always been outgoing and free-spirited at heart, so it only made sense to me at the time to gather people who had the same interests as me. So, I organized a biker\u2019s club.": u"Eu sempre fui soci\u00e1vel e de esp\u00edrito livre, ent\u00e3o na \u00e9poca fez sentido reunir pessoas que tinham os mesmos interesses que eu. Assim, organizei um clube de motociclistas.",
        u"I\u2019d always come to this spot so no one could find me, and I wouldn\u2019t have to deal with other people.": u"Eu sempre vinha at\u00e9 aqui para que ningu\u00e9m me encontrasse e eu n\u00e3o precisasse lidar com outras pessoas.",
        u"I\u2019d be honored, sir! Thank you for letting me help!": u"Seria uma honra, senhor! Obrigado por me permitir ajudar!",
        u"I\u2019d be into anything as long as it\u2019s with you\u2026": u"Eu toparia qualquer coisa desde que fosse com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d be lying if I said it\u2019s not a kink of mine\u2026": u"Eu estaria mentindo se dissesse que isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 um fetiche meu\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d be lying if I said it\u2019s not a kink of mine\u2026{fast}": u"Eu estaria mentindo se dissesse que isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 um fetiche meu\u2026{fast}",
        u"I\u2019d beg to differ. You didn\u2019t seem so enthused showing me around. You looked rather stressed, actually.": u"Discordo. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parecia t\u00e3o entusiasmado ao me mostrar o lugar. Na verdade, parecia bem estressado.",
        u"I\u2019d come back home from a long day of work and still find the time to take care of Dad, and he\u2019d always try to show me that he was happy.": u"Eu voltava para casa depois de um longo dia de trabalho e ainda encontrava tempo para cuidar do Pai, e ele sempre tentava demonstrar que estava feliz.",
        u"I\u2019d expected her to spazz over how a bunch of guys slept together!": u"Eu esperava que ela surtasse por um monte de caras terem dormido juntos!",
        u"I\u2019d like a taste of that candy cane\u2026": u"Eu gostaria de provar essa bengala doce\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d like something fresh! What about foie gras? That sounds greeny!": u"Eu queria algo fresco! Que tal foie gras? Parece coisa verde!",
        u"I\u2019d like that! He and I get along great in the kitchen! With a little more experience, he\u2019ll be as good as me\u2026 or even better!": u"Eu gostaria! N\u00f3s dois nos damos muito bem na cozinha! Com um pouco mais de experi\u00eancia, ele ficar\u00e1 t\u00e3o bom quanto eu\u2026 ou at\u00e9 melhor!",
        u"I\u2019d like that.": u"Eu gostaria.",
        u"I\u2019d like to congratulate you both, as it\u2019s our most outstanding release yet! It generated a lot more sales than we anticipated!": u"Gostaria de parabenizar os dois, pois \u00e9 o nosso lan\u00e7amento de maior destaque at\u00e9 agora! Ele gerou muito mais vendas do que esper\u00e1vamos!",
        u"I\u2019d like to see one of us choking~! And I bet you\u2019d totally like to see ME coming~": u"Eu gostaria de ver um de n\u00f3s engasgando~! E aposto que voc\u00ea adoraria ME ver chegando l\u00e1~",
        u"I\u2019d like to take you up on that offer. I\u2019m getting too old for this.": u"Gostaria de aceitar essa oferta. Estou ficando velho demais para isso.",
        u"I\u2019d much rather have your cooking than mine!": u"Prefiro muito mais a sua comida do que a minha!",
        u"I\u2019d rather be alone than spend my precious time pretending to be friends with people like you.": u"Prefiro ficar sozinha a desperdi\u00e7ar meu precioso tempo fingindo ser amiga de gente como voc\u00eas.",
        u"I\u2019d rather have something that fills me up.": u"Eu preferia algo que me deixasse satisfeito.",
        u"I\u2019d rather not share you with strangers.": u"Prefiro n\u00e3o compartilhar voc\u00ea com estranhos.",
        u"I\u2019d rather stay here\u2026 with you\u2026": u"Eu prefiro ficar aqui\u2026 com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d really appreciate if you gave it more thought, Mr. Nomoru. I\u2019d be thrilled to see Camp Buddy expand its horizons.": u"Eu realmente agradeceria se pensasse melhor na proposta, Sr. Nomoru. Ficaria muito feliz em ver o Camp Buddy expandir seus horizontes.",
        u"I\u2019d really appreciate that, Yoshi\u2026 That\u2019s all I\u2019ll need\u2026": u"Eu agradeceria muito, Yoshi\u2026 \u00c9 tudo de que vou precisar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d really love to see you in\u2026 nothing but that necklace\u2026": u"Eu adoraria ver voc\u00ea usando\u2026 nada al\u00e9m desse colar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019d say I\u2019m impressed considering this is a cheap costume from the party store.": u"Diria que estou impressionada, considerando que \u00e9 uma fantasia barata de loja de festas.",
        u"I\u2019d say I\u2019m not surprised, but you caught me off guard as well. ": u"Eu diria que n\u00e3o estou surpreso, mas voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m me pegou de surpresa. ",
        u"I\u2019d say I\u2019m one hella great dancer! How about I treat you like a real VIP~?": u"Eu diria que sou um dan\u00e7arino bom pra caramba! Que tal eu tratar voc\u00ea como um verdadeiro VIP~?",
        u"I\u2019d say it\u2019s still an improvement compared to how she acted as a scout.": u"Eu diria que ainda \u00e9 uma melhora em compara\u00e7\u00e3o com seu comportamento como escoteira.",
        u"I\u2019d say it\u2019s worth it!  No pain, no gain!": u"Eu diria que vale a pena! Sem dor, sem ganho!",
        u"I\u2019d say it\u2019s worth it! No pain, no gain!": u"Eu diria que vale a pena! Sem dor, sem ganho!",
        u"I\u2019d say that\u2019s the least surprising change. I knew from the moment we met that you\u2019d end up back at this place. ": u"Eu diria que essa \u00e9 a mudan\u00e7a menos surpreendente. Desde que nos conhecemos, sabia que voc\u00ea acabaria voltando para c\u00e1.",
        u"I\u2019d say the same! I\u2019ve never had someone that I\u2019ve gotten as close with as you!": u"Eu digo o mesmo! Nunca tive algu\u00e9m de quem me aproximasse tanto quanto de voc\u00ea!",
        u"I\u2019d say we\u2019re at about 80\\% completion of the original target! You guys can leave the rest for us tomorrow, and we\u2019ll finish it before sunset!": u"Eu diria que conclu\u00edmos cerca de 80\\% da meta original! Podem deixar o restante para n\u00f3s amanh\u00e3, e terminaremos antes do p\u00f4r do sol!",
        u"I\u2019d switch tasks any day.": u"Eu trocaria de tarefa a qualquer momento.",
        u"I\u2019d try and argue with you, but you\u2019re right.": u"Eu tentaria discutir, mas voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o.",
        u"I\u2019ll admit that times were tough back then\u2026": u"Admito que naquela \u00e9poca as coisas foram dif\u00edceis\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll admit though, I also am guilty of forgetting someone. I don\u2019t think I remember you at all, Aiden.": u"Mas admito que tamb\u00e9m esqueci algu\u00e9m. Acho que n\u00e3o me lembro nem um pouco de voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"I\u2019ll admit, I\u2019ve always been fond of bath houses\u2026 There\u2019s something very soothing about them.": u"Admito que sempre gostei de casas de banho\u2026 H\u00e1 algo muito reconfortante nelas.",
        u"I\u2019ll always be here for you, Aiden!": u"Sempre estarei aqui por voc\u00ea, Aiden!",
        u"I\u2019ll always be your father, and you\u2019ll always be my son\u2026 So don\u2019t be afraid\u2026": u"Eu sempre serei seu pai, e voc\u00ea sempre ser\u00e1 meu filho\u2026 Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o tenha medo\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll attend to the other groups! Get to work!": u"Vou cuidar dos outros grupos! Ao trabalho!",
        u"I\u2019ll be able to really contribute and truly belong at Camp Buddy one day!": u"Um dia vou poder contribuir de verdade e realmente fazer parte do Camp Buddy!",
        u"I\u2019ll be alright, but what about you?": u"Eu vou ficar bem, mas e voc\u00ea?",
        u"I\u2019ll be around the shed if you need me~!": u"Estarei perto do galp\u00e3o se precisar de mim~!",
        u"I\u2019ll be at the office if you guys need me, alright?": u"Vou estar no escrit\u00f3rio se precisarem de mim, certo?",
        u"I\u2019ll be checking on all of your progress at the end of the day. You\u2019re all dismissed!": u"Verificarei o progresso de todos no fim do dia. Est\u00e3o dispensados!",
        u"I\u2019ll be honest, I was winging the whole thing. I just repeated the same stuff Goro said during the previous meetings.": u"Para ser sincero, improvisei tudo. S\u00f3 repeti as mesmas coisas que Goro disse nas reuni\u00f5es anteriores.",
        u"I\u2019ll be needing a room of my own to stay in.": u"Precisarei de um quarto s\u00f3 para mim.",
        u"I\u2019ll be right back!": u"Volto logo!",
        u"I\u2019ll be right back, you two.": u"J\u00e1 volto, voc\u00eas dois.",
        u"I\u2019ll call everyone to send you off now, alright?": u"Vou chamar todo mundo para se despedir de voc\u00ea agora, certo?",
        u"I\u2019ll carry Emilia to the shuttle and get her situated.": u"Vou levar Emilia at\u00e9 o \u00f4nibus e acomod\u00e1-la.",
        u"I\u2019ll carry you.": u"Eu carrego voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019ll catch up after a phone call. Please go ahead, Yoshinori.": u"Eu os alcan\u00e7o depois de um telefonema. Podem ir na frente, Yoshinori.",
        u"I\u2019ll come and give you a taste then~": u"Ent\u00e3o vou a\u00ed te dar um gostinho~",
        u"I\u2019ll come inside.": u"J\u00e1 vou entrar.",
        u"I\u2019ll cover for you, Aiden! ": u"Eu cuidarei disso por voc\u00ea, Aiden!",
        u"I\u2019ll do his legs.": u"Eu cuido das pernas dele.",
        u"I\u2019ll do it myself. It\u2019s only fair that we give her the chance to defend herself.": u"Eu mesmo vou falar com ela. \u00c9 justo darmos a ela a chance de se defender.",
        u"I\u2019ll do it. ": u"Eu topo. ",
        u"I\u2019ll do my best to communicate more. ": u"Vou fazer o poss\u00edvel para me comunicar mais. ",
        u"I\u2019ll do my best to not let them resurface again, and I sincerely hope my actions don\u2019t change the way you see me, as both your leader and your friend.": u"Farei o poss\u00edvel para n\u00e3o deix\u00e1-los voltar, e espero sinceramente que minhas a\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o mudem a forma como voc\u00eas me veem, tanto como l\u00edder quanto como amigo.",
        u"I\u2019ll email you the specifics on each topic so you can consider them thoroughly.": u"Enviarei por e-mail os detalhes de cada t\u00f3pico para que possa analis\u00e1-los cuidadosamente.",
        u"I\u2019ll gather everyone immediately\u2026!": u"Reunirei todos imediatamente\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019ll get straight to the point.": u"Vou direto ao ponto.",
        u"I\u2019ll get straight to the point. You\u2019ve done something seriously wrong that I can\u2019t turn a blind eye to!": u"Vou direto ao ponto. Voc\u00ea fez algo muito errado, e eu n\u00e3o posso simplesmente fechar os olhos para isso!",
        u"I\u2019ll get you some tissues.": u"Vou pegar alguns len\u00e7os para voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019ll go ahead and preheat the oven.": u"Vou come\u00e7ar pr\u00e9-aquecendo o forno.",
        u"I\u2019ll go check on him! Maybe I can help him finish up too!": u"Vou ver como ele est\u00e1! Talvez eu tamb\u00e9m possa ajud\u00e1-lo a terminar!",
        u"I\u2019ll go first!": u"Eu vou primeiro!",
        u"I\u2019ll go get my coat! Yipeee~": u"Vou pegar meu casaco! Yipeee~",
        u"I\u2019ll go get the shovels!": u"Vou buscar as p\u00e1s!",
        u"I\u2019ll go get us some liquor!": u"Vou buscar uma bebida para n\u00f3s!",
        u"I\u2019ll go order something and get a table for us! Distract her for me, Yoshi!": u"Vou pedir alguma coisa e arrumar uma mesa para n\u00f3s! Distrai ela para mim, Yoshi!",
        u"I\u2019ll go set the table!": u"Vou arrumar a mesa!",
        u"I\u2019ll go to her room and fetch her! I\u2019ll be right back!": u"Vou at\u00e9 o quarto dela busc\u00e1-la! J\u00e1 volto!",
        u"I\u2019ll grab my first aid kit, and we\u2019ll patch up that bruise!": u"Vou pegar meu kit de primeiros socorros, e cuidaremos desse hematoma!",
        u"I\u2019ll handle her, guys. Let me go and sort this out.": u"Eu cuido dela, pessoal. Deixem que eu resolva isso.",
        u"I\u2019ll handle it.": u"Eu cuido disso.",
        u"I\u2019ll have you know, I\u2019m not as rusty as you think. I\u2019m far more \u2018experienced' than you.": u"Saiba que n\u00e3o estou t\u00e3o enferrujado quanto voc\u00ea pensa. Sou muito mais \u2018experiente\u2019 que voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019ll head to the kitchen and start cooking!": u"Vou para a cozinha come\u00e7ar a cozinhar!",
        u"I\u2019ll join, it sounds fun.": u"Eu participo, parece divertido.",
        u"I\u2019ll just call everyone when the food is ready!": u"Eu chamo todo mundo quando a comida estiver pronta!",
        u"I\u2019ll just catch up, Sir Goro.": u"Eu alcan\u00e7o o senhor depois, Sr. Goro.",
        u"I\u2019ll just move into the staff quarters. There should be an extra bed there, anyway.": u"Eu me mudarei para os aposentos da equipe. De qualquer forma, deve haver uma cama extra l\u00e1.",
        u"I\u2019ll just shower later then.": u"Ent\u00e3o eu tomo banho depois.",
        u"I\u2019ll just tuck you in, Aiden\u2026": u"Vou apenas cobrir voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll keep in touch\u2026 And I\u2019ll make time if the camp needs my help.": u"Vou manter contato\u2026 E arranjarei tempo se o acampamento precisar da minha ajuda.",
        u"I\u2019ll keep that in mind, Emilia\u2026": u"Vou pensar nisso, Emilia\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll keep that in mind, Mr. Clermont.": u"Vou me lembrar disso, Sr. Clermont.",
        u"I\u2019ll keep this camp alive and make it bigger than you ever imagined it could be.": u"Vou manter este acampamento vivo e torn\u00e1-lo maior do que voc\u00ea jamais imaginou que poderia ser.",
        u"I\u2019ll listen\u2026": u"Eu vou ouvir\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll make sure to consider what everyone has said.": u"Vou levar em considera\u00e7\u00e3o tudo o que voc\u00eas disseram.",
        u"I\u2019ll make sure you get your fill, Aiden\u2026": u"Vou garantir que voc\u00ea fique bem satisfeito, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ll make you eat your words, Mr. Perfect!": u"Vou fazer voc\u00ea engolir essas palavras, Sr. Perfeitinho!",
        u"I\u2019ll miss all of you guys!": u"Vou sentir falta de todos voc\u00eas!",
        u"I\u2019ll nap with you later.": u"Vou cochilar com voc\u00ea mais tarde.",
        u"I\u2019ll play fight with you if you want.": u"Posso brincar de brigar com voc\u00ea, se quiser.",
        u"I\u2019ll put it up, don\u2019t worry. ": u"Eu instalo, n\u00e3o se preocupe. ",
        u"I\u2019ll save the vanilla flavor for you, sir!": u"Vou guardar o sabor de baunilha para o senhor!",
        u"I\u2019ll see you two in a few days! Stay safe!": u"Vejo voc\u00eas dois daqui a alguns dias! Cuidem-se!",
        u"I\u2019ll serve some up at the mess hall! Just follow me!": u"Vou servir um pouco no refeit\u00f3rio! \u00c9 s\u00f3 me seguir!",
        u"I\u2019ll setup the camera! Everyone, huddle up!": u"Vou preparar a c\u00e2mera! Todo mundo, juntem-se!",
        u"I\u2019ll start moving now, alright\u2026?": u"Vou come\u00e7ar a me mexer agora, tudo bem\u2026?",
        u"I\u2019ll start! Never have I ever had sex!": u"Eu come\u00e7o! Eu nunca fiz sexo!",
        u"I\u2019ll start! Yoichi, truth or dare!": u"Eu come\u00e7o! Yoichi, verdade ou desafio!",
        u"I\u2019ll stick around here for now, and make sure that he has everything he needs.": u"Vou ficar por aqui por enquanto e garantir que ele tenha tudo de que precisa.",
        u"I\u2019ll still come visit every now and then, though! You guys will need some tech maintenance after all.": u"Mas ainda vou visitar voc\u00eas de vez em quando! Afinal, voc\u00eas v\u00e3o precisar de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o na tecnologia.",
        u"I\u2019ll take care of him! You guys go finish up and come over to the mess hall for the meal!": u"Eu cuido dele! Voc\u00eas terminem a\u00ed e venham ao refeit\u00f3rio para a refei\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"I\u2019ll take her from here, Yuri! ": u"Eu levo ela daqui, Yuri! ",
        u"I\u2019ll take her from here, dear.": u"Eu a levo daqui, querida.",
        u"I\u2019ll take it.": u"Eu aceito.",
        u"I\u2019ll take my leave for now and rest up! I still have to send an email report to Mr. Clermont, after all!": u"Vou me retirar e descansar! Afinal, ainda preciso enviar um relat\u00f3rio por e-mail ao Sr. Clermont!",
        u"I\u2019ll take over and brief everyone.": u"Vou assumir e orientar todo mundo.",
        u"I\u2019ll take over for you clearing out the snow! I gotta make up for my time in the kitchen, after all.": u"Vou assumir seu lugar na limpeza da neve! Afinal, preciso compensar o tempo que passei na cozinha.",
        u"I\u2019ll take that as a yes~!": u"Vou considerar isso um sim~!",
        u"I\u2019ll totally kick Yoichi\u2019s ass.": u"Eu vou acabar com o Yoichi.",
        u"I\u2019ll try my best then! I\u2019m counting on you, Yoshi\u2026!": u"Ent\u00e3o farei o meu melhor! Conto com voc\u00ea, Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019ll try next. I have the perfect one.": u"Eu tento agora. Tenho uma perfeita.",
        u"I\u2019ll watch. ": u"Eu vou assistir. ",
        u"I\u2019ll wear just an apron and let you watch, if you join~": u"Vou usar s\u00f3 um avental e deixar voc\u00ea assistir, se vier comigo~",
        u"I\u2019m Dar, lead foreman. I build stuff.": u"Sou Dar, encarregado-chefe. Eu construo coisas.",
        u"I\u2019m Darius. *shakes Hyunjin\u2019s hand*": u"Sou Darius. *aperta a m\u00e3o de Hyunjin*",
        u"I\u2019m Yuri! ": u"Eu sou Yuri! ",
        u"I\u2019m a WHAT?! Take that back!!!": u"Eu sou O QU\u00ca?! Retire o que disse!!!",
        u"I\u2019m a fucking joke for believing that I had something special I could do\u2026!": u"Eu sou uma piada do caralho por ter acreditado que sabia fazer algo especial\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019m a go-getter, so if I were in your shoes, I\u2019d fight for that position! ": u"Eu sou determinada, ent\u00e3o, se estivesse no seu lugar, lutaria por essa oportunidade! ",
        u"I\u2019m a go-getter, so if I were in your shoes, I\u2019d fight for that position!{fast}": u"Eu sou determinada, ent\u00e3o, se estivesse no seu lugar, lutaria por essa oportunidade!{fast}",
        u"I\u2019m a little surprised, from the sound of things yesterday I thought we\u2019d be here longer, but it did have to end eventually.": u"Estou um pouco surpreso. Pelo que disseram ontem, achei que ficar\u00edamos aqui por mais tempo, mas uma hora tinha que acabar.",
        u"I\u2019m a lot older than you think, but I get that a lot, haha!": u"Sou bem mais velho do que voc\u00ea pensa, mas ou\u00e7o muito isso, haha!",
        u"I\u2019m a lot stronger than I look~ She never tried to get anywhere near me after that incident.": u"Eu sou bem mais forte do que pare\u00e7o~ Ela nunca mais tentou chegar perto de mim depois daquele incidente.",
        u"I\u2019m a pretty good gamer, if I do say so myself~": u"Sou um jogador bem bom, mod\u00e9stia \u00e0 parte~",
        u"I\u2019m a professional with exactly the experience you need, and I\u2019m going out of my way to help you. The right choice is obvious.": u"Sou uma profissional com exatamente a experi\u00eancia de que precisa e estou me esfor\u00e7ando para ajud\u00e1-lo. A escolha certa \u00e9 \u00f3bvia.",
        u"I\u2019m actually already done for the day, sir! Now I can hang out with you guys before I go to bed!": u"Na verdade, j\u00e1 terminei meu trabalho de hoje, senhor! Agora posso passar um tempo com voc\u00eas antes de ir dormir!",
        u"I\u2019m actually glad that we get to hang out with you, Sir Goro! We rarely got the chance to do that last year!": u"Na verdade, fico feliz de podermos passar um tempo com o senhor, Sr. Goro! No ano passado quase nunca tivemos essa oportunidade!",
        u"I\u2019m actually kind of hungry, so let\u2019s go get some food!": u"Na verdade estou com um pouco de fome, ent\u00e3o vamos pegar comida!",
        u"I\u2019m actually scheduled for my entrance exam later today too.": u"Na verdade, minha prova de admiss\u00e3o est\u00e1 marcada para mais tarde hoje.",
        u"I\u2019m actually shocked you were able to teach Yoshi about computers too. He\u2019s such a caveman when it comes to anything tech. Must\u2019ve taken the whole day, am I right?": u"Na verdade, estou surpresa por voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m ter conseguido ensinar inform\u00e1tica ao Yoshi. Ele \u00e9 um verdadeiro homem das cavernas quando o assunto \u00e9 tecnologia. Deve ter levado o dia inteiro, acertei?",
        u"I\u2019m actually surprised you two resonate so much! ": u"Na verdade, estou surpreso com o quanto voc\u00eas dois combinam! ",
        u"I\u2019m actually talking about Emilia, Dad\u2026 I thought she\u2019d give her obnoxious behavior a break, especially after the fuss she made last night.": u"Na verdade, estou falando da Emilia, pai\u2026 Achei que ela daria um tempo nesse comportamento insuport\u00e1vel, principalmente depois do esc\u00e2ndalo de ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"I\u2019m afraid Emilia might cause us more trouble than help.": u"Tenho medo de que Emilia acabe causando mais problemas do que ajudando.",
        u"I\u2019m afraid of the past repeating itself\u2026": u"Tenho medo de que o passado se repita\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m afraid that I\u2019d lose someone I love again\u2026": u"Tenho medo de perder novamente algu\u00e9m que amo\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m afraid.": u"Receio que sim.",
        u"I\u2019m already at my wits end with that girl. I don\u2019t think we\u2019ll ever be friends outside of work.": u"Essa garota j\u00e1 acabou com a minha paci\u00eancia. Acho que nunca seremos amigas fora do trabalho.",
        u"I\u2019m already done for the day, actually! Now I can hang out with you guys before I go to bed!": u"Na verdade, j\u00e1 terminei por hoje! Agora posso passar um tempo com voc\u00eas antes de dormir!",
        u"I\u2019m already happy enough getting to spend time with you, you know?": u"J\u00e1 fico feliz s\u00f3 por poder passar um tempo com voc\u00ea, sabia?",
        u"I\u2019m always down for a sing-along~!": u"Estou sempre disposto a cantar junto~!",
        u"I\u2019m always happy to assist!": u"Estou sempre disposto a ajudar!",
        u"I\u2019m an IT specialist, and I\u2019m here to perform an inspection and determine the camp\u2019s technological needs.": u"Sou especialista em TI e estou aqui para realizar uma inspe\u00e7\u00e3o e determinar as necessidades tecnol\u00f3gicas do acampamento.",
        u"I\u2019m appalled to hear that you\u2019d even consider turning it down! ": u"Estou chocada de saber que voc\u00ea sequer considera recusar! ",
        u"I\u2019m back, Yoshinori. Were you waiting for me?": u"Voltei, Yoshinori. Estava me esperando?",
        u"I\u2019m being serious here! If you made a career out of your talent, you\u2019d be really successful!": u"Estou falando s\u00e9rio! Se transformasse seu talento em carreira, voc\u00ea teria muito sucesso!",
        u"I\u2019m coming, I\u2019m coming! What do you think this is? Hell\u2019s kitchen?!": u"J\u00e1 vai, j\u00e1 vai! O que voc\u00ea acha que \u00e9 isso? Hell\u2019s Kitchen?!",
        u"I\u2019m coming, Yoshinori\u2026!!": u"Eu vou gozar, Yoshinori\u2026!!",
        u"I\u2019m curious, where did you learn to cook?": u"Estou curioso, onde voc\u00ea aprendeu a cozinhar?",
        u"I\u2019m curious. What did Aiden\u2019s reading say, Lloyd?": u"Estou curioso. O que a leitura de Aiden revelou, Lloyd?",
        u"I\u2019m curious. What did Sir Goro\u2019s reading say, Lloyd?": u"Estou curioso. O que a leitura do Sr. Goro revelou, Lloyd?",
        u"I\u2019m deliberately missing out on a life changing opportunity that everyone knows is best for me\u2026": u"Estou deliberadamente deixando passar uma oportunidade que pode mudar minha vida e que todos sabem ser o melhor para mim\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m deliberately missing out on a life-changing opportunity that everyone knows is best for me\u2026": u"Estou deliberadamente deixando passar uma oportunidade que pode mudar minha vida e que todos sabem ser o melhor para mim\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m doing just that with Jin here, and he seems to be very pleased.": u"Estou fazendo exatamente isso com Jin, e ele parece estar bastante satisfeito.",
        u"I\u2019m done being stuck in my ways and just going with the flow, sweeping every bad thing under the rug and thinking it\u2019d all go away.": u"Cansei de ficar preso aos meus velhos h\u00e1bitos e apenas seguir o fluxo, varrendo tudo de ruim para debaixo do tapete e achando que desapareceria.",
        u"I\u2019m doubting my choice to be here\u2026 I\u2019m doubting my choice to hold on to you as well\u2026": u"Estou questionando minha escolha de estar aqui\u2026 e tamb\u00e9m estou questionando minha escolha de continuar me agarrando a voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m down. Lloyd?": u"Eu topo. Lloyd?",
        u"I\u2019m drawing some layouts and planning out the repairs, and uhh\u2026": u"Estou desenhando algumas plantas e planejando os reparos, e uhh\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m enjoying it just as much, sir! I never would\u2019ve thought I\u2019d be able to experience all this luxury in my life.": u"Estou gostando tanto quanto o senhor! Nunca imaginei que teria a chance de experimentar todo esse luxo na minha vida.",
        u"I\u2019m enjoying it so much that it almost feels wrong.": u"Estou gostando tanto que quase parece errado.",
        u"I\u2019m excited as well.  I\u2019m sure we\u2019ll have a memorable first term considering how much we\u2019ve prepared for this!": u"Tamb\u00e9m estou animado.  Tenho certeza de que teremos uma primeira temporada inesquec\u00edvel, considerando o quanto nos preparamos!",
        u"I\u2019m excited.": u"Estou animado.",
        u"I\u2019m feeling a little hungry after all that\u2026 ": u"Estou com um pouco de fome depois de tudo aquilo\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m feeling really hungry\u2026": u"Estou com muita fome\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m fine now, everyone\u2026 I didn\u2019t mean to make you all worry\u2026 ": u"Estou bem agora, pessoal\u2026 N\u00e3o queria deixar todos voc\u00eas preocupados\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m fine staying at Camp Buddy, sir! No need to go anywhere fancy!": u"Por mim, tudo bem ficar no Camp Buddy, senhor! N\u00e3o precisamos ir a nenhum lugar chique!",
        u"I\u2019m fine, dear. Thanks for checking up on me. ": u"Estou bem, querida. Obrigado por vir ver como estou. ",
        u"I\u2019m fine. Today\u2019s not as cold as yesterday.": u"Estou bem. Hoje n\u00e3o est\u00e1 t\u00e3o frio quanto ontem.",
        u"I\u2019m getting anxious\u2026 People are whispering and staring at us\u2026": u"Estou ficando ansioso\u2026 As pessoas est\u00e3o cochichando e olhando para a gente\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m glad Darius and Lloyd finally got their label. They\u2019re a really good match for each other!": u"Fico feliz que Darius e Lloyd finalmente oficializaram o relacionamento. Eles combinam muito!",
        u"I\u2019m glad I was able to help. This would\u2019ve been impossible to do by yourself.": u"Fico feliz por ter ajudado. Seria imposs\u00edvel fazer isso sozinho.",
        u"I\u2019m glad it all worked out in the end!": u"Fico feliz que no fim tenha dado tudo certo!",
        u"I\u2019m glad to hear it. It sounds like we can really rely on them for support. Great work handling everything, you three.": u"Fico feliz em saber. Parece que realmente podemos contar com o apoio deles. Voc\u00eas tr\u00eas fizeram um \u00f3timo trabalho cuidando de tudo.",
        u"I\u2019m glad we were able to find a way to still celebrate it!": u"Fico feliz que conseguimos encontrar um jeito de comemorar mesmo assim!",
        u"I\u2019m glad we\u2019re on the same page, sir!": u"Fico feliz que estejamos de acordo, senhor!",
        u"I\u2019m glad you all understand\u2026 ": u"Fico feliz que todos entendam\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m glad you can count on me too, sir\u2026 We\u2019re partners, after all.": u"Fico feliz que o senhor tamb\u00e9m possa contar comigo\u2026 Afinal, somos parceiros.",
        u"I\u2019m glad you enjoyed it, Aiden! I did promise you I\u2019d take you on an actual date once everything settled down.": u"Fico feliz que tenha gostado, Aiden! Eu prometi que levaria voc\u00ea para um encontro de verdade quando tudo se acalmasse.",
        u"I\u2019m glad you enjoyed it, Aiden\u2026": u"Fico feliz que tenha gostado, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m glad you enjoyed it, Yoshinori. I was hoping we\u2019d be able to go somewhere special once everything settled down.": u"Fico feliz que tenha gostado, Yoshinori. Eu esperava que pud\u00e9ssemos ir a algum lugar especial quando tudo se acalmasse.",
        u"I\u2019m glad you finally see now why all of us were guiding you in this direction!": u"Fico feliz que finalmente entenda por que todos n\u00f3s est\u00e1vamos guiando voc\u00ea nessa dire\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"I\u2019m glad you noticed his efforts, Aiden. He\u2019s had a hard time trying to adjust to all of this at once.": u"Fico feliz que tenha percebido o esfor\u00e7o dele, Aiden. Tem sido dif\u00edcil para ele se adaptar a tudo isso de uma vez.",
        u"I\u2019m glad you see it that way! ": u"Fico feliz que voc\u00ea pense assim! ",
        u"I\u2019m glad you see that in me, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Fico feliz que enxergue isso em mim, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m glad you trust me, Goro\u2026 I\u2019m really grateful for everything you\u2019ve done for me and the camp this whole time.": u"Fico feliz que confie em mim, Goro\u2026 Sou muito grato por tudo que voc\u00ea fez por mim e pelo acampamento durante todo esse tempo.",
        u"I\u2019m glad you were able to see how much potential you have, Aiden": u"Fico feliz que tenha conseguido enxergar o quanto de potencial voc\u00ea tem, Aiden",
        u"I\u2019m glad you\u2019re enjoying this, Yoshinori. I\u2019ve been really looking forward to going somewhere special like this once everything settled down.": u"Fico feliz que esteja gostando, Yoshinori. Eu estava realmente ansioso para irmos a algum lugar especial assim quando tudo se acalmasse.",
        u"I\u2019m glad. I\u2019ll try to be more open with you guys. It\u2019ll take some time getting used to.": u"Fico feliz. Vou tentar ser mais aberto com voc\u00eas. Levarei algum tempo para me acostumar.",
        u"I\u2019m going in, Aiden\u2026": u"Eu vou entrar, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m going in, Yoshinori\u2026 I\u2019ll make you feel great\u2026": u"Vou entrar, Yoshinori\u2026 Vou fazer voc\u00ea se sentir muito bem\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m going in.": u"Eu vou entrar.",
        u"I\u2019m going to be honest\u2026 I had a bit of trouble sleeping last night thinking about what happened yesterday with Emilia\u2026": u"Vou ser sincero\u2026 Tive um pouco de dificuldade para dormir ontem \u00e0 noite pensando no que aconteceu com Emilia\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m going to do whatever it takes for him!": u"Vou fazer tudo que puder por ele!",
        u"I\u2019m going to get more snacks!": u"Vou buscar mais petiscos!",
        u"I\u2019m going to get my sketchbook and get started right now!": u"Vou pegar meu caderno de desenho e come\u00e7ar agora mesmo!",
        u"I\u2019m gonna get started on the other work.": u"Vou come\u00e7ar o outro trabalho.",
        u"I\u2019m gonna prove what you said to that bartender isn\u2019t true!": u"Vou provar que aquilo que voc\u00ea disse para o bartender n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade!",
        u"I\u2019m gonna pump you \u2018til you\u2019re dry!": u"Vou cavalgar voc\u00ea at\u00e9 n\u00e3o sobrar nada!",
        u"I\u2019m good. Excited for the project.": u"Estou bem. Animado com o projeto.",
        u"I\u2019m good. I didn\u2019t know you worked here too\u2026": u"Estou bem. N\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m trabalhava aqui\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m guessing this is going to be a first for most of us, right?": u"Imagino que esta seja a primeira vez para a maioria de n\u00f3s, certo?",
        u"I\u2019m happy I can say that I understand you much better now, sir\u2026": u"Fico feliz em poder dizer que agora entendo o senhor muito melhor\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m here to help you!": u"Estou aqui para ajudar voc\u00ea!",
        u"I\u2019m here to make a report, sir\u2026!": u"Vim fazer um relat\u00f3rio, senhor\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019m hitting the hay too! Got another long day coming up tomorrow!": u"Tamb\u00e9m vou para a cama! Teremos outro dia longo amanh\u00e3!",
        u"I\u2019m impressed, but let\u2019s see how long you can resist.": u"Estou impressionado, mas vamos ver por quanto tempo consegue resistir.",
        u"I\u2019m impressed, dear.": u"Estou impressionado, querido.",
        u"I\u2019m impressed. This looks like it took a lot of work.": u"Estou impressionado. Parece que isso deu muito trabalho.",
        u"I\u2019m just as surprised, as I thought maintenance was fairly self-explanatory, but clearly you needed more guidance to do such a simple job.": u"Tamb\u00e9m estou surpresa. Achei que a manuten\u00e7\u00e3o fosse bastante autoexplicativa, mas claramente voc\u00ea precisava de mais orienta\u00e7\u00e3o para um trabalho t\u00e3o simples.",
        u"I\u2019m just doing my job! It\u2019s not my fault that none of you can accept how wrong you all are! ": u"Eu s\u00f3 estou fazendo meu trabalho! N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa minha se nenhum de voc\u00eas consegue aceitar o quanto est\u00e3o errados! ",
        u"I\u2019m just feeling a little light-headed from too much sleep\u2026 But I\u2019m fine now, really\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou um pouco tonta por ter dormido demais\u2026 Mas agora estou bem, de verdade\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just feeling really thirsty\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou com muita sede\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just glad I don\u2019t have to hear Emilia boss us around for at least a couple of days.": u"S\u00f3 estou feliz por n\u00e3o precisar ouvir Emilia mandando na gente por pelo menos alguns dias.",
        u"I\u2019m just glad we can finally go home now\u2026  ": u"S\u00f3 estou feliz por finalmente podermos voltar para casa\u2026  ",
        u"I\u2019m just glad we enjoyed our time together.": u"S\u00f3 fico feliz por termos aproveitado nosso tempo juntos.",
        u"I\u2019m just glad you kept your undies on, no one wants to see your overgrown bush\u2026": u"S\u00f3 fico feliz que tenha mantido a cueca; ningu\u00e9m quer ver esse matagal enorme\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just glad you let me take him into the camp to begin with, sir.": u"S\u00f3 fico feliz que o senhor tenha permitido que eu o trouxesse para o acampamento, para come\u00e7o de conversa.",
        u"I\u2019m just glad you trusted me enough to tell me all of that. It really means a lot to me, Aiden.": u"S\u00f3 fico feliz por voc\u00ea ter confiado em mim o suficiente para me contar tudo isso. Significa muito para mim, Aiden.",
        u"I\u2019m just kidding, Yoshinori! Take it easy!": u"Estou apenas brincando, Yoshinori! Relaxe!",
        u"I\u2019m just really ashamed\u2026 because what I just did earlier today made things a lot worse\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou muito envergonhada\u2026 porque o que fiz mais cedo hoje piorou muito as coisas\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just really confused with what changed all of a sudden\u2026": u"S\u00f3 estou muito confuso com o que mudou de repente\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just relieved you said something back there, Gramps.": u"S\u00f3 estou aliviado por voc\u00ea ter falado alguma coisa l\u00e1, Vov\u00f4.",
        u"I\u2019m just relieved you said something back there, Yoshi.": u"S\u00f3 estou aliviado por voc\u00ea ter falado alguma coisa l\u00e1, Yoshi.",
        u"I\u2019m just sayin\u2019 I won\u2019t believe it til\u2019 I see it~": u"S\u00f3 estou dizendo que n\u00e3o acredito at\u00e9 ver~",
        u"I\u2019m just so lonely again\u2026 it\u2019s\u2026 reminding me of back then when you left for school\u2026": u"Estou me sentindo t\u00e3o sozinho de novo\u2026 isso\u2026 est\u00e1 me lembrando de quando voc\u00ea foi embora para estudar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m just surprised you have another tattoo, Mr. Andre. And it\u2019s a big one too.": u"S\u00f3 estou surpreso por ter outra tatuagem, Sr. Andre. E ela tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 grande.",
        u"I\u2019m just trying to understand you!": u"Eu s\u00f3 estou tentando entender voc\u00ea!",
        u"I\u2019m just\u2026 not used to showing vulnerability like that. ": u"Eu s\u00f3\u2026 n\u00e3o estou acostumado a mostrar vulnerabilidade desse jeito. ",
        u"I\u2019m leaving to study now so I can be a scoutmaster here one day!": u"Estou indo estudar agora para poder ser chefe escoteiro aqui um dia!",
        u"I\u2019m living the dream! ": u"Estou vivendo o sonho! ",
        u"I\u2019m lost for words\u2026": u"Estou sem palavras\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m making this choice for myself\u2026 I need to prove that I can find happiness on my own without attaching it to the camp\u2026 attaching it to you\u2026": u"Estou fazendo esta escolha por mim mesmo\u2026 Preciso provar que consigo encontrar felicidade sozinho, sem vincul\u00e1-la ao acampamento\u2026 nem a voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not allowed to bring visitors as per the camp policy, but luckily Sir Goro made an exception and is letting you wait here due to our circumstances\u2026 ": u"Segundo as regras do acampamento, n\u00e3o posso trazer visitantes, mas felizmente o senhor Goro abriu uma exce\u00e7\u00e3o e permitiu que voc\u00ea esperasse aqui devido \u00e0s circunst\u00e2ncias\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m not answering that!": u"N\u00e3o vou responder isso!",
        u"I\u2019m not doing well, and I push people around me away because I keep comparing them to you and everyone at Camp Buddy.": u"Eu n\u00e3o estou bem e acabo afastando as pessoas ao meu redor porque continuo comparando todas elas a voc\u00ea e a todo mundo do Camp Buddy.",
        u"I\u2019m not done talking.": u"Ainda n\u00e3o terminei de falar.",
        u"I\u2019m not exactly sure how helpful she\u2019s been, knowing how distracted she could get when she\u2019s around Aiden.": u"N\u00e3o sei exatamente o quanto ela foi \u00fatil, considerando como pode ficar distra\u00edda quando est\u00e1 perto de Aiden.",
        u"I\u2019m not familiar\u2026 Is that some kind of gentleman\u2019s club?": u"N\u00e3o conhe\u00e7o\u2026 \u00c9 algum tipo de clube masculino?",
        u"I\u2019m not giving up, Aiden\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o estou desistindo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not going to lie, I was feeling rather stressed out after dealing with issues one after another since we left the hotel.": u"N\u00e3o vou mentir, eu estava bastante estressado depois de lidar com um problema atr\u00e1s do outro desde que sa\u00edmos do hotel.",
        u"I\u2019m not in a hurry~": u"N\u00e3o estou com pressa~",
        u"I\u2019m not joking! What\u2019s wrong with you, Dar?!": u"N\u00e3o estou brincando! Qual \u00e9 o seu problema, Dar?!",
        u"I\u2019m not leaving. Not until I hear the truth from you.": u"N\u00e3o vou embora. N\u00e3o at\u00e9 ouvir a verdade de voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019m not really used to being somewhere as fancy as this\u2026": u"N\u00e3o estou muito acostumado a ficar em um lugar t\u00e3o chique assim\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not sure I remember right, but\u2026 I think she used to hang out with Yoshi a lot\u2026": u"N\u00e3o tenho certeza se lembro direito, mas\u2026 Acho que ela costumava passar muito tempo com Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not sure how Emilia will handle that when she wakes up\u2026": u"N\u00e3o sei como Emilia vai lidar com isso quando acordar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not sure how exactly I can help, but I\u2019m glad you\u2019re letting me see what you\u2019ve been working on with Mr. Clermont these past few weeks.": u"N\u00e3o sei exatamente como posso ajudar, mas fico feliz que me deixe conhecer o trabalho que tem realizado com o senhor Clermont nas \u00faltimas semanas.",
        u"I\u2019m not sure if I\u2019m even helping though\u2026 I\u2019m not as good of a cook as you are. ": u"Mas nem sei se realmente estou ajudando\u2026 N\u00e3o cozinho t\u00e3o bem quanto voc\u00ea. ",
        u"I\u2019m not sure if this is the alcohol talking but\u2026 C-Can I try them on\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 o \u00e1lcool falando, mas\u2026 P-Posso experimentar\u2026?",
        u"I\u2019m not sure if this is the alcohol talking but\u2026 C-Can you try them on\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 o \u00e1lcool falando, mas\u2026 V-Voc\u00ea pode experimentar\u2026?",
        u"I\u2019m not sure if this is the alcohol talking but\u2026 I want to see you as a leather daddy\u2026": u"N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 o \u00e1lcool falando, mas\u2026 quero ver voc\u00ea como um leather daddy\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not sure if this is the alcohol talking but\u2026 strap me up!": u"N\u00e3o sei se \u00e9 o \u00e1lcool falando, mas\u2026 coloque essas tiras em mim!",
        u"I\u2019m not sure, but Goro trusts us to handle things while he\u2019s away.": u"N\u00e3o sei, mas Goro confia em n\u00f3s para cuidar das coisas enquanto ele est\u00e1 fora.",
        u"I\u2019m not sure, but it\u2019s probably important, so we\u2019ll just have to handle it for now.": u"N\u00e3o sei, mas provavelmente \u00e9 importante, ent\u00e3o teremos que cuidar das coisas por enquanto.",
        u"I\u2019m not sure\u2026 And he\u2019s the only one who knows how to lead the project\u2026": u"N\u00e3o sei\u2026 E ele \u00e9 o \u00fanico que sabe como liderar o projeto\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not sure\u2026 Maybe we should wait for him before doing anything?": u"N\u00e3o sei\u2026 Talvez dev\u00eassemos esperar ele voltar antes de fazer qualquer coisa?",
        u"I\u2019m not trying to be callous here, and I\u2019m sure we all know, but Aiden has never really gotten to experience financial freedom.": u"N\u00e3o quero ser insens\u00edvel, e tenho certeza de que todos sabemos disso, mas Aiden nunca teve a oportunidade de experimentar verdadeira liberdade financeira.",
        u"I\u2019m not turning away from you, especially not to the promise we made back then\u2026": u"N\u00e3o estou virando as costas para voc\u00ea, muito menos para a promessa que fizemos naquela \u00e9poca\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not worth anything\u2026": u"Eu n\u00e3o valho nada\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m not! I never thought I\u2019d like pineapples on my pizza!": u"N\u00e3o estou! Nunca pensei que gostaria de abacaxi na pizza!",
        u"I\u2019m not. You\u2019re perfect for head pats.": u"N\u00e3o estou. Voc\u00ea tem a altura perfeita para receber cafun\u00e9.",
        u"I\u2019m off to check on the workers \u2013 see you boys later!": u"Vou verificar os trabalhadores \u2014 vejo voc\u00eas depois, rapazes!",
        u"I\u2019m off.  I\u2019ll be back next week.": u"Estou indo.  Volto na semana que vem.",
        u"I\u2019m okay with a three-way.": u"Por mim, pode ser a tr\u00eas.",
        u"I\u2019m on a vacation with my boss\u2026": u"Estou de f\u00e9rias com meu chefe\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m only telling things as they are. I can\u2019t let an opportunity to point out legitimate flaws pass.": u"S\u00f3 estou dizendo as coisas como elas s\u00e3o. N\u00e3o posso deixar passar uma oportunidade de apontar falhas leg\u00edtimas.",
        u"I\u2019m only trying to prove my point. Do I look upset to you?": u"S\u00f3 estou tentando provar meu ponto. Eu pare\u00e7o chateada para voc\u00ea?",
        u"I\u2019m only trying to see if she\u2019s been trash-talking any of us online! Just to make sure she\u2019s really on our side!": u"S\u00f3 estou tentando descobrir se ela anda falando mal de algum de n\u00f3s na internet! Apenas para ter certeza de que est\u00e1 mesmo do nosso lado!",
        u"I\u2019m out. I have dogs to feed.": u"T\u00f4 fora. Tenho cachorros para alimentar.",
        u"I\u2019m poor as dirt, I\u2019m not educated, I have no actual skills\u2026 I\u2019m nothing.": u"Sou pobre para caramba, n\u00e3o tenho estudo, n\u00e3o tenho nenhuma habilidade de verdade\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o sou nada.",
        u"I\u2019m pretty bummed too\u2026 This is the first time I really had friends as close as you guys\u2026": u"Tamb\u00e9m estou bem triste\u2026 \u00c9 a primeira vez que realmente tive amigos t\u00e3o pr\u00f3ximos quanto voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m pretty proud of what we\u2019ve accomplished considering we\u2019re a small group of people with humble beginnings. ": u"Tenho muito orgulho do que conquistamos, considerando que somos um pequeno grupo de pessoas de origem humilde. ",
        u"I\u2019m pretty sore too.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m estou bem dolorido.",
        u"I\u2019m pretty sure I got a double knockout.": u"Tenho quase certeza de que consegui um nocaute duplo.",
        u"I\u2019m pretty sure. I think you\u2019re underestimating yourself, lad.": u"Tenho certeza. Acho que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 subestimando seu pr\u00f3prio talento, rapaz.",
        u"I\u2019m pretty surprised to see you both here! A caf\u00e9 doesn\u2019t seem like your style. ": u"Estou bem surpresa de ver voc\u00eas dois aqui! Um caf\u00e9 n\u00e3o parece muito o estilo de voc\u00eas. ",
        u"I\u2019m pretty surprised to see you out of the office to begin with, Gramps. Thought you were swamped with Clermont mumbo-jumbo?": u"Para come\u00e7ar, estou bem surpreso de v\u00ea-lo fora do escrit\u00f3rio, Vov\u00f4. Pensei que estivesse atolado com aquela papelada toda do Clermont.",
        u"I\u2019m quite confused. What do you mean, Ms. Komarova?": u"Estou bastante confuso. O que quer dizer, Srta. Komarova?",
        u"I\u2019m ready for you, sir!": u"Estou pronto para o senhor!",
        u"I\u2019m ready to share our experiences with the next generation of scouts!": u"Estou pronto para compartilhar nossas experi\u00eancias com a pr\u00f3xima gera\u00e7\u00e3o de escoteiros!",
        u"I\u2019m really curious as to why\u2026 Maybe you two just got off on the wrong foot?": u"Tenho muita curiosidade para saber o motivo\u2026 Talvez voc\u00eas duas s\u00f3 tenham come\u00e7ado com o p\u00e9 esquerdo?",
        u"I\u2019m really embarrassed about it\u2026": u"Estou muito envergonhado com isso\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m really embarrassed to start that conversation. It\u2019s not like me to bring something up like that\u2026 Lloyd will be suspicious.": u"Tenho muita vergonha de come\u00e7ar essa conversa. N\u00e3o \u00e9 do meu feitio tocar num assunto assim\u2026 Lloyd vai desconfiar.",
        u"I\u2019m really glad I talked to you about it. Thanks for always believing in me, Yoshi!": u"Fico muito feliz de ter conversado com voc\u00ea sobre isso. Obrigado por sempre acreditar em mim, Yoshi!",
        u"I\u2019m really glad we were able to resolve things on a positive note, Emilia.": u"Fico muito feliz por termos conseguido resolver as coisas de forma positiva, Emilia.",
        u"I\u2019m really glad you all liked it! I wasn\u2019t sure if it\u2019s just because of the presentation or something.": u"Fico muito feliz que todos tenham gostado! N\u00e3o sabia se era s\u00f3 por causa da apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o ou algo assim.",
        u"I\u2019m really glad you decided to accept.": u"Fico muito feliz que tenha decidido aceitar.",
        u"I\u2019m really glad you stayed, Aiden\u2026": u"Estou muito feliz que voc\u00ea tenha ficado, Aiden\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m really grateful for all the things you guys and Camp Buddy have done for me.": u"Sou muito grato por tudo que voc\u00eas e o Camp Buddy fizeram por mim.",
        u"I\u2019m really humbled by your acknowledgement, Emilia\u2026 But please, save your tears\u2026 ": u"Fico realmente tocado por voc\u00ea reconhecer isso, Emilia\u2026 Mas, por favor, n\u00e3o precisa chorar\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m really looking forward to you all dominating me\u2026": u"Estou realmente ansioso para todos voc\u00eas me dominarem\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m really lucky to have you around, too, because you do all this cool stuff that I could never see myself doing in a million years!": u"Tamb\u00e9m tenho muita sorte de ter voc\u00ea por perto, porque voc\u00ea faz todas essas coisas incr\u00edveis que eu jamais me imaginaria fazendo nem em um milh\u00e3o de anos!",
        u"I\u2019m really proud of you, Aiden!": u"Estou muito orgulhoso de voc\u00ea, Aiden!",
        u"I\u2019m really sorry for going out without telling you. ": u"Sinto muito por ter sa\u00eddo sem avisar. ",
        u"I\u2019m really sorry for the way I lashed out, too\u2026": u"Tamb\u00e9m sinto muito pela forma como descontei tudo em voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m really sorry, Aiden, I wish I had more time. It\u2019s really just the distance that\u2019s been making things hard\u2026": u"Sinto muito, Aiden, queria ter mais tempo. \u00c9 realmente a dist\u00e2ncia que est\u00e1 tornando tudo t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m really sorry, Aiden\u2026 I promise I\u2019ll make it up to you\u2026 maybe you just need time to\u2014": u"Sinto muito, Aiden\u2026 Prometo que vou compensar\u2026 talvez voc\u00ea s\u00f3 precise de um tempo para\u2014",
        u"I\u2019m really worried about being away from you\u2026 especially since we just started dating\u2026": u"Estou muito preocupado em ficar longe de voc\u00ea\u2026 principalmente porque acabamos de come\u00e7ar a namorar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m reconsidering my decision\u2026": u"Estou reconsiderando minha decis\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m relieved you see it too, dear.": u"Fico aliviado que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m enxergue dessa forma, querida.",
        u"I\u2019m serious! To think I\u2019d be missing out on all of this if I had made a different choice.": u"Estou falando s\u00e9rio! Pensar que eu perderia tudo isso se tivesse feito uma escolha diferente.",
        u"I\u2019m serious.": u"Estou falando s\u00e9rio.",
        u"I\u2019m sick and tired of being fed commoner\u2019s grub every meal! I want my personal chef!": u"Estou farta de comer essa gororoba de plebeu em todas as refei\u00e7\u00f5es! Quero meu chef particular!",
        u"I\u2019m simply performing my duties as an official member of the maintenance department.": u"Estou apenas cumprindo minhas fun\u00e7\u00f5es como membro oficial do departamento de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I\u2019m sipping hot cocoa.": u"Estou tomando chocolate quente.",
        u"I\u2019m so ashamed of how I acted in front of everyone else\u2026 in front of you\u2026": u"Tenho tanta vergonha de como agi diante de todos\u2026 diante de voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m so glad he was able to move past all of that!": u"Fico muito feliz que ele tenha conseguido superar tudo aquilo!",
        u"I\u2019m so happy to finally be with you like this\u2026 I\u2019ve waited for so long\u2026": u"Estou t\u00e3o feliz por finalmente estar com voc\u00ea assim\u2026 Esperei tanto tempo\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m so happy to see you two bonding so well and owning up to your past actions like this!": u"Fico t\u00e3o feliz em ver voc\u00eas dois se dando t\u00e3o bem e assumindo seus erros do passado dessa maneira!",
        u"I\u2019m so sorry about that, Emilia. But don\u2019t get me wrong, I am actually glad to see you again! ": u"Sinto muito por isso, Emilia. Mas n\u00e3o me entenda mal, estou realmente feliz em rev\u00ea-la!",
        u"I\u2019m so sorry, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Sinto muito, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m so used to doing simple chores, and I really have no idea how to do the \u2018management\u2019 stuff.": u"Estou t\u00e3o acostumado a tarefas simples que n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia de como lidar com essa parte de \u2018administra\u00e7\u00e3o\u2019.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry I couldn\u2019t meet you a little earlier, Jin! The workers kept me busy all day long today!": u"Desculpe por n\u00e3o ter conseguido conhec\u00ea-lo mais cedo, Jin! Os trabalhadores me mantiveram ocupada o dia inteiro!",
        u"I\u2019m sorry I couldn\u2019t stay up while we were drinking last night, sir\u2026": u"Desculpe por n\u00e3o ter conseguido ficar acordado enquanto beb\u00edamos ontem \u00e0 noite, senhor\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sorry about that. Let me help you out. ": u"Pe\u00e7o desculpas por isso. Deixe-me ajud\u00e1-lo. ",
        u"I\u2019m sorry about that. Topics about his height trigger him.": u"Desculpe por isso. Assuntos relacionados \u00e0 altura o deixam irritado.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry again you had to see me like that\u2026": u"Sinto muito novamente por voc\u00ea ter me visto daquele jeito\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sorry for asking but\u2026 did you really think everything was that bad so far?": u"Desculpe perguntar, mas\u2026 voc\u00ea realmente achou que tudo estava t\u00e3o ruim at\u00e9 agora?",
        u"I\u2019m sorry if I\u2019m scary.": u"Desculpe se sou assustador.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry if it weirded you out.": u"Desculpe se isso pareceu estranho.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, I don\u2019t think we were informed about this\u2026": u"Desculpe, acho que n\u00e3o fomos informados sobre isso\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, Yuri\u2026 I really tried hard to convince him\u2026 ": u"Desculpe, Yuri\u2026 Eu realmente tentei muito convenc\u00ea-lo\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, but if anyone has been causing delays here, it\u2019s you.": u"Desculpe, mas se algu\u00e9m est\u00e1 causando atrasos aqui, \u00e9 voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, but you\u2019re not in charge here, Sir Goro is.": u"Desculpe, mas voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 no comando aqui. O Sr. Goro est\u00e1.",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, but\u2026 Is\u2026 this what you really wanted to talk about\u2026?": u"Desculpe, mas\u2026 Era\u2026 sobre isso que voc\u00ea realmente queria conversar\u2026?",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, sir. I also thought a woodcutting badge would be cool\u2026": u"Desculpe, senhor. Eu tamb\u00e9m achei que um distintivo de corte de lenha seria legal\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sorry, what\u2026? ": u"Desculpa, o qu\u00ea\u2026? ",
        u"I\u2019m sorry\u2026": u"Desculpa\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sorry\u2026 I tried to hide it since it was inappropriate behavior\u2026": u"Desculpe\u2026 Tentei esconder porque seria um comportamento inadequado\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m starting to feel like everyone\u2019s really got their own thing to work on\u2026 while I just oversee everything but don\u2019t actually get involved much\u2026": u"Estou come\u00e7ando a sentir que todos realmente t\u00eam suas pr\u00f3prias coisas para fazer\u2026 enquanto eu apenas supervisiono tudo, sem me envolver muito\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m starting to regret this decision\u2026": u"Estou come\u00e7ando a me arrepender desta decis\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m starting to rethink my decision about staying here\u2026": u"Estou come\u00e7ando a reconsiderar minha decis\u00e3o de ficar aqui\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m staying here with you, sir\u2026": u"Vou ficar aqui com o senhor\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m staying here with you.": u"Eu vou ficar aqui com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019m still excited either way!": u"Ainda estou animada de qualquer jeito!",
        u"I\u2019m still in contact with him at the very least, I\u2019ll make sure he\u2019s okay and try to change his mind.": u"Pelo menos ainda estou em contato com ele. Vou me certificar de que esteja bem e tentar faz\u00ea-lo mudar de ideia.",
        u"I\u2019m still your superior now, and here we are. We just need to find ways, don\u2019t you think?": u"Ainda sou seu superior agora, e aqui estamos. S\u00f3 precisamos encontrar oportunidades, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"I\u2019m supposed to be the reindeer, but you\u2019re the one whose nose is turning red! Hahaha!": u"Eu que deveria ser a rena, mas \u00e9 o seu nariz que est\u00e1 ficando vermelho! Hahaha!",
        u"I\u2019m sure Aiden doesn\u2019t mind them! It\u2019s what he likes doing after all!": u"Tenho certeza de que Aiden n\u00e3o se importa! Afinal, \u00e9 o que ele gosta de fazer!",
        u"I\u2019m sure Dad can make something really tasty out of what you guys gathered!": u"Tenho certeza de que o papai consegue preparar algo bem gostoso com o que voc\u00eas coletaram!",
        u"I\u2019m sure I can find a way to tell her as professionally as possible. What\u2019s more important to me right now is taking the opportunity to help you.": u"Tenho certeza de que encontrarei uma maneira profissional de explicar. O mais importante para mim agora \u00e9 aproveitar a oportunidade de ajudar voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019m sure I can help you with your situation, if you\u2019d just let me\u2026": u"Tenho certeza de que posso ajudar com sua situa\u00e7\u00e3o, se voc\u00ea simplesmente deixar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sure I seasoned this one just right! You\u2019ll see!": u"Tenho certeza de que temperei este perfeitamente! Voc\u00ea ver\u00e1!",
        u"I\u2019m sure I\u2019ve told you before how Dad and I don\u2019t really have much outside of Camp Buddy.": u"Tenho certeza de que j\u00e1 contei que meu pai e eu n\u00e3o temos muita coisa fora do Camp Buddy.",
        u"I\u2019m sure Mr. Clermont will understand if we explain\u2026": u"Tenho certeza de que o Sr. Clermont vai entender se explicarmos\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sure a lot of them will come back! And if not, that\u2019s okay too!": u"Tenho certeza de que muitos voltar\u00e3o! E, se n\u00e3o voltarem, tudo bem tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"I\u2019m sure chances to experience high-class meals are once in a blue moon for you, so why not try something new for once to elevate yours and everyone\u2019s taste level?": u"Tenho certeza de que oportunidades de experimentar refei\u00e7\u00f5es de alto n\u00edvel s\u00e3o rar\u00edssimas para voc\u00ea, ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o experimentar algo novo para elevar o seu paladar e o de todos?",
        u"I\u2019m sure everyone here will do their best to stay in touch.": u"Tenho certeza de que todos aqui far\u00e3o o poss\u00edvel para manter contato.",
        u"I\u2019m sure for you! Come on, let\u2019s go swim!": u"Eu decido por voc\u00ea! Vamos, vamos nadar!",
        u"I\u2019m sure he\u2019d be so proud of you right now\u2026!": u"Tenho certeza de que ele estaria muito orgulhoso de voc\u00ea agora\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019m sure he\u2019ll want to report about the site condition once he finds out at least.": u"Tenho certeza de que ele vai querer informar sobre a situa\u00e7\u00e3o do canteiro assim que descobrir.",
        u"I\u2019m sure if we all approach this with a positive attitude, we\u2019ll achieve our collective goal. That\u2019s what we all want, isn\u2019t it?": u"Tenho certeza de que, com uma atitude positiva, alcan\u00e7aremos nosso objetivo coletivo. \u00c9 isso que todos queremos, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"I\u2019m sure if you stop and look around as well, you can find something worth fighting for too.": u"Tenho certeza de que, se parar e olhar ao seu redor, tamb\u00e9m encontrar\u00e1 algo pelo qual vale a pena lutar.",
        u"I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll all be worth in the end, sir!": u"Tenho certeza de que tudo vai valer a pena no final, senhor!",
        u"I\u2019m sure that could be negotiated! ": u"Tenho certeza de que isso poderia ser negociado! ",
        u"I\u2019m sure trips like these needed a lot of planning and preparation to make sure everything goes perfectly!": u"Tenho certeza de que viagens como esta exigem muito planejamento e prepara\u00e7\u00e3o para garantir que tudo corra perfeitamente!",
        u"I\u2019m sure we all played a role in this, but it won\u2019t help Emilia, or any of us for that matter, if we keep focusing on what went wrong.": u"Tenho certeza de que todos tivemos algum papel nisso, mas n\u00e3o vai ajudar a Emilia nem nenhum de n\u00f3s se continuarmos focados no que deu errado.",
        u"I\u2019m sure with Aiden taking care of her, she\u2019ll get well in no time.": u"Tenho certeza de que, com o Aiden cuidando dela, vai melhorar rapidinho.",
        u"I\u2019m sure with guys of your caliber, a lot of the staff would be happy to volunteer to have some fun.": u"Tenho certeza de que, com homens do calibre de voc\u00eas, muitos funcion\u00e1rios ficariam felizes em se oferecer para a divers\u00e3o.",
        u"I\u2019m sure without you, Camp Buddy wouldn\u2019t be nearly as successful, and the rest of us wouldn\u2019t be so passionate about it!": u"Tenho certeza de que, sem voc\u00ea, o Camp Buddy n\u00e3o teria tanto sucesso, e o restante de n\u00f3s n\u00e3o seria t\u00e3o apaixonado por este lugar!",
        u"I\u2019m sure you all know Aiden\u2019s not really used to being around all this luxury, so it made him feel a little out of place.": u"Tenho certeza de que todos sabem que o Aiden n\u00e3o est\u00e1 acostumado com todo esse luxo, ent\u00e3o ele acabou se sentindo um pouco deslocado.",
        u"I\u2019m sure you can agree that changes are inevitable. Refusing to adapt will eventually doom this camp.": u"Tenho certeza de que concorda que as mudan\u00e7as s\u00e3o inevit\u00e1veis. Recusar-se a adaptar acabar\u00e1 condenando este acampamento.",
        u"I\u2019m sure you can imagine how difficult that must\u2019ve been to handle on his own\u2026": u"Tenho certeza de que consegue imaginar como deve ter sido dif\u00edcil enfrentar isso sozinho\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m sure you remember back then how I had nothing too\u2026 ": u"Tenho certeza de que se lembra de como eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o tinha nada naquela \u00e9poca\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019m sure you said yes, right? We could be co-workers! I mean\u2026 have the same boss at least, haha!": u"Tenho certeza de que aceitou, certo? Poder\u00edamos ser colegas de trabalho! Quer dizer\u2026 pelo menos ter o mesmo chefe, haha!",
        u"I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll ace it.": u"Tenho certeza de que voc\u00ea vai arrasar.",
        u"I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll be able to relax there.": u"Tenho certeza de que conseguir\u00e1 relaxar l\u00e1.",
        u"I\u2019m sure you\u2019re still in perfect shape, sir!": u"Tenho certeza de que o senhor ainda est\u00e1 em perfeita forma!",
        u"I\u2019m surprised Darius isn\u2019t with you.": u"Estou surpreso que Darius n\u00e3o esteja com voc\u00ea.",
        u"I\u2019m surprised Mr. Clermont hasn\u2019t left yet. ": u"Estou surpreso que o Sr. Clermont ainda n\u00e3o tenha ido embora. ",
        u"I\u2019m surprised that the other staff are okay with this.": u"Estou surpreso que o resto da equipe aceite isso numa boa.",
        u"I\u2019m surprised to see you here, Jin. Are you helping with the repairs?": u"Estou surpreso de ver voc\u00ea aqui, Jin. Est\u00e1 ajudando nos reparos?",
        u"I\u2019m surprised we were able to drag Jin into it. I never pegged him as someone who\u2019d be interested in fitness.": u"Estou surpreso que conseguimos arrastar o Jin para isso. Nunca imaginei que ele se interessaria por exerc\u00edcios.",
        u"I\u2019m surprised you let everyone drink again, Yuri\u2026 Even the scouts\u2026": u"Estou surpreso que tenha deixado todo mundo beber de novo, Yuri\u2026 At\u00e9 os escoteiros\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m surprised you of all people are saying this, Yoshi.": u"Estou surpresa que justamente voc\u00ea esteja dizendo isso, Yoshi.",
        u"I\u2019m surprised you of all people are saying this, Yoshi. I was sure you\u2019d \u2018give her the benefit of the doubt\u2019 again.": u"Estou surpresa que justamente voc\u00ea esteja dizendo isso, Yoshi. Tinha certeza de que voc\u00ea iria \u2018dar a ela o benef\u00edcio da d\u00favida\u2019 de novo.",
        u"I\u2019m surprised you two even agreed to go out and do chores together\u2026": u"Estou surpreso que voc\u00eas duas tenham concordado em sair para fazer tarefas juntas\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m surprised you were able to drag Jin into it. I never pegged him as someone who\u2019d be interested in fitness.": u"Estou surpreso que tenham conseguido arrastar o Jin para isso. Nunca imaginei que ele se interessaria por exerc\u00edcios.",
        u"I\u2019m talking about your attitude and tone. Tell me that\u2019s not being disruptive.": u"Estou falando da sua atitude e do seu tom. Diga que isso n\u00e3o est\u00e1 atrapalhando.",
        u"I\u2019m telling the truth! She really\u2014": u"Eu estou falando a verdade! Ela realmente\u2014",
        u"I\u2019m the closest they\u2019ve got since I know a thing or two about electrical work. But boy, let me tell you, it\u2019s not the same at all, not one bit!": u"Eu sou o mais pr\u00f3ximo disso que eles t\u00eam, pois entendo uma coisinha ou outra de eletricidade. Mas, cara, vou dizer: n\u00e3o \u00e9 a mesma coisa, nem um pouco!",
        u"I\u2019m the lucky one.": u"Eu \u00e9 que tenho sorte.",
        u"I\u2019m the one spoiling the mood?! Preposterous!": u"Eu \u00e9 que estou estragando o clima?! Absurdo!",
        u"I\u2019m the one who brought it up. I apologize.": u"Fui eu quem tocou no assunto. Pe\u00e7o desculpas.",
        u"I\u2019m the one who should be thanking you! You\u2019ve all been so hospitable these last two days!": u"Eu \u00e9 que deveria agradecer! Todos voc\u00eas foram muito hospitaleiros nestes \u00faltimos dois dias!",
        u"I\u2019m the one who should be thanking you! You\u2019ve all been so hospitable to me!": u"Eu \u00e9 que deveria agradecer! Todos voc\u00eas foram muito hospitaleiros comigo!",
        u"I\u2019m tired, quite frankly\u2026 but I had to finish this report of everyone\u2019s work today for Sir Goro.": u"Sinceramente, estou cansado\u2026 mas precisava terminar este relat\u00f3rio para o Senhor Goro sobre o trabalho de todos hoje.",
        u"I\u2019m totally alright, Yoshi\u2026!": u"Estou totalmente bem, Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"I\u2019m trying my best to show you all that I can work just as hard and that this is much more than a job to me.": u"Estou fazendo o poss\u00edvel para mostrar a todos que posso trabalhar t\u00e3o duro quanto voc\u00eas e que isto representa muito mais do que um emprego para mim.",
        u"I\u2019m trying to earn my cooking badge today, and I could use another person to try out the food I made!": u"Estou tentando conquistar o distintivo de culin\u00e1ria hoje, e seria bom ter outra pessoa para provar a comida que fiz!",
        u"I\u2019m trying to think of ways to really show how much I\u2019m willing to change\u2026": u"Estou tentando pensar em maneiras de realmente mostrar o quanto estou disposta a mudar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m turning it down.": u"Eu vou recusar.",
        u"I\u2019m usually the one who gets drunk first after all\u2026": u"Afinal, normalmente sou eu quem fica b\u00eabado primeiro\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m very grateful for all the amazing things that happened and the lessons I\u2019ve learned along the way, but I\u2019m more than satisfied with what we\u2019ve achieved\u2026": u"Sou muito grato por todas as coisas incr\u00edveis que aconteceram e pelas li\u00e7\u00f5es que aprendi ao longo do caminho, mas estou mais do que satisfeito com o que conquistamos\u2026",
        u"I\u2019m waiting for the entertainment later! I heard it\u2019s gonna be a blast!": u"Estou esperando o show mais tarde! Ouvi dizer que vai ser incr\u00edvel!",
        u"I\u2019m well aware of the severity of the error I made, which is why I need to be terminated from my position so that I don\u2019t negatively affect the project further.": u"Tenho plena consci\u00eancia da gravidade do erro que cometi, por isso preciso ser afastada do cargo para n\u00e3o prejudicar ainda mais o projeto.",
        u"I\u2019m worried about you more than everyone else.": u"Estou mais preocupado com voc\u00ea do que com todo mundo.",
        u"I\u2019m your father and I\u2019m the one you\u2019re supposed to rely on\u2026": u"Eu sou seu pai e deveria ser eu a pessoa em quem voc\u00ea pode confiar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve actually talked about it with her on multiple occasions too\u2026": u"Na verdade, j\u00e1 conversei sobre isso com ela v\u00e1rias vezes\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve already beaten you once.": u"Eu j\u00e1 venci voc\u00ea uma vez.",
        u"I\u2019ve already called Mr. Clermont and he\u2019s aware of our situation.": u"J\u00e1 liguei para o Sr. Clermont e ele est\u00e1 ciente da nossa situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I\u2019ve already given him his costume too! I can\u2019t wait to see him in it~": u"J\u00e1 dei a fantasia dele tamb\u00e9m! Mal posso esperar para v\u00ea-lo usando~",
        u"I\u2019ve already got it covered \u2013 I signed on with a contractor who will provide us a team of professionals with the best expertise to handle the work.": u"J\u00e1 cuidei disso: contratei uma empreiteira que fornecer\u00e1 uma equipe de profissionais altamente qualificados para realizar o trabalho.",
        u"I\u2019ve already looked up all her socials before. If only we had more information about her we could use\u2026": u"J\u00e1 pesquisei todas as redes sociais dela antes. Se ao menos tiv\u00e9ssemos mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es sobre ela para usar\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve already reviewed who the people around me are without actually talking to them. ": u"J\u00e1 pesquisei quem s\u00e3o as pessoas ao meu redor sem precisar falar com elas.",
        u"I\u2019ve already talked to Mr. Clermont, and he\u2019s arranged the accommodations for us.": u"J\u00e1 falei com o Sr. Clermont, e ele providenciou nossa hospedagem.",
        u"I\u2019ve always anchored myself to you, and it\u2019s about time I find my direction.": u"Sempre me apoiei em voc\u00ea como minha \u00e2ncora, e j\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de eu encontrar minha pr\u00f3pria dire\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"I\u2019ve always believed that we\u2019re in this together, Goro\u2026 We\u2019re partners, aren\u2019t we?": u"Sempre acreditei que estamos juntos nisso, Goro\u2026 Somos parceiros, n\u00e3o somos?",
        u"I\u2019ve always endured whatever life throws at me, and for some goddamn reason, I\u2019m getting in my own way this time.": u"Sempre aguentei tudo que a vida jogou em cima de mim e, por algum maldito motivo, desta vez sou eu mesmo que estou me atrapalhando.",
        u"I\u2019ve always known how much I don\u2019t deserve you\u2026 ": u"Sempre soube o quanto n\u00e3o mere\u00e7o voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019ve always looked at them but never tried it myself. ": u"Sempre admirei cosplays, mas nunca tentei fazer um. ",
        u"I\u2019ve always loved you, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu sempre amei voc\u00ea, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve always loved you, sir\u2026": u"Eu sempre amei o senhor\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve always wanted to experience a top tier five-star dinner! I wonder if there\u2019s gonna be some entertainment like a gala or a ball!": u"Sempre quis experimentar um jantar cinco estrelas de primeira! Ser\u00e1 que vai ter algum entretenimento, tipo uma gala ou um baile?!",
        u"I\u2019ve always wanted to take you out on a dinner like this, Yoshinori.": u"Sempre quis levar voc\u00ea para um jantar assim, Yoshinori.",
        u"I\u2019ve assigned different tasks for each group, and everyone needs to finish before sunset!": u"Designei tarefas diferentes para cada grupo, e todos precisam terminar antes do p\u00f4r do sol!",
        u"I\u2019ve been alone my entire life and it\u2019s mostly because I simply don\u2019t know how to interact with people\u2026 ": u"Passei a vida inteira sozinho, principalmente porque simplesmente n\u00e3o sei como interagir com as pessoas\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019ve been called that a couple of times, but I try to take it as a compliment.": u"J\u00e1 me chamaram assim algumas vezes, mas tento considerar um elogio.",
        u"I\u2019ve been holding on to this place for so long, sacrificing myself for the camp and everyone else this whole time, but never really pursued my own happiness\u2026": u"H\u00e1 tanto tempo venho me agarrando a este lugar, sacrificando-me pelo acampamento e por todos os outros, mas nunca busquei de verdade a minha pr\u00f3pria felicidade\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve been looking far ahead into the future instead of cherishing what\u2019s right in front of me \u2013 my family at Camp Buddy.": u"Tenho olhado longe demais para o futuro em vez de valorizar o que est\u00e1 bem diante de mim: a minha fam\u00edlia no Camp Buddy.",
        u"I\u2019ve been sacrificing myself for the camp and everyone else this whole time, but never really pursued my own happiness\u2026 ": u"Passei todo esse tempo me sacrificando pelo acampamento e por todos os outros, mas nunca busquei de verdade a minha pr\u00f3pria felicidade\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2019ve been showing you how but you keep ignoring me! Seriously, you have the attention span of a goldfish!": u"Estou mostrando como fazer, mas voc\u00ea continua me ignorando! S\u00e9rio, sua capacidade de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a de um peixe-dourado!",
        u"I\u2019ve been speaking with the rest of the staff and gathering their thoughts on the matter.": u"Conversei com o restante da equipe e reuni as opini\u00f5es deles sobre o assunto.",
        u"I\u2019ve been swamped with management tasks and missing out on what\u2019s actually going on in each department.": u"Tenho estado sobrecarregado com tarefas administrativas e perdido o que realmente acontece em cada setor.",
        u"I\u2019ve been telling these guys to livestream our game sessions!": u"Venho dizendo para esses caras transmitirem nossas sess\u00f5es de jogo ao vivo!",
        u"I\u2019ve been trying so hard to work on myself since this season began\u2026": u"Tenho me esfor\u00e7ado tanto para melhorar desde que esta temporada come\u00e7ou\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve been trying to be as useful as I can ever since this project started, and sometimes it just gets overwhelming, is all!": u"Desde o in\u00edcio do projeto, tento ser o mais \u00fatil poss\u00edvel, e \u00e0s vezes tudo fica um pouco demais, s\u00f3 isso!",
        u"I\u2019ve been waiting all my life, and when I got a taste of it\u2026 not even for a year\u2026 you let me go.": u"Esperei a vida inteira e, quando finalmente pude viver isso\u2026 nem por um ano inteiro\u2026 voc\u00ea me deixou ir.",
        u"I\u2019ve been wanting to get my hands on you all morning\u2026": u"Estou querendo colocar minhas m\u00e3os em voc\u00ea a manh\u00e3 inteira\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve been with him long enough to know he\u2019s the kind of person who always perseveres no matter what\u2026": u"Conhe\u00e7o ele h\u00e1 tempo suficiente para saber que \u00e9 o tipo de pessoa que sempre persevera, aconte\u00e7a o que acontecer\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve got more to give, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Ainda tenho mais para dar, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve got to hand it to you, Mr. Sirius! These new buildings are looking really cool so far! ": u"Tenho que admitir, Sr. Sirius! Esses novos pr\u00e9dios est\u00e3o ficando muito legais! ",
        u"I\u2019ve got to meet his expectations if I\u2019m going to run this place one day.": u"Tenho que corresponder \u00e0s expectativas dele se vou administrar este lugar um dia.",
        u"I\u2019ve gotten so used to having people around me just come and go, and I always found it easier to not deal with anyone but myself.": u"Fiquei t\u00e3o acostumado a ver as pessoas ao meu redor simplesmente irem e virem que sempre achei mais f\u00e1cil n\u00e3o lidar com ningu\u00e9m al\u00e9m de mim mesmo.",
        u"I\u2019ve gotten used to being surrounded by trees and staying in wooden cabins all the time.": u"Acostumei-me a estar sempre cercado de \u00e1rvores e ficar em cabanas de madeira.",
        u"I\u2019ve grown quite fond of this place, after all.  And I\u2019m even adjusting to a simpler life!": u"Afinal, acabei me apegando bastante a este lugar.  E estou at\u00e9 me adaptando a uma vida mais simples!",
        u"I\u2019ve had enough of your talking! It\u2019s mine and Dynamite\u2019s turn!": u"J\u00e1 chega dessa conversa! \u00c9 a minha vez e a do Dinamite!",
        u"I\u2019ve had these feelings for so long\u2026 And I\u2019m ready for them to be set in stone...": u"Carrego esses sentimentos h\u00e1 tanto tempo\u2026 E estou pronto para torn\u00e1-los permanentes\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve heard enough.": u"J\u00e1 ouvi o bastante.",
        u"I\u2019ve heard there\u2019s plenty of new stuff being developed for the next term! It makes me excited to come back next summer!": u"Ouvi dizer que est\u00e3o preparando muitas novidades para a pr\u00f3xima temporada! Isso me deixa animado para voltar no pr\u00f3ximo ver\u00e3o!",
        u"I\u2019ve known you long enough to know that it must\u2019ve upset you though, Aiden.": u"Conhe\u00e7o voc\u00ea h\u00e1 tempo suficiente para saber que aquilo deve ter mexido com voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"I\u2019ve never been in a hotel as extravagant as this. I can only imagine how much Mr. Clermont spent on this trip\u2026": u"Nunca estive em um hotel t\u00e3o extravagante assim. S\u00f3 consigo imaginar quanto o Sr. Clermont gastou nesta viagem\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve never had anyone as close as that before, so\u2026 I really just wanna give off the same energy.": u"Nunca tive algu\u00e9m t\u00e3o pr\u00f3ximo assim antes, ent\u00e3o\u2026 Quero muito retribuir da mesma forma.",
        u"I\u2019ve never really had the luxury to pick or choose my own path, so I\u2019ve gotten used to a simple life.": u"Nunca tive o luxo de escolher meu pr\u00f3prio caminho, ent\u00e3o me acostumei a uma vida simples.",
        u"I\u2019ve never seen this much snow here before.": u"Nunca vi tanta neve aqui antes.",
        u"I\u2019ve never thought of you that way\u2026! Not even once!": u"Eu nunca pensei em voc\u00ea desse jeito\u2026! Nem uma \u00fanica vez!",
        u"I\u2019ve noticed that this schedule is similar to our previous one but now includes extensive work over the winter season.": u"Notei que este cronograma \u00e9 semelhante ao anterior, por\u00e9m agora inclui um longo per\u00edodo de trabalho durante o inverno.",
        u"I\u2019ve only been trying to participate the conversation and you all shut me down at every chance.": u"S\u00f3 estou tentando participar da conversa, e voc\u00eas me cortam em toda oportunidade.",
        u"I\u2019ve read a few books about tarot in the past as well, but it seems to have surged in popularity recently.": u"Tamb\u00e9m li alguns livros sobre tar\u00f4 no passado, mas parece que ele ficou muito mais popular recentemente.",
        u"I\u2019ve said it before, but you\u2019ll do a fine job leading this place one day.": u"J\u00e1 disse isso antes, mas um dia voc\u00ea far\u00e1 um \u00f3timo trabalho liderando este lugar.",
        u"I\u2019ve seen how hard you work not only for the camp, but for your family too\u2026 All while keeping a smile on your face!": u"Eu vi o quanto o senhor se esfor\u00e7a n\u00e3o s\u00f3 pelo acampamento, mas tamb\u00e9m pela sua fam\u00edlia\u2026 Tudo isso mantendo um sorriso no rosto!",
        u"I\u2019ve spent enough time detached from him and the rest of the camp, so hopefully I can earn his trust and respect too.": u"Passei tempo demais distante dele e do resto do acampamento, ent\u00e3o espero tamb\u00e9m conquistar a confian\u00e7a e o respeito dele.",
        u"I\u2019ve spent my whole life giving up everything until there was nothing left to give.": u"Passei a vida inteira abrindo m\u00e3o de tudo at\u00e9 n\u00e3o restar mais nada para dar.",
        u"I\u2019ve spent too much time behind a desk recently, and I\u2019m eager to stretch my muscles.": u"Tenho passado tempo demais atr\u00e1s de uma mesa ultimamente e estou ansioso para exercitar os m\u00fasculos.",
        u"I\u2019ve taken special lessons on fine dining etiquette from a young age, after all~": u"Afinal, tive aulas especiais de etiqueta \u00e0 mesa desde muito jovem~",
        u"I\u2019ve thought about it for a long time, Yoshi\u2026 I think we should just be friends\u2026 at least for now\u2026": u"Pensei muito nisso, Yoshi\u2026 Acho que dever\u00edamos ser apenas amigos\u2026 pelo menos por enquanto\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve tried a few times, but they all ended up in disappointment\u2026 The real world can be cruel and heartless sometimes\u2026": u"J\u00e1 tentei algumas vezes, mas todas terminaram em decep\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 O mundo real \u00e0s vezes pode ser cruel e insens\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve used up all my chances and now I\u2019m being given another one\u2026 I don\u2019t know if I can trust myself to not make another mistake\u2026": u"J\u00e1 esgotei todas as minhas chances e agora est\u00e3o me dando outra\u2026 N\u00e3o sei se posso confiar em mim mesma para n\u00e3o cometer outro erro\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve witnessed the camp change in ways I never wished for\u2026 from the scoutmasters losing their passion to the scouts becoming uninterested and unruly\u2026": u"Vi o acampamento mudar de formas que nunca desejei\u2026 desde os chefes escoteiros perdendo a paix\u00e3o at\u00e9 os escoteiros ficando desinteressados e indisciplinados\u2026",
        u"I\u2019ve written down a full report for you on their plans, and you can see it on your desk when you get the chance!": u"Preparei um relat\u00f3rio completo sobre os planos deles, e o senhor poder\u00e1 encontr\u00e1-lo em sua mesa quando tiver a oportunidade!",
        u"I\u2026": u"Eu\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I can\u2019t believe that Emilia would do something like this\u2026 ": u"Eu\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o acredito que a Emilia faria algo assim\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2026 I do.": u"E-Eu jogo.",
        u"I\u2026 I don\u2019t want to be here anymore, Yoshi\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o quero mais ficar aqui, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I feel bad, I really don\u2019t know what to get\u2026 even with the descriptions listed\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 me sinto mal, realmente n\u00e3o sei o que pedir\u2026 mesmo com as descri\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I guess it\u2019s just unusual for me to see you making jokes again, sir. It\u2019s been so long since I\u2019ve seen you this cheerful.": u"Eu\u2026 Acho apenas estranho v\u00ea-lo fazendo piadas de novo, senhor. Faz tanto tempo que n\u00e3o o vejo t\u00e3o alegre.",
        u"I\u2026 I guess that\u2019s another thing that I learned here \u2013 how to make friends.": u"Eu\u2026 Acho que essa \u00e9 outra coisa que aprendi aqui \u2014 como fazer amigos.",
        u"I\u2026 I remember\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu me lembro\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m already content\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu j\u00e1 estou satisfeito\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m fine.": u"Eu\u2026 Estou bem.",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m just as shocked as you guys\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Estou t\u00e3o chocado quanto voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m not sure about this, Emilia\u2026 ": u"Eu\u2026 N\u00e3o tenho certeza disso, Emilia\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m really sorry about the whole thing\u2026 ": u"Eu\u2026 Eu sinto muito por tudo aquilo\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m really sorry\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu sinto muito\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019m sorry, Emilia\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu sinto muito, Emilia\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 I\u2019ve had enough\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 Eu j\u00e1 tive o bastante\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 Uhh\u2026 No\u2014": u"Eu\u2026 Hum\u2026 N\u00e3o\u2014",
        u"I\u2026 Uhh\u2026 Yeah?": u"Eu\u2026 Uhh\u2026 Gostei?",
        u"I\u2026 Well\u2014": u"Eu\u2026 Bem\u2014",
        u"I\u2026 am lost for words\u2026 I certainly wasn\u2019t expecting this from you, Ms. Komarova.": u"Eu\u2026 estou sem palavras\u2026 Certamente n\u00e3o esperava isso da senhora, Srta. Komarova.",
        u"I\u2026 can\u2019t believe it. It\u2019s been so long, I barely recognized you!": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o consigo acreditar. Faz tanto tempo que mal reconheci voc\u00ea!",
        u"I\u2026 can\u2019t believe she called us background characters\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o acredito que ela nos chamou de personagens secund\u00e1rios\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 can\u2019t even remember exactly how things went down yesterday\u2026 ": u"Eu\u2026 nem consigo me lembrar exatamente de como as coisas aconteceram ontem\u2026 ",
        u"I\u2026 didn\u2019t expect that she would be going this far to be honest. I wasn\u2019t informed that our inspector would also be getting involved in management\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 sinceramente n\u00e3o esperava que ela fosse t\u00e3o longe. N\u00e3o fui informado de que nossa inspetora tamb\u00e9m se envolveria na administra\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 didn\u2019t know you had to go through all that, Goro\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea tinha passado por tudo isso, Goro\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 didn\u2019t mean it like that, Emilia\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o quis dizer dessa forma, Emilia\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 didn\u2019t realize that, sir.": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o tinha percebido isso, senhor.",
        u"I\u2026 didn\u2019t want to be alone again\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o queria ficar sozinho de novo\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 don\u2019t think Aiden\u2019s personal habits ever caused us trouble before. Are you sure you\u2019re just not looking too much into it?": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o acho que os h\u00e1bitos pessoais de Aiden j\u00e1 tenham nos causado problemas. Tem certeza de que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 exagerando?",
        u"I\u2026 don\u2019t think I\u2019ll come back to the job, dear.": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o acho que voltarei ao trabalho, querida.",
        u"I\u2026 don\u2019t think we should be gossiping about her like this\u2026 It might just make things worse.": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o acho que devamos fofocar sobre ela assim\u2026 Isso pode apenas piorar as coisas.",
        u"I\u2026 don\u2019t want to be alone again\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o quero ficar sozinho de novo\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 might think about it. ": u"Eu\u2026 posso pensar nisso. ",
        u"I\u2026 played the game that comic is based on\u2026 and I\u2019m a big, no\u2026 HUGE fan!": u"Eu\u2026 joguei o jogo no qual esse quadrinho se baseia\u2026 e sou um grande, n\u00e3o\u2026 ENORME f\u00e3!",
        u"I\u2026 really need to leave. I don\u2019t belong here\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 realmente preciso ir embora. Eu n\u00e3o perten\u00e7o a este lugar\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 really want you to be here, and to hear that you can\u2019t come\u2026 it\u2019s really disappointing\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 queria muito que voc\u00ea estivesse aqui, e ouvir que n\u00e3o pode vir\u2026 \u00e9 realmente decepcionante\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 see.": u"E\u2026 entendo.",
        u"I\u2026 think the way I talked to her last night is what really pushed her over the edge\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 acho que a forma como falei com ela ontem \u00e0 noite foi o que realmente a levou ao limite\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 tried to look back\u2026 to find something worth fighting for.": u"Eu\u2026 tentei olhar para tr\u00e1s\u2026 para encontrar algo pelo qual valesse a pena lutar.",
        u"I\u2026 understand.": u"Eu\u2026 entendo.",
        u"I\u2026 want to help alleviate some of his workload so he can focus more on what he\u2019s really passionate about, cooking.": u"Eu\u2026 quero ajudar a diminuir a carga de trabalho dele para que possa se concentrar mais no que realmente ama: cozinhar.",
        u"I\u2026 want to make a choice for myself once and for all. I\u2019m tired of going with the flow\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 quero tomar uma decis\u00e3o por mim mesmo de uma vez por todas. Estou cansado de apenas seguir o fluxo\u2026",
        u"I\u2026 want to make a choice for myself once and for all\u2026 I\u2019m tired of going with the flow\u2026": u"Eu\u2026 quero tomar uma decis\u00e3o por mim mesmo de uma vez por todas\u2026 Estou cansado de apenas seguir o fluxo\u2026",
        u"J-Jin! That was supposed to be our secret!": u"J-Jin! Isso era para ser nosso segredo!",
        u"J-Just an apron, you mean\u2026!": u"S-S\u00f3 um avental, voc\u00ea quer dizer\u2026!",
        u"J-Just don\u2019t teach him all your habits, alright?": u"S-S\u00f3 n\u00e3o ensine todos os seus h\u00e1bitos para ele, certo?",
        u"J-Just help me up already\u2026!": u"S-S\u00f3 me ajude a levantar logo\u2026!",
        u"JIN! MY, MAN~! ": u"JIN! MEU PARCEIRO~! ",
        u"JSKAJDKWQAK WHAT?! ": u"JSKAJDKWQAK O QU\u00ca?! ",
        u"JUST LEAVE ME ALONE ALREADY!!! ": u"S\u00d3 ME DEIXE EM PAZ DE UMA VEZ!!! ",
        u"Jack him off.": u"Masturb\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Jeez, where was this Emilia back at the hotel?": u"Caramba, onde estava essa Emilia l\u00e1 no hotel?",
        u"Jeez, you still talk to yourself this much? I thought you were over that habit!": u"Nossa, voc\u00ea ainda fala tanto sozinho? Pensei que j\u00e1 tivesse perdido esse h\u00e1bito!",
        u"Jin already has a good-looking face to begin with. This just shows his full potential.": u"Jin j\u00e1 tem um rosto bonito naturalmente. Isto s\u00f3 mostra todo o potencial dele.",
        u"Jin and I already decided we\u2019ll have a nice BL-reading session on the whole ride~!": u"Eu e Jin j\u00e1 decidimos que vamos fazer uma bela sess\u00e3o de leitura de BL durante toda a viagem~!",
        u"Jin and I have this little website project where we\u2019re transcribing Yuri\u2019s journal and restoring the photos for a blog! ": u"Jin e eu temos um pequeno projeto de site no qual transcrevemos o di\u00e1rio de Yuri e restauramos as fotos para um blog! ",
        u"Jin has quite a few more upgrades he\u2019s working on as well, but I was relieved to see that none of them would disrupt the spirit of the camp.": u"Jin tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 trabalhando em v\u00e1rias outras melhorias, mas fiquei aliviado ao ver que nenhuma delas prejudicaria o esp\u00edrito do acampamento.",
        u"Jin here is like me, he prefers the outdoors! A place this fancy can feel too stuffy for our liking.": u"O Jin \u00e9 como eu, ele prefere ficar ao ar livre! Um lugar chique assim pode parecer sufocante demais para gente como n\u00f3s.",
        u"Jin here was just catching me up on what we missed!": u"Jin estava justamente me contando o que perdemos!",
        u"Jin here was up all night!": u"Jin passou a noite inteira acordado!",
        u"Jin was also able to finish the website and all the necessary tech integrations for the camp! ": u"Jin tamb\u00e9m conseguiu terminar o site e todas as integra\u00e7\u00f5es tecnol\u00f3gicas necess\u00e1rias para o acampamento! ",
        u"Jin! Come over here, lemme check out your costume!": u"Jin! Venha aqui, deixe eu ver sua fantasia!",
        u"Jin, I have appointed Yoshinori here as your guide while you conduct an inspection of the camp. ": u"Jin, designei Yoshinori para ser seu guia enquanto voc\u00ea realiza uma inspe\u00e7\u00e3o no acampamento. ",
        u"Jin, is your nose bleeding again\u2026?": u"Jin, seu nariz est\u00e1 sangrando de novo\u2026?",
        u"Jin, this is Yoichi and Taiga. They\u2019re scouts here, but they stayed on as full-time volunteers.": u"Jin, estes s\u00e3o Yoichi e Taiga. Eles s\u00e3o escoteiros daqui, mas permaneceram como volunt\u00e1rios em tempo integral.",
        u"Jin, this is Yuri, one of my fellow scoutmasters. She is also Sir Goro\u2019s daughter.": u"Jin, esta \u00e9 Yuri, uma das chefes escoteiras que trabalham comigo. Ela tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 filha do Senhor Goro.",
        u"Jin? What are you doing back in the room already?": u"Jin? O que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 fazendo de volta no quarto?",
        u"Jin? You\u2019re not trying to work before the vacation, are you?": u"Jin? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 tentando trabalhar antes das f\u00e9rias, est\u00e1?",
        u"Jin\u2019s over at the mess hall having some coffee, and Gramps is in his office with Mr. Clermont.": u"O Jin est\u00e1 no refeit\u00f3rio tomando caf\u00e9, e o Vov\u00f4 est\u00e1 no escrit\u00f3rio com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Jin\u2019s right. We can\u2019t let her disrespect the staff anymore than she has already.": u"Jin tem raz\u00e3o. N\u00e3o podemos deixar que ela desrespeite os funcion\u00e1rios ainda mais do que j\u00e1 fez.",
