        u"Look at the entrance, Yoshinori.": u"Olhe para a entrada, Yoshinori.",
        u"Look at you Mr. \\\u201cI\u2019m-not-good-at-conversations\\\u201d~": u"Olha s\u00f3 voc\u00ea, Sr. \\\u201cEu-n\u00e3o-sou-bom-de-conversa\\\u201d~",
        u"Look at you, you're as red as a tomato! You\u2019re still that same dorky scout, hahaha!": u"Olhe s\u00f3 para voc\u00ea, vermelho como um tomate! Ainda \u00e9 o mesmo escoteiro bobinho, hahaha!",
        u"Look how cute! Everyone matches the theme now!": u"Olhem que fofos! Agora todo mundo combina com o tema!",
        u"Look how you\u2019re really taking charge tonight, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Olha s\u00f3 como voc\u00ea est\u00e1 realmente assumindo o controle esta noite, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Look no more! I have the perfect thing right here!": u"N\u00e3o precisa procurar mais! Tenho a coisa perfeita bem aqui!",
        u"Look no more, the Dar-Lloyd Builder Duo is here to save the day!": u"N\u00e3o procurem mais: a Dupla de Construtores Dar-Lloyd chegou para salvar o dia!",
        u"Look out the window, we\u2019ve got a really pretty view of the city at night. ": u"Olhe pela janela, temos uma vista muito bonita da cidade \u00e0 noite. ",
        u"Look who you\u2019re talking to.": u"Olha quem est\u00e1 falando.",
        u"Look, I know criticism isn\u2019t easy to take in, but someone has to point these things out.": u"Sei que n\u00e3o \u00e9 f\u00e1cil receber cr\u00edticas, mas algu\u00e9m precisa apontar essas coisas.",
        u"Look, I know you want to help around the camp, Yoshinori. But this is not a job for a scout.": u"Olhe, sei que quer ajudar pelo acampamento, Yoshinori. Mas este n\u00e3o \u00e9 um trabalho para um escoteiro.",
        u"Look, I know you\u2019re getting frustrated today with all the talk about the offer especially when you\u2019re still thinking about it, but\u2026": u"Olha, sei que hoje voc\u00ea est\u00e1 ficando frustrado com toda essa conversa sobre a oferta, principalmente porque ainda est\u00e1 pensando nela, mas\u2026",
        u"Look, I know you\u2019re getting frustrated today with all the talk about the offer especially when you\u2019re still thinking about it, but\u2026{fast}": u"Olha, sei que hoje voc\u00ea est\u00e1 ficando frustrado com toda essa conversa sobre a oferta, principalmente porque ainda est\u00e1 pensando nela, mas\u2026{fast}",
        u"Look, I\u2019m not in the mood for more preaching if that\u2019s what you\u2019re here for.": u"Olha, n\u00e3o estou com disposi\u00e7\u00e3o para mais serm\u00e3o se foi para isso que veio.",
        u"Look, Yoshinori\u2026 My rod looks like it needs to be disciplined. ": u"Olhe, Yoshinori\u2026 Parece que meu bast\u00e3o precisa ser disciplinado. ",
        u"Look, what I\u2019m saying is, there\u2019s a way we can solve what you\u2019re worried about and achieve your dreams at the same time! A middle ground.": u"Olha, o que estou dizendo \u00e9 que existe uma maneira de resolver o que est\u00e1 preocupando voc\u00ea e, ao mesmo tempo, realizar seus sonhos! Um meio-termo.",
        u"Looking at it all cleared like this makes me realize how much larger Camp Buddy\u2019s property is.": u"Ver tudo limpo assim me faz perceber como a propriedade do Camp Buddy \u00e9 grande.",
        u"Looking at it further, she\u2019s apparently notorious for disruptive behavior getting her blacklisted by the places she\u2019s worked in before\u2026": u"Pesquisando mais, aparentemente ela \u00e9 conhecida pelo comportamento problem\u00e1tico, chegando a entrar na lista negra dos lugares onde trabalhou antes\u2026",
        u"Looking at the crowd, I can easily tell who\u2019s only here for a good time.": u"Olhando para o p\u00fablico, consigo dizer facilmente quem veio apenas em busca de divers\u00e3o.",
        u"Looking at the menu, I might order some exotic black coffee. Maybe you could pick a snack we can share?": u"Olhando o card\u00e1pio, acho que vou pedir um caf\u00e9 preto ex\u00f3tico. Talvez voc\u00ea possa escolher um lanche para dividirmos?",
        u"Looking at the menu, I might order some exotic black coffee. Maybe you could pick a snack we can share?{fast}": u"Olhando o card\u00e1pio, acho que vou pedir um caf\u00e9 preto ex\u00f3tico. Talvez voc\u00ea possa escolher um lanche para dividirmos?{fast}",
        u"Looking at the original scope of the project, I\u2019ve noticed that some of the offered technology integration was declined?": u"Ao analisar o escopo original, notei que parte da integra\u00e7\u00e3o tecnol\u00f3gica oferecida foi recusada.",
        u"Looking back, I really thought everything would go the way I imagined as long as I kept doing things the 'proper\u2019 way.": u"Olhando para tr\u00e1s, eu realmente achava que tudo sairia como imaginava desde que continuasse fazendo as coisas do jeito \u2018certo\u2019.",
        u"Looks good on you, though~ Since when did you become interested in\u2014 ": u"Mas ficou bonito em voc\u00ea~ Desde quando come\u00e7ou a se interessar por\u2014",
        u"Looks like Emilia didn\u2019t take it well, huh?": u"Parece que Emilia n\u00e3o reagiu bem, hein?",
        u"Looks like I lose again! Here goes the pants!": u"Parece que perdi de novo! L\u00e1 v\u00e3o as cal\u00e7as!",
        u"Looks like I might have to put you on the naughty list after all.": u"Parece que vou ter que colocar voc\u00ea na lista dos malcriados, afinal.",
        u"Looks like I\u2019ll be needing a massage down there too, huh?": u"Parece que tamb\u00e9m vou precisar de uma massagem l\u00e1 embaixo, hein?",
        u"Looks like I\u2019m only a tiny piece away from baring it all~ You got what it takes, Yoshi?": u"Parece que falta s\u00f3 uma pecinha para eu mostrar tudo~ Voc\u00ea d\u00e1 conta, Yoshi?",
        u"Looks like Ms. Emilia really said some upsetting things back there, huh?": u"Parece que a Srta. Emilia disse coisas bem desagrad\u00e1veis l\u00e1, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Looks like Yuri\u2019s with him too. Let\u2019s go see what they\u2019re up to!": u"Parece que a Yuri tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 com ele. Vamos ver o que est\u00e3o fazendo!",
        u"Looks like Yuri\u2019s with him too. Let\u2019s see what they\u2019re up to!": u"Parece que a Yuri tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 com ele. Vamos ver o que est\u00e3o fazendo!",
        u"Looks like everyone\u2019s divided into groups and working hard already!": u"Parece que todos j\u00e1 se dividiram em grupos e est\u00e3o trabalhando duro!",
        u"Looks like everyone\u2019s having their breakfast. I still can\u2019t get used to seeing this place so lively outside of the summer. ": u"Parece que todos est\u00e3o tomando caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3. Ainda n\u00e3o consigo me acostumar a ver este lugar t\u00e3o animado fora do ver\u00e3o. ",
        u"Looks like she\u2019s harassing that waiter too\u2026": u"Parece que ela tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 atormentando aquele gar\u00e7om\u2026",
        u"Looks like someone woke up on the wrong side of the bed today, hahaha!": u"Parece que algu\u00e9m acordou com o p\u00e9 esquerdo hoje, hahaha!",
        u"Looks like the alcohol\u2019s certainly doing the trick, huh\u2026?": u"Parece que o \u00e1lcool est\u00e1 mesmo fazendo efeito, hein\u2026?",
        u"Looks like the cleanup outside is done, the sky\u2019s clear and I can see shuttles arriving, \u2013 we can finally go home.": u"Parece que a limpeza l\u00e1 fora terminou, o c\u00e9u est\u00e1 limpo e consigo ver os \u00f4nibus chegando \u2014 finalmente podemos voltar para casa.",
        u"Looks like there\u2019s a commotion over there, too.": u"Parece que tamb\u00e9m tem uma confus\u00e3o acontecendo ali.",
        u"Looks like time has taken its toll on us, huh, sir?": u"Parece que o tempo cobrou seu pre\u00e7o de n\u00f3s, n\u00e3o \u00e9, senhor?",
        u"Looks like we don\u2019t have to worry about firewood for the winter. I even think these might last us till next year.": u"Parece que n\u00e3o precisaremos nos preocupar com lenha para o inverno. Acho at\u00e9 que isso pode durar at\u00e9 o ano que vem.",
        u"Looks like we have a new breakout star over here~!": u"Parece que temos uma nova estrela revela\u00e7\u00e3o por aqui~!",
        u"Looks like we weren\u2019t the only couple around here, huh?": u"Parece que n\u00e3o \u00e9ramos o \u00fanico casal por aqui, hein?",
        u"Looks like we\u2019re back to the grind again, huh?": u"Parece que voltamos \u00e0 rotina de trabalho, hein?",
        u"Looks like we\u2019re in for a great year!": u"Parece que teremos um excelente ano!",
        u"Looks like we\u2019re invested now, Yoshinori.": u"Parece que agora estamos envolvidos nisso, Yoshinori.",
        u"Looks like we\u2019re late for the party, huh?": u"Parece que chegamos atrasados para a festa, hein?",
        u"Looks like we\u2019ve got some unfinished business.": u"Parece que ainda temos assuntos inacabados.",
        u"Looks like you found my stash of biking gear, huh?": u"Parece que encontrou meu estoque de equipamentos de motoqueiro, hein?",
        u"Looks like you guys are doing repairs as planned, and since we have some free time, we thought we\u2019d come help!": u"Parece que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o fazendo os reparos como planejado e, como temos um tempo livre, pensamos em vir ajudar!",
        u"Looks like you guys are working out too, huh?": u"Parece que voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m v\u00e3o treinar, hein?",
        u"Looks like you have quite the hangover, huh? You really didn\u2019t hold back on those drinks\u2026": u"Parece que est\u00e1 com uma baita ressaca, hein? Voc\u00ea realmente n\u00e3o se conteve com aqueles drinques\u2026",
        u"Looks like you\u2019re quite the early bird, Yoshinori! The assembly is still an hour from now!": u"Parece que voc\u00ea acorda bem cedo, Yoshinori! Ainda falta uma hora para a reuni\u00e3o!",
        u"Looks like you\u2019ve put Hiro to work here, Aiden. Shouldn\u2019t he be out partying with his friends?": u"Parece que colocou Hiro para trabalhar aqui, Aiden. Ele n\u00e3o deveria estar l\u00e1 fora festejando com os amigos?",
        u"Look\u2026 I know how important it is to you to be independent and tough\u2026 As a leader, I bear that responsibility as well.": u"Olhe\u2026 Sei o quanto \u00e9 importante para voc\u00ea ser independente e forte\u2026 Como l\u00edder, tamb\u00e9m carrego essa responsabilidade.",
        u"Love you too.": u"Tamb\u00e9m te amo.",
        u"Lovely weather we\u2019re having today, aren\u2019t we?": u"O tempo est\u00e1 ador\u00e1vel hoje, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"Luckily for me, that\u2019s usually the same category of food the scouts love, so I have a menu that I prepped before that we can use!": u"Para minha sorte, esse costuma ser o tipo de comida que os escoteiros adoram, ent\u00e3o tenho um card\u00e1pio que preparei antes e podemos usar!",
        u"Luckily we had our suits provided for us. We blend right in.": u"Ainda bem que providenciaram nossos trajes. N\u00f3s nos encaixamos perfeitamente.",
        u"Luckily, I came prepared! I assumed the worst and that the camp didn\u2019t have a working PC, so I have a pre-built one for you guys in one of my suitcases here!": u"Por sorte, vim preparado! Presumi o pior, que o acampamento n\u00e3o teria um computador funcionando, ent\u00e3o trouxe um semimontado para voc\u00eas em uma destas malas!",
        u"Luckily, I\u2019m in such a good mood today, so I don\u2019t mind offering some suggestions~": u"Por sorte, estou de \u00f3timo humor hoje, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o me importo de dar algumas sugest\u00f5es~",
        u"Luckily, the workers aren\u2019t scheduled to return for a few more days too.": u"Felizmente, os trabalhadores s\u00f3 devem voltar daqui a alguns dias.",
        u"Lunchtime, everyone! I made a nice pot of chili, some corn muffins, and a warm pudding for dessert!": u"Hora do almo\u00e7o, pessoal! Fiz uma bela panela de chili, muffins de milho e um pudim quentinho de sobremesa!",
        u"M-Maybe Aiden can join us too\u2026?": u"T-Talvez Aiden possa participar tamb\u00e9m\u2026?",
        u"M-Maybe I could help you out with the chores, Dad?": u"T-Talvez eu pudesse ajud\u00e1-lo com as tarefas, pai?",
        u"M-Maybe a tiger\u2026?": u"T-Talvez um tigre\u2026?",
        u"M-Maybe it\u2019s a little undercooked\u2026 I bit into some raw dough underneath.": u"T-Talvez esteja um pouco crua\u2026 Mordi um pouco de massa crua por baixo.",
        u"M-Maybe let\u2019s just order something else\u2026": u"T-Talvez dev\u00eassemos pedir outra coisa\u2026",
        u"M-Maybe next time\u2026": u"T-Talvez da pr\u00f3xima vez\u2026",
        u"M-Maybe we should go before we give him another nosebleed.": u"T-Talvez dev\u00eassemos ir antes de causarmos outro sangramento nasal nele.",
        u"M-Maybe we should\u2019ve gotten changed first before chilling out here.": u"T-Talvez dev\u00eassemos ter trocado de roupa antes de vir relaxar aqui.",
        u"M-Me too, Aiden\u2026!!": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m, Aiden\u2026!!",
        u"M-Me too, Goro\u2026 ": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m, Goro\u2026 ",
        u"M-Me too, Goro\u2026 And I want more\u2026": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m, Goro\u2026 E quero mais\u2026",
        u"M-Me too\u2026!": u"E-Eu tamb\u00e9m\u2026!",
        u"M-More like hot actually\u2026": u"N-Na verdade, estou mais para excitado\u2026",
        u"M-Mr. Clermont\u2026?!": u"S-Sr. Clermont\u2026?!",
        u"M-My camera\u2026!!": u"M-Minha c\u00e2mera\u2026!!",
        u"MAKE WAY! MAKE WAY! The queen of the night has arrived! ": u"ABRAM CAMINHO! ABRAM CAMINHO! A rainha da noite chegou! ",
        u"MY EYES!! MY EEEEYES!!": u"MEUS OLHOS!! MEUS OLHOOOOOS!!",
        u"Maaaan, you guys are so lucky.": u"Caaara, voc\u00eas t\u00eam muita sorte.",
        u"Make sure she takes these and refrains from sleeping pills for now.": u"Certifiquem-se de que ela tome estes medicamentos e evite comprimidos para dormir por enquanto.",
        u"Make sure to savor the taste when you swallow, alright~?": u"N\u00e3o deixe de saborear quando engolir, est\u00e1 bem~?",
        u"Make sure to use this time to have some snacks and hydrate. ": u"Aproveitem este tempo para comer um lanche e se hidratar. ",
        u"Make the daily report.": u"Fazer o relat\u00f3rio di\u00e1rio.",
        u"Makes me curious about their story.": u"Isso me deixa curioso sobre a hist\u00f3ria deles.",
        u"Makes me wish we had our own setup back at camp. We mostly stay in shape with only body workouts and a couple of weights.": u"At\u00e9 d\u00e1 vontade de termos nossa pr\u00f3pria academia no acampamento. L\u00e1 nos mantemos em forma principalmente com exerc\u00edcios de peso corporal e alguns pesos.",
        u"Making that decision gave me some real closure.": u"Tomar essa decis\u00e3o realmente me trouxe uma sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de encerramento.",
        u"Man, I was hoping we coulda waited \u2019til we got back to camp to talk about this drama\u2026  ": u"Cara, eu esperava que pud\u00e9ssemos esperar at\u00e9 voltar ao acampamento para falar desse drama\u2026  ",
        u"Man, talk about being extra\u2026 am I right?": u"Cara, isso que \u00e9 exagero\u2026 n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Man, you were doing all these cool things, and I was learning how to knit patches when I was that age\u2026 I feel so lame all of a sudden.": u"Cara, voc\u00ea fazia todas essas coisas legais, enquanto eu aprendia a bordar emblemas quando tinha essa idade\u2026 De repente me sinto t\u00e3o sem gra\u00e7a.",
        u"Man\u2026 This vacation caused all sorts of drama, didn\u2019t it? Hahaha!": u"Cara\u2026 Estas f\u00e9rias causaram todo tipo de confus\u00e3o, n\u00e3o foi? Hahaha!",
        u"Matches my getup, anyways.": u"Combina com minha roupa, de qualquer forma.",
        u"May I ask why you\u2019re requesting this?": u"Posso perguntar por que est\u00e1 fazendo esse pedido?",
        u"May I remind you that as the inspector and as a representative of Clermont Inc., that while your job is to critique and point out flaws, you should do so in a more supportive manner.": u"Permita-me lembr\u00e1-la de que, como inspetora e representante da Clermont Inc., embora seu trabalho seja avaliar e apontar falhas, deve faz\u00ea-lo de uma forma mais construtiva.",
        u"Maybe I could use it for a divination!": u"Talvez eu pudesse us\u00e1-la para uma adivinha\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Maybe I should check just to make sure she doesn\u2019t.": u"Talvez eu devesse verificar, s\u00f3 para garantir que n\u00e3o cause.",
        u"Maybe I should go and see if I can help Aiden with his tasks.": u"Talvez eu devesse ver se posso ajudar Aiden com as tarefas dele.",
        u"Maybe I should try to reach out and help\u2026": u"Talvez eu devesse tentar falar com ele e ajudar\u2026",
        u"Maybe I should\u2019ve taken Aiden\u2019s offer for a fitness routine so I could be more useful\u2026": u"Talvez eu devesse ter aceitado a oferta de Aiden para fazer uma rotina de exerc\u00edcios e ser mais \u00fatil\u2026",
        u"Maybe I\u2019m just tired and I\u2019m hearing everything wrong\u2026. ": u"Talvez eu s\u00f3 esteja cansado e esteja entendendo tudo errado\u2026. ",
        u"Maybe a dip back in the bath will help.": u"Talvez voltar para o banho ajude.",
        u"Maybe all of you shouldn\u2019t have been so rude, then none of this would\u2019ve happened!": u"Talvez voc\u00eas n\u00e3o devessem ter sido t\u00e3o grosseiros, ent\u00e3o nada disso teria acontecido!",
        u"Maybe even fight over it.": u"Talvez at\u00e9 brigassem por isso.",
        u"Maybe he started working in the office\u2026?": u"Talvez ele j\u00e1 tenha come\u00e7ado a trabalhar no escrit\u00f3rio\u2026?",
        u"Maybe he thinks I\u2019m not ready for it\u2026": u"Talvez ele ache que ainda n\u00e3o estou pronto\u2026",
        u"Maybe if you wipe that blank look and smile more you\u2019d be less intimidating?": u"Talvez se tirasse essa express\u00e3o vazia e sorrisse mais, pareceria menos intimidador?",
        u"Maybe it\u2019d be nice to relax a little bit, so how about we try the spa?": u"Talvez fosse bom relaxar um pouco, ent\u00e3o que tal experimentarmos o spa?",
        u"Maybe it\u2019ll be something like you see on Food TV Shows!": u"Talvez seja algo como o que aparece nos programas de culin\u00e1ria da TV!",
        u"Maybe it\u2019s a bad idea if Yuri and Jin stay with you guys\u2026? They\u2019ll pass out way too often\u2026": u"Talvez seja uma m\u00e1 ideia Yuri e Jin ficarem com voc\u00eas\u2026? Eles v\u00e3o desmaiar vezes demais\u2026",
        u"Maybe it\u2019s a lot more like a club than a casual pub\u2026": u"Talvez pare\u00e7a muito mais uma boate do que um pub casual\u2026",
        u"Maybe it\u2019s adorable to YOU.": u"Talvez seja ador\u00e1vel PARA VOC\u00ca.",
        u"Maybe it\u2019s her family\u2019s business or something?": u"Talvez seja o ramo da fam\u00edlia dela ou algo assim?",
        u"Maybe one day I\u2019ll be able to get it back though, if he still has it.": u"Mas talvez um dia eu consiga peg\u00e1-la de volta, se ele ainda estiver com ela.",
        u"Maybe one day you can get the bike back\u2026 and take me on a ride!": u"Talvez um dia voc\u00ea possa recuperar a moto\u2026 e me levar para dar uma volta!",
        u"Maybe one day, I\u2019ll be able to lift you too, sir.": u"Talvez um dia eu consiga levantar o senhor tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Maybe people will think twice before making fun of Lloyd\u2019s bowtie.": u"Talvez as pessoas pensem duas vezes antes de tirar sarro da gravata-borboleta do Lloyd.",
        u"Maybe she doesn\u2019t want to show her face after being exposed as a liar.": u"Talvez ela n\u00e3o queira aparecer depois de ter sido desmascarada como mentirosa.",
        u"Maybe she faked it all too\u2026?": u"Talvez tenha falsificado tudo isso tamb\u00e9m\u2026?",
        u"Maybe she used her connections\u2026? You know how wealthy pricks can be, Dad\u2026": u"Talvez ela tenha usado seus contatos\u2026? Voc\u00ea sabe como esses ricos babacas podem ser, pai\u2026",
        u"Maybe she\u2019s the kind that mellows out as you hang out with her more.": u"Talvez ela seja do tipo que fica mais tranquila \u00e0 medida que convivemos.",
        u"Maybe so, but Jin won\u2019t mind, will you~?": u"Talvez, mas Jin n\u00e3o vai se importar, vai~?",
        u"Maybe some fresh fish\u2019ll lighten his mood too!": u"Talvez um peixe fresco tamb\u00e9m melhore o humor dele!",
        u"Maybe something a little more outdoorsy and natural would have suited you better.": u"Talvez algo mais ao ar livre e pr\u00f3ximo da natureza combinasse mais com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Maybe that makes it a little bit clearer for Aiden.": u"Talvez isso deixe as coisas um pouco mais claras para Aiden.",
        u"Maybe that makes things a little bit clearer for you, Aiden?": u"Talvez isso deixe as coisas um pouco mais claras para voc\u00ea, Aiden?",
        u"Maybe that meeting yesterday was a reality check for her.": u"Talvez a reuni\u00e3o de ontem tenha sido um choque de realidade para ela.",
        u"Maybe the bartender was right, I\u2019d be great as an entertainer here\u2026! Hahaha!": u"Talvez o bartender tivesse raz\u00e3o, eu seria \u00f3timo como artista daqui\u2026! Hahaha!",
        u"Maybe then the scouts would call me Buttcheeks too, huh?": u"Talvez os escoteiros tamb\u00e9m me chamassem de Bunda, hein?",
        u"Maybe there\u2019s still some left in the kitchen.": u"Talvez ainda tenha algumas na cozinha.",
        u"Maybe they already headed to work\u2026?": u"Talvez eles j\u00e1 tenham ido trabalhar\u2026?",
        u"Maybe they forgot\u2026? Or maybe they\u2019re still asleep.": u"Talvez tenham esquecido\u2026? Ou talvez ainda estejam dormindo.",
        u"Maybe they just like the way Gramps smells.": u"Talvez eles simplesmente gostem do cheiro do Vov\u00f4.",
        u"Maybe they\u2019re already waiting for us downstairs\u2026? ": u"Talvez j\u00e1 estejam esperando por n\u00f3s l\u00e1 embaixo\u2026? ",
        u"Maybe this getaway Mr. Clermont offered us is the perfect way to get rid of the tension and loosen up some.": u"Talvez essa viagem que o Sr. Clermont nos ofereceu seja a maneira perfeita de aliviar a tens\u00e3o e relaxar um pouco.",
        u"Maybe this is for the best\u2026": u"Talvez seja melhor assim\u2026",
        u"Maybe this wouldn\u2019t have happened if I\u2019d just worked with Emilia from the start\u2026 ": u"Talvez nada disso tivesse acontecido se eu simplesmente tivesse trabalhado com Emilia desde o come\u00e7o\u2026 ",
        u"Maybe try the\u2026 uhh\u2026 korma?": u"Talvez o\u2026 h\u00e3\u2026 korma?",
        u"Maybe we can go back to the lobby?": u"Talvez possamos voltar ao sagu\u00e3o?",
