        u"More importantly, he completed all his deadlines with time to spare. I would know, because I also watched over the progress of his department.": u"Mais importante, ele cumpriu todos os prazos com tempo de sobra. Eu sei disso porque tamb\u00e9m acompanhei o progresso do departamento dele.",
