        u"More like you\u2019ll be patting Lloyd with your other \u201chead\u201d at that height~! Hahaha!": u"Com essa altura, \u00e9 mais prov\u00e1vel que voc\u00ea acaricie Lloyd com a sua outra \u201ccabe\u00e7a\u201d~! Hahaha!",
