        u"My goodness, did we not just have a conversation about table manners? Stop talking when your mouth is full.": u"Meu Deus, n\u00f3s n\u00e3o acabamos de conversar sobre boas maneiras \u00e0 mesa? Pare de falar de boca cheia.",
        u"My goodness\u2026 You? Overwhelmed with work? That doesn\u2019t sound like you at all.": u"Minha nossa\u2026 Voc\u00ea? Sobrecarregado de trabalho? Isso n\u00e3o combina nada com voc\u00ea.",
