        u"No wonder my butt was so sore when I woke up! I thought I was just having a wet dream, hahaha!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 \u00e0 toa que minha bunda estava t\u00e3o dolorida quando acordei! Pensei que s\u00f3 tivesse tido um sonho molhado, hahaha!",
        u"No wonder you were always so nice to her. But then, you\u2019re always nice to everyone.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 de se admirar que voc\u00ea sempre tenha sido t\u00e3o gentil com ela. Mas, pensando bem, voc\u00ea \u00e9 gentil com todo mundo.",
        u"No! I\u2019m just saying...! Don\u2019t make such a big deal outta it! ": u"N\u00e3o! S\u00f3 estou dizendo\u2026! N\u00e3o fa\u00e7a tanto caso disso! ",
        u"No, Aiden. Just gently unfold it without shaking it out and place it on your lap.": u"N\u00e3o, Aiden. Apenas abra-o delicadamente, sem sacudir, e coloque-o no colo.",
        u"No, Aiden. You don\u2019t have to apologize\u2026": u"N\u00e3o, Aiden. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa se desculpar\u2026",
        u"No, I want to talk to you in private. It\u2019s an urgent matter.": u"N\u00e3o, quero falar com voc\u00ea em particular. \u00c9 urgente.",
        u"No, I was there cleaning up with Aiden and Emilia earlier. He told me he last saw Dad in here\u2026": u"N\u00e3o, eu estava l\u00e1 limpando com Aiden e Emilia mais cedo. Ele disse que viu o Pai aqui pela \u00faltima vez\u2026",
        u"No, I\u2019m only watching over you. Yuri\u2019s been the one nursing you all day\u2026  She just went out to fetch your medicine.": u"N\u00e3o, estou apenas vigiando voc\u00ea. Yuri \u00e9 quem cuidou de voc\u00ea o dia inteiro\u2026  Ela acabou de sair para buscar seus rem\u00e9dios.",
        u"No, YOU had me cumming!": u"N\u00e3o, VOC\u00ca me fez gozar!",
