        u"No, it\u2019s alright\u2026 ": u"N\u00e3o, tudo bem\u2026",
        u"No, it\u2019s not, Lloyd. It\u2019s vegetables.": u"N\u00e3o, Lloyd. S\u00e3o legumes.",
