        u"No, it\u2019s very real. And well-drawn too.": u"N\u00e3o, \u00e9 algo bem real. E est\u00e1 bem desenhado tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"No, no! It\u2019ll be fine! Those meetings take HOURS anyways! He won\u2019t even know you\u2019re gone! Just say yes already!!": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o! Ficar\u00e1 tudo bem! Essas reuni\u00f5es demoram HORAS! Ele nem saber\u00e1 que voc\u00ea saiu! Diga logo que sim!!",
        u"No, no, it\u2019s actually charming, bro~!": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o, na verdade \u00e9 encantador, cara~!",
        u"No, no, it\u2019s fine, Yoshi. You know we\u2019re always here to listen and help you with whatever\u2019s going through your head!": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o, tudo bem, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea sabe que estamos sempre aqui para ouvi-lo e ajudar com o que estiver passando pela sua cabe\u00e7a!",
        u"No, no, no\u2026 You can\u2019t be serious! Why would he turn down something we\u2019ve all been working so hard for?!": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o, n\u00e3o\u2026 N\u00e3o pode ser s\u00e9rio! Por que ele recusaria algo pelo qual todos n\u00f3s trabalhamos tanto?!",
        u"No, no, we just need to work together and be Mr. Nomoru\u2019s advisors \u2013 to ensure we provide more 'modern' insights about how this camp and project should be run.": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o. S\u00f3 precisamos trabalhar juntos e ser conselheiros do Sr. Nomoru, garantindo ideias mais \u2018modernas\u2019 sobre como administrar o acampamento e o projeto.",
        u"No, no. Let\u2019s talk about it, since she\u2019s questioning my abilities.": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00e3o. Vamos falar disso, j\u00e1 que ela est\u00e1 questionando minhas capacidades.",
        u"No, not at all, Yoshinori.": u"N\u00e3o, de maneira alguma, Yoshinori.",
        u"No, not at all. Why would you ask that? ": u"N\u00e3o, de modo algum. Por que pergunta? ",
        u"No, sir\u2026": u"N\u00e3o, senhor\u2026",
        u"No, sir\u2026 There\u2019s nothing you need to apologize for\u2026": u"N\u00e3o, senhor\u2026 N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada pelo que precise se desculpar\u2026",
        u"No, sir\u2026 What I meant was, it\u2019s more unbelievable to me how different you\u2019ve become since then.": u"N\u00e3o, senhor\u2026 O que quis dizer \u00e9 que acho ainda mais inacredit\u00e1vel o quanto o senhor mudou desde aquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"No, thank you! Like they say, beauty is pain~": u"N\u00e3o, obrigada! Como dizem, beleza d\u00f3i~",
        u"No, thank you, sir! If you didn\u2019t build Camp Buddy, we wouldn\u2019t have the greatest summer ever! ": u"N\u00e3o, n\u00f3s \u00e9 que agradecemos, senhor! Se n\u00e3o tivesse criado o Camp Buddy, n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos o melhor ver\u00e3o de todos! ",
        u"No, thank youuuuuu~~": u"N\u00e3o, obrigadaaaaa~~",
        u"No, unfortunately. But luckily, I\u2019ve been able to handle everything so far!": u"N\u00e3o, infelizmente. Mas, por sorte, consegui cuidar de tudo at\u00e9 agora!",
        u"No, unfortunately. Waiting that long and letting these damages endure the cold would only make it worse. ": u"N\u00e3o, infelizmente. Esperar tanto e deixar esses danos expostos ao frio s\u00f3 pioraria a situa\u00e7\u00e3o. ",
        u"No, we\u2019re good. ": u"N\u00e3o, estamos bem. ",
        u"No, yeah, we\u2019re good\u2026! Just a little squabble, is all\u2026!": u"N\u00e3o, sim, est\u00e1 tudo bem\u2026! Foi s\u00f3 uma pequena discuss\u00e3o\u2026!",
