        u"Nobody\u2019s paying attention to us anyway! And if they were, they\u2019d be into it too!": u"Ningu\u00e9m est\u00e1 prestando aten\u00e7\u00e3o em n\u00f3s! E, se estivessem, tamb\u00e9m ficariam excitados!",
        u"None of the amazing experiences and memories would\u2019ve been possible if it weren\u2019t for you.": u"Nenhuma dessas experi\u00eancias e lembran\u00e7as incr\u00edveis teria sido poss\u00edvel sem o senhor.",
        u"None of the fans are running \u2013 I\u2019m shocked it even boots up at all\u2026! ": u"Nenhuma das ventoinhas est\u00e1 funcionando \u2014 estou surpreso que ele sequer consiga iniciar\u2026! ",
        u"None of us know the whole story but I can understand a little why she acts like that\u2026": u"Nenhum de n\u00f3s conhece a hist\u00f3ria toda, mas consigo entender um pouco por que ela age assim\u2026",
        u"None of us were with Aiden when Andre passed\u2026": u"Nenhum de n\u00f3s estava com Aiden quando Andre faleceu\u2026",
