        u"Noooooo!!!! It\u2019s worse than I expected! Everything is buried in snow\u2026!!": u"N\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o!!!! Est\u00e1 pior do que eu esperava! Est\u00e1 tudo soterrado na neve\u2026!!",
        u"Nooooooo!!!!": u"N\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o!!!!",
        u"Nope!": u"Nem pensar!",
