        u"Nope, I\u2019m good! Not a real fan of massages. It gets too ticklish for me.": u"N\u00e3o, estou bem! N\u00e3o sou muito f\u00e3 de massagens. Sinto muitas c\u00f3cegas.",
        u"Nope, it was tasty.": u"N\u00e3o, estava gostoso.",
        u"Nope, pretty sure it\u2019s just your body. Trust me, you\u2019ve had that since I first met you!": u"N\u00e3o, tenho quase certeza de que \u00e9 seu corpo mesmo. Acredite, voc\u00ea tem esse cheiro desde que nos conhecemos!",
        u"Nope. I\u2019m out.": u"N\u00e3o. T\u00f4 fora.",
        u"Nope. This game\u2019s already too weird, I\u2019m out.": u"Nem pensar. Esse jogo j\u00e1 ficou estranho demais, estou fora.",
        u"Nope~! We were just chit-chatting!": u"N\u00e3o~! S\u00f3 est\u00e1vamos batendo papo!",
        u"Normally it wouldn\u2019t be this bad, but with the windows closed and the heater on, I feel like I\u2019m starting to get sticky.": u"Normalmente n\u00e3o seria t\u00e3o ruim, mas com as janelas fechadas e o aquecedor ligado, estou come\u00e7ando a ficar todo pegajoso.",
        u"Normally, I\u2019d use my time to think about what activities we\u2019d be doing next, or how to improve everyone\u2019s experiences at camp.": u"Normalmente, eu usaria o tempo para pensar nas pr\u00f3ximas atividades ou em como melhorar a experi\u00eancia de todos no acampamento.",
        u"Not accurate, Lloyd\u2026": u"Nada preciso, Lloyd\u2026",
        u"Not again with the \u2018loose\u2019 jokes, Aiden\u2026 Let\u2019s just pack.": u"De novo n\u00e3o com as piadas sobre \u2018relaxar\u2019, Aiden\u2026 Vamos apenas fazer as malas.",
        u"Not again\u2026": u"De novo n\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Not at all!": u"De jeito nenhum!",
        u"Not at all! I\u2019m making sure I\u2019m taking things at my own pace and having fun with it! ": u"De jeito nenhum! Estou fazendo tudo no meu ritmo e me divertindo com isso! ",
        u"Not at all! We just finished a little meeting and I\u2019m about to take my leave.": u"De forma alguma! Acabamos de terminar uma pequena reuni\u00e3o e j\u00e1 estou de sa\u00edda.",
        u"Not at all! What are you up to?": u"De jeito nenhum! O que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o fazendo?",
        u"Not at all! Yoshinori was helping me out this whole time, and it\u2019s more of a side project I did for fun!": u"De jeito nenhum! Yoshinori me ajudou esse tempo todo, e foi mais um projeto paralelo que fiz por divers\u00e3o!",
        u"Not at all, Dad! You know parties are my specialty after all~": u"Que nada, Pai! Voc\u00ea sabe que festas s\u00e3o minha especialidade~",
        u"Not at all, I was just giving Emilia some advice.": u"De jeito nenhum, eu s\u00f3 estava dando alguns conselhos para Emilia.",
        u"Not at all, especially if we\u2019re talking about restaurants.": u"De jeito nenhum, principalmente se estivermos falando de restaurantes.",
        u"Not at all, sir! It\u2019s actually perfect for this season\u2019s weather too!": u"De modo algum, senhor! Na verdade, tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 perfeito para o clima desta esta\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Not at all, sir! Spending time with you feels so familiar.": u"De jeito nenhum, senhor! Passar um tempo com o senhor parece t\u00e3o familiar.",
        u"Not at all, sir. It actually brings me back.": u"De jeito nenhum, senhor. Na verdade, isso me traz lembran\u00e7as.",
        u"Not at all.": u"De jeito nenhum.",
        u"Not at all. What brings you two here? ": u"De jeito nenhum. O que traz voc\u00eas dois aqui? ",
        u"Not even denying to that masseur what you really think of me\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea nem negou para aquele massagista o que realmente pensa de mim\u2026",
        u"Not even half a day of being boyfriends and we\u2019ve already had make-up sex! Hehehe!": u"Nem faz meio dia que somos namorados e j\u00e1 fizemos sexo de reconcilia\u00e7\u00e3o! Hehehe!",
        u"Not everything is lost, sir\u2026! We\u2019re all a part of your family now, too!": u"Nem tudo est\u00e1 perdido, senhor\u2026! Todos n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m fazemos parte da sua fam\u00edlia agora!",
        u"Not exactly, but she did give me something to think about earlier.": u"N\u00e3o exatamente, mas ela me deu algo em que pensar.",
        u"Not exactly. It\u2019s actually for Camp Buddy. ": u"N\u00e3o exatamente. Na verdade, \u00e9 para o Camp Buddy. ",
        u"Not gonna lie, I was about to ask you for help after that nightmare feedback I got, so I\u2019m really glad you ended up asking me!": u"Sinceramente, eu estava prestes a pedir sua ajuda depois daquela avalia\u00e7\u00e3o de pesadelo, ent\u00e3o fico muito feliz que voc\u00ea tenha me convidado!",
        u"Not in front of our salad, Aiden\u2026!": u"N\u00e3o na frente da nossa salada, Aiden\u2026!",
        u"Not just that! You see, tarot cards are used to gain insight into the past, present or future by formulating a question, then drawing and interpreting the cards~!": u"N\u00e3o apenas isso! As cartas de tar\u00f4 permitem compreender o passado, o presente ou o futuro ao formular uma pergunta, tirar as cartas e interpret\u00e1-las~!",
        u"Not knowing how to socialize doesn\u2019t give her a pass to be a bitch!": u"N\u00e3o saber socializar n\u00e3o d\u00e1 a ela passe livre para ser uma vaca!",
        u"Not me! I\u2019m into a different kind of woodworking! Later, dorks!": u"Eu n\u00e3o! Eu gosto de outro tipo de \u201cmadeira\u201d! Falou, nerds!",
        u"Not me.": u"Eu n\u00e3o.",
        u"Not me. I felt relaxed for the entire day after.": u"Eu n\u00e3o. Fiquei relaxado pelo resto do dia.",
        u"Not me. Not anyone at Camp Buddy. Not even your own parents! ": u"Nem eu. Nem ningu\u00e9m do Camp Buddy. Nem mesmo seus pr\u00f3prios pais! ",
        u"Not me~ ": u"Eu n\u00e3o~ ",
        u"Not much has changed, if I do say so myself\u2026 You\u2019re still that go-getting, active scout that I remember.": u"N\u00e3o mudou muita coisa, se quer saber a minha opini\u00e3o\u2026 Voc\u00ea ainda \u00e9 aquele escoteiro ativo e cheio de iniciativa de que me lembro.",
        u"Not my fault you have a monster cock, Gramps~!": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa minha se o senhor tem um pau monstruoso, vov\u00f4~!",
        u"Not now, you two. Help me carry Yuri and Jin out.": u"Agora n\u00e3o, voc\u00eas dois. Ajudem-me a levar Yuri e Jin para fora.",
        u"Not on my watch.": u"N\u00e3o enquanto eu estiver aqui.",
        u"Not only for taking care of me, but also for all the advice and understanding\u2026": u"N\u00e3o apenas por cuidarem de mim, mas tamb\u00e9m por todos os conselhos e pela compreens\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Not only have you taught me how to love again, but you also showed me what it\u2019s like to be truly loved\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o apenas me ensinou a amar novamente, como tamb\u00e9m me mostrou como \u00e9 ser verdadeiramente amado\u2026",
        u"Not only that, but he comes from a family of excellent cooks as well.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ele vem de uma fam\u00edlia de excelentes cozinheiros.",
        u"Not only that, but he has zero credentials and no formal training whatsoever to be in a position of leadership!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ele n\u00e3o tem nenhuma credencial nem qualquer forma\u00e7\u00e3o formal para ocupar uma posi\u00e7\u00e3o de lideran\u00e7a!",
        u"Not only that, but he\u2019s leveled up his cooking skills too, you guys should try some of his snacks!": u"E n\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 isso, ele tamb\u00e9m melhorou muito na cozinha; voc\u00eas deveriam experimentar alguns petiscos dele!",
        u"Not only that, but my delinquent days were also a joyful time of my life\u2026 They\u2019re a genuine part of who I am.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, meus dias de delinquente tamb\u00e9m foram uma \u00e9poca feliz da minha vida\u2026 Eles s\u00e3o uma parte verdadeira de quem eu sou.",
        u"Not only that, but phew, the prices for classes are something else\u2026 ": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ufa, os pre\u00e7os desses cursos s\u00e3o outro n\u00edvel\u2026 ",
        u"Not only that, but we\u2019re just one door away from the office. It\u2019ll be more convenient for work.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, ficaremos a apenas uma porta de dist\u00e2ncia do escrit\u00f3rio. Ser\u00e1 mais conveniente para o trabalho.",
        u"Not only that, everyone tried so hard to deal with her attitude! Especially you, Yoshi!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, todos se esfor\u00e7aram muito para lidar com o jeito dela! Principalmente voc\u00ea, Yoshi!",
        u"Not only that\u2026 She makes unrelated comments to make it seem like she\u2019s done some work while tearing us down.": u"E n\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 isso\u2026 Ela faz coment\u00e1rios sem rela\u00e7\u00e3o com o assunto para parecer que trabalhou enquanto nos coloca para baixo.",
        u"Not only that\u2026 but I believe all of you also find it strange that she tries so hard with her job\u2026": u"Al\u00e9m disso\u2026 acredito que todos voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m achem estranho ela se esfor\u00e7ar tanto para manter esse emprego\u2026",
        u"Not only were you always cheerful, but you were ready to help me and the camp out any way you could.": u"Al\u00e9m de estar sempre alegre, voc\u00ea estava pronto para ajudar a mim e ao acampamento de qualquer maneira que pudesse.",
        u"Not only will that give you a good, flat surface to work with, but your axe will also have a place to dig into.": u"Al\u00e9m de proporcionar uma superf\u00edcie boa e plana para trabalhar, isso tamb\u00e9m d\u00e1 ao machado um lugar seguro para atingir.",
        u"Not quite, Yoshinori. I also spent some time reviewing the paperwork that Mr. Clermont had prepared, and we can expect even more specialists to arrive starting tomorrow.": u"Ainda n\u00e3o, Yoshinori. Tamb\u00e9m passei algum tempo revisando a documenta\u00e7\u00e3o preparada pelo Sr. Clermont, e podemos esperar a chegada de ainda mais especialistas a partir de amanh\u00e3.",
        u"Not really! We just got here too!": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o! A gente tamb\u00e9m acabou de chegar!",
        u"Not really. I just don\u2019t have any other ideas.": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o. S\u00f3 n\u00e3o tenho outras ideias.",
        u"Not really. I prefer it that way.": u"N\u00e3o. Prefiro assim.",
        u"Not really. It\u2019s database work, so it\u2019s more on the tedious side.": u"Na verdade, n\u00e3o. \u00c9 trabalho de banco de dados, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 mais tedioso do que dif\u00edcil.",
        u"Not really. It\u2019s just the way I am.": u"N\u00e3o. \u00c9 apenas meu jeito.",
        u"Not right now\u2026 I could barely put my underwear on\u2026": u"Agora n\u00e3o\u2026 Eu mal consegui vestir minha cueca\u2026",
        u"Not so fast, Yoshinori. I believe we have a game to finish.": u"N\u00e3o t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido, Yoshinori. Acredito que temos um jogo para terminar.",
        u"Not sure about Yoichi here, but I\u2019ve been waiting for something to work on! Time here has been really slow during the off-season, after all.": u"N\u00e3o sei quanto ao Yoichi, mas eu estava esperando por algo em que trabalhar! Afinal, o tempo tem passado muito devagar aqui durante a baixa temporada.",
        u"Not sure how Mr. Clermont will react to all of this\u2026": u"N\u00e3o sei como o Sr. Clermont vai reagir a tudo isso\u2026",
        u"Not sure if this is just a youngster\u2019s thing\u2026 But is it really alright for you guys to be basing your \u2018destiny\u2019 and \u2018future\u2019 on the creases of your hands\u2026?": u"N\u00e3o sei se isso \u00e9 coisa de jovem\u2026 Mas \u00e9 mesmo sensato voc\u00eas basearem seu \u2018destino\u2019 e \u2018futuro\u2019 nas linhas das m\u00e3os\u2026?",
        u"Not sure what that is, but sure! You had me at stripper!": u"N\u00e3o sei bem o que \u00e9 isso, mas beleza! Voc\u00ea me ganhou no stripper!",
        u"Not telling!": u"N\u00e3o vou contar!",
        u"Not that I blame Dad, he always supported me no matter what my interests were.": u"N\u00e3o que eu culpe o Pai; ele sempre me apoiou, n\u00e3o importava quais fossem meus interesses.",
        u"Not that I blame you though, I\u2019m feeling frisky after a few days too~": u"N\u00e3o que eu possa culpar voc\u00ea, depois de alguns dias eu tamb\u00e9m estou ficando assanhado~",
        u"Not that I have any complaints~": u"N\u00e3o que eu tenha alguma reclama\u00e7\u00e3o~",
        u"Not that I\u2019m complaining~ You know I\u2019m always down for some fun!": u"N\u00e3o que eu esteja reclamando~ Voc\u00ea sabe que eu sempre topo uma divers\u00e3o!",
        u"Not to mention it\u2019s really spacious, even considering how many guests are in here.": u"Sem falar que \u00e9 muito espa\u00e7oso, mesmo considerando quantos h\u00f3spedes est\u00e3o aqui.",
        u"Not to mention our amazing construction team who does all the labor! ": u"Sem falar na nossa incr\u00edvel equipe de constru\u00e7\u00e3o, que faz todo o trabalho pesado! ",
        u"Not to mention over a task as minor as site clearing.": u"Ainda mais por uma tarefa t\u00e3o simples quanto a limpeza do terreno.",
        u"Not to mention that I\u2019m learning new skills as well.": u"Sem falar que tamb\u00e9m estou aprendendo novas habilidades.",
        u"Not to mention we had that foraging activity! All I could gather were mushrooms and herbs\u2026 And that\u2019s supposed to be our dinner too\u2026": u"Sem falar na atividade de coleta! Tudo o que consegui juntar foram cogumelos e ervas\u2026 E isso ainda deveria ser nosso jantar\u2026",
        u"Not to mention, if one of the staff is handling JUST the maintenance, wouldn\u2019t it make more sense that the scoutmaster title for Mr. Flynn be revoked and changed back to a \u2018helper\u2019?": u"Al\u00e9m disso, se um funcion\u00e1rio cuida APENAS da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o faria mais sentido revogar o t\u00edtulo de chefe escoteiro do Sr. Flynn e voltar a cham\u00e1-lo de \u2018ajudante\u2019?",
        u"Not to mention, if one of the staff is handling JUST the maintenance, wouldn\u2019t it make more sense that the scoutmaster title for Mr. Flynn be revoked and changed back to a \u2018helper\u2019?{fast}": u"Al\u00e9m disso, se um funcion\u00e1rio cuida APENAS da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o faria mais sentido revogar o t\u00edtulo de chefe escoteiro do Sr. Flynn e voltar a cham\u00e1-lo de \u2018ajudante\u2019?{fast}",
        u"Not until I\u2019m done.": u"N\u00e3o at\u00e9 eu terminar.",
        u"Not until you tell your dad to give me everything I just said!": u"S\u00f3 depois que voc\u00ea mandar seu pai me dar tudo o que eu acabei de pedir!",
        u"Not well, honestly\u2026 She got pretty angry.": u"Nada bem, sinceramente\u2026 Ela ficou bem irritada.",
        u"Not when someone like Emilia tests me! That time should\u2019ve taught her a lesson not to mess with my stuff!": u"N\u00e3o quando algu\u00e9m como a Emilia testa a minha paci\u00eancia! Aquilo deveria ter ensinado ela a n\u00e3o mexer nas minhas coisas!",
        u"Not with this in the way!": u"N\u00e3o com isso no caminho!",
        u"Not with those horrible table manners, he can\u2019t.": u"N\u00e3o com esses modos horr\u00edveis \u00e0 mesa.",
        u"Note that this report will be sent to Mr. Clermont, but I will enumerate all my concerns just so everyone knows where they missed the mark.": u"Este relat\u00f3rio ser\u00e1 enviado ao Sr. Clermont, mas listarei todas as minhas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es para que todos saibam onde ficaram abaixo do esperado.",
        u"Noted, sir!": u"Entendido, senhor!",
        u"Nothing inappropriate, Yuri.": u"Nada impr\u00f3prio, Yuri.",
        u"Nothing like the bars we go to back home, huh?": u"Nada parecido com os bares que frequentamos em casa, hein?",
        u"Nothing will beat the first time I stripped in front of you, though!": u"Mas nada vai superar a primeira vez que tirei a roupa na sua frente!",
        u"Nothing~ I\u2019m gonna go and work with Yoshi now! ": u"Nada~ Vou trabalhar com o Yoshi agora! ",
        u"Now I feel bad I didn\u2019t get anything for you\u2026": u"Agora me sinto mal por n\u00e3o ter comprado nada para voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Now I feel bad that I get to do all these activities while all you do is work\u2026": u"Agora me sinto mal por poder participar de todas essas atividades enquanto voc\u00ea s\u00f3 trabalha\u2026",
        u"Now I feel like I missed out. I never went to a summer camp in my younger days.": u"Agora sinto que perdi uma experi\u00eancia importante. Nunca fui a um acampamento de ver\u00e3o quando era mais novo.",
        u"Now I feel really guilty I urged everyone to look into her\u2026 I didn\u2019t expect it to spiral into all this\u2026": u"Agora me sinto muito culpado por ter incentivado todos a investig\u00e1-la\u2026 N\u00e3o esperava que tudo chegasse a esse ponto\u2026",
        u"Now I get to follow that dream for real and make something relevant out of myself.": u"Agora posso seguir esse sonho de verdade e fazer algo importante da minha vida.",
        u"Now I have something to look forward to while the scouts aren\u2019t here\u2026": u"Agora tenho algo pelo que esperar enquanto os escoteiros n\u00e3o est\u00e3o aqui\u2026",
        u"Now I have something to look forward to while the scouts aren\u2019t here\u2026{fast}": u"Agora tenho algo pelo que esperar enquanto os escoteiros n\u00e3o est\u00e3o aqui\u2026{fast}",
        u"Now I realize that I wasn't even considering the reason you had for making that decision...": u"Agora percebo que eu nem estava considerando o motivo que levou voc\u00ea a tomar essa decis\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Now I wanna get fingered too!": u"Agora eu tamb\u00e9m quero levar uma dedada!",
        u"Now I wanna see if Bro-Aiden and Scoutmaster Yoshi can beat Darius\u2019 record!": u"Agora quero ver se o Mano-Aiden e o chefe escoteiro Yoshi conseguem bater o recorde do Darius!",
        u"Now I wonder what I\u2019m going to be called from now on\u2026": u"Agora fico imaginando como v\u00e3o me chamar daqui para frente\u2026",
        u"Now I\u2019m actually curious what the camp was like back then from the eyes of a scout\u2026": u"Agora fiquei realmente curioso para saber como era o acampamento naquela \u00e9poca pelos olhos de uma escoteira\u2026",
        u"Now I\u2019m not sure if you should let me tag along next time\u2026.": u"Agora n\u00e3o sei se o senhor deveria me deixar acompanh\u00e1-lo da pr\u00f3xima vez\u2026",
        u"Now I\u2019m really curious about what kind of fun stuff we\u2019ll see at that hotel~": u"Agora estou muito curioso para saber que coisas divertidas vamos encontrar naquele hotel~",
        u"Now I\u2019m really curious how that party went.": u"Agora estou muito curioso para saber como foi aquela festa.",
        u"Now I\u2019m turned on too\u2026 Good thing nobody is around right now to see this\u2026 ": u"Agora tamb\u00e9m fiquei excitado\u2026 Ainda bem que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 ningu\u00e9m por perto para ver isto\u2026",
        u"Now all of a sudden you\u2019re interested? It\u2019s none of your business. Leave me alone.": u"Agora, de repente, est\u00e1 interessado? N\u00e3o \u00e9 da sua conta. Deixe-me em paz.",
        u"Now be more patient, dear.  Use this opportunity to share the knowledge you\u2019ve learned!": u"Agora tenha mais paci\u00eancia, querida. Aproveite esta oportunidade para compartilhar o conhecimento que adquiriu!",
        u"Now calm down, Yuri. Like Mr. Clermont said, this trip might be a good chance for us to unwind after all the stress from work.": u"Calma, Yuri. Como o Sr. Clermont disse, esta viagem pode ser uma boa oportunidade para relaxarmos depois de todo o estresse do trabalho.",
        u"Now calm down, dear. This trip gives us a good chance to unwind after all the stress from work.": u"Agora se acalme, querida. Esta viagem nos d\u00e1 uma boa oportunidade de relaxar depois de todo o estresse do trabalho.",
        u"Now come on, let\u2019s finish up work so we can wrap up for today.": u"Agora vamos, precisamos terminar o trabalho para encerrar por hoje.",
        u"Now come on, since you\u2019re all up, get in your uniforms and let\u2019s start an activity!": u"Agora vamos, j\u00e1 que todos acordaram, vistam os uniformes e vamos come\u00e7ar uma atividade!",
        u"Now come on, the best way to get you out of a slump is to get your muscles pumping! Let\u2019s get to cleaning!": u"Agora vamos, a melhor maneira de tirar voc\u00ea do des\u00e2nimo \u00e9 colocar os m\u00fasculos para trabalhar! Vamos limpar tudo!",
        u"Now come on, these boxes won\u2019t move themselves!": u"Agora vamos, essas caixas n\u00e3o v\u00e3o se mover sozinhas!",
        u"Now don\u2019t discredit your work so far. All of your efforts count.": u"N\u00e3o diminuam o trabalho que fizeram at\u00e9 agora. Todo esfor\u00e7o conta.",
        u"Now everything is too long and baggy for him.": u"Agora tudo ficou comprido e folgado demais nele.",
        u"Now go get into your positions!": u"Agora v\u00e1 para sua posi\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Now go! They must be waiting already!": u"Agora v\u00e1! Eles j\u00e1 devem estar esperando!",
        u"Now here I am, alone in my room, wondering\u2026 if all of this is worth it\u2026": u"E agora estou aqui, sozinho no meu quarto, me perguntando\u2026 se tudo isso vale a pena\u2026",
        u"Now how does this work?": u"Agora, como isso funciona?",
        u"Now if you\u2019ll excuse me, I gotta get lunch started \u2019cause I got hungry workers to feed!": u"Agora, se me d\u00e3o licen\u00e7a, preciso come\u00e7ar o almo\u00e7o porque tenho trabalhadores famintos para alimentar!",
        u"Now if you\u2019ll excuse us, I\u2019m gonna take this \u2018go-getter\u2019 and get her started mopping!": u"Agora, com licen\u00e7a, vou levar esta \u2018determinada\u2019 para come\u00e7ar a passar o esfreg\u00e3o!",
        u"Now imagine that during a summer term with all the scouts too. And he still manages to participate in physical and wellness activities at the same time.": u"Agora imagine isso durante uma temporada de ver\u00e3o com todos os escoteiros. E ainda consegue participar das atividades f\u00edsicas e de bem-estar.",
        u"Now it makes sense why Mr. Clermont was asking for our measurements a few weeks ago\u2026 ": u"Agora faz sentido o Sr. Clermont ter pedido nossas medidas algumas semanas atr\u00e1s\u2026 ",
        u"Now let\u2019s get on with things before this cheese-train gets out of control.": u"Agora vamos ao trabalho antes que esse trem da mela\u00e7\u00e3o saia dos trilhos.",
        u"Now let\u2019s get pumpin\u2019~": u"Agora vamos come\u00e7ar a bombar~",
        u"Now let\u2019s get to work!": u"Agora, vamos ao trabalho!",
        u"Now let\u2019s go join them! All that boning made me hungry!": u"Agora vamos nos juntar a eles! Toda aquela transa me deixou com fome!",
        u"Now please get some rest, you can take the top bunk on the right side! ": u"Agora, por favor, descanse um pouco. Pode ficar com o beliche de cima, do lado direito! ",
        u"Now say it!": u"Agora diga!",
        u"Now stop stressing and get in bed with me!": u"Agora pare de se preocupar e venha para a cama comigo!",
        u"Now that I think about it\u2026 I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve ever heard of a workplace that parties this much together\u2026": u"Pensando bem\u2026 Acho que nunca ouvi falar de um local de trabalho onde todo mundo festeja tanto junto\u2026",
        u"Now that I think about it\u2026 I wonder if that was a subtle invite\u2026": u"Pensando bem\u2026 Ser\u00e1 que aquilo foi um convite discreto\u2026?",
        u"Now that I think about it\u2026 you still haven\u2019t grown any taller since then\u2026 Not that it\u2019s a bad thing! ": u"Pensando bem\u2026 voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o cresceu nada desde aquela \u00e9poca\u2026 N\u00e3o que isso seja ruim! ",
        u"Now that I\u2019m here and I have you, it\u2019s everything I could have ever asked for\u2026": u"Agora que estou aqui e tenho voc\u00ea, \u00e9 tudo que eu poderia ter desejado\u2026",
        u"Now that I\u2019m less busy this season, I\u2019ll definitely be sticking around you more often.": u"Agora que estou menos ocupado nesta temporada, com certeza ficarei mais tempo ao seu lado.",
        u"Now that I\u2019m not going anywhere, I\u2019m sure we can pull it off, hahaha!": u"Agora que n\u00e3o vou a lugar nenhum, tenho certeza de que vamos conseguir, hahaha!",
        u"Now that everyone\u2019s naked, let\u2019s check out everyone\u2019s bod, shall we? I wanna know who Jin thinks is the best~": u"Agora que todos est\u00e3o pelados, vamos conferir o corpo de cada um, certo? Quero saber quem Jin acha que \u00e9 o melhor~",
        u"Now that was just dirty. Hahaha!": u"Agora isso foi bem malicioso. Hahaha!",
        u"Now that we had something in common, I continued taking her out more and more, until I realized\u2026": u"Agora que t\u00ednhamos algo em comum, continuei levando-a para acampar cada vez mais, at\u00e9 perceber\u2026",
        u"Now that we have the tents set up, I should start getting the first activity ready!": u"Agora que as barracas est\u00e3o montadas, eu deveria come\u00e7ar a preparar a primeira atividade!",
        u"Now that you have the chance to change that, the decision here seems so obvious!": u"Agora que voc\u00ea tem a chance de mudar isso, a decis\u00e3o parece t\u00e3o \u00f3bvia!",
        u"Now that you mention it, I\u2019ve only ever seen Sir Goro drunk once.": u"Agora que voc\u00ea mencionou, s\u00f3 vi o senhor Goro b\u00eabado uma vez.",
        u"Now that you mention it, yeah\u2026 ": u"Agora que mencionou, \u00e9 verdade\u2026 ",
        u"Now that you\u2019re my husband, let\u2019s make this honeymoon count\u2026": u"Agora que voc\u00ea \u00e9 meu marido, vamos aproveitar esta lua de mel ao m\u00e1ximo\u2026",
        u"Now that you\u2019re officially moving in with me, there\u2019s gonna be some house rules! Same goes for staying here at the camp!": u"Agora que vai oficialmente morar comigo, teremos algumas regras no quarto! E o mesmo vale para ficar aqui no acampamento!",
        u"Now that\u2019s something I\u2019m totally on board with!": u"Nisso eu apoio completamente!",
        u"Now that\u2019s the spirit! I hope you\u2019ll keep that positive attitude for when all the new workers arrive tomorrow and start working!": u"Esse \u00e9 o esp\u00edrito! Espero que mantenha essa atitude positiva quando todos os novos trabalhadores chegarem e come\u00e7arem o servi\u00e7o amanh\u00e3!",
        u"Now that\u2019s the spirit! I really appreciate your enthusiasm!": u"Esse \u00e9 o esp\u00edrito! Aprecio muito seu entusiasmo!",
        u"Now that\u2019s unexpected\u2026": u"Essa eu n\u00e3o esperava\u2026",
        u"Now that\u2019s what I call a workout! ": u"Agora isso \u00e9 o que eu chamo de treino! ",
        u"Now that\u2019s what I\u2019m talking about! It\u2019s about time we got you back, Yoshi!": u"\u00c9 disso que estou falando! J\u00e1 estava na hora de termos o velho Yoshi de volta!",
        u"Now that\u2019s what I\u2019m talking \u2019bout~!": u"Agora sim estamos falando a mesma l\u00edngua~!",
        u"Now the curse has been lifted~": u"Agora a maldi\u00e7\u00e3o foi quebrada~",
        u"Now this is a look I could get used to, Yoshinori~": u"Agora sim, esta \u00e9 uma vis\u00e3o \u00e0 qual eu poderia me acostumar, Yoshinori~",
        u"Now we get to experience what it\u2019s like to actually be one\u2026": u"Agora podemos descobrir como \u00e9 realmente ser um casal\u2026",
        u"Now we\u2019re just buttering each other up. ": u"Agora s\u00f3 estamos bajulando um ao outro. ",
        u"Now we\u2019re just connecting them all to the network and making sure they\u2019re working properly.": u"Agora s\u00f3 estamos conectando todas \u00e0 rede e verificando se est\u00e3o funcionando corretamente.",
        u"Now we\u2019re talking!": u"Agora sim!",
        u"Now we\u2019re talking! My mouth is watering from just looking at it!": u"Agora sim! Minha boca est\u00e1 salivando s\u00f3 de olhar!",
        u"Now we\u2019ve made it even bigger in such a short period of time\u2026 and to receive yet another opportunity was just so unexpected... ": u"Agora conseguimos torn\u00e1-lo ainda maior em t\u00e3o pouco tempo\u2026 e receber mais uma oportunidade foi simplesmente inesperado demais\u2026 ",
        u"Now why are you two giving me that look?!": u"Agora por que voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o me olhando desse jeito?!",
        u"Now you don\u2019t even care if the strangers here ogle your package~": u"Agora voc\u00ea nem liga se os estranhos daqui ficarem secando o seu pacote~",
        u"Now you get what I feel, Dad?!": u"Agora entende como eu me sinto, pai?!",
        u"Now you got me hyped up! Grab some weights, and let\u2019s get pumping already!": u"Agora voc\u00ea me animou! Pegue alguns pesos e vamos come\u00e7ar a malhar!",
        u"Now you guys are just stretching it.": u"Agora voc\u00eas est\u00e3o for\u00e7ando.",
        u"Now you know what it feels like.": u"Agora voc\u00ea sabe como \u00e9.",
        u"Now you realize what I\u2019ve been telling you all from the start?! ": u"Agora voc\u00eas percebem o que venho dizendo desde o come\u00e7o?! ",
        u"Now you\u2019re talking! Let\u2019s grab some drinks, then!": u"Agora sim! Ent\u00e3o vamos tomar alguns drinques!",
        u"Now! Where are we supposed to sit? Shouldn\u2019t we be getting served right about now?": u"Agora! Onde devemos nos sentar? J\u00e1 n\u00e3o deveriam estar nos atendendo?",
        u"Now, I can finally do things right, and treat you the way you deserve and more\u2026": u"Agora posso finalmente fazer as coisas direito e tratar voc\u00ea como merece, e ainda melhor\u2026",
        u"Now, I chose something I truly want for myself.": u"Agora, escolhi algo que realmente quero para mim.",
        u"Now, I feel a real sense of fulfilment when I complete them, seeing everyone enjoy the comfort as a direct result of my hard work.": u"Agora sinto uma verdadeira realiza\u00e7\u00e3o quando termino essas tarefas e vejo todos desfrutando do conforto como resultado direto do meu esfor\u00e7o.",
        u"Now, I think we\u2019ve bothered you enough! You keep resting and we\u2019ll check on you again tomorrow, alright?": u"Agora acho que j\u00e1 incomodamos voc\u00ea o suficiente! Continue descansando e amanh\u00e3 voltaremos para ver como est\u00e1, certo?",
        u"Now, I\u2019ll go take that top bunk!": u"Agora vou ficar com a cama de cima!",
        u"Now, Mr. Clermont has arranged four master king suites for the executive staff. ": u"Agora, o Sr. Clermont reservou quatro su\u00edtes master king para a equipe executiva. ",
        u"Now, Yoshi, go and fetch the scouts and bring them to the mess hall!": u"Agora, Yoshi, v\u00e1 buscar os escoteiros e leve-os ao refeit\u00f3rio!",
        u"Now, after getting the chance to be closer with you, I started to see things differently\u2026": u"Agora, depois de ter a chance de ficar mais pr\u00f3ximo de voc\u00ea, comecei a enxergar as coisas de outra forma\u2026",
        u"Now, all this serious business has made me tired, not to mention all the walking around the camp to inspect!": u"Todos esses assuntos s\u00e9rios me deixaram cansada, sem falar em toda a caminhada pelo acampamento durante a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Now, calm down both of you. Emilia, you\u2019ve only just recovered.": u"Agora, acalmem-se voc\u00eas duas. Emilia, voc\u00ea acabou de se recuperar.",
        u"Now, calm down both of you. Especially you, Emilia, you just recovered!": u"Agora se acalmem, voc\u00eas duas. Principalmente voc\u00ea, Emilia, acabou de se recuperar!",
        u"Now, come on! Yoshi has one point left, and I\u2019m gonna make the most of it! It\u2019s my turn again!": u"Agora, vamos! Yoshi s\u00f3 tem um ponto, e vou aproveitar ao m\u00e1ximo! \u00c9 minha vez de novo!",
        u"Now, do you mind telling me why you\u2019re acting strangely again, Yoshinori?": u"Agora, importa-se de explicar por que est\u00e1 agindo de forma estranha novamente, Yoshinori?",
        u"Now, eat up before this soup gets cold.": u"Agora coma antes que essa sopa esfrie.",
        u"Now, every decision we make has either serious rewards or consequences \u2013 back then, everything was just one exciting thing after the next!": u"Agora, toda decis\u00e3o que tomamos traz grandes recompensas ou consequ\u00eancias \u2014 naquela \u00e9poca, era s\u00f3 uma coisa empolgante atr\u00e1s da outra!",
        u"Now, for all the workers, grab a copy of the schedule here. ": u"Agora, todos os trabalhadores devem pegar aqui uma c\u00f3pia do cronograma.",
        u"Now, get on your knees.": u"Agora, fique de joelhos.",
        u"Now, go find Aiden, Yoshinori\u2026 I\u2019m sure he\u2019s waiting for you.": u"Agora v\u00e1 encontrar Aiden, Yoshinori\u2026 Tenho certeza de que ele est\u00e1 esperando por voc\u00ea.",
        u"Now, go find him\u2026 I\u2019m sure he\u2019s waiting for you": u"Agora v\u00e1 encontr\u00e1-lo\u2026 Tenho certeza de que ele est\u00e1 esperando por voc\u00ea.",
        u"Now, if you don\u2019t mind, I\u2019ll be heading out for a while. Yoshinori, please assist Jin here with whatever he needs for today.": u"Agora, se n\u00e3o se importam, vou sair por algum tempo. Yoshinori, por favor, ajude Jin com tudo de que ele precisar hoje.",
        u"Now, if you\u2019ll excuse me, I\u2019ll head out and get started on those adjustments to the plan!": u"Agora, se me d\u00e3o licen\u00e7a, vou come\u00e7ar a fazer esses ajustes no projeto!",
        u"Now, let\u2019s all celebrate the completion of our goals!": u"Agora, vamos todos comemorar a conclus\u00e3o dos nossos objetivos!",
        u"Now, let\u2019s get some rest. It\u2019s been a long day today.": u"Agora vamos descansar. Hoje foi um dia longo.",
        u"Now, let\u2019s go back to work.": u"Agora, vamos voltar ao trabalho.",
        u"Now, let\u2019s move on and discuss when the project is expected to be completed.": u"Agora, vamos prosseguir e discutir o prazo previsto para a conclus\u00e3o do projeto.",
        u"Now, let\u2019s usher in a bright future, together!": u"Agora, vamos construir juntos um futuro brilhante!",
        u"Now, now, Yuri. We\u2019re here to relax, so don\u2019t get worked up again.": u"Calma, Yuri. Estamos aqui para relaxar, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se exalte de novo.",
        u"Now, now, guys. If Jin isn\u2019t comfortable with it, maybe we shouldn\u2019t\u2014": u"Calma, pessoal. Se Jin n\u00e3o se sente \u00e0 vontade com isso, talvez n\u00e3o dev\u00eassemos\u2014",
        u"Now, now, there\u2019s plenty for everybody! ": u"Calma, calma, h\u00e1 bastante para todos! ",
        u"Now, now, you two\u2026": u"Calma, calma, voc\u00eas dois\u2026",
        u"Now, now\u2026 There\u2019s a perfectly good explanation for that, Yuri\u2026": u"Calma, calma\u2026 H\u00e1 uma explica\u00e7\u00e3o perfeitamente razo\u00e1vel para isso, Yuri\u2026",
        u"Now, shall we proceed with the preliminary inspection?": u"Agora, podemos prosseguir com a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o preliminar?",
        u"Now, shall we resume our hike? We\u2019re almost at our destination!": u"Agora, vamos retomar a caminhada? Estamos quase no destino!",
        u"Now, shoo, I wanna focus on my BL and you boys should go out there and do something interesting!": u"Agora, x\u00f4! Quero me concentrar no meu BL, e voc\u00eas dois deveriam sair e fazer alguma coisa interessante!",
        u"Now, should we get these snow blowers inside? I\u2019m eager to see how quickly they can knock those piles away!": u"Agora, que tal levarmos esses sopradores de neve para dentro? Estou ansioso para ver a rapidez com que v\u00e3o acabar com aqueles montes!",
        u"Now, should we go and see about those materials?": u"Agora, vamos verificar aqueles materiais?",
        u"Now, since Yoshi and Gramps are our special guests, why don\u2019t we give \u2019em the honor of picking what game we play?": u"Agora, j\u00e1 que Yoshi e Vov\u00f4 s\u00e3o nossos convidados especiais, por que n\u00e3o damos a eles a honra de escolher o jogo?",
        u"Now, some of you might be wondering why I\u2019ve assigned you all in pairs. The reason for this is to improve your sense of cooperation, especially in times of emergency!": u"Agora, alguns de voc\u00eas podem estar se perguntando por que designei duplas. A raz\u00e3o \u00e9 aprimorar o senso de coopera\u00e7\u00e3o, especialmente em emerg\u00eancias!",
        u"Now, that I\u2019m recharged, maybe we should check out the gym, sir?": u"Agora que recuperei as energias, talvez dev\u00eassemos conhecer a academia, senhor?",
        u"Now, to the future and whatever it might hold.": u"Agora, ao futuro e a tudo que ele possa trazer.",
        u"Now, what\u2019s causing all these issues? Everything boils down to the management department.": u"Agora, o que est\u00e1 causando todos esses problemas? Tudo se resume ao setor administrativo.",
        u"Now, where\u2019s Lloyd and Darius?! ": u"Agora, onde est\u00e3o Lloyd e Darius?! ",
        u"Nowhere\u2026 I-It\u2019s over for me\u2026": u"Para lugar nenhum\u2026 A-Acabou para mim\u2026",
        u"Now\u2026 Give it a try.": u"Agora\u2026 Tente voc\u00ea.",
        u"Now\u2026 Why don\u2019t we check out if it\u2019d fit you too?": u"Agora\u2026 Que tal vermos se ele serve em voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"Now\u2026 Why don\u2019t we put these things to good use?": u"Agora\u2026 Por que n\u00e3o damos um bom uso a essas coisas?",
        u"No\u2026": u"N\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"No\u2026 I already promised I\u2019d help Sir Goro with his admin tasks, so, I turned her down\u2026": u"N\u00e3o\u2026 Eu j\u00e1 havia prometido ajudar o Sr. Goro com as tarefas administrativas, ent\u00e3o recusei\u2026",
        u"No\u2026 I noticed during my time as both an inspector and these last few months that Aiden does all the maintenance work by himself, both during the on and off season. ": u"N\u00e3o\u2026 Durante meu tempo como inspetora e nestes \u00faltimos meses, percebi que Aiden faz sozinho todo o trabalho de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o, tanto durante quanto fora da temporada. ",
        u"Nyeeeh! Come and get me!": u"Nyeeeh! Vem me pegar!",
        u"O-Obviously\u2026": u"O-Obviamente\u2026",
        u"O-Of course I can! My only intent was\u2014": u"C-Claro que consigo! Minha \u00fanica inten\u00e7\u00e3o era\u2014",
        u"O-Of course I have! It\u2019s my job to know all the details of the project after all!": u"C-Claro que sim! Afinal, \u00e9 meu trabalho conhecer todos os detalhes do projeto!",
        u"O-Of course!": u"C-Claro!",
        u"O-Of course, sir! You can even call me Jin, for short!": u"C-Claro, senhor! Pode at\u00e9 me chamar de Jin, para abreviar!",
        u"O-Of course. ": u"C-Claro.",
        u"O-Of course\u2026": u"C-Claro\u2026",
        u"O-Of what\u2026?": u"C-Com medo de qu\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"O-Oh hey, is that\u2026 Yuri?": u"O-Oh, ei, aquela \u00e9\u2026 a Yuri?",
        u"O-Oh no, I wouldn\u2019t want you guys to miss out on all the fun stuff around the hotel! ": u"A-Ah, n\u00e3o, eu n\u00e3o gostaria que voc\u00eas perdessem todas as coisas divertidas do hotel! ",
        u"O-Oh no, I\u2019ve been spotted\u2026!": u"A-Ah, n\u00e3o, fui descoberto\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh no, sir\u2026! I wouldn\u2019t want you guys to miss out on all the fun stuff around the hotel! ": u"O-Oh n\u00e3o, senhor\u2026! Eu n\u00e3o gostaria que voc\u00eas perdessem todas as coisas divertidas do hotel! ",
        u"O-Oh! Hey there, Aiden! ": u"A-Ah! Ol\u00e1, Aiden! ",
        u"O-Oh! I only learned it all from Sir Goro\u2019s lessons\u2026!": u"A-Ah! Eu s\u00f3 aprendi tudo nas aulas do senhor Goro\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh! I was just thinking about how surreal everything is\u2026 the project is done, and Camp Buddy is two times bigger than it was.": u"O-Oh! S\u00f3 estava pensando em como tudo parece surreal\u2026 o projeto acabou e o Camp Buddy est\u00e1 duas vezes maior do que antes.",
        u"O-Oh! I-I\u2019m sorry, I don\u2019t drink, sir\u2026!": u"O-Oh! D-Desculpe, eu n\u00e3o bebo, senhor\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh! I\u2019m fine\u2026! ": u"A-Ah! Estou bem\u2026! ",
        u"O-Oh! I\u2019m sorry, Yoshinori\u2026! It\u2019s just\u2026 I\u2019ve never seen a really fancy kitchen like this in person before\u2026": u"A-Ah! Desculpe, Yoshinori\u2026! \u00c9 que\u2026 Nunca vi pessoalmente uma cozinha t\u00e3o sofisticada como esta\u2026",
        u"O-Oh! Since everyone is here, I think this is the perfect time for us to take a victory selfie! ": u"O-Oh! J\u00e1 que todos est\u00e3o aqui, acho que este \u00e9 o momento perfeito para tirarmos uma selfie da vit\u00f3ria! ",
        u"O-Oh! Sir Goro\u2019s saying something\u2026!": u"O-Oh! O Sr. Goro est\u00e1 dizendo alguma coisa\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh! Sorry! I thought there was nobody in here!": u"A-Ah! Desculpem! Pensei que n\u00e3o houvesse ningu\u00e9m aqui!",
        u"O-Oh!!! Now I remember! Little Lloyd and Serious Darius from the first term?!": u"A-Ah!!! Agora me lembro! O Pequeno Lloyd e o Darius Dur\u00e3o da primeira temporada?!",
        u"O-Oh, I see.": u"A-Ah, entendo.",
        u"O-Oh, I was just thinking how much you\u2019ve really bulked up over time.": u"O-Oh, eu s\u00f3 estava pensando em como voc\u00ea ficou muito mais musculoso com o tempo.",
        u"O-Oh, I-I apologize\u2026! ": u"A-Ah, d-desculpe\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, I\u2019m sorry, sir! I totally spaced out\u2026 I just realized that\u2014": u"O-Oh, desculpe, senhor! Eu me distra\u00ed completamente\u2026 Acabei de perceber que\u2014",
        u"O-Oh, I\u2019m sorry, sir! I totally spaced out\u2026 I just realized that\u2014{fast}": u"O-Oh, desculpe, senhor! Eu me distra\u00ed completamente\u2026 Acabei de perceber que\u2014{fast}",
        u"O-Oh, about what?": u"O-Oh, sobre o qu\u00ea?",
        u"O-Oh, alright! Hmmm\u2026 Let me think.": u"O-Oh, certo! Hmmm\u2026 Deixe-me pensar.",
        u"O-Oh, and we can set up the camp at the fields in advance, so we\u2019ll have more time to do an outdoor activity for the rest of the day\u2026!": u"A-Ah, e podemos montar o acampamento nos campos com anteced\u00eancia, para termos mais tempo para uma atividade ao ar livre durante o restante do dia\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, coming! Give me just a moment!": u"A-Ah, j\u00e1 vou! S\u00f3 um instante!",
        u"O-Oh, good morning, gentlemen! I hope I didn\u2019t interrupt anything!": u"O-Oh, bom dia, senhores! Espero n\u00e3o ter interrompido nada!",
        u"O-Oh, it\u2019s nothing, I just thought you were acting different compared to this morning. Is something wrong?": u"O-Oh, n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada, s\u00f3 achei que voc\u00ea estava agindo diferente de hoje de manh\u00e3. Aconteceu alguma coisa?",
        u"O-Oh, no sir, please you don\u2019t have to do that\u2026": u"A-Ah, n\u00e3o, senhor, por favor, n\u00e3o precisa fazer isso\u2026",
        u"O-Oh, no, it\u2019s a scout-themed summer camp. ": u"A-Ah, n\u00e3o, \u00e9 um acampamento de ver\u00e3o para escoteiros. ",
        u"O-Oh, no, sir! I\u2019m fine\u2026!": u"A-Ah, n\u00e3o, senhor! Estou bem\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, nothing, really!": u"A-Ah, nada, s\u00e9rio!",
        u"O-Oh, really? He must be talking about the online bookstore I developed for his publishing company\u2026!": u"A-Ah, s\u00e9rio? Ele deve estar falando da livraria virtual que desenvolvi para a editora dele\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, right\u2026 Oops.": u"A-Ah, \u00e9\u2026 Oops.",
        u"O-Oh, right\u2026!": u"A-Ah, \u00e9\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, thank goodness I\u2019m in the right place!": u"A-Ah, gra\u00e7as a Deus estou no lugar certo!",
        u"O-Oh, thanks Natsumi and Hunter\u2026!": u"O-Oh, obrigado, Natsumi e Hunter\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh, this? It\u2019s actually a flower necklace I was making!": u"O-Oh, isto? Na verdade, \u00e9 um colar de flores que eu estava fazendo!",
        u"O-Oh, well\u2026": u"O-Oh, bem\u2026",
        u"O-Oh, what is it, sir?": u"O-Oh, o que foi, senhor?",
        u"O-Oh, wow\u2026 That\u2019s really amazing! ": u"A-Ah, uau\u2026 Isso \u00e9 realmente incr\u00edvel! ",
        u"O-Oh, yes, I\u2019m totally fine! This place is a little out of my element, anyway\u2026": u"A-Ah, sim, estou perfeitamente bem! Este lugar n\u00e3o faz muito o meu estilo mesmo\u2026",
        u"O-Oh, you mean the empty bucket\u2026? Well\u2026 You did puke around two times last night\u2026": u"A-Ah, quer dizer o balde vazio\u2026? Bem\u2026 Voc\u00ea vomitou umas duas vezes na noite passada\u2026",
        u"O-Oh, you mean way back when you were in the uh\u2026 biker gang?": u"O-Oh, quer dizer l\u00e1 na \u00e9poca em que o senhor fazia parte daquela, ahn\u2026 gangue de motoqueiros?",
        u"O-Oh...! On second thought, I need to take this call.": u"A-Ah\u2026! Pensando bem, preciso atender a esta liga\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"O-Oh\u2026": u"A-Ah\u2026",
        u"O-Oh\u2026 I had no idea\u2026": u"O-Oh\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o fazia ideia\u2026",
        u"O-Oh\u2026 I\u2019m guessing it\u2019s one of those BL movies?": u"O-Oh\u2026 Imagino que seja um daqueles filmes BL?",
        u"O-Oh\u2026 Sort of! Yuri, Aiden, Lloyd, Darius and I were actually from the very first batch of Camp Buddy scouts. Sir Goro was even our scoutmaster back then!": u"A-Ah\u2026 Mais ou menos! Yuri, Aiden, Lloyd, Darius e eu fomos da primeira turma de escoteiros do Camp Buddy. O Senhor Goro era at\u00e9 nosso chefe escoteiro naquela \u00e9poca!",
        u"O-Oh\u2026 We\u2019re not playing a game, sir. I\u2019m sketching up a fanfic for Ms. Yuri, and Natsumi\u2019s modeling for the cover.": u"O-Oh\u2026 N\u00e3o estamos jogando, senhor. Estou fazendo os esbo\u00e7os de uma fanfic para a Srta. Yuri, e Natsumi est\u00e1 servindo de modelo para a capa.",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! How about I help you wash, sir? I can massage you while I\u2019m at it, too\u2026!": u"O-Oh\u2026! Que tal eu ajudar o senhor a se lavar? Posso fazer uma massagem tamb\u00e9m\u2026!",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! I thought you were just the chef here?": u"A-Ah\u2026! Pensei que voc\u00ea fosse apenas o cozinheiro daqui?",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! I\u2019m coming!": u"A-Ah\u2026! J\u00e1 vou!",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! I\u2019m not working either!": u"A-Ah\u2026! Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o estou trabalhando!",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! I\u2026 don\u2019t mind that at all! ": u"A-Ah\u2026! Eu\u2026 n\u00e3o me importo nem um pouco! ",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! Let me help you with that suitcase, Yuri!": u"A-Ah\u2026! Deixe-me ajudar com essa mala, Yuri!",
        u"O-Oh\u2026! We should schedule a road trip, too! How about every weekend?": u"O-Oh\u2026! Tamb\u00e9m dever\u00edamos marcar uma viagem de moto! Que tal todo fim de semana?",
        u"O-Okay, Goro\u2026": u"C-Certo, Goro\u2026",
        u"O-Okay, sir\u2026!": u"C-Certo, senhor\u2026!",
        u"O-Okay\u2026!": u"C-Certo\u2026!",
        u"O-Once you make soft copies of your collection, please share them with me too\u2026": u"Q-Quando fizer c\u00f3pias digitais da sua cole\u00e7\u00e3o, por favor, compartilhe-as comigo tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"O-Oof\u2026 Y-You have really big hands, Darius\u2026 And a tight grip too\u2026": u"U-Ufa\u2026 V-Voc\u00ea tem m\u00e3os muito grandes, Darius\u2026 E um aperto forte tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"O-Ow!": u"A-Ai!",
        u"O-Ow! Aiden, what are you-?!": u"A-Ai! Aiden, o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1\u2014?!",
        u"O-Ow! Wh-What was that for, Yuri??": u"A-Ai! P-Por que fez isso, Yuri??",
        u"OH NO! Did I interrupt a very intimate love-making session?!": u"AH, N\u00c3O! Interrompi uma sess\u00e3o muito \u00edntima de amor?!",
        u"OH! I just remembered, I promised Aiden I\u2019d help him in the garden this morning!  ": u"OH! Acabei de lembrar que prometi ao Aiden que o ajudaria no jardim esta manh\u00e3!  ",
        u"OH! I recognize that book!": u"AH! Eu reconhe\u00e7o esse livro!",
        u"OMG! Alright, I have tons more fanfics of all different genres! Let\u2019s find the one that suits you the best!!": u"MEU DEUS! Certo, tenho muitas outras fanfics de todos os g\u00eaneros! Vamos encontrar a que mais combina com voc\u00ea!!",
        u"OMG! I can\u2019t believe you\u2019ve read them! How embarrassing! ": u"MEU DEUS! N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea as leu! Que vergonha! ",
        u"OMG! That gives me an idea, Jin! I could get a physical copy of all your stuff too! You\u2019ll let me print them out, right?!": u"MEU DEUS! Isso me deu uma ideia, Jin! Tamb\u00e9m posso fazer c\u00f3pias f\u00edsicas de todo o seu material! Voc\u00ea vai me deixar imprimir, n\u00e3o vai?!",
        u"OMG!!!!": u"MEU DEUS!!!!",
        u"OMG, I CAN\u2019T BELIEVE I FOUND ANOTHER ONE LIKE ME!!!": u"MEU DEUS, N\u00c3O ACREDITO QUE ENCONTREI OUTRA PESSOA COMO EU!!!",
        u"OMG, OMG, OMG, it\u2019s finally happening~!!": u"MEU DEUS, MEU DEUS, MEU DEUS, finalmente est\u00e1 acontecendo~!!",
        u"OMJIZZ! You think that\u2019s been the secret ingredient this whole time?!": u"OMJIZZ! Ser\u00e1 que esse era o ingrediente secreto esse tempo todo?!",
        u"OPEN THIS DOOR, EMILIA!": u"ABRA ESTA PORTA, EMILIA!",
        u"Obviously Emilia here hasn\u2019t gotten a taste of how we do things at Camp Buddy.": u"Obviamente Emilia ainda n\u00e3o experimentou como fazemos as coisas no Camp Buddy.",
        u"Obviously I don\u2019t stay with you guys, so, no! Alright, speak up, all of you!": u"Obviamente eu n\u00e3o fico com voc\u00eas, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o! Certo, falem, todos voc\u00eas!",
        u"Obviously! Otherwise, there wouldn\u2019t be a ring on Yoshi\u2019s finger~": u"\u00d3bvio! Caso contr\u00e1rio, n\u00e3o teria um anel no dedo do Yoshi~",
        u"Obviously, you're upset.": u"\u00c9 \u00f3bvio que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 chateado.",
        u"Occasionally, Sir Goro and I would help Lloyd and Darius with their department to accelerate the progress, not hesitating to get our hands dirty.": u"De vez em quando, eu e o Sr. Goro ajud\u00e1vamos Lloyd e Darius no departamento deles para acelerar o progresso, sem hesitar em colocar a m\u00e3o na massa.",
        u"Of all the ships to become real, why the two of you?!": u"De todos os casais que poderiam virar realidade, por que justamente voc\u00eas dois?!",
        u"Of all things she\u2019d dress me in, why a nutcracker?": u"De todas as coisas que ela poderia me vestir, por que um quebra-nozes?",
        u"Of course not! ": u"Claro que n\u00e3o! ",
        u"Of course not! I can\u2019t believe that you\u2019re accusing me of such things! Whoever told that to you is probably just making stuff up to get rid of me!": u"Claro que n\u00e3o! N\u00e3o acredito que esteja me acusando de coisas assim! Quem contou isso provavelmente est\u00e1 inventando tudo para se livrar de mim!",
        u"Of course!": u"Claro!",
        u"Of course! All of us here at Camp Buddy will be there for you!": u"Claro! Todos n\u00f3s aqui no Camp Buddy estaremos ao seu lado!",
        u"Of course! Bottom\u2019s Up guarantees our guests quality \u2018top\u2019 service just like our slogan says~": u"\u00c9 claro! O Bottom\u2019s Up garante aos h\u00f3spedes um servi\u00e7o de \u2018primeira\u2019, como diz nosso slogan~",
        u"Of course! I got a lot of work to do in here, so it\u2019s gonna get hot!": u"Claro! Tenho muito trabalho para fazer aqui, ent\u00e3o vai ficar quente!",
        u"Of course! I pride myself on cultivating talent!": u"Claro! Tenho orgulho de incentivar talentos!",
        u"Of course! I will send the details of how you have to prepare, along with the school information, dates, and curriculum as soon as possible!": u"Claro! Enviarei o quanto antes os detalhes de como voc\u00ea deve se preparar, junto com as informa\u00e7\u00f5es da escola, datas e curr\u00edculo!",
        u"Of course! It\u2019s really special to me.": u"Claro! \u00c9 muito especial para mim.",
        u"Of course! I\u2019d be happy to help you out~ What liquor do you usually fancy? Rum? Whiskey? Tequila? ": u"\u00c9 claro! Ficarei feliz em ajud\u00e1-los~ De que bebida costumam gostar? Rum? U\u00edsque? Tequila? ",
        u"Of course! I\u2019ve gathered you all here today to make a very IMPORTANT announcement regarding our productivity for the next few months.": u"Claro! Reuni todos aqui hoje para fazer um an\u00fancio muito IMPORTANTE sobre nossa produtividade nos pr\u00f3ximos meses.",
        u"Of course! Let me know if there\u2019s anything I can do to help.": u"Claro! Avise-me se houver algo que eu possa fazer para ajudar.",
        u"Of course! Now come on, let\u2019s get to sleep \u2013 we have a busy day tomorrow!": u"Claro! Agora vamos dormir \u2014 teremos um dia cheio amanh\u00e3!",
        u"Of course! Take your time!": u"Claro! Fiquem \u00e0 vontade!",
        u"Of course! They worked together the whole project, and they\u2019ve always been a pair since we were scouts.": u"Claro! Eles trabalharam juntos durante todo o projeto e sempre foram uma dupla desde quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros.",
        u"Of course! This hotel offers maximum luxury, fit for kings and queens!": u"Claro! Este hotel oferece luxo m\u00e1ximo, digno de reis e rainhas!",
        u"Of course! Until next time!": u"Claro! At\u00e9 a pr\u00f3xima!",
        u"Of course! We\u2019re scheduled to give you a full tour of the camp after lunch!": u"Claro! Est\u00e1 programado fazermos um passeio completo pelo acampamento depois do almo\u00e7o!",
        u"Of course, Aiden\u2026 I\u2019ll always be here for you. ": u"Claro, Aiden\u2026 Sempre estarei aqui por voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Of course, Dad! We\u2019ve all got your back!": u"Claro, pai! Todos n\u00f3s estamos do seu lado!",
        u"Of course, Goro. That makes sense.": u"Claro, Goro. Faz sentido.",
        u"Of course, Goro\u2026 ": u"Claro, Goro\u2026 ",
        u"Of course, Goro\u2026 I\u2019ll always be here for you. ": u"Claro, Goro\u2026 Sempre estarei aqui por voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Of course, I do. Maybe one day I\u2019ll get it back, if he still has it. ": u"Claro que sim. Talvez um dia eu a pegue de volta, se ele ainda estiver com ela. ",
        u"Of course, I have to make sure and be the first one up as the inspector! Don\u2019t twist my actions into something else to fit your narrative.": u"\u00c9 claro, como inspetora preciso garantir que sou a primeira a chegar! N\u00e3o distor\u00e7a minhas a\u00e7\u00f5es para encaix\u00e1-las na sua narrativa.",
        u"Of course, I love that about you just as much.": u"Claro, eu amo isso em voc\u00ea do mesmo jeito.",
        u"Of course, Mr. \u2018Sirius\u2019!": u"Claro, Sr. \u2018Sirius\u2019!",
        u"Of course, and you can call me Yoshi! ": u"Claro, e pode me chamar de Yoshi! ",
        u"Of course, it meant a lot to me, so I kept it safe.": u"\u00c9 claro, ele significava muito para mim, ent\u00e3o o guardei com cuidado.",
        u"Of course, of course.": u"Claro, claro.",
        u"Of course, sir! We wouldn\u2019t miss it!": u"Claro, senhor! N\u00e3o perder\u00edamos por nada!",
        u"Of course, sir! We wouldn\u2019t miss something this important!": u"Claro, senhor! N\u00e3o perder\u00edamos algo t\u00e3o importante!",
        u"Of course, sir! We\u2019re right behind you.": u"Claro, senhor! Estamos logo atr\u00e1s.",
        u"Of course, sir! Which would you prefer, red, white, or sparkling?": u"Claro, senhor! Qual preferem: tinto, branco ou espumante?",
        u"Of course, sir. That makes sense.": u"Claro, senhor. Faz sentido.",
        u"Of course, sir... If that\u2019s the case, we\u2019ll do our best to meet your expectations.": u"Claro, senhor... Se \u00e9 assim, faremos o poss\u00edvel para corresponder \u00e0s suas expectativas.",
        u"Of course, this celebration wouldn\u2019t be complete without a reward for everyone\u2019s hard work.": u"Claro, esta comemora\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o estaria completa sem uma recompensa pelo trabalho duro de todos.",
        u"Of course, with the camp president\u2019s approval and go signal.": u"Naturalmente, mediante a aprova\u00e7\u00e3o e autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o do presidente do acampamento.",
        u"Of course. Aiden was still trying to convince me to stay.": u"Claro. Aiden ainda estava tentando me convencer a ficar.",
        u"Of course. Call me if you need anything else.": u"Claro. Chamem-me se precisarem de mais alguma coisa.",
        u"Of course. I doubt you\u2019ll be able to walk properly after all that, hehehe!": u"Claro. Duvido que consiga andar direito depois de tudo isso, hehehe!",
        u"Of course. It\u2019s really special to me.": u"Claro. \u00c9 muito especial para mim.",
        u"Of course. Now come on, let\u2019s catch up with the others. There\u2019s still so much more to do!": u"Claro. Agora vamos alcan\u00e7ar os outros. Ainda temos muita coisa para fazer!",
        u"Of course. See you later.": u"Claro. At\u00e9 mais.",
        u"Of course. Unless you don\u2019t want it?": u"Claro. A menos que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o queira?",
        u"Of course. We do this every year anyway.": u"Claro. N\u00f3s fazemos isso todo ano mesmo.",
        u"Of course. We do this every year anyways. ": u"Claro. Fazemos isso todos os anos mesmo. ",
        u"Of course. Where did you think Yuri\u2019s artistic skills came from?": u"Claro. De onde voc\u00ea acha que vieram as habilidades art\u00edsticas da Yuri?",
        u"Of course~ It\u2019s my pleasure, hehe.": u"Claro~ O prazer \u00e9 meu, hehe.",
        u"Of course\u2026 We have all day long\u2026": u"Claro\u2026 Temos o dia inteiro\u2026",
        u"Off limits! Private property!": u"Proibido! Propriedade privada!",
        u"Oh Aiden! Why did you call? How have you been? ": u"Oh, Aiden! Por que ligou? Como voc\u00ea est\u00e1? ",
        u"Oh I dunno, Yoshi~ I\u2019m not convinced \u2019til I get a closer look!": u"Ah, sei n\u00e3o, Yoshi~ S\u00f3 vou acreditar depois de olhar mais de perto!",
        u"Oh boy! I can\u2019t wait to see what we ordered then!": u"Nossa! Ent\u00e3o mal posso esperar para ver o que pedimos!",
        u"Oh boy! We gotta see this, Yoshi!": u"Caramba! A gente precisa ver isso, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh boy, it did. It\u2019s hard to forget that detail. You looked like you were having the best time.": u"Ah, estava mesmo. \u00c9 dif\u00edcil esquecer esse detalhe. Voc\u00ea parecia estar se divertindo como nunca.",
        u"Oh boy, you don\u2019t know the half of it! Almost every scout was afraid of him back then! ": u"Ah, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe nem da metade! Quase todos os escoteiros tinham medo dele naquela \u00e9poca! ",
        u"Oh boy, you don\u2019t know the half of it. Dar might not look it, but he\u2019s quite the comedian, too!": u"Ah, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe nem da metade. Pode n\u00e3o parecer, mas o Dar tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 um grande comediante!",
        u"Oh come on, Yoshi! I\u2019m sure everyone\u2019d like to have my cakes for dessert!": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Yoshi! Tenho certeza de que todo mundo adoraria comer meus bolos de sobremesa!",
        u"Oh crap! He just died!": u"Caramba! Ele acabou de morrer!",
        u"Oh crap! I didn\u2019t notice the time! Haha, guess we had too much fun, huh Yoshi?": u"Ah, droga! Nem percebi a hora! Haha, acho que nos divertimos demais, hein, Yoshi?",
        u"Oh crap! She saw us\u2026!": u"Ah, droga! Ela viu a gente\u2026!",
        u"Oh crap, I don\u2019t even remember doing that\u2026 Sorry, Yoshi\u2026": u"Ah, droga, nem me lembro de ter feito isso\u2026 Desculpe, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Oh crap, that was close\u2026! I almost crashed into all the food\u2026": u"Ah, droga, essa foi por pouco\u2026! Quase ca\u00ed em cima de toda a comida\u2026",
        u"Oh crap\u2026 Don\u2019t tell me I got the bad ending on this route\u2026": u"Ah, droga\u2026 N\u00e3o me diga que peguei o final ruim desta rota\u2026",
        u"Oh dear, and it\u2019s all over that fine suit of yours \u2013 no, wait, that belongs to Mr. Clermont, doesn\u2019t it?": u"Oh, c\u00e9us, caiu tudo nesse seu belo terno \u2014 n\u00e3o, espere, ele pertence ao Sr. Clermont, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Oh dear, there\u2019ll be plenty of other times for that! ": u"Ah, querido, teremos muitas outras oportunidades para isso! ",
        u"Oh dear\u2026!": u"Oh, c\u00e9us\u2026!",
        u"Oh drats. Mind doing some washing while I get started prepping?": u"Ah, droga. Se importa de lavar a lou\u00e7a enquanto come\u00e7o a preparar as coisas?",
        u"Oh fuck, Yoshi\u2026 You\u2019re so huge, you make me feel full\u2026 ": u"Porra, Yoshi\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o enorme, me deixa completamente cheio\u2026 ",
        u"Oh god\u2026 that was so embarrassing, Aiden\u2026  Everybody saw you covered in\u2026 you know.": u"Meu Deus\u2026 isso foi t\u00e3o constrangedor, Aiden\u2026 Todo mundo viu voc\u00ea coberto de\u2026 voc\u00ea sabe.",
        u"Oh god\u2026 that was so embarrassing, Goro\u2026": u"Meu Deus\u2026 isso foi t\u00e3o constrangedor, Goro\u2026",
        u"Oh hello, Aiden! And\u2026 Emilia\u2026?": u"Oh, ol\u00e1, Aiden! E\u2026 Emilia\u2026?",
        u"Oh hey, Dad, Yoshi! Good of you two to finally join the party with everyone!": u"Oh, oi, Pai, Yoshi! Que bom que voc\u00eas finalmente vieram participar da festa com todo mundo!",
        u"Oh hey, Lloyd! I was wondering where you were.": u"Ah, ei, Lloyd! Eu estava me perguntando onde voc\u00ea estava.",
        u"Oh hey, Yoshi!": u"Oh, oi, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh hey, guys! Good morning! You\u2019re all up early!": u"Ah, ei, pessoal! Bom dia! Voc\u00eas acordaram cedo!",
        u"Oh hey, guys. ": u"Oh, oi, pessoal. ",
        u"Oh hey, you\u2019re up, Yoshi!": u"Ah, voc\u00ea acordou, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh man\u2026 How can I make a campfire if I can\u2019t even split wood?": u"Ah, cara\u2026 Como vou fazer uma fogueira se nem consigo rachar lenha?",
        u"Oh man\u2026 I might\u2019ve partied too much\u2026 ": u"Ah, cara\u2026 Acho que festejei demais\u2026 ",
        u"Oh my god! HAHAHAHA! You should\u2019ve taken pictures!": u"Meu Deus! HAHAHAHA! Voc\u00ea devia ter tirado fotos!",
        u"Oh my god!!! Could it be?!": u"Meu Deus!!! Ser\u00e1 que \u00e9 isso mesmo?!",
        u"Oh my god, Aiden!! Don\u2019t forget us when you\u2019re famous!": u"Meu Deus, Aiden!! N\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a da gente quando ficar famoso!",
        u"Oh my god, I did what?!": u"Meu Deus, eu fiz o qu\u00ea?!",
        u"Oh my god, I had forgotten about that\u2026 That was so criiiinge!!!": u"Meu Deus, eu tinha esquecido disso\u2026 Foi t\u00e3o vergonhooooso!!!",
        u"Oh my god, Yoshi!!! I\u2019m sooo happy for you! Isn\u2019t this your dream?!": u"Meu Deus, Yoshi!!! Estou t\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o feliz por voc\u00ea! Esse n\u00e3o \u00e9 o seu sonho?!",
        u"Oh my god, that\u2019s amazing, Yoshi!": u"Meu Deus, isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh my god\u2026 Can\u2019t we have this dinner without you trying to argue?": u"Meu Deus\u2026 N\u00e3o podemos ter este jantar sem voc\u00ea tentar arranjar uma discuss\u00e3o?",
        u"Oh my god\u2026 Everyone\u2019s still looking\u2026": u"Meu Deus\u2026 Todo mundo ainda est\u00e1 olhando\u2026",
        u"Oh my god\u2026 Is that who I think it is?! ": u"Meu Deus\u2026 \u00c9 quem eu estou pensando?! ",
        u"Oh my goodness, you might be having a heatstroke! Let\u2019s get some cotton to stop the bleeding\u2026 or better yet, you should take a cold shower!": u"Meu Deus, voc\u00ea pode estar sofrendo uma insola\u00e7\u00e3o! Vamos pegar algod\u00e3o para estancar o sangue\u2026 ou melhor, voc\u00ea deveria tomar um banho frio!",
        u"Oh my goodness, you must\u2019ve caught our jaws dropping when we walked in\u2026": u"Meu Deus, voc\u00ea deve ter registrado nossa cara de espanto quando entramos\u2026",
        u"Oh my gosh! You guys startled me!": u"Meu Deus! Voc\u00eas me assustaram!",
        u"Oh my! Who\u2019s this fine gentleman?": u"Minha nossa! Quem \u00e9 este belo cavalheiro?",
        u"Oh my, here we go again\u2026 Yoshi\u2026 *facepalm*": u"Ai, meu Deus, l\u00e1 vamos n\u00f3s de novo\u2026 Yoshi\u2026 *p\u00f5e a m\u00e3o no rosto*",
        u"Oh my\u2026": u"Meu Deus\u2026",
        u"Oh my\u2026 Let me get my laptop and we\u2019ll get started!": u"Minha nossa\u2026 Vou pegar meu notebook e come\u00e7amos!",
        u"Oh my\u2026 That sounded like a Yoshi speech, so I guess we know where he got it from\u2026": u"Oh, nossa\u2026 Isso pareceu um discurso do Yoshi, ent\u00e3o acho que sabemos de quem ele aprendeu\u2026",
        u"Oh no! A-Aiden, put something on\u2026!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o! A-Aiden, vista alguma coisa\u2026!",
        u"Oh no! And we worked all the way through lunch too! You must be starving!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o! E tamb\u00e9m trabalhamos durante todo o hor\u00e1rio do almo\u00e7o! Voc\u00ea deve estar morrendo de fome!",
        u"Oh no! G-Goro, toss me my pants\u2026!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o! G-Goro, jogue minha cal\u00e7a\u2026!",
        u"Oh no! Here come the waterworks for real! ": u"Ah, n\u00e3o! Agora as l\u00e1grimas v\u00eam de verdade! ",
        u"Oh no! I forgot to take one last group picture! ": u"Ah, n\u00e3o! Esqueci de tirar uma \u00faltima foto do grupo! ",
