        u"Oh no!! This isn\u2019t looking good, Dar! We have to check on the site!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o!! Isso n\u00e3o parece nada bom, Dar! Precisamos verificar a obra!",
        u"Oh no, Aiden\u2026 It\u2019s okay though! You can do it! I believe in you.": u"Oh, n\u00e3o, Aiden\u2026 Mas tudo bem! Voc\u00ea consegue! Eu acredito em voc\u00ea.",
        u"Oh no, I haven\u2019t yet! I came here as soon as I woke up!": u"Oh n\u00e3o, ainda n\u00e3o! Vim para c\u00e1 assim que acordei!",
