        u"Oh no, do you still feel sick from the bus ride this morning?": u"Oh, n\u00e3o, voc\u00ea ainda est\u00e1 passando mal por causa da viagem de \u00f4nibus desta manh\u00e3?",
        u"Oh no, no, no, NO.": u"Ah n\u00e3o, n\u00e3o, n\u00e3o, N\u00c3O.",
        u"Oh no, the other campers are coming in\u2026": u"Ah, n\u00e3o, os outros campistas est\u00e3o chegando\u2026",
        u"Oh no, where is everybody\u2026? ": u"Ah, n\u00e3o, onde est\u00e1 todo mundo\u2026? ",
        u"Oh no, you don\u2019t! It\u2019s your turn, Jin!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o escapa! \u00c9 sua vez, Jin!",
        u"Oh no. What did I say\u2026?": u"Ah, n\u00e3o. O que eu disse\u2026?",
        u"Oh no~ I guess you gonna have to strip too!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o~ Acho que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m vai ter que tirar a roupa!",
        u"Oh no\u2026": u"Ah, n\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Oh no\u2026 Is Ms. Emilia gonna get in trouble\u2026?": u"Ah, n\u00e3o\u2026 A Srta. Emilia vai se meter em problemas\u2026?",
        u"Oh no\u2026 With four of us missing, I\u2019m sure Sir Goro will notice\u2026!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o\u2026 Com quatro de n\u00f3s desaparecidos, tenho certeza de que o senhor Goro vai perceber\u2026!",
        u"Oh really? What happened then?": u"Ah, \u00e9 mesmo? E o que aconteceu depois?",
        u"Oh right! I remember a few times you got me and everybody else to throw a thing or two in there!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Lembro que algumas vezes voc\u00ea pediu para mim e para o resto do pessoal colocarmos uma coisa ou outra l\u00e1!",
        u"Oh right! That\u2019s why you had to do the announcement thingy a while ago\u2026": u"Ah, \u00e9! Por isso voc\u00ea teve que fazer aquele an\u00fancio mais cedo\u2026",
        u"Oh right, sorry for the tangent.": u"Ah, certo, desculpe pela distra\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Oh right, that\u2019s a good idea. I don\u2019t think that was on my checklist \u2013 good thing you thought of it.": u"Ah, certo, \u00e9 uma boa ideia. Acho que isso n\u00e3o estava na minha lista \u2014 ainda bem que voc\u00ea se lembrou.",
        u"Oh right, the guys will probably be up soon.": u"Ah, \u00e9, os caras provavelmente v\u00e3o acordar logo.",
        u"Oh right, they should be showing up in just a couple of days.": u"Ah, \u00e9, eles devem chegar daqui a apenas alguns dias.",
        u"Oh right, they should be showing up tomorrow.": u"Ah, \u00e9, eles devem chegar amanh\u00e3.",
        u"Oh right. Then your turn, Lloyd. Truth or dare?": u"Ah, \u00e9. Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 sua vez, Lloyd. Verdade ou desafio?",
        u"Oh right\u2026 that\u2019s today!": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 \u00e9 hoje!",
        u"Oh shit\u2026 oh shit\u2026": u"Merda\u2026 merda\u2026",
        u"Oh something\u2019s overloaded for sure. Just look at his pants~": u"Ah, alguma coisa est\u00e1 sobrecarregada com certeza. \u00c9 s\u00f3 olhar para a cal\u00e7a dele~",
        u"Oh wait, Aiden. I almost forgot Jin\u2019s here too. Why don\u2019t we ask him if he wants some soup as well?": u"Ah, espere, Aiden. Quase esqueci que o Jin tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 aqui. Por que n\u00e3o perguntamos se ele quer sopa tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"Oh well, I guess we better start our day as well and see what we can work on.": u"Bem, acho melhor come\u00e7armos nosso dia tamb\u00e9m e vermos no que podemos trabalhar.",
        u"Oh well, there\u2019s always next time. Right, Yoshi?": u"Bom, sempre haver\u00e1 uma pr\u00f3xima vez. N\u00e3o \u00e9, Yoshi?",
        u"Oh wooow, don\u2019t you two look classy?": u"Oh, uaaau, voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o est\u00e3o elegantes?",
        u"Oh wow! I didn\u2019t think you\u2019d do that kind of job, sir\u2026!": u"Nossa! N\u00e3o pensei que o senhor faria esse tipo de trabalho\u2026!",
        u"Oh wow! Like a camp history!": u"Ah, uau! Tipo uma hist\u00f3ria do acampamento!",
        u"Oh wow! Score!": u"Nossa! A\u00ed sim!",
        u"Oh wow! Thank you, Sir Goro! ": u"Nossa! Obrigado, Sr. Goro! ",
        u"Oh wow! You both look amazing!": u"Nossa! Voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o incr\u00edveis!",
        u"Oh wow, so it\u2019s basically a prehistoric relic\u2026": u"Nossa, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 praticamente uma rel\u00edquia pr\u00e9-hist\u00f3rica\u2026",
        u"Oh wow\u2026 I was sure you were a model scout like Yoshi\u2026": u"Nossa\u2026 Eu tinha certeza de que voc\u00ea era uma escoteira exemplar como o Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Oh wow\u2026 This seems like a lot to do\u2026 and you have to make thirty servings of this?!": u"Nossa\u2026 Parece muito trabalho\u2026 E voc\u00ea precisa preparar trinta por\u00e7\u00f5es disso?!",
        u"Oh yeaaaah, where did that come from?!": u"Ah, \u00e9\u00e9\u00e9\u00e9, de onde ela veio?!",
        u"Oh yeaaaahhh... I almost forgot about that. Mr. Clermont got them some special tickets to an island resort, right?!": u"Ah, \u00e9\u00e9\u00e9\u00e9\u2026 Quase esqueci disso. O Sr. Clermont conseguiu para eles ingressos especiais para um resort numa ilha, certo?!",
        u"Oh yeah! Good thinking, Dad! ": u"Ah, sim! Boa ideia, pai! ",
        u"Oh yeah! He told me to wake him up for that\u2026!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Ele me pediu para acord\u00e1-lo para isso\u2026!",
        u"Oh yeah! I can see us on the monitor!": u"Ah, sim! Consigo ver a gente no monitor!",
        u"Oh yeah! I got a bunch of their numbers too, so if you guys ever wanna party with some rich dudes, hit me up~!": u"Ah, sim! Tamb\u00e9m peguei o n\u00famero de v\u00e1rios deles, ent\u00e3o se algum dia quiserem festejar com uns caras ricos, \u00e9 s\u00f3 me chamar~!",
        u"Oh yeah! That was so satisfying! In my head I was like \u201cYesss! Yesss! Get her, Dad!\u201d": u"Ah, sim! Foi t\u00e3o satisfat\u00f3rio! Na minha cabe\u00e7a eu estava tipo: \u201cSiiim! Siiim! Acaba com ela, pai!\u201d",
        u"Oh yeah! That was so satisfying! In my head I was like \u201cYesss! Yesss! Get her, Yoshi!\u201d": u"Ah, sim! Foi t\u00e3o satisfat\u00f3rio! Na minha cabe\u00e7a, eu s\u00f3 pensava: \u201cIsso! Isso! Acaba com ela, Yoshi!\u201d",
        u"Oh yeah! That\u2019s even more important than all this \u2013 what the heck were you doing?!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Isso \u00e9 ainda mais importante que tudo isso \u2014 o que diabos voc\u00ea estava fazendo?!",
        u"Oh yeah! We worked together on some minor repairs and furniture assembly!": u"Ah, sim! Trabalhamos juntos em alguns pequenos reparos e montagem de m\u00f3veis!",
        u"Oh yeah! You can add that to that blog you\u2019ve been working on!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Voc\u00ea pode colocar isso naquele blog em que est\u00e1 trabalhando!",
        u"Oh yeah, Gramps! Does this mean you\u2019re officially retiring too?": u"Ah, \u00e9, Vov\u00f4! Isso significa que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m vai se aposentar oficialmente?",
        u"Oh yeah, I forgot that you get sunburnt really easily, don\u2019t you?": u"Ah, \u00e9, esqueci que voc\u00ea se queima muito f\u00e1cil no sol, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Oh yeah, I heard she made quite the scene when she was enrolled here a few days ago\u2026": u"Ah, sim, ouvi dizer que ela causou um grande esc\u00e2ndalo quando foi matriculada aqui, alguns dias atr\u00e1s\u2026",
        u"Oh yeah, I noticed it as soon as I got in here! It looks really cool, Jin! Thank you!": u"Ah, sim, notei assim que entrei! Ele parece muito legal, Jin! Obrigada!",
        u"Oh yeah, I noticed that too. These unused cabins don\u2019t have them. ": u"Ah, \u00e9, eu tamb\u00e9m reparei. Essas cabanas sem uso n\u00e3o t\u00eam divis\u00f3rias. ",
        u"Oh yeah, I remember the first time I saw it! Do you guys remember that?": u"Ah, \u00e9! Eu lembro da primeira vez que vi! Voc\u00eas lembram disso?",
        u"Oh yeah, I saw. It looks like it\u2019s not stopping anytime soon either.": u"Ah, sim, eu vi. E parece que n\u00e3o vai parar t\u00e3o cedo.",
        u"Oh yeah, let me introduce you! You\u2019re going to love them!": u"Ah, sim, deixe-me apresentar voc\u00eas! Voc\u00ea vai ador\u00e1-los!",
        u"Oh yeah, speaking of Gramps, shouldn\u2019t he be back by now?": u"Ah, sim, falando no Vov\u00f4, ele j\u00e1 n\u00e3o deveria ter voltado?",
        u"Oh yeah, they\u2019re chaotic. But in a good way!": u"Ah, sim, eles s\u00e3o ca\u00f3ticos. Mas no bom sentido!",
        u"Oh yeah, we used to do that all the time when we were scouts too!": u"Ah, sim, faz\u00edamos isso o tempo todo quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Oh yeah, where is everyone else? They all ran off suddenly and I haven\u2019t seen them yet\u2026": u"Ah, \u00e9, onde est\u00e1 todo mundo? Todos sa\u00edram correndo de repente e ainda n\u00e3o os vi\u2026",
        u"Oh yeah, you guys haven\u2019t met the new crew! ": u"Ah, \u00e9, voc\u00eas ainda n\u00e3o conheceram a nova equipe! ",
        u"Oh yeah. I don\u2019t see Aiden around. Maybe he\u2019s making another serving!": u"Ah, \u00e9. N\u00e3o estou vendo Aiden por aqui. Talvez esteja preparando outra por\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Oh yeah?": u"Ah \u00e9?",
        u"Oh yeah? ": u"Ah \u00e9? ",
        u"Oh yeah? I think the bulge in your pants disagrees~": u"Ah, \u00e9? Acho que o volume na sua sunga discorda~",
        u"Oh yeah? I\u2019d like to see you try!": u"Ah, \u00e9? Quero ver tentar!",
        u"Oh yeah? I\u2019d like to see you try.": u"Ah, \u00e9? Quero s\u00f3 ver voc\u00ea tentar.",
        u"Oh yeah? Like what?": u"Ah, \u00e9? Quais?",
        u"Oh yeah? Make sure you scrub me clean, then~": u"Ah, \u00e9? Ent\u00e3o trate de me esfregar bem~",
        u"Oh yeah? Remember when we went to the beach last summer and you kept asking me for your razor?": u"Ah, \u00e9? Lembra quando fomos \u00e0 praia no ver\u00e3o passado e voc\u00ea ficou me pedindo seu barbeador?",
