        u"Oh yeah\u2026 But you guys get my point! A job at Clermont Inc. is really as prestigious as it gets! It\u2019ll be really good for your resume!": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 Mas voc\u00eas entenderam! Um emprego na Clermont Inc. \u00e9 o m\u00e1ximo em prest\u00edgio! Vai ficar \u00f3timo no seu curr\u00edculo!",
