        u"Oh yeah\u2026 Gramps\u2019s the one who\u2019s gonna have to explain all this\u2026 Did he talk to him yet?": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 O Vov\u00f4 \u00e9 quem vai ter que explicar tudo isso\u2026 Ele j\u00e1 falou com ele?",
        u"Oh yeah\u2026 I don\u2019t think I told you, but it was actually my dad\u2019s dream to become a chef.": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 Acho que nunca contei, mas o sonho do meu pai era se tornar chef.",
        u"Oh yeah\u2026 It was on a camping trip, if I remember right\u2026": u"Ah, sim\u2026 Foi durante uma viagem de acampamento, se bem me lembro\u2026",
