        u"Oh yeah\u2026 you\u2019re right about that\u2026 ": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 ",
        u"Oh yeah\u2026 you\u2019re the one doing that now since Emilia is tapped out.": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 agora \u00e9 voc\u00ea quem est\u00e1 fazendo isso, j\u00e1 que Emilia est\u00e1 fora de combate.",
        u"Oh yeah\u2026?": u"Ah \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"Oh yeah\u2026? Now it\u2019s my turn, isn\u2019t it\u2026?": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026? Agora \u00e9 a minha vez, n\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026?",
        u"Oh! ": u"Ah! ",
        u"Oh! Actually, we could continue with that journal project maybe? I had a lot of fun last time we did it together!": u"Ah! Na verdade, talvez pud\u00e9ssemos continuar aquele projeto do di\u00e1rio? Eu me diverti muito da \u00faltima vez que fizemos isso juntos!",
