        u"Oh! And if you\u2019d like, I can get out a bit of elbow grease and help you clear the snow myself too, haha!": u"Ah! E, se quiserem, posso arrega\u00e7ar as mangas e ajudar pessoalmente a limpar a neve tamb\u00e9m, haha!",
        u"Oh! And one more thing.": u"Ah! E mais uma coisa.",
        u"Oh! Hey there, Yoshi! ": u"Ah! Ol\u00e1, Yoshi! ",
