        u"Oh! That\u2019d be nice! ": u"Ah! Seria \u00f3timo! ",
        u"Oh! The seafood menu has a lot of fancy sounding ones! Should I get the ceviche? The quenelle? Or the acqua pazza?": u"Ah! O card\u00e1pio de frutos do mar tem um monte de nomes chiques! Devo pedir ceviche? Quenelle? Ou acqua pazza?",
        u"Oh! There they are! ": u"Ah! A\u00ed est\u00e3o eles! ",
        u"Oh! There you are, Yoshi!": u"Ah! A\u00ed est\u00e1 voc\u00ea, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh! They\u2019re back, you guys!": u"Oh! Eles voltaram, pessoal!",
        u"Oh! This is perfect! You and I are winning for sure, Emilia!": u"Oh! Isto \u00e9 perfeito! Eu e voc\u00ea vamos ganhar com certeza, Emilia!",
        u"Oh! Yes, sir?": u"Ah! Sim, senhor?",
        u"Oh! Yoshi, Aiden! ": u"Ah! Yoshi, Aiden! ",
        u"Oh! Yoshi\u2019s over there by the arch! And it looks like he\u2019s with some people!": u"Ah! O Yoshi est\u00e1 ali perto do arco! E parece que est\u00e1 com algumas pessoas!",
        u"Oh! You okay, Yoshi?": u"Oh! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshi?",
        u"Oh, Aiden needs some help again in the kitchen.": u"Ah, Aiden precisa novamente de ajuda na cozinha.",
        u"Oh, Aiden! You\u2019re up!": u"Ah, Aiden! Voc\u00ea acordou!",
        u"Oh, Aiden\u2026!": u"Ah, Aiden\u2026!",
        u"Oh, Clermont Inc. actually reached out to a bunch of different construction firms with the basics of the project.": u"Ah, na verdade, a Clermont Inc. entrou em contato com v\u00e1rias construtoras, apresentando os pontos b\u00e1sicos do projeto.",
        u"Oh, Dar and I will come help you, Aiden! Drawing pretty much reminds us of work!": u"Oh, eu e Dar vamos ajudar voc\u00ea, Aiden! Desenhar praticamente lembra nosso trabalho!",
        u"Oh, Emilia and I were grabbing supplies to clean the mess hall thoroughly before the workers arrived. ": u"Ah, eu e Emilia viemos buscar materiais para limpar bem o refeit\u00f3rio antes que os trabalhadores cheguem. ",
        u"Oh, Hi Dad, Yoshi! I haven\u2019t seen you guys since we split up at the lobby!": u"Oh, oi, pai, Yoshi! N\u00e3o vejo voc\u00eas desde que nos separamos no sagu\u00e3o!",
        u"Oh, I KNOW! It\u2019s because you\u2019re the owner\u2019s daughter! Talk about rampant nepotism! This camp is absolutely ridiculous!!!": u"Ah, eu SEI! \u00c9 porque voc\u00ea \u00e9 filha do dono! Isso sim \u00e9 nepotismo descarado! Este acampamento \u00e9 completamente rid\u00edculo!!!",
        u"Oh, I actually know a nice foot spa recipe that\u2019ll ease that right away! Add some cucumbers and a mud mask, and we\u2019ll have a proper spa day!": u"Ah, na verdade conhe\u00e7o uma \u00f3tima receita de spa para os p\u00e9s que vai aliviar isso na hora! Acrescente pepinos e uma m\u00e1scara de lama e teremos um verdadeiro dia de spa!",
        u"Oh, I almost forgot to ask\u2026 How are the other departments doing?": u"Oh, quase esqueci de perguntar\u2026 Como est\u00e3o os outros departamentos?",
        u"Oh, I already took care of those! I was up past midnight dusting off the floors and putting sheets on the beds.": u"Ah, j\u00e1 cuidei disso! Fiquei acordada depois da meia-noite limpando o ch\u00e3o e colocando len\u00e7\u00f3is nas camas.",
        u"Oh, I apologize for my assumption.": u"Oh, pe\u00e7o desculpas pela minha suposi\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Oh, I can give you one if you\u2014": u"Ah, eu posso fazer uma no senhor se\u2014",
        u"Oh, I do! It\u2019s similar with Sir Goro, right? He was very \u2018strict\u2019 before, too! Now he\u2019s all nice and friendly!": u"Ah, eu entendi! \u00c9 parecido com o Sr. Goro, certo? Ele tamb\u00e9m era bem \u2018r\u00edgido\u2019 antes! Agora \u00e9 todo gentil e amig\u00e1vel!",
        u"Oh, I don\u2019t mind~ Just wanted you to use that mouth on the real gift here~": u"Oh, eu n\u00e3o me importo~ S\u00f3 queria que voc\u00ea usasse essa boca no verdadeiro presente aqui~",
        u"Oh, I dunno, maybe like\u2026 a famous pop-culture scientist turned into this one episode!": u"Ah, sei l\u00e1, talvez tipo\u2026 aquilo em que um cientista famoso da cultura pop se transformou em um epis\u00f3dio!",
        u"Oh, I dunno\u2026 Something about this whole thing is making me low-key anxious\u2026": u"Ah, sei l\u00e1\u2026 Tem alguma coisa nessa situa\u00e7\u00e3o toda que est\u00e1 me deixando meio ansioso\u2026",
        u"Oh, I forgot Jin has the same\u2026 interests as Yuri. Maybe he\u2019s a little\u2026 overwhelmed?": u"Ah, esqueci que Jin tem os mesmos\u2026 interesses que Yuri. Talvez ele esteja um pouco\u2026 sobrecarregado?",
        u"Oh, I get you! I never jump into the action without proper prep, or else it\u2019d really hurt my ass!": u"Ah, eu entendo! Nunca entro em a\u00e7\u00e3o sem a prepara\u00e7\u00e3o adequada, sen\u00e3o meu traseiro acaba sofrendo!",
        u"Oh, I guess my hunch was wrong this time~": u"Ah, acho que meu palpite estava errado desta vez~",
        u"Oh, I handled more of the permit work that Mr. Clermont needed down at the city hall. ": u"Ah, cuidei de mais algumas licen\u00e7as de que o Sr. Clermont precisava na prefeitura. ",
        u"Oh, I have an idea! You should add a lot of computers next term! Or maybe a few gaming consoles\u2026 or even better, VR!": u"Ah, tive uma ideia! Voc\u00eas deveriam colocar v\u00e1rios computadores na pr\u00f3xima temporada! Ou alguns consoles\u2026 ou melhor ainda, realidade virtual!",
        u"Oh, I have an idea, Aiden! ": u"Ah, tive uma ideia, Aiden! ",
        u"Oh, I hope it wasn\u2019t too difficult.": u"Ah, espero que n\u00e3o tenha sido muito dif\u00edcil.",
        u"Oh, I just finished here, so I can chop some right away!": u"Ah, acabei de terminar aqui, ent\u00e3o posso cortar um pouco agora mesmo!",
        u"Oh, I just got an idea! You should move into our cabin from now on!": u"Ah, tive uma ideia! De agora em diante, voc\u00ea deveria se mudar para nossa cabana!",
        u"Oh, I just had to, uhh\u2026 do a few chores along the way. ": u"Ah, eu s\u00f3 precisei, uhh\u2026 fazer algumas tarefas no caminho. ",
        u"Oh, I need you to talk with the representatives. I\u2019m sure you\u2019re way better than me when it comes to that kind of formal talk.": u"Ah, preciso que converse com os representantes. Tenho certeza de que voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito melhor do que eu nesse tipo de conversa formal.",
        u"Oh, I remember! Yoshi and I had \u2018Sex on the Beach!\u2019": u"Ah, lembrei! Eu e o Yoshi tomamos \u2018Sex on the Beach\u2019!",
        u"Oh, I see! Hello, nice to meet you guys! I\u2019m Jin! I was sent here to work on tech upgrades for the camp!": u"Ah, entendo! Ol\u00e1, \u00e9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-los! Sou Jin! Fui enviado para trabalhar nas melhorias tecnol\u00f3gicas do acampamento!",
        u"Oh, I see! I\u2019m sorry I missed it\u2026 I wish I\u2019d gotten up earlier to join in!": u"Ah, entendi! Sinto muito por ter perdido\u2026 Queria ter acordado mais cedo para participar!",
        u"Oh, I see\u2026 Well, they\u2019re gonna take a while in there for sure! If you want, you can help me with my badge-earning activity!": u"Ah, entendo\u2026 Bem, eles certamente v\u00e3o demorar l\u00e1 dentro! Se quiser, pode me ajudar na atividade para conquistar o distintivo!",
        u"Oh, I see\u2026!": u"Ah, entendi\u2026!",
        u"Oh, I see\u2026! I hope you\u2019re not stressing yourself out, though.": u"Ah, entendo\u2026! S\u00f3 espero que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o esteja se sobrecarregando.",
        u"Oh, I think so! Looks like he\u2019s headed into that private room\u2026 Wonder what he\u2019s up to?": u"Oh, acho que sim! Parece que ele est\u00e1 entrando naquela sala privativa\u2026 O que ser\u00e1 que est\u00e1 fazendo?",
        u"Oh, I totally get you! It\u2019s why I turned down Mr. Clermont\u2019s offer, too.": u"Ah, eu entendo perfeitamente! Foi por isso que tamb\u00e9m recusei a oferta do Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Oh, I wanna check that out!": u"Oh, quero ver isso!",
        u"Oh, I want to check the gym out, sir!": u"Oh, quero conhecer a academia, senhor!",
        u"Oh, I was only acknowledging Taiga and Emilia\u2019s redemption journey!": u"Ah, eu s\u00f3 estava reconhecendo a jornada de reden\u00e7\u00e3o do Taiga e da Emilia!",
        u"Oh, I was planning to bring all this to the laundry room later \u2013 why are you working on it, Emilia? ": u"Ah, eu estava planejando levar tudo isso para a lavanderia depois \u2014 por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 cuidando disso, Emilia? ",
        u"Oh, I\u2019d love it if you sandwiched my hotdog.": u"Oh, eu adoraria se voc\u00ea prensasse meu cachorro-quente.",
        u"Oh, I\u2019d love to see you wear the outfit!": u"Oh, eu adoraria ver voc\u00ea usando essa roupa!",
        u"Oh, I\u2019ll cream fill your donut hole.": u"Oh, eu vou encher seu buraquinho de creme.",
        u"Oh, I\u2019ll fill you up alright~! You wanna do it right here and now?": u"Ah, eu vou encher voc\u00ea direitinho~! Quer fazer aqui e agora?",
        u"Oh, I\u2019ll help you out, Aiden!": u"Oh, eu ajudo voc\u00ea, Aiden!",
        u"Oh, I\u2019ll show you a whole meat baguette.": u"Oh, eu vou mostrar uma baguete inteira de carne para voc\u00ea.",
        u"Oh, I\u2019m just waiting for Dad to finish his staff meeting\u2026 He asked me to stay put and wait here...": u"Ah, s\u00f3 estou esperando o papai terminar a reuni\u00e3o da equipe\u2026 Ele pediu que eu ficasse parado esperando aqui\u2026",
        u"Oh, I\u2019m not letting you do that, Jin! You can use mine!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o vou permitir isso, Jin! Pode usar a minha!",
        u"Oh, I\u2019m sorry about that, Mr. Andre\u2026! I was the one who invited Aiden to help me with my badge-earning activity!": u"Ah, desculpe por isso, senhor Andre\u2026! Fui eu quem convidou o Aiden para me ajudar na atividade do distintivo!",
        u"Oh, I\u2019m sure Aiden can do it! He\u2019s made everything from burgers to steaks!": u"Ah, tenho certeza de que o Aiden consegue! Ele j\u00e1 fez de tudo, de hamb\u00fargueres a bifes!",
        u"Oh, Jin\u2026! Did you need anything?": u"Oh, Jin\u2026! Precisava de alguma coisa?",
        u"Oh, Sir Goro! I can be in charge of the tents! ": u"Ah, Sr. Goro! Eu posso ficar respons\u00e1vel pelas barracas!",
        u"Oh, Sir Goro! I thought you were in the office.": u"Ah, Sr. Goro! Achei que estivesse no escrit\u00f3rio.",
        u"Oh, Yoshi, look over there! Are you seeing what I\u2019m seeing?": u"Ah, Yoshi, olhe ali! Est\u00e1 vendo o que eu estou vendo?",
        u"Oh, Yuri, dear. What brings you he\u2014": u"Ah, Yuri, querida. O que a traz at\u00e9 a\u2014",
        u"Oh, already?! Time\u2019s moved so fast the past few days\u2026": u"Oh, j\u00e1?! O tempo passou t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido nestes \u00faltimos dias\u2026",
        u"Oh, and Aiden, make sure to tell Yoshi what you REALLY think about his cooking, okay?!": u"Ah, e Aiden, diga ao Yoshi o que REALMENTE achou da comida dele, est\u00e1 bem?!",
        u"Oh, and I noticed we have a new printer too?": u"Ah, e percebi que tamb\u00e9m temos uma impressora nova?",
        u"Oh, and Mr. Flynn, please do let me know! I have high hopes for you!": u"Ah, e Sr. Flynn, n\u00e3o deixe de me avisar! Tenho grandes expectativas para voc\u00ea!",
        u"Oh, and did I mention there\u2019s always a risk of getting mauled by a bear while you sleep?": u"Ah, e mencionei que sempre existe o risco de um urso atacar voc\u00ea enquanto dorme?",
        u"Oh, and don\u2019t forget noisy chewing and lip-smacking. That\u2019s just disgustingly barbaric.": u"Oh, e n\u00e3o se esque\u00e7am de mastigar fazendo barulho ou estalar os l\u00e1bios. Isso \u00e9 simplesmente barbaramente nojento.",
        u"Oh, and guess what, Gramps? The foremen are actually two former campers of ours, Darius and Lloyd! Remember them?": u"Ah, e adivinhe s\u00f3, Vov\u00f4? Os mestres de obras s\u00e3o, na verdade, dois ex-campistas nossos, Darius e Lloyd! Lembra deles?",
        u"Oh, and isn\u2019t that Yuri over there?": u"Ah, aquela ali n\u00e3o \u00e9 a Yuri?",
        u"Oh, and speaking of reasons we\u2019re here\u2026": u"Oh, e falando nos motivos de estarmos aqui\u2026",
        u"Oh, and the other two are just regular background characters.": u"Ah, e os outros dois s\u00e3o apenas personagens secund\u00e1rios comuns.",
        u"Oh, and the password is CUMBODY69\u2026.": u"Ah, e a senha \u00e9 CUMBODY69\u2026",
        u"Oh, are you his pimp? ": u"Ah, voc\u00ea \u00e9 o cafet\u00e3o dele? ",
        u"Oh, arms, huh? I\u2019m kinda surprised you wanna work on those, Yoshi!": u"Ah, bra\u00e7os, hein? Estou surpreso que queira exercit\u00e1-los, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh, but I bet Jin can fix those! He\u2019s got so many computer skills, surely that\u2019s one of them too!": u"Ah, mas aposto que Jin pode consert\u00e1-las! Ele tem tantas habilidades com computadores que certamente essa tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 uma delas!",
        u"Oh, but everyone worked hard on the decorations! And of course, Mr. Andre and Aiden cooked all the food!": u"Oh, mas todo mundo trabalhou muito nas decora\u00e7\u00f5es! E, claro, Sr. Andre e Aiden fizeram toda a comida!",
        u"Oh, come on guys, we\u2019re here for a vacation! Mr. Clermont expects us to have fun and relax here!": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, pessoal, estamos aqui de f\u00e9rias! O Sr. Clermont espera que a gente se divirta e relaxe aqui!",
        u"Oh, come on! It\u2019s fine! I always like to smack some wood and work my muscles up!": u"Ah, que isso! Tudo bem! Sempre gosto de rachar umas toras e exercitar os m\u00fasculos!",
        u"Oh, come on! I\u2019m literally just gonna go over there! ": u"Ah, qual \u00e9! Eu literalmente s\u00f3 vou ali! ",
        u"Oh, come on! People go to places like this looking for a \u2018spicy\u2019 kind of fun~": u"Ah, qual \u00e9! As pessoas v\u00e3o a lugares assim em busca de uma divers\u00e3o mais \u2018picante\u2019~",
        u"Oh, come on, Aiden! When are you ever gonna let that go?": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Aiden! Quando voc\u00ea vai esquecer isso?",
        u"Oh, come on, Aiden. We do it all the time.": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Aiden. Fazemos isso o tempo todo.",
        u"Oh, come on, Dad!": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, pai!",
        u"Oh, come on, Yoshi! Aren\u2019t we trying to poach Jin here?": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Yoshi! N\u00e3o estamos tentando recrutar o Jin para c\u00e1?",
        u"Oh, come on, Yoshi! We both know you\u2019ve been busy with your own tasks during the term. Besides, you\u2019ve really been helping me with chores this off-season!": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Yoshi! N\u00f3s dois sabemos que voc\u00ea esteve ocupado com suas pr\u00f3prias tarefas durante a temporada. Al\u00e9m disso, tem me ajudado muito com os afazeres nesta baixa temporada!",
        u"Oh, come on, Yoshi. I know you want to see them too~": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, Yoshi. Eu sei que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m quer ver~",
        u"Oh, come on, don\u2019t use the father card on me\u2026 ": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, n\u00e3o use a carta de pai contra mim\u2026 ",
        u"Oh, come on, haven\u2019t you already given me that exact same advice multiple times?": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 n\u00e3o me deu exatamente esse mesmo conselho v\u00e1rias vezes?",
        u"Oh, come on, that\u2019s not what the camp spirit is about! ": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, n\u00e3o \u00e9 esse o esp\u00edrito do acampamento!",
        u"Oh, come on, you guys! No one\u2019s sleeping on the couch. Dar and I can just share one bed!": u"Ah, qual \u00e9, pessoal! Ningu\u00e9m vai dormir no sof\u00e1. Dar e eu podemos simplesmente dividir uma cama!",
        u"Oh, come on, you just look at their application forms and see who wrote \u201cwriting\u201d as their hobbies.": u"Ah, qual \u00e9! Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 olha as fichas de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e v\u00ea quem colocou \u201cescrever\u201d como passatempo.",
        u"Oh, crap, Emilia\u2019s here too! Quick, Yoshi, let\u2019s scram!": u"Ah, droga, Emilia tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 aqui! R\u00e1pido, Yoshi, vamos dar o fora!",
        u"Oh, don\u2019t bother denying it! It\u2019s okay to admit you like the scouts~": u"Oh, nem adianta negar! Tudo bem admitir que voc\u00ea gosta dos escoteiros~",
        u"Oh, don\u2019t get me started! This pink thing was trying to get us killed with how reckless she is behind the wheel!": u"Oh, nem me fa\u00e7a come\u00e7ar! Essa coisa rosa quase fez a gente morrer com o jeito imprudente que dirige!",
        u"Oh, don\u2019t give me that bullshit! Why can\u2019t you admit that the real reason you\u2019re doing this is only for yourself?!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o venha com essa merda! Por que n\u00e3o admite que o verdadeiro motivo de estar fazendo isso \u00e9 s\u00f3 por voc\u00ea mesmo?!",
        u"Oh, don\u2019t think like that, Jin! We encourage everyone\u2019s hobbies and interests here at Camp Buddy! So please feel free to express yourself!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o pense assim, Jin! Aqui no Camp Buddy, incentivamos os passatempos e interesses de todos! Portanto, fique \u00e0 vontade para se expressar!",
        u"Oh, don\u2019t worry, Dad! I\u2019m just making sure everything\u2019s perfect for you and Yoshi~": u"Oh, n\u00e3o se preocupe, Pai! S\u00f3 estou garantindo que tudo fique perfeito para voc\u00ea e Yoshi~",
        u"Oh, drats! ": u"Oh, droga! ",
        u"Oh, good idea Yoshi! If we do all the prep work today, I can cook up something special for them tomorrow!": u"Ah, boa ideia, Yoshi! Se fizermos toda a prepara\u00e7\u00e3o hoje, amanh\u00e3 posso cozinhar algo especial para eles!",
        u"Oh, great\u2026 New people. ": u"Ah, \u00f3timo\u2026 Gente nova. ",
        u"Oh, haha! It\u2019s nothing! My wife\u2019s just a little tired, is all!": u"Ah, haha! N\u00e3o \u00e9 nada! Minha esposa s\u00f3 est\u00e1 um pouco cansada!",
        u"Oh, haha! Most of them are construction workers, so they do tend to be more fit.": u"Ah, haha! A maioria \u00e9 formada por trabalhadores da constru\u00e7\u00e3o, ent\u00e3o eles realmente tendem a estar em melhor forma.",
        u"Oh, he left not long before you got up. I\u2019m not sure what for though\u2026": u"Oh, ele saiu pouco antes de voc\u00ea acordar. Mas n\u00e3o sei para qu\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Oh, he said he went off to grab some booze for us! I think he\u2019s pulling something special out of his office.": u"Ah, ele disse que foi buscar umas bebidas para n\u00f3s! Acho que est\u00e1 pegando alguma coisa especial no escrit\u00f3rio.",
        u"Oh, he went out not too long before you got up. I\u2019m not sure what for though\u2026": u"Ah, ele saiu pouco antes de voc\u00eas acordarem. Mas n\u00e3o sei para qu\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Oh, hello there, Yoshi, Aiden!": u"Ah, ol\u00e1, Yoshi, Aiden!",
        u"Oh, hey Dad! It\u2019s probably time to cook dinner, right?": u"Ah, oi, pai! Deve estar na hora de preparar o jantar, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Oh, hey Gramps! Didn\u2019t see you there! Finished taking a dump? ": u"Ah, ei, Vov\u00f4! Nem vi voc\u00ea a\u00ed! Terminou de cagar? ",
        u"Oh, hey Yoshi!": u"Oh, oi, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh, hey Yoshi! You\u2019re back!": u"Ah, ei, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea voltou!",
        u"Oh, hey guys! I was just doing some repairs. Dad let me help him today!": u"Ah, oi, pessoal! Eu s\u00f3 estava fazendo alguns reparos. Meu pai deixou eu ajudar hoje!",
        u"Oh, hey there you two! Thanks for bringing them and helping clean up!": u"Oh, ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas dois! Obrigado por trazerem e ajudarem na limpeza!",
        u"Oh, hey there, you two! Good morning!": u"Ah, ol\u00e1, voc\u00eas duas! Bom dia!",
        u"Oh, hey! Good morning, Yoshi!": u"Oh, ei! Bom dia, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh, hey, Yoshinori. I\u2019m just doing my daily morning yoga.": u"Ah, ol\u00e1, Yoshinori. S\u00f3 estou fazendo minha ioga matinal de todos os dias.",
        u"Oh, heya Scoutmaster Yoshi and Sir Goro!": u"Oh, ol\u00e1, chefe escoteiro Yoshi e Sr. Goro!",
        u"Oh, heya Yoshi and Sir Goro! What brings you here?": u"Oh, ol\u00e1, Yoshi e Sr. Goro! O que traz voc\u00eas aqui?",
        u"Oh, he\u2019ll be fine without me for a while! Hihihi~!": u"Ah, ele ficar\u00e1 bem sem mim por um tempinho! Hihihi~!",
        u"Oh, he\u2019s actually on his way here! Maybe he\u2019s in the changing room by now!": u"Oh, na verdade ele est\u00e1 vindo para c\u00e1! Talvez j\u00e1 esteja no vesti\u00e1rio!",
        u"Oh, he\u2019s in the corner bunk over there, sir!": u"Oh, ele est\u00e1 naquele beliche no canto, senhor!",
        u"Oh, he\u2019s still cleaning up the kitchen. He really pulled through, cooking the party food at the last minute!": u"Ah, ele ainda est\u00e1 limpando a cozinha. Ele realmente salvou o dia preparando a comida da festa de \u00faltima hora!",
        u"Oh, how about enrolling him here as a scout, then? That would be so fun!! Don\u2019t you think so, Aiden?!": u"Ah, ent\u00e3o que tal matricul\u00e1-lo aqui como escoteiro? Seria muito divertido!! N\u00e3o acha, Aiden?!",
        u"Oh, how about rock paper scissors? That\u2019s nice and easy!": u"Oh, que tal pedra, papel e tesoura? \u00c9 simples e f\u00e1cil!",
        u"Oh, how about we head over to the bar, sir?": u"Oh, que tal irmos ao bar, senhor?",
        u"Oh, how about we play picture charades? ": u"Oh, que tal jogarmos m\u00edmica com desenhos? ",
        u"Oh, if you\u2019re looking for Lloyd and Darius, they already went downstairs to do stuff around the hotel.": u"Ah, se est\u00e3o procurando Lloyd e Darius, eles j\u00e1 desceram para fazer algumas coisas pelo hotel.",
        u"Oh, if you\u2019re not too tired, Aiden, why don\u2019t we help Jin finish up tonight?": u"Ah, se n\u00e3o estiver muito cansado, Aiden, por que n\u00e3o ajudamos Jin a terminar isso hoje \u00e0 noite?",
        u"Oh, if you\u2019re not too tired, Sir Goro, why don\u2019t we help Jin finish up tonight?": u"Oh, se n\u00e3o estiver muito cansado, Sr. Goro, por que n\u00e3o ajudamos Jin a terminar isso hoje \u00e0 noite?",
        u"Oh, is this what you were telling me about when Jin first arrived, Yoshinori?": u"Ah, \u00e9 sobre isso que voc\u00ea estava me contando quando o Jin chegou, Yoshinori?",
        u"Oh, isn\u2019t that Jin over there?": u"Ah, aquele ali n\u00e3o \u00e9 o Jin?",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s Little Lloyd and Serious Darius! ": u"Ah, s\u00e3o o Pequeno Lloyd e o S\u00e9rio Darius!",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s actually interesting though, sir! It\u2019s a romantic story of two partners separated by fate! They\u2019re desperate for each other, but torn apart by destiny! ": u"Oh, mas na verdade \u00e9 interessante, senhor! \u00c9 uma hist\u00f3ria rom\u00e2ntica sobre dois parceiros separados pelo destino! Eles desejam desesperadamente um ao outro, mas o destino os mant\u00e9m afastados! ",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s actually new! After we played that game the other day, Dar and I had a serious talk.": u"Oh, na verdade isso \u00e9 recente! Depois daquele jogo outro dia, Dar e eu tivemos uma conversa s\u00e9ria.",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s done!": u"Ah, est\u00e1 pronta!",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s easy! You go around the room and take turns saying something you\u2019ve never done!": u"Oh, \u00e9 f\u00e1cil! Cada um, na sua vez, diz alguma coisa que nunca fez!",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s just\u2026 It\u2019s so unexpected! I didn\u2019t know you worked for Mr. Clermont, especially for a job like this\u2026": u"Ah, \u00e9 s\u00f3 que\u2026 Foi t\u00e3o inesperado! Eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea trabalhava para o Sr. Clermont, ainda mais num cargo como este\u2026",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s not a problem! It was actually fun teaching someone the stuff I do!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o foi problema! Na verdade, foi divertido ensinar a algu\u00e9m as coisas que fa\u00e7o!",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s nothing major, Aiden! I\u2019m just crafting something!": u"Oh, n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada demais, Aiden! S\u00f3 estou fazendo uma coisa!",
        u"Oh, it\u2019s the same symbol that\u2019s around the camp and on our uniforms\u2026!": u"Ah, \u00e9 o mesmo s\u00edmbolo que vemos pelo acampamento e em nossos uniformes\u2026!",
        u"Oh, just in time Yuri. Jin and I were about to lose the undies!": u"Oh, chegou bem na hora, Yuri. Eu e Jin est\u00e1vamos prestes a perder as cuecas!",
        u"Oh, let me help too, Mr. Andre! I\u2019m sure Sir Goro would love to have Aiden here too! Let me just grab Yuri, and we\u2019ll go ask him right away!": u"Ah, deixe-me ajudar tamb\u00e9m, senhor Andre! Tenho certeza de que o senhor Goro tamb\u00e9m adoraria ter o Aiden aqui! Vou chamar a Yuri e perguntaremos a ele agora mesmo!",
        u"Oh, let me loosen that for you.": u"Ah, deixa eu afrouxar para voc\u00ea.",
        u"Oh, let\u2019s ask Aiden about it! He knows a lot about food!": u"Ah, vamos perguntar ao Aiden! Ele entende bastante de comida!",
        u"Oh, look at that. He came back after all.": u"Oh, olha s\u00f3. Ele voltou mesmo.",
        u"Oh, look at you~ You\u2019re acting all positive again, just like when you were a scout!": u"Ah, olhe s\u00f3 voc\u00ea~ Est\u00e1 todo positivo de novo, como quando era escoteiro!",
        u"Oh, look! They have a bar here, Aiden! ": u"Ah, olhe! Tem um bar aqui, Aiden! ",
        u"Oh, my apologies. It really looked like something else.": u"Oh, minhas desculpas. Realmente parecia outra coisa.",
        u"Oh, my bad! I didn\u2019t realize you two were exclusive.": u"Ah, foi mal! N\u00e3o percebi que voc\u00eas dois eram exclusivos.",
        u"Oh, my bad. It really looked like something else.": u"Ah, foi mal. Realmente parecia outra coisa.",
        u"Oh, no you don\u2019t Jin! You\u2019re in too, and we\u2019re gonna see that twink bod of yours again!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o vai n\u00e3o, Jin! Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m vai participar, e vamos ver esse seu corpinho de twink de novo!",
        u"Oh, not at all, Mr. Clermont! You\u2019re welcome here at the camp anytime you want!": u"Oh, de forma alguma, Sr. Clermont! O senhor ser\u00e1 bem-vindo ao acampamento sempre que quiser!",
        u"Oh, not for another hour! I was just checking in to see how our new cabin resident\u2019s doing!": u"Oh, s\u00f3 daqui a uma hora! Eu s\u00f3 vim ver como est\u00e1 nosso novo morador da cabana!",
        u"Oh, not this time around. I\u2019m making sure I finish all my prep work in the evenings now, especially after how much we crammed the other day.": u"Ah, desta vez n\u00e3o. Agora estou me certificando de terminar todo o preparo \u00e0 noite, principalmente depois da correria que tivemos outro dia.",
        u"Oh, now I\u2019m curious! What\u2019s in these boxes, anyway?": u"Oh, agora fiquei curioso! O que tem nessas caixas?",
        u"Oh, now you\u2019re acting shy when you were moaning like crazy a second ago?": u"Ah, agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bancando o t\u00edmido quando estava gemendo feito louco um segundo atr\u00e1s?",
        u"Oh, of course! Let me bring you to his office!": u"Ah, claro! Vou lev\u00e1-lo ao escrit\u00f3rio dele!",
        u"Oh, of course, of course!": u"Oh, claro, claro!",
        u"Oh, oh! I wanna pick dare!": u"Oh, oh! Eu quero escolher desafio!",
        u"Oh, oh! Look, Dad! Someone just got here!": u"Ah, ah! Olhe, pai! Algu\u00e9m acabou de chegar!",
        u"Oh, oh, is this that online thingie where Jin\u2019s been posting raw pics of you and Gramps? ": u"Oh, oh, \u00e9 aquela coisa online em que Jin anda postando fotos sem filtro suas e do Vov\u00f4? ",
        u"Oh, please! You\u2019d manage to burn cereal if we let you in the kitchen!": u"Ah, por favor! Voc\u00ea conseguiria queimar cereal se deix\u00e1ssemos voc\u00ea na cozinha!",
        u"Oh, r-right! Yes, sir! ": u"Ah, c-certo! Sim, senhor! ",
        u"Oh, really now? That doesn\u2019t sound like you at all, Aiden.": u"Ah, \u00e9 mesmo? Isso n\u00e3o parece nem um pouco com voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"Oh, really? I guess I wouldn\u2019t exist if Dad didn\u2019t. Who was yours with, Yoshi?": u"Oh, s\u00e9rio? Acho que eu nem existiria se o Pai n\u00e3o tivesse feito. Com quem foi a sua, Yoshi?",
        u"Oh, really? If it\u2019s so amazing, then why were you making such a fuss? You\u2019re so loud, anyone could hear.": u"Ah, \u00e9? Se \u00e9 t\u00e3o incr\u00edvel, por que estava fazendo tanto esc\u00e2ndalo? Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o barulhento que qualquer um poderia ouvir.",
        u"Oh, really? If there\u2019s one available, sure.": u"Ah, \u00e9? Se tiver um dispon\u00edvel, claro.",
        u"Oh, really? That kinda surprises me, considering how good everything Mr. Andre makes here is!": u"Ah, s\u00e9rio? Isso me surpreende um pouco, considerando como tudo que o senhor Andre prepara aqui \u00e9 bom!",
        u"Oh, right on time! I just finished serving everyone else, so we can have dinner together!": u"Ah, chegaram na hora certa! Acabei de servir todo mundo, ent\u00e3o podemos jantar juntos!",
        u"Oh, right!": u"Ah, \u00e9!",
        u"Oh, right! Hahaha!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Hahaha!",
        u"Oh, right! I almost forgot haha!": u"Ah, \u00e9! Quase esqueci, haha!",
        u"Oh, right! You did say earlier we\u2019d be sharing the room with others. Where are they? ": u"Ah, certo! Voc\u00ea disse antes que dividir\u00edamos o quarto com outras pessoas. Onde est\u00e3o eles? ",
        u"Oh, right. Emilia stayed with you last night so Mr. Clermont could have a room.": u"Ah, \u00e9. Emilia ficou com voc\u00ea ontem \u00e0 noite para o Sr. Clermont poder usar um quarto.",
        u"Oh, right. I have to finish packing too. ": u"Ah, \u00e9. Tamb\u00e9m preciso terminar de arrumar minhas coisas. ",
        u"Oh, right. You\u2019re still here...": u"Ah, \u00e9. Voc\u00ea ainda est\u00e1 aqui...",
        u"Oh, right\u2026 A lot of what you read includes pictures too, right?": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026 Muito do que voc\u00ea l\u00ea tamb\u00e9m inclui imagens, certo?",
        u"Oh, she\u2019s still at the cabin! She\u2019s been taking care of one of our other crew. You guys will meet them later, as soon as they\u2019re ready!": u"Ah, ela ainda est\u00e1 na cabana! Est\u00e1 cuidando de outra pessoa da nossa equipe. Voc\u00eas v\u00e3o conhec\u00ea-la depois, assim que estiver pronta!",
        u"Oh, shucks, Yoshi. You\u2019re flattering me too much in front of Jin, hahaha!": u"Ah, assim fico sem jeito, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 me elogiando demais na frente do Jin, hahaha!",
        u"Oh, shut up! Do you really think I\u2019m stupid enough to believe that?": u"Ah, cale a boca! Acha mesmo que sou burra o bastante para acreditar nisso?",
        u"Oh, shut up! I blame you \u2013 your dorkiness is rubbing off on me. ": u"Ah, cale a boca! A culpa \u00e9 sua \u2014 seu jeito bob\u00e3o est\u00e1 pegando em mim. ",
        u"Oh, sir! Isn\u2019t that Yuri over there?": u"Oh, senhor! Aquela n\u00e3o \u00e9 Yuri ali?",
        u"Oh, so that\u2019s how you got jacked! Count me in, then! ": u"Ah, ent\u00e3o foi assim que ficou sarado! Pode contar comigo! ",
        u"Oh, so you knew about this! You two are being secretive now, huh?!": u"Oh, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea sabia disso! Agora voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o cheios de segredos, hein?!",
        u"Oh, sorry Aiden! I\u2019m just so overjoyed to see this side of Emilia.": u"Oh, desculpa, Aiden! S\u00f3 estou muito feliz em ver esse lado da Emilia.",
        u"Oh, speak of the devil! Welcome back, Dad!": u"Ah, falando nele! Bem-vindo de volta, pai!",
        u"Oh, speaking of which\u2026 looks like some people really can\u2019t wait for summer.": u"Oh, falando nisso\u2026 parece que algumas pessoas realmente n\u00e3o conseguem esperar pelo ver\u00e3o.",
        u"Oh, stop acting so innocent, all of you! None of us are virgins here, right?!": u"Ah, parem de se fazer de inocentes! Nenhum de n\u00f3s \u00e9 virgem aqui, certo?!",
        u"Oh, sure! I\u2019d be happy to help, sir!": u"Ah, claro! Ficarei feliz em ajudar, senhor!",
        u"Oh, sure! I\u2019d love to.": u"Ah, claro! Eu adoraria.",
        u"Oh, sure! What\u2019s next on your task list?": u"Ah, claro! Qual \u00e9 a pr\u00f3xima tarefa da sua lista?",
        u"Oh, sure, you can! Go on, do your crunches!": u"Ah, claro que consegue! Vai, fa\u00e7a seus abdominais!",
        u"Oh, thank god you\u2019re here Emilia. I\u2019m losing it with Dad and Yoshi\u2026!": u"Oh, gra\u00e7as a Deus voc\u00ea chegou, Emilia. Estou ficando maluca com o Pai e o Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"Oh, thank god, she\u2019s gone. That\u2019s one way to get rid of her, Dad.": u"Ah, gra\u00e7as a Deus, ela foi embora. Esse \u00e9 um jeito de se livrar dela, pai.",
        u"Oh, thank goodness, it\u2019s not just me! ": u"Ah, gra\u00e7as a Deus, n\u00e3o sou s\u00f3 eu!",
        u"Oh, that makes sense. What brings you two to a place like this?  ": u"Ah, isso faz sentido. O que trouxe voc\u00eas dois a um lugar assim?  ",
        u"Oh, that quickly?": u"Oh, t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido?",
        u"Oh, that reminds me, I should probably check on the other group too. There was quite a bit more snow over there\u2026": u"Ah, isso me lembra que eu deveria verificar o outro grupo tamb\u00e9m. Tinha bem mais neve por l\u00e1\u2026",
        u"Oh, that reminds me\u2026! Were you able to take off the ring stuck on your thing?": u"Ah, isso me lembrou\u2026! Voc\u00ea conseguiu tirar o anel que ficou preso na sua coisa?",
        u"Oh, that sounds rough\u2026": u"Ah, parece ter sido dif\u00edcil\u2026",
        u"Oh, that\u2019d be great if you can!": u"Oh, seria \u00f3timo se pudesse!",
        u"Oh, that\u2019s a relief\u2026 For a minute there, I thought I\u2019d be late on our first day of renovations.": u"Ah, que al\u00edvio\u2026 Por um instante, pensei que me atrasaria no primeiro dia das reformas.",
        u"Oh, that\u2019s great! I\u2019ve been dying to meet the new guys!": u"Ah, \u00f3timo! Estou louco para conhecer os novatos!",
        u"Oh, the food\u2019s coming.": u"Ah, a comida est\u00e1 chegando.",
        u"Oh, the receptionist told us that we have a scheduled formal dinner tonight down at the restaurant.": u"Oh, a recepcionista nos disse que temos um jantar formal marcado para esta noite no restaurante.",
        u"Oh, the scouts came by to help us shovel! I called Yoichi and Taiga last night, and the whole gang came along!": u"Ah, os escoteiros vieram nos ajudar a retirar a neve! Liguei para Yoichi e Taiga ontem \u00e0 noite, e a turma inteira veio junto!",
        u"Oh, then that\u2019s good news\u2026! Isn\u2019t it\u2026? ": u"Oh, ent\u00e3o isso \u00e9 uma boa not\u00edcia\u2026! N\u00e3o \u00e9\u2026? ",
        u"Oh, there he is!": u"Oh, a\u00ed est\u00e1 ele!",
        u"Oh, there were plenty of juices, alright~": u"Ah, pode ter certeza de que teve bastante \u2018suco\u2019~",
        u"Oh, there\u2019s Lloyd and Darius! They look busy~": u"Oh, ali est\u00e3o Lloyd e Darius! Parecem ocupados~",
        u"Oh, these are pictures from way back\u2026!": u"Oh, s\u00e3o fotos de muito tempo atr\u00e1s\u2026!",
        u"Oh, these aren\u2019t playing cards, they\u2019re tarot cards! I\u2019m trying to foresee what Sir Goro has in store for his future!": u"Ah, estas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o cartas de baralho, s\u00e3o cartas de tar\u00f4! Estou tentando prever o que o futuro reserva para o Sr. Goro!",
        u"Oh, these? It\u2019s just some stuff I unboxed from some of my crates when I finished work today.": u"Ah, isto? S\u00e3o apenas algumas coisas que tirei de umas caixas quando terminei o trabalho hoje.",
        u"Oh, they aren\u2019t the workers, Yoshi! They\u2019re just here to deliver the building materials!": u"Ah, eles n\u00e3o s\u00e3o os trabalhadores, Yoshi! Vieram apenas entregar os materiais de constru\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Oh, they loved it! If you didn\u2019t notice, it started getting quiet out there, everyone\u2019s so busy munching down on your food, haha! ": u"Ah, eles adoraram! Se n\u00e3o percebeu, come\u00e7ou a ficar silencioso l\u00e1 fora porque todo mundo est\u00e1 ocupado devorando sua comida, haha! ",
        u"Oh, they must be close friends then. I bet we\u2019ll like her too!": u"Ah, ent\u00e3o elas devem ser bem amigas. Aposto que tamb\u00e9m vamos gostar dela!",
        u"Oh, they\u2019re the real deal. I\u2019ve already learned a thing or two about design and carpentry from them.": u"Ah, eles s\u00e3o profissionais de verdade. J\u00e1 aprendi algumas coisas sobre design e carpintaria com eles.",
        u"Oh, this isn\u2019t \u2018just\u2019 work! I\u2019m giving Hunter here some training for his blooming art career!": u"Oh, isto n\u00e3o \u00e9 \u2018s\u00f3\u2019 trabalho! Estou dando ao Hunter um treinamento para sua promissora carreira art\u00edstica!",
        u"Oh, this must be the hotel brochure. Let\u2019s take a look.": u"Ah, deve ser o folheto do hotel. Vamos dar uma olhada.",
        u"Oh, this? Yep! It\u2019s something I got in my younger years, before Aiden was around, haha.": u"Ah, esta? Sim! Fiz quando era mais jovem, antes de Aiden nascer, haha.",
        u"Oh, those days are so far behind me. You\u2019re not making me feel any younger.": u"Oh, esses dias ficaram t\u00e3o para tr\u00e1s. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 me fazendo sentir mais jovem.",
        u"Oh, umm\u2026 Well, you see, I figured I'd work on clearing out the shed since I overheard Dad on the phone talking about needing storage space.": u"Ah, hum\u2026 Bem, eu resolvi esvaziar o galp\u00e3o porque ouvi o papai falando ao telefone que precisava de espa\u00e7o para armazenamento.",
        u"Oh, very well, but don\u2019t drag me down!": u"Oh, tudo bem, mas n\u00e3o me fa\u00e7a perder!",
        u"Oh, wait! Isn\u2019t that Emilia over there?": u"Oh, espere! Aquela ali n\u00e3o \u00e9 Emilia?",
        u"Oh, wait, how about her? She looks like she\u2019s just standing there alone. Why don\u2019t we invite her?": u"Ah, espere, e ela? Parece que est\u00e1 ali sozinha. Por que n\u00e3o a convidamos?",
        u"Oh, wait\u2026": u"Oh, espere\u2026",
        u"Oh, we actually went to a beach too with the scouts not too long ago!": u"Ah, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m fomos \u00e0 praia com os escoteiros n\u00e3o faz muito tempo!",
        u"Oh, we all just worked on physical tasks today! We should probably get washed up now though, huh?": u"Ah, hoje todos n\u00f3s fizemos trabalhos bra\u00e7ais! Mas provavelmente dever\u00edamos nos lavar agora, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Oh, we have just the perfect thing! May I offer a private sauna room to such a lovely couple~?": u"Oh, temos exatamente a coisa perfeita! Posso oferecer uma sauna privativa para um casal t\u00e3o ador\u00e1vel~?",
        u"Oh, we have just the perfect thing! May I offer a private sauna room to such a lovely couple~?{fast}": u"Oh, temos exatamente a coisa perfeita! Posso oferecer uma sauna privativa para um casal t\u00e3o ador\u00e1vel~?{fast}",
        u"Oh, welcome back ladies. How was your drive?": u"Oh, bem-vindas de volta, senhoritas. Como foi a viagem?",
        u"Oh, well I\u2019m done eating it. That just made me hungrier.": u"Ah, bem, j\u00e1 terminei de comer. Isso s\u00f3 me deixou com mais fome.",
        u"Oh, we\u2019re gonna work together? Now I can\u2019t say no to that! ": u"Ah, vamos trabalhar juntos? Agora n\u00e3o posso recusar!",
        u"Oh, what is it, Aiden?": u"Oh, o que foi, Aiden?",
        u"Oh, what is it?": u"Ah, o que seria?",
        u"Oh, what\u2019s the matter, Lloyd? Are you hurt somewhere?": u"Ah, o que houve, Lloyd? Voc\u00ea se machucou em algum lugar?",
        u"Oh, why didn\u2019t you say so?!": u"Ah, por que n\u00e3o disse antes?!",
        u"Oh, woops, looks like I left it in the messhall!": u"Ah, opa, parece que deixei no refeit\u00f3rio!",
        u"Oh, wow! I can\u2019t believe we have security cameras now!": u"Oh, uau! N\u00e3o acredito que agora temos c\u00e2meras de seguran\u00e7a!",
        u"Oh, wow\u2026!": u"Oh, uau\u2026!",
        u"Oh, yeah, he and Aiden are both gone. Hihi, are they sneaking around again?": u"Ah, \u00e9, ele e Aiden sa\u00edram. Hihi, ser\u00e1 que est\u00e3o aprontando escondidos de novo?",
        u"Oh, yeah, they\u2019re both gone. They better not be sneaking around again and surprise me with daddy buttsex\u2026!": u"Ah, \u00e9, os dois sa\u00edram. \u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o estarem aprontando escondidos de novo e me surpreenderem com sexo anal de daddy\u2026!",
        u"Oh, yeah. I know where to find the agenda documents, so I figured I\u2019d take over.": u"Ah, sim. Sei onde encontrar os documentos da agenda, ent\u00e3o achei melhor assumir por enquanto.",
        u"Oh, yeah\u2026! You had a much more risqu\u00e9 one you were supposed to wear\u2026": u"Ah, \u00e9\u2026! Voc\u00ea tinha uma bem mais ousada que deveria ter usado\u2026",
        u"Oh, yes! A lot of the scouts have come back, and well\u2026 they really miss you\u2026": u"Oh, sim! Muitos dos escoteiros voltaram e, bem\u2026 eles sentem muita falta de voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"Oh, yes! I\u2019ll be fine\u2026 Honestly, I prefer to stay in the room anyway.": u"Oh, sim! Vou ficar bem\u2026 Sinceramente, prefiro ficar no quarto mesmo.",
        u"Oh, you bet! I\u2019m having the time of my life here!": u"Pode apostar! Estou me divertindo como nunca aqui!",
        u"Oh, you can say that again! My horoscope this month told me that I was going to \\\u201cmeet familiar faces on the roads ahead.\\\u201d": u"Ah, pode dizer isso de novo! Meu hor\u00f3scopo deste m\u00eas disse que eu iria \\\u201cencontrar rostos familiares pelos caminhos \u00e0 frente.\\\u201d",
        u"Oh, you cosplay, Jin? ": u"Oh, voc\u00ea faz cosplay, Jin? ",
        u"Oh, you don\u2019t have to do that here! Our chef prepares three meals a day for everyone at camp!": u"Ah, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa fazer isso aqui! Nosso cozinheiro prepara tr\u00eas refei\u00e7\u00f5es por dia para todos no acampamento!",
        u"Oh, you don\u2019t need to worry about that, Dad! We already handled it last night!": u"Oh, n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar com isso, pai! N\u00f3s j\u00e1 resolvemos tudo ontem \u00e0 noite!",
        u"Oh, you flatter me too much. Dishwashing isn\u2019t that revolutionary to be so highly credited for.": u"Oh, voc\u00eas me elogiam demais. Lavar lou\u00e7a n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo t\u00e3o revolucion\u00e1rio para merecer tanto reconhecimento.",
        u"Oh, you guys are gonna take a shower?": u"Ah, voc\u00eas v\u00e3o tomar banho?",
        u"Oh, you have your own blog, Mr. Jin?": u"Ah, o senhor tem seu pr\u00f3prio blog, Sr. Jin?",
        u"Oh, you have your own blog?": u"Oh, voc\u00ea tem seu pr\u00f3prio blog?",
        u"Oh, you just pick a card and try and draw what\u2019s on it! ": u"Oh, voc\u00ea s\u00f3 pega uma carta e tenta desenhar o que estiver nela! ",
        u"Oh, you mean like our beach trip, sir?": u"Oh, quer dizer como nossa viagem \u00e0 praia, senhor?",
        u"Oh, you mean like the time we slept naked together later that same night?": u"Ah, voc\u00ea quer dizer como aquela vez em que dormimos pelados juntos mais tarde naquela mesma noite?",
        u"Oh, you mean that one bottle you've had for like a decade? What was it called\u2026? Huge Boss?": u"Ah, aquela garrafa que voc\u00ea tem h\u00e1 uns dez anos? Como era o nome mesmo\u2026? Huge Boss?",
        u"Oh, you still feel a little sick?": u"Ah, ainda est\u00e1 se sentindo um pouco mal?",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re a lifesaver, Jin! Take a picture of that chandelier, and that column over there, and oooh! That statue in the corner too!": u"Ah, voc\u00ea salvou minha vida, Jin! Tire uma foto daquele lustre, daquela coluna ali e, ooh! Tamb\u00e9m daquela est\u00e1tua no canto!",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re an occult fan, Lloyd?": u"Oh, voc\u00ea gosta de ocultismo, Lloyd?",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re awake, Yoshi!": u"Ah, voc\u00ea acordou, Yoshi!",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re finally awake, Emilia\u2026! We\u2019re back at camp!": u"Ah, finalmente acordou, Emilia\u2026! Estamos de volta ao acampamento!",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re not in trouble. I was just wondering why you stayed in. There\u2019s so much to do out there. ": u"Oh, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 encrencado. S\u00f3 estava me perguntando por que ficou aqui. H\u00e1 tanta coisa para fazer l\u00e1 fora. ",
        u"Oh, you\u2019re with Yoshi too!": u"Oh, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 com o Yoshi!",
        u"Oh.": u"Ah.",
        u"Oh. Aiden. Yoshi.": u"Ah. Aiden. Yoshi.",
        u"Oh. I didn\u2019t even notice that.": u"Oh. Eu nem tinha percebido isso.",
        u"Oh. Maybe this will help out.": u"Ah. Talvez isto ajude.",
        u"Oh. What\u2019s on the agenda, if I may ask?": u"Ah. Qual \u00e9 a pauta, se me permite perguntar?",
        u"Oh. Yoshi. Sir Goro.": u"Oh. Yoshi. Senhor Goro.",
        u"Oh... hehe\u2026 My bad, little guy!": u"Ah\u2026 hehe\u2026 Foi mal, baixinho!",
        u"Oh? Are we interrupting something here~?": u"Oh? Estamos interrompendo alguma coisa aqui~?",
        u"Oh? Don\u2019t you wanna stay for dessert? I can whip up something fancy again!": u"Oh? N\u00e3o quer ficar para a sobremesa? Posso preparar outra coisa sofisticada!",
        u"Oh? I didn\u2019t realize they were assisting with the preparations.": u"Oh? N\u00e3o sabia que eles estavam ajudando nos preparativos.",
        u"Oh? I think he\u2019s still in his quarters\u2026!": u"H\u00e3? Acho que ele ainda est\u00e1 em seus aposentos\u2026!",
        u"Oh? Just a few moments ago, you were crying out without a care in the world, but now you\u2019re worried?": u"Oh? H\u00e1 poucos instantes voc\u00ea estava gritando sem se importar com nada, mas agora est\u00e1 preocupado?",
        u"Oh? Says the boy who can\u2019t keep his clothes on when he\u2019s drunk?": u"Ah \u00e9? Diz o garoto que n\u00e3o consegue ficar vestido quando est\u00e1 b\u00eabado?",
        u"Oh? Something catch your eye?": u"Oh? Alguma coisa chamou sua aten\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Oh? That sounds nice.": u"Oh? Parece \u00f3timo.",
        u"Oh? What for?": u"Oh? Por qu\u00ea?",
        u"Oh? What is it, Dad?": u"Oh? O que foi, Pai?",
        u"Oh? What\u2019s it about?": u"Oh? Sobre o que \u00e9?",
        u"Oh? Who could that be?": u"Oh? Quem ser\u00e1?",
        u"Oh? You still have an appetite after your \u2018meal\u2019 earlier?": u"Oh? Ainda est\u00e1 com apetite depois da sua \u2018refei\u00e7\u00e3o\u2019 de antes?",
        u"Ohhh, is it like a digital journal?": u"Ohhh, \u00e9 como um di\u00e1rio digital?",
        u"Ohhh~ They went on a little date then, huh? ": u"Ohhh~ Ent\u00e3o eles foram a um encontrinho, hein? ",
        u"Ohhh\u2026 Are you gonna be our disciplinary committee? ": u"Ohhh\u2026 Voc\u00ea vai ser nosso comit\u00ea disciplinar? ",
        u"Ohhh\u2026 Is Emilia gonna be our disciplinary committee? ": u"Ohhh\u2026 Emilia vai ser nossa comiss\u00e3o disciplinar? ",
        u"Ohhh\u2026 So that\u2019s why no matter how hard I was hitting it, it wouldn\u2019t split.": u"Ohhh\u2026 Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 por isso que, n\u00e3o importa o quanto eu batesse, ela n\u00e3o rachava.",
        u"Ohh~ Now we\u2019re talking~!": u"Ohh~ Agora sim~!",
        u"Ohh\u2026 I see\u2026 Darius is a really interesting guy, isn\u2019t he?": u"Ahh\u2026 Entendo\u2026 Darius \u00e9 um cara muito interessante, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Ohh\u2026 I\u2019ve always wondered why it\u2019s like that. Now I know.": u"Ohh\u2026 Sempre me perguntei por que era assim. Agora eu sei.",
        u"Oho, if you\u2019ll be paying attention to me, then maybe I\u2019ll have more \u201caccidental\u201d slip-ups~": u"Oho, se voc\u00ea vai prestar aten\u00e7\u00e3o em mim, talvez eu tenha mais escorreg\u00f5es \u201cacidentais\u201d~",
        u"Ohoho, now that sounds like something you\u2019d be more interested in~": u"Ohoho, isso parece muito mais a sua cara~",
        u"Ohoho, you should ask Yoshi just how good I am in bed~": u"Ohoho, pergunte ao Yoshi o quanto eu sou bom na cama~",
        u"Ohoho~ Can\u2019t help but stare at my junk, Yoshi? ": u"Ohoho~ N\u00e3o consegue parar de olhar para o meu pacote, Yoshi? ",
        u"Ohoho~ I like a clingy Yoshi!": u"Ohoho~ Gosto de um Yoshi possessivo!",
        u"Ohoho~ I\u2019m gonna enjoy drinking more of this all night~!": u"Ohoho~ Vou adorar beber mais disso a noite inteira~!",
        u"Ohoho~ Since when did you get so possessive, Yoshi? I like it~": u"Ohoho~ Desde quando voc\u00ea ficou t\u00e3o possessivo, Yoshi? Eu gosto~",
        u"Oho~ Did you guys have a group \u2018workout\u2019 yesterday~?": u"Oho~ Voc\u00eas fizeram um \u2018treino\u2019 em grupo ontem~?",
        u"Oho~ Distracted by my bod, are you?": u"Oho~ Ficou distra\u00eddo com o meu corpo, foi?",
        u"Oho~ Don\u2019t mind if I do~": u"Oho~ Ser\u00e1 um prazer~",
        u"Oho~ I like the sound of that~": u"Oho~ Gostei disso~",
        u"Oho~ Is this the new guy? He\u2019s quite the twink!": u"Oho~ Este \u00e9 o novato? Ele \u00e9 um belo twink!",
        u"Oho~ Look at you being the one who strips first now.": u"Oho~ Olha s\u00f3 voc\u00ea sendo o primeiro a tirar a roupa agora.",
        u"Oho~ Looks like someone can\u2019t wait to get the action going?": u"Oho~ Parece que algu\u00e9m mal pode esperar para come\u00e7ar a a\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Oho~ Looks like you want some \u201cbuns\u201d with your dinner~": u"Oho~ Parece que voc\u00ea quer um pouco de \u201cp\u00e3ozinho\u201d com o jantar~",
        u"Oho~ Make him ride on your rocket and see stars!": u"Oho~ Fa\u00e7a ele montar no seu foguete e ver estrelas!",
        u"Oho~ Now all of a sudden you don\u2019t care that anyone can just walk in and see us?": u"Oho~ Agora, de repente, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se importa que algu\u00e9m possa entrar e ver a gente?",
        u"Oho~ Now you\u2019ve made me hungry! Can\u2019t wait for today\u2019s special~": u"Oho~ Agora voc\u00ea me deixou com fome! Mal posso esperar pelo especial de hoje~",
        u"Oho~ Someone\u2019s really hungry! One special order coming right up!": u"Oho~ Algu\u00e9m est\u00e1 mesmo com fome! Um pedido especial saindo agora!",
        u"Oho~ Sounds like you guys did something \u2018fun\u2019?": u"Oho~ Parece que voc\u00eas fizeram algo \u2018divertido\u2019?",
        u"Oho~ Wanting someone else to take charge? ": u"Oho~ Quer que outra pessoa assuma o controle? ",
        u"Oho~ Wanting to take control, Yoshi?": u"Oho~ Quer assumir o controle, Yoshi?",
        u"Oho~ Yoshi, and in front of everyone else too!": u"Oho~ Yoshi, e na frente de todo mundo tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Oho~ You came all the way here just to tell me that?": u"Oho~ Voc\u00ea veio at\u00e9 aqui s\u00f3 para me dizer isso?",
        u"Oho~ You tellin\u2019 me we\u2019re gonna be more than just boyfriends now?": u"Oho~ Est\u00e1 dizendo que vamos ser mais do que apenas namorados agora?",
        u"Oho~ You\u2019re feeling forward tonight, are you Gramps~?": u"Oho~ Est\u00e1 bem atrevido esta noite, hein, Vov\u00f4~?",
        u"Oho~ You\u2019re showing a lot of skin in that outfit, I see! With some muscles, you could put mine to shame, haha!": u"Oho~ Estou vendo que essa roupa mostra bastante pele! Com alguns m\u00fasculos, voc\u00ea poderia fazer a minha passar vergonha, haha!",
        u"Oho~! I like the sound of that~!": u"Oho~! Gostei disso~!",
        u"Oho~? You guys got room for one more?": u"Oho~? Tem espa\u00e7o para mais um?",
        u"Oh~ Hey, Yoshi! ": u"Ah~ Ol\u00e1, Yoshi! ",
        u"Oh~ Sounds interesting.": u"Oh~ Parece interessante.",
        u"Oh~? Can\u2019t wait to ride me already, Yoshinori?": u"Oh~? J\u00e1 n\u00e3o consegue esperar para cavalgar em mim, Yoshinori?",
        u"Oh~? Don\u2019t you mean with \u2018Dad\u2019 and \u2018Dad\u2019?": u"Oh~? N\u00e3o quer dizer com \u2018Pai\u2019 e \u2018Pai\u2019?",
        u"Oh~? What\u2019s that I see against your abs, Yoshinori?": u"Oh~? O que \u00e9 isso que estou vendo em seu abd\u00f4men, Yoshinori?",
        u"Oh\u2026 ": u"Ah\u2026 ",
        u"Oh\u2026 Actually, I was planning to ask for my weekly task list, but it can wait since you\u2019re busy!": u"Ah\u2026 Na verdade, eu pretendia pedir a minha lista semanal de tarefas, mas pode esperar, j\u00e1 que o senhor est\u00e1 ocupado!",
        u"Oh\u2026 Alright, then.": u"Ah\u2026 Est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Oh\u2026 I didn\u2019t think of it that way.": u"Oh\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o tinha pensado dessa forma.",
        u"Oh\u2026 I see\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Entendo\u2026",
        u"Oh\u2026 I thought you made up your mind last night?": u"Oh\u2026 Achei que voc\u00ea tivesse se decidido ontem \u00e0 noite?",
        u"Oh\u2026 Isn\u2019t that too much, sir? I mean\u2026 you\u2019ve already funded the entire expansion.": u"Ah\u2026 Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 demais, senhor? Quero dizer\u2026 O senhor j\u00e1 financiou toda a expans\u00e3o.",
        u"Oh\u2026 It\u2019s that kind of show\u2026": u"Oh\u2026 \u00c9 esse tipo de show\u2026",
        u"Oh\u2026 She\u2019s that rich girl from back then. Can\u2019t forget about her.": u"Ah\u2026 Ela \u00e9 aquela garota rica daquela \u00e9poca. Imposs\u00edvel esquec\u00ea-la.",
        u"Oh\u2026 So that\u2019s what I\u2019ve been hearing outside.": u"Ah\u2026 Ent\u00e3o era isso que eu estava ouvindo l\u00e1 fora.",
        u"Oh\u2026 So that\u2019s what this is about.": u"Oh\u2026 Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 disso que se trata.",
        u"Oh\u2026 So that\u2019s what you\u2019ve been carrying\u2026 ": u"Ah\u2026 Ent\u00e3o era isso que voc\u00ea estava carregando\u2026 ",
        u"Oh\u2026 That\u2019s actually one of our scoutmasters\u2026 He\u2019s in charge of food service and camp maintenance.": u"Ah\u2026 Na verdade, esse \u00e9 um dos nossos chefes escoteiros\u2026 Ele \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pela alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e pela manuten\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento.",
        u"Oh\u2026 This is beyond what I expected\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Isto vai muito al\u00e9m do que eu esperava\u2026",
        u"Oh\u2026 This is way better, though.": u"Ah\u2026 Mas isto \u00e9 muito melhor.",
        u"Oh\u2026 Umm\u2026 Well, it depends on the situation actually\u2026 Is this about you and Lloyd?": u"Ah\u2026 Umm\u2026 Bem, na verdade depende da situa\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Isso \u00e9 sobre voc\u00ea e o Lloyd?",
        u"Oh\u2026 Well\u2026 I guess we can work on that one\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Bem\u2026 Acho que podemos trabalhar nisso\u2026",
        u"Oh\u2026 We\u2019re doing that now.": u"Ah\u2026 Ent\u00e3o vamos fazer isso agora.",
        u"Oh\u2026 Yeah, I guess the last time we did this was when I was a scout.": u"Oh\u2026 \u00c9, acho que a \u00faltima vez que fizemos isso foi quando eu era escoteiro.",
        u"Oh\u2026 You\u2019re resigning permanently\u2026?": u"Oh\u2026 Voc\u00ea vai deixar o cargo permanentemente\u2026?",
        u"Oh\u2026 alright.": u"Ah\u2026 est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Oh\u2026 my\u2026 god, that table is covered in cum.": u"Meu\u2026 Deus\u2026 aquela mesa est\u00e1 coberta de porra.",
        u"Oh\u2026 that\u2019s interesting. So that\u2019s what you were talking about last night, too.": u"Ah\u2026 que interessante. Ent\u00e3o era disso que voc\u00ea estava falando ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Oh\u2026! Good morning, Jin!": u"Ah\u2026! Bom dia, Jin!",
        u"Oh\u2026! Hey there, Dad! ": u"Oh\u2026! Oi, pai! ",
        u"Oh\u2026! I was just planning to get some porkchops with gravy, you like that too, right?": u"Ah\u2026! Eu estava pensando em pedir costeletas de porco com molho, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m gosta, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Oh\u2026! I worked on the camp\u2019s registrar database over the last few months! I should be able to pull that information up!": u"Ah\u2026! Trabalhei no banco de dados de registros do acampamento nos \u00faltimos meses! Devo conseguir acessar essas informa\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"Okay! That\u2019s all the chairs set up! I think we\u2019re\u2014": u"Certo! Todas as cadeiras est\u00e3o arrumadas! Acho que n\u00f3s\u2014",
        u"Okay, 3\u2026 2\u2026 1\u2026 Cheese!": u"Certo, 3\u2026 2\u2026 1\u2026 Digam xis!",
        u"Okay, Aiden! I think that's the last of it ready to go!": u"Certo, Aiden! Acho que agora est\u00e1 tudo pronto para levar!",
        u"Okay, Aiden, I know I promised that I\u2019d take care of you today, but we have an emergency staff meeting\u2026": u"Certo, Aiden, sei que prometi cuidar de voc\u00ea hoje, mas temos uma reuni\u00e3o de emerg\u00eancia da equipe\u2026",
        u"Okay, Dad! See you both there!": u"Certo, pai! Vejo voc\u00eas dois l\u00e1!",
        u"Okay, Dad. I don\u2019t mind waiting.": u"Est\u00e1 bem, pai. N\u00e3o me importo de esperar.",
        u"Okay, I give up\u2026": u"Certo, eu desisto\u2026",
        u"Okay, I take it back. It does sound weird if you\u2019re the one calling me old.": u"Certo, retiro o que disse. Realmente soa estranho quando \u00e9 voc\u00ea quem me chama de velho.",
        u"Okay, I totally saw that coming. Except I thought you\u2019d also make a pun out of choking.": u"T\u00e1, essa eu vi chegando de longe. S\u00f3 achei que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m faria uma piada com engasgar.",
        u"Okay, I-I can take it\u2026!": u"Certo, e-eu consigo aguentar\u2026!",
        u"Okay, Yuri! This is the last box with your name on it in there.": u"Pronto, Yuri! Esta \u00e9 a \u00faltima caixa l\u00e1 dentro com o seu nome.",
        u"Okay, a little warning, I don\u2019t have a lot of experience cooking, so please don\u2019t expect too much!": u"Certo, um pequeno aviso: n\u00e3o tenho muita experi\u00eancia na cozinha, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o espere demais!",
        u"Okay, great!": u"Certo, \u00f3timo!",
        u"Okay, great! Let\u2019s get started!": u"Certo, \u00f3timo! Vamos come\u00e7ar!",
        u"Okay, if you say so~": u"Est\u00e1 bem, se voc\u00ea diz~",
        u"Okay, let\u2019s start creaming! ": u"Certo, vamos come\u00e7ar a bater o creme! ",
        u"Okay, now I\u2019m convinced the drinks really are going to your head.": u"Certo, agora estou convencido de que as bebidas realmente subiram \u00e0 sua cabe\u00e7a.",
        u"Okay, now that sounds like the Emilia we know\u2026": u"Certo, agora sim parece a Emilia que conhecemos\u2026",
        u"Okay, now that\u2019s actually scary.": u"T\u00e1, agora isso \u00e9 realmente assustador.",
        u"Okay, now you can\u2019t tell me they\u2019re not planning to have sex from how they both said that.": u"T\u00e1, depois do jeito que os dois falaram, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode mais dizer que eles n\u00e3o est\u00e3o planejando transar.",
        u"Okay, now you guys have to listen to me! We\u2019ll have some REAL fun out there!": u"Certo, agora voc\u00eas precisam me ouvir! Vamos nos divertir de VERDADE l\u00e1 fora!",
        u"Okay, scouts! Form up into a line and find your buddies! We\u2019re going to begin our march.": u"Certo, escoteiros! Formem uma fila e encontrem suas duplas! Vamos iniciar a marcha.",
        u"Okay, so based on the layout Jin gave us, there should be a satellite dish right over there.": u"Certo, de acordo com o projeto que Jin nos deu, deve haver uma antena parab\u00f3lica bem ali.",
        u"Okay, that\u2019s enough chitchat and reunions for today!": u"Certo, chega de conversa e reencontros por hoje!",
        u"Okay, then! There\u2019s just one last department I have to check!": u"Certo, ent\u00e3o! S\u00f3 falta verificar um \u00faltimo departamento!",
        u"Okay, you\u2019re in \u2013 I-I mean, I\u2019m in.": u"Certo, voc\u00ea entra \u2014 q-quero dizer, eu topo.",
        u"Okay. I stand corrected.": u"Certo. Retiro o que disse.",
        u"Okay. Make out with Darius.": u"Certo. D\u00ea uns amassos no Darius.",
        u"Okay\u2026 This new PC is all set up! It just needs to finish installing all of the software and programs, then it should be good to go!": u"Certo\u2026 Este novo computador est\u00e1 montado! S\u00f3 precisa terminar de instalar todos os programas e depois estar\u00e1 pronto para uso!",
        u"Okay\u2026 you got me\u2026": u"Est\u00e1 bem\u2026 voc\u00ea me pegou\u2026",
        u"Okay\u2026!": u"Certo\u2026!",
        u"On it, bro!": u"Deixa comigo, mano!",
        u"On my count, Yoshi\u2026! One, two\u2014 ": u"No meu comando, Yoshi\u2026! Um, dois\u2014 ",
        u"On my count. One\u2026 Two\u2026": u"Quando eu contar. Um\u2026 Dois\u2026",
        u"On that note, I guess we should get dressed and start our day as well. ": u"Falando nisso, acho que tamb\u00e9m devemos nos vestir e come\u00e7ar o dia. ",
        u"On that note, I think you have what it takes to pursue the culinary arts. All that\u2019s missing is a certification.": u"Pensando nisso, acho que voc\u00ea tem o necess\u00e1rio para seguir carreira na gastronomia. S\u00f3 falta uma certifica\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"On that note, I was hoping to report my own mistakes to Mr. Clermont directly.": u"Quanto a isso, eu esperava contar pessoalmente ao Sr. Clermont sobre meus pr\u00f3prios erros.",
        u"On that note, let\u2019s get you out of here before someone else walks in.": u"Falando nisso, vamos tirar voc\u00ea daqui antes que outra pessoa entre.",
        u"On that note, please allow me some time to gather the required manpower to cater for all this work.": u"Nesse caso, por favor, conceda-me algum tempo para reunir a m\u00e3o de obra necess\u00e1ria para todo esse trabalho.",
        u"On that note, why don\u2019t we go out and try something already? I\u2019ve got this hotel brochure from earlier, so let\u2019s take a look.": u"Falando nisso, por que n\u00e3o sa\u00edmos e experimentamos alguma coisa? Peguei este folheto do hotel mais cedo, ent\u00e3o vamos dar uma olhada.",
        u"On that note\u2026 I-I think I have to get to work before Emilia thinks I\u2019m slacking\u2026 ": u"Falando nisso\u2026 A-Acho que preciso come\u00e7ar a trabalhar antes que Emilia pense que estou enrolando\u2026 ",
        u"On that note\u2026 I\u2019d really prefer it if you dropped the formality and called me by name from now on.": u"Falando nisso\u2026 Eu realmente preferiria que deixasse a formalidade de lado e me chamasse pelo nome de agora em diante.",
        u"On the upside, I think we\u2019re all destined to connect better thanks to the divination I did earlier while you guys were in that meeting!": u"Pelo lado positivo, acho que todos estamos destinados a criar la\u00e7os mais fortes, gra\u00e7as \u00e0 adivinha\u00e7\u00e3o que fiz enquanto voc\u00eas estavam na reuni\u00e3o!",
        u"On top of our other responsibilities, Aiden and I made sure that the camp was well-maintained and that the staff was properly cared for.": u"Al\u00e9m das outras responsabilidades, Aiden e eu garantimos que o acampamento fosse bem conservado e a equipe recebesse os devidos cuidados.",
        u"On top of our other responsibilities, Sir Goro had me tag along to his meetings and appointments. With each one, I started to gain confidence and learn from him.": u"Al\u00e9m de nossas outras responsabilidades, o Sr. Goro me levava \u00e0s reuni\u00f5es e compromissos dele. A cada um deles, comecei a ganhar confian\u00e7a e aprender com ele.",
        u"On top of that, we\u2019ll make sure to work overtime today to speed things up a bit!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, vamos fazer hora extra hoje para acelerar um pouco as coisas!",
        u"Once again I learn something new from you. ": u"Mais uma vez aprendo algo novo com voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Once again, thank you all for your hospitality! I hope that I didn\u2019t put you out too much.": u"Mais uma vez, agrade\u00e7o a hospitalidade de todos! Espero n\u00e3o ter causado muito inc\u00f4modo.",
        u"Once again, this is too much, sir\u2026 You\u2019ve already given so much to the camp, and now you\u2019re taking time to personally visit.": u"Mais uma vez, isso \u00e9 demais, senhor\u2026 O senhor j\u00e1 deu tanto ao acampamento e agora ainda est\u00e1 reservando seu tempo para vir pessoalmente.",
        u"Once the project started, I added the other\u2019s costumes, but with the hotel vacation, I thought there wasn\u2019t going to be time.": u"Quando o projeto come\u00e7ou, acrescentei as fantasias dos outros, mas com as f\u00e9rias no hotel achei que n\u00e3o ter\u00edamos tempo.",
        u"Once the term was over, Andre began struggling with the work around camp due to an illness.": u"Quando a temporada terminou, Andre come\u00e7ou a ter dificuldades com o trabalho no acampamento por causa de uma doen\u00e7a.",
        u"Once you all have decided, I\u2019ll have our staff move your luggage to your rooms!": u"Assim que decidirem, pedirei \u00e0 nossa equipe que leve a bagagem aos quartos!",
        u"Once you see mine all grown up, I\u2019ll drop that jaw of yours!": u"Quando vir o meu completamente crescido, seu queixo vai cair!",
        u"One day, I\u2019ll be able to take you to newer places. So, get used to the new sights.": u"Um dia, vou poder levar voc\u00ea a lugares novos. Ent\u00e3o v\u00e1 se acostumando com novas paisagens.",
        u"One day, I\u2019ll be right back here, and we\u2019ll be together again!": u"Um dia, vou voltar para c\u00e1 e estaremos juntos novamente!",
        u"One even mentioned\u2026 a \u201cbeefcake show\u201d???": u"Um deles at\u00e9 mencionou\u2026 um \u201cshow de musculosos\u201d???",
        u"One of our tech-savvy scouts last term actually went there to upload a promotional video for our fundraising campaign.": u"Na temporada passada, um de nossos escoteiros que entendia de tecnologia foi at\u00e9 l\u00e1 para enviar um v\u00eddeo promocional da nossa campanha de arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"One thing I know is that it\u2019s for the best if I have some time outside of Camp Buddy.": u"Uma coisa eu sei: ser\u00e1 melhor se eu passar algum tempo longe do Camp Buddy.",
        u"One\u2026 two\u2026 Whew\u2026!": u"Um\u2026 dois\u2026 Ufa\u2026!",
        u"One\u2026 two\u2026 three\u2026": u"Um\u2026 dois\u2026 tr\u00eas\u2026",
        u"Only Goro would know when it\u2019s time.": u"S\u00f3 Goro saber\u00e1 quando chegar a hora.",
        u"Only if I win, you bare it all instead!": u"Mas se eu ganhar, \u00e9 voc\u00ea que tira tudo!",
        u"Only when he has problems! That\u2019s why I hate it so much!": u"S\u00f3 quando ele est\u00e1 com problemas! \u00c9 por isso que eu odeio tanto isso!",
        u"Oof, don\u2019t move too much, Lloyd!": u"Oof, n\u00e3o se mexa demais, Lloyd!",
        u"Oof... Help me out here, Yoshi\u2026": u"Ufa... Ajude-me aqui, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Oof\u2026 Man, I\u2019m hungry\u2026 Did you cook anything yet, Aiden\u2026?": u"Ufa\u2026 Cara, estou com fome\u2026 J\u00e1 cozinhou alguma coisa, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Oof\u2026 Sounds bad.": u"Oof\u2026 Parece ruim.",
        u"Oof\u2026 Trust us, we know\u2026": u"Uff\u2026 Acredite, n\u00f3s sabemos\u2026",
        u"Oof\u2026 We\u2019re gonna have to take the whole day to get you all caught up\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Vamos precisar do dia inteiro para deixar voc\u00ea por dentro de tudo\u2026",
        u"Ooh! A bad dragon! A big bad dragon!": u"Ooh! Um drag\u00e3o mau! Um drag\u00e3o grande e mau!",
        u"Ooh! Aiden, should we get coq au vin? That sounds juicy~": u"Ooh! Aiden, ser\u00e1 que devemos pedir coq au vin? Parece suculento~",
        u"Ooh! Dad, should I get coq au vin? That sounds juicy~": u"Ooh! Pai, ser\u00e1 que pe\u00e7o coq au vin? Parece suculento~",
        u"Ooh! Good idea! I could really use that after a long trip! ": u"Ooh! Boa ideia! Eu realmente preciso disso depois de uma longa viagem! ",
        u"Ooh! Good idea! Maybe they\u2019re up to something fun! ": u"Ooh! Boa ideia! Talvez estejam fazendo algo divertido! ",
        u"Ooh! Good idea! My muscles need some stretching after sitting on that bus for hours! ": u"Ooh! Boa ideia! Meus m\u00fasculos precisam se alongar depois de passar horas sentado naquele \u00f4nibus! ",
        u"Ooh! Good idea! Those snacks were good on the ride, but I\u2019m craving some real food! ": u"Ooh! Boa ideia! Os lanches da viagem estavam gostosos, mas estou com vontade de comer comida de verdade! ",
