        u"Plus, I think you\u2019d enjoy working up a sweat too, if you know what I mean~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m gostaria de suar um pouco, se \u00e9 que me entende~",
        u"Plus, I\u2019m not complaining about some extra pizza~": u"Al\u00e9m disso, n\u00e3o vou reclamar de comer mais pizza~",
        u"Plus, doing chores over the last few months has been strangely\u2026 enjoyable.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, fazer tarefas dom\u00e9sticas nos \u00faltimos meses tem sido estranhamente\u2026 agrad\u00e1vel.",
        u"Plus, it\u2019d be nice to have some privacy again.": u"Al\u00e9m do mais, seria bom ter um pouco de privacidade de novo.",
        u"Poor Yoshinori here was panting like a dog a few minutes ago.": u"O pobre Yoshinori estava ofegando feito cachorro alguns minutos atr\u00e1s.",
        u"Pour me a drink and you got it!": u"Sirva uma bebida para mim e eu conto!",
        u"Pretty creepy!": u"Bem assustador!",
        u"Pretty hard, right? You\u2019ve seen what these arms can do...": u"Bem duros, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 viu do que estes bra\u00e7os s\u00e3o capazes\u2026",
        u"Pretty slick, huh?": u"Bem esperto, hein?",
        u"Pretty sure what I just did goes against the norm.": u"Tenho quase certeza de que o que acabei de fazer foge do que \u00e9 considerado normal.",
        u"Probably both.": u"Provavelmente os dois.",
        u"Probably waiting to speak with the manager again\u2026": u"Provavelmente esperando para falar com o gerente de novo\u2026",
        u"Professionals have spent years in culinary school studying and mastering the craft.": u"Profissionais passam anos em escolas de gastronomia estudando e dominando o of\u00edcio.",
        u"Prom? I\u2019ve never went to one. Too bad, \u2019cause I would\u2019ve loved to go with you.": u"Baile de formatura? Nunca fui a um. Uma pena, porque eu teria adorado ir com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Promise not to laugh.": u"Prometam que n\u00e3o v\u00e3o rir.",
        u"Props to your commitment.": u"Pontos pela dedica\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Psh! Why go further when you have Taiga right here? He was a total douche back then too, right?": u"Psh! Para que procurar outro exemplo quando temos o Taiga bem aqui? Ele tamb\u00e9m era um completo babaca naquela \u00e9poca, n\u00e3o era?",
        u"Psh, it\u2019s \u2019cause you always do it in front of others": u"Psh, \u00e9 porque voc\u00ea sempre faz isso na frente dos outros.",
        u"Psh, there were already strippers in there! Everyone was already expecting to see some dick, I just added an extra one!": u"Pff, j\u00e1 havia strippers l\u00e1! Todo mundo j\u00e1 esperava ver algum pau, eu s\u00f3 acrescentei mais um!",
        u"Psh\u2026 Hardly.": u"Psh\u2026 At\u00e9 parece.",
        u"Psh\u2026 I\u2019m fine! I\u2019m just HOT!": u"Psh\u2026 Estou bem! S\u00f3 estou com CALOR!",
        u"Psh\u2026! You\u2019re cheesy as always, Yoshi!": u"Pff\u2026! Voc\u00ea continua sentimental como sempre, Yoshi!",
        u"Psshhh. I\u2019m fine! ": u"Psshhh. Estou bem! ",
        u"Psssh, It\u2019s fine Gramps! You\u2019re the president, so we leave the hard choices up to you!": u"Psssh, est\u00e1 tudo bem, Vov\u00f4! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 o presidente, ent\u00e3o deixamos as decis\u00f5es dif\u00edceis nas suas m\u00e3os!",
        u"Psssh, no one cares~! Besides, I don\u2019t ever get a chance to talk about my hobbies to the two of you without getting scolded.": u"Psssh, ningu\u00e9m liga~! Al\u00e9m disso, nunca tenho oportunidade de falar dos meus hobbies com voc\u00eas dois sem levar bronca.",
        u"Pssst\u2026 Can you guys fill me in on who she is? Seems like she knows the rest of you.": u"Pssst\u2026 Podem me explicar quem ela \u00e9? Parece que conhece todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Pulse\u2026": u"Pulso\u2026",
