        u"R-Right\u2026 Is that why you don\u2019t have a shirt on? Aren't you cold?": u"C-Certo\u2026 \u00c9 por isso que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 sem camisa? N\u00e3o est\u00e1 com frio?",
        u"R-Right\u2026!": u"C-Certo\u2026!",
        u"R-Ring? Th-Thing\u2026?": u"A-Anel? C-Coisa\u2026?",
        u"R-Ring\u2026? Y-You mean the one\u2019s that\u2019s on your\u2026": u"A-Anel\u2026? V-Voc\u00ea quer dizer aquele que est\u00e1 no seu\u2026",
        u"R-Risque? I\u2019m listening\u2026": u"O-Ousada? Estou ouvindo\u2026",
        u"RAT?! Didn\u2019t know rich-person food is that exotic?!": u"RATO?! N\u00e3o sabia que comida de rico era t\u00e3o ex\u00f3tica?!",
        u"Raise your arms overhead, extending them high with a straight body\u2026": u"Levante os bra\u00e7os acima da cabe\u00e7a, estendendo-os bem alto e mantendo o corpo ereto\u2026",
        u"Really, sir? I don\u2019t want to get in your way, especially in an important meeting.": u"S\u00e9rio, senhor? N\u00e3o quero atrapalh\u00e1-lo, principalmente em uma reuni\u00e3o importante.",
        u"Really? I thought someone like you would\u2019ve pulled off this kind of job without a hitch.": u"S\u00e9rio? Achei que algu\u00e9m como voc\u00ea faria este trabalho sem nenhuma dificuldade.",
        u"Really? I thought you and Yuri went on trips like this together.": u"S\u00e9rio? Achei que o senhor e Yuri fizessem viagens assim juntos.",
        u"Really? If I was as rich as her, I\u2019d have nothing to whine about!": u"S\u00e9rio? Se eu fosse t\u00e3o rico quanto ela, n\u00e3o teria motivo nenhum para reclamar!",
        u"Really? I\u2019m a bit surprised, Jin. You\u2019re a really handsome guy, after all.": u"S\u00e9rio? Estou um pouco surpreso, Jin. Afinal, voc\u00ea \u00e9 um cara muito bonito.",
        u"Really? That\u2019s a relief \u2013 they\u2019ll know the place even better than an outside contractor would.": u"S\u00e9rio? Que al\u00edvio \u2014 eles conhecer\u00e3o o lugar melhor do que qualquer empreiteiro de fora.",
        u"Really? Then what was all that moaning for when I shoved it into him earlier? Sounds like even you got some pleasure out of that!": u"\u00c9 mesmo? Ent\u00e3o por que todos aqueles gemidos quando eu enfiei nele antes? Parece que at\u00e9 voc\u00ea sentiu prazer com aquilo!",
        u"Really? There must be something you do outside of work that always makes you happy!": u"S\u00e9rio? Deve haver algo que fa\u00e7a fora do trabalho e que sempre o deixe feliz!",
        u"Really? We\u2019re going through this again?": u"S\u00e9rio? Vamos passar por isso de novo?",
        u"Really? Why don\u2019t you come open it then~?": u"\u00c9 mesmo? Ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o vem abrir~?",
        u"Really? Why\u2019s that?": u"S\u00e9rio? Por qu\u00ea?",
        u"Really? You seem more of a food critic than a chef to me...": u"S\u00e9rio? Para mim, voc\u00ea parece mais uma cr\u00edtica gastron\u00f4mica do que uma chef\u2026",
        u"Really? You two almost never argue\u2026 Mind if I ask what was it about? ": u"S\u00e9rio? Voc\u00eas dois quase nunca discutem\u2026 Posso perguntar qual foi o motivo? ",
        u"Really\u2026? Wow\u2026 I didn\u2019t notice at all.": u"S\u00e9rio\u2026? Uau\u2026 Eu nem percebi.",
        u"Rebuilding other branches is a life\u2019s worth of work.": u"Reconstruir outras unidades \u00e9 trabalho para uma vida inteira.",
        u"Red would be excellent. Give us the best one.": u"Tinto seria excelente. Traga o melhor.",
        u"Rediscovering what this place means to me.": u"Redescobrir o que este lugar significa para mim.",
        u"Regardless of my past, I\u2019m happy where I am today.": u"Independentemente do meu passado, estou feliz onde estou hoje.",
        u"Regardless of our schedules and routines, we all adjusted to each other and finished the work according to all the deadlines.": u"Independentemente de nossos hor\u00e1rios e rotinas, todos nos adaptamos uns aos outros e conclu\u00edmos o trabalho dentro de todos os prazos.",
        u"Regardless, I am glad that she is surrounded by supportive people.": u"De qualquer forma, fico feliz que ela esteja cercada de pessoas que a apoiam.",
        u"Regardless, I have to accept your resignation and not allow you to represent my company any longer. ": u"Ainda assim, preciso aceitar sua ren\u00fancia e n\u00e3o posso mais permitir que represente minha empresa. ",
        u"Regardless, I\u2019ll have to report to Mr. Clermont on both the camp\u2019s situation and Emilia being sick.": u"De qualquer forma, terei que informar o Sr. Clermont tanto sobre a situa\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento quanto sobre o estado de sa\u00fade da Emilia.",
        u"Regardless, if she really is planning on quitting, that must be settled back at camp.": u"De qualquer forma, se ela realmente pretende se demitir, isso precisa ser resolvido no acampamento.",
        u"Regardless, it\u2019s a good thing to experience.": u"De qualquer forma, \u00e9 uma experi\u00eancia valiosa.",
        u"Regardless, knowing that everything is on track, it\u2019s clear to me that you all have done an excellent job with the project so far.": u"De qualquer forma, sabendo que tudo est\u00e1 dentro do planejado, fica claro para mim que todos fizeram um excelente trabalho no projeto at\u00e9 agora.",
        u"Regardless, my behavior was unacceptable, especially for someone who carries the name of the camp on their shoulders.": u"Independentemente disso, meu comportamento foi inaceit\u00e1vel, principalmente para algu\u00e9m que carrega o nome do acampamento nos ombros.",
        u"Regardless, this was quite the experience.": u"De qualquer forma, foi uma experi\u00eancia e tanto.",
        u"Regardless, this was quite the experience. ": u"De qualquer forma, foi uma experi\u00eancia e tanto. ",
        u"Relaaaax! Nobody ever comes in here besides me and my dad! And you won\u2019t tell on me, will you?": u"Relaxa! Ningu\u00e9m nunca entra aqui al\u00e9m de mim e do meu pai! E voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai contar para ningu\u00e9m, vai?",
        u"Relax! It just means that it reflects losses, struggles, unexpected changes, and interruptions in a person\u2019s lifestyle.": u"Relaxa! S\u00f3 significa que ela reflete perdas, dificuldades, mudan\u00e7as inesperadas e interrup\u00e7\u00f5es no estilo de vida de uma pessoa.",
