        u"S-So all I had to do this whole time was sneak up on Sir Goro while he\u2019s sleeping\u2026": u"E-Ent\u00e3o tudo que eu precisava fazer esse tempo todo era me aproximar do Sr. Goro enquanto ele dormia\u2026",
