        u"S-Sorry, sir\u2026! I didn\u2019t mean to!": u"D-Desculpe, senhor\u2026! N\u00e3o foi minha inten\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"S-Sorry\u2026 I take a long time to get ready\u2026 Especially for a special occasion\u2026": u"D-Desculpem\u2026 Demoro muito para me arrumar\u2026 Principalmente para uma ocasi\u00e3o especial\u2026",
        u"S-Sort of\u2026 But we didn\u2019t mean to\u2026": u"M-Mais ou menos\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o foi por querer\u2026",
        u"S-Spicy you say\u2026?!": u"P-Picantes, voc\u00ea disse\u2026?!",
        u"S-Stop staring at it!": u"P-Pare de olhar!",
        u"S-Stop staring at it, all of you\u2026! ": u"P-Parem todos de olhar para ela\u2026!",
        u"S-Sure thing, Sir! Let me just lock the door first. ": u"C-Claro, senhor! S\u00f3 vou trancar a porta primeiro. ",
        u"S-Sure, Aiden\u2026": u"C-Claro, Aiden\u2026",
        u"S-Sure, I\u2019ll let you know when I need it\u2026! ": u"C-Claro, aviso quando precisar\u2026! ",
        u"S-Sure\u2026": u"C-Claro\u2026",
        u"S-Sure\u2026 Right away, ma\u2019am.": u"C-Claro\u2026 Imediatamente, senhora.",
        u"S-Sure\u2026! Here you go. ": u"C-Claro\u2026! Aqui est\u00e1. ",
        u"S-Sword fight\u2026?": u"D-Duelo de espadas\u2026?",
        u"SEND THIS ANGEL BOY TO BL HEAVEN!": u"MANDEM ESTE GAROTO-ANJO PARA O PARA\u00cdSO BL!",
        u"SHUT YOUR FUCKING MOUTH!": u"CALE A PORRA DA BOCA!",
        u"SIR GORO!!!": u"SENHOR GORO!!!",
        u"SIR GORO\u2026!!": u"SR. GORO\u2026!!",
        u"STRETCH?!": u"FOR\u00c7ANDO?!",
        u"SWEET! You\u2019re gonna have a great time here with us, just like the good ol\u2019 days! ": u"\u00d3TIMO! Voc\u00ea vai se divertir muito aqui conosco, como nos bons e velhos tempos! ",
        u"Sadism and Masochism.": u"Sadismo e Masoquismo.",
        u"Sadly, she\u2019s always been like that\u2026": u"Infelizmente, ela sempre foi assim\u2026",
        u"Sadly, the workers won\u2019t arrive till next week\u2026 I don\u2019t think we have much of a choice but to do it ourselves.": u"Infelizmente, os trabalhadores s\u00f3 chegam na semana que vem\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o temos muita escolha al\u00e9m de fazer isso n\u00f3s mesmos.",
        u"Sadly, what you overheard was true. ": u"Infelizmente, o que voc\u00ea ouviu era verdade. ",
        u"Same goes for you! I\u2019d rather hang out with Mr. Perfect or Twinkerbell, or even that annoying Torch-head!": u"O mesmo vale para voc\u00ea! Eu preferiria passar o tempo com o Senhor Perfeito, a Fadinha ou at\u00e9 aquele Cabe\u00e7a de Tocha irritante!",
        u"Same! Although I didn't mind you turning into a hunk~": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m! Embora eu n\u00e3o tenha reclamado de voc\u00ea ter virado um gostos\u00e3o~",
        u"Same! I much prefer cuddly Gramps!": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m! Prefiro muito mais o Vov\u00f4 carinhoso!",
        u"Same, actually. But I think he\u2019s really enjoying his visit here.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m. Mas acho que ele est\u00e1 gostando muito da visita.",
        u"Same.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Same. And so did Lloyd.": u"Eu tamb\u00e9m. E Lloyd tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Save it for later, and check out this hotel brochure I got.": u"Guarde isso para mais tarde e d\u00ea uma olhada neste folheto do hotel que peguei.",
        u"Say, yes?": u"Que tal dizer \u2018sim\u2019?",
        u"Says like the worst offender of all of us.": u"Diz justamente o pior de todos n\u00f3s nisso.",
        u"Says the guy not in one yet.": u"Diz o cara que ainda nem colocou a dele.",
        u"Says the guy who has the biggest \u201ceverything\u201d out of everyone here!": u"Diz o cara que tem o maior \u201ctudo\u201d entre todos aqui!",
        u"Say\u2026 What made you decide on this trip all of a sudden?": u"Me diz\u2026 O que fez voc\u00ea decidir por esta viagem t\u00e3o de repente?",
        u"Scheduled or not, the management staff being the last ones to arrive is very telling.": u"Estando no cronograma ou n\u00e3o, o fato de a equipe de administra\u00e7\u00e3o ser a \u00faltima a chegar diz muita coisa.",
        u"Scissors! Hah! Got you!": u"Tesoura! Hah! Peguei voc\u00ea!",
        u"Sci\u2014I mean rock!": u"Teso\u2014quero dizer, pedra!",
        u"Scoot a little closer, will you?": u"Chegue um pouco mais perto, sim?",
        u"Score! I just got the best roommate!": u"Isso! Acabei de conseguir o melhor colega de quarto!",
        u"Scoutmaster Yoshi is a Pisces and Taiga is a Cancer.": u"O chefe escoteiro Yoshi \u00e9 de Peixes e Taiga \u00e9 de C\u00e2ncer.",
        u"Scoutmaster Yoshi, you\u2019re not even that old! You shouldn\u2019t be saying things like that.": u"Chefe escoteiro Yoshi, voc\u00ea nem \u00e9 t\u00e3o velho! N\u00e3o deveria falar assim.",
        u"Scrawny muscles! You\u2019ll look like Dynamite over here!": u"M\u00fasculos de magrelo! Voc\u00ea vai ficar igual ao Dinamite aqui!",
        u"Screw digging, this is way more fun!": u"Que se dane cavar, isso \u00e9 muito mais divertido!",
        u"Screw that! I did my part!! Our daughter\u2019s old enough, what else do you want from me?!": u"Que se dane! Eu fiz a minha parte!! Nossa filha j\u00e1 tem idade suficiente, o que mais voc\u00ea quer de mim?!",
        u"Screw the other room! I\u2019ll sleep on the floor! You won\u2019t even know I\u2019m there!": u"Dane-se o outro quarto! Eu durmo no ch\u00e3o! Voc\u00eas nem v\u00e3o perceber que estou l\u00e1!",
        u"Seasons have come and gone since we started this amazing project\u2026 And everything that happened was the opposite of what I thought it\u2019d be.": u"Temporadas vieram e se foram desde que come\u00e7amos este projeto incr\u00edvel\u2026 E tudo que aconteceu foi o oposto do que eu imaginava.",
        u"See that pile of broken bricks over there? I want you to smash \u2019em to smaller pieces!": u"Est\u00e1 vendo aquela pilha de tijolos quebrados? Quero que voc\u00ea quebre tudo em peda\u00e7os menores!",
        u"See that, Gramps? I\u2019m a perfect fit!": u"Viu s\u00f3, vov\u00f4? Eu encaixo perfeitamente!",
        u"See ya later, guys\u2026!": u"At\u00e9 mais, pessoal\u2026!",
        u"See ya, guys! It\u2019s been a pleasure working with everyone!": u"At\u00e9 mais, pessoal! Foi um prazer trabalhar com todos voc\u00eas!",
        u"See you guys soon! Can\u2019t wait to see your formal looks~!": u"At\u00e9 daqui a pouco! Mal posso esperar para ver voc\u00eas todos arrumados~!",
        u"See you inside, Yoshi. ": u"Vejo voc\u00ea l\u00e1 dentro, Yoshi. ",
        u"See you later then, Yoshinori.": u"At\u00e9 mais, ent\u00e3o, Yoshinori.",
        u"See, Aiden? Emilia gets it! Now where was I\u2026 ": u"Viu, Aiden? A Emilia entende! Agora, onde eu estava mesmo\u2026 ",
        u"See, Dad?! Yoichi doesn\u2019t mind! Now get out of those clothes\u2014": u"Viu, Pai?! Yoichi n\u00e3o se importa! Agora tire essas roupas\u2014",
        u"See, Dar? There\u2019s no need to be shy!": u"Viu, Dar? N\u00e3o precisa ter vergonha!",
        u"See, Darius here was kinda like a brother to me back in my scout days, Yoshi.": u"Veja, Yoshi, o Darius era como um irm\u00e3o para mim na \u00e9poca em que eu era escoteiro.",
        u"See, I told you they\u2019d laugh at me!": u"Viu? Eu disse que eles iam rir de mim!",
        u"See, Lloyd understands! I always love poking at these two~!": u"Viu? Lloyd entende! Eu adoro provocar esses dois~!",
        u"See, Yoshi? Jin\u2019s cool with it!": u"Est\u00e1 vendo, Yoshi? Jin est\u00e1 de boa com isso!",
        u"See, this is why I didn\u2019t ever want to listen to him back then.": u"Viu? \u00c9 por isso que eu nunca queria ouvir ele naquela \u00e9poca.",
        u"See, you\u2019re getting the hang of it~": u"Viu? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pegando o jeito~",
        u"See? Aiden gets it! Where\u2019s your camping spirit, Yuri?": u"Viu? Aiden entendeu! Onde est\u00e1 seu esp\u00edrito aventureiro, Yuri?",
        u"See? He said it himself.": u"Viu? Ele mesmo disse.",
        u"See? Isn\u2019t that nice?": u"Viu? N\u00e3o \u00e9 uma del\u00edcia?",
        u"See? It\u2019s big enough for the both of us.": u"Viu? \u00c9 grande o bastante para n\u00f3s dois.",
        u"See? It\u2019s pretty easy.": u"Viu? \u00c9 bem f\u00e1cil.",
        u"See? Just relax and enjoy it.": u"Viu? Apenas relaxe e aproveite.",
        u"See? Modest.": u"Viu? Modesto.",
        u"See? Mr. Clermont knows how to have fun!": u"Viu? O Sr. Clermont sabe se divertir!",
        u"See? Sir Goro and Aiden have the camping spirit, even when we\u2019re on a bus!": u"Viram? O Sr. Goro e Aiden mant\u00eam o esp\u00edrito do acampamento at\u00e9 dentro de um \u00f4nibus!",
        u"See? That\u2019s the healthy way of thinking about it!": u"Viu? Essa \u00e9 a maneira saud\u00e1vel de pensar!",
        u"See? Yoshinori here clearly took notes!": u"Est\u00e1 vendo? Yoshinori claramente fez anota\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"See? Yoshinori understands!": u"Viram? Yoshinori entende!",
        u"See? ~ New beginnings! ": u"Viram?~ Novos come\u00e7os!",
        u"Seeing Aiden happy with my company made it all worth it.": u"Ver Aiden feliz com minha companhia fazia tudo valer a pena.",
        u"Seeing how you\u2019ve gotten so close over the last few months, all leading up to a proposal\u2026 wow!": u"Ver como voc\u00eas ficaram t\u00e3o pr\u00f3ximos nos \u00faltimos meses, culminando num pedido de casamento\u2026 uau!",
        u"Seeing others, I thought I was a freak.": u"Vendo os outros, achei que eu fosse uma aberra\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Seeing the frameworks of the new cabins at the expansion site, we could already imagine how different the camp was going to look.": u"Ao vermos as estruturas das novas cabanas na \u00e1rea de expans\u00e3o, j\u00e1 consegu\u00edamos imaginar como o acampamento ficaria diferente.",
        u"Seeing us like this feels so nostalgic\u2026 It really takes me back\u2026": u"Ver todos n\u00f3s assim traz tanta nostalgia\u2026 Realmente me faz voltar no tempo\u2026",
        u"Seeing you guys together, it\u2019s like there\u2019s some new spark in him\u2026 From the way he talks to you, to the tiniest gestures.": u"Quando vejo voc\u00eas juntos, parece que h\u00e1 uma nova chama nele\u2026 Desde a forma como fala com voc\u00ea at\u00e9 os menores gestos.",
        u"Seeing you in my leather jacket really gets me going\u2026": u"Ver voc\u00ea usando minha jaqueta de couro realmente me deixa excitado\u2026",
        u"Seems he was really having stomach issues.": u"Parece que ele realmente estava com problemas no est\u00f4mago.",
        u"Seems like you might\u2019ve partied a bit too much last night...  ": u"Parece que voc\u00ea festejou um pouco demais ontem \u00e0 noite...  ",
        u"Seeya at the party then~": u"Vejo voc\u00eas na festa~",
        u"Seeya later, you two!": u"At\u00e9 mais, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Seeya!": u"At\u00e9 mais!",
        u"Seriously though, It\u2019s the least I could do.": u"Mas, falando s\u00e9rio, \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer.",
        u"Seriously, Aiden. I can\u2019t believe you haven\u2019t grown out of this stripping habit of yours.": u"S\u00e9rio, Aiden. N\u00e3o acredito que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o superou esse h\u00e1bito de tirar a roupa.",
        u"Seriously, I should watch over you more often. ": u"Falando s\u00e9rio, eu deveria cuidar mais de voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Seriously, I think it\u2019s just some excuse to get Yoshi to do her job or something.": u"Sinceramente, acho que \u00e9 s\u00f3 uma desculpa para fazer Yoshi trabalhar por ela ou algo assim.",
        u"Seriously, Keitaro?": u"S\u00e9rio, Keitaro?",
        u"Seriously, Yoshi? Read the room!": u"S\u00e9rio, Yoshi? Perceba o clima!",
        u"Seriously, this stuff should all be digital by now. ": u"S\u00e9rio, a essa altura tudo isso j\u00e1 deveria ser digital. ",
        u"Seriously. How does everyone here strip so fast?": u"S\u00e9rio. Como todo mundo aqui tira a roupa t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido?",
        u"Seriously? How do you even keep track of everyone\u2019s scent here?!": u"S\u00e9rio? Como voc\u00ea consegue acompanhar o cheiro de todo mundo daqui?!",
        u"Seriously?! After everyone tore into me back there, you still have the nerve to attack me like this?!": u"Est\u00e1 falando s\u00e9rio?! Depois de todo mundo cair em cima de mim l\u00e1 dentro, voc\u00ea ainda tem coragem de me atacar assim?!",
        u"Seriously?! After you kept your mouth shut and let everyone gang up on me back there, you still have the nerve to attack me like this?!": u"S\u00e9rio?! Depois de ficar calado e deixar todo mundo se voltar contra mim l\u00e1 dentro, voc\u00ea ainda tem coragem de me atacar assim?!",
        u"Seriously?! What\u2019s gotten into you, Yoshinori?!": u"S\u00e9rio?! O que deu em voc\u00ea, Yoshinori?!",
        u"Serving the first course! ": u"Servindo o primeiro prato! ",
        u"Sh-Shallow?!": u"S-Superficial?!",
        u"Sh-Should someone try and stop her\u2026? ": u"A-Algu\u00e9m deveria tentar impedi-la\u2026? ",
        u"Sh-Should someone try and stop her\u2026? We might get kicked out of here\u2026 I don\u2019t wanna stay outside covered in snow\u2026": u"A-Algu\u00e9m n\u00e3o deveria tentar impedi-la\u2026? Podemos acabar expulsos daqui\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o quero ficar l\u00e1 fora coberto de neve\u2026",
        u"Sh-Should someone try and stop her\u2026? {fast}": u"A-Algu\u00e9m deveria tentar impedi-la\u2026? {fast}",
        u"Sh-Should we let go? He\u2019s starting to grope my chest\u2026": u"D-Dever\u00edamos soltar? Ele est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando a apalpar meu peito\u2026",
        u"Sh-Shut up!": u"C-Cala a boca!",
        u"Sh-Shut up! My parents love me! They buy me EVERYTHING I ask for!": u"C-Cala a boca! Meus pais me amam! Eles compram TUDO o que eu pe\u00e7o!",
        u"Shall we go meet the workers then? We\u2019ll have a short briefing on each department\u2019s status.": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos encontrar os trabalhadores? Faremos uma breve reuni\u00e3o sobre a situa\u00e7\u00e3o de cada departamento.",
        u"Shape.": u"Formato.",
        u"She and her mother didn\u2019t get along, and all Yuri saw when we were together was her parents arguing\u2026": u"Ela e a m\u00e3e n\u00e3o se davam bem, e tudo que Yuri via quando est\u00e1vamos juntos eram os pais discutindo\u2026",
        u"She could just occasionally drop by since her job is only to inspect.": u"Ela poderia simplesmente aparecer de vez em quando, j\u00e1 que o trabalho dela \u00e9 apenas fazer inspe\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"She could quit at any time since she doesn\u2019t really need this job\u2026 but she doesn\u2019t\u2026": u"Ela poderia pedir demiss\u00e3o a qualquer momento, j\u00e1 que n\u00e3o precisa realmente desse emprego\u2026 mas n\u00e3o pede\u2026",
        u"She deserved it.": u"Ela mereceu.",
        u"She didn't seem to take it well when I spoke up at the meeting earlier.": u"Ela tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o pareceu reagir bem quando me manifestei na reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"She didn\u2019t even DO anything! All she did was make a crappy schedule and then agree to go back to the one you made, Dad.": u"Ela nem FEZ nada! S\u00f3 criou um cronograma horr\u00edvel e depois concordou em voltar ao que o senhor havia feito, pai.",
        u"She didn\u2019t have a problem with you, did she?": u"Ela n\u00e3o teve nenhum problema com voc\u00ea, teve?",
        u"She doesn\u2019t get along with anyone, creates problems that aren\u2019t even there, and last but not least, she\u2019s mean to the bone.": u"Ela n\u00e3o se d\u00e1 bem com ningu\u00e9m, cria problemas que nem existem e, por \u00faltimo mas n\u00e3o menos importante, \u00e9 maldosa at\u00e9 os ossos.",
        u"She doesn\u2019t have to be a scoutmaster to be able to help the camp out.": u"Ela n\u00e3o precisa ser chefe escoteira para poder ajudar o acampamento.",
        u"She doesn\u2019t seem to take rejection well\u2026 Just like when I spoke up at the meeting earlier.": u"Ela n\u00e3o parece lidar bem com rejei\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026 Assim como quando me manifestei na reuni\u00e3o mais cedo.",
        u"She doesn\u2019t\u2026": u"Ela n\u00e3o tem\u2026",
        u"She even accused me of picking favorites among the campers.": u"Ela chegou a me acusar de escolher favoritos entre os campistas.",
        u"She finally realized she had made her fair share of mistakes, in fact. I am glad she\u2019s beginning to take accountability for her actions.": u"Na verdade, ela finalmente percebeu que tamb\u00e9m cometeu muitos erros. Fico feliz que esteja come\u00e7ando a assumir responsabilidade por suas atitudes.",
        u"She has a point.": u"Ela tem raz\u00e3o.",
        u"She lied her way back out of desperation not only for her survival but also to regain her pride\u2026": u"Ela mentiu para conseguir voltar por desespero, n\u00e3o apenas para sobreviver, mas tamb\u00e9m para recuperar seu orgulho\u2026",
        u"She made what was supposed to be an amazing fine dining experience super awkward and embarrassing.": u"Ela transformou o que deveria ser uma experi\u00eancia incr\u00edvel de alta gastronomia em algo extremamente constrangedor e desconfort\u00e1vel.",
        u"She might as well have, saying that my taste in fashion hasn\u2019t changed after all these years!": u"Foi praticamente isso quando disse que meu gosto por moda n\u00e3o mudou depois de todos esses anos!",
        u"She might experience some lethargy when she regains her consciousness but overall, she\u2019ll be fine.": u"Ela pode sentir alguma letargia quando recuperar a consci\u00eancia, mas, no geral, ficar\u00e1 bem.",
        u"She needs to learn a lesson.": u"Ela precisa aprender uma li\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"She never enjoyed her time at camp as a scout, so it doesn\u2019t make sense why she\u2019d accept coming back here in the first place\u2026": u"Ela nunca gostou do tempo que passou no acampamento como escoteira, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o faz sentido ter aceitado voltar para c\u00e1\u2026",
        u"She probably knew I would hate this one and took advantage of my initiative! That witch!": u"Ela provavelmente sabia que eu odiaria essa tarefa e se aproveitou da minha iniciativa! Aquela bruxa!",
        u"She really did lose everything she had, just like we found out in our search\u2026": u"Ela realmente perdeu tudo o que tinha, exatamente como descobrimos na nossa pesquisa\u2026",
        u"She really does push your buttons, doesn\u2019t she? ": u"Ela realmente tira voc\u00ea do s\u00e9rio, n\u00e3o \u00e9? ",
        u"She really has the nerve to be the angry one?! ": u"Ela ainda tem a cara de pau de ficar com raiva?! ",
        u"She said it contrasts with my skin tone nicely~": u"Ela disse que combina bem com o tom da minha pele~",
        u"She said that to you\u2026?": u"Ela disse isso para voc\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"She said the same thing to me yesterday, too\u2026 It\u2019s why I was up working all night\u2026": u"Ela disse a mesma coisa para mim ontem tamb\u00e9m\u2026 Foi por isso que fiquei trabalhando a noite inteira\u2026",
        u"She says that she regretted how 'covered' I was during the last costume party and wanted to give me more eye-candy this time.": u"Ela disse que se arrependeu de eu estar t\u00e3o 'coberto' na \u00faltima festa \u00e0 fantasia e queria me dar mais col\u00edrio para os olhos desta vez.",
        u"She should be able to handle your trip back. Our shuttle\u2019s seats can be laid back so she can properly rest.": u"Ela deve conseguir fazer a viagem de volta. Os assentos do nosso \u00f4nibus reclinam, ent\u00e3o poder\u00e1 descansar adequadamente.",
        u"She should be punished for this! You can\u2019t let this slide just because she\u2019s your daughter!!": u"Ela tem que ser punida por isso! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode deixar passar s\u00f3 porque ela \u00e9 sua filha!!",
        u"She told me that she wanted to work with me to help clear up my role on this project.": u"Ela disse que queria trabalhar comigo para ajudar a definir minha fun\u00e7\u00e3o neste projeto.",
        u"She used to act as if I was her rival or something when I was just minding my own business!": u"Ela agia como se eu fosse rival dela ou algo assim, quando eu s\u00f3 estava cuidando da minha vida!",
        u"She wants me to clean up after the construction workers at the site every day, and write these super detailed reports that I don\u2019t even know how to do\u2026": u"Ela quer que eu limpe a sujeira dos trabalhadores no terreno todos os dias e escreva relat\u00f3rios muito detalhados que nem sei como fazer\u2026",
        u"She was always away, leaving Dad and I, like we weren\u2019t a family.": u"Ela estava sempre longe, deixando eu e o pai para tr\u00e1s, como se n\u00e3o f\u00f4ssemos uma fam\u00edlia.",
        u"She was asking if I planned to accept her offer about working with her for the rest of the project.": u"Ela perguntou se eu pretendia aceitar a oferta de trabalhar com ela pelo restante do projeto.",
        u"She was being so disrespectful, especially to Aiden.": u"Ela estava sendo muito desrespeitosa, principalmente com o Aiden.",
        u"She was reaaaallly glaring at you though, Gramps.": u"Mas ela estava encarando muuuito voc\u00ea, Vov\u00f4.",
        u"She was really caught off guard that we found out about her secret, though\u2026 that really pushed her over her limit\u2026": u"Ela ficou realmente surpresa por termos descoberto o segredo dela\u2026 isso a levou ao limite\u2026",
        u"She was saying hurtful things.": u"Ela estava dizendo coisas cru\u00e9is.",
        u"She was saying so many hurtful things, especially about Aiden.": u"Ela estava dizendo tantas coisas cru\u00e9is, principalmente sobre o Aiden.",
        u"She was so disrespectful.": u"Ela foi muito desrespeitosa.",
        u"She was so furious she even said she quits.": u"Ela ficou t\u00e3o furiosa que at\u00e9 disse que se demite.",
        u"She was so pissed off when she thought she had to pay for the extended stay\u2026": u"Ela ficou furiosa quando achou que teria que pagar pela estadia prolongada\u2026",
        u"She was trying to discredit all of us after our hard work.": u"Ela estava tentando desacreditar todos n\u00f3s depois de tanto trabalho.",
        u"She was trying to discredit everyone.": u"Ela estava tentando desacreditar todo mundo.",
        u"She wasn\u2019t injured or struggling to breathe when I found her\u2026 So, let\u2019s just hope everything is ok\u2026": u"Ela n\u00e3o estava ferida nem com dificuldade para respirar quando a encontrei\u2026 Ent\u00e3o s\u00f3 podemos esperar que esteja tudo bem\u2026",
        u"She would complain as usual, but she did the job well and got it done on time!": u"Ela reclamava como sempre, mas fazia um bom trabalho e terminava tudo no prazo!",
        u"Sheeeessshh, you sound so pissed, Grampss\u2026.": u"Caaaraamba, voc\u00ea parece t\u00e3o irritado, Vov\u00f4\u2026",
        u"Sheesh Gramps, do we need to get your memory checked? I think you\u2019ve said that line every day the past few months!": u"Caramba, Vov\u00f4, precisamos examinar sua mem\u00f3ria? Acho que voc\u00ea diz essa frase todo dia h\u00e1 meses!",
        u"Sheesh, Gramps! You startled me!": u"Caramba, Vov\u00f4! Voc\u00ea me assustou!",
        u"Sheesh, I barely recognize myself there. Has it really been that long\u2026?": u"Nossa, mal me reconhe\u00e7o a\u00ed. J\u00e1 faz mesmo tanto tempo\u2026?",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi, I almost had a heart attack!": u"Caramba, Yoshi, quase tive um ataque card\u00edaco!",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi. Did you only invite me to work out for the gunshow?": u"Caramba, Yoshi. Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 me chamou para treinar para ficar admirando os m\u00fasculos?",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi. Look what you\u2019ve done to Jin in just a day.": u"Nossa, Yoshi. Veja o que voc\u00ea fez com Jin em apenas um dia.",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi\u2026 Shouldn\u2019t you be taking it easy? The sportsfest is over, and we\u2019re on vacation! We should be relaxing!": u"Caramba, Yoshi\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria pegar leve? O festival esportivo acabou e estamos de f\u00e9rias! Dever\u00edamos estar relaxando!",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi\u2026 That was messy\u2026": u"Caramba, Yoshi\u2026 Isso foi complicado\u2026",
        u"Sheesh, Yoshi\u2026 What the heck made her so mad during the inspection?": u"Nossa, Yoshi\u2026 O que diabos deixou ela t\u00e3o irritada durante a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Sheesh, Yuri\u2026 Even after all these years, you still hate her this much?": u"Caramba, Yuri\u2026 Mesmo depois de todos esses anos, voc\u00ea ainda odeia tanto ela?",
        u"Sheesh, Yuri\u2026 You\u2019re gonna give me a heart attack\u2026 I thought you were gonna smack Emilia there for a second.": u"Caramba, Yuri\u2026 Voc\u00ea vai me dar um ataque card\u00edaco\u2026 Por um segundo achei que fosse bater na Emilia.",
        u"Sheesh, seriously? I thought you of all people would know the local rules!": u"Nossa, s\u00e9rio? Pensei que justamente voc\u00ea conhecesse as regras locais!",
        u"Sheesh, so this is what it\u2019s like to be cheesy.": u"Caramba, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 assim que \u00e9 ser meloso.",
        u"Sheesh, we totally reek from all that pool sludge!": u"Nossa, estamos fedendo por causa de toda aquela lama da piscina!",
        u"Sheesh, you don\u2019t sound excited at all. Come on, tell us more! How have you been all these years?": u"Nossa, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parece nem um pouco animado. Vamos, conte mais! Como voc\u00ea esteve durante todos esses anos?",
        u"Sheesh... He really has that much money to blow on peeps like us? You sure the guy just doesn\u2019t have a crush on you, Gramps?": u"Caramba... Ele realmente tem tanto dinheiro assim para gastar com gente como n\u00f3s? Tem certeza de que esse cara n\u00e3o est\u00e1 a fim de voc\u00ea, vov\u00f4?",
        u"Sheesh... I knew that was a bad idea.": u"Nossa... Eu sabia que era uma p\u00e9ssima ideia.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 All of a sudden, our work piled in like a storm\u2026 Literally\u2026": u"Caramba\u2026 De repente, nosso trabalho se acumulou como uma tempestade\u2026 Literalmente\u2026",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 I can only imagine her reaction.": u"Nossa\u2026 S\u00f3 consigo imaginar a rea\u00e7\u00e3o dela.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 I dunno what to say, Yoshi.": u"Nossa\u2026 N\u00e3o sei o que dizer, Yoshi.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 I feel bad, it\u2019s almost midnight and you haven\u2019t eaten yet\u2026 ": u"Poxa\u2026 Estou me sentindo mal, j\u00e1 \u00e9 quase meia-noite e voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o comeu\u2026 ",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 I honestly forgot that thing existed\u2026 I think the last time I saw it was when we were still scouts!": u"Nossa\u2026 Eu sinceramente tinha esquecido que isso existia\u2026 Acho que a \u00faltima vez que o vi foi quando ainda \u00e9ramos escoteiros!",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 Now I know where Yoshi got his speeches from.": u"Caramba\u2026 Agora sei de onde o Yoshi tirou esses discursos.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 Saying that still feels unreal! I just got chills!": u"Caramba\u2026 Dizer isso ainda parece irreal! At\u00e9 me deu um arrepio!",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 Someone woke up the wrong side of the bed again, huh?": u"Caramba\u2026 Algu\u00e9m acordou com o p\u00e9 esquerdo de novo, hein?",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 Sounds like someone woke up on the wrong side of the bed today, huh\u2026? ": u"Caramba\u2026 Parece que algu\u00e9m acordou com o p\u00e9 esquerdo hoje, hein\u2026? ",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 That doesn\u2019t look good\u2026": u"Caramba\u2026 Isso n\u00e3o parece nada bom\u2026",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 There\u2019s so much stuff on Gramps\u2019 desk\u2026 How can he even tell which stack of paper he\u2019s working on? ": u"Caramba\u2026 Tem tanta coisa na mesa do Vov\u00f4\u2026 Como ele sabe em qual pilha de pap\u00e9is est\u00e1 trabalhando? ",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 Using that was a real low blow.": u"Caramba\u2026 Usar isso contra voc\u00ea foi um golpe muito baixo.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 You could\u2019ve gone along with it for a minute, dad.": u"Nossa\u2026 Podia ter entrado na brincadeira por um minuto, pai.",
        u"Sheesh\u2026 You don\u2019t sound that excited, Yoshi. ": u"Caramba\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parece t\u00e3o animado, Yoshi. ",
        u"She\u2019d be left out to dry\u2026 again. ": u"Ela ficaria desamparada\u2026 de novo. ",
        u"She\u2019s a Karen.": u"Ela \u00e9 uma Karen.",
        u"She\u2019s a real domme.": u"Ela \u00e9 uma dominadora de verdade.",
        u"She\u2019s also expecting me to work with her at the same time\u2026": u"E, ao mesmo tempo, espera que eu trabalhe com ela\u2026",
        u"She\u2019s an excellent counselor, I must say.": u"Tenho que admitir que ela \u00e9 uma excelente conselheira.",
        u"She\u2019s been talking nonstop about how excited she was to see you all dressed up...": u"Ela n\u00e3o parou de falar sobre como estava animada para ver voc\u00eas todos arrumados...",
        u"She\u2019s fortunate that someone found her, or it could have been much worse.": u"Ela teve sorte de algu\u00e9m encontr\u00e1-la, ou poderia ter sido muito pior.",
        u"She\u2019s lucky Dad\u2019s way past his gangster days, or else she would\u2019ve been taken down!": u"Ela tem sorte de o papai ter deixado os tempos de g\u00e2ngster para tr\u00e1s, sen\u00e3o j\u00e1 teria sido derrubada!",
        u"She\u2019s neither. She\u2019s just mean. ": u"Ela n\u00e3o \u00e9 nenhum dos dois. Ela s\u00f3 \u00e9 maldosa. ",
        u"She\u2019s nitpicking at this point.": u"A essa altura ela s\u00f3 est\u00e1 procurando pelo em ovo.",
        u"She\u2019s probably gonna be talking about \u2018cracks\u2019 and \u2018ships\u2019 the entire way, whatever that means.": u"Ela provavelmente vai passar o caminho inteiro falando de \u2018cracks\u2019 e \u2018ships\u2019, seja l\u00e1 o que isso signifique.",
        u"She\u2019s so business-minded she couldn\u2019t care less about our feelings! I bet that was the ugly side of a Capricorn talking!": u"Ela s\u00f3 pensa em neg\u00f3cios e n\u00e3o d\u00e1 a m\u00ednima para nossos sentimentos! Aposto que era o lado ruim de Capric\u00f3rnio falando!",
        u"She\u2019s still annoying, don\u2019t get me wrong. But we\u2019re learning to deal with each other better.": u"Ela ainda \u00e9 irritante, n\u00e3o me entenda mal. Mas estamos aprendendo a lidar melhor uma com a outra.",
        u"She\u2019s the one who pulled my hair first! I was just defending myself!": u"Foi ela que puxou meu cabelo primeiro! Eu s\u00f3 estava me defendendo!",
        u"She\u2026 just\u2026 attacked me out of nowhere! ": u"Ela\u2026 simplesmente\u2026 me atacou do nada! ",
        u"Shh, Gramps! Don\u2019t be so obvious about it! We\u2019re not supposed to have them in public!": u"Shh, Vov\u00f4! N\u00e3o fale t\u00e3o abertamente! N\u00e3o dever\u00edamos beber isto em p\u00fablico!",
        u"Shh, Lloyd. She\u2019s right over there.": u"Shh, Lloyd. Ela est\u00e1 bem ali.",
        u"Shhh! Don\u2019t throw me under the bus, Yuri!": u"Shhh! N\u00e3o me entregue assim, Yuri!",
        u"Shocking, I know. But it was her decision.": u"Chocante, eu sei. Mas foi decis\u00e3o dela.",
        u"Shorty was fuming, so I had to drag him away before the giant finished him.": u"O baixinho estava furioso, ent\u00e3o tive que arrast\u00e1-lo para longe antes que o gigante acabasse com ele.",
        u"Shots, shots, shots! Wooo! ": u"Doses, doses, doses! Uhuu! ",
        u"Should I call him Slenderman now?": u"Ser\u00e1 que devo cham\u00e1-lo de Slenderman agora?",
        u"Should we clean up the mess hall first, though? It\u2019s probably a little dustier than usual\u2026": u"Mas n\u00e3o dever\u00edamos limpar o refeit\u00f3rio primeiro? Provavelmente est\u00e1 um pouco mais empoeirado que o normal\u2026",
        u"Should we continue with our tou\u2014": u"Podemos continuar nosso pas\u2014",
        u"Should we get you moved into our cabin now, Jin? Or get you some breakfast first, at least?": u"Vamos acomod\u00e1-lo em nossa cabana agora, Jin? Ou pelo menos providenciar seu caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3 primeiro?",
        u"Should we go down to the lobby and check out just to be sure? ": u"Vamos descer at\u00e9 o sagu\u00e3o e fazer o check-out s\u00f3 para ter certeza? ",
        u"Should we head over there now?": u"Devemos ir para l\u00e1 agora?",
        u"Should we seal the deal then?": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos selar o acordo?",
        u"Shouldn\u2019t pompous, rich snobs like you be rotting in your mansion all alone?!": u"Esnobes ricas e metidas como voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveriam estar apodrecendo sozinhas nas pr\u00f3prias mans\u00f5es?!",
        u"Shouldn\u2019t someone like her be able to afford something like that anyway?": u"Algu\u00e9m como ela n\u00e3o deveria conseguir pagar algo assim sem problemas?",
        u"Shouldn\u2019t we confirm this with Emilia first?": u"N\u00e3o dever\u00edamos confirmar isso com Emilia primeiro?",
        u"Shouldn\u2019t you be resting now too? I saw you with Lloyd and Darius going around the camp all afternoon.": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o deveria estar descansando agora? Vi voc\u00ea com Lloyd e Darius andando pelo acampamento a tarde inteira.",
        u"Shouldn\u2019t you know better than anyone as the camp\u2019s leader that business is no place for emotional attachment?!": u"Como l\u00edder do acampamento, voc\u00ea deveria saber melhor do que ningu\u00e9m que neg\u00f3cios n\u00e3o s\u00e3o lugar para v\u00ednculos emocionais!",
        u"Show me your hand!": u"Mostre sua m\u00e3o!",
        u"Show up in front of everyone and say I\u2019m dirt poor and unskilled?! ": u"Aparecer na frente de todo mundo e dizer que sou miser\u00e1vel e n\u00e3o tenho qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o nenhuma?! ",
        u"Shush, Dar.": u"Shhh, Dar.",
        u"Shush, Wolfboy!": u"Shh, garoto-lobo!",
        u"Shush, Wolfboy.": u"Quieto, Garoto-Lobo.",
        u"Shush, you! I\u2019ll help you plan your wedding some other day! ": u"Shhh, voc\u00ea! Eu ajudo a planejar seu casamento outro dia! ",
        u"Shut it! And why are these old geezers in here? Are they getting to eat the new batch before the rest of us?!": u"Cala a boca! E por que esses velhotes est\u00e3o aqui? Eles v\u00e3o comer a nova leva antes do resto de n\u00f3s?!",
        u"Shut the hell up, Emilia! You know nothing about Aiden!": u"Cala a porra da boca, Emilia! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe nada sobre o Aiden!",
        u"Shut up! I can piss wherever I want! ": u"Cala a boca! Posso mijar onde eu quiser! ",
        u"Shut up! Just leave me alone like everyone else!!!": u"Cala a boca! S\u00f3 me deixa sozinha como todo mundo!!!",
        u"Shut up, Dynamite!": u"Cale a boca, Dinamite!",
        u"Shut up, Dynamite! I wasn\u2019t talking to you!": u"Cala a boca, Dinamite! Eu n\u00e3o estava falando com voc\u00ea!",
        u"Shut up, Mr. Perfect!": u"Cale a boca, Sr. Perfeito!",
        u"Shut up, old geezer! We\u2019re having fun! ": u"Cala a boca, velhote! Estamos nos divertindo! ",
        u"Sh\u2026Soggy Daddy.": u"P\u2026Papai Encharcado.",
        u"Simpletons! These are just the appetizers! They\u2019re supposed to be small!": u"Simpl\u00f3rios! Estas s\u00e3o apenas as entradas! Elas devem ser pequenas!",
        u"Since I left after the first term, you had to manage everything on your own\u2026 I can only imagine how much more difficult it was to be in your shoes.": u"Como fui embora depois da primeira temporada, o senhor teve que administrar tudo sozinho\u2026 S\u00f3 posso imaginar como foi dif\u00edcil estar no seu lugar.",
        u"Since I\u2019ll be staying here for the QA work, I thought I\u2019d go out of my way to make sure you get a clearer perspective!": u"Como ficarei aqui para o controle de qualidade, farei quest\u00e3o de lhe proporcionar uma perspectiva mais clara!",
        u"Since I\u2019m here, I might as well\u2026": u"J\u00e1 que estou aqui, posso aproveitar e\u2026",
        u"Since he\u2019s my dad, I can get complacent working with him and complain a lot, which he tolerates for some reason.": u"Como ele \u00e9 meu pai, acabo ficando acomodada trabalhando com ele e reclamo bastante, coisa que ele tolera por algum motivo.",
        u"Since it sounds like everyone\u2019s not that willing to learn, you can all just watch what I\u2019m doing and follow~": u"J\u00e1 que parece que ningu\u00e9m est\u00e1 muito disposto a aprender, podem simplesmente observar o que fa\u00e7o e me imitar~",
        u"Since our workout yesterday, Jin wanted to continue being more physically active.": u"Desde o nosso treino de ontem, Jin quis continuar sendo mais ativo fisicamente.",
        u"Since this morning.": u"Desde hoje de manh\u00e3.",
        u"Since those do have the most room for improvement, as you said back in the meeting. Aiden could really use some help with the oversight.": u"Como voc\u00ea disse na reuni\u00e3o, s\u00e3o os que mais podem melhorar. Aiden realmente precisa de ajuda com a supervis\u00e3o.",
        u"Since we achieved this goal and everybody is here, along with Mr. Clermont and the scouts, I\u2019ve decided to throw us a party!": u"Como alcan\u00e7amos essa meta e todo mundo est\u00e1 aqui, junto com o Sr. Clermont e os escoteiros, decidi fazer uma festa para n\u00f3s!",
        u"Since we\u2019re all here, why don\u2019t we work on it together, sir?": u"J\u00e1 que estamos todos aqui, por que n\u00e3o trabalhamos juntos, senhor?",
        u"Since when were you the tardy person, hmm? Have all these years at Camp Buddy really changed you that much?": u"Desde quando voc\u00ea \u00e9 o atrasado, hmm? Todos esses anos no Camp Buddy realmente o mudaram tanto assim?",
        u"Since you are VIP guests, your food, room, and entertainment are included in your stay, on top of priority access to all our facilities!": u"Como s\u00e3o h\u00f3spedes VIP, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o, acomoda\u00e7\u00e3o e entretenimento est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na estadia, al\u00e9m de acesso priorit\u00e1rio a todas as nossas instala\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"Since your dad is the chef here, then that means you should know a thing or two about cooking, right?": u"Como o seu pai \u00e9 o cozinheiro daqui, isso significa que voc\u00ea deve entender um pouco de culin\u00e1ria, certo?",
        u"Since you\u2019re on the nice list this year, you\u2019ve got a huge present \u2018coming\u2019\u2026 And I\u2019m not talking about just this candy cane~": u"Como voc\u00ea est\u00e1 na lista dos bonzinhos este ano, tem um present\u00e3o \u2018chegando\u2019\u2026 E n\u00e3o estou falando s\u00f3 deste bast\u00e3o de doce~",
        u"Sing-along? We\u2019re not campers anymore, Yoshi. ": u"Cantar junto? N\u00e3o somos mais campistas, Yoshi. ",
        u"Sir Aiden was dressed up like an ancient pharaoh\u2026": u"O Sr. Aiden estava vestido como um antigo fara\u00f3\u2026",
        u"Sir Goro already assigned me to help him out with managerial duties \u2026": u"O Sr. Goro j\u00e1 me designou para ajud\u00e1-lo nas tarefas administrativas\u2026",
        u"Sir Goro and I are actually here to grab a meal. I just happened to notice you were having a problem with the staff again.": u"Na verdade, eu e o Sr. Goro viemos comer alguma coisa. S\u00f3 percebi que voc\u00ea estava tendo problemas com os funcion\u00e1rios de novo.",
        u"Sir Goro and Yoshi always seem to have fun with me when we do that.": u"O Sr. Goro e Yoshi sempre parecem se divertir comigo quando fazemos isso.",
        u"Sir Goro helped us too.": u"O Senhor Goro tamb\u00e9m nos ajudou.",
        u"Sir Goro knows what's best.": u"O Sr. Goro sabe o que \u00e9 melhor.",
        u"Sir Goro knows what\u2019s best for the project, not you.": u"O Sr. Goro sabe o que \u00e9 melhor para o projeto, n\u00e3o voc\u00ea.",
        u"Sir Goro once told me that nothing beats the company of someone else when you have to relieve yourself of this kind of urge\u2026": u"O Sr. Goro certa vez me disse que nada supera a companhia de outra pessoa quando \u00e9 preciso aliviar esse tipo de vontade\u2026",
        u"Sir Goro really saved our butts!": u"O senhor Goro realmente salvou a nossa pele!",
        u"Sir Goro wasn\u2019t supposed to be bunking with us in the first place, Lloyd.": u"O Sr. Goro nem deveria estar dividindo a cabana conosco desde o come\u00e7o, Lloyd.",
        u"Sir Goro will want to know how yesterday went.": u"O Senhor Goro vai querer saber como foi o dia de ontem.",
        u"Sir Goro!": u"Senhor Goro!",
        u"Sir Goro, ENOUGH!": u"Senhor Goro, CHEGA!",
        u"Sir Goro, no!!": u"Sr. Goro, n\u00e3o!!",
        u"Sir Goro?": u"Senhor Goro?",
        u"Sir Goro?? Are you in here?": u"Sr. Goro?? O senhor est\u00e1 aqui?",
        u"Sir Goro\u2019s been doing most of the heavy lifting. He can work way faster than the rest of us.": u"O Sr. Goro est\u00e1 fazendo a maior parte do trabalho pesado. Ele consegue trabalhar muito mais r\u00e1pido que n\u00f3s.",
        u"Sir Goro\u2019s behavior completely changes around Yoshinori\u2026 He\u2019s a lot more\u2026 I don\u2019t know\u2026 personal?": u"O comportamento do Sr. Goro muda completamente perto de Yoshinori\u2026 Ele fica muito mais\u2026 sei l\u00e1\u2026 \u00edntimo?",
        u"Sir Goro\u2019s costume just looks so hot\u2014 I mean, cool!": u"A fantasia do Sr. Goro est\u00e1 t\u00e3o gostosa\u2014 Quero dizer, legal!",
        u"Sir Goro\u2019s heart line is only broken for the first third, though! The rest is continuously long and even has a fork at the end!": u"Mas a linha do cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Sr. Goro s\u00f3 \u00e9 interrompida no primeiro ter\u00e7o! O restante \u00e9 longo e cont\u00ednuo, e at\u00e9 se divide no final!",
        u"Sir Goro\u2019s right. And like I said, we have to at least hear Emilia\u2019s side before we make any decisions.": u"O Sr. Goro tem raz\u00e3o. E, como eu disse, precisamos ao menos ouvir o lado da Emilia antes de tomar qualquer decis\u00e3o.",
        u"Sir Goro\u2026": u"Senhor Goro\u2026",
        u"Sir Goro\u2026 ": u"Senhor Goro\u2026 ",
        u"Sir Goro\u2026 I know things aren\u2019t going the way you planned\u2026": u"Sr. Goro\u2026 Eu sei que as coisas n\u00e3o est\u00e3o saindo como o senhor planejou\u2026",
        u"Sir Goro\u2026!": u"Senhor Goro\u2026!",
        u"Sir\u2026 You\u2019re better than this\u2026": u"Senhor\u2026 O senhor \u00e9 melhor do que isso\u2026",
        u"Sit down and let loose.(DLC)": u"Sente-se e relaxe.(DLC)",
        u"Six in the morning sharp, you'll come with me, and we'll chop wood together.": u"\u00c0s seis da manh\u00e3 em ponto, voc\u00ea vir\u00e1 comigo e vamos cortar lenha juntos.",
        u"Size matters. Deal with it, chump.": u"Tamanho importa. Aceite isso, fracote.",
        u"Skill.": u"Habilidade.",
        u"Sleep whenever you like, Jin! Don\u2019t let that Emilia tell you how to live your life!": u"Durma quando quiser, Jin! N\u00e3o deixe Emilia dizer como deve viver sua vida!",
        u"Sleeping on the grass, getting wet from the morning dew, and then there\u2019s the bugs\u2026": u"Dormir na grama, molhar-se com o orvalho da manh\u00e3\u2026 sem falar nos insetos\u2026",
        u"Slow down, Emilia\u2026 It\u2019s a little early for you to be moving around\u2026": u"Calma, Emilia\u2026 Ainda \u00e9 um pouco cedo para voc\u00ea ficar se movimentando\u2026",
        u"Slowly but surely, I\u2019m starting to think Lloyd here is some kind of a leprechaun or something.": u"Aos poucos, estou come\u00e7ando a achar que o Lloyd \u00e9 algum tipo de duende ou coisa assim.",
        u"Smells like a rematch is underway.": u"Parece que uma revanche est\u00e1 a caminho.",
        u"Snap out of it, Jin!": u"Volte \u00e0 realidade, Jin!",
        u"Snowstorms happen here at least once a year, but this was way worse than usual\u2026": u"Tempestades de neve acontecem aqui pelo menos uma vez por ano, mas esta foi muito pior que o normal\u2026",
        u"So I gave them what they wanted and took my pants off! And then I got a ton of cash!": u"Ent\u00e3o dei a eles o que queriam e tirei as cal\u00e7as! E depois ganhei uma grana preta!",
        u"So I started picking myself back up.": u"Ent\u00e3o comecei a me reerguer.",
        u"So as soon as I knew the camp needed help, you were the first person to come to mind...": u"Ent\u00e3o, assim que soube que o acampamento precisava de ajuda, voc\u00ea foi a primeira pessoa em quem pensei\u2026",
        u"So be it, Yoshinori. Don\u2019t come crying to me when you are fully aware of how excruciatingly hectic the next few months are going to be!": u"Que assim seja, Yoshinori. N\u00e3o venha chorar para mim quando sabe perfeitamente como os pr\u00f3ximos meses ser\u00e3o dolorosamente ca\u00f3ticos!",
        u"So instead, you were sneaking around in it under a blanket. Kinky~": u"Ent\u00e3o, em vez disso, ficou andando escondido com ela por baixo de um cobertor. Safado~",
        u"So it seems we\u2019re all willing to give Emilia another chance.": u"Ent\u00e3o parece que todos estamos dispostos a dar outra chance a Emilia.",
        u"So just let us know if you wanna get jacked, Jin! We\u2019ll team up and work you out~ *wink*": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 avisar se quiser ficar fort\u00e3o, Jin! N\u00f3s dois podemos treinar voc\u00ea~ *pisca*",
        u"So maybe taking risks isn't so bad...?": u"Ent\u00e3o talvez correr riscos n\u00e3o seja t\u00e3o ruim assim...?",
        u"So much for a peaceful evening\u2026": u"E l\u00e1 se foi a noite tranquila\u2026",
        u"So much for being professionals\u2026": u"E l\u00e1 se foi o profissionalismo\u2026",
        u"So much for being \u201ca step ahead of everybody else.\u201d": u"E l\u00e1 se foi o papo de estar \u201cum passo \u00e0 frente de todos\u201d.",
        u"So much for healthy eating.": u"E l\u00e1 se foi a alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o saud\u00e1vel.",
        u"So much has changed for me because of you.": u"Tanta coisa mudou para mim por sua causa.",
        u"So please, understand why I\u2019m doing this, Yoshi\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, por favor, entenda por que estou fazendo isso, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"So please\u2026 grant me this last wish\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, por favor\u2026 realize este meu \u00faltimo desejo\u2026",
        u"So please\u2026 tell me what it is\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, por favor\u2026 diga o que \u00e9\u2026",
        u"So romantic~! ": u"T\u00e3o rom\u00e2ntico~! ",
        u"So sorry about all that! We\u2019ll be on our way!": u"Desculpe por tudo isso! J\u00e1 estamos indo!",
        u"So tell me, Ms. Komarova. What \u2018credentials\u2019 give you the right to tell me how to run my own camp?": u"Ent\u00e3o me diga, Srta. Komarova. Que \u2018credenciais\u2019 lhe d\u00e3o o direito de dizer como devo administrar meu pr\u00f3prio acampamento?",
        u"So that was you two I heard last night\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o eram voc\u00eas dois que eu ouvi ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"So that wraps up everything. I\u2019ve given you the in-depth details of the renovations that Mr. Clermont gave me so that we\u2019re all equally clear.": u"E isso encerra tudo. Expliquei em detalhes as reformas apresentadas pelo senhor Clermont para que todos estejamos igualmente informados.",
        u"So that\u2019s where you two were!": u"Ent\u00e3o era aqui que voc\u00eas dois estavam!",
        u"So that\u2019s why you\u2019re not dying like the rest of us this morning! Hahaha!": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 por isso que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 morrendo como o resto de n\u00f3s esta manh\u00e3! Hahaha!",
        u"So we\u2019ll give the naked apron show a dry run?": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos fazer um ensaio do show de avental sem roupa?",
        u"So what if everything isn\u2019t what it used to be?! It\u2019s not my fault my parents were criminals! ": u"E da\u00ed se as coisas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o mais como antes?! N\u00e3o \u00e9 minha culpa que meus pais fossem criminosos! ",
        u"So what?! I\u2019ll teach them how to put on a show~!": u"E da\u00ed?! Vou ensin\u00e1-los a dar um espet\u00e1culo~!",
        u"So why did she come back here, out of all places\u2026?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que ela voltou justamente para c\u00e1\u2026?",
        u"So why did something like this make him crumble?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que algo assim fez ele desmoronar?",
        u"So will the new cabins be your main focus while you\u2019re both here?": u"Ent\u00e3o, as novas cabanas ser\u00e3o o foco principal de voc\u00eas enquanto estiverem aqui?",
        u"So yeah, that\u2019s one less thing to worry about!": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 isso, uma preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o a menos!",
        u"So, I asked Dad to let me take over...": u"Ent\u00e3o pedi ao Pai que deixasse tudo comigo\u2026",
        u"So, I guess we can call this one a tie, right Gramps?": u"Ent\u00e3o acho que podemos considerar um empate, certo, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"So, I really apologize for my behavior, and I promise I\u2019ll try my best not to let that happen again.": u"Ent\u00e3o pe\u00e7o sinceras desculpas pelo meu comportamento e prometo fazer o poss\u00edvel para n\u00e3o deixar isso acontecer novamente.",
        u"So, I would like to teach you how to work with the computer and troubleshoot it in case no one is around to fix it.": u"Ent\u00e3o gostaria de ensinar voc\u00ea a usar o computador e solucionar problemas caso n\u00e3o haja ningu\u00e9m por perto para consert\u00e1-lo.",
        u"So, I\u2019ll do just that! Hahaha! I\u2019ll make sure every cent he spent on us is worth it~!": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 exatamente isso que farei! Hahaha! Vou garantir que cada centavo que ele gastou conosco tenha valido a pena~!",
        u"So, I\u2019m really sorry\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, eu sinto muito\u2026",
        u"So, I\u2019m really thankful, Aiden\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, sou muito grato a voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026",
        u"So, I\u2019ve divided my concerns into four categories \u2013 construction, staff, technology, and management.": u"Dividi minhas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es em quatro categorias: constru\u00e7\u00e3o, equipe, tecnologia e administra\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"So, I\u2019ve got a bit of good news for you \u2013 as you may know, the little book \u201cGreatest Memories\u201d that we\u2019ve published has been on the shelves and online stores for over a month.": u"Bem, tenho boas not\u00edcias para voc\u00eas: como devem saber, o livrinho \u201cMaiores Lembran\u00e7as\u201d que publicamos est\u00e1 nas prateleiras e lojas virtuais h\u00e1 mais de um m\u00eas.",
        u"So, Jin~ How was that for a spicy story~?": u"E ent\u00e3o, Jin~ O que achou dessa hist\u00f3ria picante~?",
        u"So, Yoshinori. Where to today? ": u"Ent\u00e3o, Yoshinori. Aonde vamos hoje? ",
        u"So, a tamer version of what you already do back at camp.": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 uma vers\u00e3o mais comportada do que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 faz no acampamento.",
        u"So, answer me honestly, Emilia\u2026 Is that all true?": u"Ent\u00e3o responda com sinceridade, Emilia\u2026 Tudo isso \u00e9 verdade?",
        u"So, as we all know, Mr. Nagame\u2019s book from last term was one of our bestselling novels in a long time!": u"Ent\u00e3o, como todos sabemos, o livro do Sr. Nagame da temporada passada foi um dos nossos romances mais vendidos em muito tempo!",
        u"So, call me Chef Emilia from now on~!": u"Ent\u00e3o, de agora em diante me chame de Chef Emilia~!",
        u"So, come over here and warm up with me before the party\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o venha aqui se aquecer comigo antes da festa\u2026",
        u"So, do you always wake up this early too? ": u"Ent\u00e3o, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m sempre acorda t\u00e3o cedo? ",
        u"So, don\u2019t touch it, thank you!": u"Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o toque nela, obrigada!",
        u"So, don\u2019t worry, and just focus on the great work we\u2019ll be doing together for Camp Buddy. It\u2019ll be just like the good ol\u2019 days!": u"Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se preocupe e apenas se concentre no \u00f3timo trabalho que faremos juntos pelo Camp Buddy. Vai ser como nos bons velhos tempos!",
        u"So, face your choices firmly to achieve your ideal happiness, or else it could lead to your ultimate regret!": u"Portanto, encare suas escolhas com firmeza para alcan\u00e7ar a felicidade ideal, ou elas poder\u00e3o levar ao seu maior arrependimento!",
        u"So, give it some time, and let yourself adjust. It\u2019s been less than a week since the expansion project kicked off after all.": u"Ent\u00e3o d\u00ea tempo ao tempo e permita-se adaptar. Afinal, faz menos de uma semana que o projeto de expans\u00e3o come\u00e7ou.",
        u"So, how did things go back at camp while I was gone?": u"Ent\u00e3o, como ficaram as coisas no acampamento enquanto estive fora?",
        u"So, how did you do it?": u"Ent\u00e3o, como voc\u00ea conseguiu?",
        u"So, is that the same bike you rode back then? It looks pretty vintage!": u"Ent\u00e3o essa \u00e9 a mesma moto que voc\u00ea pilotava naquela \u00e9poca? Ela parece bem antiga!",
        u"So, is there anything I can help with around here, bro?": u"Ent\u00e3o, tem alguma coisa em que eu possa ajudar por aqui, mano?",
        u"So, it is true\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade\u2026",
        u"So, leave me alone and get lo\u2014": u"Ent\u00e3o me deixe em paz e d\u00ea o fo\u2014",
        u"So, p-please\u2026 Don\u2019t give up\u2026 ": u"Ent\u00e3o, p-por favor\u2026 N\u00e3o desista\u2026 ",
        u"So, please Yoshi\u2026 Just set me free\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, por favor, Yoshi\u2026 Apenas me deixe livre\u2026",
        u"So, please. The last thing I\u2019ll ask of you is to understand and set me free\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, por favor. A \u00faltima coisa que vou pedir a voc\u00ea \u00e9 que entenda e me deixe partir\u2026",
        u"So, ready for your lap dance?": u"Ent\u00e3o, pronto para sua lap dance?",
        u"So, she has a huge ego, what\u2019s new?": u"Ent\u00e3o ela tem um ego enorme, qual \u00e9 a novidade?",
        u"So, tell us, Yoshi! What makes the best dick in your humble opinion~?": u"Ent\u00e3o nos diga, Yoshi! Na sua humilde opini\u00e3o, o que faz um pau ser o melhor~?",
        u"So, tell us, Yoshi! What makes the best dick in your humble opinion~?{fast}": u"Ent\u00e3o nos diga, Yoshi! Na sua humilde opini\u00e3o, o que faz um pau ser o melhor~?{fast}",
        u"So, thanks for staying by my side and supporting my decision, Yoshi.": u"Ent\u00e3o, obrigado por ficar ao meu lado e apoiar minha decis\u00e3o, Yoshi.",
        u"So, thanks for staying by my side and supporting my decision, Yoshinori.": u"Ent\u00e3o, obrigado por permanecer ao meu lado e apoiar minha decis\u00e3o, Yoshinori.",
        u"So, that\u2019s where you\u2019re staring, huh~? Looks like someone\u2019s wanting to get out of his winter blues~  ": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 a\u00ed que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 olhando, hein~? Parece que algu\u00e9m quer espantar a tristeza do inverno~  ",
        u"So, the framing where you place the actual roofing are called trusses.": u"Ent\u00e3o, a estrutura onde o telhado propriamente dito \u00e9 apoiado \u00e9 chamada de tesoura.",
        u"So, we did\u2026 and then Dad\u2019s smile finally came back.": u"E foi o que fizemos\u2026 e ent\u00e3o o sorriso do Pai finalmente voltou.",
        u"So, we\u2019re really gonna give her the boot, huh\u2026? ": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos mesmo mandar ela embora, hein\u2026? ",
        u"So, what are you both up to?": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o fazendo?",
        u"So, what brings you boys back here?": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que trouxe voc\u00eas de volta?",
        u"So, what do we wanna check out this time? ": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que queremos conhecer desta vez? ",
        u"So, what do you wanna do for the night, Yoshi?": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00ea quer fazer esta noite, Yoshi?",
        u"So, what do you want to do for the night, Yoshinori?": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00ea quer fazer esta noite, Yoshinori?",
        u"So, what do you want to do for the night, Yoshinori?{fast}": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00ea quer fazer esta noite, Yoshinori?{fast}",
        u"So, what\u2019s with the sudden party? ": u"Ent\u00e3o, por que essa festa de repente? ",
        u"So, when I got cut off from that lifestyle, I realized I don\u2019t really know anything at all.": u"Ent\u00e3o, quando fui afastada daquele estilo de vida, percebi que na verdade n\u00e3o sei fazer praticamente nada.",
        u"So, when she lost everything that once defined her \u2013 her dignity, her past and her one friend \u2013 she had nowhere left to run back to\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, quando ela perdeu tudo o que antes a definia \u2014 sua dignidade, seu passado e seu \u00fanico amigo \u2014 n\u00e3o restou nenhum lugar para onde pudesse voltar\u2026",
        u"So, when\u2019s the honeymoon, Gramps?!": u"Ent\u00e3o, quando vai ser a lua de mel, Vov\u00f4?!",
        u"So, when\u2019s the rematch? She\u2019s been getting on your nerves again, so\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o, quando vai ser a revanche? Ela anda te irritando de novo, ent\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"So, where do you think we should go first?": u"Ent\u00e3o, aonde acha que devemos ir primeiro?",
        u"So, who else have you been snooping on, Yoshi~? Been spying on my buns while I\u2019m not looking~?": u"Ent\u00e3o, quem mais voc\u00ea anda espionando, Yoshi~? Anda olhando minha bunda quando n\u00e3o estou vendo~?",
        u"So, who wants to go first?": u"Ent\u00e3o, quem quer come\u00e7ar?",
        u"So, yeah! Congrats to you two!  ": u"Ent\u00e3o, \u00e9 isso! Parab\u00e9ns para voc\u00eas dois!  ",
        u"So, yeah! We totally get why you feel iffy about it! All that pressure would make me boil over too!": u"Ent\u00e3o, \u00e9! Entendemos perfeitamente por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 inseguro! Toda essa press\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m me faria explodir!",
        u"So, you better pay close attention to this meeting and learn something from it, or else I won\u2019t let you come along next time!  ": u"Portanto, \u00e9 melhor prestar bastante aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 reuni\u00e3o e aprender alguma coisa, ou n\u00e3o permitirei que venha comigo da pr\u00f3xima vez!  ",
        u"So, you decided to stalk her\u2026?": u"Ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea decidiu persegui-la pela internet\u2026?",
        u"So, you wanna join our tent-building group?": u"Ent\u00e3o, quer participar do nosso grupo de montagem de barracas?",
        u"So, you wanna tell me why you\u2019re spacing out again, Yoshi?": u"Ent\u00e3o, quer me contar por que est\u00e1 distra\u00eddo de novo, Yoshi?",
        u"So, you want to help? I\u2019d love to hear more about the party!": u"Ent\u00e3o, querem ajudar? Eu adoraria saber mais sobre a festa!",
        u"So, you\u2019re saying Yoshi is\u2026 cool?": u"Ent\u00e3o est\u00e1 dizendo que Yoshi \u00e9\u2026 legal?",
        u"So, you\u2019re saying that I don\u2019t?": u"Ent\u00e3o est\u00e1 dizendo que eu n\u00e3o tenho?",
        u"So, you\u2019re saying we're stuck here?! This is unacceptable!": u"Ent\u00e3o est\u00e1 dizendo que estamos presos aqui?! Isso \u00e9 inaceit\u00e1vel!",
        u"So, you\u2019re telling me your plan is to help wash dishes and unclog toilets to contribute to this project? My ears must be broken.": u"Ent\u00e3o seu plano para contribuir com o projeto \u00e9 lavar pratos e desentupir vasos sanit\u00e1rios? Meus ouvidos devem estar com defeito.",
        u"So, you\u2019re telling me you\u2019re just going to let things run as they are, refusing any changes for the sake of the camp? My ears must be broken!": u"Ent\u00e3o est\u00e1 me dizendo que vai simplesmente deixar tudo continuar como est\u00e1, recusando qualquer mudan\u00e7a pelo bem do acampamento? S\u00f3 posso estar ouvindo errado!",
        u"So, you\u2019re telling me, this whole time we\u2019ve all been hanging out, everyone knew, except for me?!": u"Ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea est\u00e1 me dizendo que, durante todo esse tempo em que estivemos juntos, todo mundo sabia, menos eu?!",
        u"So? We\u2019re not exactly at the fanciest of venues here! A little delay won\u2019t hurt anything!": u"E da\u00ed? N\u00e3o estamos exatamente no local mais sofisticado do mundo! Um pequeno atraso n\u00e3o vai fazer mal!",
        u"So? What do you say? Partners?": u"Ent\u00e3o? O que me diz? Parceiros?",
        u"Some individuals might misuse medications like these when they are subjected to emotional distress.": u"Algumas pessoas podem fazer uso inadequado de medicamentos como esses quando est\u00e3o sob forte sofrimento emocional.",
        u"Some of my grades are actually starting to go down\u2026": u"Na verdade, algumas das minhas notas est\u00e3o come\u00e7ando a cair\u2026",
        u"Some of them are pretty hunky. You sure you didn\u2019t see anyone you fancy, Gramps? ": u"Alguns s\u00e3o bem gostosos. Tem certeza de que nunca viu algu\u00e9m que lhe agradasse, vov\u00f4? ",
        u"Some of these looks painful to wear though\u2026": u"Mas alguns deles parecem dolorosos de usar\u2026",
        u"Some of you aren\u2019t familiar with the anger issues I had in the past..": u"Alguns de voc\u00eas n\u00e3o conhecem os problemas que tive com raiva no passado\u2026",
        u"Some people find him rude and annoying because it seems like he\u2019s always talking over me.": u"Algumas pessoas o acham grosseiro e irritante porque parece que ele est\u00e1 sempre falando por cima de mim.",
        u"Some snow? There\u2019s at least eight inches covering an entire two acres, Lloyd.": u"Um pouco de neve? Tem pelo menos vinte cent\u00edmetros cobrindo quase um hectare inteiro, Lloyd.",
        u"Some things never really change, huh? You\u2019re always so sentimental, just like a retired person!": u"Algumas coisas nunca mudam mesmo, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Voc\u00ea vive t\u00e3o sentimental, igualzinho a um aposentado!",
        u"Somebody, count us off!": u"Algu\u00e9m fa\u00e7a a contagem!",
        u"Someday, I\u2019m going to be a scoutmaster like you! A person that everyone can count on!": u"Um dia, vou ser um chefe escoteiro como o senhor! Uma pessoa com quem todos possam contar!",
        u"Somehow I doubt that\u2026": u"Por algum motivo, duvido disso\u2026",
        u"Somehow, I feel like we\u2019re gonna be seeing a lot more of that.": u"Por algum motivo, acho que ainda vamos ver muito mais disso.",
        u"Somehow, I think you\u2019re both cooler now.": u"De algum jeito, acho voc\u00eas dois mais legais agora.",
        u"Someone who had the brightest smile, while carrying all this pain in your heart for years, fighting this battle on your own.": u"Algu\u00e9m que tinha o sorriso mais radiante, enquanto carregava toda essa dor no cora\u00e7\u00e3o por anos, lutando sozinho essa batalha.",
        u"Someone\u2019s brave.": u"Algu\u00e9m est\u00e1 corajoso.",
        u"Something filling.": u"Algo que nos deixe satisfeitos.",
        u"Something like that would make us miss our target for sure\u2026": u"Algo assim certamente faria com que perd\u00eassemos nosso prazo\u2026",
        u"Something like that would make us miss our targeted deadline for sure\u2026": u"Algo assim certamente faria com que perd\u00eassemos o prazo previsto\u2026",
        u"Something quick.": u"Algo r\u00e1pido.",
        u"Something rougher.": u"Algo mais intenso.",
        u"Something tells me that you and I are gonna have a good time here at camp~!": u"Algo me diz que voc\u00ea e eu vamos nos divertir muito aqui no acampamento~!",
        u"Something that makes us sweat.": u"Algo que nos fa\u00e7a suar.",
        u"Something\u2019s not adding up here\u2026 I think the only way to know is to ask Dad directly\u2026": u"Tem alguma coisa que n\u00e3o fecha\u2026 Acho que a \u00fanica forma de saber \u00e9 perguntar diretamente ao Pai\u2026",
        u"Something\u2019s sticking out of the box\u2026 What is that?": u"Tem alguma coisa saindo da caixa\u2026 O que \u00e9 isso?",
        u"Sometimes, I wish I could do all the leadership stuff that you can do! Totally fits the scoutmaster title.": u"\u00c0s vezes, gostaria de conseguir fazer todas essas coisas de lideran\u00e7a que voc\u00ea faz! Combina totalmente com o t\u00edtulo de chefe escoteiro.",
        u"Sooo, how is it? Good, right?": u"Ent\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o, como est\u00e1? Boa, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Soooo\u2026 We actually have one more surprise for everyone\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o\u2026 Na verdade temos mais uma surpresa para todos\u2026",
        u"Soooo\u2026 what\u2019s up with the suits? It\u2019s been a long time since I\u2019ve seen you guys wear something so formal.": u"Ent\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o\u2026 O que aconteceu com esses ternos? Faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o vejo voc\u00eas usando algo t\u00e3o formal.",
        u"Sooo\u2026 Why exactly are we back here again?": u"Ent\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o\u2026 Por que exatamente voltamos aqui?",
        u"Sorry I can\u2019t hear your orders from up here, Pipsqueak!": u"Desculpa, n\u00e3o consigo ouvir suas ordens daqui de cima, Tampinha!",
        u"Sorry I didn\u2019t wake up in time though, Yuri. I was supposed to take the scouts home today.": u"Desculpe n\u00e3o ter acordado a tempo, Yuri. Eu deveria levar os escoteiros para casa hoje.",
        u"Sorry I had to take that detour. It\u2019s the only route available to reach this place by motorcycle.": u"Desculpe pelo desvio. \u00c9 a \u00fanica rota dispon\u00edvel para chegar a este lugar de moto.",
        u"Sorry about Yoshinori here, I don\u2019t think he\u2019s fully gotten his mind off of a certain \u2018event\u2019 yesterday.": u"Desculpe pelo Yoshinori. Acho que ele ainda n\u00e3o tirou completamente da cabe\u00e7a um certo \u2018evento\u2019 de ontem.",
        u"Sorry for barging in, but the materials just arrived, Yoshi!": u"Desculpe entrar assim, mas os materiais acabaram de chegar, Yoshi!",
        u"Sorry for causing you trouble first thing in the morning, Yoshi\u2026": u"Desculpe causar problemas logo de manh\u00e3, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Sorry for taking up space in the kitchen. You\u2019re good to start cooking now!": u"Desculpem por ocupar espa\u00e7o na cozinha. J\u00e1 podem come\u00e7ar a cozinhar!",
        u"Sorry for the delay, everyone! I was just making sure Yoichi and Taiga were all set before we left!": u"Desculpem a demora, pessoal! Eu s\u00f3 estava me certificando de que Yoichi e Taiga estavam preparados antes de sairmos!",
        u"Sorry for the wait, everyone! Today\u2019s special is creamy potato soup!": u"Desculpem a demora, pessoal! O prato especial de hoje \u00e9 sopa cremosa de batata!",
        u"Sorry for the wait, here are your menus!": u"Desculpem pela espera, aqui est\u00e3o os card\u00e1pios!",
        u"Sorry it took so long! I had to whip up some mashed potatoes too! ": u"Desculpem pela demora! Tamb\u00e9m tive que preparar um pouco de pur\u00ea de batatas! ",
        u"Sorry sir, I\u2019ll come back again- I mean, I gotta go!": u"Desculpe, senhor, eu volto depois\u2014 Quer dizer, preciso ir!",
        u"Sorry, it took a little longer since I had to make the dough and sauce from scratch.": u"Desculpe, demorou um pouco mais porque precisei fazer a massa e o molho do zero.",
        u"Sort of.": u"Mais ou menos.",
        u"Sort of\u2026 I\u2019ve been limping all day thanks to Dar over here! This guy doesn\u2019t know how to take it easy!": u"Mais ou menos\u2026 Estou mancando o dia inteiro por causa do Dar aqui! Esse cara n\u00e3o sabe pegar leve!",
        u"Sort of\u2026 Some of the ingredients weren\u2019t available, so I did a little bit of substituting\u2026": u"Mais ou menos\u2026 Alguns ingredientes n\u00e3o estavam dispon\u00edveis, ent\u00e3o fiz algumas substitui\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026",
        u"Sounds about right.": u"Parece certo.",
        u"Sounds complicated to me. Shouldn\u2019t you get some rest, buddy? ": u"Parece complicado para mim. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria descansar um pouco, amigo?",
        u"Sounds complicated. Shouldn\u2019t you get some rest? ": u"Parece complicado. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria descansar um pouco? ",
        u"Sounds good to me. I could use a little stress relief after today. What do you say, Yoshinori?": u"Parece \u00f3timo. Um pouco de al\u00edvio para o estresse cairia bem depois de hoje. O que acha, Yoshinori?",
        u"Sounds good.": u"Parece bom.",
        u"Sounds like I win~": u"Parece que eu venci~",
        u"Sounds like I\u2019m not the only one who\u2019s got plenty to unpack~": u"Parece que n\u00e3o sou o \u00fanico com muita coisa para colocar para fora~",
        u"Sounds like a plan!": u"Parece um bom plano!",
        u"Sounds like everyone isn\u2019t a fan of her\u2026": u"Parece que ningu\u00e9m aqui gosta muito dela\u2026",
        u"Sounds like the perfect way to end the day. Let\u2019s go.": u"Parece a maneira perfeita de terminar o dia. Vamos.",
        u"Sounds like you could use some pizza! It\u2019s gonna be ooey-gooey with cheese too once I heat it up!": u"Parece que uma pizza lhe faria bem! Quando eu a esquentar, o queijo ficar\u00e1 todo derretido e cremoso!",
        u"Sounds like you\u2019d enjoy a \u2018Leg Spreader\u2019, sir!": u"Parece que o senhor gostaria de um \u2018Abre-Pernas\u2019!",
        u"Sounds more like a heart attack.": u"Parece mais um ataque card\u00edaco.",
        u"Sounds simple enough.": u"Parece simples.",
        u"Sounds to me like the answer\u2019s pretty obvious then. ": u"Para mim, parece que a resposta \u00e9 bem \u00f3bvia. ",
        u"Sounds to me like you\u2019re imagining something else! Can\u2019t wait til\u2019 the evening?": u"Parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 imaginando outra coisa! N\u00e3o consegue esperar at\u00e9 a noite?",
        u"So\u2026 Did the ring ever come off?": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026 O anel saiu?",
        u"So\u2026 How do I look? ": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026 Como eu estou? ",
        u"So\u2026 How do I look? {fast}": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026 Como eu estou? {fast}",
        u"So\u2026 What\u2019s next?": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026 O que vem agora?",
        u"So\u2026? How was your first professional meeting?": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026? Como foi a sua primeira reuni\u00e3o profissional?",
        u"So\u2026? How was your first professional meeting?{fast}": u"Ent\u00e3o\u2026? Como foi a sua primeira reuni\u00e3o profissional?{fast}",
        u"Speak for him.": u"Falar por ele.",
        u"Speaking of Sir Goro\u2026 When are he and Yoshi going to be back? ": u"Falando no Sr. Goro\u2026 Quando ele e Yoshi v\u00e3o voltar? ",
        u"Speaking of Sir Goro\u2026 where are he and Yoshi?! I haven\u2019t seen them today.": u"Falando no Sr. Goro\u2026 onde est\u00e3o ele e Yoshi?! N\u00e3o os vi hoje.",
        u"Speaking of Yoshi\u2026 When are he and Aiden going to be back? ": u"Falando no Yoshi\u2026 Quando ele e Aiden v\u00e3o voltar? ",
        u"Speaking of Yoshi\u2026 Where is he?! I haven\u2019t seen him today.": u"Falando no Yoshi\u2026 Onde ele est\u00e1?! N\u00e3o vi ele hoje.",
        u"Speaking of breaking ice, did Yoshinori already go to the site to work? I don\u2019t see him.": u"Falando em quebrar gelo, Yoshinori j\u00e1 foi trabalhar no canteiro? N\u00e3o estou vendo ele.",
        u"Speaking of jobs! I heard from Dad that someone got quite the job offer~": u"Falando em trabalho! Ouvi do papai que algu\u00e9m recebeu uma bela oferta~",
        u"Speaking of last night though\u2026 and I don\u2019t mean to dig into it more, but\u2026": u"Falando em ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 e n\u00e3o quero ficar insistindo no assunto, mas\u2026",
        u"Speaking of sleep, did you get enough rest, Jin?": u"Falando em dormir, voc\u00ea descansou o suficiente, Jin?",
        u"Speaking of space, why are you sitting so far over there?": u"Falando em espa\u00e7o, por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 sentado t\u00e3o longe?",
        u"Speaking of that! You two came home so late last night\u2026 and with a motorcycle too!": u"Falando nisso! Voc\u00eas dois voltaram t\u00e3o tarde ontem\u2026 e ainda por cima de moto!",
        u"Speaking of which, I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve seen him all morning.": u"Falando nisso, acho que n\u00e3o vi ele a manh\u00e3 inteira.",
        u"Speaking of which, I\u2019ll get some admin work done too!": u"Falando nisso, vou adiantar um pouco do trabalho administrativo tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Speaking of which, Mr. Clermont gave us the specifics of today\u2019s agenda this morning. Dad told me to relay the info to you guys!": u"Falando nisso, o senhor Clermont enviou hoje de manh\u00e3 os detalhes da programa\u00e7\u00e3o. O papai pediu que eu transmitisse as informa\u00e7\u00f5es a voc\u00eas!",
        u"Speaking of which, Yoshinori here will have to take my place someday.": u"Falando nisso, Yoshinori ter\u00e1 que assumir meu lugar algum dia.",
        u"Speaking of which, do I even need to check you out, Yoshi? I know every \u201cinch\u201d of you already!": u"Falando nisso, preciso mesmo avaliar voc\u00ea, Yoshi? J\u00e1 conhe\u00e7o cada \u201ccent\u00edmetro\u201d seu!",
        u"Speaking of which, his father\u2019s looking for him. I think they\u2019re about to start kitchen duty.": u"Falando nisso, o pai dele est\u00e1 procurando por ele. Acho que est\u00e3o prestes a come\u00e7ar o servi\u00e7o na cozinha.",
        u"Speaking of which, how come Gayvid and Goliath get steak for dinner while the rest of us get fish and grass?!": u"Falando nisso, por que Gayvid e Golias ganham carne no jantar enquanto o resto de n\u00f3s come peixe e mato?!",
        u"Speaking of which, put on an apron and let's start prepping these ingredients already!": u"Falando nisso, vista um avental e vamos come\u00e7ar logo a preparar os ingredientes!",
        u"Speaking of which, why don't you let me help you finish up here? I brought an axe with me anyway!": u"Falando nisso, por que n\u00e3o me deixa ajudar a terminar o trabalho? Eu trouxe um machado mesmo!",
        u"Speaking of which\u2026 looks like some people really can\u2019t wait for summer.": u"Falando nisso\u2026 parece que algumas pessoas realmente mal podem esperar pelo ver\u00e3o.",
        u"Spending this vacation with you gave me some ideas of what we can do in the future. ": u"Passar estas f\u00e9rias com voc\u00ea me deu algumas ideias do que podemos fazer no futuro. ",
        u"Splitting wood is not just about strength, you need good technique and posture too.": u"Rachar lenha n\u00e3o depende s\u00f3 de for\u00e7a; voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m precisa de boa t\u00e9cnica e postura.",
        u"Spoiler alert.": u"Alerta de spoiler.",
        u"Ssh! Keep it down!": u"Shh! Fala baixo!",
        u"Sshh, Aiden! Everyone can hear us\u2026!": u"Shhh, Aiden! Todo mundo pode ouvir\u2026!",
        u"Ssssh, Taiga! Hiro and Yoichi might hear you\u2026!": u"Ssssh, Taiga! Hiro e Yoichi podem ouvir voc\u00ea\u2026!",
        u"Standing here now, I\u2019m ready to spend the rest of my life with you. ": u"Agora, aqui diante de voc\u00ea, estou pronto para passar o resto da minha vida ao seu lado. ",
        u"Starting a fire is the last thing I wanna do\u2026 I wish we could at least cool down first\u2026": u"Acender uma fogueira \u00e9 a \u00faltima coisa que quero fazer\u2026 Queria que ao menos pud\u00e9ssemos nos refrescar primeiro\u2026",
        u"Starting the next term, Yoshinori will be taking my place as the camp president.": u"A partir da pr\u00f3xima temporada, Yoshinori assumir\u00e1 meu lugar como presidente do acampamento.",
        u"Starting tomorrow, you and I will be in charge of both managing the construction as well as handling all staff concerns.": u"A partir de amanh\u00e3, n\u00f3s dois cuidaremos tanto da administra\u00e7\u00e3o da constru\u00e7\u00e3o quanto de todas as quest\u00f5es da equipe.",
        u"Starting tomorrow, you and I will be in charge of both technology and overall management.": u"A partir de amanh\u00e3, n\u00f3s dois ficaremos respons\u00e1veis pela tecnologia e pela administra\u00e7\u00e3o geral.",
        u"Stay quiet.": u"Ficar em sil\u00eancio.",
        u"Stay till, you bad boy! Keep squirming like that or I\u2019ll have to discipline you!": u"Fique quieto, seu garoto levado! Continue se contorcendo assim e vou ter que disciplinar voc\u00ea!",
        u"Staying in the campgrounds all day long was starting to bore me!": u"Ficar o dia inteiro nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es do acampamento estava come\u00e7ando a me entediar!",
        u"Step off that putrid high horse and get away from Camp Buddy already!": u"Desce desse seu pedestal nojento e se afasta logo do Camp Buddy!",
        u"Stick your tongue out.": u"Coloque a l\u00edngua para fora.",
        u"Still no sign of Dad?": u"Ainda nenhum sinal do Pai?",
        u"Still, I regret stooping down to her level and fighting with her about everything.": u"Mesmo assim, arrependo-me de ter descido ao n\u00edvel dela e discutido por causa de tudo.",
        u"Still, I\u2019m impressed by his cooking. I don\u2019t think we\u2019ve had another scout since you that was that capable, Aiden.": u"Ainda assim, estou impressionado com a comida dele. Acho que n\u00e3o tivemos outro escoteiro t\u00e3o habilidoso desde voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"Still, doesn\u2019t give her an excuse for that attitude. ": u"Mesmo assim, isso n\u00e3o justifica aquela atitude. ",
        u"Still, every time it gives me a heart attack\u2026 {p=1.0}And each time I secretly hope it\u2019s a real request\u2026": u"Mesmo assim, toda vez quase tenho um ataque card\u00edaco\u2026 {p=1.0}E toda vez, no fundo, espero que seja um pedido de verdade\u2026",
        u"Still, it wouldn\u2019t have happened if you hadn\u2019t been showing Sir Goro every little thing I was working on! ": u"Mesmo assim, isso n\u00e3o teria acontecido se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o mostrasse ao senhor Goro cada coisinha em que eu estava trabalhando! ",
        u"Still, it\u2019s good to see you willing to help. It shows how much you\u2019ve grown.": u"Ainda assim, \u00e9 bom ver voc\u00ea disposta a ajudar. Isso mostra o quanto voc\u00ea amadureceu.",
        u"Still, it\u2019s unfortunate she never grew out of her past attitude.": u"Ainda assim, \u00e9 uma pena que ela nunca tenha superado aquela atitude do passado.",
        u"Still\u2026 It\u2019s not an excuse to let myself fall into a fit of rage like that\u2026 ": u"Mesmo assim\u2026 Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 desculpa para eu me deixar cair num acesso de f\u00faria daquele jeito\u2026 ",
        u"Stop!! You\u2019re breaking it!!!": u"Para!! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 quebrando ela!!!",
        u"Stranger danger.": u"Perigo \u00e0 vista.",
        u"Strengthen our bonds even more than before.": u"Fortalecer nossos la\u00e7os ainda mais.",
        u"Stuff me up.": u"Pode me encher.",
        u"Stupid Torch-head didn\u2019t even try to cook for us!": u"O Cabe\u00e7a-de-Tocha idiota nem tentou cozinhar para a gente!",
        u"Stupid Wolfboy didn\u2019t know how to use my phone and put Scoutmaster Yoshi on loudspeaker.": u"O idiota do Garoto-Lobo n\u00e3o sabia usar meu celular e colocou o chefe escoteiro Yoshi no viva-voz.",
        u"Stupid camp! Stupid parents! Stupid everything!!": u"Acampamento idiota! Pais idiotas! Tudo idiota!!",
        u"Stutters! I\u2019ve just got the thing for you!": u"Gaguinho! Tenho a coisa certa para voc\u00ea!",
        u"Submission.": u"Submiss\u00e3o.",
        u"Such a tease\u2026": u"Que provocador\u2026",
        u"Suck up.": u"Puxa-saco.",
        u"Sucks I can\u2019t even remember! Not fair!": u"Que droga eu nem conseguir lembrar! N\u00e3o \u00e9 justo!",
        u"Summer is right around the corner, though. The scouts will be coming back soon.": u"Mas o ver\u00e3o est\u00e1 logo a\u00ed. Os escoteiros voltar\u00e3o em breve.",
        u"Summer is right around the corner, though. The scouts will be coming back soon.  ": u"Mas o ver\u00e3o est\u00e1 logo a\u00ed. Os escoteiros voltar\u00e3o em breve.  ",
        u"Summer\u2019s here.": u"O ver\u00e3o chegou.",
        u"Sure thing!": u"Claro!",
        u"Sure thing! Goodnight, Yoshi!": u"Com certeza! Boa noite, Yoshi!",
        u"Sure thing! I can whip up a nice breakfast for you~!": u"Claro! Posso preparar um belo caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3 para voc\u00ea~!",
        u"Sure thing! I could use some chill time after earlier!": u"Com certeza! Eu bem que preciso relaxar depois de tudo aquilo!",
        u"Sure thing! I feel extra loose like this~": u"Claro! Assim eu me sinto ainda mais soltinho~",
        u"Sure thing! I\u2019m curious what the food there is like, anyway!": u"Claro! Eu j\u00e1 estava curioso para saber como \u00e9 a comida de l\u00e1!",
        u"Sure thing! I\u2019m feeling pretty hungry too!": u"Claro! Eu tamb\u00e9m estou ficando com bastante fome!",
        u"Sure thing! I\u2019ve been wanting to check it out, too!": u"Com certeza! Eu tamb\u00e9m queria conhecer!",
        u"Sure thing! My muscles could use a stretch!": u"Com certeza! Meus m\u00fasculos precisam de um alongamento!",
        u"Sure thing! That sounds like a great chance to catch up!": u"Claro! Parece uma \u00f3tima oportunidade para colocar a conversa em dia!",
        u"Sure thing, Lloyd.": u"Claro, Lloyd.",
        u"Sure thing, Yoshi!": u"Claro, Yoshi!",
        u"Sure thing, Yoshi.": u"Claro, Yoshi.",
        u"Sure thing, Yoshinori. We\u2019ll sweat even more before the day\u2019s over, heh.": u"Claro, Yoshinori. Vamos suar ainda mais antes de o dia acabar, heh.",
        u"Sure thing, babe. Love ya!": u"Claro, amor. Te amo!",
        u"Sure thing, sir! I\u2019ll show you!": u"Claro, senhor! Vou mostrar!",
        u"Sure thing.": u"Claro.",
        u"Sure! Feel free to order me around to do whatever you like! I\u2019m your personal slave for the day!": u"Claro! Fique \u00e0 vontade para mandar que eu fa\u00e7a o que quiser! Sou seu escravo pessoal por hoje!",
        u"Sure! Let\u2019s head over there.": u"Claro! Vamos at\u00e9 l\u00e1.",
        u"Sure! Let\u2019s just hope we don\u2019t interrupt something, hehe~": u"Claro! S\u00f3 espero que a gente n\u00e3o interrompa nada, hehe~",
        u"Sure! That sounds like a good idea! ": u"Claro! Parece uma boa ideia! ",
        u"Sure! We\u2019d love to!": u"Claro! Adorar\u00edamos!",
        u"Sure, Aiden!": u"Claro, Aiden!",
        u"Sure, Aiden. Thanks.": u"Claro, Aiden. Obrigado.",
        u"Sure, I could use the exercise! ": u"Claro, um pouco de exerc\u00edcio vai me fazer bem! ",
        u"Sure, I don\u2019t mind!": u"Claro, n\u00e3o me importo!",
        u"Sure, I have everyone\u2019s IDs on file. Would that suffice?": u"Claro, tenho os documentos de todos arquivados. Isso seria suficiente?",
        u"Sure, I think I\u2019ve finished all the chores for the day. Turns out they aren\u2019t so bad when nobody is around.": u"Claro, acho que terminei todas as tarefas de hoje. At\u00e9 que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o t\u00e3o ruins quando n\u00e3o tem ningu\u00e9m por perto.",
        u"Sure, I\u2014": u"Claro, eu\u2014",
        u"Sure, I\u2019d be happy to help some.": u"Claro, ficarei feliz em ajudar um pouco.",
        u"Sure, I\u2019ll bring you back, but don\u2019t you want to try something new?": u"Claro, eu trago voc\u00ea de volta, mas n\u00e3o quer experimentar algo novo?",
        u"Sure, I\u2019ll give it a read, dear.": u"Claro, vou dar uma lida, querida.",
        u"Sure, I\u2019ll stop as soon as you \u2018come'.  ": u"Claro, eu paro assim que voc\u00ea \u2018gozar\u2019.  ",
        u"Sure, I\u2019m curious what the menu is like there.": u"Claro, estou curioso para saber como \u00e9 o card\u00e1pio de l\u00e1.",
        u"Sure, What\u2019s on your mind, big guy?": u"Claro. O que est\u00e1 incomodando voc\u00ea, grand\u00e3o?",
        u"Sure, Yoshi! What\u2019s the plan for today?": u"Claro, Yoshi! Qual \u00e9 o plano para hoje?",
        u"Sure, Yoshi! What\u2019s the plan for today?{fast}": u"Claro, Yoshi! Qual \u00e9 o plano para hoje?{fast}",
        u"Sure, Yuri. That should be good enough. I think you and Hyunjin will like it in fact.": u"Claro, Yuri. Deve ser uma boa escolha. Na verdade, acho que voc\u00ea e Hyunjin v\u00e3o gostar.",
        u"Sure, but only when I\u2019m supervising.": u"Claro, mas somente quando eu estiver supervisionando.",
        u"Sure, it\u2019s right over there in the corner~": u"Claro, fica bem ali no canto~",
        u"Sure, money is important, but there are other things to consider as well.": u"Claro, dinheiro \u00e9 importante, mas tamb\u00e9m existem outras coisas a considerar.",
        u"Sure, simple enough. Let\u2019s see.": u"Claro, parece simples. Vamos ver.",
        u"Sure, that sounds exciting, Aiden.": u"Claro, parece empolgante, Aiden.",
        u"Sure. I don\u2019t mind telling you another story.": u"Claro. N\u00e3o me importo de contar outra hist\u00f3ria.",
        u"Sure. I\u2019ll be working in our cabin for now. See you tomorrow! ": u"Certo. Por enquanto, vou trabalhar na nossa cabana. At\u00e9 amanh\u00e3! ",
        u"Sure. The more, the merrier.": u"Claro. Quanto mais gente, melhor.",
        u"Sure. We can grab a light snack.": u"Claro. Podemos fazer um lanche leve.",
        u"Surely there was a better option than this trashy camp! At the very least you could\u2019ve let me stay at home alone!": u"Com certeza havia uma op\u00e7\u00e3o melhor do que este acampamento de quinta! No m\u00ednimo, voc\u00eas poderiam ter me deixado ficar sozinha em casa!",
        u"Surprisingly, we haven\u2019t gotten any complaints, at least before Emilia. ": u"Surpreendentemente, n\u00e3o recebemos nenhuma reclama\u00e7\u00e3o, pelo menos antes de Emilia. ",
        u"Sweet! I\u2019m ready for some woodworking!": u"Boa! Estou pronto para trabalhar com madeira!",
        u"Sweet! We\u2019re gonna be roomies, Dar!": u"Demais! Vamos dividir a cabana, Dar!",
        u"T-T-That\u2019s definitely just c-crum, I mean CREAM\u2026! I-It got pretty messy in the kitchen!": u"C-C-Com certeza \u00e9 s\u00f3 c-crem, quero dizer, CREME\u2026! F-Fizemos uma bela bagun\u00e7a na cozinha!",
        u"T-Taiga! Why are you asking these things too?! They don\u2019t have to\u2014": u"T-Taiga! Por que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 pedindo essas coisas?! Eles n\u00e3o precisam\u2014",
        u"T-Tell me what?": u"C-Contar o qu\u00ea?",
        u"T-That sounds really ominous\u2026 Is Aiden going to be alright?": u"I-Isso parece muito sinistro\u2026 Aiden vai ficar bem?",
        u"T-That\u2019s not really important, Aiden\u2026 I\u2019m sure Mr. Clermont won\u2019t mind.": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 realmente importante, Aiden\u2026 Tenho certeza de que o Sr. Clermont n\u00e3o vai se importar.",
        u"T-That\u2019s not\u2014": u"N-N\u00e3o \u00e9\u2014",
        u"T-The portions are kinda small, aren\u2019t they\u2026?": u"A-As por\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o meio pequenas, n\u00e3o s\u00e3o\u2026?",
        u"T-To be fair, even I thought it was inappropriate\u2026": u"P-Para ser justo, at\u00e9 eu achei que fosse algo indecente\u2026",
        u"T-Too sweet\u2026": u"D-Doce demais\u2026",
        u"THAT IS SO GROSS!! EW, EW, EW!!": u"ISSO \u00c9 T\u00c3O NOJENTO!! ECA, ECA, ECA!!",
        u"THERE YOU ARE!!!": u"A\u00cd EST\u00c3O VOC\u00caS!!!",
        u"THIS IS NORMAL HERE?!": u"ISSO \u00c9 NORMAL AQUI?!",
        u"TIMBER!!": u"VAI CAIR!!",
        u"TOTALLY NOT! It feels like I\u2019m being boiled alive!!": u"NADA DISSO! Parece que estou sendo cozido vivo!!",
        u"Tada!": u"Tcharam!",
        u"Tada! And that\u2019s how I make pizza! ": u"Tad\u00e1! E \u00e9 assim que fa\u00e7o pizza! ",
        u"Taiga! Give him a hint he can understand maybe?": u"Taiga! D\u00ea uma dica que ele consiga entender!",
        u"Taiga, to think that you would be the scout who brings motivation to even your scoutmasters!": u"Taiga, pensar que voc\u00ea seria o escoteiro capaz de motivar at\u00e9 seus chefes escoteiros!",
        u"Taiga\u2019s quite an aspiring carpenter.": u"Taiga \u00e9 um aspirante a carpinteiro e tanto.",
        u"Take a good look at yourself and ask if there\u2019s a single person in the world who's ever wanted you.": u"Olhe bem para si mesmo e pergunte se existe uma \u00fanica pessoa no mundo que algum dia quis voc\u00ea.",
        u"Take a good look at yourself and tell me who\u2019s actually incompetent here!": u"Olhe bem para si mesma e me diga quem \u00e9 realmente incompetente aqui!",
        u"Take a look at our menu to see what we have for each course! Feel free to let us know if you have any specific requests and we\u2019ll gladly prepare them for you!": u"Deem uma olhada em nosso card\u00e1pio para ver as op\u00e7\u00f5es de cada prato! Se tiverem algum pedido espec\u00edfico, \u00e9 s\u00f3 nos avisar e teremos prazer em prepar\u00e1-lo!",
        u"Take care, Mr. Clermont!": u"Cuide-se, Sr. Clermont!",
        u"Take his clothes off.": u"Tirar a roupa dele.",
        u"Take it and let\u2019s get you loosened up.": u"Pegue e vamos fazer voc\u00ea relaxar um pouco.",
        u"Take it easy, Aiden. I\u2019d really rather you be yourself.": u"Calma, Aiden. Eu realmente prefiro que voc\u00ea seja voc\u00ea mesmo.",
        u"Take it easy, Emilia\u2026 You\u2019re not well. ": u"Calma, Emilia\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 bem. ",
        u"Take it with a grain of salt, Aiden. I\u2019m sure they\u2019re just sharing their opinions based on their experiences. ": u"N\u00e3o leve tudo ao p\u00e9 da letra, Aiden. Tenho certeza de que elas s\u00f3 est\u00e3o compartilhando opini\u00f5es com base nas pr\u00f3prias experi\u00eancias. ",
        u"Take me back here, sir!": u"Traga-me de volta aqui, senhor!",
        u"Take my hand. It\u2019s best if I just show you.": u"Segure minha m\u00e3o. \u00c9 melhor simplesmente mostrar a voc\u00ea.",
        u"Take special note with yours, I\u2019ve added extra details addressing my concerns from yesterday.": u"Preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o especial \u00e0 sua. Acrescentei detalhes para tratar das preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es que identifiquei ontem.",
        u"Take this job seriously! You\u2019re a scoutmaster, aren\u2019t you?": u"Leve este trabalho a s\u00e9rio! O senhor \u00e9 chefe escoteiro, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Talk about rude! I\u2019m just trying to have a conversation with you!": u"Quanta grosseria! S\u00f3 estou tentando conversar com voc\u00ea!",
        u"Talk about the meeting.": u"Falar sobre a reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"Talk about the suit.": u"Falar sobre o terno.",
        u"Talk about the weather.": u"Falar sobre o tempo.",
        u"Talking about my glow-up, eh? I\u2019ll take that as a compliment.": u"Falando da minha transforma\u00e7\u00e3o, \u00e9? Vou considerar isso um elogio.",
        u"Tastes like anise\u2026": u"Tem gosto de anis\u2026",
        u"Tch! I\u2019ll have you know this cock lives up to its size! So don\u2019t test me, or else you\u2019ll get a taste of it yourself!": u"Tsc! Pois saiba que este pau est\u00e1 \u00e0 altura do pr\u00f3prio tamanho! Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o me teste, ou voc\u00ea vai prov\u00e1-lo pessoalmente!",
        u"Tch, fine.": u"Tch, est\u00e1 bem.",
        u"Tch, you\u2019ve even started to leak already. Naughty Yoshinori, it\u2019s too early for that. ": u"Tch, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 come\u00e7ou at\u00e9 a vazar. Yoshinori levado, ainda \u00e9 cedo demais para isso. ",
        u"Tch. Damn, she has me beat.": u"Tch. Droga, ela me superou.",
        u"Tch. Fine! You\u2019ll be bare-ass naked in the snow by the end of the game!": u"Tch. Tudo bem! At\u00e9 o fim do jogo voc\u00ea vai estar com a bunda pelada na neve!",
        u"Tch. Fine, then you all show me what you can do!": u"Tch. Tudo bem, ent\u00e3o quero ver o que voc\u00eas conseguem fazer!",
        u"Tch. You guys keep acting so busy even when there\u2019s nobody here.  ": u"Tsc. Voc\u00eas continuam fingindo estar t\u00e3o ocupados mesmo quando n\u00e3o h\u00e1 ningu\u00e9m aqui.  ",
        u"Teach me more about repairing, I think it\u2019ll come in handy around here!  ": u"Me ensine mais sobre reparos, acho que vai ser \u00fatil por aqui!  ",
        u"Teaching me to be myself again\u2026 ": u"Por me ensinar a ser eu mesmo novamente\u2026 ",
        u"Teehee~ It\u2019s no surprise anyone would be jealous. I mean\u2026 who wouldn\u2019t be over someone like me?": u"Teehee~ N\u00e3o \u00e9 surpresa que qualquer um fique com inveja. Quero dizer\u2026 quem n\u00e3o ficaria com inveja de algu\u00e9m como eu?",
        u"Tell me about it. Somehow, she managed to make mine even more revealing than last year\u2019s! ": u"Nem me fale. De algum jeito ela conseguiu fazer a minha ainda mais reveladora que a do ano passado! ",
        u"Tell me about it\u2026": u"Nem me fale\u2026",
        u"Tell me if I need to stop, Aiden\u2026": u"Diga se eu precisar parar, Aiden\u2026",
        u"Tell me what's wrong.": u"Me diga o que est\u00e1 acontecendo.",
        u"Tequila, vodka, gin, and rum all together. A total homewrecker.": u"Tequila, vodca, gim e rum, tudo junto. Uma verdadeira destruidora de lares.",
        u"Th-Thank you again for letting me tag along today, sir\u2026!": u"O-Obrigado novamente por me permitir acompanh\u00e1-lo hoje, senhor\u2026!",
        u"Th-Thank you both, really.": u"O-Obrigado aos dois, de verdade.",
        u"Th-Thank you so much, Keitaro!": u"M-Muito obrigado, Keitaro!",
        u"Th-Thank you so much, sir! We\u2019ll gladly take you up on the offer!": u"M-Muito obrigado, senhor! Aceitaremos a oferta com prazer!",
        u"Th-Thank you very much, sir! I\u2019m really honored to have this\u2026!": u"M-Muito obrigado, senhor! Sinto-me verdadeiramente honrado por receb\u00ea-la\u2026!",
        u"Th-Thank you, Goro! I\u2019ll definitely take care of it!": u"O-Obrigado, Goro! Com certeza vou cuidar muito bem dela!",
        u"Th-Thank you, Goro. You look extra handsome as well.": u"O-Obrigado, Goro. Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 especialmente bonito.",
        u"Th-Thank you, Goro\u2026": u"O-Obrigado, Goro\u2026",
        u"Th-Thank you, Mr. Clermont\u2026": u"O-Obrigado, Sr. Clermont\u2026",
        u"Th-Thank you, Yuri. I\u2019m sorry that we didn\u2019t tell you sooner, though.": u"O-Obrigado, Yuri. Desculpe por n\u00e3o termos contado antes.",
        u"Th-Thank you, sir!": u"O-Obrigado, senhor!",
        u"Th-Thank you, sir! I\u2019ll make sure I\u2019m worth your thrust\u2026 I mean, trust!": u"O-Obrigado, senhor! Vou garantir que mere\u00e7a sua estocada\u2026 Quero dizer, confian\u00e7a!",
        u"Th-Thank you, sir, but it would feel far too inappropriate\u2026": u"O-Obrigado, senhor, mas eu me sentiria muito inadequado\u2026",
        u"Th-Thank you, sir. It really honors me to know that you place so much faith in me and my abilities.": u"O-Obrigado, senhor. \u00c9 uma grande honra saber que deposita tanta confian\u00e7a em mim e em minhas capacidades.",
        u"Th-Thank you, sir\u2026 I really appreciate your advice.": u"O-Obrigado, senhor\u2026 Agrade\u00e7o muito pelo conselho.",
        u"Th-Thanks again for lending me your suit, sir\u2026! It\u2019s been so long since I\u2019ve worn something this formal!": u"O-Obrigado novamente por me emprestar o seu terno, senhor\u2026! Faz tanto tempo que n\u00e3o uso algo t\u00e3o formal!",
        u"Th-Thanks for carrying mine though, Aiden\u2026": u"O-Obrigado por carregar a minha, Aiden\u2026",
        u"Th-Thanks for carrying mine though, Sir Goro\u2026": u"O-Obrigado por carregar a minha, Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"Th-Thanks, Emilia\u2026": u"O-Obrigado, Emilia\u2026",
        u"Th-Thanks, Yoshi\u2026": u"O-Obrigado, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Th-Thanks. You guys can go ahead, I\u2019ll catch up.": u"O-Obrigado. Podem ir na frente, eu alcan\u00e7o voc\u00eas.",
        u"Th-Thanks\u2026 I\u2019ll take anything to end this suffering\u2026": u"O-Obrigado\u2026 Aceito qualquer coisa para acabar com este sofrimento\u2026",
        u"Th-That could\u2019ve gone worse for you, Emilia\u2026": u"I-Isso poderia ter terminado muito pior para voc\u00ea, Emilia\u2026",
        u"Th-That doesn\u2019t sound very happy, dear\u2026": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o parece muito feliz, querida\u2026",
        u"Th-That explains the towel fanservice\u2026": u"I-Isso explica o fanservice das toalhas\u2026",
        u"Th-That guy over there\u2026! H-He\u2019s serving food\u2026 NAKED! ": u"A-Aquele cara ali\u2026! E-Ele est\u00e1 servindo comida\u2026 PELADO! ",
        u"Th-That just sounds painful\u2026": u"I-Isso parece doloroso\u2026",
        u"Th-That package is wrapped really nicely\u2026": u"E-Esse pacote est\u00e1 muito bem embrulhado\u2026",
        u"Th-That stocking is stuffed\u2026": u"E-Essa meia est\u00e1 bem recheada\u2026",
        u"Th-That was a long time ago, sir\u2026": u"I-Isso foi h\u00e1 muito tempo, senhor\u2026",
        u"Th-That was delicious, sir\u2026": u"I-Isso estava delicioso, senhor\u2026",
        u"Th-That was iced-coffee\u2026 Yuri made it for me\u2026": u"A-Aquilo era caf\u00e9 gelado\u2026 Yuri fez para mim\u2026",
        u"Th-That wasn\u2019t funny, Sir Goro\u2026!": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o teve gra\u00e7a, Sr. Goro\u2026!",
        u"Th-That's true... It's because I pushed myself out of my comfort zone that I met all of you too.": u"\u00c9-\u00c9 verdade\u2026 Foi porque me forcei a sair da minha zona de conforto que conheci todos voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Th-That\u2019s a lot of belts\u2026 And some of them look like\u2026 *gulp*": u"I-Isso \u00e9 um monte de cintos\u2026 E alguns parecem\u2026 *gulp*",
        u"Th-That\u2019s a really bad sunburn!": u"E-Essa queimadura de sol est\u00e1 muito feia!",
        u"Th-That\u2019s kinda creepy, Yuri\u2026": u"I-Isso \u00e9 meio assustador, Yuri\u2026",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not funny\u2026!!": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o tem gra\u00e7a\u2026!!",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not like you at all, Goro\u2026": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o parece nada com voc\u00ea, Goro\u2026",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not true, sir! What about Yuri? ": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, senhor! E a Yuri? ",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not what I meant, Aiden\u2026!": u"N-N\u00e3o foi isso que eu quis dizer, Aiden\u2026!",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not what happened, Emilia! ": u"N-N\u00e3o foi isso que aconteceu, Emilia! ",
        u"Th-That\u2019s not what it was for, you brat!": u"N-N\u00e3o era para isso, seu moleque!",
        u"Th-That\u2019s right! It\u2019ll be much more productive for both of us to stay close to the office! All the records are stored there after all!": u"I-Isso mesmo! Ser\u00e1 muito mais produtivo para n\u00f3s dois ficarmos perto do escrit\u00f3rio! Afinal, todos os registros ficam guardados l\u00e1!",
        u"Th-That\u2026 doesn\u2019t help at all.": u"I-Isso\u2026 n\u00e3o ajuda em nada.",
        u"Th-The opposite\u2026 I-I don\u2019t know where to start\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9 o contr\u00e1rio\u2026 E-Eu n\u00e3o sei por onde come\u00e7ar\u2026",
        u"Th-The way you say it\u2026": u"D-Do jeito que voc\u00ea fala\u2026",
        u"Th-The weather\u2019s really nice today, isn\u2019t it, sir\u2026?": u"O-O tempo est\u00e1 muito agrad\u00e1vel hoje, n\u00e3o est\u00e1, senhor\u2026?",
        u"Th-There you are, Aiden! I\u2019ve been looking for you! ": u"A-A\u00ed est\u00e1 voc\u00ea, Aiden! Eu estava procurando por voc\u00ea! ",
        u"Th-There! That\u2019s all you're getting!": u"P-Pronto! Isso \u00e9 tudo que voc\u00eas v\u00e3o ganhar!",
        u"Th-They weren\u2019t kidding when they said we\u2019re going to be treated like royalty here\u2026We have all these staff doing everything for us.": u"N-N\u00e3o estavam brincando quando disseram que ser\u00edamos tratados como realeza aqui\u2026 Temos todos esses funcion\u00e1rios fazendo tudo por n\u00f3s.",
        u"Th-This is amazing, Hiro!": u"I-Isso est\u00e1 incr\u00edvel, Hiro!",
        u"Th-This is as high as my arms can reach!!": u"I-Isso \u00e9 o mais alto que meus bra\u00e7os alcan\u00e7am!!",
        u"Th-This is news to me!": u"I-Isso \u00e9 novidade para mim!",
        u"Th-This is really surreal, sir\u2026": u"I-Isso \u00e9 realmente surreal, senhor\u2026",
        u"Th-This isn\u2019t something to laugh about, Aiden\u2026!!": u"I-Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 motivo para rir, Aiden\u2026!!",
        u"Th-This is\u2026!": u"I-Isto \u00e9\u2026!",
        u"Th-This looks crazy expensive\u2026!! You didn\u2019t have to.": u"I-Isso parece absurdamente caro\u2026!! N\u00e3o precisava.",
        u"Th-This really doesn\u2019t make sense\u2026 I always thought Sir Goro wanted the camp to grow\u2026": u"I-Isso realmente n\u00e3o faz sentido\u2026 Sempre achei que o Sr. Goro quisesse ver o acampamento crescer\u2026",
        u"Th-there so much \u2018cream\u2019 all over the kitchen\u2026 ": u"T-Tem tanto \u2018creme\u2019 espalhado pela cozinha\u2026 ",
        u"Thank god, it\u2019s just a hat. I thought this was just another excuse to make us wear something kinky.": u"Gra\u00e7as a Deus, \u00e9 s\u00f3 um chap\u00e9u. Achei que fosse mais uma desculpa para nos fazer usar alguma coisa safada.",
        u"Thank goodness I realized I really was content with the camp\u2026": u"Ainda bem que percebi que realmente estava satisfeito com o acampamento\u2026",
        u"Thank goodness, we were away from camp when this happened. It would\u2019ve been really dangerous for everyone.": u"Ainda bem que est\u00e1vamos longe do acampamento quando isso aconteceu. Teria sido muito perigoso para todos.",
        u"Thank goodness, you\u2019re awake now\u2026! I was so worried!": u"Gra\u00e7as a Deus, voc\u00ea acordou\u2026! Eu estava t\u00e3o preocupada!",
        u"Thank you Aiden. I know what to do now.": u"Obrigado, Aiden. Agora sei o que fazer.",
        u"Thank you again for all of your understanding, and also for bearing with me while I was gone.": u"Obrigado novamente pela compreens\u00e3o de todos e tamb\u00e9m por terem segurado as pontas enquanto estive fora.",
        u"Thank you again for waking me up\u2026 It seems that my body clock isn\u2019t properly tuned today.": u"Obrigado novamente por me acordar\u2026 Parece que meu rel\u00f3gio biol\u00f3gico n\u00e3o est\u00e1 funcionando direito hoje.",
        u"Thank you again, Mr. Clermont. We\u2019ll take our leave then.": u"Obrigado mais uma vez, Sr. Clermont. Ent\u00e3o, vamos nos retirar.",
        u"Thank you again, and I hope to see you all sometime soon!": u"Obrigado novamente, e espero ver todos voc\u00eas em breve!",
        u"Thank you again, sir, for everything you\u2019ve done, and for being here to celebrate with us today!": u"Obrigado novamente, senhor, por tudo que fez e por estar aqui hoje para comemorar conosco!",
        u"Thank you again, sir, for everything you\u2019ve done, and for being here with us today.": u"Obrigado novamente, senhor, por tudo que fez e por estar aqui conosco hoje.",
        u"Thank you all again for understanding\u2026 ": u"Obrigado novamente pela compreens\u00e3o de todos\u2026 ",
        u"Thank you both. I only push through because of all of you.": u"Obrigado aos dois. S\u00f3 continuo seguindo em frente por causa de todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Thank you for bringing this up, Mr. Clermont. I believe these matters are of utmost importance.": u"Obrigada por abordar o assunto, Sr. Clermont. Acredito que essas quest\u00f5es sejam da maior import\u00e2ncia.",
        u"Thank you for letting me use it over the last few months, sir.": u"Obrigado por me deixar us\u00e1-lo nos \u00faltimos meses, senhor.",
        u"Thank you for taking care of that, Yuri\u2026 I was really worried it put us in serious trouble.": u"Obrigado por cuidar disso, Yuri\u2026 Eu estava realmente preocupado que isso tivesse nos causado s\u00e9rios problemas.",
        u"Thank you for taking so much time to teach me. The way you explained everything to me step by step made me realize how simple it actually was.": u"Obrigado por dedicar tanto tempo para me ensinar. A forma como explicou tudo passo a passo me fez perceber como era simples.",
        u"Thank you for taking the initiative and finding a solution to our issues, Yoshinori.": u"Obrigado por tomar a iniciativa e encontrar uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o para nossos problemas, Yoshinori.",
        u"Thank you for the offer, Mr. Clermont. I will definitely consider it.": u"Obrigado pela oferta, Sr. Clermont. Com certeza vou consider\u00e1-la.",
        u"Thank you for your concern, Yoshinori. I\u2019m fine.": u"Obrigado pela preocupa\u00e7\u00e3o, Yoshinori. Estou bem.",
        u"Thank you for your service, Sir Goro.": u"Obrigado por todos os seus anos de servi\u00e7o, Sr. Goro.",
        u"Thank you guys for your hard work! I really appreciate it.": u"Obrigada pelo trabalho duro, pessoal! Agrade\u00e7o de verdade.",
        u"Thank you so much again for seeing the worth of our camp, Mr. Clermont. ": u"Muito obrigado novamente por reconhecer o valor do nosso acampamento, senhor Clermont. ",
        u"Thank you so much for being such a great host, Yoshinori!": u"Muito obrigado por ser um anfitri\u00e3o t\u00e3o maravilhoso, Yoshinori!",
        u"Thank you so much for this opportunity, sir. It really cleared my mind about what my role in this project really is!": u"Muito obrigado pela oportunidade, senhor. Isso realmente esclareceu qual deve ser minha fun\u00e7\u00e3o neste projeto!",
        u"Thank you very much for your generosity.": u"Muito obrigado por sua generosidade.",
        u"Thank you! There\u2019s gonna be another batch of cameras to install in the spring when they finish the expansion site.": u"Obrigado! Haver\u00e1 outro lote de c\u00e2meras para instalar na primavera, quando terminarem a \u00e1rea de expans\u00e3o.",
        u"Thank you, Andre. You can return to your post now. ": u"Obrigado, Andre. Pode voltar ao seu posto agora. ",
        u"Thank you, Goro. I\u2019ll make you proud!": u"Obrigado, Goro. Vou deixar voc\u00ea orgulhoso!",
        u"Thank you, Mr. Clermont for seeing something in me and giving me the chance to use my talents in the best possible way I can.": u"Obrigado, Sr. Clermont, por enxergar algo em mim e me dar a chance de usar meus talentos da melhor maneira poss\u00edvel.",
        u"Thank you, Mr. Clermont!": u"Obrigado, Sr. Clermont!",
        u"Thank you, Sir Goro!": u"Obrigado, Senhor Goro!",
        u"Thank you, Yoshi.": u"Obrigado, Yoshi.",
        u"Thank you, Yoshinori. That\u2019s perfect.": u"Obrigado, Yoshinori. Est\u00e1 perfeito.",
        u"Thank you, all. ": u"Obrigado a todos. ",
        u"Thank you, everyone.": u"Obrigado, pessoal.",
        u"Thank you, everyone\u2026 I promise I\u2019ll do my best!": u"Obrigado, pessoal\u2026 Prometo que farei o meu melhor!",
        u"Thank you, sir\u2026! I know the past will help guide us to a better version of ourselves for the future!": u"Obrigado, senhor\u2026! Sei que o passado ajudar\u00e1 a nos conduzir a vers\u00f5es melhores de n\u00f3s mesmos no futuro!",
        u"Thank you, we\u2019ll let you know if we need anything else.": u"Obrigado. Avisaremos se precisarmos de mais alguma coisa.",
        u"Thank you, your kindness is greatly appreciated.": u"Obrigado, agrade\u00e7o muito a gentileza de voc\u00eas.",
        u"Thank you.": u"Obrigado.",
        u"Thank you. You guys are very friendly.": u"Obrigado. Voc\u00eas s\u00e3o muito amig\u00e1veis.",
        u"Thank youuuuu~": u"Obrigadooou~",
        u"Thank you\u2026": u"Obrigada\u2026",
        u"Thankfully, I caught you that time, so you didn\u2019t get scraped up.": u"Felizmente, consegui segur\u00e1-lo naquela vez, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea n\u00e3o se machucou.",
        u"Thankfully, Yuri was there to assist him so he wasn\u2019t as stressed with all the paperwork as he used to be!": u"Felizmente, Yuri estava l\u00e1 para ajud\u00e1-lo, ent\u00e3o ele n\u00e3o ficou t\u00e3o estressado com toda a papelada quanto costumava ficar!",
        u"Thankfully, because Aiden and I were handling the construction team, Yuri was able to focus on assisting Sir Goro.": u"Felizmente, como Aiden e eu cuid\u00e1vamos da equipe de constru\u00e7\u00e3o, Yuri p\u00f4de se concentrar em ajudar o Sr. Goro.",
        u"Thankfully, because Sir Goro and I were handling most of the management, Yuri was able to focus on assisting Aiden.": u"Felizmente, como eu e o Sr. Goro cuid\u00e1vamos da maior parte da administra\u00e7\u00e3o, Yuri p\u00f4de se concentrar em ajudar Aiden.",
        u"Thankfully, for all of you, I\u2019m here to make sure he gets his money\u2019s worth~": u"Felizmente para todos voc\u00eas, estou aqui para garantir que ele receba o devido retorno pelo investimento~",
        u"Thankfully, it wasn\u2019t anywhere near a lethal dose, and I was able to administer medicine that reverses the sedating effects.": u"Felizmente, n\u00e3o chegou nem perto de uma dose letal, e consegui administrar um medicamento que reverte os efeitos sedativos.",
        u"Thankfully, the manager was pretty understanding of the situation!": u"Felizmente, o gerente foi bastante compreensivo com a situa\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Thankfully, the weather didn\u2019t act up for the rest of the season, letting Lloyd, Darius, and all the workers continuously make progress on the construction.": u"Felizmente, o clima n\u00e3o voltou a causar problemas pelo restante da temporada, permitindo que Lloyd, Darius e todos os trabalhadores avan\u00e7assem continuamente na constru\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Thankfully, we were away from camp when this happened. It would\u2019ve been really dangerous for everyone.": u"Felizmente, est\u00e1vamos longe do acampamento quando isso aconteceu. Teria sido muito perigoso para todos.",
        u"Thankfully, we\u2019re planning to hire more people to help, starting next term. ": u"Felizmente, planejamos contratar mais pessoas para ajudar a partir da pr\u00f3xima temporada. ",
        u"Thanks a lot for changing my mind, Yoshi. I won\u2019t let you down\u2026!": u"Muito obrigado por me fazer mudar de ideia, Yoshi. N\u00e3o vou decepcionar voc\u00ea\u2026!",
        u"Thanks a lot for changing my mind, Yoshi. I won\u2019t let you guys down!": u"Muito obrigado por me fazer mudar de ideia, Yoshi. N\u00e3o vou decepcionar voc\u00eas!",
        u"Thanks again for helping me with the chores, guys. ": u"Obrigado novamente por me ajudarem com as tarefas, pessoal. ",
        u"Thanks again for helping us take care of the deliveries today, Yoshi!": u"Obrigado de novo por nos ajudar com as entregas hoje, Yoshi!",
        u"Thanks again for staying with us, Mr. Clermont. We appreciate you taking the time out of your busy schedule to spend time with us yesterday.": u"Obrigado novamente por ficar conosco, Sr. Clermont. Agradecemos por tirar um tempo da sua agenda t\u00e3o ocupada para passar o dia de ontem conosco.",
        u"Thanks for agreeing to one more meal before you leave, Mr. Clermont.": u"Obrigado por aceitar mais uma refei\u00e7\u00e3o antes de partir, Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Thanks for being honest and giving me some tips, Aiden. You\u2019re a really nice guy!": u"Obrigado pela sinceridade e pelas dicas, Aiden. Voc\u00ea \u00e9 um cara muito gentil!",
        u"Thanks for cheering me up!": u"Obrigado por me animar!",
        u"Thanks for explaining, sir!": u"Obrigado por explicar, senhor!",
        u"Thanks for helping me clean up earlier, Aiden! I know you were already tired from cooking the food too.": u"Obrigado por me ajudar a limpar tudo antes, Aiden! Sei que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 estava cansado depois de cozinhar tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Thanks for helping me get through it, Yoshi\u2026": u"Obrigado por me ajudar a superar isso, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Thanks for helping me move in.": u"Obrigado por me ajudarem com a mudan\u00e7a.",
        u"Thanks for helping me pack, Yoshi! ": u"Obrigado por me ajudar a fazer as malas, Yoshi! ",
        u"Thanks for helping me pack, Yoshinori. I almost always leave something behind on trips like these\u2026": u"Obrigado por me ajudar a arrumar as coisas, Yoshinori. Quase sempre esque\u00e7o alguma coisa em viagens assim\u2026",
        u"Thanks for helping me set up the tent, Aiden! Couldn\u2019t have done it without you!": u"Obrigado por me ajudar a montar a barraca, Aiden! N\u00e3o teria conseguido sem voc\u00ea!",
        u"Thanks for looking out for me, everyone\u2026": u"Obrigado por se preocuparem comigo, pessoal\u2026",
        u"Thanks for reassuring everyone after this morning, Dad! ": u"Obrigada por tranquilizar todo mundo depois do que aconteceu esta manh\u00e3, pai! ",
        u"Thanks for the compliment, but\u2026": u"Obrigado pelo elogio, mas\u2026",
        u"Thanks for the food, Aiden. It\u2019s delicious as always.": u"Obrigado pela comida, Aiden. Est\u00e1 deliciosa como sempre.",
        u"Thanks for the help, doctor. ": u"Obrigado pela ajuda, doutor. ",
        u"Thanks for the opportunity, Mr. Clermont! I\u2019ll think about it!": u"Obrigado pela oportunidade, Sr. Clermont! Vou pensar!",
        u"Thanks for waiting on the tables, Yoshi! How did everyone like the food?": u"Obrigado por servir as mesas, Yoshi! O que todo mundo achou da comida?",
        u"Thanks to everyone and Camp Buddy, for once I had something to hope for.": u"Gra\u00e7as a todos e ao Camp Buddy, pela primeira vez eu tinha algo em que depositar esperan\u00e7a.",
        u"Thanks to that, I was able to help Yoshi with some projects over the past few years. Just last summer, we worked with a few scouts to fix some of the really busted up cabins!": u"Gra\u00e7as a isso, pude ajudar Yoshi em alguns projetos nos \u00faltimos anos. No ver\u00e3o passado, trabalhamos com alguns escoteiros para consertar umas cabanas que estavam bem acabadas!",
        u"Thanks! Just call me for your orders!": u"Obrigado! \u00c9 s\u00f3 me chamar quando quiserem pedir!",
        u"Thanks, Aiden! I\u2019ll bring the workers here soon for lunch so you can meet them too!": u"Obrigado, Aiden! Trarei os trabalhadores para almo\u00e7ar em breve, assim voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m poder\u00e1 conhec\u00ea-los!",
        u"Thanks, Aiden.  I appreciate the company.": u"Obrigado, Aiden.  Agrade\u00e7o a companhia.",
        u"Thanks, Aiden. I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll all be worth it in the end.": u"Obrigado, Aiden. Tenho certeza de que tudo vai valer a pena no final.",
        u"Thanks, Aiden\u2026": u"Obrigado, Aiden\u2026",
        u"Thanks, Dad! I do feel expensive and elegant, which is very unusual!": u"Obrigada, pai! Eu realmente me sinto cara e elegante, o que \u00e9 bem incomum!",
        u"Thanks, Dar. I knew I could count on you. ": u"Obrigado, Dar. Sabia que podia contar com voc\u00ea. ",
        u"Thanks, I\u2019ll keep that in mind. ": u"Obrigado, vou me lembrar disso. ",
        u"Thanks, I\u2019m really proud of it! I can\u2019t wait to see what people say about it.": u"Obrigado, estou muito orgulhoso! Mal posso esperar para ver o que as pessoas v\u00e3o dizer.",
        u"Thanks, Shorty Hubby.": u"Obrigado, maridinho baixinho.",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi! Come on, let\u2019s go!": u"Obrigado, Yoshi! Vamos!",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi! You\u2019re the best!": u"Obrigado, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 o melhor!",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi! you\u2019re a lifesaver! The workers should be waiting at the site with Lloyd and Darius!": u"Obrigado, Yoshi! Voc\u00ea salvou o dia! Os trabalhadores devem estar esperando no local com Lloyd e Darius!",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi.": u"Obrigado, Yoshi.",
        u"Thanks, Yoshinori. Let\u2019s get some sleep, it\u2019ll be a busy day tomorrow.": u"Obrigado, Yoshinori. Vamos dormir; teremos um dia cheio amanh\u00e3.",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi\u2026": u"Obrigado, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Thanks, Yoshi\u2026 ": u"Obrigado, Yoshi\u2026 ",
        u"Thanks, but no thanks. We\u2019re good with our orders. ": u"Obrigado, mas n\u00e3o. Estamos satisfeitos com nossos pedidos. ",
        u"Thanks, but that won\u2019t be necessary. We\u2019ll pour it ourselves.": u"Obrigado, mas n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 necess\u00e1rio. N\u00f3s mesmos serviremos.",
        u"Thanks, but there\u2019s no need to escort us.": u"Obrigado, mas n\u00e3o precisa nos acompanhar.",
        u"Thanks, dear. Let\u2019s just meet downstairs at the lobby.": u"Obrigado, querida. Vamos nos encontrar l\u00e1 embaixo, no sagu\u00e3o.",
        u"Thanks, guys!": u"Obrigado, pessoal!",
        u"Thanks, sir! I just finished doing some yoga~. You know I don\u2019t skip a day of my routine!": u"Obrigado, senhor! Acabei de fazer um pouco de yoga~. Sabe que n\u00e3o pulo um dia da minha rotina!",
        u"Thanks. Now if you don\u2019t mind, I really have to go.": u"Obrigado. Agora, se n\u00e3o se importam, realmente preciso ir.",
        u"Thanks\u2026": u"Obrigado\u2026",
        u"That I didn\u2019t need to be more than what I am today\u2026": u"Que eu n\u00e3o precisava ser mais do que sou hoje\u2026",
        u"That actually had me thinking, sir\u2026 If she had issues with the management, shouldn\u2019t she have offered to work with you instead?": u"Isso me fez pensar, senhor\u2026 Se ela tinha problemas com a administra\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o deveria ter se oferecido para trabalhar com o senhor?",
        u"That actually reminds me. How will we stay in touch after the contract ends?": u"Isso me lembrou de uma coisa. Como vamos manter contato depois que o contrato acabar?",
        u"That and having booze.": u"Isso e bebendo.",
        u"That better not be some green, healthy crap you\u2019re feeding us.": u"\u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o ser alguma porcaria verde e saud\u00e1vel que voc\u00eas v\u00e3o nos dar.",
        u"That big ol\u2019 teddy bear is like a dad to me already! You better not screw up and make him go back to being scary and grumpy, you got that?!": u"Aquele urs\u00e3o j\u00e1 \u00e9 como um pai para mim! \u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o estragar tudo e faz\u00ea-lo voltar a ser assustador e rabugento, entendeu?!",
        u"That brings me to another point: why were non-construction staff involved in the first place?": u"Isso me leva a outro ponto: por que funcion\u00e1rios de outros setores participaram da constru\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"That can be arranged, if you want~": u"Isso pode ser providenciado, se voc\u00ea quiser~",
        u"That ceiling alone must have cost a fortune.": u"S\u00f3 aquele teto deve ter custado uma fortuna.",
        u"That comparison doesn\u2019t help at all, Dar!": u"Essa compara\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o ajuda em nada, Dar!",
        u"That decision isn\u2019t up to only you, Ms. Komarova. You need both mine and Yoshinori\u2019s consent as well.": u"Essa decis\u00e3o n\u00e3o cabe apenas a voc\u00ea, Srta. Komarova. Tamb\u00e9m precisa do consentimento meu e de Yoshinori.",
        u"That doesn\u2019t add up. What else is more important than Camp Buddy to him?": u"Isso n\u00e3o faz sentido. O que seria mais importante para ele do que o Camp Buddy?",
        u"That doesn\u2019t change the fact that you two have purposefully kept me out of the loop, all because you\u2019re incapable of taking action without someone telling you what to do!": u"Isso n\u00e3o muda o fato de que voc\u00eas dois me mantiveram deliberadamente por fora de tudo, simplesmente porque s\u00e3o incapazes de agir sem algu\u00e9m dizer o que fazer!",
        u"That doesn\u2019t look like a cleared site now, does it?": u"Isso n\u00e3o parece um terreno limpo, parece?",
        u"That doesn\u2019t sound too enthusiastic. Did my comment about your role upset you?": u"Isso n\u00e3o parece muito entusiasmado. Meu coment\u00e1rio sobre sua fun\u00e7\u00e3o o incomodou?",
        u"That event sounds more up your alley, Aiden.": u"Esse evento parece mais a sua cara, Aiden.",
        u"That explains all the leather\u2026": u"Isso explica todo aquele couro\u2026",
        u"That feels good, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 muito bom, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"That happened again during last night\u2019s dinner. When everyone started to point out her flaws, she immediately deflected everything at Aiden\u2026": u"Isso aconteceu de novo no jantar de ontem. Quando todos come\u00e7aram a apontar os defeitos dela, imediatamente desviou tudo para o Aiden\u2026",
        u"That happened again during last night\u2019s dinner. When everyone started to point out her flaws, she immediately deflected everything at Sir Goro\u2026": u"Isso aconteceu de novo no jantar de ontem. Quando todos come\u00e7aram a apontar os defeitos dela, imediatamente desviou tudo para o Sr. Goro\u2026",
        u"That has been on your mind for the past week. ": u"Isso tem ocupado seus pensamentos durante a \u00faltima semana.",
        u"That is great to hear. Now, let\u2019s get on to business.": u"\u00c9 \u00f3timo ouvir isso. Agora, vamos aos neg\u00f3cios.",
        u"That is honestly disturbing.": u"Isso \u00e9 sinceramente perturbador.",
        u"That is something I desire as well. ": u"Isso \u00e9 algo que tamb\u00e9m desejo. ",
        u"That is the blandest response I\u2019ve ever heard from you! Aren\u2019t you supposed to be the sunshine scout around here?": u"Essa foi a resposta mais sem gra\u00e7a que j\u00e1 ouvi de voc\u00ea! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria ser o escoteiro radiante daqui?",
        u"That isn't debris. We plan to recycle it as firewood for the incoming winter.": u"Aquilo n\u00e3o \u00e9 entulho. Planejamos reaproveit\u00e1-lo como lenha para o pr\u00f3ximo inverno.",
        u"That kinda reminds me of when you were interested in cooking a long time ago \u2013 we used to spend so much time in the kitchen together!": u"Isso me lembra de quando voc\u00ea se interessava por culin\u00e1ria, h\u00e1 muito tempo \u2014 costum\u00e1vamos passar tanto tempo juntos na cozinha!",
        u"That leaves Aiden and I sharing a room then! ": u"Ent\u00e3o, resta Aiden dividir o quarto comigo! ",
        u"That made him an easy target for bullies in the past. Which made him cry often.": u"Isso fez dele um alvo f\u00e1cil para valent\u00f5es no passado. E o fazia chorar com frequ\u00eancia.",
        u"That made you sound really old, sir\u2026 and cheesy.": u"Isso fez o senhor parecer bem velho\u2026 e cafona.",
        u"That makes me happy\u2026": u"Isso me deixa feliz\u2026",
        u"That makes sense! To be honest, the most I\u2019ve ever done with the computer is turn it on to read e-mails\u2026": u"Faz sentido! Para ser sincero, o m\u00e1ximo que j\u00e1 fiz com o computador foi lig\u00e1-lo para ler e-mails\u2026",
        u"That makes sense.": u"Faz sentido.",
        u"That makes sense. High-end bars like these tend to have nightlife activities.": u"Faz sentido. Bares sofisticados como este costumam ter atra\u00e7\u00f5es noturnas.",
        u"That makes sense\u2026 Yuri did like to draw and write back then. And she really encourages the scouts to have a creative outlet.": u"Faz sentido\u2026 A Yuri gostava de desenhar e escrever naquela \u00e9poca. E ela realmente incentiva os escoteiros a terem uma forma de express\u00e3o criativa.",
        u"That may be so, but I value all of your opinions. Yoshinori and I are leading this place, but all of you are what make it happen.": u"Pode at\u00e9 ser, mas valorizo a opini\u00e3o de todos voc\u00eas. Yoshinori e eu lideramos este lugar, mas s\u00e3o voc\u00eas que fazem tudo acontecer.",
        u"That means I won\u2019t get to come back here \u2019til I finish the whole thing\u2026": u"Isso significa que n\u00e3o poderei voltar para c\u00e1 at\u00e9 terminar tudo\u2026",
        u"That means we need to get as much work done as possible before the season ends.": u"Isso significa que precisamos avan\u00e7ar o m\u00e1ximo poss\u00edvel antes do fim da temporada.",
        u"That might be a good idea\u2026 We need to know what\u2019s going on too.": u"Talvez seja uma boa ideia\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m precisamos saber o que est\u00e1 acontecendo.",
        u"That might be for the best. I don\u2019t think any of us would want to share a room with her in the first place.": u"Talvez seja melhor assim. Acho que nenhum de n\u00f3s gostaria de dividir um quarto com ela mesmo.",
        u"That or this necktie is choking me to death!": u"Ou ent\u00e3o \u00e9 esta gravata que est\u00e1 me estrangulando at\u00e9 a morte!",
        u"That outfit and the bike behind you\u2026 You look so handsome, sir!": u"Essa roupa e a moto atr\u00e1s de voc\u00ea\u2026 O senhor est\u00e1 t\u00e3o bonito!",
        u"That settles it then.": u"Ent\u00e3o est\u00e1 decidido.",
        u"That should be all of it!": u"Acho que isso \u00e9 tudo!",
        u"That should be everything then. Is everyone clear on our goals?": u"Ent\u00e3o deve ser tudo. Todos entenderam nossos objetivos?",
        u"That should\u2019ve been obvious upon my arrival! Now, show me to the best seat in here!": u"Isso deveria ter ficado \u00f3bvio assim que cheguei! Agora, leve-me ao melhor lugar daqui!",
        u"That should\u2019ve been obvious, don\u2019t you think? I\u2019m the only heir to my family\u2019s grandiose conglomerate after all, so of course I\u2019d be busy.": u"Isso deveria ser \u00f3bvio, n\u00e3o acha? Afinal, sou a \u00fanica herdeira do grandioso conglomerado da minha fam\u00edlia, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 claro que estava ocupada.",
        u"That sounds great, Aiden! I\u2019ll help you catch some as soon as I\u2019m done here!": u"Parece \u00f3timo, Aiden! Vou ajudar voc\u00ea a pegar alguns assim que terminar aqui!",
        u"That sounds great, Yoshi! I\u2019d love to have you in the kitchen with me!": u"Parece \u00f3timo, Yoshi! Adoraria ter voc\u00ea comigo na cozinha!",
        u"That sounds interesting.": u"Parece interessante.",
        u"That sounds like something else\u2026": u"Isso parece outra coisa\u2026",
        u"That sounds like something you\u2019d be more interested in.": u"Isso parece algo que despertaria mais seu interesse.",
        u"That sounds like\u2026 a lot.": u"Isso parece\u2026 muita coisa.",
        u"That sounds nice, I guess\u2026?": u"Parece gostoso, eu acho\u2026?",
        u"That sounds really cool\u2026!": u"Isso parece muito legal\u2026!",
        u"That sounds terrible for my body! I can\u2019t have that much sugar in one sitting!": u"Isso parece p\u00e9ssimo para o meu corpo! N\u00e3o posso comer tanto a\u00e7\u00facar de uma vez!",
        u"That stands for tomatoes, lettuce, and cheese, right\u2026? I didn\u2019t know we were making burgers today.": u"TLC significa tomate, alface e queijo, certo\u2026? Eu n\u00e3o sabia que far\u00edamos hamb\u00fargueres hoje.",
        u"That sums up all of my concerns. I hope everyone paid attention.": u"Isso resume todas as minhas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es. Espero que todos tenham prestado aten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"That takes a lotta guts, if you ask me~": u"Isso exige muita coragem, se quer saber minha opini\u00e3o~",
        u"That the only reason I keep fighting and looking towards the future\u2026": u"Que a \u00fanica raz\u00e3o pela qual continuo lutando e olhando para o futuro\u2026",
        u"That was a lot wilder than usual\u2026 I almost can\u2019t feel my legs.": u"Aquilo foi muito mais intenso que o normal\u2026 Quase n\u00e3o consigo sentir minhas pernas.",
        u"That was a one-time deal, kiddo.": u"Aquilo foi coisa de uma vez s\u00f3, garoto.",
        u"That was a really amazing speech you gave there, Goro!": u"Foi um discurso realmente incr\u00edvel que voc\u00ea fez, Goro!",
        u"That was a seriously bad pun, Yoshi.": u"Essa foi uma piada muito ruim, Yoshi.",
        u"That was bad.": u"Essa foi p\u00e9ssima.",
        u"That was fast\u2026 We\u2019re not in a hurry, you know.": u"Foi r\u00e1pido\u2026 N\u00e3o estamos com pressa, sabia?",
        u"That was hard to watch\u2026": u"Foi dif\u00edcil assistir \u00e0quilo\u2026",
        u"That was lame.": u"Essa foi p\u00e9ssima.",
        u"That was one of the best ideas I had last summer! I have plenty of other \u201csexier\u201d ideas for everyone to enjoy~! Hehehe\u2026": u"Essa foi uma das melhores ideias que tive no ver\u00e3o passado! Tenho muitas outras ideias \u201cmais sensuais\u201d para todos aproveitarem~! Hehehe\u2026",
        u"That was so freaking awesome, Sir Goro! ": u"Isso foi incr\u00edvel pra caramba, Sr. Goro! ",
        u"That was strange\u2026 and also very sexual\u2026": u"Aquilo foi estranho\u2026 e tamb\u00e9m muito sexual\u2026",
        u"That was supposed to be a secret, Aiden\u2026": u"Era para isso ser segredo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"That was supposed to be my costume this year, but it fits you so much better!": u"Essa seria minha fantasia deste ano, mas fica muito melhor em voc\u00ea!",
        u"That was the last time I heard from him\u2026 ": u"Essa foi a \u00faltima vez que tive not\u00edcias dele\u2026 ",
        u"That wasn't funny.": u"Isso n\u00e3o teve gra\u00e7a.",
        u"That wasn\u2019t fair, you grabbed Yoshi before I could take him!": u"Aquilo n\u00e3o foi justo, voc\u00ea pegou o Yoshi antes que eu pudesse!",
        u"That wasn\u2019t loud at all\u2026": u"Eu nem falei alto\u2026",
        u"That will hinder this project in many ways we do not want to see.": u"Isso prejudicar\u00e1 o projeto de v\u00e1rias maneiras que n\u00e3o queremos presenciar.",
        u"That won\u2019t be necessary. Not much has changed here, so I still know my way around.": u"N\u00e3o ser\u00e1 necess\u00e1rio. Pouca coisa mudou aqui, ent\u00e3o ainda conhe\u00e7o o lugar.",
        u"That workout really got my blood pumping!": u"Esse treino realmente fez meu sangue circular!",
        u"That wouldn\u2019t have happened to begin with if I was there guiding you\u2026": u"Isso nem teria acontecido se eu estivesse l\u00e1 para orientar voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"That's actually something I really admire about you, sir!": u"Na verdade, isso \u00e9 algo que admiro muito no senhor!",
        u"That's not the case.": u"N\u00e3o foi isso que aconteceu.",
        u"That's so embarassing.": u"Isso \u00e9 t\u00e3o constrangedor.",
        u"That's what I'm here for.": u"\u00c9 para isso que estou aqui.",
        u"That's why I understand how you feel about Aiden not being able to be a part of the camp.": u"Por isso entendo como se sente por ele n\u00e3o poder fazer parte do acampamento.",
        u"That's why I understand how you feel about Aiden not being able to be a part of the camp.{fast}": u"Por isso entendo como se sente por ele n\u00e3o poder fazer parte do acampamento.{fast}",
        u"That's why I'm so grateful that we got to spend so much time together and catch up with one another last summer.": u"Por isso sou t\u00e3o grato por termos passado tanto tempo juntos e colocado a conversa em dia no ver\u00e3o passado.",
        u"That, and I made everyone some hot cocoa and coffee~!": u"Al\u00e9m disso, preparei chocolate quente e caf\u00e9 para todo mundo~!",
        u"That, and I think she just doesn\u2019t like me for some reason. It\u2019s just so different from how she acts around you.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, acho que ela simplesmente n\u00e3o gosta de mim por algum motivo. \u00c9 muito diferente de como age perto de voc\u00ea.",
        u"That, and Ms. Komarova\u2019s illness had me quite concerned.": u"Al\u00e9m disso, a doen\u00e7a da Srta. Komarova me deixou bastante preocupado.",
        u"That, and to assign one of your staff to coordinate with whichever representatives I will send to the site on my behalf. Now, isn\u2019t that convenient for both of us?": u"Isso e designar um funcion\u00e1rio para coordenar com os representantes que eu enviar ao local em meu nome. N\u00e3o \u00e9 conveniente para n\u00f3s dois?",
        u"That, or I was going to invite you to start staying over in my room to give the staff here more space.": u"Ou convidaria voc\u00ea para ficar no meu quarto, liberando mais espa\u00e7o para a equipe daqui.",
        u"That... I'm not sure. All we know is how things ended up.": u"Isso\u2026 eu n\u00e3o sei. Tudo que sabemos \u00e9 como as coisas terminaram.",
        u"That\u2019d be a really bad idea, sir.": u"Isso seria uma p\u00e9ssima ideia, senhor.",
        u"That\u2019s SCOUTGRANDMASTER LLOYD to you!": u"Para voc\u00ea \u00e9 GR\u00c3O-MESTRE ESCOTEIRO LLOYD!",
        u"That\u2019s Yoshi for ya! He\u2019s hard wired to give advice, so he can\u2019t help it!": u"Esse \u00e9 o Yoshi! Ele foi programado para dar conselhos, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o consegue evitar!",
        u"That\u2019s a first for me\u2026": u"Essa foi a primeira vez para mim\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s a generic phrase, Lloyd. ": u"Essa \u00e9 uma frase gen\u00e9rica, Lloyd.",
        u"That\u2019s a gift you\u2019ve always had, Yoshi.": u"Esse \u00e9 um dom que voc\u00ea sempre teve, Yoshi.",
        u"That\u2019s a gift you\u2019ve always had, Yoshinori.": u"Esse \u00e9 um dom que voc\u00ea sempre teve, Yoshinori.",
        u"That\u2019s a good mindset for the whole thing.": u"Essa \u00e9 uma boa maneira de encarar tudo isso.",
        u"That\u2019s a good way to look at it, Emilia! ": u"Essa \u00e9 uma boa maneira de enxergar as coisas, Emilia! ",
        u"That\u2019s a great idea! It\u2019d be nice to have our own fancy dining experience back at camp every now and then!": u"\u00d3tima ideia! Seria legal termos nossa pr\u00f3pria experi\u00eancia gastron\u00f4mica chique no acampamento de vez em quando!",
        u"That\u2019s a great idea, Yoshi! But\u2026 so many of the pictures have deteriorated over the years, I\u2019m not sure if they\u2019ll really be useful.": u"\u00c9 uma \u00f3tima ideia, Yoshi! Mas\u2026 muitas fotos se deterioraram ao longo dos anos; n\u00e3o sei se ser\u00e3o realmente \u00fateis.",
        u"That\u2019s a load of crap!! ": u"Isso \u00e9 uma baita mentira!! ",
        u"That\u2019s a very good mindset to have, Aiden.": u"Essa \u00e9 uma \u00f3tima mentalidade, Aiden.",
        u"That\u2019s all I wanted from my parents, and I see now that I took it for granted even here\u2026": u"Era tudo que eu queria dos meus pais, e agora vejo que at\u00e9 aqui eu n\u00e3o dei valor a isso\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s all for now! We\u2019ll be leaving in five minutes!": u"\u00c9 tudo por enquanto! Partiremos em cinco minutos!",
        u"That\u2019s all you\u2019ve been focusing on the past few months, and you deserve a break.": u"Foi s\u00f3 nisso que voc\u00ea se concentrou nos \u00faltimos meses, e merece uma pausa.",
        u"That\u2019s amazing! We\u2019re looking forward to working with you and making this place the best it can be!": u"Isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel! Estamos ansiosos para trabalhar com voc\u00eas e tornar este lugar o melhor poss\u00edvel!",
        u"That\u2019s an admirable goal, Yoshinori. Looking back where we came from is a reminder of why we pursued this path.": u"Esse \u00e9 um objetivo admir\u00e1vel, Yoshinori. Olhar para o lugar de onde viemos nos lembra por que seguimos este caminho.",
        u"That\u2019s an amazing thing to hear, Lloyd. I\u2019m sure Darius feels the same about you.": u"\u00c9 maravilhoso ouvir isso, Lloyd. Tenho certeza de que Darius sente o mesmo por voc\u00ea.",
        u"That\u2019s an excellent idea, sir! I can easily adjust the site development plan to retain some of the trees and incorporate the camp\u2019s aesthetics!": u"\u00c9 uma excelente ideia, senhor! Posso ajustar facilmente o plano de desenvolvimento para preservar algumas \u00e1rvores e incorpor\u00e1-las \u00e0 est\u00e9tica do acampamento!",
        u"That\u2019s an honor to hear from you, sir\u2026!": u"\u00c9 uma honra ouvir isso do senhor\u2026!",
        u"That\u2019s another thing!  The only reason you have the nerve to constantly insult me is because your father lets you get away with all of it!": u"E tem mais!  A \u00fanica raz\u00e3o pela qual voc\u00ea tem coragem de me insultar constantemente \u00e9 porque seu pai deixa voc\u00ea se safar de tudo!",
        u"That\u2019s awesome! After helping you, I\u2019ve started to understand a little better how everything works!": u"Isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel! Depois de ajud\u00e1-lo, comecei a entender um pouco melhor como tudo funciona!",
        u"That\u2019s because I want to be here for you, Aiden\u2026! More than anything else!": u"\u00c9 porque eu quero estar aqui por voc\u00ea, Aiden\u2026! Mais do que qualquer outra coisa!",
        u"That\u2019s big news! This is probably what Mr. Clermont was talking about on our call\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 uma grande not\u00edcia! Provavelmente era disso que o Sr. Clermont estava falando na liga\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s bouillabaisse my dear, it\u2019s a good thing I\u2019m here. If anyone needs help with the menu, I don\u2019t mind educating you~": u"Isso \u00e9 bouillabaisse, meu querido. Ainda bem que estou aqui. Se algu\u00e9m precisar de ajuda com o card\u00e1pio, n\u00e3o me importo de ensinar~",
        u"That\u2019s bullshit! Quit being a pussycat!": u"Que merda! Pare de ser um gatinho medroso!",
        u"That\u2019s common knowledge, you know!": u"Isso \u00e9 conhecimento geral, sabia!",
        u"That\u2019s crazy\u2026 Are we sure this is the same Emilia\u2026?": u"Isso \u00e9 loucura\u2026 Temos certeza de que \u00e9 a mesma Emilia\u2026?",
        u"That\u2019s different from a giant lizard on your shoulder, son.": u"\u00c9 diferente de um lagarto gigante no ombro, filho.",
        u"That\u2019s easy for you to say, Yoshi! You\u2019re the one who left me in the past, so how would you know anyway?!": u"\u00c9 f\u00e1cil para voc\u00ea dizer isso, Yoshi! Foi voc\u00ea quem me deixou no passado, ent\u00e3o como poderia saber?!",
        u"That\u2019s enough spectating for you. Let\u2019s get this rodeo started!": u"Chega de ficar olhando. Vamos come\u00e7ar este rodeio!",
        u"That\u2019s enough!": u"J\u00e1 chega!",
        u"That\u2019s even more surprising.": u"Isso \u00e9 ainda mais surpreendente.",
        u"That\u2019s exactly how I like it\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 exatamente assim que eu gosto\u2026 ",
        u"That\u2019s exactly what I signed up for, sir!": u"Foi exatamente para isso que me inscrevi, senhor!",
        u"That\u2019s exactly why I agreed to Mr. Clermont\u2019s offer. We couldn\u2019t pass up the chance to bond like this.": u"Foi exatamente por isso que aceitei a oferta do Sr. Clermont. N\u00e3o pod\u00edamos deixar passar uma oportunidade assim de estreitar nossos la\u00e7os.",
        u"That\u2019s funny.": u"Que engra\u00e7ado.",
        u"That\u2019s good enough for me~": u"Isso \u00e9 suficiente para mim~",
        u"That\u2019s good enough! Better than waiting for ice to melt!": u"J\u00e1 est\u00e1 \u00f3timo! Melhor do que esperar o gelo derreter!",
        u"That\u2019s good. I do remember helping out a few times as well\u2026 It was enjoyable.": u"Que bom. Lembro que tamb\u00e9m ajudei algumas vezes\u2026 Foi agrad\u00e1vel.",
        u"That\u2019s good. I knew that style and color would suit you well...": u"Que bom. Eu sabia que esse estilo e essa cor combinariam com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s good\u2026": u"Que bom\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s good\u2026 I knew Yoshi would be able to take care of you, that\u2019s why I left you guys alone last night.": u"Que bom\u2026 Eu sabia que Yoshi conseguiria cuidar de voc\u00ea, por isso deixei voc\u00eas dois sozinhos ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"That\u2019s great to hear! I\u2019m glad to know everything\u2019s still on track!": u"Que \u00f3timo saber disso! Fico feliz que tudo continue dentro do planejado!",
        u"That\u2019s great! That should help us get a head start on the biggest chunk of the work.": u"Isso \u00e9 \u00f3timo! Deve nos dar uma vantagem na maior parte do trabalho.",
        u"That\u2019s great, Aiden! I\u2019m sure the workers will go nuts over your cooking! I can tell how good it is just from the smell! ": u"Isso \u00e9 \u00f3timo, Aiden! Tenho certeza de que os trabalhadores v\u00e3o adorar a sua comida! S\u00f3 pelo cheiro j\u00e1 percebo como est\u00e1 boa! ",
        u"That\u2019s great, Emilia! You\u2019ve got such a wonderful mindset about it all now!": u"Isso \u00e9 \u00f3timo, Emilia! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com uma mentalidade maravilhosa sobre tudo isso agora!",
        u"That\u2019s great, sir! I have to admit, I was kind of nervous seeing all those people arrive today, but it sounds like we\u2019ve got it all taken care of now.": u"Isso \u00e9 \u00f3timo, senhor! Admito que fiquei um pouco nervoso ao ver toda aquela gente chegando hoje, mas parece que agora est\u00e1 tudo sob controle.",
        u"That\u2019s how it\u2019s always been, and this time is no different! ": u"Sempre foi assim, e desta vez n\u00e3o \u00e9 diferente! ",
        u"That\u2019s interesting. Notes taken.": u"Interessante. Anotado.",
        u"That\u2019s kinda what I feel guilty about\u2026": u"\u00c9 justamente por isso que me sinto culpado\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s more Gramps\u2019 style! And trust me, he can get real rough!": u"Isso \u00e9 mais o estilo do Vov\u00f4! E acredite, ele pode ser bem bruto!",
        u"That\u2019s more like it.": u"Assim est\u00e1 melhor.",
        u"That\u2019s my cue!": u"Essa \u00e9 minha deixa!",
        u"That\u2019s normal, though\u2026 it takes time to hone your craft! It\u2019s what I went through to get my degree!": u"Mas isso \u00e9 normal\u2026 leva tempo para aperfei\u00e7oar sua profiss\u00e3o! Foi o que passei para conseguir meu diploma!",
        u"That\u2019s not a good thing at all. I\u2019m concerned that we\u2019re experiencing delays already and the project has barely started.": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada bom. \u00c9 preocupante j\u00e1 haver atrasos quando o projeto mal come\u00e7ou.",
        u"That\u2019s not a problem, Sir Goro! I already have Yuri and Aiden with me anyway! We just need to get three more people!": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 problema, Sr. Goro! J\u00e1 tenho Yuri e Aiden comigo! S\u00f3 precisamos de mais tr\u00eas pessoas!",
        u"That\u2019s not an easy thing to do, either. ": u"Isso tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo f\u00e1cil de fazer. ",
        u"That\u2019s not an excuse to just leave it on the site. This camp has a storage shed to keep all clutter, am I not correct?": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 desculpa para deix\u00e1-lo no terreno. Este acampamento tem um galp\u00e3o para guardar materiais, n\u00e3o estou certa?",
        u"That\u2019s not fair!": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 justo!",
        u"That\u2019s not necessary, sir! I do think with the combination of the machines that you brought and the extra help from the scouts, we may be able to finish everything today!": u"N\u00e3o ser\u00e1 necess\u00e1rio, senhor! Acho que, juntando as m\u00e1quinas que trouxe com a ajuda extra dos escoteiros, talvez consigamos terminar tudo hoje!",
        u"That\u2019s not the case, Yoshinori\u2026 I\u2019ve made up my mind already. ": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 isso, Yoshinori\u2026 Eu j\u00e1 tomei minha decis\u00e3o. ",
        u"That\u2019s not the issue here, the problem is that none of my suggestions are even considered, while everyone just agrees to whatever Mr. Nomoru says.": u"Esse n\u00e3o \u00e9 o problema. O problema \u00e9 que nenhuma das minhas sugest\u00f5es sequer \u00e9 considerada, enquanto todos simplesmente concordam com tudo que o Sr. Nomoru diz.",
        u"That\u2019s not the only new thing I see though\u2026 I see some unfamiliar faces as well\u2026": u"Mas essa n\u00e3o \u00e9 a \u00fanica novidade que estou vendo\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m vejo alguns rostos desconhecidos\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s not the point.": u"Essa n\u00e3o \u00e9 a quest\u00e3o.",
        u"That\u2019s not true, Aiden. You could do things like this too, if you tried!": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Aiden. Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m conseguiria fazer coisas assim se tentasse!",
        u"That\u2019s not true, Aiden. You\u2019ve seen my dad lately \u2013 he\u2019s been in his office chair so much. I wouldn\u2019t be surprised if his butt was glued to it! ": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Aiden. Voc\u00ea viu o meu pai ultimamente: ele passa tanto tempo na cadeira do escrit\u00f3rio que eu n\u00e3o me surpreenderia se a bunda dele estivesse colada nela! ",
        u"That\u2019s not true, Emilia! I was only trying to reason with you! ": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Emilia! Eu s\u00f3 estava tentando fazer voc\u00ea ouvir a raz\u00e3o! ",
        u"That\u2019s not true, Emilia! Please, listen to me!": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Emilia! Por favor, me escute!",
        u"That\u2019s not true, Emilia! Sir Goro was only trying to defend everyone from your criticisms!": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Emilia! O Sr. Goro s\u00f3 estava tentando defender todos das suas cr\u00edticas!",
        u"That\u2019s not what I meant at all, silly!": u"N\u00e3o foi nada disso que eu quis dizer, bobo!",
        u"That\u2019s nothing new, Yuri. He\u2019s actually wearing more than usual.": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 novidade, Yuri. Na verdade, ele est\u00e1 usando mais roupa do que de costume.",
        u"That\u2019s okay. I only ever learned these things from my engineering course, and on-site experience.": u"Tudo bem. Eu s\u00f3 aprendi essas coisas no meu curso de engenharia e com experi\u00eancia em obras.",
        u"That\u2019s one thing that never changed about Mr. Andre\u2026": u"Essa \u00e9 uma coisa que nunca mudou no Sr. Andre\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s one! Try another!": u"Esse foi um! Tente outro!",
        u"That\u2019s only because I was hiding something. There\u2019s no need to do that anymore~": u"Isso era s\u00f3 porque eu estava escondendo algo. Agora n\u00e3o preciso mais fazer isso~",
        u"That\u2019s our cue. Let\u2019s go!": u"Esse \u00e9 o nosso chamado. Vamos!",
        u"That\u2019s partly my fault, sir. I didn\u2019t foresee that the expansion site would have this much vegetation. I should\u2019ve conducted the survey earlier.": u"Isso \u00e9 parcialmente culpa minha, senhor. N\u00e3o previ que o terreno da expans\u00e3o teria tanta vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o. Eu deveria ter feito a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o antes.",
        u"That\u2019s perfect! ": u"Perfeito! ",
        u"That\u2019s perfect! I\u2019ll take it.": u"Perfeito! Ficarei com ele.",
        u"That\u2019s perfect, Keitaro. Thanks. Who taught you that, though?": u"Perfeito, Keitaro. Obrigado. Mas quem ensinou isso a voc\u00ea?",
        u"That\u2019s quite a feat considering how expensive the price point here is\u2026": u"\u00c9 uma fa\u00e7anha e tanto considerando como os pre\u00e7os daqui s\u00e3o altos\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s quite a lot\u2026 Is it really possible to build all of that in such a short amount of time?": u"\u00c9 muita coisa\u2026 \u00c9 mesmo poss\u00edvel construir tudo isso em t\u00e3o pouco tempo?",
        u"That\u2019s really cool! I would love to read through it and learn the history of the camp.": u"Isso \u00e9 muito legal! Eu adoraria l\u00ea-lo e conhecer a hist\u00f3ria do acampamento.",
        u"That\u2019s really great to hear, Lloyd. I\u2019m happy to see you two finally working things out together.": u"\u00c9 muito bom ouvir isso, Lloyd. Fico feliz em ver voc\u00eas dois finalmente resolvendo as coisas juntos.",
        u"That\u2019s really interesting\u2026 It makes me want to know more about this camp\u2019s history\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 muito interessante\u2026 Faz com que eu queira conhecer melhor a hist\u00f3ria deste acampamento\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s right!": u"Isso mesmo!",
        u"That\u2019s right! Camp Buddy is a scout-themed summer camp, after all!": u"Isso mesmo! Afinal, o Camp Buddy \u00e9 um acampamento de ver\u00e3o com tema escoteiro!",
        u"That\u2019s right! I am fierce! I won\u2019t let this keep me down!": u"Isso mesmo! Eu sou forte! N\u00e3o vou deixar isso me derrubar!",
        u"That\u2019s right! Please feel free to come back and visit, sir!": u"Isso mesmo! Sinta-se \u00e0 vontade para voltar e nos visitar, senhor!",
        u"That\u2019s right! There\u2019s still plenty of events for the rest of the night!": u"Isso mesmo! Ainda h\u00e1 muitos eventos durante o restante da noite!",
        u"That\u2019s right, Aiden! It\u2019s never too late to explore what the future has in store for us!": u"Isso mesmo, Aiden! Nunca \u00e9 tarde demais para descobrir o que o futuro nos reserva!",
        u"That\u2019s right, expose her! I really never thought I\u2019d see the day Yoshi would be on my side about this! ": u"Isso mesmo, desmascare ela! Nunca pensei que veria o dia em que o Yoshi ficaria do meu lado nisso! ",
        u"That\u2019s right, sir\u2026 Just take a deep breath\u2026": u"Isso, senhor\u2026 Respire fundo\u2026",
        u"That\u2019s right. Besides, Jin\u2019s tasks do not need to follow a strict daily schedule. As long as he gets the job done, then there\u2019s no problem.": u"Isso mesmo. Al\u00e9m disso, as tarefas de Jin n\u00e3o precisam seguir um cronograma di\u00e1rio r\u00edgido. Desde que conclua o trabalho, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 problema.",
        u"That\u2019s right. I guess let\u2019s make the most out of it while we\u2019re still here.": u"\u00c9 verdade. Acho que devemos aproveitar ao m\u00e1ximo enquanto ainda estamos aqui.",
        u"That\u2019s right. If the scouts are allowed to rely on technology, they\u2019d be less focused on the lessons we\u2019re trying to teach them.": u"Isso mesmo. Se os escoteiros puderem depender da tecnologia, prestar\u00e3o menos aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s li\u00e7\u00f5es que tentamos ensinar.",
        u"That\u2019s right. I\u2019m confident we can manage.": u"Isso mesmo. Estou confiante de que conseguiremos administrar tudo.",
        u"That\u2019s right. No matter my opinion, it's up to him to decide.": u"\u00c9 verdade. Independentemente da minha opini\u00e3o, cabe a ele decidir.",
        u"That\u2019s right. The only things that are not covered are the miscellaneous stuff that we need. But all of that should be handled by the fundraising that we did last year.": u"Isso mesmo. As \u00fanicas coisas n\u00e3o cobertas s\u00e3o os itens diversos de que precisaremos, mas a arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o que fizemos no ano passado deve cuidar de tudo isso.",
        u"That\u2019s right. We can\u2019t just leave her behind.": u"Isso mesmo. N\u00e3o podemos simplesmente deix\u00e1-la para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"That\u2019s right... I need to support him no matter what choice he makes.": u"\u00c9 verdade\u2026 Preciso apoi\u00e1-lo, n\u00e3o importa qual escolha ele fa\u00e7a.",
        u"That\u2019s right~ ": u"Isso mesmo~ ",
        u"That\u2019s right\u2026 Aiden\u2019s happiness is what matters the most!": u"\u00c9 verdade\u2026 A felicidade de Aiden \u00e9 o que mais importa!",
        u"That\u2019s seventeen marshmallows though! That was basically the whole bag!": u"Mas foram dezessete marshmallows! Isso foi praticamente o pacote inteiro!",
        u"That\u2019s so mean.": u"Isso \u00e9 t\u00e3o maldoso.",
        u"That\u2019s something I really admire about you, Aiden. I wish I were as optimistic as you.": u"Isso \u00e9 algo que admiro muito em voc\u00ea, Aiden. Gostaria de ser t\u00e3o otimista quanto voc\u00ea.",
        u"That\u2019s something that I will forever admire about you\u2026 ": u"Isso \u00e9 algo que sempre vou admirar no senhor\u2026 ",
        u"That\u2019s splendid news! I was hoping that you\u2019d accept this opportunity!": u"Essa \u00e9 uma not\u00edcia espl\u00eandida! Eu esperava que voc\u00ea aceitasse esta oportunidade!",
        u"That\u2019s surprising. For someone as virile as you, I was sure you\u2019d be into it. What do you and Yoshinori prefer then?": u"Isso \u00e9 surpreendente. Para algu\u00e9m t\u00e3o viril quanto voc\u00ea, eu tinha certeza de que gostaria. Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00ea e Yoshinori preferem?",
        u"That\u2019s surprising. For someone as virile as you, I was sure you\u2019d be into it. What do you and Yoshinori prefer then?{fast}": u"Isso \u00e9 surpreendente. Para algu\u00e9m t\u00e3o viril quanto voc\u00ea, eu tinha certeza de que gostaria. Ent\u00e3o, o que voc\u00ea e Yoshinori preferem?{fast}",
        u"That\u2019s the fucking problem, Yoshinori!!": u"Esse \u00e9 justamente o maldito problema, Yoshinori!!",
        u"That\u2019s the nice way of saying \u201canyone but Ms. Emilia\u201d, Jin.": u"Essa \u00e9 a maneira educada de dizer \u201cqualquer pessoa menos a Srta. Emilia\u201d, Jin.",
        u"That\u2019s the only way she pulled that off.": u"\u00c9 a \u00fanica forma de ela ter conseguido.",
        u"That\u2019s the point! It\u2019s meant to stimulate your senses, to build up your appetite for the main course! ": u"Esse \u00e9 o objetivo! Serve para estimular seus sentidos e aumentar o apetite para o prato principal! ",
        u"That\u2019s the point! You\u2019re way more fun when you\u2019re drunk!": u"Esse \u00e9 o objetivo! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito mais divertido quando est\u00e1 b\u00eabado!",
        u"That\u2019s the right way to think about it, Aiden!": u"\u00c9 assim que voc\u00ea deve pensar, Aiden!",
        u"That\u2019s the same thing Yuri said!": u"\u00c9 a mesma coisa que Yuri disse!",
        u"That\u2019s the spirit, Emilia! You\u2019re speaking like a true buddy now!": u"Esse \u00e9 o esp\u00edrito, Emilia! Agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando como uma verdadeira buddy!",
        u"That\u2019s the thing. He declined the offer.": u"Esse \u00e9 o detalhe. Ele recusou a oferta.",
        u"That\u2019s the thing\u2026 you\u2019re taking it for granted yet again\u2026 LDR doesn\u2019t work for us obviously.": u"Esse \u00e9 o problema\u2026 voc\u00ea est\u00e1 tratando isso como garantido de novo\u2026 Um relacionamento \u00e0 dist\u00e2ncia obviamente n\u00e3o funciona para n\u00f3s.",
        u"That\u2019s true! I\u2019ve seen how much you were able to put down before! I think those muscles play a big role in it, also~": u"\u00c9 verdade! J\u00e1 vi o quanto voc\u00ea consegue beber! Acho que esses m\u00fasculos tamb\u00e9m t\u00eam um papel importante nisso~",
        u"That\u2019s true, but you still deserve to be taken care of every once in a while.": u"\u00c9 verdade, mas voc\u00ea ainda merece que cuidem de voc\u00ea de vez em quando.",
        u"That\u2019s true, sir! We saw how you started changing during our term!": u"\u00c9 verdade, senhor! Vimos como come\u00e7ou a mudar durante nossa temporada!",
        u"That\u2019s true. And normally, I don\u2019t mind letting him and the pups run around during the off-season.": u"\u00c9 verdade. E normalmente n\u00e3o me importo em deixar ele e os filhotes correrem por a\u00ed fora da temporada.",
        u"That\u2019s true. Did it bring up a bad memory or something?": u"\u00c9 verdade. Ela trouxe alguma lembran\u00e7a ruim ou algo assim?",
        u"That\u2019s true. What Aiden makes back at camp sure is better than anything I get when I eat out.": u"\u00c9 verdade. O que o Aiden prepara no acampamento certamente \u00e9 melhor do que qualquer coisa que como fora.",
        u"That\u2019s truly unfortunate, Mr. Flynn\u2026 I had no doubt you would\u2019ve been a breakout star in the culinary industry.": u"\u00c9 realmente uma pena, Sr. Flynn\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o tinha d\u00favida de que voc\u00ea se tornaria uma grande revela\u00e7\u00e3o no ramo da gastronomia.",
        u"That\u2019s truly unfortunate, Mr. Nomoru\u2026 I was certain that you would accept this offer!": u"Isso \u00e9 realmente lament\u00e1vel, Sr. Nomoru\u2026 Eu tinha certeza de que aceitaria esta proposta!",
        u"That\u2019s truly unfortunate\u2026 I was certain that Mr. Nomoru would accept this offer.": u"Isso \u00e9 realmente lament\u00e1vel\u2026 Eu tinha certeza de que o Sr. Nomoru aceitaria esta proposta.",
        u"That\u2019s truly unfortunate\u2026 I\u2019m sorry to hear that.": u"Isso \u00e9 realmente lament\u00e1vel\u2026 Sinto muito em ouvir isso.",
        u"That\u2019s very chivalrous of you, Darius\u2026 Lloyd is a lucky person then!": u"Isso \u00e9 muito cavalheiresco de sua parte, Darius\u2026 Ent\u00e3o Lloyd \u00e9 uma pessoa de sorte!",
        u"That\u2019s way better than a flopped obstacle course reveal, if you ask me~!": u"Isso \u00e9 bem melhor do que uma apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o fracassada de pista de obst\u00e1culos, se quer saber~!",
        u"That\u2019s weird\u2026 I thought we unboxed everything earlier today.": u"Estranho\u2026 Achei que t\u00ednhamos desempacotado tudo mais cedo.",
        u"That\u2019s weird\u2026 Where could Dad be? And how are we gonna handle everything today?": u"Que estranho\u2026 Onde ser\u00e1 que o Pai est\u00e1? E como vamos cuidar de tudo hoje?",
        u"That\u2019s weird\u2026 Where could Dad be? And how are we gonna handle everything today?{fast}": u"Que estranho\u2026 Onde ser\u00e1 que o Pai est\u00e1? E como vamos cuidar de tudo hoje?{fast}",
        u"That\u2019s what I love about you the most\u2026!": u"\u00c9 isso que eu mais amo em voc\u00ea\u2026!",
        u"That\u2019s what I thought. I\u2019m not done myself, so you\u2019d best get ready.": u"Foi o que pensei. Eu tamb\u00e9m ainda n\u00e3o terminei, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor se preparar.",
        u"That\u2019s what I was trying to say, ma\u2019am\u2026 ": u"Era exatamente isso que eu estava tentando dizer, senhora\u2026 ",
        u"That\u2019s what I\u2019m here for, Aiden!": u"\u00c9 para isso que estou aqui, Aiden!",
        u"That\u2019s what I\u2019m thinking as well.": u"Tamb\u00e9m estou pensando nisso.",
        u"That\u2019s what got me thinking, Aiden. It seems like she was making a huge deal out of your department and using that as a way to take over. ": u"Foi isso que me fez pensar, Aiden. Parece que ela exagerou os problemas do seu setor para us\u00e1-los como forma de assumir o controle.",
        u"That\u2019s what you are! ": u"Mas \u00e9 isso que voc\u00ea \u00e9! ",
        u"That\u2019s when I knew I had to steer things in a different direction.": u"Foi quando percebi que precisava conduzir as coisas em outra dire\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"That\u2019s when I started working harder\u2026 I wanted to save enough money to make that dream a reality. ": u"Foi quando comecei a trabalhar ainda mais\u2026 Queria economizar dinheiro suficiente para transformar aquele sonho em realidade. ",
        u"That\u2019s why I always make sure to have Dar here to help me, so things will go smoothly and be much more enjoyable!": u"Por isso sempre fa\u00e7o quest\u00e3o de ter o Dar aqui para me ajudar, assim tudo corre sem problemas e fica muito mais gostoso!",
        u"That\u2019s why I try my best to be his bodyguard. And make sure he always has a smile on his face. ": u"Por isso fa\u00e7o o poss\u00edvel para ser seu guarda-costas. E garantir que sempre tenha um sorriso no rosto. ",
        u"That\u2019s why I\u2019m really glad you made this decision, and see just how much potential you have, Aiden!": u"Por isso fico muito feliz que tenha tomado essa decis\u00e3o e percebido o quanto de potencial voc\u00ea tem, Aiden!",
        u"That\u2019s why I\u2019m really surprised that you\u2019re excited to be back.": u"\u00c9 por isso que estou t\u00e3o surpreso por voc\u00ea estar animada em voltar.",
        u"That\u2019s why I\u2019m really thankful of Mr. Clermont for putting me in a job where I have to be outdoors and around plenty of people to work with.": u"Por isso sou muito grato ao Sr. Clermont por me colocar num trabalho em que preciso ficar ao ar livre e cercado de muitas pessoas.",
        u"That\u2019s why Jin\u2019s here to bring us up to date!": u"\u00c9 por isso que Jin est\u00e1 aqui para nos atualizar!",
        u"That\u2019s why even when he became so stern and shut-off the last few years, all I could do was try to be by his side.": u"Por isso, mesmo quando ele ficou t\u00e3o r\u00edgido e fechado nos \u00faltimos anos, tudo o que eu podia fazer era tentar ficar ao lado dele.",
        u"That\u2019s why it honestly breaks my heart to see you like this\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 por isso que, sinceramente, parte meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o ver voc\u00ea assim\u2026 ",
        u"That\u2019s why you gotta speak up more bro, so people like Yoshi won\u2019t get scared of you.": u"Por isso voc\u00ea precisa falar mais, cara, para que pessoas como o Yoshi n\u00e3o fiquem com medo de voc\u00ea.",
        u"That\u2019s why you shouldn\u2019t miss this chance, Aiden!": u"\u00c9 por isso que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria deixar essa chance passar, Aiden!",
        u"That\u2019s why you slept with me naked to begin with, right?": u"Foi por isso que dormiu nu comigo para come\u00e7ar, n\u00e3o foi?",
        u"That\u2019s why you slept with me naked to begin with, right?{fast}": u"Foi por isso que dormiu nu comigo para come\u00e7ar, n\u00e3o foi?{fast}",
        u"That\u2019s why you\u2019re my biggest inspiration, sir!": u"\u00c9 por isso que o senhor \u00e9 minha maior inspira\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"That\u2019s wild\u2026 Can you believe you\u2019re going to be her stepdad now, Yoshi?!": u"Isso \u00e9 loucura\u2026 Consegue acreditar que agora vai ser padrasto dela, Yoshi?!",
        u"That\u2019s your main thing, bro! A job doesn\u2019t count! ": u"Essa \u00e9 sua principal ocupa\u00e7\u00e3o, cara! Trabalho n\u00e3o conta! ",
        u"That\u2019s \u2018sir\u2019 to you, boy!": u"\u00c9 \u2018senhor\u2019 para voc\u00ea, garoto!",
        u"That\u2019s\u2026 a lot of stuff, Goro\u2026 All of this came from your room\u2026?": u"Isso \u00e9\u2026 muita coisa, Goro\u2026 Tudo isso veio do seu quarto\u2026?",
        u"The FUCBoyS Association figured that since we\u2019re expecting more campers next term, they would like to build more cabins and facilities!": u"A Associa\u00e7\u00e3o FUCBoyS considerou que, como esperamos mais campistas na pr\u00f3xima temporada, seria conveniente construir mais cabanas e instala\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"The Forever Twinky One, am I right?!": u"O Twink Eterno, n\u00e3o \u00e9?!",
        u"The Wi-Fi signal\u2019s the strongest here, too\u2026": u"O sinal do Wi-Fi tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 mais forte aqui\u2026",
        u"The Yoshinori I know aspired for greater things, and not allowing himself to be bossed around so easily!": u"O Yoshinori que conhe\u00e7o aspirava a coisas maiores e n\u00e3o se deixava mandar com tanta facilidade!",
        u"The actual experience is always different though! Just like you, most of your fellow scouts have never even tried camping or exploring the great outdoors. ": u"Mas a experi\u00eancia pr\u00e1tica \u00e9 sempre diferente! Assim como voc\u00ea, a maioria dos seus colegas nunca acampou nem explorou a natureza. ",
        u"The answer is obvious, Aiden!": u"A resposta \u00e9 \u00f3bvia, Aiden!",
        u"The answer is obvious.": u"A resposta \u00e9 \u00f3bvia.",
        u"The appetizers were good. I don\u2019t see the problem here.": u"As entradas estavam boas. N\u00e3o vejo problema algum.",
        u"The architecture of this place is AMAZING! Just look at the intricate designs! Where do I begin? It\u2019s a sensory overload!": u"A arquitetura deste lugar \u00e9 INCR\u00cdVEL! Olhem s\u00f3 esses detalhes elaborados! Por onde eu come\u00e7o? \u00c9 informa\u00e7\u00e3o demais para os sentidos!",
        u"The bed in my room is big enough for two people anyway.": u"A cama do meu quarto \u00e9 grande o bastante para duas pessoas mesmo.",
        u"The best we can do for now is keep things under control and regain our momentum one step at a time.": u"O melhor que podemos fazer agora \u00e9 manter tudo sob controle e recuperar nosso ritmo, um passo de cada vez.",
        u"The booth we were in wasn\u2019t very private and I was worried someone would catch us\u2026": u"A cabine onde est\u00e1vamos n\u00e3o era muito privativa, e eu temia que algu\u00e9m nos pegasse\u2026",
        u"The caf\u00e9 seems like it might be a nice place to hang out at!": u"O caf\u00e9 parece um lugar agrad\u00e1vel para passarmos o tempo!",
        u"The catch is\u2026 it\u2019d take at least two years\u2026 ": u"O problema \u00e9\u2026 levaria pelo menos dois anos\u2026 ",
        u"The change has to come from you\u2026 I\u2019m sure you\u2019re tired of living in your old ways too.": u"A mudan\u00e7a precisa partir de voc\u00ea\u2026 Tenho certeza de que tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 cansada de viver como antes.",
        u"The clothes, probably not anymore. They\u2019re already too small for me, since I bulked up a lot over the years.": u"As roupas, provavelmente n\u00e3o. J\u00e1 est\u00e3o pequenas demais para mim, j\u00e1 que fiquei muito maior ao longo dos anos.",
        u"The consequences of being an adult\u2026 We really don\u2019t have time in our busy lives\u2026": u"As consequ\u00eancias de ser adulto\u2026 Realmente n\u00e3o temos tempo em nossas vidas corridas\u2026",
        u"The conversation moved so fast that I didn\u2019t know when I was supposed to talk, or even have time to process the information!": u"A conversa avan\u00e7ou t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido que eu n\u00e3o sabia quando deveria falar, nem tive tempo para processar as informa\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"The conversation moved so fast that I didn\u2019t know when I was supposed to talk, or even have time to process the information! ": u"A conversa avan\u00e7ou t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido que eu n\u00e3o sabia quando deveria falar, nem tive tempo para processar as informa\u00e7\u00f5es! ",
        u"The credit goes to Yoshinori. He was quite the thoughtful scout, you know.": u"O m\u00e9rito \u00e9 do Yoshinori. Ele era um escoteiro muito atencioso, sabia.",
        u"The criticisms were rather trifling, but we don\u2019t have much of a choice except to try and make do since Mr. Clermont placed her here.": u"As cr\u00edticas foram um tanto insignificantes, mas n\u00e3o temos muita escolha al\u00e9m de nos adaptar, j\u00e1 que o Sr. Clermont a colocou aqui.",
        u"The days flew by, and we saw the fruits of our labor take shape as we came closer and closer to completion!": u"Os dias passaram voando, e vimos os frutos do nosso trabalho tomarem forma \u00e0 medida que nos aproxim\u00e1vamos cada vez mais da conclus\u00e3o!",
        u"The dream we had lost all its spirit, turning the camp into a soulless business, and I completely lost touch of what it was supposed to be\u2026": u"O sonho que t\u00ednhamos perdeu toda a sua ess\u00eancia, transformando o acampamento em um neg\u00f3cio sem alma, e eu perdi completamente de vista o que ele deveria ser\u2026",
        u"The entertainment here is really\u2026 unique, huh?": u"O entretenimento daqui \u00e9 realmente\u2026 singular, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"The expectations I had were so unreasonable, acting so entitled and then being so loathsome when things didn\u2019t go my way\u2026": u"As expectativas que eu tinha eram t\u00e3o absurdas, agindo como se tudo me fosse devido e depois sendo t\u00e3o desprez\u00edvel quando as coisas n\u00e3o sa\u00edam como eu queria\u2026",
        u"The explanation for that is rather simple. ": u"A explica\u00e7\u00e3o para isso \u00e9 bem simples. ",
        u"The fork, however, indicates the willingness to sacrifice everything for love!": u"J\u00e1 a bifurca\u00e7\u00e3o indica disposi\u00e7\u00e3o para sacrificar tudo pelo amor!",
        u"The good news is that it\u2019s already passed, and the clean-up operations are already underway.": u"A boa not\u00edcia \u00e9 que ela j\u00e1 passou e as opera\u00e7\u00f5es de limpeza j\u00e1 est\u00e3o em andamento.",
        u"The gown? Cucci! The feather? Verse-ace! The shoes? Louis Butt-on! The jewelry? Stiffany & Ho!": u"O vestido? Cucci! A pluma? Verse-ace! Os sapatos? Louis Butt-on! As joias? Stiffany & Ho!",
        u"The gown? Cucci! The feathers? Verse-ace! The shoes? Louis Butt-on! The jewelry? Stiffany & Ho!": u"O vestido? Cucci! As plumas? Verse-ace! Os sapatos? Louis Butt-on! As joias? Stiffany & Ho!",
        u"The holiday\u2019s still a couple weeks away! Your calendar\u2019s way off again, crazy lady!": u"Ainda faltam algumas semanas para o feriado! Seu calend\u00e1rio est\u00e1 todo errado de novo, maluca!",
        u"The impact you have on Aiden is what\u2019s led him to become the great man he is today.": u"A influ\u00eancia que voc\u00ea tem sobre o Aiden ajudou a transform\u00e1-lo no grande homem que ele \u00e9 hoje.",
        u"The insight from these professionals gave us a huge scope of potential upgrades with the budget that we have.": u"A an\u00e1lise desses profissionais nos apresentou um vasto conjunto de poss\u00edveis melhorias dentro do or\u00e7amento dispon\u00edvel.",
        u"The last thing I want is you guys being groggy and hungover as our first impression!": u"A \u00faltima coisa que quero \u00e9 causar uma primeira impress\u00e3o com voc\u00eas sonolentos e de ressaca!",
        u"The last time was at a beach.": u"A \u00faltima vez foi em uma praia.",
        u"The last two nights were pretty rough. Hopefully they didn\u2019t spoil the whole getaway for you.": u"As duas \u00faltimas noites foram bem dif\u00edceis. Espero que n\u00e3o tenham estragado toda a viagem para voc\u00ea.",
        u"The latter eviction is just a few months ago too\u2026 So, that must be where she last lived\u2026": u"E esse \u00faltimo despejo aconteceu h\u00e1 apenas alguns meses\u2026 Ent\u00e3o deve ter sido onde ela morou por \u00faltimo\u2026",
        u"The least you could do is help me out!": u"O m\u00ednimo que voc\u00ea pode fazer \u00e9 me ajudar!",
        u"The lobby? Did you forget something?": u"O sagu\u00e3o? Esqueceu alguma coisa?",
        u"The men behind me are my construction team. As I\u2019m sure you know, we\u2019ve been selected by Clermont Inc. to design and construct all the new buildings and amenities as per the official plan!": u"Os homens atr\u00e1s de mim s\u00e3o a minha equipe de constru\u00e7\u00e3o. Como certamente sabem, fomos escolhidos pela Clermont Inc. para projetar e construir todos os novos edif\u00edcios e instala\u00e7\u00f5es conforme o plano oficial!",
        u"The moment I saw this on the brochure, I had to go check it out!": u"No instante em que vi isto no folheto, precisei vir conhecer!",
        u"The moment the bus started moving, he started gagging...": u"Assim que o \u00f4nibus come\u00e7ou a andar, ele come\u00e7ou a ter \u00e2nsia\u2026",
        u"The moment the first scout term ended, I grew apart from everyone, including her\u2026": u"Assim que a primeira temporada como escoteiro terminou, eu me afastei de todo mundo, inclusive dela\u2026",
        u"The more, the merrier!": u"Quanto mais, melhor.",
        u"The more, the merrier, right?": u"Quanto mais gente, melhor, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"The more, the merrier.": u"Quanto mais, melhor.",
        u"The new girl? ": u"A garota nova?",
        u"The next few months are looking quite full, aren\u2019t they?": u"Os pr\u00f3ximos meses parecem bem cheios, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"The next term is only a week away. Can I really leave the camp to you like this?": u"A pr\u00f3xima temporada come\u00e7a em apenas uma semana. Posso mesmo deixar o acampamento nas suas m\u00e3os desse jeito?",
        u"The next term is still months away and a lot can happen in their personal lives.": u"Ainda faltam meses para a pr\u00f3xima temporada, e muita coisa pode acontecer na vida deles.",
        u"The one time I tried playing a gacha game I had to quit \u2013 I got super unlucky and was too broke to keep going!": u"Na \u00fanica vez que tentei jogar um gacha, tive que parar \u2014 dei muito azar e fiquei sem dinheiro para continuar!",
        u"The only people I need to know are already familiar faces, so there\u2019s no need for that.": u"As \u00fanicas pessoas que preciso conhecer j\u00e1 s\u00e3o rostos familiares, ent\u00e3o isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio.",
        u"The only thing I could think about was that everything happened because of how useless I was, and how I had no place in the world\u2026": u"A \u00fanica coisa em que conseguia pensar era que tudo havia acontecido porque eu era in\u00fatil e n\u00e3o tinha lugar neste mundo\u2026",
        u"The only thing I had left was to try and make Camp Buddy the best it could be\u2026": u"A \u00fanica coisa que me restava era tentar tornar o Camp Buddy o melhor poss\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"The only thing that\u2019s still irritating me is Emilia being on the trip with us. But I guess you can\u2019t have everything, huh?": u"A \u00fanica coisa que ainda me irrita \u00e9 Emilia estar viajando conosco. Mas acho que n\u00e3o se pode ter tudo, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"The only thing we had in common back then is how we were both sort of outcasts.": u"A \u00fanica coisa que t\u00ednhamos em comum naquela \u00e9poca era que n\u00f3s dois \u00e9ramos meio exclu\u00eddos.",
        u"The only way we\u2019ll know is if we ask Goro directly\u2026 ": u"A \u00fanica forma de saber \u00e9 perguntar diretamente ao Goro\u2026 ",
        u"The origin of the blessed apron has been revealed\u2026": u"A origem do avental aben\u00e7oado foi revelada\u2026",
        u"The other scouts used to stay away from him because of how quiet he was.": u"Os outros escoteiros costumavam se afastar dele por ele ser t\u00e3o quieto.",
        u"The past made you who you are today.": u"O passado fez de voc\u00ea quem \u00e9 hoje.",
        u"The people I mistreated are the ones who saved me from what I thought was inevitable\u2026": u"As pessoas que maltratei foram justamente as que me salvaram do que eu achava inevit\u00e1vel\u2026",
        u"The pills appear to be prescribed to Ms. Komarova for sleep deprivation, and it appears she takes these pills regularly, but today she took more than she should.    ": u"Os comprimidos parecem ter sido prescritos \u00e0 Srta. Komarova para problemas de sono, e aparentemente ela os toma regularmente, mas hoje tomou mais do que deveria.    ",
        u"The pleasure\u2019s all mine! ": u"O prazer foi todo meu! ",
        u"The promise we made to each other.": u"Da promessa que fizemos um ao outro.",
        u"The reality is I was never meant for anything great in the first place. ": u"A realidade \u00e9 que eu nunca fui destinado a fazer nada grandioso. ",
        u"The reason why the webbings are assembled in a certain pattern is so that everything behaves as a single, rigid structure.": u"O motivo de as barras internas serem montadas em determinado padr\u00e3o \u00e9 fazer com que tudo funcione como uma \u00fanica estrutura r\u00edgida.",
        u"The road to get there wasn\u2019t easy at all, and it was only possible because Yuri was with me every step of the way.": u"O caminho at\u00e9 l\u00e1 n\u00e3o foi nada f\u00e1cil, e s\u00f3 foi poss\u00edvel porque Yuri esteve comigo em cada passo.",
        u"The roads to the nearest one are still being cleared of snow\u2026": u"As estradas at\u00e9 o hospital mais pr\u00f3ximo ainda est\u00e3o sendo liberadas da neve\u2026",
        u"The rules are simple! Three rounds per person, each round you lose, you strip a piece of clothing! If you\u2019re naked, you\u2019re out!": u"As regras s\u00e3o simples! Tr\u00eas rodadas por pessoa; a cada rodada que perder, tira uma pe\u00e7a de roupa! Se ficar pelado, est\u00e1 fora!",
        u"The shed has been overflowing for a while, so it's probably best we go through it and see what's worth keeping.": u"O galp\u00e3o est\u00e1 abarrotado h\u00e1 algum tempo, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor examinarmos tudo e vermos o que vale a pena guardar.",
        u"The shocking turn of events reveals the forbidden affair!": u"A chocante reviravolta revela o romance proibido!",
        u"The show\u2019s over, Emilia\u2026 We found out you\u2019ve been lying to everyone this whole time\u2026 ": u"O teatro acabou, Emilia\u2026 Descobrimos que voc\u00ea mentiu para todo mundo esse tempo todo\u2026 ",
        u"The sides of my jacket don\u2019t even connect. Closing it is impossible.": u"Os lados da minha jaqueta nem se encontram. \u00c9 imposs\u00edvel fech\u00e1-la.",
        u"The snow boots should be in the shed. Come with me, scouts! ": u"As botas de neve devem estar no galp\u00e3o. Venham comigo, escoteiros! ",
        u"The snow started to thaw, and with spring just around the corner, we could clearly see how much progress we made!": u"A neve come\u00e7ou a derreter e, com a primavera chegando, consegu\u00edamos ver claramente o quanto hav\u00edamos avan\u00e7ado!",
        u"The specialists probably won\u2019t arrive for a while too\u2026 Maybe I should go out for a morning patrol first\u2026 ": u"Os especialistas provavelmente ainda v\u00e3o demorar para chegar\u2026 Talvez eu devesse fazer uma patrulha matinal primeiro\u2026 ",
        u"The staff is ready for the scouts inside. The meal for the reception party is all prepared as well, sir!": u"A equipe est\u00e1 pronta para receber os escoteiros l\u00e1 dentro. A refei\u00e7\u00e3o da festa de recep\u00e7\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 preparada, senhor!",
        u"The sun references happiness, warmth and vitality, and when combined with the Fool emphasizes innocence and optimism!": u"O Sol representa felicidade, calor e vitalidade e, combinado com O Louco, enfatiza inoc\u00eancia e otimismo!",
        u"The surface of the pool is frozen, but the falls themselves are still flowing so calmly.": u"A superf\u00edcie da lagoa est\u00e1 congelada, mas a cachoeira continua fluindo t\u00e3o tranquilamente.",
        u"The taste does seem kind of complex, huh? It\u2019s a totally different style from yours.": u"O sabor realmente parece meio complexo, n\u00e3o \u00e9? \u00c9 um estilo completamente diferente do seu.",
        u"The thought of you two\u2026 *shivers*": u"S\u00f3 de pensar em voc\u00eas dois\u2026 *arrepios*",
        u"The truth is that everything I have so far is because of pity\u2026": u"A verdade \u00e9 que tudo o que tenho at\u00e9 agora \u00e9 por pena\u2026",
        u"The water is so nice and warm\u2026 Perfect for how cold it\u2019s been getting lately\u2026": u"A \u00e1gua est\u00e1 t\u00e3o gostosa e quentinha\u2026 Perfeita para esse frio que tem feito ultimamente\u2026",
        u"The way they\u2019re using the snowblowers makes it look like it\u2019s not even a chore anymore.": u"Do jeito que est\u00e3o usando os sopradores de neve, nem parece mais trabalho.",
        u"The what goes to the what now\u2026?": u"O qu\u00ea vai aonde mesmo\u2026?",
        u"The workers are gathered as well and the shuttle should arrive in a few minutes!": u"Os trabalhadores tamb\u00e9m j\u00e1 est\u00e3o reunidos, e o \u00f4nibus deve chegar em alguns minutos!",
        u"The workers have just arrived and we\u2019re gathering to discuss resuming our expansion project.": u"Os trabalhadores acabaram de chegar e estamos nos reunindo para discutir a retomada do projeto de expans\u00e3o.",
        u"Then I found myself managing several branches at once, and I used them as an excuse to shut away my pain, and fill the emptiness in my heart.": u"Ent\u00e3o me vi administrando v\u00e1rias unidades ao mesmo tempo, usando isso como desculpa para esconder minha dor e preencher o vazio no meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Then I guess I\u2019ll just have to deal with this \u2013 you\u2019re in luck, \u2019cause I know a quick fix~": u"Ent\u00e3o acho que vou ter que resolver isso \u2013 voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com sorte, porque eu conhe\u00e7o uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o rapidinha~",
        u"Then I\u2019ll be a star!": u"Ent\u00e3o eu vou virar uma estrela!",
        u"Then I\u2019ll do everything I can to stay here, and I won\u2019t just wait either\u2026 I\u2019ll try to make something out of myself, too\u2026!": u"Ent\u00e3o vou fazer tudo o que puder para continuar aqui, e tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o vou ficar apenas esperando\u2026 Vou tentar construir algo para mim tamb\u00e9m\u2026!",
        u"Then I\u2019ll show them how to make a good splash!": u"Ent\u00e3o vou mostrar como se d\u00e1 um belo mergulho!",
        u"Then come on over and open your present~": u"Ent\u00e3o venha aqui abrir seu presente~",
        u"Then explain to me why your parents are in prison and how you ended up losing everything!": u"Ent\u00e3o me explique por que seus pais est\u00e3o na pris\u00e3o e como voc\u00ea acabou perdendo tudo!",
        u"Then get your lazy ass up from that bed, scout. We\u2019re on vacation and we\u2019ve already spent half our day cooped up in this room.": u"Ent\u00e3o tire essa bunda pregui\u00e7osa da cama, escoteiro. Estamos de f\u00e9rias e j\u00e1 passamos metade do dia presos neste quarto.",
        u"Then grab an axe and show me what you got~!": u"Ent\u00e3o pegue um machado e mostre do que \u00e9 capaz~!",
        u"Then he must be afraid of being alone again\u2026": u"Ent\u00e3o ele deve ter medo de ficar sozinho novamente\u2026",
        u"Then hold your axe near your waist \u2013 one hand on the base of the handle, palm facing toward you and the other hand at the neck, palm facing away, thumb next to the axe head.": u"Depois, segure o machado perto da cintura \u2014 uma m\u00e3o na base do cabo, com a palma voltada para voc\u00ea, e a outra perto da cabe\u00e7a, com a palma para fora e o polegar pr\u00f3ximo \u00e0 l\u00e2mina.",
        u"Then it\u2019s your turn, Dynamite! I dare you to get naked! ": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 sua vez, Dinamite! Desafio voc\u00ea a ficar pelado! ",
        u"Then leave.": u"Ent\u00e3o v\u00e1 embora.",
        u"Then let\u2019s make sure that they have the best Camp Buddy to come back to! ": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos garantir que eles tenham o melhor Camp Buddy poss\u00edvel para onde voltar! ",
        u"Then let\u2019s make sure they have the best version of Camp Buddy to come back to!": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos garantir que eles tenham a melhor vers\u00e3o do Camp Buddy para onde voltar!",
        u"Then let\u2019s settle this for good! First one to make Yoshi cum, wins!": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos resolver isso de uma vez! O primeiro a fazer Yoshi gozar vence!",
        u"Then maybe you won\u2019t have to do everything on your own, sir!": u"Ent\u00e3o talvez o senhor n\u00e3o precise fazer tudo sozinho!",
        u"Then this is the perfect moment to discuss these matters and ensure that we can move forward with the project positively.": u"Ent\u00e3o este \u00e9 o momento perfeito para discutirmos essas quest\u00f5es e garantirmos que o projeto avance de forma positiva.",
        u"Then we add a little lovin\u2019 over here~!": u"Depois acrescentamos um pouco de carinho aqui~!",
        u"Then we better start dressing up now, or we\u2019ll be late.": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor come\u00e7armos a nos arrumar agora, sen\u00e3o vamos nos atrasar.",
        u"Then when he became my boss, I don\u2019t think I ever let myself in here much. ": u"Depois, quando ele virou meu chefe, acho que quase nunca entrava aqui por conta pr\u00f3pria. ",
        u"Then why don\u2019t I fill you up?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que eu n\u00e3o encho voc\u00ea?",
        u"Then why don\u2019t you stay here and work with us? Nobody else is good with computers like you are!": u"Ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o fica aqui e trabalha conosco? Ningu\u00e9m mais entende de computadores como voc\u00ea!",
        u"Then you left to pursue your dream to become a scoutmaster, and the effects of my divorce finally hit me.": u"Ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea partiu para perseguir seu sonho de se tornar chefe escoteiro, e os efeitos do meu div\u00f3rcio finalmente me atingiram.",
        u"There aren\u2019t any booths.": u"N\u00e3o tem divis\u00f3rias.",
        u"There he is!": u"Ali est\u00e1 ele!",
        u"There must be a new wave of e-mails we need to respond to! Do you mind if I use the computer, Jin?": u"Deve haver uma nova leva de e-mails para responder! Voc\u00ea se importa se eu usar o computador, Jin?",
        u"There must be a reason he made this decision\u2026": u"Deve haver um motivo para ele ter tomado essa decis\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"There must be a way to have Aiden here at the camp. He wouldn\u2019t be alone back at home anymore, and we could have so much fun together!": u"Deve haver uma maneira de ter o Aiden aqui no acampamento. Ele n\u00e3o ficaria mais sozinho em casa, e poder\u00edamos nos divertir muito juntos!",
        u"There must be a way to have Aiden here at the camp. I\u2019m sure he\u2019d become, like, the best chef ever!": u"Deve haver uma maneira de ter o Aiden aqui no acampamento. Tenho certeza de que ele se tornaria o melhor chef de todos!",
        u"There was never a reason to bring it up\u2026 And I don\u2019t think it\u2019s something to be proud of either\u2026 ": u"Nunca houve motivo para tocar no assunto\u2026 E tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o acho que seja algo do qual me orgulhar\u2026 ",
        u"There was nothing I should\u2019ve been afraid of, after all\u2026": u"No fim das contas, n\u00e3o havia nada do que eu precisasse ter medo\u2026",
        u"There was really no other way it could\u2019ve gone down if you ask me\u2026": u"Se quer saber minha opini\u00e3o, n\u00e3o havia outra maneira de aquilo terminar\u2026",
        u"There wasn\u2019t enough room in here, and I didn\u2019t want to have Emilia share storage space with me in the room.": u"N\u00e3o havia espa\u00e7o suficiente aqui, e eu n\u00e3o queria dividir o espa\u00e7o de armazenamento do quarto com Emilia.",
        u"There we go! Errand finished!": u"Pronto! Tarefa conclu\u00edda!",
        u"There we go! Everything\u2019s installed and ready to go!": u"Pronto! Tudo est\u00e1 instalado e pronto para funcionar!",
        u"There we go! I think I\u2019m fully packed! ": u"Pronto! Acho que terminei de arrumar tudo! ",
        u"There we go, you guys already have the qualities for it! ": u"A\u00ed est\u00e1, voc\u00eas j\u00e1 t\u00eam as qualidades necess\u00e1rias! ",
        u"There we go.": u"Pronto.",
        u"There were a couple of times I wanted to get up and check on her. ": u"Algumas vezes tive vontade de levantar e ir ver como ela estava. ",
        u"There were a couple of times I wanted to get up and check on her\u2026 but it was really late.": u"Algumas vezes eu quis me levantar e ir ver como ela estava\u2026 mas j\u00e1 era muito tarde.",
        u"There were a lot more people, loud music, and... uh\u2026 entertainers.": u"Tinha muito mais gente, m\u00fasica alta e... ahn\u2026 artistas.",
        u"There were plenty of hardships along the way, but I don\u2019t regret any of them. They helped shape everything into what we have today.": u"Houve muitas dificuldades pelo caminho, mas n\u00e3o me arrependo de nenhuma. Elas ajudaram a moldar tudo no que temos hoje.",
        u"There you are, Sir Goro! ": u"A\u00ed est\u00e1 o senhor, Sr. Goro! ",
        u"There you are, Yoshi!": u"A\u00ed est\u00e1 voc\u00ea, Yoshi!",
        u"There you go again Keitaro, making everyone your best friend!": u"L\u00e1 vai voc\u00ea de novo, Keitaro, fazendo de todo mundo seu melhor amigo!",
        u"There you go teasing me again, Aiden.": u"L\u00e1 vem voc\u00ea me provocando de novo, Aiden.",
        u"There you go.": u"Pronto.",
        u"There you two are! You missed the champagne popping! What took you so long?!": u"A\u00ed est\u00e3o voc\u00eas dois! Perderam a abertura do champanhe! Por que demoraram tanto?!",
        u"There you two are!! What took you so long?! You missed the champagne popping!": u"A\u00ed est\u00e3o voc\u00eas dois!! Por que demoraram tanto?! Perderam a abertura do champanhe!",
        u"There! That\u2019s more like it!": u"A\u00ed! Agora sim!",
        u"There! That\u2019s much better!": u"Pronto! Assim est\u00e1 bem melhor!",
        u"There's a few old tools that sorely need replacing, and we have some rusted and broken stuff we need to dispose of too.": u"H\u00e1 algumas ferramentas velhas que precisam urgentemente ser substitu\u00eddas, al\u00e9m de coisas enferrujadas e quebradas que devemos descartar.",
        u"There's a lot to consider besides just money.": u"H\u00e1 muito a considerar al\u00e9m do dinheiro.",
        u"There's a way to make it happen!": u"Existe uma maneira de fazer dar certo!",
        u"There's nothing to worry about.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada com que se preocupar.",
        u"There's so much stuff to do just to keep the place running with only the few of us and almost all the scouts gone.": u"H\u00e1 tanta coisa para fazer s\u00f3 para manter este lugar funcionando, agora que restamos t\u00e3o poucos e quase todos os escoteiros foram embora.",
        u"There, now you can cry all you want, but you\u2019re still not allowed to cum.": u"Pronto, agora pode chorar o quanto quiser, mas ainda n\u00e3o tem permiss\u00e3o para gozar.",
        u"There\u2019s a bar, caf\u00e9, gym, and so much more\u2026 I can\u2019t even pick\u2026 ": u"Tem bar, caf\u00e9, academia e muito mais\u2026 Nem consigo escolher\u2026 ",
        u"There\u2019s a good reason why I removed some of the proposed integrations.": u"H\u00e1 uma boa raz\u00e3o para eu ter removido algumas das integra\u00e7\u00f5es propostas.",
        u"There\u2019s a guy who\u2019s been walking around the entrance for a while now.": u"Tem um cara andando de um lado para o outro na entrada h\u00e1 algum tempo.",
        u"There\u2019s a proper time and place for that, Aiden. ": u"Existe hora e lugar apropriados para isso, Aiden. ",
        u"There\u2019s a right way to handle this. And the fact that she\u2019s a camp alumnus could put the sponsorship at risk too\u2026": u"Existe uma maneira correta de lidar com isso. E o fato de ela ser ex-integrante do acampamento tamb\u00e9m pode colocar o patroc\u00ednio em risco\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s a sense of fulfillment that what we\u2019re doing here makes a difference even in the littlest way possible.": u"\u00c9 gratificante saber que o que fazemos aqui faz diferen\u00e7a, mesmo que seja da menor maneira poss\u00edvel.",
        u"There\u2019s also a lot of new scouts and scoutmasters as well. It\u2019s been really busy around here\u2026": u"Tamb\u00e9m h\u00e1 muitos escoteiros e chefes escoteiros novos. As coisas est\u00e3o bem corridas por aqui\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s also a lot of studies that say yoga makes you happier, healthier, and more flexible!": u"Tamb\u00e9m h\u00e1 muitos estudos dizendo que a ioga deixa voc\u00ea mais feliz, saud\u00e1vel e flex\u00edvel!",
        u"There\u2019s barely any left, you dummy.": u"Quase n\u00e3o sobrou nenhuma, seu idiota.",
        u"There\u2019s enough \u2018meat\u2019 and \u2018balls\u2019 for you both! ": u"Tem \u2018carne\u2019 e \u2018bolas\u2019 de sobra para voc\u00eas dois! ",
        u"There\u2019s just no excuse\u2026 I was so, so wrong\u2026": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 desculpa\u2026 Eu estava t\u00e3o, t\u00e3o errada\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s no denying how much he enjoys your company\u2026 and it seems like he\u2019s been wanting it for a really long time now, too.": u"N\u00e3o d\u00e1 para negar o quanto ele gosta da sua companhia\u2026 e parece que deseja isso h\u00e1 muito tempo tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"There\u2019s no judgment here! C\u2019mere!  ": u"Ningu\u00e9m vai julgar voc\u00ea aqui! Venha c\u00e1!  ",
        u"There\u2019s no need, you\u2019ll know me when you know me.": u"N\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio. Voc\u00eas me conhecer\u00e3o quando me conhecerem.",
        u"There\u2019s no need. I do have a favor to ask though.": u"N\u00e3o precisa. Mas tenho um favor para pedir.",
        u"There\u2019s no point, sir\u2026 I\u2019m sure everyone\u2019s already left\u2026": u"N\u00e3o adianta, senhor\u2026 Tenho certeza de que todos j\u00e1 foram embora\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s no point. You\u2019ll end up sleeping, anyway.": u"N\u00e3o adianta. Voc\u00ea vai acabar dormindo mesmo.",
        u"There\u2019s no pressure, Aiden! You don\u2019t have to decide right away.": u"Sem press\u00e3o, Aiden! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa decidir agora.",
        u"There\u2019s no reason why we can\u2019t be together and still stay at the camp!": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para n\u00e3o podermos ficar juntos e ainda permanecer no acampamento!",
        u"There\u2019s no use denying it. The moment I stood up from the pool, your bulge did the same.": u"N\u00e3o adianta negar. No instante em que me levantei da piscina, seu volume tamb\u00e9m se levantou.",
        u"There\u2019s no way I\u2019m going to let you trash him when you refuse to acknowledge the fact that he works the hardest out of everyone here!": u"Eu n\u00e3o vou deixar voc\u00ea falar mal dele quando se recusa a reconhecer que ele \u00e9 quem mais trabalha entre todos aqui!",
        u"There\u2019s no way that Emilia could have maintained her lifestyle without her family\u2019s wealth\u2026": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 como Emilia ter mantido aquele estilo de vida sem a riqueza da fam\u00edlia\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s no way that Ms. Komarova could have maintained her lifestyle without her family\u2019s wealth\u2026": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 como a Srta. Komarova ter mantido seu estilo de vida sem a fortuna da fam\u00edlia\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s no way to know unless we ask Goro himself\u2026": u"N\u00e3o temos como saber sem perguntar ao pr\u00f3prio Goro\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s nobody better suited for the task, since it\u2019s my job to oversee the entire project! We can take charge and lead together.": u"Ningu\u00e9m \u00e9 mais adequado para isso, pois meu trabalho \u00e9 supervisionar todo o projeto! Podemos assumir o comando e liderar juntos.",
        u"There\u2019s not much to see there, but I guess it\u2019ll help kill some time.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito para ver por l\u00e1, mas acho que vai ajudar a passar o tempo.",
        u"There\u2019s not much to see there, but I guess it\u2019ll help kill some time.  ": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito para ver l\u00e1, mas acho que vai ajudar a passar o tempo.  ",
        u"There\u2019s not much we can do until the snow is gone, though\u2026": u"Mas n\u00e3o h\u00e1 muito que possamos fazer at\u00e9 a neve desaparecer\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s nothing caring about that\u2026": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de carinhoso nisso\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s nothing for me to do here. You can\u2019t expect me to sit around here and watch you play house with a bunch of scouts.": u"N\u00e3o tenho nada para fazer aqui. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode esperar que eu fique sentada vendo voc\u00ea brincar de casinha com um bando de escoteiros.",
        u"There\u2019s nothing to be embarrassed about, Aiden\u2026 Showing your weakness doesn\u2019t make you any less of a person.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para se envergonhar, Aiden\u2026 Mostrar suas fraquezas n\u00e3o faz de voc\u00ea uma pessoa menor.",
        u"There\u2019s nothing to worry about, Aiden. ": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada com que se preocupar, Aiden. ",
        u"There\u2019s nothing wrong with Darius\u2019 expressions! Honestly, his blank face is a lot more mysterious and attractive to some people!": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de errado com as express\u00f5es do Darius! Sinceramente, o rosto inexpressivo dele \u00e9 muito mais misterioso e atraente para algumas pessoas!",
        u"There\u2019s nothing \u2018fun\u2019 about setting up tents. And I don\u2019t need to learn how, especially when I have people to do it for me.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada de \u2018divertido\u2019 em montar barracas. E n\u00e3o preciso aprender, especialmente quando tenho pessoas que fazem isso por mim.",
        u"There\u2019s obviously change that needs to happen, and we can only do so much to help you.": u"\u00c9 \u00f3bvio que algumas coisas precisam mudar, e s\u00f3 podemos ajud\u00e1-la at\u00e9 certo ponto.",
        u"There\u2019s obviously changes that need to be made, and we can only do so much to help you.": u"Obviamente h\u00e1 mudan\u00e7as que precisam ser feitas, e n\u00f3s s\u00f3 podemos ajudar at\u00e9 certo ponto.",
        u"There\u2019s one thing I wanted to ask though\u2026 How come only one person does all the chores?": u"Mas queria perguntar uma coisa\u2026 Por que apenas uma pessoa faz todas as tarefas?",
        u"There\u2019s one thing I wanted to ask though\u2026 How come only one person does all the chores?{fast}": u"Mas queria perguntar uma coisa\u2026 Por que apenas uma pessoa faz todas as tarefas?{fast}",
        u"There\u2019s only one bed\u2026": u"S\u00f3 tem uma cama\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s only two cubicles left though\u2026 Even with Darius and Lloyd sharing one\u2026": u"Mas s\u00f3 restam duas cabines\u2026 Mesmo com Darius e Lloyd dividindo uma\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s plenty of delicious food to enjoy and they decide to do this instead.": u"Tem tanta comida deliciosa para aproveitar e eles decidem fazer isso.",
        u"There\u2019s so much drama on top of being exhausted from shoveling all day\u2026": u"\u00c9 drama demais al\u00e9m de todo o cansa\u00e7o de passar o dia usando a p\u00e1\u2026",
        u"There\u2019s so much untapped potential here, and I would like to be a part of its future.": u"H\u00e1 tanto potencial inexplorado aqui, e eu gostaria de fazer parte do futuro deste lugar.",
        u"There\u2019s your yes, Emilia! Thanks, Dad~!": u"A\u00ed est\u00e1 o seu sim, Emilia! Obrigada, pai~!",
        u"These changes are inevitable anyways, so there\u2019s no reason to hold back now.": u"De qualquer forma, essas mudan\u00e7as s\u00e3o inevit\u00e1veis, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para resistir agora.",
        u"These costumes really are\u2026 something\u2026": u"Essas fantasias realmente s\u00e3o\u2026 alguma coisa\u2026",
        u"These folders contain each department\u2019s tasks, concerns, and a reminder of how everything should be done. Make sure to read and follow the details carefully.": u"Estas pastas cont\u00eam as tarefas e problemas de cada setor, al\u00e9m de instru\u00e7\u00f5es sobre como tudo deve ser feito. Leiam e sigam os detalhes com aten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"These jobs aren\u2019t menial! You\u2019re gonna work your ass off till you can see how essential these tasks are since\u2014": u"Essas tarefas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o insignificantes! Voc\u00ea vai trabalhar at\u00e9 cansar para perceber como elas s\u00e3o essenciais, j\u00e1 que\u2014",
        u"These look really tight\u2026": u"Isso parece bem apertado\u2026",
        u"These pants are really short and tight\u2026 ": u"Essas cal\u00e7as s\u00e3o muito curtas e apertadas\u2026 ",
        u"These snowblowers are the best! We only need to shovel the bigger piles, and then just blow the rest!": u"Esses sopradores de neve s\u00e3o demais! S\u00f3 precisamos usar as p\u00e1s nos montes maiores e depois soprar o resto!",
        u"These so-called \u2018issues\u2019 you\u2019ve brought forward during this meeting have been completely irrelevant to the project, and quite frankly not worth Mr. Clermont\u2019s, or any of our time.": u"Esses supostos \u2018problemas\u2019 que voc\u00ea trouxe nesta reuni\u00e3o s\u00e3o completamente irrelevantes para o projeto e, francamente, n\u00e3o merecem o tempo do Sr. Clermont nem de nenhum de n\u00f3s.",
        u"These two are Lloyd and Darius. They\u2019re in charge of designing and building all the new facilities.": u"Estes dois s\u00e3o Lloyd e Darius. Eles s\u00e3o respons\u00e1veis por projetar e construir todas as novas instala\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"They actually coordinated it already with Mr. Clermont, and he agreed as well.": u"Na verdade, eles j\u00e1 acertaram tudo com o Sr. Clermont, e ele tamb\u00e9m concordou.",
        u"They are not! And I am not!": u"N\u00e3o subiram! E eu n\u00e3o sou!",
        u"They are what makes this place worth fighting for.": u"S\u00e3o eles que fazem este lugar valer a pena lutar.",
        u"They call me Architect Sirius, and this is Foreman Najjar.": u"Chamam-me de Arquiteto Sirius, e este \u00e9 o Mestre de Obras Najjar.",
        u"They could\u2019ve sent at least one butler for me to order around!": u"Poderiam ao menos ter mandado um mordomo para eu dar ordens!",
        u"They did say I stand out from the crowd, after all.": u"Afinal, dizem que eu me destaco na multid\u00e3o.",
        u"They enrolled here to experience and enjoy activities that they wouldn\u2019t get to normally, where technology is often present.": u"Eles se inscreveram aqui para experimentar e aproveitar atividades que normalmente n\u00e3o teriam, onde a tecnologia costuma estar presente.",
        u"They even offer massages. In fact, I\u2019ve already booked one for after my soak.": u"Eles at\u00e9 oferecem massagens. Na verdade, j\u00e1 marquei uma para depois do meu banho.",
        u"They gave me a hotel brochure, so let\u2019s take a look!": u"Deram-me um folheto do hotel, ent\u00e3o vamos dar uma olhada!",
        u"They get to look but you get to touch~": u"Eles podem olhar, mas voc\u00ea pode tocar~",
        u"They had to settle out of court for most of these cases, getting fined and then sued for even more.": u"Eles tiveram que fazer acordos extrajudiciais na maioria desses casos, receberam multas e depois foram processados por ainda mais.",
        u"They have both prepared their own vows, and I would like to give them this opportunity to share them with each other. Mr. Nagira?": u"Ambos prepararam seus pr\u00f3prios votos, e gostaria de dar a eles esta oportunidade de compartilh\u00e1-los um com o outro. Sr. Nagira?",
        u"They left me to rot alone, leaving me with absolutely nothing!!": u"Eles me abandonaram para apodrecer sozinha, sem me deixar absolutamente nada!!",
        u"They must have been excited to come back and help out here after the good times they spent in the past! ": u"Eles devem ter ficado animados para voltar e ajudar aqui depois dos bons momentos que viveram no passado! ",
        u"They prefer to hang out with their friends \u2013 and that\u2019s a good thing.": u"Eles preferem passar um tempo com os amigos \u2014 e isso \u00e9 uma coisa boa.",
        u"They really left an impression on me even in the short time I spent with them.": u"Eles realmente deixaram uma impress\u00e3o em mim, mesmo no pouco tempo que passei com eles.",
        u"They say looks match what we\u2019re feeling, so why don\u2019t you find out if it\u2019s true~": u"Dizem que a apar\u00eancia combina com o que estamos sentindo, ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o descobre se \u00e9 verdade~",
        u"They say time flies when you\u2019re having fun, and I\u2019d say we had tons!": u"Dizem que o tempo voa quando estamos nos divertindo, e eu diria que nos divertimos muito!",
        u"They started dating back at the hotel, Yuri! I thought that was obvious!": u"Eles come\u00e7aram a namorar l\u00e1 no hotel, Yuri! Achei que fosse \u00f3bvio!",
        u"They stop doing those things whenever they see me with Lloyd.": u"Elas param de fazer isso sempre que me veem com Lloyd.",
        u"They sure did\u2026": u"Com certeza\u2026",
        u"They talked about their own daughter as if it was a nuisance to deal with her.": u"Eles falavam da pr\u00f3pria filha como se lidar com ela fosse um inc\u00f4modo.",
        u"They threw you away, crossing their fingers that you\u2019d change, and learn how to get along with other people.": u"Eles se livraram de voc\u00ea, torcendo para que voc\u00ea mudasse e aprendesse a conviver com outras pessoas.",
        u"They told me they were going to work on my body\u2026 And I think I might have had a different idea before I agreed\u2026": u"Eles disseram que iam trabalhar meu corpo\u2026 E acho que eu tinha entendido outra coisa antes de aceitar\u2026",
        u"They were supposed to show up at the same time as the workers later, but they got here earlier than scheduled. ": u"Deveriam chegar mais tarde, junto com os trabalhadores, mas vieram antes do previsto. ",
        u"They won\u2019t even notice we\u2019re gone, and we can come back as soon as we\u2019ve cooled down!": u"Nem perceber\u00e3o que sa\u00edmos, e podemos voltar assim que nos refrescarmos!",
        u"They wouldn\u2019t get so worked up if you hadn\u2019t pushed their buttons, Aiden.": u"Eles n\u00e3o ficariam t\u00e3o exaltados se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o os provocasse, Aiden.",
        u"They\u2019d been so excited for this since their wedding. It\u2019s so adorable to see those two so madly in love.": u"Eles estavam t\u00e3o animados para isso desde o casamento. \u00c9 t\u00e3o ador\u00e1vel ver os dois t\u00e3o perdidamente apaixonados.",
        u"They\u2019ll be fine. Aiden just got overwhelmed.": u"Eles v\u00e3o ficar bem. O Aiden s\u00f3 ficou sobrecarregado.",
        u"They\u2019ll still be working in these departments, but you will be the one responsible for ensuring satisfactory results.": u"Eles continuar\u00e3o trabalhando nesses setores, mas voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 respons\u00e1vel por garantir resultados satisfat\u00f3rios.",
        u"They\u2019re all brand new and belong to Camp Buddy now!": u"S\u00e3o todos novinhos e agora pertencem ao Camp Buddy!",
        u"They\u2019re all going to appear on the website as a blog for interested scouts to read and find out what kind of experiences they\u2019ll have here at Camp Buddy!": u"Tudo vai aparecer no site como um blog para que escoteiros interessados possam ler e descobrir que tipo de experi\u00eancias ter\u00e3o aqui no Camp Buddy!",
        u"They\u2019re called fanfics, hmph!": u"Chamam-se fanfics, hmpf!",
        u"They\u2019re currently convicted and serving a sentence for all these business malpractices\u2026": u"Atualmente est\u00e3o condenados e cumprindo pena por todas essas pr\u00e1ticas comerciais ilegais\u2026",
        u"They\u2019re either scared of me or think I\u2019m boring. ": u"Ou t\u00eam medo de mim, ou me acham entediante. ",
        u"They\u2019re grown men. You don\u2019t have to dress them like dolls. ": u"Eles s\u00e3o homens adultos. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa vesti-los como bonecos. ",
        u"They\u2019re literally next door, Lloyd.": u"Eles est\u00e3o literalmente na porta ao lado, Lloyd.",
        u"They\u2019re not laughing at you; they\u2019re laughing with you.": u"Eles n\u00e3o est\u00e3o rindo de voc\u00ea; est\u00e3o rindo com voc\u00ea.",
        u"They\u2019re playing a game.": u"Eles est\u00e3o brincando.",
        u"They\u2019re probably using expensive ingredients, though\u2026 I\u2019m much more used to making homey food with cheap stuff\u2026": u"Mas eles provavelmente usam ingredientes caros\u2026 Estou muito mais acostumado a fazer comida caseira com ingredientes baratos\u2026",
        u"They\u2019re telling the truth, Jin. Even the scoutmasters were intimidated by me for the last couple years\u2026  ": u"Eles est\u00e3o dizendo a verdade, Jin. At\u00e9 os chefes escoteiros se sentiam intimidados por mim nos \u00faltimos anos\u2026  ",
        u"Things are really starting to change around here, huh Yoshi?": u"As coisas est\u00e3o realmente come\u00e7ando a mudar por aqui, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Yoshi?",
        u"Things didn\u2019t always work out the way we planned, and we were challenged way past our limits.": u"As coisas nem sempre sa\u00edram como planejamos, e fomos desafiados muito al\u00e9m dos nossos limites.",
        u"Things get spicy when you\u2019re tipsy~": u"As coisas ficam picantes quando voc\u00ea fica alegrinho~",
        u"Things have changed since then, I know. But I really do miss it.": u"As coisas mudaram desde ent\u00e3o, eu sei. Mas realmente sinto falta daquilo.",
        u"Things were so crazy busy for the both of us that we didn\u2019t have time for ourselves, you know?": u"As coisas ficaram t\u00e3o corridas para n\u00f3s dois que n\u00e3o t\u00ednhamos tempo para n\u00f3s mesmos, sabe?",
        u"Think of it as a chance to have a nice dinner with everyone!": u"Pense nisso como uma oportunidade de ter um jantar agrad\u00e1vel com todo mundo!",
        u"Think of it as a fancy date for the two of us!": u"Pense nisso como um encontro chique para n\u00f3s dois!",
        u"Think of it as me returning the favor. I don\u2019t want to let an old friend down, after all.": u"Considere isso uma retribui\u00e7\u00e3o. N\u00e3o quero decepcionar um velho amigo.",
        u"Think you can take us both\u2026? Hmmm~?": u"Acha que consegue aguentar n\u00f3s dois\u2026? Hmmm~?",
        u"Thinking about it, She\u2019s the only scoutmaster that does that\u2026 You and Gramps usually like the traditional stuff.": u"Pensando bem, ela \u00e9 a \u00fanica chefe escoteira que faz isso\u2026 Voc\u00ea e o Vov\u00f4 normalmente preferem as coisas tradicionais.",
        u"Thinking about it, it makes sense, right?! Because you weren\u2019t used to the hotel lifestyle before! ": u"Pensando bem, faz sentido, n\u00e3o \u00e9?! Porque voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava acostumado com aquele estilo de vida do hotel! ",
        u"Thinking about it, it\u2019s crazy how things ended up back then.  ": u"Pensando bem, \u00e9 incr\u00edvel como as coisas acabaram naquela \u00e9poca.  ",
        u"Thinking that I\u2019d lost everything\u2026. I was ready to give up too.": u"Achando que tinha perdido tudo\u2026. Eu tamb\u00e9m estava pronto para desistir.",
        u"This actually leaves me a little bit of time to give an update to Mr. Clermont.": u"Isso me d\u00e1 um pouco de tempo para atualizar o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"This better not take too long or I\u2019ll start snoring.": u"\u00c9 melhor isso n\u00e3o demorar muito ou vou come\u00e7ar a roncar.",
        u"This camp wouldn't even function without Aiden.": u"O acampamento nem funcionaria sem Aiden.",
        u"This could actually put them in more danger because they lack the knowledge needed to adapt in any given situation.": u"Isso pode coloc\u00e1-los em maior perigo, pois n\u00e3o ter\u00e3o o conhecimento necess\u00e1rio para se adaptar a qualquer situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"This dinner is over. All of you, back to your rooms.": u"Este jantar acabou. Todos voc\u00eas, voltem para os quartos.",
        u"This establishment is SEVERELY understaffed to begin with, and to be honest, most of your roles are scattered and hard to pin down. ": u"Para come\u00e7ar, este estabelecimento sofre de uma GRAVE falta de funcion\u00e1rios e, sinceramente, a maioria das fun\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e1 dispersa e mal definida.",
        u"This hangover\u2019s intense, my head\u2019s spinning.": u"Essa ressaca est\u00e1 forte, minha cabe\u00e7a est\u00e1 girando.",
        u"This has been weighing on you for a long time and you were pushed to your limit\u2026": u"Isso estava pesando sobre o senhor h\u00e1 muito tempo, e o senhor chegou ao seu limite\u2026",
        u"This invitation says our reservation is an hour from now.": u"Este convite diz que nossa reserva \u00e9 daqui a uma hora.",
        u"This is Hyunjin, he\u2019s in charge of the technology department!": u"Este \u00e9 Hyunjin, respons\u00e1vel pelo departamento de tecnologia!",
        u"This is Jin, he\u2019s our new technology specialist. I was going to bring him here earlier, but we had to get to work first!": u"Este \u00e9 Jin, nosso novo especialista em tecnologia. Eu o traria aqui mais cedo, mas primeiro tivemos que trabalhar!",
        u"This is Lloyd Sirius and Darius Najjar! They\u2019re Camp Buddy alumni! ": u"Estes s\u00e3o Lloyd Sirius e Darius Najjar! Eles s\u00e3o ex-integrantes do Camp Buddy! ",
        u"This is Lloyd, my business partner. He\u2019s older than me, Aiden.": u"Este \u00e9 Lloyd, meu s\u00f3cio. Ele \u00e9 mais velho do que eu, Aiden.",
        u"This is a huge project after all, you\u2019re going to need my help!": u"Afinal, este \u00e9 um projeto enorme e voc\u00ea precisar\u00e1 da minha ajuda!",
        u"This is a truly momentous day, so eat your hearts out, and celebrate these final moments with each other!": u"Este \u00e9 realmente um dia memor\u00e1vel, ent\u00e3o comam \u00e0 vontade e celebrem estes \u00faltimos momentos juntos!",
        u"This is all so much to take in\u2026 ": u"\u00c9 muita coisa para assimilar\u2026 ",
        u"This is all so\u2026 overwhelming\u2026": u"Isso tudo \u00e9 t\u00e3o\u2026 dif\u00edcil de assimilar\u2026",
        u"This is an extremely serious accusation\u2026  Mr. Clermont would not take this lightly, I\u2019m sure\u2026": u"Esta \u00e9 uma acusa\u00e7\u00e3o extremamente s\u00e9ria\u2026  Tenho certeza de que o Sr. Clermont n\u00e3o trataria isso levianamente\u2026",
        u"This is bad\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 ruim\u2026",
        u"This is basically the same thing, but it\u2019s your turn this time!": u"\u00c9 basicamente a mesma coisa, s\u00f3 que desta vez \u00e9 a sua vez!",
        u"This is exactly where we made our promise way back then... at the end of the very first term.": u"Foi exatamente aqui que fizemos nossa promessa tanto tempo atr\u00e1s\u2026 no fim da primeira temporada.",
        u"This is exactly why I wanted to be alone in the first place!": u"\u00c9 exatamente por isso que eu queria ficar sozinha desde o come\u00e7o!",
        u"This is exactly your problem. Just because you have some title, you think you can abuse your power and dictate for everyone what they can and can\u2019t do!": u"Esse \u00e9 exatamente o seu problema. S\u00f3 porque tem um t\u00edtulo, acha que pode abusar do poder e ditar para todos o que podem ou n\u00e3o fazer!",
        u"This is for me and Dad! I always pack for him during trips like this or he\u2019ll forget something!": u"Isso \u00e9 para mim e para o papai! Sempre arrumo as coisas dele em viagens assim, sen\u00e3o ele esquece alguma coisa!",
        u"This is gonna be a long day\u2026": u"Este vai ser um longo dia\u2026",
        u"This is gonna be the smuttiest orgy I\u2019ll ever have the chance to witness in my puny, trash existence!": u"Esta vai ser a orgia mais indecente que terei a chance de testemunhar em toda a minha exist\u00eancia insignificante e lixo!",
        u"This is it?!": u"\u00c9 s\u00f3 isso?!",
        u"This is just what I need to beat the heat!": u"Era exatamente disso que eu precisava para vencer o calor!",
        u"This is like\u2026 a life-changing opportunity, not only for the camp, but for you, Yoshi! ": u"Isso \u00e9\u2026 uma oportunidade capaz de mudar sua vida, n\u00e3o apenas para o acampamento, mas para voc\u00ea, Yoshi! ",
        u"This is like\u2026 a life-changing opportunity, not only for the camp, but for you, Yoshi!{fast}": u"Isso \u00e9\u2026 uma oportunidade capaz de mudar sua vida, n\u00e3o apenas para o acampamento, mas para voc\u00ea, Yoshi!{fast}",
        u"This is more than I could have ever hoped for, and I want to make sure the trust everyone placed in me is worth it.": u"Isso \u00e9 mais do que eu poderia ter esperado, e quero garantir que a confian\u00e7a que todos depositaram em mim valha a pena.",
        u"This is nice\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 bom\u2026",
        u"This is no fair! It\u2019s like you guys are targeting me and Dar!": u"Isso n\u00e3o vale! Parece que voc\u00eas est\u00e3o mirando em mim e no Dar!",
        u"This is such a wonderful day for Camp Buddy. We\u2019ve all been working towards this moment for so long!": u"Este \u00e9 um dia maravilhoso para o Camp Buddy. Todos n\u00f3s trabalhamos por tanto tempo para chegar a este momento!",
        u"This is taking way too long! Stack a bunch in there!": u"Isso est\u00e1 demorando demais! Coloque v\u00e1rios de uma vez!",
        u"This is teeeechnically more than usual!": u"Tecnicameeeente, isso \u00e9 mais roupa do que eu costumo usar!",
        u"This is the biggest opportunity we\u2019ve ever had, and I thought it was your dream\u2026": u"Esta \u00e9 a maior oportunidade que j\u00e1 tivemos, e eu achei que esse fosse o seu sonho\u2026",
        u"This is the only one I was missing from my collection at home! I already have everything from this artist circle except for this!": u"Este \u00e9 o \u00fanico que faltava na minha cole\u00e7\u00e3o em casa! J\u00e1 tenho tudo deste c\u00edrculo de artistas, menos isto!",
        u"This is the perfect chance for me to\u2014": u"Esta \u00e9 a oportunidade perfeita para eu\u2014",
        u"This is the perfect opportunity to change that, Aiden!": u"Esta \u00e9 a oportunidade perfeita para mudar isso, Aiden!",
        u"This is the reason why I didn\u2019t want her on our team\u2026 There\u2019s something really off about her.": u"\u00c9 por isso que eu n\u00e3o a queria na equipe\u2026 H\u00e1 algo muito estranho nela.",
        u"This is too much for me, Yoshi\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 demais para mim, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"This is too much, Aiden\u2026": u"Isso \u00e9 demais, Aiden\u2026",
        u"This is way out of my usual comfort zone, but hey! If you guys think I look cool, then I\u2019m fine with it! Plus, it\u2019s not like I have to wear this forever.": u"Isto est\u00e1 muito fora da minha zona de conforto, mas ei! Se voc\u00eas acham que estou legal, tudo bem! Al\u00e9m disso, n\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eu tivesse que usar isto para sempre.",
        u"This is what happens when you leave the work halfway done\u2026": u"\u00c9 isso que acontece quando se deixa o trabalho pela metade\u2026",
        u"This is what you wanted all along, isn\u2019t it Yoshinori\u2026?": u"Era isso que voc\u00ea queria desde o come\u00e7o, n\u00e3o era, Yoshinori\u2026?",
        u"This is where I really draw the line, Emilia!": u"Agora voc\u00ea realmente passou dos limites, Emilia!",
        u"This is where I used to put all my favorite memories with you guys! It was so much fun to write about what we were up to.": u"Era aqui que eu registrava todas as minhas lembran\u00e7as favoritas com voc\u00eas! Era muito divertido escrever sobre o que est\u00e1vamos fazendo.",
        u"This is where Yuri told us to go\u2026 But I don\u2019t see anyone else yet.": u"Foi aqui que a Yuri disse para virmos\u2026 Mas ainda n\u00e3o estou vendo mais ningu\u00e9m.",
        u"This is why nobody stays in your life. Except maybe for your daughter, because you know what? She doesn\u2019t really have much of a choice.": u"\u00c9 por isso que ningu\u00e9m permanece na sua vida. Exceto talvez sua filha, porque, quer saber? Ela n\u00e3o tem muita escolha.",
        u"This isn\u2019t anyone\u2019s fault. None of us could\u2019ve anticipated a storm like this.": u"Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa de ningu\u00e9m. Nenhum de n\u00f3s poderia ter previsto uma tempestade assim.",
        u"This isn\u2019t fast at all, hahaha! And trust me, I rode through way worse than this back in my day! I\u2019ve still got the skills to handle it!": u"Isso nem \u00e9 r\u00e1pido, hahaha! E acredite, na minha \u00e9poca eu pilotei em condi\u00e7\u00f5es muito piores! Ainda tenho habilidade para lidar com isso!",
        u"This isn\u2019t really the best look for your scoutmaster, especially on our last camping trip together.": u"Esta n\u00e3o \u00e9 exatamente a melhor imagem para o seu chefe escoteiro, principalmente na nossa \u00faltima viagem de acampamento juntos.",
        u"This isn\u2019t the time to be doubting myself\u2026! I need to believe in myself more!": u"Esta n\u00e3o \u00e9 a hora de duvidar de mim mesmo\u2026! Preciso acreditar mais em mim!",
        u"This just proves you don\u2019t understand what I had to go through\u2026!": u"Isso s\u00f3 prova que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o entende o que eu tive que passar\u2026!",
        u"This leads to distractions that only causes more time lost on the project! ": u"Isso causa distra\u00e7\u00f5es que s\u00f3 fazem o projeto perder ainda mais tempo! ",
        u"This looks even better than what I imagined\u2026!": u"Isso \u00e9 ainda melhor do que eu imaginava\u2026!",
        u"This looks familiar\u2026": u"Isso parece familiar\u2026",
        u"This may not mean much right now, but I assure you it will make sense one day.": u"Talvez isto n\u00e3o signifique muito agora, mas garanto que um dia far\u00e1 sentido.",
        u"This meeting isn\u2019t even on the schedule. ": u"Esta reuni\u00e3o nem est\u00e1 no cronograma. ",
        u"This menu description says it\u2019s chicken cooked in red wine. That should be good enough.": u"A descri\u00e7\u00e3o do card\u00e1pio diz que \u00e9 frango cozido em vinho tinto. Parece bom o bastante.",
        u"This might be the first time I\u2019ve seen you this covered up, though.": u"Mas talvez seja a primeira vez que vejo voc\u00ea t\u00e3o coberto assim.",
        u"This must be Aiden\u2019s idea, I-I\u2019m so sorry about this, sir!! I-I\u2019ll get this under control\u2026!": u"Isso s\u00f3 pode ter sido ideia do Aiden, s-sinto muito, senhor!! E-Eu vou controlar a situa\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026!",
        u"This new opportunity only made me realize that I\u2019m going to commit myself to something beyond my limits again\u2026": u"Essa nova oportunidade s\u00f3 me fez perceber que eu acabaria me comprometendo novamente com algo al\u00e9m dos meus limites\u2026",
        u"This new schedule includes every deadline for each aspect of the project!  ": u"Este novo cronograma inclui todos os prazos de cada aspecto do projeto!  ",
        u"This one is on\u2026 B.D.S.M\u2026 What does that even mean?": u"Esta aqui \u00e9 sobre\u2026 B.D.S.M\u2026 O que isso significa?",
        u"This one should be good, you guys\u2026! Everyone likes bacon and cheese, right? Then something fruity for dessert?": u"Este aqui deve ser bom, pessoal\u2026! Todo mundo gosta de bacon e queijo, certo? E depois alguma coisa com frutas de sobremesa?",
        u"This outfit feels a bit contradictory, too\u2026 I\u2019m an angel, but I\u2019m definitely not having pure thoughts!": u"Essa roupa tamb\u00e9m parece meio contradit\u00f3ria\u2026 Sou um anjo, mas definitivamente n\u00e3o estou tendo pensamentos puros!",
        u"This path I chose for our first camping trip is a short and safe one to help everyone familiarize themselves with the trail for our future hikes!": u"O caminho que escolhi para a nossa primeira viagem de acampamento \u00e9 curto e seguro, para que todos se familiarizem com a trilha das futuras caminhadas!",
        u"This place also had complete five-out-of-five star positive reviews\u2026 ": u"Este lugar tamb\u00e9m tinha avalia\u00e7\u00f5es totalmente positivas, cinco de cinco estrelas\u2026 ",
        u"This place here is on another level, though. Did you know they\u2019ll serve you drinks while you\u2019re in the water?  ": u"Mas este lugar est\u00e1 em outro n\u00edvel. Sabiam que servem bebidas enquanto voc\u00ea est\u00e1 na \u00e1gua?  ",
        u"This place is so relaxing, I haven\u2019t been paying much attention to anything else.": u"Este lugar \u00e9 t\u00e3o relaxante que n\u00e3o tenho prestado muita aten\u00e7\u00e3o em mais nada.",
        u"This place is\u2026 interesting\u2026 It\u2019s nothing like the bars we go to back home!": u"Este lugar \u00e9\u2026 interessante\u2026 N\u00e3o se parece em nada com os bares que frequentamos em casa!",
        u"This place\u2019s legacy is something that I want you to carry into the future, and share with others, too.": u"O legado deste lugar \u00e9 algo que quero que voc\u00ea leve para o futuro e tamb\u00e9m compartilhe com outras pessoas.",
        u"This project has been a reminder of just how far we\u2019ve all come as a team, and how much I owe each and every one of you.": u"Este projeto foi um lembrete de quanto avan\u00e7amos como equipe e de quanto devo a cada um de voc\u00eas.",
        u"This project has just been a reminder of how far we\u2019ve all come as a team, and how much I owe each and every one of you.": u"Este projeto serviu para lembrar o quanto avan\u00e7amos como equipe e o quanto devo a cada um de voc\u00eas.",
        u"This really is the first time we\u2019ve seen you let your walls down, and I\u2019m glad you trusted us enough to tell us how you honestly feel\u2026": u"Esta realmente \u00e9 a primeira vez que vemos voc\u00ea baixar a guarda, e fico feliz que tenha confiado em n\u00f3s o bastante para dizer como realmente se sente\u2026",
        u"This seems to be a bigger problem than I anticipated\u2026 I think we should stop for now.  It will only get colder since the sun has just set too.": u"Parece ser um problema maior do que eu esperava\u2026 Acho que devemos parar por enquanto. S\u00f3 vai ficar mais frio agora que o sol se p\u00f4s.",
        u"This should be enough for now\u2026": u"Isso deve ser suficiente por enquanto\u2026",
        u"This summer flew by really fast, huh, Aiden?": u"Este ver\u00e3o passou voando, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Aiden?",
        u"This vacation has passed by so quickly\u2026 I didn\u2019t even realize that we were going home today.": u"Estas f\u00e9rias passaram t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido\u2026 Nem percebi que voltar\u00edamos para casa hoje.",
        u"This was a mistake all along\u2026 We can\u2019t spend our futures together\u2026 ": u"Isso foi um erro desde o come\u00e7o\u2026 N\u00e3o podemos passar nosso futuro juntos\u2026 ",
        u"This was actually what I was afraid of when we were scheduling work around the winter time\u2026": u"Era justamente disso que eu tinha medo quando est\u00e1vamos programando o trabalho para o per\u00edodo do inverno\u2026",
        u"This was actually what Sir Goro was afraid of when we were scheduling work around the winter time\u2026": u"Era exatamente disso que o Sr. Goro tinha medo quando est\u00e1vamos planejando o trabalho durante o inverno\u2026",
        u"This was before we all became roommates, right?": u"Isso foi antes de todos n\u00f3s virarmos colegas de quarto, certo?",
        u"This was dad's dream, and he would've been so proud to see me fulfill it... So I can't take this huge opportunity for granted...": u"Esse era o sonho do Pai, e ele teria ficado t\u00e3o orgulhoso de me ver realiz\u00e1-lo\u2026 Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o posso desperdi\u00e7ar uma oportunidade t\u00e3o grande\u2026",
        u"This was way before I had my family, even before I met my wife.": u"Isso foi muito antes de eu ter minha fam\u00edlia, antes mesmo de conhecer minha esposa.",
        u"This was what Dad would\u2019ve wanted for me\u2026 So I can't take this huge opportunity for granted...": u"Era isso que o Pai teria desejado para mim\u2026 Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o posso desperdi\u00e7ar uma oportunidade t\u00e3o grande\u2026",
        u"This wasn\u2019t just our dream together, it\u2019s theirs\u2019 too\u2026": u"Esse n\u00e3o era apenas o nosso sonho, tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 o sonho deles\u2026",
        u"This whole endeavor is really testing us, don\u2019t you think?": u"Todo esse projeto est\u00e1 realmente nos colocando \u00e0 prova, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"This whole time we were being \u2018inspected\u2019 by someone without any qualifications\u2026": u"Esse tempo todo est\u00e1vamos sendo \u2018inspecionados\u2019 por algu\u00e9m sem qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o alguma\u2026",
        u"This will ensure a stricter schedule and allow me to serve as a bridge of communication between Camp Buddy and Clermont Inc.": u"Isso garantir\u00e1 um cronograma mais rigoroso e permitir\u00e1 que eu sirva de ponte entre o Camp Buddy e a Clermont Inc.",
        u"This will help you relax, sir\u2026": u"Isso vai ajudar o senhor a relaxar\u2026",
        u"This will push us back a few more weeks\u2026 or even months! ": u"Isso vai nos atrasar mais algumas semanas\u2026 ou at\u00e9 meses! ",
        u"This wouldn\u2019t have happened if I had approached things in a better way\u2026": u"Isso n\u00e3o teria acontecido se eu tivesse abordado as coisas de uma forma melhor\u2026",
        u"This wouldn\u2019t have happened if you weren\u2019t so rough last night, you know?": u"Isso n\u00e3o teria acontecido se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse pegado t\u00e3o pesado ontem \u00e0 noite, sabia?",
        u"This\u2019ll be perfect with the chips I brought!": u"Isso vai ficar perfeito com as batatas que eu trouxe!",
        u"This\u2019ll be really good for you, Dad! You\u2019re finally letting go of all these responsibilities! I\u2019m so excited for your retirement!": u"Isso vai fazer muito bem para voc\u00ea, Pai! Finalmente est\u00e1 deixando todas essas responsabilidades de lado! Estou t\u00e3o animada com sua aposentadoria!",
        u"This\u2019ll help you chill out. *hands over a glass of whiskey* ": u"Isto vai ajudar voc\u00ea a relaxar. *entrega um copo de u\u00edsque* ",
        u"This\u2026 looks interesting.": u"Isto\u2026 parece interessante.",
        u"Those are just the mere basics, though~ There are a lot more to consider especially once the meal has been served!": u"Mas isso \u00e9 apenas o b\u00e1sico~ H\u00e1 muito mais a considerar, principalmente depois que a refei\u00e7\u00e3o for servida!",
        u"Those are some seriously contradicting things, Yuri. ": u"Essas coisas combinam muito pouco entre si, Yuri. ",
        u"Those cocktails really hit the spot! I can\u2019t remember how many I had!  ": u"Aqueles coquet\u00e9is desceram muito bem! Nem lembro quantos eu tomei!  ",
        u"Though I gotta say, I\u2019m pretty surprised you\u2019re up at a normal-person schedule, Jin.": u"Mas tenho que dizer, estou bem surpreso de voc\u00ea estar acordado num hor\u00e1rio de gente normal, Jin.",
        u"Though I kinda landed on my elbow \u2013 it\u2019s a good thing the leaves broke my fall.": u"Mas ca\u00ed meio que sobre o cotovelo \u2014 ainda bem que as folhas amorteceram a queda.",
        u"Though I\u2019m surprised he was able to pick all that up from just my smell\u2026 ": u"Mas estou surpreso por ele ter percebido tudo isso apenas pelo meu cheiro\u2026 ",
        u"Though it\u2019ll probably take me a while to read through all the entries\u2026  I\u2019ll let you guys know if there\u2019s some cool stuff in here!": u"Mas provavelmente levarei um tempo para ler todas as anota\u00e7\u00f5es\u2026 Avisarei voc\u00eas se encontrar alguma coisa legal aqui!",
        u"Though, I gotta drop this stuff by Gramps\u2019 desk first! You can go get started in the kitchen for me, Yoshi!": u"Mas primeiro preciso deixar estas coisas na mesa do Vov\u00f4! Pode ir come\u00e7ando na cozinha por mim, Yoshi!",
        u"Though, I have to say, you must be a genius to be an architect at such an early age, Mr. Sirius!": u"Mas preciso dizer que deve ser um g\u00eanio para ser arquiteto t\u00e3o jovem, senhor Sirius!",
        u"Though, I\u2019m a bit curious \u2013 aren\u2019t you a little nervous to be meeting him today? ": u"Mas estou um pouco curioso\u2026 O senhor n\u00e3o est\u00e1 um pouco nervoso por encontr\u00e1-lo hoje? ",
        u"Three's Company! (DLC)": u"Tr\u00eas \u00e9 melhor! (DLC)",
        u"Time for our shower then.": u"Ent\u00e3o \u00e9 hora do nosso banho.",
        u"Time had set us apart, and I believed there was no way we could return to what we had before.": u"O tempo havia nos afastado, e eu acreditava que n\u00e3o havia como voltarmos ao que t\u00ednhamos antes.",
        u"Time out, you two!!": u"Chega, voc\u00eas duas!!",
        u"Time sure has flown by, hasn\u2019t it?": u"O tempo realmente voou, n\u00e3o foi?",
        u"Time to collect my reward~": u"Hora de pegar minha recompensa~",
        u"Time\u2019s up!": u"Acabou o tempo!",
        u"To Camp Buddy and to the future!": u"Ao Camp Buddy e ao futuro!",
        u"To be fair, I don\u2019t think any of us have one either\u2026": u"Para ser justo, acho que nenhum de n\u00f3s tem uma tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"To be fair, I just thought they were for camp records too when we got asked\u2026": u"Para ser justo, eu tamb\u00e9m achei que as medidas eram s\u00f3 para os registros do acampamento quando perguntaram\u2026",
        u"To be honest, I think I\u2019ve always known, deep in my heart, and just kept denying it\u2026": u"Para ser sincero, acho que no fundo do meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o eu sempre soube e simplesmente continuei negando\u2026",
        u"To be honest, I'm a little concerned about the authorities seeing us with these beers now.": u"Para ser sincero, agora estou um pouco preocupado que as autoridades nos vejam com estas cervejas.",
        u"To be honest, though, I\u2019m really excited! It\u2019s been a while since I cooked for a lot of people, haha! ": u"Mas, para ser sincero, estou muito animado! Faz tempo que n\u00e3o cozinho para tanta gente, haha! ",
        u"To celebrate the completion of our initial objective, I thought it would be fitting to set up a celebratory trip! I\u2019ve booked an exclusive hotel for everyone to stay at this weekend!": u"Para comemorar a conclus\u00e3o do nosso objetivo inicial, achei apropriado organizar uma viagem de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o! Reservei um hotel exclusivo para todos passarem este fim de semana!",
        u"To do the things you like\u2026  be with people you love\u2026 and find what truly makes you happy\u2026": u"Que fa\u00e7a as coisas de que gosta\u2026 fique com as pessoas que ama\u2026 e descubra o que realmente faz voc\u00ea feliz\u2026",
        u"To get the certification I need, I have to enroll in the training course for it.": u"Para conseguir a certifica\u00e7\u00e3o de que preciso, tenho que me matricular no curso de forma\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"To give you a bit of history, Jin \u2013 as this camp\u2019s president, I used to lead strictly, always charging in with an iron fist.": u"Para lhe contar um pouco da hist\u00f3ria, Jin: como presidente deste acampamento, eu costumava liderar com rigidez, sempre agindo com m\u00e3o de ferro.",
        u"To her, Camp Buddy was the only choice she had left.": u"Para ela, o Camp Buddy era a \u00fanica op\u00e7\u00e3o que restava.",
        u"To her, I was still the only friend she made back then, and the fact that she couldn\u2019t rely on me at her lowest point hurt her the most\u2026": u"Para ela, eu ainda era o \u00fanico amigo que fez naquela \u00e9poca, e o fato de n\u00e3o poder contar comigo no pior momento foi o que mais a machucou\u2026",
        u"To know that you let me into the deepest and darkest thoughts you had, it really made me realize that you\u2019re the one I want to fight for the most\u2026": u"Saber que voc\u00ea me deixou conhecer seus pensamentos mais profundos e sombrios realmente me fez perceber que voc\u00ea \u00e9 a pessoa por quem mais quero lutar\u2026",
        u"To me, Camp Buddy is already perfect the way it is\u2026": u"Para mim, o Camp Buddy j\u00e1 \u00e9 perfeito do jeito que est\u00e1\u2026",
        u"To save time, water, and heating, here at Camp Buddy, we shower TOGETHER!": u"Para economizar tempo, \u00e1gua e aquecimento, aqui no Camp Buddy n\u00f3s tomamos banho JUNTOS!",
        u"To start with, I falsified my credentials to get the job as an inspector. ": u"Para come\u00e7ar, falsifiquei minhas credenciais para conseguir o emprego de inspetora. ",
        u"To start, we\u2019ve received so many amazing chances already and regained what we nearly lost the previous term\u2026": u"Para come\u00e7ar, j\u00e1 recebemos tantas oportunidades incr\u00edveis e recuperamos o que quase perdemos na temporada anterior\u2026",
        u"To sum it up, he wants to expand Camp Buddy\u2019s reach and asked if I was interested in reacquiring the previous branches that were shut down.": u"Resumindo, ele quer ampliar o alcance do Camp Buddy e perguntou se eu teria interesse em readquirir as antigas unidades que foram fechadas.",
        u"To the bestest dad and scoutmaster ever! ": u"Para o melhor pai e chefe escoteiro de todos! ",
        u"To think Yoshi\u2019s baking his hotdog in Aiden\u2019s lovin\u2019 oven while all of us were having a meal outside!": u"E pensar que o Yoshi estava assando o cachorro-quente dele no forninho amoroso do Aiden enquanto todos n\u00f3s com\u00edamos l\u00e1 fora!",
        u"To think that Yoshi was brave enough to spy like that too\u2026 How unexpected.": u"Pensar que Yoshi tamb\u00e9m teve coragem de espionar desse jeito\u2026 Que inesperado.",
        u"To think that we\u2019ll have to leave soon and go back to reality\u2026": u"E pensar que logo teremos que ir embora e voltar \u00e0 realidade\u2026",
        u"To think that we\u2019ve only just begun this chapter\u2026 I can\u2019t wait for what else we\u2019ll do out there.": u"Pensar que acabamos de come\u00e7ar este cap\u00edtulo\u2026 Mal posso esperar para ver o que mais faremos por a\u00ed.",
        u"To think that you turned down the biggest opportunity we\u2019ve ever had without me knowing\u2026": u"Pensar que voc\u00ea recusou a maior oportunidade que j\u00e1 tivemos sem que eu soubesse\u2026",
        u"To think, I just showed up here one day and before I knew it, I was stuck to you like glue, haha!": u"E pensar que um dia eu simplesmente apareci aqui e, quando percebi, j\u00e1 estava grudado em voc\u00ea igual cola, haha!",
        u"To what\u2026? ": u"De qu\u00ea\u2026? ",
        u"Today marks exactly six months since we started dating, five months and 26 days since our engagement... and a month since our wedding.": u"Hoje faz exatamente seis meses desde que come\u00e7amos a namorar, cinco meses e 26 dias desde nosso noivado\u2026 e um m\u00eas desde nosso casamento.",
        u"Today\u2019s our last night here, Aiden\u2026 Just hold on for a little longer\u2026": u"Hoje \u00e9 nossa \u00faltima noite aqui, Aiden\u2026 Aguenta s\u00f3 mais um pouco\u2026",
        u"Today\u2019s pretty much a vacant day again, isn\u2019t it?": u"Hoje vai ser praticamente outro dia livre, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Today\u2019s the last day of vacation, are you not planning to go explore around the hotel at all?": u"Hoje \u00e9 o \u00faltimo dia das f\u00e9rias. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pretende explorar o hotel nem um pouco?",
        u"Together they managed the project\u2019s documentation, and each report sent to Emilia validated each department\u2019s progress. ": u"Juntos, administraram a documenta\u00e7\u00e3o do projeto, e cada relat\u00f3rio enviado a Emilia confirmava o progresso dos setores.",
        u"Told ya I was serious!": u"Eu disse que tava falando s\u00e9rio!",
        u"Told you she\u2019s just gonna find something to complain about\u2026": u"Eu avisei que ela s\u00f3 ia encontrar alguma coisa para reclamar\u2026",
        u"Toodles~ ": u"Tchauzinho~",
        u"Took you both ages to make it official. *sigh* Youngsters these days\u2026": u"Voc\u00eas dois levaram uma eternidade para oficializar. *suspiro* Jovens de hoje em dia\u2026",
        u"Torch-head\u2019s record is six, and mine is ten!": u"O recorde do Cabe\u00e7a-de-Tocha \u00e9 seis, e o meu \u00e9 dez!",
        u"Toss your shirt over here too\u2026?": u"Joga sua camiseta aqui tamb\u00e9m\u2026?",
        u"True, and Aiden has always been a big supporter of everyone here. ": u"\u00c9 verdade, e Aiden sempre apoiou muito todo mundo aqui. ",
        u"True. But regardless, we should get some rest too.": u"Verdade. Mas, de qualquer forma, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m dever\u00edamos descansar.",
        u"True. It\u2019s too late for you to grow.": u"Verdade. J\u00e1 \u00e9 tarde demais para voc\u00ea crescer.",
        u"Trust me, I\u2019ve tried it myself and it\u2019s just not for me, so I stick to appreciating it instead.": u"Acredite, eu mesma j\u00e1 tentei e n\u00e3o \u00e9 para mim, ent\u00e3o prefiro apenas apreciar.",
        u"Trust me, this isn\u2019t new. I just save it for special occasions.": u"Acredite, isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 novidade. S\u00f3 guardo para ocasi\u00f5es especiais.",
        u"Trust me, you don\u2019t wanna see it. He acts like a completely different person!": u"Acreditem em mim, voc\u00eas n\u00e3o querem ver. Ele vira uma pessoa completamente diferente!",
        u"Trust me, you will. Just give it a couple more rounds.": u"Confie em mim, vai se acostumar. S\u00f3 precisamos de mais algumas rodadas.",
        u"Trust me, you\u2019ll be a lot happier that way! ": u"Confie em mim, voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 muito mais feliz assim! ",
        u"Trust us, dear. We know.": u"Acredite, querida. N\u00f3s sabemos.",
        u"Truth or dare! Better think carefully!": u"Verdade ou desafio! \u00c9 melhor pensar com cuidado!",
        u"Try and talk to him, big guy! Let him know that there\u2019s a fire in you that you want to share with him!": u"Tente conversar com ele, grand\u00e3o! Mostre que existe um fogo dentro de voc\u00ea que quer compartilhar com ele!",
        u"Try it, Dar! We wanna see! ": u"Tenta, Dar! A gente quer ver! ",
        u"Try me!": u"Quero s\u00f3 ver!",
        u"Try me! ": u"Pode tentar! ",
        u"Try my cocoa.": u"Experimente meu chocolate quente.",
        u"Trying to be more cheerful and softspoken, I really thought I was doing better\u2026": u"Tentando ser mais alegre e falar de forma mais gentil, eu realmente achei que estava melhorando\u2026",
        u"Tsk, looking at other people like that, you\u2019re gonna make me jealous.": u"Tsk, olhando para outras pessoas desse jeito, voc\u00ea vai me deixar com ci\u00fames.",
        u"Tsk, tsk, there you go, bringing it back to work, Yoshi! Come on, let the beers loosen you up too!": u"Tsc, tsc, l\u00e1 vai voc\u00ea falar de trabalho de novo, Yoshi! Qual \u00e9, deixe as cervejas relaxarem voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"Tsk, tsk. Late, just like I expected\u2026 ": u"Tsc, tsc. Atrasados, como eu esperava\u2026",
        u"Tsk\u2026 I knew it\u2026": u"Tsk\u2026 Eu sabia\u2026",
        u"Tuck him in.": u"Cobri-lo.",
        u"Twelve for me, so looks like I win!": u"Doze para mim, ent\u00e3o parece que eu ganhei!",
        u"Two boys cuddling in a tent, zero feet apart \u2019cause they\u2019re very much gay~": u"Dois garotos abra\u00e7ados numa barraca, sem nenhuma dist\u00e2ncia porque s\u00e3o muito gays~",
        u"Two guys hugging on screen doesn\u2019t look like work to me~": u"Dois caras se abra\u00e7ando na tela n\u00e3o parece trabalho para mim~",
        u"Two salmon fillets and Caesar salads coming right up!": u"Saindo dois fil\u00e9s de salm\u00e3o e saladas Caesar!",
        u"Two\u2026": u"Dois\u2026",
        u"U-Uh\u2026 I\u2019m really sorry about this, but I\u2019m confused\u2026 How do you guys know each other?": u"H-Hum\u2026 Desculpem mesmo, mas estou confuso\u2026 Como voc\u00eas se conhecem?",
        u"U-Umm\u2026 I brought one with me\u2026 If you want, I can take the pictures for you.": u"H-Humm\u2026 Eu trouxe uma comigo\u2026 Se quiser, posso tirar as fotos para voc\u00ea.",
        u"U-Umm\u2026 Ms. Emilia isn\u2019t here yet, though...": u"H-Hum\u2026 Mas a Srta. Emilia ainda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 aqui\u2026",
        u"U-Umm\u2026 What about these extra spoons and forks? Will I get kicked out if I use the wrong one?": u"A-Ahn\u2026 E estas colheres e garfos extras? V\u00e3o me expulsar se eu usar o errado?",
        u"U-Um\u2026 No, I\u2019m sorry. Maybe you would prefer some bacon or ham instead?": u"A-Ahn\u2026 N\u00e3o, desculpe. Talvez prefira bacon ou presunto?",
        u"U-Uwaaah\u2026!! C-Coming\u2026 A-Aiden...!!": u"U-Uwaaah\u2026!! V-Vou gozar\u2026 A-Aiden...!!",
        u"U-Uwaaah\u2026!! C-Coming\u2026 Y-Yoshi\u2026!! ": u"U-Uwaaah\u2026!! V-Vou gozar\u2026 Y-Yoshi\u2026!! ",
        u"UGH! FINALLY, you old geezers are here! We\u2019ve been waiting here all day!": u"AFF! FINALMENTE voc\u00eas, velhotes, chegaram! Estamos esperando aqui o dia inteiro!",
        u"UGH!!!": u"URGH!!!",
        u"UGH, GREAT!!! I\u2019m starving!! ": u"AFF, \u00d3TIMO!!! Estou morrendo de fome!! ",
        u"UGHhhh\u2026": u"AFFfff\u2026",
        u"Ugh! Elitist as always! Posting pictures of designer stuff and random things in the hotel!": u"Urgh! Elitista como sempre! Postando fotos de coisas de grife e de coisas aleat\u00f3rias no hotel!",
        u"Ugh! I can\u2019t believe you! It\u2019s literally the only thing I asked you to do!": u"Ugh! N\u00e3o acredito em voc\u00ea! Era literalmente a \u00fanica coisa que pedi para voc\u00ea fazer!",
        u"Ugh! I know right?! ": u"Argh! Pois \u00e9, n\u00e3o \u00e9?! ",
        u"Ugh! I know right?! I didn\u2019t mind when she was talking shit about me! But why did she have to pick on Aiden for some reason?!": u"Argh! Pois \u00e9, n\u00e3o \u00e9?! N\u00e3o me importei quando ela falou merda de mim! Mas por que ela tinha que implicar com o Aiden?!",
        u"Ugh! I know right?! It\u2019s like we\u2019re not in the middle of a project!": u"Ugh! Eu sei, n\u00e9?! Parece at\u00e9 que n\u00e3o estamos no meio de um projeto!",
        u"Ugh! I wouldn\u2019t be surprised if this was just a ploy to force us into paying for another night!": u"Ugh! N\u00e3o me surpreenderia se isso fosse apenas um golpe para nos obrigar a pagar outra di\u00e1ria!",
        u"Ugh! It\u2019s about time!": u"Argh! At\u00e9 que enfim!",
        u"Ugh! I\u2019ve been wanting to do that since we got back here! This dirty, sticky sweat is really bad for my skin!": u"Ugh! Estou querendo fazer isso desde que voltamos! Esse suor sujo e pegajoso faz muito mal para minha pele!",
        u"Ugh! What was the point of bringing all this out here then?!": u"Ugh! Ent\u00e3o para que trouxe tudo isso at\u00e9 aqui?!",
        u"Ugh! Why did my parents even send me here?! I can\u2019t believe they spent money just for me to be forced into labor!": u"Ugh! Por que meus pais me mandaram para c\u00e1?! N\u00e3o acredito que gastaram dinheiro s\u00f3 para me obrigarem a trabalhar!",
        u"Ugh!! Must\u2019ve felt like heaven!": u"Ugh!! Deve ter sido uma del\u00edcia!",
        u"Ugh, I hope so! I really need a shower!": u"Urgh, espero que sim! Eu realmente preciso de um banho!",
        u"Ugh, I see\u2026 Let me get up then.": u"Aff, entendo\u2026 Ent\u00e3o deixe-me levantar.",
        u"Ugh, I seriously can\u2019t wait to go back to camp today\u2026 I actually started packing last night when I couldn\u2019t sleep.": u"Ugh, mal posso esperar para voltar ao acampamento hoje\u2026 Na verdade, comecei a fazer as malas ontem \u00e0 noite quando n\u00e3o consegui dormir.",
        u"Ugh, Yoshi\u2026 seriously?": u"Argh, Yoshi\u2026 est\u00e1 falando s\u00e9rio?",
        u"Ugh, can\u2019t we just leave them here?": u"Argh, n\u00e3o podemos simplesmente deix\u00e1-los aqui?",
        u"Ugh, fine! Are you a top or a bottom?": u"Ugh, tudo bem! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 ativo ou passivo?",
        u"Ugh, fine! You boys have fun then, I\u2019ll go and get some more snacks in the kitchen! Come help me out, Emilia!": u"Ugh, tudo bem! Divirtam-se ent\u00e3o, rapazes. Vou buscar mais petiscos na cozinha! Venha me ajudar, Emilia!",
        u"Ugh, fine.": u"Ugh, t\u00e1 bom.",
        u"Ugh, give me a break! We don\u2019t need you babysitting us!": u"Argh, d\u00e1 um tempo! N\u00e3o precisamos que fique cuidando da gente!",
        u"Ugh, great\u2026 Now everyone\u2019s here.": u"Aff, \u00f3timo\u2026 Agora todos est\u00e3o aqui.",
        u"Ugh, he\u2019s such a meathead.": u"Ugh, ele \u00e9 t\u00e3o cabe\u00e7a-dura.",
        u"Ugh, looks like I messed up the manicure Yuri gave me. I\u2019ll just ask her to give me another one!": u"Ugh, parece que estraguei a manicure que a Yuri fez em mim. Vou pedir para ela fazer outra!",
        u"Ugh, shouldn\u2019t you have assigned feeding times already, Wolfboy? ": u"Ugh, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 n\u00e3o deveria ter hor\u00e1rios definidos para comer, Garoto-Lobo? ",
        u"Ugh, there goes two more of my players.": u"Ugh, l\u00e1 se v\u00e3o mais dois dos meus jogadores.",
        u"Ugh, this is like the fifth time he\u2019s cried today.": u"Ugh, acho que esta \u00e9 a quinta vez que ele chora hoje.",
        u"Ugh, way to make it sound lame, Mr. Perfect.": u"Ugh, bela maneira de fazer parecer sem gra\u00e7a, Sr. Perfeitinho.",
        u"Ugh, well at least you\u2019re here now!": u"Ugh, bem, pelo menos voc\u00eas est\u00e3o aqui agora!",
        u"Ugh, what a turd.": u"Ugh, que babaca.",
        u"Ugh, why am I not surprised to hear that? You could\u2019ve made us late!": u"Ugh, por que n\u00e3o estou surpresa em ouvir isso? Voc\u00ea poderia ter nos atrasado!",
        u"Ugh, you can say that AFTER you stop spending every paycheck on fancy clothes and makeup!": u"Ugh, pode dizer isso DEPOIS que parar de gastar todo sal\u00e1rio com roupas chiques e maquiagem!",
        u"Ugh, you said it! And even if we did have some privacy, we\u2019d be too exhausted from how busy we are every day\u2026": u"Ugh, nem me fale! E mesmo se tiv\u00e9ssemos alguma privacidade, estar\u00edamos cansados demais de t\u00e3o ocupados que ficamos todos os dias\u2026",
        u"Ugh. Can we please stop with the nicknames?! We already put up with them the entire time we were at camp!": u"Aff. Podemos parar com os apelidos, por favor?! J\u00e1 tivemos que aguent\u00e1-los durante todo o tempo em que estivemos no acampamento!",
        u"Ugh. Good riddance.": u"Ugh. J\u00e1 vai tarde.",
        u"Ughhh! I can barely walk!!": u"Ughhh! Mal consigo andar!!",
        u"Ughhhh\u2026 five more minutes? Can\u2019t we go already? It\u2019s been two hours since we woke up!": u"Ughhhh\u2026 Mais cinco minutos? N\u00e3o podemos ir logo? J\u00e1 faz duas horas que acordamos!",
        u"Ughhh\u2026 Do we really have to go, Yoshi??": u"Urghhh\u2026 A gente realmente precisa ir, Yoshi??",
        u"Ughhh\u2026 Do we really have to go, Yoshi??{fast}": u"Urghhh\u2026 A gente realmente precisa ir, Yoshi??{fast}",
        u"Ughhh\u2026 I am sooooo tired\u2026": u"Afff\u2026 Estou t\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o cansada\u2026",
        u"Ughhh\u2026 Just when I thought this vacation couldn\u2019t get any better\u2026": u"Ughhh\u2026 Justo quando achei que estas f\u00e9rias n\u00e3o poderiam ficar melhores\u2026",
        u"Ughhh\u2026 Why is everything going wrong suddenly?!": u"Ughhh\u2026 Por que de repente tudo est\u00e1 dando errado?!",
        u"Ughh\u2026 I\u2019m just so boooored\u2026": u"Ughh\u2026 Estou t\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o entediado\u2026",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Do we really have to work with her\u2026?": u"Ugh\u2026 Precisamos mesmo trabalhar com ela\u2026?",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Don\u2019t get me started on how much these high heels hurt my feet! ": u"Ugh\u2026 Nem me fa\u00e7a come\u00e7ar a falar do quanto estes saltos altos est\u00e3o machucando meus p\u00e9s! ",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Easy for you to say\u2026 You have such a cool costume! You\u2019re lucky that you\u2019re wearing something less embarrassing.": u"Ugh\u2026 F\u00e1cil falar\u2026 Sua fantasia \u00e9 muito mais legal! Voc\u00ea tem sorte de estar usando algo menos constrangedor.",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Fine. I\u2019ll try to not to stoop down to her level, and I\u2019ll prove we can do our job.": u"Ugh\u2026 Est\u00e1 bem. Tentarei n\u00e3o descer ao n\u00edvel dela e provarei que sabemos fazer nosso trabalho.",
        u"Ugh\u2026 He\u2019s always like this when it\u2019s his feeding time\u2026 I told him we could just heat up whatever\u2019s in the fridge.": u"Aff\u2026 Ele sempre fica assim na hora de comer\u2026 Eu disse que poder\u00edamos simplesmente esquentar o que estivesse na geladeira.",
        u"Ugh\u2026 I can\u2019t believe you, Yoshi! ": u"Aff\u2026 N\u00e3o acredito em voc\u00ea, Yoshi! ",
        u"Ugh\u2026 I should\u2019ve known you would make me an elf, out of all things\u2026": u"Ugh\u2026 Eu devia saber que, de todas as coisas, voc\u00ea me faria de elfo\u2026",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Is it me, or is it getting hot in here?! ": u"Argh\u2026 Sou eu ou est\u00e1 ficando quente aqui?! ",
        u"Ugh\u2026 It was pretty crazy, and now I\u2019m starving!": u"Ugh\u2026 Foi uma loucura, e agora estou morrendo de fome!",
        u"Ugh\u2026 It\u2019s about time she left.": u"Ugh\u2026 At\u00e9 que enfim ela saiu.",
        u"Ugh\u2026 I\u2019m sorry\u2026 I don\u2019t feel so good\u2026": u"Argh\u2026 Desculpe\u2026 N\u00e3o estou me sentindo muito bem\u2026",
        u"Ugh\u2026 That stupid cooking badge. As soon as you got it, you stopped trying to get better at cooking.": u"Aff\u2026 Aquele distintivo idiota de culin\u00e1ria. Assim que o conquistou, voc\u00ea parou de tentar melhorar na cozinha.",
        u"Ugh\u2026 That stupid cooking badge. As soon as you got it, you stopped trying to get better at cooking.{fast}": u"Aff\u2026 Aquele distintivo idiota de culin\u00e1ria. Assim que o conquistou, voc\u00ea parou de tentar melhorar na cozinha.{fast}",
        u"Ugh\u2026 This is gonna be a long ride\u2026": u"Argh\u2026 Esta viagem vai ser longa\u2026",
        u"Ugh\u2026 This is so embarrassing\u2026": u"Urgh\u2026 Isso \u00e9 t\u00e3o constrangedor\u2026",
        u"Ugh\u2026 This is what my life has become\u2026 ": u"Ugh\u2026 Foi nisso que minha vida se transformou\u2026 ",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Why am I doing this with you again\u2026?": u"Ugh\u2026 Por que estou fazendo isso com voc\u00ea mesmo\u2026?",
        u"Ugh\u2026 Why the heck did Dad pick the only spot with no shade for us to camp in?!": u"Argh\u2026 Por que diabos o papai escolheu o \u00fanico lugar sem sombra para acamparmos?!",
        u"Ugh\u2026 here we go again\u2026": u"Ugh\u2026 l\u00e1 vamos n\u00f3s de novo\u2026",
        u"Uh, Yoshi? Why is Jin peeking over there?": u"Uhh, Yoshi? Por que o Jin est\u00e1 espiando ali?",
        u"Uh, no way, it\u2019s awesome! You\u2019re gonna make someone very happy one day, Dar!": u"Ah, de jeito nenhum, \u00e9 incr\u00edvel! Voc\u00ea ainda vai fazer algu\u00e9m muito feliz um dia, Dar!",
        u"Uh-oh, I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve ever seen this much snow before!": u"Opa, acho que nunca vi tanta neve assim!",
        u"Uh-oh, don\u2019t tell me I turned into a puking machine?!": u"Ah, n\u00e3o, n\u00e3o me diga que virei uma m\u00e1quina de vomitar?!",
        u"Uh-oh, here come the waterworks.": u"Opa, l\u00e1 v\u00eam as l\u00e1grimas.",
        u"Uh-oh, it\u2019s bedtime already and Gramps is getting cranky~. ": u"Opa, j\u00e1 est\u00e1 na hora de dormir e o vov\u00f4 est\u00e1 ficando mal-humorado~",
        u"Uh-oh~ What do you think you\u2019re doing there, Yoshi~?": u"Uh-oh~ O que voc\u00ea acha que est\u00e1 fazendo a\u00ed, Yoshi~?",
        u"Uh-uh, no thank you!": u"Uh-uh, n\u00e3o, obrigada!",
        u"Uh? Aren\u2019t you going to wash your hands, first?": u"H\u00e3? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai lavar as m\u00e3os primeiro?",
        u"Uhh, guys? We need to bring Emilia to her room right away. She\u2019s still asleep, but I\u2019m worried she might catch a cold out here.": u"Ahh, pessoal? Precisamos levar Emilia para o quarto agora. Ela ainda est\u00e1 dormindo, mas estou preocupado que possa pegar um resfriado aqui fora.",
        u"Uhh... We might\u2019ve squirted too much.": u"Ahn\u2026 Talvez tenhamos espremido creme demais.",
        u"Uhhh\u2026 Dar? I need another tall guy around\u2026 ": u"Uhhh\u2026 Dar? Preciso de outro cara alto aqui\u2026 ",
        u"Uhhh\u2026 What\u2019s going on over here?": u"Uhhh\u2026 O que est\u00e1 acontecendo aqui?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 An apron?": u"Uhh\u2026 Um avental?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Darius? Aren\u2019t you gonna go with Lloyd? ": u"Hum\u2026 Darius? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai com o Lloyd? ",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Dear\u2026 I think the outfit you gave me is a tad small\u2026": u"Uhh\u2026 Querida\u2026 Acho que a roupa que voc\u00ea me deu \u00e9 um pouco pequena\u2026",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Don\u2019t tell me he\u2019s also\u2014": u"Uhh\u2026 N\u00e3o me diga que ele tamb\u00e9m\u2014",
        u"Uhh\u2026 G-Gimme a sec.": u"Uhh\u2026 M-Me d\u00ea um segundo.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 He\u2019s got his earphones on.": u"Uhh\u2026 Ele est\u00e1 de fones de ouvido.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 I don\u2019t think I could even if I tried\u2026 I can\u2019t even figure out what they used to make these flavors.": u"H\u00e3\u2026 Acho que eu n\u00e3o conseguiria nem se tentasse\u2026 N\u00e3o consigo nem descobrir o que usaram para criar esses sabores.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 I don\u2019t think we\u2014": u"Ahn\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o precisamos\u2014",
        u"Uhh\u2026 I have a small box here that says \\\u201cDon\u2019t Touch\\\u201d\u2026?": u"Hum\u2026 Encontrei uma caixinha que diz \\\u201cN\u00e3o toque\\\u201d\u2026?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 I-I\u2019m not sure what kind of fish is used in any of those\u2026": u"H\u00e3\u2026 E-Eu n\u00e3o sei que tipo de peixe \u00e9 usado em nenhum desses\u2026",
        u"Uhh\u2026 I\u2019m not sure modeling is something I\u2019m good at, Ms. Yuri.": u"Uhh\u2026 N\u00e3o tenho certeza se levo jeito para ser modelo, Srta. Yuri.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Jin? You should really go back to the cabin. You may catch a cold at this rate.": u"Ahh\u2026 Jin? Voc\u00ea realmente deveria voltar para a cabana. Desse jeito pode acabar pegando um resfriado.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Jin? You should really go back to the cabin. You\u2019re gonna catch a cold at this rate.": u"Uhh\u2026 Jin? Voc\u00ea deveria mesmo voltar para a cabana. Desse jeito vai acabar pegando um resfriado.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Look at his pants.": u"Uhh\u2026 Olhe para a cal\u00e7a dele.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 More legroom in vehicles\u2026?": u"Hum\u2026 Mais espa\u00e7o para as pernas nos ve\u00edculos\u2026?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Okay?": u"Uhh\u2026 Certo?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Sir Goro?": u"Uhh\u2026 Senhor Goro?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Sir? Is everything alright\u2026?": u"Hum\u2026 Senhor? Est\u00e1 tudo bem\u2026?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 Sure. Only one at a time though.": u"Uhh\u2026 Claro. Mas s\u00f3 um de cada vez.",
        u"Uhh\u2026 That\u2019s duck liver, Lloyd\u2026 I think\u2026": u"H\u00e3\u2026 Isso \u00e9 f\u00edgado de pato, Lloyd\u2026 Eu acho\u2026",
        u"Uhh\u2026 We might\u2019ve overloaded him again, Aiden\u2026": u"H\u00e3\u2026 Acho que sobrecarregamos ele de novo, Aiden\u2026",
        u"Uhh\u2026 We might\u2019ve overloaded him again, sir\u2026": u"Ahn\u2026 Talvez tenhamos sobrecarregado ele de novo, senhor\u2026",
        u"Uhh\u2026 What was in there? Are you keeping dangerous items at camp?": u"Hum\u2026 O que tinha l\u00e1 dentro? Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 guardando objetos perigosos no acampamento?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 What\u2019s going on\u2026?": u"Hum\u2026 O que est\u00e1 acontecendo\u2026?",
        u"Uhh\u2026 okay\u2026 Rock, paper, scissors\u2026 Shoot?": u"Uhh\u2026 certo\u2026 Pedra, papel, tesoura\u2026 J\u00e1?",
        u"Uh\u2026 I\u2019m sorry to interrupt you two, but\u2026": u"Hum\u2026 Desculpem interromper voc\u00eas dois, mas\u2026",
        u"Uh\u2026 We usually just drink canned beer. ": u"Ah\u2026 Normalmente s\u00f3 bebemos cerveja em lata. ",
        u"Uh\u2026 We\u2019re fairly new here, so we don\u2019t really know what to get\u2026": u"Ah\u2026 Somos novos por aqui, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o sabemos muito bem o que pedir\u2026",
        u"Uh\u2026 What\u2019s going on? Are we being pranked\u2026?": u"H\u00e3\u2026 O que est\u00e1 acontecendo? Est\u00e3o pregando uma pe\u00e7a na gente\u2026?",
        u"Uh\u2026 Why is Jin peeking over there?": u"Uh\u2026 Por que Jin est\u00e1 espiando ali?",
        u"Uh\u2026 Yuri-dear\u2026 Maybe you should relax a little\u2026?": u"Uh\u2026 querida Yuri\u2026 Talvez devesse relaxar um pouco\u2026?",
        u"Um, Yoshi? I need a hand here~": u"Hum, Yoshi? Preciso de uma ajudinha aqui~",
        u"Um, excuse me? I need everyone\u2019s full attention. This is very important.": u"Hmm, com licen\u00e7a? Preciso da aten\u00e7\u00e3o de todos. Isto \u00e9 muito importante.",
        u"Um. No one asked.": u"Hum. Ningu\u00e9m perguntou.",
        u"Umm, everyone? Maybe let\u2019s just order something we\u2019re all more familiar with?": u"Hum, pessoal? Talvez seja melhor pedirmos algo com que todos estejamos mais familiarizados?",
        u"Umm, why are you talking to me?": u"Hmm, por que est\u00e1 falando comigo?",
        u"Umm... the shed???": u"Humm\u2026 no dep\u00f3sito???",
        u"Umm\u2026": u"Hum\u2026",
        u"Umm\u2026 Alright\u2026!": u"Umm\u2026 Certo\u2026!",
        u"Umm\u2026 I guess someone would probably need to stay to maintain most of the tech\u2026 ": u"Umm\u2026 Acho que algu\u00e9m provavelmente precisaria ficar para cuidar da manuten\u00e7\u00e3o de boa parte da tecnologia\u2026 ",
        u"Umm\u2026 I hope you don\u2019t mind us using Sir Goro\u2019s computer here, Yoshi\u2026": u"Umm\u2026 Espero que n\u00e3o se importe de estarmos usando o computador do Sr. Goro, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Umm\u2026 Okay?": u"Umm\u2026 Certo?",
        u"Umm\u2026 Sir Goro?": u"Umm\u2026 Senhor Goro?",
        u"Umm\u2026 Y-Yeah\u2026": u"Hum\u2026 S-Sim\u2026",
        u"Umm\u2026 Yes! I need you to come to the mess hall with me, sir!": u"Ahn\u2026 Sim! Preciso que venha comigo ao refeit\u00f3rio, senhor!",
        u"Understand me?! I tried to get back in touch with you from the start, and you never once reciprocated! ": u"Me entender?! Desde o come\u00e7o tentei me reaproximar de voc\u00ea, e voc\u00ea nunca correspondeu uma \u00fanica vez! ",
        u"Understood. I\u2019ll make sure to review everything carefully.": u"Entendido. Farei quest\u00e3o de analisar tudo com cuidado.",
        u"Understood. Thank you for the update. That means we\u2019ll have to extend our stay here, doesn\u2019t it?": u"Entendo. Obrigado pela atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o. Isso significa que teremos que prolongar nossa estadia, correto?",
        u"Unfortunately, Mr. Clermont had to see it, which was quite embarrassing.": u"Infelizmente, o Sr. Clermont teve que presenciar tudo, o que foi bastante constrangedor.",
        u"Unfortunately, not\u2026": u"Infelizmente, n\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Unfortunately, that might be the case\u2026 ": u"Infelizmente, talvez seja esse o caso\u2026 ",
        u"Unfortunately, yes. A strong blizzard blew through the capital last night and rendered all the roads unpassable.": u"Infelizmente, sim. Uma forte nevasca atingiu a capital ontem \u00e0 noite e deixou todas as estradas intransit\u00e1veis.",
        u"Unless~": u"A menos que~",
        u"Unless\u2026 you\u2019re not finished with the view?  ": u"A menos que\u2026 voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o tenha terminado de apreciar a vista?  ",
        u"Unlimited vacay.": u"F\u00e9rias ilimitadas.",
        u"Until then, I\u2019ll be right here waiting.": u"At\u00e9 l\u00e1, estarei bem aqui esperando.",
        u"Up until his final moments\u2026": u"At\u00e9 seus \u00faltimos momentos\u2026",
        u"Us as well! It\u2019s a privilege to be here!": u"N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m! \u00c9 um privil\u00e9gio estar aqui!",
        u"Using three shovels at the same time won\u2019t make your work faster, Yoichi!": u"Usar tr\u00eas p\u00e1s ao mesmo tempo n\u00e3o vai fazer voc\u00ea trabalhar mais r\u00e1pido, Yoichi!",
        u"Usually the local city hall sends their assistance, and I\u2019ve been in touch with them since yesterday. Unfortunately, they\u2019re still occupied clearing public roads.  ": u"Normalmente a prefeitura envia ajuda, e estou em contato com eles desde ontem. Infelizmente, ainda est\u00e3o ocupados liberando as vias p\u00fablicas.  ",
        u"Vacay.": u"F\u00e9rias.",
        u"Vera, let\u2019s settle this later, alright?": u"Vera, vamos resolver isso mais tarde, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"Vera, wait\u2014!": u"Vera, espere\u2014!",
        u"Very fine choice, madam. I\u2019ll make sure everything is carefully prepared to your liking.": u"Excelente escolha, senhora. Vou garantir que tudo seja cuidadosamente preparado ao seu gosto.",
        u"Very horny.": u"Com muito tes\u00e3o.",
        u"Very well. I\u2019m glad that you\u2019re willing to resolve this amongst yourselves.": u"Muito bem. Fico contente que esteja disposto a resolver isso entre voc\u00eas.",
        u"Very well. Mr. Clermont chose me to guarantee that this sponsorship meets his expectations.": u"Muito bem. O Sr. Clermont me escolheu para garantir que este patroc\u00ednio corresponda \u00e0s expectativas dele.",
        u"W-WAH!": u"A-AAH!",
        u"W-WAH! You don\u2019t have to carry me, Gramps!": u"W-WAH! N\u00e3o precisa me carregar, Vov\u00f4!",
        u"W-WAHHH!! What?!! ": u"W-WAHHH!! O qu\u00ea?!! ",
        u"W-WHAT?!": u"O-O QU\u00ca?!",
        u"W-Wah! Is it finally happening?!": u"U-Uau! Finalmente vai acontecer?!",
        u"W-Wah! Sir Goro?!": u"W-Wah! Senhor Goro?!",
        u"W-Wah! Why would I do that?! ": u"A-Ah! Por que eu faria isso?! ",
        u"W-Wah...! What are you doing\u2026?": u"W-Wah\u2026! O que est\u00e1 fazendo\u2026?",
        u"W-Wahh\u2026 I\u2019m here! Sorry I\u2019m late, guys\u2026!": u"W-Wahh\u2026 Cheguei! Desculpem o atraso, pessoal\u2026!",
        u"W-Wah\u2026 I still don\u2019t see it\u2026": u"W-Wah\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o consigo enxergar\u2026",
        u"W-Wah\u2026! Aiden, wait\u2014": u"U-Uah\u2026! Aiden, espere\u2014",
        u"W-Wah\u2026! I-I\u2019m just telling the truth!": u"U-Uah\u2026! E-Estou apenas dizendo a verdade!",
        u"W-Wah\u2026! Sir Goro, wait\u2014": u"U-Uah\u2026! Sr. Goro, espere\u2014",
        u"W-Wait a minute, sir\u2026 I-Is that a\u2026 tail?": u"E-Espere um pouco, senhor\u2026 I-Isso \u00e9 uma\u2026 cauda?",
        u"W-Wait a minute. Emilia?! I-Is that you?": u"E-Espere a\u00ed. Emilia?! \u00c9-\u00c9 voc\u00ea?",
        u"W-Wait a minute\u2026 Why is Jin just standing there in the corner?": u"E-Espere a\u00ed\u2026 Por que Jin est\u00e1 parado naquele canto?",
        u"W-Wait! Emilia\u2019s not here yet!": u"E-Espera! A Emilia ainda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 aqui!",
        u"W-Wait! Let\u2019s go back to camp or else we\u2019ll all get in trouble!": u"E-Esperem! Vamos voltar para o acampamento ou todos teremos problemas!",
        u"W-Wait, Aiden! You're not dressed yet!": u"E-Espera, Aiden! Voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o se vestiu!",
        u"W-Wait, Aiden, are you gonna-": u"E-Espera, Aiden, voc\u00ea vai\u2014",
        u"W-Wait, Aiden\u2019s not dressed yet!": u"E-Espera, Aiden ainda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 vestido!",
        u"W-Wait, Aiden\u2026 We should really stop before someone comes\u2026 ": u"E-Espere, Aiden\u2026 \u00c9 melhor pararmos antes que algu\u00e9m apare\u00e7a\u2026 ",
        u"W-Wait, Jin\u2026!!": u"E-Espere, Jin\u2026!!",
        u"W-Wait, Mr. Clermont, please let me carry that!  ": u"E-Espere, Sr. Clermont, por favor, deixe que eu carregue isso!  ",
        u"W-Wait, Sir Goro didn\u2019t even say yes yet\u2026!": u"E-Espera, o Sr. Goro nem disse sim ainda\u2026!",
        u"W-Wait, WHAT\u2026?!": u"E-Espere, O QU\u00ca\u2026?!",
        u"W-Wait, Yoshinori\u2026!": u"E-Espere, Yoshinori\u2026!",
        u"W-Wait, Yuri\u2014": u"E-Espere, Yuri\u2014",
        u"W-Wait, Yuri\u2026! What about the\u2014": u"E-Espere, Yuri\u2026! E a\u2014",
        u"W-Wait, a-are you all sure?! ": u"E-Esperem, v-voc\u00eas t\u00eam certeza?! ",
        u"W-Wait, did you say formal dinner, Yuri? I don\u2019t think any of us packed appropriate clothing for something like this\u2026": u"E-Espera, voc\u00ea disse jantar formal, Yuri? Acho que nenhum de n\u00f3s trouxe roupas adequadas para algo assim\u2026",
        u"W-Wait, did you say formal dinner, sir? I don\u2019t think any of us packed appropriate clothing for something like this\u2026": u"E-Espera, o senhor disse jantar formal? Acho que nenhum de n\u00f3s trouxe roupas apropriadas para algo assim\u2026",
        u"W-Wait, he\u2019s not what you think\u2026!": u"E-Espere, ele n\u00e3o \u00e9 o que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pensando\u2026!",
        u"W-Wait, maybe we should-": u"E-Espera, talvez dev\u00eassemos\u2014",
        u"W-Wait, really? You don\u2019t remember anything at all? ": u"E-Espere, s\u00e9rio? N\u00e3o se lembra de absolutamente nada? ",
        u"W-Wait, wait\u2026 Did you have a costume party during the summer too?!": u"E-Espere, espere\u2026 Voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m tiveram uma festa \u00e0 fantasia durante o ver\u00e3o?!",
        u"W-Wait, we\u2019re doing it?!": u"E-Espera, vamos fazer isso?!",
        u"W-Wait, what\u2026? You don\u2019t mean\u2014": u"E-Espere, o qu\u00ea\u2026? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quer dizer\u2014",
        u"W-Wait, what\u2026?!": u"E-Espera, o qu\u00ea\u2026?!",
        u"W-Wait, you and Emilia are gonna be permanent roommates?!": u"E-Espere, voc\u00ea e Emilia v\u00e3o dividir o quarto permanentemente?!",
        u"W-Wait, you can\u2019t be serious\u2026 ": u"E-Espere, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode estar falando s\u00e9rio\u2026 ",
        u"W-Wait, you had a costume party during the summer too?": u"E-Espera, voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m fizeram uma festa \u00e0 fantasia durante o ver\u00e3o?",
        u"W-Wait, you read her fanfics, Emilia\u2026?": u"E-Espera, voc\u00ea leu as fanfics dela, Emilia\u2026?",
        u"W-Wait, you\u2019re gonna carry me?!": u"E-Espere, voc\u00ea vai me carregar?!",
        u"W-Wait\u2026 I-I\u2019ve never really taken a shower with someone else, but\u2014": u"E-Espere\u2026 E-Eu nunca tomei banho com outra pessoa, mas\u2014",
        u"W-Wait\u2026 Is it okay for you to wear something like this\u2026? I mean, maybe if it\u2019s just us, but Mr. Clermont is here too, right\u2026?": u"E-Espere\u2026 Tem problema voc\u00ea usar algo assim\u2026? Quero dizer, talvez se estiv\u00e9ssemos s\u00f3 n\u00f3s, mas o Sr. Clermont tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 aqui, n\u00e3o est\u00e1\u2026?",
        u"W-Wait\u2026 You mean you all weren\u2019t intimidated by me?": u"E-Esperem\u2026 Quer dizer que nenhum de voc\u00eas ficou intimidado comigo?",
        u"W-Wait\u2026 before we leave\u2026 I really want to take this opportunity to properly thank you both\u2026": u"E-Esperem\u2026 antes de irmos\u2026 quero muito aproveitar esta oportunidade para agradecer de verdade a voc\u00eas dois\u2026",
        u"W-Wait\u2026! I-I\u2019m still not\u2014": u"E-Espere\u2026! E-Eu ainda n\u00e3o\u2014",
        u"W-Wait\u2026! L-Love-making?!": u"E-Espere\u2026! A-Amor?!",
        u"W-Was Yuri right about what happened in the kitchen, though\u2026?": u"M-Mas a Yuri estava certa sobre o que aconteceu na cozinha\u2026?",
        u"W-We do know how to cook, but it\u2019s definitely not anything like this\u2026": u"N-N\u00f3s sabemos cozinhar, mas definitivamente n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada parecido com isto\u2026",
        u"W-We don\u2019t have to do that, Yoshi! Let\u2019s just get a drink to calm everyone down.": u"N-N\u00e3o precisamos fazer isso, Yoshi! Vamos s\u00f3 tomar alguma coisa para todo mundo se acalmar.",
        u"W-We figured we\u2019d show up for work early now that we have an inspector\u2026": u"A-Achamos melhor chegar cedo ao trabalho agora que temos uma inspetora\u2026",
        u"W-We only learned recently, sir. During our stay at the hotel.": u"S-S\u00f3 descobrimos recentemente, senhor. Durante nossa estadia no hotel.",
        u"W-We should be the ones asking you that\u2026!!": u"N-N\u00f3s \u00e9 que dever\u00edamos perguntar isso\u2026!!",
        u"W-Well I just thought you'd enjoy some company.": u"B-Bem, achei que voc\u00ea gostaria de ter companhia.",
        u"W-Well maybe because Goro is your Dad\u2026?": u"B-Bem, talvez porque Goro seja seu Pai\u2026?",
        u"W-Well, I also play games and watch anime on it, if that\u2019s the answer you\u2019re looking for\u2026": u"B-Bem, tamb\u00e9m jogo e assisto a animes nele, se \u00e9 essa a resposta que procura\u2026",
        u"W-Well, I am! Just not when you do it to other people!": u"B-Bem, eu me acostumei! S\u00f3 n\u00e3o quando voc\u00ea faz isso com outras pessoas!",
        u"W-Well, I did have a bit of a rocky start for my first couple of terms, but thankfully, things have turned out fine.": u"B-Bem, tive um come\u00e7o um pouco dif\u00edcil nas primeiras temporadas, mas, felizmente, tudo acabou dando certo.",
        u"W-Well, I didn\u2019t mean to cause any trouble\u2026 I was just trying to make the workers happy.": u"B-Bem, eu n\u00e3o queria causar problemas\u2026 S\u00f3 estava tentando animar os trabalhadores.",
        u"W-Well, I do try to help you out sometimes when my schedule is loose.": u"B-Bem, \u00e0s vezes tento ajud\u00e1-lo quando a minha agenda est\u00e1 livre.",
        u"W-Well, I don\u2019t mind sharing a room with you, Yuri\u2026 We can make up for the lost time on the bus ride watching BL.": u"B-Bem, n\u00e3o me importo de dividir o quarto com voc\u00ea, Yuri\u2026 Podemos compensar o tempo perdido no \u00f4nibus assistindo BL.",
        u"W-Well, I figured it would be better as a surprise.": u"B-Bem, achei que seria melhor como surpresa.",
        u"W-Well, I have my laptop here with me\u2026 And if you guys want, we could work on the journal project some more\u2026! ": u"B-Bem, estou com meu notebook aqui\u2026 E, se voc\u00eas quiserem, podemos trabalhar mais um pouco no projeto do di\u00e1rio\u2026! ",
        u"W-Well, I haven\u2019t seen Aiden yet either!": u"B-Bem, eu tamb\u00e9m ainda n\u00e3o vi o Aiden!",
        u"W-Well, I haven\u2019t seen Goro yet either!": u"B-Bem, eu tamb\u00e9m ainda n\u00e3o vi o Goro!",
        u"W-Well, I like them all, but I prefer\u2026 *ehem* muscles the most!": u"B-Bem, gosto de todos, mas prefiro\u2026 *cof cof* m\u00fasculos acima de tudo!",
        u"W-Well, I mean\u2026 it\u2019s probably out of my bounds to see you in the raw, sir\u2026!": u"B-Bem, quero dizer\u2026 provavelmente ultrapassa meus limites v\u00ea-lo ao natural, senhor\u2026!",
        u"W-Well, I noticed how you and Yoshinori have gotten closer over the span of the project.": u"B-Bem, percebi como voc\u00ea e Yoshinori ficaram mais pr\u00f3ximos ao longo do projeto.",
        u"W-Well, I owe that to all the badges I\u2019ve hand-knitted over the years.": u"B-Bem, devo isso a todos os distintivos que tricotei \u00e0 m\u00e3o ao longo dos anos.",
        u"W-Well, I remember that you enjoy the same stuff as Yuri. But is there something else that maybe\u2026 you know? We could do together?": u"B-Bem, lembro que gosta das mesmas coisas que Yuri. Mas existe alguma outra coisa que talvez\u2026 voc\u00ea sabe? Pud\u00e9ssemos fazer juntos?",
        u"W-Well, I still want to have some fun\u2026 Three is better than two?": u"B-Bem, eu ainda quero me divertir\u2026 Tr\u00eas \u00e9 melhor que dois?",
        u"W-Well, I thought it would be easier to carry stuff around if I was stronger.": u"B-Bem, achei que seria mais f\u00e1cil carregar as coisas se eu fosse mais forte.",
        u"W-Well, I thought we were about to go cool down, Aiden?": u"B-Bem, achei que est\u00e1vamos prestes a relaxar, Aiden?",
        u"W-Well, I was about to\u2026 I really haven\u2019t got the chance to shower ever since I got here\u2026": u"B-Bem, eu estava prestes a usar\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o tive a oportunidade de tomar banho desde que cheguei\u2026",
        u"W-Well, I\u2019m not really used to going on trips with a large group, and I\u2019m not actually sure what to do\u2026": u"B-Bem, n\u00e3o estou muito acostumado a viajar com grupos grandes e, na verdade, nem sei direito o que fazer\u2026",
        u"W-Well, if I see a situation where I can make a difference, I do my best to try and help.": u"B-Bem, quando vejo uma situa\u00e7\u00e3o em que posso fazer a diferen\u00e7a, fa\u00e7o o poss\u00edvel para ajudar.",
        u"W-Well, if you put it that way, I guess so.": u"B-Bem, pensando dessa forma, acho que sim.",
        u"W-Well, if you\u2019re interested, we could write a blog post for it too!": u"B-Bem, se estiverem interessados, tamb\u00e9m poder\u00edamos escrever uma publica\u00e7\u00e3o no blog sobre ela!",
        u"W-Well, it\u2019s not that I wasn\u2019t interested anymore. I just thought it wasn\u2019t my strongest suit.": u"B-Bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 que eu tivesse perdido o interesse. S\u00f3 achei que n\u00e3o era o meu ponto forte.",
        u"W-Well, let\u2019s just say she was really expecting I\u2019d say yes to her offer\u2026": u"B-Bem, digamos que ela realmente esperava que eu aceitasse\u2026",
        u"W-Well, let\u2019s just try it, Aiden!": u"B-Bem, vamos apenas experimentar, Aiden!",
        u"W-Well, not really\u2026 It\u2019s actually the opposite\u2026 ": u"B-Bem, n\u00e3o exatamente\u2026 Na verdade, \u00e9 o contr\u00e1rio\u2026 ",
        u"W-Well, should we really be talking about something like this in a public caf\u00e9...?": u"B-Bem, ser\u00e1 que dever\u00edamos mesmo falar sobre isso num caf\u00e9 p\u00fablico\u2026?",
        u"W-Well, that\u2019s kinda what I\u2019m afraid of. ": u"B-Bem, \u00e9 justamente disso que tenho medo.",
        u"W-Well, the last time Mr. Clermont was here, you acted quite differently from your usual self. I mean\u2026 I\u2019ve never seen you that frantic before.": u"B-Bem, da \u00faltima vez que o senhor Clermont esteve aqui, o senhor agiu de maneira muito diferente do habitual. Quero dizer\u2026 Nunca o vi t\u00e3o agitado antes.",
        u"W-Well, the workers came back so it got quite busy\u2026": u"B-Bem, os trabalhadores voltaram, ent\u00e3o ficou bem corrido\u2026",
        u"W-Well, usually when people are fans of BL it\u2019s either as a kink or an escape from reality\u2026": u"B-Bem, geralmente quando algu\u00e9m \u00e9 f\u00e3 de BL \u00e9 por fetiche ou como uma fuga da realidade\u2026",
        u"W-Well, we are dating now, after all\u2026 Although I admit it\u2019s still hard to wrap my head around being with my boss\u2026": u"B-Bem, afinal, estamos namorando agora\u2026 Embora eu admita que ainda \u00e9 dif\u00edcil assimilar que estou com meu chefe\u2026",
        u"W-Well, we kinda got lost\u2026": u"B-Bem, n\u00f3s meio que nos perdemos\u2026",
        u"W-Well, we were trying to, but Sir Goro actually found us shortly after you guys left.": u"B-Bem, a gente estava tentando, mas o Sr. Goro encontrou a gente pouco depois que voc\u00eas sa\u00edram.",
        u"W-Well, we\u2019re home now! Everyone\u2019s been worried about you, you know\u2026": u"B-Bem, estamos em casa agora! Todo mundo ficou preocupado com voc\u00ea, sabia\u2026",
        u"W-Well, what did you expect starting with that kind of question?": u"B-Bem, o que voc\u00ea esperava come\u00e7ando com uma pergunta dessas?",
        u"W-Well, you can have some fish for your main if you want something lighter\u2026": u"B-Bem, voc\u00ea pode pedir peixe como prato principal se quiser algo mais leve\u2026",
        u"W-Well, you could have if you had at least worn pants\u2026": u"B-Bem, poderia ter visto se pelo menos tivesse colocado uma cal\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"W-Well, you did\u2026 But I didn\u2019t know it was for something to wear! ": u"B-Bem, tirou\u2026 Mas eu n\u00e3o sabia que era para alguma coisa que eu fosse vestir! ",
        u"W-Well, you\u2019re barely wearing anything, Aiden\u2026": u"B-Bem, voc\u00ea mal est\u00e1 vestindo alguma coisa, Aiden\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 A really large snowstorm blew in last night, and now all the roads are covered in snow\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 Uma tempestade de neve muito forte chegou ontem \u00e0 noite, e agora todas as estradas est\u00e3o cobertas de neve\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 About that\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 Sobre isso\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 He kept mentioning an email Sir Goro sent him this morning\u2026 I couldn\u2019t really follow since I didn\u2019t know the full story.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Ele continuou mencionando um e-mail que o Sr. Goro enviou esta manh\u00e3\u2026 N\u00e3o consegui entender direito porque n\u00e3o sabia da hist\u00f3ria toda.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 How do I put this\u2026?": u"B-Bem\u2026 Como posso dizer isto\u2026?",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I also came to ask you about something I thought I could help you with, sir\u2026!": u"B-Bem\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m vim perguntar sobre algo em que pensei que poderia ajud\u00e1-lo, senhor\u2026!",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I guess I could use a bit of a break to just chill here with you.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Acho que eu poderia aproveitar uma pausa para simplesmente relaxar aqui com voc\u00ea.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I haven\u2019t completely figured it out yet.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o pensei em tudo.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I just don\u2019t want to make anyone feel uncomfortable\u2026 I promised myself I\u2019d do my best to keep everything professional at this job.": u"B-Bem\u2026 S\u00f3 n\u00e3o quero deixar ningu\u00e9m desconfort\u00e1vel\u2026 Prometi a mim mesmo que faria o poss\u00edvel para manter tudo profissional neste trabalho.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I kinda had to stop myself in the middle before I got too carried away.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Precisei parar no meio antes que me empolgasse demais.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I was waiting by the door until Ms. Vera walked out\u2026 ": u"B-Bem\u2026 Eu estava esperando perto da porta at\u00e9 a Sra. Vera sair\u2026 ",
        u"W-Well\u2026 It\u2019s about the offer Mr. Clermont gave Goro yesterday. He wants to reopen the other branches of Camp Buddy\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 \u00c9 sobre a proposta que o Sr. Clermont fez a Goro ontem. Ele quer reabrir as outras unidades do Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 It\u2019s not fair that I\u2019m the only who gets teased around you, sir.": u"B-Bem\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 justo que eu seja o \u00fanico provocado quando estou perto do senhor.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I\u2019m just doing regular maintenance on our website.": u"B-Bem\u2026 S\u00f3 estou fazendo a manuten\u00e7\u00e3o de rotina no nosso site.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 I\u2019m just feeling kinda pressured \u2019bout the whole thing. ": u"B-Bem\u2026 S\u00f3 estou me sentindo meio pressionado com essa hist\u00f3ria toda. ",
        u"W-Well\u2026 Not exactly\u2026 ": u"B-Bem\u2026 N\u00e3o exatamente\u2026 ",
        u"W-Well\u2026 She did at first. But since we had enough proof, she had no choice but to admit to everything\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 No come\u00e7o, sim. Mas como t\u00ednhamos provas suficientes, ela n\u00e3o teve escolha a n\u00e3o ser admitir tudo\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 She did, and it really gave me something to think about.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Disse, sim, e realmente me deu algo em que pensar.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 That\u2019s not\u2014": u"B-Bem\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9\u2014",
        u"W-Well\u2026 We just thought we didn\u2019t need it\u2026 since we\u2019re an adventure-themed summer camp\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 N\u00f3s apenas ach\u00e1vamos que n\u00e3o precis\u00e1vamos disso\u2026 j\u00e1 que somos um acampamento de ver\u00e3o voltado para aventuras\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 We were actually looking up Ms. Emilia\u2019s profile online\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 Na verdade, est\u00e1vamos pesquisando o perfil da srta. Emilia na internet\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 Yeah, kind of like Camp Buddy.": u"B-Bem\u2026 \u00c9, mais ou menos como o Camp Buddy.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 You guys know I have a lot of social anxiety\u2026 And I like to have my fantasies in my games and novels\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 Voc\u00eas sabem que tenho muita ansiedade social\u2026 E gosto de viver minhas fantasias nos jogos e romances\u2026",
        u"W-Well\u2026 You had to tell them all about the camp rules and set them up in their cabins\u2026 It\u2019s no wonder you\u2019re tired.": u"B-Bem\u2026 Voc\u00ea teve que explicar a todos as regras do acampamento e acomod\u00e1-los nas cabanas\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 de admirar que esteja cansada.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 You were my scoutmaster then and you\u2019ve always stayed in your own cabin.": u"B-Bem\u2026 O senhor era meu chefe escoteiro naquela \u00e9poca e sempre ficava em sua pr\u00f3pria cabana.",
        u"W-Well\u2026 busy as usual\u2026 The instructors here are really strict\u2026 and the exams are really hard\u2026": u"B-Bem\u2026 ocupado como sempre\u2026 Os instrutores daqui s\u00e3o muito rigorosos\u2026 e as provas s\u00e3o muito dif\u00edceis\u2026",
