        u"Way to think ahead. I can\u2019t wait to get back to camp either.": u"Isso que \u00e9 pensar adiante. Tamb\u00e9m mal posso esperar para voltar ao acampamento.",
        u"We actually checked this place out last night\u2026 It was much livelier then!": u"Na verdade, n\u00f3s passamos por aqui ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 Estava bem mais animado!",
        u"We actually used to have more staff a couple years ago to do these tasks.": u"Na verdade, alguns anos atr\u00e1s t\u00ednhamos mais funcion\u00e1rios para realizar essas tarefas.",
        u"We all decided that we want to stay here at Camp Buddy if that\u2019s alright...?": u"Todos decidimos que queremos ficar aqui no Camp Buddy, se estiver tudo bem\u2026?",
        u"We all felt like we were back at our very first term at Camp Buddy, and I wouldn\u2019t have changed it for anything! ": u"Todos sentimos como se estiv\u00e9ssemos de volta \u00e0 nossa primeira temporada no Camp Buddy, e eu n\u00e3o trocaria isso por nada! ",
        u"We all got to know each other a lot better through them, and we learned how to work together!": u"Gra\u00e7as a elas, todos nos conhecemos muito melhor e aprendemos a trabalhar em equipe!",
        u"We all know how that went\u2026": u"Todos sabemos como aquilo terminou\u2026",
        u"We already allocated funds for situations like this. We\u2019ll just use them!": u"J\u00e1 reservamos verba para situa\u00e7\u00f5es como esta. Vamos simplesmente us\u00e1-la!",
        u"We already did that last camping trip! We don\u2019t want to do the same thing over and over, right?": u"J\u00e1 fizemos isso na \u00faltima viagem! N\u00e3o queremos repetir sempre a mesma coisa, certo?",
        u"We already had spare materials in case of something like this to be safe, but most of that was used on the repairs yesterday.": u"J\u00e1 t\u00ednhamos materiais de reserva para o caso de algo assim acontecer, mas a maior parte foi usada nos reparos de ontem.",
        u"We also believe that it will allow us to maintain the spirit and quality of the camp better than we otherwise could.": u"Tamb\u00e9m acreditamos que assim conseguiremos preservar melhor o esp\u00edrito e a qualidade do acampamento.",
        u"We appreciate it.": u"Agradecemos.",
        u"We appreciate the hospitality! I\u2019m starving!": u"Agradecemos a hospitalidade! Estou morrendo de fome!",
        u"We are an outdoor-themed camp, after all!": u"Afinal, somos um acampamento voltado para atividades ao ar livre!",
        u"We are gathered here today to celebrate the union of Goro Nomoru and Yoshinori Nagira.": u"Estamos reunidos aqui hoje para celebrar a uni\u00e3o de Goro Nomoru e Yoshinori Nagira.",
        u"We are going to maintain the same target of at least a month before next year\u2019s summer term begins.": u"Manteremos a mesma meta: pelo menos um m\u00eas antes do in\u00edcio da temporada de ver\u00e3o do pr\u00f3ximo ano.",
        u"We believe it would be in the best interests of both Emilia and Camp Buddy to have her stay. ": u"Acreditamos que seria melhor tanto para Emilia quanto para o Camp Buddy que ela ficasse. ",
        u"We both had a passion for adventure and loved the idea of doing those same activities together with the people we loved.": u"N\u00f3s dois \u00e9ramos apaixonados por aventura e ador\u00e1vamos a ideia de fazer aquelas atividades junto das pessoas que am\u00e1vamos.",
        u"We both have different hobbies, and I like for him to spend time doing what he enjoys.": u"Temos passatempos diferentes, e gosto que ele passe o tempo fazendo aquilo de que gosta.",
        u"We both know how hard everyone worked to reach our goals, but you still pointed out so many unnecessary things!": u"N\u00f3s dois sabemos o quanto todos trabalharam para alcan\u00e7ar nossas metas, mas mesmo assim voc\u00ea apontou tantas coisas desnecess\u00e1rias!",
        u"We both really enjoyed teaching Taiga and Yoichi over the project, and want to share our knowledge with the rest of the scouts.": u"N\u00f3s dois gostamos muito de ensinar Taiga e Yoichi durante o projeto e queremos compartilhar nosso conhecimento com os outros escoteiros.",
        u"We call it D-L-Do! \u201cDarius and Lloyd will do it all for you~\u201d ": u"Chamamos de D-L-Do! \u201cDarius e Lloyd fazem tudo para voc\u00ea~\u201d ",
        u"We can celebrate with the roasted chicken, but let\u2019s lay off on the alcohol for now, alright?!": u"Podemos comemorar com o frango assado, mas vamos deixar o \u00e1lcool de lado por enquanto, est\u00e1 bem?!",
        u"We can clear the entire site and start rebuilding by tomorrow at this rate.": u"Nesse ritmo, podemos limpar toda a obra e come\u00e7ar a reconstru\u00e7\u00e3o amanh\u00e3.",
        u"We can do all the activities together! We can go hiking, fishing, and you can teach me how to cook until I get my cooking badge!": u"Podemos fazer todas as atividades juntos! Podemos caminhar, pescar, e voc\u00ea pode me ensinar a cozinhar at\u00e9 eu conquistar o distintivo de culin\u00e1ria!",
        u"We can do something else to warm up.": u"Podemos fazer outra coisa para nos aquecer.",
        u"We can resolve everything once we get back to the camp.": u"Podemos resolver tudo quando voltarmos ao acampamento.",
        u"We can start fixing the actual damage tomorrow.": u"Podemos come\u00e7ar a consertar os danos de verdade amanh\u00e3.",
        u"We can start, Yoshinori. I\u2019ll draw.": u"N\u00f3s podemos come\u00e7ar, Yoshinori. Eu desenho.",
        u"We can still have fun indoors.": u"Ainda podemos nos divertir aqui dentro.",
        u"We can still talk this out. Don\u2019t let everything end this way\u2026": u"Ainda podemos conversar sobre isso. N\u00e3o deixe tudo terminar assim\u2026",
        u"We can take care of this later, guys. Let me know if Goro calls back.": u"Podemos resolver isso depois, pessoal. Avisem se Goro retornar a liga\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"We can't just turn it down.": u"N\u00e3o podemos simplesmente recusar.",
        u"We can\u2019t continue working with someone that keeps dragging us down either. Besides, Mr. Clermont mentioned replacing her at our last meeting too.": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o podemos continuar trabalhando com algu\u00e9m que s\u00f3 nos atrasa. Al\u00e9m disso, o Sr. Clermont mencionou substitu\u00ed-la na nossa \u00faltima reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"We can\u2019t efficiently educate the campers on survival skills with technology to distract them.": u"N\u00e3o podemos ensinar habilidades de sobreviv\u00eancia aos campistas de maneira eficiente com a tecnologia para distra\u00ed-los.",
        u"We can\u2019t just continue working with someone that keeps dragging us down either. Besides, Mr. Clermont mentioned replacing her on our last meeting too.": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o podemos continuar trabalhando com algu\u00e9m que vive nos prejudicando. Al\u00e9m disso, o Sr. Clermont mencionou substitu\u00ed-la na nossa \u00faltima reuni\u00e3o.",
        u"We can\u2019t just leave the camp\u2026 What\u2019ll happen to everyone else?": u"N\u00e3o podemos simplesmente deixar o acampamento\u2026 O que vai acontecer com todos os outros?",
        u"We cooked all your favorites, sir.": u"Preparamos todos os seus pratos favoritos, senhor.",
        u"We could always hang out outside of Camp Buddy too, right?! A little get together?!": u"Tamb\u00e9m podemos nos encontrar fora do Camp Buddy, certo?! Fazer uma reuni\u00e3ozinha?!",
        u"We could do it right now, if you\u2019re ready!": u"Podemos fazer isso agora mesmo, se estiver pronto!",
        u"We could grab something to eat over at the caf\u00e9!": u"A gente podia comer alguma coisa l\u00e1 no caf\u00e9!",
        u"We could have fun together.": u"Poder\u00edamos nos divertir juntos.",
        u"We couldn\u2019t contact you, and we were all getting worried...": u"N\u00e3o conseguimos falar com voc\u00ea e todos est\u00e1vamos ficando preocupados\u2026",
        u"We couldn\u2019t find Sir Goro this morning. He must\u2019ve had to attend something urgent.": u"N\u00e3o conseguimos encontrar o Sr. Goro esta manh\u00e3. Ele deve ter precisado resolver algo urgente.",
        u"We deserve the break.": u"Merecemos este descanso.",
        u"We deserve this break, anyway. We just worked super hard on the fundraiser all week long!": u"De qualquer forma, merecemos esta pausa. Trabalhamos pra caramba na arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o a semana inteira!",
        u"We did it in public...": u"Fizemos aquilo em p\u00fablico...",
        u"We did manage to hold a fundraiser and find a sponsor, so it\u2019s all good now!": u"Conseguimos realizar uma campanha de arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o e encontrar um patrocinador, ent\u00e3o agora est\u00e1 tudo bem!",
        u"We did! And Ms. Yuri had a whole bunch of costumes for us to choose from then!": u"Sim! E a Srta. Yuri tinha um monte de fantasias para escolhermos naquela \u00e9poca!",
        u"We didn\u2019t even notice how long we were working on this. I can see how you struggle with the concept of time, Jin! ": u"Nem percebemos quanto tempo ficamos trabalhando nisso. Agora entendo como voc\u00ea perde a no\u00e7\u00e3o do tempo, Jin! ",
        u"We didn\u2019t have much of a choice but to order out. ": u"N\u00e3o tivemos muita escolha al\u00e9m de pedir comida. ",
        u"We don\u2019t have anything like these back at home\u2026 ": u"N\u00e3o temos nada parecido em casa\u2026 ",
        u"We don\u2019t have to be friends with Emilia, but we don\u2019t have to antagonize her either.": u"N\u00e3o precisamos ser amigos de Emilia, mas tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o precisamos provoc\u00e1-la.",
        u"We don\u2019t have to do that, Aiden. ": u"N\u00e3o precisamos fazer isso, Aiden. ",
        u"We don\u2019t know that yet! Tell us who\u2019s better, Yoshi!": u"Ainda n\u00e3o sabemos! Diga quem \u00e9 melhor, Yoshi!",
        u"We don\u2019t need anything more than what we already have\u2026 ": u"N\u00e3o precisamos de nada al\u00e9m do que j\u00e1 temos\u2026 ",
        u"We don\u2019t need to like her, but Mr. Clermont assigned her here for a reason. We have to trust his judgement.": u"N\u00e3o precisamos gostar dela, mas o Sr. Clermont a designou por um motivo. Temos que confiar no julgamento dele.",
        u"We don\u2019t snoop around and call you out for your personal schedules!": u"N\u00f3s n\u00e3o ficamos bisbilhotando e criticando seus hor\u00e1rios pessoais!",
        u"We do\u2026 quite often.": u"N\u00f3s fazemos\u2026 com bastante frequ\u00eancia.",
        u"We even fought when no one could see us\u2026": u"A gente at\u00e9 brigava quando ningu\u00e9m estava olhando\u2026",
        u"We figured Yoshi would know what\u2019s best to do. I was so relieved to see you in high spirits this morning. ": u"Imaginamos que o Yoshi saberia o que fazer. Fiquei t\u00e3o aliviada ao ver voc\u00ea animado esta manh\u00e3. ",
        u"We finally didn\u2019t have to worry about all that stuff as much anymore.": u"Finalmente n\u00e3o precis\u00e1vamos mais nos preocupar tanto com todas aquelas coisas.",
        u"We got lost.": u"N\u00f3s nos perdemos.",
        u"We got to swim and fool around all day, and to top it all off with a romantic sunset dinner\u2026 Damn you really outdid yourself this time!": u"Nadamos e nos divertimos o dia inteiro e, para completar, tivemos um jantar rom\u00e2ntico ao p\u00f4r do sol\u2026 Caramba, desta vez voc\u00ea realmente se superou!",
        u"We got to swim and fool around all day\u2026 and to top it all off, now we get to cuddle while watching the sunset\u2026 ": u"Nadamos e brincamos o dia inteiro\u2026 e, para completar, agora podemos ficar abra\u00e7ados enquanto assistimos ao p\u00f4r do sol\u2026 ",
        u"We had plenty of chances to do this back in the day, but I wonder why we didn\u2019t\u2026": u"Tivemos muitas oportunidades de fazer isso antigamente, mas me pergunto por que nunca fizemos\u2026",
        u"We had such a long day yesterday though, so I\u2019m not surprised you were that tired.": u"Mas tivemos um dia t\u00e3o longo ontem que n\u00e3o me surpreende voc\u00ea estar t\u00e3o cansado.",
        u"We had the chance the entire spring\u2026 last year\u2026 and all the time before that\u2026": u"Tivemos a primavera inteira\u2026 o ano passado\u2026 e todo o tempo antes disso\u2026",
        u"We had to keep moving around, too, until we found Camp Buddy.": u"Tamb\u00e9m tivemos que ficar nos mudando de um lugar para outro at\u00e9 encontrarmos o Camp Buddy.",
        u"We had to relaunch our website and keep it updated to cater for online enrollments and job applications.": u"Precis\u00e1vamos relan\u00e7ar nosso site e mant\u00ea-lo atualizado para receber inscri\u00e7\u00f5es online de escoteiros e candidaturas a empregos.",
        u"We have Buddy Law #1 to thank for that!": u"Temos que agradecer \u00e0 Lei Buddy n\u00ba 1 por isso!",
        u"We have GOT to have a mini divination session as soon we\u2019re done today!": u"N\u00f3s PRECISAMOS fazer uma pequena sess\u00e3o de adivinha\u00e7\u00e3o assim que terminarmos hoje!",
        u"We have a long day of travel ahead of us tomorrow!": u"Temos um longo dia de viagem pela frente amanh\u00e3!",
        u"We have a team of construction workers too, but they\u2019re on leave for a couple more days.": u"Tamb\u00e9m temos uma equipe de oper\u00e1rios, mas eles ainda est\u00e3o de folga por mais alguns dias.",
        u"We have bad news. It seems that some of the foundations and roofing framework collapsed from the snow buildup.": u"Temos m\u00e1s not\u00edcias. Parece que parte das funda\u00e7\u00f5es e da estrutura do telhado desabou com o ac\u00famulo de neve.",
        u"We have enough to last for a little while still, but it looks like we need to order more to cover what we lost.": u"Ainda temos o suficiente para algum tempo, mas parece que precisamos encomendar mais para repor o que perdemos.",
        u"We have pretty high standards when it comes to taste, all thanks to Aiden\u2019s cooking~": u"Temos padr\u00f5es bem altos quando se trata de sabor, tudo gra\u00e7as \u00e0 comida do Aiden~",
        u"We have room for one more.": u"Tem espa\u00e7o para mais um.",
        u"We have to at least clear the snow away from the paths and structures so we can assess the damages.": u"Precisamos pelo menos remover a neve dos caminhos e das estruturas para podermos avaliar os danos.",
        u"We have to make a promise!": u"Temos que fazer uma promessa!",
        u"We have to wait for him to get back before doing anything.": u"Temos que esperar ele voltar antes de fazer qualquer coisa.",
        u"We haven\u2019t really had time to do any activities as a group, you know?": u"N\u00e3o tivemos muito tempo para fazer atividades em grupo, sabe?",
        u"We just gotta get you to stop overthinking things, hehe~": u"S\u00f3 precisamos fazer voc\u00ea parar de pensar demais nas coisas, hehe~",
        u"We just have different strengths, and together we make the perfect balance!": u"S\u00f3 temos pontos fortes diferentes, e juntos formamos o equil\u00edbrio perfeito!",
        u"We just have to do our best to keep things under control and get our momentum back.": u"S\u00f3 precisamos fazer o poss\u00edvel para manter tudo sob controle e recuperar nosso ritmo.",
        u"We just have to learn to not take her personal remarks seriously and focus on our jobs.": u"S\u00f3 precisamos aprender a n\u00e3o levar as observa\u00e7\u00f5es pessoais dela a s\u00e9rio e nos concentrar no trabalho.",
        u"We just need a review and signature from Sir Goro and we\u2019ll take care of the rest.": u"S\u00f3 precisamos que o Sr. Goro revise e assine, e cuidaremos do resto.",
        u"We kept the dumbass busy by letting him blow up balloons.": u"Mantivemos o idiota ocupado deixando ele encher bal\u00f5es.",
        u"We know it\u2019s fairly outdated\u2026 and it runs pretty slow, so we barely touch it most days.": u"Sabemos que ele est\u00e1 bastante ultrapassado\u2026 e funciona bem devagar, ent\u00e3o quase nunca o usamos.",
        u"We know you can get pushy, and someone like Emilia would definitely lash out if she\u2019s confronted with something as serious as that\u2026": u"Sabemos que voc\u00ea pode ser insistente, e algu\u00e9m como a Emilia com certeza reagiria mal ao ser confrontada com algo t\u00e3o s\u00e9rio\u2026",
        u"We learn something new every day, right~? ": u"Aprendemos algo novo todos os dias, n\u00e3o \u00e9~? ",
        u"We learned that during our trip\u2026": u"Aprendemos isso durante nossa viagem\u2026",
        u"We literally all just went on a vacation together, Yoshinori\u2026": u"Literalmente todos n\u00f3s acabamos de viajar juntos, Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"We made it where only admins can access the footage, and only you and Sir Goro have those accounts for now. ": u"Configuramos para que apenas administradores tenham acesso \u00e0s grava\u00e7\u00f5es, e por enquanto s\u00f3 voc\u00ea e o Sr. Goro t\u00eam essas contas. ",
        u"We may be here at Camp Buddy for a different reason this time, but our experiences together will forever be a part of us, no matter where we are in life!": u"Podemos estar aqui no Camp Buddy por um motivo diferente desta vez, mas nossas experi\u00eancias juntos sempre far\u00e3o parte de n\u00f3s, n\u00e3o importa onde estejamos na vida!",
        u"We may be in the middle of our work, but Sir Goro and I have the management stuff covered!": u"Podemos estar no meio do nosso trabalho, mas eu e o Sr. Goro damos conta da parte administrativa!",
        u"We may be just a temporary place for our scouts, but I\u2019d like to believe that the memories we give them lasts forever.": u"Podemos ser apenas um lugar tempor\u00e1rio para nossos escoteiros, mas gosto de acreditar que as lembran\u00e7as que proporcionamos a eles duram para sempre.",
        u"We may never compare to what you had, but we can be your family too. ": u"Talvez nunca possamos substituir o que voc\u00ea tinha, mas tamb\u00e9m podemos ser sua fam\u00edlia. ",
        u"We might not get a chance for something like this again with how busy we\u2019ll get, after all! ": u"Afinal, talvez n\u00e3o tenhamos outra oportunidade como esta quando ficarmos t\u00e3o ocupados! ",
        u"We might\u2019ve taken a little more than we could\u2014": u"Talvez tenhamos bebido um pouco mais do que consegu\u00edamos\u2014",
        u"We need to know the situation too.": u"Tamb\u00e9m precisamos entender a situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"We need to know the situation, after all.": u"Afinal, precisamos entender a situa\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"We only ever camp here on special occasions, after all\u2026  ": u"Afinal, s\u00f3 acampamos aqui em ocasi\u00f5es especiais\u2026  ",
        u"We only have information about her from when she was a scout. I assumed that she was credible since she was put here by Mr. Clermont.": u"S\u00f3 temos informa\u00e7\u00f5es dela da \u00e9poca em que era escoteira. Presumi que fosse confi\u00e1vel, j\u00e1 que foi colocada aqui pelo Sr. Clermont.",
        u"We packed extra clothing, bug spray, and toiletries too, sir!": u"Tamb\u00e9m levamos roupas extras, repelente e artigos de higiene, senhor!",
        u"We reached our initial target working with her.": u"Alcan\u00e7amos nossa meta inicial trabalhando com ela.",
        u"We really have to thank Mr. Nagame and his friends for that\u2026 ": u"Realmente temos que agradecer ao senhor Nagame e aos amigos dele por isso\u2026 ",
        u"We really need more people to clear this snow\u2026": u"Precisamos mesmo de mais gente para retirar essa neve\u2026",
        u"We received many critiques from Emilia\u2019s inspections, and she grew more and more frustrated. ": u"Recebemos muitas cr\u00edticas durante as inspe\u00e7\u00f5es de Emilia, e ela ficou cada vez mais frustrada.",
        u"We rely on you a lot more than you think!": u"Dependemos de voc\u00ea muito mais do que imagina!",
        u"We saw you both acting sus and we followed to see what you two were up to!": u"Vimos voc\u00eas dois agindo de forma suspeita e seguimos para descobrir o que estavam aprontando!",
        u"We should be all set now for the work that\u2019s going to be happening over the next few days.": u"Agora deve estar tudo pronto para o trabalho que acontecer\u00e1 nos pr\u00f3ximos dias.",
        u"We should be back on schedule now, right?": u"Agora devemos ter retomado o cronograma, certo?",
        u"We should be trying to do something fun out here.": u"Dever\u00edamos estar tentando fazer algo divertido por aqui.",
        u"We should board the shuttle, then. We\u2019ll find out once we get there. ": u"Ent\u00e3o devemos embarcar no \u00f4nibus. Descobriremos quando chegarmos l\u00e1. ",
        u"We should do this all together next time, though! I wanna show off my favorite yoga pose!": u"Da pr\u00f3xima vez dever\u00edamos fazer isso todos juntos! Quero mostrar minha posi\u00e7\u00e3o de ioga favorita!",
        u"We should do this more often while it\u2019s still off-season! Who knows, maybe one of these days I'll get to see what kind of drunk Gramps is!": u"Dever\u00edamos fazer isso com mais frequ\u00eancia enquanto ainda estamos na baixa temporada! Quem sabe um dia eu descubra que tipo de b\u00eabado o Vov\u00f4 \u00e9!",
        u"We should enjoy that while it lasts! Haha!": u"Devemos aproveitar enquanto podemos! Haha!",
        u"We should give them a tour on the first day, don\u2019t you think? I think they\u2019d really love that!": u"Dever\u00edamos fazer um passeio com eles no primeiro dia, n\u00e3o acha? Acho que eles adorariam!",
        u"We should go and make our daily report to Sir Goro. ": u"Dever\u00edamos ir fazer nosso relat\u00f3rio di\u00e1rio ao Sr. Goro. ",
        u"We should really get you something to eat. Let\u2019s head to the mess hall \u2013 dinner should be about ready!": u"Precisamos arranjar algo para voc\u00ea comer. Vamos ao refeit\u00f3rio \u2014 o jantar j\u00e1 deve estar quase pronto!",
        u"We should settle this, then! First one to make Yoshi cum, wins!": u"Ent\u00e3o vamos resolver isso! O primeiro a fazer o Yoshi gozar vence!",
        u"We should try switching it up sometimes, though\u2026 I want to be able to do it to you too.": u"Mas dever\u00edamos inverter \u00e0s vezes\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m quero poder fazer isso com voc\u00ea.",
        u"We should've allowed devices.": u"Dever\u00edamos ter permitido aparelhos.",
        u"We shouldn\u2019t miss this chance to spend as much time as we can together!": u"N\u00e3o devemos perder esta oportunidade de passar juntos todo o tempo que pudermos!",
        u"We shouldn\u2019t miss this chance, Goro!": u"N\u00e3o dever\u00edamos perder esta chance, Goro!",
        u"We spent as much time together as we could, doing things we loved.": u"Passamos o m\u00e1ximo de tempo poss\u00edvel juntos, fazendo as coisas que am\u00e1vamos.",
        u"We spent the day cleaning the obstacle course, and the pool was especially dirty.": u"Passamos o dia limpando a pista de obst\u00e1culos, e a piscina estava especialmente suja.",
        u"We started clearing out the site today! Had to chop lots of wood and move stuff around.": u"Come\u00e7amos a limpar o terreno hoje! Tivemos que cortar muita madeira e carregar coisas de um lado para o outro.",
        u"We still have a long way to go; the destination is in the capital, after all.": u"Ainda temos um longo caminho pela frente; afinal, nosso destino fica na capital.",
        u"We still have a long winter ahead \u2013 let\u2019s make sure the scouts have the best version of Camp Buddy to come back to!": u"Ainda temos um longo inverno pela frente \u2014 vamos garantir que os escoteiros tenham a melhor vers\u00e3o do Camp Buddy para onde voltar!",
        u"We talked about it, and we all want her to continue working with us.  ": u"Conversamos sobre isso e todos queremos que ela continue trabalhando conosco.  ",
        u"We thought it would be best if we concentrated our efforts and made one perfect Camp Buddy.": u"Achamos que seria melhor concentrar nossos esfor\u00e7os e tornar este Camp Buddy perfeito.",
        u"We thought it would be nice to leave it as a surprise for you, Aiden, and Dad.": u"Achamos que seria legal deixar como surpresa para voc\u00ea, Aiden e o papai.",
        u"We thought we\u2019d bring it your attention before we contacted Mr. Clermont.": u"Achamos melhor avis\u00e1-lo antes de entrarmos em contato com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"We try to encourage practical and survival skills in the more traditional way as much as possible.": u"Tentamos incentivar habilidades pr\u00e1ticas e de sobreviv\u00eancia da maneira mais tradicional poss\u00edvel.",
        u"We try to encourage survival skills.": u"Tentamos incentivar habilidades de sobreviv\u00eancia.",
        u"We understand your concerns.": u"Entendemos suas preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"We understand, and I take responsibility as the camp president.": u"Entendemos, e assumo a responsabilidade como presidente do acampamento.",
        u"We understand\u2026": u"Entendemos\u2026",
        u"We want to help.": u"Queremos ajudar.",
        u"We wanted to find a nice place to chill, and the seats here are super comfy! Plus, check out the ambience!": u"Quer\u00edamos encontrar um lugar legal para relaxar, e os assentos daqui s\u00e3o superconfort\u00e1veis! Al\u00e9m disso, olha s\u00f3 o ambiente!",
        u"We were a little behind schedule on the site clearing, so I decided to lend an extra hand.": u"Est\u00e1vamos um pouco atrasados na limpeza do terreno, ent\u00e3o decidi dar uma ajuda extra.",
        u"We were actually worried for a bit! You looked like you didn\u2019t wanna come!": u"A gente at\u00e9 ficou preocupado por um tempo! Parecia que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o queria vir!",
        u"We were all working on something serious and she risked that for her personal gain\u2026!": u"Todos est\u00e1vamos trabalhando em algo s\u00e9rio, e ela colocou tudo em risco para benef\u00edcio pr\u00f3prio\u2026!",
        u"We were both just waiting for each other this whole time\u2026": u"N\u00f3s dois estivemos esperando um pelo outro esse tempo todo\u2026",
        u"We were gonna wait for you guys, but everyone\u2019s kinda in a hurry.": u"\u00cdamos esperar voc\u00eas, mas todo mundo est\u00e1 meio com pressa.",
        u"We were gonna wait for you, but everyone\u2019s kinda in a hurry.": u"\u00cdamos esperar, mas todos est\u00e3o meio apressados.",
        u"We were just chatting with Mr. Clermont about our time as Camp Buddy scouts!": u"Est\u00e1vamos conversando com o Sr. Clermont sobre a \u00e9poca em que \u00e9ramos escoteiros do Camp Buddy!",
        u"We were overqualified for Mr. Clermont\u2019s criteria, and once he heard we were past scouts from Camp Buddy as well, we were immediately given the job.": u"T\u00ednhamos qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es de sobra para os crit\u00e9rios do Sr. Clermont e, assim que ele soube que tamb\u00e9m fomos escoteiros do Camp Buddy, recebemos o trabalho na hora.",
        u"We were so nervous when you confessed, but it was the right thing to do!": u"Ficamos t\u00e3o nervosos quando voc\u00ea confessou, mas foi a coisa certa a fazer!",
        u"We were worried about you, sir.": u"Est\u00e1vamos preocupados com o senhor.",
        u"We were, but things weren\u2019t so great before this moment\u2026": u"Est\u00e1vamos, mas as coisas n\u00e3o iam t\u00e3o bem antes desse momento\u2026",
        u"We weren\u2019t aware of this matter either until recently like I said. You can at least be relieved to know that we managed to fix it amongst ourselves.": u"Como eu disse, n\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o sab\u00edamos disso at\u00e9 recentemente. Pelo menos pode ficar aliviado por termos conseguido resolver a situa\u00e7\u00e3o entre n\u00f3s.",
        u"We weren\u2019t sure how old you were, so we just had each scout stick a candle in there!": u"N\u00e3o t\u00ednhamos certeza da sua idade, ent\u00e3o simplesmente pedimos para cada escoteiro colocar uma vela!",
        u"We will! After the ceremony! Now come on, let\u2019s get to the altar!": u"Vamos fazer isso! Depois da cerim\u00f4nia! Agora vamos para o altar!",
        u"We won\u2019t know that till we try~ Let\u2019s get this contest started, and the one who makes Yoshi cum the most gets to keep him!": u"S\u00f3 vamos saber tentando~ Vamos come\u00e7ar essa competi\u00e7\u00e3o, e quem fizer Yoshi gozar mais fica com ele!",
        u"We wouldn't have made it this far without him.": u"N\u00e3o ter\u00edamos chegado at\u00e9 aqui sem ele.",
        u"We wouldn\u2019t have cooled off that way! I already feel so much better, so you should jump in too!": u"Assim n\u00e3o conseguir\u00edamos nos refrescar! J\u00e1 estou me sentindo muito melhor, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea devia entrar tamb\u00e9m!",
        u"We would\u2019ve at least heard about them if they\u2019re bigshots in our field, Lloyd.": u"Ao menos ter\u00edamos ouvido falar deles se fossem importantes na nossa \u00e1rea, Lloyd.",
        u"We'll do better next time.": u"Faremos melhor da pr\u00f3xima vez.",
        u"We'll try to meet your expectations.": u"Tentaremos atender \u00e0s suas expectativas.",
        u"We're done working out.": u"Terminamos o treino.",
        u"We're just friends.": u"Somos apenas amigos.",
        u"We're looking to hire more people to help.": u"Estamos procurando contratar mais pessoas.",
        u"We're not.": u"N\u00e3o somos.",
        u"We're on vacation.": u"Estamos de f\u00e9rias.",
        u"We're together now.": u"Estamos juntos agora.",
        u"Weeell\u2026 Maybe if you play one more round\u2026 with me!": u"Beeem\u2026 Talvez se jogar mais uma rodada\u2026 comigo!",
        u"Welcome to Bottom\u2019s Up! What can I get for you?": u"Bem-vinda ao Bottom\u2019s Up! O que posso servir?",
        u"Welcome to Buddy Falls, Aiden! Isn\u2019t this place amazing?": u"Bem-vindo \u00e0 Cachoeira Buddy, Aiden! Este lugar n\u00e3o \u00e9 incr\u00edvel?",
        u"Welcome to Camp Buddy! What\u2019s your name? ": u"Bem-vindo ao Camp Buddy! Qual \u00e9 o seu nome? ",
        u"Welcome to our wonderful Kris-My-Ass spectacular party! ": u"Bem-vindos \u00e0 nossa maravilhosa e espetacular festa Kris-My-Ass! ",
        u"Welcome to the project, officially.": u"Bem-vinda oficialmente ao projeto.",
        u"Well I think I speak for all of us when I say I can\u2019t wait to try it!": u"Bem, acho que falo por todos quando digo que mal posso esperar para experimentar!",
        u"Well let\u2019s see if it tastes as good as it looks.": u"Bem, vamos ver se o sabor \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom quanto a apar\u00eancia.",
        u"Well then, I\u2019m looking forward to seeing you out there soon, Mr. Flynn! Have a lovely day!": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o estou ansioso para v\u00ea-lo por l\u00e1 em breve, Sr. Flynn! Tenha um \u00f3timo dia!",
        u"Well then\u2014": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o\u2014",
        u"Well yes, but what I mean is that you haven't really told me anything about yourself!": u"Bem, sim, mas quero dizer que voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o me contou nada sobre si mesmo!",
        u"Well you\u2019re in luck, \u2019cause I just finished fixing up the water in here!": u"Ent\u00e3o voc\u00eas est\u00e3o com sorte, porque acabei de consertar a \u00e1gua daqui!",
        u"Well, Aiden does strike me as someone who\u2019d enjoy a place like this. Maybe not as much for you, Yoshinori.": u"Bem, Aiden realmente parece o tipo de pessoa que gostaria de um lugar assim. Talvez n\u00e3o tanto voc\u00ea, Yoshinori.",
        u"Well, Aiden\u2026 We kinda did \u2018it\u2019\u2026 in public\u2026": u"Bem, Aiden\u2026 N\u00f3s meio que fizemos \u2018aquilo\u2019\u2026 em p\u00fablico\u2026",
        u"Well, BL to me is more than just the art!": u"Bem, para mim BL \u00e9 mais do que apenas a arte!",
        u"Well, Dad said that everything in the construction will be covered by the sponsorship.": u"Bem, o papai disse que tudo relacionado \u00e0 constru\u00e7\u00e3o ser\u00e1 coberto pelo patroc\u00ednio.",
        u"Well, Dar and I had just finished a really crappy job right before the posting.": u"Bem, eu e Dar t\u00ednhamos acabado de terminar um trabalho p\u00e9ssimo pouco antes da publica\u00e7\u00e3o da vaga.",
        u"Well, Emilia, I\u2019d like to introduce you to your new teammates!": u"Bem, Emilia, gostaria de apresent\u00e1-la aos seus novos colegas de equipe!",
        u"Well, Goro is counting on me to run this place one day.": u"Bem, Goro conta comigo para administrar este lugar um dia.",
        u"Well, I already finished making all the beds in the workers\u2019 cabins, and the laundry\u2019s already running, so I might as well make myself useful.": u"Bem, j\u00e1 terminei de arrumar todas as camas nas cabanas dos trabalhadores, e a roupa j\u00e1 est\u00e1 lavando, ent\u00e3o achei melhor me tornar \u00fatil.",
        u"Well, I am! I\u2019m also the laundryman, gardener, pool-boy, or any kind of \u201cjob\u201d you want me to do \u2013 I\u2019m at your service!": u"Bem, eu sou! Tamb\u00e9m sou lavadeiro, jardineiro, piscineiro ou fa\u00e7o qualquer tipo de \u201cservi\u00e7o\u201d que quiser \u2014 estou \u00e0 sua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Well, I believe it\u2019s important to unwind, especially after several months of hard work. ": u"Bem, acredito que seja importante relaxar, principalmente depois de v\u00e1rios meses de trabalho duro. ",
        u"Well, I can do that too! Maybe even better than you~ ": u"Bem, eu tamb\u00e9m consigo! Talvez at\u00e9 melhor que voc\u00ea~ ",
        u"Well, I can make my special juice to help quench that \u201cthirst\u201d of yours~": u"Bem, posso preparar meu suco especial para ajudar a matar essa sua \u201csede\u201d~",
        u"Well, I can sign them for now! I\u2019ll just run it by him as soon as he gets back!": u"Bem, posso assinar por enquanto! Assim que ele voltar, confirmo tudo com ele!",
        u"Well, I did end up showing it during the after party. I\u2019m sure you remember, Yoshinori.": u"Bem, acabei mostrando durante a festa depois da festa. Tenho certeza de que voc\u00ea se lembra, Yoshinori.",
        u"Well, I did mean everything I said.": u"Bem, eu realmente quis dizer tudo o que disse.",
        u"Well, I don\u2019t know how to explain it, \u2019cause Dar\u2019s pretty much the opposite of me.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o sei como explicar, porque Dar \u00e9 praticamente o meu oposto.",
        u"Well, I don\u2019t mind hearing more\u2026! They always inspire me, believe it or not!": u"Bem, eu n\u00e3o me importo de ouvir mais\u2026! Acredite ou n\u00e3o, seus discursos sempre me inspiram!",
        u"Well, I don\u2019t want it to end like our last costume party, with the scoutmasters cleaning up after us.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o quero que termine como nossa \u00faltima festa \u00e0 fantasia, com os chefes escoteiros limpando tudo depois da gente.",
        u"Well, I ended up accepting the offer. I think it was the right path for me after all, Gramps.": u"Bem, acabei aceitando a oferta. Acho que, afinal, esse era o caminho certo para mim, Vov\u00f4.",
        u"Well, I ended up turning down the offer. I don\u2019t think it was the right path for me, Gramps.": u"Bem, acabei recusando a oferta. N\u00e3o acho que fosse o caminho certo para mim, Vov\u00f4.",
        u"Well, I feel a lot more motivated now! Thank you, Sir Goro.": u"Bem, agora me sinto muito mais motivado! Obrigado, Sr. Goro.",
        u"Well, I figured I should return the favor and distract you too, sir.": u"Bem, achei que deveria retribuir o favor e distrair o senhor tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Well, I figured that since we\u2019re going to work so closely for the next couple of months, it would be nice to start fresh and catch up, on a more personal level~!": u"Bem, como trabalharemos t\u00e3o pr\u00f3ximos nos pr\u00f3ximos meses, pensei que seria bom recome\u00e7armos e colocarmos a conversa em dia num n\u00edvel mais pessoal~!",
        u"Well, I got caught up with a lot of things\u2026 but mostly, I got this bad boy back from my friend. ": u"Bem, acabei me ocupando com v\u00e1rias coisas\u2026 mas principalmente fui buscar esta belezinha de volta com meu amigo. ",
        u"Well, I guess I could use some new faces around here. I\u2019m tired of seeing Dynamite and hearing him nag every day. ": u"Bem, acho que alguns rostos novos seriam bem-vindos. Estou cansado de ver o Dinamite e ouvi-lo reclamar todos os dias. ",
        u"Well, I guess I need more practice cooking\u2026 *sigh* So much for earning that badge\u2026": u"Bem, acho que preciso praticar mais na cozinha\u2026 *suspiro* L\u00e1 se vai o meu distintivo\u2026",
        u"Well, I guess I shouldn\u2019t be surprised. You two have been just as close as Aiden and I ever since we were scouts.": u"Bem, acho que n\u00e3o deveria me surpreender. Voc\u00eas dois s\u00e3o t\u00e3o pr\u00f3ximos quanto eu e Aiden desde que \u00e9ramos escoteiros.",
        u"Well, I guess you\u2019re gonna have to spend the night out in the cold, then.": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o acho que voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que passar a noite ao relento.",
        u"Well, I have Yoshinori to thank for that. He helped to calm me down and brought me back to my senses.": u"Bem, tenho que agradecer a Yoshinori por isso. Ele me ajudou a me acalmar e a recuperar o ju\u00edzo.",
        u"Well, I have nowhere else to be anyway\u2026 and Aiden\u2019s gonna need all the help he can get!": u"Bem, de qualquer forma n\u00e3o tenho outro lugar para ir\u2026 e Aiden vai precisar de toda ajuda poss\u00edvel!",
        u"Well, I have nowhere else to be anyway\u2026 and I\u2019ll probably be taking over Aiden\u2019s job.": u"Bem, eu n\u00e3o tenho outro lugar para ir mesmo\u2026 e provavelmente vou assumir o trabalho de Aiden.",
        u"Well, I have now\u2026 But yeah, I didn\u2019t really sleep the night before either\u2026": u"Bem, agora eu dormi\u2026 Mas sim, tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o dormi de verdade na noite anterior\u2026",
        u"Well, I have to say, Yoshinori\u2026 You\u2019re a pretty good middle man.": u"Bem, tenho que admitir, Yoshinori\u2026 Voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito bom ficando no meio.",
        u"Well, I have your drinks ready now! Please enjoy!": u"Bem, suas bebidas est\u00e3o prontas! Aproveitem!",
        u"Well, I hope you don\u2019t mind if we hang out here with you then!": u"Bem, espero que n\u00e3o se importe se ficarmos aqui com voc\u00ea, ent\u00e3o!",
        u"Well, I hope you don\u2019t mind if we hang out here with you then.": u"Bem, espero que n\u00e3o se importe se ficarmos aqui com voc\u00ea ent\u00e3o.",
        u"Well, I just feel a little bad we have to leave on such short notice\u2026 Mr. Clermont really surprised us with this trip.": u"Bem, s\u00f3 me sinto um pouco mal por termos que partir com t\u00e3o pouco aviso\u2026 O Sr. Clermont realmente nos surpreendeu com esta viagem.",
        u"Well, I kinda meant it in a nostalgic sense!": u"Bem, eu quis dizer isso em um sentido nost\u00e1lgico!",
        u"Well, I knew you wouldn\u2019t come with me unless I tricked you with treats. ": u"Bem, eu sabia que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o viria comigo se eu n\u00e3o o enganasse com guloseimas. ",
        u"Well, I leave it up to you. But it would give me pleasure if you\u2019d submit to me.": u"Bem, deixo a decis\u00e3o com voc\u00ea. Mas seria um prazer se voc\u00ea se submetesse a mim.",
        u"Well, I mostly just want to see what\u2019s available!": u"Bem, eu s\u00f3 quero ver o que tem dispon\u00edvel!",
        u"Well, I only need to oversee every aspect of this week\u2019s checklist\u2026": u"Bem, s\u00f3 preciso supervisionar todos os pontos da lista de tarefas desta semana\u2026",
        u"Well, I still have to write down a report for Sir Goro about everything that happened today.": u"Bem, ainda preciso escrever um relat\u00f3rio para o Senhor Goro sobre tudo o que aconteceu hoje.",
        u"Well, I think it\u2019d be nice to be able to bounce them a little bit!": u"Bem, acho que seria legal conseguir faz\u00ea-los saltar um pouco!",
        u"Well, I think this off-season is the perfect time to start! ": u"Bem, acho que este per\u00edodo fora da temporada \u00e9 perfeito para come\u00e7ar! ",
        u"Well, I think you look really pretty, Ms. Yuri!": u"Bem, acho que a Srta. Yuri est\u00e1 muito bonita!",
        u"Well, I think you two would pass off as entertainers if I do say so myself! Handsome, hunky, and must be packing too~!": u"Bem, acho que voc\u00eas dois poderiam passar por artistas, se me permitem dizer! Bonitos, sarados e devem ser bem-dotados~!",
        u"Well, I thought I\u2019d take advantage of this rare opportunity and try out some options I\u2019ve never had before.": u"Bem, pensei em aproveitar esta rara oportunidade para experimentar algumas op\u00e7\u00f5es que nunca tinha provado.",
        u"Well, I was actually inspired by you, sir!": u"Bem, na verdade eu me inspirei no senhor!",
        u"Well, I was going to ask for your help anyway, but Yuri told me you were busy with other chores.": u"Bem, eu ia pedir a sua ajuda mesmo assim, mas a Yuri disse que voc\u00ea estava ocupado com outras tarefas.",
        u"Well, I was telling Yoshinori earlier today how I\u2019ve been trying to be more easygoing around you guys\u2026 especially after how I was the past few years.": u"Bem, hoje mais cedo eu dizia a Yoshinori que estou tentando ser mais descontra\u00eddo com voc\u00eas\u2026 especialmente depois da maneira como agi nos \u00faltimos anos.",
        u"Well, I won\u2019t. But still\u2026": u"Bem, n\u00e3o vou. Mas mesmo assim\u2026",
        u"Well, I worked hard to look like this, after all! Hahaha!": u"Bem, afinal, trabalhei duro para ter esta apar\u00eancia! Hahaha!",
        u"Well, I would normally, but Yuri\u2019s not comfortable with me changing in there.": u"Bem, normalmente eu faria isso, mas Yuri n\u00e3o se sente \u00e0 vontade comigo me trocando l\u00e1 dentro.",
        u"Well, I would\u2019ve liked to get to this point sooner. But I admit I got a bit carried away with the small talk.": u"Bem, eu gostaria de ter chegado a este ponto mais cedo. Mas admito que me empolguei um pouco com a conversa.",
        u"Well, I'm trying my best to not be such a grump. I want to show how much I enjoy being here at camp with you all.": u"Bem, estou fazendo o poss\u00edvel para n\u00e3o ser t\u00e3o rabugento. Quero mostrar o quanto gosto de estar aqui no acampamento com todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Well, I'm trying to make sure we have everything arranged properly with Mr. Clermont. It's the least I could do, considering his company is sponsoring our camp.": u"Bem, estou tentando garantir que tudo esteja devidamente acertado com o senhor Clermont. \u00c9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer, considerando que a empresa dele patrocina o nosso acampamento.",
        u"Well, I\u2019d be glad to tell you more after everything settles down. So, let\u2019s save that for a different time.": u"Bem, terei prazer em contar mais quando tudo se acalmar. Ent\u00e3o vamos deixar isso para outra hora.",
        u"Well, I\u2019d make sure and pack some cold weather clothes! It\u2019s getting a lot chillier lately and winter\u2019s coming really soon!": u"Bem, eu levaria roupas para o frio! Ultimamente est\u00e1 ficando bem mais gelado e o inverno est\u00e1 chegando rapidinho!",
        u"Well, I\u2019ll be honest. I was shocked when you returned to Camp Buddy. I could barely recognize you.": u"Bem, vou ser sincero. Fiquei chocado quando voc\u00ea voltou ao Camp Buddy. Quase n\u00e3o reconheci voc\u00ea.",
        u"Well, I\u2019ll be honest\u2026 your decision really relieved me! I was worried you\u2019d miss out on this amazing chance.": u"Bem, vou ser sincero\u2026 sua decis\u00e3o realmente me aliviou! Eu estava preocupado que voc\u00ea deixasse essa oportunidade incr\u00edvel passar.",
        u"Well, I\u2019ll help you get started if you don\u2019t know the basics! I promise it\u2019s not that complicated!": u"Bem, vou ajud\u00e1-la a come\u00e7ar caso n\u00e3o saiba o b\u00e1sico! Prometo que n\u00e3o \u00e9 t\u00e3o complicado!",
        u"Well, I\u2019ll just take it all with a grain of salt. ": u"Bem, vou encarar tudo isso com certa cautela. ",
        u"Well, I\u2019ll let it slide for now, for old time\u2019s sake.": u"Bem, deixarei passar desta vez, pelos velhos tempos.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m down to that! Maybe next time we can try fitting us both into Yoshi!": u"Por mim, tudo bem! Talvez da pr\u00f3xima vez possamos tentar caber n\u00f3s dois no Yoshi!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m down. Yoshinori, you\u2019re getting drunk tonight.": u"Por mim, tudo bem. Yoshinori, hoje voc\u00ea vai ficar b\u00eabado.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m glad I at least scored two out of three days with you. Not to mention, I\u2019m coming out of here with you as my boyfriend.": u"Bem, fico feliz de pelo menos ter conseguido dois de tr\u00eas dias com voc\u00ea. Sem falar que estou saindo daqui com voc\u00ea como meu namorado.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m glad Yuri\u2019s back to normal at least.": u"Bem, pelo menos fico feliz que Yuri tenha voltado ao normal.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m glad that you\u2019re recovering just fine, Emilia!": u"Bem, fico feliz que esteja se recuperando bem, Emilia!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m glad you still trust me enough to tell me your doubts and concerns.": u"Bem, fico feliz que ainda confie em mim o bastante para contar suas d\u00favidas e preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m going to take a shower before bed. Want me to wash you up, too?": u"Bem, vou tomar banho antes de dormir. Quer que eu d\u00ea banho em voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m?",
        u"Well, I\u2019m just getting started~ Lemme show you my style!": u"Bem, eu s\u00f3 estou come\u00e7ando~ Deixa eu mostrar meu estilo!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m just glad you\u2019re starting to enjoy your time here, Aiden.": u"Bem, s\u00f3 fico feliz que voc\u00ea esteja come\u00e7ando a aproveitar seu tempo aqui, Aiden.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m learning about you right now.": u"Bem, j\u00e1 estou aprendendo bastante sobre voc\u00ea.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m not going alone. You\u2019re coming with me.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o vou sozinho. Voc\u00ea vem comigo.",
        u"Well, I\u2019m not just your scout, sir! I\u2019m your friend too!": u"Bem, eu n\u00e3o sou apenas seu escoteiro, senhor! Tamb\u00e9m sou seu amigo!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m not risking it. I\u2019m staying here. ": u"Bem, n\u00e3o vou arriscar. Vou ficar aqui. ",
        u"Well, I\u2019m not sleeping just yet! I still have to brew up my nightly detox!": u"Bem, ainda n\u00e3o vou dormir! Preciso preparar meu detox noturno!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m really looking forward to it! I finally made up my mind about what my role in this project really is!": u"Bem, estou muito animado! Finalmente decidi qual ser\u00e1 minha verdadeira fun\u00e7\u00e3o neste projeto!",
        u"Well, I\u2019m serious \u2019bout working my thighs! So, don\u2019t mind if I go ahead and get started!": u"Bem, eu t\u00f4 falando s\u00e9rio sobre treinar minhas coxas! Ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o se importe se eu come\u00e7ar logo!",
        u"Well, I\u2019ve always liked leather\u2026 including \u2018intimate\u2019 accessories.": u"Bem, eu sempre gostei de couro\u2026 inclusive de acess\u00f3rios \u2018\u00edntimos\u2019.",
        u"Well, I\u2019ve been planning this for a while now, so I\u2019m glad everything went smoothly!": u"Bem, estou planejando isso h\u00e1 algum tempo, ent\u00e3o fico feliz que tudo tenha dado certo!",
        u"Well, I\u2019ve been thinking\u2026 This vacation has been our only private time together and I feel bad for being so down in the dumps for half the trip.": u"Bem, eu estava pensando\u2026 Estas f\u00e9rias foram nosso \u00fanico tempo a s\u00f3s, e me sinto mal por ter ficado t\u00e3o para baixo durante metade da viagem.",
        u"Well, I\u2019ve had a really negative mindset about my role here at Camp Buddy for a while now\u2026": u"Bem, h\u00e1 algum tempo tenho uma vis\u00e3o muito negativa sobre meu papel aqui no Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"Well, I\u2026": u"Bem, eu\u2026",
        u"Well, I\u2026 Uhh\u2014": u"Bem, eu\u2026 Uhh\u2014",
        u"Well, I\u2026 lost a point, too": u"Bem, eu\u2026 tamb\u00e9m perdi um ponto",
        u"Well, Lloyd\u2026 That\u2019s duck liver.": u"Bem, Lloyd\u2026 Isso \u00e9 f\u00edgado de pato.",
        u"Well, Mr. Clermont is an entrepreneur. His business has plenty of investments that he\u2019s funded and earns passively from, and Camp Buddy has caught his attention.": u"Bem, o Sr. Clermont \u00e9 um empres\u00e1rio. A empresa dele tem v\u00e1rios investimentos que financiou e dos quais recebe renda passiva, e o Camp Buddy chamou sua aten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Well, Mr. Nomoru? It's your call.": u"Bem, Sr. Nomoru? A decis\u00e3o \u00e9 sua.",
        u"Well, Sir Goro actually brought us here not too long ago! It\u2019s partly why I still know the way here, haha!": u"Bem, o senhor Goro nos trouxe aqui n\u00e3o faz muito tempo! \u00c9 por isso que ainda sei o caminho, haha!",
        u"Well, Yoshinori and Aiden, order as many drinks as you want! ": u"Bem, Yoshinori e Aiden, pe\u00e7am quantos drinques quiserem! ",
        u"Well, Yoshinori? Who\u2019s better?": u"E ent\u00e3o, Yoshinori? Quem \u00e9 melhor?",
        u"Well, Yoshinori\u2026 How rough do you want me to be? ": u"Bem, Yoshinori\u2026 O quanto voc\u00ea quer que eu seja bruto? ",
        u"Well, Yoshinori\u2026 Looks like your massage worked\u2026": u"Bem, Yoshinori\u2026 Parece que sua massagem funcionou\u2026",
        u"Well, Yuri was only two here. That makes me twenty-two around this time\u2026 ": u"Bem, Yuri s\u00f3 tinha dois anos aqui. Ent\u00e3o eu devia ter uns vinte e dois\u2026 ",
        u"Well, a friend of Mr. Andre is a friend of ours! My name\u2019s Yoshinori! ": u"Bem, um amigo do senhor Andre \u00e9 nosso amigo! Meu nome \u00e9 Yoshinori! ",
        u"Well, after I drew the \u2018Hanged Man\u2019, \u2018Emperor\u2019, and \u2018Death\u2019, it sounded like Sir Goro would be undergoing some transformation!": u"Bem, depois que tirei \u2018O Enforcado\u2019, \u2018O Imperador\u2019 e \u2018A Morte\u2019, pareceu que o Sr. Goro passaria por alguma transforma\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Well, after I drew the \u2018Sun, \u2018World\u2019, and \u2018Fool\u2019, we determined that they all encompass his persona and general approach to life!": u"Bem, depois que tirei \u2018O Sol\u2019, \u2018O Mundo\u2019 e \u2018O Louco\u2019, conclu\u00edmos que todas representam sua personalidade e maneira de encarar a vida!",
        u"Well, after your progress report yesterday, I had to see for myself how much damage the storm had done.": u"Bem, depois do seu relat\u00f3rio de progresso de ontem, precisei ver pessoalmente quanto dano a tempestade havia causado.",
        u"Well, all I can say is just keep it up, whatever you two have going on!": u"Bem, tudo que posso dizer \u00e9: continuem assim, seja l\u00e1 o que estiver rolando entre voc\u00eas!",
        u"Well, anyways! Isn\u2019t the view here amazing?": u"Bem, enfim! A vista daqui n\u00e3o \u00e9 incr\u00edvel?",
        u"Well, are you going to keep me waiting?": u"Bem, vai continuar me deixando esperando?",
        u"Well, aren\u2019t you adorable...?": u"Ora, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma gracinha\u2026?",
        u"Well, aren\u2019t you overworked yourself, Aiden? ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o est\u00e1 trabalhando demais, Aiden? ",
        u"Well, aren\u2019t you two getting along just nicely~": u"Ora, vejam como voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o se dando t\u00e3o bem~",
        u"Well, as far as I know, that will take the most of our time, but there's a few other projects as well.": u"Bem, pelo que sei, isso ocupar\u00e1 a maior parte do nosso tempo, mas tamb\u00e9m h\u00e1 alguns outros projetos.",
        u"Well, as long as you have the drive, it\u2019s never too late to learn! ": u"Bem, enquanto tiver vontade, nunca \u00e9 tarde demais para aprender! ",
        u"Well, as long as you\u2019re okay!": u"Bem, desde que voc\u00ea esteja bem!",
        u"Well, at first, I thought I\u2019d make something extra special for Mr. Clermont on his last day. He\u2019s done a lot for us and the camp, after all.": u"Bem, no come\u00e7o pensei em fazer algo especialmente caprichado para o Sr. Clermont no \u00faltimo dia dele. Afinal, ele fez muito por n\u00f3s e pelo acampamento.",
        u"Well, at least here in the spa you don\u2019t have to worry about getting burnt again, Lloyd!": u"Bem, pelo menos aqui no spa voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar em se queimar de novo, Lloyd!",
        u"Well, being camp president can be a lot of work, dear. Thankfully the other staff can handle some of the tasks for now.": u"Bem, ser presidente do acampamento d\u00e1 bastante trabalho, querida. Felizmente, os outros funcion\u00e1rios podem cuidar de algumas tarefas por enquanto.",
        u"Well, come on, stud! Straddle up and let\u2019s get breeding already!": u"Ent\u00e3o vem, garanh\u00e3o! Monta logo e vamos come\u00e7ar a cruzar!",
        u"Well, dear. You can save your objections for our wedding. Although, it won\u2019t really change much, haha.": u"Bem, querida. Pode guardar suas obje\u00e7\u00f5es para o nosso casamento. Embora isso n\u00e3o v\u00e1 mudar muita coisa, haha.",
        u"Well, dear\u2026 I\u2019m sure you remember how we tried this together before\u2026": u"Bem, querida\u2026 Tenho certeza de que se lembra de quando tentamos isso antes\u2026",
        u"Well, did any of those spark an interest for you? ": u"Bem, alguma dessas coisas despertou seu interesse? ",
        u"Well, do you like it?": u"Bem, voc\u00ea gostou?",
        u"Well, don\u2019t just stand there, join me! The water\u2019s fine!": u"Bem, n\u00e3o fique a\u00ed parado, venha comigo! A \u00e1gua est\u00e1 \u00f3tima!",
        u"Well, don\u2019t mind if I do some squats right over\u2026": u"Bem, espero que n\u00e3o se importe se eu fizer alguns agachamentos bem aqui\u2026",
        u"Well, don\u2019t mind if I join in~": u"Bem, espero que n\u00e3o se importe se eu participar~",
        u"Well, don\u2019t. We earned this trip. And the only things I really had to spend money on were the upgrades and extra amenities.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o se sinta. N\u00f3s merecemos esta viagem. E as \u00fanicas coisas em que realmente precisei gastar dinheiro foram os upgrades e comodidades extras.",
        u"Well, either way, I did plan to move in here at some point to get closer with you guys\u2026": u"Bem, de qualquer forma, eu planejava me mudar para c\u00e1 em algum momento para ficar mais pr\u00f3ximo de voc\u00eas\u2026",
        u"Well, having a child changed my life forever. I was striving for the perfect family and did my best to be an ideal father and husband.": u"Bem, ter uma filha mudou minha vida para sempre. Eu buscava a fam\u00edlia perfeita e fazia o poss\u00edvel para ser o pai e marido ideal.",
        u"Well, he was informed you weren\u2019t feeling well, but we left the rest out for now.": u"Bem, ele foi informado de que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava bem, mas deixamos o restante de fora por enquanto.",
        u"Well, how about we move around to warm up? All this lying around will just make you bored.": u"Bem, que tal nos mexermos para esquentar? Ficar deitado assim s\u00f3 vai deixar voc\u00ea entediado.",
        u"Well, how about you show me how much you really want it\u2026?": u"Bem, que tal me mostrar o quanto realmente quer\u2026?",
        u"Well, if that\u2019s the case, we\u2019ll be on our way, Jin.": u"Bem, nesse caso, vamos indo, Jin.",
        u"Well, if that\u2019s what\u2019ll make Gramps happy, then I guess\u2026": u"Bem, se \u00e9 isso que vai fazer o Vov\u00f4 feliz, ent\u00e3o acho que\u2026",
        u"Well, if we\u2019re talking about the superficial level, then yes! I love me some good porn!": u"Bem, se estamos falando do lado superficial, ent\u00e3o sim! Eu adoro um bom porn\u00f4!",
        u"Well, if you all insist\u2026 I\u2026 guess I could join\u2026": u"Bem, se todos insistem\u2026 Acho\u2026 que posso ir junto\u2026",
        u"Well, if you keep pointing it out like that, you\u2019re going to make me want to do it less.": u"Bem, se continuar chamando aten\u00e7\u00e3o para isso desse jeito, vai acabar me fazendo querer fazer menos.",
        u"Well, if you put it that way\u2026": u"Bem, se voc\u00ea coloca desse jeito\u2026",
        u"Well, if you really to want to give me a show, then start working out. ": u"Bem, se quer mesmo fazer um show para mim, ent\u00e3o comece a treinar. ",
        u"Well, if you really want to spend your day with me, why don\u2019t you help me out with my other chores? I just finished up here, anyways.": u"Bem, se realmente quer passar o dia comigo, por que n\u00e3o me ajuda com os outros afazeres? De qualquer forma, acabei de terminar aqui.",
        u"Well, if you\u2019d been paying attention to our lessons, you would know to bring the basics, such as your navigation tools, adequate food and water, a first-aid kit, and more!": u"Bem, se tivesse prestado aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s aulas, saberia que deve levar o b\u00e1sico, como instrumentos de navega\u00e7\u00e3o, comida e \u00e1gua suficientes, um kit de primeiros socorros e muito mais!",
        u"Well, if you\u2019re going to beg like that.": u"Bem, se vai implorar desse jeito.",
        u"Well, if you\u2019re gonna move back in, Dad, then I\u2019ll go tidy up the room for you!": u"Bem, se vai voltar para o seu quarto, Pai, ent\u00e3o vou arrum\u00e1-lo para voc\u00ea!",
        u"Well, isn\u2019t she, like, super rich? Like born-and-raised-rich? That was her whole shtick back then!": u"Bem, ela n\u00e3o \u00e9, tipo, super-rica? Rica de ber\u00e7o? Essa era toda a personalidade dela naquela \u00e9poca!",
        u"Well, it depends on how you use them~!": u"Bem, depende de como voc\u00ea os usa~!",
        u"Well, it did get everybody excited whenever it happened.": u"Bem, realmente deixava todo mundo animado sempre que acontecia.",
        u"Well, it doesn\u2019t have to be fancy. I\u2019d really like to take you somewhere new!": u"Bem, n\u00e3o precisa ser chique. Eu realmente gostaria de levar voc\u00ea a algum lugar novo!",
        u"Well, it is a really big change though\u2026": u"Bem, mas \u00e9 uma mudan\u00e7a bem grande\u2026",
        u"Well, it is your first day of retirement now officially! You\u2019re free to do whatever you want!": u"Bem, oficialmente hoje \u00e9 seu primeiro dia de aposentadoria! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 livre para fazer o que quiser!",
        u"Well, it looks like Yoshi, Lloyd, and Darius only have only one point left now, so they might lose!": u"Bem, parece que Yoshi, Lloyd e Darius s\u00f3 t\u00eam um ponto sobrando agora, ent\u00e3o podem perder!",
        u"Well, it seems that everyone has mutual feelings here after all! ": u"Bem, parece que no fim todos aqui compartilham do mesmo sentimento! ",
        u"Well, it sounds like everyone is settling in again, at least. ": u"Bem, pelo menos parece que todo mundo est\u00e1 voltando \u00e0 rotina. ",
        u"Well, it sounds like he\u2019s fully made up his mind! I won\u2019t try and convince you all any further!": u"Bem, parece que ele j\u00e1 tomou sua decis\u00e3o! N\u00e3o vou mais tentar convencer voc\u00eas!",
        u"Well, it sounds to me like you two had fun at least.": u"Bem, pelo menos parece que voc\u00eas duas se divertiram.",
        u"Well, it turns out that Dar felt the same way, and all we had to do was talk about it!": u"Bem, descobri que Dar sentia a mesma coisa, e tudo que precis\u00e1vamos fazer era conversar!",
        u"Well, it was only because I was with you, sir!": u"Bem, foi s\u00f3 porque eu estava com o senhor!",
        u"Well, it was only possible because of you.": u"Bem, isso s\u00f3 foi poss\u00edvel por sua causa.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s a good thing the bartender here knows their job. Especially if you guys managed to get drunk, hehe.": u"Bem, ainda bem que o bartender daqui sabe o que faz. Principalmente se conseguiu deixar voc\u00eas b\u00eabados, hehe.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s a good thing we have Jin around now! He actually stopped by to drop this fan off a little while ago.": u"Bem, ainda bem que temos Jin por perto agora! Ele passou aqui para deixar este ventilador h\u00e1 pouco tempo.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s a good thing you did, or else I wouldn\u2019t have been able to work on my checklist today.": u"Bem, ainda bem que fez isso, sen\u00e3o eu n\u00e3o conseguiria cuidar da minha lista de tarefas hoje.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s a good thing you had something semi-formal\u2026 You still look nice nonetheless! ": u"Bem, ainda bem que voc\u00ea tinha algo semiformal\u2026 Mesmo assim, est\u00e1 bonito! ",
        u"Well, it\u2019s all thanks to my assistant chef today! If it weren\u2019t for you helping me, I\u2019d probably be scrambling right now trying to get all this done.": u"Bem, tudo gra\u00e7as ao meu cozinheiro assistente de hoje! Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tivesse me ajudado, eu provavelmente estaria correndo agora para terminar tudo.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s been quite a while since we closed down, and nobody\u2019s used it since the scouts, right?": u"Bem, faz bastante tempo que fechamos, e ningu\u00e9m usa o lugar desde a partida dos escoteiros, certo?",
        u"Well, it\u2019s been so long since the last. And honestly, if it weren\u2019t for the heat, I don\u2019t think I\u2019d have been able to take it.": u"Bem, faz muito tempo desde a \u00faltima. E, sinceramente, se n\u00e3o fosse pelo calor, acho que eu n\u00e3o teria conseguido aguentar.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s far in the past, way before Camp Buddy was around.": u"Bem, isso ficou muito no passado, bem antes de o Camp Buddy existir.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s good to see you enjoying yourself at least. You\u2019ve been working nonstop at camp, and I\u2019m not talking about just on the project.": u"Bem, pelo menos \u00e9 bom ver voc\u00ea se divertindo. Tem trabalhado sem parar no acampamento, e n\u00e3o estou falando apenas do projeto.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s just the two of us here right now. How about I help you wash up for old times\u2019 sake?": u"Bem, agora estamos s\u00f3 n\u00f3s dois aqui. Que tal eu ajudar voc\u00ea a se lavar, pelos velhos tempos?",
        u"Well, it\u2019s my job to point out concerns, and I only commented on what I found on my inspection.": u"Bem, \u00e9 meu trabalho apontar problemas, e apenas comentei o que encontrei durante a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s nice you\u2019re taking good care of your health! I usually chop wood in the morning to wake my muscles up!": u"Bem, \u00e9 bom que esteja cuidando da sa\u00fade! Eu costumo cortar lenha pela manh\u00e3 para despertar os m\u00fasculos!",
        u"Well, it\u2019s no fun if we just stay in the room. Why don\u2019t we go and check out what else we could do here?": u"Bem, n\u00e3o ter\u00e1 gra\u00e7a se ficarmos apenas no quarto. Por que n\u00e3o vamos descobrir o que mais podemos fazer aqui?",
        u"Well, it\u2019s not exactly a bad thing. I understood that you were just thrilled to be at the camp.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o era exatamente algo ruim. Eu entendia que voc\u00ea estava apenas empolgado por estar no acampamento.",
        u"Well, it\u2019s not going to change unless you start\u2026 After all, we\u2019re equals, aren\u2019t we?": u"Bem, isso n\u00e3o vai mudar se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o come\u00e7ar\u2026 Afinal, somos iguais, n\u00e3o somos?",
        u"Well, it\u2019s not just for the badge! I saw Sir Goro chopping trees over there, and I thought I could help!": u"Bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 s\u00f3 pelo distintivo! Vi o Sr. Goro cortando \u00e1rvores ali e achei que poderia ajudar!",
        u"Well, it\u2019s not like I designed everything from scratch! I took most of the inspiration and even some plan layouts from the existing structures here!": u"Bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 como se eu tivesse projetado tudo do zero! Tirei a maior parte da inspira\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 algumas plantas das estruturas que j\u00e1 existem aqui!",
        u"Well, it\u2019s not that big of a deal\u2026 But yes, I\u2019ve never been able to fully shake off my negative mindset about my role here at Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9 nada t\u00e3o grave\u2026 Mas sim, nunca consegui me livrar completamente dos pensamentos negativos sobre meu papel aqui no Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"Well, just don\u2019t overthink it and enjoy the moment.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o pense demais e apenas aproveite o momento.",
        u"Well, just for some small talk! There\u2019s something I\u2019ve been meaning to tell your scoutmasters!": u"Bem, apenas para conversarmos um pouco! H\u00e1 algo que estou querendo contar aos seus chefes escoteiros!",
        u"Well, just take it easy, alright? What are you planning to work on anyway? ": u"Bem, pegue leve, certo? Que parte pretende treinar? ",
        u"Well, let me at least get you out of that suit and into something better for the party.": u"Bem, pelo menos deixe eu tirar voc\u00ea desse terno e colocar algo melhor para a festa.",
        u"Well, let\u2019s forget about her and figure out what we can still do around here for the day!": u"Bem, vamos esquecer dela e descobrir o que ainda podemos fazer por aqui hoje!",
        u"Well, let\u2019s get started doing something to get work off your mind! Check out this hotel brochure I got.": u"Bem, vamos come\u00e7ar fazendo alguma coisa para tirar o trabalho da sua cabe\u00e7a! Veja este folheto do hotel que peguei.",
        u"Well, let\u2019s give it a chance and take a closer look.": u"Bem, vamos dar uma chance a ele e examin\u00e1-lo melhor.",
        u"Well, let\u2019s have a toast then! To the whims of fate!": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o vamos brindar! Aos caprichos do destino!",
        u"Well, let\u2019s just hope nobody saw us.": u"Bem, vamos apenas torcer para que ningu\u00e9m tenha nos visto.",
        u"Well, let\u2019s just say the last batch really showed off the spirit of Camp Buddy.": u"Bem, digamos que o \u00faltimo grupo realmente mostrou o esp\u00edrito do Camp Buddy.",
        u"Well, let\u2019s talk somewhere else. Give me just a bit to get ready.": u"Bem, vamos conversar em outro lugar. S\u00f3 me d\u00ea um tempinho para me arrumar.",
        u"Well, look at you, Mr. Smooth-Talker! Keep complimenting my cooking like that, and I\u2019ll serve you today's special, if you catch my drift~": u"Ora, olhe s\u00f3 para voc\u00ea, senhor Galanteador! Continue elogiando a minha comida assim e servirei o especial do dia, se \u00e9 que me entende~",
        u"Well, luckily for me, the kitchen here had everything I needed to make it faster. It was my first time trying a food processor, mixer, and an oven!": u"Bem, para minha sorte, esta cozinha tinha tudo de que eu precisava para fazer mais r\u00e1pido. Foi a primeira vez que usei um processador, uma batedeira e um forno!",
        u"Well, maybe I could help out as well? I was planning to be more hands-on today anyway.  ": u"Bem, talvez eu tamb\u00e9m possa ajudar. De qualquer modo, eu pretendia participar mais ativamente hoje.",
        u"Well, maybe I should join you guys more often, then.": u"Bem, talvez eu devesse me juntar a voc\u00eas com mais frequ\u00eancia.",
        u"Well, maybe all of you shouldn\u2019t have been so rude, then none of this would\u2019ve happened.": u"Bem, talvez voc\u00eas n\u00e3o devessem ter sido t\u00e3o grosseiros, a\u00ed nada disso teria acontecido.",
        u"Well, maybe if you visit us here at least once a month?": u"Bem, talvez se voc\u00ea nos visitar aqui pelo menos uma vez por m\u00eas?",
        u"Well, maybe this time it\u2019ll be different!": u"Bem, talvez desta vez seja diferente!",
        u"Well, maybe we could get to know you instead? ": u"Bem, talvez n\u00f3s possamos conhecer voc\u00ea?",
        u"Well, maybe you can help me take it off~?": u"Bem, talvez voc\u00ea possa me ajudar a tirar~?",
        u"Well, my boss said that\u2019s the dress code around here~": u"Bem, meu chefe disse que esse \u00e9 o c\u00f3digo de vestimenta daqui~",
        u"Well, my driver just arrived! I hope to see you all again sometime soon, and hopefully for good news!": u"Bem, meu motorista acabou de chegar! Espero v\u00ea-los novamente em breve e, de prefer\u00eancia, com boas not\u00edcias!",
        u"Well, my homoscope sense is telling ya\u2019ll to hurry up and finish so we can eat!": u"Bem, meu sentido de hom\u00f3scopo est\u00e1 dizendo para voc\u00eas se apressarem e terminarem logo para podermos comer!",
        u"Well, not as frequently, dear. And it was usually for business appointments and not leisure dining like this.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o com tanta frequ\u00eancia, querida. E geralmente era em compromissos de neg\u00f3cios, n\u00e3o em jantares de lazer como este.",
        u"Well, not exactly\u2026 I was just ecstatic about all of the things we accomplished when I delivered that speech.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o exatamente\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 estava extasiado com tudo que conquistamos quando fiz aquele discurso.",
        u"Well, now that our judge has left the scene, you have to do it, Yoshi!": u"Bem, agora que nosso juiz saiu de cena, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que fazer isso, Yoshi!",
        u"Well, now that you're a scoutmaster just like me, I'm sure you could use a helping hand!": u"Bem, agora que voc\u00ea \u00e9 um chefe escoteiro como eu, tenho certeza de que uma m\u00e3ozinha seria bem-vinda!",
        u"Well, only her social media, really. And they\u2019re all set to private.": u"Bem, na verdade s\u00f3 vimos as redes sociais dela. E est\u00e3o todas privadas.",
        u"Well, only to make sure she\u2019s not going to get herself in trouble.": u"Bem, apenas para garantir que n\u00e3o arrume problemas.",
        u"Well, our sponsor brought us here for a team-building vacation.": u"Bem, nosso patrocinador nos trouxe aqui para umas f\u00e9rias de integra\u00e7\u00e3o da equipe.",
        u"Well, quit watching and join us then, Pipsqueak! ": u"Ent\u00e3o pare de assistir e venha brincar com a gente, Baixinho! ",
        u"Well, remember that blog that we\u2019ve been working on for the last couple of months?": u"Bem, lembram daquele blog em que estamos trabalhando h\u00e1 alguns meses?",
        u"Well, she asked for it. And I didn\u2019t have much of a choice, since I AM the camp counselor you know.": u"Bem, ela pediu. E eu n\u00e3o tinha muita escolha, j\u00e1 que EU SOU a conselheira do acampamento, sabe.",
        u"Well, she is a flat-out insufferable person.": u"Bem, ela \u00e9 simplesmente uma pessoa insuport\u00e1vel.",
        u"Well, should we get up then?": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o vamos levantar?",
        u"Well, since it\u2019s you two\u2019s last day in our cabin, we thought we should take the chance to send you off with a bang!": u"Bem, como este \u00e9 o \u00faltimo dia de voc\u00eas dois na nossa cabana, achamos que dever\u00edamos aproveitar para fazer uma despedida em grande estilo!",
        u"Well, since this trip was paid for, I had to use my honeymoon budget somewhere, right?": u"Bem, j\u00e1 que esta viagem foi paga, eu precisava gastar meu or\u00e7amento da lua de mel em alguma coisa, certo?",
        u"Well, since we\u2019re both dressed like this for fun, why don\u2019t we play the right kind of game~?": u"Bem, j\u00e1 que estamos vestidos assim por divers\u00e3o, por que n\u00e3o jogamos o tipo certo de jogo~?",
        u"Well, some of it\u2019s already been stored in here for a couple years now. I figured it was time to bring it all back inside.": u"Bem, parte disso j\u00e1 est\u00e1 guardada aqui h\u00e1 alguns anos. Achei que estava na hora de levar tudo de volta para dentro.",
        u"Well, sounds like we gotta find out ourselves!": u"Bem, parece que vamos ter que descobrir sozinhos!",
        u"Well, suit yourself~! It\u2019s gonna be a boys-only strip show then!": u"Bem, voc\u00ea que sabe~! Ent\u00e3o vai ser um show de strip s\u00f3 com os garotos!",
        u"Well, thankfully, Yoshinori was able to calm me down.": u"Bem, felizmente Yoshinori conseguiu me acalmar.",
        u"Well, thanks to all this cum, the ring just slides right off~!": u"Bem, gra\u00e7as a todo esse s\u00eamen, o anel simplesmente desliza para fora~!",
        u"Well, that did the trick~": u"Bem, isso resolveu~",
        u"Well, that is my job here after all~ And a counselor can only help if the person is willing to meet them halfway! ": u"Bem, afinal esse \u00e9 o meu trabalho aqui~ E uma conselheira s\u00f3 pode ajudar se a pessoa tamb\u00e9m estiver disposta a fazer sua parte! ",
        u"Well, that was kinda expected, knowing her\u2026 ": u"Bem, isso j\u00e1 era meio esperado, conhecendo ela\u2026 ",
        u"Well, that\u2019s a good start at least! If you keep it up, you\u2019ll be fit in no time!": u"Bem, pelo menos \u00e9 um bom come\u00e7o! Se continuar assim, vai ficar em forma rapidinho!",
        u"Well, that\u2019s a good way to look at it, sir!": u"Bem, essa \u00e9 uma boa maneira de encarar a situa\u00e7\u00e3o, senhor!",
        u"Well, that\u2019s how it\u2019s supposed to be. Just enjoy the moment.": u"Bem, \u00e9 assim que deve ser. Apenas aproveite o momento.",
        u"Well, that\u2019s something you don\u2019t hear about every day. Aren\u2019t you guys too old to be in a summer camp?": u"Bem, isso n\u00e3o se ouve todos os dias. Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o s\u00e3o velhos demais para estar num acampamento de ver\u00e3o?",
        u"Well, that\u2019s why Dar is around! He works wonders when it comes to construction!": u"Bem, \u00e9 por isso que o Dar est\u00e1 aqui! Ele faz maravilhas quando o assunto \u00e9 constru\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Well, that\u2019s why I had you in a hot bath and sauna in the first place. ": u"Bem, foi por isso que coloquei voc\u00ea num banho quente e numa sauna desde o come\u00e7o. ",
        u"Well, the handbook did say that one of the best spots for camping is in a nice, flat grassy area! ": u"Bem, o manual dizia que um dos melhores lugares para acampar \u00e9 uma \u00e1rea gramada, plana e agrad\u00e1vel! ",
        u"Well, the holidays are just around the corner, so work must be slow for him right now.": u"Bem, as festas de fim de ano est\u00e3o logo a\u00ed, ent\u00e3o o trabalho dele deve estar mais tranquilo agora.",
        u"Well, the one chance we had to do that was last night.": u"Bem, a \u00fanica oportunidade que tivemos foi ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Well, the original suit Yuri gave me had more pieces, but I figured this was more my style.": u"Bem, a roupa original que Yuri me deu tinha mais pe\u00e7as, mas achei que assim combinava mais comigo.",
        u"Well, the room can fit one more~ Think you can handle three guys at the same time, Jin?": u"Bem, cabe mais um no quarto~ Acha que consegue dar conta de tr\u00eas caras ao mesmo tempo, Jin?",
        u"Well, there definitely was some choking.": u"Bem, definitivamente teve algu\u00e9m engasgando.",
        u"Well, there's no way I'll let you lift all these crates by yourself. You could get hurt!": u"Bem, de jeito nenhum vou deixar voc\u00ea carregar todas essas caixas sozinha. Voc\u00ea pode se machucar!",
        u"Well, there\u2019s no taming this stallion! ": u"Bem, n\u00e3o tem como domar este garanh\u00e3o! ",
        u"Well, there\u2019s not too much of that left! It\u2019ll only take a few more months until we\u2019re completely done!": u"Bem, n\u00e3o falta tanto assim! S\u00f3 mais alguns meses at\u00e9 terminarmos completamente!",
        u"Well, this is Emilia we\u2019re talking about, Yoshi. Everyone knows how she was in the past.": u"Bem, estamos falando de Emilia, Yoshi. Todos sabem como ela era no passado.",
        u"Well, this is the first time Sir Goro has gone on a trip with us in a while, and I just want to make sure he has a great time!": u"Bem, esta \u00e9 a primeira vez em muito tempo que o Sr. Goro viaja conosco, e s\u00f3 quero garantir que ele se divirta bastante!",
        u"Well, this morning, the workers and I set up cameras around the camp based on Yuri\u2019s recommendations.": u"Bem, esta manh\u00e3, eu e os trabalhadores instalamos c\u00e2meras pelo acampamento seguindo as recomenda\u00e7\u00f5es da Yuri.",
        u"Well, throughout the previous months I received separate reports from our inspector.": u"Bem, ao longo dos \u00faltimos meses recebi relat\u00f3rios separados de nossa inspetora.",
        u"Well, time moves slower when I\u2019m not seeing you guys, after all!": u"Bem, o tempo passa mais devagar quando n\u00e3o vejo voc\u00eas!",
        u"Well, today\u2019s your lucky day, Yoichi~! Aiden cooked up something special for dinner!": u"Bem, hoje \u00e9 o seu dia de sorte, Yoichi~! O Aiden preparou algo especial para o jantar!",
        u"Well, too bad. We don\u2019t have any\u2014": u"Bem, que pena. N\u00e3o temos nenhum\u2014",
        u"Well, too bad\u2026 I just can\u2019t get enough of you\u2026 *kisses Yoshinori\u2019s neck*": u"Bem, azar\u2026 Eu simplesmente n\u00e3o me canso de voc\u00ea\u2026 *beija o pesco\u00e7o de Yoshinori*",
        u"Well, want me to teach you?": u"Bem, quer que eu ensine?",
        u"Well, we all thought about it over the last few months, after we realized that staying was a possibility. ": u"Bem, todos pensamos nisso nos \u00faltimos meses, depois que percebemos que ficar aqui era uma possibilidade. ",
        u"Well, we all wanna give that inspector a better impression today, like Gramps said last night.": u"Bem, todos queremos causar uma impress\u00e3o melhor na inspetora hoje, como o vov\u00f4 disse ontem \u00e0 noite.",
        u"Well, we brought the scouts back home and I thought it would be a good idea to do a grocery run on the way back.": u"Bem, levamos os escoteiros de volta para casa e achei que seria uma boa ideia passar no mercado no caminho de volta.",
        u"Well, we can always go out again someday when we finish the project.": u"Bem, sempre podemos viajar de novo algum dia quando terminarmos o projeto.",
        u"Well, we can still make things fun even when we\u2019re cooped up indoors.": u"Bem, ainda podemos nos divertir mesmo presos aqui dentro.",
        u"Well, we don\u2019t have a choice. Mr. Clermont handpicked her for the position.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o temos escolha. O Sr. Clermont a escolheu pessoalmente para o cargo.",
        u"Well, we don\u2019t have any of her information in our records other than her scout application.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o temos nenhuma informa\u00e7\u00e3o dela em nossos registros al\u00e9m da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o como escoteira.",
        u"Well, we don\u2019t have any of her information in our records other than her scout application. And we just assumed that she was credible since she was put here by Mr. Clermont.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o temos nenhuma informa\u00e7\u00e3o dela em nossos registros al\u00e9m da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o como escoteira. E simplesmente presumimos que fosse confi\u00e1vel, j\u00e1 que foi colocada aqui pelo Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Well, we don\u2019t mind sharing a room with Aiden. Right, Dar?": u"Bem, n\u00e3o nos importamos de dividir o quarto com Aiden. Certo, Dar?",
        u"Well, we don\u2019t mind sharing a room with Jin. Right, Dar?": u"Bem, n\u00e3o nos importamos de dividir um quarto com Jin. N\u00e3o \u00e9, Dar?",
        u"Well, we figured we\u2019d give our new inspector a better impression today.": u"Bem, achamos melhor causar uma impress\u00e3o melhor na nossa nova inspetora hoje.",
        u"Well, we had to go our different paths after the first term. That\u2019s just the way it worked out.": u"Bem, tivemos que seguir caminhos diferentes depois da primeira temporada. Foi assim que as coisas aconteceram.",
        u"Well, we have room for one more, sir!": u"Bem, temos espa\u00e7o para mais um, senhor!",
        u"Well, we just saw Mr. Clermont leave so we figured we could get some stuff out of the room now.": u"Bem, acabamos de ver o Sr. Clermont indo embora, ent\u00e3o pensamos que j\u00e1 poder\u00edamos tirar algumas coisas do quarto.",
        u"Well, we really pushed his body to the limit.": u"Bem, realmente levamos o corpo dele ao limite.",
        u"Well, we won\u2019t know til\u2019 we try! Let\u2019s get this contest started \u2013 your dick versus my ass!": u"Bem, s\u00f3 vamos saber tentando! Vamos come\u00e7ar essa disputa \u2013 seu pau contra minha bunda!",
        u"Well, we won\u2019t know until we try!": u"Bem, s\u00f3 saberemos se experimentarmos!",
        u"Well, we would be here all day if we discussed each and every bullet.": u"Bem, ficar\u00edamos aqui o dia inteiro se discut\u00edssemos cada um dos t\u00f3picos.",
        u"Well, well, well! It looks like we\u2019ve got a new couple here at camp!": u"Ora, ora, ora! Parece que temos um novo casal no acampamento!",
        u"Well, well\u2026 Looks like someone\u2019s on the naughty list this year.": u"Ora, ora\u2026 Parece que algu\u00e9m entrou para a lista dos malcriados este ano.",
        u"Well, we\u2019ll see. I\u2019m not sure how often I\u2019ll be in the area.": u"Bem, veremos. N\u00e3o sei com que frequ\u00eancia estarei por aqui.",
        u"Well, we\u2019re already here! It won\u2019t hurt to try at least one of them, right?": u"Bem, j\u00e1 estamos aqui! N\u00e3o custa experimentar pelo menos um deles, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Well, we\u2019re here now. What do you want?": u"Bem, estamos aqui agora. O que voc\u00ea quer?",
        u"Well, we\u2019re not going to use that PC anymore. I think using it would cause more headaches instead.": u"Bem, n\u00e3o usaremos mais aquele computador. Acho que us\u00e1-lo s\u00f3 causaria mais dores de cabe\u00e7a.",
        u"Well, we\u2019re planning to help with the work.": u"Bem, estamos planejando ajudar no trabalho.",
        u"Well, we\u2019ve stumbled on a little problem\u2026 The storm from before destroyed some of the raw materials that weren\u2019t properly stored\u2026": u"Bem, encontramos um pequeno problema\u2026 A tempestade destruiu alguns dos materiais que n\u00e3o estavam armazenados corretamente\u2026",
        u"Well, what are you waiting for? Let\u2019s ride!": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que est\u00e1 esperando? Vamos dar uma volta!",
        u"Well, what are you waiting for? Let\u2019s ride!{fast}": u"Ent\u00e3o, o que est\u00e1 esperando? Vamos dar uma volta!{fast}",
        u"Well, what matters is that you\u2019re home now. Everyone was quite worried about you.": u"Bem, o que importa \u00e9 que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 em casa agora. Todos ficaram muito preocupados com voc\u00ea.",
        u"Well, what part are you planning to work on?": u"Bem, que parte pretende treinar?",
        u"Well, what part are you planning to work on?{fast}": u"Bem, que parte pretende treinar?{fast}",
        u"Well, what\u2019s stopping you from going back to it now?": u"Bem, o que est\u00e1 impedindo voc\u00ea de voltar a isso agora?",
        u"Well, why don\u2019t we give you a huge serving then?": u"Bem, ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o damos uma por\u00e7\u00e3o enorme para voc\u00ea?",
        u"Well, why don\u2019t we go and try something out? Take a look at this brochure.": u"Bem, por que n\u00e3o sa\u00edmos e experimentamos alguma coisa? D\u00ea uma olhada neste folheto.",
        u"Well, why don\u2019t you two head to the showers. You look like you could both use one.": u"Bem, por que voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o v\u00e3o tomar banho? Parece que est\u00e3o precisando.",
        u"Well, with twice as many enrollees, let\u2019s see if you can handle all that \u2018youthful energy\u2019 haha!": u"Bem, com o dobro de inscritos, vamos ver se voc\u00ea aguenta toda essa \u2018energia juvenil\u2019, haha!",
        u"Well, you all might want to eat up before it melts.": u"Bem, \u00e9 melhor voc\u00eas comerem antes que derreta.",
        u"Well, you came to the right place~! Come and sit here with me~": u"Bem, voc\u00eas vieram ao lugar certo~! Venham sentar aqui comigo~",
        u"Well, you can borrow it if you want~ ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea pode peg\u00e1-lo emprestado se quiser~ ",
        u"Well, you can have \\\u201cthese buns\u201d\\ for any meal you want~": u"Bem, voc\u00ea pode comer \\\u201cestes p\u00e3ezinhos\u201d\\ em qualquer refei\u00e7\u00e3o que quiser~",
        u"Well, you can have some fish if you want something lighter. Here, how about I narrow it down for you.": u"Bem, pode comer peixe se quiser algo mais leve. Aqui, que tal eu reduzir as op\u00e7\u00f5es para voc\u00ea?",
        u"Well, you can leave all the work to me, dear! I\u2019m a scoutmaster now, and your job as a scout is to have fun and learn as much as you can!": u"Bem, pode deixar todo o trabalho comigo, querida! Agora sou chefe escoteiro, e seu dever como escoteira \u00e9 se divertir e aprender o m\u00e1ximo que puder!",
        u"Well, you can make up for it faster than you think. Honestly, I feel so different from who I was half a year ago\u2026": u"Bem, voc\u00ea pode compensar tudo mais r\u00e1pido do que imagina. Sinceramente, me sinto t\u00e3o diferente de quem eu era h\u00e1 meio ano\u2026",
        u"Well, you could all be really popular with your unique personalities\u2026": u"Bem, todos voc\u00eas poderiam ficar muito populares com essas personalidades \u00fanicas\u2026",
        u"Well, you could call him Goro too, if you wanted. ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m poderia cham\u00e1-lo de Goro, se quisesse. ",
        u"Well, you did manage to flash an entire club last night, you know\u2026 ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea conseguiu mostrar tudo para uma boate inteira ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026 ",
        u"Well, you didn\u2019t ask.": u"Bem, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o perguntou.",
        u"Well, you guys go ahead! Aiden and I have to go bring everyone their suits!": u"Bem, voc\u00eas podem ir na frente! Eu e Aiden precisamos levar os trajes de todo mundo!",
        u"Well, you have been taking me out on a lot of road trips ever since we got engaged!": u"Bem, voc\u00ea tem me levado para muitas viagens de moto desde que ficamos noivos!",
        u"Well, you have been wearing suits lately thanks to all those meetings we attended together, but this is different. ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea tem usado ternos ultimamente por causa de todas aquelas reuni\u00f5es que frequentamos juntos, mas isto \u00e9 diferente. ",
        u"Well, you just look at someone\u2019s hand like this and analyze specific creases!": u"Bem, voc\u00ea olha a m\u00e3o de algu\u00e9m assim e analisa algumas linhas espec\u00edficas!",
        u"Well, you know I always support your interests, Yuri. As long as you don\u2019t get over-excited about them and faint.": u"Bem, voc\u00ea sabe que sempre apoio seus interesses, Yuri. Desde que n\u00e3o fique empolgada demais e desmaie.",
        u"Well, you know me, I\u2019m not used to being so vulnerable like that\u2026": u"Bem, voc\u00ea me conhece, eu n\u00e3o estou acostumado a ficar t\u00e3o vulner\u00e1vel assim\u2026",
        u"Well, you lame-o\u2019s know how to ruin the mood!": u"Bem, voc\u00eas, seus sem-gra\u00e7a, sabem mesmo como acabar com o clima!",
        u"Well, you were always so much better at it than I was. ": u"Bem, voc\u00ea sempre foi muito melhor nisso do que eu. ",
        u"Well, your fantasy\u2019s about to get even better \u2019cause the breeding stud is here!": u"Bem, sua fantasia est\u00e1 prestes a ficar ainda melhor, porque o garanh\u00e3o chegou!",
        u"Well, your five minutes are up and we\u2019re all ready, so let\u2019s goooooo!": u"Bem, seus cinco minutos acabaram e estamos todos prontos, ent\u00e3o vamooooos!",
        u"Well, you\u2019re already doing that, Aiden! But this time around, you'll get to help with something much bigger out there!": u"Bem, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 faz isso, Aiden! Mas desta vez ter\u00e1 a chance de contribuir com algo muito maior l\u00e1 fora!",
        u"Well, you\u2019re always distracting me with yours, so I figured I should return the favor.": u"Bem, voc\u00ea sempre me distrai com o seu, ent\u00e3o achei que deveria retribuir o favor.",
        u"Well, you\u2019re going to have to beg harder if you want me that badly.": u"Bem, vai ter que implorar com mais vontade se me quer tanto assim.",
        u"Well, you\u2019re not holding the axe the right way. Here, let me show you.": u"Bem, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 segurando o machado do jeito certo. Aqui, deixe-me mostrar.",
        u"Well, you\u2019re not wrong, I was quite the sniveller during my stay here as a scout. But that\u2019s so long ago.": u"Bem, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 errado. Eu reclamava bastante durante minha estadia como escoteira. Mas isso foi h\u00e1 muito tempo.",
        u"Well, you\u2019ve already worked hard, even on your first day! I think you deserve to loosen up a little!": u"Bem, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 trabalhou muito, mesmo sendo seu primeiro dia! Acho que merece relaxar um pouco!",
        u"Well.. You never know what\u2019s going on behind the scenes in people\u2019s lives, so it\u2019s best to give them the benefit of the doubt\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Nunca sabemos o que est\u00e1 acontecendo nos bastidores da vida das pessoas, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor dar a elas o benef\u00edcio da d\u00favida\u2026",
        u"Well... We never know what\u2019s going on behind the scenes in people\u2019s lives, so it\u2019s best to give them the benefit of the doubt\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Nunca sabemos o que acontece nos bastidores da vida das pessoas, ent\u00e3o \u00e9 melhor dar a elas o benef\u00edcio da d\u00favida\u2026",
        u"Well? Didn\u2019t I tell you I was ready to get off?": u"E ent\u00e3o? Eu n\u00e3o disse que estava pronto para gozar?",
        u"Well? I\u2019m waiting.": u"E ent\u00e3o? Estou esperando.",
        u"Well?! Not even one compliment? I didn\u2019t put on a lovely dress just to be ignored!": u"E ent\u00e3o?! Nem um elogio? Eu n\u00e3o coloquei um vestido lindo para ser ignorada!",
        u"Well\u2026": u"Bem\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 Alright": u"Bem\u2026 Tudo bem.",
        u"Well\u2026 Emilia was clear today about wanting to come clean. I just didn\u2019t expect it to be this early.": u"Bem\u2026 Emilia deixou claro hoje que queria contar a verdade. S\u00f3 n\u00e3o esperava que fosse t\u00e3o cedo.",
        u"Well\u2026 Goodbye, Yoshi.": u"Bem\u2026 Adeus, Yoshi.",
        u"Well\u2026 He was actually looking for Sir Goro. He said that he couldn\u2019t contact him this morning\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Na verdade, ele estava procurando o Sr. Goro. Disse que n\u00e3o conseguiu entrar em contato com ele esta manh\u00e3\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 I am\u2026 but I\u2019m also sad that I\u2019ll be leaving\u2026 you know, same old, same old.": u"Bem\u2026 estou\u2026 mas tamb\u00e9m fico triste por ter que ir embora\u2026 sabe, a mesma hist\u00f3ria de sempre.",
        u"Well\u2026 I do all those things because it makes me happy to help everyone out, but it\u2019s also what I\u2019ve always been used to growing up.": u"Bem\u2026 Fa\u00e7o tudo isso porque ajudar todos me deixa feliz, mas tamb\u00e9m foi assim que me acostumei a viver enquanto crescia.",
        u"Well\u2026 I do believe everything happens for a reason.": u"Bem\u2026 Eu realmente acredito que tudo acontece por uma raz\u00e3o.",
        u"Well\u2026 I don\u2019t know the whole story from your point of view.": u"Bem\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o conhe\u00e7o toda a hist\u00f3ria do seu ponto de vista.",
        u"Well\u2026 I don\u2019t think it has to do with the inspection, to be honest\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Sinceramente, acho que n\u00e3o tem rela\u00e7\u00e3o com a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 I guess it\u2019s mostly because I\u2019ve been far less busy now that we\u2019re in the off-season.": u"Bem\u2026 Acho que \u00e9 principalmente porque tenho estado muito menos ocupado agora que estamos na baixa temporada.",
        u"Well\u2026 I had just as much fun with everyone\u2026 Watching you all slowly get drunk was rather\u2026 interesting.": u"Bem\u2026 Eu me diverti tanto quanto todos voc\u00eas\u2026 Ver todo mundo ficando b\u00eabado aos poucos foi bem\u2026 interessante.",
        u"Well\u2026 I just don\u2019t wanna be a burden to you, you know?": u"Bem\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 n\u00e3o quero ser um fardo para voc\u00ea, sabe?",
        u"Well\u2026 I just really hope I can help you with this project, sir.": u"Bem\u2026 Eu realmente espero conseguir ajud\u00e1-lo neste projeto, senhor.",
        u"Well\u2026 I just wanted to check up on both of you, especially you, Dad\u2026! ": u"Bem\u2026 Eu s\u00f3 queria ver como voc\u00eas dois estavam, principalmente voc\u00ea, pai\u2026! ",
        u"Well\u2026 I promised you that I\u2019d take you on an actual date once everything settled down, remember?": u"Bem\u2026 Eu prometi que levaria voc\u00ea para um encontro de verdade quando tudo se acalmasse, lembra?",
        u"Well\u2026 I still am serious about completing the project at least. ": u"Bem\u2026 Pelo menos ainda pretendo concluir o projeto. ",
        u"Well\u2026 I want us to enjoy this project, sir.": u"Bem\u2026 Quero que a gente aproveite este projeto, senhor.",
        u"Well\u2026 If you have a daughter, you have no choice but to learn at some point in your life\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Quando se tem uma filha, em algum momento da vida voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem escolha a n\u00e3o ser aprender\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 If you\u2019re really going now, just don\u2019t forget to call me, alright?": u"Bem\u2026 Se voc\u00ea realmente vai partir agora, s\u00f3 n\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a de me ligar, certo?",
        u"Well\u2026 It was only when I got the job here that I found out that you lost your dad\u2026 ": u"Bem\u2026 Foi s\u00f3 quando consegui o emprego aqui que descobri que voc\u00ea perdeu seu pai\u2026 ",
        u"Well\u2026 It was only when I got the job here that I found out you lost your dad\u2026 ": u"Bem\u2026 S\u00f3 quando consegui o emprego aqui descobri que voc\u00ea tinha perdido seu pai\u2026 ",
        u"Well\u2026 It\u2019s about you and Gramps.": u"Bem\u2026 \u00c9 sobre voc\u00ea e o Vov\u00f4.",
        u"Well\u2026 It\u2019s been okay. For the most part.": u"Bem\u2026 Tem sido tudo bem. Na maior parte.",
        u"Well\u2026 It\u2019s hard to think otherwise seeing you stressed out like this even though we\u2019re on vacation.": u"Bem\u2026 \u00c9 dif\u00edcil pensar o contr\u00e1rio vendo voc\u00ea t\u00e3o estressada assim, mesmo estando de f\u00e9rias.",
        u"Well\u2026 It\u2019s kinda confidential\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 \u00c9 meio confidencial\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 I\u2019d really like that. I know Dad wouldn\u2019t mind.": u"Bem\u2026 Eu gostaria muito. Sei que o papai n\u00e3o se importaria.",
        u"Well\u2026 I\u2019m so overwhelmed with school\u2026 I haven\u2019t made any friends here\u2026 and it\u2019s so hard to be alone\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Estou t\u00e3o sobrecarregado com a escola\u2026 N\u00e3o fiz nenhum amigo aqui\u2026 e \u00e9 t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil ficar sozinho\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 Last night, I came in to grab a drink, and the bartender convinced me I could join in with the other entertainers!": u"Bem\u2026 Ontem \u00e0 noite, vim tomar uma bebida, e o bartender me convenceu de que eu podia me juntar aos outros artistas!",
        u"Well\u2026 Me and the others have been talking\u2026 ": u"Bem\u2026 Eu e os outros estivemos conversando\u2026 ",
        u"Well\u2026 Mr. Clermont expected that, so he made provisions for us.": u"Bem\u2026 O Sr. Clermont previu isso, ent\u00e3o providenciou tudo para n\u00f3s.",
        u"Well\u2026 She was just telling me everything that happened while we were gone.": u"Bem\u2026 Ela estava me contando tudo o que aconteceu enquanto est\u00e1vamos fora.",
        u"Well\u2026 The funny thing is I used to try when I was younger, but as soon as Dad and I found out that we both enjoyed camping, I shifted my focus.": u"Bem\u2026 O engra\u00e7ado \u00e9 que eu tentava quando era mais nova, mas assim que eu e o Pai descobrimos que ambos gost\u00e1vamos de acampar, mudei meu foco.",
        u"Well\u2026 The news did say we\u2019d have clear weather for the next few days. Maybe we can work, as long as we\u2019re careful?": u"Bem\u2026 As not\u00edcias disseram que teremos tempo aberto nos pr\u00f3ximos dias. Talvez possamos trabalhar, desde que tenhamos cuidado?",
        u"Well\u2026 There\u2019s a lot of things to consider besides just the money, after all\u2026": u"Bem\u2026 Afinal, h\u00e1 muitas coisas a considerar al\u00e9m do dinheiro\u2026",
        u"Well\u2026 We can only give her so many chances. It\u2019s just not going to work if she keeps refusing to get along.": u"Bem\u2026 S\u00f3 podemos dar a ela um certo n\u00famero de chances. Simplesmente n\u00e3o vai funcionar se ela continuar se recusando a cooperar.",
        u"Well\u2026 What if we let her stay?": u"Bem\u2026 E se deixarmos ela ficar?",
        u"Well\u2026 You kinda made a scene when you stripped in front of everyone at the club\u2026 ": u"Bem\u2026 Voc\u00ea meio que fez uma cena quando tirou a roupa na frente de todo mundo na boate\u2026 ",
        u"Well\u2026 You were by yourself over here, so I thought you might want to join our group for the activity!": u"Bem\u2026 Voc\u00ea estava sozinha aqui, ent\u00e3o pensei que talvez quisesse participar da atividade com nosso grupo!",
        u"Well\u2026 alright. But listen up, \u2019cause I\u2019m only telling you once.": u"Bem\u2026 certo. Mas preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o, porque s\u00f3 vou contar uma vez.",
        u"Well\u2026 back then, Sir Goro was our scoutmaster, and we were the ones having a great summer at camp.": u"Bem\u2026 Naquela \u00e9poca, o senhor Goro era o nosso chefe escoteiro, e \u00e9ramos n\u00f3s que aproveit\u00e1vamos um ver\u00e3o maravilhoso no acampamento.",
        u"Well\u2026 have you tried the\u2026 you know\u2026 ol\u2019 reliable sausage fight?": u"Bem\u2026 j\u00e1 tentou a\u2026 voc\u00ea sabe\u2026 velha e confi\u00e1vel luta de lingui\u00e7as?",
        u"Well\u2026 let\u2019s try not to get carried away by her antics. On the bright side, we have an extra day here to relax.": u"Bem\u2026 vamos tentar n\u00e3o nos deixar levar pelas palha\u00e7adas dela. Pelo lado bom, temos mais um dia aqui para relaxar.",
        u"Well\u2026 most of them are common sense, but yeah, some rules are a little more nuanced, the fancier the place is.": u"Bem\u2026 a maioria \u00e9 quest\u00e3o de bom senso, mas sim, algumas regras t\u00eam mais nuances quanto mais sofisticado \u00e9 o lugar.",
        u"Well\u2026 sure, I won\u2019t say no to that! Take me, take me!": u"Bem\u2026 claro, n\u00e3o vou recusar! Leve-me, leve-me!",
        u"Well\u2026 when everyone left after the first term, my only goal was helping Dad run the camps. And I had to relocate to handle one of the other branches.": u"Bem\u2026 quando todos foram embora depois da primeira temporada, meu \u00fanico objetivo era ajudar o Pai a administrar os acampamentos. E precisei me mudar para cuidar de uma das outras unidades.",
        u"Welp! If that\u2019s all we\u2019re getting, then I guess I\u2019ll go ahead and do my night routines \u2013 we\u2019ve spent enough time chit-chatting!": u"Bem! Se isso \u00e9 tudo que vamos conseguir, acho que vou fazer minha rotina noturna \u2014 j\u00e1 passamos tempo suficiente batendo papo!",
        u"Were there only a few scouts last term?": u"Havia poucos escoteiros na temporada passada?",
        u"Were you talking about me, Lloyd?": u"Estavam falando de mim, Lloyd?",
        u"Weren\u2019t you such the go-getter back then? Since that was how you and I ended up as acquaintances!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o era t\u00e3o determinado naquela \u00e9poca? Foi assim que n\u00f3s dois acabamos nos conhecendo!",
        u"We\u2019d be a lot faster if we had a snowplow, though. ": u"Ser\u00edamos muito mais r\u00e1pidos se tiv\u00e9ssemos um limpa-neve. ",
        u"We\u2019d have understood if you had just told us the truth\u2026!": u"N\u00f3s ter\u00edamos entendido se voc\u00ea simplesmente tivesse contado a verdade\u2026!",
        u"We\u2019d rather do something rougher together.": u"Preferimos fazer algo mais intenso juntos.",
        u"We\u2019d rather do something that doesn\u2019t take too long.": u"Preferimos fazer algo que n\u00e3o demore muito.",
        u"We\u2019d rather do something that makes us sweat!": u"Preferimos fazer algo que nos fa\u00e7a suar!",
        u"We\u2019ll also be building an events hall, an infirmary, and some guest lodging along the lake.": u"Tamb\u00e9m construiremos um sal\u00e3o de eventos, uma enfermaria e alguns alojamentos para h\u00f3spedes \u00e0 beira do lago.",
        u"We\u2019ll be here all day~! Now come on, let\u2019s work up a sweat! ": u"Ficaremos aqui o dia inteiro~! Agora vamos suar um pouco! ",
        u"We\u2019ll both be like headless chickens, haha!": u"N\u00f3s dois vamos ficar mais perdidos que cegos em tiroteio, haha!",
        u"We\u2019ll cook our favorite dish\u2026 Eat together like a family\u2026 Like we used to, Aiden\u2026": u"Vamos preparar nosso prato favorito\u2026 Comer juntos como uma fam\u00edlia\u2026 Como faz\u00edamos antes, Aiden\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ll do better next time.": u"Faremos melhor da pr\u00f3xima vez.",
        u"We\u2019ll do whatever we want\u2026 We have all day\u2026": u"Vamos fazer tudo o que quisermos\u2026 Temos o dia inteiro\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ll do whatever\u2019s best for the camp.": u"Faremos o que for melhor para o acampamento.",
        u"We\u2019ll get to eat great food though! Aren\u2019t you excited about that?": u"Mas vamos poder comer comida \u00f3tima! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 animado com isso?",
        u"We\u2019ll go ahead, you guys!": u"A gente vai na frente, pessoal!",
        u"We\u2019ll go ahead, you two! Sorry to cut our conversation short! ": u"N\u00f3s vamos na frente! Desculpem encerrar nossa conversa t\u00e3o cedo! ",
        u"We\u2019ll have to work hard to make sure everything is ready by then, so I\u2019ll be expecting you all to be prepared for what\u2019s to come.": u"Teremos que trabalhar muito para garantir que tudo esteja pronto at\u00e9 l\u00e1, ent\u00e3o espero que todos estejam preparados para o que est\u00e1 por vir.",
        u"We\u2019ll head back to the site and put these in temporary storage while there\u2019s still daylight!": u"Vamos voltar para a obra e colocar isso no armazenamento tempor\u00e1rio enquanto ainda h\u00e1 luz do dia!",
        u"We\u2019ll just watch.": u"Vamos s\u00f3 assistir.",
        u"We\u2019ll keep that in mind, sir.": u"Vamos nos lembrar disso, senhor.",
        u"We\u2019ll keep updating you as usual if there are any issues in our department, sir.": u"Continuaremos mantendo o senhor informado, como sempre, caso haja algum problema em nosso departamento.",
        u"We\u2019ll leave as soon as you get changed.": u"Partiremos assim que voc\u00ea se trocar.",
        u"We\u2019ll let\u2019s see if it tastes as good as it looks.": u"Bem, vamos ver se o sabor \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom quanto a apar\u00eancia.",
        u"We\u2019ll make sure everything is taken care of for the next summer term on the admin side.": u"Vamos garantir que toda a parte administrativa esteja pronta para a pr\u00f3xima temporada de ver\u00e3o.",
        u"We\u2019ll make sure to work on that right away.": u"Cuidaremos disso imediatamente.",
        u"We\u2019ll really miss you guys! Boo hoo!": u"Vamos sentir muita falta de voc\u00eas! Bu\u00e1\u00e1!",
        u"We\u2019ll set a daily schedule and send off teams by their specialty until all the required workforce has been fully mobilized at the camp.": u"Estabeleceremos um cronograma di\u00e1rio e enviaremos equipes por especialidade at\u00e9 que toda a m\u00e3o de obra necess\u00e1ria esteja mobilizada no acampamento.",
        u"We\u2019ll start preparing the site first thing tomorrow. Our aim is to clear out the land of trees and debris, level the ground, then move all the building materials there by the end of this week.": u"Come\u00e7aremos a preparar o terreno logo cedo amanh\u00e3. Nosso objetivo \u00e9 retirar as \u00e1rvores e os detritos, nivelar o solo e levar todos os materiais de constru\u00e7\u00e3o para l\u00e1 at\u00e9 o fim desta semana.",
        u"We\u2019ll take it from here.": u"N\u00f3s cuidamos daqui.",
        u"We\u2019ll take the room.": u"Vamos ficar com a sala.",
        u"We\u2019ll try our best to meet your expectations.": u"Faremos o poss\u00edvel para atender \u00e0s suas expectativas.",
        u"We\u2019re actually chronicling the memories going all the way back to my term as a scout to post on there!": u"Na verdade, estamos registrando lembran\u00e7as desde a minha temporada como escoteiro para publicar l\u00e1!",
        u"We\u2019re all different, so your dynamic with him has its own style!": u"Todos somos diferentes, ent\u00e3o a din\u00e2mica de voc\u00eas tem seu pr\u00f3prio estilo!",
        u"We\u2019re all going to miss Aiden\u2019s cooking.": u"Todos n\u00f3s vamos sentir falta da comida do Aiden.",
        u"We\u2019re all here to help\u2026 I\u2019m here to help\u2026": u"Estamos todos aqui para ajudar\u2026 Eu estou aqui para ajudar\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re all men here. There\u2019s nothing to be embarrassed about.": u"Somos todos homens aqui. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 motivo para vergonha.",
        u"We\u2019re all only human, Aiden. We\u2019re allowed to have bad days every now and then; and it had been eating at you for so long, of course you lost control.": u"Somos todos humanos, Aiden. Podemos ter dias ruins de vez em quando; e aquilo estava te consumindo h\u00e1 tanto tempo que \u00e9 claro que voc\u00ea acabou perdendo o controle.",
        u"We\u2019re almost to the bed, Yoshinori.": u"Estamos quase chegando \u00e0 cama, Yoshinori.",
        u"We\u2019re already doing you a favor by trying to deflect each of your attempts to spoil this amazing night for us.": u"J\u00e1 estamos fazendo um favor a voc\u00ea ao tentar desviar cada uma das suas tentativas de estragar esta noite incr\u00edvel para n\u00f3s.",
        u"We\u2019re already getting some requests for you in the back room, bro!": u"J\u00e1 estamos recebendo alguns pedidos por voc\u00ea na sala dos fundos, cara!",
        u"We\u2019re back at Camp Buddy. You were passed out for the whole day.": u"Estamos de volta ao Camp Buddy. Voc\u00ea ficou desacordada o dia inteiro.",
        u"We\u2019re booked at a hotel, though, so I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll be like a staycation at least. You\u2019ll be comfortable with that, right? ": u"Mas vamos ficar em um hotel, ent\u00e3o tenho certeza de que pelo menos vai parecer umas f\u00e9rias tranquilas. Voc\u00ea vai ficar confort\u00e1vel com isso, certo? ",
        u"We\u2019re both out.": u"N\u00f3s dois estamos fora.",
        u"We\u2019re both still going to be with you for meals and breaks too. The only change is where we\u2019re sleeping.": u"N\u00f3s dois ainda estaremos com voc\u00eas nas refei\u00e7\u00f5es e nos intervalos. A \u00fanica mudan\u00e7a \u00e9 onde vamos dormir.",
        u"We\u2019re doing alright, I think\u2026! Not as fast as the other group, but we\u2019re having fun.": u"Acho que estamos indo bem\u2026! N\u00e3o t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido quanto o outro grupo, mas estamos nos divertindo.",
        u"We\u2019re game too! It\u2019s called Truth or DAR after all, ehhhhhhhhh?": u"N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m topamos! Afinal, \u00e9 Verdade ou DARsafio, ehhhhhhhhh?",
        u"We\u2019re glad to have the \u201cold\u201d you back as well, sir!": u"Tamb\u00e9m estamos felizes por ter o senhor dos \u201cvelhos\u201d tempos de volta!",
        u"We\u2019re going to wait for the weather to pass to avoid any dangerous conditions that could harm the workers. ": u"Vamos esperar o mau tempo passar para evitar condi\u00e7\u00f5es perigosas que possam colocar os trabalhadores em risco. ",
        u"We\u2019re gonna be crazy busy for the next few months again, huh?": u"Vamos ficar ocupados pra caramba pelos pr\u00f3ximos meses de novo, hein?",
        u"We\u2019re gonna drink more, sir\u2026?!": u"Vamos beber mais, senhor\u2026?!",
        u"We\u2019re gonna drink tonight, sir??": u"Vamos beber esta noite, senhor??",
        u"We\u2019re gonna have so much fun this summer, Yoshi! There\u2019s plenty of others coming soon, and there\u2019ll be at least a hundred of us!": u"Vamos nos divertir muito neste ver\u00e3o, Yoshi! Muitos outros chegar\u00e3o em breve, e seremos pelo menos cem!",
        u"We\u2019re gonna have some fun tonight! ": u"Vamos nos divertir esta noite! ",
        u"We\u2019re having a holiday party, so we might as well play the part! ": u"Estamos fazendo uma festa de fim de ano, ent\u00e3o podemos muito bem entrar no personagem! ",
        u"We\u2019re here representing both Camp Buddy and Mr. Clermont\u2019s reputation\u2026 And this incident might have just cost us our sponsorship\u2026": u"Estamos aqui representando tanto o Camp Buddy quanto a reputa\u00e7\u00e3o do Sr. Clermont\u2026 E este incidente pode ter acabado de nos custar o patroc\u00ednio\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re here to have a good time and that\u2019s what we\u2019re gonna do. ": u"Estamos aqui para nos divertir, e \u00e9 isso que vamos fazer. ",
        u"We\u2019re here, Yuri!": u"Chegamos, Yuri!",
        u"We\u2019re here. How\u2019s Em\u2014": u"Chegamos. Como est\u00e1 a Em\u2014",
        u"We\u2019re just getting started, Yoshi\u2026 I\u2019m not pulling out \u2019til I unload everything inside you\u2026": u"Estamos s\u00f3 come\u00e7ando, Yoshi\u2026 N\u00e3o vou tirar at\u00e9 despejar tudo dentro de voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re just one message away\u2026! ": u"Estamos a apenas uma mensagem de dist\u00e2ncia\u2026! ",
        u"We\u2019re looking to him for his opinion because he has the skill and experience.": u"Buscamos a opini\u00e3o dele porque ele tem habilidade e experi\u00eancia.",
        u"We\u2019re lucky the hats were left over from last year\u2019s party! ": u"Ainda bem que sobraram chap\u00e9us da festa do ano passado! ",
        u"We\u2019re lucky we caught the aurora in time\u2026 It\u2019s pretty rare to spot it so clearly like this\u2026": u"Tivemos sorte de chegar a tempo de ver a aurora\u2026 \u00c9 bem raro conseguir enxerg\u00e1-la com tanta clareza assim\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re lucky we have lots of open-minded people who let stuff go.": u"Temos sorte de estar cercados de pessoas de mente aberta que sabem deixar as coisas para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"We\u2019re not doing anything against the rules, so I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll be fine, Aiden! Trust me!": u"N\u00e3o estamos fazendo nada contra as regras, ent\u00e3o tenho certeza de que ficar\u00e1 tudo bem, Aiden! Confie em mim!",
        u"We\u2019re not even sure if Emilia would want that. ": u"Nem sabemos se Emilia iria querer isso. ",
        u"We\u2019re not excusing the wrong things she\u2019s done, but this really helped us understand her better.": u"N\u00e3o estamos desculpando as coisas erradas que ela fez, mas isso realmente nos ajudou a entend\u00ea-la melhor.",
        u"We\u2019re not going out there in just our underwear, Aiden.": u"N\u00e3o vamos sair por a\u00ed s\u00f3 de roupa \u00edntima, Aiden.",
        u"We\u2019re not going to stop until you run dry\u2026": u"N\u00e3o vamos parar at\u00e9 voc\u00ea ficar completamente seco\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re on vacation, and we just had the sportsfest too! Loosen up a little!": u"Estamos de f\u00e9rias e acabamos de ter o festival esportivo tamb\u00e9m! Relaxa um pouco!",
        u"We\u2019re only following protocols, ma\u2019am, please underst\u2014": u"Estamos apenas seguindo os protocolos, senhora, por favor, enten\u2014",
        u"We\u2019re partners, aren\u2019t we?": u"Somos parceiros, n\u00e3o somos?",
        u"We\u2019re proceeding as planned. The doctor said it\u2019s safe for Emilia to travel.": u"Vamos seguir como planejado. O m\u00e9dico disse que \u00e9 seguro Emilia viajar.",
        u"We\u2019re ready for a change of pace from all the construction work.": u"Estamos prontos para mudar um pouco o ritmo depois de todo esse trabalho de constru\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"We\u2019re really lucky to have you teaching and guiding us, sir!": u"Temos muita sorte por contar com o senhor para nos ensinar e orientar!",
        u"We\u2019re reporting for duty, sir!": u"Estamos nos apresentando para o servi\u00e7o, senhor!",
        u"We\u2019re setting up for the best year ever, and so much of that is thanks to you!": u"Estamos nos preparando para o melhor ano de todos, e grande parte disso \u00e9 gra\u00e7as a voc\u00ea!",
        u"We\u2019re sorry about that! We just had a meeting to take care of! ": u"Desculpem por isso! Tivemos que cuidar de uma reuni\u00e3o! ",
        u"We\u2019re sorry for coming at such short notice!": u"Desculpem por aparecermos sem avisar!",
        u"We\u2019re staying over at Keitaro\u2019s place and our friends are gonna be there.": u"Vamos ficar na casa do Keitaro e nossos amigos tamb\u00e9m estar\u00e3o l\u00e1.",
        u"We\u2019re still just\u2026 friends.": u"Ainda somos apenas\u2026 amigos.",
        u"We\u2019re taking care of her until she gets back on her feet, but I think there\u2019s more we can do to help.": u"Estamos cuidando dela at\u00e9 que se recupere, mas acho que podemos fazer mais para ajudar.",
        u"We\u2019re taking the survival, teamwork and leadership skills from scouting and mixing them up with all the fun, recreational activities of a summer camp!": u"Estamos combinando as habilidades de sobreviv\u00eancia, trabalho em equipe e lideran\u00e7a do escotismo com todas as atividades recreativas e divertidas de um acampamento de ver\u00e3o!",
        u"We\u2019re talking about a planetarium here right\u2026? Just so we\u2019re clear.": u"Estamos falando de um planet\u00e1rio, certo\u2026? S\u00f3 para deixar claro.",
        u"We\u2019re transcribing Yuri\u2019s journal and restoring the photos for a blog! Jin\u2019s doing most of the work though, since I\u2019m notoriously bad with anything tech-related\u2026": u"Estamos transcrevendo o di\u00e1rio de Yuri e restaurando as fotos para um blog! Mas Jin est\u00e1 fazendo a maior parte do trabalho, j\u00e1 que sou notoriamente ruim com qualquer coisa relacionada a tecnologia\u2026",
        u"We\u2019re your family too, sir!": u"N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m somos sua fam\u00edlia, senhor!",
        u"We\u2019ve all done our best to continue his dream, and one day, if he comes back, Camp Buddy will be here for him again.": u"Todos fizemos o poss\u00edvel para continuar o sonho dele e, um dia, se ele voltar, o Camp Buddy estar\u00e1 aqui para receb\u00ea-lo novamente.",
        u"We\u2019ve all gone through our own hardships, making mistakes along the way.": u"Todos n\u00f3s passamos por nossas pr\u00f3prias dificuldades e cometemos erros pelo caminho.",
        u"We\u2019ve already decorated and prepared everything!": u"J\u00e1 decoramos e preparamos tudo!",
        u"We\u2019ve been apart, struggled when we\u2019re together, and learned more about each other than we ever thought possible.": u"Ficamos separados, enfrentamos dificuldades quando est\u00e1vamos juntos e aprendemos um sobre o outro mais do que jamais imaginamos ser poss\u00edvel.",
        u"We\u2019ve been in the industry for years already as contractors\u2026 it\u2019s about time we started our own firm.": u"J\u00e1 estamos no ramo h\u00e1 anos como prestadores de servi\u00e7o\u2026 Est\u00e1 na hora de abrirmos nossa pr\u00f3pria empresa.",
        u"We\u2019ve been so stuck in our ways that we didn\u2019t even consider all of this before\u2026": u"Est\u00e1vamos t\u00e3o presos aos nossos costumes que nunca consideramos tudo isso\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ve been talking with them all morning \u2013 you should\u2019ve at least figured out who they are by now!": u"Passamos a manh\u00e3 inteira conversando com eles \u2014 a esta altura voc\u00ea j\u00e1 deveria ter percebido quem s\u00e3o!",
        u"We\u2019ve been together long enough, haven\u2019t we? I take this relationship seriously!": u"Estamos juntos h\u00e1 tempo suficiente, n\u00e3o estamos? Eu levo este relacionamento a s\u00e9rio!",
        u"We\u2019ve both done so much for a such long time. This is our chance to be happy together\u2026!": u"N\u00f3s dois fizemos tanto por tanto tempo. Esta \u00e9 a nossa chance de sermos felizes juntos\u2026!",
        u"We\u2019ve come so far after all these years\u2026 Please don\u2019t ever leave us\u2026": u"Chegamos t\u00e3o longe depois de todos esses anos\u2026 Por favor, nunca nos abandone\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ve come such a long way just to fix things and return to how it was when we started\u2026": u"Percorremos um caminho t\u00e3o longo apenas para consertar as coisas e voltar ao que t\u00ednhamos quando come\u00e7amos\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ve done so much even without that label, though. ": u"Mas j\u00e1 fizemos tanta coisa mesmo sem esse r\u00f3tulo. ",
        u"We\u2019ve got another party to attend, hehehe!": u"Temos outra festa para ir, hehehe!",
        u"We\u2019ve got you settled in at last, Jin\u2026 Today\u2019s been such a long day!": u"Finalmente conseguimos acomod\u00e1-lo, Jin\u2026 Hoje foi um dia muito longo!",
        u"We\u2019ve gotten so used to being surrounded by trees and staying in wooden cabins all the time, huh?": u"Ficamos t\u00e3o acostumados a estar cercados por \u00e1rvores e a viver em cabanas de madeira, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"We\u2019ve had all these experiences together... all these chances... and we still ended up in the same place as before\u2026": u"Tivemos todas essas experi\u00eancias juntos\u2026 todas essas chances\u2026 e mesmo assim acabamos no mesmo lugar de antes\u2026",
        u"We\u2019ve only been gone for a couple days, but I missed Camp Buddy already.": u"S\u00f3 ficamos fora por alguns dias, mas j\u00e1 estava com saudade do Camp Buddy.",
        u"We\u2019ve prepared lodging for all your workers in some of our unused cabins, while you two can stay with us in our scoutmaster quarters, if that\u2019s alright?": u"Preparamos alojamento para todos os trabalhadores em algumas cabanas desocupadas, enquanto voc\u00eas dois podem ficar conosco nos aposentos dos chefes escoteiros, se estiver tudo bem.",
        u"We\u2026 almost had sex\u2026 in the club\u2026": u"N\u00f3s\u2026 quase fizemos sexo\u2026 na boate\u2026",
        u"We\u2026 don\u2019t share the same views anymore\u2026": u"N\u00f3s\u2026 j\u00e1 n\u00e3o vemos as coisas da mesma forma\u2026",
        u"We\u2026 had an argument a while ago, and he left before we could properly resolve it\u2026": u"N\u00f3s\u2026 discutimos h\u00e1 pouco, e ele foi embora antes que pud\u00e9ssemos resolver as coisas direito\u2026",
        u"Wh-Wha?": u"O-O qu\u00ea?",
        u"Wh-Wha? \u2018Death\u2019?! Does that mean Gramps is gonna die of something other than old age?!": u"O-O qu\u00ea? \u2018A Morte\u2019?! Isso quer dizer que o Vov\u00f4 vai morrer de alguma coisa al\u00e9m de velhice?!",
        u"Wh-Wha?! I won\u2019t get to see the view \u2013 you\u2019re gonna block the whole window with your giant body!": u"O-O qu\u00ea?! Eu n\u00e3o vou conseguir ver a paisagem \u2014 voc\u00ea vai bloquear a janela inteira com esse corpo gigante!",
        u"Wh-What about the camp\u2026?": u"E-E o acampamento\u2026?",
        u"Wh-What are you trying to say, Aiden\u2026?": u"O-O que est\u00e1 querendo dizer, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Wh-What are you trying to say, Dad\u2026?": u"O-O que est\u00e1 tentando dizer, Pai\u2026?",
        u"Wh-What are you trying to say, sir\u2026?": u"O-O que o senhor quer dizer\u2026?",
        u"Wh-What are you trying to say\u2026?": u"O-O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 querendo dizer\u2026?",
