        u"Wh-Whoa! I\u2019ve never seen you two like that before, Lloyd!": u"U-Uau! Nunca vi voc\u00eas dois assim antes, Lloyd!",
        u"Wh-Whoa\u2026 There\u2019s a huge crowd in here!": u"U-Uau\u2026 Tem uma multid\u00e3o enorme aqui!",
        u"Wh-Whoa\u2026! This place is so crowded!": u"N-Nossa\u2026! Este lugar est\u00e1 lotado!",
        u"Wh-Why are you doing this\u2026? ": u"P-Por que est\u00e1 fazendo isso\u2026? ",
        u"Wh-Why would I have known that?! I\u2019ve never even heard of it before!": u"P-Por que eu saberia disso?! Eu nunca nem ouvi falar nisso!",
        u"Wh-Why\u2026?": u"P-Por qu\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"Wha! Money\u2019s falling out of your underwear! That\u2019s where you put it?!": u"O qu\u00ea! Tem dinheiro caindo da sua cueca! Foi a\u00ed que voc\u00ea guardou?!",
        u"Wha? But my undies are on right now\u2026": u"O qu\u00ea? Mas estou de cueca agora\u2026",
        u"Whaaaaaatttt??? I can take in mooooooore than you think!": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea??? Eu aguento muuuuuuito mais do que voc\u00ea imagina!",
        u"Whaaaaat?! That takes out all the fun!": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea?! Assim perde toda a gra\u00e7a!",
        u"Whaaaat? I\u2019m just workin\u2019 out~ You\u2019re the one making it dirty!": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea? Eu s\u00f3 t\u00f4 malhando~ Voc\u00ea \u00e9 que est\u00e1 deixando isso indecente!",
        u"Whaaaat?! That\u2019s not spicy at all!": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea?! Isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 picante nem um pouco!",
        u"Whaaat? Not my fault you\u2019re so easy and fun to tease~": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea? N\u00e3o \u00e9 culpa minha se \u00e9 t\u00e3o f\u00e1cil e divertido provocar voc\u00ea~",
        u"Whaaat? You act like you don\u2019t like it when I tease you~": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea? Voc\u00ea age como se n\u00e3o gostasse quando eu provoco voc\u00ea~",
        u"Whaaat?! We\u2019re part of the skinny squad, so you\u2019re supposed to be on my side!": u"O qu\u00ea\u00ea\u00ea?! Fazemos parte do grupo dos magrelos, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea deveria ficar do meu lado!",
        u"Whaddaya say we go for another ride\u2026? I\u2019ve still got some juice left over here~": u"Que tal a gente dar mais uma cavalgada\u2026? Ainda tenho um pouco de energia sobrando aqui~",
        u"What Emilia did back there was completely uncalled for\u2026 and you were only trying to stand up for all of us, just like you have before\u2026": u"O que Emilia fez l\u00e1 foi completamente desnecess\u00e1rio\u2026 e o senhor s\u00f3 estava tentando defender todos n\u00f3s, como j\u00e1 fez antes\u2026",
        u"What I didn\u2019t realize was that I was doing it to cover the pain inside\u2026": u"O que eu n\u00e3o percebia era que fazia tudo isso para encobrir a dor que carregava por dentro\u2026",
        u"What I do know is all of us would be glad to work further with you, but now that choice is entirely up to you.": u"O que sei \u00e9 que todos ficar\u00edamos felizes em continuar trabalhando com voc\u00ea, mas agora essa escolha depende inteiramente de voc\u00ea.",
        u"What I meant is going out with a partner.": u"Quis dizer sair com um parceiro.",
        u"What I said really upset you\u2026 And you were right about not being able to count on me as your friend.": u"O que eu disse realmente a magoou\u2026 E voc\u00ea tinha raz\u00e3o sobre n\u00e3o poder contar comigo como amigo.",
        u"What I said to you and how I acted\u2026 I want you to know that I regret them.": u"O que eu disse e a forma como agi\u2026 Quero que saiba que me arrependo.",
        u"What I\u2019m trying to say is that we should go explore and check out what kind of fun stuff is here!": u"O que estou tentando dizer \u00e9 que devemos explorar e descobrir que coisas divertidas h\u00e1 por aqui!",
        u"What I\u2019m trying to say is that you\u2019ve always been doing things on your own while also watching out for all of us.": u"O que estou tentando dizer \u00e9 que voc\u00ea sempre fez tudo sozinho e, ao mesmo tempo, cuidou de todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"What I\u2019m trying to say is, I definitely missed out on a lot of the fun times I could\u2019ve spent with you.": u"O que quero dizer \u00e9 que certamente perdi muitos momentos divertidos que poderia ter passado com voc\u00ea.",
        u"What a good idea, Yoshi! That means you won\u2019t need me to do the taste-testing after all!": u"Que \u00f3tima ideia, Yoshi! Isso significa que n\u00e3o precisar\u00e1 de mim para provar a comida, afinal!",
        u"What a hog! She gets a room all to herself?! ": u"Que folgada! Ela fica com um quarto inteiro s\u00f3 para si?! ",
        u"What a lively bunch, aren\u2019t they?": u"Que grupo animado, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"What a perfect way to end our trip. I\u2019m sure we\u2019ll have an amazing night.": u"Que maneira perfeita de terminar nossa viagem. Tenho certeza de que teremos uma noite incr\u00edvel.",
        u"What about Emilia though? She\u2019s gonna be bummed if she finds out you\u2019re turning her offer down.": u"Mas e Emilia? Ela ficar\u00e1 chateada quando descobrir que voc\u00ea recusar\u00e1 a proposta.",
        u"What about Emilia\u2019s records, Sir Goro? ": u"E os registros da Emilia, Sr. Goro? ",
        u"What about Goro though?": u"E o Goro?",
        u"What about Mr. Scoutmaster Chef here who lacks any sort of professionalism?!": u"E o Sr. Chefe Escoteiro Cozinheiro aqui, que n\u00e3o tem nenhum tipo de profissionalismo?!",
        u"What about Yoshi\u2026? Do you really have to go too?": u"E o Yoshi\u2026? Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m precisa mesmo ir?",
        u"What about all those years you\u2019ve spent helping me and the camp\u2026? Do you really believe we\u2019d have gotten this far without you?": u"E todos esses anos que voc\u00ea passou ajudando a mim e ao acampamento\u2026? Voc\u00ea realmente acha que ter\u00edamos chegado t\u00e3o longe sem voc\u00ea?",
        u"What about her parents? As I mentioned, we do have Ms. Komarova\u2019s past scout registration. ": u"E os pais dela? Como mencionei, n\u00f3s temos o antigo cadastro de escoteira da Srta. Komarova. ",
        u"What about the stuff with Emilia..?": u"E quanto \u00e0 situa\u00e7\u00e3o com Emilia\u2026?",
        u"What about you two? You\u2019re all covered in muck.": u"E voc\u00eas dois? Est\u00e3o cobertos de sujeira.",
        u"What about you, Aiden? Have you picked one for your main yet? I\u2019ll have whatever you\u2019re having.": u"E voc\u00ea, Aiden? J\u00e1 escolheu o prato principal? Vou pedir o mesmo que voc\u00ea.",
        u"What about you, Jin? Wanna come with me?": u"E voc\u00ea, Jin? Quer vir comigo?",
