        u"What\u2019s yours?": u"E o seu?",
        u"What\u2026?": u"O qu\u00ea\u2026?",
        u"What\u2026? Aiden?": u"O qu\u00ea\u2026? Aiden?",
        u"What\u2026? Even Mr. Clermont can\u2019t reach him? ": u"O qu\u00ea\u2026? Nem o Sr. Clermont consegue falar com ele? ",
        u"What\u2026?!": u"O qu\u00ea\u2026?!",
        u"Wha\u2014 but that\u2019s not true at all, Darius! I\u2019ve always thought you were interesting!": u"O qu\u00ea\u2014 mas isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade, Darius! Sempre achei voc\u00ea interessante!",
        u"When Dar and I saw that it was for Camp Buddy, we got excited and immediately sent an application in.": u"Quando Dar e eu vimos que era para o Camp Buddy, ficamos animados e enviamos nossa candidatura imediatamente.",
        u"When I became a scoutmaster here I never stopped grinding, always afraid of screwing something up.": u"Quando me tornei chefe escoteiro aqui, nunca parei de trabalhar duro, sempre com medo de estragar alguma coisa.",
        u"When I came back to Camp Buddy, it was nothing like before\u2026": u"Quando voltei ao Camp Buddy, nada era como antes\u2026",
        u"When I first took her out camping with me, she was so thrilled, and everything about her lit up like I hadn\u2019t seen in years.": u"Quando a levei para acampar comigo pela primeira vez, ela ficou t\u00e3o empolgada que parecia irradiar uma alegria que eu n\u00e3o via havia anos.",
        u"When I found him, he was in just his apron in the kitchen as usual, hehe.": u"Quando o encontrei, ele estava s\u00f3 de avental na cozinha, como sempre, hehe.",
        u"When I look at this tattoo, I remember that things will always look up.": u"Quando olho para esta tatuagem, lembro que as coisas sempre v\u00e3o melhorar.",
        u"When I ran into her yesterday, she tried to call me cheap and tacky!": u"Quando encontrei com ela ontem, tentou me chamar de cafona e barata!",
        u"When I saw the look on everyone\u2019s faces back there\u2026 even my own daughter\u2026": u"Quando vi a express\u00e3o no rosto de todos l\u00e1\u2026 at\u00e9 da minha pr\u00f3pria filha\u2026",
        u"When I saw you chugging those drinks last night, I decided to slow down to make sure we both didn\u2019t get wasted, haha!": u"Quando vi voc\u00ea virando aqueles drinques ontem \u00e0 noite, decidi ir mais devagar para garantir que n\u00f3s dois n\u00e3o fic\u00e1ssemos acabados, haha!",
        u"When I spoke with the workers, they were all expecting to need to do repairs, but were quite happy to learn that we had already completed the majority of them.": u"Quando conversei com os trabalhadores, todos esperavam ter que fazer reparos, mas ficaram muito satisfeitos ao saber que j\u00e1 t\u00ednhamos conclu\u00eddo a maior parte deles.",
        u"When I thought I had lost everything, it was the one thing that gave me hope.": u"Quando achei que tinha perdido tudo, aquela promessa foi a \u00fanica coisa que me deu esperan\u00e7a.",
        u"When I was dealing with all the problems with my ex-wife, I didn\u2019t feel the full extent of the pain because you were there to distract me\u2026": u"Quando eu estava lidando com todos os problemas com minha ex-esposa, n\u00e3o senti toda a dimens\u00e3o da dor porque voc\u00ea estava l\u00e1 para me distrair\u2026",
        u"When I went to the office this morning\u2026 ": u"Quando fui ao escrit\u00f3rio hoje de manh\u00e3\u2026 ",
        u"When Yuri was growing up, she didn\u2019t have the best environment at home\u2026": u"Quando Yuri estava crescendo, ela n\u00e3o tinha o melhor ambiente em casa\u2026",
        u"When are we starting our hike again?": u"Quando retomaremos a caminhada?",
        u"When are you going to accept that he\u2019s just as good a scoutmaster as the rest of us?!": u"Quando voc\u00ea vai aceitar que ele \u00e9 um chefe escoteiro t\u00e3o bom quanto qualquer um de n\u00f3s?!",
        u"When deep inside\u2026 All I wanted was to be back.": u"Quando, no fundo\u2026 Tudo que eu queria era voltar.",
        u"When further combined with the World, it may reflect a lack of power over events, but with patience, a new opportunity can be expected!": u"Junto a O Mundo, pode indicar falta de controle sobre os acontecimentos, mas, com paci\u00eancia, uma nova oportunidade surgir\u00e1!",
        u"When in reality, at least in my case, it was all about the brotherhood.": u"Na verdade, pelo menos no meu caso, tudo girava em torno da irmandade.",
        u"When is our official starting date for the project, if I may ask?": u"Posso perguntar qual \u00e9 a data oficial de in\u00edcio do projeto?",
        u"When we got back together, things were so different.": u"Quando nos reencontramos, as coisas estavam t\u00e3o diferentes.",
        u"When we got separated, I lost touch with you completely\u2026": u"Quando nos separamos, perdi completamente o contato com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"When we got separated, I lost touch with you completely\u2026 ": u"Quando nos separamos, perdi completamente o contato com voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"When we keep things to ourselves, it just boils up inside until it explodes\u2026": u"Quando guardamos tudo para n\u00f3s mesmos, aquilo ferve por dentro at\u00e9 explodir\u2026",
        u"When you deliver a forceful downswing, concentrate your vision on your target, all the way down to the base.": u"Ao desferir o golpe para baixo, mantenha os olhos concentrados no alvo durante todo o movimento at\u00e9 a base.",
        u"When you think about it\u2026 that does sound like a lot of work\u2026": u"Pensando bem\u2026 realmente parece dar muito trabalho\u2026",
        u"Whenever I realize I\u2019m hungry, I just go to the nearest convenience store and grab something there.": u"Quando percebo que estou com fome, simplesmente vou \u00e0 loja de conveni\u00eancia mais pr\u00f3xima e compro alguma coisa.",
        u"Whenever she doesn\u2019t get her way, she tends to say horrible things about you for no reason\u2026 ": u"Sempre que n\u00e3o consegue o que quer, ela costuma dizer coisas horr\u00edveis sobre voc\u00ea sem motivo\u2026 ",
        u"Whenever we look at BL together, she always appreciates the drawings, character designs and how well-written the stories are.": u"Sempre que vemos BL juntos, ela aprecia os desenhos, o design dos personagens e o quanto as hist\u00f3rias s\u00e3o bem escritas.",
        u"Where are we gonna get three more people though? We definitely need the help, \u2019cause I'm not good at building like Yoshi.": u"Mas onde vamos encontrar mais tr\u00eas pessoas? Com certeza precisamos de ajuda, porque n\u00e3o sou boa em construir como Yoshi.",
        u"Where do we even start though\u2026?": u"Mas por onde come\u00e7amos\u2026?",
        u"Where do you even learn all these things, Lloyd? ": u"Onde voc\u00ea aprende todas essas coisas, Lloyd? ",
        u"Where do you think we\u2019ll get the money to pay for something outrageous like this?! ": u"De onde acha que vamos tirar dinheiro para pagar algo absurdo assim?! ",
        u"Where is everybody though? Did I wake up late again\u2026?": u"Mas onde est\u00e1 todo mundo? Acordei tarde de novo\u2026?",
        u"Where is everybody? Did I wake up late again\u2026?": u"Onde est\u00e1 todo mundo? Acordei tarde de novo\u2026?",
        u"Where is he anyway? I don\u2019t see him on any of the bunks.": u"Onde ele est\u00e1, afinal? N\u00e3o o vejo em nenhum dos beliches.",
        u"Where the heck is Yoshi and the best man?!": u"Onde diabos est\u00e3o Yoshi e o padrinho?!",
        u"Where the hell\u2019s the food?! I\u2019m starving!": u"Onde diabos est\u00e1 a comida?! Estou morrendo de fome!",
        u"Where to next?": u"Aonde vamos agora?",
        u"Where will you go\u2026?": u"Para onde voc\u00ea vai\u2026?",
        u"Where\u2019s Dad?! The workers just arrived! ": u"Onde est\u00e1 o Pai?! Os trabalhadores acabaram de chegar! ",
        u"Where\u2019s Goro and Aiden\u2026?": u"Onde est\u00e3o Goro e Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Where\u2019s Goro?": u"Onde est\u00e1 Goro?",
        u"Where\u2019s Gramps anyways? Shouldn\u2019t he be the one briefing us on all of this?": u"Afinal, onde est\u00e1 o Vov\u00f4? N\u00e3o deveria ser ele a nos explicar tudo isso?",
        u"Where\u2019s Lloyd? I thought you were with him.": u"Onde est\u00e1 Lloyd? Pensei que estivesse com ele.",
        u"Where\u2019s your bike now, Goro?": u"Onde est\u00e1 sua moto agora, Goro?",
        u"Where\u2019s your competitive spirit, Yoshinori? You didn\u2019t build those arms for nothing, right?": u"Onde est\u00e1 seu esp\u00edrito competitivo, Yoshinori? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o desenvolveu esses bra\u00e7os \u00e0 toa, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Where\u2019s your sense of camaraderie, Jin? There\u2019s no better connection than the connection through real life experiences with your friends, am I right? ": u"Cad\u00ea seu esp\u00edrito de camaradagem, Jin? N\u00e3o existe conex\u00e3o melhor do que aquela criada por experi\u00eancias reais com seus amigos, n\u00e3o \u00e9? ",
        u"Whether it\u2019s my hyperness, my temper, or even my height! He accepts all of them!": u"Seja minha agita\u00e7\u00e3o, meu temperamento ou at\u00e9 minha altura! Ele aceita tudo!",
        u"Whew! A nice hot shower really helped wash off all that sweat!": u"Ufa! Um bom banho quente ajudou mesmo a tirar todo aquele suor!",
        u"Whew! Finally, it\u2019s done!": u"Ufa! Finalmente, terminamos!",
        u"Whew! I feel much better after that!": u"Ufa! Estou me sentindo muito melhor depois disso!",
        u"Whew! It\u2019s so nice to see the camp crowded again!": u"Ufa! \u00c9 t\u00e3o bom ver o acampamento cheio de novo!",
        u"Whew! Mashed potatoes, check! Greens, check! We\u2019ve got two pots of stew simmering and lots of barbecue ribs sitting in the oven, and those should be ready in a few minutes! ": u"Ufa! Pur\u00ea de batatas, pronto! Verduras, prontas! Temos duas panelas de ensopado cozinhando e muitas costelas ao molho barbecue no forno; tudo deve ficar pronto em alguns minutos! ",
        u"Whew! That swim was so refreshing!": u"Ufa! Esse mergulho foi t\u00e3o refrescante!",
        u"Whew! That was such a nice swim!": u"Ufa! Que mergulho gostoso!",
        u"Whew! That\u2019s a relief!": u"Ufa! Que al\u00edvio!",
        u"Whew! That\u2019s one crate out of thirty\u2026": u"Ufa! Uma caixa j\u00e1 foi, faltam vinte e nove\u2026",
        u"Whew! There we go, all done! ": u"Ufa! Pronto, terminei! ",
        u"Whew, I\u2019m so beat\u2026! It\u2019s been a while since I had so much fun.": u"Ufa, estou acabado\u2026! Faz tempo que n\u00e3o me divirto tanto.",
        u"Whew, it\u2019s much quieter this morning. ": u"Ufa, est\u00e1 bem mais tranquilo esta manh\u00e3. ",
        u"Whew, she\u2019s still as feisty as ever!": u"Ufa, ela continua t\u00e3o geniosa quanto antes!",
        u"Whew, the water feels great!": u"Ufa, a \u00e1gua est\u00e1 \u00f3tima!",
        u"Whew... Okay\u2026 ": u"Ufa... Certo\u2026 ",
        u"Whew... Thanks, Yoshi! I dunno what I'd have done without you after spilling all that.": u"Ufa... Valeu, Yoshi! N\u00e3o sei o que teria feito sem voc\u00ea depois de derramar tudo aquilo.",
        u"Wheww\u2026 On a hot day like this, I could float here all day!": u"Ufa\u2026 Num dia quente assim, eu poderia ficar boiando aqui o dia inteiro!",
        u"Wheww\u2026 Oooh\u2026": u"Ufff\u2026 Oooh\u2026",
        u"Whew~ Look at all this sweat! I can finally feel the burn!": u"Ufa~ Olha todo esse suor! Finalmente estou sentindo o esfor\u00e7o!",
        u"Whew\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 Finally, some alone ti\u2014": u"Ufa\u2026 Finalmente, um pouco de tempo soz\u2014",
        u"Whew\u2026 I think that fixes this one. ": u"Ufa\u2026 Acho que consertei este aqui. ",
        u"Whew\u2026 It\u2019s a good thing he ran into you. I was worried he ran off somewhere outside Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Ainda bem que ele encontrou voc\u00ea. Eu estava preocupado que tivesse fugido para algum lugar fora do Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 It\u2019s a good thing we\u2019re having a sunny winter, especially after that storm.": u"Ufa\u2026 Ainda bem que estamos tendo um inverno ensolarado, principalmente depois daquela tempestade.",
        u"Whew\u2026 It\u2019s finally happening\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Finalmente est\u00e1 acontecendo\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 It\u2019s really nice here, sir.": u"Ufa\u2026 Aqui \u00e9 muito agrad\u00e1vel, senhor.",
        u"Whew\u2026 I\u2019m just happy I pulled it off\u2026. I was trying so hard to remember how it looked, hahaha! ": u"Ufa\u2026 S\u00f3 estou feliz por ter conseguido\u2026 Eu estava me esfor\u00e7ando tanto para lembrar como era, hahaha! ",
        u"Whew\u2026 Just when I thought tonight\u2019s gonna be chill\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Justo quando achei que a noite seria tranquila\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 That sounds\u2026 really intense\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Isso parece\u2026 ter sido bem intenso\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 That\u2019s a relief\u2026": u"Ufa\u2026 Que al\u00edvio\u2026",
        u"Whew\u2026 The ceremony was a success!": u"Ufa\u2026 A cerim\u00f4nia foi um sucesso!",
        u"Whew\u2026 There\u2019s still so much left even after all that shoveling.": u"Ufa\u2026 Ainda falta tanta coisa mesmo depois de toda essa neve que retiramos.",
        u"Whew\u2026 We almost got carried away in there.": u"Ufa\u2026 Quase nos empolgamos demais l\u00e1 dentro.",
        u"Whew\u2026 Well, that happened.": u"Ufa\u2026 Bem, isso aconteceu.",
        u"Whew\u2026 You\u2019re right.  Now that I\u2019m laying down, I can\u2019t feel my legs anymore, haha!": u"Ufa\u2026 Voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o. Agora que me deitei, nem sinto mais minhas pernas, haha!",
        u"Whew\u2026 it\u2019s really getting chillier, huh?": u"Ufa\u2026 est\u00e1 ficando bem mais frio, n\u00e9?",
        u"Whew\u2026! That\u2019s done!": u"Ufa\u2026! Resolvido!",
        u"Which are the only three badges you earned.": u"Que s\u00e3o as \u00fanicas tr\u00eas ins\u00edgnias que voc\u00ea conquistou.",
        u"Which brings me to another issue: Ms. Nomoru\u2019s attitude problem. She\u2019s very hostile towards me, as you can see.": u"Isso me leva a outro problema: a atitude da Srta. Nomoru. Como podem ver, ela \u00e9 muito hostil comigo.",
        u"Which is exactly why I\u2019m not proud of it\u2026": u"\u00c9 exatamente por isso que n\u00e3o me orgulho disso\u2026",
        u"Which makes it more exciting don\u2019t you think?": u"O que torna tudo mais empolgante, n\u00e3o acha?",
        u"Which one?": u"Qual deles?",
        u"Which part of this is less embarassing...? I look like Willy Wanker.": u"Que parte disso \u00e9 menos constrangedora...? Eu pare\u00e7o o Willy Wanker.",
        u"While I can\u2019t deny that we had our rivals and got into trouble with them often, we never went out of our way to cause harm or commit crimes.": u"Embora eu n\u00e3o possa negar que t\u00ednhamos rivais e frequentemente arranj\u00e1vamos problemas com eles, nunca sa\u00edamos por a\u00ed procurando machucar algu\u00e9m ou cometer crimes.",
        u"While I was alone, I was able to think about it... and I realized... you're right...": u"Enquanto fiquei sozinho, consegui pensar melhor\u2026 e percebi\u2026 que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"While I\u2019m at it, thanks again for treating us to these nice cold drinks. It\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve had a beer like this.": u"A prop\u00f3sito, obrigado novamente por nos oferecer estas bebidas bem geladas. Faz tempo que n\u00e3o tomo uma cerveja assim.",
        u"While Mr. Clermont was impressed by our camp, I think their story was really what convinced him to support us like this.": u"Embora o senhor Clermont tenha ficado impressionado com o acampamento, acho que foi a hist\u00f3ria deles que realmente o convenceu a nos apoiar desta forma.",
        u"While snowstorms happen here at least once a year, this year\u2019s was an extreme exception.": u"Embora tempestades de neve aconte\u00e7am aqui pelo menos uma vez por ano, a deste ano foi uma exce\u00e7\u00e3o extrema.",
        u"While this expansion project\u2019s funding is a separate investment for me, I\u2019ve made sure to respect Mr. Nagame\u2019s wishes, and pool in his royalties alongside this sponsorship!": u"Embora o financiamento deste projeto de expans\u00e3o seja um investimento separado meu, fiz quest\u00e3o de respeitar o desejo do Sr. Nagame e juntar os royalties dele ao patroc\u00ednio!",
        u"While we were busy with our tasks, Jin spent many sleepless nights working on the technological goals of the project.": u"Enquanto est\u00e1vamos ocupados, Jin passou muitas noites sem dormir trabalhando nas metas tecnol\u00f3gicas do projeto.",
        u"While we were on this trip\u2026 I found out that my wife has been\u2026 seeing someone else.": u"Enquanto est\u00e1vamos nesta viagem\u2026 descobri que minha esposa estava\u2026 saindo com outra pessoa.",
        u"While we\u2019re here, we\u2019ll be running a nice side hustle \u2013 a design consultancy firm! ": u"Enquanto estivermos aqui, vamos tocar um belo trabalho paralelo \u2014 uma empresa de consultoria em design! ",
        u"While you wait, we\u2019ll send over our hottest, newest entertainer to your table! Be right back!": u"Enquanto esperam, vamos mandar nosso artista mais gostoso e mais novo at\u00e9 a mesa! J\u00e1 volto!",
        u"While you wait, why don\u2019t you consider joining some of the events tonight?": u"Enquanto esperam, por que n\u00e3o consideram participar de alguns eventos desta noite?",
        u"While you were gone today, I found out that you turned down the offer for Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Enquanto voc\u00ea estava fora hoje, descobri que recusou a proposta para o Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"Who are we kidding here, Yoshinori? I hate all of you, and you all hate me. There\u2019s no secret there.": u"Quem estamos tentando enganar, Yoshinori? Eu odeio todos voc\u00eas, e todos voc\u00eas me odeiam. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 segredo nenhum nisso.",
        u"Who else would I be talking about?": u"De quem mais eu estaria falando?",
        u"Who knew Jin was also a photographer, haha! ": u"Quem diria que Jin tamb\u00e9m era fot\u00f3grafo, haha! ",
        u"Who knew that cutie Jin can look as handsome as this?": u"Quem diria que o fofinho Jin poderia ficar t\u00e3o bonito assim?",
        u"Who knows, maybe I\u2019ll try and recreate the stuff that we had in that fancy dinner!": u"Quem sabe, talvez eu tente recriar as coisas que comemos naquele jantar chique!",
        u"Who said we were done?": u"Quem disse que terminamos?",
        u"Who wouldn\u2019t be annoyed at that?! If I had to listen to her Karen-ing for another minute\u2014": u"Quem n\u00e3o ficaria irritado com aquilo?! Se eu tivesse que ouvi-la bancando a Karen por mais um minuto\u2014",
        u"Who would\u2019ve thought the girls who pulled each other\u2019s hair are besties now?": u"Quem diria que as garotas que puxavam o cabelo uma da outra agora seriam melhores amigas?",
        u"Who you calling pinhead?": u"Quem voc\u00ea est\u00e1 chamando de cabe\u00e7a-oca?",
        u"Whoa!": u"Uau!",
        u"Whoa! Does that mean you\u2019re rich now, Keitaro?!": u"Uau! Isso significa que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 rico agora, Keitaro?!",
        u"Whoa! Don\u2019t tell me Jin\u2019s our roommate too?!": u"Uau! N\u00e3o me diga que Jin tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 nosso colega de quarto?!",
        u"Whoa! Good thing you didn\u2019t hurt your back, Gramps!": u"Uau! Ainda bem que n\u00e3o machucou as costas, vov\u00f4!",
        u"Whoa! He\u2019s right! That\u2019s amazing!": u"Uau! Ele tem raz\u00e3o! Isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel!",
        u"Whoa! How\u2019d you know, Yoshi?!": u"Uau! Como voc\u00ea sabia, Yoshi?!",
        u"Whoa! I can\u2019t believe it!": u"Uau! N\u00e3o acredito!",
        u"Whoa! Jin you look so\u2026 different! ": u"Uau! Jin, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 t\u00e3o\u2026 diferente! ",
        u"Whoa! Really?!": u"Uau! S\u00e9rio?!",
        u"Whoa! That\u2019s big news to me\u2026! ": u"Uau! Isso \u00e9 uma grande novidade para mim\u2026! ",
        u"Whoa! That\u2019s incredibly detailed for what it is, Yuri!": u"Uau! Est\u00e1 incrivelmente detalhado para o que \u00e9, Yuri!",
        u"Whoa! This place looks lively\u2026!": u"Uau! Este lugar parece animado\u2026!",
        u"Whoa! Wh-What are you wearing?!": u"Uau! O-O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 vestindo?!",
        u"Whoa! What\u2019s with the commotion?": u"Uau! O que est\u00e1 acontecendo aqui?",
        u"Whoa! Where did that drink come from?": u"Uau! De onde veio essa bebida?",
        u"Whoa! Y-Your nose is bleeding! ": u"Uau! S-Seu nariz est\u00e1 sangrando! ",
        u"Whoa! Yoshinori? Really?": u"Uau! Yoshinori? S\u00e9rio?",
        u"Whoa! You mean like the ones on those TV game shows?!": u"Uau! Quer dizer, como aquelas dos programas de competi\u00e7\u00e3o da TV?!",
        u"Whoa, Emilia! Why are you washing dishes?": u"Uau, Emilia! Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 lavando a lou\u00e7a?",
        u"Whoa, I didn\u2019t think you were the type who\u2019d like to do it in public too!": u"Uau, n\u00e3o pensei que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m fosse do tipo que gosta de fazer isso em p\u00fablico!",
        u"Whoa, careful, Gramps. You don\u2019t wanna get so drunk that you\u2019ll strip down and scare everyone with your monster dong.": u"Ei, cuidado, Vov\u00f4. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai querer ficar t\u00e3o b\u00eabado a ponto de tirar a roupa e assustar todo mundo com essa sua jeba monstruosa.",
        u"Whoa, it\u2019s bustling over here!": u"Uau, est\u00e1 movimentado por aqui!",
        u"Whoa, really? ": u"Uau, s\u00e9rio? ",
        u"Whoa, really?!": u"Uau, \u00e9 s\u00e9rio?!",
        u"Whoa, that\u2019s great news, Aiden! Congrats!": u"Uau, isso \u00e9 uma \u00f3tima not\u00edcia, Aiden! Parab\u00e9ns!",
        u"Whoa, the plating looks just like in the hotel restaurant! You made this, Aiden?!": u"Uau, a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 igual \u00e0 do restaurante do hotel! Voc\u00ea fez isso, Aiden?!",
        u"Whoa, whoa, Gramps! You don\u2019t wanna be a sobbing mess in front of our sponsor!": u"Ei, ei, Vov\u00f4! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai querer virar uma choradeira na frente do nosso patrocinador!",
        u"Whoa, whoa, whoa, you\u2019re not planning to get me drunk again, are you?": u"Ei, ei, ei, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 planejando me deixar b\u00eabado de novo, est\u00e1?",
        u"Whoa, whoa, whoa. What are you trying to do here, Yuri?": u"Ei, ei, ei. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 tentando fazer aqui, Yuri?",
        u"Whoa, you can do that?": u"Uau, pode fazer isso?",
        u"Whoa, you guys look beat! What have you been doing today? ": u"Uau, voc\u00eas parecem acabados! O que fizeram hoje? ",
        u"Whoa, you weren\u2019t kidding when you said this place needed a cleanup\u2026": u"Uau, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava brincando quando disse que este lugar precisava de uma limpeza\u2026",
        u"Whoa, you\u2019re right\u2026! The window\u2019s super hazy, and the city looks really dull now from all the snow.": u"Uau, voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026! A janela est\u00e1 toda emba\u00e7ada, e a cidade parece bem apagada agora com toda essa neve.",
        u"Whoa\u2026 I can\u2019t believe that worked\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 N\u00e3o acredito que isso funcionou\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 I get a stack...?": u"Uau\u2026 Eu recebo uma pilha inteira\u2026?",
        u"Whoa\u2026 I guess I shouldn\u2019t be surprised, but the room is luxurious too\u2026  ": u"Uau\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o deveria me surpreender, mas o quarto tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 luxuoso\u2026  ",
        u"Whoa\u2026 I only recognize a few of these drinks, sir\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 S\u00f3 reconhe\u00e7o algumas dessas bebidas, senhor\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 It even has whipped cream?!": u"Uau\u2026 Tem at\u00e9 chantilly?!",
        u"Whoa\u2026 It sounds like we\u2019re going to be treated like royalty here\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Parece que seremos tratados como a realeza aqui\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 I\u2019m really surprised to hear that, Yuri.": u"Uau\u2026 Estou realmente surpreso de ouvir isso, Yuri.",
        u"Whoa\u2026 Mr. Clermont\u2019s really gone overboard with this\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 O Sr. Clermont realmente exagerou nisso\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 These look colorful. It\u2019s even got a teeny-tiny umbrella, haha!": u"Uau\u2026 Eles s\u00e3o coloridos. T\u00eam at\u00e9 um guarda-chuvinha, haha!",
        u"Whoa\u2026 This computer is at least a decade old\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Este computador tem pelo menos uma d\u00e9cada\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 This place looks cozy!": u"Uau\u2026 Este lugar parece aconchegante!",
        u"Whoa\u2026 This place really has everything\u2026 You could live like a king if you had the money to stay here for the rest of your life\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Este lugar realmente tem de tudo\u2026 Voc\u00ea poderia viver como um rei se tivesse dinheiro para ficar aqui pelo resto da vida\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 This place really has everything\u2026 You could live like royalty for the rest of your life if you had the money to stay here\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Este lugar realmente tem de tudo\u2026 Voc\u00ea poderia viver como realeza pelo resto da vida se tivesse dinheiro para ficar aqui\u2026",
        u"Whoa\u2026 What\u2019s up with all the luggage, Yuri?": u"Uau\u2026 Por que tanta bagagem, Yuri?",
        u"Whoa\u2026 Why is Gramps\u2019 fortune all about romance?": u"Uau\u2026 Por que a sorte do Vov\u00f4 \u00e9 toda sobre romance?",
        u"Whoa\u2026 You guys are already packed? ": u"Uau\u2026 Voc\u00eas j\u00e1 arrumaram as malas? ",
        u"Whoa\u2026 like an actual physical fight?": u"Uau\u2026 tipo uma briga de verdade, no bra\u00e7o?",
        u"Whoa\u2026! It does fit me!": u"Uau\u2026! Ela realmente serve em mim!",
        u"Whoa\u2026! They weren\u2019t kidding when they said they\u2019d be sending thirty people here\u2026": u"Uau\u2026! Eles n\u00e3o estavam brincando quando disseram que enviariam trinta pessoas para c\u00e1\u2026",
        u"Whoops! You're right \u2013 let's hope we don't run into anyone else to distract us, haha!": u"Opa! Tem raz\u00e3o \u2014 vamos torcer para n\u00e3o encontrarmos mais ningu\u00e9m para nos distrair, haha!",
        u"Whoops, I got too carried away!": u"Opa, eu me empolguei demais!",
        u"Whoops, didn\u2019t see you there, Lloyd~!": u"Opa, nem vi voc\u00ea a\u00ed, Lloyd~!",
        u"Whoops, sorry! I cleaned the pool today, and I guess a lot of sludge got onto me!": u"Opa, desculpem! Limpei a piscina hoje e acho que muita lama acabou caindo em mim!",
        u"Who\u2019s this guy and what did you do to the old, boring sheriff?": u"Quem \u00e9 esse cara e o que voc\u00ea fez com o velho xerife sem gra\u00e7a?",
        u"Why am I not surprised that your solution to everything is to just cut it off?": u"Por que n\u00e3o me surpreende que sua solu\u00e7\u00e3o para tudo seja simplesmente cortar os la\u00e7os?",
        u"Why are we acting like we don\u2019t see Aiden naked all the time\u2026? ": u"Por que estamos agindo como se n\u00e3o v\u00edssemos Aiden pelado o tempo todo\u2026? ",
        u"Why are you acting so suspicious, then? You two are up to something, aren\u2019t you?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que est\u00e3o agindo de forma t\u00e3o suspeita? Voc\u00eas est\u00e3o aprontando alguma coisa, n\u00e3o est\u00e3o?",
        u"Why are you even pushing this so hard?!": u"Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 insistindo tanto nisso?!",
        u"Why are you giving up all of a sudden? That would make everything we\u2019ve been through pointless!": u"Por que est\u00e1 desistindo de repente? Isso tornaria in\u00fatil tudo pelo que passamos!",
        u"Why are you keeping all of this in the shed anyway? Why not in your room or something?": u"Afinal, por que est\u00e1 guardando tudo isso no galp\u00e3o? Por que n\u00e3o no seu quarto ou em outro lugar?",
        u"Why are you looking at me like that~? Still thinking I\u2019m one of the strippers out there?": u"Por que est\u00e1 olhando para mim desse jeito~? Ainda est\u00e1 pensando que eu sou um daqueles strippers l\u00e1 fora?",
        u"Why are you saying that so confidently\u2026?": u"Por que est\u00e1 dizendo isso com tanta confian\u00e7a\u2026?",
        u"Why are you so absorbed in what everyone else is doing? ": u"Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 t\u00e3o obcecada com o que todo mundo est\u00e1 fazendo? ",
        u"Why are you so jittery? Your back\u2019s hunched and your muscles are all tensed up.": u"Por que est\u00e1 t\u00e3o inquieto? Suas costas est\u00e3o curvadas e seus m\u00fasculos est\u00e3o todos tensos.",
        u"Why are you so unphased by this?!": u"Por que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 t\u00e3o tranquilo com isso?!",
        u"Why can\u2019t I go out and do what I want then?!": u"Ent\u00e3o por que eu n\u00e3o posso sair e fazer o que quero?!",
        u"Why can\u2019t you just let me wear the costume I had from the last party?": u"Por que n\u00e3o pode simplesmente me deixar usar a fantasia da \u00faltima festa?",
        u"Why did Sir Goro follow you and Emilia? Did something happen?": u"Por que o Sr. Goro foi atr\u00e1s de voc\u00ea e Emilia? Aconteceu alguma coisa?",
        u"Why did you even let her take charge, Dad? You've been in charge of everything this whole time just fine.": u"Por que deixou ela assumir o controle, pai? O senhor administrou tudo muito bem at\u00e9 agora.",
        u"Why did you have to hide all of these things from us\u2026?": u"Por que precisou esconder tudo isso de n\u00f3s\u2026?",
        u"Why did you invite her to our group again, Yoshi?": u"Por que voc\u00ea a convidou para o grupo mesmo, Yoshi?",
        u"Why did you never tell me about this, Dar?! I should\u2019ve been the first one to know!": u"Por que voc\u00ea nunca me contou isso, Dar?! Eu devia ter sido o primeiro a saber!",
        u"Why didn\u2019t we come here to begin with?! With this heat, this would\u2019ve been the perfect camping spot!": u"Por que n\u00e3o viemos para c\u00e1 desde o come\u00e7o?! Com este calor, este seria o lugar perfeito para acampar!",
        u"Why didn\u2019t you ask any of us for help? I mean\u2026 that's a lot of lifting for just one person, you know. ": u"Por que n\u00e3o pediu ajuda a nenhum de n\u00f3s? Quero dizer\u2026 \u00c9 peso demais para uma pessoa s\u00f3, sabia? ",
        u"Why didn\u2019t you guys wake me up? I didn\u2019t know the workers were coming this early.": u"Por que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o me acordaram? Eu n\u00e3o sabia que os trabalhadores viriam t\u00e3o cedo.",
        u"Why do you ask? ": u"Por que pergunta? ",
        u"Why do you keep trying to bring Aiden down?!": u"Por que voc\u00ea continua tentando rebaixar o Aiden?!",
        u"Why do you know this, sir\u2026? ": u"Por que o senhor sabe disso\u2026? ",
        u"Why do you think you\u2019re different now? Are you overthinking again?": u"Por que acha que est\u00e1 diferente agora? Est\u00e1 pensando demais de novo?",
        u"Why don't I give you a hand?": u"Por que n\u00e3o lhe dou uma m\u00e3o?",
        u"Why don\u2019t I give you a hand, Aiden? I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll make your job easier!": u"Por que n\u00e3o lhe dou uma m\u00e3o, Aiden? Tenho certeza de que facilitar\u00e1 o seu trabalho!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we check out the gym, Aiden? ": u"Por que n\u00e3o conhecemos a academia, Aiden? ",
        u"Why don\u2019t we do something fun then, Aiden?": u"Por que n\u00e3o fazemos algo divertido, ent\u00e3o, Aiden?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we get something to eat?": u"Que tal pegarmos algo para comer?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we go and check on Jin? ": u"Por que n\u00e3o vamos ver como Jin est\u00e1? ",
        u"Why don\u2019t we go and check on Jin? He might need some encouragement getting out of his room.": u"Por que n\u00e3o vamos ver como o Jin est\u00e1? Talvez ele precise de um incentivo para sair do quarto.",
        u"Why don\u2019t we go and see then?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o vamos ver?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we go check on our friends?": u"Por que n\u00e3o vamos ver como est\u00e3o nossos amigos?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we head over to the construction site?": u"Que tal irmos at\u00e9 a obra?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we head over to the other rooms and see what they\u2019re doing?": u"Por que n\u00e3o vamos at\u00e9 os outros quartos para ver o que o pessoal est\u00e1 fazendo?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we head to the mess hall? We can have a little snack!": u"Por que n\u00e3o vamos ao refeit\u00f3rio? Podemos fazer um lanchinho!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we join them? We had a long day, and I think we\u2019ve earned a good meal.": u"Por que n\u00e3o nos juntamos a eles? Tivemos um dia longo e acho que merecemos uma boa refei\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Why don\u2019t we lead the scouts together, then?": u"Ent\u00e3o, por que n\u00e3o lideramos os escoteiros juntos?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we set up the tents to get some shade then?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o montamos as barracas para conseguirmos um pouco de sombra?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we sit there then while we\u2019re drying off?": u"Por que n\u00e3o sentamos l\u00e1 enquanto secamos?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we take our time instead? ": u"Por que n\u00e3o fazemos com calma? ",
        u"Why don\u2019t we try that crunch machine? It focuses on your abs!": u"Por que n\u00e3o experimentamos aquela m\u00e1quina abdominal? Ela trabalha o abd\u00f4men!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we try this curl machine? It looks like it focuses on your biceps!": u"Por que n\u00e3o experimentamos esta m\u00e1quina de rosca? Parece focar nos b\u00edceps!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we try this press machine? It focuses on your pecs!": u"Por que n\u00e3o experimentamos esta m\u00e1quina de supino? Ela trabalha os peitorais!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we try this squat machine? It focuses on your glutes!": u"Por que n\u00e3o experimentamos esta m\u00e1quina de agachamento? Ela trabalha os gl\u00fateos!",
        u"Why don\u2019t we walk around for some fresh air first before we get to work?": u"Que tal caminharmos um pouco e tomarmos um ar fresco antes de come\u00e7ar o trabalho?",
        u"Why don\u2019t we work together to transcribe the journal and its pictures online? We could set up a section on the website Jin will be making called \u201cThe History of Camp Buddy\u201d!": u"Por que n\u00e3o trabalhamos juntos para transcrever o di\u00e1rio e colocar suas fotos na internet? Poder\u00edamos criar uma se\u00e7\u00e3o no site que Jin far\u00e1 chamada \u201cA Hist\u00f3ria do Camp Buddy\u201d!",
        u"Why don\u2019t you come along with me?": u"Por que n\u00e3o vem comigo?",
        u"Why don\u2019t you come and join us? You look like you could use some sweating yourself~!": u"Por que n\u00e3o vem se juntar a n\u00f3s? Parece que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 precisando suar um pouco~!",
        u"Why don\u2019t you come and join us? You look like you could use some sweating yourself~!{fast}": u"Por que n\u00e3o vem se juntar a n\u00f3s? Parece que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 precisando suar um pouco~!{fast}",
        u"Why don\u2019t you come with me today?": u"Por que n\u00e3o vem comigo hoje?",
        u"Why don\u2019t you give it a try?": u"Por que n\u00e3o experimenta?",
        u"Why don\u2019t you guys give me a hand, and I\u2019ll treat you both to a beer?": u"Que tal voc\u00eas me darem uma m\u00e3o e eu pagar uma cerveja para os dois?",
        u"Why don\u2019t you guys join us then? There\u2019s plenty of room beside me and Yoshi here in the tub!": u"Ent\u00e3o por que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o entram com a gente? Tem bastante espa\u00e7o aqui na banheira ao lado de mim e do Yoshi!",
        u"Why don\u2019t you guys join us then? There\u2019s plenty of room beside me and Yoshinori here in the tub!": u"Ent\u00e3o por que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o se juntam a n\u00f3s? Tem bastante espa\u00e7o ao lado de mim e do Yoshinori aqui na banheira!",
        u"Why don\u2019t you start trying these suits on to see what matches your style~?": u"Por que voc\u00eas n\u00e3o come\u00e7am a experimentar esses ternos para ver qual combina mais com o estilo de voc\u00eas~?",
        u"Why has nobody pointed out that we have an outdated leader who built this franchise up, then ran it into the ground?!": u"Por que ningu\u00e9m mencionou que temos um l\u00edder ultrapassado que construiu esta franquia e depois a levou \u00e0 ru\u00edna?!",
        u"Why in the world would you demote yourself to such grueling labor?!": u"Por que diabos voc\u00ea se rebaixaria a um trabalho bra\u00e7al t\u00e3o exaustivo?!",
        u"Why noooot? That could be a really cool camp activity! I can already see it\u2026 We\u2019ll call it the Camp Budd-E-Sportsfest!": u"Por que n\u00e3\u00e3\u00e3o? Poderia ser uma atividade muito legal no acampamento! J\u00e1 consigo imaginar\u2026 Vamos chamar de Camp Budd-E-Sportsfest!",
        u"Why not make it happen then~?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que n\u00e3o fazem acontecer~?",
        u"Why not? He\u2019s Snowball\u2019s dad, and it\u2019s what he looks like!": u"Por que n\u00e3o? Ele \u00e9 o pai do Bola de Neve, e \u00e9 exatamente com isso que ele parece!",
        u"Why not?! We can\u2019t let her get away with this!! ": u"Por que n\u00e3o?! N\u00e3o podemos deixar ela sair impune disso!! ",
        u"Why not~? He\u2019ll get real friendly with the other campers then, hehe~": u"Por que n\u00e3o~? Assim ele vai ficar bem \u00edntimo dos outros campistas, hehe~",
        u"Why of course I brought my own attire!": u"Mas \u00e9 claro que trouxe meu pr\u00f3prio traje!",
        u"Why of course! We don\u2019t need to be in such a hurry! You wouldn\u2019t be required to move until the end of spring!": u"Mas \u00e9 claro! N\u00e3o precisamos ter tanta pressa! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisar\u00e1 se mudar at\u00e9 o fim da primavera!",
        u"Why that\u2019s not a very hospitable way to welcome back an alumnus. Let\u2019s just say I\u2019m here on very important business.": u"Ora, essa n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma forma muito hospitaleira de receber uma ex-aluna. Digamos apenas que estou aqui a neg\u00f3cios muito importantes.",
        u"Why would an elite like her have the exact qualifications for a construction project then\u2026?": u"Ent\u00e3o por que algu\u00e9m da elite como ela teria exatamente as qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es necess\u00e1rias para um projeto de constru\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026?",
        u"Why would she keep working at a job where no one likes her?": u"Por que continuaria num emprego em que ningu\u00e9m gosta dela?",
        u"Why yes, I am!": u"Ora, sim, estou!",
        u"Why, I wouldn\u2019t miss it for the world! I just wanted to swing over for a moment and give you a little wedding gift before the ceremony~": u"Ora, eu n\u00e3o perderia isso por nada! S\u00f3 queria passar aqui por um instante e entregar um pequeno presente de casamento antes da cerim\u00f4nia~",
        u"Why, Yoshi\u2026?": u"Por qu\u00ea, Yoshi\u2026?",
        u"Why, even here at an all-expense paid luxury resort, he lacks the dignity to not cause a commotion!": u"Ora, mesmo aqui, num resort de luxo com todas as despesas pagas, ele n\u00e3o tem dignidade suficiente para evitar causar confus\u00e3o!",
        u"Why, is there something wrong? ": u"Por qu\u00ea, tem alguma coisa errada? ",
        u"Why, thank you, sir~ But I\u2019ll admit I only know the basics of palm-reading.": u"Ora, obrigado, senhor~ Mas admito que s\u00f3 conhe\u00e7o o b\u00e1sico de quiromancia.",
        u"Why, that\u2019s not the right answer!": u"Ora, essa n\u00e3o \u00e9 a resposta certa!",
        u"Why, there\u2019s no need for that~ I\u2019ve had plenty of experience with fine dining establishments, and I know exactly what I want!": u"Ora, n\u00e3o h\u00e1 necessidade disso~ Tenho bastante experi\u00eancia com restaurantes requintados e sei exatamente o que quero!",
        u"Why? Afraid I can make Yoshi feel better than you can, Gramps?": u"Por qu\u00ea? Com medo de eu conseguir dar mais prazer ao Yoshi do que voc\u00ea, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"Why\u2014 There\u2019s no way I\u2019d behave with such disgusting table manners, even more so over commoner\u2019s grub!": u"Ora\u2014 Eu jamais teria modos \u00e0 mesa t\u00e3o nojentos, ainda mais por causa de comida de plebeu!",
        u"Why\u2019d you close your eyes, Yoshi? I thought we were done holding back?": u"Por que fechou os olhos, Yoshi? Achei que j\u00e1 tiv\u00e9ssemos parado de nos segurar.",
        u"Why\u2019d you dress like pimps for a boring meeting?": u"Por que se vestiram como cafet\u00f5es para uma reuni\u00e3o chata?",
        u"Will he be okay\u2026?": u"Ele vai ficar bem\u2026?",
        u"Will you be able to have everything prepped in time, Aiden? It seems like a lot to do\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea conseguir\u00e1 preparar tudo a tempo, Aiden? Parece muito trabalho\u2026",
        u"Will you be forever by my side\u2026?": u"Voc\u00ea ficar\u00e1 ao meu lado para sempre\u2026?",
        u"Will you be staying here at camp for the span of this project too?": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m ficar\u00e1 aqui no acampamento durante o projeto?",
        u"Winter has finally come, huh? It\u2019s a good thing our vacation is going to be mostly indoors. ": u"O inverno finalmente chegou, hein? Ainda bem que nossas f\u00e9rias ser\u00e3o principalmente em ambientes fechados. ",
        u"Wipe him down.": u"Limp\u00e1-lo.",
        u"With Emilia pushing a tight schedule, the construction moved forward at a very fast pace.": u"Com Emilia impondo um cronograma apertado, a constru\u00e7\u00e3o avan\u00e7ou em um ritmo muito acelerado.",
        u"With Lloyd and I working together, we thought it would be the perfect opportunity to make this decision.": u"Comigo e Lloyd trabalhando juntos, achamos que esta seria a oportunidade perfeita para tomar essa decis\u00e3o.",
        u"With Yoshi\u2019s arms lovingly entwined around Aiden\u2019s slim yet chiseled body, they share each other\u2019s heat\u2026": u"Com os bra\u00e7os de Yoshi amorosamente entrela\u00e7ados no corpo esbelto, por\u00e9m definido, de Aiden, eles compartilham o calor um do outro\u2026",
        u"With a sexy bod like this? Why wouldn\u2019t I want to show it off~?": u"Com um corp\u00e3o sexy desses? Por que eu n\u00e3o iria querer exibir~?",
        u"With all of these survival tools and knowledge from the lessons we\u2019ve had, you\u2019ll definitely be able to handle an emergency!": u"Com todas essas ferramentas de sobreviv\u00eancia e o conhecimento adquirido nas aulas, voc\u00eas certamente conseguir\u00e3o lidar com uma emerg\u00eancia!",
        u"With all the extra help, we\u2019ll be done in no time!": u"Com toda essa ajuda extra, terminaremos rapidinho!",
        u"With all the new scouts coming in next year, we\u2019ll probably have to stop that. We don\u2019t want a camper catching us, after all.": u"Com todos os novos escoteiros chegando no ano que vem, provavelmente teremos que parar. Afinal, n\u00e3o queremos que algum campista nos pegue.",
        u"With an inspector keeping an eye on us all the time, I\u2019m worried I might just cause trouble for everyone\u2026": u"Com uma inspetora nos vigiando o tempo todo, tenho medo de acabar causando problemas para todos\u2026",
        u"With any luck, we\u2019ll have them out soon and reach an even broader audience.": u"Com sorte, elas ser\u00e3o lan\u00e7adas em breve e alcan\u00e7aremos um p\u00fablico ainda maior.",
        u"With arms that can choke you to death, man boobs, cheese-grater abs, and watermelon-crushing thighs, what more can you ask for?!": u"Com bra\u00e7os capazes de estrangular algu\u00e9m, peit\u00f5es, abd\u00f4men de tanquinho e coxas que esmagam melancias, o que mais se pode querer?!",
        u"With everything going on at work, I needed a bit of time away from the stress, and the rustic lifestyle was perfect for me.": u"Com tudo que anda acontecendo no trabalho, eu precisava de um tempo longe do estresse, e esse estilo de vida r\u00fastico foi perfeito para mim.",
        u"With how Emilia has been acting, I knew something was bound to happen.": u"Pela forma como Emilia vinha agindo, eu sabia que alguma coisa acabaria acontecendo.",
        u"With how interested you are, you\u2019ll learn quick.": u"Com todo esse interesse, voc\u00ea vai aprender r\u00e1pido.",
        u"With how professional and commanding you sound, I\u2019m guessing you\u2019re a Capricorn?": u"Pelo jeito profissional e autorit\u00e1rio com que fala, vou chutar que voc\u00ea \u00e9 Capric\u00f3rnio?",
        u"With real money\u2026?": u"Com dinheiro de verdade\u2026?",
        u"With so many different mediums it could be presented in, you can really appreciate the creative process involved in making it!": u"Com tantas m\u00eddias diferentes em que pode ser apresentado, d\u00e1 para apreciar de verdade o processo criativo envolvido em produzi-lo!",
        u"With someone of Mr. Clermont\u2019s caliber, he\u2019d really put your name out there! ": u"Com algu\u00e9m do calibre do Sr. Clermont, ele realmente faria seu nome ficar conhecido! ",
        u"With that being said, I took it upon myself to arrange a little getaway for the entire team!": u"Dito isso, tomei a liberdade de organizar uma pequena viagem para toda a equipe!",
        u"With that being said, we should all try and get up earlier than usual ": u"Dito isso, todos devemos tentar acordar mais cedo que o habitual.",
        u"With that in mind and considering your staffing issue, I will personally stay here for the span of this project.": u"Com isso em mente e considerando a falta de funcion\u00e1rios, permanecerei aqui pessoalmente durante todo o projeto.",
        u"With that old man?": u"Com aquele velho?",
        u"With the current workforce, we should be done in around two to three days.": u"Com a m\u00e3o de obra atual, devemos terminar em cerca de dois ou tr\u00eas dias.",
        u"With the help of the scouts and the machines, we were able to finish clearing the site today!": u"Com a ajuda dos escoteiros e das m\u00e1quinas, conseguimos terminar de limpar a obra hoje!",
        u"With the majority of the sales being allocated for upgrades around Camp Buddy, we\u2019re able to offer a full sponsorship for many years to come!": u"Com a maior parte das vendas destinada a melhorias no Camp Buddy, poderemos oferecer patroc\u00ednio integral durante muitos anos!",
        u"With the offer, everything here at this branch would remain the same and Goro would still be the leader, but\u2026": u"Com a proposta, tudo nesta unidade continuaria igual e Goro ainda seria o l\u00edder, mas\u2026",
        u"With the scouts gone, I don\u2019t have as many responsibilities\u2026 and I guess that\u2019s given me a lot of time to think about myself for once.": u"Com os escoteiros longe, n\u00e3o tenho tantas responsabilidades\u2026 E acho que isso me deu bastante tempo para pensar em mim mesmo, para variar.",
        u"With the sponsorship going into effect, things are going to be busy from now on, and I expect you both to do your best to help out as much as you can.": u"Com o patroc\u00ednio entrando em vigor, as coisas ficar\u00e3o agitadas de agora em diante, e espero que voc\u00eas dois fa\u00e7am o poss\u00edvel para ajudar o m\u00e1ximo que puderem.",
        u"With the weather getting colder, surely a habit like that is unnecessary. I just thought it was important to point out. ": u"Com o tempo esfriando, esse h\u00e1bito certamente \u00e9 desnecess\u00e1rio. Achei importante mencion\u00e1-lo.",
        u"With this incident, she\u2019s already earned a strike from me. If she keeps up this behavior, I might have to take further action.": u"Com este incidente, ela j\u00e1 recebeu uma advert\u00eancia minha. Se continuar com esse comportamento, talvez eu precise tomar outras medidas.",
        u"With this, Aiden started having much more time for himself, and he used it to make our meals at camp much more special.": u"Com isso, Aiden passou a ter muito mais tempo para si mesmo e o usou para tornar nossas refei\u00e7\u00f5es no acampamento ainda mais especiais.",
        u"With this, it\u2019s\u2026 well\u2026": u"Com isso, fica\u2026 bem\u2026",
        u"With us working side by side, I can make sure to guide you every step of the way.": u"Trabalhando lado a lado, poderei orient\u00e1-lo em cada etapa.",
        u"With you, he\u2019s much more productive! And considering how much he\u2019s mellowed out recently, I don\u2019t think I have to worry about him as much anymore!": u"Com voc\u00ea, ele \u00e9 muito mais produtivo! E considerando o quanto ficou mais tranquilo ultimamente, acho que n\u00e3o preciso mais me preocupar tanto com ele!",
        u"Without knowing the details, it\u2019s no wonder you\u2019re feeling anxious and hesitant, so let\u2019s fix that.": u"Sem conhecer os detalhes, n\u00e3o \u00e9 de se admirar que esteja ansioso e hesitante, ent\u00e3o vamos resolver isso.",
        u"Without me, your whole project wouldn\u2019t have gotten this far, and we wouldn\u2019t be sitting here enjoying this lovely dinner.": u"Sem mim, todo o projeto de voc\u00eas n\u00e3o teria chegado t\u00e3o longe e n\u00e3o estar\u00edamos aqui desfrutando deste ador\u00e1vel jantar.",
        u"Woah, this is a really huge deal, Gramps\u2026 Looking at everything, this is gonna cost a fortune!": u"Uau, isso \u00e9 algo realmente enorme, Vov\u00f4\u2026 Pelo que vejo, vai custar uma fortuna!",
        u"Woah, way to go Dar!": u"Uau, mandou bem, Dar!",
        u"Woah, woah! What are you two arguing about?": u"Ei, ei! Por que voc\u00eas duas est\u00e3o discutindo?",
        u"Wonder what\u2019s for lunch.": u"O que ser\u00e1 que tem para o almo\u00e7o?",
        u"Wonderful! Now, I believe it\u2019s time for me to leave.": u"Maravilha! Agora, acredito que chegou a hora de eu partir.",
        u"Won\u2019t that mess up your vacation?": u"Isso n\u00e3o vai estragar suas f\u00e9rias?",
        u"Woo! It\u2019s starting to snow! Look! Look!": u"Uau! Est\u00e1 come\u00e7ando a nevar! Olhem! Olhem!",
        u"Wood morning, sir!": u"Bom pau, senhor!",
        u"Wooo!! River party!!!": u"Uhuuu!! Festa no rio!!!",
        u"Woooo! Keep the bartender\u2019s special coming then! I\u2019d like to try them all! ": u"Uhuuu! Ent\u00e3o continue trazendo os especiais do bartender! Quero experimentar todos! ",
        u"Woooow!!! My mouth is watering just looking at it! ": u"Uaaaau!!! Minha boca est\u00e1 salivando s\u00f3 de olhar! ",
        u"Woops, looks like the rolls are done.": u"Opa, parece que os p\u00e3ezinhos est\u00e3o prontos.",
        u"Working with you guys the last few months, I got to make amazing memories myself with all of you too.": u"Trabalhando com voc\u00eas nesses \u00faltimos meses, tamb\u00e9m consegui criar lembran\u00e7as incr\u00edveis com todos voc\u00eas.",
        u"Working with you these last few years made me feel useful \u2013 it helped me to move past my pain.": u"Trabalhar com voc\u00ea nesses \u00faltimos anos me fez sentir \u00fatil \u2014 me ajudou a superar minha dor.",
        u"Worried about the offer?": u"Preocupado com a oferta?",
        u"Would you believe it was less than a day after we posted the application that they responded?": u"Acreditam que eles responderam menos de um dia depois de publicarmos a vaga?",
        u"Would you kindly escort her to her room, please?": u"Poderia, por gentileza, acompanh\u00e1-la at\u00e9 o quarto?",
        u"Would you like me to call for the staff to take your coat and your bag? Just so you\u2019d be more comfortable before our meal.": u"Gostaria que eu chamasse um funcion\u00e1rio para guardar seu casaco e sua bolsa? Assim voc\u00ea ficaria mais confort\u00e1vel antes da refei\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Would you like me to call for the staff to take your feathers and purse? Just so you\u2019d be more comfortable before our meal.": u"Gostaria que eu chamasse um funcion\u00e1rio para guardar suas plumas e sua bolsa? S\u00f3 para ficar mais confort\u00e1vel antes da refei\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Would you look at that\u2026 Little Lloyd\u2026 I can\u2019t believe it\u2019s really you!": u"Ora, vejam s\u00f3\u2026 Pequeno Lloyd\u2026 N\u00e3o acredito que \u00e9 mesmo voc\u00ea!",
        u"Would you rather have everyone eat off of dirty plates?": u"Preferia que todo mundo comesse em pratos sujos?",
        u"Would you stop that already?!": u"D\u00e1 para parar com isso de uma vez?!",
        u"Wow Gramps, it sounds like you plan on spending the day here \u2013 making the most of it, right?": u"Uau, vov\u00f4, parece que pretende passar o dia aqui \u2014 aproveitando ao m\u00e1ximo, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Wow! Camp Buddy is gonna be high-tech?!": u"Uau! O Camp Buddy vai ficar supertecnol\u00f3gico?!",
        u"Wow! Everything\u2019s cleared out? That\u2019s amazing! I guess we\u2019re officially back on track then! ": u"Uau! Est\u00e1 tudo limpo? Isso \u00e9 incr\u00edvel! Acho que oficialmente voltamos aos trilhos! ",
        u"Wow! Everything\u2019s cleared over here! Good job, you two!": u"Uau! Est\u00e1 tudo limpo por aqui! Bom trabalho, voc\u00eas dois!",
        u"Wow! Like a live show?": u"Uau! Tipo um show ao vivo?",
        u"Wow! That sounds so gooood! ": u"Uau! Parece t\u00e3o booom! ",
        u"Wow! That\u2019s really inspiring!": u"Uau! Isso \u00e9 realmente inspirador!",
        u"Wow! This is really amazing, Jin! It\u2019s so nostalgic to see ourselves on the website like that!": u"Uau! Isso ficou incr\u00edvel, Jin! D\u00e1 tanta nostalgia ver a gente no site desse jeito!",
        u"Wow! You can really do that?!": u"Uau! Voc\u00ea realmente consegue fazer isso?!",
        u"Wow! You have a nice one too, Yoshi!": u"Uau! O seu tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 bonito, Yoshi!",
        u"Wow!! I can\u2019t wait! I can always count on you and your dad to cook up something good!": u"Uau!! Mal posso esperar! Sempre posso contar com voc\u00ea e seu pai para prepararem algo gostoso!",
        u"Wow, Gramps can\u2019t hide his excitement either, huh?": u"Uau, nem o Vov\u00f4 consegue esconder a anima\u00e7\u00e3o, hein?",
        u"Wow, Gramps!  I\u2019m impressed! You do know what I like!": u"Uau, Vov\u00f4!  Estou impressionado! Voc\u00ea sabe mesmo do que eu gosto!",
        u"Wow, I already forgot about that, hahaha!": u"Uau, eu j\u00e1 tinha esquecido disso, hahaha!",
        u"Wow, I didn\u2019t expect you and Mr. Clermont to jump into work stuff right away this morning.": u"Uau, n\u00e3o esperava que voc\u00ea e o Sr. Clermont fossem falar de trabalho logo de manh\u00e3.",
        u"Wow, I didn\u2019t know you were good with plumbing too!": u"Uau, eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m entendia de encanamento!",
        u"Wow, I never thought I\u2019d hear that from you both!   ": u"Uau, nunca pensei que ouviria isso de voc\u00eas duas!   ",
        u"Wow, I wanna try too!": u"Uau, eu tamb\u00e9m quero tentar!",
        u"Wow, an architect and a construction foreman\u2026 That sounds so official.": u"Uau, um arquiteto e um encarregado de obras\u2026 Parece t\u00e3o profissional.",
        u"Wow, and here I thought this trip couldn\u2019t get any fancier.": u"Uau, e eu achando que esta viagem n\u00e3o poderia ficar ainda mais chique.",
        u"Wow, he read you to filth, huh\u2026?": u"Uau, ele acabou com voc\u00ea, hein\u2026?",
        u"Wow, it\u2019s so different from our old PC\u2026 and it runs so fast too!": u"Uau, \u00e9 t\u00e3o diferente do nosso computador antigo\u2026 e tamb\u00e9m funciona t\u00e3o r\u00e1pido!",
        u"Wow, look at all these fancy-sounding drinks and desserts! They all look delicious, sir!": u"Uau, olhe todas essas bebidas e sobremesas com nomes chiques! Tudo parece delicioso, senhor!",
        u"Wow, now it all makes sense that you\u2019ve always been so fit, sir\u2026 This camp really struck gold with its leader\u2026": u"Uau, agora faz sentido o senhor sempre estar em t\u00e3o boa forma\u2026 Este acampamento tirou a sorte grande com seu l\u00edder\u2026",
        u"Wow, really?": u"Uau, s\u00e9rio?",
        u"Wow, somebody has done their homework! ": u"Uau, algu\u00e9m fez a li\u00e7\u00e3o de casa! ",
        u"Wow, thanks~!": u"Uau, obrigado~!",
        u"Wow, that sounds like a huge upgrade! ": u"Uau, parece uma baita melhoria! ",
        u"Wow, that\u2019s not what I expected to happen.": u"Uau, n\u00e3o era isso que eu esperava que acontecesse.",
        u"Wow, they really love to play in the snow, huh?": u"Uau, eles realmente adoram brincar na neve, hein?",
        u"Wow, we\u2019ve got this sauna to ourselves? I guess I shouldn\u2019t be so surprised since everything else is so fancy\u2026": u"Uau, temos esta sauna s\u00f3 para n\u00f3s? Acho que n\u00e3o deveria ficar t\u00e3o surpreso, j\u00e1 que todo o resto \u00e9 t\u00e3o chique\u2026",
        u"Wow, would you look at that! It\u2019s already printing! That\u2019s really cool.": u"Uau, olhem s\u00f3! J\u00e1 est\u00e1 imprimindo! Isso \u00e9 muito legal.",
        u"Wow, you didn\u2019t have to do all of this, Aiden! But I\u2019ll always say yes to your pulled pork sandwich! ": u"Uau, n\u00e3o precisava fazer tudo isso, Aiden! Mas nunca vou recusar seu sandu\u00edche de carne de porco desfiada! ",
        u"Wow, you really went all out on this, Jin\u2026 I hope it didn\u2019t mess with your other work!": u"Uau, voc\u00ea realmente caprichou nisso, Jin\u2026 Espero que n\u00e3o tenha atrapalhado seu outro trabalho!",
        u"Wow, you two are really in sync with each other. It\u2019s almost like you\u2019ve been cooking together forever.": u"Uau, voc\u00eas dois est\u00e3o realmente em sintonia. Parece at\u00e9 que cozinham juntos h\u00e1 anos.",
        u"Wow. What is wrong with you?": u"Uau. Qual \u00e9 o seu problema?",
        u"Wow\u2026 Check out all the fancy equipment they have here!": u"Uau\u2026 Olhe todos esses equipamentos sofisticados que eles t\u00eam aqui!",
        u"Wow\u2026 Check out all the fancy equipment they have here!  ": u"Uau\u2026 Olhe s\u00f3 todos os equipamentos sofisticados que t\u00eam aqui!  ",
        u"Wow\u2026 Daring\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Ousado\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 Even the crew here have fancy taglines.": u"Uau\u2026 At\u00e9 a equipe daqui tem frases de efeito sofisticadas.",
        u"Wow\u2026 I never knew you guys had to do this much work every day\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Eu n\u00e3o sabia que voc\u00eas precisavam fazer tanto trabalho todos os dias\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 I was expecting that we\u2019d all just stay in one room\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Eu esperava que todos fic\u00e1ssemos em um \u00fanico quarto\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 Look at this place! It\u2019s like we stepped into a whole new world!": u"Uau\u2026 Olhem este lugar! \u00c9 como se tiv\u00e9ssemos entrado em um mundo totalmente novo!",
        u"Wow\u2026 Mr. Clermont is really going all out on Camp Buddy\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 O Sr. Clermont est\u00e1 realmente apostando tudo no Camp Buddy\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 Sounds exciting.": u"Uau\u2026 Parece emocionante.",
        u"Wow\u2026 That sounds\u2026 wild\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Isso parece\u2026 selvagem\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 That\u2019s really heartwarming\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Isso \u00e9 realmente emocionante\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 This is probably the first time a new guy hasn\u2019t been intimidated meeting you, sir\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Esta deve ser a primeira vez que um novato n\u00e3o fica intimidado ao conhec\u00ea-lo, senhor\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 We all look so different here\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Todos n\u00f3s parecemos t\u00e3o diferentes aqui\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 You weren\u2019t kidding\u2026 He really is like Yuri\u2026": u"Uau\u2026 Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava brincando\u2026 Ele realmente \u00e9 como Yuri\u2026",
        u"Wow\u2026 Yuri really went all out again with this event, huh\u2026?": u"Uau\u2026 A Yuri realmente caprichou de novo neste evento, hein\u2026?",
        u"W\u2026 Wh-Wha\u2026 Yoshinori?": u"O\u2026 O-O qu\u00ea\u2026 Yoshinori?",
        u"W\u2026 Wh-Wha\u2026 Yoshinori?{fast}": u"O\u2026 O-O qu\u00ea\u2026 Yoshinori?{fast}",
        u"Y-YURI!! STOP THAT!!": u"Y-YURI!! PARE COM ISSO!!",
        u"Y-Yeaaahh\u2026 S-So good\u2026": u"S-Siiim\u2026 T-T\u00e3o gostoso\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeaah\u2026 T-That\u2019s how I like it, Yoshi\u2026": u"S-Siiim\u2026 \u00c9-\u00c9 assim que eu gosto, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeaah\u2026 T-That\u2019s how I like it, Yoshi\u2026. ": u"S-Siiim\u2026 \u00c9-\u00c9 assim que eu gosto, Yoshi\u2026 ",
        u"Y-Yeah!": u"S-Sim!",
        u"Y-Yeah! Although, I\u2019m totally clueless about what kind of activities there are here\u2026": u"S-Sim! Embora eu n\u00e3o fa\u00e7a ideia de que tipo de atividades existem por aqui\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah! I was just getting some air\u2026!": u"S-Sim! Eu s\u00f3 estava tomando um pouco de ar\u2026!",
        u"Y-Yeah! Why don\u2019t we do that?": u"S-Sim! Por que n\u00e3o fazemos isso?",
        u"Y-Yeah, Aiden\u2026? ": u"S-Sim, Aiden\u2026? ",
        u"Y-Yeah, I am a bit\u2026 My heart is pounding!": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, um pouco\u2026 Meu cora\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 disparado!",
        u"Y-Yeah, I feel like I\u2019m having withdrawals already \u2013 after so much work the last few months, I feel like I should be working still\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, parece que j\u00e1 estou em abstin\u00eancia \u2014 depois de tanto trabalho nos \u00faltimos meses, sinto que ainda deveria estar trabalhando\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, I guess\u2026": u"S-Sim, acho que sim\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, I was gonna say\u2026": u"S-Sim, eu ia dizer isso\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, I wouldn\u2019t want to bother you guys while you\u2019re working, after all.  ": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, afinal, eu n\u00e3o gostaria de incomodar voc\u00eas enquanto estiverem trabalhando.  ",
        u"Y-Yeah, I\u2019ll be fine, Aiden.": u"S-Sim, eu vou ficar bem, Aiden.",
        u"Y-Yeah, I\u2019m a little groggy this morning\u2026 I\u2019ve always been a lightweight when it comes to booze.": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, estou meio grogue esta manh\u00e3\u2026 Sempre fui fraco para bebida.",
        u"Y-Yeah, I\u2019m coming\u2014": u"S-Sim, j\u00e1 vou\u2014",
        u"Y-Yeah, Yoshi...! I'm ready for everything you've got...!": u"S-Sim, Yoshi...! Estou pronto para tudo que voc\u00ea tiver...!",
        u"Y-Yeah, Yoshi\u2026!": u"S-Sim, Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"Y-Yeah, but there\u2019s more to consider besides just the money\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, mas h\u00e1 mais coisas para considerar al\u00e9m do dinheiro\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, haha. Don\u2019t want everyone thinking I partied too hard.": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, haha. N\u00e3o quero que todos pensem que exagerei na festa.",
        u"Y-Yeah, it freaked me out a little\u2026 I thought I might\u2019ve been in trouble or something\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, fiquei um pouco assustado\u2026 Achei que pudesse estar encrencado ou algo assim\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, kinda\u2026 ": u"S-Sim, mais ou menos\u2026 ",
        u"Y-Yeah, let\u2019s call it a night\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, vamos encerrar a noite\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, we were worried things could\u2019ve gone sour again\u2026": u"S-Sim, est\u00e1vamos preocupados que as coisas pudessem dar errado de novo\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah, you\u2019re probably right, Yuri! He\u2019ll probably have some crazy stories to tell, too!": u"\u00c9-\u00c9, voc\u00ea provavelmente tem raz\u00e3o, Yuri! Ele tamb\u00e9m deve ter umas hist\u00f3rias malucas para contar!",
        u"Y-Yeah.": u"S-Sim.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 And from all the stuff laying around, it looks like you\u2019ve been taking care of me, huh\u2026?": u"S-Sim\u2026 E, por todas estas coisas espalhadas, parece que voc\u00ea esteve cuidando de mim, hein\u2026?",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 Even this project takes so much time and effort to make happen\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 At\u00e9 este projeto exige tanto tempo e esfor\u00e7o para acontecer\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I can\u2019t even think of her as a daughter\u2026 It\u2019s too strange.": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 Eu nem consigo pensar nela como filha\u2026 \u00c9 estranho demais.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I don\u2019t think we\u2019ve ever came this much\u2026 We made such a mess\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 Acho que nunca gozamos tanto assim\u2026 Fizemos uma bagun\u00e7a enorme\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I feel so full\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 Estou t\u00e3o cheio\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I kept hoping that he\u2019d show up at the ceremony at least.": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 Eu continuei esperando que pelo menos ele aparecesse na cerim\u00f4nia.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I stopped by after I finished up some coding.": u"S-Sim\u2026 Passei aqui depois que terminei de programar.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s been a while since Yuri let us all drink at the camp. And you know I have a pretty low tolerance for liquor\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 Faz tempo que a Yuri n\u00e3o deixava todo mundo beber no acampamento. E voc\u00ea sabe que minha toler\u00e2ncia a \u00e1lcool \u00e9 bem baixa\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s nice and snug\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 Est\u00e1 bem quentinho e aconchegante\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s so refreshing\u2026 ": u"S-Sim\u2026 \u00c9 t\u00e3o refrescante\u2026 ",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 I\u2019ve never seen it this beautiful before!": u"S-Sim\u2026 Nunca vi este lugar t\u00e3o bonito antes!",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 Let\u2019s get washed up before someone else comes in\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 Vamos nos lavar antes que mais algu\u00e9m entre\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 Something\u2019s not adding up here\u2026": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 Tem alguma coisa que n\u00e3o fecha\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 That\u2019s exactly it\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 \u00c9 exatamente isso\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 The best thing we can do for now is to help her get better.": u"S-Sim\u2026 O melhor que podemos fazer agora \u00e9 ajud\u00e1-la a melhorar.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 The entire room was so tense, especially after you guys left\u2026 Everyone else was staring at us\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 O sal\u00e3o inteiro ficou t\u00e3o tenso, principalmente depois que voc\u00eas sa\u00edram\u2026 Todo mundo estava olhando para n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 The least she could do is apologize to all of us for treating us so crappily\u2026": u"S-Sim\u2026 O m\u00ednimo que poderia fazer \u00e9 pedir desculpas a todos n\u00f3s por ter nos tratado t\u00e3o mal\u2026",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 We decided this on our own, and we don\u2019t really want to force it if it\u2019s not\u2014": u"\u00c9-\u00c9\u2026 N\u00f3s decidimos isso por conta pr\u00f3pria e n\u00e3o queremos for\u00e7ar nada se n\u00e3o for\u2014",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026 just a little nauseous from the bumpy ride. I didn\u2019t think you were serious about driving on a snowy dirt path.": u"S-Sim\u2026 s\u00f3 estou um pouco enjoado por causa do caminho acidentado. N\u00e3o achei que estivesse falando s\u00e9rio sobre pilotar por uma estrada de terra coberta de neve.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026!": u"S-Sim\u2026!",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026! I\u2019ve been looking for you all day.": u"S-Sim\u2026! Passei o dia inteiro procurando voc\u00ea.",
        u"Y-Yeah\u2026!!": u"S-Sim\u2026!!",
