        u"Y-Yes! We prepared this billing estimate for all the materials!": u"S-Sim! Preparamos esta estimativa de custos de todos os materiais!",
        u"Y-Yes, Daddy! I mean\u2026 Sir Goro!": u"S-Sim, Daddy! Quer dizer\u2026 Sr. Goro!",
        u"Y-Yes, but that doesn\u2019t mean I\u2019ll stop looking up to you, sir\u2014 I mean\u2026 Goro\u2026": u"S-Sim, mas isso n\u00e3o significa que vou deixar de admirar o senhor\u2014 Quer dizer\u2026 Goro\u2026",
        u"Y-Yes, gladly\u2026! This way, ma\u2019am!": u"S-Sim, com prazer\u2026! Por aqui, senhora!",
        u"Y-Yes, ma\u2019am\u2026 Our policy states that all VIP guests are insured for emergencies like this. We will not charge you for your extended stay.": u"S-Sim, senhora\u2026 Nossa pol\u00edtica determina que todos os h\u00f3spedes VIP t\u00eam cobertura para emerg\u00eancias como esta. N\u00e3o cobraremos pela estadia prolongada.",
        u"Y-Yes, my name is Hyunjin Choi\u2026! ": u"S-Sim, meu nome \u00e9 Hyunjin Choi\u2026! ",
        u"Y-Yes, of course\u2026 We\u2019d just like to order a bottle of wine!": u"S-Sim, claro\u2026 S\u00f3 gostar\u00edamos de pedir uma garrafa de vinho!",
        u"Y-Yes, sir!": u"S-Sim, senhor!",
        u"Y-Yes, sir! In fact, Yuri and I handed out some drinks and snacks to the other scouts while we were waiting\u2026!": u"S-Sim, senhor! Na verdade, a Yuri e eu distribu\u00edmos bebidas e lanches aos outros escoteiros enquanto esper\u00e1vamos\u2026!",
        u"Y-Yes, sir! You can count on me!": u"S-Sim, senhor! Pode contar comigo!",
        u"Y-Yes, sir. Guilty as charged.": u"S-Sim, senhor. Culpado, confesso.",
