        u"Y-You look stunning, Emilia\u2026": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 deslumbrante, Emilia\u2026",
        u"Y-You mean sleep together with you and all the scouts? I don\u2019t think I\u2019m allowed to\u2026": u"Q-Quer dizer, dormir com voc\u00ea e todos os escoteiros? Acho que n\u00e3o tenho permiss\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Y-You noticed?": u"V-Voc\u00ea percebeu?",
        u"Y-You really are a hot-blooded bull, sir\u2026  ": u"V-Voc\u00ea realmente \u00e9 um touro de sangue quente, senhor\u2026  ",
        u"Y-You should go back to everyone\u2026 They\u2019re waiting for you back there.": u"V-Voc\u00ea deveria voltar para junto do pessoal\u2026 Eles est\u00e3o esperando por voc\u00ea l\u00e1.",
        u"Y-You should\u2019ve said that sooner, then!": u"E-Ent\u00e3o deveria ter dito isso antes!",
        u"Y-You still have energy after all that...? W-We should clean up before someone comes\u2026 ": u"V-Voc\u00ea ainda tem energia depois de tudo isso...? A-A gente devia limpar tudo antes que algu\u00e9m apare\u00e7a\u2026 ",
        u"Y-You think\u2026 it\u2019s COOL?! ": u"V-Voc\u00ea acha\u2026 LEGAL?! ",
        u"Y-You too, sir\u2026 Your cock feels amazing\u2026": u"V-Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m, senhor\u2026 Seu pau \u00e9 incr\u00edvel\u2026",
        u"Y-You too\u2026": u"V-Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"Y-You were distracting me!": u"V-Voc\u00ea estava me distraindo!",
        u"Y-Your phone, though\u2026 It\u2019s broken\u2026 I can ask a scoutmaster to fix it.": u"M-Mas o seu celular\u2026 Ele quebrou\u2026 Posso pedir para um chefe escoteiro consert\u00e1-lo.",
        u"Y-Your size isn\u2019t something anyone can get used to easily\u2026": u"O-O seu tamanho n\u00e3o \u00e9 algo com que algu\u00e9m consiga se acostumar facilmente\u2026",
        u"Y-You\u2019ll get better, Dad! If we just keep doing the treatments, there\u2019s a chance you\u2019ll recover\u2026!": u"V-Voc\u00ea vai melhorar, Pai! Se continuarmos com os tratamentos, existe uma chance de voc\u00ea se recuperar\u2026!",
        u"Y-You\u2019re happy when you\u2019re doing\u2026 Lloyd?": u"V-Voc\u00ea fica feliz quando est\u00e1 fazendo\u2026 Lloyd?",
        u"Y-You\u2019re just seeing things, sir\u2026!": u"O-O senhor est\u00e1 imaginando coisas\u2026!",
        u"Y-You\u2019re letting go of me too\u2026?": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 abrindo m\u00e3o de mim tamb\u00e9m\u2026?",
        u"Y-You\u2019re really into this stuff too\u2026 Jin? ": u"V-Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m gosta mesmo dessas coisas\u2026 Jin? ",
        u"Y-You\u2019re too close...!!": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 perto demais...!!",
