        u"Y-You\u2019re\u2026 NAKED! ": u"V-Voc\u00ea est\u00e1\u2026 PELADO! ",
        u"Y-Yuri! C-Can you move a little?! You\u2019re stepping on my foot!": u"Y-Yuri! P-Pode se afastar um pouco?! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pisando no meu p\u00e9!",
        u"Y-Yuri! Stop that!": u"Y-Yuri! Pare com isso!",
        u"Y-Yuri! What are you wearing!?": u"Y-Yuri! O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 vestindo!?",
        u"Y-Yuri, how are you so calm about this?!": u"Y-Yuri, como voc\u00ea consegue ficar t\u00e3o calma com isso?!",
        u"Y-Yuri?! You\u2019re not gonna catch that bus on foot! Are you stupid?!": u"Y-Yuri?! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o vai alcan\u00e7ar aquele \u00f4nibus a p\u00e9! Ficou maluca?!",
        u"Y-Yuri\u2026 You\u2019re getting distracted already\u2026 Try to make sure you fully check and count all the materials properly.": u"Y-Yuri\u2026 Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 se distraindo\u2026 Procure conferir e contar todos os materiais corretamente.",
        u"Y-Yuri\u2026? I see\u2026": u"Y-Yuri\u2026? Entendo\u2026",
        u"YEAH! Pass over the booze already!": u"ISSO! Passa logo a bebida!",
        u"YES! LET ME GRAB MY CAMERA!": u"SIM! DEIXE-ME PEGAR MINHA C\u00c2MERA!",
        u"YES! Oh my god, no wonder you were acting so weird!!!": u"SIM! Meu Deus, n\u00e3o \u00e9 \u00e0 toa que voc\u00ea estava agindo de um jeito t\u00e3o estranho!!!",
        u"YES! YES! Good idea!": u"SIM! SIM! Boa ideia!",
        u"YES! YES! Thank you! Thank you!": u"SIM! SIM! Obrigado! Obrigado!",
        u"YES, IT IS! I INSIST!": u"SIM, \u00c9! EU INSISTO!",
        u"YES, PLEASE DO! LET ME SEE THE GARDEN OF EDEN!": u"SIM, POR FAVOR! DEIXE-ME VER O JARDIM DO \u00c9DEN!",
        u"YES.": u"SIM.",
        u"YOSHI\u2019S RIGHT, YOU KNOW?! Don\u2019t you agree, Jin?": u"YOSHI TEM RAZ\u00c3O, SABIA?! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o concorda, Jin?",
        u"Yay! Hear that, guys? We can bug them all the time now!": u"Eba! Ouviram, pessoal? Agora podemos incomod\u00e1-los o tempo todo!",
        u"Yay! You better tell me what you think about it, promise?!": u"Yay! Depois me diga o que achou, promete?!",
        u"Yay! You\u2019re a lifesaver, Aiden! I think we\u2019re gonna be really good friends! *whispers* If you survive the pizza, that is\u2026": u"Viva! Voc\u00ea salvou a minha vida, Aiden! Acho que seremos grandes amigos! *sussurra* Isto \u00e9, se sobreviver \u00e0 pizza\u2026",
        u"Yay, Dad! I\u2019m so happy you\u2019re finally giving yourself a well-deserved break!": u"Oba, Pai! Estou t\u00e3o feliz que finalmente vai se dar um descanso merecido!",
        u"Yeaaaahhh, Yoshi and I shower together all the time! You\u2019ve been missing out on the fun stuff, Gramps!": u"Siiim, Yoshi e eu tomamos banho juntos o tempo todo! O senhor est\u00e1 perdendo toda a divers\u00e3o, vov\u00f4!",
        u"Yeaaah I really owe you big time for taking over my job as Dad\u2019s secretary.": u"\u00c9\u00e9\u00e9, eu realmente devo muito a voc\u00ea por assumir meu trabalho como secret\u00e1ria do Pai.",
        u"Yeaaah, I\u2019m still kinda sore from all the shoveling yesterday. I wanna focus on my core and lower body today!": u"Siiim, ainda estou meio dolorido de tanto usar a p\u00e1 ontem. Hoje quero focar no abd\u00f4men e na parte inferior do corpo!",
        u"Yeaaah, it really \u2018suits\u2019 you guys well! Get it? Suit?": u"Siiim, esses trajes realmente \u2018caem\u2019 bem em voc\u00eas! Entenderam? Caem bem?",
        u"Yeaaahh! Come relax with us and have some breakfast. It\u2019s still hella early anyways!": u"Siiim! Venha relaxar com a gente e tomar caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3. Ainda est\u00e1 cedo pra caramba!",
        u"Yeaaahhh\u2026 I thought my legs were gonna break off from that ten-mile hike!": u"Siiim\u2026 Achei que minhas pernas fossem cair depois daquela caminhada de dezesseis quil\u00f4metros!",
        u"Yeaaahhh\u2026 We can\u2019t get back to work at this rate\u2026 I\u2019m just hoping the storm didn\u2019t hit the site.": u"\u00c9\u00e9\u00e9\u00e9\u2026 Desse jeito n\u00e3o vamos conseguir voltar ao trabalho\u2026 S\u00f3 espero que a tempestade n\u00e3o tenha atingido a obra.",
        u"Yeaaahh\u2026  I rarely see you take charge, Yoshi.": u"\u00c9\u00e9\u00e9\u2026  Raramente vejo voc\u00ea assumir o controle, Yoshi.",
        u"Yeaaahh\u2026 I had to make sure everyone was comfortable, so I kept checking on them every now and then.": u"Siiim\u2026 Eu precisava garantir que todos estivessem confort\u00e1veis, ent\u00e3o fui verific\u00e1-los de vez em quando.",
        u"Yeaaahh\u2026 you\u2019ve been shoveling for a while now. Leave this work to the big guys!": u"\u00c9\u00e9\u00e9\u2026 voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 usando a p\u00e1 h\u00e1 um bom tempo. Deixe esse trabalho para os grand\u00f5es!",
        u"Yeaahhh, that\u2019s what I thought for you too, Yoshi.": u"\u00c9\u00e9\u00e9, foi o que eu imaginei para voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m, Yoshi.",
        u"Yeah!": u"Sim!",
        u"Yeah! ": u"Sim! ",
        u"Yeah! And it\u2019s more fun than being stuck here with you old geezers! I wouldn\u2019t wanna go on your boring business trip!": u"Sim! E \u00e9 mais divertido do que ficar preso aqui com voc\u00eas, velhotes! Eu n\u00e3o iria querer participar dessa viagem de neg\u00f3cios chata!",
        u"Yeah! And they\u2019re all going to appear on the website as a blog that interested scouts can read and find out what sorts of experiences they\u2019ll have here at Camp Buddy!": u"Sim! E tudo vai aparecer no site como um blog que escoteiros interessados poder\u00e3o ler para descobrir que tipo de experi\u00eancias ter\u00e3o aqui no Camp Buddy!",
        u"Yeah! Are you planning on using the bathroom, Jin?": u"Sim! Voc\u00ea estava planejando usar o banheiro, Jin?",
        u"Yeah! Besides, haven\u2019t you guys seen each other naked in the showers already? ": u"\u00c9! Al\u00e9m disso, voc\u00eas ainda n\u00e3o se viram pelados no chuveiro? ",
        u"Yeah! Come on Dar, let\u2019s go get a room and you can give me that deep massage you promised!": u"Isso! Vamos, Dar, vamos pegar um quarto e voc\u00ea pode me fazer aquela massagem profunda que prometeu!",
        u"Yeah! Dad bought me a lot of books about camping and survival!": u"Sim! O papai comprou muitos livros sobre acampamento e sobreviv\u00eancia para mim!",
        u"Yeah! Don\u2019t sweat it, Aiden!": u"Tenho! N\u00e3o esquente com isso, Aiden!",
        u"Yeah! Go ahead, try it!": u"Sim! V\u00e1 em frente, experimente!",
        u"Yeah! He usually hung out there whenever he wasn\u2019t with his cabinmate.": u"Sim! Ele costumava ficar por l\u00e1 quando n\u00e3o estava com o colega de cabana.",
        u"Yeah! He\u2019ll be taking the last bunk in here!": u"Sim! Ele ficar\u00e1 com o \u00faltimo beliche daqui!",
        u"Yeah! He\u2019s not the grumpy-scary camp president anymore!": u"\u00c9! Ele n\u00e3o \u00e9 mais aquele presidente do acampamento rabugento e assustador!",
        u"Yeah! I heard aromatherapy is really good to reduce stress and boost energy levels~ So we came here for a soak!": u"Sim! Ouvi dizer que aromaterapia \u00e9 \u00f3tima para reduzir o estresse e aumentar a energia~ Ent\u00e3o viemos dar um mergulho!",
        u"Yeah! I kept telling her to stay behind and wait, but she insisted on coming along!": u"Pois \u00e9! Eu dizia para ela ficar aqui e esperar, mas ela insistiu em vir junto!",
        u"Yeah! I kinda memorized this place when I got my navigation badge!": u"Sim! Eu praticamente decorei este lugar quando conquistei meu distintivo de navega\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Yeah! I know it\u2019ll take a really long time, but once that happens, I\u2019ll be right back here with you!": u"Sim! Sei que vai demorar bastante, mas quando isso acontecer, estarei de volta aqui com voc\u00ea!",
        u"Yeah! I still haven\u2019t heard one word of apology from her! ": u"\u00c9! Ainda n\u00e3o ouvi uma \u00fanica palavra de desculpas dela! ",
        u"Yeah! I think it\u2019s cool! I\u2019m sure Hunter would like it too!": u"Sim! Acho isso legal! Tenho certeza de que o Hunter tamb\u00e9m gostaria!",
        u"Yeah! In a sense, it\u2019s like your job as a scoutmaster!": u"Sim! De certa forma, \u00e9 como o seu trabalho de chefe escoteiro!",
        u"Yeah! It was actually destined from way before!": u"Sim! Na verdade, isso j\u00e1 estava destinado h\u00e1 muito tempo!",
        u"Yeah! It was just like this where Ms. Yuri had costumes ready for everyone!": u"Sim! Foi igual a esta, com a Srta. Yuri preparando fantasias para todo mundo!",
        u"Yeah! It\u2019s not fair that we\u2019re the only ones feeling embarrassed about this!": u"\u00c9! N\u00e3o \u00e9 justo sermos os \u00fanicos passando vergonha com isso!",
        u"Yeah! It\u2019s their first winter, and I think this is their new favorite weather!": u"\u00c9! \u00c9 o primeiro inverno deles, e acho que esse virou o clima favorito!",
        u"Yeah! I\u2019m sure Yoshi, Yuri, and I can sneak away from time to time!": u"Sim! Tenho certeza de que Yoshi, Yuri e eu podemos dar uma escapada de vez em quando!",
        u"Yeah! Let\u2019s get in one last hurrah together before the workers get back!": u"Sim! Vamos aproveitar uma \u00faltima comemora\u00e7\u00e3o juntos antes de os trabalhadores voltarem!",
        u"Yeah! Let\u2019s make sure we have a great time on this vacation!": u"Sim! Vamos aproveitar muito estas f\u00e9rias!",
        u"Yeah! Listen to Mr. Bartender and live a little, Yoshi~!": u"Isso! Ou\u00e7a o Sr. Bartender e aproveite a vida um pouco, Yoshi~!",
        u"Yeah! Maybe some people just made that up! I really don\u2019t like it when others gossip like that!": u"Pois \u00e9! Talvez algumas pessoas tenham inventado tudo! Eu n\u00e3o gosto quando os outros fazem fofocas assim!",
        u"Yeah! Maybe we can join in too!": u"Sim! Talvez a gente tamb\u00e9m possa participar!",
        u"Yeah! Maybe you can make Camp Buddy into your own fantasy world~": u"\u00c9! Talvez voc\u00ea possa transformar o Camp Buddy no seu pr\u00f3prio mundo de fantasia~",
        u"Yeah! No one snooped around and called you out for your personal time!": u"\u00c9! Ningu\u00e9m ficou bisbilhotando e criticando voc\u00ea pelo que faz no seu tempo pessoal!",
        u"Yeah! Once you get the hang of it, learn certain skills and how things work, it\u2019s gonna get easier!": u"\u00c9! Quando pegar o jeito, aprender certas habilidades e entender como tudo funciona, vai ficar mais f\u00e1cil!",
        u"Yeah! People all over the internet love to get into discussions about the meanings!": u"Sim! Pessoas de toda a internet adoram discutir os significados!",
        u"Yeah! Sharing is caring!": u"\u00c9! Compartilhar \u00e9 se importar!",
        u"Yeah! Some people usually take these things for granted, when in fact the author puts weeks and even months into creating something so amazing.": u"Sim! Algumas pessoas n\u00e3o d\u00e3o valor a essas coisas, quando na verdade o autor passa semanas e at\u00e9 meses criando algo t\u00e3o incr\u00edvel.",
        u"Yeah! Surely you could\u2019ve scored if you wanted to!": u"Sim! Com certeza conseguiria algu\u00e9m se quisesse!",
        u"Yeah! Taiga and I like to write too!": u"Sim! Eu e Taiga tamb\u00e9m gostamos de escrever!",
        u"Yeah! That\u2019s Frogboy, he\u2019s Geezer, and that\u2019s Buttcheeks and Sheriff Brokeback!": u"\u00c9! Aquele \u00e9 Garoto-Sapo, ele \u00e9 Velhote, e aqueles s\u00e3o Bund\u00e3o e Xerife Brokeback!",
        u"Yeah! That\u2019s a good way to put it!": u"Sim! \u00c9 uma boa forma de pensar!",
        u"Yeah! That\u2019s one way to think of it!": u"\u00c9! Esse \u00e9 um jeito de ver as coisas!",
        u"Yeah! That\u2019s the spirit, Aiden!": u"\u00c9! Esse \u00e9 o esp\u00edrito, Aiden!",
        u"Yeah! The next term is only a few days away and the scouts are finally gonna see everything we worked hard on.": u"\u00c9! Faltam apenas alguns dias para a pr\u00f3xima temporada, e os escoteiros finalmente v\u00e3o ver tudo pelo que trabalhamos tanto.",
        u"Yeah! We loved it here so much we don\u2019t wanna leave anymore!": u"\u00c9! Gostamos tanto daqui que n\u00e3o queremos mais ir embora!",
        u"Yeah! We tried so many positions. It\u2019s been a while since we got to sweat together like that.": u"Sim! Experimentamos tantas posi\u00e7\u00f5es. Fazia tempo que n\u00e3o su\u00e1vamos juntos daquele jeito.",
        u"Yeah! We\u2019re finally home!": u"\u00c9! Finalmente estamos em casa!",
        u"Yeah! We\u2019re just about to start, though! ": u"Sim! Mas estamos s\u00f3 come\u00e7ando! ",
        u"Yeah! You always had a way of getting everyone to work together while making sure they were having fun too!": u"Sim! Voc\u00ea sempre conseguia fazer todos trabalharem juntos e, ao mesmo tempo, garantir que se divertissem!",
        u"Yeah! You can count on me, Aiden!": u"Sim! Pode contar comigo, Aiden!",
        u"Yeah! You guys should try it too! The water feels really good down there!": u"Sim! Voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m deviam experimentar! A \u00e1gua \u00e9 uma del\u00edcia l\u00e1 embaixo!",
        u"Yeah! You have this manly, almost vanilla-like smell when you sweat. ": u"\u00c9! Quando voc\u00ea sua, fica com um cheiro masculino, quase de baunilha. ",
        u"Yeah! You\u2019re already getting more confident just being with us here!": u"Sim! Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 ficando mais confiante s\u00f3 por estar aqui conosco!",
        u"Yeah, Aiden\u2026 Are you sure you\u2019d want something that big? Everyone would see it all the time!": u"Pois \u00e9, Aiden\u2026 Tem certeza de que gostaria de algo t\u00e3o grande? Todo mundo veria o tempo inteiro!",
        u"Yeah, Dad! We never get to hang out, cause all you do is work!": u"\u00c9, pai! Nunca conseguimos passar um tempo juntos porque voc\u00ea s\u00f3 trabalha!",
        u"Yeah, Dad\u2019s always been my role model\u2026": u"\u00c9, o Pai sempre foi meu exemplo\u2026",
        u"Yeah, Dar was chopping trees down like crazy! I wish I could\u2019ve helped as much as you guys though.": u"Sim, Dar estava derrubando \u00e1rvores feito louco! Queria ter ajudado tanto quanto voc\u00eas.",
        u"Yeah, Darius and I designed a few industrial kitchens before and we know that it gets pretty hectic in there.": u"\u00c9, eu e Darius j\u00e1 projetamos algumas cozinhas industriais e sabemos que o neg\u00f3cio fica bem ca\u00f3tico l\u00e1 dentro.",
        u"Yeah, Darius looks like he\u2019s a mob boss or something! ": u"\u00c9, Darius parece um chef\u00e3o da m\u00e1fia ou algo assim! ",
        u"Yeah, Emilia asked to stay with me so Mr. Clermont could stay in her room for now.": u"Sim, Emilia pediu para ficar comigo para que o Sr. Clermont pudesse usar o quarto dela por enquanto.",
        u"Yeah, I agree\u2026 Could you imagine Camp Buddy as a gacha game?": u"\u00c9, concordo\u2026 Consegue imaginar Camp Buddy como um jogo gacha?",
        u"Yeah, I agree\u2026 Do you have trouble sleeping, Jin?": u"Sim, concordo\u2026 Voc\u00ea tem dificuldade para dormir, Jin?",
        u"Yeah, I already think of everyone here as my own, you know!": u"\u00c9, eu j\u00e1 considero todo mundo aqui como minha pr\u00f3pria fam\u00edlia, sabia!",
        u"Yeah, I bet the only time we\u2019ll have to casually chat with each other will be at night after work, like this!": u"Sim, aposto que nosso \u00fanico momento para conversar tranquilamente ser\u00e1 \u00e0 noite, depois do trabalho, como agora!",
        u"Yeah, I can barely recognize this place compared to how crazy it was here last night!": u"\u00c9, mal d\u00e1 para reconhecer este lugar comparado \u00e0 loucura que estava ontem \u00e0 noite!",
        u"Yeah, I can see that\u2026 all the staff here are hella gorgeous.": u"Sim, d\u00e1 para perceber\u2026 toda a equipe daqui \u00e9 linda demais.",
        u"Yeah, I can understand that\u2026": u"\u00c9, consigo entender\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I can\u2019t wait to see the look on their faces when they see how big the camp is now! ": u"\u00c9, mal posso esperar para ver a cara deles quando perceberem o quanto o acampamento cresceu! ",
        u"Yeah, I could seriously use a hand. ": u"Sim, uma ajuda cairia muito bem. ",
        u"Yeah, I couldn\u2019t have been more wrong.": u"\u00c9, eu n\u00e3o poderia estar mais enganado.",
        u"Yeah, I did struggle earning that cooking badge\u2026 but I had a lot of fun with you because of it!": u"Sim, tive dificuldades para conquistar aquele distintivo de culin\u00e1ria\u2026 Mas, gra\u00e7as a ele, diverti-me muito com voc\u00ea!",
        u"Yeah, I didn\u2019t want to decide on the spot. Especially with something so important.": u"\u00c9, eu n\u00e3o queria decidir na hora. Principalmente algo t\u00e3o importante.",
        u"Yeah, I didn\u2019t want to decide on the spot. Especially with something so important.{fast}": u"\u00c9, eu n\u00e3o queria decidir na hora. Principalmente algo t\u00e3o importante.{fast}",
        u"Yeah, I don\u2019t even know why I tried.": u"Pois \u00e9, nem sei por que tentei.",
        u"Yeah, I don\u2019t think this one was even built to connect to the internet.": u"Pois \u00e9, acho que este nem foi constru\u00eddo para se conectar \u00e0 internet.",
        u"Yeah, I feel like I\u2019m having withdrawals already \u2013 after so much work the last few months, I feel like I should be working still\u2026": u"\u00c9, parece que j\u00e1 estou sentindo abstin\u00eancia \u2014 depois de tanto trabalho nos \u00faltimos meses, sinto que ainda deveria estar trabalhando\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I feel like the old Emilia died and was replaced by an evil doppelganger.": u"\u00c9, parece que a antiga Emilia morreu e foi substitu\u00edda por uma s\u00f3sia maligna.",
        u"Yeah, I guess I kinda am.": u"\u00c9, acho que estou mesmo.",
        u"Yeah, I guess that time we had a group call was kinda fun. Better than hearing Dynamite\u2019s annoying voice all the time.": u"\u00c9, acho que aquela chamada em grupo foi at\u00e9 divertida. Melhor do que ouvir a voz irritante do Dinamite o tempo todo.",
        u"Yeah, I guess there\u2019s not too much we can do without the other workers around.": u"\u00c9, acho que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 muita coisa que possamos fazer sem os outros trabalhadores por perto.",
        u"Yeah, I guess you\u2019re right, Yoshi. This is just another hurdle for us to jump over!": u"\u00c9, acho que tem raz\u00e3o, Yoshi. Este \u00e9 s\u00f3 mais um obst\u00e1culo para superarmos!",
        u"Yeah, I guess you\u2019re right\u2026": u"\u00c9, acho que voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I know how difficult it must\u2019ve been for Aiden to solo the past couple years. I wish I could\u2019ve helped him more.": u"Sim, sei como deve ter sido dif\u00edcil para Aiden cuidar de tudo sozinho nos \u00faltimos anos. Gostaria de ter ajudado mais.",
        u"Yeah, I miss being a scout \u2013 it was the happiest time of my life!  ": u"Sim, sinto falta de ser escoteira \u2014 foi a \u00e9poca mais feliz da minha vida!  ",
        u"Yeah, I miss the old Yoshi too! You were so cheerful and carefree back then, and now you spend so much of your time worrying!  ": u"\u00c9, tamb\u00e9m sinto falta do antigo Yoshi! Voc\u00ea era t\u00e3o alegre e despreocupado naquela \u00e9poca, e agora passa tanto tempo se preocupando!  ",
        u"Yeah, I never thought I\u2019d get a real shot to chase after something I felt was never meant for me.": u"\u00c9, nunca pensei que teria uma chance de verdade de correr atr\u00e1s de algo que eu achava que nunca seria para mim.",
        u"Yeah, I never thought I\u2019d get a real shot to chase after something I felt was never meant for me.{fast}": u"\u00c9, nunca pensei que teria uma chance de verdade de correr atr\u00e1s de algo que eu achava que nunca seria para mim.{fast}",
        u"Yeah, I remember it looking a lot more polished before we left.": u"\u00c9, lembro que tudo parecia bem mais arrumado antes de irmos embora.",
        u"Yeah, I remember\u2026": u"Sim, eu me lembro\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I think Darius and I got a pretty good look at the site. I also got most of the measurements I needed.": u"Sim, acho que Darius e eu conseguimos examinar bem o local. Tamb\u00e9m tirei a maior parte das medidas de que precisava.",
        u"Yeah, I think that\u2019s enough reunions for one day. We have a long day ahead.": u"\u00c9, acho que j\u00e1 tivemos reencontros suficientes por hoje. Temos um longo dia pela frente.",
        u"Yeah, I understand that feeling now\u2026": u"\u00c9, agora eu entendo esse sentimento\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I was super wasted! ": u"\u00c9, eu estava b\u00eabado pra caramba! ",
        u"Yeah, I wouldn\u2019t mind taking it easy after working up a sweat~": u"\u00c9, eu n\u00e3o me importaria de relaxar depois de suar um pouco~",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019d love to! I\u2019ll be honest, I\u2019m very intrigued about all these photos you have!": u"Sim, eu adoraria! Sinceramente, estou muito curioso sobre todas essas fotos que voc\u00eas t\u00eam!",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019ll need to pack up my stuff as well!": u"Sim, tamb\u00e9m vou precisar arrumar minhas coisas!",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m hungry toooo\u2026 I didn\u2019t really eat much last night\u2026": u"\u00c9, eu tamb\u00e9m estou com fooome\u2026 N\u00e3o comi muita coisa ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m not complaining! I won\u2019t say no to more fancy living!": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o vou reclamar! N\u00e3o vou recusar mais um pouco dessa vida de luxo!",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m not really good at it myself, but a part of me kinda wishes I was.": u"\u00c9, eu mesma n\u00e3o sou muito boa nisso, mas uma parte de mim gostaria de ser.",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m not used to it either. It\u2019s usually me who does stuff like that.": u"\u00c9, eu tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o estou acostumado. Normalmente sou eu quem faz esse tipo de coisa.",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m still not doing that.": u"Pois \u00e9, ainda n\u00e3o vou fazer isso.",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019m with Yoshi on this one, not into those.": u"\u00c9, concordo com Yoshi nessa, n\u00e3o gosto dessas coisas.",
        u"Yeah, I\u2019ve had better. But I guess this\u2019ll do.": u"\u00c9, j\u00e1 comi coisa melhor. Mas acho que isso serve.",
        u"Yeah, Lloyd was freaking out the whole ride home about the storm\u2026": u"\u00c9, Lloyd ficou desesperado durante toda a viagem de volta por causa da tempestade\u2026",
        u"Yeah, Natsumi\u2026 We\u2019ve been working all day, surely you can take this chance to enjoy the time with everyone!": u"\u00c9, Natsumi\u2026 Trabalhamos o dia inteiro, voc\u00ea bem que pode aproveitar esta oportunidade para se divertir com todo mundo!",
        u"Yeah, Yoshinori. Get your mind out of the gutter.": u"\u00c9, Yoshinori. Tire a cabe\u00e7a da sarjeta.",
        u"Yeah, a week or two ago Yuri wanted to get rid of Emilia, and now they\u2019re acting like besties.": u"\u00c9, uma ou duas semanas atr\u00e1s a Yuri queria se livrar da Emilia, e agora est\u00e3o agindo como melhores amigas.",
        u"Yeah, although I\u2019m not sure how much more I\u2019m up for, haha!": u"\u00c9, embora eu n\u00e3o saiba quanto mais eu aguento, haha!",
        u"Yeah, and I believe we can take care of her better at camp.": u"\u00c9, e acredito que podemos cuidar melhor dela no acampamento.",
        u"Yeah, and I\u2019ve just been hanging out here at the caf\u00e9! I think this will be my chill spot for the trip~": u"Sim, e s\u00f3 tenho passado o tempo aqui no caf\u00e9! Acho que este ser\u00e1 meu lugar de descanso durante a viagem~",
        u"Yeah, and Mr. Clermont has already set us up with another gig!": u"\u00c9, e o Sr. Clermont j\u00e1 conseguiu outro trabalho para n\u00f3s!",
        u"Yeah, and believe it or not, she even apologized to me for how she\u2019s treated me.": u"\u00c9, e acredite ou n\u00e3o, ela at\u00e9 me pediu desculpas pela forma como me tratou.",
        u"Yeah, and he had the updated schedule, so we couldn\u2019t start.": u"\u00c9, e ele estava com o cronograma atualizado, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o conseguimos come\u00e7ar.",
        u"Yeah, and isn\u2019t Mr. Clermont with you?": u"\u00c9, e o Sr. Clermont n\u00e3o est\u00e1 com voc\u00ea?",
        u"Yeah, and she liked it so much she\u2019s gonna bunk with me from now on!": u"Sim, e ela gostou tanto que vai dividir o quarto comigo de agora em diante!",
        u"Yeah, and that gives me another question!": u"\u00c9, e isso me traz outra pergunta!",
        u"Yeah, and we can handle ourselves, no problem. Dad\u2019s got us covered.": u"\u00c9, e conseguimos nos virar sem problema. O pai est\u00e1 cuidando de n\u00f3s.",
        u"Yeah, and we had to clean up a spill on the kitchen floor *wink*": u"\u00c9, e tivemos que limpar uma coisa que derramou no ch\u00e3o da cozinha *pisca*",
        u"Yeah, and you\u2019re doing great! You\u2019ve taken a lot of work off my plate with all the stirring and washing!": u"Sim, e voc\u00ea est\u00e1 indo muito bem! Tirou bastante trabalho das minhas costas mexendo as panelas e lavando as coisas!",
        u"Yeah, as long as you\u2019re being genuine with your actions, things should work out fine!": u"\u00c9, desde que suas atitudes sejam sinceras, tudo deve dar certo!",
        u"Yeah, because you were a busy scoutmaster back then. ": u"\u00c9, porque voc\u00ea era um chefe escoteiro muito ocupado naquela \u00e9poca. ",
        u"Yeah, but I have to admit, it felt surreal turning down something I spent my whole life working towards\u2026": u"Sim, mas tenho que admitir que foi surreal recusar algo pelo qual trabalhei a vida inteira\u2026",
        u"Yeah, but I have to be honest\u2026 It'll be really sad if I never see some of those campers again.": u"\u00c9, mas preciso ser sincero\u2026 Ser\u00e1 muito triste se eu nunca mais vir alguns daqueles campistas.",
        u"Yeah, but I meant as a group! We used to go on short trips to the beach when we were scouts~": u"Sim, mas quis dizer em grupo! Costum\u00e1vamos fazer pequenas viagens \u00e0 praia quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros~",
        u"Yeah, but he\u2019s told Yoshi a ton of times before that he\u2019ll make him head of the camp once he retires!": u"Sim, mas ele j\u00e1 disse v\u00e1rias vezes ao Yoshi que vai coloc\u00e1-lo \u00e0 frente do acampamento quando se aposentar!",
        u"Yeah, but just give me a sec\u2026 I feel like my insides are sinking\u2026": u"Sim, mas me d\u00ea s\u00f3 um segundo\u2026 Parece que minhas entranhas est\u00e3o afundando\u2026",
        u"Yeah, but that was like a work trip! This time we won\u2019t have any responsibilities\u2026 and that\u2019s basically never happened before!": u"Sim, mas aquilo foi mais como uma viagem de trabalho! Desta vez n\u00e3o teremos responsabilidade nenhuma\u2026 e isso praticamente nunca aconteceu antes!",
        u"Yeah, but that\u2019s how it goes, and I know you\u2019d be successful at it!": u"\u00c9, mas faz parte, e sei que voc\u00ea teria sucesso nisso!",
        u"Yeah, by the looks of things I think we\u2019ll need another day to finish up.": u"\u00c9, pelo jeito acho que vamos precisar de mais um dia para terminar.",
        u"Yeah, definitely! It really looked crazy fancy, just like the stuff at the hotel!": u"Sim, com certeza! Ficou sofisticado demais, igualzinho \u00e0s coisas do hotel!",
        u"Yeah, definitely! It\u2019s gonna be a long winter \u2013 we\u2019ll be working till all the snow melts outside!": u"\u00c9, com certeza! Vai ser um inverno longo \u2014 vamos trabalhar at\u00e9 toda a neve l\u00e1 fora derreter!",
        u"Yeah, don\u2019t be such a pain in the ass.": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o seja t\u00e3o insuport\u00e1vel.",
        u"Yeah, even the water feels expensive\u2026 It\u2019s kinda sparkly and it smells like flowers\u2026": u"\u00c9, at\u00e9 a \u00e1gua parece cara\u2026 Ela meio que brilha e tem cheiro de flores\u2026",
        u"Yeah, everyone really worked hard today!  The place looks a lot bigger without all the vegetation.": u"Sim, todos trabalharam muito hoje! O lugar parece bem maior sem toda aquela vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Yeah, exactly!": u"Sim, exatamente!",
        u"Yeah, for some weird reason they like this old geezer. ": u"\u00c9, por algum motivo estranho eles gostam desse velhote. ",
        u"Yeah, good thing I was up extra early when they arrived or else nobody would\u2019ve been around to let them in! ": u"Sim, ainda bem que acordei bem cedo quando chegaram, sen\u00e3o n\u00e3o haveria ningu\u00e9m para deix\u00e1-los entrar! ",
        u"Yeah, gotta flex to impress, right?! ": u"Sim, \u00e9 preciso mostrar os m\u00fasculos para impressionar, certo?! ",
        u"Yeah, having Yuri around actually made me feel a lot more comfortable. She\u2019s actually my first IRL friend that I can share the same interests with! ": u"\u00c9, ter a Yuri por perto realmente me deixou muito mais \u00e0 vontade. Na verdade, ela \u00e9 minha primeira amiga na vida real com quem posso compartilhar os mesmos interesses! ",
        u"Yeah, having a job means I have access to adult money\u2026 and that means I have the freedom to use it on whatever I want\u2026": u"\u00c9, ter emprego significa que tenho dinheiro de adulto\u2026 e isso significa que tenho liberdade para gastar no que quiser\u2026",
        u"Yeah, he\u2019s just passed out.": u"Sim, ele s\u00f3 est\u00e1 apagado.",
        u"Yeah, he\u2019s part dog, so don\u2019t be too surprised if he pees in your room to mark his territory.": u"Pois \u00e9, ele \u00e9 meio cachorro, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o fique muito surpreso se ele urinar no seu quarto para marcar territ\u00f3rio.",
        u"Yeah, if we\u2019re gonna get conned by these boomers into free labor, might as well make it entertaining, right?": u"\u00c9, se esses velhotes v\u00e3o nos enganar para conseguir m\u00e3o de obra gr\u00e1tis, pelo menos podemos tornar isso divertido, n\u00e9?",
        u"Yeah, it feels like we\u2019re going on a school field trip!": u"Sim, parece que vamos fazer uma excurs\u00e3o escolar!",
        u"Yeah, it feels strange after a couple weeks of quiet, haha!": u"\u00c9, parece estranho depois de algumas semanas de sil\u00eancio, haha!",
        u"Yeah, it goes way back to our scout days.": u"\u00c9, isso vem desde nossos tempos de escoteiros.",
        u"Yeah, it is.": u"Sim, est\u00e1.",
        u"Yeah, it looks like the sky is clear, and I can see cars moving around outside so everything must\u2019ve been resolved.": u"\u00c9, parece que o c\u00e9u est\u00e1 limpo, e consigo ver carros circulando l\u00e1 fora, ent\u00e3o tudo deve ter sido resolvido.",
        u"Yeah, it really was just her defense mechanism\u2026 ": u"\u00c9, realmente era apenas o mecanismo de defesa dela\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah, it was another surprise arrangement by Mr. Clermont.": u"Sim, foi outra surpresa organizada pelo Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019ll be just like old times! We used to spend so much time together.": u"Sim, ser\u00e1 como nos velhos tempos! Costum\u00e1vamos passar tanto tempo juntos.",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019s as if the stars aligned and we\u2019re all having a reunion, aren\u2019t we?": u"Pois \u00e9, parece at\u00e9 que os astros se alinharam e estamos todos nos reencontrando, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019s been such a long week working with the scouts on the fundraiser, and this was a great way to celebrate.": u"\u00c9, foi uma semana t\u00e3o longa trabalhando com os escoteiros na arrecada\u00e7\u00e3o, e essa foi uma \u00f3tima maneira de comemorar.",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019s so good covering your meat, I can never get enough of it. ": u"Sim, \u00e9 t\u00e3o bom cobrindo sua carne que nunca me canso dele. ",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019s so pretty\u2026 In all my years at camp, I\u2019ve never seen it like this.": u"Sim, \u00e9 t\u00e3o bonita\u2026 Em todos os meus anos no acampamento, nunca a vi assim.",
        u"Yeah, it\u2019s time to get back to the grind, even though I\u2019m dragging a little bit.": u"\u00c9, hora de voltar ao trabalho, mesmo eu estando meio acabado.",
        u"Yeah, lighten up, will you?! We literally finished the project; you should be celebrating!": u"\u00c9, relaxa um pouco! N\u00f3s literalmente terminamos o projeto; voc\u00ea deveria estar comemorando!",
        u"Yeah, like once or twice every term! ": u"Sim, uma ou duas vezes por temporada! ",
        u"Yeah, luckily Darius\u2019 attire came with these suspenders he didn\u2019t need since he\u2019s wearing a closed suit.": u"Sim, por sorte o traje do Darius veio com estes suspens\u00f3rios, dos quais ele n\u00e3o precisava porque est\u00e1 usando o palet\u00f3 fechado.",
        u"Yeah, man. It\u2019s only, like, 6:00 AM! Chill!": u"Pois \u00e9, cara. Ainda s\u00e3o, tipo, seis da manh\u00e3! Relaxe!",
        u"Yeah, me too. It\u2019s a nice feeling compared to a long day of work.": u"\u00c9, eu tamb\u00e9m. \u00c9 uma sensa\u00e7\u00e3o boa comparada a um longo dia de trabalho.",
        u"Yeah, no kidding. This place is almost too perfect.": u"Sim, nem me fale. Este lugar \u00e9 quase perfeito demais.",
        u"Yeah, or else I\u2019d be less than halfway through the list.": u"\u00c9, sen\u00e3o eu ainda nem teria chegado \u00e0 metade da lista.",
        u"Yeah, plus I wouldn\u2019t have ever been able to deal with all that stuff from my past, so I\u2019m glad.": u"\u00c9, al\u00e9m disso, eu nunca teria conseguido lidar com todas aquelas coisas do meu passado, ent\u00e3o fico feliz.",
        u"Yeah, pretty much! He always encouraged me to pursue my own interests no matter what they were!": u"\u00c9, basicamente isso! Ele sempre me incentivou a seguir meus pr\u00f3prios interesses, n\u00e3o importava quais fossem!",
        u"Yeah, she didn\u2019t\u2026": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o reagiu\u2026",
        u"Yeah, sir! Thanks for taking us here for the field trip!": u"Sim, senhor! Obrigado por nos trazer aqui para a excurs\u00e3o!",
        u"Yeah, sir\u2026 If anything, it made us appreciate you even more.": u"Sim, senhor\u2026 Na verdade, isso fez com que admir\u00e1ssemos o senhor ainda mais.",
        u"Yeah, so it\u2019s not fair I\u2019m the only one!": u"Pois \u00e9, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o \u00e9 justo eu ser o \u00fanico!",
        u"Yeah, so much so she\u2019s staying permanently. ": u"Sim, tanto que ela vai ficar permanentemente. ",
        u"Yeah, some groups are already checking out.": u"\u00c9, alguns grupos j\u00e1 est\u00e3o fazendo o check-out.",
        u"Yeah, sorry about that\u2026 I wasn\u2019t careful at all, Yoshi.": u"Sim, desculpe por isso\u2026 N\u00e3o tive cuidado nenhum, Yoshi.",
        u"Yeah, stop worrying about us! Just go ahead already, everyone\u2019s waiting for you out there!": u"Sim, pare de se preocupar com a gente! V\u00e1 logo, todo mundo est\u00e1 esperando voc\u00ea l\u00e1 fora!",
        u"Yeah, tell her, Gramps! ": u"Sim, diga a ela, vov\u00f4! ",
        u"Yeah, tell me about it. She really put me in the spotlight back there and called me out in front of you guys.": u"Nem me fale. Ela me colocou no centro das aten\u00e7\u00f5es e me criticou na frente de voc\u00eas.",
        u"Yeah, tell us, Yoshi\u2026!": u"Sim, conte para n\u00f3s, Yoshi\u2026!",
        u"Yeah, that makes sense\u2026 I\u2019m really glad Gramps is taking it easy on Emilia... And even more so that he\u2019s taking care of her right now!": u"\u00c9, faz sentido\u2026 Fico muito feliz que o Vov\u00f4 esteja pegando leve com Emilia\u2026 E ainda mais por estar cuidando dela agora!",
        u"Yeah, that\u2019s me, Vera, and a very tiny Yuri.": u"Sim, somos eu, Vera e uma Yuri bem pequenininha.",
        u"Yeah, the fact that we\u2019re staying here almost makes me feel guilty, if I\u2019m being honest. ": u"Sim, para ser sincero, o fato de nos hospedarmos aqui quase me faz sentir culpado. ",
        u"Yeah, the scouts always ignore you when you do it.": u"\u00c9, os escoteiros sempre ignoram voc\u00ea quando faz isso.",
        u"Yeah, they look like they\u2019re having harmless fun, anyways.": u"\u00c9, parece que eles s\u00f3 est\u00e3o se divertindo sem fazer mal a ningu\u00e9m.",
        u"Yeah, this is probably one of the biggest sites I\u2019ve ever worked on! I\u2019m really excited to start ground-breaking soon!": u"Sim, este provavelmente \u00e9 um dos maiores terrenos em que j\u00e1 trabalhei! Estou ansioso para come\u00e7armos a constru\u00e7\u00e3o em breve!",
        u"Yeah, this looks like it took a lot of effort to do! ": u"\u00c9, parece que deu muito trabalho fazer isso! ",
        u"Yeah, this place is a lot more like a club than a casual pub\u2026": u"\u00c9, este lugar parece muito mais uma boate do que um pub casual\u2026",
        u"Yeah, this place is a lot more like a party club than a casual pub\u2026": u"Sim, este lugar parece muito mais uma boate do que um bar casual\u2026",
        u"Yeah, this place is amazing. Our room even has a balcony overlooking the entire island\u2026": u"\u00c9, este lugar \u00e9 incr\u00edvel. Nosso quarto tem at\u00e9 uma varanda com vista para a ilha inteira\u2026",
        u"Yeah, to think that less than a year ago he wanted nothing to do with Camp Buddy, or us, anymore.": u"\u00c9, pensar que h\u00e1 menos de um ano ele n\u00e3o queria mais saber do Camp Buddy nem de n\u00f3s.",
        u"Yeah, totally! After all, I\u2019m sure Jin would wanna hear what costume I had on that night~": u"Claro! Afinal, tenho certeza de que o Jin vai querer saber qual fantasia eu usei naquela noite~",
        u"Yeah, totally! We could use some more hands around here!": u"Sim, com certeza! Algumas m\u00e3os a mais seriam \u00f3timas por aqui!",
        u"Yeah, wait till you see the pool\u2026 It\u2019s filthy!": u"Pois \u00e9, espere at\u00e9 ver a piscina\u2026 Est\u00e1 imunda!",
        u"Yeah, way to go, dude! You\u2019re a lean, mean, twinky machine!": u"Isso a\u00ed, cara! Voc\u00ea \u00e9 uma m\u00e1quina twink magrinha e malvada!",
        u"Yeah, we blend right in!": u"Sim, combinamos perfeitamente com o lugar!",
        u"Yeah, we can\u2019t let Yoshi finish everything up without us, haha!": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o podemos deixar o Yoshi terminar tudo sem a gente, haha!",
        u"Yeah, we can\u2019t really plan out the repairs without getting a clearer view.": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para planejar os reparos sem termos uma vis\u00e3o mais clara.",
        u"Yeah, we could even camp out, no need for fancy hotels!": u"Sim, poder\u00edamos at\u00e9 acampar, sem precisar de hot\u00e9is chiques!",
        u"Yeah, we don\u2019t have to read through tons and tons of application forms like we did last term!": u"\u00c9, n\u00e3o precisamos mais ler pilhas e pilhas de formul\u00e1rios de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o como na temporada passada!",
        u"Yeah, we have! Even though everyone has started getting busy with their own things, we still find time to catch up with each other.  ": u"Sim! Embora todos tenham come\u00e7ado a se ocupar com as pr\u00f3prias coisas, ainda encontramos tempo para colocar a conversa em dia.  ",
        u"Yeah, we saw it and came down right away\u2026": u"Sim, vimos e descemos imediatamente\u2026",
        u"Yeah, weren\u2019t you enjoying a snoopfest with Yuri?": u"\u00c9, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o estava se divertindo bisbilhotando com a Yuri?",
        u"Yeah, we\u2019re here to help you guys clear out the snow.": u"\u00c9, viemos ajudar voc\u00eas a retirar a neve.",
        u"Yeah, what Emilia and Yuri said just got me thinking\u2026": u"\u00c9, o que Emilia e Yuri disseram me deixou pensando\u2026",
        u"Yeah, what Jin said! This is why we didn\u2019t want to show you, \u2019cause I knew you\u2019d jump to conclusions!": u"Isso, o que o Jin disse! Por isso n\u00e3o quer\u00edamos mostrar, porque eu sabia que voc\u00eas tirariam conclus\u00f5es precipitadas!",
        u"Yeah, who knew you\u2019d turn out to be such a hunk!": u"Pois \u00e9, quem diria que voc\u00ea ficaria t\u00e3o gostos\u00e3o!",
        u"Yeah, yeah! Now come on, we need to distribute these lunches!": u"T\u00e1, t\u00e1! Agora vamos, precisamos distribuir esses almo\u00e7os!",
        u"Yeah, yeah, I know! But did we really HAVE to wait for two weeks to actually start camping at a summer camp?": u"Sim, sim, eu sei! Mas precis\u00e1vamos MESMO esperar duas semanas para acampar de verdade em um acampamento de ver\u00e3o?",
        u"Yeah, yeah, it\u2019s fine! How many times do I have to tell you?": u"Sim, sim, est\u00e1 tudo bem! Quantas vezes eu tenho que dizer?",
        u"Yeah, yeah, whatever you say! Either way, I\u2019m not gonna lie, it\u2019s nice to finally have a girl I can hang out with for once! ": u"Sim, sim, como quiser! De qualquer forma, n\u00e3o vou mentir, \u00e9 bom finalmente ter uma garota com quem eu possa passar um tempo! ",
        u"Yeah, yeah\u2026 ": u"Sim, sim\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah, you always get hyped up about any activities you get to do with them.": u"Sim, voc\u00ea sempre se empolga com qualquer atividade que possa fazer com eles.",
        u"Yeah, you can leave these guys to me! I\u2019ll make sure they don\u2019t cause a fuss later, hahaha!": u"Sim, pode deix\u00e1-los comigo! Garantirei que n\u00e3o causem confus\u00e3o mais tarde, hahaha!",
        u"Yeah, you did. A lot more than you were supposed to\u2026": u"\u00c9, se divertiu mesmo. Muito mais do que deveria\u2026",
        u"Yeah, you guys are right\u2026! ": u"\u00c9, voc\u00eas t\u00eam raz\u00e3o\u2026! ",
        u"Yeah, you must be used to stuffing things in your mouth, huh bro?": u"\u00c9, voc\u00ea deve estar acostumado a enfiar coisas na boca, hein, mano?",
        u"Yeah, you\u2019re like the closest to her out of all of us.": u"\u00c9, voc\u00ea \u00e9 quem mais se aproximou dela entre todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"Yeah, you\u2019re right, Yoshi!": u"\u00c9, voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o, Yoshi!",
        u"Yeah, you\u2019re right\u2026 And I\u2019ve been looking forward to spending some quality time with you, but I guess everything being so fancy caught me off guard\u2026": u"Sim, tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 Eu estava ansioso para passar um tempo de qualidade com voc\u00ea, mas acho que toda essa sofistica\u00e7\u00e3o me pegou de surpresa\u2026",
        u"Yeah, you\u2019ve never really seemed like that kind of guy since we\u2019ve known you.": u"\u00c9, desde que conhecemos voc\u00ea, nunca pareceu ser esse tipo de cara.",
        u"Yeah.": u"Sim.",
        u"Yeah. And on top of that, even though I warned her before we left for the trip, she still went out of her way to harass Aiden.": u"\u00c9. E, al\u00e9m disso, mesmo depois de eu t\u00ea-la avisado antes da viagem, ela ainda fez quest\u00e3o de atormentar o Aiden.",
        u"Yeah. And on top of that, even though I warned her before we left for the trip, she still went out of her way to insult Sir Goro.": u"\u00c9. E al\u00e9m disso, mesmo depois de eu avis\u00e1-la antes de sairmos para a viagem, ela ainda fez quest\u00e3o de insultar o Sr. Goro.",
        u"Yeah. But I always made sure no one noticed. ": u"Sim. Mas sempre me certificava de que ningu\u00e9m percebesse. ",
        u"Yeah. But don\u2019t worry, she\u2019s doing a lot better now and just needs to continue resting! ": u"Sim. Mas n\u00e3o se preocupem, ela est\u00e1 muito melhor agora e s\u00f3 precisa continuar descansando! ",
        u"Yeah. He might need some encouragement getting out of his room.": u"Sim. Talvez ele precise de um incentivo para sair do quarto.",
        u"Yeah. He never got angry, even when we were scouts.": u"\u00c9. Ele nunca ficava bravo, nem mesmo quando \u00e9ramos escoteiros.",
        u"Yeah. I figured we could really use the extra hands to get things done, so I called Yoichi and Taiga yesterday.": u"Sim. Achei que uma ajuda extra seria muito \u00fatil, ent\u00e3o liguei para Yoichi e Taiga ontem.",
        u"Yeah. I, uhh\u2026 guess you could say that.": u"Sim. Eu, hum\u2026 acho que se pode dizer isso.",
        u"Yeah. It\u2019s kind of a cockblock, huh? But can\u2019t blame anyone for the weather!": u"\u00c9. Meio que estraga os planos, n\u00e9? Mas n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para culpar ningu\u00e9m pelo clima!",
        u"Yeah. It\u2019s nice to take a short break to rest our backs and breathe a little.": u"\u00c9. \u00c9 bom fazer uma pequena pausa para descansar as costas e respirar um pouco.",
        u"Yeah. It\u2019s ten times more ink-efficient than the old one. I recommended this one when I found that you guys print out a lot of pamphlets and ad materials.": u"Sim. Ela usa tinta com dez vezes mais efici\u00eancia que a antiga. Recomendei este modelo quando descobri que voc\u00eas imprimem muitos panfletos e materiais publicit\u00e1rios.",
        u"Yeah. I\u2019d like to see you in it.": u"Sim. Gostaria de ver voc\u00ea usando.",
        u"Yeah. I\u2019d rather her act like this than be stressed about Emilia.": u"\u00c9. Prefiro que ela aja assim do que fique estressada por causa de Emilia.",
        u"Yeah. I\u2019ll get us some and we can chill here for a while. Everything we order is paid for anyway.": u"Sim. Vou pegar algumas coisas para n\u00f3s e podemos relaxar aqui por um tempo. Tudo o que pedirmos j\u00e1 est\u00e1 pago mesmo.",
        u"Yeah. I\u2019m definitely not surprised that you ended up being a scoutmaster here, Yoshinori. You\u2019ve always been the model scout.": u"Pois \u00e9. N\u00e3o me surpreende nem um pouco que tenha se tornado chefe escoteiro daqui, Yoshinori. Voc\u00ea sempre foi o escoteiro exemplar.",
        u"Yeah. I\u2019m sure you guys remember how I was way too excitable in my younger days.": u"Sim. Tenho certeza de que voc\u00eas lembram como eu era agitado demais quando era mais novo.",
        u"Yeah. Last year\u2019s batch was definitely one of the closest groups we\u2019ve ever had at the camp.": u"Sim. A turma do ano passado foi, sem d\u00favida, um dos grupos mais unidos que j\u00e1 tivemos no acampamento.",
        u"Yeah. Our dynamic was still the same, with me being your superior, but you still managed to always be your carefree self.": u"Sim. Nossa din\u00e2mica ainda era a mesma, comigo sendo seu superior, mas voc\u00ea sempre conseguia ser aquele seu eu despreocupado.",
        u"Yeah. That sounds perfect!": u"Sim. Parece perfeito!",
        u"Yeah. Try and rest for now, Emilia. ": u"\u00c9. Tente descansar por enquanto, Emilia. ",
        u"Yeah. What are we supposed to pack even?": u"Pois \u00e9. Afinal, o que devemos levar?",
        u"Yeah. Where\u2019s Lloyd?": u"Sim. Onde est\u00e1 o Lloyd?",
        u"Yeah. You don\u2019t need to check everything for me now, Yoshinori. I can handle myself.": u"Sim. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa verificar tudo por mim agora, Yoshinori. Sei cuidar de mim mesmo.",
        u"Yeah... It\u2019s as if she doesn\u2019t have a clue what she\u2019s doing\u2026": u"\u00c9... Parece que ela n\u00e3o faz ideia do que est\u00e1 fazendo\u2026",
        u"Yeah?": u"Sim?",
        u"Yeahhhh! Do that and get back quick so we can eat!": u"Siiim! Fa\u00e7a isso e volte r\u00e1pido para podermos comer!",
        u"Yeah~! It was so wonderful to be able to write down memories, and I wanted them to be able to experience that as well!": u"Sim~! Era t\u00e3o maravilhoso poder registrar as lembran\u00e7as, e eu queria que eles tamb\u00e9m tivessem essa experi\u00eancia!",
        u"Yeah\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Although I barely recognized you, Goro\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Embora eu mal tenha reconhecido voc\u00ea, Goro\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 And Yuri didn\u2019t take it so well\u2026 I\u2019ve never seen her lose her temper like that!": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 E Yuri n\u00e3o reagiu nada bem\u2026 Nunca a vi perder a paci\u00eancia daquele jeito!",
        u"Yeah\u2026 And that would give me more time to do other important tasks\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 E isso me daria mais tempo para realizar outras tarefas importantes\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 And the showers in our cabin aren\u2019t working so we\u2019re looking for a place to wash off.": u"\u00c9\u2026 E os chuveiros da nossa cabana n\u00e3o est\u00e3o funcionando, ent\u00e3o estamos procurando um lugar para nos lavar.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 But I kinda get what you\u2019re saying, Yoshi.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Mas acho que entendo o que voc\u00ea quer dizer, Yoshi.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 But with the curriculum I have, I\u2019m gonna be really busy.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Mas com o curr\u00edculo que vou ter, vou ficar muito ocupado.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Can\u2019t I have my chicken noodle soup in peace? I need to dispel all this tension\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 N\u00e3o posso tomar minha sopa de frango com macarr\u00e3o em paz? Preciso aliviar toda essa tens\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Compared to Camp Buddy, this is a completely different world.": u"Sim\u2026 Comparado ao Camp Buddy, este \u00e9 um mundo completamente diferente.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Despite these damages, it was the right call for us to a take that break. ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Apesar desses danos, foi a decis\u00e3o certa fazermos aquela pausa. ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Even if I\u2019d known about this, I doubt anything in my wardrobe would be fitting for tonight!": u"\u00c9\u2026 Mesmo se eu soubesse disso, duvido que alguma roupa do meu guarda-roupa fosse adequada para esta noite!",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Fancy, isn\u2019t it? I was surprised too the first time I came here.": u"Sim\u2026 Sofisticado, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Tamb\u00e9m fiquei surpreso na primeira vez que vim aqui.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Good call.": u"Sim\u2026 Boa decis\u00e3o.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Hell, but still fun\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Um inferno, mas ainda divertido\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 He\u2019s been trying to be more understanding and forgiving than he was before.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Ele vem tentando ser mais compreensivo e tolerante do que era antes.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Hmm, let\u2019s see\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 Hmm, vejamos\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I can tell that lady does not like us at all.": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 D\u00e1 para perceber que aquela mulher n\u00e3o gosta nada de n\u00f3s.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I can\u2019t remember the last time I took an actual bath\u2026 We only have showers back at the camp, after all.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Nem me lembro da \u00faltima vez que tomei um banho de banheira de verdade\u2026 Afinal, no acampamento s\u00f3 temos chuveiros.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I can\u2019t remember the last time I took an actual bath\u2026 We\u2019ve only had showers back at camp.": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 Nem me lembro da \u00faltima vez que tomei um banho de banheira de verdade\u2026 No acampamento, s\u00f3 temos chuveiros.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I don't understand why she labeled the construction department as \u2018DELAYED\u2019 in red ink and all caps. As far as I know we were doing just fine\u2026": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 N\u00e3o entendo por que ela marcou o setor de constru\u00e7\u00e3o como \u2018ATRASADO\u2019, em vermelho e letras mai\u00fasculas. At\u00e9 onde sei, est\u00e1vamos indo muito bem\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll ever get used to being this laid back.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Acho que nunca vou me acostumar a ficar t\u00e3o tranquilo assim.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I don\u2019t think screaming like that makes the service any faster\u2026": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 Acho que gritar assim n\u00e3o torna o servi\u00e7o mais r\u00e1pido\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I guess I shouldn\u2019t think of it as a bad thing.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Acho que n\u00e3o deveria enxergar isso como algo ruim.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I guess it\u2019s kinda the same\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Acho que \u00e9 mais ou menos a mesma coisa\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I guess that\u2019s my cue to pack up too.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Acho que essa \u00e9 minha deixa para arrumar minhas coisas tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I had to look up how much it cost to book this place, and honestly it\u2019s nowhere near what I can afford. ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Tive que pesquisar quanto custa reservar este lugar e, sinceramente, est\u00e1 muito al\u00e9m do que posso pagar. ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I have some stuff I wanted to work on still.": u"Sim\u2026 Ainda tenho algumas coisas em que gostaria de trabalhar.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I just slipped on my way down.": u"Sim\u2026 Eu apenas escorreguei ao descer.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I keep waking up every day ready to work, but I don\u2019t have any specific jobs other than just overseeing things\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 Acordo todos os dias pronto para trabalhar, mas n\u00e3o tenho nenhuma tarefa espec\u00edfica al\u00e9m de supervisionar as coisas\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I know. The only thing left to do is to wait for the scouts.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu sei. A \u00fanica coisa que resta fazer \u00e9 esperar pelos escoteiros.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I know\u2026 ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu sei\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I mean, you were just trying to avoid the conversation\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Quero dizer, voc\u00ea acabou de tentar fugir da conversa\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I miss being a scout too.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m sinto falta de ser escoteiro.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I really got the chance to connect with the campers as well\u2026 It's probably the greatest term I've ever had.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m tive a oportunidade de criar la\u00e7os com os campistas\u2026 Provavelmente foi a melhor temporada que j\u00e1 tive.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I think I may have upset her even more than when we were with Mr. Clermont.": u"Sim\u2026 Acho que posso ter deixado ela ainda mais chateada do que quando est\u00e1vamos com o Sr. Clermont.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I was confused at first, but I think I got the gist of it. But damn, you guys have no idea how much weird stuff this woman is into.": u"\u00c9\u2026 No come\u00e7o fiquei confusa, mas acho que entendi a ideia. Mas, caramba, voc\u00eas n\u00e3o fazem ideia de quanta coisa estranha essa mulher curte.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I-I\u2019m actually not sure why we don\u2019t\u2026": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 N-Na verdade, n\u00e3o sei por que n\u00e3o permitimos\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 If it weren\u2019t for that, I wouldn\u2019t be sitting here with you\u2026 ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Se n\u00e3o fosse por isso, eu n\u00e3o estaria sentado aqui com voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 If it weren\u2019t for that, we wouldn\u2019t be together\u2026 ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Se n\u00e3o fosse por isso, n\u00e3o estar\u00edamos juntos\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 If someone told me that twiggy Aiden would grow up to be this huge, I wouldn\u2019t have believed it.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Se algu\u00e9m tivesse me dito que aquele Aiden magrelo cresceria e ficaria desse tamanho, eu n\u00e3o teria acreditado.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It feels like it was just yesterday that I met you. And suddenly we\u2019re on the last day of the term\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Parece que foi ontem que conheci voc\u00ea. E, de repente, estamos no \u00faltimo dia da temporada\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It looks like it\u2019s collected a lot of dust! ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Parece que juntou bastante poeira! ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It seems a little overkill to give us four master king suites with a party of our size\u2026 ": u"Pois \u00e9\u2026 Parece um pouco exagerado dar quatro su\u00edtes master com cama king-size para um grupo do nosso tamanho\u2026 ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It seems so out of character\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Parece t\u00e3o fora do normal para ele\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s amazing how far you\u2019ve come since then, Aiden.": u"\u00c9\u2026 \u00c9 incr\u00edvel ver o quanto voc\u00ea avan\u00e7ou desde aquela \u00e9poca, Aiden.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s getting really steamy in here. Let me just take my shirt off\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Est\u00e1 ficando muito abafado aqui. Vou tirar minha camisa\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 It\u2019s probably gonna take a while to get rid of all that snow\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Provavelmente vai levar um tempo para remover toda essa neve\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019d kill to be in a nice, air-conditioned establishment too\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu mataria para estar em algum lugar agrad\u00e1vel e com ar-condicionado tamb\u00e9m\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019d like that too.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu tamb\u00e9m gostaria.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019d like to be less of a shut-in. Especially when it comes to spending time with you guys.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu gostaria de ser menos recluso. Principalmente quando se trata de passar tempo com voc\u00eas.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019m just stretching a bit and watching the stars before bed.": u"\u00c9\u2026 S\u00f3 estou me alongando um pouco e olhando as estrelas antes de dormir.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019m sure I would\u2019ve frozen up too if I had been in your shoes\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Tenho certeza de que eu tamb\u00e9m teria travado se estivesse no seu lugar\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019m sure it\u2019s difficult to be in Sir Goro\u2019s place.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Tenho certeza de que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil estar no lugar do Sr. Goro.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019ve been craving you so badly, you have no idea\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Eu estava desejando voc\u00ea tanto, voc\u00ea nem imagina\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 I\u2019ve never been so spoiled in my life\u2026 I almost feel guilty about it.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Nunca fui t\u00e3o mimado na vida\u2026 Quase me sinto culpado.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 My fingers feel frozen from all the time outside today\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Meus dedos parecem congelados depois de passar tanto tempo l\u00e1 fora hoje\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 My sister and I aren\u2019t great cooks, ahehe\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Minha irm\u00e3 e eu n\u00e3o somos grandes cozinheiros, ahehe\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Plus if she really is broke, there\u2019s no way she can afford to stay another night\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Al\u00e9m disso, se ela realmente est\u00e1 sem dinheiro, n\u00e3o tem como pagar mais uma noite aqui\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 She made everything way too personal\u2026 I didn\u2019t even know half the stuff she was referring to, since I\u2019m still new\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Ela levou tudo para um lado pessoal demais\u2026 Eu nem sabia de metade das coisas \u00e0s quais ela se referia, j\u00e1 que ainda sou novo aqui\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Thanks for handling it, Yoshi\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Obrigada por cuidar disso, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 That was a huge decision to make, and honestly Sir Goro made the right call.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Foi uma decis\u00e3o enorme e, sinceramente, entendo a escolha do Sr. Goro.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 That\u2019s right! I\u2019m more focused and productive during the night!": u"Sim\u2026 \u00c9 isso mesmo! Fico mais concentrado e produtivo durante a noite!",
        u"Yeah\u2026 The one thing I\u2019ve always wanted to tell you is that\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 A \u00fanica coisa que sempre quis dizer a voc\u00ea \u00e9 que\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 The problems just keep coming one on top of another\u2026   ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Os problemas n\u00e3o param de se acumular, um atr\u00e1s do outro\u2026   ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 The problems just keep piling on top of each other.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Os problemas simplesmente continuam se acumulando.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Thinking about it, we probably should\u2019ve allowed devices.": u"Sim\u2026 Pensando bem, provavelmente dever\u00edamos ter permitido aparelhos.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Unlike here at the camp, I can have a meal planned for the week to prep and cook everything in advance.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Ao contr\u00e1rio daqui do acampamento, posso planejar as refei\u00e7\u00f5es da semana e preparar tudo com anteced\u00eancia.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Usually talking about serious stuff like that over the phone gives me a little bit of anxiety.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Normalmente falar sobre coisas s\u00e9rias assim pelo telefone me deixa um pouco ansioso.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 We all got tongue tied whenever he was in the same room as us\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Todos fic\u00e1vamos sem palavras quando ele entrava no mesmo lugar que n\u00f3s\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 We all just wanted to help you shake it off\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 Todos n\u00f3s s\u00f3 quer\u00edamos ajudar voc\u00ea a se livrar daquela tens\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 We didn\u2019t really get the chance to ask you\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 N\u00f3s realmente n\u00e3o tivemos a chance de perguntar\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Whether we like it or not, she filled the role of inspector despite not being qualified for the job.": u"\u00c9\u2026 Gostemos ou n\u00e3o, ela desempenhou o papel de inspetora apesar de n\u00e3o ser qualificada para o trabalho.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Yoshi knows what he\u2019s doing\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 O Yoshi sabe o que est\u00e1 fazendo\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 You packed them for me yesterday. ": u"\u00c9\u2026 Voc\u00ea arrumou tudo para mim ontem. ",
        u"Yeah\u2026 Yours could be bigger than all of ours combined\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 O seu talvez seja maior do que os nossos tr\u00eas juntos\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 and that\u2019s just one of the many things that don\u2019t add up about Ms. Emilia\u2026": u"\u00c9\u2026 e essa \u00e9 apenas uma das muitas coisas que n\u00e3o fazem sentido sobre a Srta. Emilia\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 and there were times that we caused trouble too.": u"\u00c9\u2026 e tamb\u00e9m houve momentos em que n\u00f3s causamos problemas.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 but the thing is, I feel like I\u2019ve forgotten what it\u2019s like to enjoy myself without worrying about everything else.": u"Sim\u2026 Mas a quest\u00e3o \u00e9 que sinto ter esquecido como \u00e9 me divertir sem me preocupar com todo o resto.",
        u"Yeah\u2026 it kinda takes a while before its gone\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 demora um pouco at\u00e9 passar\u2026",
        u"Yeah\u2026 the box it was in must have gotten wet somehow\u2026 But it\u2019s still readable for the most part!!": u"Sim\u2026 A caixa onde estava deve ter se molhado de alguma forma\u2026 Mas ainda d\u00e1 para ler quase tudo!!",
        u"Yeah\u2026! I can help us earn some money, and you won\u2019t have to worry about me being at home alone, since we\u2019ll be together all the time!": u"Sim\u2026! Posso ajudar a ganhar algum dinheiro, e voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisar\u00e1 se preocupar comigo sozinho em casa, pois estaremos juntos o tempo todo!",
        u"Yep! I\u2019m already booked for a VIP session later! Who knew you can make tons of cash off of it?!": u"Sim! J\u00e1 estou reservado para uma sess\u00e3o VIP mais tarde! Quem diria que dava para ganhar uma grana preta com isso?!",
        u"Yep! Like raw, hardcore sex!": u"Isso! Como sexo selvagem e pesado!",
        u"Yep! Now if you both don\u2019t mind, I\u2019ll be taking my little chef to work!": u"Isso! Agora, se voc\u00eas dois n\u00e3o se importam, vou levar meu pequeno chef para o trabalho!",
        u"Yep! The workers always cheer and holler at me whenever I bring them their meals!": u"Sim! Os trabalhadores sempre gritam e comemoram quando levo as refei\u00e7\u00f5es deles!",
        u"Yep! We have ten connected so far, mostly around the perimeter and activity areas.": u"Sim! Temos dez conectadas at\u00e9 agora, principalmente no per\u00edmetro e nas \u00e1reas de atividades.",
        u"Yep! You guys are free to join if you want! They said that audience interaction is welcome!": u"Sim! Voc\u00eas podem participar se quiserem! Disseram que a intera\u00e7\u00e3o com o p\u00fablico \u00e9 bem-vinda!",
        u"Yep, I\u2019m good with that! We\u2019re all packed up and ready to go anyways!": u"Sim, por mim tudo bem! J\u00e1 arrumamos tudo e estamos prontos para ir mesmo!",
        u"Yep, and I\u2019ll be making sure the workers are fed and keeping up the regular maintenance.": u"Sim, e eu garantirei que os trabalhadores sejam alimentados enquanto mantenho a manuten\u00e7\u00e3o de rotina.",
        u"Yes! And that\u2019s exactly what we did!": u"Sim! E foi exatamente isso que fizemos!",
        u"Yes! Come on, I\u2019ll wash you off!": u"Sim! Vamos, eu vou limpar voc\u00ea!",
        u"Yes! Do you want to help? I\u2019d love to hear more about the party!": u"Sim! Querem ajudar? Eu adoraria saber mais sobre a festa!",
        u"Yes! From my understanding, Lloyd was quite eager to return here in particular.": u"Sim! Pelo que entendi, Lloyd estava especialmente ansioso para voltar para c\u00e1.",
        u"Yes! I feel like we\u2019re one step closer to trusting each other, too! ": u"Sim! Sinto que tamb\u00e9m estamos um passo mais perto de confiar uns nos outros! ",
        u"Yes! It was my very first project when I started working here!": u"Sim! Foi meu primeiro projeto quando comecei a trabalhar aqui!",
        u"Yes! I\u2019ll be coordinating with the contractors tomorrow to tour them around the camp and provide them accommodations!": u"Sim! Amanh\u00e3 coordenarei os prestadores de servi\u00e7o, mostrarei o acampamento e providenciarei as acomoda\u00e7\u00f5es!",
        u"Yes! Oh, I\u2019m so glad you remember it, Yoshi.": u"Sim! Ah, fico t\u00e3o feliz que voc\u00ea se lembre dele, Yoshi.",
        u"Yes! That ice queen costume suits you so well! Finally, a lady I can dress up as well!": u"Sim! Essa fantasia de rainha do gelo combina muito com voc\u00ea! Finalmente uma mulher que eu tamb\u00e9m posso vestir!",
        u"Yes! There are only two things Dad assigned for today \u2013 matching the deliveries with the materials list and prepare for the workers\u2019 arrival.": u"Sim! O papai atribuiu apenas duas tarefas para hoje: conferir as entregas com a lista de materiais e preparar a chegada dos trabalhadores.",
        u"Yes! We\u2019ve tried to keep all the spaces the same throughout the years to keep the classic feel of the place. I knew you would appreciate it, being an architect!": u"Sim! Tentamos manter todos os espa\u00e7os iguais ao longo dos anos para preservar a atmosfera cl\u00e1ssica do lugar. Eu sabia que apreciaria isso, sendo arquiteto!",
        u"Yes!!! I LOVE IT!!": u"Sim!!! EU ADORO!!",
        u"Yes, Aiden\u2026?": u"Sim, Aiden\u2026?",
        u"Yes, Aiden\u2026? ": u"Sim, Aiden\u2026? ",
        u"Yes, Dad!": u"Sim, pai!",
        u"Yes, Emilia?": u"Sim, Emilia?",
        u"Yes, I believe you.": u"Sim, eu acredito em voc\u00ea.",
        u"Yes, I can\u2019t imagine how my life would be now if I had chosen differently.": u"Sim, n\u00e3o consigo imaginar como seria minha vida hoje se tivesse escolhido diferente.",
        u"Yes, I can\u2019t imagine how my life would be now if I stayed the way I was.": u"Sim, n\u00e3o consigo imaginar como seria minha vida hoje se eu tivesse continuado daquele jeito.",
        u"Yes, I did notice that. When Yoshinori became his assistant, when we were on a vacation, and even more now.": u"Sim, eu percebi. Quando Yoshinori virou assistente dele, durante nossas f\u00e9rias e ainda mais agora.",
        u"Yes, I have some urgent business to take care of at the city hall and I\u2019m already running late.": u"Sim, tenho alguns assuntos urgentes para resolver na prefeitura e j\u00e1 estou atrasado.",
        u"Yes, I read my BL there.": u"Sim, leio meu BL nele.",
        u"Yes, I\u2019m into doujinshis more! I really appreciate the ways a small artist or writer can evoke my senses and convey intense emotions!": u"Sim, gosto mais de doujinshis! Admiro muito como um artista ou escritor independente consegue estimular meus sentidos e transmitir emo\u00e7\u00f5es intensas!",
        u"Yes, I\u2019m sure it seems quite jarring coming off of the events here today, but I honestly wasn\u2019t expecting such a back and forth.": u"Sim, imagino que pare\u00e7a um tanto repentino depois dos acontecimentos de hoje, mas sinceramente n\u00e3o esperava toda essa discuss\u00e3o.",
        u"Yes, Jin. You\u2019re supposed to take it slow \u2013 if you go too fast, it can be painful.": u"Sim, Jin. Voc\u00ea deve ir devagar \u2014 se for r\u00e1pido demais, pode doer.",
        u"Yes, although going to bathhouses isn\u2019t new to me. Back in the day, I would go to one whenever I needed to release the stress of running the camp.   ": u"Sim, embora frequentar casas de banho n\u00e3o seja novidade para mim. Antigamente, eu ia a uma sempre que precisava aliviar o estresse de administrar o acampamento.   ",
        u"Yes, and I\u2019m here to volunteer too! This wouldn\u2019t be a new thing to us anyway! Sir Goro, Aiden and I have a rotation for chopping firewood!": u"Sim, e tamb\u00e9m vim me oferecer! Isso n\u00e3o seria novidade para n\u00f3s! O Sr. Goro, Aiden e eu fazemos um rod\u00edzio para cortar lenha!",
        u"Yes, and Mr. Clermont has already been made aware of the situation and has arranged extended accommodations for your party.": u"Sim, e o Sr. Clermont j\u00e1 foi informado da situa\u00e7\u00e3o e providenciou a extens\u00e3o da hospedagem para o grupo.",
        u"Yes, and this one in particular is the first time I took Yuri camping.": u"Sim, e esta em particular \u00e9 da primeira vez que levei Yuri para acampar.",
        u"Yes, but I understand communication is needed.": u"Sim, mas entendo que comunica\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria.",
        u"Yes, but for a reason.": u"Sim, mas existe um motivo.",
        u"Yes, come relax with us while we finish our breakfast. We\u2019re way too early for today\u2019s schedule, anyway.": u"Sim, venha relaxar conosco enquanto terminamos o caf\u00e9 da manh\u00e3. De qualquer forma, estamos muito adiantados para o cronograma de hoje.",
        u"Yes, he is. He\u2019s always eager and ready to try something new. It\u2019s something I admire about him.": u"Sim. Ele est\u00e1 sempre animado e pronto para experimentar algo novo. \u00c9 algo que admiro nele.",
        u"Yes, it has come to my attention that the original timetable included a large unproductive break of several weeks.": u"Sim, percebi que o cronograma original inclu\u00eda uma longa pausa improdutiva de v\u00e1rias semanas.",
        u"Yes, it is, sir\u2026!   ": u"Sim, \u00e9 ele, senhor\u2026!   ",
        u"Yes, it is. I had it restored and tuned up yesterday\u2026 which explains why I was gone.": u"Sim. Mandei restaur\u00e1-la e fazer alguns ajustes ontem\u2026 o que explica por que eu sumi.",
        u"Yes, it\u2019s as good as Aiden\u2019s. ": u"Sim, est\u00e1 t\u00e3o bom quanto o de Aiden. ",
        u"Yes, ma\u2019am\u2026": u"Sim, senhora\u2026",
        u"Yes, of course, we follow their guidelines for most of our camp activities.": u"Sim, \u00e9 claro. Seguimos as diretrizes deles na maioria das atividades do acampamento.",
        u"Yes, really! So, please, PLEASE, save me from having another tummy ache today, Aiden!!": u"Sim, s\u00e9rio! Ent\u00e3o, por favor, POR FAVOR, poupe-me de outra dor de barriga hoje, Aiden!!",
        u"Yes, really. Who knew we\u2019d get along so well, right?": u"Sim, s\u00e9rio. Quem diria que nos dar\u00edamos t\u00e3o bem, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Yes, sir!": u"Sim, senhor!",
        u"Yes, sir! ": u"Sim, senhor! ",
        u"Yes, sir! I absolutely LOVE it!": u"Sim, senhor! Eu simplesmente AMO!",
        u"Yes, sir! I can\u2019t wait to be back for the next summer!": u"Sim, senhor! Mal posso esperar para voltar no pr\u00f3ximo ver\u00e3o!",
        u"Yes, sir! I really believe it was!": u"Sim, senhor! Eu realmente acredito nisso!",
        u"Yes, sir! It\u2019s a pleasure to meet you again as well, Mr. Clermont!": u"Sim, senhor! Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 um prazer encontr\u00e1-lo novamente, senhor Clermont!",
        u"Yes, sir! I\u2019ll do my best and stay by your side throughout the whole thing! ": u"Sim, senhor! Farei o meu melhor e permanecerei ao seu lado durante tudo isso!",
        u"Yes, sir! I\u2019ll do my best!": u"Sim, senhor! Darei o meu melhor!",
        u"Yes, sir! Kindly follow me this way to verify!": u"Sim, senhor! Por gentileza, siga-me para fazermos a verifica\u00e7\u00e3o!",
        u"Yes, sir! She also mentioned having work to do in the shed.": u"Sim, senhor! Ela tamb\u00e9m mencionou que tinha trabalho para fazer no galp\u00e3o.",
        u"Yes, sir! Thank you, sir!": u"Sim, senhor! Obrigado, senhor!",
        u"Yes, sir! The layout is already prepared!": u"Sim, senhor! O projeto j\u00e1 est\u00e1 preparado!",
        u"Yes, sir! We\u2019ll get dressed right away!": u"Sim, senhor! Vamos nos vestir agora mesmo!",
        u"Yes, sir! We\u2019ll make sure everything gets done on time!": u"Sim, senhor! Vamos garantir que tudo seja conclu\u00eddo a tempo!",
        u"Yes, sir! We\u2019re trying to log down all of our memories from the very first camp term up until now!": u"Sim, senhor! Estamos tentando registrar todas as nossas lembran\u00e7as desde a primeira temporada do acampamento at\u00e9 agora!",
        u"Yes, sir! You can count on me!": u"Sim, senhor! Pode contar comigo!",
        u"Yes, sir! Yuri managed the deliveries, workers, and got everyone settled into their accommodations, while Aiden made sure they were all well fed.": u"Sim, senhor! Yuri cuidou das entregas e dos trabalhadores e acomodou todos em seus alojamentos, enquanto Aiden garantiu que fossem bem alimentados.",
        u"Yes, sir.": u"Sim, senhor.",
        u"Yes, sir. I figured we could really use the extra hands to get things done, so I called Yoichi and Taiga yesterday.": u"Sim, senhor. Achei que algumas m\u00e3os extras ajudariam muito, ent\u00e3o liguei para Yoichi e Taiga ontem.",
        u"Yes, sir. I thought it would match the style. It\u2019s been a long time since I wore something this nice.": u"Sim, senhor. Achei que combinaria com o estilo. Faz muito tempo que n\u00e3o uso algo t\u00e3o bonito.",
        u"Yes, sir. I\u2019ll study it very carefully.": u"Sim, senhor. Vou estudar tudo com muita aten\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"Yes, sir. Thank you for today.": u"Sim, senhor. Obrigado por hoje.",
        u"Yes, sir. This is quite unexpected.": u"Sim, senhor. Isto \u00e9 bastante inesperado.",
        u"Yes, sir. We\u2019ll get dressed immediately.": u"Sim, senhor. Vamos nos vestir imediatamente.",
        u"Yes, sir...": u"Sim, senhor\u2026",
        u"Yes, sir?": u"Sim, senhor?",
        u"Yes, sir? Is everything alright?": u"Sim, senhor? Est\u00e1 tudo bem?",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026": u"Sim, senhor\u2026",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026 I did notice that as well.": u"Sim, senhor\u2026 Tamb\u00e9m percebi isso.",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026 I mean\u2026 Goro\u2026!": u"Sim, senhor\u2026 Quer dizer\u2026 Goro\u2026!",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026 Put it back in me\u2026 please\u2026": u"Sim, senhor\u2026 Coloque de volta em mim\u2026 por favor\u2026",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026 She actually offered to work directly with me, too. But I didn\u2019t give her an answer just yet.": u"Sim, senhor\u2026 Ela tamb\u00e9m se ofereceu para trabalhar diretamente comigo. Mas ainda n\u00e3o dei uma resposta.",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026!": u"Sim, senhor\u2026!",
        u"Yes, sir\u2026? ": u"Sim, senhor\u2026? ",
        u"Yes, that is our priority right now.": u"Sim, essa \u00e9 nossa prioridade agora.",
        u"Yes, that\u2019s how Camp Buddy was born.": u"Sim, foi assim que o Camp Buddy nasceu.",
        u"Yes, the insignia represents the core meaning of this camp.": u"Sim, a ins\u00edgnia representa a ess\u00eancia deste acampamento.",
        u"Yes, we all saw just exactly what that \u2018love\u2019 entails.": u"Sim, todos n\u00f3s vimos exatamente o que esse \u2018amor\u2019 envolve.",
        u"Yes, we can put that all in the past now\u2026 What\u2019s important is what we do from here on.": u"Sim, podemos deixar tudo isso no passado agora\u2026 O importante \u00e9 o que faremos daqui para frente.",
        u"Yes, we can\u2019t thank you enough, Mr. Clermont!": u"Sim, n\u00e3o temos como agradecer o bastante, senhor Clermont!",
        u"Yes, we want to set a good example for our scouts.": u"Sim, queremos dar um bom exemplo aos nossos escoteiros.",
        u"Yes, we\u2019re in a much better state than yesterday. ": u"Sim, estamos numa situa\u00e7\u00e3o muito melhor do que ontem. ",
        u"Yes, yes! Let\u2019s do it, Jin! ": u"Sim, sim! Vamos fazer isso, Jin! ",
        u"Yes, you are! Get back here!": u"Vai sim! Volte aqui!",
        u"Yes, you are! No backing out now!": u"Sim, v\u00e3o! Agora n\u00e3o podem desistir!",
        u"Yes, you have a sharp memory.": u"Sim, voc\u00ea tem uma \u00f3tima mem\u00f3ria.",
        u"Yes, you look beautiful, dear\u2026 You were still little the last time I saw you in a dress.": u"Sim, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 linda, querida\u2026 Voc\u00ea ainda era pequena na \u00faltima vez que a vi de vestido.",
        u"Yes, you\u2019ve been shoveling for quite a while now. You can leave this kind of work to us.": u"Sim, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 est\u00e1 retirando neve h\u00e1 bastante tempo. Pode deixar esse tipo de trabalho conosco.",
        u"Yes.": u"Sim.",
        u"Yes. ": u"Sim. ",
        u"Yes. And I\u2019m thankful for it. I can finally say I\u2019m happy where I am in life.": u"Sim. E sou grato por isso. Finalmente posso dizer que estou feliz com a minha vida.",
        u"Yes. But it\u2019s not about the repairs.": u"Sim. Mas n\u00e3o \u00e9 sobre os reparos.",
        u"Yes. But more than that, this place is very special to me.": u"Sim. Mas, al\u00e9m disso, este lugar \u00e9 muito especial para mim.",
        u"Yes. But we\u2019re not camping here tonight. I brought you here for something else\u2026": u"Sim. Mas n\u00e3o vamos acampar aqui esta noite. Trouxe voc\u00ea por outro motivo\u2026",
        u"Yes. But with how busy we\u2019ve all been, I never had the chance.": u"Sim. Mas, com todos t\u00e3o ocupados, nunca tive a oportunidade.",
        u"Yes. Could you please get us wine for the table?": u"Sim. Poderia nos trazer vinho para a mesa?",
        u"Yes. Curry is life.": u"Sim. Curry \u00e9 vida.",
        u"Yes. Don\u2019t want you getting hurt down there.": u"Sim. N\u00e3o quero que voc\u00ea se machuque l\u00e1 embaixo.",
        u"Yes. Every day, you\u2019re becoming more and more like a leader.": u"Sim. A cada dia voc\u00ea se torna mais e mais um l\u00edder.",
        u"Yes. Every day, you\u2019re becoming more and more like a leader.{fast}": u"Sim. A cada dia voc\u00ea se torna mais e mais um l\u00edder.{fast}",
        u"Yes. Hopefully we\u2019re through all the seasonal hiccups, and we have until spring to finish everything.": u"Sim. Espero que j\u00e1 tenhamos superado todos os contratempos da esta\u00e7\u00e3o, e temos at\u00e9 a primavera para terminar tudo.",
        u"Yes. How did you end up in this situation?": u"Sim. Como voc\u00ea acabou nessa situa\u00e7\u00e3o?",
        u"Yes. I didn\u2019t want to skip a day of my routine. ": u"Sim. N\u00e3o queria perder um dia da minha rotina. ",
        u"Yes. It\u2019s gonna be a big bang.": u"Sim. Vai ser um grande estrondo.",
        u"Yes. I\u2019m happy where I am in life. My past made me who I am today.": u"Sim. Estou feliz com a minha vida. Meu passado me tornou quem sou hoje.",
        u"Yes. I\u2019ve been looking forward to it, especially since we had to work the entire spring just to get everything in place for your takeover.": u"Sim. Eu estava ansioso por isso, principalmente porque tivemos que trabalhar durante toda a primavera s\u00f3 para deixar tudo pronto para voc\u00ea assumir.",
        u"Yes. Most game developers nowadays use that as a business model. And it works.": u"Sim. Hoje em dia muitos desenvolvedores de jogos usam isso como modelo de neg\u00f3cios. E funciona.",
        u"Yes. Mostly herbal teas and other relaxing beverages, though.": u"Sim. Mas principalmente ch\u00e1s de ervas e outras bebidas relaxantes.",
        u"Yes. She was rather strict and straightforward with her opinions. It kind of reminded me of how I was, and not in a good way.": u"Sim. Ela foi bastante r\u00edgida e direta em suas opini\u00f5es. Lembrou-me um pouco de como eu era, e n\u00e3o de uma forma boa.",
        u"Yes. The last we saw you, you were headed to serve a guest\u2026": u"Sim. Da \u00faltima vez que vimos voc\u00ea, estava indo atender um cliente\u2026",
        u"Yes. This has been something I\u2019ve been wanting to talk to you about, but never had the chance to.": u"Sim. Faz tempo que quero conversar com voc\u00ea sobre isso, mas nunca tive a oportunidade.",
        u"Yes. Today I also learned Lloyd really likes being called cute.": u"Sim. Hoje tamb\u00e9m descobri que Lloyd gosta muito de ser chamado de fofo.",
        u"Yes. We\u2019ll start by having fast Wi-Fi, for sure.": u"Sim. Para come\u00e7ar, teremos Wi-Fi r\u00e1pido, com certeza.",
        u"Yes. Without further weatherproofing, the materials will deteriorate at a rapid rate until they\u2019re unsalvageable.": u"Sim. Sem prote\u00e7\u00e3o adicional contra o clima, os materiais v\u00e3o se deteriorar rapidamente at\u00e9 n\u00e3o poderem mais ser aproveitados.",
        u"Yes. You never know what people are going through that makes them act a certain way.": u"Sim. Nunca sabemos pelo que as pessoas est\u00e3o passando e o que as faz agir de determinada maneira.",
        u"Yes. Yuri already scheduled a moving truck for all my stuff.": u"Sim. Yuri j\u00e1 agendou um caminh\u00e3o de mudan\u00e7a para levar todas as minhas coisas.",
        u"Yes?": u"Sim?",
        u"Yes\u2026": u"Sim\u2026",
        u"Yes\u2026 In fact, I just called him earlier to confirm it\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 Na verdade, acabei de ligar para ele para confirmar\u2026",
        u"Yes\u2026 In fact, Yoshinori just called him earlier to confirm it\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 Na verdade, Yoshinori acabou de ligar para ele e confirmar\u2026",
        u"Yes\u2026 I\u2019m sorry. I had to sort things out with Yoshinori first before I could tell everyone.": u"Sim\u2026 Desculpe. Eu precisava resolver as coisas com Yoshinori antes de contar a todos.",
        u"Yes\u2026 Yoshinori knows what he\u2019s doing\u2026": u"Sim\u2026 Yoshinori sabe o que est\u00e1 fazendo\u2026",
        u"Yes\u2026! I was informed that I need to stay and work here on-site to ensure maximum output since we have a tight schedule.": u"Sim\u2026! Fui informado de que preciso ficar e trabalhar aqui para garantir o m\u00e1ximo rendimento, j\u00e1 que temos um prazo apertado.",
        u"Yet I\u2019ve become so distant over the years that I couldn\u2019t even return the favor.{fast}": u"Ainda assim, fiquei t\u00e3o distante ao longo dos anos que nem consegui retribuir.{fast}",
        u"Yieeee! Come on, let\u2019s get going already!": u"Ieeee! Vamos, precisamos partir logo!",
        u"Yiieee! My fanfic buddy is staying! ": u"Yiieee! Meu parceiro de fanfics vai ficar! ",
        u"Yikes! Scary Goro\u2019s back!": u"Eita! O Goro assustador voltou!",
        u"Yikes! You mean I have to feed that many too?! I only prepared for half of that last night\u2026!": u"Nossa! Quer dizer que tamb\u00e9m preciso alimentar toda essa gente?! Ontem \u00e0 noite preparei comida apenas para a metade\u2026!",
        u"Yikes! You mean I have to feed that many too?! I only prepared for half of that last night\u2026!{fast}": u"Nossa! Quer dizer que tamb\u00e9m preciso alimentar toda essa gente?! Ontem \u00e0 noite preparei comida apenas para a metade\u2026!{fast}",
        u"Yikes, Emilia is here\u2026 ": u"Eita, a Emilia est\u00e1 aqui\u2026 ",
        u"Yikes, I just remembered I have to get the workers\u2019 rooms cleaned up!": u"Eita, acabei de lembrar que preciso limpar os quartos dos trabalhadores!",
        u"Yikes, do you still feel sick from the bus ride this morning?": u"Nossa, ainda est\u00e1 enjoado por causa da viagem de \u00f4nibus desta manh\u00e3?",
        u"Yikes, sounds like a red flag.": u"Nossa, parece um belo sinal de alerta.",
        u"Yikes. Sorry, Dad.": u"Nossa. Desculpe, pai.",
        u"Yikes\u2026 I can only imagine\u2026": u"Eita\u2026 S\u00f3 consigo imaginar\u2026",
        u"Yikes\u2026 I don\u2019t know how you do that. I don\u2019t function well without my eight hours of REM sleep!": u"Nossa\u2026 N\u00e3o sei como voc\u00ea consegue. Eu n\u00e3o funciono direito sem minhas oito horas de sono REM!",
        u"Yikes\u2026 It sounds like her parents are even worse than her\u2026": u"Nossa\u2026 Parece que os pais dela s\u00e3o ainda piores do que ela\u2026",
        u"Yikes\u2026 Looks like Emilia\u2019s making a scene again\u2026": u"Eita\u2026 Parece que Emilia est\u00e1 fazendo uma cena de novo\u2026",
        u"Yikes\u2026 She really said all that?": u"Caramba\u2026 Ela disse tudo isso mesmo?",
        u"Yikes\u2026 That looks like it hurts!": u"Eita\u2026 Isso parece doer!",
        u"Yikes\u2026 This is probably her worst fit of rage yet\u2026": u"Nossa\u2026 Esse provavelmente foi o pior ataque de raiva dela at\u00e9 agora\u2026",
        u"Yikes\u2026 We\u2019re really stalking her now\u2026": u"Nossa\u2026 Agora estamos mesmo investigando a vida dela\u2026",
        u"Yo-shi-no-ri cutting down a tree.": u"Yo-shi-no-ri derrubando uma \u00e1rvore.",
        u"Yoichi can be just as wild as his puppies. ": u"O Yoichi consegue ser t\u00e3o selvagem quanto os filhotes. ",
        u"Yoichi did mention there were new people working for the project.": u"Yoichi comentou que havia gente nova trabalhando no projeto.",
        u"Yoichi has come a really long way since he first came here, hasn\u2019t he?": u"O Yoichi evoluiu muito desde que chegou aqui pela primeira vez, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Yoichi! Put your pants back on!": u"Yoichi! Vista as cal\u00e7as de novo!",
        u"Yoichi! That\u2019s not a nice way to introduce someone! ": u"Yoichi! Essa n\u00e3o \u00e9 uma forma legal de apresentar algu\u00e9m! ",
        u"Yoichi! There\u2019s no way either of us, especially Sir Goro, would do something like that!": u"Yoichi! De jeito nenhum qualquer um de n\u00f3s, principalmente o senhor Goro, faria algo assim!",
        u"Yoichi! We haven\u2019t even started working yet\u2026": u"Yoichi! Nem come\u00e7amos a trabalhar ainda\u2026",
        u"Yoichi! Where are your manners?!": u"Yoichi! Onde est\u00e3o seus modos?!",
        u"Yoichi! Would you stop running around already?! You\u2019re not supposed to chase after them!": u"Yoichi! D\u00e1 para parar de correr de uma vez?! Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deveria perseguir eles!",
        u"Yoichi! You\u2019re making a huge mess! Stop playing around!": u"Yoichi! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo uma bagun\u00e7a enorme! Pare de brincar!",
        u"Yoichi, I thought you were over calling me that nickname!": u"Yoichi, pensei que voc\u00ea tivesse parado de me chamar por esse apelido!",
        u"Yoichi, it\u2019s only been ten minutes. ": u"Yoichi, passaram apenas dez minutos. ",
        u"Yoichi, stop peeing in the snow! ": u"Yoichi, pare de fazer xixi na neve! ",
        u"Yoshi and Gramps are doing the big, important work to actually help the camp, so I don't mind taking on the simple tasks.": u"Yoshi e o Vov\u00f4 cuidam do trabalho grande e importante que realmente ajuda o acampamento, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o me importo de assumir as tarefas simples.",
        u"Yoshi didn\u2019t say that it has to be as long as a pole, you old man!": u"Yoshi n\u00e3o disse que precisava ser comprido como um poste, seu velho!",
        u"Yoshi didn\u2019t say that it has to be as thick as an arm, you old man!": u"Yoshi n\u00e3o disse que precisava ser grosso como um bra\u00e7o, seu velho!",
        u"Yoshi is still the same model scout, always prepared for anything! ": u"O Yoshi continua sendo o mesmo escoteiro exemplar, sempre preparado para tudo! ",
        u"Yoshi would know.": u"Yoshi saberia.",
        u"Yoshi \u2013 the not-so-virgin sacrifice.": u"Yoshi \u2014 o sacrif\u00edcio n\u00e3o t\u00e3o virgem.",
        u"Yoshi! How come you didn\u2019t tell us that the gang was coming over today?! ": u"Yoshi! Por que n\u00e3o contou que a turma viria hoje?! ",
        u"Yoshi! You\u2019re in the emails now, right? Can you check that out for us?  ": u"Yoshi! Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 com os e-mails abertos, certo? Pode verificar isso para n\u00f3s?  ",
        u"Yoshi, Yuri\u2026 Please don\u2019t blame yourselves like that\u2026": u"Yoshi, Yuri\u2026 Por favor, n\u00e3o se culpem desse jeito\u2026",
        u"Yoshi, are you listening?!": u"Yoshi, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 ouvindo?!",
        u"Yoshi, he\u2019s talking to furniture.": u"Yoshi, ele est\u00e1 conversando com os m\u00f3veis.",
        u"Yoshi, this is no different than when you put on your camp uniform! And Dad, yours is literally a two-piece outfit!": u"Yoshi, isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 diferente de vestir seu uniforme do acampamento! E Pai, a sua fantasia literalmente s\u00f3 tem duas pe\u00e7as!",
        u"Yoshi, wait\u2014 Ugh\u2026!": u"Yoshi, espere\u2014 Ugh\u2026!",
        u"Yoshi, why did you have to choose the most boring chore\u2026? We could\u2019ve gone exploring and finding stuff like firewood or something!": u"Yoshi, por que voc\u00ea tinha que escolher a tarefa mais chata\u2026? Poder\u00edamos explorar e procurar coisas como lenha!",
        u"Yoshi, you don\u2019t just ask people why they\u2019re quiet, it\u2019s like asking someone why they never shut up.": u"Yoshi, n\u00e3o se pergunta \u00e0s pessoas por que s\u00e3o caladas. \u00c9 como perguntar a algu\u00e9m por que nunca fecha a boca.",
        u"Yoshi?! Are you monologuing again?!": u"Yoshi?! Est\u00e1 fazendo mon\u00f3logo de novo?!",
        u"Yoshinori Nagira, do you take Goro Nomoru to be your husband?": u"Yoshinori Nagira, aceita Goro Nomoru como seu marido?",
        u"Yoshinori actually requested a day off for both of them, since we don\u2019t have anything going on.": u"Na verdade, Yoshinori pediu um dia de folga para os dois, j\u00e1 que n\u00e3o temos nada acontecendo.",
        u"Yoshinori and I are a pair.": u"Eu e Yoshinori somos uma dupla.",
        u"Yoshinori and I lose a point.": u"Eu e Yoshinori perdemos um ponto.",
        u"Yoshinori and the rest, kindly pack Emilia\u2019s belongings and make sure we don\u2019t leave anything behind.": u"Yoshinori e os demais, por favor arrumem os pertences de Emilia e garantam que nada fique para tr\u00e1s.",
        u"Yoshinori had been planning this surprise date for a while now. It\u2019s actually adorable to see those two so madly in love.": u"Yoshinori estava planejando esse encontro surpresa h\u00e1 algum tempo. \u00c9 realmente ador\u00e1vel ver os dois t\u00e3o apaixonados.",
        u"Yoshinori was even kind enough to buy it at the capital for me!": u"Yoshinori foi gentil o bastante para compr\u00e1-lo na capital para mim!",
        u"Yoshinori was right to condemn me all those times he defended you, because everything I\u2019ve been saying to and about you was just cruel and untrue\u2026": u"Yoshinori estava certo em me repreender todas aquelas vezes em que defendeu voc\u00ea, porque tudo o que eu dizia para voc\u00ea e sobre voc\u00ea era cruel e falso\u2026",
        u"Yoshinori was supposed to be under my wing, not yours. That\u2019s how I wrote it in the outline I gave everyone today.": u"Yoshinori deveria estar sob minha supervis\u00e3o, n\u00e3o a sua. Foi assim que escrevi no plano que entreguei a todos hoje.",
        u"Yoshinori was telling me we had a delivery yesterday \u2013 I just wanted to check it out.": u"Yoshinori me contou que tivemos uma entrega ontem \u2014 eu s\u00f3 queria conferir.",
        u"Yoshinori! Where did you get this axe from?!": u"Yoshinori! Onde voc\u00ea conseguiu esse machado?!",
        u"Yoshinori, I\u2019ll need you to escort them as well, just like you did today for Lloyd and Darius. Is that clear?": u"Yoshinori, precisarei que voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m os acompanhe, assim como fez hoje com Lloyd e Darius. Est\u00e1 claro?",
        u"Yoshinori, I\u2019m gonna\u2014": u"Yoshinori, eu vou\u2014",
        u"Yoshinori, are you alright? It\u2019s been a while since I saw you so lost in your thoughts. ": u"Yoshinori, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem? Faz tempo que n\u00e3o vejo voc\u00ea t\u00e3o perdido em seus pensamentos. ",
        u"Yoshinori, at my age, I know what a relationship looks like.": u"Yoshinori, com a minha idade, eu sei reconhecer um relacionamento.",
        u"Yoshinori, get the aloe cream from the first aid kit. Darius, set up a beach mat and an umbrella. Aiden, fetch him some water.": u"Yoshinori, pegue o creme de aloe vera no kit de primeiros socorros. Darius, monte uma esteira de praia e um guarda-sol. Aiden, traga \u00e1gua para ele.",
        u"Yoshinori, if you wouldn\u2019t mind explaining?": u"Yoshinori, poderia explicar?",
        u"Yoshinori, look for his clothes then follow us to our room.": u"Yoshinori, procure as roupas dele e depois nos encontre no quarto.",
        u"Yoshinori, quick, put his underwear back on\u2026!": u"Yoshinori, r\u00e1pido, coloque a cueca dele de volta\u2026!",
        u"Yoshinori\u2026 ": u"Yoshinori\u2026",
        u"Yoshinori\u2026 Are you alright?": u"Yoshinori\u2026 Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"Yoshinori\u2026 Even when I was at my lowest, you\u2019ve always stayed by my side, helping me to overcome all the many challenges we\u2019ve faced together.": u"Yoshinori\u2026 Mesmo quando eu estava no meu pior momento, voc\u00ea sempre permaneceu ao meu lado, ajudando-me a superar todos os desafios que enfrentamos juntos.",
        u"Yoshi\u2026 Please, stop sugarcoating everything for me when we both know the truth\u2026": u"Yoshi\u2026 Por favor, pare de tentar ado\u00e7ar tudo para mim quando n\u00f3s dois sabemos a verdade\u2026",
        u"Yoshi\u2026 You\u2019ve already made me eat five horrible dishes today! How is this one any different?!": u"Yoshi\u2026 Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 me fez comer cinco pratos horr\u00edveis hoje! Por que este seria diferente?!",
        u"Yoshi\u2026! The more you corner me like this, the more I don\u2019t want to!": u"Yoshi\u2026! Quanto mais voc\u00ea me pressiona desse jeito, menos eu quero aceitar!",
        u"Yoshi\u2026! The more you corner me like this, the more I don\u2019t want to!{fast}": u"Yoshi\u2026! Quanto mais voc\u00ea me pressiona desse jeito, menos eu quero aceitar!{fast}",
        u"You actually sounded tough when you were doing all that serious talk a while ago \u2013 it\u2019s way different from your lame, dorky-ass self!": u"Voc\u00ea at\u00e9 pareceu dur\u00e3o naquele papo s\u00e9rio de antes \u2014 bem diferente do seu jeito normal de nerd sem gra\u00e7a!",
        u"You all don\u2019t have to worry about us here at Camp Buddy too. You have helped us more than enough, especially you, Aiden.": u"Voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o precisam se preocupar conosco aqui no Camp Buddy. J\u00e1 nos ajudaram mais do que o suficiente, especialmente voc\u00ea, Aiden.",
        u"You all helped me to realize I don\u2019t need to let my past dictate my present.": u"Todos voc\u00eas me ajudaram a perceber que n\u00e3o preciso deixar meu passado determinar meu presente.",
        u"You all let him get away with basically anything as if he wasn\u2019t carrying the camp\u2019s reputation with him!": u"Voc\u00eas deixam ele fazer praticamente qualquer coisa como se n\u00e3o carregasse consigo a reputa\u00e7\u00e3o do acampamento!",
        u"You all look like you had fun with this morning\u2019s activity, though!": u"Mas parece que todos voc\u00eas se divertiram com a atividade desta manh\u00e3!",
        u"You all look to me to make the right decisions, but instead I chose to let my anger get the best of me\u2026 ": u"Todos voc\u00eas confiam em mim para tomar as decis\u00f5es certas, mas, em vez disso, deixei minha raiva me dominar\u2026 ",
        u"You all never cease to amaze me. One surprise after another, huh?": u"Voc\u00eas nunca deixam de me surpreender. Uma surpresa atr\u00e1s da outra, hein?",
        u"You alright, Yoshinori?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshinori?",
        u"You always were a sappy drunk, Yoshi! ": u"Voc\u00ea sempre foi um b\u00eabado sentimental, Yoshi! ",
        u"You and I are together now, Yoshinori\u2026 ": u"Voc\u00ea e eu estamos juntos agora, Yoshinori\u2026 ",
        u"You and I just went to the beach last summer, though.": u"Mas eu e voc\u00ea fomos \u00e0 praia no ver\u00e3o passado.",
        u"You and Lloyd are gonna get along just fine.": u"Voc\u00ea e Lloyd v\u00e3o se dar muito bem.",
        u"You and Mr. Nomoru completely disregarded the plan I had laid out, repeatedly performing tasks out of your scope like headless chickens.": u"Voc\u00ea e o Sr. Nomoru ignoraram completamente o plano que estabeleci, realizando repetidamente tarefas fora de suas fun\u00e7\u00f5es como baratas tontas.",
        u"You and Ms. Yuri looks so good too \u2013 I\u2019ve never seen you both so dressed up.": u"O senhor e a Srta. Yuri tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o \u00f3timos \u2014 nunca vi voc\u00eas dois t\u00e3o arrumados.",
        u"You and Yoshinori as well. I mentioned it earlier, but it\u2019s amazing to see how much the two of you have bulked up over the recent years.": u"Voc\u00ea e Yoshinori tamb\u00e9m. J\u00e1 mencionei isso, mas \u00e9 impressionante ver o quanto voc\u00eas dois ficaram musculosos nos \u00faltimos anos.",
        u"You and the scouts from the previous term were the reason I got my passion back and remembered what we all dreamed for this place to be.": u"Voc\u00ea e os escoteiros da \u00faltima temporada foram a raz\u00e3o de eu recuperar minha paix\u00e3o e me lembrar do que todos sonh\u00e1vamos que este lugar se tornasse.",
        u"You are familiar with the Federation of Unified Camping Boy Scouts, or FUCBoyS, I believe?": u"Creio que conhe\u00e7a a Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Unificada dos Escoteiros de Acampamento, ou FUCBoyS?",
        u"You bet! I\u2019d say everyone had extra fun with Yuri\u2019s costume party idea.": u"Com certeza! Eu diria que todo mundo se divertiu ainda mais com a ideia da festa \u00e0 fantasia da Yuri.",
        u"You bet. And it\u2019s too cold outside to do anything fun, unlike in the summer.": u"Com certeza. E est\u00e1 frio demais l\u00e1 fora para fazer qualquer coisa divertida, ao contr\u00e1rio do ver\u00e3o.",
        u"You bet. I\u2019m so lucky I got to stay here with you.": u"Com certeza. Tenho muita sorte de ter ficado aqui com voc\u00ea.",
        u"You better be ready \u2019cause we\u2019re doin\u2019 a whole lotta breeding tonight!": u"\u00c9 melhor estar preparado, porque vamos cruzar pra valer esta noite!",
        u"You better get used to it, Aiden.": u"\u00c9 melhor se acostumar, Aiden.",
        u"You better not start calling me Gramps too.": u"\u00c9 melhor n\u00e3o come\u00e7ar a me chamar de vov\u00f4 tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"You better take it easy with those shots, alright? Don\u2019t want you turning into a crying mess so early in the morning!": u"\u00c9 melhor pegar leve nesses shots, beleza? N\u00e3o queremos que voc\u00ea vire uma po\u00e7a de l\u00e1grimas t\u00e3o cedo!",
        u"You both look so happy here!": u"Voc\u00eas dois parecem t\u00e3o felizes aqui!",
        u"You both should\u2019ve moved at double time since we were waiting for you!": u"Voc\u00eas dois deveriam ter se apressado, j\u00e1 que est\u00e1vamos esperando!",
        u"You boys are the best scouts a scoutmaster could ask for!": u"Voc\u00eas s\u00e3o os melhores escoteiros que um chefe escoteiro poderia desejar!",
        u"You boys coming?": u"Voc\u00eas v\u00eam, garotos?",
        u"You built a home for all of us, somewhere we could always return to, no matter what happened. ": u"O senhor construiu um lar para todos n\u00f3s, um lugar para onde sempre poder\u00edamos voltar, n\u00e3o importa o que acontecesse. ",
        u"You called Dynamite a WHAT?!": u"Voc\u00ea chamou o Dinamite de QU\u00ca?!",
        u"You came inside me, Yoshi\u2026 It feels so warm\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea gozou dentro de mim, Yoshi\u2026 Est\u00e1 t\u00e3o quentinho\u2026",
        u"You can always change it later\u2026!": u"Voc\u00ea sempre pode mudar depois\u2026!",
        u"You can always join in the fun~ We have private booths in the back if you want to hit up one of them~": u"Podem sempre participar da divers\u00e3o~ Temos cabines privativas nos fundos, se quiserem usar uma~",
        u"You can assist me, and I\u2019ll show you what each part does and how everything works!": u"Voc\u00ea pode me ajudar, e mostrarei o que cada pe\u00e7a faz e como tudo funciona!",
        u"You can count on me to do my best and be there every step of the way.": u"Pode contar comigo para dar o meu melhor e estar ao seu lado em cada etapa do caminho.",
        u"You can count on my staff and I to do our part throughout this entire project. ": u"Pode contar comigo e com minha equipe para fazermos a nossa parte durante todo o projeto. ",
        u"You can count on them to take you to heaven!": u"Pode contar com eles para levar voc\u00ea ao c\u00e9u!",
        u"You can count on us.": u"Pode contar conosco.",
        u"You can do something about it, especially now that you have people to support you.": u"Voc\u00ea pode fazer algo a respeito, principalmente agora que tem pessoas para apoi\u00e1-la.",
        u"You can expect nothing but the best from our group! I\u2019m a specialist in both the architectural and structural aspects of the project!": u"Podem esperar somente o melhor do nosso grupo! Sou especialista nos aspectos arquitet\u00f4nicos e estruturais do projeto!",
        u"You can get back to doing your management stuff while Gramps is gone, Yoshi! Thanks for the help!": u"Pode voltar \u00e0s suas tarefas de administra\u00e7\u00e3o enquanto o Vov\u00f4 est\u00e1 fora, Yoshi! Obrigado pela ajuda!",
        u"You can go ahead too, Aiden. I just need to get something! I\u2019ll catch up!": u"Pode ir na frente tamb\u00e9m, Aiden. S\u00f3 preciso pegar uma coisa! J\u00e1 alcan\u00e7o voc\u00eas!",
        u"You can go ahead, I\u2019ll catch up.": u"Pode ir na frente, eu j\u00e1 alcan\u00e7o voc\u00ea.",
        u"You can go and get it if you want.": u"Pode ir buscar se quiser.",
        u"You can go on ahead without me.": u"Pode ir na frente sem mim.",
        u"You can imagine how easily I can \u2018handle\u2019 someone even your size\u2026": u"Pode imaginar como consigo \u2018dar conta\u2019 facilmente at\u00e9 de algu\u00e9m do seu tamanho\u2026",
        u"You can imagine just how happy we both were to launch the very first term and finally get to share our dream with everyone else. With you.": u"Pode imaginar como n\u00f3s dois ficamos felizes ao iniciar a primeira temporada e finalmente compartilhar nosso sonho com todos. Com voc\u00ea.",
        u"You can keep ignoring every statement I make, Ms. Komarova, but I will not tolerate this any longer!": u"Pode continuar ignorando tudo que digo, Srta. Komarova, mas n\u00e3o vou tolerar mais isso!",
        u"You can learn as we go, I\u2019m here to help after all.": u"Voc\u00ea pode aprender durante o processo. Afinal, estou aqui para ajudar.",
        u"You can leave Mr. Clermont to us! We just finished here too, anyways!": u"Pode deixar o Sr. Clermont com a gente! N\u00f3s tamb\u00e9m acabamos por aqui!",
        u"You can leave it to me. I\u2019ll keep an eye on her.": u"Pode deixar comigo. Vou ficar de olho nela.",
        u"You can make use of your survival items, such as your flint, flashlight and sleeping bag, to set up a temporary camp.": u"Voc\u00eas podem usar os itens de sobreviv\u00eancia, como pederneira, lanterna e saco de dormir, para montar um acampamento tempor\u00e1rio.",
        u"You can open them now, sir!": u"Pode abrir agora, senhor!",
        u"You can relax and not concern yourself about this anymore, but I would like to express that the offer will stay on the table!": u"Pode relaxar e n\u00e3o precisa mais se preocupar com isso, mas quero deixar claro que a oferta continuar\u00e1 de p\u00e9!",
        u"You can rely on me from now on! Just believe in me!": u"Voc\u00ea pode contar comigo de agora em diante! Apenas acredite em mim!",
        u"You can rest easy about her here.": u"Pode ficar tranquilo quanto a ela aqui.",
        u"You can roll your eyes all you want, but you\u2019re here at Camp Buddy! ": u"Pode revirar os olhos \u00e0 vontade, mas voc\u00ea est\u00e1 no Camp Buddy!",
        u"You can see it now, yeah?": u"Agora d\u00e1 pra ver, n\u00e9?",
        u"You can stay in my quarters here in the office, Ms. Komarova. ": u"A senhorita pode ficar nos meus aposentos aqui no escrit\u00f3rio, Srta. Komarova.",
        u"You can take a lick if you\u2019d like~": u"Pode dar uma lambida se quiser~",
        u"You can take my bunk, sir! I\u2019m sharing a bed with Dar!": u"O senhor pode ficar com meu beliche! Vou dividir a cama com Dar!",
        u"You can take things to a new level!": u"Voc\u00ea pode levar as coisas a outro n\u00edvel!",
        u"You can talk to me\u2026 I-I\u2019ll listen...": u"Pode falar comigo\u2026 E-Eu vou ouvir...",
        u"You can tell us anything, Aiden.": u"Pode contar qualquer coisa para n\u00f3s, Aiden.",
        u"You can use the ones in our quarters, sir! We have several cubicles there!": u"O senhor pode usar os chuveiros dos nossos aposentos! Temos v\u00e1rias cabines l\u00e1!",
        u"You can't just give up either!": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o pode simplesmente desistir!",
        u"You can\u2019t even get him hard, you rookie.": u"Voc\u00ea nem consegue deix\u00e1-lo duro, novato.",
        u"You can\u2019t expect me to just stand there while you berate everyone, especially Aiden!": u"N\u00e3o pode esperar que eu fique parado enquanto voc\u00ea destrata todo mundo, principalmente o Aiden!",
        u"You can\u2019t expect me to stand by and not defend everyone, especially if you\u2019re being unreasonable.": u"N\u00e3o pode esperar que eu fique parado sem defender todo mundo, ainda mais quando voc\u00ea est\u00e1 sendo injusta.",
        u"You can\u2019t give up now, Emilia\u2026 It\u2019s not too late to make things right. ": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode desistir agora, Emilia\u2026 Ainda n\u00e3o \u00e9 tarde para consertar as coisas. ",
        u"You can\u2019t just get one \u2019cause your old man has one!": u"N\u00e3o pode simplesmente fazer uma porque seu velho tem uma!",
        u"You can\u2019t just overwhelm him with questions like that.": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o podem simplesmente sufoc\u00e1-lo com tantas perguntas assim.",
        u"You can\u2019t leave just like this\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode ir embora assim\u2026",
        u"You can\u2019t talk to a VIP guest like this! ": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode falar assim com uma h\u00f3spede VIP! ",
        u"You continue to let yourself be held down and waste your potential, keeping yourself and the camp from a better future.": u"Voc\u00ea continua permitindo que o prendam e desperdi\u00e7a seu potencial, impedindo voc\u00ea e o acampamento de terem um futuro melhor.",
        u"You cooked pizza\u2026 in the microwave?": u"Voc\u00ea assou uma pizza\u2026 no micro-ondas?",
        u"You could be working in a position of leadership and instead you choose manual labor? You must not be the same person I remember!": u"Poderia ocupar um cargo de lideran\u00e7a e, em vez disso, escolhe trabalho manual? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o deve ser a pessoa de quem me lembro!",
        u"You could have someone take my job at any time, and nothing would change!": u"Voc\u00ea poderia colocar qualquer pessoa no meu lugar a qualquer momento, e nada mudaria!",
        u"You couldn\u2019t stop showing me those fanfics of yours all night long!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parava de me mostrar aquelas suas fanfics a noite inteira!",
        u"You could\u2019ve at least put something on so you don\u2019t catch our guests off guard.": u"Poderia pelo menos ter vestido alguma coisa para n\u00e3o pegar nossos convidados desprevenidos.",
        u"You definitely have some interesting developments in store for you, Sir Goro! And maybe some tough decisions too.": u"Com certeza h\u00e1 acontecimentos interessantes reservados para o senhor, Sr. Goro! E talvez algumas decis\u00f5es dif\u00edceis tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"You deserve it and I promise you it\u2019s going to be all good from here!": u"Voc\u00ea merece isso, e prometo que daqui para frente tudo vai dar certo!",
        u"You did a great job, Yoshinori. You\u2019ve always been an amazing leader, and I\u2019m really proud of you.": u"Voc\u00ea fez um \u00f3timo trabalho, Yoshinori. Sempre foi um l\u00edder incr\u00edvel, e tenho muito orgulho de voc\u00ea.",
        u"You did great, Aiden! You were very professional, and everything you said came from the heart.": u"Voc\u00ea foi \u00f3timo, Aiden! Foi muito profissional, e tudo o que disse veio do cora\u00e7\u00e3o.",
        u"You did great, Aiden! You were very professional, and everything you said came from the heart.   ": u"Voc\u00ea foi \u00f3timo, Aiden! Foi muito profissional, e tudo o que disse veio do cora\u00e7\u00e3o.   ",
        u"You did what you could. Let\u2019s just get to work and do what we can to fix this.": u"Voc\u00ea fez o que podia. Vamos trabalhar e fazer o poss\u00edvel para consertar isso.",
        u"You did your job last summer, and whether they come back or not is up to them.": u"Voc\u00ea fez o seu trabalho no ver\u00e3o passado, e voltar ou n\u00e3o depende deles.",
        u"You didn\u2019t have to pinch me so hard\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisava me beliscar com tanta for\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"You didn\u2019t need my help talking to Mr. Clermont after all!": u"No fim, voc\u00ea nem precisou da minha ajuda para falar com o Sr. Clermont!",
        u"You didn\u2019t sleep with me naked for nothing, right?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o dormiu pelado comigo \u00e0 toa, certo?",
        u"You didn\u2019t sleep with me naked for nothing, right?{fast}": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o dormiu pelado comigo \u00e0 toa, certo?{fast}",
        u"You didn\u2019t think I\u2019d forget, did you Dad?! It\u2019s been so hard pretending all morning!": u"N\u00e3o achou que eu esqueceria, n\u00e9, pai?! Foi t\u00e3o dif\u00edcil fingir a manh\u00e3 inteira!",
        u"You didn\u2019t treat me any differently, always going out of your way to spend time with me or to make sure I was never left out.": u"Voc\u00ea nunca me tratou de forma diferente, sempre fazendo quest\u00e3o de passar tempo comigo ou garantir que eu nunca ficasse de fora.",
        u"You do seem like you\u2019ve been drinking for a while with all these empty glasses lying around, sir.": u"Parece mesmo que o senhor j\u00e1 est\u00e1 bebendo h\u00e1 um tempo, com todos esses copos vazios espalhados.",
        u"You don't have to bottle it up.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa guardar tudo para si.",
        u"You don't have to bottle up what you're feeling and deal with it on your own.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa guardar o que est\u00e1 sentindo e lidar com tudo sozinho.",
        u"You don't know what you're saying.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe do que est\u00e1 falando.",
        u"You don't need to answer right now.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa responder agora.",
        u"You don\u2019t belong with us, and you never will!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pertence ao nosso grupo e nunca vai pertencer!",
        u"You don\u2019t deserve to suffer like that again, just because we aren\u2019t satisfied with what we have\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o merece sofrer assim novamente s\u00f3 porque n\u00e3o estamos satisfeitos com o que j\u00e1 temos\u2026",
        u"You don\u2019t even know what that word means.": u"Voc\u00ea nem sabe o que essa palavra significa.",
        u"You don\u2019t exactly help with that either, you know.": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o ajuda muito com isso, sabia?",
        u"You don\u2019t get it, Yoichi? Cool! Cause it\u2019s cold!": u"N\u00e3o entendeu, Yoichi? \u2018Legal\u2019! Porque est\u00e1 frio!",
        u"You don\u2019t gotta tell me!": u"Nem precisa me dizer!",
        u"You don\u2019t have any right to question his role considering how much he does for Camp Buddy, especially these last few months.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem direito de questionar a fun\u00e7\u00e3o dele, considerando tudo que faz pelo Camp Buddy, especialmente nos \u00faltimos meses.",
        u"You don\u2019t have to anymore\u2026 ": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa mais\u2026 ",
        u"You don\u2019t have to be alone anymore. We\u2019ll all be here for you.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa mais ficar sozinha. Todos estaremos aqui por voc\u00ea.",
        u"You don\u2019t have to be alone, sir\u2026 I\u2019m here.": u"O senhor n\u00e3o precisa ficar sozinho\u2026 Eu estou aqui.",
        u"You don\u2019t have to give up on your own happiness and continue with the camp either\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o precisa abrir m\u00e3o da sua pr\u00f3pria felicidade para continuar com o acampamento\u2026",
        u"You don\u2019t have to tell me twice \u2013 no way I\u2019d be able to do what Gramps does, haha!": u"Nem precisa me dizer \u2014 eu jamais conseguiria fazer o que o Vov\u00f4 faz, haha!",
        u"You don\u2019t have to worry about the other scouts too! Yuri and I just finished handing out drinks and snacks to them!": u"Tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar com os outros escoteiros! A Yuri e eu acabamos de distribuir bebidas e lanches para eles!",
        u"You don\u2019t have to. I\u2019m more than happy to be here with you\u2026": u"N\u00e3o precisa. J\u00e1 estou mais do que feliz por estar aqui com voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"You don\u2019t know how much I\u2019ve looked up to you from the moment I met you!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o faz ideia do quanto eu admiro voc\u00ea desde o momento em que nos conhecemos!",
        u"You don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about \u2013 I\u2019m the one with the size and skill, so watch and learn, chump.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe do que est\u00e1 falando \u2013 eu \u00e9 que tenho tamanho e habilidade, ent\u00e3o observe e aprenda, ot\u00e1rio.",
        u"You don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o sabe do que est\u00e1 falando.",
        u"You don\u2019t need an answer right now, do you, Mr. Clermont?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa de uma resposta agora, precisa, Sr. Clermont?",
        u"You don\u2019t need to accept it but\u2026 I apologize for everything.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa aceitar, mas\u2026 pe\u00e7o desculpas por tudo.",
        u"You don\u2019t need to tell me twice\u2026": u"N\u00e3o precisa pedir duas vezes\u2026",
        u"You don\u2019t need to worry about the money. I\u2019ll handle everything.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o precisa se preocupar com dinheiro. Eu cuido de tudo.",
        u"You don\u2019t need to, sir! You can leave it to me and Yuri to supervise everyone!": u"N\u00e3o precisa, senhor! Pode deixar que eu e Yuri supervisionamos todo mundo!",
        u"You don\u2019t see how hard he works to keep the camp running. ": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o v\u00ea o quanto ele trabalha para manter o acampamento funcionando.",
        u"You don\u2019t seem to mind. Your body\u2019s already trembling in excitement\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o parece se importar. Seu corpo j\u00e1 est\u00e1 tremendo de excita\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026",
        u"You don\u2019t understand! I\u2019ve been looking for this old thing for ages! I can\u2019t believe it was in the shed all these years!": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o entendem! Procuro esta coisa velha h\u00e1 anos! N\u00e3o acredito que ficou no galp\u00e3o todo esse tempo!",
        u"You don\u2019t understand, we\u2019re here as guests\u2026! And I need to take Aiden with me.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o entende, estamos aqui como h\u00f3spedes\u2026! E preciso levar Aiden comigo.",
        u"You even made a lot of important decisions on the spot\u2026 I\u2019m not sure I could have done that!": u"O senhor at\u00e9 tomou v\u00e1rias decis\u00f5es importantes na hora\u2026 N\u00e3o sei se eu conseguiria fazer isso!",
        u"You fabricated your application to get a job at Camp Buddy\u2026 And continued to lie about your status and your professional experience the entire project\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea falsificou sua candidatura para conseguir um emprego no Camp Buddy\u2026 E continuou mentindo sobre sua situa\u00e7\u00e3o e sua experi\u00eancia profissional durante todo o projeto\u2026",
        u"You flatter me too much, sir\u2026": u"O senhor me elogia demais\u2026",
        u"You gave me hope for the future and a chance at true happiness\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea me deu esperan\u00e7a para o futuro e uma chance de encontrar a verdadeira felicidade\u2026",
        u"You gave me hope when I thought everything was failing in my life\u2026 A second chance at happiness\u2026 ": u"Voc\u00ea me deu esperan\u00e7a quando achei que tudo na minha vida estava desmoronando\u2026 Uma segunda chance de ser feliz\u2026 ",
        u"You gave us quite the scare back there\u2026 Good thing Yoshi found you\u2026 ": u"Voc\u00ea nos deu um baita susto l\u00e1\u2026 Ainda bem que o Yoshi encontrou voc\u00ea\u2026 ",
        u"You gave us quite the scare back there\u2026 It\u2019s a good thing Yoshinori found you just in time.": u"Voc\u00ea nos deu um grande susto\u2026 Ainda bem que Yoshinori encontrou voc\u00ea a tempo.",
        u"You get hella flirty and your tongue gets loose, if you know what I mean~": u"Fica muito paquerador e sua l\u00edngua fica solta, se \u00e9 que me entende~",
        u"You get to skip activities whenever you want, bring your books on camping trips, and they even let you stay with everyone in the boys\u2019 cabins!!": u"Voc\u00ea pode faltar \u00e0s atividades quando bem entende, levar seus livros nas viagens e at\u00e9 deixam voc\u00ea ficar junto com todo mundo nas cabanas dos meninos!!",
        u"You got the sauce simmering, little chef?": u"O molho est\u00e1 fervendo, pequeno chef?",
        u"You got your plane ticket ready, right? Your passport? IDs? ": u"Sua passagem est\u00e1 pronta, certo? Passaporte? Documentos? ",
        u"You gotta help me with this tie, though. I know how to tie a knot twenty different ways, but I have no clue what to do with this thing.": u"Mas voc\u00ea vai ter que me ajudar com esta gravata. Eu sei fazer vinte tipos diferentes de n\u00f3s, mas n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia do que fazer com esta coisa.",
        u"You gotta work hard if you want a reward too~": u"Tem que se esfor\u00e7ar se tamb\u00e9m quiser uma recompensa~",
        u"You guys are ones to talk! You\u2019re all covered in dirt!": u"Mas olhem quem fala! Voc\u00eas tamb\u00e9m est\u00e3o cobertos de terra!",
        u"You guys are right about what you said\u2026 And I owe you all an explanation at least.": u"Voc\u00eas t\u00eam raz\u00e3o no que disseram\u2026 E pelo menos devo uma explica\u00e7\u00e3o a todos.",
        u"You guys don\u2019t have to worry, though! We\u2019re just gonna shovel some snow away! ": u"Mas voc\u00eas n\u00e3o precisam se preocupar! S\u00f3 vamos tirar um pouco da neve com p\u00e1s! ",
        u"You guys don\u2019t think it\u2019s weird?": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o acham estranho?",
        u"You guys go ahead. I\u2019m gonna take a shower since I\u2019m just about to start my day.": u"Podem ir na frente. Vou tomar banho, j\u00e1 que meu dia est\u00e1 apenas come\u00e7ando.",
        u"You guys have no idea how much just her voice has been irritating me for the last few months!": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o fazem ideia do quanto at\u00e9 a voz dela vem me irritando nos \u00faltimos meses!",
        u"You guys have quite the crowd here, huh? And most of them are\u2026 buff\u2026 guys\u2026?": u"Voc\u00eas t\u00eam muita gente aqui, n\u00e3o \u00e9? E a maioria deles s\u00e3o\u2026 caras\u2026 musculosos\u2026?",
        u"You guys know I've always had a passion for writing, even when I was younger. I thought it would be great to share that with the scouts, so they'd be able to look fondly back on their experiences here one day!": u"Voc\u00eas sabem que sempre fui apaixonada por escrever, mesmo quando era mais jovem. Achei que seria \u00f3timo compartilhar isso com os escoteiros, para que um dia pudessem recordar com carinho as experi\u00eancias que viveram aqui!",
        u"You guys should know that someone like Emilia won\u2019t get away with causing trouble with Dad keeping his eye on her!": u"Voc\u00eas sabem que algu\u00e9m como Emilia n\u00e3o vai sair impune causando problemas enquanto o papai estiver de olho nela!",
        u"You guys startled me!": u"Voc\u00eas me assustaram!",
        u"You guys sure got dirty from that gardening activity though!": u"Mas voc\u00eas ficaram bem sujos naquela atividade de jardinagem!",
        u"You guys won\u2019t believe what I just found!!": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o v\u00e3o acreditar no que acabei de encontrar!!",
        u"You guys won\u2019t believe what I just found\u2026": u"Voc\u00eas n\u00e3o v\u00e3o acreditar no que acabei de encontrar\u2026",
        u"You had everything under control.": u"O senhor tinha tudo sob controle.",
        u"You had good intentions, and it\u2019s not your fault if Emilia can\u2019t see that.": u"Voc\u00ea tinha boas inten\u00e7\u00f5es, e n\u00e3o \u00e9 sua culpa se a Emilia n\u00e3o consegue enxergar isso.",
        u"You had nothing nice to say. What did you expect?": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tinha nada de bom para dizer. O que esperava?",
        u"You had to hike, and then prepare everyone\u2019s meals on top of that\u2026": u"Voc\u00eas tiveram que caminhar e, al\u00e9m disso, preparar as refei\u00e7\u00f5es de todo mundo\u2026",
        u"You have a good eye for luxury, Mr. Nomoru~ Of course I\u2019ve brought my own attire!": u"O Sr. tem bom olho para luxo, Sr. Nomoru~ \u00c9 claro que eu trouxe meu pr\u00f3prio traje!",
        u"You have a promising builder then.": u"Ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea tem um construtor promissor.",
        u"You have access to your navigation tools to help get you both back on track, reach the destination, or return to camp.": u"Voc\u00eas t\u00eam instrumentos de navega\u00e7\u00e3o para ajud\u00e1-los a retomar o caminho, chegar ao destino ou voltar ao acampamento.",
        u"You have been working nonstop on paperwork since the last term ended. I was hoping to be able to assist you with it some.": u"O senhor trabalha sem parar nessa papelada desde o fim da \u00faltima temporada. Eu esperava poder ajud\u00e1-lo um pouco.",
        u"You have everything it takes!": u"Voc\u00ea tem tudo de que precisa!",
        u"You have my word that it won\u2019t affect the work we\u2019re doing here!": u"Dou minha palavra de que isso n\u00e3o afetar\u00e1 o trabalho que estamos fazendo aqui!",
        u"You have no idea what you\u2019re talking about! You weren\u2019t even here for any of that! So, just shut the hell up!": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o faz ideia do que est\u00e1 falando! Nem estava aqui quando tudo isso aconteceu! Ent\u00e3o cale a porra da boca!",
        u"You have some time to train, and you\u2019d be able to come up with some really fun activities for the scouts!": u"Voc\u00ea tem algum tempo para praticar e poderia inventar atividades muito divertidas para os escoteiros!",
        u"You have the entire night to prepare and pack up for your wonderful vacation!": u"Voc\u00eas t\u00eam a noite inteira para se preparar e arrumar as malas para suas maravilhosas f\u00e9rias!",
        u"You have the nerve to tell me that? Don\u2019t tell me how I should spend my time!": u"Voc\u00ea ainda tem coragem de me dizer isso? N\u00e3o me diga como eu devo passar o meu tempo!",
        u"You have to explain it to everyone else! They wouldn\u2019t stop asking me about that bike all morning!": u"Voc\u00eas precisam explicar isso para todo mundo! Eles passaram a manh\u00e3 inteira me perguntando sobre aquela moto!",
        u"You have to explain it to everyone else! They wouldn\u2019t stop asking me what was going on all morning!": u"Voc\u00eas precisam explicar isso para todo mundo! Eles passaram a manh\u00e3 inteira me perguntando o que estava acontecendo!",
        u"You haven\u2019t even cleaned up yet! Or gotten dressed!": u"Voc\u00ea nem se limpou ainda! Nem se vestiu!",
        u"You heard me! You want the prize, you gotta risk it all!": u"Voc\u00ea ouviu! Se quer o pr\u00eamio, tem que arriscar tudo!",
        u"You helped carry the wood. ": u"Voc\u00ea ajudou a carregar a madeira.",
        u"You holdin\u2019 up ok back there, Yoshinori?": u"Est\u00e1 aguentando bem a\u00ed atr\u00e1s, Yoshinori?",
        u"You hopped in the shower before any of us could question you.": u"Voc\u00ea entrou no chuveiro antes que qualquer um de n\u00f3s pudesse perguntar alguma coisa.",
        u"You just did it with me! Use that same energy with Lloyd, and you\u2019ll find your answers!": u"Voc\u00ea acabou de fazer isso comigo! Use essa mesma disposi\u00e7\u00e3o com o Lloyd e encontrar\u00e1 suas respostas!",
        u"You just need to make it \u201calive\u201d.": u"Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 precisa faz\u00ea-lo \u201cganhar vida\u201d.",
        u"You just outed me.": u"Voc\u00ea acabou de me entregar.",
        u"You just recovered. You don\u2019t have to pressure yourself like that, Emilia. ": u"Voc\u00ea acabou de se recuperar. N\u00e3o precisa se pressionar desse jeito, Emilia. ",
        u"You kept count of all that?!": u"Voc\u00ea contou tudo isso?!",
        u"You kept count?!": u"Voc\u00ea contou?!",
        u"You kinda stripped in front of everyone there\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea meio que tirou a roupa na frente de todo mundo\u2026",
        u"You knew about that too, right, Yoshi? You\u2019ve been out drinking with me before!": u"Voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m sabia disso, n\u00e3o \u00e9, Yoshi? J\u00e1 saiu para beber comigo antes!",
        u"You know I did this for Yuri! I did it for us!": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que fiz isso pela Yuri! Fiz por n\u00f3s!",
        u"You know I have high standards, considering I get way better food, service and atmosphere at home than at this mediocre hotel!": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que meus padr\u00f5es s\u00e3o altos, afinal tenho comida, servi\u00e7o e ambiente muito melhores em casa do que neste hotel med\u00edocre!",
        u"You know how Gramps is, his office was a disaster! I straightened it up for him.": u"Voc\u00ea sabe como o Vov\u00f4 \u00e9, o escrit\u00f3rio dele estava uma bagun\u00e7a! Dei uma arrumada para ele.",
        u"You know how Yoichi is, he has to make it fun in his own way!": u"Voc\u00ea sabe como Yoichi \u00e9, ele precisa tornar tudo divertido do jeito dele!",
        u"You know how men are, dear.": u"Voc\u00ea sabe como os homens s\u00e3o, querida.",
        u"You know how much I like it there, you perv~": u"Voc\u00ea sabe o quanto eu gosto a\u00ed, seu pervertido~",
        u"You know how much being apart hurts me\u2026 I lost my dad, I lost all my friends and now I can\u2019t even see you\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea sabe o quanto ficar separado d\u00f3i em mim\u2026 Perdi meu pai, perdi todos os meus amigos e agora nem consigo ver voc\u00ea\u2026",
        u"You know me too well.": u"Voc\u00ea me conhece bem demais.",
        u"You know me- I prefer to be straightforward, especially when it comes to work.": u"Voc\u00ea me conhece: prefiro ser direta, especialmente quando se trata de trabalho.",
        u"You know she\u2019s always been like that\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que ela sempre foi assim\u2026",
        u"You know that\u2019s how she\u2019s always been, Yuri\u2026 Who knows? Maybe she\u2019s just trying to start a conversation with you.": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que ela sempre foi assim, Yuri\u2026 Quem sabe? Talvez s\u00f3 esteja tentando puxar conversa com voc\u00ea.",
        u"You know that\u2019s not going to happen, Yoshinori.": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que isso n\u00e3o vai acontecer, Yoshinori.",
        u"You know there\u2019s nothing to see there, Yoshinori.": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para ver l\u00e1, Yoshinori.",
        u"You know there\u2019s nothing to see there, Yoshi\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que n\u00e3o h\u00e1 nada para ver l\u00e1, Yoshi\u2026",
        u"You know this guy, Dar?": u"Voc\u00ea conhece esse cara, Dar?",
        u"You know what I mean, Yoshi! I gotta make it up to you, it\u2019s the least I can do!": u"Voc\u00ea sabe o que quero dizer, Yoshi! Tenho que compensar voc\u00ea, \u00e9 o m\u00ednimo que posso fazer!",
        u"You know what else got huge?": u"Sabe o que mais ficou enorme?",
        u"You know what else is good about being somewhere so private~?": u"Sabe o que mais \u00e9 bom em estar em um lugar t\u00e3o reservado~?",
        u"You know what they say, \u201cleave today\u2019s problems to tomorrow\u2019s me!\u201d": u"Sabe como dizem: \u201cdeixe os problemas de hoje para o eu de amanh\u00e3!\u201d",
        u"You know what you\u2019re doing! You\u2019re acting like that goody-two-shoes scout that pretends to care about everything!": u"Voc\u00ea sabe muito bem o que est\u00e1 fazendo! Est\u00e1 agindo como aquele escoteirinho certinho que finge se importar com tudo!",
        u"You know what, I\u2019m done with you, Yoshinori. ": u"Quer saber? Cansei de voc\u00ea, Yoshinori. ",
        u"You know what? I could get used to this.": u"Quer saber? Eu poderia me acostumar com isso.",
        u"You know what? Nevermind. Just come join the party already! Everyone\u2019s doing their own thing now!  ": u"Quer saber? Deixa para l\u00e1. Venham logo participar da festa! Agora todo mundo est\u00e1 fazendo o que quer!  ",
        u"You know what? There\u2019s no point explaining myself to people who won\u2019t even bother to listen! ": u"Quer saber? N\u00e3o adianta me explicar para pessoas que nem se d\u00e3o ao trabalho de ouvir! ",
        u"You know what\u2019d really help me relax?": u"Sabe o que realmente me ajudaria a relaxar?",
        u"You know you can count on me. I really meant what I said to you last night\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea sabe que pode contar comigo. Eu falei s\u00e9rio sobre o que disse ontem \u00e0 noite\u2026",
        u"You know you could\u2019ve just asked\u2026": u"Sabe que poderia simplesmente ter pedido\u2026",
        u"You know, I never asked, but how did you and Yuri actually get into this stuff anyway?": u"Sabe, nunca perguntei, mas como voc\u00ea e a Yuri come\u00e7aram a gostar dessas coisas?",
        u"You know, I should be flattered by that statement\u2026": u"Sabe, eu deveria me sentir lisonjeada com isso\u2026",
        u"You know, I think I\u2019ll even miss this bantering.": u"Sabe, acho que vou at\u00e9 sentir falta dessas provoca\u00e7\u00f5es.",
        u"You know, I thought I\u2019d need a lot longer to think about it\u2026": u"Sabe, achei que precisaria de muito mais tempo para pensar\u2026",
        u"You know, I'm really thankful for that badge \u2013 if it wasn't for it, I probably wouldn't have met you.": u"Sabe, sou muito grato por aquele distintivo; se n\u00e3o fosse por ele, provavelmente n\u00e3o teria conhecido voc\u00ea.",
        u"You know, Yoshi here has never taken me on an actual date! Maybe he could learn a thing or two from you~": u"Sabe, o Yoshi nunca me levou para um encontro de verdade! Talvez ele possa aprender uma coisinha ou outra com voc\u00ea~",
        u"You know, Yoshinori, you were such a passionate and caring scout that you constantly inspired me to keep fighting for Camp Buddy. ": u"Sabe, Yoshinori, voc\u00ea era um escoteiro t\u00e3o dedicado e atencioso que sempre me inspirava a continuar lutando pelo Camp Buddy. ",
        u"You know, Yuri was quite jealous when I gave you that brooch.": u"Sabe, a Yuri ficou com bastante ci\u00fame quando lhe dei esse broche.",
        u"You know, after working with Yuri for a few months, you get used to it.": u"Sabe, depois de trabalhar com Yuri por alguns meses, voc\u00ea acaba se acostumando.",
        u"You know, it was probably a good thing we were in the water, or there would\u2019ve been no way to clean up that mess.": u"Pensando bem, foi bom a gente estar na \u00e1gua, sen\u00e3o n\u00e3o teria como limpar aquela bagun\u00e7a.",
        u"You know, it was probably a good thing you brought me to the water, sir, or there would\u2019ve been no way to clean up that mess.": u"Sabe, provavelmente foi bom o senhor ter me levado at\u00e9 a \u00e1gua, sen\u00e3o n\u00e3o haveria como limpar aquela bagun\u00e7a.",
        u"You know, it\u2019s been a while since we last showered together, huh, Yoshi?": u"Sabe, faz um tempo desde a \u00faltima vez que tomamos banho juntos, hein, Yoshi?",
        u"You know, it\u2019s been quite some time since I was able to do something like this with someone special.": u"Sabe, faz bastante tempo desde que pude fazer algo assim com algu\u00e9m especial.",
        u"You know, sometimes you just gotta learn to go with the flow and see where it takes you!": u"Sabe, \u00e0s vezes voc\u00ea s\u00f3 precisa aprender a seguir o fluxo e ver aonde ele leva!",
        u"You know, the reason I gave you that badge is the same reason I brought you to this business meeting today.": u"Sabe, o motivo pelo qual lhe dei aquela ins\u00edgnia \u00e9 o mesmo pelo qual o trouxe a esta reuni\u00e3o de neg\u00f3cios hoje.",
        u"You know, this is exactly what I was looking forward to as soon as I found out we were going on a vacation.": u"Sabe, era exatamente por isso que eu estava ansioso assim que soube que sair\u00edamos de f\u00e9rias.",
        u"You know, you could totally start your own restaurant and I\u2019d be your loyal customer with how good your food is.": u"Sabe, voc\u00ea poderia abrir seu pr\u00f3prio restaurante. Com uma comida t\u00e3o boa, eu seria cliente fiel.",
        u"You know\u2026 I\u2019ve always wondered, how did you and Mr. Andre get so good at cooking?": u"Sabe\u2026 Sempre tive curiosidade: como voc\u00ea e o Sr. Andre ficaram t\u00e3o bons na cozinha?",
        u"You know\u2026 the same thing I\u2019ve been thinking about for the past week\u2026": u"Sabe\u2026 a mesma coisa em que venho pensando durante a \u00faltima semana\u2026",
        u"You lead the way and I\u2019ll follow!": u"Voc\u00ea mostra o caminho e eu acompanho!",
        u"You like a \u2018Cocksucking Cowboy\u2019, right sir?": u"O senhor gosta de um \u2018Cowboy Chupador\u2019, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"You like it? Yuri got me this suit just for the occasion!": u"Gostou? A Yuri comprou esta sunga para mim especialmente para a ocasi\u00e3o!",
        u"You look dashing\u2026 and really handsome, I should say.": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 elegante\u2026 e muito bonito, devo dizer.",
        u"You look great as usual, sir! Formal wear really \u2018suits\u2019 you!": u"O senhor est\u00e1 \u00f3timo como sempre! Roupa formal realmente lhe cai como uma luva!",
        u"You look like a breeding stud.": u"Voc\u00ea parece um garanh\u00e3o pronto para procriar.",
        u"You look like you could use a meal or two! You\u2019ve come to the right place!": u"Parece que voc\u00ea precisa de uma ou duas refei\u00e7\u00f5es! Veio ao lugar certo!",
        u"You look like you're ready for a ride.": u"Parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pronto para uma cavalgada.",
        u"You look like you\u2019re enjoying it, huh Goro\u2026?": u"Parece que est\u00e1 gostando, hein, Goro\u2026?",
        u"You look like you\u2019re ready for a ride.": u"Parece que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pronto para uma cavalgada.",
        u"You look wonderful, Ms. Komarova. But is this a different outfit than the one Mr. Clermont provided us?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 maravilhosa, Srta. Komarova. Mas essa roupa \u00e9 diferente da que o Sr. Clermont providenciou para n\u00f3s?",
        u"You look wonderful, Yoshinori.": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 maravilhoso, Yoshinori.",
        u"You lost me at website\u2026": u"Parei de entender em \u2018site\u2019\u2026",
        u"You made a scene.": u"Voc\u00ea fez uma cena.",
        u"You made me realize I could be more than I ever thought I could be.": u"Voc\u00ea me fez perceber que eu podia ser mais do que jamais imaginei.",
        u"You made that summer bearable for me to say the least, so that must mean something, yes?": u"Voc\u00ea tornou aquele ver\u00e3o ao menos suport\u00e1vel para mim, ent\u00e3o isso deve significar alguma coisa, n\u00e3o?",
        u"You make food to order and there\u2019s always people to feed as long as the shop sign says open.": u"Voc\u00ea prepara comida conforme os pedidos e sempre h\u00e1 gente para alimentar enquanto a placa disser que est\u00e1 aberto.",
        u"You may all resume your scheduled tasks, as I would rather conduct my evaluation while everyone is at work in their departments. ": u"Todos podem retomar suas tarefas programadas, pois prefiro realizar minha avalia\u00e7\u00e3o enquanto trabalham em seus respectivos setores.",
        u"You may be close to your thirties, but you still have a long way to go with this kind of stuff, late-bloomer!": u"Voc\u00ea pode estar chegando aos trinta, mas ainda tem muito o que aprender nesse tipo de coisa, atrasadinho!",
        u"You mean Keitaro and his friends?": u"Quer dizer Keitaro e os amigos dele?",
        u"You mean a quickie, right? I\u2019m down \u2013 let\u2019s go right here and now!": u"Quer dizer uma rapidinha, n\u00e3o \u00e9? Estou dentro \u2014 vamos fazer aqui e agora!",
        u"You mean like the one you called\u2026 Downward Dog Style? ": u"Voc\u00ea quer dizer aquela que chamou de\u2026 Estilo Cachorro Olhando para Baixo? ",
        u"You mean the helper?": u"Quer dizer o ajudante?",
        u"You mean the same pork and beans I always see you lick clean off your plate?": u"Voc\u00ea quer dizer a mesma carne de porco com feij\u00e3o que eu sempre vejo voc\u00ea limpar at\u00e9 a \u00faltima gota do prato?",
        u"You mean with the entire expansion project thingy?": u"Quer dizer por causa de toda essa coisa do projeto de expans\u00e3o?",
        u"You mean, Yoshi\u2019s the only one who tolerated her. Ugh\u2026 Why does she have to be the inspector, of all people?": u"Quer dizer que Yoshi era o \u00fanico que a tolerava. Ugh\u2026 Por que, entre todas as pessoas, ela tinha que ser a inspetora?",
        u"You mean\u2026 You want to work with me, Aiden?": u"Quer dizer\u2026 Voc\u00ea quer trabalhar comigo, Aiden?",
        u"You men are so disgusting! No way I\u2019m undressing in a work space! EVER!": u"Voc\u00eas homens s\u00e3o t\u00e3o nojentos! De jeito nenhum vou tirar a roupa no local de trabalho! NUNCA!",
        u"You might as well be an archeologist with all digging you\u2019ve been doing with those eyes.": u"Com tanto que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 escavando com esses olhos, j\u00e1 poderia ser arque\u00f3logo.",
        u"You might have to start putting on more clothes, though. We can\u2019t have her inspecting your butt too.": u"Mas talvez tenha que come\u00e7ar a usar mais roupas. N\u00e3o podemos deixar que ela inspecione sua bunda tamb\u00e9m.",
        u"You might not believe it, but things wouldn\u2019t have been the same without you.": u"Talvez voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acredite, mas as coisas n\u00e3o teriam sido as mesmas sem voc\u00ea.",
        u"You missed the whole point, Lloyd. They\u2019re trying NOT to get distracted.": u"Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o entendeu nada, Lloyd. Eles est\u00e3o tentando N\u00c3O se distrair.",
        u"You must be getting close, Yoshi... Let it all out.": u"Voc\u00ea deve estar quase l\u00e1, Yoshi\u2026 Coloque tudo para fora.",
        u"You must be so tired of having no consistent responsibility for this project\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea deve estar cansado de n\u00e3o ter uma responsabilidade definida neste projeto\u2026",
        u"You must\u2019ve been looking forward to it, knowing how good the food here is!": u"Voc\u00ea devia estar ansioso por isso, sabendo como a comida daqui \u00e9 boa!",
        u"You must\u2019ve really flipped a switch in Gramps, Yoshi, \u2019cause I can\u2019t imagine him doing a romantic thing like that, haha!": u"Voc\u00ea deve ter virado alguma chave no Vov\u00f4, Yoshi, porque n\u00e3o consigo imaginar ele fazendo algo rom\u00e2ntico assim, haha!",
        u"You need some guidance, and we can catch up! I don\u2019t see any loss here.": u"Voc\u00ea precisa de orienta\u00e7\u00e3o, e n\u00f3s podemos colocar a conversa em dia! N\u00e3o vejo nenhuma desvantagem.",
        u"You need somebody to help with the snacks, and it IS my job now, after all.": u"Voc\u00ea precisa de algu\u00e9m para ajudar com os petiscos, e afinal esse \u00c9 meu trabalho agora.",
        u"You need to have a stable base, preferably a stump, larger than the rounds you\u2019re going to be splitting on top of it. ": u"Voc\u00ea precisa de uma base est\u00e1vel, de prefer\u00eancia um toco, maior que as toras que vai rachar sobre ele. ",
        u"You need to stay put and recover.": u"Voc\u00ea precisa ficar a\u00ed e se recuperar.",
        u"You never know, maybe you\u2019ll get some ideas for a new camp menu!": u"Vai saber, talvez voc\u00ea tenha algumas ideias para um novo card\u00e1pio do acampamento!",
        u"You not knowing is more shocking news than the engagement, honestly.": u"Sinceramente, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o saber disso \u00e9 mais chocante do que o noivado.",
        u"You only got away with that because yesterday was a trial run.": u"Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 escapou dessa porque ontem foi um teste.",
        u"You only live once, so make the most of it!": u"S\u00f3 se vive uma vez, ent\u00e3o aproveite ao m\u00e1ximo!",
        u"You only really said what we were all thinking, sir\u2026": u"O senhor s\u00f3 disse o que todos n\u00f3s est\u00e1vamos pensando\u2026",
        u"You ordered prosciutto, ma\u2019am\u2026 And it\u2019s from our cold cuts menu\u2026": u"A senhora pediu prosciutto\u2026 E ele est\u00e1 no nosso card\u00e1pio de frios\u2026",
        u"You practically do the most work out of all of us! And whether they're simple or not doesn't matter, they're just as important!": u"Voc\u00ea praticamente trabalha mais do que todos n\u00f3s! E n\u00e3o importa se as tarefas s\u00e3o simples ou n\u00e3o, elas s\u00e3o igualmente importantes!",
        u"You probably don\u2019t notice it, but\u2026 You tend to speak a lot whenever we talk about Lloyd.": u"Talvez n\u00e3o perceba, mas\u2026 Voc\u00ea costuma falar bastante sempre que conversamos sobre Lloyd.",
        u"You quit your job and put all your savings into this without me knowing, and now you expect me to play along and act as if everything is perfect?!": u"Voc\u00ea largou o emprego e colocou todas as suas economias nisso sem me contar, e agora espera que eu entre na brincadeira e finja que tudo est\u00e1 perfeito?!",
        u"You read my mind sir, I was just going to order whatever you did, hahaha!": u"O senhor leu minha mente, eu ia simplesmente pedir o mesmo que o senhor, hahaha!",
        u"You really amaze me with how understanding you can be with people.": u"Voc\u00ea realmente me impressiona com o quanto consegue compreender as pessoas.",
        u"You really are an exhibitionist, Aiden\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea realmente \u00e9 um exibicionista, Aiden\u2026",
        u"You really are confident, aren\u2019t you?": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 mesmo confiante, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"You really are quick to strip, aren\u2019t you?": u"Voc\u00ea realmente n\u00e3o perde tempo para tirar a roupa, n\u00e9?",
        u"You really deserve this because you\u2019ve worked so hard all your life.": u"Voc\u00ea realmente merece isso, porque trabalhou tanto a vida inteira.",
        u"You really deserved better\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea realmente merecia algo melhor\u2026",
        u"You really did help me get through some tough times, and I owe you a lot for that.": u"Voc\u00ea realmente me ajudou a superar momentos dif\u00edceis, e devo muito a voc\u00ea por isso.",
