        u"You\u2019re right\u2026 We\u2019ve already reached our dream\u2026 We\u2019re together again and leading the camp side by side.": u"Voc\u00ea tem raz\u00e3o\u2026 J\u00e1 realizamos nosso sonho\u2026 Estamos juntos novamente e liderando o acampamento lado a lado.",
        u"You\u2019re rotten to the core just like you were back then!": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 podre at\u00e9 o \u00e2mago, exatamente como era naquela \u00e9poca!",
        u"You\u2019re so amazing, Aiden\u2026 I can\u2019t believe you\u2019re really mine now\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 incr\u00edvel, Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o consigo acreditar que agora voc\u00ea \u00e9 realmente meu\u2026",
        u"You\u2019re someone who can light up a room. I can always count on you to cheer me up when I\u2019m feeling overwhelmed.": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 algu\u00e9m que ilumina qualquer ambiente. Sempre posso contar com voc\u00ea para me animar quando estou sobrecarregado.",
        u"You\u2019re still sore from all that pounding, hehe~": u"Voc\u00ea ainda est\u00e1 dolorido por causa de toda aquela transa, hehe~",
        u"You\u2019re such a dork, Yoshi.": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o bob\u00e3o, Yoshi.",
        u"You\u2019re such a weirdo, what the heck?!": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 t\u00e3o esquisito, mas que diabos?!",
        u"You\u2019re talented and hard-working, so now all you have to do is take that next step!": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 talentoso e esfor\u00e7ado, ent\u00e3o agora s\u00f3 precisa dar o pr\u00f3ximo passo!",
        u"You\u2019re talking about your role for this expansion project, right?": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 falando do seu papel neste projeto de expans\u00e3o, certo?",
        u"You\u2019re telling me! Who knew they\u2019d throw a fancy dinner at us to top off the trip?!": u"Nem me fale! Quem diria que preparariam um jantar chique para fechar a viagem com chave de ouro?!",
        u"You\u2019re telling me, you two snuck up here to\u2014": u"Est\u00e1 dizendo que voc\u00eas dois vieram escondidos at\u00e9 aqui para\u2014",
        u"You\u2019re tempting me to put on some weight with an offer like that, Aiden, hahaha!": u"Com uma oferta dessas, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 me tentando a ganhar uns quilinhos, Aiden, hahaha!",
        u"You\u2019re the best, Aiden\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 o melhor, Aiden\u2026",
        u"You\u2019re the big spoon now, so you get to be in charge.": u"Agora voc\u00ea \u00e9 quem est\u00e1 me abra\u00e7ando por tr\u00e1s, ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea manda.",
        u"You\u2019re the most patient, resilient, and hardworking person I know\u2026 and you put others before yourself.": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 a pessoa mais paciente, resiliente e trabalhadora que conhe\u00e7o\u2026 e sempre coloca os outros antes de si mesmo.",
        u"You\u2019re the one who just \u2018leid\u2019 me \u2013 don\u2019t you think I should return the favor?": u"Foi voc\u00ea quem acabou de me dar um \u2018lei\u2019 \u2014 n\u00e3o acha que eu deveria retribuir o favor?",
        u"You\u2019re the one who made fun of it back in the room, Dar.": u"Foi voc\u00ea quem tirou sarro disso l\u00e1 no quarto, Dar.",
        u"You\u2019re the one who never lets go of stuff!": u"\u00c9 voc\u00ea quem nunca se desfaz de nada!",
        u"You\u2019re the only one who listens to all my problems, you know?": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 a \u00fanica que escuta todos os meus problemas, sabia?",
        u"You\u2019re too noisy, Yoshinori. Now you\u2019re really gonna get punished!": u"Voc\u00ea faz barulho demais, Yoshinori. Agora vai ser punido de verdade!",
        u"You\u2019re totally loosened up now, Yoshinori\u2026 I\u2019m gonna keep fucking you til\u2019 the sun comes up\u2026": u"Agora voc\u00ea est\u00e1 completamente relaxado, Yoshinori\u2026 Vou continuar fodendo voc\u00ea at\u00e9 o sol nascer\u2026",
        u"You\u2019re very crafty, Taiga.": u"Voc\u00ea leva jeito para trabalhos manuais, Taiga.",
        u"You\u2019re very kind, Yoshinori\u2026 Possibly too kind.": u"Voc\u00ea \u00e9 muito bondoso, Yoshinori\u2026 Talvez at\u00e9 demais.",
        u"You\u2019re wasting time if you ask me~ If you don\u2019t want it, teach me how to cook and I\u2019ll gladly take your spot!": u"Se quer minha opini\u00e3o, est\u00e1 perdendo tempo~ Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o quiser, me ensine a cozinhar e eu aceito seu lugar com prazer!",
        u"You\u2019re way off, Twinkerbell! She\u2019s been a prick ever since she got here a couple months ago!": u"Passou longe, Sininho! Ela tem sido uma babaca desde que chegou aqui h\u00e1 alguns meses!",
        u"You\u2019re welcome! Since we\u2019re friends now, just call me Yoshi!": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 de qu\u00ea! J\u00e1 que agora somos amigos, pode me chamar de Yoshi!",
        u"You\u2019re welcome, Aiden. ": u"De nada, Aiden. ",
        u"You\u2019re welcome, Yoshi!": u"De nada, Yoshi!",
        u"You\u2019re welcome, Yoshinori. Now let\u2019s get going. Everyone must\u2019ve finished with their break.": u"N\u00e3o h\u00e1 de qu\u00ea, Yoshinori. Agora vamos. Todos j\u00e1 devem ter terminado a pausa.",
        u"You\u2019re welcome, sir! I\u2019m so glad you like it!": u"De nada, senhor! Fico muito feliz que tenha gostado!",
        u"You\u2019re wrong, Aiden!": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 errado, Aiden!",
        u"You\u2019ve all already done so much for the camp during your term that it feels a bit embarrassing to ask for more, but I\u2019m grateful nonetheless. ": u"Todos voc\u00eas j\u00e1 fizeram tanto pelo acampamento durante sua temporada que \u00e9 at\u00e9 constrangedor pedir mais, mas ainda assim sou muito grato. ",
        u"You\u2019ve all resolved the issues I was worried about, even if they weren\u2019t in ways I expected!": u"Voc\u00eas resolveram todos os problemas que me preocupavam, mesmo que de maneiras que eu n\u00e3o esperava!",
        u"You\u2019ve all worked extremely hard, and I want to express how thankful I am for all of your dedication and commitment!": u"Todos voc\u00eas trabalharam muito, e quero expressar o quanto sou grato por toda a dedica\u00e7\u00e3o e comprometimento!",
        u"You\u2019ve all worked extremely hard, and I want to express my gratitude to your dedication and commitment to seeing things through.": u"Todos voc\u00eas trabalharam muito, e quero expressar minha gratid\u00e3o pela dedica\u00e7\u00e3o e pelo compromisso de levar tudo at\u00e9 o fim.",
        u"You\u2019ve already done way more than that with me today.": u"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 fez muito mais do que isso comigo hoje.",
        u"You\u2019ve already explained plenty. Frankly, I am even considering that it may be in everyone\u2019s best interest to reassign your position.": u"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 explicou bastante. Sinceramente, estou at\u00e9 considerando que realoc\u00e1-la possa ser o melhor para todos.",
        u"You\u2019ve already taken so much of my youth away from me! You knew I never wanted any of this!": u"Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 tirou tanto da minha juventude! Sabia que eu nunca quis nada disso!",
        u"You\u2019ve always been so good at it, so I never needed to get any better.": u"Voc\u00ea sempre foi t\u00e3o bom nisso que eu nunca precisei melhorar.",
        u"You\u2019ve always been the one watching out for all of us.": u"Voc\u00ea sempre foi quem cuidou de todos n\u00f3s.",
        u"You\u2019ve always hidden this \u2013 never letting anyone know what you\u2019ve been through\u2026": u"Voc\u00ea sempre escondeu isso \u2014 nunca deixou ningu\u00e9m saber pelo que passou\u2026",
        u"You\u2019ve barely left the room the last two days, Jin.": u"Voc\u00ea mal saiu do quarto nos \u00faltimos dois dias, Jin.",
        u"You\u2019ve barely left your room the last two days, Jin.": u"Voc\u00ea mal saiu do quarto nos \u00faltimos dois dias, Jin.",
        u"You\u2019ve been patient and understanding even when I didn\u2019t deserve it... And I admit there was a time when I took that for granted.": u"Voc\u00ea foi paciente e compreensivo mesmo quando eu n\u00e3o merecia\u2026 E admito que houve uma \u00e9poca em que n\u00e3o dei o devido valor a isso.",
        u"You\u2019ve been really open with me today, and it was thanks to that I was able to find some answers for you.": u"Voc\u00ea foi muito aberta comigo hoje, e foi gra\u00e7as a isso que consegui encontrar algumas respostas para voc\u00ea.",
        u"You\u2019ve been teasing me all day long, so what do you expect?": u"Voc\u00ea passou o dia inteiro me provocando, ent\u00e3o o que esperava?",
        u"You\u2019ve changed for the better, and nobody will let this one incident define you.": u"O senhor mudou para melhor, e ningu\u00e9m vai deixar que este \u00fanico incidente defina quem o senhor \u00e9.",
        u"You\u2019ve changed.": u"Voc\u00ea mudou.",
        u"You\u2019ve come such a long way, sir.": u"O senhor percorreu um longo caminho.",
        u"You\u2019ve given me, Yuri, and everyone else here a place to belong that we never had before!": u"O senhor deu a mim, \u00e0 Yuri e a todos aqui um lugar ao qual pertencer, algo que nunca tivemos antes!",
        u"You\u2019ve gone through so much worse in the past and pulled through every single one\u2026 ": u"O senhor j\u00e1 passou por coisas muito piores no passado e superou cada uma delas\u2026 ",
        u"You\u2019ve got a crush on the camp president.": u"Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 a fim do presidente do acampamento.",
        u"You\u2019ve got something dripping down there.": u"Tem alguma coisa escorrendo a\u00ed embaixo.",
        u"You\u2019ve gotta know at this point that we\u2019re just dragging this out. ": u"A esta altura voc\u00ea precisa perceber que s\u00f3 estamos prolongando isso. ",
        u"You\u2019ve grown one centimeter since we last saw them.": u"Voc\u00ea cresceu um cent\u00edmetro desde a \u00faltima vez que os vimos.",
        u"You\u2019ve hardly changed from when we were younger.": u"Voc\u00ea quase n\u00e3o mudou desde quando \u00e9ramos mais novos.",
        u"You\u2019ve piqued my interest either way\u2026 how does it work\u2026?": u"De qualquer forma, despertou meu interesse\u2026 como funciona\u2026?",
        u"You\u2019ve pretty much kept our camp running over the years.": u"Ao longo dos anos, foi praticamente voc\u00ea quem manteve o nosso acampamento funcionando.",
        u"Yup!": u"Sim!",
        u"Yup! ": u"Isso!",
        u"Yup! *burp*": u"Sim! *arroto*",
        u"Yup! But I\u2019m doing you a favor and letting you pick which of our hot bods you want on your plate tonight~": u"Sim! Mas estou fazendo um favor e deixando voc\u00ea escolher qual dos nossos corpos gostosos quer no seu prato esta noite~",
        u"Yup! But let\u2019s just say it took some special lube~ ": u"Sim! Mas digamos que foi preciso um lubrificante especial~ ",
        u"Yup! Hahaha!": u"Sim! Hahaha!",
        u"Yup! He agreed to the rules! Besides, what\u2019s the problem? You ain\u2019t naked under there are you Gramps?": u"Sim! Ele concordou com as regras! Al\u00e9m disso, qual \u00e9 o problema? Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 pelado por baixo, est\u00e1, Vov\u00f4?",
        u"Yup! He was a real ball of angst! Yoichi was spot on calling him Dynamite, hahaha!": u"Sim! Ele era uma verdadeira bola de ang\u00fastia! O Yoichi acertou em cheio ao cham\u00e1-lo de Dinamite, hahaha!",
        u"Yup! I guess I can\u2019t blame her, though, my room is a lot neater and cleaner than hers anyway~": u"Sim! Mas acho que n\u00e3o posso culp\u00e1-la, meu quarto \u00e9 muito mais arrumado e limpo que o dela~",
        u"Yup! I helped Lloyd and Darius make the arch!": u"Sim! Ajudei Lloyd e Darius a montar o arco!",
        u"Yup! It got pretty sticky and steamy in here~": u"Sim! Ficou bem pegajoso e quente aqui dentro~",
        u"Yup! It should be good, I\u2019m just starting on the meatballs now!": u"Sim! Deve estar bom, estou come\u00e7ando as alm\u00f4ndegas agora!",
        u"Yup! It will take me a little while to assemble this new one though.": u"Isso! Mas levarei algum tempo para montar este novo.",
        u"Yup! It\u2019s called \u2018chubby buddy!\u2019": u"Sim! Chama-se \u2018Chubby Buddy\u2019!",
        u"Yup! Just sun, sand, and all the beach bods you can imagine!": u"Isso! Sol, areia e todos os corpos de praia que voc\u00ea puder imaginar!",
        u"Yup! Let\u2019s get cooking, good looking!": u"Isso! Vamos cozinhar, bonit\u00e3o!",
        u"Yup! Might as well spend some quality time with everyone, right?": u"Sim! J\u00e1 que estamos aqui, podemos aproveitar para passar um tempo legal com todo mundo, certo?",
        u"Yup! That\u2019s one thing I\u2019m glad that\u2019s never changed \u2019bout you, hahaha!": u"Sim! Essa \u00e9 uma coisa que fico feliz que nunca tenha mudado em voc\u00ea, hahaha!",
        u"Yup! There\u2019s also that one gross time he was sobbing about giving me a little brother to fix the problems.": u"Sim! Teve tamb\u00e9m aquela vez nojenta em que ele ficou chorando sobre me dar um irm\u00e3ozinho para resolver os problemas.",
        u"Yup! This journal has all my precious scout memories! And they\u2019re mostly about Camp Buddy\u2019s debut!": u"Sim! Este di\u00e1rio tem todas as minhas preciosas lembran\u00e7as de escoteira! E a maioria \u00e9 sobre o in\u00edcio do Camp Buddy!",
        u"Yup! We\u2019re actually chronicling the memories going all the way back to my term as a scout to post on there!": u"Sim! Estamos registrando mem\u00f3rias desde a \u00e9poca em que eu era escoteiro para publicar l\u00e1!",
        u"Yup! You know that by now!": u"Sim! Voc\u00ea j\u00e1 devia saber!",
        u"Yup! You know you can always count on me!": u"Sim! Voc\u00ea sabe que sempre pode contar comigo!",
        u"Yup, Gramps~! That\u2019s why no matter how tough you act around us, we know you\u2019re a softie~!": u"Isso mesmo, Vov\u00f4~! Por isso, n\u00e3o importa o quanto voc\u00ea banque o dur\u00e3o perto da gente, n\u00f3s sabemos que voc\u00ea \u00e9 um cora\u00e7\u00e3o mole~!",
        u"Yup, she\u2019s watching porn, alright.": u"\u00c9, ela est\u00e1 vendo porn\u00f4, sem d\u00favida.",
        u"Yuri and I were handing out some drinks and snacks to the other scouts while we were waiting.": u"A Yuri e eu est\u00e1vamos distribuindo bebidas e lanches aos outros escoteiros enquanto esper\u00e1vamos.",
        u"Yuri didn\u2019t want us to get scolded, so she made me run with the laptop before he noticed\u2026": u"A Yuri n\u00e3o queria que a gente levasse bronca, ent\u00e3o me fez fugir com o notebook antes que ele percebesse\u2026",
        u"Yuri here has been interested in nature for a long time, so most of the things I\u2019ve been teaching here are things she already knows.": u"A Yuri se interessa pela natureza h\u00e1 muito tempo, ent\u00e3o j\u00e1 conhece a maioria das coisas que tenho ensinado aqui.",
        u"Yuri here has been listening to me ramble all day.": u"A Yuri ficou me ouvindo falar sem parar o dia inteiro.",
        u"Yuri is terrible at picking out what I wear \u2013 she\u2019s never paid attention to my body type, after all.": u"Yuri \u00e9 p\u00e9ssima escolhendo minhas roupas \u2014 afinal, nunca prestou aten\u00e7\u00e3o ao meu tipo f\u00edsico.",
        u"Yuri really takes after her mother, doesn't she?": u"Yuri realmente puxou a m\u00e3e, n\u00e3o \u00e9?",
        u"Yuri was super excited to see her journal digitized so she can view it anytime she wants.": u"Yuri ficou superanimada ao ver o di\u00e1rio digitalizado, assim pode consult\u00e1-lo quando quiser.",
        u"Yuri will go nuts once she finds out!": u"Yuri vai enlouquecer quando descobrir!",
        u"Yuri! I told you never to bring that up!": u"Yuri! Eu disse para nunca tocar nesse assunto!",
        u"Yuri! Language! ": u"Yuri! Olha a linguagem! ",
        u"Yuri! What the hell are you doing?! I\u2019ve been waiting for half an hour!": u"Yuri! Que diabos voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?! Estou esperando h\u00e1 meia hora!",
        u"Yuri! You should know that violence is never the answer!!": u"Yuri! Voc\u00ea deveria saber que viol\u00eancia nunca \u00e9 a solu\u00e7\u00e3o!!",
        u"Yuri, I told you not to barge in\u2026 they aren\u2019t done yet\u2026! ": u"Yuri, eu disse para n\u00e3o entrar de repente\u2026 eles ainda n\u00e3o terminaram\u2026! ",
        u"Yuri, behave.": u"Yuri, comporte-se.",
