        u"Yuri, chill!": u"Yuri, calma!",
        u"Yuri, did you really have to narrow it down like that? You should let Aiden pick whatever he likes!": u"Yuri, precisava mesmo limitar assim? Voc\u00ea deveria deixar o Aiden escolher o que quiser!",
        u"Yuri, didn\u2019t you and Jin already do a background check on Emilia yesterday?": u"Yuri, voc\u00ea e o Jin n\u00e3o fizeram uma pesquisa sobre o passado da Emilia ontem?",
        u"Yuri, in my office!": u"Yuri, para a minha sala!",
