        u"Yuri, that\u2019s enough! Let her go!": u"Yuri, chega! Solta ela!",
        u"Yuri, to your room. NOW.": u"Yuri, para o seu quarto. AGORA.",
        u"Yuri-dear, what are you doing here all by yourself?": u"Querida Yuri, o que est\u00e1 fazendo aqui sozinha?",
        u"Yuri-dear, you should\u2019ve waited for us so we could help.": u"Querida Yuri, voc\u00ea deveria ter esperado por n\u00f3s para que pud\u00e9ssemos ajudar.",
        u"Yuri? You were in on this? ": u"Yuri? Voc\u00ea sabia disso? ",
        u"Yuri\u2019s already using it, and knowing her, it\u2019ll be at least an hour before she\u2019s finished.": u"Yuri j\u00e1 est\u00e1 usando, e, conhecendo-a, levar\u00e1 pelo menos uma hora para terminar.",
        u"Yuri\u2019s always been the artistic type. It\u2019s why she often leads similar activities with the scouts.": u"Yuri sempre teve um lado art\u00edstico. \u00c9 por isso que costuma liderar atividades semelhantes com os escoteiros.",
        u"Yuri\u2019s been looking forward to today! Can\u2019t you understand how important this is? ": u"A Yuri estava ansiosa pelo dia de hoje! N\u00e3o consegue entender como isso \u00e9 importante? ",
        u"Yuri\u2019s kinda right, though\u2026 I\u2019m already sweating bullets out here.": u"Mas Yuri tem um pouco de raz\u00e3o\u2026 J\u00e1 estou suando em bicas aqui.",
        u"Yuri\u2019s making sure of that while we\u2019re out here!": u"A Yuri est\u00e1 cuidando disso enquanto estamos aqui fora!",
        u"Yuri\u2019s right, everyone. Instead, we should all be grateful for all the hard work and time Goro dedicated to the camp since we were scouts!": u"Yuri tem raz\u00e3o, pessoal. Em vez disso, dever\u00edamos agradecer por todo o trabalho e tempo que Goro dedicou ao acampamento desde que \u00e9ramos escoteiros!",
        u"Yuri\u2019s sitting way over here on the verge of choking, and you\u2019re all talking like there\u2019s an inside joke.": u"Yuri est\u00e1 sentada l\u00e1 longe quase engasgando, e voc\u00eas est\u00e3o falando como se houvesse uma piada interna.",
        u"Yuri\u2026 I already broke a nail doing the laundry\u2026 Can I take a break from all of these menial jobs\u2026?": u"Yuri\u2026 J\u00e1 quebrei uma unha lavando roupa\u2026 Posso dar uma pausa em todas essas tarefas bra\u00e7ais\u2026?",
        u"Yuri\u2026 It\u2019s fine dining. I don\u2019t think there\u2019s going to be any dancing involved.": u"Yuri\u2026 \u00c9 um jantar requintado. Acho que n\u00e3o vai ter dan\u00e7a.",
        u"Yuri\u2026 S-Sir Goro\u2019s wearing the same ring\u2026": u"Yuri\u2026 O-O Sr. Goro est\u00e1 usando a mesma alian\u00e7a\u2026",
        u"Yuri\u2026 We literally just came back from a vacation\u2026 Is this really necessary\u2026?": u"Yuri\u2026 N\u00f3s literalmente acabamos de voltar de f\u00e9rias\u2026 Isso \u00e9 mesmo necess\u00e1rio\u2026?",
        u"Yuri\u2026 You\u2019re going to give me a heart attack. I thought you hurt yourself or something\u2026": u"Yuri\u2026 Voc\u00ea ainda vai me causar um ataque card\u00edaco. Pensei que tivesse se machucado ou algo assim\u2026",
        u"and I oop\u2014": u"eita\u2014",
        u"ha! You two must\u2019ve been trying to sneak away for some midnight action, huh?!": u"Ha! Voc\u00eas dois deviam estar tentando escapar para uma divers\u00e3ozinha de madrugada, hein?!",
        u"{i}(A bead of precum started forming on Aiden\u2019s tip\u2026 There was no doubt he was enjoying himself\u2026){/i}": u"{i}(Uma gota de pr\u00e9-s\u00eamen come\u00e7ou a se formar na ponta de Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o havia d\u00favida de que ele estava gostando\u2026){/i}",
        u"{i}(A bead of precum started forming on my tip, and I could feel my insides getting slicker from Aiden\u2019s leaking\u2026 There was no doubt we were enjoying ourselves.){/i}": u"{i}(Uma gota de pr\u00e9-s\u00eamen come\u00e7ou a se formar na minha ponta, e eu sentia meu interior ficar mais lubrificado com o l\u00edquido de Aiden\u2026 N\u00e3o havia d\u00favida de que est\u00e1vamos gostando.){/i}",
