        u"{i}After Sir Goro and I talked, he headed off to the office to report to Mr. Clermont, while I got started shoveling with Lloyd and Darius.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que eu e o Sr. Goro conversamos, ele foi ao escrit\u00f3rio informar o Sr. Clermont, enquanto eu comecei a retirar a neve com Lloyd e Darius.{/i}",
        u"{i}After Sir Goro left, Aiden and I continued to chat and soak in the bath.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que o Sr. Goro saiu, Aiden e eu continuamos conversando e relaxando na \u00e1gua.{/i}",
        u"{i}After Yuri ran off, I went over to Goro and chatted with him and the scouts for the rest of the night.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que Yuri saiu correndo, fui at\u00e9 Goro e passei o resto da noite conversando com ele e os escoteiros.{/i}",
        u"{i}After a busy day handling all the camp\u2019s business with Sir Goro, we made sure to enjoy our time together, just the six of us. {/i}": u"{i}Depois de um dia corrido cuidando dos assuntos do acampamento com o senhor Goro, fizemos quest\u00e3o de aproveitar o tempo juntos, apenas n\u00f3s seis. {/i}",
        u"{i}After a while, Aiden and the others came back with the shovels and we started to clear the snow.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de um tempo, Aiden e os outros voltaram com as p\u00e1s e come\u00e7amos a remover a neve.{/i}",
        u"{i}After all this time, I guess the tension and stress of dealing with Emilia finally exploded out of me\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Depois de todo esse tempo, acho que a tens\u00e3o e o estresse de lidar com Emilia finalmente explodiram dentro de mim\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}After chatting with Jin, Aiden went to make some soup for all three of us.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de conversar com Jin, Aiden foi preparar sopa para n\u00f3s tr\u00eas.{/i}",
        u"{i}After getting some snacks from Aiden, we munched on them and chatted with him and Hiro for a while longer.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de pegarmos alguns petiscos com Aiden, ficamos comendo e conversando com ele e Hiro por mais um tempo.{/i}",
        u"{i}After he calmed down, Jin joined us and helped get the next entry ready.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que se acalmou, Jin se juntou a n\u00f3s e ajudou a preparar a pr\u00f3xima postagem.{/i}",
        u"{i}After letting myself rest a little, Sir Goro and I washed up and headed out to check out the other areas of the hotel.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de descansar um pouco, eu e o Sr. Goro nos lavamos e sa\u00edmos para conhecer as outras \u00e1reas do hotel.{/i}",
        u"{i}After moving Emilia to her bed, I immediately used the phone in her room to call for medical help.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de colocar Emilia na cama, usei imediatamente o telefone do quarto para chamar ajuda m\u00e9dica.{/i}",
        u"{i}After our dinner, Jin and I went back to the office to finish up the computer setup.{/i}": u"{i}Depois do jantar, Jin e eu voltamos ao escrit\u00f3rio para terminar de configurar o computador.{/i}",
        u"{i}After our serious talk, Emilia and I chatted a little bit more light-heartedly about the scouts coming back and when she\u2019d get to meet them.{/i}": u"{i}Depois da nossa conversa s\u00e9ria, Emilia e eu conversamos de forma mais descontra\u00edda sobre a volta dos escoteiros e quando ela poderia conhec\u00ea-los.{/i}",
        u"{i}After our talk, Goro drove us both home in silence\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Depois da nossa conversa, Goro nos levou de volta para casa em sil\u00eancio\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}After our talk, we spent the rest of the day cleaning up the obstacle course.{/i}": u"{i}Depois da conversa, passamos o restante do dia limpando a pista de obst\u00e1culos.{/i}",
        u"{i}After relieving myself, I hurriedly cleaned up my mess and got ready for the day\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Depois de me aliviar, limpei rapidamente a bagun\u00e7a e me preparei para o dia\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}After such a long week, I didn\u2019t even try to resist Aiden as he pulled himself up from the grass and positioned himself right on top me.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de uma semana t\u00e3o longa, nem tentei resistir quando Aiden se levantou da grama e se posicionou bem em cima de mim.{/i}",
        u"{i}After such an eventful day, Sir Goro and I managed to spend a really peaceful night together.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de um dia t\u00e3o cheio de acontecimentos, eu e o Sr. Goro conseguimos passar uma noite realmente tranquila juntos.{/i}",
        u"{i}After taking a few minutes to catch our breath and come to our senses, we shakily picked ourselves up and headed into the shower.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de alguns minutos para recuperar o f\u00f4lego e voltar aos nossos sentidos, levantamos ainda tr\u00eamulos e fomos para o chuveiro.{/i}",
        u"{i}After that call, Aiden set boundaries for us, and I couldn\u2019t contact him any more\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Depois daquela liga\u00e7\u00e3o, Aiden estabeleceu limites entre n\u00f3s, e eu n\u00e3o pude mais entrar em contato com ele\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}After that call, I couldn\u2019t contact him anymore.{/i}": u"{i}Depois daquela liga\u00e7\u00e3o, n\u00e3o consegui mais entrar em contato com ele.{/i}",
        u"{i}After the ceremony, everyone packed up, and it was time to say goodbye.{/i}": u"{i}Depois da cerim\u00f4nia, todos arrumaram suas coisas, e chegou a hora de nos despedirmos.{/i}",
        u"{i}After the ceremony, we all went back to the mess hall for the reception. Everyone had a great time, and I loved every minute of the start of my new life with Goro.{/i}": u"{i}Depois da cerim\u00f4nia, todos voltamos ao refeit\u00f3rio para a recep\u00e7\u00e3o. Todos se divertiram muito, e eu amei cada minuto do come\u00e7o da minha nova vida com Goro.{/i}",
        u"{i}After they\u2019d had a few drinks, I stepped in and stopped them from getting totally wasted before dark.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de alguns drinques, eu intervim e impedi que os dois ficassem completamente b\u00eabados antes de escurecer.{/i}",
        u"{i}After they\u2019d had a few drinks, I stepped in and stopped them from getting totally wasted before it was even evening.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de alguns drinques, eu intervim e impedi que os dois ficassem completamente b\u00eabados antes mesmo de anoitecer.{/i}",
        u"{i}After we finished our stretch, Aiden and I continued our workout.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de terminarmos o alongamento, eu e Aiden continuamos nosso treino.{/i}",
        u"{i}After we left the lobby, we decided to check out somewhere else in the hotel.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que sa\u00edmos do sagu\u00e3o, decidimos conhecer outro lugar do hotel.{/i}",
        u"{i}After we left the lobby, we decided to head back to our room for the night.{/i}": u"{i}Depois que sa\u00edmos do sagu\u00e3o, decidimos voltar ao nosso quarto para passar a noite.{/i}",
        u"{i}After working on the blog, we all headed to get some snacks and told Jin more stories about the previous term.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de trabalharmos no blog, fomos pegar alguns petiscos e contamos a Jin mais hist\u00f3rias sobre a temporada anterior.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I ended up spending the evening drinking with Mr. Clermont and Sir Goro, while the rest of the scouts ate and played games.{/i}": u"{i}Aiden e eu acabamos passando a noite bebendo com o Sr. Clermont e o Sr. Goro, enquanto o restante dos escoteiros comia e brincava.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I headed to the kitchen and got started cooking lunch for the workers, then spent the rest of the morning distributing them.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden fomos para a cozinha preparar o almo\u00e7o dos trabalhadores e passamos o restante da manh\u00e3 distribuindo as refei\u00e7\u00f5es.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I helped Sir Goro get control of Yoichi and the pups, and then we actually stayed outside and played in the snow with them for a while.{/i}": u"{i}Aiden e eu ajudamos o Sr. Goro a controlar Yoichi e os filhotes, e depois ficamos do lado de fora brincando na neve com eles por um tempo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I left the office and told everyone his big news. Everyone was excited for him, but Aiden insisted he wanted to focus on finishing the project for now.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden sa\u00edmos do escrit\u00f3rio e contamos a grande novidade a todos. Todos ficaram animados por ele, mas Aiden insistiu que, por enquanto, queria se concentrar em terminar o projeto.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I spent the afternoon helping Lloyd and Darius with some of the repairs at the construction site.{/i}": u"{i}Aiden e eu passamos a tarde ajudando Lloyd e Darius em alguns reparos na obra.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I spent the rest of the morning in the kitchen, making lunch for everyone and distributing them to all the workers.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden passamos o restante da manh\u00e3 na cozinha, preparando o almo\u00e7o de todos e distribuindo-o aos trabalhadores.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I stayed a little longer, relaxing and enjoying the afternoon.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden ficamos mais um pouco, relaxando e aproveitando a tarde.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I stayed a little longer, relaxing and recovering from last night.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden ficamos mais um pouco, relaxando e nos recuperando da noite passada.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden and I worked on a nice to-go lunch for all the workers at the construction site.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Aiden preparamos um bom almo\u00e7o para viagem para todos os trabalhadores da obra.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden finally became a professional chef, and was traveling the world enjoying his newfound passion.{/i}": u"{i}Aiden finalmente se tornou um chef profissional e estava viajando pelo mundo, aproveitando sua nova paix\u00e3o.{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden seems like he\u2019s a little overwhelmed from all the luxury\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Aiden parece um pouco sobrecarregado com todo esse luxo\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden seems like he\u2019s a little overwhelmed from all the luxury\u2026{/i}{fast}": u"{i}Aiden parece um pouco sobrecarregado com todo esse luxo\u2026{/i}{fast}",
        u"{i}Aiden was really upset to leave Camp Buddy\u2026 And I have to admit, it was hard to watch him go\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Aiden ficou muito abalado por deixar o Camp Buddy\u2026 E tenho que admitir que foi dif\u00edcil v\u00ea-lo partir\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Aiden\u2019s questions continued to echo in my mind, and a part of me was unsure of what would become of Goro and I after this final push\u2026{/i}": u"{i}As perguntas de Aiden continuavam ecoando na minha cabe\u00e7a, e parte de mim n\u00e3o sabia o que seria de Goro e de mim depois desse esfor\u00e7o final\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}All of this will be worth it in the end\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}No fim, tudo isso vai valer a pena\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}And after all those months of hard work, I think everyone could use a break.{/i}": u"{i}E depois de todos esses meses de trabalho duro, acho que todos merecem uma pausa.{/i}",
        u"{i}As I stood there at the arches of Camp Buddy alone, I was left to wonder about the choices I\u2019ve made\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Enquanto eu permanecia sozinho diante dos arcos do Camp Buddy, fiquei refletindo sobre as escolhas que fiz\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}As I worked with Aiden, he stayed quiet and lost in his thoughts the entire time.{/i}": u"{i}Enquanto trabalhava com Aiden, ele permaneceu quieto e perdido em seus pensamentos o tempo todo.{/i}",
        u"{i}As much as I didn\u2019t want to leave, I gave Emilia the space that she asked for\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Por mais que eu n\u00e3o quisesse ir embora, dei a Emilia o espa\u00e7o que ela pediu\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}As we left Jin to rest, we suddenly realized how late it was, and decided to head back to our own room and call it a night.{/i}": u"{i}Ao deixarmos Jin descansar, percebemos como j\u00e1 estava tarde e decidimos voltar ao nosso quarto para encerrar a noite.{/i}",
        u"{i}As we left Jin to rest, we suddenly realized that it was already dark out, but we spotted one more place for us to go\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Quando deixamos Jin descansar, percebemos que j\u00e1 estava escuro, mas encontramos mais um lugar para visitar\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}As we left Jin to rest, we suddenly realized that it was already sunset!{/i}": u"{i}Quando deixamos Jin descansar, de repente percebemos que j\u00e1 era o p\u00f4r do sol!{/i}",
        u"{i}As we left Jin to rest, we suddenly realized that the sun had already set.{/i}": u"{i}Quando deixamos Jin descansar, percebemos de repente que o sol j\u00e1 havia se posto.{/i}",
        u"{i}Before I could react, he started rigging the clasps on my gear, restricting me\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Antes que eu pudesse reagir, ele come\u00e7ou a prender os fechos do meu equipamento, imobilizando-me\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Before long, the snow started to thaw, and the project was complete.{/i}": u"{i}N\u00e3o demorou para a neve come\u00e7ar a derreter e o projeto ser conclu\u00eddo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Before we knew it, a month and a half had gone by and the season was about to change again\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, um m\u00eas e meio j\u00e1 havia passado e a esta\u00e7\u00e3o estava prestes a mudar novamente\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Before we knew it, a month and a half had gone by, and the season was about to change again\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, um m\u00eas e meio havia passado, e a esta\u00e7\u00e3o estava prestes a mudar novamente\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Before we realized, it had gotten late, so we headed back to our room to call it a night. {/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, j\u00e1 estava tarde, ent\u00e3o voltamos ao quarto para encerrar a noite. {/i}",
        u"{i}Before we realized, it was already dark out, but we spotted one more place for us to go\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, j\u00e1 estava escuro, mas encontramos mais um lugar para visitar\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}Before we realized, it was already sunset, and we decided to check out another area of the hotel! {/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, j\u00e1 era o p\u00f4r do sol, e decidimos conhecer outra \u00e1rea do hotel! {/i}",
        u"{i}Before we realized, the sun had already set, and we decided to check out another area of the hotel for the evening! {/i}": u"{i}Quando percebemos, o sol j\u00e1 havia se posto, e decidimos conhecer outra \u00e1rea do hotel durante a noite! {/i}",
        u"{i}But I can only do so much, and she\u2019s not willing to meet me halfway\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Mas eu s\u00f3 posso fazer at\u00e9 certo ponto, e ela n\u00e3o est\u00e1 disposta a fazer a parte dela\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}But I can\u2019t force him, and I want him to be happy too\u2026 I even tried to make the time special for us and make each day memorable as best I could.{/i}": u"{i}Mas n\u00e3o posso obrig\u00e1-lo, e tamb\u00e9m quero que ele seja feliz\u2026 At\u00e9 tentei tornar nosso tempo juntos especial e fazer cada dia ser memor\u00e1vel da melhor forma poss\u00edvel.{/i}",
        u"{i}Darius kept on making these strange flirty gestures at Lloyd, which seemed to fluster him too\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Darius continuou fazendo estranhos gestos de flerte para Lloyd, que tamb\u00e9m parecia ficar sem jeito\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Each day, I would wait at the arches of Camp Buddy, holding on to his promise, waiting for him to come home to me again\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Todos os dias, eu esperava nos arcos do Camp Buddy, agarrado \u00e0 promessa dele, esperando que voltasse para casa, para mim\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Even though Goro and I thought we had gained so much throughout the seasons\u2026 In the end I felt like I lost everything\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Embora Goro e eu ach\u00e1ssemos que hav\u00edamos conquistado tanto ao longo das temporadas\u2026 No fim, senti como se tivesse perdido tudo\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Even though I\u2019d rather him be here with me, I\u2019m sure that this was the right call so Aiden could follow his dreams.{/i}": u"{i}Embora eu preferisse que ele estivesse aqui comigo, tenho certeza de que essa foi a decis\u00e3o certa para que Aiden pudesse seguir seus sonhos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Even though it was embarrassing Sir Goro caught us, I\u2019m glad Aiden and I got to work out together today.{/i}": u"{i}Embora tenha sido constrangedor o Sr. Goro nos encontrar assim, fico feliz que eu e Aiden tenhamos treinado juntos hoje.{/i}",
        u"{i}Even though we should\u2019ve been celebrating with the ribbon-cutting, I couldn\u2019t help but feel hollow inside\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Embora dev\u00eassemos estar comemorando durante o corte da fita, eu n\u00e3o conseguia deixar de sentir um vazio por dentro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Even though we were both shaky after our workout and fooling around, Aiden and I headed into the shower and cleaned up.{/i}": u"{i}Embora n\u00f3s dois ainda estiv\u00e9ssemos tr\u00eamulos depois do treino e da nossa brincadeira, Aiden e eu fomos para o chuveiro e nos limpamos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually we drove back to Camp Buddy and all began to pack for the trip.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, voltamos de carro ao Camp Buddy e todos come\u00e7aram a arrumar as malas para a viagem.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, Aiden and Emilia came back with snacks, and we all kept partying for the rest of the evening!{/i}": u"{i}Depois, Aiden e Emilia voltaram com os petiscos, e todos continuamos festejando pelo resto da noite!{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, Aiden and the others came back with snacks, and we all kept partying for the rest of the evening!{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, Aiden e os outros voltaram com os petiscos, e continuamos festejando pelo resto da noite!{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, Lloyd came looking for us and we realized it was already dark out! {/i}": u"{i}Por fim, Lloyd veio nos procurar, e percebemos que j\u00e1 estava escuro! {/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, Lloyd came looking for us and we realized it was already sunset! {/i}": u"{i}Por fim, Lloyd veio nos procurar, e percebemos que j\u00e1 era o p\u00f4r do sol! {/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, Sir Goro went to check on Mr. Clermont, and Aiden and I headed back to our cabin.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, o Sr. Goro foi ver o Sr. Clermont, e eu e Aiden voltamos para nossa cabana.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, after we finished, we joined the rest of the group and partied for the remainder of the evening!{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, depois que terminamos, nos juntamos ao restante do grupo e festejamos pelo resto da noite!{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, he had to take care of some other customers, leaving us with more rounds than we ordered.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, ele precisou atender outros clientes e nos deixou com mais rodadas do que hav\u00edamos pedido.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we decided to get out and explore another area of the hotel! {/i}": u"{i}Por fim, decidimos sair dali e explorar outra \u00e1rea do hotel! {/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we decided to get out and explore another area of the hotel!{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, decidimos sair e explorar outra \u00e1rea do hotel!{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we decided to get out and explore another area of the hotel.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, decidimos sair dali e explorar outra \u00e1rea do hotel.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we decided to go and explore another area of the hotel! {/i}": u"{i}Por fim, decidimos explorar outra \u00e1rea do hotel! {/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we decided to head back to our room for the night.{/i}": u"{i}No fim, decidimos voltar para o nosso quarto e encerrar a noite.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we finished up and everyone headed to work on their separate departments.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, terminamos e todos foram trabalhar em seus respectivos departamentos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Eventually, we finished with the repairs and headed back to our cabin.{/i}": u"{i}Por fim, terminamos os reparos e voltamos para nossa cabana.{/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone continued to work hard while we caught up, and after a few hours, we could really start to see the progress!{/i}": u"{i}Todos continuaram trabalhando duro enquanto coloc\u00e1vamos a conversa em dia e, depois de algumas horas, j\u00e1 dava para ver claramente o progresso!{/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone else arrived as soon as they heard what happened\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Todos os outros chegaram assim que souberam do que aconteceu\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone kept asking Goro and I questions as we ate our meal\u2026 We had to tell the whole story of how it happened for them to be satisfied.{/i}": u"{i}Todos continuaram fazendo perguntas a Goro e a mim enquanto com\u00edamos\u2026 Tivemos que contar toda a hist\u00f3ria de como aconteceu para satisfazer a curiosidade deles.{/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone was in a somber mood the entire drive home\u2026 We couldn\u2019t help but worry about Emilia\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Todos ficaram com um clima pesado durante toda a viagem de volta\u2026 N\u00e3o consegu\u00edamos deixar de nos preocupar com Emilia\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone worked hard for the next few months, and I did my best to help Aiden get ready for his schooling once the work was done.{/i}": u"{i}Todos trabalharam duro nos meses seguintes, e fiz o poss\u00edvel para ajudar Aiden a se preparar para os estudos assim que o trabalho terminasse.{/i}",
        u"{i}Everyone worked hard for the next few months, and I did my best to lead in Goro's place.{/i}": u"{i}Todos trabalharam duro nos meses seguintes, e fiz o meu melhor para liderar no lugar de Goro.{/i}",
        u"{i}Following Sir Goro\u2019s command, I knelt on the ground and began to pull down his suit\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Seguindo a ordem do Sr. Goro, ajoelhei-me no ch\u00e3o e comecei a abaixar seu traje\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Goro and I carried everything into our room and spent the rest of the day unpacking and chatting casually about his things.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e Goro levamos tudo para o nosso quarto e passamos o resto do dia desempacotando e conversando tranquilamente sobre as coisas dele.{/i}",
        u"{i}Goro and I ended up spending the evening drinking with Mr. Clermont, Lloyd and Darius, while the rest of the scouts ate and played games.{/i}": u"{i}Goro e eu acabamos passando a noite bebendo com o Sr. Clermont, Lloyd e Darius, enquanto o restante dos escoteiros comia e jogava.{/i}",
        u"{i}Goro has come such a long way to be able to be so open with me\u2026 It\u2019s like the floodgates have opened and he\u2019s so excited to tell me all about his life.{/i}": u"{i}Goro avan\u00e7ou tanto para conseguir se abrir assim comigo\u2026 \u00c9 como se as comportas tivessem se aberto e agora ele estivesse empolgado para me contar tudo sobre sua vida.{/i}",
        u"{i}Goro laid himself down on the bed as I fetched a pair of handcuffs\u2026 I quickly strapped him in, ready to take over\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Goro se deitou na cama enquanto eu pegava um par de algemas\u2026 Rapidamente o prendi, pronto para assumir o controle\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Goro looked a little embarrassed, but happy too\u2026 He finally seems truly content to be taking this new step in his life.{/i}": u"{i}Goro parecia um pouco envergonhado, mas tamb\u00e9m feliz\u2026 Finalmente parece realmente contente por dar este novo passo em sua vida.{/i}",
        u"{i}He hung out with us until he felt better, and then left to go shower in his room.{/i}": u"{i}Ele ficou conosco at\u00e9 se sentir melhor e depois saiu para tomar banho no quarto dele.{/i}",
        u"{i}He laid back against the wooden boards, spreading out his body to give me a clear view\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Ele se recostou nas t\u00e1buas de madeira, abrindo o corpo para me dar uma vis\u00e3o completa\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}He laid me back against the wooden boards, spreading out my body and positioning himself in front of me\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Ele me deitou sobre as t\u00e1buas de madeira, abrindo meu corpo e se posicionando diante de mim\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}He positioned himself on top of me, and I knew what was coming next\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Ele se posicionou sobre mim, e eu sabia o que viria em seguida\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}He was acting strangely, but he didn\u2019t seem upset\u2026 I wonder where he\u2019s taking me\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Ele estava agindo de forma estranha, mas n\u00e3o parecia chateado\u2026 Para onde ser\u00e1 que est\u00e1 me levando\u2026?{/i}",
        u"{i}Hearing about Sir Goro\u2019s past with his family gave me a new sense of respect for he and Yuri\u2019s relationship\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Ouvir sobre o passado do Sr. Goro com a fam\u00edlia me fez respeitar ainda mais a rela\u00e7\u00e3o entre ele e Yuri\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Hearing the pain and frustration in his voice, I feel like I failed Aiden\u2026 Especially since there\u2019s something about him that I don\u2019t understand even after all these years.{/i}": u"{i}Ouvindo a dor e a frustra\u00e7\u00e3o na voz dele, sinto que falhei com Aiden\u2026 Principalmente porque existe algo sobre ele que ainda n\u00e3o entendo, mesmo depois de todos esses anos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Hiro told us about all the stuff he\u2019d been trying in the kitchen since leaving camp, and before long he and Aiden were totally wrapped up in conversation about it!{/i}": u"{i}Hiro contou tudo que vinha experimentando na cozinha desde que saiu do acampamento e, pouco depois, ele e Aiden estavam completamente envolvidos na conversa!{/i}",
        u"{i}However, I wonder what Aiden really meant when he asked Sir Goro to join in\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Mas fico imaginando o que Aiden realmente quis dizer quando convidou o Sr. Goro para participar\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Hurriedly, Aiden slid both our suits down to our legs, then gently pushed me into the shallows\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Apressado, Aiden deslizou nossas sungas at\u00e9 as pernas e ent\u00e3o me empurrou gentilmente para a \u00e1gua rasa\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I can figure that out later! For now, I just need to do my best to give them a proper welcome and instructions!{/i}": u"{i}Posso descobrir isso depois! Por enquanto, preciso apenas fazer o poss\u00edvel para receb\u00ea-los e orient\u00e1-los adequadamente!{/i}",
        u"{i}I can\u2019t believe that I never saw how he was losing heart for the camp\u2026 There must be something else that I missed\u2026{/i}": u"{i}N\u00e3o acredito que nunca percebi como ele estava perdendo o entusiasmo pelo acampamento\u2026 Deve haver alguma outra coisa que deixei passar\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I can\u2019t believe that I never saw how he was losing heart for the camp\u2026 and for our relationship\u2026{/i}": u"{i}N\u00e3o acredito que nunca percebi como ele estava perdendo a esperan\u00e7a no acampamento\u2026 e no nosso relacionamento\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I can\u2019t wait to share the rest of my days with him!{/i}": u"{i}Mal posso esperar para compartilhar o resto dos meus dias com ele!{/i}",
        u"{i}I continued to talk to Emilia for a little bit longer until Aiden and Taiga brought us some food.{/i}": u"{i}Continuei conversando com Emilia por mais um pouco, at\u00e9 Aiden e Taiga trazerem comida para n\u00f3s.{/i}",
        u"{i}I couldn\u2019t believe what an amazing opportunity Mr. Clermont was offering Aiden\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Eu n\u00e3o conseguia acreditar na oportunidade incr\u00edvel que o Sr. Clermont estava oferecendo a Aiden\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}I couldn\u2019t hold on any longer as my consciousness began to fade, and as I passed out, I couldn\u2019t believe what had just happened\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Eu n\u00e3o conseguia mais me manter consciente e, enquanto desmaiava, mal podia acreditar no que acabara de acontecer\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I do feel bad that I upset her as much as I did, but I couldn\u2019t keep doing nothing.{/i}": u"{i}Eu me sinto mal por t\u00ea-la deixado t\u00e3o chateada, mas n\u00e3o dava para continuar sem fazer nada.{/i}",
        u"{i}I have to admit that I was having a hard time focusing with the teasing views and positions Aiden was doing\u2026 It almost ended up going in a different direction\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Tenho que admitir que estava dif\u00edcil me concentrar com as poses provocantes de Aiden\u2026 Quase acabamos levando o treino para outra dire\u00e7\u00e3o\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I hope that we get the chance to catch up again soon, as I ended up going to sleep even more pent up than before...{/i}": u"{i}Espero que tenhamos outra oportunidade em breve, pois acabei indo dormir ainda mais frustrado do que antes\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I just have to stay resolute, and remember that all of this is for the sake of the camp and Goro\u2019s happiness\u2026{/i}": u"{i}S\u00f3 preciso permanecer firme e lembrar que tudo isso \u00e9 pelo bem do acampamento e pela felicidade de Goro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I knew he couldn\u2019t get the advice about the offer off his mind.{/i}": u"{i}Eu sabia que ele n\u00e3o conseguia tirar da cabe\u00e7a os conselhos sobre a oferta.{/i}",
        u"{i}I laid down on my back, eager for what came next\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Deitei de costas, ansioso pelo que viria a seguir\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I was at loss for words as Goro drove us both home in silence\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Fiquei sem palavras enquanto Goro nos levava de volta para casa em sil\u00eancio\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I was so caught off guard by Goro\u2019s sudden appearance, I didn\u2019t even have time to ask him about the offer\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Fui t\u00e3o pego de surpresa pela apari\u00e7\u00e3o repentina de Goro que nem tive tempo de perguntar sobre a proposta\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I wish he could\u2019ve been here today\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Eu queria que ele pudesse estar aqui hoje\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I would never forget this moment with Goro\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Eu jamais esqueceria este momento com Goro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I'm going to make sure to support him any way that I can, so that he doesn't have to hesitate anymore!{/i}": u"{i}Vou garantir que o apoie de todas as formas que puder, para que ele n\u00e3o precise mais hesitar!{/i}",
        u"{i}In my heart, I realized how much I failed him by pushing him to make a choice I thought was for the best\u2026{/i}": u"{i}No fundo, percebi o quanto falhei com ele ao pression\u00e1-lo a tomar uma decis\u00e3o que eu achava ser a melhor\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It also meant that the time had come for us to say goodbye to our friends as well.{/i}": u"{i}Isso tamb\u00e9m significava que havia chegado a hora de nos despedirmos dos nossos amigos.{/i}",
        u"{i}It feels good, huh? {/i}": u"{i}\u00c9 gostoso, n\u00e3o \u00e9?{/i}",
        u"{i}It seems like finally, after everything we\u2019ve been through the last few months, we were able to have an honest talk with Emilia\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Parece que finalmente, depois de tudo o que passamos nos \u00faltimos meses, conseguimos ter uma conversa sincera com a Emilia\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It was already late, but we spotted one more place for us to go\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}J\u00e1 era tarde, mas encontramos mais um lugar para visitar\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}It was hard work, but we managed to finish it all just before sunset.{/i}": u"{i}Foi um trabalho dif\u00edcil, mas conseguimos terminar tudo pouco antes do p\u00f4r do sol.{/i}",
        u"{i}It was honestly overwhelming to take it all in, and I sometimes wished it didn\u2019t have to be this way\u2026 If only Goro would stay here\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Sinceramente, era muita coisa para assimilar, e \u00e0s vezes eu desejava que n\u00e3o precisasse ser assim\u2026 Se Goro simplesmente ficasse aqui\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It was odd, but I\u2019m glad to see them acting even closer!{/i}": u"{i}Foi estranho, mas fico feliz em v\u00ea-los ainda mais pr\u00f3ximos!{/i}",
        u"{i}It was really nostalgic to work with Aiden in the kitchen\u2026 No wonder he was reminiscing about the past.{/i}": u"{i}Foi realmente nost\u00e1lgico trabalhar com o Aiden na cozinha\u2026 N\u00e3o \u00e9 de admirar que ele estivesse recordando o passado.{/i}",
        u"{i}It wasn\u2019t too long before we were both starting to feel a little tipsy\u2026{/i}": u"{i}N\u00e3o demorou muito para n\u00f3s dois come\u00e7armos a ficar um pouco b\u00eabados\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It will all be worth it in the end\u2026{/i}": u"{i}No fim, tudo isso valer\u00e1 a pena\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It's too bad that Aiden and I got interrupted... I was really enjoying fooling around with him like that, especially after a long day's work... {/i}": u"{i}\u00c9 uma pena que Aiden e eu tenhamos sido interrompidos\u2026 Eu estava gostando muito de brincar com ele daquele jeito, principalmente depois de um longo dia de trabalho\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}It's too bad that Sir Goro and I got interrupted... I was really enjoying what we were doing, especially after a long day's work...{/i}": u"{i}\u00c9 uma pena que o Sr. Goro e eu tenhamos sido interrompidos\u2026 Eu estava gostando muito do que faz\u00edamos, especialmente depois de um longo dia de trabalho\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s a good thing Mr. Clermont was so generous to offer us a trip to bond together\u2026 Maybe we can help resolve our issues there.{/i}": u"{i}Ainda bem que o Sr. Clermont foi t\u00e3o generoso ao nos oferecer uma viagem para estreitarmos nossos la\u00e7os\u2026 Talvez possamos resolver nossos problemas por l\u00e1.{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s been so long\u2026 I forgot how good you were in bed\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Faz tanto tempo\u2026 Eu tinha esquecido como voc\u00ea era bom na cama\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s just like back at the hotel\u2026 He keeps trying to change the topic and act as if everything is fine.{/i}": u"{i}\u00c9 igual ao que aconteceu no hotel\u2026 Ele continua tentando mudar de assunto e agir como se estivesse tudo bem.{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s not often he and I have a conversation like that, but I\u2019m glad that we were able to look back and spend time together like we used to.{/i}": u"{i}N\u00e3o \u00e9 sempre que temos uma conversa assim, mas fico feliz por termos relembrado e passado algum tempo juntos como antes.{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s only been a few days, and so much has changed already!{/i}": u"{i}Faz apenas alguns dias, e tanta coisa j\u00e1 mudou!{/i}",
        u"{i}It\u2019s really refreshing to be able to talk to him on such a personal level, and not just about work\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}\u00c9 realmente revigorante poder conversar com ele de forma t\u00e3o pessoal, e n\u00e3o apenas sobre trabalho\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019ll make sure to show Sir Goro that he was right to place his trust in me!{/i}": u"{i}Farei quest\u00e3o de mostrar ao senhor Goro que ele fez bem em confiar em mim!{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m glad Yuri\u2019s finally getting to explore herself a bit more!{/i}": u"{i}Fico feliz que Yuri finalmente esteja tendo a chance de explorar um pouco mais seus pr\u00f3prios interesses!{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m glad he and Aiden have such a strong bond!{/i}": u"{i}Fico feliz que ele e Aiden tenham um v\u00ednculo t\u00e3o forte!{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m gonna make sure I help him in every way I can!{/i}": u"{i}Vou fazer quest\u00e3o de ajud\u00e1-lo de todas as maneiras que puder!{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m so glad she opened up to us, allowing us to finally understand her side, and is willing to give it another chance\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Fico muito feliz que ela tenha se aberto conosco, permitindo que finalmente entend\u00eassemos o lado dela, e que esteja disposta a tentar novamente\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m so happy I get to be a part of it!{/i}": u"{i}Fico t\u00e3o feliz por poder fazer parte disso!{/i}",
        u"{i}I\u2019m sure he\u2019s excited for the chance! I\u2019m so happy for him!{/i}": u"{i}Tenho certeza de que ele est\u00e1 animado com a oportunidade! Estou t\u00e3o feliz por ele!{/i}",
        u"{i}Knowing how much change was coming starting tomorrow, it makes me feel thankful for the simple times like this I get to spend with everyone.{/i}": u"{i}Sabendo quantas mudan\u00e7as come\u00e7ariam amanh\u00e3, sinto-me grato por momentos simples como este, que posso passar com todos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Lloyd claimed it was all due to \u2018fortune\u2019, but it was clear he was the captain of his own destiny.{/i}": u"{i}Lloyd dizia que tudo se devia \u00e0 \u2018sorte\u2019, mas estava claro que ele era o capit\u00e3o do pr\u00f3prio destino.{/i}",
        u"{i}Maybe this was meant to happen after all - he reached his dreams at the cost of the love we once had for each other\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Talvez isso realmente estivesse destinado a acontecer \u2014 ele realizou seus sonhos ao custo do amor que um dia tivemos um pelo outro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Meanwhile, I took Darius and Lloyd on a tour of the camp, showing them all the changes and discussing the work they\u2019d be doing in more detail\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Enquanto isso, levei Darius e Lloyd para conhecer o acampamento, mostrando todas as mudan\u00e7as e conversando com mais detalhes sobre o trabalho que fariam\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}Moving quickly, Aiden and Goro tied my arms behind my back before I could respond, positioning themselves on either side of me\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Movendo-se rapidamente, Aiden e Goro amarraram meus bra\u00e7os atr\u00e1s das costas antes que eu pudesse reagir, posicionando-se um de cada lado de mim\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}My only hope now is that he\u2019ll come back one day and see how I\u2019ve kept the camp alive for him\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Minha \u00fanica esperan\u00e7a agora \u00e9 que ele volte algum dia e veja como mantive o acampamento vivo por ele\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Not wanting to aggravate Yuri, I went into the bathroom and put my costume on before heading to the kitchen to find Aiden\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Sem querer irritar a Yuri, fui ao banheiro colocar minha fantasia antes de seguir para a cozinha para procurar Aiden\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Not wanting to aggravate Yuri, I went into the bathroom and put my costume on before heading to the office to find Sir Goro\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Sem querer irritar Yuri, fui ao banheiro vestir minha fantasia antes de seguir para o escrit\u00f3rio \u00e0 procura do Sr. Goro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Now that our project was officially complete, everyone began packing their things to leave.{/i}": u"{i}Agora que nosso projeto estava oficialmente conclu\u00eddo, todos come\u00e7aram a arrumar suas coisas para partir.{/i}",
        u"{i}Once all the lunches had been handed out, we went around the camp doing maintenance tasks, and before we knew it, the sun was setting.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de entregar todos os almo\u00e7os, percorremos o acampamento realizando tarefas de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o e, quando percebemos, o sol j\u00e1 estava se pondo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Once it was ready, we headed over there to deliver it!{/i}": u"{i}Quando ficou pronto, fomos at\u00e9 l\u00e1 entregar!{/i}",
        u"{i}Once we finished distributing the lunches to everyone, Aiden and I headed back to the kitchen to cleanup.{/i}": u"{i}Depois de terminar de distribuir os almo\u00e7os para todos, eu e Aiden voltamos \u00e0 cozinha para limpar tudo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Our bodies were really pruney, and Aiden couldn\u2019t resist poking me all over and teasing about it!{/i}": u"{i}Nossos corpos estavam todos enrugados, e Aiden n\u00e3o resistiu a me cutucar por toda parte e fazer piadas sobre isso!{/i}",
        u"{i}Right away, I began to regret pushing Aiden, despite knowing how badly he\u2019s been bothered today\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Imediatamente comecei a me arrepender de ter pressionado Aiden, mesmo sabendo o quanto tudo isso o incomodou hoje\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Seeing Aiden with a newfound determination was proof of how much he\u2019s changed\u2026 He\u2019s finally making the effort to pursue something for his own future. {/i}": u"{i}Ver Aiden com essa nova determina\u00e7\u00e3o era uma prova do quanto ele mudou\u2026 Finalmente est\u00e1 se esfor\u00e7ando para buscar algo para o pr\u00f3prio futuro. {/i}",
        u"{i}Sharing the cabin with everyone made me feel like I was a scout again.{/i}": u"{i}Dividir a cabana com todos me fez sentir como se eu fosse escoteiro novamente.{/i}",
        u"{i}Shortly after we finished cooking, we headed over to the construction site to bring everyone lunch and see what else we could do.{/i}": u"{i}Pouco depois de terminarmos de cozinhar, fomos at\u00e9 a obra levar o almo\u00e7o para todos e ver no que mais poder\u00edamos ajudar.{/i}",
        u"{i}Since everyone else was gone from the cabin again this morning, they must\u2019ve already gotten to work\u2026 I\u2019d have to catch up.{/i}": u"{i}Como todos tinham sa\u00eddo da cabana novamente nesta manh\u00e3, j\u00e1 deviam estar trabalhando\u2026 Eu teria que alcan\u00e7\u00e1-los.{/i}",
        u"{i}Since the sun was still up for a little while longer, Aiden and I went back to shoveling with everyone else before it got dark.{/i}": u"{i}Como o sol ainda ficaria no c\u00e9u por mais um tempo, eu e Aiden voltamos a retirar a neve com os outros antes que escurecesse.{/i}",
        u"{i}Since the sun was still up for a little while longer, Goro and I headed back to join everyone and continue shoveling before it got dark.{/i}": u"{i}Como o sol ainda ficaria no c\u00e9u por mais um pouco, eu e Goro voltamos para nos juntar aos outros e continuar retirando a neve antes de escurecer.{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro and Aiden had gotten really fired up for their sudden drinking competition\u2026{/i}": u"{i}O Sr. Goro e Aiden ficaram realmente empolgados com aquela competi\u00e7\u00e3o de bebida que surgiu do nada\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro and I brought Aiden back to our room and gave him some medicine to help with his hangover.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e o Sr. Goro levamos Aiden de volta ao nosso quarto e demos um rem\u00e9dio para ajudar com a ressaca.{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro and I stayed a little longer to chat with Lloyd and Darius, while we all relaxed in the hot bath.{/i}": u"{i}Eu e o Sr. Goro ficamos mais um pouco conversando com Lloyd e Darius enquanto todos relax\u00e1vamos no banho quente.{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro and I were so aroused from teasing each other that we couldn\u2019t resist anymore\u2026{/i}": u"{i}O Sr. Goro e eu est\u00e1vamos t\u00e3o excitados de provocar um ao outro que n\u00e3o consegu\u00edamos mais resistir\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro continued to tease and chat with me on the car ride back\u2026 It was actually really fun to see him loosened up like that.{/i}": u"{i}O senhor Goro continuou brincando e conversando comigo durante a viagem de volta\u2026 Foi realmente muito divertido v\u00ea-lo t\u00e3o descontra\u00eddo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro immediately called a meeting with the other scoutmasters to prepare for the workers\u2019 arrival tomorrow.{/i}": u"{i}O senhor Goro convocou imediatamente uma reuni\u00e3o com os outros chefes escoteiros para preparar a chegada dos trabalhadores amanh\u00e3.{/i}",
        u"{i}Sir Goro is trying his best to open up around me, reminiscing about the past and chatting casually.{/i}": u"{i}O senhor Goro est\u00e1 fazendo o poss\u00edvel para se abrir comigo, relembrando o passado e conversando de maneira descontra\u00edda.{/i}",
        u"{i}Somehow, whenever Emilia and I interact, it always ends up so tense\u2026 I wish there was a way to reach her like I could back then.{/i}": u"{i}De algum modo, sempre que eu e Emilia interagimos, tudo acaba ficando t\u00e3o tenso\u2026 Queria que houvesse uma maneira de me aproximar dela como eu conseguia naquela \u00e9poca.{/i}",
        u"{i}Still filled with passion, we finished up with a tender kiss\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Ainda tomados pela paix\u00e3o, terminamos com um beijo carinhoso\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Surprisingly, none of us could guess anyone\u2019s drawing, making Yuri more and more frustrated.{/i}": u"{i}Surpreendentemente, nenhum de n\u00f3s conseguia adivinhar os desenhos dos outros, deixando Yuri cada vez mais frustrada.{/i}",
        u"{i}Taking Goro\u2019s hand, we hiked our way to the top of the falls as the sun continued to set.{/i}": u"{i}Segurando a m\u00e3o de Goro, seguimos pela trilha at\u00e9 o topo da cachoeira enquanto o sol continuava se pondo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Talking with Aiden like that was really good for both of us\u2026 I think we both needed to get some things off our chest.{/i}": u"{i}Conversar assim com Aiden foi muito bom para n\u00f3s dois\u2026 Acho que ambos precis\u00e1vamos desabafar algumas coisas.{/i}",
        u"{i}Thankfully, Aiden was there to get my mind off of her.{/i}": u"{i}Felizmente, Aiden estava l\u00e1 para me fazer parar de pensar nela.{/i}",
        u"{i}Thankfully, I was able to help Aiden clear up his doubts and steer him towards the right path.{/i}": u"{i}Felizmente, consegui ajudar Aiden a esclarecer suas d\u00favidas e gui\u00e1-lo para o caminho certo.{/i}",
        u"{i}Thankfully, Sir Goro was there to get my mind off of her.{/i}": u"{i}Felizmente, o Sr. Goro estava l\u00e1 para me ajudar a tirar ela da cabe\u00e7a.{/i}",
        u"{i}Thankfully, Yuri was eager to talk about her fanfics, so she was distracted from her concerns with Emilia\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Felizmente, Yuri estava ansiosa para falar de suas fanfics, ent\u00e3o se distraiu das preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es com Emilia\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}That\u2019s right\u2026 Go slow\u2026 I like it that way\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Isso\u2026 V\u00e1 devagar\u2026 Eu gosto assim\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}That\u2019s why this time around, I had to respect his decision and let him go\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Por isso, desta vez, eu precisava respeitar a decis\u00e3o dele e deix\u00e1-lo ir\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}The bartender kept serving Aiden and I drinks for a while, and we really enjoyed our conversation with him.{/i}": u"{i}O bartender continuou servindo drinques para Aiden e para mim por algum tempo, e gostamos muito de conversar com ele.{/i}",
        u"{i}The five of us spent the next little while in the mess hall finishing up our lunch and catching up on old times, but before long it was time to get back to work.{/i}": u"{i}N\u00f3s cinco passamos mais algum tempo no refeit\u00f3rio, terminando o almo\u00e7o e relembrando os velhos tempos, mas logo chegou a hora de voltar ao trabalho.{/i}",
        u"{i}The whole time I\u2019ve been with them, I can\u2019t shake the feeling that I\u2019ve met them before\u2026 But I can\u2019t remember when or where.{/i}": u"{i}Durante todo o tempo que passei com eles, n\u00e3o consegui afastar a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de que j\u00e1 os conhecia\u2026 Mas n\u00e3o me lembro de quando ou onde.{/i}",
        u"{i}They both grudgingly agreed to stop but promised to settle it when we got back to camp.  {/i}": u"{i}Os dois aceitaram parar a contragosto, mas prometeram resolver a disputa quando volt\u00e1ssemos ao acampamento.  {/i}",
        u"{i}This was everything Goro dreamed of\u2026 or so I thought.{/i}": u"{i}Isso era tudo com que Goro sonhava\u2026 ou pelo menos era o que eu pensava.{/i}",
        u"{i}Time flew by, and before I knew it, we were back at Camp Buddy.{/i}": u"{i}O tempo voou e, quando percebi, est\u00e1vamos de volta ao Camp Buddy.{/i}",
        u"{i}Under the shooting stars, our lips touched, with a newfound promise to each other that we\u2019d always be together.{/i}": u"{i}Sob as estrelas cadentes, nossos l\u00e1bios se tocaram, selando uma nova promessa de que estar\u00edamos sempre juntos.{/i}",
        u"{i}Until I received the news that he had finally become a professional chef.{/i}": u"{i}At\u00e9 que recebi a not\u00edcia de que ele finalmente havia se tornado um chef profissional.{/i}",
        u"{i}Until then, all the memories we shared together will keep replaying in my head, holding on to what\u2019s left of the love I had for him\u2026{/i}": u"{i}At\u00e9 l\u00e1, todas as lembran\u00e7as que compartilhamos continuar\u00e3o se repetindo na minha cabe\u00e7a, enquanto me agarro ao que restou do amor que eu sentia por ele\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Watching Aiden leave, I couldn\u2019t even stop him\u2026 I was too stunned to say anything else\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Vendo Aiden ir embora, eu nem consegui impedi-lo\u2026 Fiquei atordoado demais para dizer qualquer outra coisa\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}We all took turns checking on her, but she was still sleeping peacefully even when we arrived back at the camp\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Todos nos revezamos para verificar como ela estava, mas continuava dormindo tranquilamente mesmo quando chegamos ao acampamento\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}We ate our meal, then decided to leave Jin to his business while Aiden and I headed back to our cabin.{/i}": u"{i}Fizemos nossa refei\u00e7\u00e3o e depois decidimos deixar Jin cuidar das coisas dele enquanto eu e Aiden volt\u00e1vamos para nossa cabana.{/i}",
        u"{i}We cleaned each other off, although I was still a little in shock about what had just happened, Aiden and Sir Goro were in good spirits.{/i}": u"{i}N\u00f3s nos limpamos; embora eu ainda estivesse um pouco em choque com o que acabara de acontecer, Aiden e o Sr. Goro estavam de bom humor.{/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to finish up our workout, take a quick shower, and check out another place in the hotel!{/i}": u"{i}Decidimos terminar o treino, tomar um banho r\u00e1pido e conhecer outro lugar do hotel!{/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to finish up our workout, take a quick shower, and check out one more place in the hotel that I spotted\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Decidimos terminar o treino, tomar um banho r\u00e1pido e conhecer mais um lugar do hotel que eu havia visto\u2026 {/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to finish up, take a quick shower, and check out another place in the hotel for the evening.{/i}": u"{i}Decidimos terminar, tomar um banho r\u00e1pido e conhecer outro lugar do hotel durante a noite.{/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to finish up, take a quick shower, and head back to our room to call it a night.{/i}": u"{i}Decidimos terminar, tomar um banho r\u00e1pido e voltar ao quarto para encerrar a noite.{/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to go check out another area of the hotel before it got dark.{/i}": u"{i}Decidimos conhecer outra \u00e1rea do hotel antes que escurecesse.{/i}",
        u"{i}We decided to go check out another area of the hotel before it got too late.{/i}": u"{i}Decidimos conhecer outra \u00e1rea do hotel antes que ficasse tarde demais.{/i}",
        u"{i}We ended up sitting and chatting with her for a long time, eating snacks and laughing at all the stories she told.{/i}": u"{i}Acabamos sentados, conversando com ela por muito tempo, comendo lanches e rindo de todas as hist\u00f3rias que contou.{/i}",
        u"{i}We ended up sitting and talking with Yuri about her fanfics for a long time, all while eating our meal.{/i}": u"{i}Acabamos ficando sentados por bastante tempo, comendo e conversando com Yuri sobre as fanfics dela.{/i}",
        u"{i}We finished the round, and eventually Lloyd and Darius came back.{/i}": u"{i}Terminamos a rodada e, depois de um tempo, Lloyd e Darius voltaram.{/i}",
        u"{i}We kept drinking and partying for the rest of the evening!{/i}": u"{i}Continuamos bebendo e festejando pelo resto da noite!{/i}",
        u"{i}We left him to rest and headed out to check another area of the hotel.{/i}": u"{i}Deixamos ele descansar e sa\u00edmos para conhecer outra \u00e1rea do hotel.{/i}",
        u"{i}We played a few more rounds, while continuing to drink and have fun.{/i}": u"{i}Jogamos mais algumas rodadas enquanto continu\u00e1vamos bebendo e nos divertindo.{/i}",
        u"{i}We shut down the game before it got too out of hand and switched to something else.{/i}": u"{i}Encerramos o jogo antes que sa\u00edsse ainda mais do controle e fomos fazer outra coisa.{/i}",
        u"{i}We spent the next while typing out some of the fun events we\u2019d done at the beach on Jin\u2019s laptop.{/i}": u"{i}Passamos algum tempo digitando no notebook de Jin algumas das atividades divertidas que fizemos na praia.{/i}",
        u"{i}We spent the rest of the afternoon working out until we realized the sun had already set.{/i}": u"{i}Passamos o resto da tarde treinando at\u00e9 percebermos que o sol j\u00e1 havia se posto.{/i}",
        u"{i}We spent the rest of the afternoon working out with Darius and chatting\u2026 I really enjoyed seeing him open up like that!{/i}": u"{i}Passamos o restante da tarde treinando e conversando com Darius\u2026 Gostei muito de v\u00ea-lo se abrir daquele jeito!{/i}",
        u"{i}We spent the rest of the evening working out until we realized it was already late.{/i}": u"{i}Passamos o resto da noite treinando at\u00e9 percebermos que j\u00e1 estava tarde.{/i}",
        u"{i}We stayed a little longer, enjoying our snacks with the beautiful view.{/i}": u"{i}Ficamos mais um pouco, aproveitando nossos lanches com aquela bela vista.{/i}",
        u"{i}We stayed a little longer, relaxing and enjoying the afternoon.{/i}": u"{i}Ficamos mais um pouco, relaxando e aproveitando a tarde.{/i}",
        u"{i}We then went around the camp doing all the maintenance tasks, and before we knew it, the sun was setting.{/i}": u"{i}Depois percorremos o acampamento fazendo todas as tarefas de manuten\u00e7\u00e3o e, quando percebemos, o sol j\u00e1 estava se pondo.{/i}",
        u"{i}We washed each other off, letting the hot water soothe our muscles after such an intense release\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Lavamos um ao outro, deixando a \u00e1gua quente relaxar nossos m\u00fasculos depois de uma descarga t\u00e3o intensa\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}We were both so relaxed that we didn\u2019t even notice how long we\u2019d spent there, and by the time we got out, it was already dark out\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Est\u00e1vamos t\u00e3o relaxados que nem percebemos quanto tempo passamos ali e, quando sa\u00edmos, j\u00e1 estava escuro\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}We were both so relaxed that we didn\u2019t even notice how long we\u2019d spent there, and by the time we got out, it was already sunset\u2026{/i}": u"{i}Est\u00e1vamos t\u00e3o relaxados que nem percebemos quanto tempo passamos ali e, quando sa\u00edmos, j\u00e1 era o p\u00f4r do sol\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}We were glad that they seem to have calmed down, and rejoined the game.{/i}": u"{i}Ficamos felizes ao ver que pareciam ter se acalmado e voltaram ao jogo.{/i}",
        u"{i}We worked on the blog with Natsumi and Hunter, excitedly telling Jin stories from the previous term.{/i}": u"{i}Trabalhamos no blog com Natsumi e Hunter, contando animadamente ao Jin hist\u00f3rias da temporada anterior.{/i}",
        u"{i}With just a short time left before the summer term started, Goro stayed true to his word and made sure to teach me everything else I needed.{/i}": u"{i}Com pouco tempo restante antes do in\u00edcio da temporada de ver\u00e3o, Goro manteve sua palavra e fez quest\u00e3o de me ensinar tudo o que ainda precisava saber.{/i}",
        u"{i}With the alcohol warming my system, I eventually fell asleep without even realizing it.{/i}": u"{i}Com o \u00e1lcool aquecendo meu corpo, acabei adormecendo sem nem perceber.{/i}",
        u"{i}Yeah\u2026 That\u2019s right\u2026 {/i}": u"{i}Isso\u2026 Assim mesmo\u2026{/i}",
        u"{i}Yoichi and Hiro kept getting Aiden, Lloyd, Darius and I to play \u2018interesting\u2019 games with them and we ended up having a lot of fun!{/i}": u"{i}Yoichi e Hiro continuaram fazendo Aiden, Lloyd, Darius e eu participarmos de brincadeiras \u2018interessantes\u2019, e acabamos nos divertindo muito!{/i}",
        u"{i}Yuri and Goro have always shared such a close bond, and I can tell how much they\u2019ve both sacrificed for each other.{/i}": u"{i}Yuri e Goro sempre tiveram um v\u00ednculo muito forte, e d\u00e1 para perceber o quanto os dois sacrificaram um pelo outro.{/i}",
        u"{i}Yuri and I left the office and explained the situation to everyone... We were all upset about Goro's sudden departure, but none of us wanted to give up on the project.{/i}": u"{i}Yuri e eu sa\u00edmos do escrit\u00f3rio e explicamos a situa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos\u2026 Todos est\u00e1vamos abalados com a partida repentina de Goro, mas nenhum de n\u00f3s queria desistir do projeto.{/i}",
        u"{i}Yuri and I took the supervisors and their teams to their respective cabins and gave them time to unpack their belongings.{/i}": u"{i}A Yuri e eu levamos os supervisores e suas equipes \u00e0s respectivas cabanas e lhes demos tempo para desfazer as bagagens.{/i}",
        u"{i}Yuri took the other workers back to their cabins to help them get settled in, while Aiden dragged Yoichi and Taiga to help him clean the kitchen after the workers finished. {/i}": u"{i}Yuri levou os outros trabalhadores de volta \u00e0s cabanas para ajud\u00e1-los a se acomodar, enquanto Aiden arrastou Yoichi e Taiga para ajud\u00e1-lo a limpar a cozinha depois que todos terminaram. {/i}",
        u"\u2014Aiden! Nice to meet you, Jin! ": u"\u2014Aiden! \u00c9 um prazer conhec\u00ea-lo, Jin! ",
        u"\u2014And that\u2019s why you should always strive to be honest with yourself, so you can\u2026 Wait a minute, where did Taiga go?": u"\u2014E \u00e9 por isso que voc\u00ea sempre deve se esfor\u00e7ar para ser honesto consigo mesmo, para poder\u2026 Espere, onde foi o Taiga?",
        u"\u2014Ohh! I have an idea that would get you to stay~ ": u"\u2014Ohh! Tive uma ideia que faria voc\u00ea querer ficar~ ",
        u"\u2014The east is the intended site for additional cabins, while the west is meant for the proposed function hall.": u"\u2014O lado leste \u00e9 destinado \u00e0s cabanas adicionais, enquanto o oeste receber\u00e1 o sal\u00e3o de eventos proposto.",
        u"\u2014and that should cover the rest of the project timeline.": u"\u2014e isso deve cobrir o restante do cronograma do projeto.",
        u"\u2014if it fits, Yoshi sits.": u"\u2014se cabe, o Yoshi senta.",
        u"\u2014never goes out of his house, and only lives off instant noodles.": u"\u2014nunca sai de casa e vive apenas de macarr\u00e3o instant\u00e2neo.",
        u"\u2018Course it will, Yoshi~ There\u2019s still a teeny little gap down there!": u"Claro que vai, Yoshi~ Ainda tem um espacinho min\u00fasculo a\u00ed embaixo!",
        u"\u2018Crazy\u2019 night, huh?": u"Noite \u2018maluca\u2019, hein?",
        u"\u2018Master Chef Aiden\u2019 has such a nice ring to it! Don\u2019t you think so?": u"\u2018Mestre-Cuca Aiden\u2019 soa t\u00e3o bem! N\u00e3o acha?",
        u"\u2018Master Chef Aiden\u2019 has such a nice ring to it! Don\u2019t you think so?{fast}": u"\u2018Mestre-Cuca Aiden\u2019 soa t\u00e3o bem! N\u00e3o acha?{fast}",
        u"\u2018Sit on my Face\u2019 times two coming up, then! ": u"Ent\u00e3o, dois \u2018Sit on my Face\u2019 saindo! ",
        u"\u2019Cause a certain someone isn\u2019t here to ruin it.": u"Porque uma certa pessoa n\u00e3o est\u00e1 aqui para estragar tudo.",
        u"\u2019Cause as thrilled as I was to hear about the offer, I felt it was too good to be true.": u"Porque, por mais empolgado que eu estivesse com a oferta, parecia bom demais para ser verdade.",
        u"\u2019Cause holy fuck, did you guys see how crazy the prices are? It\u2019s more than my daily salary!": u"Porque, puta merda, voc\u00eas viram como os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o absurdos? \u00c9 mais do que meu sal\u00e1rio di\u00e1rio!",
        u"\u201cBenefit of the doubt\u201d. Yeah, you\u2019ve said that like a hundred times already, Yoshi.": u"\u201cBenef\u00edcio da d\u00favida\u201d. Sim, voc\u00ea j\u00e1 disse isso umas cem vezes, Yoshi.",
        u"\u201cIt\u2019S tHe sAmE jOb yOu wErE bAdMoUtHiNg BaCk ThEn\u201d Fine, fine! I get it\u2026 geez\u2026": u"\u201c\u00c9 o MeSmO tRaBaLhO qUe VoC\u00ea FaLaVa MaL aNtEs\u201d T\u00e1, t\u00e1! Eu entendi\u2026 nossa\u2026",
        u"\u201cThe best scout around,\u201d say the scoutmasters! I\u2019m as real as you can get!": u"\u201cO melhor escoteiro de todos\u201d, segundo os chefes escoteiros! N\u00e3o poderia estar falando mais s\u00e9rio!",
        u"\u2026 And whenever I try and give someone criticism, I always try and do it gently, so that they don\u2019t beat themselves up too much.": u"\u2026 E sempre que tento fazer uma cr\u00edtica a algu\u00e9m, procuro falar com delicadeza para que a pessoa n\u00e3o se culpe demais.",
        u"\u2026And I guess I\u2019ve just gotten used to handling things on my own.": u"\u2026E acho que simplesmente me acostumei a resolver tudo sozinho.",
        u"\u2026And now I\u2019m here, reconnecting with you guys! Coincidence? I think not!": u"\u2026E agora estou aqui, reencontrando voc\u00eas! Coincid\u00eancia? Acho que n\u00e3o!",
        u"\u2026And that is to protect that smile that gives me so much happiness.": u"\u2026E esse prop\u00f3sito \u00e9 proteger esse sorriso que me traz tanta felicidade.",
        u"\u2026And that\u2019s the progress of the project so far, Mr. Clermont.  I believe we\u2019ve reached all targets on schedule.": u"\u2026E esse \u00e9 o progresso do projeto at\u00e9 agora, Sr. Clermont.  Acredito que alcan\u00e7amos todas as metas dentro do prazo.",
        u"\u2026Bareback.": u"\u2026Sem cobertura.",
        u"\u2026I can\u2019t imagine how difficult that was.": u"\u2026Nem consigo imaginar como isso deve ter sido dif\u00edcil.",
        u"\u2026I finished the blog project, sir!  Please check it out!": u"\u2026Terminei o projeto do blog, senhor! Por favor, deem uma olhada!",
        u"\u2026I never knew.": u"\u2026Eu n\u00e3o sabia.",
        u"\u2026I thought you didn\u2019t want me here anymore. ": u"\u2026Achei que voc\u00ea n\u00e3o me queria mais aqui. ",
        u"\u2026I\u2019d say your best quality is the way you always hold your head high and look at things so positively.": u"\u2026Eu diria que sua melhor qualidade \u00e9 a forma como sempre mant\u00e9m a cabe\u00e7a erguida e v\u00ea as coisas de maneira t\u00e3o positiva.",
        u"\u2026I\u2019d say your best quality is the way you always persevere no matter the predicament you face, coming out stronger than you were before each time.": u"\u2026Eu diria que sua melhor qualidade \u00e9 a forma como voc\u00ea sempre persevera, n\u00e3o importa a dificuldade que enfrente, saindo dela mais forte a cada vez.",
        u"\u2026I\u2019m sorry about being so persistent earlier.": u"\u2026Desculpe por ter sido t\u00e3o insistente antes.",
        u"\u2026I\u2019m sure I saw him come in here.": u"\u2026Tenho certeza de que vi ele entrar aqui.",
        u"\u2026Just don\u2019t forget to put on a shirt, okay?": u"\u2026S\u00f3 n\u00e3o se esque\u00e7a de vestir uma camisa, est\u00e1 bem?",
        u"\u2026Oh! Aiden, you\u2019re here too!": u"\u2026Ah! Aiden, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m est\u00e1 aqui!",
        u"\u2026Okay. Don\u2019t stay out here too long.": u"\u2026Certo. N\u00e3o fique aqui fora por muito tempo.",
        u"\u2026Okay. I give up.": u"\u2026Certo. Eu desisto.",
        u"\u2026Really? What for?": u"\u2026S\u00e9rio? Por qu\u00ea?",
        u"\u2026Shoot!": u"\u2026J\u00e1!",
        u"\u2026That I have to let go.": u"\u2026Que preciso deixar partir.",
        u"\u2026Thinking about how fun it was, it really made me want to relive those moments again.": u"\u2026Pensar no quanto foi divertido realmente me deu vontade de reviver aqueles momentos.",
        u"\u2026What do you mean you can\u2019t come? It\u2019s okay if you\u2019re going to be late, we don\u2019t mind waiting.": u"\u2026Como assim, voc\u00ea n\u00e3o pode vir? Tudo bem se for se atrasar, n\u00e3o nos importamos de esperar.",
        u"\u2026Which will be ruined if SOMEONE doesn\u2019t finish setting up those chairs!": u"\u2026Que ser\u00e1 arruinado se ALGU\u00c9M n\u00e3o terminar de arrumar aquelas cadeiras!",
        u"\u2026Yes, sir.": u"\u2026Sim, senhor.",
        u"\u2026You alright, Yoshi?": u"\u2026Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 bem, Yoshi?",
        u"\u2026Yuri told me you came up here to answer a call?  ": u"\u2026Yuri me disse que o senhor veio at\u00e9 aqui para atender uma liga\u00e7\u00e3o?  ",
        u"\u2026and I\u2019m here for you! ": u"\u2026e eu estou aqui pelo senhor! ",
        u"\u2026have no idea.": u"\u2026n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia.",
        u"\u2026is all because of you.": u"\u2026\u00e9 voc\u00ea.",
        u"\u2026party.": u"\u2026festa.",
        u"\u2026then SWING!": u"\u2026e ent\u00e3o GOLPEIE!",
        u"\u2026with orders of course.": u"\u2026com ordens, \u00e9 claro.",
        u"\u2026youthful?? ": u"\u2026jovem?? ",
        u"\u2026\u201cHOMERUN!\u201d DOUJINSHI?!": u"\u2026DOUJINSHI DE \u201cHOMERUN!\u201d?!",
    }

